(225, 'BELTOLA WEIGHT LOSS & GAIN CLUB #### VFC', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>BELTOLA WEIGHT LOSS & GAIN CLUB VFC</h1>\n<p>Located at Market Complex, Kamrup Zila Parishad, Beltola - Basistha Rd, BELTOLA WEIGHT LOSS & GAIN CLUB VFC is a dedicated wellness center committed to providing personalized and effective weight management solutions to the residents of Beltola and the surrounding communities in Assam.  We understand that achieving and maintaining a healthy weight is a deeply personal journey, requiring a holistic approach that addresses individual needs and preferences.  Our club distinguishes itself from generic gyms and diet programs by offering a comprehensive, supportive, and culturally sensitive environment tailored to the specific requirements of our local clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike typical weight loss programs, BELTOLA WEIGHT LOSS & GAIN CLUB VFC offers a unique dual approach.  We cater not only to individuals seeking weight loss but also to those aiming for healthy weight gain.  This inclusive model recognizes the diverse needs within our community and emphasizes the importance of achieving a balanced and healthy weight, regardless of the individual\'s starting point. Our experienced team of nutritionists, fitness trainers, and wellness counselors work collaboratively to create customized plans that address each client\'s specific metabolic profile, dietary restrictions, lifestyle preferences, and personal goals.  We offer a range of services to help clients achieve lasting results, fostering a supportive and encouraging atmosphere throughout their journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass personalized diet plans, tailored exercise regimens, nutritional counseling, and regular progress monitoring.  Unique to our approach is the integration of traditional Assamese dietary principles and practices into our weight management plans.  We believe in leveraging the rich culinary heritage of the region to create healthy and sustainable meal plans that are both delicious and culturally relevant.  This approach not only makes the weight management process more enjoyable but also fosters a stronger connection to local food traditions, promoting long-term adherence to healthy eating habits.  Furthermore, we provide ongoing support and guidance through regular consultations, group workshops on healthy lifestyle choices, and motivational sessions, all designed to build confidence and encourage positive behavior change.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At BELTOLA WEIGHT LOSS & GAIN CLUB VFC, we prioritize an exceptional customer experience.  Our commitment to individualized care ensures that every member receives personalized attention, fostering a strong sense of community and belonging. We recognize the importance of building trust and rapport with our clients, which is why our team takes the time to understand individual needs, concerns, and goals.  Our friendly and approachable staff provide a welcoming and encouraging environment, making the weight management process less daunting and more enjoyable.  We actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and collaborations with local organizations, further reinforcing our commitment to improving overall community well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond our immediate services, we are deeply invested in fostering long-term relationships with our members. We believe in sustainable lifestyle changes rather than quick fixes.  Our post-program support ensures that our clients receive the ongoing guidance they need to maintain their progress and achieve long-term success. This includes access to our online resources, regular check-ins, and opportunities for ongoing consultation.  We envision BELTOLA WEIGHT LOSS & GAIN CLUB VFC becoming a leading wellness center in Beltola, recognized not only for its effective weight management programs but also for its commitment to community health and well-being. We plan to expand our range of services to include yoga, meditation classes, and potentially introduce specialized programs targeting specific health conditions, all within a culturally sensitive and supportive environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include expanding our physical space to accommodate a wider range of activities and a growing membership base.  We aim to establish strategic partnerships with local healthcare providers and organizations to reach a broader audience and offer integrated wellness solutions.  We also strive to become a leading resource for reliable information on healthy living within the Beltola community, acting as a hub for promoting sustainable lifestyle changes and fostering a healthier, more vibrant community. Through a combination of innovative programs, personalized care, and a deep commitment to the community, BELTOLA WEIGHT LOSS & GAIN CLUB VFC is dedicated to empowering individuals to achieve their weight goals and lead healthier, happier lives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In summary, BELTOLA WEIGHT LOSS & GAIN CLUB VFC offers a unique blend of personalized weight management solutions, culturally relevant dietary approaches, and a strong commitment to community well-being.  We are confident in our ability to meet the evolving needs of the Beltola community and contribute significantly to fostering a healthier lifestyle for our members and the wider population. Our approach, focusing on both weight loss and weight gain, along with our emphasis on personalized care and community engagement, sets us apart in the local market and positions us for significant growth and lasting success.</p>', 'Market Complex, Kamrup Zila Parishad, Beltola - Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8399969125', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:40:24', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(226, 'NES-Yoga Centre, Yogashala', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>NES-Yoga Centre, Yogashala: A Sanctuary of Wellbeing in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>NES-Yoga Centre, Yogashala, nestled at House 16, First Floor, Sundarpur By Lane 1, RG Baruah Rd, offers a haven of tranquility and physical wellness in the heart of Guwahati.  More than just a yoga studio, we are a vibrant community hub dedicated to promoting holistic wellbeing through the ancient practice of yoga.  In the bustling landscape of Assam\'s capital, NES-Yoga stands out for its commitment to personalized instruction, a diverse range of classes catering to all levels, and a strong focus on connecting with the local community. We believe in empowering individuals to achieve their full potential through the transformative power of yoga, fostering a sense of belonging and shared growth within our Yogashala.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to quality and accessibility sets us apart. We understand that the needs of our community are diverse. Therefore, we offer a comprehensive curriculum of yoga styles, including Hatha, Ashtanga, Vinyasa, and restorative yoga.  We also cater to specific needs with specialized classes designed for beginners, pregnant women, seniors, and individuals with specific physical limitations. Each class is carefully crafted to provide a safe, supportive, and challenging environment for students of all levels. Our unique selling point lies in our personalized approach – small class sizes ensure that each student receives individual attention and modifications as needed, ensuring a safe and effective practice. This personalized touch, combined with our experienced and certified instructors, fosters a strong sense of community and individual progress.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We recognize the significant role yoga plays in addressing the modern lifestyle challenges faced by many in Guwahati.  Stress, anxiety, and sedentary lifestyles are increasingly prevalent.  Our classes provide a much-needed antidote, offering a space to de-stress, build strength and flexibility, improve posture, and cultivate a greater sense of inner peace and mindfulness. We also incorporate elements of pranayama (breathing techniques) and meditation into our classes, promoting not just physical wellbeing but also mental and emotional balance. The benefits are palpable: increased energy levels, improved sleep quality, reduced stress and anxiety, and a heightened sense of self-awareness. We are filling a crucial gap in the local market by offering high-quality, accessible yoga instruction to individuals seeking holistic wellbeing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At NES-Yoga Centre, Yogashala, customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable and respected. From the moment you step into our studio, you\'ll be greeted with warmth and personalized attention. Our instructors are not just teachers; they are mentors, offering guidance and support throughout your yoga journey. We maintain open communication channels to ensure that your needs are met and your feedback is valued.  We actively foster a sense of community through workshops, retreats, and social events, encouraging students to connect with one another and build lasting relationships. By actively participating in local community initiatives, we demonstrate our commitment to building strong bonds with the people of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our future vision extends beyond providing exceptional yoga instruction. We aim to become a leading wellness centre in Guwahati, expanding our offerings to include workshops on related disciplines such as Ayurveda, meditation retreats, and nutritional guidance. We plan to further strengthen our community engagement through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, promoting holistic wellbeing within the broader Guwahati community.  We are also exploring options for teacher training programs, empowering individuals to become certified yoga instructors and contribute to the growing demand for qualified yoga professionals in Assam.  Our long-term goal is to establish NES-Yoga Centre, Yogashala as a beacon of wellbeing, not just within Guwahati, but across the state, contributing to a healthier and happier Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In essence, NES-Yoga Centre, Yogashala is more than just a yoga studio; it’s a community, a sanctuary, and a transformative space where individuals discover their inner strength, cultivate wellbeing, and connect with a supportive network.  We are committed to empowering individuals through the practice of yoga and contributing to the overall wellbeing of the Guwahati community.  Our dedication to personalized instruction, diverse class offerings, and community engagement sets us apart, making us a valuable resource for those seeking a path to a healthier, happier, and more fulfilling life.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We invite you to experience the transformative power of yoga at NES-Yoga Centre, Yogashala.  Visit us at House 16, First Floor, Sundarpur By Lane 1, RG Baruah Rd, and embark on your journey to wellbeing.</p>', 'House 16, First Floor, Sundarpur By Lane 1, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8073781833', '', 'http://www.nes-yoga.org/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:40:32', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(227, 'The Workout Zone Guwahati', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>The Workout Zone Guwahati: Your Fitness Destination in the Heart of the City</h1>\n\n<p>The Workout Zone Guwahati, strategically located at House - 27, Rajgarh Rd, opposite Icon Academy, is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a vibrant community hub dedicated to helping individuals achieve their health and wellness goals.  We understand the unique needs of the Guwahati community and strive to provide a comprehensive fitness experience that caters to diverse fitness levels and aspirations.  In a city increasingly focused on health and well-being, The Workout Zone distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized training, state-of-the-art facilities, and a strong sense of community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence sets us apart within the Assam fitness landscape.  Guwahati is experiencing a surge in demand for high-quality fitness services, and The Workout Zone directly addresses this need by offering a diverse range of programs and equipment designed to maximize results.  We are not just another gym; we are a comprehensive fitness solution tailored to the specific needs of the local population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>The Workout Zone offers a comprehensive suite of fitness services designed to cater to a broad spectrum of individuals.  Our state-of-the-art facility houses a fully equipped weight training area with a wide selection of free weights and resistance machines, ensuring members have access to the equipment they need to achieve their goals.  We also feature a dedicated cardio zone with treadmills, elliptical trainers, stationary bikes, and rowing machines, providing a variety of options for cardiovascular training.  Beyond traditional gym equipment, we offer a range of specialized fitness classes, including Zumba, Yoga, Pilates, and HIIT (High-Intensity Interval Training) sessions led by certified instructors. These classes provide a dynamic and engaging workout experience, perfect for individuals seeking group fitness motivation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of The Workout Zone is our commitment to personalized training.  We offer one-on-one personal training sessions tailored to individual needs and fitness goals.  Our certified personal trainers work closely with members to develop customized workout plans and provide guidance and support throughout their fitness journey. This level of personalized attention ensures members receive the best possible results and fosters a more effective and enjoyable fitness experience. This personalized approach directly addresses a growing demand within the Guwahati fitness market for more specialized and effective training methods.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Further differentiating ourselves from competitors, we offer nutritional guidance as an integral part of our fitness programs.  Understanding the crucial role nutrition plays in overall fitness, we provide members with access to resources and information to make informed dietary choices, complementing their training regimen for optimal results. This holistic approach to fitness is a key component of our commitment to providing exceptional and effective service to our clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At The Workout Zone, we believe that a positive and supportive environment is key to achieving fitness goals. We foster a welcoming atmosphere where members feel comfortable, motivated, and supported in their fitness journey.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are always available to answer questions, provide guidance, and ensure a positive experience for every member.  We regularly conduct member surveys and actively seek feedback to continuously improve our services and meet the evolving needs of our community.  This commitment to customer satisfaction is central to our business philosophy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We pride ourselves on building strong relationships with our members and connecting with the local community. We sponsor local fitness events, partner with community organizations, and actively engage in initiatives that promote health and wellness within Guwahati.  By being actively involved in the community, we strengthen our connection with our members and contribute positively to the city\'s overall well-being. This commitment goes beyond simply providing fitness services; it\'s about building a healthy and vibrant community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>The Workout Zone has ambitious growth plans for the future.  We aim to expand our facilities and service offerings to better serve the growing demand for fitness services in Guwahati.  This includes plans for adding new fitness classes, introducing advanced training equipment, and potentially expanding our location to accommodate a larger membership base.  We also aim to further develop our personalized training programs, integrating cutting-edge technology and fitness methodologies to enhance the effectiveness of our training services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish The Workout Zone as the premier fitness destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional service, state-of-the-art facilities, and strong community ties.  We are committed to continually innovating and improving our services, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of the fitness industry in Assam.  We believe that by investing in our members, our community, and our facilities, we can achieve sustainable growth and make a significant contribution to the health and well-being of Guwahati\'s residents.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>By combining a commitment to personalized training, state-of-the-art facilities, and a strong community focus, The Workout Zone is poised for continued success and significant growth within the vibrant Guwahati fitness market.</p>', 'House - 27, Rajgarh Rd, opposite Icon Academy', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002414472', '', 'https://www.instagram.com/twz_sriyaan/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:40:40', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(228, 'The Yoga Studio - Ganeshguri Studio', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>The Yoga Studio - Ganeshguri Studio: Cultivating Inner Peace in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, The Yoga Studio - Ganeshguri Studio offers a sanctuary of tranquility and well-being.  More than just a fitness center, we are a community hub dedicated to promoting physical and mental health through the ancient practice of yoga.  We recognize the growing need for accessible and high-quality yoga instruction in Guwahati, and we strive to fill that need with a personalized and culturally sensitive approach. Our studio distinguishes itself through a commitment to expert instruction, a welcoming atmosphere, and a deep understanding of the specific needs of the Assamese community.  We believe in the transformative power of yoga and are passionate about sharing its benefits with individuals of all levels, ages, and backgrounds. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our unique approach lies in the careful curation of our yoga styles and teacher training.  We offer a diverse range of classes catering to various fitness levels and preferences, from gentle Hatha and restorative yoga for beginners to more challenging Vinyasa flow and Ashtanga styles for experienced practitioners.  We understand the importance of accessibility, offering modifications and variations to accommodate diverse physical abilities.  Our teachers are highly skilled and certified professionals with extensive experience in teaching yoga in diverse settings.  Beyond the physical postures, we emphasize the philosophical aspects of yoga, including mindfulness, meditation, and breathwork, integrating them into our classes to encourage holistic well-being. This holistic approach resonates deeply with the cultural values of Assam, which emphasizes a harmonious relationship between mind, body, and spirit.  We aim to foster a sense of community, helping individuals connect with their inner selves and build meaningful relationships with fellow practitioners. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>At The Yoga Studio - Ganeshguri Studio, customer experience is paramount.  We foster a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and supported.  Our studio is designed to be a tranquil oasis, featuring a clean and spacious practice area equipped with high-quality mats and props.  We prioritize individualized attention, ensuring each student receives guidance and modifications tailored to their unique needs and limitations.  Beyond individual classes, we regularly host workshops and retreats focusing on specific yoga styles, meditation techniques, and related wellness practices.  We believe in actively engaging with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, participating in community events, and offering discounted classes to underprivileged groups.  Our commitment to fostering a sense of community and belonging distinguishes us in the Guwahati market, creating a loyal client base and solidifying our position as a trusted wellness provider. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our future vision is ambitious yet grounded in our commitment to serving the community.  We plan to expand our offerings to include specialized yoga programs, such as prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and therapeutic yoga for specific conditions. We envision establishing collaborations with local healthcare professionals to integrate yoga into preventative healthcare programs.  Furthermore, we aim to grow our team of instructors, attracting talented and passionate yoga teachers from within Assam and beyond.  This expansion will allow us to reach a wider audience and increase the frequency and diversity of our class schedule.  We also aim to create a strong online presence through a user-friendly website and an active social media engagement strategy, expanding our reach beyond our physical studio and connecting with individuals across Assam and potentially beyond. We plan to introduce teacher training programs to cultivate a new generation of yoga instructors within the region, furthering our commitment to the growth and development of the yoga community in Assam.   Our ultimate goal is to make The Yoga Studio - Ganeshguri Studio the premier yoga destination in Guwahati, synonymous with quality, inclusivity, and community. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>The Yoga Studio - Ganeshguri Studio is more than just a business; it\'s a testament to the power of yoga to transform lives.  Our commitment to quality instruction, personalized attention, and community engagement sets us apart in the vibrant and growing wellness market of Guwahati. We are dedicated to building a thriving and supportive yoga community, and we look forward to welcoming you to our studio.  We invite you to experience the transformative power of yoga and discover the inner peace that awaits you at The Yoga Studio – Ganeshguri Studio. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9954066399', '', 'https://theyogastudio.co.in/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:45:10', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(229, 'Arunima Dutta\'s The Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Arunima Dutta\'s The Yoga Studio</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled above the Panasonic Showroom at U Turn, Chandmari Flyover, Arunima Dutta\'s The Yoga Studio offers a haven of tranquility and well-being in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  More than just a yoga studio, it represents a commitment to holistic health and a deep connection with the vibrant Assamese community.  Arunima Dutta, a highly experienced and certified yoga instructor, founded the studio with a vision to provide accessible, high-quality yoga instruction tailored to the specific needs and preferences of the local population.  The studio\'s unique approach integrates traditional yoga practices with a modern understanding of wellness, creating a truly transformative experience for its members.  In a region increasingly focused on health and well-being, Arunima Dutta\'s The Yoga Studio is carving a niche by offering a personalized and culturally sensitive approach to yoga, setting it apart in the competitive fitness landscape of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering centers around a diverse range of yoga classes designed to cater to all levels, from beginners to experienced practitioners.  We provide Hatha, Vinyasa, Ashtanga, and restorative yoga classes, each meticulously crafted to promote physical strength, flexibility, and mental clarity.  Furthermore, we offer specialized workshops focusing on prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and yoga nidra, reflecting our commitment to inclusivity and meeting the specific needs of diverse age groups and physical capabilities within the community.  A key unique selling point is our emphasis on personalized attention.  Class sizes are kept intentionally small to allow Arunima and her team to provide individualized guidance and modifications to ensure each student experiences a safe and effective practice. This personalized approach, combined with the serene and inviting atmosphere of the studio, creates a truly transformative learning environment.  We are acutely aware of the need for convenient and accessible fitness options in Guwahati and strive to offer flexible scheduling options, including weekend classes and evening sessions, to accommodate the diverse lifestyle demands of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Arunima Dutta\'s The Yoga Studio, customer experience is paramount. We believe that building a strong, trusting relationship with each student is key to fostering a supportive and encouraging learning environment.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where individuals feel comfortable exploring their physical and mental limits.  We prioritize clear communication, offering personalized feedback and support to help each student achieve their individual goals.  We foster a strong sense of community through regular social events, workshops, and informal gatherings, promoting a sense of belonging among our students.  This proactive community engagement has proven successful in building a loyal clientele and extending the studio’s positive impact beyond the confines of the yoga mat. We actively participate in local health fairs and community initiatives, further solidifying our commitment to the well-being of the Guwahati community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Arunima Dutta\'s The Yoga Studio envisions a future where yoga becomes an integral part of the daily lives of many in Guwahati.  Our ambitious growth plans include expanding our range of classes and workshops to incorporate new styles and techniques, keeping our offerings current and engaging.  We are also exploring the possibility of offering teacher training programs to cultivate a new generation of yoga instructors within Assam.  Furthermore, we aim to expand our reach beyond the studio through online classes and collaborations with local businesses and organizations.   Our long-term goal is to establish ourselves as the leading yoga studio in the region, recognized for our unwavering commitment to excellence, our deep connection with the local community, and our profound impact on the well-being of individuals across Assam. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local wellness centers and healthcare providers, to further integrate yoga into preventative healthcare practices in the region.  This multifaceted approach ensures sustainable growth while upholding our commitment to promoting a healthier and more mindful community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In summary, Arunima Dutta\'s The Yoga Studio is not just a business; it is a community hub dedicated to holistic well-being.  By providing high-quality yoga instruction in a welcoming and supportive environment, we are fulfilling a vital need within the Guwahati community.  Our commitment to personalized attention, cultural sensitivity, and community engagement sets us apart and positions us for significant growth and lasting impact within the Assamese wellness landscape.  We strive to empower individuals to achieve their physical and mental health goals, fostering a stronger, more connected community through the transformative power of yoga.</p>', 'U Turn, Chandmari Flyover, above Panasonic Showroom', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9706077977', '', 'http://www.theyogastudio.co.in/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:45:17', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(230, 'NAMAH YOG STUDIO', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>NAMAH YOGA STUDIO: Finding Your Balance in the Heart of Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on Zoo Road, near the vibrant City Centre of Guwahati, Namah Yoga Studio offers a sanctuary of peace and rejuvenation in the bustling heart of Assam.  More than just a yoga studio, Namah provides a holistic wellness experience, thoughtfully designed to meet the specific needs and aspirations of the Guwahati community. We recognize the growing demand for accessible and high-quality yoga instruction, combined with a genuine commitment to fostering a sense of community and well-being.  Our unique approach blends traditional yogic practices with a modern, inclusive ethos, creating a space where individuals of all levels can find their balance, both on and off the mat.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to authenticity is reflected in the comprehensive range of yoga styles we offer.  From the invigorating flow of Vinyasa to the mindful stillness of Hatha, and the restorative power of Yin Yoga, our diverse schedule caters to a wide spectrum of preferences and physical capabilities.  We pride ourselves on employing experienced and certified instructors who are passionate about sharing their knowledge and fostering a supportive learning environment. Beyond traditional yoga classes, we also incorporate workshops focusing on pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and yoga philosophy, enriching the practice and deepening the understanding of this ancient discipline. We also offer specialized classes tailored to specific needs, such as prenatal yoga and yoga for seniors, ensuring accessibility and inclusivity for the diverse population of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Namah Yoga Studio apart is our unwavering focus on creating a truly exceptional customer experience. We believe that yoga is more than just physical exercise; it\'s a journey of self-discovery and personal growth.  To support this journey, we have cultivated a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, emphasizing respect, kindness, and understanding amongst our students.  Our studio is designed to be a calming and aesthetically pleasing space, featuring natural light, comfortable amenities, and a tranquil atmosphere that encourages relaxation and focus.  We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events, further strengthening our connection to the city and its vibrant culture.  Our commitment to personalized attention extends beyond the studio doors. We provide individual feedback and support, fostering a strong sense of community among our students.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Namah Yoga Studio goes beyond the provision of classes; it fosters a sense of community.  We host regular social gatherings and workshops outside of scheduled classes, creating opportunities for students to connect and build relationships. This emphasis on community building is crucial in a city like Guwahati, where fostering a strong sense of belonging is integral to wellbeing.  We believe that our studio is not just a place to practice yoga, but a space for personal growth, connection, and community building.  We also recognize the importance of accessibility, striving to create a pricing structure that is fair and inclusive to those from various socioeconomic backgrounds within the city.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our vision for the future is ambitious yet grounded in our commitment to serving the Guwahati community.  We plan to expand our offerings, potentially including specialized retreats, teacher training programs, and collaborations with other wellness professionals in the city. We aim to become a leading wellness centre in Assam, a hub for holistic health and wellbeing, and a place where individuals can find solace, strength, and a sense of belonging.  We envision continued growth, not just in terms of student numbers but also in the depth and breadth of the services we offer, always remaining true to our core values of inclusivity, authenticity, and community building.  We plan to leverage technology, such as online class scheduling and communication tools, to further enhance the convenience and accessibility of our services for our valued students.  Ultimately, our goal is to become an integral part of the Guwahati landscape, a trusted resource for those seeking physical and mental wellness through the transformative practice of yoga.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In summary, Namah Yoga Studio is more than just a business; it\'s a sanctuary, a community, and a journey towards holistic wellbeing, deeply rooted in the heart of Guwahati.  Our commitment to quality instruction, exceptional customer service, and community engagement positions us for continued growth and success within the thriving Assamese wellness market. We are committed to evolving and adapting to the changing needs of our community, while always staying true to the ancient wisdom and transformative power of yoga.</p>', 'Zoo Rd, near City Centre', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8638816026', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:45:24', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(231, 'Aru Yoga Centre - Serenity Within', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Aru Yoga Centre - Serenity Within</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, at the convenient location of Bus Stand, Mother Teresa Rd, near Narangi, near Bank of India, Aru Yoga Centre - Serenity Within offers a sanctuary of peace and well-being for the vibrant community.  We stand apart from other yoga studios in the region by offering a holistic approach to yoga, incorporating traditional Asana practice with a deep understanding of the spiritual and mental benefits it provides. Our commitment to personalized attention, experienced instructors, and a serene environment makes us a unique and valuable addition to the burgeoning wellness scene in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Aru Yoga Centre is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a journey towards inner harmony. We recognize the growing need for stress management and holistic wellness in today\'s fast-paced world. Our services cater to individuals seeking stress relief, improved physical fitness, enhanced flexibility, and a deeper connection with their inner selves.  We aim to foster a supportive and inclusive community where individuals of all levels, from beginners to experienced yogis, can find their place and flourish.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our core offerings encompass a range of yoga styles tailored to meet diverse needs and preferences.  We conduct regular Hatha, Vinyasa, and Yin Yoga classes, each designed to promote physical strength, flexibility, and balance.  We also offer specialized workshops focusing on specific areas like meditation, pranayama (breathing techniques), and yoga philosophy.  These workshops are often led by visiting experienced instructors from across India, providing our students access to diverse expertise and perspectives.  Beyond group classes, we provide personalized one-on-one sessions catering to individual requirements and goals, ensuring focused attention and customized practice plans.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Aru Yoga Centre differentiates itself through its emphasis on individualized attention and a commitment to creating a supportive community. Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, possessing a deep understanding of yoga\'s physical and spiritual dimensions. They are skilled in adapting poses to suit diverse body types and fitness levels, ensuring a safe and beneficial practice for all.  The small class sizes also enable instructors to provide personalized feedback and guidance, fostering a more intimate and effective learning experience.  We also offer workshops and retreats beyond the studio, tapping into the beautiful natural landscapes surrounding Guwahati to enhance the holistic experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Aru Yoga Centre, we believe that creating a welcoming and inclusive environment is paramount. We strive to cultivate a sense of community, fostering connections between students and creating a supportive space for personal growth.  Our commitment to personalized attention extends beyond the practice itself; we actively encourage interaction and build relationships with our students. This allows us to better understand their individual needs and create tailored experiences that enhance their journey towards well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in our clean, serene, and well-equipped studio. We provide comfortable mats, props, and a tranquil atmosphere designed to promote relaxation and focus.  We also regularly organize community events, such as workshops on healthy living and mindfulness, to further engage with and support our local community.   We are committed to building a lasting relationship with our clientele, understanding their evolving needs, and continually improving our services to better serve them.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Aru Yoga Centre envisions becoming a leading wellness centre in Guwahati, known for its high-quality instruction, personalized approach, and strong community ties.  Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate other complementary therapies such as Ayurvedic treatments, offering teacher training programs to certify aspiring yoga instructors, and collaborating with local businesses to promote holistic wellness within the broader community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We plan to expand our physical space to accommodate a larger number of students and introduce more specialized classes, responding to the evolving needs and interests of our clientele.  We also aim to deepen our community engagement by partnering with local schools, organizations, and businesses to provide yoga and wellness workshops and programs. Our long-term goal is to establish Aru Yoga Centre as a beacon of holistic well-being in Assam, contributing significantly to the health and happiness of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Through unwavering dedication to excellence and a genuine commitment to our students\' well-being, Aru Yoga Centre - Serenity Within is poised to make a significant and lasting impact on the health and wellness landscape of Guwahati and beyond. We invite you to join us on this journey toward serenity and self-discovery.</p>', 'Bus Stand, Mother Teresa Rd, near Narangi, near Bank of India', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8135941109', '', 'https://aruyogacentre.com/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:45:31', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(232, 'Yoga Miracle By Dibya Jyoti Deka', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Yoga Miracle By Dibya Jyoti Deka</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 1 No, Pub Santi Nagar, Yoga Miracle By Dibya Jyoti Deka offers a unique and transformative yoga experience tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community.  More than just a yoga studio, Yoga Miracle is a sanctuary of well-being, blending traditional yogic practices with a modern, accessible approach.  In a region increasingly aware of the importance of holistic health and wellness, Yoga Miracle fills a vital gap in the market, providing high-quality instruction and a supportive community environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The studio\'s significance within the local business landscape stems from its commitment to promoting both physical and mental wellness.  Recognizing the fast-paced lifestyle and stress levels prevalent in modern Assam, Yoga Miracle offers a respite from the everyday pressures, fostering a sense of calm and inner peace.  The studio\'s dedication to authenticity and personalized instruction sets it apart from generic fitness centers, fostering a strong sense of community and trust among its clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Yoga Miracle By Dibya Jyoti Deka provides a diverse range of yoga classes catering to various levels of experience and fitness.  From introductory Hatha yoga to more challenging Ashtanga and Vinyasa flows, there are options for everyone, regardless of their prior yoga experience.  The studio also offers specialized workshops focusing on specific areas such as stress management, back pain relief, and prenatal yoga, addressing prevalent health concerns within the community.  Each class emphasizes proper alignment and mindful movement, ensuring both physical benefits and a deeper connection to the self.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key unique selling point is Dibya Jyoti Deka\'s profound understanding of yoga and its ability to adapt to individual needs.  With years of experience and a deep commitment to personalized instruction,  Dibya ensures every student receives tailored guidance and support, creating a safe and encouraging learning environment.  This personalized approach, combined with the studio\'s tranquil atmosphere, distinguishes Yoga Miracle from other fitness centers, attracting students seeking a genuine and transformative experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The studio\'s services directly meet the local market needs by offering accessible and affordable yoga instruction.  Addressing the increasing demand for wellness practices, Yoga Miracle provides a convenient and welcoming space for individuals of all ages and backgrounds to improve their physical health, mental well-being, and overall quality of life.  The focus on personalized instruction further caters to the diverse needs of the community, ensuring a comfortable and effective learning experience for everyone.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Yoga Miracle, customer experience is paramount.  The studio fosters a welcoming and inclusive environment where students feel comfortable, supported, and encouraged to explore their yoga journey at their own pace.  Dibya Jyoti Deka\'s approachable and compassionate teaching style ensures that every student feels valued and understood.  Beyond the classes themselves, the studio aims to create a sense of community through workshops, social gatherings, and opportunities for students to connect with one another.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets Yoga Miracle apart is the emphasis on personalized attention and building genuine relationships with students.  This commitment to individual well-being goes beyond just the physical practice, extending to a holistic approach that considers the mental and emotional aspects of health. By creating a safe and supportive space, Yoga Miracle promotes a sense of belonging and fosters a strong community bond amongst its students.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The studio actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events. This outreach reinforces the studio\'s commitment to not just serving individuals, but also contributing positively to the wider Assamese community.  This commitment to community engagement further strengthens its position as a trusted and valued member of the local landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Yoga Miracle By Dibya Jyoti Deka envisions a future of continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati area.  Future plans include offering a wider range of yoga styles and workshops, potentially incorporating Ayurvedic principles and other complementary therapies into the services provided.  The studio also aims to expand its outreach programs, partnering with local organizations to bring the benefits of yoga to underserved communities.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term goals include establishing Yoga Miracle as a leading center for holistic wellness in Assam, becoming a recognized and respected resource for yoga education and community engagement.  The studio aims to continue fostering a strong sense of community, providing a space where individuals can connect, grow, and thrive both physically and mentally. This continued growth will be achieved through a strategic approach combining high-quality instruction, personalized attention, and a strong commitment to serving the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In essence, Yoga Miracle By Dibya Jyoti Deka is more than just a business; it is a testament to the transformative power of yoga and its capacity to positively impact individuals and communities.  With its commitment to personalized instruction, community engagement, and a holistic approach to well-being, Yoga Miracle is poised to continue its growth and become a cornerstone of the health and wellness landscape in Assam.</p>', '1 No, Pub Santi Nagar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8011695700', '', 'https://yogamiracle.in/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:45:40', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL);
