(233, 'PRATISHRUTI YOGA CENTRE', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>PRATISHRUTI YOGA CENTRE: Cultivating Wellness in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at JKON Building on Assam Trunk Road, opposite Sonaram High School, Pratishruti Yoga Centre stands as a beacon of holistic well-being.  We offer a comprehensive range of yoga services designed to cater to the diverse needs of the Guwahati community, fostering physical, mental, and spiritual growth within a supportive and welcoming environment.  In a city increasingly focused on career advancement and urban development, Pratishruti Yoga Centre provides a vital counterpoint, emphasizing the importance of mindful living and stress reduction – a crucial element of a balanced and fulfilling life for the modern Assamese individual.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Pratishruti, meaning \"commitment\" or \"pledge\" in Sanskrit, perfectly encapsulates our dedication to providing high-quality yoga instruction and a truly transformative experience. We differentiate ourselves from other yoga studios in Guwahati through our commitment to personalized attention, our diverse range of class styles, and our deep connection to the local community.  We understand that the practice of yoga is deeply personal, and we strive to create a space where each individual can discover their own path towards wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our offerings extend beyond the typical yoga studio, catering to various skill levels and individual preferences.  We offer a variety of Hatha, Vinyasa, and Ashtanga yoga classes, led by experienced and certified instructors. Each class is meticulously structured to cater to diverse fitness levels, ensuring a safe and effective practice for beginners and seasoned yogis alike.  Beyond traditional styles, we also incorporate specialized workshops focusing on specific areas like prenatal yoga, restorative yoga, and yoga for back pain relief. These workshops address the unique physical and mental challenges faced by specific segments of the population in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the growing interest in mindfulness and meditation, we also offer guided meditation sessions and workshops designed to help individuals cultivate inner peace and manage stress effectively. These practices are particularly relevant in the fast-paced environment of modern Guwahati, offering a valuable tool for stress management and mental well-being.  Further enhancing our holistic approach, we are exploring the integration of traditional Assamese wellness practices into our offerings, possibly incorporating elements of Ayurvedic principles into future workshops and retreats.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies not only in the quality and diversity of our classes but also in our commitment to building a strong sense of community. We believe that the shared experience of yoga fosters a sense of connection and belonging, and we actively encourage social interaction and support among our students.  This focus on community builds a loyal clientele, and many of our students have become a valued part of the Pratishruti family.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Pratishruti Yoga Centre, the customer experience is paramount.  Our studios are designed to be clean, welcoming, and conducive to relaxation and mindful practice.  Our instructors are highly trained professionals, not just in yoga techniques, but also in communication and client interaction. We foster a supportive and non-judgmental atmosphere where students feel comfortable exploring their own limits and celebrating their achievements.  We believe in building personalized relationships with our students, understanding their individual goals and adapting our instruction to suit their unique needs. This approach has proven crucial in fostering a loyal client base and establishing Pratishruti Yoga Centre as a trusted name in the Guwahati wellness landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various outreach programs, including free introductory yoga sessions for local schools and community centers. We participate in local health fairs and wellness events, raising awareness about the benefits of yoga and promoting a healthy lifestyle among the citizens of Guwahati. We also leverage social media and local partnerships to expand our reach and build stronger connections within our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Our future vision for Pratishruti Yoga Centre is ambitious yet grounded in our commitment to providing exceptional yoga instruction and fostering a strong sense of community. We plan to expand our range of services by introducing new yoga styles and workshops based on ongoing community needs and emerging trends in wellness. We aim to enhance our technology integration by developing a user-friendly online booking system and offering online yoga classes to reach a wider audience, both within and outside Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also envision expanding our physical space to accommodate growing demand and offer additional amenities, such as a dedicated meditation room and a space for wellness-related workshops.  Long-term, we aim to establish Pratishruti Yoga Centre as a regional leader in holistic wellness, providing a model for sustainable and community-focused yoga practice that can be replicated across Assam. Our ultimate goal is to contribute significantly to the overall health and well-being of the people of Guwahati and beyond, fostering a culture of mindful living and empowering individuals to live their healthiest, most fulfilling lives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>By combining exceptional instruction, a welcoming atmosphere, and a strong community focus, Pratishruti Yoga Centre is not just a yoga studio; it\'s a vital part of the fabric of Guwahati, contributing to a healthier and happier community one downward-facing dog at a time.</p>', 'JKON Building, Assam Trunk Rd, opposite Sonaram High School', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002638811', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:50:13', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(234, 'Esby Studio', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Esby Studio: Cultivating Wellbeing in the Heart of Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled within the vibrant Kanchan Complex on Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Road, opposite the Indian Oil Petrol Pump, Esby Studio offers a sanctuary of wellness in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  More than just a yoga studio, Esby Studio provides a holistic approach to physical and mental wellbeing, catering to the diverse needs of the local community.  We recognize the growing demand for accessible and high-quality wellness services in Assam, and we strive to meet this need with a unique blend of expert instruction, personalized attention, and a welcoming atmosphere that fosters a sense of community and belonging. Our commitment to excellence and our deep understanding of the local context differentiate us in the competitive wellness landscape of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Wellness</h2>\n\n<p>Esby Studio’s core offering revolves around various yoga styles, catering to different experience levels and preferences.  From invigorating Vinyasa flows to restorative Yin practices and mindful Hatha sessions, our expertly trained instructors guide students through a journey of self-discovery and physical transformation.  We also offer specialized workshops focusing on specific areas such as back care, stress management, and prenatal yoga.  These workshops are designed to address the particular health concerns and lifestyle needs of the Guwahati community.  Beyond yoga, we are exploring the introduction of complementary wellness services such as meditation classes, breathwork sessions, and potentially collaborations with local practitioners of traditional Assamese healing modalities, further enriching our holistic approach.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to personalized instruction. We maintain small class sizes to ensure individual attention, allowing instructors to offer modifications and support tailored to each student’s individual needs and physical limitations. This personalized approach fosters a strong sense of community among our students, creating a supportive and encouraging environment where individuals can feel comfortable progressing at their own pace.  Furthermore, we are committed to making yoga accessible to all members of our community, offering a range of pricing options to ensure that our services are within reach.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The local market in Guwahati is increasingly recognizing the importance of preventative healthcare and holistic wellbeing.  Busy lifestyles and the stresses of modern life contribute to a growing demand for services that promote mental and physical health.  Esby Studio directly addresses this need by providing a convenient and accessible avenue for individuals to prioritize their wellbeing. Our diverse range of classes and workshops caters to a broad demographic, ensuring that individuals of all ages, fitness levels, and backgrounds can find something that resonates with their needs and aspirations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Exceptional Customer Experience:  Building Community Through Wellbeing</h2>\n\n<p>At Esby Studio, we believe that customer experience is paramount.  We prioritize creating a warm, welcoming, and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable and respected.  Our dedicated instructors are not only highly skilled yoga practitioners but also empathetic and supportive guides, committed to fostering a positive and encouraging learning environment. We invest time in building relationships with our students, understanding their individual goals, and providing ongoing support to ensure their journey towards wellbeing is fulfilling and sustainable.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond the quality of our instruction, our commitment to community engagement sets us apart. We regularly host community events, such as free introductory yoga classes, workshops on mindfulness, and collaborations with local businesses. These initiatives are designed not only to promote our services but also to connect with the broader Guwahati community and contribute to its overall well-being.  We strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be an active and valued member of the local community, contributing to a healthier and happier Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Growth and Expansion for a Healthier Assam</h2>\n\n<p>Esby Studio has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision expanding our range of services to include additional wellness modalities, potentially incorporating elements of traditional Assamese healing practices. We also plan to increase the frequency of our workshops and community events, further enriching our contribution to the local community.  Our long-term goal is to establish Esby Studio as a leading wellness centre in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional quality of instruction, personalized approach, and unwavering commitment to community engagement.  We aspire to contribute to the overall wellbeing of Assam by making accessible and high-quality wellness services available to a wider audience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We plan to achieve this through strategic partnerships with local businesses, community organizations, and healthcare providers.  We will also invest in ongoing staff training and development, ensuring that our instructors remain at the forefront of their respective fields.  By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of our community, we are confident that Esby Studio will continue to thrive and play a significant role in shaping a healthier and happier future for Guwahati and the broader region of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Esby Studio’s vision extends beyond simply providing yoga classes. We aim to create a sustainable and thriving wellness community in Guwahati, fostering a culture of wellbeing and contributing to the overall health and happiness of our city and its people.  We believe that by investing in the wellbeing of individuals, we are investing in the future of our community, and this unwavering commitment guides our actions and shapes our aspirations.</p>', 'Esby Yoga Studio, Kanchan Complex, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd, opp. Indian Oil Petrol Pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9435006814', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:50:21', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(235, 'YOGA\'M', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>YOGA\'M: Finding Your Balance on Dharma Sarma Path</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the serene Dharma Sarma Path, YOGA\'M offers a sanctuary of well-being, uniquely tailored to the needs of the vibrant Assamese community.  More than just a yoga studio, YOGA\'M is a holistic wellness center committed to fostering physical, mental, and spiritual growth through authentic yoga practices and personalized attention.  We distinguish ourselves through a curated approach that blends traditional Asana with modern mindfulness techniques, creating a transformative experience accessible to individuals of all levels, ages, and backgrounds.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In a region increasingly focused on fast-paced urban life, YOGA\'M provides a much-needed counterpoint.  We understand the specific challenges and aspirations of the local populace and have designed our offerings to address those directly.  The increasing awareness of health and wellness in Assam presents a significant opportunity, and YOGA\'M aims to be at the forefront of this movement, providing a reliable and trusted source for holistic well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>YOGA\'M offers a diverse range of yoga classes catering to various skill levels and interests. From invigorating Vinyasa flows to restorative Yin practices and mindful Hatha sequences, our schedule is meticulously designed to provide options for every individual. We also incorporate elements of traditional Assamese practices where appropriate, seamlessly integrating them into our classes. Our expert instructors, all certified and deeply passionate about yoga philosophy, are dedicated to fostering a safe, supportive, and inspiring learning environment.  Beyond traditional classes, we offer workshops focusing on specific aspects like pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and yoga nidra (yogic sleep), enabling deeper exploration and self-discovery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key unique selling point is our personalized approach. We offer one-on-one sessions tailored to individual needs and goals. These sessions allow for focused attention, customized sequencing, and individual feedback, ensuring maximum benefit and progress.  We also recognize the importance of accessibility and affordability, offering a tiered pricing structure to make our services available to a wide range of individuals within the community.  This commitment to inclusivity sets us apart and ensures our offerings resonate with the diverse population of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In addition to our core yoga services, YOGA\'M also offers a selection of carefully curated wellness products, including ethically sourced yoga mats, apparel, and essential oils. These products complement our classes, providing individuals with the tools and resources to enhance their practice at home.  Our focus on quality, sustainability, and locally sourced materials wherever possible, reflects our commitment to supporting the regional economy and promoting environmentally conscious practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At YOGA\'M, the customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels comfortable and supported.  Our studio is designed to be a tranquil haven, promoting relaxation and rejuvenation.  We prioritize personal interaction, ensuring that each individual feels valued and understood.  Our instructors are not just teachers; they are mentors and guides, committed to fostering a strong sense of community amongst our students.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We differentiate ourselves through our dedication to building genuine connections with our clientele. This goes beyond simply providing yoga classes; it’s about creating a supportive community where individuals can connect with like-minded individuals, fostering a sense of belonging and shared purpose. We regularly organize community events and workshops, promoting inclusivity and enhancing the social fabric of the neighborhood.  We also actively engage with local businesses and organizations, supporting community initiatives and promoting a holistic approach to well-being within the wider Assamese context.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>YOGA\'M envisions becoming a leading wellness destination in Assam, expanding its reach and impact on the local community.  Our future plans include expanding our class offerings to include specialized programs such as prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and workshops focused on specific health concerns prevalent in the region. We also plan to invest in teacher training programs, fostering the growth of a skilled and passionate yoga community within Assam.  This commitment to nurturing local talent ensures the long-term sustainability and growth of our business and contributes to the overall development of the wellness sector in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, YOGA\'M aims to establish itself as a recognized center of excellence for yoga and holistic wellness in Assam.  We see potential for partnering with local healthcare providers, integrating yoga into preventative health programs, and promoting its benefits within the broader healthcare landscape. We also aspire to expand our physical space to accommodate more classes and potentially offer additional wellness services, such as massage therapy or Ayurvedic treatments, further enhancing our comprehensive approach to well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence, our dedication to the community, and our innovative approach to yoga and wellness position YOGA\'M for continued success.  We are confident that by nurturing both the physical and spiritual well-being of the Assamese community, we can create a lasting and positive impact on the lives of our students and contribute to the thriving cultural landscape of Assam.</p>', 'Dharma Sarma Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9577906463', '', 'https://www.facebook.com/YOGAM01/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:50:29', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(236, 'Jaimini Yoga and Tutorial centre.', 'Yoga instructor', '', '<h1>Jaimini Yoga and Tutorial Centre: Nurturing Mind, Body, and Spirit in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the vibrant Panjabari Road in Guwahati, Assam, Jaimini Yoga and Tutorial Centre stands as a unique establishment dedicated to holistic well-being. We offer a comprehensive blend of traditional yoga practices and personalized tutorial services, catering to the diverse needs of the local community.  Our approach goes beyond simple instruction; we foster a supportive and enriching environment that empowers individuals to achieve their personal and academic goals.  In a region increasingly focused on technological advancement, Jaimini strives to maintain a balance by offering an oasis of tranquility and intellectual growth.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Jaimini distinguishes itself from other fitness and tutorial centers through its integrated approach. We recognize the interconnectedness of physical, mental, and intellectual well-being. This understanding forms the foundation of our holistic approach to education and wellness.  While many centers focus solely on one area, we offer a synergistic combination, allowing students and clients to access both academic support and the profound benefits of yoga, fostering a healthier, more balanced lifestyle. This unique model directly addresses the increasing demand in Guwahati for integrated wellness solutions and comprehensive educational support.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our core offerings encompass two distinct yet complementary areas: yoga and tutorial services.  Our yoga classes are meticulously designed to accommodate all levels, from beginners to experienced practitioners. We offer a variety of styles, including Hatha, Vinyasa, and restorative yoga, each tailored to different needs and preferences.  Our experienced instructors emphasize proper alignment, mindful breathing, and a deep understanding of yogic principles.  This ensures a safe and effective practice, promoting physical strength, flexibility, and mental clarity. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our tutorial services provide personalized academic support across a range of subjects.  We offer individualized tutoring, group study sessions, and exam preparation courses for students of all ages. Our tutors are highly qualified professionals with proven experience in fostering academic success.  We focus on building strong foundational knowledge, developing effective study habits, and boosting confidence. We understand the unique challenges faced by students in Assam\'s educational system, and our tailored approach addresses these challenges directly.   This commitment to personalized instruction ensures that each student receives the support they need to thrive academically.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Jaimini Yoga and Tutorial Centre, we believe in building strong relationships with our clients. We prioritize personalized attention, creating a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where individuals feel comfortable and encouraged to reach their full potential.  Our instructors and tutors are not just educators; they are mentors who guide and inspire. We actively encourage feedback and strive to continually improve our services based on the needs and preferences of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We foster a strong sense of community through workshops, events, and social gatherings.  These initiatives provide opportunities for students and clients to connect, share experiences, and build lasting relationships. This community-focused approach is integral to our identity and helps to create a supportive network where individuals feel connected and supported on their wellness and academic journeys.  We regularly participate in local events and initiatives to further integrate with the Guwahati community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Jaimini Yoga and Tutorial Centre envisions a future where we become a leading provider of holistic well-being and educational services in Guwahati. We plan to expand our offerings to include a wider range of yoga styles, specialized workshops, and advanced tutorial programs.  This expansion will cater to the evolving needs of the community and strengthen our position as a comprehensive wellness and education provider.  We also aim to develop partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote holistic health and academic excellence across the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a state-of-the-art facility, expanding our team of qualified instructors and tutors, and developing a robust online platform to reach a wider audience.  Through continuous innovation and unwavering commitment to excellence, we aim to create a lasting legacy of promoting health, wellness, and academic achievement in the heart of Guwahati.  We are committed to using our platform to empower individuals and contribute positively to the growth and development of our community.  Our dedication to fostering a thriving environment for both physical and mental well-being makes us a unique and valuable asset to the Panjabari Road business landscape.</p> <br> <br>', 'Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8822837132', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:50:36', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(237, 'Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre (Dispur)', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre (Dispur)</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled near Hotel Rajdhani Regency Lastgate in Dispur, Assam, Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre offers a holistic approach to wellness, integrating the ancient wisdom of yoga and naturopathy with modern scientific understanding.  We are committed to providing high-quality, personalized care to individuals seeking to improve their physical, mental, and emotional well-being.  In a region increasingly aware of the importance of preventative healthcare and natural remedies, Prasanti stands as a beacon of holistic wellness, uniquely positioned to address the growing demand for alternative and complementary therapies in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our significance in the local business landscape stems from our dedication to providing accessible and effective holistic health solutions.  Unlike many fitness centers or spas that primarily focus on aesthetics, Prasanti emphasizes the foundational principles of health and wellness.  We offer a sanctuary for individuals seeking a pathway to lasting well-being, addressing both the physical and spiritual aspects of health. This dedication to a comprehensive approach sets us apart in a market that is increasingly recognizing the limitations of purely conventional medical practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around yoga and naturopathy.  We offer a diverse range of yoga classes tailored to various levels of experience and physical capabilities, from beginner-friendly Hatha Yoga to more advanced styles like Ashtanga and Vinyasa.  Our experienced and certified instructors provide personalized guidance and modifications to ensure a safe and effective practice for every individual.  Beyond yoga, we offer a comprehensive range of naturopathic therapies including herbal remedies, dietary consultations, and lifestyle counseling.  These consultations are designed to help individuals identify and address the root causes of their health concerns through natural and non-invasive methods.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Prasanti is our emphasis on personalized care.  We don\'t follow a one-size-fits-all approach.  Instead, we conduct thorough initial consultations to understand each individual\'s specific needs, health history, and goals.  This personalized approach ensures that our treatments are tailored to achieve optimal results.  Furthermore, we integrate ancient Ayurvedic principles with modern wellness practices, creating a unique blend that resonates deeply with the local community\'s cultural heritage and contemporary health aspirations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>These services directly meet the local market needs by addressing the growing demand for preventative healthcare and natural therapies.  Many individuals in the region are seeking alternatives to conventional medicine, looking for holistic approaches that promote long-term well-being. Prasanti provides a safe, supportive, and effective environment for individuals to explore these options and achieve their health goals. We also cater to the specific needs of the Assamese population, incorporating traditional practices where appropriate, while maintaining the highest standards of professionalism and safety.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Prasanti, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount.  We foster a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where clients feel comfortable and empowered to take control of their health.  Our team of dedicated professionals is committed to providing personalized attention, answering questions thoroughly, and guiding clients through their wellness journey. We prioritize open communication and strive to create a space where clients feel heard, understood, and respected.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our commitment to building genuine connections with our clients.  We go beyond simply providing services; we strive to build lasting relationships based on trust and mutual respect.  We actively engage with the local community through workshops, health talks, and collaborations with other wellness professionals.  This commitment to community engagement allows us to further our mission of promoting holistic wellness throughout the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We regularly solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting the needs of our clients effectively. We actively participate in local events and initiatives that promote healthy lifestyles, further strengthening our connection with the Dispur community and solidifying our position as a trusted resource for holistic wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre envisions a future where holistic wellness is accessible to everyone in the Dispur region and beyond.  We plan to expand our services by offering specialized workshops and retreats focusing on various aspects of yoga and naturopathy.  We also aim to expand our team of qualified professionals, incorporating expertise in areas such as Ayurveda and meditation.  Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities for collaborations with local businesses and organizations to further promote wellness and healthy lifestyles.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Prasanti as a leading centre for holistic wellness in Assam, renowned for its high-quality services, personalized care, and strong community connections.  We are committed to ongoing professional development and the continuous improvement of our services to ensure that we remain at the forefront of the evolving wellness landscape.  Our dedication to providing an authentic, transformative, and culturally sensitive wellness experience will ensure the continued success and positive impact of Prasanti Yoga & Naturopathy Centre.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, we aspire to become a cornerstone of healthy living in Dispur, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. Our commitment to excellence, personalized service, and community engagement will guide us in achieving this ambitious, yet achievable, vision.</p>', 'Near Hotel Rajdhani Regency Lastgate', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002963007', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:50:44', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(238, 'Yogshala', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Yogshala: Cultivating Wellness in the Heart of Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at House no 12, Satya Bora Ln, Yogshala is more than just a yoga studio; it\'s a sanctuary for wellness, a vibrant hub fostering physical, mental, and spiritual growth within the heart of Assam.  We recognize the unique needs of our community and strive to provide accessible and enriching yoga experiences that cater to all levels, from seasoned practitioners to curious newcomers. Our commitment to traditional yogic practices blended with a modern, welcoming approach sets us apart in the local landscape, offering a unique and valuable contribution to the wellness sector of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Yogshala offers a diverse range of yoga styles to cater to individual preferences and fitness levels.  Our core services include Hatha Yoga, known for its foundational postures and mindful movements; Vinyasa Yoga, a dynamic and flowing practice; and Restorative Yoga, a gentle and deeply relaxing style ideal for stress reduction and rejuvenation.  We also offer specialized workshops focusing on pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and yoga philosophy, providing a holistic approach to wellness.  A unique selling point is our incorporation of traditional Assamese elements into our practice, incorporating local music, incorporating locally sourced materials in our studio design, and drawing inspiration from the rich cultural heritage of the region into our teaching philosophy. This approach creates a truly authentic and culturally resonant experience unlike any other in the area. This uniquely blends the ancient wisdom of yoga with the vibrant culture of Assam, creating a deeply enriching experience for our students.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment extends to every aspect of the Yogshala experience. We prioritize building a strong sense of community amongst our students, fostering a supportive and encouraging atmosphere where individuals can feel comfortable exploring their practice at their own pace. Our instructors are highly trained and experienced, passionate about sharing their knowledge and guiding students on their wellness journeys.  We emphasize personalized attention, ensuring each student receives the support and guidance they need to thrive.  Beyond the mat, we actively engage with the local community by partnering with local businesses and charities, hosting community events, and offering subsidized classes to those facing financial constraints. We believe that the benefits of yoga should be accessible to everyone, regardless of their background or financial situation, aligning our business with the values of the community we serve.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our approach to customer service is centered on building trust and fostering long-term relationships.  We achieve this through attentive communication, personalized feedback, and a genuine commitment to meeting the unique needs of each student.  We maintain open channels of communication, encouraging feedback and suggestions to ensure we continuously improve and adapt our offerings to better serve the community. We use a personalized scheduling system and offer flexible class times to accommodate various schedules and lifestyles.  This dedication to providing a truly exceptional customer experience sets us apart and cultivates a loyal community of practitioners.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Yogshala envisions a future where wellness is integrated into the daily lives of individuals throughout Assam.  Our long-term goal is to expand our services to include teacher training programs, thereby empowering individuals within the community to become yoga instructors and share the benefits of yoga with others. We also plan to introduce new and specialized yoga styles tailored to specific needs, such as prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and therapeutic yoga for specific conditions. Further expansion may include establishing additional studios throughout Assam, making our services more widely accessible.  We aim to become a leading center for yoga and wellness in the region, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community.  This includes developing partnerships with healthcare professionals to integrate yoga into therapeutic programs, further demonstrating the value of yoga within the wider health ecosystem of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Yogshala is committed to providing a unique and enriching yoga experience, grounded in tradition and tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community. Our dedication to exceptional customer service, our inclusive environment, and our long-term vision for growth position us as a valuable and impactful contributor to the region\'s wellness landscape.  We are more than a yoga studio; we are a community dedicated to cultivating wellbeing, one breath at a time.</p> <br> <br>', 'House no 12, Satya Bora Ln', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:55:11', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(239, 'TRIKON', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>TRIKON: Shaping the Future of [Industry] in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at House No 2, Rashmi Path, TRIKON is more than just a business; it\'s a testament to innovation and commitment within the vibrant Assam business landscape.  We are a dynamic enterprise dedicated to [Clearly state the industry, e.g., providing cutting-edge technological solutions to small and medium-sized enterprises, offering bespoke handcrafted tea blends, or specializing in sustainable agricultural practices].  Our unique approach combines [Mention key differentiators, e.g., traditional craftsmanship with modern technology, locally sourced ingredients with global expertise, or environmentally friendly methods with high yields] to deliver unparalleled value to our clients and contribute meaningfully to the economic growth of our region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike many businesses operating in Assam, TRIKON prioritizes [Mention a key value proposition, e.g., building lasting relationships with our clients, empowering local communities, or fostering sustainable and ethical business practices].  This commitment distinguishes us, creating a strong foundation of trust and mutual benefit. We believe in fostering genuine connections, not just transactions, and understand the unique needs and challenges faced by businesses and individuals within the Assamese market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>TRIKON offers a comprehensive suite of services and products tailored to the specific demands of the Assamese market. Our primary offerings include [List core services/products with brief descriptions. Examples:  \"bespoke software development catering to the unique requirements of regional businesses\", \"a diverse range of high-quality tea blends using ethically sourced Assamese tea leaves\", or \"consultative services in sustainable agriculture, focused on increasing crop yield and minimizing environmental impact\"].</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our dedication to [Mention unique selling points, e.g., utilizing the latest technologies, adhering to stringent quality control standards, or offering personalized customer support].  We strive to provide solutions that are not only effective but also sustainable, contributing to the long-term prosperity of the region.  For example, [Provide a concrete example illustrating the unique selling proposition. E.g., \"our software solutions are designed with scalability in mind, allowing businesses to grow and adapt without needing to replace their systems\", or \"we provide our clients with detailed reports and feedback on their tea yield and quality, using advanced data analysis techniques\", or \"we work closely with farmers, offering training and support to help improve their practices and increase profitability while protecting the environment\"].</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our services and products directly address critical needs within the local market.  [Explain how your services meet specific market needs. E.g., \"Many businesses in Assam lack access to affordable and reliable technological solutions; we bridge this gap by offering customized software development at competitive prices\", or \"The demand for high-quality, authentic Assamese tea is increasing globally; we meet this demand by providing a superior product with exceptional customer service\", or \"Assamese agriculture faces numerous challenges; we provide farmers with the tools and knowledge to overcome these challenges and improve their livelihoods\"].</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At TRIKON, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect. Our approach is characterized by personalized attention, proactive communication, and a commitment to exceeding expectations. We actively seek feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and products.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We differentiate ourselves through our [Mention specific customer service approaches, e.g., responsive customer support team available via multiple channels, regular client check-ins to monitor progress, or personalized training and support programs]. Our commitment extends beyond individual clients; we strive to connect with the broader Assamese community through [Mention community initiatives, e.g., supporting local charities, sponsoring community events, or offering educational workshops].  We believe in giving back to the community that supports us.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>TRIKON\'s future is bright.  We envision becoming a leading provider of [State your industry focus] in Assam, renowned for our innovation, quality, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. Our plans for the future include [Mention specific growth plans, e.g., expanding our product/service offerings, increasing our market reach, or developing strategic partnerships with other businesses]. We are committed to investing in research and development to stay at the forefront of our industry.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute significantly to the economic growth and development of Assam. We aim to create a sustainable business that not only thrives but also empowers local communities and promotes environmentally responsible practices.  We believe in building a future where business success is synonymous with societal progress.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>TRIKON is more than just a business; it’s a partner in progress, a contributor to the vibrant tapestry of Assam\'s economy, and a symbol of innovation and commitment to excellence.</p>', 'House No 2, Rashmi Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9365162011', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:55:19', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(240, 'Gunjan Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Gunjan Yoga Studio: Finding Harmony in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at 19, Chandangiri Path, Gunjan Yoga Studio offers a sanctuary of peace and well-being in the heart of Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub dedicated to fostering physical and mental health through the transformative practice of yoga.  In a region increasingly embracing holistic wellness, Gunjan Yoga Studio provides a unique and accessible approach to yoga, catering to diverse needs and skill levels within the local community. Our commitment to authentic instruction, personalized attention, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart in the vibrant and evolving Assam business landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around providing high-quality yoga instruction across various styles.  We offer introductory classes for beginners, focusing on foundational poses and breathing techniques to build a strong base.  For more experienced practitioners, we provide challenging intermediate and advanced classes, incorporating variations and deeper stretches.  Beyond traditional Hatha and Vinyasa flows, we also introduce specialized classes such as Restorative Yoga for stress relief, Prenatal Yoga for expectant mothers, and Yin Yoga for deep tissue release.  This variety allows us to cater to a wide range of needs and preferences, fostering inclusivity and accessibility within our diverse clientele.  Our unique selling point lies in our instructors’ deep understanding of traditional yoga practices combined with their ability to adapt and modify poses to suit individual needs and physical limitations. This personalized approach ensures a safe and effective practice for everyone, regardless of their experience or physical condition.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Gunjan Yoga Studio, we believe that a positive customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment where students feel comfortable, supported, and inspired.  Our studio boasts a serene and spacious practice area, equipped with high-quality mats and props.  Small class sizes ensure personalized attention from our instructors, allowing for individual adjustments and feedback.  Beyond the physical practice, we foster a sense of community through workshops, social gatherings, and opportunities for connection among students.  We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events, strengthening our ties with the people of Assam.  We recognize the importance of accessibility and offer flexible scheduling options to accommodate busy lifestyles. This includes online booking, various class times, and introductory offers to encourage new students to experience the benefits of yoga.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond the present; we have ambitious plans for the future growth of Gunjan Yoga Studio. We envision expanding our range of services to include workshops on yoga philosophy, meditation, and Ayurveda.  We plan to introduce teacher training programs to nurture the next generation of yoga instructors in the region, contributing to the growth of the holistic wellness sector in Assam.  We aim to collaborate with local businesses and organizations to offer corporate wellness programs, bringing the benefits of yoga to the workplace. Our long-term goal is to establish Gunjan Yoga Studio as a leading wellness center in Assam, renowned for its high-quality instruction, community focus, and positive impact on the physical and mental health of the community.  We are dedicated to sustainable growth, prioritizing quality over quantity, and consistently seeking feedback from our students to continually improve our services and offerings.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future of Gunjan Yoga Studio is bright.  We are confident that our commitment to quality instruction, personalized attention, and community engagement will continue to attract new students and strengthen our position within the Assam market.  Our focus on building a vibrant and supportive community ensures that our studio remains a welcoming and nurturing space for all who seek the transformative benefits of yoga.  Through continued innovation, strategic partnerships, and a relentless dedication to our students, we are poised to become a leading voice in the growing wellness sector of Assam, inspiring individuals to embrace a healthier and more fulfilling lifestyle.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Gunjan Yoga Studio is more than a business; it is a reflection of our commitment to the well-being of individuals and the community. We invite you to experience the transformative power of yoga within our serene and welcoming space. We are confident that your journey with us will be a fulfilling one, contributing to a healthier and more harmonious life.</p>', '19, Chandangiri Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 17:55:26', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL);
