(249, 'The Three Gym', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>The Three Gym: Shaping a Healthier Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at 78, Ajanta Path, The Three Gym stands as a beacon of fitness and wellness in the vibrant landscape of Assam.  More than just a gym, we are a community hub dedicated to fostering a healthier lifestyle through personalized training, cutting-edge equipment, and an unwavering commitment to our members\' success.  Our unique approach blends the latest fitness methodologies with a deep understanding of the specific needs and preferences of the Assamese community, setting us apart in the local fitness market.  We strive to create an environment that is both challenging and supportive, empowering individuals to achieve their fitness goals and build a stronger, healthier Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence begins with our comprehensive range of services.  We offer a state-of-the-art fitness center equipped with the latest cardio and strength training equipment, meticulously chosen to cater to diverse fitness levels and training styles.  Beyond the equipment, we provide a dynamic schedule of group fitness classes, including Zumba, Yoga, Aerobics, and specialized strength and conditioning programs.  These classes are tailored to meet varying levels of experience, fostering a supportive and inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of their fitness background.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized training plans.  Each member undergoes a comprehensive assessment to identify their fitness goals and limitations, following which a dedicated trainer develops a tailored plan.  This individualized approach ensures effective and safe progress, maximizing results and minimizing the risk of injury.  We understand the importance of nutritional guidance in achieving holistic wellness and offer nutritional counseling services as part of our comprehensive fitness packages.  This holistic approach, combining fitness training and nutritional support, effectively addresses the growing demand for health and wellness solutions within the Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Three Gym, customer experience is paramount.  We cultivate a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where members feel comfortable, supported, and motivated.  Our dedicated team of highly trained and certified instructors are not just fitness professionals; they are mentors who build relationships with each member, providing encouragement, guidance, and accountability.  We actively engage with the local community through participation in health awareness campaigns, sponsoring local sporting events, and offering discounted memberships to local schools and organizations.  Our commitment extends beyond the gym walls, reflecting our dedication to building a strong and healthy community within Assam.  We are proud to offer flexible membership options designed to suit individual budgets and lifestyles, ensuring accessibility to our services for a broad spectrum of the community.  Our ongoing feedback mechanisms ensure continuous improvement in our offerings and services, adapting to the ever-evolving needs of our members.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Three Gym is poised for significant growth and expansion within the Assamese market.  Our future plans include expanding our class offerings to incorporate emerging fitness trends and incorporating advanced technologies to further enhance the member experience.  We envision strategically partnering with local businesses and organizations to promote health and wellness across the region.  Our long-term goal is to establish multiple locations across Assam, becoming the leading provider of comprehensive fitness solutions and a driving force behind improved health and wellness for the entire state.  We will continually invest in the development of our team and facilities, ensuring that we maintain our high standards of quality and customer service, further cementing our position as a trusted and respected fitness establishment in Assam.  This growth will be driven by our commitment to understanding and catering to the specific needs of the Assamese community, ensuring the accessibility and relevance of our offerings.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, The Three Gym is more than a fitness center; it is a testament to the growing emphasis on health and wellness in Assam.  Our unique blend of cutting-edge facilities, personalized training, community engagement, and a commitment to customer satisfaction positions us as a leading player in the local fitness landscape.  With ambitious plans for future expansion and a deep commitment to the Assamese community, we are confident in our ability to continue shaping a healthier and more vibrant future for Assam, one member at a time.  Our goal is to continuously improve, innovate and expand our offerings to remain at the forefront of fitness solutions within Assam, ensuring a comprehensive and engaging experience for every member who chooses to join us on their fitness journey.</p>', '78, Ajanta Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:05:18', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(250, 'SAI YOGA CENTRE', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>SAI YOGA CENTRE: Finding Harmony in the Heart of Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on Dr Bhupen Hazarika Path, near the esteemed Lalsingh Academy School, SAI YOGA CENTRE offers a tranquil sanctuary for individuals seeking physical and mental well-being through the ancient practice of yoga.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub fostering holistic health and mindful living within the vibrant tapestry of Guwahati\'s cultural landscape. Our commitment to authentic yogic principles, combined with a deeply personalized approach, sets us apart in the growing wellness sector of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>SAI YOGA CENTRE distinguishes itself through a dedicated focus on individual needs and a comprehensive curriculum catering to diverse experience levels. We understand that the journey to wellness is unique to each person.  Therefore, we offer a range of classes designed to accommodate beginners seeking foundational knowledge and experienced practitioners looking to deepen their practice.  Our classes are not merely physical exercises; they are meticulously crafted to cultivate mindfulness, enhance flexibility, improve strength, and promote overall balance – both physically and mentally.  We emphasize the importance of proper alignment and breathing techniques, ensuring a safe and effective practice for all participants.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our primary service is a wide array of yoga classes, including Hatha, Vinyasa, Ashtanga, and restorative yoga.  We also offer specialized workshops on pranayama (breathing techniques), meditation, and yoga philosophy. These workshops delve deeper into the theoretical and practical aspects of yoga, enriching the overall learning experience and encouraging a more holistic understanding of this ancient practice.  Furthermore, we conduct personalized yoga sessions tailored to individual needs and goals, whether it\'s injury rehabilitation, stress management, or simply enhancing overall fitness.  Beyond classes and workshops, SAI YOGA CENTRE provides a curated selection of high-quality yoga mats, apparel, and accessories, ensuring convenience and support for our students’ practice.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point is our emphasis on accessibility and inclusivity. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment for individuals of all ages, fitness levels, and backgrounds. Our instructors are highly qualified, experienced, and deeply passionate about sharing the transformative power of yoga with the community.  We understand the specific needs of the Assamese population and tailor our teaching to reflect the cultural nuances and preferences of our clientele.  This localized approach is what truly differentiates us, establishing a strong connection with our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At SAI YOGA CENTRE, our commitment to exceptional customer service extends beyond the yoga mat. We believe in building genuine relationships with our students and fostering a sense of community within our studio.  This starts with a warm welcome and personalized attention from our friendly and knowledgeable staff. We offer introductory sessions to help newcomers find the best class for their needs and provide ongoing support to ensure continued progress and satisfaction. Regular feedback sessions, both formal and informal, provide opportunities for students to voice concerns, share experiences, and contribute to refining our services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and charitable organizations, participating in community events and sponsoring local initiatives to promote health and wellness. This community engagement not only strengthens our brand identity but also underscores our dedication to giving back to the region that supports us.  By offering scholarships and reduced-fee programs, we make yoga accessible to a wider segment of the population, ensuring that the benefits of this transformative practice reach those who need it most.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>SAI YOGA CENTRE envisions a future where yoga becomes an integral part of the daily lives of many in Guwahati. We plan to expand our range of classes and workshops, incorporating new and innovative approaches while retaining our focus on traditional yogic principles.  This includes exploring specialized yoga styles catering to specific needs, such as prenatal yoga and yoga for seniors. We also plan to develop a comprehensive online platform, offering virtual classes and resources to broaden our reach and cater to individuals who may not be able to attend in-person sessions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish SAI YOGA CENTRE as a leading wellness destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, community engagement, and transformative impact on the lives of our students. We aim to contribute to the overall health and well-being of the region by promoting mindful living and empowering individuals through the practice of yoga.  Through continuous growth, expansion of our offerings, and unwavering commitment to our community, we are confident in realizing our vision of a healthier, happier, and more harmonious Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in the power of yoga to transform lives and are excited to continue this journey of growth and positive change, right here in the heart of Guwahati.</p>', 'Dr Bhupen Hazarika Path, near Lalsingh Academy School', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864014197', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:05:26', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(251, 'Kinetics Fitness Studio', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>Kinetics Fitness Studio: Shaping a Healthier Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Kinetics Fitness Studio, nestled on the vibrant Bishnu Rabha Path, is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a dynamic hub fostering holistic well-being within the heart of Assam.  We understand the unique needs of our community and strive to provide accessible, effective, and engaging fitness solutions tailored to the local landscape.  Our commitment extends beyond simply offering workouts; we aim to build a supportive community where individuals can achieve their fitness aspirations and cultivate a healthier lifestyle.  This commitment sets us apart in the growing Assam fitness market, focusing on personalized attention and results-driven programs.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our approach differs from generic fitness chains by prioritizing individual needs and community engagement. We recognize that the \"one-size-fits-all\" approach fails to cater to the diverse needs and preferences within our community. This is why we offer a comprehensive range of services designed to meet a broad spectrum of fitness goals and abilities. We believe that fitness is a journey, not a destination, and our programs reflect this philosophy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Kinetics Fitness Studio offers a diverse range of services to cater to the varied fitness requirements of our clientele.  Our flagship offering is our comprehensive range of expertly designed fitness classes. These include high-intensity interval training (HIIT), Yoga, Zumba, Pilates, and strength training programs, all tailored to different fitness levels and preferences.  Our experienced and certified instructors provide personalized guidance and motivation, ensuring participants achieve their individual fitness goals within a supportive and encouraging atmosphere. Beyond classes, we provide access to state-of-the-art equipment for individualized workouts.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point is our specialized programs.  Recognizing the unique needs of the Assamese population, we\'ve developed fitness programs that incorporate traditional Assamese exercises and movement patterns, blending modern fitness techniques with the wisdom of traditional practices.  This creates a truly unique and culturally relevant fitness experience unavailable elsewhere.  Furthermore, we offer nutritional guidance and workshops, educating our members about healthy eating habits appropriate for the local climate and dietary preferences, further enhancing their wellness journey. Our commitment to providing personalized plans, coupled with our culturally relevant approach, meets the specific market demands and ensures effective and engaging fitness solutions for our clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Kinetics Fitness Studio, we believe that exceptional customer experience is paramount. We foster a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels comfortable and supported.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are dedicated to providing personalized attention, guiding members through their fitness journeys, and ensuring they feel valued and understood.  We actively encourage a sense of community among our members, promoting interaction and camaraderie through social events and group fitness initiatives. This fosters a supportive environment that contributes significantly to motivation and overall success.  Our commitment to personalized service, including regular progress check-ins and customized workout plans, ensures that each member receives the attention they need to thrive.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our connection to the local community goes beyond simply providing fitness services. We regularly partner with local health organizations and community groups to promote wellness initiatives and host free fitness events for the wider public.  We also actively support local businesses and charities, reflecting our deep commitment to the growth and well-being of the entire Assam community.  By engaging with our community on multiple levels, we create a strong sense of belonging and reinforce our position as a vital part of the local landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Kinetics Fitness Studio envisions a future where we become the leading fitness destination in Assam, recognized for our exceptional services, commitment to community, and culturally relevant approach to fitness. Our growth strategy focuses on expanding our range of services, potentially including specialized programs for senior citizens, pregnant women, and individuals with specific health conditions.  We plan to introduce advanced fitness technologies and expand our facility to accommodate growing membership.  We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and health organizations, creating a more integrated approach to community wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Kinetics Fitness Studio as a beacon of health and wellness, not only within Bishnu Rabha Path but across Assam. We strive to create a sustainable model that promotes healthy lifestyles, empowers individuals to achieve their fitness goals, and strengthens the overall well-being of our community. By continuously adapting to the evolving needs of our clientele, embracing innovation, and nurturing a strong sense of community, we are confident in achieving our ambitious vision and making a lasting positive impact on the lives of our members and the wider Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to investing in our staff\'s professional development, ensuring they receive ongoing training and education to provide the highest quality fitness guidance. This commitment to excellence, combined with our dedication to the community, will continue to solidify Kinetics Fitness Studio\'s reputation as a trusted and respected establishment in Assam.</p>', 'Bishnu Rabha Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9387637805', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:05:34', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(252, 'UPAVEDA- Pain Treatment & Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>UPAVEDA - Pain Treatment & Ayurvedic Clinic</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the 1st Floor of Ambika Complex, UPAVEDA - Pain Treatment & Ayurvedic Clinic represents a unique and vital addition to Assam\'s healthcare landscape.  We offer a holistic approach to pain management and wellness, blending the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda with modern diagnostic techniques.  Our clinic distinguishes itself by providing personalized care rooted in traditional Ayurvedic principles, while simultaneously employing contemporary methods to ensure accurate diagnoses and effective treatment strategies. This unique blend caters to a growing demand for alternative and complementary therapies in the region, offering a refreshing alternative to conventional pain management approaches.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>UPAVEDA\'s significance within the local business community lies in its commitment to providing accessible and high-quality Ayurvedic healthcare.  We recognize the prevalence of chronic pain and the limitations of solely relying on conventional medical interventions.  By incorporating the time-tested methods of Ayurveda, we aim to address the root causes of pain, promoting long-term relief and improved overall well-being.  This approach not only caters to individuals seeking alternative pain management but also actively contributes to the growing recognition and acceptance of Ayurveda as a valuable healthcare modality within Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around the diagnosis and treatment of various pain conditions using a comprehensive Ayurvedic approach.  This includes detailed consultations, pulse diagnosis, individualized treatment plans, and the administration of herbal remedies, therapeutic massages (Abhyanga), and Panchakarma therapies (where appropriate and under expert supervision). We tailor treatments to individual needs and constitutions, emphasizing personalized care rather than a one-size-fits-all approach.  Unique to UPAVEDA is our integration of modern diagnostic tools alongside Ayurvedic practices, ensuring a thorough understanding of the patient\'s condition before devising a treatment plan. This hybrid approach provides clients with the confidence of modern medical assessment combined with the healing power of Ayurveda.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also offer a range of Ayurvedic wellness packages aimed at preventative healthcare and stress reduction.  These packages include specialized massages, herbal steam baths (Swedana), and dietary consultations, promoting holistic wellness and overall health improvement.  The unique selling points of UPAVEDA include our highly qualified and experienced Ayurvedic practitioners, our commitment to using only high-quality, ethically sourced herbs, and our personalized, compassionate approach to patient care.  Our services directly address the local market\'s growing need for effective pain relief and wellness solutions that align with traditional and cultural values.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At UPAVEDA, we prioritize a patient-centric approach to healthcare. Our commitment to building strong doctor-patient relationships is paramount. We create a comfortable and welcoming atmosphere where individuals feel heard, understood, and respected.  Our practitioners take the time to listen attentively to each patient\'s concerns, conducting thorough consultations to fully understand their medical history and lifestyle. This personalized approach extends beyond the consultation room; we provide ongoing support and guidance throughout the treatment process, ensuring patients feel empowered and informed every step of the way.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets UPAVEDA apart is our dedication to connecting with the local community. We regularly organize workshops and health awareness programs to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda and its role in pain management.  We actively engage with local community organizations and participate in health fairs, striving to become a trusted resource for holistic healthcare within Assam. This commitment to community engagement reinforces our dedication to providing accessible and affordable Ayurvedic treatments, ensuring that our services benefit a broad range of individuals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>UPAVEDA envisions becoming a leading provider of holistic pain treatment and Ayurvedic wellness services in Assam.  Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate specialized Ayurvedic treatments for specific conditions, as well as offering advanced training programs for aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners. We aim to establish collaborative relationships with other healthcare providers in the region, fostering a synergistic approach to patient care.  This collaboration will enhance the overall quality of healthcare in the region, promoting a more integrated and holistic approach to wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, UPAVEDA aims to become a recognized center of excellence for Ayurvedic medicine in Assam, contributing to the advancement of this traditional healing system.  We plan to conduct research into the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments for specific pain conditions, contributing to the growing body of evidence supporting its effectiveness.  Our ultimate goal is to improve the quality of life for individuals suffering from chronic pain and to promote a culture of holistic well-being within the community.  We are committed to making UPAVEDA a leading force in the evolution of healthcare in Assam, combining the best of traditional and modern approaches to deliver exceptional patient care.</p> <br> <br>', '1st Floor, Ambika Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8724872789', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:05:41', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(253, 'Trishoolin yoga and wellness', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness: Cultivating Wellbeing in the Heart of Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness, nestled at House no 8, Nihar Path, Niribili Path, offers a haven of tranquility and rejuvenation in the vibrant landscape of Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a holistic wellness center dedicated to empowering individuals to achieve optimal physical, mental, and spiritual well-being.  Our unique approach blends traditional Ashtanga yoga practices with the healing wisdom of Ayurveda, creating a transformative experience tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community.  In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and emphasis on community, Trishoolin aims to become a central hub for holistic wellness, fostering a sense of connection and shared growth among our clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to providing exceptional service differentiates us within the local market. We recognize that the demands of modern life can often leave individuals feeling stressed and disconnected.  Trishoolin offers a sanctuary where individuals can escape the daily pressures and reconnect with their inner selves. Our location, in a peaceful residential area, contributes to the serene and calming atmosphere we have cultivated. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At Trishoolin, we offer a comprehensive range of services designed to meet diverse wellness needs.  Our core offering centers around Ashtanga yoga classes, catering to various skill levels, from beginners to experienced practitioners.  We emphasize mindful movement, proper alignment, and the cultivation of inner peace through the practice.  Our experienced instructors are certified and passionate about guiding students on their individual yoga journeys.  Beyond Ashtanga, we also offer Hatha and Vinyasa flow classes, ensuring a variety of options to suit different preferences and fitness levels.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In addition to yoga, we provide Ayurvedic consultations and therapies.  Ayurveda, the ancient Indian system of medicine, focuses on restoring balance within the body through personalized dietary recommendations, herbal remedies, and massage therapies.  Our Ayurvedic practitioner collaborates closely with yoga instructors to provide holistic wellness plans tailored to each client\'s unique constitution and needs.  This integrated approach ensures a synergistic effect, maximizing the benefits of both yoga and Ayurveda.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique aspect of our offering is our incorporation of traditional Assamese practices into our wellness programs. We offer workshops and retreats that explore the connection between yoga, Ayurveda, and the rich cultural heritage of Assam. These workshops often incorporate local ingredients and practices, creating a truly unique and immersive experience for our clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also offer a curated selection of high-quality yoga props, including mats, blocks, straps, and bolsters, sourced from ethical and sustainable providers. This ensures our clients have access to the best tools to support their practice. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Trishoolin, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a thriving business. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable and supported. Our staff is highly trained in providing personalized attention, understanding the unique needs and goals of each client. We take the time to get to know our clients, understanding their health concerns, fitness levels, and wellness aspirations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We foster a strong sense of community among our clients through regular workshops, social gatherings, and special events.  This community-centric approach helps clients connect with like-minded individuals, creating a supportive and encouraging environment for their wellness journey.  Our commitment to building relationships extends beyond our studio walls, as we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with other businesses and participation in local events.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Trishoolin Yoga and Wellness envisions a future where we become a leading provider of holistic wellness services in Assam.  We plan to expand our offerings by introducing new yoga styles, incorporating more traditional Assamese healing modalities, and developing specialized programs for specific populations such as pregnant women, seniors, and individuals with chronic conditions.  We also plan to expand our facilities, potentially adding a dedicated Ayurvedic treatment room and a meditation space.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Trishoolin as a recognized center of excellence in holistic wellness, not only within Assam but also within the broader northeastern region of India.  We aim to contribute to the overall well-being of the community by promoting healthy lifestyles, fostering a sense of connection, and empowering individuals to live their most fulfilling lives.  We will achieve this through continued investment in our staff, expansion of our services, and a steadfast commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe that the increasing awareness of the importance of holistic health and wellness presents significant growth opportunities for Trishoolin.  By continuing to innovate, adapt, and prioritize the needs of our clients, we are confident in our ability to achieve our ambitious goals and make a lasting positive impact on the community we serve.</p>', 'House no 8, Nihar Path, Niribili Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:10:12', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(254, 'Fit7 By MS Dhoni', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Fit7 By MS Dhoni: Elevating Fitness in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Fit7 By MS Dhoni, strategically located at KK Tower, 2nd Floor, GS Rd, near SB Deorah College Borah Service in Guwahati, Assam, represents a significant addition to the state\'s burgeoning fitness landscape.  More than just a gym, Fit7 offers a holistic fitness experience infused with the discipline and dedication synonymous with the brand\'s namesake.  We leverage cutting-edge technology, expert-led training, and a community-focused approach to empower individuals to achieve their fitness aspirations, fostering a healthier and more vibrant Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique position in the market stems from the powerful combination of a globally recognized brand associated with excellence and a deep understanding of the specific needs of the Guwahati community.  Unlike generic fitness centers, Fit7 provides a tailored experience that goes beyond simple equipment access. We recognize the diverse fitness goals and preferences within our community and have structured our programs to cater to each individual\'s journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Fit7 By MS Dhoni offers a comprehensive range of fitness services designed to cater to diverse fitness levels and objectives. Our state-of-the-art facility houses advanced cardio and strength training equipment, ensuring a diverse and stimulating workout experience.  Beyond the equipment, our core strength lies in our expertly designed fitness programs. These programs are developed by certified fitness professionals and incorporate a blend of high-intensity interval training (HIIT), strength conditioning, functional fitness, and personalized workout plans. We offer both group classes and personal training sessions, ensuring that every member receives the attention and guidance they need to succeed.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling proposition of Fit7 is our commitment to personalized training.  Our certified trainers conduct thorough fitness assessments to understand each member\'s individual needs, goals, and limitations.  Based on this assessment, they create customized workout plans and provide ongoing support to ensure optimal progress and injury prevention. This individualized approach sets us apart from more generic gym experiences and ensures that our members see tangible results. Furthermore, we integrate technology seamlessly into the fitness journey, providing members with access to fitness tracking apps and personalized nutritional guidance.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the specific needs of the Guwahati community, we\'ve tailored our offerings to address common health concerns and fitness preferences. Our programs incorporate elements of yoga and other traditional fitness practices, catering to the cultural preferences of our members.  We also offer nutrition workshops and consultation sessions to help individuals achieve their fitness goals through a holistic approach that considers both exercise and diet.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Fit7 By MS Dhoni, we prioritize creating a welcoming and supportive environment where members feel comfortable pursuing their fitness goals.  Our dedicated staff is committed to providing exceptional customer service, offering guidance, motivation, and a sense of community.  We foster a positive and inclusive atmosphere, ensuring that individuals of all fitness levels feel welcome and encouraged.  Our clean and modern facility contributes to a positive and motivating workout experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our gym walls. We actively participate in local health and wellness initiatives and sponsor community events, demonstrating our dedication to the well-being of Guwahati.  We strive to build a strong relationship with our members, fostering a sense of belonging and mutual support. Regular feedback sessions and member surveys help us continuously improve our services and better meet the evolving needs of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Fit7 By MS Dhoni envisions becoming the leading fitness destination in Guwahati and a benchmark for fitness excellence in Assam.  Our future plans include expanding our facility to accommodate more members and offer a wider range of fitness services.  We aim to introduce specialized programs focusing on specific demographics, such as senior fitness, youth training, and rehabilitation programs. We also plan to incorporate advanced technology and innovative fitness methodologies to further enhance our offerings.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we aim to establish multiple Fit7 locations across Assam, bringing our unique brand of fitness to more communities.  We also envision developing partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote health and wellness across the region.  Our commitment to community engagement, combined with our dedication to providing a superior fitness experience, will fuel our growth and solidify our position as a leader in the Assam fitness industry. Our goal is not only to help individuals achieve their personal fitness goals but also to contribute to the overall health and well-being of the community we serve. We believe in the transformative power of fitness and are committed to empowering individuals in their journey toward a healthier and happier life.</p> <br> <br>', 'KK Tower, 2nd Floor, GS Rd, near SB Deorah College Borah Service', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7577011234', '', 'http://fit7.in/guwahati-fit7-gym/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:10:20', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(255, 'WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the 3rd floor of a wellness studio in ABC, GS Road, Guwahati, opposite Sohum Emporia and conveniently located next to the Indian Oil Petrol Pump, WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina offers a sanctuary of rejuvenation and holistic well-being for the discerning residents of Assam.  We stand apart from the typical fitness centers and spas by offering a uniquely curated blend of traditional Ayurvedic practices and modern wellness techniques, catering specifically to the needs and preferences of the local community.  Our commitment to personalized service and a deeply relaxing atmosphere sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati wellness market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our significance within the Assam business landscape lies in our dedication to promoting holistic wellness, a concept gaining significant traction.  We address the growing demand for mindful self-care and preventative health measures, often overlooked in the fast-paced modern lifestyle.  By offering a comprehensive range of services, we cater to individuals seeking stress reduction, improved physical health, and overall enhanced well-being, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina provides a diverse array of services designed to nurture the mind, body, and spirit.  Our core offerings include personalized Ayurvedic consultations, incorporating traditional diagnostic methods and customized treatment plans based on individual doshas.  We offer a range of rejuvenating therapies, from traditional Abhyanga massages to Shirodhara and other specialized treatments designed to alleviate stress, improve circulation, and promote overall health.  Furthermore, we incorporate modern wellness practices like yoga, meditation sessions, and customized fitness plans, offering a complete holistic wellness experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point is our integration of traditional Ayurvedic wisdom with contemporary wellness modalities. This approach allows us to cater to a wide spectrum of clients, from those seeking authentic Ayurvedic treatments to those seeking a blend of ancient practices and modern fitness techniques. We also pride ourselves on sourcing high-quality, locally-sourced products whenever possible, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable practices.  Our customized treatment plans and attentive personalized service ensure that each client\'s experience is tailored to their specific needs and preferences.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our services directly address the local market needs by providing accessible and affordable holistic wellness solutions.  Guwahati, like many urban centers, experiences high levels of stress and lifestyle-related health concerns.  WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina offers a practical and effective approach to addressing these concerns, empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards better health and well-being.  Our commitment to providing high-quality services in a tranquil and welcoming environment makes us a valuable addition to the local community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina, exceptional customer experience is paramount. We believe in building strong relationships with our clients based on trust, understanding, and personalized attention. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere designed to promote relaxation and tranquility.  Our highly trained and experienced therapists and instructors provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring every client feels comfortable and cared for.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our commitment to creating a truly personalized wellness journey for each client.  We take the time to understand individual needs, preferences, and health goals, designing customized treatment plans that address specific requirements.  This personalized approach fosters a sense of trust and connection, helping clients achieve their wellness objectives effectively.  We also actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and partnerships with local organizations to promote awareness about holistic health and well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our connection with the local community extends beyond our services.  We actively participate in local events, collaborate with community organizations, and support local initiatives.  This commitment to social responsibility strengthens our ties with the community and contributes to a sense of shared well-being.  We believe in fostering a sense of community within our studio, creating a space where individuals can connect, relax, and rejuvenate.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision becoming a leading holistic wellness destination in Guwahati, offering a wider range of services and expanding our team of experienced professionals.  Our future plans include introducing new therapies, workshops, and wellness programs to cater to the evolving needs of our clients. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our reach through strategic partnerships and collaborations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina as a recognized center of excellence in holistic wellness, not just in Guwahati, but across Assam. We aim to contribute to the overall health and well-being of the community by providing accessible, affordable, and high-quality wellness services.  We are committed to continuous improvement, innovation, and providing exceptional customer service to ensure we remain a trusted and valued resource for holistic wellness in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Through our commitment to excellence, personalized service, and community engagement, WELLNESS STUDIO by Rubina is poised for significant growth and success.  We are confident that our unique blend of traditional and modern wellness practices will continue to resonate with the community, helping us achieve our vision of a healthier and more vibrant Assam.</p>', '3rd floor, wellness studio, ABC, GS Rd, opp. Sohum Emporia, next to Indian Oil Petrol Pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6900474821', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:10:28', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(256, 'Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre, Borbari, VIP Road Branch', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre, Borbari, VIP Road Branch</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at 5R59+Q5G, VIP Rd, Borbari, the Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre offers a sanctuary of tranquility and well-being amidst the vibrant energy of Guwahati.  Our centre stands as a beacon of holistic health, providing a unique blend of traditional Himalayan yoga practices and modern mindfulness techniques tailored to the specific needs of the Assam community. We are committed to fostering physical, mental, and spiritual growth, creating a supportive environment where individuals can cultivate inner peace and unlock their full potential. Our unique approach, blending ancient wisdom with contemporary understanding, distinguishes us in the growing wellness landscape of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our centre\'s significance in the local business landscape stems from the increasing recognition of yoga and meditation as essential tools for stress management and overall health.  In today\'s fast-paced world, individuals are increasingly seeking holistic wellness solutions, and our centre provides a much-needed space for self-care and personal development.  We cater to a diverse clientele, including professionals seeking stress relief, individuals aiming to improve their physical fitness, and those exploring the spiritual dimensions of yoga and meditation.  By offering accessible and inclusive programs, we contribute to the vibrant wellness scene of Borbari and beyond.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>The Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to various levels of experience and individual needs.  Our core offerings include Hatha Yoga, Vinyasa Yoga, Yin Yoga, and Restorative Yoga classes conducted by experienced and certified instructors. We also provide specialized workshops focusing on pranayama (breathing techniques), meditation practices, and yoga philosophy.  Our individualized attention ensures that each participant receives personalized guidance and support.  Beyond group classes, we offer private sessions tailored to specific needs and goals, including therapeutic yoga for individuals with physical limitations or chronic health conditions. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key unique selling point is our emphasis on the authentic Himalayan yoga tradition.  Our instructors are trained in traditional techniques passed down through generations, ensuring the purity and effectiveness of our practices. We also incorporate elements of mindfulness and meditation techniques, creating a holistic approach to well-being that addresses both the physical and mental aspects of health. We understand the unique needs of the local community and have designed our programs to be accessible and culturally sensitive, fostering a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere. Our pricing structure is designed to be competitive and affordable, making our services accessible to a broad spectrum of the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At the Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre, we prioritize creating a nurturing and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable and empowered to explore their inner selves.  Our commitment to exceptional customer service begins with a warm and welcoming atmosphere – a serene and meticulously clean studio designed to promote relaxation and focus.  Our instructors are not only highly skilled but also deeply compassionate, providing personalized attention and guidance to each participant. We actively encourage a sense of community among our students through regular events, workshops, and social gatherings, fostering a supportive network of like-minded individuals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond the studio walls. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, offering workshops and introductory classes to promote the benefits of yoga and meditation. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we regularly offer subsidized classes and workshops to individuals who may not otherwise have access to these life-enhancing practices. By building strong relationships with our clients and the broader community, we strive to create a sustainable and impactful presence in Borbari.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>The Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  We envision becoming a leading wellness centre in Assam, recognized for the quality of our instruction, the inclusivity of our programs, and our positive contribution to the local community. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to encompass additional yoga styles, workshops on Ayurveda, and potentially offering teacher training programs. We aim to develop strategic partnerships with local businesses and healthcare providers to integrate our services into broader wellness initiatives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we aspire to establish multiple branches across Guwahati and potentially other regions of Assam, making our holistic wellness approach accessible to a wider population.  We are committed to continuous learning and development, ensuring that our instructors remain at the forefront of their field. Our ultimate goal is to create a legacy of well-being in Assam, empowering individuals to lead healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the transformative practices of yoga and meditation. We are confident that our commitment to quality, community engagement, and continuous improvement will ensure the long-term success and impact of the Himalayan Yoga and Meditation Centre.</p> <br> <br>', '5R59+Q5G, VIP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002466438', '', 'http://www.hymcindia.com/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:10:36', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(257, 'Sunshine signup yoga', 'Yoga instructor', '', '<h1>Sunshine Signup Yoga: Cultivating Wellbeing in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the serene Sanjog Path, Sunshine Signup Yoga offers a unique and transformative yoga experience tailored to the vibrant community of Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a sanctuary for physical and mental wellbeing, fostering a sense of community and connection within our practice. We strive to make yoga accessible and enjoyable for all levels, from beginners to experienced practitioners, recognizing the diverse needs and preferences of our local clientele. Our commitment to quality instruction, personalized attention, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart in the burgeoning wellness landscape of Assam. <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our establishment recognizes the growing awareness and demand for holistic wellness practices in the region. We leverage this trend by providing a diverse range of yoga styles, catering to individual preferences and fitness levels.  Our offerings go beyond the standard asana practice, encompassing workshops on pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and yoga philosophy, to facilitate a deeper understanding and appreciation of the practice.  This holistic approach resonates deeply with the Assam community, known for its appreciation of traditional practices and natural harmony.   <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Sunshine Signup Yoga offers a comprehensive range of yoga classes, catering to various levels and interests.  Our signature Hatha Yoga classes provide a foundational practice for beginners, focusing on alignment and breathwork.  For those seeking a more vigorous practice, we offer Vinyasa Flow, a dynamic and energizing style that builds strength, flexibility, and endurance.  We also cater to those seeking a calmer, more restorative experience with our Yin Yoga and Restorative Yoga classes. <br> <br>\n\n\n<p>Beyond regular classes, we host specialized workshops and retreats focusing on specific aspects of yoga and wellness.  These workshops address the unique needs of the local population, including stress management techniques, mindfulness practices, and workshops focused on integrating yoga into daily life. Our unique selling point is the personalized attention each student receives, ensuring that the practice is both safe and beneficial for every individual.  Small class sizes allow our instructors to provide individual feedback and adjustments, promoting a deeper understanding and appreciation of the practice. <br> <br>\n\n\n<p>We also incorporate elements of traditional Assamese culture into our practice.  We partner with local artisans to provide organic and locally sourced products, such as herbal teas and essential oils, which are used in our workshops and offered for purchase in our studio.  This commitment to local businesses and sustainable practices resonates with our community, fostering a sense of collaboration and mutual support. <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Sunshine Signup Yoga, we are dedicated to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and supported.  Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, committed to providing a safe and effective practice.  They create a positive and encouraging atmosphere, where students feel empowered to explore their practice at their own pace. We emphasize the importance of building a strong community, fostering connections among our students. <br> <br>\n\n\n<p>Our approach to customer service is built on personalized attention and genuine care.  We take the time to get to know our students, understanding their individual needs and goals. We offer various class packages and flexible scheduling options to accommodate busy lifestyles and diverse preferences.  We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in community events, and offering discounted classes to underprivileged individuals.  Our social media presence showcases our work, creating engagement and fostering a sense of belonging.  <br> <br>\n\n\n<p>Regular feedback sessions and surveys allow us to continually improve our offerings and meet the evolving needs of our clientele. We also encourage open communication and are receptive to any suggestions or requests from our community. This creates a strong sense of shared ownership, enriching the experience for both the students and the instructors. <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Sunshine Signup Yoga envisions becoming a leading wellness center in Assam, expanding its services to include a wider range of wellness practices and community engagement initiatives.  We plan to introduce new yoga styles and workshops, incorporating the latest trends in holistic wellness.  This includes expanding our retreat offerings to more scenic locations within Assam, fostering a unique blend of yoga and cultural exploration. <br> <br>\n\n\n<p>We also aim to increase our community outreach programs, collaborating with local schools, hospitals, and community centers to promote the benefits of yoga and wellness.  Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and impactful business that contributes positively to the health and wellbeing of the Assam community, promoting mental and physical wellbeing through yoga and mindful living. We aim to establish a strong brand presence, recognized for its high-quality instruction and commitment to creating a supportive and inclusive community. <br> <br>\n\n\n<p>We believe that Sunshine Signup Yoga has the potential to become a significant contributor to the growing wellness sector in Assam.  By staying true to our core values of quality, inclusivity, and community engagement, we are confident in our ability to achieve our ambitious goals and make a meaningful contribution to the lives of our students and the broader community.  Our ongoing commitment to innovation and adaptation ensures that we will continue to evolve with the needs of the local community, ultimately solidifying our place as a leading yoga studio in Assam. <br> <br>', 'Sanjog Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:10:44', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(258, 'Morning Yoga', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Morning Yoga: Cultivating Wellness in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Morning Yoga, nestled within the vibrant cultural hub of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and transformative approach to yoga and wellness.  Located at C/o Nrityanjali Academy, House No 238 B 2nd Floor, GNB Rd, above S R minimart and Punjab National Bank, we are conveniently situated for individuals seeking a peaceful escape from the bustling city life.  Our studio provides a haven for self-discovery and physical rejuvenation, contributing to the growing health and wellness consciousness within the Assam business landscape.  We differentiate ourselves through a highly personalized approach, focusing on individual needs and fostering a strong sense of community amongst our practitioners.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our significance lies in bridging the gap between traditional yoga practices and the modern lifestyle.  In a region where the pace of life is increasingly demanding, Morning Yoga provides a vital counterpoint: a space for stress reduction, improved physical health, and enhanced mental clarity.  We cater to a diverse clientele, acknowledging the unique health and wellness requirements of the local community, ranging from beginners to seasoned yoga enthusiasts.  We believe in the power of yoga to not only improve physical well-being but also foster personal growth and inner peace.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Morning Yoga\'s primary offerings centre around a carefully curated selection of yoga classes catering to different skill levels and interests.  We offer Hatha, Vinyasa, and restorative yoga styles, each designed to provide specific benefits.  Hatha classes focus on foundational poses and breathing techniques, perfect for beginners and those seeking gentle movement and relaxation.  Vinyasa flows offer a more dynamic and challenging practice, building strength, flexibility, and stamina.  Restorative yoga sessions prioritize deep relaxation and stress reduction, ideal for promoting overall well-being.  In addition to these core classes, we regularly host workshops and specialized sessions focused on themes such as mindful movement, pranayama (breathing exercises), and yoga philosophy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to personalized attention. Class sizes are kept deliberately small to allow for individualized instruction and modifications.  We believe in creating a supportive and inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of their experience level, feel comfortable and encouraged to explore their practice at their own pace.  This highly personalized approach meets the specific needs of the local market by offering a tailored yoga experience that is both accessible and effective.  We also offer introductory packages and flexible class schedules to accommodate busy lifestyles, ensuring yoga is accessible to everyone in the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Morning Yoga, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and nurturing atmosphere where students feel valued and supported.  Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, possessing not only technical expertise but also a genuine passion for sharing the transformative power of yoga. They foster a sense of community within the studio, encouraging students to connect with each other and build lasting relationships.  This supportive environment makes Morning Yoga more than just a fitness studio; it\'s a community of like-minded individuals pursuing wellness and personal growth.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We regularly solicit feedback from our students and use this information to continuously improve our services and offerings.  We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with other businesses and organizations, participating in local health and wellness events. This proactive engagement allows us to further establish our presence and provide accessible wellness opportunities to a wider audience.  Our commitment to community outreach reflects our dedication to building a thriving and supportive wellness ecosystem in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Morning Yoga has ambitious plans for future growth. We aim to expand our range of services to include additional yoga styles, workshops, and wellness offerings, such as meditation classes and mindfulness workshops.  We envision forging partnerships with local businesses and organizations to provide yoga services in corporate settings and community centers, making yoga accessible to a larger segment of the population.  We also plan to leverage technology to expand our reach by developing an online platform offering virtual classes and resources.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to become a leading wellness center in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional quality of instruction, commitment to community engagement, and positive impact on the lives of our students.  We are committed to fostering a culture of well-being, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the practice of yoga.  We believe that by continuing to adapt and innovate, Morning Yoga will remain a vital contributor to the health and wellness landscape of Assam for years to come.</p> <br> <br>', 'C/o Nrityanjali Academy, House No 238 B 2nd Floor, GNB Rd, above S R minimart and Punjab National Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:15:12', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(259, 'Yogfal Yoga Centre', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Yogfal Yoga Centre: Cultivating Wellness in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Yogfal Yoga Centre, nestled at House No: 04, Nilakantha Apartment, Ajanta Path, Survey (Beltola), Samannay Path, in Guwahati, Assam, offers a sanctuary for holistic well-being. We are committed to providing high-quality yoga instruction and fostering a supportive community dedicated to physical and mental health.  Our centre distinguishes itself within the burgeoning wellness landscape of Assam by combining traditional yoga practices with a modern, accessible approach, catering to a diverse range of individuals and their unique needs. We recognize the increasing demand for stress-reduction techniques and preventative healthcare in today\'s fast-paced society, a need that Yogfal Yoga Centre directly addresses. <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond simply providing asana (physical postures). We recognize the interconnectedness of mind, body, and spirit, and our approach reflects this understanding. Yogfal Yoga Centre goes beyond the typical studio experience by offering a curated selection of classes catering to various experience levels and fitness goals.  Our offerings include Hatha, Vinyasa, and Yin Yoga, each tailored to promote flexibility, strength, and mindfulness. We also incorporate elements of pranayama (breathwork) and meditation into our classes to help students cultivate inner peace and manage stress effectively. Beyond the traditional classes, we host workshops focusing on specific areas such as back care, stress management, and advanced yogic techniques, enriching the overall experience and catering to a broad spectrum of interests.  A unique selling point is our integration of traditional Assamese wellness practices into our workshops – a distinctive feature within the region. <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Yogfal Yoga Centre, customer experience is paramount. We believe that a welcoming and supportive environment is crucial for fostering personal growth and achieving wellness goals.  Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, creating a safe and encouraging space for individuals of all levels, from beginners to seasoned practitioners.  We prioritize personalized attention, offering modifications and adjustments to ensure each student can practice safely and effectively. We foster a sense of community through regular events, workshops, and informal gatherings, allowing students to connect with like-minded individuals and build lasting relationships. We also actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and charitable organizations, promoting wellness initiatives throughout Guwahati. This integrated approach, focusing on both individual needs and community building, solidifies our position as a trusted and valued resource within the area. <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our approach to customer service extends beyond the physical studio.  We offer online booking options for enhanced convenience and personalized communication channels to address any queries or concerns promptly. Our commitment to transparency and clear communication ensures that our students feel valued and informed throughout their yoga journey with us.  We regularly solicit feedback to refine our services and ensure we are consistently exceeding expectations.  This dedication to ongoing improvement, coupled with our focus on building a vibrant, supportive community, is fundamental to our success. <br> <br>\n\n<p>Yogfal Yoga Centre has ambitious plans for the future. We envision expanding our range of services to include specialized yoga therapies, such as restorative yoga for individuals with specific health concerns, and prenatal yoga classes.  We also plan to introduce teacher training programs to cultivate future generations of yoga instructors within the region, further strengthening the local wellness community.  We are exploring collaborations with local businesses and healthcare providers to integrate yoga into a broader wellness ecosystem in Guwahati.  Our long-term goal is to establish Yogfal Yoga Centre as a leading provider of holistic wellness services in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality instruction, community engagement, and a profound impact on the well-being of its students and the community at large.  This includes exploring opportunities to develop an online platform to extend our reach beyond the physical location and to provide additional resources and support to our students. We believe in sustainable growth that benefits both our students and the wider community. <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Yogfal Yoga Centre offers a unique and comprehensive approach to yoga and wellness in Guwahati. We blend traditional practice with modern accessibility, focusing on individualized attention, community building, and a commitment to holistic well-being.  Our dedication to exceeding expectations, combined with ambitious future plans, positions us to become a leading force in the Assamese wellness industry, fostering a healthier and more vibrant community.  Our location in the heart of Guwahati allows us easy access to a wide range of individuals who are seeking to incorporate yoga and wellness into their lives.  The combination of our expertise and our focus on community ensures that Yogfal Yoga Centre will continue to thrive and positively contribute to the local landscape. <br> <br>', 'House No: 04, Nilakantha Apartment, Ajanta Path, Survey(Beltola), Samannay Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:15:19', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(260, 'F3 FITNESS', 'Gym', '', '<h1>F3 FITNESS: Elevating Fitness in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Jilmil Path House, 2, Beltola - Basistha Rd, F3 FITNESS is more than just a gym; it\'s a transformative experience designed to empower individuals to achieve their peak physical and mental well-being.  We recognize the unique fitness needs of the Guwahati community and have crafted a comprehensive program to address them, setting us apart in the burgeoning Assam fitness landscape.  Our commitment to personalized service, cutting-edge equipment, and a vibrant community atmosphere distinguishes us as a premier fitness destination.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our approach focuses on holistic wellness, understanding that fitness journeys are intensely personal. We avoid the generic \'one-size-fits-all\' approach, instead tailoring programs to suit individual goals, fitness levels, and lifestyles.  This commitment to personalization, coupled with our state-of-the-art facilities, allows us to cater to a diverse clientele, from seasoned athletes seeking peak performance to individuals embarking on their fitness journey for the first time. We believe everyone deserves access to a supportive and motivating environment that celebrates their progress and fosters a lasting love for fitness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>F3 FITNESS offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to maximize results and cater to diverse needs. Our core offerings include: personalized fitness consultations, individual and group training sessions led by certified instructors, a wide array of fitness classes (yoga, Zumba, CrossFit-inspired workouts, and more), and access to our fully equipped state-of-the-art gym.  We boast a range of cardiovascular equipment, strength training machines, and free weights, ensuring a comprehensive and varied workout experience. In addition to fitness programs, we also offer nutritional guidance, providing clients with the tools to fuel their bodies for optimal performance.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering dedication to personalized attention.  Our experienced instructors meticulously craft tailored workout plans, taking into account individual fitness levels, goals, and any pre-existing conditions.  Regular progress assessments and adjustments ensure clients remain motivated and on track.  Beyond individual training, we foster a strong sense of community through group classes, fostering a supportive network where members can motivate and inspire one another. We also organize regular wellness workshops and health talks, covering topics such as nutrition, stress management, and injury prevention – all designed to holistically enhance the well-being of our members.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: A Community Built on Wellness</h2>\n\n<p>At F3 FITNESS, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every member feels comfortable, supported, and empowered.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are readily available to assist members, answer questions, and provide guidance.  We prioritize cleanliness and hygiene, maintaining a high standard of facility maintenance to ensure a safe and enjoyable workout experience.  Furthermore, our commitment to the local community extends beyond our walls. We actively seek opportunities to collaborate with local businesses and organizations, promoting health and wellness within the larger Guwahati community through sponsorships and community events.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in fostering a culture of positive reinforcement and celebrate every milestone achieved by our members.  This emphasis on community and personal growth contributes significantly to member retention and satisfaction. Regular feedback mechanisms, both formal and informal, allow us to continuously improve our services and adapt to the evolving needs of our clients. We use technology to enhance the member experience, including a user-friendly online booking system and a dedicated mobile app for tracking progress and accessing personalized workout plans. This modern approach reflects our commitment to providing a convenient and seamless fitness journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Our Reach and Impact</h2>\n\n<p>F3 FITNESS envisions a future where we become the leading fitness provider in Guwahati, known not just for our facilities but for the transformative impact we have on individuals\' lives. Our growth strategy focuses on several key areas: expansion of our fitness offerings to include specialized programs (e.g., prenatal fitness, senior fitness), strategic partnerships with local businesses and healthcare providers, and the development of advanced fitness technology integration. We aim to establish F3 FITNESS as a trusted resource for health and wellness information within the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we aspire to expand our presence beyond our current location, exploring opportunities to open additional facilities across Guwahati and potentially other regions of Assam. This expansion will be driven by our commitment to providing accessible, high-quality fitness services to a wider audience.  We aim to continue investing in our staff through ongoing training and development, ensuring our instructors remain at the forefront of fitness trends and methodologies.  Our ultimate goal is to cultivate a vibrant and thriving fitness community, contributing to a healthier and happier Guwahati, one workout at a time.  Our dedication to personalized service, community building, and continuous improvement positions F3 FITNESS for sustained growth and lasting success in the Assam market.</p> <br> <br>', 'Jilmil Path House, 2, Beltola - Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7578968071', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:15:27', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(261, 'Avirodhayog - Online Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Avirodhayog - Online Yoga Studio</h1>\n<p>Located at 58/58, T.R. Phookan Road, Avirodhayog is a pioneering online yoga studio dedicated to bringing the transformative power of yoga to the people of Assam and beyond.  We recognize the growing demand for accessible and convenient wellness solutions in today\'s fast-paced world, and we are uniquely positioned to meet this need by offering a high-quality, online yoga experience that caters specifically to the diverse needs and preferences of the Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike traditional brick-and-mortar studios, Avirodhayog\'s online platform eliminates geographical barriers, making yoga accessible to individuals across Assam, irrespective of their location or mobility. This is particularly significant given the vast and sometimes geographically challenging terrain of the state. Our commitment to providing a high-quality experience extends beyond convenience; we carefully curate our classes to resonate with local cultural nuances and sensitivities, ensuring inclusivity and relatability.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>Avirodhayog offers a diverse range of online yoga classes catering to various levels of experience and fitness goals. Our offerings include beginner-friendly Hatha yoga, invigorating Vinyasa flows, restorative Yin yoga for stress relief, and specialized classes focusing on flexibility, strength, and mindfulness. Each class is carefully designed and meticulously delivered by experienced and certified yoga instructors who are deeply knowledgeable about the practice and passionate about sharing its benefits.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Avirodhayog is our incorporation of Assamese cultural elements into our practice.  We incorporate traditional Assamese music and mantras into certain classes, fostering a deeper connection with the local heritage. We also offer specialized workshops focusing on traditional Assamese healing practices, blending ancient wisdom with modern yoga techniques.  This unique approach caters to a specific market need – the desire for a yoga experience that is both effective and culturally relevant.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond individual classes, Avirodhayog offers subscription packages providing access to a library of recorded sessions, ensuring flexibility and convenience. We also provide personalized guidance through optional online consultations with our instructors, allowing for tailored support and a more holistic approach to wellness.  This tiered system caters to diverse needs and budgets, making yoga accessible to a wider segment of the Assamese population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>At Avirodhayog, we believe that customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and supportive online community where individuals feel comfortable and empowered to embark on their yoga journey. Our user-friendly online platform is designed for ease of navigation and access, ensuring a seamless experience from class registration to participation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our instructors are highly trained not only in yoga but also in providing exceptional customer support.  They are readily available to answer questions, offer modifications for different ability levels, and build a personalized connection with each student. We foster a sense of community through online forums and interactive sessions, encouraging interaction and support among our students. This sense of community is crucial, especially within an online setting, promoting engagement and fostering a sense of belonging.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through participation in health fairs, workshops, and collaborations with local organizations. This helps us build awareness about the benefits of yoga and expand our reach beyond our online platform.  We also offer discounted memberships to students and senior citizens, reflecting our commitment to making yoga accessible to all members of the Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>Avirodhayog envisions becoming the leading online yoga studio in Assam, renowned for its high-quality instruction, culturally sensitive approach, and strong community engagement.  We plan to expand our offerings to include additional yoga styles, specialized workshops, and potentially even teacher training programs. This expansion will not only cater to a broader range of preferences but also contribute to the growth and development of the yoga community in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We aim to leverage technology to further enhance the user experience, integrating features such as personalized workout plans, progress tracking, and interactive challenges. We also plan to explore partnerships with local businesses and wellness centers to create synergistic opportunities and expand our reach.  Our long-term goal is to establish Avirodhayog as a leading provider of holistic wellness solutions in Assam, positively impacting the physical and mental well-being of individuals across the state.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Through continuous innovation, commitment to excellence, and a deep understanding of the local needs and aspirations, Avirodhayog is poised for significant growth and success.  We are confident in our ability to make a lasting contribution to the health and well-being of the Assamese community, promoting a culture of wellness and empowerment through the transformative practice of yoga.</p>', '58 58, TR Phookan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8376948361', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:15:34', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(262, 'Guidance Station', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>Guidance Station: Navigating Success in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Guidance Station, located at House no - 92, 1st Floor, Panjabari Rd, Guwahati, is more than just a business; it\'s a strategic partner for individuals and enterprises seeking to navigate the dynamic landscape of Assam\'s thriving economy.  We offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to empower our clients to achieve their full potential, fostering growth and innovation within the local community.  Our unique approach combines a deep understanding of the regional market with a forward-thinking vision, setting us apart as a trusted resource for those seeking guidance and support.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our establishment recognizes the specific challenges and opportunities unique to the Assam business environment. We are deeply invested in understanding the local context,  the cultural nuances, and the evolving economic trends that shape the region. This understanding informs every aspect of our services, ensuring our solutions are not only effective but also culturally sensitive and relevant to the needs of our diverse clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Guidance Station provides a range of services tailored to meet the diverse requirements of our clients.  Our core offerings include comprehensive business consulting, focusing on strategic planning, market research, and financial analysis specifically for businesses operating within Assam. We also offer specialized training programs designed to enhance professional skills and leadership capabilities, equipping individuals and teams with the knowledge and tools to succeed in today\'s competitive market.  Furthermore, we provide mentorship and networking opportunities, connecting our clients with valuable industry contacts and fostering collaborative growth within the local business community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What distinguishes Guidance Station is our personalized approach. We don\'t offer one-size-fits-all solutions. Instead, we work closely with each client to understand their unique circumstances, aspirations, and challenges, crafting bespoke strategies that are tailored to their specific needs. This individualized attention, combined with our extensive knowledge of the local market, ensures that our clients receive the most relevant and effective guidance possible.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our market research services are particularly noteworthy, going beyond standard data collection to provide actionable insights that help businesses make informed decisions.  We leverage both quantitative and qualitative methods, incorporating local knowledge and understanding to offer a comprehensive perspective on market trends, consumer behavior, and competitive landscapes within Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Guidance Station, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of success. We are committed to building strong, long-lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect.  We strive to create a supportive and collaborative environment where clients feel comfortable sharing their challenges and aspirations, knowing that they are working with a partner who is genuinely invested in their success.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our dedication to fostering strong community ties is integral to our approach. We actively participate in local business events, collaborate with other organizations, and support initiatives that benefit the community.  This commitment reflects our belief that the success of our clients is inextricably linked to the overall prosperity of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively solicit feedback from our clients, using their insights to continually improve our services and ensure that we are consistently meeting their evolving needs.  Our responsiveness and proactive communication style build confidence and ensures our clients feel valued and supported throughout their journey with Guidance Station.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Guidance Station envisions a future where we are recognized as the leading provider of business support and development services in Assam.  We plan to expand our service offerings to encompass emerging areas of growth within the regional economy, including sustainable development initiatives and technological advancements.  This expansion will be driven by our commitment to staying ahead of the curve and providing our clients with the most cutting-edge solutions available.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We aim to build a larger team of experienced professionals, bringing in diverse skill sets and expertise to further enhance our capacity to serve our clients. This growth will be accompanied by an ongoing commitment to professional development for our staff, ensuring that we maintain the highest levels of competence and provide the best possible service.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to become a catalyst for economic growth in Assam, empowering businesses and individuals to achieve their full potential and contribute to the region\'s overall prosperity.  We believe that by providing exceptional service, fostering community engagement, and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, we can achieve this vision and become a truly indispensable resource for the local business community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Guidance Station is more than just a business; it\'s a commitment to the future of Assam\'s economic landscape.  We invite you to partner with us and discover the possibilities that await.</p>', 'House no - 92, 1st Floor, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8822372426', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:15:42', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(263, 'Studio 7', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Studio 7: Elevating Creativity in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the second floor of Krishna Tower on GS Road, Studio 7 is more than just a creative space; it\'s a vibrant hub fostering innovation and artistic expression within the dynamic business landscape of Assam.  We are committed to providing high-quality services and fostering a collaborative environment that empowers both established professionals and emerging talent. Our unique approach blends traditional craftsmanship with cutting-edge technology, setting us apart in the competitive Guwahati market. <br> <br></p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Studio 7 offers a comprehensive suite of services catering to a diverse clientele.  Our primary focus lies in providing premium photography and videography services.  We capture compelling visuals for corporate events, product launches, weddings, and individual portraits, utilizing state-of-the-art equipment and advanced editing techniques. Our photography extends beyond traditional still images; we also specialize in drone photography, offering unique perspectives and breathtaking aerial shots of landscapes, buildings, and events.  This service is particularly valuable in showcasing the beauty of Assam and its diverse locations to both local and international audiences.<br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Beyond photography and videography, Studio 7 provides comprehensive post-production services including high-quality image and video editing, color correction, and graphic design. We understand the importance of storytelling, and our post-production process is meticulously designed to ensure that the final product reflects the client\'s vision and captures the essence of their message.  Furthermore, we offer graphic design services, including logo creation, branding materials, and marketing collateral, helping businesses establish a strong and memorable brand identity.  Our unique selling proposition is our integrated approach; we seamlessly combine photography, videography, and graphic design to deliver holistic and impactful visual solutions. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>We also recognize the need for accessible and affordable professional media services within the local market. We tailor our packages to meet diverse budgets, ensuring that our services are available to a broad range of clients, from small businesses to large corporations. This commitment to inclusivity is part of our dedication to supporting the growth and development of the creative industries within Assam.<br> <br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Studio 7, we believe that exceeding client expectations is paramount. Our customer service approach is built on open communication, collaboration, and a deep understanding of individual needs.  We work closely with each client to understand their vision and translate that into stunning visual content. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness and our ability to deliver projects on time and within budget. Our team is composed of experienced and passionate professionals dedicated to ensuring client satisfaction. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our commitment to fostering strong relationships with our clients.  We believe in building lasting partnerships based on trust and mutual respect.  We actively engage with the local community through workshops, collaborations with local artists and businesses, and participation in relevant events. This active engagement allows us to understand the evolving needs of the market and tailor our services accordingly.  We are not just a service provider; we are an integral part of the creative fabric of Guwahati.<br> <br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Studio 7 envisions a future where we are recognized as the leading provider of creative visual solutions in Assam. We plan to expand our service offerings to include animation and 3D modeling, further enhancing our capacity to deliver innovative and comprehensive solutions.  This expansion will allow us to cater to a wider range of clients and projects, solidifying our position in the market.  <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the growth of the creative industries in Assam. We plan to achieve this by investing in our team\'s professional development, embracing technological advancements, and continuing to build strong relationships with our clients and the wider community. We also aspire to establish training programs to nurture emerging talent within the region, fostering a new generation of creative professionals.  Our commitment to excellence, innovation, and community engagement will drive our growth and ensure the continued success of Studio 7.<br> <br></p>\n\n<p>We are confident that Studio 7 will continue to play a significant role in shaping the creative landscape of Assam, empowering businesses and individuals to tell their stories through compelling visual narratives.  Our presence in Krishna Tower, a prominent location on GS Road, ensures easy accessibility and a visible presence within the heart of Guwahati’s business district. We look forward to continuing to serve our clients and the wider community with dedication and passion.<br> <br></p>', 'Studio 7, 2nd Floor, Krishna Tower, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7578035427', '', 'http://www.studio7ghy.com/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:20:10', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(264, 'Niramaya yoga studio', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Niramaya Yoga Studio: Finding Inner Peace in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at Flat no. 5, Krishna Apartment, behind GNRC Hospital, Niramaya Yoga Studio offers a sanctuary of tranquility and well-being.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub dedicated to promoting physical, mental, and spiritual health within the vibrant tapestry of Assamese life.  Our unique approach blends traditional yoga practices with a deep understanding of the specific needs and cultural context of the Guwahati community.  This commitment to cultural sensitivity and personalized attention sets us apart in the burgeoning wellness landscape of Assam.  We strive to create an inclusive and accessible space where individuals of all ages, backgrounds, and experience levels can discover the transformative power of yoga.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around offering a diverse range of yoga styles catered to individual needs and preferences.  We provide beginner-friendly Hatha yoga classes designed to build a strong foundation in fundamental postures and breathing techniques.  For those seeking a more dynamic practice, we offer invigorating Vinyasa flows, emphasizing mindful movement and building strength and flexibility.  Beyond these core offerings, we also incorporate restorative yoga sessions promoting deep relaxation and stress reduction, and specialized prenatal yoga classes for expecting mothers. Each class is meticulously designed to cater to the varying levels of experience and physical capabilities of our students, ensuring a safe and enriching experience for all.  Our unique selling point lies in our individualized approach. We offer personalized guidance, taking the time to understand each student\'s goals and limitations to create a customized practice journey that promotes sustainable well-being.  This commitment to personal attention addresses the increasing demand for personalized wellness solutions within the local market. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Niramaya, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a thriving community. We foster a warm and welcoming atmosphere, creating a sense of belonging and support amongst our students.  Our instructors are highly trained and certified yoga professionals, passionate about sharing their knowledge and expertise.  They are committed to creating a safe and encouraging learning environment where students feel comfortable exploring their practice at their own pace.  We prioritize building genuine connections with our students, going beyond the typical instructor-student relationship to create a supportive community.  We achieve this through regular workshops, themed events, and community outreach programs, fostering a sense of connection not just within the studio, but also within the wider Guwahati community.  We are committed to actively engaging with local organizations and initiatives to promote wellness and mindful living across the city. This community-focused approach differentiates us, making Niramaya Yoga Studio more than just a place to practice; it’s a space to connect, grow, and find belonging.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Niramaya Yoga Studio envisions a future where yoga becomes an integral part of the daily lives of individuals in Guwahati. Our growth strategy focuses on expanding our range of services to encompass workshops on meditation, mindfulness, and Ayurvedic principles, further enriching the wellness experience we offer.  We plan to introduce specialized yoga retreats and workshops that showcase the natural beauty of Assam, drawing in participants from across the region and beyond.  Our long-term goal is to establish Niramaya as the leading wellness center in Guwahati, recognized not only for its exceptional yoga instruction but also for its commitment to fostering a vibrant and supportive community.  We will achieve this through ongoing investment in teacher training, strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations, and a continued commitment to delivering high-quality, culturally sensitive, and personalized wellness solutions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe that yoga is more than just physical exercise; it\'s a journey of self-discovery, a path towards greater self-awareness and a deeper connection with oneself and the world around us.  We at Niramaya Yoga Studio are dedicated to guiding you on this transformative journey, providing a supportive and nurturing environment where you can cultivate inner peace and unlock your full potential.  Our commitment to personalized attention, community engagement, and culturally relevant yoga practices sets us apart, positioning Niramaya as a unique and valuable asset to the Guwahati community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are confident that Niramaya Yoga Studio will not only thrive but also contribute significantly to the wellness and overall well-being of the Guwahati community. Our vision extends beyond simply providing yoga classes; it\'s about fostering a culture of holistic wellness, promoting mindful living, and strengthening the bonds of community.</p>', 'Flat no. 5, Krishna Apartment, behind GNRC Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9957036837', '', 'https://niramayayogastudio.com/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:20:17', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL);
