(265, 'Ayush Yoga 24', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Ayush Yoga 24: Cultivating Wellness in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Ayush Yoga 24, located at 1, Rajgarh Link Rd, is a premier yoga and wellness center dedicated to providing high-quality instruction and holistic wellbeing services to the vibrant community of Assam.  We understand the unique needs and cultural context of our region and strive to offer a yoga experience that is both authentic and accessible to all.  Our commitment to personalized attention, expert instruction, and a serene environment sets us apart in the growing wellness landscape of Assam. We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub fostering physical, mental, and spiritual growth.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ayush Yoga 24 distinguishes itself through a multifaceted approach to wellness. Our core services encompass a diverse range of yoga styles, catering to varying experience levels and individual needs.  We offer Hatha, Vinyasa, Ashtanga, and restorative yoga classes, each thoughtfully designed to promote flexibility, strength, and inner peace.  Beyond traditional yoga, we also incorporate elements of meditation, pranayama (breathing techniques), and yoga therapy into our offerings.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized approach.  We emphasize small class sizes to ensure individual attention and tailor our instruction to meet specific physical limitations and personal goals.  This allows us to cater to a wider demographic, from seasoned yogis to complete beginners, and those seeking rehabilitation or stress management techniques.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the growing demand for accessible and effective stress-reduction techniques in Assam, we have curated a schedule that caters to busy lifestyles. Our early morning, lunchtime, and evening classes provide flexibility for individuals with varying work and family commitments. We also offer corporate wellness programs, bringing the benefits of yoga and mindfulness to businesses in the region.  We further address the specific needs of the local community by incorporating elements of traditional Assamese healing practices where appropriate, creating a truly unique and culturally relevant wellness experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Ayush Yoga 24, customer experience is paramount.  We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and supported. Our instructors are highly qualified, experienced, and passionate about sharing the transformative power of yoga. They are committed to fostering a sense of community amongst our students, creating an atmosphere of mutual respect and encouragement.  Beyond the classes, we prioritize building personal connections with our clients.  We offer personalized consultations to help individuals develop a tailored yoga practice that aligns with their individual needs and goals.  We also actively participate in local community events and initiatives, fostering a strong bond with our neighbours and contributing to the overall wellbeing of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends to the studio itself. We have designed a serene and tranquil space, equipped with top-of-the-line yoga equipment and amenities, ensuring a comfortable and inspiring practice environment. The studio is meticulously maintained to uphold the highest standards of hygiene and cleanliness.  We consistently seek feedback from our clients and use this valuable input to continually enhance our services and offerings.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, Ayush Yoga 24 envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam region.  Our immediate plans include expanding our schedule to include specialized workshops and retreats focusing on advanced yoga practices, yoga therapy, and mindfulness techniques. We also plan to develop online resources and virtual classes to make our services more accessible to a wider audience.  We aspire to establish Ayush Yoga 24 as a leading wellness destination in Assam, not only through our exceptional instruction but also through our commitment to community engagement and social responsibility.  Long-term, we aim to establish partnerships with local healthcare providers and organizations to integrate yoga into broader wellness initiatives and promote the benefits of yoga for a healthier and happier Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our vision extends beyond just providing yoga classes; we aim to create a movement that promotes holistic well-being within our community and beyond.  By fostering a sense of connection, providing high-quality instruction, and continually adapting to the evolving needs of our clients, Ayush Yoga 24 is poised to play a significant role in the growth of the wellness industry in Assam, creating a healthier and more harmonious community for generations to come.  We are deeply committed to the wellbeing of our clients and our community, and we believe that through the practice of yoga, we can contribute to a more balanced and fulfilling life for all.</p> <br> <br>', '1, Rajgarh Link Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864200129', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:20:24', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(266, '\"SIDDHI\" Yoga, Meditation & Therapy Centre', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>SIDDHI Yoga, Meditation & Therapy Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on GNB Rd, near Maharshi Vidya Mandir and opposite Abhishek Motors, SIDDHI Yoga, Meditation & Therapy Centre offers a sanctuary of wellness in the heart of Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a holistic wellness destination dedicated to fostering physical, mental, and emotional well-being within the vibrant community we serve.  Our unique approach blends traditional practices with modern therapeutic techniques, creating a personalized and deeply enriching experience for each individual who walks through our doors.  In a region increasingly focused on progress, SIDDHI provides a vital counterpoint – a space for introspection, healing, and connection with the self.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>SIDDHI distinguishes itself from other wellness centres in Assam through its comprehensive and integrated approach. We recognize that true well-being requires a multi-faceted approach, and therefore, we offer a carefully curated selection of services designed to address the diverse needs of our clients. Our core offerings include a variety of yoga styles, catering to different fitness levels and preferences, from gentle Hatha yoga for beginners to more challenging Vinyasa flows for experienced practitioners.  We also provide guided meditation sessions, focusing on mindfulness techniques and stress reduction, invaluable tools in today\'s fast-paced world.  Furthermore, our centre offers therapeutic services, including individual and group therapy sessions guided by qualified professionals.  This holistic approach ensures that clients receive support across multiple dimensions of their well-being, fostering a more complete and sustainable path to a healthier lifestyle.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for SIDDHI is our commitment to personalized care. We understand that each individual’s journey to wellness is unique.  Our experienced instructors and therapists take the time to understand each client\'s specific needs and goals, crafting tailored programs that are both effective and enjoyable.  We offer introductory sessions and assessments to ensure that clients are placed in classes and programs that are appropriate for their experience level and health conditions.  This personalized approach creates a supportive and nurturing environment where individuals feel comfortable and empowered to explore their wellness journey at their own pace.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond individual services, SIDDHI is deeply committed to fostering a strong connection with the local Assam community.  We regularly host workshops and community events focused on various aspects of wellness, including healthy cooking demonstrations, stress management techniques, and discussions on mindful living.  We believe that wellness is not just an individual pursuit but a collective responsibility, and we actively seek opportunities to promote holistic well-being within our community through education and outreach. We also partner with local businesses and organizations to extend our reach and contribute to the broader health and wellness landscape of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our customer experience extends beyond the services we offer. We strive to create a welcoming and serene atmosphere within our centre, providing a tranquil escape from the demands of daily life. Our facility is designed to be calming and inviting, incorporating elements that promote relaxation and inner peace.  We prioritize clean, comfortable spaces and a friendly, supportive staff who are dedicated to providing excellent customer service.  We value feedback and actively seek to improve our services based on the needs and suggestions of our clients, ensuring that SIDDHI remains a place where individuals feel valued and supported on their wellness journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>SIDDHI\'s vision extends beyond its current offerings.  We plan to expand our services in the coming years, introducing new yoga styles, workshops, and therapeutic modalities to meet the evolving needs of our community.  We also envision creating partnerships with local healthcare providers to integrate our services into existing healthcare frameworks, promoting a more holistic and integrated approach to well-being within the region.  We aim to become a leading wellness centre in Assam, recognized for our commitment to excellence, innovation, and community engagement.  Our long-term goal is to contribute significantly to the health and happiness of individuals and the broader Assam community, establishing SIDDHI as a trusted and respected name in holistic wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, SIDDHI Yoga, Meditation & Therapy Centre offers a unique and comprehensive approach to wellness in Assam, combining traditional practices with modern therapeutic techniques within a supportive and community-focused environment.  Our commitment to personalized care, community engagement, and continuous improvement positions us for sustained growth and a lasting impact on the well-being of the region.  We invite you to experience the SIDDHI difference and embark on your journey to a healthier, happier you.</p>', 'GNB Rd, near Maharshi Vidya Mandir, opposite Abhishek Motors', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9101014429', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:20:31', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(267, 'Fat2Fit', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>Fat2Fit: Transforming Lives, One Step at a Time</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at 47 A, Jayanagar Rd, opposite Kendriya Vidyalaya, Fat2Fit is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a transformative experience designed to empower individuals in the vibrant Assam community to achieve their health and wellness goals.  We understand the unique challenges and aspirations of our local population, and our comprehensive approach addresses these needs with a personalized touch, setting us apart in the burgeoning fitness landscape of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond providing state-of-the-art facilities; it\'s about fostering a supportive and motivating environment where individuals feel comfortable, challenged, and ultimately, successful. We believe that true fitness is a holistic journey, encompassing physical, mental, and emotional well-being. This philosophy underpins every program and service we offer.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Wellness</h2>\n\n<p>Fat2Fit offers a diverse range of services designed to cater to individuals of all fitness levels and aspirations. Our core offerings include personalized fitness training programs tailored to individual needs and goals, encompassing strength training, cardiovascular exercises, and flexibility routines.  We utilize evidence-based methodologies and incorporate regular progress evaluations to ensure optimal results.  Our experienced trainers are not only highly qualified but also deeply invested in understanding the specific health considerations prevalent within the Assam community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond personalized training, we also provide nutritional counseling and guidance.  Our registered dietitians work closely with clients to create customized meal plans that are both effective and culturally sensitive, incorporating local ingredients and respecting traditional dietary practices while promoting healthy eating habits.  We recognize that sustainable weight management and improved fitness require a holistic approach that addresses both exercise and nutrition.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we offer group fitness classes, providing a fun and engaging environment for participants to work out collectively.  These classes are designed to be accessible to all fitness levels, focusing on community building and shared motivation.  We\'re committed to providing options that are both effective and enjoyable, making fitness a sustainable and enjoyable part of daily life.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets Fat2Fit apart is our emphasis on personalized attention and ongoing support. We recognize that every individual’s journey is unique, and we adapt our services to meet those individual needs, fostering a sense of community and partnership throughout the transformation process.  This personal touch is what makes the difference, providing support and encouragement beyond simple exercise routines.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Building a Supportive Community</h2>\n\n<p>At Fat2Fit, we prioritize exceptional customer service.  We believe that a welcoming and supportive environment is crucial for helping individuals achieve their fitness goals.  Our staff are highly trained and dedicated to providing personalized attention, answering questions, and offering guidance throughout the entire process. We strive to create a comfortable and inclusive space for everyone, regardless of their background or fitness level.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, including partnerships with local schools and community organizations to promote healthy living and wellness education.  We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we are committed to being a positive force in the Assam region. Our commitment to community engagement helps us understand and address the unique health and wellness needs of our local population more effectively.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We regularly solicit client feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting the evolving needs of our members. We believe that active listening and responsiveness are essential aspects of building lasting relationships with our clients and fostering a sense of community within our fitness center.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Our Reach and Impact</h2>\n\n<p>Fat2Fit has ambitious plans for the future.  We envision expanding our services to include additional specialized programs, such as yoga, Pilates, and specialized fitness programs targeted at specific age groups or health conditions. We are also exploring opportunities to enhance our technology integration to provide clients with convenient access to their workout plans, nutritional advice, and progress tracking.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we aspire to become a leading provider of holistic wellness services in Assam, renowned for our personalized approach, community engagement, and commitment to achieving tangible results for our clients.  We aim to create a lasting impact on the health and well-being of the local population, empowering individuals to lead healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. We\'re committed to continuous improvement and expansion, always seeking new ways to serve our community and support our members on their wellness journeys.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our ultimate goal is to establish Fat2Fit as a symbol of health, wellness, and community empowerment within Assam, a place where individuals feel supported, encouraged, and empowered to achieve their personal best.</p>', '47 A, Jayanagar Rd, opposite Kendriya Vidyalaya', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9435602399', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:20:39', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(268, 'Queendom Fitness', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>Queendom Fitness: Empowering Women in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Queendom Fitness, located at 48, Panjabari Rd, Guwahati, is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a vibrant community dedicated to empowering women through holistic wellness.  Recognizing the unique challenges and aspirations of women in Assam, we provide a supportive and inclusive environment where fitness journeys are celebrated, not judged.  In a region where access to high-quality, women-centric fitness facilities can be limited, Queendom Fitness fills a critical gap, offering a specialized and personalized approach to health and wellbeing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our establishment is significant in the local business landscape as a pioneer in providing specialized fitness solutions tailored specifically for women.  We are committed to fostering a safe space free from intimidation, where women of all ages, fitness levels, and backgrounds feel comfortable pursuing their health goals. This commitment sets us apart from more generic fitness centers and aligns perfectly with the growing demand for inclusive and women-focused wellness options in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Queendom Fitness offers a diverse range of services designed to cater to individual needs and preferences.  Our core offerings include specialized fitness classes such as Zumba, Yoga, Pilates, and strength training designed with women\'s specific physiological needs in mind.  We also provide personalized training programs developed by certified instructors, ensuring tailored workout plans that align with individual goals and limitations.  Nutritional counseling and wellness workshops are also integral components of our services, providing a holistic approach to health and fitness.  Furthermore, we offer access to state-of-the-art fitness equipment in a clean and well-maintained facility.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our unwavering commitment to creating a supportive and empowering community. We foster a welcoming environment where women feel encouraged and motivated to achieve their personal best, regardless of their starting point.  Our instructors are not just trainers; they are mentors, providing guidance and support beyond the workout session.  This personalized approach, combined with our focus on women\'s specific needs, creates a significant differentiator in the local market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The services offered directly address the needs of the local market by providing accessible and inclusive fitness options for women.  The prevalence of sedentary lifestyles and a lack of specialized women\'s fitness centers in Guwahati highlight the market need for a facility like Queendom Fitness.  We address concerns regarding safety, comfort, and inclusivity, fostering an environment where women feel confident pursuing their fitness journeys.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Queendom Fitness, customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and supportive atmosphere from the moment a woman walks through our doors.  Our dedicated staff is trained to provide exceptional customer service, offering personalized attention and guidance throughout the fitness journey.  We maintain a clean and well-maintained facility, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable workout environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our genuine commitment to fostering a community where women feel empowered and supported. We actively engage with local women\'s groups and organizations to promote health and wellness, and we host regular events to strengthen our community bonds. This focus on community building goes beyond the transactional aspect of fitness; it creates a sense of belonging and shared purpose, significantly enhancing the customer experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in community events, and sponsorships of local initiatives that promote women\'s empowerment and wellbeing.  This active participation strengthens our connection to the community and underscores our commitment to being more than just a fitness center – we\'re a part of the fabric of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Queendom Fitness envisions becoming the leading women\'s fitness center in Guwahati, expanding our services and reach to empower more women to achieve their health and wellness goals.  We plan to expand our range of fitness classes, introducing new and innovative programs to cater to evolving preferences.  We also aim to expand our facility, potentially incorporating additional amenities such as a spa or wellness retreat space to further enhance our holistic approach.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish a network of Queendom Fitness centers across Assam, bringing our unique brand of women\'s empowerment and fitness to more communities.  We believe in the power of fitness to transform lives, and we\'re committed to making that transformative power accessible to women throughout the region.  We are exploring opportunities for collaborations with local healthcare providers and wellness professionals to offer comprehensive health and wellness solutions to our members.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Further growth will be driven by a continued focus on exceptional customer service, community engagement, and the ongoing development of innovative and high-quality fitness programs tailored to meet the evolving needs of women in Assam.  Our commitment to empowering women and promoting holistic wellness will remain the cornerstone of our growth and success.</p>', '48, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9476777319', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:25:11', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(269, 'Yoga class at Home', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Yoga Class at Home: Finding Inner Peace in the Heart of Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Yoga Class at Home, nestled within the serene Bora Service, Green Path, offers a unique and accessible approach to yoga practice in the vibrant landscape of Assam.  We understand the busy lives of our community and the growing need for holistic wellness solutions that fit seamlessly into daily routines.  Unlike traditional studios, we bring the transformative power of yoga directly to your home, fostering a personalized and comfortable environment for self-discovery and rejuvenation. This unique model addresses a significant gap in the local market, providing a convenient and personalized yoga experience that caters to individual needs and preferences.  Our commitment to individualized attention, coupled with our deep respect for the rich cultural heritage of Assam, distinguishes us in the region\'s burgeoning wellness sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service revolves around providing expertly tailored yoga classes within the comfort of your own home. We offer a diverse range of styles, including Hatha, Vinyasa, and Restorative yoga, catering to all fitness levels, from beginners to experienced practitioners. Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, possessing a deep understanding of yoga philosophy and anatomy.  They are adept at modifying poses to accommodate individual needs and limitations, ensuring a safe and effective practice for everyone.  A unique selling point is our emphasis on personalized instruction.  Each class is designed to address the specific physical and mental needs of the client, creating a truly customized experience that is far more effective than a standard group class setting. This personalized approach directly addresses the needs of our local market, which increasingly values individualized health and wellness solutions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond the physical postures, we focus on cultivating a holistic approach to wellness. Our classes integrate mindfulness techniques, pranayama (breathing exercises), and meditation, promoting mental clarity, stress reduction, and emotional balance. We recognize that the benefits of yoga extend far beyond the physical, impacting mental well-being and fostering a sense of inner peace.  This holistic approach resonates deeply with the community, where traditional wellness practices are often intertwined with spiritual and cultural beliefs. We strive to create a supportive and welcoming environment where individuals feel comfortable expressing their needs and sharing their journey.  Our commitment to fostering a sense of community, coupled with our focus on individualized attention, sets us apart and helps us cultivate strong, lasting relationships with our clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of our philosophy. We prioritize clear and open communication, ensuring that clients feel heard and understood.  We are flexible and accommodating, scheduling classes to meet individual needs and preferences. We maintain regular check-ins with our clients, ensuring that they are progressing safely and effectively.  We actively engage with the local community through workshops, free introductory classes, and partnerships with local businesses that align with our holistic wellness vision.  These initiatives not only help build brand awareness but also serve as valuable opportunities to connect with the community and share the transformative power of yoga. We build trust through consistent, reliable service and genuine care, making Yoga Class at Home a trusted and respected name in the region.  This personalized and community-focused approach forms the bedrock of our success.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our future vision encompasses significant growth and expansion within the Assam region. We plan to expand our team of highly skilled instructors, allowing us to serve a wider clientele and offer a more extensive range of yoga styles and specialized workshops. We aim to develop strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote our services and reach a larger audience. We will also explore digital platforms to enhance our reach and accessibility, offering online classes and resources to complement our in-home services. We envision Yoga Class at Home as a leading provider of holistic wellness solutions in Assam, a trusted resource for individuals seeking a path towards improved physical and mental well-being.  Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and impactful business that positively contributes to the health and happiness of the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond expansion, we are committed to maintaining our focus on personalized attention and community engagement.  We recognize that our success is intrinsically linked to the well-being of our clients and the strength of our community ties. We will continue to invest in professional development for our instructors, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of yoga practice and education.  We plan to integrate further elements of Assamese culture and tradition into our classes, offering a truly unique and authentic yoga experience that respects and celebrates the rich heritage of the region. This commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement will ensure that Yoga Class at Home remains a valuable and respected member of the Assam business landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In essence, Yoga Class at Home provides more than just yoga instruction; we provide a pathway to wellness, a sense of community, and a personalized journey towards self-discovery.  By bringing the transformative power of yoga to the comfort of your home, we strive to improve the lives of individuals and contribute positively to the vibrant community of Assam. We are committed to ongoing growth and innovation, always striving to improve our services and better serve the needs of our clients. Our dedication to quality, personalization, and community engagement will ensure the sustained success of Yoga Class at Home in the years to come.</p>', 'Bora Service, Green Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7896449014', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:25:19', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(270, 'Yog Sadhana Centre', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Yog Sadhana Centre: Cultivating Inner Peace in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at House no 21, Bye Lane 9, Lachit Nagar Main Rd, the Yog Sadhana Centre stands as a beacon of holistic well-being, offering a sanctuary for individuals seeking physical, mental, and spiritual growth. In a bustling city increasingly demanding of its inhabitants, the Centre provides a much-needed space for introspection, rejuvenation, and connection with the inner self.  Unlike many fitness studios or yoga centers, Yog Sadhana Centre distinguishes itself by integrating ancient yogic practices with a modern, accessible approach, catering to diverse needs and experience levels within the Guwahati community. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique approach blends traditional Ashtanga, Hatha, and Vinyasa styles with therapeutic yoga modalities. This diverse curriculum allows us to cater to a wide range of individuals, from seasoned yoga practitioners seeking advanced instruction to complete beginners looking to explore the benefits of yoga for the first time.  We prioritize small class sizes to ensure personalized attention and effective instruction, fostering a supportive and encouraging environment. Beyond asanas (physical postures), our programs incorporate pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and mindfulness techniques, providing a comprehensive approach to holistic well-being.  This integrated approach uniquely addresses the growing demand for stress management, improved mental health, and increased physical fitness within the Assam region.  </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the Yog Sadhana Centre, we firmly believe that the journey to inner peace begins with a positive and supportive environment. Our experienced and certified instructors are not just teachers; they are mentors who guide each student with compassion and understanding. We value building strong relationships with our students, creating a close-knit community where individuals feel comfortable sharing their experiences and supporting one another\'s growth.  We achieve this through a combination of friendly, attentive service, regular community events like workshops and retreats, and open communication channels that encourage feedback and personal connection. This personalized approach to customer service, combined with our tranquil studio setting, sets us apart from larger, more impersonal studios.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We foster a sense of community by actively participating in local events and collaborating with other businesses promoting healthy lifestyles in Guwahati. We regularly host workshops on relevant topics such as stress management and mindful living, attracting individuals from beyond our immediate clientele. This proactive involvement enhances our connection with the local community, positioning us not merely as a business but as a valuable resource within the region.  Furthermore, we emphasize sustainable practices, reducing our environmental footprint wherever possible, further aligning with the growing awareness of ecological responsibility within Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, the Yog Sadhana Centre envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati area.  We plan to introduce specialized workshops focusing on specific needs, such as yoga for seniors, prenatal yoga, and yoga for athletes.  We also aim to expand our teacher training programs to nurture the next generation of yoga instructors in Assam, contributing to the overall growth of the yoga community within the state.  Long-term, we aspire to become a leading provider of holistic wellness programs in the region, continually evolving our offerings to meet the changing needs of our community while upholding our core values of accessibility, inclusivity, and personalized attention. Our ultimate goal is to empower individuals to cultivate inner peace and lead fulfilling lives, enriching not only their own well-being, but also the community at large.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to quality instruction, personalized service, and community engagement positions the Yog Sadhana Centre as a leading holistic wellness provider in Guwahati. We are not merely a business; we are a sanctuary for personal growth and a hub for a thriving community.  We are confident in our ability to continue to serve the growing demand for holistic wellness solutions in Assam, and to make a significant contribution to the health and happiness of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We invite you to experience the transformative power of yoga and mindfulness at the Yog Sadhana Centre.  Discover a space where you can reconnect with your inner self, nurture your well-being, and become part of a supportive community dedicated to personal growth.  Contact us today to learn more about our programs and schedule a visit.</p>', 'House no 21, Bye Lane 9, Lachit Nagar Main Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8011695700', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:25:26', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(271, 'Divine Yoga Studio (Yoga Classes)', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Divine Yoga Studio (Yoga Classes)</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled near the serene Grahmya Devata Mandir, Divine Yoga Studio offers a sanctuary of peace and rejuvenation in the heart of Assam.  More than just a yoga studio, we are a community hub fostering physical and mental well-being through expertly guided yoga practices tailored to the diverse needs of our local clientele.  We recognize the unique demands of our community and strive to provide accessible and enriching yoga experiences that complement the vibrant culture of Assam. Our commitment to quality instruction, personalized attention, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart, establishing Divine Yoga Studio as a leading provider of holistic wellness services in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service is the provision of diverse yoga classes catering to all levels, from beginners to seasoned practitioners. We offer a comprehensive range of styles, including Hatha, Vinyasa, Ashtanga, and Restorative yoga.  Each class is meticulously designed to promote flexibility, strength, balance, and stress reduction.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to incorporating traditional Asana practice with a modern approach, acknowledging the specific needs and preferences of the Assamese community.  We also offer specialized workshops focusing on prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and yoga therapy for specific health concerns. This targeted approach directly addresses the diverse health and wellness requirements within our local market, filling a gap in the current wellness landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Divine Yoga Studio, we believe that exceptional customer experience is paramount.  We foster a welcoming and inclusive environment where individuals of all backgrounds and fitness levels feel comfortable and supported. Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, providing personalized attention and modifications to suit individual needs.  We emphasize the importance of building a strong sense of community among our students, creating opportunities for interaction and support both within and outside of the class setting.  This community focus extends beyond our studio walls, as we actively participate in local events and initiatives to promote health and well-being within the larger Assamese community.  We strive to create a space where individuals can not only improve their physical health but also connect with a supportive community and discover inner peace.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our future vision for Divine Yoga Studio is ambitious yet grounded in our commitment to serving the Assamese community. We plan to expand our range of services by introducing new yoga styles, workshops, and wellness programs.  This might include incorporating elements of traditional Assamese healing practices into our offerings, creating a truly unique and culturally relevant experience.  We are also exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations to reach a wider audience and create synergistic opportunities for growth.  We aim to become a recognized leader in holistic wellness, not just within our immediate area but across the wider region.  This will be achieved through continued investment in teacher training, innovative program development, and unwavering dedication to our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond expanding our service offerings, we also envision a future that prioritizes sustainability and ethical practices. This includes incorporating environmentally conscious measures within our studio operations and promoting mindful consumption among our students. We want to ensure that our business not only contributes to the well-being of our clients but also supports the long-term health of our community and environment.  We aim to be a model for responsible and sustainable business practices within the Assamese wellness sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In summary, Divine Yoga Studio is more than just a fitness center; it is a vibrant community hub dedicated to promoting holistic well-being through accessible and culturally relevant yoga practices.  Our commitment to exceptional customer service, personalized attention, and community engagement sets us apart.  Our future plans for expansion and sustainability solidify our position as a leading provider of wellness services in Assam, ensuring a positive and lasting impact on the lives of our students and the community we serve.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We invite you to experience the Divine Yoga Studio difference. Join us and embark on a journey of self-discovery, physical transformation, and inner peace.</p>', 'Near Grahmya Devata Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9854316812', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:25:32', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(272, 'Bliss Yoga Centre Guwahati', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Bliss Yoga Centre Guwahati: Finding Your Inner Peace in the Heart of Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Bliss Yoga Centre Guwahati, nestled at 5QP4+XP4, Surjya Club, CK Agarwala Rd, behind Kamrup Academy School, offers a haven of tranquility and rejuvenation in the bustling city.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub fostering physical, mental, and spiritual well-being within the vibrant tapestry of Guwahati\'s cultural landscape.  Our unique approach blends traditional Ashtanga, Hatha, and Vinyasa styles with the mindful incorporation of elements from traditional Assamese wellness practices, creating a truly distinctive experience unavailable elsewhere in the region. We aim to cater to the diverse needs of the Guwahati community, offering a sanctuary for both seasoned yogis and those new to the practice.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a diverse range of yoga classes tailored to various experience levels and fitness goals.  From invigorating Vinyasa flows that build strength and flexibility to gentle Hatha classes promoting relaxation and stress reduction, we cater to a wide spectrum of needs. Our signature Ashtanga classes provide a challenging yet rewarding practice for those seeking a deeper immersion in this dynamic style.  Beyond these core offerings, we also conduct specialized workshops focusing on prenatal yoga, restorative yoga, and meditation techniques,  further enriching the holistic well-being experience we provide.  A unique selling point lies in our integration of traditional Assamese healing modalities into our workshops – incorporating elements of Ayurveda and traditional breathing exercises into our sessions, adding a distinctly local flavor to our practice and creating a uniquely Assamese yoga experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We recognize the increasing need for stress management and mental wellness in today\'s fast-paced world, and our services directly address this growing demand. The calming atmosphere of our studio, coupled with the expertise of our qualified instructors, provides a much-needed respite from daily pressures.  Our classes are designed not only to enhance physical fitness but also to cultivate inner peace and mindfulness, fostering a sense of calm and balance within our students.  This holistic approach sets us apart, distinguishing us from typical fitness centers and positioning us as a leading provider of comprehensive well-being services in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Bliss Yoga Centre Guwahati. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable and supported. Our dedicated team of experienced and certified instructors provides personalized attention, offering modifications and guidance to ensure a safe and effective practice for all participants, regardless of their age, fitness level, or prior yoga experience. We prioritize building strong relationships with our students, fostering a sense of community and belonging. This goes beyond the studio walls; we regularly organize community events and outreach programs, connecting with the local community through yoga workshops and charitable initiatives, promoting physical and mental health awareness within Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to fostering a welcoming and inclusive environment extends to our pricing structure, designed to be accessible to a broad range of individuals within the community. We believe that yoga should be a practice available to everyone, irrespective of their financial situation.  We offer various membership options and pricing tiers to cater to individual needs and budgetary constraints, ensuring that the transformative benefits of yoga are within reach for the entire Guwahati community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Bliss Yoga Centre Guwahati envisions significant growth and expansion.  We plan to introduce new specialized workshops and teacher training programs, further establishing our position as a leading yoga institution in Assam. We also aim to expand our physical space, creating more room for diverse classes and community events.  Our long-term goal is to become a recognized centre of excellence for yoga and holistic wellness, not just in Guwahati, but throughout the region, spreading the transformative power of yoga and mindful living throughout Assam and beyond.  We aspire to inspire a community-wide embrace of a healthy and balanced lifestyle, promoting physical and mental wellness within the local populace and contributing to the vibrant and growing wellness sector in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our future plans also include actively participating in local health and wellness fairs and collaborating with other businesses and organizations in the Guwahati area to broaden our reach and impact. By consistently delivering high-quality instruction and fostering a positive community atmosphere, we are confident in our ability to realize our vision and establish Bliss Yoga Centre Guwahati as a leading institution in the field of holistic well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Bliss Yoga Centre Guwahati aspires to be more than just a yoga studio – we aim to be a beacon of well-being in the heart of Guwahati, empowering individuals to lead healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. Our commitment to excellence, community engagement, and holistic well-being sets us apart and lays a solid foundation for a future brimming with success.</p>', '5QP4+XP4, Surjya Club, CK Agarwala Rd, behind Kamrup Academy School', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:25:39', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(273, 'Sai Yoga centre kalapahar', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Sai Yoga Centre Kalapahar</h1>\n<p>Nestled at 4th, 4th Battalion Gate Ln, Kalapahar, Sai Yoga Centre stands as a beacon of wellness and holistic living in the heart of Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub dedicated to promoting physical and mental well-being through the ancient practice of yoga and its diverse applications.  Our unique approach combines traditional Asana practice with modern wellness techniques, catering specifically to the needs and cultural context of the local community.  This dedication to both authenticity and accessibility sets us apart in the growing Assam wellness market. <br><br></p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>At Sai Yoga Centre, we offer a comprehensive range of yoga classes designed to accommodate all levels of experience, from beginners to advanced practitioners. Our classes include Hatha Yoga, focusing on fundamental postures and breathwork, Vinyasa Flow, emphasizing dynamic movement and fluidity, and restorative yoga, promoting deep relaxation and stress reduction. We also incorporate elements of Pranayama (breathing exercises) and meditation into our classes, fostering a holistic approach to wellness.  We recognize the unique physical and mental demands of life in Assam, and our classes are carefully designed to help individuals manage stress, improve flexibility, build strength, and cultivate inner peace.  <br><br></p>\n\n<p>Beyond our regular classes, we offer specialized workshops focused on specific areas such as yoga for back pain relief, prenatal yoga, and yoga for seniors. These targeted workshops address the prevalent health concerns within the local population, providing practical and accessible solutions through the power of yoga.  In addition to our class offerings, we also provide personalized yoga consultations to help individuals develop a practice tailored to their specific needs and goals. We believe in fostering a strong connection between practitioner and student, providing individualized attention to support each person\'s journey towards a healthier lifestyle.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Sai Yoga Centre is our commitment to integrating traditional Assamese elements into our practice.  We incorporate local knowledge of herbal remedies and mindfulness techniques, weaving them into our classes to create a truly authentic and culturally relevant experience.  This fusion of ancient wisdom and modern techniques sets us apart and resonates deeply with the local community, contributing to a sense of pride and belonging within the yoga practice.<br><br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>At Sai Yoga Centre, we prioritize creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable and supported.  Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, dedicated to providing clear instruction, personalized attention, and a nurturing atmosphere. We believe that a strong teacher-student relationship is fundamental to a successful yoga practice, and we strive to foster a sense of community and connection among our students.  <br><br></p>\n\n<p>Our commitment to customer service extends beyond the yoga mat.  We strive to create a space where students feel comfortable asking questions, sharing their experiences, and receiving support in their yoga journey.  We offer convenient scheduling options, flexible class packages, and a welcoming studio environment that promotes relaxation and self-discovery.  We are actively engaged in the Kalapahar community, participating in local events and collaborating with other businesses to promote holistic wellness initiatives. This proactive community involvement strengthens our connection with our clients and fosters a deeper sense of belonging.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>We actively solicit feedback from our students, using this invaluable information to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting the evolving needs of our community. We believe in transparency and open communication, fostering a trusting relationship with our clientele and building a loyal following based on mutual respect and shared commitment to wellbeing.<br><br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>Sai Yoga Centre Kalapahar has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  We envision becoming a leading wellness center in the region, offering an ever-expanding range of services and programs to cater to the growing demand for holistic wellness solutions.  Our future plans include expanding our class offerings to encompass new styles of yoga, incorporating workshops on related wellness topics such as nutrition and mindfulness, and potentially expanding our physical space to accommodate a larger student base. <br><br></p>\n\n<p>We also aim to develop a robust teacher training program to cultivate a new generation of qualified yoga instructors within the Assam region. This initiative will further contribute to the growth of the yoga community and ensure the continuation of this transformative practice for generations to come.  Our long-term goal is to establish Sai Yoga Centre as a reputable and respected institution, contributing significantly to the overall health and well-being of the community while simultaneously promoting the rich tradition of yoga in Assam. <br><br></p>\n\n<p>Our commitment to quality, community engagement, and continuous improvement will remain the cornerstone of our future endeavors. We are confident that our dedication to providing exceptional service and fostering a supportive environment will ensure the continued success and growth of Sai Yoga Centre Kalapahar, making it a true center of wellness in the heart of Assam. <br><br></p>', '4th, 4th Battalion Gate Ln', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:30:13', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(274, 'TM Fitness Studio', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>TM Fitness Studio: Shaping a Healthier Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>TM Fitness Studio, located on the 2nd Floor of Vrindavan Complex on Beltola Road, opposite CCD, is more than just a gym; it\'s a vibrant community hub dedicated to promoting holistic wellness in Guwahati.  We recognize the growing need for accessible and high-quality fitness solutions within the city, and we\'ve designed our studio to cater specifically to the unique needs and preferences of the local population.  Our commitment to personalized training, state-of-the-art equipment, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart in the burgeoning fitness landscape of Assam. We are dedicated to empowering individuals to achieve their fitness goals while fostering a strong sense of community and support.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our comprehensive approach to fitness distinguishes us from traditional gyms.  We offer a diverse range of services designed to cater to varying fitness levels and goals.  These include personalized training programs tailored to individual needs and aspirations, ranging from weight loss and muscle gain to injury rehabilitation and improved athletic performance.  Our certified trainers undergo rigorous training and are deeply familiar with the latest fitness methodologies. They prioritize client safety and create customized workout plans that progressively challenge individuals, ensuring long-term results and injury prevention.  Beyond personalized training, we offer group fitness classes, including Zumba, Yoga, and high-intensity interval training (HIIT), fostering a sense of camaraderie and motivation among participants.  We also provide nutritional guidance and support to complement our exercise programs, recognizing the crucial role of nutrition in overall well-being.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for TM Fitness Studio is our unwavering dedication to fostering a supportive and inclusive environment. We believe fitness should be accessible to everyone, regardless of age, background, or fitness level.  Our studio is equipped with modern, well-maintained equipment from leading brands, ensuring a safe and comfortable workout experience.  We also actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, including free fitness workshops and partnerships with local organizations, demonstrating our commitment to promoting health and wellness beyond the walls of our studio.  Our focus on building strong relationships with our clients ensures a personalized and rewarding fitness journey for each individual.  We pride ourselves on our exceptional customer service, providing readily available support and ongoing encouragement to help clients reach their full potential.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to personalized service extends beyond the individual training sessions.  We utilize advanced technology to track client progress, providing regular feedback and making necessary adjustments to their programs to ensure optimal results. This personalized approach contributes to greater client engagement and significantly improves adherence to the fitness regime.  Furthermore, our welcoming atmosphere cultivates a sense of community within the studio, encouraging members to support and motivate each other towards their fitness objectives.  We believe that a positive and encouraging environment is key to achieving long-term fitness success.  The friendly and knowledgeable staff are always available to answer questions, provide guidance, and ensure a comfortable and enjoyable experience for each client.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>TM Fitness Studio has ambitious plans for the future.  We envision expanding our service offerings to include additional group fitness classes, specialized workshops, and potentially incorporating wellness services like physiotherapy or nutritional counseling.  We also aim to expand our reach within the Guwahati community, partnering with more local businesses and organizations to increase awareness about the importance of fitness and wellness.  Our long-term goal is to become a recognized leader in the Guwahati fitness industry, known for our exceptional services, commitment to community engagement, and the transformative impact we have on the lives of our clients.  We will continue to invest in state-of-the-art equipment, training for our staff, and innovative programming to stay at the forefront of the fitness landscape.  We are committed to continually evolving and adapting to meet the ever-changing needs and expectations of our clients, ensuring that TM Fitness Studio remains a vital part of the Guwahati community for years to come.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>In summary, TM Fitness Studio is not just a place to work out; it\'s a place to transform lives. We combine cutting-edge fitness solutions with a deeply personalized approach, fostering a supportive and engaging community that empowers individuals to achieve their fitness goals and live healthier, happier lives.  Our convenient location, exceptional customer service, and unwavering commitment to excellence distinguish us in the Guwahati fitness market.  We invite you to experience the TM Fitness Studio difference and embark on your fitness journey with us.</p>', '2nd Floor, Vrindavan Complex, Beltola Rd, opposite CCD', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7896910223', '', 'http://tandramoni92.zumba.com/', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:30:21', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(275, 'Nityama', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Nityama: Elevating Experiences in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Jurani Path, H 14, RG Baruah Rd, Central, opposite the bustling city center, Nityama stands as a testament to meticulous craftsmanship and unwavering dedication to customer satisfaction.  We are not merely a business; we are a vital thread woven into the vibrant tapestry of Assam\'s commercial landscape. Our commitment to quality, coupled with our deep understanding of local needs, has allowed us to establish a strong foothold in the community and build lasting relationships with our valued clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike many businesses that adopt a generalized approach, Nityama distinguishes itself by prioritizing personalized service and a deep engagement with the Assamese market.  We understand that success in this region requires more than just offering products or services; it demands a thorough understanding of the local culture, preferences, and specific demands.  This intimate knowledge is what underpins our operational philosophy and fuels our commitment to exceeding customer expectations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Nityama\'s core offering centers around [<em>Insert Core Business Here -  e.g.,  high-quality handcrafted Assamese textiles, bespoke jewelry design and creation using locally sourced materials, curated experiences showcasing Assamese art and culture, etc.</em>].  We source our materials responsibly and prioritize ethical practices in our production process. This commitment reflects not only our business values but also our deep respect for the rich heritage and environment of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our emphasis on [<em>Insert Unique Selling Proposition - e.g.,  unique designs inspired by traditional Assamese motifs, use of sustainable and ethically sourced materials, personalized consultations to create bespoke pieces,  unparalleled customer service, etc.</em>]. We strive to deliver products and services that are not only aesthetically pleasing but also tell a story, reflecting the unique artistry and cultural heritage of Assam. This approach allows us to cater to the growing demand for authentic, handcrafted products while appealing to a broader market seeking unique and meaningful experiences.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our services are tailored to meet a range of local market needs.  For example, [<em>Insert Specific Examples, tailored to the core business, e.g.,  we cater to both individual customers seeking unique gifts and larger organizations looking for corporate gifting options, or we provide personalized cultural tours designed for both local residents and international tourists.</em>].  We continuously adapt our offerings to meet evolving trends and demands, ensuring that we remain a relevant and reliable resource for our clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Nityama, customer experience is paramount. We believe that building strong relationships is crucial to long-term success. Our approach emphasizes personalized service, open communication, and a genuine desire to understand our clients\' needs. We are committed to providing a welcoming and comfortable environment where customers feel valued and respected.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond simply fulfilling orders. We strive to create a memorable experience for each client, building trust and fostering lasting relationships. This is achieved through [<em>Insert Specific strategies, e.g.,  regular client communication, personalized consultations, after-sales support, loyalty programs, community engagement activities, etc.</em>]. We actively seek feedback to continually improve our services and ensure that we consistently meet and exceed expectations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in the power of community engagement.  We actively participate in local initiatives and events, further strengthening our ties with the community and building a strong brand reputation. [<em>Insert examples of community involvement, e.g.,  participation in local fairs and festivals, supporting local artisans, sponsoring community events, offering workshops, etc.</em>]. This approach fosters a sense of belonging and mutual support, reinforcing our position as a valued member of the Guwahati business community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Nityama\'s future is bright.  We envision continued growth and expansion, both within Guwahati and potentially into other regions of Assam. Our long-term goals include [<em>Insert specific, measurable goals, e.g.,  expanding our product line, opening a larger retail space, establishing online sales channels, partnering with other local businesses, expanding our team, investing in technology, developing new product lines, establishing a training program, etc</em>].</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to maintaining our focus on quality, craftsmanship, and exceptional customer service.  By consistently delivering on our promises and adapting to the ever-evolving needs of the market, we are confident in our ability to achieve sustained growth and establish Nityama as a leading brand in Assam. Our dedication to preserving and promoting Assamese heritage, combined with our commitment to innovation and customer satisfaction, will continue to drive our success for years to come.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We invite you to experience the Nityama difference. Visit us at Jurani Path, H 14, RG Baruah Rd, Central, Guwahati, and discover the unique artistry and exceptional service that sets us apart.</p>', 'Jurani Path, H 14, RG Baruah Rd, Central, opp. Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8638900732', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:30:29', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(276, 'Ground Zero Gym & Fitness Panjabari', 'Gym', '', '<h1>Ground Zero Gym & Fitness Panjabari</h1>\n\n<p>Ground Zero Gym & Fitness Panjabari, strategically located on Panjabari Road, is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a vibrant hub for health and wellness in the heart of Guwahati. We cater to the diverse fitness needs of the Panjabari community and beyond, offering a comprehensive range of services designed to empower individuals to achieve their personal best.  Our commitment to excellence, combined with a personalized approach to fitness, sets us apart in the dynamic Assam fitness landscape. We are dedicated to fostering a strong sense of community and providing a supportive environment where members can thrive on their fitness journeys.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ground Zero Gym & Fitness Panjabari distinguishes itself through a unique blend of cutting-edge facilities and personalized training programs. Our state-of-the-art equipment includes a wide array of strength training machines, cardio equipment, and functional training tools.  We also boast a dedicated area for group fitness classes, offering a dynamic schedule of options like Zumba, Yoga, Pilates, and high-intensity interval training (HIIT).  Beyond the equipment, our USP lies in our commitment to personalized training plans.  Our certified trainers conduct thorough fitness assessments to understand each member\'s individual needs, goals, and limitations, creating tailored workout plans that maximize results and minimize injury risk.  We recognize that the fitness needs of our community are diverse, encompassing all age groups and fitness levels, and our programs reflect this inclusivity. We cater to both beginners seeking to establish a healthy lifestyle and seasoned athletes looking to enhance their performance.  This individualized approach ensures that our services effectively meet the varied demands of the local market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Ground Zero Gym & Fitness Panjabari. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where every member feels valued and encouraged. Our friendly and knowledgeable staff is dedicated to providing exceptional service, from assisting members with equipment to answering questions and offering guidance.  We maintain meticulous cleanliness and hygiene standards to ensure a safe and comfortable workout environment.  Beyond the gym walls, we actively engage with the local community. We sponsor local sports events, participate in community initiatives, and offer discounted memberships to local organizations and students.  We believe in building strong relationships with our members, fostering a sense of belonging, and contributing positively to the overall well-being of the Panjabari community.  Our regular fitness challenges, workshops, and social gatherings further solidify this sense of community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our vision for the future of Ground Zero Gym & Fitness Panjabari is ambitious yet grounded in our core values.  We aim to become the leading fitness destination in Panjabari and a benchmark for fitness excellence in Assam.  Our expansion plans include introducing new fitness programs, expanding our equipment inventory with cutting-edge technology, and potentially adding additional services such as nutritional counseling and physiotherapy.  We are committed to investing in ongoing staff training to ensure that our team stays at the forefront of fitness knowledge and trends. We also intend to strengthen our community engagement initiatives, working more closely with local schools and organizations to promote healthy lifestyles among younger generations.  Long-term, we see Ground Zero Gym & Fitness Panjabari evolving into a comprehensive wellness center, offering holistic services that enhance not only physical health but also mental and emotional well-being.  This includes exploring options such as meditation classes, stress management workshops, and collaborations with local health professionals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In summary, Ground Zero Gym & Fitness Panjabari represents a commitment to providing high-quality fitness services tailored to the specific needs of the Panjabari community. Our unique approach, combining state-of-the-art facilities with personalized training, coupled with our focus on customer experience and community engagement, sets us apart. We are confident in our ability to achieve our ambitious growth plans and establish ourselves as the premier fitness destination in the region, contributing significantly to the health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p>', 'Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8099311269', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:30:38', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(277, 'DIKSHHA YOGA CENTRE', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>DIKSHHA YOGA CENTRE: Cultivating Wellness in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled above Farma Care on Road, New Airport Rd, in Guwahati, Assam, DIKSHHA YOGA CENTRE stands as a beacon of holistic well-being.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub dedicated to fostering physical, mental, and spiritual growth within the vibrant tapestry of Assamese life.  Our unique approach blends traditional yogic principles with a modern understanding of wellness, offering a transformative experience tailored to the specific needs of our community. We differentiate ourselves through our commitment to personalized instruction, a welcoming atmosphere, and a deep respect for the rich cultural heritage of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to providing accessible and high-quality yoga instruction is evident in our diverse range of offerings.  We cater to all levels, from beginners taking their first tentative steps on the mat to experienced practitioners seeking to deepen their practice.  Our core services include Hatha Yoga, a foundational style emphasizing posture and breath control; Vinyasa Yoga, a dynamic flow-based practice; and Restorative Yoga, a gentle style promoting deep relaxation and stress reduction.  We also offer specialized workshops focusing on specific areas such as prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and yoga nidra (yogic sleep). Each class is carefully crafted to provide a balanced and safe practice, focusing on proper alignment and mindful movement.  Our unique selling point lies in the individualized attention each student receives, ensuring a practice that is both challenging and supportive.  This personalized approach addresses the diverse needs and fitness levels within our community, making yoga accessible to a broader spectrum of individuals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The needs of the local market in Guwahati are diverse, encompassing a desire for physical fitness, stress management, and a sense of community. DIKSHHA YOGA CENTRE directly addresses these needs by offering a variety of yoga styles that cater to differing preferences and fitness levels.  Our commitment to personalized attention allows us to tailor the practice to individual requirements, ensuring effectiveness and promoting sustainable well-being. We recognize that stress is a pervasive issue, and our classes, workshops, and specialized programs provide effective tools for stress management and relaxation. In a bustling city like Guwahati, the sense of community fostered within our centre offers a much-needed respite and connection, providing a supportive and encouraging environment for personal growth.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At DIKSHHA YOGA CENTRE, customer experience is paramount. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every individual feels comfortable and respected.  From the moment a new student walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and kindness. Our instructors are highly trained and certified, committed to providing clear instruction and personalized guidance.  We foster a strong sense of community through regular social events and workshops, encouraging interaction and connection among our students. We actively engage with the local community by participating in health fairs and collaborating with local businesses to promote overall wellness. This commitment extends beyond the studio walls, reflecting our dedication to contributing to the well-being of the entire Guwahati community. We strive to create a sanctuary where individuals can connect with their inner selves, find solace, and build lasting relationships.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our vision for the future is to expand our reach and impact within the Guwahati community and beyond.  We plan to introduce new yoga styles and workshops, catering to an even broader range of interests and needs. We envision expanding our facility to accommodate more classes and create a larger space for community gatherings and events. We also aim to collaborate with local businesses and organizations to promote holistic well-being across the region.  We are exploring the possibility of offering online yoga classes to reach a wider audience and make our services accessible to those who may not be able to attend in-person sessions.   Our long-term goal is to establish DIKSHHA YOGA CENTRE as the premier wellness destination in Guwahati, known for its exceptional quality, inclusive atmosphere, and profound positive impact on the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>DIKSHHA YOGA CENTRE is more than just a business; it is a commitment to the holistic well-being of the Guwahati community.  We are dedicated to providing high-quality yoga instruction in a welcoming and supportive environment, fostering physical, mental, and spiritual growth for individuals of all levels.  Our commitment to personalized attention, community engagement, and continuous growth ensures that we will continue to be a valued resource for years to come, enriching the lives of those who walk through our doors and contributing positively to the fabric of Assamese society.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p> We are confident that our dedication, coupled with our deep understanding of the local needs, positions DIKSHHA YOGA CENTRE for sustained success and a significant contribution to the wellness landscape of Guwahati.</p>', 'Road, New Airport Rd, above Farma Care', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9854267239', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:30:46', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(278, 'Aerobic Fitness', 'Gym', '', '<h1>Aerobic Fitness: Revitalizing Health in Bhetapara</h1>\n\n<p>Aerobic Fitness, situated on the vibrant Bhetapara-Ghoramara Road, is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a community hub dedicated to promoting holistic well-being through innovative aerobic exercise programs.  We understand the unique needs of the Bhetapara community and strive to provide accessible, effective, and enjoyable fitness solutions that cater to all ages and fitness levels.  Our commitment to personalized training, coupled with a supportive and motivating atmosphere, sets us apart in the Assam fitness landscape.  We aim to be the leading provider of aerobic fitness solutions, fostering a healthier and more energetic community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our significance within the local business landscape stems from our dedication to addressing the growing demand for accessible and effective fitness options in the area.  While many fitness centers focus solely on strength training or specialized equipment, Aerobic Fitness offers a comprehensive approach, emphasizing the vital role of cardiovascular health in overall well-being. We recognize that a healthy community is a thriving community, and our contribution to the physical and mental health of our patrons directly benefits the broader Bhetapara area.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Aerobic Fitness offers a diverse range of services designed to meet the varied needs of our clientele.  Our core offering includes a comprehensive schedule of aerobic classes, encompassing Zumba, step aerobics, low-impact cardio, and high-intensity interval training (HIIT).  We cater to all fitness levels, from beginners to advanced participants, with modified routines available for those with specific needs or limitations. Beyond group classes, we provide personalized training sessions tailored to individual goals and fitness assessments to ensure clients are exercising effectively and safely.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What distinguishes Aerobic Fitness is our commitment to incorporating elements of local culture into our programs.  We regularly incorporate traditional Assamese folk dances into our routines, providing a unique and engaging workout experience. This fusion of modern fitness techniques with local traditions resonates deeply with our community, fostering a sense of belonging and pride. Our commitment to using locally sourced, sustainable materials in our facility also reflects our dedication to the well-being of our community and environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We meet the local market needs by offering flexible membership options, competitive pricing, and a convenient location easily accessible by public transport.  Recognizing that busy schedules can often hinder fitness goals, we provide diverse class times, including early morning, evening, and weekend options. Our focus on personalized service ensures every member feels understood and supported in their fitness journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Aerobic Fitness, the customer experience is paramount.  We foster a welcoming and supportive environment, where members feel comfortable and encouraged to reach their fitness goals. Our instructors are highly qualified, certified professionals with a passion for fitness and a commitment to providing exceptional service. They are not just instructors but motivators, ensuring each client feels valued and part of a larger community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique approach to customer service extends beyond the workouts.  We provide regular wellness workshops focusing on nutrition, stress management, and other aspects of holistic well-being.  We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools, community centers, and local businesses to promote health and fitness initiatives. This fosters a sense of connection, transforming Aerobic Fitness into more than just a gym, but a central hub for community engagement.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs and aspirations, and celebrating their achievements.  Through regular feedback mechanisms and personalized communication, we strive to ensure that every member feels heard and supported throughout their fitness journey with us. Our commitment to creating a positive and inclusive environment is a cornerstone of our success.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Aerobic Fitness envisions a future where we are not only the leading fitness center in Bhetapara but also a recognized model for community-focused wellness initiatives across Assam.  We plan to expand our services, incorporating additional fitness programs such as yoga, Pilates, and specialized programs for senior citizens. We are exploring partnerships with local healthcare providers to further integrate fitness into comprehensive wellness plans.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish a network of Aerobic Fitness centers across Assam, replicating our successful community-focused model in other regions. We aim to become a recognizable brand synonymous with high-quality fitness, personalized service, and a strong commitment to community engagement.  Continuous improvement through incorporating advanced technology, enhanced training programs, and expanded facilities are integral to our growth strategy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>By remaining responsive to the evolving needs of our community, investing in our staff and facilities, and consistently delivering exceptional customer experiences, Aerobic Fitness is poised for significant growth and long-term sustainability. We are committed to playing a vital role in creating a healthier, happier, and more energetic Assam, one client at a time.</p>', 'Bhetapara - Ghoramara Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8486708922', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:35:12', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(279, 'Shriya Yoga Institute', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Shriya Yoga Institute: Cultivating Wellness in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at House no 5, Path, opposite Shreenagar Kali Mandir, Shriya Yoga Institute offers a sanctuary of well-being in the heart of Assam.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community dedicated to promoting holistic health and mindful living through the ancient practice of yoga.  Our unique approach blends traditional Asana practice with the principles of Ayurveda, creating a tailored and enriching experience for individuals of all levels, regardless of their prior experience with yoga.  In a region increasingly focused on modern lifestyles, Shriya Yoga Institute provides a vital counterpoint, offering a path towards physical fitness, mental clarity, and spiritual growth.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Shriya Yoga Institute distinguishes itself within the Assam wellness landscape through its commitment to personalized instruction and community engagement. Unlike large, impersonal studios, we prioritize small class sizes, ensuring each participant receives individualized attention and guidance.  Our instructors are highly trained and certified, possessing extensive knowledge not only in various yoga styles but also in related disciplines like pranayama (breathing techniques) and meditation.  This individualized approach ensures that participants receive the most beneficial and safe practice possible, catering to specific needs and limitations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our core offerings center around a diverse range of yoga styles, designed to cater to different fitness levels and personal preferences.  These include Hatha Yoga, a foundational style emphasizing fundamental postures and breathing exercises; Vinyasa Yoga, a flowing style that builds strength and flexibility; and Restorative Yoga, a gentle practice ideal for stress reduction and relaxation. We also incorporate elements of Ayurveda, the traditional Indian system of medicine, into our classes, providing guidance on diet, lifestyle, and holistic well-being.  Beyond scheduled classes, we offer private sessions tailored to individual needs and goals, providing a highly personalized yoga experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Shriya Yoga Institute is our commitment to incorporating the rich cultural heritage of Assam into our practice. We offer workshops focusing on traditional Assamese practices that complement yoga, such as specific breathing techniques drawn from local traditions and mindful movement inspired by Assamese folk dance. This distinctive approach not only resonates deeply with the local community but also enriches the overall yoga experience, creating a truly authentic and culturally relevant practice.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The services offered by Shriya Yoga Institute directly address the needs of the local market.  With increasing levels of stress and sedentary lifestyles in modern Assam, there is a growing demand for holistic wellness practices. Our yoga programs provide a viable solution, offering a path towards stress management, improved physical health, and a stronger sense of mental clarity. The incorporation of Ayurvedic principles further addresses the local preference for traditional healing methods.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Shriya Yoga Institute, we believe that a welcoming and supportive environment is paramount. Our approach to customer service centers around creating a sense of community, where individuals feel comfortable, respected, and empowered.  We strive to foster a positive and inclusive atmosphere, welcoming participants of all backgrounds, ages, and fitness levels. This commitment extends beyond the yoga mat, as we actively seek to engage with the local community through workshops, outreach programs, and collaborations with other local businesses.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our dedication to building genuine relationships with our students.  Our instructors are not merely teachers; they are mentors who guide participants on their individual journeys toward well-being. We prioritize open communication, encouraging feedback and tailoring our services to ensure each participant feels heard and understood. This personalized approach fosters a sense of trust and mutual respect, creating a strong bond between instructors and students, strengthening the sense of community we cultivate.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our connection to the local community extends beyond our client base.  We actively engage with local organizations, participating in community events and offering workshops to promote wellness and well-being throughout Assam.  We believe in the power of yoga to transform lives, and we are committed to making its benefits accessible to all members of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Shriya Yoga Institute envisions a future where yoga is an integral part of a healthy lifestyle for people in Assam. We plan to expand our services to include additional yoga styles, specialized workshops, and teacher training programs.  This expansion will not only cater to the growing demand for yoga but also create opportunities for individuals to pursue yoga as a profession within the local community. We aim to develop partnerships with local businesses and organizations to further promote the benefits of yoga and to integrate it into community-wide wellness initiatives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Shriya Yoga Institute as a leading wellness center in Assam, renowned for its high-quality instruction, personalized approach, and strong community ties.  We envision a future where our institute serves as a hub for holistic well-being, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the transformative power of yoga. We are committed to sustainable growth, ensuring that our expansion remains in line with our core values of community engagement, personalized service, and a deep respect for the rich cultural heritage of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>By building on our current foundation of exceptional instruction, personalized attention, and community engagement, Shriya Yoga Institute is poised for significant growth and a lasting impact on the wellness landscape of Assam.</p>', 'House no 5, Path, opposite Shreenagar Kali Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8723055977', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:35:21', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(280, '𝗘𝗹𝘆𝘀𝗶𝘂𝗺 𝗗𝗼𝗷𝗼 Best Karate School in Guwahati/Sports & Traditional/Karate School/Self Defence Training/Yoga Classes in Guwahati', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Elysium Dojo: Cultivating Strength and Serenity in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at House #4, Samannay Path, Elysium Dojo stands as a premier martial arts and wellness center in Guwahati, Assam.  More than just a karate school, Elysium Dojo offers a holistic approach to personal development, blending traditional Japanese karate techniques with the calming practice of yoga, all within a supportive and enriching environment.  We are committed to fostering physical strength, mental discipline, and a deep sense of self-confidence within our diverse community, contributing significantly to the growing wellness landscape of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique approach differentiates us from other fitness and martial arts centers in the region. While many focus solely on the competitive aspects of karate, Elysium Dojo emphasizes character building and personal growth alongside physical prowess. We instill values of respect, discipline, and perseverance, fostering a positive and supportive learning environment for students of all ages and skill levels. This holistic approach resonates deeply with the local community, attracting individuals seeking not just physical fitness but also personal transformation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Elysium Dojo offers a comprehensive range of services designed to meet the diverse needs of our community. Our core offering is traditional Shotokan karate instruction, taught by experienced and certified instructors.  Classes cater to all levels, from beginners to advanced practitioners, ensuring a personalized and challenging experience for each student.  Our curriculum emphasizes both kata (forms) and kumite (sparring), developing both technical skill and practical self-defense capabilities.  Beyond karate, we provide specialized self-defense training tailored to practical real-world scenarios, empowering individuals to protect themselves with confidence.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the growing demand for holistic wellness, we also offer a comprehensive yoga program.  Our yoga classes incorporate various styles, focusing on flexibility, strength, balance, and mindfulness.  These classes complement our karate program, providing a pathway to physical and mental rejuvenation.  This dual approach – the dynamic energy of karate combined with the calming practice of yoga – allows students to experience a well-rounded approach to physical and mental fitness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our integrated approach. The combination of karate, self-defense, and yoga under one roof provides a unique value proposition, offering a holistic wellness solution rarely found elsewhere in Guwahati.  We cater to a diverse clientele, from children seeking discipline and fitness to adults seeking self-improvement and stress reduction, thereby filling a significant gap in the local market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Elysium Dojo, we are committed to providing an exceptional customer experience.  Our instructors are highly qualified and passionate about their art, fostering a welcoming and inclusive environment for all students.  We maintain small class sizes to ensure personalized attention and effective instruction.  We strive to build strong relationships with our students, understanding their individual goals and tailoring our training to meet their specific needs. We also regularly conduct workshops and seminars on various aspects of martial arts and wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to community engagement sets us apart.  We participate in local events and initiatives, promoting the benefits of martial arts and healthy living. We believe in actively contributing to the well-being of our community, fostering a sense of belonging and shared purpose among our students and the wider Guwahati population.  Regular open houses and introductory classes are held to further engage the local community and build awareness of our services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Elysium Dojo has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  We envision becoming the leading martial arts and wellness center in Guwahati, renowned for the quality of our instruction, the inclusivity of our community, and the positive impact we have on the lives of our students.  We plan to expand our course offerings, potentially including specialized workshops, advanced training programs, and possibly even introducing other martial arts disciplines in the future.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing strong partnerships with local schools and organizations to promote physical activity and healthy lifestyles among young people.  We aim to continue fostering a thriving community at Elysium Dojo, a place where individuals can achieve their personal best, develop valuable life skills, and connect with like-minded individuals in a supportive and enriching environment.  We are committed to being a positive force in the Guwahati community, continuing to build upon our success through consistent innovation and a unwavering commitment to excellence.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Elysium Dojo aims to be more than just a training center; we aspire to be a catalyst for personal growth, a hub for community engagement, and a testament to the transformative power of martial arts and wellness.</p>', 'House #4, Samannay Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:35:28', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL);
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(281, 'Palaash Bon Yoga Studio', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Palaash Bon Yoga Studio: Finding Harmony in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Palaash Bon Yoga Studio, located opposite DY365, offers a unique and enriching yoga experience tailored to the vibrant community of Assam. We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a sanctuary for physical and mental well-being, fostering a sense of community and connection within the local landscape.  Our approach blends traditional yoga practices with a modern understanding of holistic health, creating a space where individuals can discover inner peace and cultivate a stronger, healthier self. We strive to be a significant contributor to the wellness scene in Assam, offering accessible and high-quality yoga instruction for all levels and backgrounds.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our studio distinguishes itself through its commitment to authenticity and accessibility. We understand the unique needs and preferences of the Assamese community and have curated our offerings to reflect this understanding. We offer a variety of yoga styles, catering to diverse fitness levels and preferences.  From invigorating Vinyasa flows to calming Yin yoga sessions and restorative practices, our diverse schedule ensures there’s something for everyone, irrespective of age or experience. We also incorporate elements of traditional Assamese wellness practices into our programming where appropriate, creating a truly unique and culturally sensitive yoga experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Palaash Bon Yoga Studio provides a comprehensive range of yoga classes and workshops.  Our core offerings include Hatha, Vinyasa, Yin, Restorative, and Prenatal yoga classes.  We also regularly host specialized workshops focusing on particular aspects of yoga, such as meditation, pranayama (breathwork), and yoga philosophy.  Our unique selling proposition lies in the personalized approach we offer.  Small class sizes allow for individualized attention from our highly qualified and experienced instructors.  This allows for customized instruction, modifications for injuries or limitations, and personalized feedback, ensuring each student feels supported and challenged in their practice. We also offer introductory workshops designed to gently introduce beginners to the benefits of yoga and build confidence in their practice.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the growing demand for accessible wellness options in Assam, we have designed our pricing structure to be inclusive and affordable. We offer a range of class passes and membership options to suit various budgets and commitment levels. We also work with local organizations and businesses to provide subsidized classes and workshops for underprivileged communities, actively contributing to the overall well-being of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Palaash Bon, we prioritize creating a warm, welcoming, and inclusive environment. Our studio is designed to be a peaceful sanctuary where students can feel comfortable and relaxed. We foster a strong sense of community among our students, encouraging interaction and creating opportunities for social connection.  Our experienced instructors are not just teachers; they are mentors who genuinely care about their students\' well-being and progress.  We emphasize building rapport with each individual, understanding their goals, and adapting our teaching style to meet their specific needs.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond our classes, we actively engage with the local community through workshops, collaborations with local businesses, and participation in community events.  We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and strive to make a positive impact on the lives of our students and neighbors. This includes offering free introductory sessions for newcomers, partnering with local businesses for cross-promotional opportunities, and participating in local health and wellness fairs.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Palaash Bon Yoga Studio has ambitious plans for future growth. We envision expanding our offerings to include a wider variety of yoga styles and specialized workshops, potentially incorporating Ayurveda and other complementary therapies. We also plan to increase our community outreach initiatives, offering more free classes and workshops to underprivileged groups. We aim to establish ourselves as a leading wellness center in Assam, recognized for the quality of our instruction, the inclusivity of our community, and our commitment to the holistic well-being of our students.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that positively impacts the lives of our students and the broader Assamese community.  We aim to establish partnerships with local hotels, resorts, and corporate entities to offer corporate wellness programs and yoga retreats. This expansion will not only enhance our financial stability but also extend our reach and contribute significantly to the wellness sector in Assam.  We believe that yoga is a powerful tool for personal growth and community building, and we are committed to sharing its transformative benefits with as many people as possible.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Palaash Bon Yoga Studio is dedicated to providing a high-quality, accessible, and culturally sensitive yoga experience in Assam.  We are committed to fostering a strong sense of community, supporting the well-being of our students, and contributing to the vibrant cultural landscape of the region. We invite you to join us on this journey of self-discovery and harmonious living.</p>', 'Opposite DY365', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:35:36', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(282, 'Anika nutrition And fitness centre (Weight loss)', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>Anika Nutrition and Fitness Centre (Weight Loss)</h1>\n\n<p>Located at H.no-21, 1st floor, Beltola Tinali, Bishnu Rabha Path, Latia Garo Bye Ln, Anika Nutrition and Fitness Centre is a dedicated weight loss facility serving the community of Guwahati, Assam.  We understand the unique health challenges faced by individuals in the region and offer a comprehensive approach to weight management that combines personalized nutrition plans with effective fitness programs.  Our centre distinguishes itself through a commitment to holistic well-being, culturally sensitive practices, and a strong focus on building long-term sustainable habits, rather than offering quick-fix solutions.  In a region where dietary habits and lifestyle choices are undergoing rapid transition, Anika Nutrition and Fitness Centre provides a much-needed resource for individuals seeking healthier and more fulfilling lives. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our centre stands out in the Assam business landscape due to its integrated approach.  We recognize that effective weight loss requires more than just physical exercise; it necessitates a deep understanding of individual dietary needs and preferences.  Consequently, we don\'t just offer generic fitness classes; we employ certified nutritionists who work closely with clients to create tailored meal plans that suit their individual lifestyles, cultural backgrounds, and dietary restrictions.  This personalized approach ensures that clients feel supported and understood throughout their weight loss journey, leading to greater success and long-term adherence.  Furthermore, our fitness programs are carefully designed to be accessible and enjoyable, incorporating a variety of activities to cater to different fitness levels and preferences. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Anika Nutrition and Fitness Centre provides a range of services designed to empower clients to achieve their weight loss goals.  Our core offerings include personalized nutrition consultations, customized meal plans, one-on-one fitness training, group fitness classes (including yoga, Zumba, and cardio workouts), and regular body composition assessments.  We pride ourselves on offering a holistic approach that goes beyond simple weight reduction. We help clients understand the underlying causes of weight gain, equipping them with the knowledge and tools to manage their weight effectively and sustainably. A unique selling point is our emphasis on incorporating locally sourced and seasonal ingredients into our meal plans, promoting the use of fresh, healthy, and readily available produce in Assam. This resonates deeply with our local clientele and emphasizes our commitment to supporting the regional economy and promoting healthy eating habits within a familiar cultural context.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The services offered directly address the growing need in Assam for accessible and culturally appropriate weight management solutions.  Many individuals in the region struggle with balancing traditional dietary habits with modern lifestyle demands, often leading to weight gain and associated health problems.  Anika Nutrition and Fitness Centre provides a safe and supportive environment where individuals can learn to make informed choices about their diet and exercise, fostering sustainable lifestyle changes and improving overall health and well-being.  Our programs cater to a diverse clientele, ensuring that our services are inclusive and adaptable to different needs and backgrounds. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Anika Nutrition and Fitness Centre, we believe that creating a positive and supportive customer experience is essential to achieving successful weight loss.  Our approach emphasizes personalized attention, building strong client relationships based on trust and understanding.  We foster a welcoming and non-judgmental environment where individuals feel comfortable sharing their goals and concerns.  Our staff are highly trained and empathetic, providing consistent support and guidance throughout the weight loss journey. We regularly organize workshops and seminars on nutrition and fitness, offering valuable information and empowering our clients to take control of their health.  Beyond individual care, we actively engage with the local community through health awareness campaigns and partnerships with local organizations, reinforcing our commitment to fostering a healthier community in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to personalized care and community engagement sets us apart.  We go the extra mile to understand each client\'s unique circumstances, ensuring that our programs are tailored to their individual needs and preferences.  This includes accommodating dietary restrictions, religious observances, and cultural sensitivities. We emphasize building a strong sense of community amongst our clients, creating a supportive and motivating environment where individuals can share their experiences and encourage one another.  This fosters a sense of belonging and camaraderie, promoting adherence to the programs and enhancing the overall weight loss experience.  Our focus on community building helps us establish strong relationships within the local area, creating a network of support that extends beyond the confines of our facility.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Anika Nutrition and Fitness Centre has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  We aim to become the leading provider of comprehensive weight management services in Guwahati and beyond. This includes expanding our range of services to incorporate additional fitness programs, specialized nutrition workshops, and potentially offering online consultation and fitness classes to reach a wider audience.  We are also exploring partnerships with local businesses and healthcare providers to create a more integrated approach to health and well-being within the community.  Long-term, we envision creating a network of Anika Nutrition and Fitness Centres across Assam, bringing our holistic approach to weight management to a wider population. Our commitment to sustainability is paramount, and we plan to integrate eco-friendly practices into our operations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our ultimate goal is to empower individuals to achieve sustainable weight loss and improve their overall health and well-being. We believe that everyone deserves access to quality healthcare and fitness services, and we are committed to making our programs accessible to all members of the community.  We will continue to invest in our staff training, program development, and community outreach efforts, solidifying our position as a trusted and reliable resource for weight management in the region.  By constantly evolving and adapting to the needs of our clients, we strive to become a beacon of health and wellness for the people of Assam.</p>', 'H.no-21, 1st floor, Beltola Tinali, Bishnu Rabha Path, Latia Garo Bye Ln', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9113705079', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:35:46', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(283, 'JH YOGA STUDIO', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>JH YOGA STUDIO: Finding Your Balance in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>JH Yoga Studio, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a sanctuary for mindful movement and holistic well-being.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a community hub dedicated to cultivating inner peace and physical strength through the transformative power of yoga and mindfulness practices. In a bustling city like Guwahati, where the demands of modern life can often feel overwhelming, JH Yoga Studio provides a much-needed space for individuals to reconnect with themselves and find their equilibrium.  We differentiate ourselves through our commitment to personalized instruction, a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, and a deep understanding of the specific needs and cultural nuances of the Guwahati community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our dedication to providing high-quality yoga instruction distinguishes us within the Assam fitness landscape.  We offer a diverse range of yoga styles to cater to various experience levels and preferences, from the invigorating flow of Vinyasa to the restorative calm of Yin Yoga.  Our signature offering, \"Assam Asanas,\" uniquely integrates traditional Assamese movement patterns with yogic principles, offering a truly authentic and culturally relevant practice.  Beginner-friendly introductory classes are designed to ease newcomers into the practice, while advanced workshops delve into more specialized techniques and philosophies.  Beyond Asana (physical postures), we also offer workshops and classes focused on Pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and Yoga Nidra (yogic sleep), providing a holistic approach to well-being that extends beyond the physical mat.  This comprehensive approach addresses the increasing local demand for stress management techniques and mindful living practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At JH Yoga Studio, we believe that exceptional customer experience is the cornerstone of a thriving business.  Our highly qualified and experienced instructors are deeply committed to fostering a supportive and welcoming environment for all students.  Small class sizes allow for individualized attention, ensuring proper alignment and modification for each individual’s unique needs and physical capabilities. We prioritize a personal and approachable atmosphere, creating a space where students feel comfortable exploring their practice at their own pace.  We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, sponsoring community events, and offering subsidized classes to underprivileged groups.  Our commitment to building strong relationships within the community strengthens our connection to the city and reflects our holistic approach to yoga and well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our vision for JH Yoga Studio extends far beyond our current offerings.  We plan to expand our class schedule to include specialized workshops on topics such as Ayurveda (traditional Indian medicine), nutrition, and stress management, further enhancing our holistic approach.  We envision the creation of a teacher training program, fostering the development of skilled and passionate yoga instructors within the Assam region.  This will contribute to the growth of the yoga community and ensure the continued dissemination of the benefits of yoga within the state.  We also plan to explore partnerships with local businesses to offer corporate wellness programs, bringing the benefits of yoga and mindfulness to the workplace. Through strategic growth and community engagement, we aim to establish JH Yoga Studio as a leading center for holistic well-being in Guwahati, contributing to a healthier and more mindful Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>JH Yoga Studio’s commitment to excellence in instruction, personalized attention, and community engagement sets it apart in the competitive landscape of Guwahati. Our unique \"Assam Asanas\" program showcases the cultural relevance of our approach, appealing to a broad spectrum of the local population.  The studio’s vision extends beyond merely providing physical exercise; it strives to cultivate a supportive community that empowers individuals to live healthier, more fulfilling lives through the practice of yoga and mindfulness.  By strategically expanding our offerings and fostering strong community ties, JH Yoga Studio is poised for significant growth and sustained success in the years to come, establishing itself as a respected institution within the Assam fitness and wellness sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe that the practice of yoga is a journey of self-discovery and transformation, and we are dedicated to guiding our students on this path.  Our commitment to providing a safe, supportive, and inspiring environment ensures that each individual who walks through our doors feels empowered to connect with their inner strength and discover their full potential.  We invite you to experience the transformative power of yoga at JH Yoga Studio, and become a part of our growing community of mindful individuals in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8472809399', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:40:13', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(284, 'Mind and Body Fitness centre', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Mind and Body Fitness Centre: Nurturing Wellness in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Mind and Body Fitness Centre, located in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a gym; it\'s a holistic wellness destination designed to cater to the specific needs and aspirations of the Assamese community.  We understand the importance of physical and mental well-being in a region rich in culture and tradition, and we strive to create a supportive and inclusive environment where individuals can achieve their fitness goals while embracing a balanced lifestyle. Our unique approach blends traditional fitness principles with modern techniques, ensuring a comprehensive and effective fitness experience.  We differentiate ourselves through a strong emphasis on personalized attention, community engagement, and a deep understanding of the local context. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Mind and Body Fitness Centre offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to diverse fitness levels and interests. Our state-of-the-art facility houses a fully equipped gymnasium featuring the latest cardio and strength training equipment. We go beyond the typical gym experience by offering a variety of specialized classes, including Yoga, Zumba, Pilates, and traditional Assamese martial arts (specific styles can be added here if known). These classes are designed not only to improve physical fitness but also to promote mental well-being and stress reduction, crucial aspects often overlooked in a fast-paced urban environment like Guwahati.  We also offer personalized fitness consultations and nutritional guidance, tailoring programs to individual needs and goals. This individualized approach ensures that every member receives the support and direction required to achieve sustainable and healthy lifestyle changes. Our unique selling point is our deep understanding and integration of local traditions, offering programs that resonate with the cultural context of Assam. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>The local market in Guwahati demands fitness solutions that are not only effective but also culturally relevant and accessible. Our centre addresses this need by offering a variety of pricing options to ensure inclusivity and affordability. We also emphasize the use of locally sourced products wherever possible, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainability.  Our commitment to offering a safe, clean, and welcoming atmosphere, coupled with our diverse program offerings, positions us as a leading fitness provider in the region. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Mind and Body Fitness Centre, we believe that the customer experience is paramount. Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are dedicated to providing personalized attention and creating a welcoming atmosphere for all members. We foster a sense of community by organizing regular events, workshops, and fitness challenges, bringing members together and creating a supportive network.  We actively engage with the local community through sponsorships of local events and collaborations with community organizations, further strengthening our ties and reflecting our commitment to the region\'s well-being.  We go beyond simple customer service; we aim to build genuine relationships with our members, understanding their individual needs and helping them achieve their goals.  We achieve this by offering flexible class schedules, personalized fitness plans and regular check-ins with trainers. This individualized attention fosters a positive, motivating, and results-oriented experience. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our commitment to creating a positive experience is reflected in our clean and well-maintained facilities, ensuring a comfortable and hygienic environment for all members. We regularly invest in upgrading our equipment and expanding our services to keep pace with the latest advancements in the fitness industry.  Through consistent communication and feedback mechanisms, we actively seek member input to ensure we are consistently meeting and exceeding expectations. This ensures we remain relevant and responsive to the evolving needs of the Guwahati community. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Mind and Body Fitness Centre has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We envision becoming a leading wellness hub in Guwahati, offering a wider range of services and programs to cater to the growing demand for holistic wellness solutions.  Our future plans include expanding our facility to incorporate additional amenities such as a spa, a nutrition clinic, and specialized rehabilitation programs. We also plan to invest in advanced technology to further enhance the member experience, such as virtual reality fitness programs and personalized fitness tracking systems.  The long-term goal is to establish multiple branches throughout Assam, bringing our unique blend of traditional and modern fitness approaches to communities across the state. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we are committed to contributing to the overall health and well-being of the Assamese population. We plan to expand our community engagement initiatives, partnering with schools and local organizations to promote healthy lifestyles among younger generations.  Our dedication to providing high-quality fitness services, coupled with our strong commitment to community engagement, will solidify our position as a leader in the Assamese fitness industry.  We envision a future where Mind and Body Fitness Centre is synonymous with health, wellness, and community in Guwahati and beyond.  We are confident that our commitment to excellence, coupled with our unique understanding of the local context, will pave the way for continued success and positive impact. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002286234', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:40:24', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(285, 'Ahimsa yoga center', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h1>Ahimsa Yoga Center: Cultivating Inner Peace in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Ahimsa Yoga Center stands as a beacon of holistic well-being, offering a unique blend of traditional yoga practices and modern wellness techniques tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community.  We are more than just a yoga studio; we are a sanctuary for self-discovery, a community hub fostering connection, and a vibrant space dedicated to promoting physical and mental health within the rich cultural landscape of Assam. Our commitment to Ahimsa – non-violence – permeates every aspect of our operation, from our mindful teaching methods to our sustainable business practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In a region increasingly focused on urban development and its associated stresses, Ahimsa Yoga Center provides a much-needed respite.  We recognize the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the Assamese lifestyle and have designed our offerings to resonate deeply with the local community. Unlike many larger, corporate yoga studios, we prioritize personalized attention, fostering a sense of intimacy and belonging that is crucial for effective yoga practice and personal growth. Our focus on accessibility, affordability, and cultural sensitivity sets us apart in the burgeoning Guwahati wellness market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Ahimsa Yoga Center provides a comprehensive range of yoga services designed to cater to diverse needs and experience levels. Our core offerings include Hatha, Vinyasa, and Yin Yoga classes, each taught by experienced and certified instructors.  We also offer specialized workshops focused on specific aspects of yoga, such as pranayama (breathwork), meditation, and yoga nidra (yogic sleep).  We understand that the local population values traditional practices, and therefore incorporate elements of traditional Assamese healing techniques and philosophies into our classes where appropriate, creating a unique and culturally relevant experience. We also offer introductory sessions for beginners ensuring comfort and progress.  Our commitment to small class sizes ensures personalized attention and a supportive learning environment for all students.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond our regular classes and workshops, we provide private yoga sessions tailored to individual needs and goals. This personalized approach allows us to address specific physical limitations, injuries, or health concerns, creating a safe and effective yoga practice for each student.  We also offer corporate yoga programs designed to promote employee well-being and reduce workplace stress, aligning with the increasing emphasis on workplace wellness in Guwahati\'s growing business sector.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to accessibility, cultural sensitivity, and personalized instruction, creating a truly unique yoga experience that resonates with the local community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Ahimsa Yoga Center, we believe that the customer experience is paramount. We foster a welcoming and inclusive environment where students feel comfortable, supported, and respected.  Our instructors are not only highly skilled but also compassionate and approachable, creating a positive and encouraging learning atmosphere. We prioritize open communication, actively soliciting feedback and adapting our services to better meet the needs of our students. Our studio itself is designed to be a calming and peaceful space, incorporating elements of Assamese aesthetics to create a sense of place and belonging.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, charities, and community organizations.  We regularly host free yoga events and workshops in public spaces to promote the benefits of yoga and make it accessible to a wider audience. We also collaborate with local artisans and businesses to showcase and support local talent, further embedding ourselves within the community fabric. This commitment to community engagement enhances our brand reputation, strengthens our connection with our clientele, and positions us as a valuable contributor to the cultural vibrancy of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Ahimsa Yoga Center envisions a future where yoga is an integral part of the daily lives of the people of Guwahati. We plan to expand our offerings to include additional yoga styles, specialized workshops, and teacher training programs.  We aim to become a leading center for yoga education and wellness in Assam, attracting students and practitioners from across the region and beyond.  We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with local healthcare providers to integrate yoga into preventative healthcare programs and to promote its therapeutic benefits for specific health conditions prevalent in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Ahimsa Yoga Center as a sustainable and socially responsible business that contributes positively to the economic and social well-being of Guwahati. We plan to expand our physical space to accommodate a growing student base, and we are exploring opportunities to introduce online classes to reach a wider audience.  We are committed to using environmentally friendly practices and supporting local businesses whenever possible, demonstrating our commitment to Ahimsa in all aspects of our operation.  By continuing to prioritize the needs of our students and the wider community, Ahimsa Yoga Center is poised for significant growth and lasting impact in the vibrant cultural landscape of Guwahati, Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:40:33', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(286, 'SSK Gym', 'Fitness center', '', '<h1>SSK Gym: Forging Fitness and Community in Lakhimi Path</h1>\n\n<p>SSK Gym, nestled in the heart of Lakhimi Path, is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a community hub dedicated to fostering health, well-being, and personal growth.  We understand the unique needs and aspirations of the people in our vibrant neighborhood and have tailored our services to provide a supportive and effective fitness experience for all fitness levels, from beginners to seasoned athletes.  In a region known for its rich culture and strong community bonds, SSK Gym strives to be a cornerstone of health and wellness, contributing to the overall vitality of Lakhimi Path.  Our commitment to excellence, personalized training, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart in the Assam fitness landscape. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond simply providing equipment and space. We aim to cultivate a positive and motivating environment where individuals can achieve their fitness goals within a supportive community. This approach resonates deeply with the local culture, emphasizing collaboration and mutual support as pathways to success. We believe that fitness should be accessible to everyone, regardless of their background or experience, and we\'ve built our operations to reflect this belief.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>SSK Gym offers a comprehensive range of fitness services designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. Our state-of-the-art facility boasts a wide array of modern cardio equipment, including treadmills, elliptical trainers, stationary bikes, and rowing machines.  We also maintain a fully equipped weight room with free weights, weight machines, and functional training tools.  Beyond the equipment, we pride ourselves on offering a diverse range of classes, from invigorating Zumba and Yoga sessions to high-intensity interval training (HIIT) and strength conditioning classes.  These are designed to be both challenging and enjoyable, suitable for varying fitness levels. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>What sets SSK Gym apart is our commitment to personalized attention.  We offer one-on-one personal training sessions with certified instructors who develop customized workout plans tailored to individual goals and needs.  Our trainers understand the importance of proper form and technique to prevent injuries and maximize results. We also provide nutritional guidance to supplement training regimes, offering advice on healthy eating habits to complement the fitness journey.  This holistic approach to fitness meets the growing demand for personalized wellness solutions within the local market. We understand that fitness goals are not just physical; mental well-being is equally important, therefore our trainers are equipped to provide motivation and support throughout the entire process. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At SSK Gym, we believe that the customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels comfortable and supported.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff is always ready to assist members with any questions or concerns. We actively promote a sense of community within the gym, encouraging members to interact and support each other. Regular social events and workshops further enhance this sense of community, allowing members to bond beyond their fitness routines. This community aspect is especially valued within the close-knit fabric of Lakhimi Path. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Beyond the gym floor, we actively engage with the local community through initiatives such as sponsoring local sports events, partnering with health organizations for wellness campaigns, and offering discounted memberships to local schools and community groups. This commitment to fostering community relationships is not merely a marketing strategy; it’s integral to our identity and a reflection of our values.  We see ourselves as a vital contributor to the health and well-being of the Lakhimi Path community, and this is reflected in our proactive engagement and ongoing support. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>SSK Gym envisions continued growth and expansion within the Lakhimi Path community and beyond.  Our immediate plans include expanding our range of classes to incorporate emerging fitness trends and incorporating new technologies to enhance the member experience.  This includes exploring options like virtual fitness classes and incorporating advanced fitness tracking technology.  We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations to further extend our reach and impact within the community. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>In the long term, we aspire to become a leading fitness center in Assam, renowned for its commitment to excellence, community engagement, and personalized service.  This ambitious goal will be achieved through continuous improvement, strategic partnerships, and a steadfast dedication to our core values.  We will continuously seek ways to innovate and adapt to the ever-evolving fitness landscape, while staying true to our commitment to building a strong and supportive community centered around health and well-being. We aim to inspire healthier lifestyles and help individuals unlock their full potential, contributing positively to the thriving community of Lakhimi Path. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>SSK Gym is more than just a place to work out; it is a testament to our commitment to building a healthier and more vibrant Lakhimi Path. We are dedicated to helping our community achieve their fitness goals in a supportive, engaging, and welcoming environment.  <br> <br> </p>', 'Lakhimi Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8135807345', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:40:42', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(287, 'Gymaholic Guwahati', 'Gym', '', '<h1>Gymaholic Guwahati: Your Fitness Destination in the Heart of the City</h1>\n\n<p>Gymaholic Guwahati, located at Gogoi Towers above Federal Bank, is more than just a gym; it\'s a vibrant fitness community dedicated to transforming lives through holistic wellness.  Established to address the growing demand for high-quality fitness facilities in Guwahati, we offer a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to individuals of all fitness levels, from beginners to seasoned athletes. Our commitment to personalized training, cutting-edge equipment, and a supportive environment sets us apart in the competitive Assam fitness landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Gymaholic Guwahati recognizes the unique needs of the Guwahati community.  We understand the importance of incorporating elements of Assamese culture and lifestyle into our fitness programs. We strive to create a space that feels welcoming and inclusive, fostering a sense of belonging for all members. Our focus extends beyond physical fitness; we aim to build a community that promotes mental well-being and healthy living.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our state-of-the-art facility boasts a wide array of services designed to cater to diverse fitness goals. We offer comprehensive strength training programs using advanced equipment from leading brands. Our cardio zone features a selection of treadmills, ellipticals, stationary bikes, and rowing machines, all meticulously maintained for optimal performance.  Beyond the standard equipment, we offer specialized classes like Zumba, Yoga, Pilates, and CrossFit, led by certified and experienced instructors.  We also provide personalized training sessions tailored to individual needs and goals, whether it’s weight loss, muscle gain, or improved overall fitness. Our unique selling point lies in our personalized approach, coupled with our commitment to ongoing support and motivation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the increasing health consciousness among Guwahatians, we also offer nutritional guidance and consultation.  Our expert trainers and nutritionists work collaboratively to develop personalized plans that complement your workout regimen, ensuring a holistic approach to health and wellness.  Further, we offer regular workshops and seminars on topics ranging from healthy eating habits to stress management techniques, enriching the fitness experience beyond just physical training.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Gymaholic Guwahati, we pride ourselves on delivering an exceptional customer experience.  From the moment you step into our facility, you\'ll be greeted by our friendly and knowledgeable staff who are dedicated to ensuring your comfort and satisfaction.  We maintain a clean and hygienic environment, providing a comfortable and motivating atmosphere for your workouts. Our emphasis on personalized attention goes beyond just training sessions.  We foster a welcoming community, encouraging interaction and support among members. We regularly organize social events and challenges to further strengthen the bond amongst our members, building a sense of community and camaraderie.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We recognize that building trust with our clients is paramount.  Transparency and open communication are key elements of our approach.  We provide regular feedback and support, ensuring that our members feel seen, heard, and valued.  Our commitment to exceeding expectations has earned us a loyal clientele, many of whom have become long-term members and active participants in our community.  We believe in investing in our members, not just their fitness, but their overall well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Gymaholic Guwahati envisions becoming the premier fitness destination in Guwahati and a leading fitness center in the Assam region.  Our future plans involve expanding our range of services, potentially including specialized programs for specific demographics such as senior citizens or pregnant women.  We also plan to invest in advanced fitness technology, incorporating innovative training techniques and digital tools to enhance the member experience.  Furthermore, we aim to grow our team by recruiting more certified trainers and specialists, ensuring we can continue to serve our growing community with exceptional quality and personalized service.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to staying at the forefront of the fitness industry, constantly updating our equipment and knowledge to offer the most effective and cutting-edge training methodologies.  Long-term, we aspire to become a recognized leader in promoting health and wellness in the region, not just through our facility but also through community outreach initiatives, promoting a healthier and fitter Guwahati.  Our goal is to make Gymaholic Guwahati synonymous with fitness excellence, community spirit, and a commitment to transformative wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in sustainable growth and intend to achieve this by continuously improving our services, fostering strong relationships with our members, and actively engaging with the local community.  We see ourselves as an integral part of the Guwahati landscape, contributing to the overall health and well-being of its residents. Our commitment to excellence, coupled with our dedication to community building, will propel Gymaholic Guwahati towards a bright and successful future.</p>', 'Gogoi Towers, above Federal Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8724997546', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:40:51', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(288, 'Real BuildersGym', 'Gym', '', '<h1>Real BuildersGym: Forging Strength, Building Futures</h1>\n\n<p>Located at 4RF4+FCV, Jayanagar Rd, Real BuildersGym is more than just a fitness center; it\'s a cornerstone of the thriving Assam fitness community.  We\'re committed to providing a comprehensive and inclusive fitness experience that empowers individuals to achieve their personal best, fostering a stronger and healthier community in the process.  Unlike generic gyms, Real BuildersGym differentiates itself through a personalized approach, state-of-the-art equipment, and a focus on building lasting relationships with our members.  Our dedication to fostering a supportive and motivating environment sets us apart in the local landscape, contributing significantly to the overall well-being of our community. </p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence is reflected in every aspect of our operation, from the meticulously maintained facilities to the highly qualified and experienced personal trainers.  We understand that fitness journeys are unique, and we tailor our services to accommodate individual needs and goals.  This commitment to personalized service is crucial in a region where access to specialized fitness programs may be limited.  We aim to bridge this gap by offering a diverse range of options to ensure everyone can find a fitness path that works for them. </p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Real BuildersGym offers a comprehensive suite of fitness services designed to cater to a diverse clientele.  Our core offerings include state-of-the-art weight training equipment, encompassing a wide range of machines and free weights to support a variety of workout styles. We also boast a dedicated cardio zone featuring treadmills, elliptical trainers, stationary bikes, and rowing machines, all meticulously maintained to ensure optimal performance.  Beyond equipment, we provide a variety of group fitness classes, including Zumba, Yoga, Pilates, and high-intensity interval training (HIIT) sessions, led by certified instructors.  These classes provide a motivating and social environment, perfect for those who prefer group workouts.  Our personal training services are designed to provide individualized guidance and support, tailored to specific fitness goals and experience levels.  This bespoke approach ensures that each member receives the attention and guidance they need to succeed.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>What sets Real BuildersGym apart is our unique emphasis on functional fitness.  Recognizing the importance of everyday movement and strength, we incorporate functional training techniques into our programs.  This focus on practical strength and conditioning ensures that our members not only look good but also feel stronger and more capable in their daily lives. We also place a strong focus on nutrition counseling, recognizing that diet plays a critical role in overall fitness success. This holistic approach to wellness distinguishes us from many competitors who focus solely on physical training.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Real BuildersGym, we believe that a positive and supportive environment is essential to achieving fitness goals. We cultivate a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where members feel comfortable, motivated, and encouraged.  Our friendly and knowledgeable staff is always available to answer questions, offer guidance, and ensure that each member has a positive experience. We go beyond the typical gym experience by organizing regular community events and workshops, fostering a sense of camaraderie and shared purpose among our members. These events might include nutrition workshops, fitness challenges, and social gatherings, strengthening the bonds within our community.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends to our personalized approach to training and guidance.  We believe in building long-term relationships with our members, understanding their individual needs, and adapting our programs to ensure their continued success.  This personalized attention, coupled with our commitment to creating a supportive and encouraging environment, makes Real BuildersGym a true community hub, fostering connections and shared achievements among our members. We actively seek feedback to continuously improve our services and meet the evolving needs of our community. This commitment to local engagement underscores our dedication to being an integral part of the Assam fitness scene.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Real BuildersGym has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  We envision becoming the leading fitness center in the region, known for its exceptional services, supportive community, and unwavering commitment to member success.  Our expansion plans include introducing new fitness classes and programs to cater to an even wider range of interests and fitness levels.  We are also exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations to further strengthen our ties within the community and expand our reach. </p><br><br>\n\n<p>Investing in advanced technology and equipment is also a key part of our future vision. We aim to incorporate innovative fitness technologies to enhance the member experience and provide access to cutting-edge training methodologies.  Furthermore, we plan to expand our facilities, potentially creating a larger space to accommodate our growing membership and offer additional amenities. Our long-term goal is to build a sustainable and thriving fitness community that promotes health, wellness, and personal growth for all members.  Real BuildersGym is committed to being a positive force within the Assam community, contributing to the overall well-being and prosperity of our region.</p><br><br>', '4RF4+FCV, Jayanagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-11 18:45:12', 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL);
