(337, 'Urban Dharma', 'Yoga studio', '', '<p><strong>Urban Dharma: Cultivating Wellness and Community in Assam</strong></p><p>Urban Dharma, strategically located at House No 7, Damoderdev Path, Mother Teresa Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a burgeoning wellness and community hub dedicated to fostering holistic well-being in the rapidly evolving landscape of the region. We are more than just a business; we are a commitment to nurturing the physical, mental, and spiritual health of individuals and families within Assam, deeply rooted in the values of balance, mindfulness, and sustainable living. In a city increasingly focused on modernization and convenience, Urban Dharma offers a refreshing alternative – a space for rejuvenation, connection, and personal growth, contributing to a healthier and more harmonious Assam.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Our core mission is to provide accessible and enriching services that cater to the unique needs of the Assamese community. We understand the cultural significance of physical and mental well-being – a tradition ingrained in the region’s philosophy – and strive to seamlessly integrate modern wellness practices with this historical foundation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Core Services and Products</strong></p><p>Urban Dharma operates across several key service lines, each designed to address distinct aspects of well-being:</p><ul><li><strong>Mindfulness &amp; Meditation Programs:</strong> We offer a comprehensive range of mindfulness and meditation practices, tailored for different experience levels – from beginner workshops to advanced retreats. These programs incorporate techniques rooted in Buddhist philosophy, adapted for the contemporary Assamese lifestyle. Our instructors are highly qualified and experienced, bringing a nuanced understanding of the region\'s cultural context to their teachings. We emphasize practical applications of mindfulness in everyday life, addressing stress, anxiety, and promoting emotional resilience. Workshops will focus on Assam-specific lifestyle challenges such as balancing work and personal life, and managing the pressures of urban living.</li><li><strong>Yoga &amp; Holistic Fitness:</strong> Our yoga classes cater to all fitness levels, offering Hatha, Vinyasa, and Restorative Yoga styles. We prioritize creating a welcoming and inclusive environment, focusing on modifications to suit individual needs. Beyond Yoga, we offer specialized fitness sessions focusing on strength training, flexibility, and core strengthening, designed to enhance overall physical health. We partner with local physiotherapists to offer introductory sessions on injury prevention and proper form. We offer classes both in-studio and through online platforms, expanding our reach within the Assamese community.</li><li><strong>Wellness Workshops &amp; Seminars:</strong> We host regular workshops and seminars on a variety of topics relevant to health and well-being, including nutrition, stress management, sleep hygiene, and mindful parenting. These sessions are led by experts in their respective fields and are designed to empower individuals with practical tools and knowledge to improve their quality of life. We actively seek out local experts and collaborate with community organizations to deliver programming that aligns with relevant health initiatives.</li><li><strong>Ayurvedic Consultations &amp; Recommendations:</strong> We partner with qualified Ayurvedic practitioners to offer personalized consultations and recommendations for incorporating Ayurvedic principles into daily routines. This includes dietary guidance, lifestyle adjustments, and herbal remedies, based on individual body types and needs. We emphasize preventative healthcare and holistic approaches to health management, incorporating the wisdom of ancient Indian traditions.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Unique Selling Points</strong></p><p>Urban Dharma differentiates itself through a unique blend of traditional Ayurvedic practices, contemporary mindfulness techniques, and a deep commitment to community engagement. Our personalized approach ensures that each client receives tailored support to meet their specific needs. We also offer a unique \"wellness packages\" that combine multiple services, providing comprehensive and cost-effective solutions. Furthermore, our emphasis on sustainable practices, including locally sourced herbal ingredients for our workshops and mindful consumption habits, resonates with the growing environmental consciousness within Assam. We actively cultivate a supportive and encouraging environment, promoting holistic well-being that extends beyond physical health.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Meeting Local Market Needs</strong></p><p>The demand for wellness services in Assam is steadily increasing, driven by a growing awareness of the importance of health and well-being. Many individuals in the region face significant challenges related to stress, mental health, and lifestyle. Urban Dharma directly addresses these needs by providing accessible and affordable services that are culturally sensitive and relevant. We fill a gap in the market by offering a holistic approach to well-being that integrates traditional wisdom with modern practices, catering to the unique cultural and lifestyle context of Assam. Our workshops are designed to be accessible to all socioeconomic backgrounds, making wellness more attainable for the community.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Customer Experience</strong></p><p>At Urban Dharma, we prioritize creating a positive and supportive customer experience. We focus on building genuine connections with our clients, fostering a sense of trust and understanding. Our instructors are not only knowledgeable but also empathetic and approachable, taking the time to listen to individual needs and provide personalized guidance. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, making everyone feel comfortable and valued.</p><p>We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with schools, community centers, and local organizations, offering free introductory sessions and workshops. We host community events, such as yoga festivals and wellness fairs, further strengthening our connection to the region. We are committed to being a resource for the community, promoting health and well-being through education and outreach.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Future Vision</strong></p><p>Urban Dharma envisions expanding its reach and impact within the Assam community. Our future plans include:</p><ul><li><strong>Developing specialized programs</strong> addressing specific health challenges prevalent in the region, such as stress related to corporate life or the impact of changing environmental conditions.</li><li><strong>Expanding our online platform</strong> to offer virtual classes and consultations, reaching a wider audience across Assam.</li><li><strong>Establishing partnerships with local healthcare providers</strong> to offer integrated wellness services.</li><li><strong>Creating a dedicated space for community healing and support</strong> – possibly incorporating a small cafe offering healthy, locally sourced food options.</li><li><strong>Investing in research and development</strong> exploring the integration of traditional Assamese medicinal practices with modern wellness techniques.</li></ul><p>Our long-term goal is to become a leading wellness hub in Assam, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. We aim to be synonymous with holistic well-being and community support, contributing to the overall prosperity and well-being of the region.</p>', 'House No 7, Damoderdev Path, Mother Teresa Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8812845558', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, NULL, 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(338, 'Purbanchal Rising Steps Academy', 'Yoga studio', '', '<p><strong>Purbanchal Rising Steps Academy: Empowering Entrepreneurs and Professionals in Northeast Assam</strong></p><p>Purbanchal Rising Steps Academy, strategically located at House No. 40, Purbanchal Path, is a dynamic and locally-focused business dedicated to fostering economic growth and professional development within the Purbanchal region of Assam. Founded with a deep understanding of the unique challenges and opportunities present in the Northeast, our academy strives to be more than just an educational institution; we aim to be a catalyst for entrepreneurial success and a cornerstone of the community\'s advancement. We address a critical need for skill-based training and practical business acumen tailored to the specific requirements of the region’s evolving economic landscape.</p><p>The Purbanchal region is characterized by a vibrant entrepreneurial spirit, yet often lacks readily accessible, high-quality training programs designed to equip individuals with the contemporary skills demanded by the modern marketplace. Many aspiring business owners and professionals face hurdles related to finance, marketing, operations, and leadership. Purbanchal Rising Steps Academy directly addresses these needs through a comprehensive suite of services designed to bridge the skills gap and unlock untapped potential within the community. Our core offerings revolve around tailored training programs in key business areas, coupled with personalized mentorship and practical workshops.</p><p><strong>Core Services &amp; Products: A Holistic Approach to Professional Growth</strong></p><p>Our primary services are segmented into three key pillars: <strong>Entrepreneurship Development, Professional Skill Enhancement, and Digital Marketing Mastery</strong>. <strong>Entrepreneurship Development</strong> focuses on nurturing innovative ideas and providing the foundational knowledge for starting and scaling businesses. This includes courses on business planning, financial management, market analysis, legal frameworks, and securing funding – concepts frequently challenging for aspiring entrepreneurs in the region. Unique to our approach is a strong emphasis on practical application through case studies featuring successful local businesses, facilitating a realistic understanding of the challenges and rewards of entrepreneurship. <strong>Professional Skill Enhancement</strong> covers a spectrum of in-demand skills applicable to both established and emerging business sectors. Courses offered include leadership development, project management, communication skills, human resource management, and accounting &amp; finance. We leverage industry-recognized methodologies and incorporate real-world scenarios to ensure relevance and effectiveness. <strong>Digital Marketing Mastery</strong> recognizes the pivotal role of online presence in today\'s business environment. Our digital marketing programs focus on SEO, social media marketing, content marketing, email marketing, and data analytics. A significant differentiator is our focus on culturally relevant digital strategies, acknowledging the importance of local language and community engagement.</p><p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Partnerships, Cultivating Success</strong></p><p>At Purbanchal Rising Steps Academy, we prioritize building enduring relationships with our clients. We understand that success is not solely about imparting knowledge, but about providing ongoing support and fostering a supportive learning environment. Our customer service approach is characterized by personalized attention, responsive communication, and a commitment to achieving individual learning goals. We conduct thorough needs assessments before recommending suitable programs, ensuring that training is aligned with specific career aspirations and business objectives. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local chambers of commerce, industry associations, and educational institutions. This collaborative approach allows us to stay abreast of evolving needs and tailor our services to the unique demands of the Purbanchal business landscape. We also host regular networking events, creating opportunities for participants to connect with peers and potential collaborators.</p><p><strong>Future Vision: A Sustainable Ecosystem of Growth</strong></p><p>Purbanchal Rising Steps Academy is poised for significant growth within the Purbanchal region. We plan to expand our program offerings to include specialized courses in emerging fields such as e-commerce, sustainable business practices, and data science. We are actively exploring the possibility of establishing a fully equipped co-working space to foster collaboration and provide a supportive environment for startups. A key element of our long-term vision is to develop a mentorship program connecting academy graduates with experienced business leaders, ensuring ongoing support and guidance. We envision Purbanchal Rising Steps Academy becoming the premier provider of professional development and entrepreneurial support in the region, contributing significantly to the economic prosperity and social well-being of the Purbanchal community. We are committed to sustainable growth, prioritizing ethical practices and investing in the local talent pool to create a thriving ecosystem of innovation and opportunity.</p><p>By empowering individuals with the skills and knowledge they need to succeed, Purbanchal Rising Steps Academy is actively shaping the future of business in Northeast Assam. We believe that investing in human capital is the most effective way to drive economic development, and we are dedicated to playing a leading role in this crucial endeavor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'House No. 40, Purbanchal Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, NULL, 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(339, 'Amritam yoga center', 'Yoga studio', '', '<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Amritam Yoga Center: Cultivating Wellness in the Heart of Assam</strong></p><p>Amritam Yoga Center, strategically located on Ashram Road in [City, Assam], is more than just a yoga studio; it is a sanctuary dedicated to holistic well-being and community empowerment. Founded on the principles of ancient yogic philosophy and modern wellness practices, Amritam offers a comprehensive range of yoga classes, meditation sessions, and wellness workshops tailored to the unique needs of the Assamese population and the wider region. In a landscape increasingly prioritizing health and mindfulness, Amritam distinguishes itself through its deeply rooted connection to local culture, commitment to accessible pricing, and a focus on individual transformation.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Wellbeing</strong></p><p>At its core, Amritam Yoga Center provides a diverse array of yoga classes designed to cater to all levels of experience, from beginners seeking foundational practice to seasoned practitioners looking to deepen their asana and pranayama skills. Our offerings include Hatha Yoga, Vinyasa Flow, Ashtanga Yoga (with introductory workshops), restorative yoga, and gentle yoga – all adapted to suit the regional climate and physical capabilities. Beyond traditional yoga, we emphasize the integration of mindfulness techniques, including guided meditations, breathwork exercises (pranayama), and relaxation methods, to reduce stress and promote emotional balance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A key differentiator for Amritam is the incorporation of traditional Assamese elements into our wellness programs. We collaborate with local herbalists to offer workshops on Ayurvedic principles and the therapeutic properties of native medicinal plants, connecting participants with the rich cultural heritage of the region. Our workshops also explore the significance of yoga and mindfulness within the context of Assam\'s traditional lifestyle and spiritual beliefs. We offer specialized retreats focusing on detoxifying practices using local ingredients, providing an immersive experience of rejuvenation within an authentic Assamese setting. Furthermore, we provide individual and small group coaching sessions to help clients achieve personalized wellness goals, ensuring tailored attention and guidance.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Customer Experience: Community, Connection, and Compassion</strong></p><p>Amritam Yoga Center prioritizes building a supportive and inclusive community where individuals feel welcomed, respected, and empowered on their wellness journey. Our customer service philosophy centers on personalized attention and genuine care. We believe in fostering a space where participants can connect with themselves, with others, and with the ancient wisdom of yoga.</p><p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools, community centers, and local organizations. Regular workshops are offered to children and senior citizens, promoting physical and mental well-being from an early age. We host community events, such as yoga festivals and meditation gatherings, fostering a sense of togetherness and shared purpose. Our pricing structure is designed to be accessible to a wide range of individuals, with tiered membership options and affordable drop-in classes. We believe that yoga should be available to everyone, regardless of their socioeconomic background. Amritam’s studio maintains a welcoming and comfortable environment with traditional decor reflecting Assamese aesthetics, creating a space conducive to relaxation and mindful practice. Our instructors are highly trained, certified yoga teachers with a deep understanding of both traditional yogic principles and modern wellness practices, and they are dedicated to guiding students with patience and empathy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Future Vision: Expanding Wellness Horizons in Assam</strong></p><p>Amritam Yoga Center’s vision extends beyond providing current services; we aspire to become a leading center for holistic wellness in Assam and the Northeast region. Our strategic plans include expanding our class offerings to include specialized programs such as prenatal and postnatal yoga, and specialized workshops focusing on stress management and emotional resilience. We are exploring partnerships with local healthcare providers to integrate yoga and mindfulness practices into therapeutic interventions, supporting the overall health and well-being of the community.</p><p>Looking ahead, we plan to establish a second studio location in [Another Location in Assam] to further increase accessibility to our services. Furthermore, we are committed to developing online resources and online classes to reach a wider audience and offer flexibility to individuals across state borders. Amritam Yoga Center is dedicated to sustainable practices, including eco-friendly cleaning supplies and minimizing environmental impact. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to empower individuals to cultivate a deeper connection with themselves and their surroundings, fostering a culture of well-being and resilience within the community. We aim to be recognized not just for our yoga classes, but for our positive impact on the health, happiness, and overall quality of life for those we serve.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Ashram Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, NULL, 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(340, 'Axom Yoga Academy', 'Yoga studio', '', '<p><strong>Axom Yoga Academy: Cultivating Wellness in the Heart of Assam</strong></p><p>Axom Yoga Academy is a comprehensive wellness center strategically located within the vibrant BAR &amp; RESTAURANTS complex on Fatashil, AK Development Road, Guwahati, Assam. We are dedicated to fostering physical, mental, and spiritual well-being through a holistic approach to yoga and mindful living. Emerging as a key player in the evolving wellness sector of Assam, Axom Yoga Academy aims to bridge the gap between traditional yogic practices and modern lifestyles, catering specifically to the needs and sensitivities of the local population. We recognize a growing demand for accessible, quality yoga instruction and holistic health services, and we are committed to fulfilling this need with expertise and genuine care.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Path to Wellness</strong></p><p>Our core offerings center around providing diverse yoga styles and related wellness services, tailored for all levels, from beginners to experienced practitioners. We provide a range of classes, including Hatha Yoga, Vinyasa Flow, Ashtanga Yoga, Restorative Yoga, and Yin Yoga. These classes are not merely physical exercises; they are designed to cultivate inner peace, improve flexibility, strength, and balance, and promote overall physical health. A key differentiator is our emphasis on incorporating pranayama (breathwork) and meditation techniques within each practice, recognizing the inseparable link between breath and consciousness. We also prioritize alignment cues and modifications to ensure inclusivity and accessibility for individuals with varying physical capabilities.</p><p>Beyond yoga classes, Axom Yoga Academy offers a curated selection of complementary services designed to enhance overall well-being. These include individual yoga consultations with certified instructors, personalized yoga plan development, and guided meditation sessions. We are actively exploring partnerships with local Ayurvedic practitioners to offer preliminary Ayurvedic consultations and wellness workshops, further enriching our offerings and connecting with the growing interest in traditional healing modalities. Furthermore, our space is thoughtfully designed to promote a calming and conducive environment, featuring natural light, calming colour palettes and comfortable props to maximize the benefits of each session. This focus on ambiance contributes to a transformative experience that extends beyond the physical practice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Community and Cultivating Connection</strong></p><p>At Axom Yoga Academy, customer experience is paramount. We prioritize creating a welcoming and supportive community where individuals feel comfortable exploring their practice without judgment. Our instructors are not just yoga teachers; they are empathetic guides committed to fostering a safe and inclusive environment for personal growth. We focus on building personal connections with our students, understanding their individual goals and tailoring classes and consultations accordingly. We actively encourage participation in workshops and community events, facilitating social interaction and a sense of belonging. <strong>A unique selling point</strong> is our commitment to offering diverse class schedules to accommodate busy lifestyles, including early morning and evening sessions, as well as weekend workshops. We also strive to be actively involved in local community initiatives, collaborating with local organizations to promote yoga and wellness in schools and workplaces.</p><p>We understand the cultural context of Assam and are mindful of incorporating local traditions and philosophies into our teachings. Our instructors are trained to respect and adapt to diverse cultural backgrounds, ensuring that all students feel welcomed and valued. Regular feedback mechanisms are in place to continually improve our services and address customer needs proactively. We are dedicated to building enduring relationships with our students, fostering a sustainable and supportive community around shared wellness goals.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Empowering Wellbeing</strong></p><p>Axom Yoga Academy envisions becoming the premier yoga and wellness destination in Assam, recognized for its quality instruction, community focus, and commitment to holistic well-being. Our future plans include expanding our class offerings to incorporate specialized workshops in areas such as detoxifying yoga, prenatal yoga, and yoga for specific physical conditions. We plan to invest in advanced equipment and technology to enhance the learning experience. Furthermore, we are actively exploring the possibility of offering online yoga classes to reach a wider audience across Assam and beyond. We are also committed to creating a sustainable and ethical business model, partnering with local suppliers and promoting environmentally conscious practices. <strong>Our long-term goal</strong> is to empower individuals to prioritize their health and well-being, fostering a culture of wellness within the community. We aim to positively impact the lives of those we serve by providing them with the tools and knowledge necessary to cultivate a balanced and fulfilling life. This includes exploration into offering corporate wellness programs to local businesses and institutions, further contributing to employee well-being and productivity. We believe that by continuously evolving and adapting to meet the changing needs of our community, Axom Yoga Academy will continue to thrive as a vital resource for health and happiness in Assam.</p>', 'BAR & RESTAURANTS, Fatashil, AK Dev Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8822957836', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, NULL, 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(341, 'SAI YOGA AND ACCESS BARS THERAPY CENTRE', 'Yoga studio', '', '<p><strong>SAI YOGA AND ACCESS BARS THERAPY CENTRE</strong> is a holistic wellness sanctuary situated at 4th, 4th Battalion Gate Ln, catering to the evolving health and well-being needs of the Assam region. Established to provide accessible and effective alternative therapies, SAI Yoga &amp; Access Bars Therapy Centre offers a unique blend of ancient yogic practices and cutting-edge bodywork, prioritizing individual needs and fostering a deeper connection to oneself. The Centre represents a significant addition to the local wellness landscape, addressing a growing demand for stress reduction, emotional balance, and overall physical and mental rejuvenation within the community.</p><p>Our core services revolve around two complementary modalities: Yoga and Access Bars Therapy. We offer a variety of yoga classes tailored to different proficiency levels, from beginner to advanced practitioners. These classes incorporate Hatha, Vinyasa, and restorative styles, emphasizing mindful movement, breathwork, and meditative practices. The curriculum is designed to improve flexibility, strength, balance, and mental clarity, catering to individuals seeking physical fitness, stress management, and enhanced mindfulness. Beyond structured classes, we provide private yoga sessions for personalized guidance and therapeutic applications, accommodating specific physical limitations and health concerns. We strongly emphasize the benefits of yoga for promoting emotional well-being, helping practitioners navigate anxieties, improve sleep quality, and cultivate a sense of inner peace – essential aspects of the Assam lifestyle, particularly given the often demanding pace of modern life.</p><p>Complementing our yoga offerings is Access Bars Therapy, a uniquely innovative technique developed by Dr. Gary Stuart. This non-invasive modality involves gently running a set of 32 “bars” along the surface of the head. These bars are mapped to various aspects of life – thoughts, emotions, beliefs, and limiting patterns. During an Access Bars session, unconscious neural pathways are gently influenced, allowing for smoother processing of these patterns. This leads to emotional release, reduced stress, increased creativity, and enhanced overall well-being. What distinguishes SAI Yoga &amp; Access Bars Therapy Centre is our commitment to providing highly skilled and certified Access Bars practitioners within the region. We prioritize individualized sessions, tailoring the experience to each client’s unique needs and challenges. Unlike more conventional therapies, Access Bars offers a gentle and deeply relaxing experience, making it particularly appealing to those seeking stress relief without strenuous physical exertion. It’s a powerful tool for addressing emotional blocks and fostering a sense of lightness and freedom – a welcome addition to the traditional wellness practices offered in Assam.</p><p>Our customer experience is built upon a foundation of empathy, professionalism, and personalized attention. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable exploring their well-being. We believe in building genuine relationships with our clients, taking the time to listen to their needs and goals. The Centre utilizes a booking system that prioritizes ease of access and flexibility, with options for online scheduling and convenient appointment reminders. Our practitioners are diligently trained to explain the benefits of each modality and to adapt the sessions to individual requirements. We actively engage with the local community through workshops and informational sessions on topics related to stress management, mindfulness, and holistic health, further fostering awareness and promoting wellness within Assam. We regularly partner with local wellness organizations and community groups to offer introductory sessions and promote our services, solidifying our role as a valuable resource for health and well-being.</p><p>Looking ahead, SAI Yoga &amp; Access Bars Therapy Centre envisions sustained growth and expansion within the Assam market. We plan to introduce specialized yoga workshops focusing on topics such as prenatal yoga, yoga for seniors, and yoga for specific emotional challenges. We are also exploring the possibility of expanding our service offerings to include complementary modalities such as aromatherapy and guided meditation. A key long-term goal is to establish ourselves as a leading provider of comprehensive wellness solutions in the region, recognized for our high-quality services and commitment to client success. Our business model emphasizes sustainable practices, including mindful waste reduction and energy-efficient operations. We are investing in professional development for our practitioners to ensure they remain at the forefront of their respective fields. Furthermore, we are actively seeking opportunities to expand our outreach to underserved communities, bringing the benefits of yoga and Access Bars Therapy to those who may not have access to traditional wellness resources. We are confident that with continued dedication to quality and community engagement, SAI Yoga &amp; Access Bars Therapy Centre will continue to thrive and contribute to the overall health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p><p>Our success is intrinsically linked to the increasing awareness of the importance of holistic well-being in the modern era, and our commitment to delivering accessible, effective, and personalized therapeutic solutions perfectly aligns with this evolving need. SAI Yoga &amp; Access Bars Therapy Centre isn’t just a place to receive therapy; it\'s a gateway to a healthier, more balanced, and more fulfilling life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', '4th, 4th Battalion Gate Ln', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, NULL, 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(342, 'Soul Beats Dance Studio', 'Yoga studio', '', '<h2>Soul Beats Dance Studio: Igniting Passion, Building Community</h2><p>Located on RG Baruah Road, Soul Beats Dance Studio is a dynamic and vibrant dance center dedicated to fostering artistic expression and physical well-being within the heart of Assam. We are more than just a dance studio; we are a community hub, a place where individuals of all ages and skill levels can discover their potential, build confidence, and connect with others through the universal language of movement. In a region increasingly valuing holistic development and cultural enrichment, Soul Beats aims to be a leading provider of accessible and engaging dance education, contributing significantly to the local arts scene.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>Core Services and Products: A Diverse Tapestry of Dance</h3><p>Soul Beats offers a comprehensive range of dance programs designed to cater to diverse interests and fitness levels. Our primary offerings include:</p><ul><li><strong>Classical Assamese Dance Forms:</strong> We take pride in preserving and promoting the rich heritage of Assamese classical dance. Our instructors are deeply rooted in these traditions, providing students with a foundational understanding of the intricate footwork, graceful gestures, and expressive storytelling inherent in forms like *Tampha* and *Bihu*. We focus on both performance and understanding the cultural significance of these dances, ensuring a meaningful connection to Assamese identity.</li><li><strong>Contemporary Dance &amp; Jazz: </strong>Our contemporary dance classes explore a wide range of modern styles, emphasizing improvisation, emotional expression, and individual interpretation. Jazz classes provide a foundation in rhythm, technique, and performance, fostering creativity and self-assurance on stage. We actively incorporate elements of both Indian and Western dance techniques, creating a unique and compelling learning environment.</li></ul><p>What sets Soul Beats apart is our unwavering commitment to student-centric learning. Our instructors are not only skilled dancers but also passionate educators who prioritize personalized attention and individualized feedback. We offer small class sizes to ensure that each student receives the guidance they need to reach their full potential. Furthermore, we regularly organize workshops and master classes led by renowned dancers, providing opportunities for students to learn from the best and expand their skills. We are dedicated to sourcing high-quality dancewear and accessories, ensuring a comfortable and professional learning experience for all our students. Our focus on building a strong community is reflected in our regular social events and performances, fostering a supportive and encouraging atmosphere.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>Customer Experience: More Than Just a Dance Lesson</h3><p>At Soul Beats, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every student feels comfortable, respected, and empowered. Our approach to customer service is built on the following principles:</p><ul><li>Personalized Attention: We take the time to understand each student’s goals, interests, and learning style, tailoring our instruction accordingly.</li><li>Community Building: We actively foster a sense of community among our students, organizing social events and performances that allow them to connect with one another and celebrate their shared passion for dance.</li><li>Positive Reinforcement: We emphasize positive reinforcement and celebrate student achievements, regardless of skill level. We believe in building confidence and fostering a growth mindset.</li><li>Responsive Communication: We maintain open lines of communication with our students and parents, providing regular updates on progress and addressing any concerns promptly.</li><li>Accessibility &amp; Flexibility: We are committed to providing convenient class times and flexible scheduling to accommodate the needs of our diverse student population.</li></ul><p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools, cultural organizations, and local events. We offer dance workshops for children and adults, and we often participate in community festivals and celebrations. This allows us to share our passion for dance and contribute to the cultural vibrancy of Assam.</p><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3>Future Vision: Growing the Art of Movement</h3><p>Soul Beats Dance Studio has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. Our long-term vision includes:</p><ul><li>Expanding Class Offerings: We plan to introduce new dance styles, such as hip-hop and contemporary fusion, to cater to a wider range of interests. We\'re also exploring specialized classes for specific age groups, like pre-school dance programs.</li><li>Developing Performance Opportunities: We aim to increase the number of performances we organize, providing our students with opportunities to showcase their talents and gain valuable performance experience. This includes organizing showcases throughout the year and potentially hosting larger-scale productions.</li><li>Community Outreach Programs: We intend to expand our community outreach initiatives, offering free dance workshops for underprivileged children and collaborating with local schools to promote dance education.</li><li>Professional Development for Instructors: We are committed to providing ongoing professional development opportunities for our instructors, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of dance education.</li></ul><p>Soul Beats Dance Studio is poised to become an integral part of the Assamese cultural landscape, nurturing talent, fostering community, and enriching lives through the power of dance. We are dedicated to creating a sustainable and thriving dance center that will continue to inspire and empower generations to come.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, NULL, 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(343, 'Niramaya Yoga Centre', 'Yoga studio', '', '```html\r\n<p><strong>Niramaya Yoga Centre: Cultivating Wellness in the Heart of Guwahati</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Niramaya Yoga Centre is an innovative wellness hub strategically located within the vibrant Eurokids Preschool, Bye Lane Number 7, Guwahati. Founded with a deep commitment to holistic well-being and mindful living, Niramaya aims to provide accessible and transformative yoga and meditation practices for individuals of all ages and backgrounds within the local Assam community. We differentiate ourselves by seamlessly integrating yoga instruction with a child-friendly environment, creating a unique space that nurtures both physical and mental health from a young age while catering to the needs of adults seeking rejuvenation and stress reduction. This positioning allows us to tap into a growing demand for accessible, quality wellness options within the city\'s residential areas.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our core services center around a comprehensive range of yoga styles, tailored to suit diverse physical abilities and experience levels. We offer Hatha Yoga, focusing on foundational postures and breathwork, perfect for beginners. For those seeking a more dynamic practice, our Vinyasa flow classes build strength, flexibility, and cardiovascular health.  We also provide Restorative Yoga, emphasizing relaxation and stress relief through supported poses.  Furthermore, we host specialized workshops focused on mindful eating, stress management, and meditation techniques, designed to enhance overall well-being.  Our offerings are complemented by private yoga sessions, personalized to individual needs and goals, providing one-on-one guidance and tailored programs.  We provide both in-person classes and convenient online sessions, catering to the evolving needs of our clientele.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A key differentiator for Niramaya Yoga Centre is its dedication to fostering a supportive and inclusive community.  We recognize the importance of creating a welcoming environment for individuals of all ages, abilities, and spiritual backgrounds.  Our instruction emphasizes modifications and alignment principles, ensuring that every participant can safely and effectively engage with the practice.  We actively promote intergenerational connection through group classes and workshops, encouraging participants to connect with each other and share experiences.  Moreover, our child-friendly setting, facilitated by the partnership with Eurokids Preschool, allows us to offer specialized yoga sessions for children, nurturing their physical, emotional, and cognitive development through playful and engaging activities. This integration extends beyond mere co-location; we actively collaborate with the preschool to promote healthy lifestyle habits within the community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The market need in Assam for accessible, high-quality yoga and wellness programs is significant.  Increased awareness of the benefits of yoga and meditation, coupled with rising stress levels in urban areas, has created a burgeoning demand for these practices.  Existing yoga studios often cater primarily to a specific demographic and can be costly to access. Niramaya addresses this gap by providing affordable, accessible classes and workshops in a convenient location.  Our emphasis on community building and personalized instruction ensures a more supportive and effective learning experience compared to large, impersonal studios. We specifically target working professionals, families, and individuals seeking a holistic approach to well-being, providing a readily available resource aligned with lifestyle needs and budgetary constraints common in contemporary Assam.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking towards the future, Niramaya Yoga Centre has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  Our immediate focus is on expanding our class offerings to incorporate specialized workshops on Ayurvedic principles and nutritional guidance.  We envision establishing a community wellness program, partnering with local healthcare providers and organizations to offer holistic health screenings and wellness consultations.  Furthermore, we plan to develop a comprehensive online platform, offering live streaming classes and on-demand content to reach a wider audience beyond the immediate vicinity. Long-term, our goal is to become a recognized leader in the wellness sector in Assam, fostering a thriving community dedicated to health, balance, and mindful living. We aim to establish Niramaya Yoga Centre as more than just a yoga studio – we aspire to be a cornerstone of well-being for the people of Guwahati, contributing to a healthier and happier community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond providing excellent instruction; we strive to cultivate a sustainable business model that benefits the local community. We actively source eco-friendly materials for our workshops and promote environmentally conscious practices among our participants.  We also plan to offer scholarships and subsidized classes to individuals from underserved communities, ensuring that the benefits of yoga are accessible to all.  By prioritizing social responsibility and community engagement, Niramaya Yoga Centre aims to create a positive impact on the lives of individuals and contribute to the overall wellness of the Guwahati region.  We believe that yoga is not just a physical practice; it’s a path to a more fulfilling life, and Niramaya is dedicated to making that path accessible and enriching for everyone.</p>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n```', 'Eurokids Preschool, Bye Lane Number 7', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, NULL, 'Active', '2025-08-11 15:22:22', NULL),
(345, 'WeBotApp Academy', 'Technical Training Institutes', '', '<p>```html</p><p><strong>WeBotApp Academy: Empowering Assam\'s Businesses with AI-Driven Solutions</strong></p><p>WeBotApp Academy is a dynamic and innovative educational institution dedicated to bridging the skills gap in Artificial Intelligence (AI) and automation within the burgeoning business ecosystem of Assam. Based at First Floor, House No: 96, Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path, near India Web Designs, Sarumotoria, Guwahati, Assam 781005, we are strategically positioned to serve the rapidly evolving needs of local enterprises and individuals eager to embrace the transformative power of intelligent technologies. Recognizing the potential of AI to revolutionize industries from e-commerce and logistics to healthcare and education in Northeast India, WeBotApp Academy provides comprehensive training and development programs designed to equip participants with the knowledge and practical skills necessary to succeed in the AI-driven future.</p><p>Our core mission is to democratize access to AI education, ensuring that businesses and individuals across Assam have the opportunity to leverage these powerful tools. We understand that many businesses in the region are currently under-resourced and lack the internal expertise to effectively implement AI solutions. WeBotApp Academy addresses this challenge by offering tailored programs that are both accessible and relevant to the specific needs of the local market. This includes modules focusing on practical AI applications, data analytics, machine learning, and the ethical considerations surrounding AI deployment. We strive to foster a collaborative learning environment that promotes knowledge sharing and practical skill development.</p><p><strong>Core Services and Products: A Tailored Approach to AI Education</strong></p><p>WeBotApp Academy offers a range of expertly curated courses designed to cater to diverse skill levels and professional backgrounds. Our primary offerings include:</p><ul><li><strong>AI Fundamentals &amp; Machine Learning: </strong>This foundational course provides an introduction to the core concepts of AI and machine learning, covering topics such as algorithms, models, and applications. It\'s designed for beginners with no prior programming or AI experience.</li></ul><p><strong>Unique Selling Points: Practicality &amp; Accessibility</strong></p><p>WeBotApp Academy differentiates itself through a strong emphasis on practical application and accessibility. Our courses are delivered through a blended learning approach, combining online modules with hands-on workshops and real-world case studies. This ensures that participants gain not just theoretical knowledge, but also the skills to immediately apply what they learn. We also prioritize accessibility by offering flexible scheduling options and affordable pricing structures, making AI education attainable for individuals and businesses of all sizes. Furthermore, our instructors are experienced professionals with expertise in various AI domains and a deep understanding of the local business landscape.</p><p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Community and Fostering Collaboration</strong></p><p>At WeBotApp Academy, we believe that exceptional customer service begins with building strong relationships. We pride ourselves on providing a supportive and encouraging learning environment. WeGo beyond simply delivering courses; we foster a community of learners by organizing networking events, workshops, and mentorship programs. Our commitment extends to providing individualized support to each participant, addressing their specific learning needs and career aspirations. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local business associations and educational institutions, offering workshops and seminars to raise awareness about the benefits of AI and to promote the Academy\'s offerings. We believe in creating a catalyst for AI adoption within Assam.</p><p><strong>Future Vision: Driving AI Adoption in Assam</strong></p><p>WeBotApp Academy envisions becoming the leading provider of AI and automation education in Assam and Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our course offerings to cover emerging AI technologies, such as deep learning and computer vision. We are actively exploring partnerships with industry leaders and technology companies to offer internships and job placement opportunities for our graduates. We also aim to establish a certification program accredited by leading AI organizations, further enhancing the credibility of our training. Our long-term goal is to empower Assam\'s businesses to become more competitive and innovative by harnessing the power of AI, creating skilled workforce and fostering economic growth.</p><p>WeBotApp Academy is more than just an educational institution; we are a partner in Assam\'s digital transformation. We are dedicated to providing the knowledge, skills, and support needed to empower businesses, individuals, and communities to thrive in the age of AI.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'First Floor, House No: 96, Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path, near India Web Designs, Sarumotoria, Guwahati, Assam 781005', 'Kamrup Metro', NULL, '7002484119', 'paban@indiawebdesigns.in', 'https://academy.webotapp.com/', NULL, NULL, '10 AM - 6 PM', NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 'Active', '2025-08-11 16:05:11', NULL);
