(382, 'The Bijit Unisex Salon & Make-up Studio (Aesthetic beauty salon for hair & skin)', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>The Bijit Unisex Salon & Make-up Studio: Aesthetic Beauty Redefined in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, The Bijit Unisex Salon & Make-up Studio stands as a premier destination for aesthetic beauty services.  We are more than just a salon; we are a sanctuary of self-care, offering a comprehensive range of hair and skin treatments tailored to meet the unique needs of the Assamese community and beyond. Our commitment to excellence, coupled with our understanding of local preferences, has solidified our position as a leading provider of high-quality beauty services in the region. We strive to create an experience that goes beyond mere beautification; we aim to empower our clients to embrace their natural beauty and enhance their self-confidence.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our philosophy is rooted in a deep respect for tradition and a keen eye towards modern trends. We recognize the rich cultural heritage of Assam and integrate elements of this heritage into our services, while also embracing cutting-edge techniques and products to deliver unparalleled results. This unique blend allows us to offer services that are both authentically Assamese and globally relevant.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At The Bijit Unisex Salon & Make-up Studio, we provide a diverse array of services encompassing hair care, skincare, and make-up artistry. Our hair services include a wide selection of haircuts, styling, coloring, treatments (such as hair spa and keratin treatments), and extensions, tailored to individual hair types and textures.  We utilize high-quality, internationally recognized hair products that are gentle yet effective, minimizing damage while maximizing results.  Our expertise extends to traditional Assamese hairstyles, allowing clients to explore their cultural heritage in a modern context.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our skincare services range from basic facials to advanced treatments targeting specific skin concerns. We offer customized facials that address issues like acne, pigmentation, and aging, employing techniques that are both effective and soothing. Our skilled estheticians are trained to identify and treat various skin conditions, providing personalized recommendations to maintain healthy and radiant skin. We prioritize the use of natural and organic products, wherever possible, reflecting our commitment to sustainability and the well-being of our clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our make-up studio specializes in bridal make-up, party make-up, and everyday looks. Our make-up artists are adept at creating flawless looks that enhance natural features, catering to individual preferences and occasions.  We also offer make-up workshops and consultations, empowering clients to master the art of make-up application themselves.  We stay updated with the latest trends in make-up artistry, ensuring our services are contemporary and stylish.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets us apart is our dedication to personalization.  We believe that each client is unique, and we tailor our services accordingly, ensuring that every individual feels heard, understood, and valued.  This personalized approach, combined with our commitment to using high-quality products and employing skilled professionals, provides an exceptional level of service that is unmatched in the Guwahati area.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At The Bijit Unisex Salon & Make-up Studio, customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere where our clients feel comfortable and pampered. Our salon is designed to provide a tranquil escape from the hustle and bustle of city life, allowing our clients to unwind and enjoy a truly rejuvenating experience.  Our team is highly trained in customer service, ensuring prompt, professional, and friendly service to each and every client.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We build strong relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of community and loyalty. We actively engage with our clientele through social media, providing updates, promotions, and valuable beauty tips. We value feedback and consistently strive to improve our services based on client input. This commitment to community engagement reflects our belief in building lasting relationships with our valued clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>The Bijit Unisex Salon & Make-up Studio has ambitious plans for future growth. We aim to expand our service offerings, introducing new and innovative treatments in line with evolving beauty trends. We also plan to further develop our training programs for our staff, ensuring our team remains at the forefront of industry best practices. We are committed to investing in the latest technology and equipment to enhance the efficiency and quality of our services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term vision is to establish The Bijit Unisex Salon & Make-up Studio as the leading beauty destination not just in Guwahati, but across Assam.  We are exploring opportunities to expand our presence by opening additional salons across the state, bringing our exceptional services to a wider audience.  We also plan to develop our own line of beauty products, incorporating traditional Assamese ingredients with modern formulations, showcasing the best of both worlds.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, our goal is to continue building on our success by providing exceptional services, fostering strong community ties, and empowering individuals to embrace their unique beauty.  The Bijit Unisex Salon & Make-up Studio is committed to being more than just a beauty salon; we are a place where beauty meets self-discovery and confidence blossoms.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7099036709', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:25:42', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(383, 'Chi Glam Studio', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Chi Glam Studio: Elevating Beauty in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Chi Glam Studio is a premier beauty and wellness destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  We are committed to providing exceptional services and a luxurious experience that caters to the diverse beauty needs of the Assamese community.  Our unique approach blends traditional techniques with modern innovations, creating a space where clients feel pampered, rejuvenated, and empowered. We recognize the growing demand for high-quality beauty services in Guwahati and aim to set a new standard of excellence, reflecting the vibrant and sophisticated culture of the region.  We are more than just a salon; we are a sanctuary where beauty meets wellbeing. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Chi Glam Studio offers a comprehensive range of beauty and wellness services, carefully curated to meet the specific needs and preferences of our clientele. Our services encompass a variety of hair care treatments, including advanced hair styling, coloring (incorporating both classic and contemporary techniques), and restorative treatments designed to address specific hair concerns, such as damage repair and scalp health.  Our skilled stylists are proficient in the latest trends and techniques, ensuring clients receive the most up-to-date and personalized looks. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Beyond hair care, we offer a full spectrum of makeup services, from everyday enhancements to sophisticated bridal and special occasion makeup.  Our makeup artists are adept at working with a variety of skin tones and types, emphasizing natural beauty while enhancing individual features. We use high-quality, reputable cosmetics ensuring a flawless and long-lasting finish.  We also provide a curated selection of skincare treatments, including facials customized to individual skin types and concerns, and advanced skin rejuvenation therapies to promote a youthful and radiant complexion.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Chi Glam Studio is our commitment to using high-quality, ethically-sourced products. We partner with both international and local brands, ensuring our clients benefit from both innovative formulations and locally-sourced, natural ingredients that are well-suited to the Assam climate and skin types. We believe in transparency and strive to inform clients about the ingredients used in our products and treatments.  This commitment ensures not only exceptional results but also promotes responsible and sustainable beauty practices. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Chi Glam Studio, we place the client experience at the heart of everything we do.  We strive to create a tranquil and welcoming environment where our clients feel comfortable and relaxed. Our team of highly trained and experienced professionals are dedicated to providing personalized attention, ensuring each client receives tailored care and expert advice.  We encourage open communication and actively listen to our clients\' needs and preferences, tailoring our services to meet their individual goals. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty.  We believe in exceeding expectations and consistently delivering exceptional results. Our commitment to providing a truly memorable experience extends beyond the services themselves. We offer a range of amenities designed to enhance client comfort and relaxation, further solidifying our commitment to exceeding industry standards. We actively engage with the local community, participating in charitable events and collaborating with local businesses to support the growth and prosperity of Guwahati. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We are also committed to continuous improvement. We regularly update our skill sets through ongoing training and education, embracing new techniques and technologies to offer clients the most advanced beauty services available.  We actively solicit feedback from our clients to ensure we are constantly evolving and adapting to meet their evolving needs.  This feedback loop is crucial to ensuring we maintain our high standards and remain a leading beauty destination in Guwahati. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Chi Glam Studio has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  Our long-term vision is to become the leading beauty and wellness destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional services, personalized attention, and commitment to client satisfaction. We aim to continually expand our service offerings, introducing innovative treatments and technologies as they become available. This will involve investing in advanced equipment and training our staff in the latest techniques to keep our services at the cutting edge. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We plan to expand our physical space to accommodate the growing demand for our services, creating a larger and more luxurious facility that offers an even more comprehensive range of treatments. We also envision expanding our product line, potentially developing our own line of skincare products inspired by the natural ingredients of Assam.  Our commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing will remain central to this expansion. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We are also exploring opportunities for strategic partnerships with other businesses in the beauty and wellness industry, as well as community organizations. This collaboration will not only enhance our brand but also strengthen our ties with the local community, further establishing Chi Glam Studio as an integral part of the vibrant cultural landscape of Guwahati. Our ultimate goal is to be a brand synonymous with luxury, professionalism, and exceptional customer service in the region, setting a benchmark for beauty in Assam. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:30:44', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(384, 'LOOKS SALON', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>LOOKS SALON: Elevating Beauty in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>LOOKS SALON is a premier beauty destination in Guwahati, Assam, committed to providing exceptional hair and beauty services in a luxurious and welcoming environment.  We distinguish ourselves through a dedication to personalized service, utilization of high-quality products, and a deep understanding of the unique beauty needs of the Assamese community.  In a rapidly evolving beauty market, LOOKS SALON offers a sophisticated and modern approach, combining traditional techniques with the latest trends to create a truly memorable salon experience. We strive to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a trusted partner in enhancing our clients\' self-esteem and confidence. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Guwahati\'s beauty industry is experiencing significant growth, driven by a rising awareness of personal grooming and a desire for high-quality beauty treatments. However, the market often lacks a consistent level of professionalism and personalized attention. LOOKS SALON fills this gap by offering a premium experience that combines expert skill with a focus on individual client needs. Our strategic location in Guwahati ensures accessibility for a wide range of clientele, fostering strong connections within the local community. <br> <br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our comprehensive range of services caters to the diverse beauty needs of our clients.  We offer a full suite of hair services, including precision haircuts, styling, coloring (including traditional and modern techniques), keratin treatments, and specialized hair care solutions tailored to the unique characteristics of Assamese hair.  Our expert stylists are adept at understanding and catering to the preferences of our clients, ensuring that every client leaves feeling confident and beautiful. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Beyond hair care, LOOKS SALON provides a curated selection of beauty services, such as expertly applied makeup for special occasions and everyday wear, manicures and pedicures with a focus on hygiene and nail health, and facial treatments designed to rejuvenate and revitalize the skin.  We utilize high-quality, internationally recognized brands alongside carefully selected organic and locally sourced products, ensuring both efficacy and respect for the environment.  Our unique selling point lies not only in the quality of our services but also in our personalized consultations, allowing us to understand each client\'s individual requirements and preferences. We take pride in our ability to offer classic and modern styles, catering to a broad spectrum of tastes and age groups within the community. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Understanding the importance of bridal services in Assamese culture, LOOKS SALON offers specialized packages for brides and their wedding parties, encompassing hair styling, makeup, and other related beauty treatments. We work closely with clients to create a look that reflects their individual style and complements the traditional aspects of their wedding celebrations. This personalized approach allows us to build strong relationships with our clients and contribute to one of the most significant days of their lives. <br> <br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At LOOKS SALON, we are committed to providing an unparalleled customer experience.  Our approach emphasizes building trust and rapport with our clients.  From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm welcome and offered a personalized consultation to discuss their needs and preferences. We believe in transparency and open communication, ensuring clients are fully informed about the services being provided and any related costs. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Our highly trained and experienced stylists and beauticians are not only skilled professionals but also exceptional communicators, adept at listening to their clients and offering advice based on their individual needs. We maintain the highest standards of hygiene and sanitation, employing strict protocols to ensure the safety and well-being of all our clients.  We foster a relaxed and comfortable atmosphere within our salon, making the entire experience enjoyable and stress-free. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with local businesses, participation in community events, and sponsorship of local initiatives. This commitment to community engagement reflects our dedication to being more than just a salon; we strive to be an integral part of the Guwahati community.  We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, fostering strong relationships and a sense of belonging.  Regular client feedback mechanisms allow us to continually improve our services and ensure that we are consistently meeting the evolving needs of our clientele. <br> <br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>LOOKS SALON envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market.  Our future plans include introducing new and innovative services, expanding our team of experienced professionals, and enhancing our facilities to offer an even more luxurious and comprehensive beauty experience.  We aim to become a leading beauty destination in Assam, renowned for our expertise, commitment to excellence, and personalized approach.  <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>We plan to achieve this through strategic marketing initiatives, building stronger relationships with our clients, and continuously investing in the professional development of our team.  This includes exploring advanced training opportunities for our stylists and beauticians, keeping them at the forefront of the latest trends and techniques in the beauty industry.  We are also exploring opportunities for partnerships with international beauty brands, further enhancing the quality and range of products and services we offer.  Our long-term goal is to establish LOOKS SALON as a synonymous name for elegance, professionalism, and exceptional beauty services within the Assam region and beyond. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Our commitment to quality, customer satisfaction, and community engagement will remain our core values as we navigate future growth and expansion. We believe that by staying true to these values, we can continue to thrive and contribute meaningfully to the beauty landscape of Guwahati and beyond. <br> <br></p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8812935810', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:35:14', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(385, 'The Roots', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>The Roots: Cultivating Growth in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, The Roots stands as a testament to the region\'s vibrant spirit and entrepreneurial drive.  More than just a business, The Roots is a reflection of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage and a commitment to sustainable and ethical practices.  We are dedicated to providing high-quality products and services that cater to the evolving needs of the local community while fostering economic growth and environmental responsibility. Our unique approach combines traditional Assamese craftsmanship with modern business strategies, creating a dynamic and impactful presence in the Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to authenticity sets us apart.  In a world increasingly dominated by mass-produced goods, The Roots champions locally sourced materials and traditional techniques. This commitment not only ensures the quality and uniqueness of our offerings but also supports local artisans and farmers, contributing to the economic well-being of the Assam community. We believe in building a sustainable future, and this commitment permeates every aspect of our operations, from sourcing to production to distribution.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>The Roots offers a diverse range of products and services centered around the rich natural resources and cultural heritage of Assam. Our primary offerings include a curated selection of handcrafted Assamese textiles, ethically sourced tea and spices, and locally produced organic food items.  Each product tells a story – a story of skilled artisans, fertile lands, and a deep-rooted connection to the region.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and authenticity.  We rigorously vet our suppliers and partners to ensure ethical sourcing and fair labor practices. We also provide detailed information about the origin and production of each item, allowing customers to understand the journey of their purchase.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The local market in Guwahati has a growing demand for high-quality, ethically sourced products that reflect the region’s rich heritage.  The Roots directly addresses this demand by offering a curated collection that caters to discerning consumers who value authenticity, sustainability, and social responsibility. We bridge the gap between traditional craftsmanship and modern consumer preferences, showcasing the beauty and value of Assamese products to a wider audience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At The Roots, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and personalized experience for each customer, fostering a sense of community and connection.  Our knowledgeable staff is passionate about Assam\'s cultural heritage and is well-equipped to answer any questions about our products and their origins. We encourage customers to engage with the stories behind our goods, fostering a deeper appreciation for the craftsmanship and cultural significance.  Beyond transactions, we aim to build lasting relationships based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our products and services. We actively engage with local organizations and initiatives that promote sustainable development and social responsibility. We regularly participate in local events and festivals, showcasing Assamese culture and strengthening our connection with the Guwahati community. We believe in giving back and supporting the growth and prosperity of our city.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>The Roots has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  Our vision is to become a leading provider of high-quality, ethically sourced Assamese products, both within Guwahati and on a national level. We plan to expand our product range to encompass a wider selection of handcrafted items, organic produce, and unique Assamese experiences.  We are also exploring opportunities for online sales and international distribution, allowing us to share the beauty and richness of Assam with a global audience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and economically viable business model that benefits both the community and the environment. We aim to empower local artisans and farmers, providing them with a platform to showcase their skills and generate income.  We also plan to invest in sustainable practices and initiatives that minimize our environmental footprint. Our future is inextricably linked to the well-being of Assam, and we are committed to contributing to its growth and prosperity for generations to come. We believe that by preserving and promoting the rich cultural heritage and natural resources of Assam, we can build a vibrant and sustainable future for all.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Roots is more than just a business; it is a commitment to preserving Assam\'s heritage, supporting its people, and creating a sustainable future. We invite you to join us on this journey as we cultivate growth, both for our business and for the community we serve.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:31:00', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(386, 'Lakme Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Lakmé Salon, Guwahati: Redefining Beauty in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Lakmé Salon, situated in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a premier destination for beauty and personal care.  We are more than just a salon; we are a sanctuary where individuals can rejuvenate, revitalize, and rediscover their inner radiance.  Our establishment brings a sophisticated, internationally recognized brand to the Assamese market, combining global expertise with a deep understanding of local preferences and needs.  This unique blend allows us to offer a truly exceptional experience, setting a new standard for beauty services in the region. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our presence in Guwahati signifies a commitment to providing the highest quality beauty services to the discerning clientele of Assam. We aim to cater to the diverse beauty needs of the community, from traditional styles to modern trends, and to contribute to the growth of the local beauty industry.  By employing the latest techniques and technologies, we deliver unparalleled results while nurturing a sense of community and well-being within our salon environment. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Lakmé Salon, Guwahati offers a comprehensive range of beauty services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele.  Our offerings include a wide array of hair services, from precision haircuts and stylish coloring techniques – including advanced Balayage and Ombre – to intensive hair treatments designed to repair damage and promote healthy growth.  We use only high-quality, internationally recognized Lakmé products, ensuring consistent results and the preservation of hair health. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our expertise extends to skincare, where we offer customized facials tailored to individual skin types and concerns.  We utilize advanced techniques and technologies, including professional-grade skincare products, to address specific issues like acne, aging, and pigmentation.  Beyond facials, we provide a comprehensive selection of beauty services, including waxing, threading, manicures, pedicures, and make-up application for special occasions and everyday wear.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Lakmé Salon, Guwahati is our commitment to personalized attention.  Our highly skilled and experienced beauty professionals undergo rigorous training, adhering to the highest standards of hygiene and professionalism.  They are adept at understanding individual needs and preferences, tailoring each service to deliver optimal results and a truly personalized experience.  This approach resonates particularly well with the Assamese clientele who value both traditional techniques and modern advancements.  The use of Lakmé\'s globally-recognized product line further ensures consistent quality and reliability, meeting the demands of a sophisticated and discerning customer base. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Lakmé Salon, Guwahati, customer satisfaction is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and luxurious atmosphere where clients feel pampered and relaxed from the moment they enter.  Our dedication to providing exceptional customer service extends beyond the services themselves.  We prioritize personalized consultations, ensuring that our clients feel heard and understood, their individual needs and preferences taken into account.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We believe in building strong relationships with our clients, creating a loyal customer base who trust us to enhance their beauty and well-being.  We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and connection. We also utilize digital platforms to remain connected and responsive to the ever-evolving needs and preferences of our clientele. This approach allows us to tailor our services and create a truly customized experience for every customer, strengthening our ties within the community. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Lakmé Salon, Guwahati envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assamese market. We plan to broaden our range of services, incorporating the latest trends and advancements in beauty technology to maintain our position as a leading beauty destination.  This could include specialized services or the introduction of new product lines that cater to the evolving demands of the market.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a stronger presence within the community by actively engaging in local initiatives and events.  We also aim to expand our team by recruiting and training skilled professionals, ensuring that our commitment to exceptional customer service and high-quality services remains unwavering.  We intend to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a prominent contributor to the beauty industry in Assam, setting standards of excellence and empowering individuals to embrace their natural beauty. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We see significant potential for growth in Guwahati and the surrounding areas. The city\'s burgeoning economy and increasing awareness of personal care are driving factors in the salon\'s future success.  Our commitment to quality, personalized service, and community engagement positions us for sustainable growth and lasting success in the Assamese market.  We are dedicated to establishing Lakmé Salon, Guwahati, as the leading destination for beauty and well-being in the region. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8638883588', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:31:17', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(387, 'PARIS UNISEX HAIR & BEAUTY SPA SALON', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>PARIS UNISEX HAIR & BEAUTY SPA SALON: Guwahati\'s Premier Destination for Holistic Wellness</h1>\n\n<p>PARIS UNISEX HAIR & BEAUTY SPA SALON, located in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and sophisticated approach to hair and beauty services.  We are more than just a salon; we are a holistic wellness destination, providing a sanctuary of relaxation and rejuvenation for the discerning clientele of Assam.  Our commitment to quality, personalized service, and the use of premium products sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati market, offering an experience that transcends the ordinary.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our establishment recognizes the evolving needs of the modern individual in Assam, who seeks both traditional and contemporary beauty treatments. We cater to this demand by blending classic techniques with cutting-edge technologies and incorporating the best of both worlds. This approach allows us to deliver a truly personalized experience, tailored to each client\'s unique needs and preferences.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Style and Care</h2>\n\n<p>At PARIS UNISEX HAIR & BEAUTY SPA SALON, our core services encompass a wide range of hair and beauty treatments, designed to enhance both inner and outer beauty. Our expert stylists provide a comprehensive array of hair services, including precision haircuts, customized coloring techniques (ranging from classic highlights to the latest balayage trends), keratin treatments for smoother, healthier hair, and nourishing hair spa treatments that revitalize and repair damaged locks.  We use only the highest quality, internationally recognized hair care products, ensuring exceptional results and long-lasting effects.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond hair care, our beauty services cater to a wide spectrum of needs.  Our skilled beauticians offer luxurious facials tailored to different skin types, utilizing advanced techniques and premium skincare lines.  We provide expert makeup application for special occasions and everyday wear, ensuring a flawless and personalized look.  Additional services include manicures and pedicures using advanced techniques and quality products, along with specialized waxing services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to personalized attention. Each client receives a thorough consultation before any service, allowing our stylists and beauticians to understand their specific needs, preferences, and concerns. This personalized approach ensures that every client leaves feeling pampered, refreshed, and completely satisfied.  Further enhancing the customer experience is our commitment to utilizing eco-conscious and cruelty-free products wherever possible, aligning with the growing awareness of sustainable practices in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Where Luxury Meets Personalization</h2>\n\n<p>At PARIS UNISEX HAIR & BEAUTY SPA SALON, customer satisfaction is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and luxurious atmosphere, where clients can escape the stresses of daily life and indulge in a truly pampering experience. Our salon boasts a sophisticated and comfortable ambiance, designed to promote relaxation and tranquility.  We believe in fostering strong relationships with our clients, building trust through consistent exceptional service and genuine care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are deeply committed to connecting with the local community.  We regularly participate in local events, support regional artisans and businesses, and actively contribute to the beautification of our city. We understand that our success is intrinsically linked to the well-being and prosperity of Guwahati, and we strive to make a positive impact on the community we serve.  This commitment goes beyond mere business; it reflects our values and dedication to the people of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Shaping the Future of Beauty in Guwahati</h2>\n\n<p>Our future vision for PARIS UNISEX HAIR & BEAUTY SPA SALON extends beyond providing exceptional services. We aspire to become the leading provider of premium hair and beauty services in Guwahati, recognized for our unwavering commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement.  We plan to expand our service offerings to incorporate new and innovative treatments, ensuring we remain at the forefront of industry trends.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to investing in the ongoing training and development of our staff, ensuring they possess the latest skills and expertise.  This dedication to excellence will allow us to provide the highest level of service and deliver consistently exceptional results. We are also exploring opportunities for strategic partnerships with complementary businesses to broaden our service portfolio and offer a more comprehensive wellness experience.  This expansion will not only benefit our clients but also strengthen our position within the Guwahati market.  Long-term, we envision PARIS UNISEX HAIR & BEAUTY SPA SALON as a landmark destination, synonymous with luxury, sophistication, and uncompromising quality in the heart of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In essence, PARIS UNISEX HAIR & BEAUTY SPA SALON represents a commitment to excellence, personalization, and community engagement. We invite you to experience the difference and discover your own path to holistic wellness within the serene and sophisticated atmosphere of our salon in Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8099149901', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:35:22', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(388, 'MIRRORS', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>MIRRORS: Reflecting Elegance and Quality in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>MIRRORS, located in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a retail establishment; it\'s a curated experience designed to meet the evolving needs of the discerning Assamese consumer.  We pride ourselves on offering a unique blend of high-quality products and exceptional customer service, establishing ourselves as a leader in our niche within the dynamic Guwahati market. Our focus on locally sourced materials, skilled craftsmanship, and a commitment to sustainable practices sets us apart and resonates deeply with the community\'s values.  We aim to be more than just a shop; we strive to be a reflection of the elegance and sophistication Guwahati represents.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Guwahati\'s burgeoning economy presents a diverse market with a growing appreciation for both traditional craftsmanship and modern aesthetics.  MIRRORS directly addresses this demand by strategically curating a collection that caters to a wide range of tastes and preferences.  We understand that the local market appreciates both the enduring appeal of heritage and the contemporary flair of modern design, and we bridge that gap flawlessly.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>MIRRORS offers a carefully curated selection of home décor, lifestyle accessories, and gift items. Our product range includes exquisite handcrafted furniture made from sustainable Assamese timber, meticulously designed lighting fixtures incorporating traditional motifs, and a stunning collection of handcrafted textiles featuring vibrant Assamese patterns.  We also offer a range of carefully selected home fragrances, bath and body products, and artisanal jewellery using locally sourced materials like Muga silk and bell metal.  </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to supporting local artisans and using sustainable materials whenever possible.  We actively collaborate with skilled craftspeople across Assam, ensuring fair wages and preserving traditional techniques. This not only enhances the authenticity and uniqueness of our products but also contributes to the economic growth of the region. Our commitment to sustainability aligns perfectly with the growing consciousness amongst Guwahati residents concerning environmentally responsible consumption. The selection process is rigorous, ensuring that each item reflects exceptional quality, exquisite design and a story reflecting its Assamese heritage.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>By showcasing the best of Assamese craftsmanship, we provide our customers with unique, high-quality products that are not easily found elsewhere.  We understand the local market’s desire for both traditional and modern aesthetics and cater to this demand by presenting a well-balanced collection that seamlessly blends these two aspects.  Our product range caters to various needs, from everyday essentials to special occasion gifts, ensuring that there\'s something for every customer.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At MIRRORS, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount.  We strive to create a welcoming and personalized shopping experience, where customers feel valued and understood. Our knowledgeable and friendly staff are passionate about our products and are always ready to offer expert advice and assistance.  We take pride in building strong relationships with our customers, ensuring that each interaction is memorable and positive.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to personalized service extends beyond the transaction. We regularly engage with our customers through various channels, including social media and community events, fostering a sense of belonging and connection.  We believe in actively participating in local initiatives, supporting local charities, and promoting sustainable practices within our community. This commitment to social responsibility strengthens our bond with the community and enhances our brand reputation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are more than just a shop – we are a part of the Guwahati community. We actively participate in local events, workshops, and initiatives, showcasing our products and sharing our passion for Assamese craftsmanship. This direct engagement with the local community has helped us establish strong relationships, build trust, and foster a loyal customer base.  Our commitment to transparency in our sourcing and production processes further enhances customer trust and reinforces our commitment to responsible business practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>MIRRORS envisions a future where we become a leading destination for exquisite home décor and lifestyle products in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our product range, exploring new collaborations with talented artisans across Assam and potentially other parts of Northeast India.  We aim to strengthen our online presence through a robust e-commerce platform, making our unique products accessible to a wider audience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a strong brand identity synonymous with quality, craftsmanship, and sustainability. We will continue to invest in training and development for our staff, ensuring that they are equipped with the skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional customer service. We also intend to expand our physical footprint, potentially opening additional locations within Guwahati or exploring other strategic locations in Assam to better serve the regional market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we plan to actively promote Assamese craftsmanship and sustainable practices through educational workshops and community initiatives.  This commitment to community engagement and sustainable development will not only enhance our brand image but also contribute positively to the economic and social fabric of Assam.  Our future growth will be driven by our unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement, ensuring that MIRRORS remains a cherished part of the Guwahati landscape for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6001702384', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:35:31', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(389, 'Zest & Zeal', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Zest & Zeal: Elevating Experiences in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Zest & Zeal is a dynamic and innovative business operating in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  We are committed to providing exceptional services and products that cater to the unique needs and preferences of the Assamese market. Unlike generic businesses, Zest & Zeal differentiates itself through a deep understanding of local culture, a commitment to sustainable practices, and a passion for delivering unparalleled customer experiences. Our presence contributes to the vibrant economic landscape of Guwahati, fostering growth and enriching the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At Zest & Zeal, we offer a curated selection of high-quality services and products, carefully chosen to address the evolving demands of the Guwahati market.  Our offerings currently focus on [mention specific service/product area, e.g.,  handcrafted Assamese silk products, bespoke event planning, organic tea sourcing and distribution, etc.].  We source materials locally wherever possible, supporting local artisans and farmers and minimizing our environmental impact. This commitment resonates strongly with the growing preference for sustainable and ethically sourced goods within the community.  </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Zest & Zeal is our unwavering dedication to quality.  We meticulously vet our suppliers and artisans, ensuring that each product meets the highest standards of excellence.  Our commitment extends beyond simply providing goods; we strive to tell the story behind each item, highlighting the rich heritage and craftsmanship inherent in Assamese artistry and tradition. This approach adds value for our customers and differentiates us from competitors who may prioritize mass-produced items over authentic, locally-sourced goods.  Our focus on providing customized solutions, tailored to individual client needs, ensures we surpass expectations and build lasting relationships.  For example, our bespoke event planning services offer complete personalization, understanding the nuances of Assamese traditions and incorporating them seamlessly into every celebration. </p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Zest & Zeal, we believe that customer satisfaction is paramount. We are dedicated to providing a seamless and personalized experience for every customer, from the initial inquiry to the final delivery or service completion.  Our team is composed of highly trained professionals who are passionate about providing exceptional service. We are fluent in Assamese and English, and our team members possess a deep understanding of local customs and preferences, ensuring seamless communication and cultural sensitivity.  We actively solicit customer feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and enhance our service.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to building strong relationships with our customers, going above and beyond to ensure their complete satisfaction.  This commitment extends beyond transactional interactions; we aim to foster long-term connections with our clients, becoming a trusted partner and resource. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events, sponsorships, and community initiatives, solidifying our commitment to Guwahati\'s growth and development.  This approach has helped us cultivate a strong and loyal customer base, reinforcing our position as a valued member of the Guwahati business community. We also leverage digital platforms to enhance customer interactions, providing convenient online ordering and customer support options.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Zest & Zeal envisions a future of continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and beyond.  We plan to expand our product and service offerings, strategically adding new items and services that complement our existing portfolio and address emerging market needs.  Our focus will remain on maintaining our commitment to quality, ethical sourcing, and exceptional customer service.  We intend to leverage technology to enhance our operational efficiency and expand our reach, potentially incorporating e-commerce strategies to access a wider customer base. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Further, we see significant potential in exploring collaborations with other local businesses and artisans to broaden our product range and offer a more diverse selection to our customers.  We also aim to establish strategic partnerships that will help us expand our market reach and introduce our products to a wider audience, both within Assam and potentially nationally. Long-term, our goal is to become a leading provider of high-quality, ethically sourced goods and services in Assam, synonymous with quality, authenticity, and exceptional customer experience. We aspire to contribute significantly to the economic growth of Guwahati and Assam, supporting local communities and showcasing the rich cultural heritage of the region on a larger platform.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Zest & Zeal is more than just a business; it\'s a testament to our dedication to the community, a commitment to quality and sustainability, and a passion for providing exceptional experiences. We are excited about the future and look forward to continuing to serve the people of Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9395441500', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:35:38', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
