(390, 'Babylon Beauty Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Babylon Beauty Salon: Redefining Beauty in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Babylon Beauty Salon is a premier beauty destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  We are committed to providing unparalleled beauty services and a truly luxurious experience to the discerning clientele of the region.  Our salon stands apart not only through the quality of our services but also through our deep understanding of the unique beauty needs and preferences of the Assamese community, blending traditional techniques with modern innovations.  We believe in celebrating the natural beauty of each individual and empowering them to feel confident and radiant. We strive to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a sanctuary of relaxation and self-care, contributing significantly to the growing wellness industry in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our significance in the local business landscape lies in our commitment to using high-quality, internationally recognized products while simultaneously embracing locally sourced ingredients and traditional techniques wherever possible. This unique blend allows us to offer treatments that cater to the specific needs of the skin and hair of the Assamese population, who often face unique environmental challenges and have specific preferences for certain ingredients and styles. We are proud to support local artisans and businesses, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of Assam in our operations and offerings.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Babylon Beauty Salon offers a comprehensive range of beauty services, catering to diverse needs and preferences. Our services include a wide array of hairstyling options, from classic cuts and styles to modern trends, adapted to suit the varying hair textures prevalent in the region. We offer advanced hair treatments, including keratin smoothing, nourishing oil treatments, and specialized color services using premium, internationally acclaimed brands as well as local, organically sourced products.   Our expertise extends to sophisticated makeup application, perfect for everyday looks, special occasions, and bridal services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond hair and makeup, we provide a comprehensive suite of skincare services, including facials tailored to different skin types, specialized treatments for acne, pigmentation, and anti-aging concerns. We also offer advanced beauty treatments, such as microdermabrasion, chemical peels, and threading.  Manicure and pedicure services are meticulously performed using sanitized equipment and high-quality products. Our unique selling points include our customized consultations, ensuring each client receives a personalized treatment plan based on their specific needs and preferences, and our commitment to using high-quality products that are ethically sourced and environmentally conscious.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We meet local market needs by addressing specific concerns and preferences. Our extensive menu of services caters to the diverse needs of our clientele, from traditional beauty treatments to the latest global trends.  Our use of both internationally recognized and locally sourced products ensures we meet a broad range of expectations, providing choices that resonate with different budgets and preferences. We understand the climate of Assam and tailor our treatments to mitigate common issues like heat damage to the hair and skin sensitivities related to seasonal changes.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Babylon Beauty Salon, customer satisfaction is our utmost priority. We strive to create a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere, ensuring each client feels pampered and valued.  Our highly trained and experienced professionals provide exceptional service, taking the time to understand each client’s individual needs and preferences. We offer personalized consultations and work closely with each client to achieve their desired look and feel. We maintain the highest levels of hygiene and sanitation, adhering to strict protocols to ensure a safe and comfortable environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What makes us stand out is our commitment to building lasting relationships with our clients. We foster a community atmosphere, encouraging interaction and feedback. We regularly organize workshops and events, educating our clients about skincare and hair care routines and the latest trends. Our focus extends beyond mere beauty treatments; we aim to empower our clients with the knowledge and confidence to care for their beauty needs effectively. We actively engage with the local community through sponsorships and charity events, strengthening our ties with the city and contributing to its well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Babylon Beauty Salon envisions significant growth and expansion in the coming years.  We plan to enhance our service offerings, introducing new and innovative treatments to stay at the forefront of the beauty industry. This includes investing in advanced technology and equipment, expanding our team of expert stylists and aestheticians, and incorporating more sustainable practices into our operations.  We intend to further develop our online presence, creating a user-friendly website and active social media engagement to reach a wider clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Babylon Beauty Salon as the leading beauty destination in Guwahati and beyond. We aim to become a recognized name synonymous with quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction.  We plan to expand our physical space, potentially opening additional locations within Guwahati or other areas of Assam.  Our continued focus on exceeding client expectations, incorporating sustainable practices, and contributing to the local community will be fundamental to our success and our journey to become a beacon of beauty and wellness in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to constantly evolving and adapting to the changing needs of our clients while maintaining our unwavering dedication to providing an exceptional beauty experience in the heart of Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7635822337', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:35:46', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(391, 'Naturoma Ladies Beauty Clinic', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Naturoma Ladies Beauty Clinic: Unveiling Natural Beauty in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Naturoma Ladies Beauty Clinic, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a premier destination for women seeking holistic and natural beauty solutions.  We are committed to providing high-quality, personalized services that cater to the unique needs and preferences of the Assamese woman, blending traditional wisdom with modern techniques.  Our clinic distinguishes itself within the vibrant Guwahati beauty landscape through its unwavering commitment to natural ingredients, personalized treatments, and a genuinely warm and welcoming atmosphere. We believe in enhancing natural beauty, not masking it, and this philosophy forms the cornerstone of our practice.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our dedication to sourcing high-quality, locally-sourced ingredients whenever possible contributes to the sustainable and ethical practices that are integral to Naturoma\'s identity. This commitment resonates deeply with the community, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty among our clientele. We are proud to support local farmers and artisans, ensuring that our ingredients are both ethically sourced and of superior quality. This commitment not only benefits the local economy but also aligns with our commitment to environmental responsibility.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Naturoma offers a comprehensive range of beauty services designed to address the diverse needs of our clientele.  Our core offerings include customized facials tailored to individual skin types and concerns, utilizing natural ingredients such as turmeric, neem, and other locally-sourced botanicals known for their therapeutic properties. We also specialize in traditional Assamese beauty treatments, incorporating age-old techniques passed down through generations. These treatments are adapted to provide modern results while preserving their authentic essence.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond facials, we provide a range of body treatments, including aromatherapy massages that incorporate essential oils to promote relaxation and well-being.  Hair care services encompass traditional oil treatments and specialized hair masks to nourish and strengthen hair, addressing common concerns prevalent in the region.  We also offer a selection of high-quality, natural skincare and hair care products for at-home use, many of which are formulated using locally-sourced ingredients, reinforcing our commitment to the local community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our holistic approach, combining scientific understanding of dermatology and cosmetology with the wisdom of traditional Assamese beauty practices.  This fusion allows us to offer personalized treatments that cater to the specific needs of our clients, reflecting the diverse skin types and preferences found across the region.  Moreover, our commitment to using natural, locally-sourced ingredients ensures that our services are both effective and environmentally conscious. This approach has garnered us a strong reputation for trust and quality within the Guwahati community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Naturoma, we believe that the customer experience is paramount.  From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm welcome and a personalized consultation to assess their individual needs and preferences.  Our team of highly trained and experienced beauty therapists are not only skilled professionals but also compassionate individuals who strive to create a comfortable and relaxing environment for each client.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We prioritize open communication and transparency, ensuring that clients are fully informed about the treatments and products we offer.  We also actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our community.  This commitment to personalized attention and open dialogue has helped us build strong relationships with our clients, many of whom have become loyal patrons.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Naturoma\'s commitment extends beyond individual clients to the larger Guwahati community. We regularly organize workshops and educational events focused on natural beauty and skincare, sharing our knowledge and expertise with a wider audience.  We actively participate in local events and initiatives, contributing to the overall well-being of the community. Our active engagement showcases our dedication to more than just beauty treatments; we strive to foster a sense of community and shared well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Naturoma Ladies Beauty Clinic has ambitious plans for the future.  We envision expanding our services to include advanced skincare treatments and wellness programs, further diversifying our offerings to meet the growing demand for holistic beauty solutions in Guwahati.  This expansion will also involve investing in state-of-the-art equipment and technology while remaining true to our core values of natural ingredients and personalized service.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also plan to strengthen our commitment to community engagement by partnering with local organizations to provide beauty services and educational programs to underprivileged women.  This initiative aligns with our broader social responsibility goals and reflects our deep commitment to empowering women within the community.  Long-term, we aspire to become a leading provider of natural beauty solutions in Assam, establishing Naturoma as a synonymous brand with trust, quality, and community engagement.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Through our dedication to providing exceptional services, fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere, and actively engaging with the Guwahati community, Naturoma Ladies Beauty Clinic is poised for significant growth and long-term success.  We are committed to upholding the highest standards of professionalism, ethical practices, and client satisfaction, solidifying our position as a trusted and respected beauty destination in the heart of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864277875', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:50:14', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(392, 'Blonde studio Hair, Beauty & Spa', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Blonde Studio Hair, Beauty & Spa: Guwahati\'s Premier Wellness Destination</h1>\n\n<p>Blonde Studio Hair, Beauty & Spa is a premium wellness destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. We are more than just a salon; we are a sanctuary dedicated to enhancing the well-being of our clients through exceptional services and a personalized approach.  In a city increasingly discerning about beauty and wellness, Blonde Studio stands out by offering a unique blend of international expertise with a deep understanding of the specific needs and preferences of the Assamese community.  We strive to create an experience that transcends the ordinary, leaving each client feeling rejuvenated, confident, and beautifully pampered.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence begins with our team of highly skilled and certified professionals.  We have assembled a diverse group of stylists, beauticians, and spa therapists, each possessing extensive experience and a passion for their craft.  Regular training and the adoption of cutting-edge techniques ensure that our services remain at the forefront of the industry.  We prioritize the use of high-quality, ethically sourced products, ensuring both efficacy and safety for our valued clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Blonde Studio offers a comprehensive range of hair, beauty, and spa services designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. Our hair services include precision haircuts, stylish coloring techniques (including balayage and ombre), keratin treatments, hair extensions, and advanced scalp treatments tailored to address specific hair concerns. Our beauty services encompass a full range of skincare treatments, facials customized to individual skin types, professional makeup application for special occasions and everyday wear, and advanced waxing services. Our spa menu provides relaxing and rejuvenating treatments, including aromatherapy massages, body wraps, scrubs, and manicures and pedicures, all delivered in a tranquil and calming environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets Blonde Studio apart is our dedication to understanding and catering to the specific beauty needs of the Assamese community.  We incorporate traditional Assamese beauty practices and ingredients wherever appropriate, blending them seamlessly with modern techniques to create unique and effective treatments.  This approach reflects our deep respect for the local culture and our commitment to providing services that resonate with our clients on a personal level. We also offer a curated selection of organic and natural products, reflecting a growing consumer demand for environmentally friendly and ethically produced goods within the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Blonde Studio, we believe that the customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and luxurious environment where every client feels valued and pampered. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with personalized attention and a genuine sense of hospitality.  Our dedicated team takes the time to understand individual needs and preferences, ensuring that each treatment is tailored to achieve optimal results. We maintain meticulous hygiene standards and prioritize the comfort and privacy of our clients throughout their visit.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to exceeding expectations extends beyond the services themselves.  We foster a strong sense of community by actively engaging with our clients and the broader Guwahati community through various initiatives.  We participate in local events, partner with charitable organizations, and regularly offer special promotions and discounts to show our appreciation for our loyal clientele.  Our goal is not merely to provide exceptional services, but to build lasting relationships based on trust, respect, and mutual understanding.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Blonde Studio has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision becoming the leading provider of premium hair, beauty, and spa services in Guwahati and beyond.  Our strategic focus includes continuing to invest in our team\'s professional development, expanding our service offerings to include new and innovative treatments, and enhancing our facilities to create an even more luxurious and relaxing experience.  We plan to leverage digital marketing and social media platforms to reach a wider audience and strengthen our brand presence within the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we aim to become a recognized leader in the Assamese wellness industry, setting new standards for excellence and innovation.  This includes exploring potential collaborations with local businesses and artisans, sourcing more locally produced ingredients, and contributing to the economic development of the community.  We are committed to sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental impact, and promoting ethical sourcing throughout our operations. We believe that by combining exceptional service, community engagement, and a commitment to sustainability, Blonde Studio can make a significant and positive impact on the wellness landscape of Guwahati and Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, our vision is to create a legacy of beauty, well-being, and community engagement in Guwahati.  We believe that by consistently exceeding client expectations and contributing positively to the community, Blonde Studio will continue to flourish and become a cherished destination for those seeking a truly transformative and luxurious wellness experience.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9127107505', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:50:22', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(393, 'BBLUNT', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>BBLUNT Guwahati: Elevating Haircare in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>BBLUNT Guwahati stands as a premier hair salon and product retailer, bringing a sophisticated approach to haircare within the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam.  We distinguish ourselves from competitors not only through our commitment to high-quality services and products but also through our deep understanding of and responsiveness to the unique needs and preferences of the Assamese market. Our focus on personalized consultations, utilization of advanced techniques, and a dedication to exceptional customer experience sets us apart, establishing BBLUNT as a leader in the region\'s beauty industry.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike generic salons, BBLUNT Guwahati offers a curated range of services designed to cater to the diverse hair textures and needs common in the region.  Our expertise extends beyond basic haircuts and styling. We specialize in intricate traditional Assamese hair braiding techniques, offering a modern twist on age-old styles, catering to both special occasions and everyday needs. We also provide customized treatments for hair damage repair, utilizing products specifically formulated to combat the effects of Assam\'s climate on hair health.  Our color services employ high-quality, ammonia-free dyes, minimizing damage while achieving rich, lasting color results.  The unique selling point of BBLUNT lies in our blend of international expertise and local understanding, creating a truly tailored experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The products sold at BBLUNT Guwahati complement our services, offering clients the ability to maintain their salon-quality look at home. We stock a comprehensive range of high-performance shampoos, conditioners, styling products, and hair treatments, all carefully selected to address the specific challenges faced by Assamese hair. We prioritize brands that align with our commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing, reflecting our conscious approach to business and a deep respect for our environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At BBLUNT Guwahati, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and luxurious atmosphere where each client feels valued and understood. Our highly skilled stylists undergo extensive training and professional development, ensuring they are equipped to handle the diverse range of hair types and styles encountered within our community.  We encourage open communication and consultation, allowing clients to express their preferences and concerns, enabling us to personalize every service to meet their individual requirements.  We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with regional fashion shows, beauty events, and charitable initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to Assam\'s growth and prosperity.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond providing exceptional service, we foster a strong sense of community within our salon. We prioritize creating a space that feels inclusive and welcoming to all, regardless of background or style preferences. We organize regular workshops and educational sessions to share haircare tips and knowledge with our clients, empowering them to make informed choices about their hair health. This commitment to community engagement is deeply ingrained in our values and underscores our long-term vision for BBLUNT Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our future vision for BBLUNT Guwahati encompasses significant expansion and diversification. We plan to introduce advanced hair and scalp analysis technology to further personalize our services and product recommendations.  We also intend to expand our product line to include natural and organically sourced Assamese ingredients, promoting local artisans and highlighting the region\'s rich biodiversity.  We envision establishing BBLUNT as a recognized training center, nurturing local talent and contributing to the growth of the beauty industry within Assam.  This strategy aligns with our goal of fostering sustainable growth and contributing positively to the economic and social fabric of the community.  Long-term, we aim to become a nationally recognized brand synonymous with excellence in haircare, proudly representing Assam on a larger scale.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>BBLUNT Guwahati is more than just a salon; it\'s a reflection of our commitment to excellence, innovation, and community engagement. We are proud to serve the people of Guwahati, offering an unparalleled experience that combines international expertise with a deep understanding of local needs. We believe in the power of transformation, both in terms of enhancing our clients’ appearance and contributing to the growth and development of our community. Our journey is ongoing, and we look forward to continuing to serve our clients and the wider community for many years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6900180555', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:50:28', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(394, 'Purple', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Purple: Redefining Elegance in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Purple, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a business; it\'s a reflection of the vibrant spirit and sophisticated tastes of the region.  We\'re committed to providing exceptional experiences and high-quality offerings, catering to the unique needs and preferences of the Assamese market.  Our dedication to detail, personalized service, and unwavering commitment to quality sets us apart, establishing Purple as a leading force in the ever-evolving Guwahati business landscape. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At Purple, our focus is on providing a curated selection of premium products and services tailored to the discerning consumer. While the precise nature of our offerings depends on our chosen niche (e.g., high-end fashion, bespoke jewelry, gourmet food, luxury travel services, etc.),  our approach remains consistent:  We prioritize quality, craftsmanship, and authenticity. We source our materials and services locally whenever possible, supporting local artisans and businesses while showcasing the rich heritage of Assam. This commitment to local sourcing not only reflects our values but also ensures that our offerings are uniquely reflective of the region. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>What truly distinguishes Purple is our dedication to exceeding expectations.  We don\'t just sell products; we curate experiences.  Whether it\'s the meticulous craftsmanship of a handcrafted item or the personalized attention received during a consultation, every interaction is designed to leave a lasting impression. This commitment is underpinned by our rigorous quality control processes and our commitment to using only the finest materials and employing the most skilled professionals. Our unique selling proposition lies in this combination of exceptional quality, personalized service, and a deep connection to the local community. This allows us to understand and meet the specific needs and desires of our clientele, providing them with an unparalleled shopping or service experience. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At the core of Purple\'s philosophy is the belief that exceptional customer service is not just a department, but a way of life. We understand that building lasting relationships with our clientele is essential to our success.  We strive to create a welcoming and sophisticated environment where our customers feel valued, understood, and appreciated. Our team is highly trained in providing personalized attention, ensuring that each interaction is tailored to individual needs and preferences.  This approach extends beyond the point of sale; we maintain ongoing communication with our customers, providing after-sales support and ensuring complete customer satisfaction. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our commitment to community engagement is paramount. We believe in actively participating in local initiatives and supporting local causes. We actively seek opportunities to collaborate with other Guwahati businesses and contribute to the overall growth and prosperity of the region.  This commitment isn\'t merely a marketing strategy; it\'s an integral part of our identity. We see ourselves as active members of the Guwahati community, contributing to its vibrant culture and economic development. This commitment builds trust and fosters strong bonds with our clientele, creating a sense of shared identity and purpose. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Purple’s future is bright. We envision expanding our reach and offerings while maintaining our commitment to quality and personalized service. Our growth strategy involves strategically expanding our product or service lines, potentially exploring opportunities in related sectors to capitalize on market trends and customer demand.  This may involve collaborations with other businesses, both within Assam and beyond, to leverage expertise and reach new markets.  We are also committed to investing in our team, providing them with opportunities for professional development and growth, ensuring that they are equipped to deliver the highest level of service. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Beyond expansion, we aim to become a recognized symbol of elegance and sophistication within Guwahati and beyond. We want to be synonymous with quality, craftsmanship, and personalized service. This long-term vision necessitates continuous innovation, a deep understanding of evolving customer needs, and a sustained commitment to our core values.  We believe that by upholding these principles, we will not only achieve sustainable growth but also contribute positively to the economic and cultural landscape of Assam. We plan to achieve this through strategic marketing, targeted collaborations, and a commitment to exceeding expectations at every turn.  Our goal is to be more than just a business; we aim to be a cultural touchstone, synonymous with quality and style within the region. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Purple is poised for significant growth and success. Our commitment to quality, personalized service, and community engagement distinguishes us in the Guwahati market. Our future plans involve strategic expansion, continuous innovation, and an unwavering dedication to upholding our core values. We are confident that Purple will not only continue to thrive but will also play a significant role in shaping the future of the Guwahati business landscape. <br> <br> </p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7896379829', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:50:36', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(395, 'Head Turners', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Head Turners: Redefining Style in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Head Turners, located in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a fashion boutique; it\'s a lifestyle destination.  We are dedicated to providing the discerning clientele of Assam with high-quality, stylish apparel and accessories, curated to reflect the unique blend of traditional elegance and modern trends that define the region.  Our commitment to exceptional customer service and a deep understanding of the local market sets us apart, making us a significant contributor to Guwahati\'s thriving fashion scene.  We believe in empowering individuals to express their personal style with confidence and grace, and our carefully selected inventory reflects this belief.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Head Turners offers a diverse range of products designed to cater to the multifaceted needs of the Guwahati market. Our collection includes contemporary women\'s and men\'s apparel, featuring both internationally recognized brands and unique, ethically sourced pieces from local artisans. This blend reflects our commitment to both global fashion trends and the preservation of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage. We also offer a carefully curated selection of accessories, including handcrafted jewelry, stylish footwear, bags, and scarves, designed to complement and enhance any outfit.  Our emphasis is on quality fabrics, impeccable tailoring, and timeless designs that transcend fleeting fashion trends.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our ability to seamlessly blend international fashion sensibilities with the distinct tastes of the Assamese consumer. We understand the need to cater to both traditional preferences and the growing demand for contemporary styles. This is reflected in our product selection, which incorporates elements of both, creating a collection that resonates with a wide demographic. We pride ourselves on offering exclusive pieces, not readily available elsewhere in Guwahati, thus providing our customers with a truly unique shopping experience. Our commitment to sustainability, sourcing many items locally and ethically, further strengthens our unique position in the market.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with local artisans and designers, providing them with a platform to showcase their talent and contribute to the economic growth of the region. This approach not only supports the local community but also enriches our product offerings with unique and handcrafted items that are highly valued by our customers.  By combining global trends with local craftsmanship, we are creating a unique fashion identity that celebrates both the modern and the traditional aspects of Assamese culture.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Head Turners, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized shopping environment where every customer feels valued and understood. Our team is comprised of knowledgeable and friendly staff dedicated to providing expert advice and assistance. We understand that choosing the right outfit involves more than just selecting clothing; it\'s about expressing oneself and feeling confident.  Our team goes above and beyond to help customers find the perfect pieces that reflect their individual style and personality.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in building strong relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and loyalty.  We regularly organize events and workshops, such as styling sessions and fashion shows, that offer opportunities for our customers to interact with each other and with our team. This engagement allows us to understand evolving trends and preferences, ensuring that our offerings always reflect the needs and desires of our community.  We actively engage on social media platforms, using them to build connections and stay connected with the latest trends.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We go the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction, offering personalized styling consultations, alterations services, and flexible return policies.  We believe that a positive shopping experience is as important as the products themselves, and our commitment to exceptional service is what truly sets us apart in Guwahati\'s competitive retail landscape.  Our focus on personalized attention and community building fosters a sense of loyalty and trust, attracting a wide range of customers.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Head Turners has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision becoming the leading fashion destination in Guwahati, renowned for its unique style, exceptional customer service, and commitment to community engagement.  We plan to expand our product offerings, incorporating new brands and categories that cater to an even wider range of customer preferences.  This expansion will be driven by ongoing market research and a keen awareness of evolving trends.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We also plan to enhance our online presence, developing a robust e-commerce platform that will allow us to reach a broader customer base beyond Guwahati.  This will be supported by strategic marketing initiatives, aimed at increasing brand awareness and attracting new customers.  Further investment in technology will also support this expansion, enabling us to streamline operations and enhance the overall customer experience.  A strong focus on sustainable practices will remain central to our business strategy, including continued support for local artisans and the use of eco-friendly materials.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Head Turners as a nationally recognized brand synonymous with quality, style, and community engagement.  We aim to become a significant contributor to the fashion industry in Assam, providing employment opportunities and fostering economic growth.  By continuously adapting to evolving market trends and maintaining our commitment to exceptional customer service, we are confident in our ability to achieve this ambitious vision and solidify our position as the premier fashion destination in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8876520648', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:50:45', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(396, 'Makeovers by NG Unisex salon', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Makeovers by NG Unisex Salon: Elevating Beauty in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Makeovers by NG Unisex Salon is a premier beauty destination in Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to providing exceptional hair and beauty services in a sophisticated and welcoming environment.  We cater to the diverse needs of the Guwahati community, offering a comprehensive range of services that blend traditional expertise with modern techniques and the latest trends.  Our commitment to quality, personalized attention, and community engagement sets us apart in the vibrant and competitive beauty landscape of Assam. We pride ourselves on understanding the unique beauty aspirations of our diverse clientele and tailoring our services to meet those needs flawlessly.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Makeovers by NG Unisex Salon offers a wide array of services designed to enhance both inner and outer beauty. Our comprehensive menu includes a full spectrum of hairstyling services, ranging from classic cuts and creative coloring to intricate bridal hairstyles and specialized treatments for hair health and restoration. We utilize high-quality, internationally recognized hair products ensuring optimal results and long-lasting effects.  Our expertise extends beyond hair care; we offer a complete range of beauty services, including professional makeup application for special occasions and everyday wear, luxurious facials tailored to different skin types, and expert manicures and pedicures.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>What truly sets us apart is our dedication to personalized service.  We take the time to understand each client\'s unique needs and preferences, providing consultations to ensure that every service is perfectly tailored to their individual style and aspirations. This personalized approach, combined with our commitment to using only the finest products, ensures that each client leaves feeling confident and rejuvenated.  We also recognize the importance of staying ahead of the curve in the ever-evolving world of beauty trends, and we continuously invest in professional training to keep our skills and knowledge up-to-date. This commitment to excellence allows us to offer innovative and cutting-edge services that meet the evolving demands of our sophisticated clientele in Guwahati.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>We understand the specific needs of the local market in Guwahati.  Our services are priced competitively to ensure accessibility for a broad range of clientele, while maintaining the high quality of service that defines our brand. We cater to a diverse clientele, from young professionals seeking quick and stylish updates to brides seeking meticulous attention to detail for their special day, and everyone in between. This understanding of our local market, combined with our commitment to delivering superior quality, has established Makeovers by NG as a trusted and preferred choice for beauty services in the region.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Makeovers by NG Unisex Salon, we believe that the customer experience is paramount. From the moment a client steps into our salon, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism. Our friendly and highly trained staff are committed to creating a relaxing and pampering environment, making each visit a truly enjoyable experience. We pride ourselves on building strong relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty.  We encourage open communication, actively listening to client needs and offering personalized recommendations. Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends beyond the services themselves; we strive to create a memorable and positive experience that keeps clients returning time and again.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>We firmly believe in the importance of connecting with our local community. We actively engage with local organizations and participate in community events, demonstrating our commitment to supporting the development of Guwahati. This approach fosters a strong sense of local ownership and pride, contributing to the vibrancy of the community and reflecting our commitment to more than just beauty services; we aim to be an integral and valued part of the Guwahati landscape.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Makeovers by NG Unisex Salon has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We envision becoming the leading provider of premium beauty services in Guwahati and beyond. Our plans include expanding our service offerings to incorporate new and innovative treatments, investing in advanced technology and equipment, and further developing our team\'s skills through ongoing training and professional development.  We are exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, potentially opening new branches in strategically located areas of Guwahati to better serve our growing clientele.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Beyond expansion, we are committed to maintaining our focus on delivering exceptional customer service and fostering strong community ties. We will continue to invest in building long-term relationships with our clients, nurturing a loyal customer base through personalized service and consistent excellence.  Our long-term goal is to establish Makeovers by NG Unisex Salon as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, professionalism, and community engagement, becoming a true benchmark for beauty excellence in Assam.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to sustainability and ethical practices will also be a key focus of our future endeavors. We are actively exploring ways to minimize our environmental impact and source ethically produced products, reflecting our dedication to responsible business practices and contributing to a more sustainable future for Guwahati and Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002776283', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:55:13', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(397, 'UNLOCK YOUR SHADOW', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>UNLOCK YOUR SHADOW: Guwahati\'s Premier Holistic Wellness Center</h1>\n\n<p>UNLOCK YOUR SHADOW, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a pioneering holistic wellness center dedicated to empowering individuals to unlock their full potential through a unique blend of ancient wisdom and modern therapeutic practices.  We recognize the unique challenges and aspirations of the Assamese community and have tailored our services to address the specific needs of this vibrant and dynamic population.  Our commitment extends beyond simply providing services; we strive to cultivate a supportive and nurturing environment where individuals can embark on a journey of self-discovery and personal growth.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and traditional healing practices, UNLOCK YOUR SHADOW offers a refreshing approach to wellness that respects and integrates these traditions while embracing innovative therapeutic methodologies. We stand apart from conventional wellness centers by offering a personalized and holistic experience, focusing on the interconnectedness of mind, body, and spirit.  Our emphasis on individual needs, coupled with our commitment to ethical and sustainable practices, firmly establishes us as a leader in the burgeoning wellness sector of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>UNLOCK YOUR SHADOW provides a comprehensive range of services designed to promote holistic well-being. Our core offerings include personalized yoga and meditation programs tailored to individual needs and fitness levels.  We offer a variety of yoga styles, from the restorative practices ideal for stress reduction to more vigorous forms for physical fitness. Our meditation programs integrate ancient techniques with modern mindfulness practices, fostering inner peace and clarity.  We also provide individual and group counselling sessions, focusing on various aspects of mental and emotional well-being, from stress management and anxiety reduction to overcoming trauma and improving relationships. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique aspect of our services is the integration of traditional Assamese healing practices.  We incorporate elements of Ayurveda, the ancient Indian system of medicine, into our therapies and wellness programs. We collaborate with local practitioners to offer specialized treatments like herbal massage and aromatherapy, using locally sourced, organic ingredients. This unique blend of traditional and modern approaches resonates deeply with the local community, providing a familiar yet innovative path to wellness.  We differentiate ourselves further through our rigorous commitment to high-quality training for our therapists and instructors, ensuring the highest standards of care and professionalism.  Our commitment to sustainable practices, including the use of eco-friendly products and the support of local artisans, further strengthens our connection with the community and environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At UNLOCK YOUR SHADOW, we believe that the client experience is paramount.  We cultivate a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where every individual feels comfortable and respected. Our dedicated team of experienced practitioners and wellness professionals strive to provide personalized care, tailoring services to meet the specific needs and preferences of each client.  We prioritize open communication and build strong therapeutic relationships based on trust and mutual understanding. This commitment extends beyond the sessions themselves; we offer ongoing support and resources to help clients maintain their well-being beyond their visits to the center.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our connection with the local community is deeply ingrained in our philosophy.  We actively engage with local organizations and participate in community events to promote wellness and provide access to our services to a wider range of individuals. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we consistently seek opportunities to contribute to the overall well-being of Guwahati. We offer subsidized services for individuals from underprivileged backgrounds and collaborate with local charities to extend our reach and impact.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>UNLOCK YOUR SHADOW envisions becoming a leading holistic wellness destination in Assam, renowned for its exceptional services, commitment to community, and dedication to holistic well-being. We plan to expand our service offerings to include workshops and retreats, providing immersive experiences that promote deeper self-discovery and personal growth.  We are also exploring the development of online platforms to make our services more accessible to a wider audience, both within Guwahati and beyond.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish a network of wellness centers across Assam, bringing the benefits of holistic wellness to communities throughout the state.  We aim to train and empower local practitioners, creating employment opportunities and contributing to the growth of the wellness sector within the region.  We envision a future where UNLOCK YOUR SHADOW becomes a symbol of holistic well-being, not only in Guwahati, but across Assam, promoting a healthier, happier, and more fulfilling life for all.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, our vision is to create a positive ripple effect, empowering individuals to lead healthier, more fulfilling lives and fostering a sense of community and shared well-being throughout Assam. We believe that by investing in the wellness of individuals, we are investing in the future of the community as a whole.  Our commitment to excellence, community engagement, and sustainable practices will guide our journey toward achieving this ambitious yet achievable vision.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7099019755', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:55:20', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(398, 'AROMA\'S', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>AROMA\'s: A Guwahati Fragrance</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, AROMA\'s is more than just a business; it\'s a celebration of the region\'s rich aromatic heritage, blended with modern sensibilities.  We are committed to providing high-quality, locally-sourced products and exceptional customer service, establishing ourselves as a trusted name in the vibrant Guwahati market.  Our dedication to ethical sourcing, sustainable practices, and community engagement sets us apart, fostering strong relationships with both our customers and the wider Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>AROMA\'s specializes in handcrafted aromatic products that capture the essence of Assam. Our core offerings include a diverse range of exquisitely scented candles, meticulously crafted soaps using traditional Assamese oils and botanicals, and luxurious bath and body products infused with locally sourced herbs and essential oils. We source many of our ingredients directly from Assamese farmers and artisans, ensuring both the quality and the ethical sourcing of our raw materials. This commitment to local sourcing not only guarantees superior product quality but also supports the local economy and preserves traditional Assamese craftsmanship.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets AROMA\'s apart is our unique blend of traditional Assamese fragrances and contemporary design.  Our candles, for example, are not only beautifully scented but also aesthetically pleasing, featuring designs inspired by Assamese art and nature.  Our soaps are not just cleansing; they are a sensory experience, incorporating the therapeutic benefits of traditional Assamese herbs and oils.  We also offer customized gift sets, perfect for both personal indulgence and corporate gifting, reflecting the diverse needs of our clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The local market in Guwahati has a growing demand for high-quality, ethically produced, and locally-sourced products.  Consumers are increasingly conscious of the environmental and social impact of their purchases, and AROMA\'s directly addresses this demand by offering products that are both luxurious and responsible. Our commitment to sustainability, evident in our packaging choices and sourcing practices, resonates deeply with this environmentally aware customer base. By focusing on the unique aromatic heritage of Assam, we offer products unavailable elsewhere, filling a gap in the market and providing a unique shopping experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At AROMA\'s, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and personalized attention. Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are always on hand to provide expert advice and assist customers in selecting the perfect products to meet their individual needs and preferences.  We strive to create a welcoming and inviting atmosphere in our store, providing a sensory experience that reflects the essence of our brand.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond exceptional in-store service, we engage with our local community through various initiatives.  We participate in local events and markets, providing opportunities for customers to learn more about our products and the story behind them. We also collaborate with local charities and organizations, contributing a portion of our profits to support worthy causes within the Guwahati community. This commitment to giving back strengthens our ties with the local community and enhances our brand reputation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we utilize various digital platforms to connect with customers, offering convenient online ordering and delivery options.  Our website and social media channels provide a platform for engaging with customers, sharing updates on new products and promotions, and fostering a sense of community around our brand. This multi-faceted approach to customer engagement strengthens brand loyalty and allows us to reach a wider audience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>AROMA\'s has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  We aim to establish ourselves as the leading provider of high-quality, locally-sourced aromatic products in Guwahati and beyond.  Our future plans include expanding our product line to include a wider range of fragrances and product categories, catering to the evolving needs of the market. We are also exploring opportunities for wholesale partnerships with hotels, spas, and other businesses in the region, increasing brand visibility and market penetration.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to investing in sustainable practices and technological advancements to enhance our operational efficiency and minimize our environmental footprint.  This includes exploring eco-friendly packaging solutions and adopting sustainable sourcing practices throughout our supply chain.  Furthermore, we aim to expand our community engagement initiatives, strengthening our commitment to supporting local artisans and giving back to the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish AROMA\'s as a nationally recognized brand, synonymous with quality, ethical sourcing, and authentic Assamese craftsmanship.  We believe that by continuing to focus on providing exceptional products, exceptional service, and building strong relationships with our customers and community, AROMA\'s will not only achieve significant growth but also contribute positively to the economic and social fabric of Guwahati and Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864101222', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:55:28', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(399, 'Rhys Hair Studio', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Rhys Hair Studio: Elevating Haircare in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Rhys Hair Studio is a premier hair salon nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to providing exceptional haircare services in a sophisticated and welcoming environment.  We strive to be more than just a salon; we aim to be a destination where clients feel pampered, understood, and empowered to embrace their unique style. Our commitment to quality, personalized service, and utilizing cutting-edge techniques sets us apart in the vibrant and evolving Guwahati beauty scene.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At Rhys Hair Studio, we offer a comprehensive range of haircare services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele.  Our expertise extends from classic cuts and styles to advanced coloring techniques, including balayage, ombre, and airtouch.  We utilize high-quality, internationally recognized hair products that are carefully selected for their effectiveness and gentle formulas, catering to various hair types and concerns.  Our skilled stylists are adept at creating bespoke looks that flatter individual features and reflect current fashion trends, ensuring our clients always leave feeling confident and refreshed.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond the standard services, we offer specialized treatments such as keratin smoothing, hair botox, and deep conditioning therapies.  These are particularly beneficial in Guwahati\'s climate, helping to combat dryness and damage caused by humidity and sun exposure. We also provide expert advice on hair care routines and product recommendations, empowering clients to maintain healthy and beautiful hair between salon visits.  Our unique selling point lies not only in our technical skills but also in our personalized approach, ensuring each client feels heard and understood throughout their salon experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we recognize the importance of staying ahead of the curve. We continuously invest in advanced training for our stylists, keeping them abreast of the latest techniques and trends in the global hair industry. This ensures we consistently deliver high-quality services that are both innovative and effective, meeting the evolving demands of our sophisticated clientele in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Rhys Hair Studio, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a client walks through our doors, we prioritize creating a warm, inviting, and relaxing atmosphere. Our friendly and knowledgeable staff are committed to providing personalized attention, carefully listening to individual needs and preferences to ensure complete client satisfaction. We strive to build lasting relationships with our clients, fostering trust and loyalty through consistent quality and exceptional care.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We go beyond simply providing hair services; we offer a personalized experience. This includes offering complimentary refreshments, ensuring comfortable seating, and creating a tranquil ambiance to help clients unwind and de-stress. We actively encourage communication and feedback, allowing us to continuously improve and tailor our services to better meet the evolving needs of our community. We are committed to building a strong and positive relationship with our local community through involvement in local events and charitable initiatives, further solidifying our position as a trusted and valued member of Guwahati society.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to hygiene and sanitation is unwavering.  We adhere to strict sterilization protocols, using only high-quality, sanitized equipment and products to ensure a clean and safe environment for all our clients.  This commitment to hygiene reflects our dedication to providing not only beautiful hair but also a worry-free and enjoyable salon experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Rhys Hair Studio has ambitious plans for the future.  We envision expanding our service offerings to include advanced hair extensions and possibly a dedicated product line featuring our own curated blends of natural ingredients. This would allow us to further cater to the specific needs of the Guwahati market, capitalizing on the growing demand for natural and organic haircare products.  We also aim to grow our team, recruiting experienced and passionate stylists who share our commitment to excellence and client satisfaction.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Rhys Hair Studio as the leading hair salon in Guwahati, recognized for its unparalleled expertise, exceptional customer service, and commitment to community engagement.  We plan to achieve this through continuous investment in training, marketing, and community outreach, constantly seeking innovative ways to improve and enhance our offerings. We believe in fostering a strong brand reputation built on trust, quality, and a deep understanding of our client\'s needs, making Rhys Hair Studio the preferred choice for discerning individuals seeking the finest haircare services in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Rhys Hair Studio aims to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a cherished part of the Guwahati community, a place where clients feel welcome, valued, and empowered to embrace their unique beauty.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9365539641', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:55:36', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(400, 'Looks Family Unisex Salon', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Looks Family Unisex Salon: Guwahati\'s Premier Destination for Hair and Beauty</h1>\n\n<p>Looks Family Unisex Salon is a thriving establishment nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam.  We pride ourselves on delivering exceptional hair and beauty services in a welcoming and sophisticated environment, catering to the diverse needs of the Guwahati community.  Recognizing the evolving demands of the local market, we offer a comprehensive range of services that go beyond the typical salon experience, combining traditional techniques with modern trends to provide unparalleled results.  Our commitment to quality, coupled with our dedication to fostering a strong connection with our clients, has quickly established Looks Family Unisex Salon as a preferred destination for families and individuals seeking top-tier hair and beauty care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our success is built upon a foundation of exceeding expectations.  We strive to create a space where each client feels valued, understood, and pampered.  This is achieved through a personalized approach to service, ensuring each client\'s unique needs and preferences are carefully considered.  Unlike many salons that focus solely on aesthetics, we emphasize the importance of hair and skin health, integrating holistic practices into our treatments.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Looks Family Unisex Salon offers a wide spectrum of services designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele.  Our expertise extends from classic haircuts and styling for men and women to intricate bridal hair and makeup services. We utilize only high-quality, internationally recognized products to ensure consistent, superior results.  Our services include:</p> <br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Hair Care:</strong> Haircuts, styling, coloring (including highlights, balayage, and ombre), keratin treatments, hair spa treatments, and extensions.</li>\n  <li><strong>Facial Treatments:</strong> Customized facials catering to different skin types, including cleansing, exfoliation, and moisturizing treatments. We also offer advanced treatments addressing specific skin concerns such as acne, pigmentation, and aging.</li>\n  <li><strong>Makeup Services:</strong> Professional makeup application for everyday wear, special occasions, and bridal events. We offer makeup lessons to enhance clients\' skill and confidence.</li>\n  <li><strong>Manicures and Pedicures:</strong> Classic and specialized manicures and pedicures, incorporating aromatherapy and various nail art techniques.</li>\n  <li><strong>Bridal Services:</strong> Comprehensive bridal packages that encompass hair styling, makeup, and other beauty enhancements for the bride and her entourage.</li>\n</ul> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our commitment to personalized consultations.  Before any service, our highly skilled stylists and beauticians spend time understanding the client\'s needs, preferences, and hair/skin type, ensuring the chosen treatment aligns perfectly with their individual goals.  This ensures a satisfying experience and results that truly enhance the client\'s natural beauty.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Looks Family Unisex Salon, we believe that the customer experience is paramount.  We are committed to creating a warm, inviting, and relaxing atmosphere.  Our team is trained not only in their respective areas of expertise but also in providing exceptional customer service. We strive to make every visit a truly enjoyable and memorable experience.  Our salon boasts a modern and comfortable interior, creating a relaxing ambiance that encourages clients to unwind and enjoy their pampering session.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and mutual support.  We participate in local events, sponsor community causes, and offer special discounts to local residents.  Our focus is not just on providing excellent beauty services but also on being a positive contributor to the vibrant Guwahati community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Looks Family Unisex Salon has ambitious plans for future growth. We aim to expand our service offerings by incorporating advanced beauty technologies and introducing new treatments in response to evolving market trends. This includes exploring collaborations with international beauty brands to bring the latest innovations to our clients in Guwahati.  We also plan to expand our team by recruiting highly skilled professionals and providing them with ongoing training opportunities to maintain the highest standards of expertise.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we envision becoming the leading provider of premium hair and beauty services in Guwahati and beyond. We aim to develop a strong brand reputation built on trust, exceptional quality, and consistent innovation.   Our commitment is to continue delivering exceptional results, fostering strong relationships with our clients, and remaining a valued contributor to the local community.  We firmly believe that through consistent effort and dedication to excellence, Looks Family Unisex Salon will continue to thrive and serve as a beacon of beauty and wellness in Guwahati, Assam.</p> <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8876879911', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 15:55:43', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(401, 'BBLUNT Dispur', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>BBLUNT Dispur: Elevating Hair Care in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>BBLUNT Dispur, located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, represents a significant advancement in the city\'s hair care landscape.  We offer a premium salon experience, blending international expertise with a deep understanding of the unique needs and preferences of the Assamese clientele.  Unlike many salons that offer generalized services, BBLUNT Dispur focuses on providing personalized, high-quality hair care solutions, utilizing advanced techniques and premium products tailored to individual hair types and concerns. Our commitment to excellence, coupled with our dedication to fostering a welcoming and sophisticated atmosphere, positions us as a leader in the Guwahati beauty industry.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our presence in Dispur underscores our belief in the vibrant and growing market for sophisticated beauty services in Guwahati. The city\'s dynamic social and economic landscape demands high-quality beauty solutions, a need we actively fulfill.  By combining professional expertise with a modern and stylish salon environment, BBLUNT Dispur caters to a discerning clientele seeking both exceptional results and a luxurious experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>BBLUNT Dispur offers a comprehensive range of hair care services, encompassing everything from classic cuts and styles to advanced color treatments and hair restoration therapies. Our highly skilled stylists are trained in the latest international techniques and utilize premium BBLUNT products, renowned for their quality and effectiveness.  We specialize in personalized consultations, carefully assessing individual hair needs before recommending tailored solutions.  This personalized approach ensures optimal results, addressing concerns such as hair fall, dryness, damage, and color correction. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to customized solutions.  We recognize that hair types and concerns vary considerably, influenced by factors such as climate, lifestyle, and genetic predisposition.  The humid climate of Assam, for instance, requires specific care to maintain healthy, manageable hair.  BBLUNT Dispur addresses this by providing specialized treatments designed to combat common hair issues prevalent in the region, ensuring lasting results and client satisfaction. We also offer a curated selection of BBLUNT retail products, allowing clients to maintain their salon-quality results at home.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond the technical expertise, we differentiate ourselves through our commitment to using high-quality, ethically sourced products that are safe and effective.  This commitment to quality extends to our hygiene and sanitation practices, adhering to the strictest industry standards to ensure a safe and comfortable environment for all our clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At BBLUNT Dispur, we strive to create a truly memorable salon experience.  Our approach is centered around personalized attention, building a rapport with each client to understand their individual needs and preferences.  From the moment a client walks in, they are greeted with warm hospitality and a relaxing atmosphere. We believe that a positive customer experience goes beyond just the service itself; it encompasses the entire interaction, from consultation to styling and after-care advice.  We aim to create an environment where clients feel pampered and valued.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our dedication extends beyond individual interactions to engaging with the broader Guwahati community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting causes that align with our values.  This commitment to community engagement strengthens our connection with our clientele and fosters a sense of shared values and purpose. We believe in giving back to the community that supports our business.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>BBLUNT Dispur envisions becoming the leading hair salon in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional service, quality, and community engagement.  Our growth strategy focuses on continuously enhancing our service offerings, expanding our team of skilled stylists, and investing in cutting-edge technology and training. We plan to introduce innovative hair care solutions tailored to the evolving needs of our clientele, staying at the forefront of industry trends and advancements. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals encompass establishing a strong brand presence in Guwahati and potentially expanding to other locations within Assam.  We aim to become a recognized employer of choice, providing opportunities for career development and growth within the beauty industry.  We are committed to sustainability, incorporating environmentally conscious practices into our operations, minimizing our environmental footprint, and promoting responsible consumption of products.  BBLUNT Dispur is not just a salon; it is a commitment to excellence, community, and sustainable growth within the vibrant beauty scene of Assam.</p> <br> <br>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7099007111', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 16:25:11', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(402, 'Trendz Herbal Beauty Care (only for ladies and kids)', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>Trendz Herbal Beauty Care: Nurturing Natural Beauty in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Trendz Herbal Beauty Care is a premier beauty and wellness destination exclusively for ladies and children in Guwahati, Assam.  We are committed to providing high-quality, natural herbal beauty solutions tailored to the specific needs and preferences of the Assamese community.  Our unique approach blends traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern beauty techniques, offering a holistic experience that celebrates natural beauty and well-being. In a market increasingly dominated by chemical-laden products, Trendz stands out as a beacon for those seeking gentle, effective, and ethically sourced beauty care. This commitment to natural ingredients, combined with our personalized service, positions us as a significant contributor to the growing health and wellness sector in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to sourcing locally and ethically is a cornerstone of our business philosophy. We believe in supporting local farmers and artisans, ensuring the sustainability of our supply chain and the economic empowerment of our community.  This commitment not only reflects our values but also ensures the highest quality and freshness of our ingredients, resulting in superior products and services. This resonates deeply with our clientele who increasingly seek products that align with their values of ethical consumption and environmental responsibility.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Trendz Herbal Beauty Care offers a comprehensive range of services and products designed to enhance beauty and promote overall well-being. Our primary services include a wide array of facials customized to different skin types, using 100% natural ingredients like turmeric, neem, and other locally sourced herbs.  We also provide specialized hair treatments incorporating traditional Ayurvedic techniques to nourish and revitalize hair, promoting healthy growth and shine.  Our range of body therapies includes herbal massages tailored to relieve stress and tension, utilizing therapeutic oils and techniques.  In addition to these services, we offer a carefully curated collection of herbal skincare products, including face masks, cleansers, toners, and moisturizers, all formulated with natural ingredients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our unwavering commitment to natural, herbal ingredients and our personalized approach to beauty care. Unlike many commercial beauty salons, we take the time to understand each client\'s individual needs and concerns, tailoring our services and product recommendations accordingly.  This personalized approach, coupled with the inherent benefits of herbal remedies, distinguishes us in a market increasingly focused on quick fixes and mass-produced products.  We understand the specific climate and lifestyle challenges faced by women and children in Assam and have developed our products and services to address those needs effectively. This understanding of our local market needs is a major driver of our success.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Trendz Herbal Beauty Care, we prioritize providing a truly exceptional customer experience. Our dedicated and highly trained staff are committed to ensuring that every client feels pampered, relaxed, and valued.  We foster a warm and welcoming atmosphere, creating a sanctuary where clients can escape the stresses of daily life and focus on their well-being. We believe that building strong relationships with our clients is key to our success, and we strive to create a loyal customer base through exceptional service and genuine care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond providing excellent services. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting workshops on natural beauty and wellness, and partnering with local charities. This commitment reflects our belief in giving back to the community that has supported us, strengthening our bonds and reinforcing our position as a valued member of the Guwahati business landscape.  We are also committed to transparency and education, ensuring that our clients understand the ingredients we use and the benefits of our natural approach to beauty.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Trendz Herbal Beauty Care has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We envision expanding our service offerings to include additional specialized treatments and developing a wider range of herbal beauty products catering to a broader audience.  We are also exploring opportunities for franchising, enabling us to bring our unique brand of natural beauty care to other parts of Assam and beyond.  This expansion will be guided by our unwavering commitment to quality, ethical sourcing, and exceptional customer service.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Trendz Herbal Beauty Care as the leading provider of natural beauty care in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, ethical practices, and its contribution to the well-being of the community. We will continue to invest in research and development, exploring new and innovative ways to harness the power of nature to enhance beauty and well-being.  This will involve strengthening our partnerships with local farmers and artisans, ensuring the sustainability of our supply chain and the continued economic empowerment of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Trendz Herbal Beauty Care is more than just a beauty salon; it\'s a holistic wellness destination that celebrates natural beauty and empowers women and children to embrace their inherent radiance.  We are confident that our commitment to quality, ethical practices, and community engagement will ensure our continued success and enable us to achieve our ambitious vision for the future.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864090380', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 16:10:11', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(403, 'N3', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>N3: Revolutionizing Business in Guwahati, Assam</h1>\n\n<p>N3 is a dynamic and innovative business enterprise based in Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to providing cutting-edge solutions to the diverse needs of the region.  We are committed to fostering growth and progress within the local business community, offering a unique blend of expertise, technology, and personalized service.  Our approach distinguishes us from traditional businesses, placing a strong emphasis on understanding the specific challenges and opportunities prevalent in the Assam market. We leverage this understanding to deliver tailored solutions that drive tangible results for our clients. Our commitment to sustainable practices and community engagement further solidifies our position as a responsible and impactful organization within the heart of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>N3’s core offerings are tailored to meet the evolving demands of the Guwahati business landscape.  While the precise services may vary depending on client needs, our focus areas include strategic business consulting, digital marketing and branding solutions, and technological integration services.  Our strategic consulting arm provides in-depth market analysis, operational efficiency assessments, and customized business plans designed to help businesses navigate the complexities of the local market and achieve sustainable growth. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our digital marketing and branding solutions provide businesses with a powerful online presence. We understand the unique characteristics of the Assam market and leverage digital channels to effectively reach target audiences. Our services include search engine optimization (SEO), social media management, content creation, and branding strategy development, all meticulously crafted to resonate with the local culture and preferences.  This ensures not only online visibility but also impactful brand engagement.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, N3 offers advanced technological integration services, helping businesses seamlessly incorporate innovative technologies into their operations.  This may include the implementation of enterprise resource planning (ERP) systems, customer relationship management (CRM) tools, or customized software solutions to streamline workflows, boost efficiency, and enhance overall productivity. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to integrate these solutions in a culturally sensitive and practical manner, ensuring ease of use and maximum impact for our clients. This ensures that technological advancements don\'t just create efficiency, but also build upon the existing fabric of the Assam business world.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At N3, we believe that exceptional customer experience is paramount. Our approach transcends a simple transactional relationship; we strive to build long-term partnerships with our clients, understanding their unique aspirations and challenges. This personalized service ensures that every solution is tailored to meet specific requirements and aligns seamlessly with the client\'s overall business strategy.  We maintain open communication channels, providing regular updates and consistent support throughout the process. Our team is highly responsive and readily available to address any queries or concerns.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets us apart is our commitment to community engagement. We actively participate in local initiatives and strive to give back to the community that has supported our growth. This commitment is not merely a marketing tactic; it is integral to our ethos.  By actively participating in and supporting the development of the Guwahati business community, we demonstrate our commitment to sustainable and responsible business practices. This approach allows us to build stronger relationships, foster trust, and contribute positively to the overall economic well-being of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>N3’s future vision is anchored in continued growth and expansion within the Assam market. We plan to expand our service offerings to encompass an even wider range of business solutions, continually adapting to the dynamic needs of the local market.  We also aim to strengthen our technology capabilities, embracing emerging technologies to provide even more innovative and effective solutions for our clients. This commitment to innovation will ensure that we remain at the forefront of the business landscape in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond service expansion, N3 envisions fostering a vibrant and supportive network within the Guwahati business community. We aim to become a leading resource and platform for collaboration, knowledge sharing, and mentorship. By actively engaging with other businesses, entrepreneurs, and industry stakeholders, we aim to contribute to a more robust and sustainable business ecosystem in Assam. This collective approach to growth underlines our long-term commitment to the prosperity of the region. We believe in collaborative success, where the strength of our network contributes to the individual strength of each member.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, N3 is more than just a business; it is a partner in progress, dedicated to empowering businesses in Guwahati and driving positive change within the Assam business landscape.  Our commitment to personalized service, community engagement, and technological innovation sets us apart, ensuring that we remain a valued and trusted resource for businesses of all sizes throughout the region.  We strive to be a driving force behind sustainable economic growth in Assam and look forward to collaborating with other organizations to achieve this shared vision.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 16:20:12', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(404, 'L\'Oréal Avalon Unisex Hair & Beauty Studio', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>L\'Oréal Avalon Unisex Hair & Beauty Studio: Guwahati\'s Premier Destination for Hair and Beauty</h1>\n\n<p>L\'Oréal Avalon Unisex Hair & Beauty Studio stands as a beacon of style and sophistication in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam.  We are more than just a salon; we are a sanctuary of self-care, a place where individuals can rediscover their beauty and confidence.  Our commitment to exceptional service, coupled with the use of high-quality L\'Oréal products, sets us apart in the competitive Guwahati beauty market.  We pride ourselves on offering a uniquely personalized experience that caters to the diverse needs and preferences of our valued clientele.  We understand the specific beauty needs of the Assamese community and strive to blend international expertise with a deep appreciation for local traditions and preferences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Fusion of International Expertise and Local Understanding</h2>\n\n<p>L\'Oréal Avalon offers a comprehensive range of hair and beauty services tailored to meet the dynamic demands of the Guwahati market. Our services encompass a wide spectrum, from classic haircuts and styling for both men and women, to advanced hair treatments including keratin smoothing, color correction, and nourishing hair spa treatments. We utilize the latest techniques and technologies, ensuring consistently exceptional results.  Our skilled stylists are adept at creating both contemporary and traditional looks, understanding the unique preferences of our diverse clientele. </p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond hair care, we provide a complete suite of beauty services. This includes professional makeup application for special occasions, skincare consultations and treatments, manicures and pedicures, and threading and waxing services. We are dedicated to using only high-quality, internationally recognized products from L\'Oréal and other leading brands.  Our commitment to using premium products, while maintaining competitive pricing, makes our services accessible and desirable to a wide range of customers.  This, combined with our dedication to staying abreast of the latest trends in hair and beauty, makes us the preferred choice for discerning individuals in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets us apart is our understanding of the local market. We recognize the importance of accommodating diverse skin tones and hair textures prevalent in Assam, offering customized solutions that address specific needs and preferences.  We have invested in extensive training for our staff to ensure they possess the expertise necessary to expertly handle various hair types and skin conditions common in the region. This cultural sensitivity and tailored approach to our services are key elements that strengthen our connection with the Guwahati community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Where Professionalism Meets Personalized Care</h2>\n\n<p>At L\'Oréal Avalon, customer experience is paramount.  We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and relaxing environment where each client feels valued and pampered. From the moment they step into our studio, our dedicated team provides attentive and personalized service, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable experience.  We maintain open communication, actively listening to our clients\' needs and preferences to deliver precisely what they desire.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community within our studio.  Regular client appreciation events, personalized recommendations, and consistent follow-up enhance our connection and solidify our commitment to exceptional customer service. We also proactively seek customer feedback, using it to continuously improve our services and maintain the highest standards of quality.  This dedication to customer satisfaction is not merely a business strategy; it is a core value that guides our every interaction.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to hygiene and safety is unwavering. We adhere to the strictest sanitation protocols, using only sterilized equipment and maintaining a clean and well-maintained studio.  We prioritize the health and well-being of our clients, using only high-quality, safe products, and employing best practices in all our services.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Our Reach and Reinforcing Our Commitment</h2>\n\n<p>L\'Oréal Avalon has ambitious plans for future growth. We envision expanding our service offerings to include advanced aesthetic treatments and possibly a retail section featuring premium hair and skincare products.  We are constantly exploring opportunities to enhance our capabilities and provide even more comprehensive beauty solutions to our valued clientele. We also plan to increase our presence in the digital space, investing in a strong online presence and utilizing digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish L\'Oréal Avalon as the leading unisex hair and beauty studio in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional quality, unparalleled service, and deep connection with the local community.  We believe in investing in our employees through ongoing professional development and training, ensuring they remain at the forefront of industry advancements.  This commitment to excellence extends to all aspects of our operation, from the services we provide to the ambiance we cultivate, ensuring that L\'Oréal Avalon continues to be a sanctuary of beauty and rejuvenation for the people of Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We are confident that our unwavering commitment to quality, our deep understanding of the local market, and our dedication to exceptional customer service will drive our continued success and establish L\'Oréal Avalon as a prominent fixture in the Guwahati beauty landscape for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002474373', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 16:25:19', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(405, 'BG\'s Unisex Salon by Bikash and Gitanjali', 'Beauty Parlors', '', '<h1>BG\'s Unisex Salon by Bikash and Gitanjali</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, BG\'s Unisex Salon by Bikash and Gitanjali stands as a premier destination for sophisticated hair and beauty services.  Since its inception, BG\'s has distinguished itself within the vibrant Assamese business landscape, not merely as a salon, but as a community hub where personalized attention and exceptional skill converge to create an unparalleled customer experience.  Our commitment to using high-quality products, coupled with our team\'s profound understanding of diverse beauty standards, sets us apart and contributes to our growing reputation as a trusted name in Guwahati\'s beauty industry.  We\'re more than just a salon; we\'re a reflection of the city\'s dynamic spirit, offering a blend of traditional Assamese hospitality with contemporary style.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive range of hair and beauty treatments designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clientele.  From classic haircuts and styling to advanced coloring techniques, including balayage and ombre, we offer services tailored to individual preferences and hair types.  We excel in providing traditional Assamese bridal makeup and hairstyling, integrating modern trends with time-honored techniques.  Our skincare services include facials, customized to address specific skin concerns, and body treatments that promote relaxation and rejuvenation.  We also offer a selection of high-quality hair care products, carefully chosen for their effectiveness and suitability for the Assamese climate.  A unique selling point is our commitment to using organic and locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, reflecting our dedication to both customer well-being and supporting local businesses.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly distinguishes BG\'s is our unwavering dedication to providing an exceptional customer experience.  We believe that a salon visit should be more than just a service; it should be an experience of pampering, relaxation, and self-care.  Our friendly and highly skilled team takes pride in creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, engaging each customer with personalized attention and genuine care.  We actively listen to our clients\' needs and preferences, tailoring each treatment to achieve the desired results.   Beyond individual services, we actively connect with the local community through regular workshops, offering hair care and beauty tips, and participating in local events, further strengthening our bonds with our valued clientele. This approach has fostered a loyal customer base, reflecting the trust and appreciation we have earned within the Guwahati community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>BG\'s Unisex Salon envisions a future of continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market.  Our immediate plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate advanced techniques and treatments, such as keratin treatments and microblading, to meet evolving customer demands.  We are committed to ongoing training and development for our team, ensuring they remain at the forefront of industry trends and possess the skills to deliver exceptional results.  In the long term, we aim to establish BG\'s as a leading beauty brand in Assam, possibly through the establishment of additional salons in other key locations across the state.  Our ultimate goal is to not only provide high-quality beauty services but to also become a recognized symbol of Assamese excellence in the beauty industry, further contributing to the economic growth of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to sustainability and environmental responsibility is another key element of our long-term vision. We are actively exploring ways to minimize our environmental impact, including using eco-friendly products and implementing waste reduction strategies. We believe in fostering a business model that benefits not only our clients but also the environment and the broader community.  This ethos guides our decision-making process and contributes to our overall sustainability and long-term success.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>BG\'s Unisex Salon by Bikash and Gitanjali is more than just a business; it\'s a testament to our passion for beauty and our dedication to serving the Guwahati community. We are proud of our achievements and are excited about the future, confident in our ability to continue exceeding expectations and maintaining our position as a leading beauty destination in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We invite you to experience the difference at BG\'s Unisex Salon. We are confident that you will leave feeling refreshed, rejuvenated, and truly beautiful.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6001936692', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 16:25:26', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
