(622, 'Nirmaan Rehabilitation Facility Guwahati', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h2>Nirmaan Rehabilitation Facility: Guwahati\'s Leading Rehab Center</h2><p>Nirmaan Rehabilitation Facility, located at Punjabari, 41-A, Namghar Path in Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of hope for individuals struggling with substance abuse and addiction. We are a leading Nasha Mukti Kendra, providing comprehensive alcohol and drug treatment services tailored to the unique needs of the Assamese community. Our commitment to holistic care, coupled with our deep understanding of the local context, sets us apart in the region\'s rehabilitation landscape. We recognize the sensitive nature of addiction and offer a supportive, non-judgmental environment where individuals can embark on their journey towards recovery with dignity and confidence. We believe in empowering individuals to reclaim their lives and contribute positively to their families and society.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Core Services and Products</h2><p>Nirmaan offers a wide spectrum of evidence-based treatment programs for alcohol and drug addiction. Our services are designed to address the multifaceted nature of addiction, encompassing medical detoxification, individual and group therapy, family counseling, and aftercare support. Our medical detoxification programs are carefully managed by experienced medical professionals, ensuring the comfort and safety of our patients. We offer a range of therapeutic approaches, including cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT), motivational interviewing, and relapse prevention strategies, tailored to individual needs and preferences. We understand that addiction often impacts families, so we incorporate family therapy into our treatment plans, empowering families to support their loved ones throughout the recovery process.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>One of our unique selling points is our strong emphasis on cultural sensitivity. We are deeply aware of the cultural nuances and social dynamics within the Assamese community and integrate these considerations into our treatment approach. This understanding allows us to build trust with our patients and create a culturally appropriate and supportive environment conducive to healing and recovery. Further distinguishing us is our comprehensive aftercare program, designed to support individuals long after they complete their residential treatment. We provide ongoing support, relapse prevention strategies, and connections to community resources, ensuring a smooth transition back into everyday life. This focus on long-term support is crucial to maintaining sobriety and fostering sustainable recovery.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Our services directly address a critical need in the Guwahati area. Substance abuse presents a significant challenge in Assam, and access to quality rehabilitation services remains a critical concern for many. Nirmaan fills this gap by offering accessible, high-quality care in a setting that prioritizes patient well-being and confidentiality. The center addresses the stigma associated with addiction by providing a compassionate and supportive atmosphere where individuals feel safe to share their struggles and receive the help they need.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Customer Experience</h2><p>At Nirmaan, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of successful rehabilitation. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where patients feel respected, understood, and empowered. Our staff, comprised of experienced therapists, counselors, medical professionals, and support staff, are dedicated to providing compassionate, individualized care. We prioritize open communication and actively involve patients in the development of their personalized treatment plans. Regular feedback sessions ensure that our services are meeting the unique needs of each individual. Our commitment to confidentiality and ethical practice builds trust and allows patients to feel safe sharing their vulnerabilities.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Nirmaan goes beyond merely providing treatment. We actively connect with the local community through outreach programs, workshops, and educational initiatives to raise awareness about substance abuse and promote help-seeking behavior. We collaborate with local organizations, community leaders, and healthcare providers to create a comprehensive support network for individuals and families affected by addiction. This proactive community engagement is fundamental to our mission of creating a healthier and more supportive society.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Future Vision</h2><p>Nirmaan Rehabilitation Facility envisions becoming the leading provider of comprehensive addiction treatment services in Assam. We plan to expand our services by offering specialized programs to address specific addictions and co-occurring disorders. We also aim to expand our outreach initiatives to reach more communities and individuals in need. Further development includes establishing partnerships with other healthcare providers and organizations to create a more integrated approach to addiction treatment. Investing in cutting-edge treatment modalities and technologies will ensure our services remain at the forefront of the field.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Our long-term goal is to contribute to a significant reduction in substance abuse within the Assam region. By fostering collaboration, promoting public awareness, and providing exceptional care, Nirmaan seeks to create a lasting positive impact on the lives of individuals and families affected by addiction. We are committed to establishing a sustainable and impactful organization that makes a tangible difference in the fight against addiction. We believe that by creating a supportive community and offering evidence-based care, we can empower individuals to lead fulfilling and productive lives free from the grip of substance abuse. The ultimate aim is to contribute to a healthier and more resilient society for all.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p>', 'Punjabari, 41-A, Namghar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7099008996', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:40:12', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(623, 'Willing-Way Wellness Society - Panjabari', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h2>Willing-Way Wellness Society - Nisha Mukti Kendra</h2><p>Located at H.No 73, Kailash Nagar Path, Panjabari Rd, near S.B.I, Guwahati, Assam, Willing-Way Wellness Society – Nisha Mukti Kendra stands as a beacon of hope and healing in the region. We are not merely a rehabilitation center; we are a comprehensive wellness society dedicated to providing holistic and compassionate care to individuals struggling with addiction and mental health challenges. Our commitment to individualized treatment plans, coupled with a strong emphasis on community engagement, distinguishes us within the Assam landscape and sets us apart as the leading rehabilitation center in Guwahati.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Core Services and Products</h2><p>Nisha Mukti Kendra offers a spectrum of evidence-based services designed to address the multifaceted nature of addiction and mental health issues. Our primary services include detoxification programs tailored to individual needs, encompassing medical supervision and supportive care to manage withdrawal symptoms safely and effectively. Beyond detoxification, we provide comprehensive therapy, encompassing individual counseling, group therapy, family therapy, and cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT). Our therapies are designed to address underlying psychological issues that contribute to addiction and mental health problems, promoting long-term recovery and relapse prevention.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>A unique aspect of our approach is the integration of traditional Assamese healing practices, where appropriate, into our treatment modalities. This holistic approach recognizes the importance of cultural sensitivity and incorporates practices that resonate with the local community, fostering a sense of comfort and connection during the recovery journey. We also offer vocational training and life skills development programs to equip individuals with the tools necessary for successful reintegration into society, providing them with opportunities for sustained recovery and meaningful employment.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Recognizing the specific needs of the Assamese population, our programs are designed to be culturally sensitive and linguistically accessible. Our team comprises experienced and qualified professionals who understand the cultural nuances of the region and are proficient in Assamese and other local languages, facilitating effective communication and building rapport with clients.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Customer Experience</h2><p>At Willing-Way Wellness Society, we prioritize a client-centered approach, focusing on building trusting relationships based on empathy, respect, and understanding. We believe that recovery is a journey, not a destination, and our commitment extends beyond the duration of formal treatment. We offer ongoing support groups, aftercare programs, and relapse prevention planning to ensure lasting recovery and positive life changes.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Our commitment to providing exceptional customer service extends to fostering strong relationships with the local community. We actively engage in outreach programs, conducting awareness campaigns on addiction and mental health issues. We work collaboratively with local organizations, healthcare providers, and community leaders to raise awareness and reduce stigma surrounding these crucial health concerns.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Our facility itself is designed to be a welcoming and therapeutic environment. We strive to create a safe and supportive atmosphere where individuals feel comfortable and empowered to participate fully in their recovery process. Client feedback is actively sought and incorporated into program development and improvements, ensuring we continuously adapt to meet evolving needs.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Future Vision</h2><p>Willing-Way Wellness Society envisions a future where addiction and mental health challenges are addressed with compassion, understanding, and accessible, high-quality care. We plan to expand our services to include more specialized programs addressing specific addictions and co-occurring disorders, ensuring we can cater to the diverse needs of the community.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Our future plans involve strengthening our community partnerships and expanding our outreach programs to reach more individuals in need. This includes collaborating with schools, workplaces, and community centers to provide education and prevention programs, addressing the issue of addiction and mental health at its root. We also aim to invest in advanced technology and training to enhance the quality and effectiveness of our treatment programs.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Long-term, we aspire to become a leading center of excellence for addiction and mental health treatment in Assam, serving as a model for other rehabilitation centers across the region. We aim to contribute to a significant reduction in the stigma associated with addiction and mental health, promoting a culture of understanding and support within the community. Through continuous innovation, commitment to quality, and unwavering dedication to our clients, Willing-Way Wellness Society is poised to make a lasting positive impact on the lives of individuals and families in Assam.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p>', 'H.No 73, Kailash Nagar Path, Panjabari Rd, near S.B.I', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8404007037', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:40:21', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(624, 'Revival Wellness Society(AC)-Best rehabilitation centre|De-addiction centre|Nasha Mukti Kendra|Drug & Alcohol treatment', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Revival Wellness Society (AC) - Your Path to Recovery</h1>\n\n<p>Revival Wellness Society (AC), located at House No-27, Beharbari, Sonkuchi Path, near Sonkuchi Temple, stands as a beacon of hope in Assam\'s fight against substance abuse.  We are a comprehensive rehabilitation and de-addiction center, operating as a Nasha Mukti Kendra, dedicated to providing holistic and individualized treatment for individuals struggling with drug and alcohol addiction.  Our commitment to compassionate care, evidence-based therapies, and community engagement sets us apart in the local landscape, offering a much-needed specialized service within the region.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the growing prevalence of substance abuse issues in Assam and the limited access to quality rehabilitation services, Revival Wellness Society (AC) was established to bridge this critical gap. We understand that addiction is a complex issue requiring a multi-faceted approach, and we are committed to providing a safe, supportive, and effective environment for individuals seeking recovery. Our location in Sonkuchi, while offering a peaceful retreat from the pressures of urban life, is also easily accessible, ensuring convenient access to our services for those in need.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Revival Wellness Society (AC) offers a comprehensive range of services tailored to the unique needs of each individual. Our primary services include medically supervised detoxification, individual and group therapy sessions, family counseling, and aftercare planning.  We employ evidence-based therapeutic modalities such as Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT), Dialectical Behavior Therapy (DBT), and motivational interviewing to address the underlying psychological and behavioral factors contributing to addiction.  Our skilled team includes medical professionals, psychiatrists, psychologists, counselors, and social workers, each dedicated to providing compassionate and professional care.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>A unique aspect of our program is our strong emphasis on holistic wellness. We believe that recovery is not just about abstaining from substances but also about fostering physical, mental, and spiritual well-being.  This is reflected in our incorporation of yoga, meditation, and other holistic practices into our treatment plans.  Further differentiating us is our culturally sensitive approach, designed to respect and integrate the unique socio-cultural contexts of our clients, ensuring a treatment experience that is both effective and comfortable.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>We understand that access to quality addiction treatment is often hindered by financial constraints.  Therefore, we strive to make our services accessible to as many individuals as possible, offering flexible payment options and working with insurance providers whenever possible. This commitment to accessibility directly responds to the critical need for affordable and effective rehabilitation options in the local community.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Revival Wellness Society (AC), we prioritize creating a safe, confidential, and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable and empowered to embark on their journey to recovery. We believe that a strong therapeutic relationship is the cornerstone of successful treatment, and our team is committed to building trust and rapport with each client. We maintain strict confidentiality, ensuring that all interactions are kept private and respectful.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to personalized care is evident in our individualized treatment plans. We conduct thorough assessments to understand each client\'s unique needs, history, and goals, developing a tailored plan that addresses their specific challenges.  Regular progress reviews ensure that the plan remains relevant and effective throughout the recovery process. We also extend our support to families, offering education and guidance to help them understand and support their loved ones\' recovery journey.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>We foster a strong sense of community within our center, encouraging peer support and creating opportunities for clients to connect with others who understand their struggles.  This supportive environment plays a vital role in fostering hope, resilience, and long-term recovery. We also actively engage with the local community through awareness campaigns and educational initiatives, aiming to reduce the stigma surrounding addiction and promote early intervention.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Revival Wellness Society (AC) envisions becoming a leading rehabilitation and de-addiction center in Assam, known for its high-quality services, compassionate care, and commitment to community engagement. We plan to expand our service offerings, potentially incorporating specialized programs for specific addictions or co-occurring disorders.  Investing in advanced therapeutic technologies and training for our staff will remain a key priority to ensure that we remain at the forefront of addiction treatment.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>We aim to expand our outreach programs to reach more individuals in need, including those in remote areas.  We also plan to develop strong partnerships with local healthcare providers, community organizations, and government agencies to strengthen our collaborative efforts in combating substance abuse. Our long-term goal is to contribute significantly to the reduction of substance abuse prevalence in Assam and to improve the lives of individuals and families affected by addiction.</p>\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment is unwavering: to provide a transformative experience, leading individuals towards lasting recovery and a healthier, more fulfilling life. Revival Wellness Society (AC) is more than just a rehabilitation center; it is a symbol of hope and a testament to the transformative power of compassion, evidence-based treatment, and community support.</p>', 'House No-27, Beharbari, Sonkuchi Path, near Sonkuchi Temple', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8638336973', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:40:29', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(625, 'NIRMAAN REHABILITATION FACILITY', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>NIRMAAN REHABILITATION FACILITY</h1>\n\n<p>NIRMAAN Rehabilitation Facility, located at Niharika Bye Lane, Panjabari, Namghar Path, opposite the masjid, stands as a beacon of hope and healing in the heart of Assam.  We are a dedicated rehabilitation center committed to providing comprehensive and compassionate care to individuals struggling with a range of physical and cognitive challenges.  Recognizing the significant need for specialized rehabilitation services in the region, NIRMAAN has been established to bridge the existing gap and deliver high-quality care within a culturally sensitive and supportive environment.  Our unique approach blends evidence-based therapies with a holistic philosophy, fostering a patient-centered journey towards recovery and improved quality of life.  This sets us apart from generic rehabilitation centers and positions us as a vital asset to the growing healthcare landscape of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services are designed to address a wide spectrum of needs. We offer a comprehensive range of therapies, including physiotherapy, occupational therapy, speech therapy, and cognitive rehabilitation. Our physiotherapy services encompass a variety of techniques aimed at restoring physical function, reducing pain, and improving mobility.  Occupational therapy focuses on enhancing daily living skills and promoting independence.  Speech therapy assists individuals in improving communication and swallowing skills.  Cognitive rehabilitation programs are tailored to address cognitive impairments, enhancing memory, attention, and problem-solving abilities.  A key differentiator for NIRMAAN is our personalized approach; we conduct thorough assessments to create individualized treatment plans that address the unique needs and goals of each patient. This customized care ensures maximum effectiveness and fosters a sense of empowerment throughout the rehabilitation process.  We strive to meet the local market need for accessible, high-quality rehabilitation services, particularly in underserved communities, filling a critical gap in healthcare provision across Assam. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At NIRMAAN, we understand that rehabilitation extends beyond clinical interventions.  Our commitment to exceptional customer experience is paramount. We believe in fostering a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment where patients feel comfortable, respected, and empowered.  Our dedicated team of skilled therapists and support staff work collaboratively to provide empathetic and attentive care.  We actively involve family members and caregivers in the treatment process, recognizing their vital role in the patient’s journey.  Regular communication and progress updates are integral to our approach, ensuring transparency and fostering trust. We go beyond simply providing clinical care; we actively engage with the local community through awareness programs, workshops, and collaborations with other healthcare providers.  This community engagement allows us to contribute to a broader understanding of rehabilitation needs and promote overall well-being within the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>NIRMAAN’s future vision extends beyond providing immediate care. We are committed to continuous improvement and expansion to better serve the growing needs of the community.  We plan to introduce specialized programs in areas such as neurological rehabilitation and pediatric rehabilitation, further strengthening our capacity to serve a wider range of patients.  Investing in advanced technologies and training for our staff will also be a key priority, ensuring that NIRMAAN remains at the forefront of rehabilitation practices.  We envision establishing partnerships with local hospitals and medical institutions to create a seamless referral system, improving access to comprehensive care.  Moreover, we aspire to become a recognized center of excellence for rehabilitation in Assam, attracting healthcare professionals and driving innovation in the field. This expansion will enable us to not only increase our patient capacity, but also to conduct research and contribute to the wider body of knowledge surrounding rehabilitation practices, making a significant contribution to the overall health and wellbeing of the Assamese population.  Our long-term goal is to establish NIRMAAN as a leading rehabilitation facility, renowned for its quality of care, compassionate approach, and significant impact on the lives of those we serve.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, NIRMAAN Rehabilitation Facility is more than just a rehabilitation center; it is a symbol of hope, healing, and progress within the community.  Our dedication to personalized care, coupled with our commitment to community engagement and continuous improvement, ensures that we are well-positioned to meet the evolving needs of the Assam region and establish ourselves as a leader in the field of rehabilitation.  We are confident that NIRMAAN will continue to positively impact the lives of countless individuals, promoting recovery, restoring independence, and enriching the lives of those entrusted to our care.</p> <br> <br>', 'niharika bye lane, Panjabari, Namghar Path, opposite masjid', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8253854859', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:45:21', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(626, 'Protisthaa Wellness Society', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Protisthaa Wellness Society: Nurturing Holistic Wellbeing in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Protisthaa Wellness Society, nestled at House No. 3A, By Lane 3, Juripar Path, near CAPUCHIN House, is a pioneering wellness center dedicated to promoting holistic health and wellbeing within the vibrant community of Assam.  We recognize the unique needs and cultural landscape of our region and have carefully crafted our services to address these specific demands, offering a distinctive approach to wellness that integrates traditional practices with modern techniques. Our commitment to personalized care, community engagement, and sustainable practices sets us apart in the local market and establishes us as a trusted resource for individuals seeking comprehensive wellbeing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike generic wellness centers, Protisthaa Wellness Society emphasizes a deeply personalized approach.  We understand that wellness is not a one-size-fits-all solution.  Our comprehensive assessments go beyond surface-level understanding, considering the individual\'s unique physical, mental, and emotional needs within the context of their lifestyle and cultural background. This holistic approach allows us to develop customized wellness plans that are effective, sustainable, and culturally sensitive.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Protisthaa Wellness Society offers a diverse range of services designed to address various aspects of wellbeing. Our core offerings include personalized yoga and meditation programs adapted to individual needs and fitness levels.  These programs emphasize mindful movement, stress reduction, and cultivating inner peace. We also provide nutritional counseling sessions, focusing on incorporating locally sourced, seasonal ingredients into healthy, balanced diets.  Our expert nutritionists work closely with clients to create dietary plans that align with their cultural preferences and specific health goals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond individual programs, we offer group workshops and community events focusing on various aspects of wellbeing. These interactive sessions provide opportunities for learning, sharing experiences, and building a supportive community focused on holistic health. We also offer specialized workshops tailored to specific needs, such as stress management for working professionals or mindful parenting techniques for parents. These workshops are designed to be practical, engaging, and empowering, promoting positive lifestyle changes within the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Protisthaa Wellness Society is our integration of traditional Assamese healing practices with modern wellness techniques. We incorporate elements of Ayurveda and traditional Assamese medicinal plants into our programs, recognizing the rich history and wisdom embedded within our local heritage. This unique blend ensures that our services are both effective and deeply rooted in the cultural context of our clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Protisthaa Wellness Society, we believe that a positive customer experience is paramount. We foster a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable, respected, and understood. Our highly trained and compassionate staff are committed to providing personalized attention, ensuring that each client\'s needs are met with empathy and professionalism. We prioritize open communication, maintaining transparent and honest interactions throughout the entire client journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond individual interactions.  We are deeply invested in building strong connections with our local community. We actively participate in local events, collaborating with other businesses and organizations to promote wellness initiatives.  We also offer discounted or pro bono services to individuals facing financial hardships, reflecting our commitment to social responsibility and community wellbeing. This approach ensures accessibility and makes our services available to a wider range of individuals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Protisthaa Wellness Society envisions becoming a leading wellness center in Assam, renowned for its holistic approach, community engagement, and commitment to excellence. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate additional modalities such as aromatherapy, traditional massage therapies, and potentially incorporating a small retail space dedicated to organic and locally sourced products that support wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also aim to strengthen our community outreach programs by developing more educational workshops and collaborating with local schools and organizations to promote healthy lifestyles amongst younger generations.  Our long-term goal is to establish Protisthaa Wellness Society as a sustainable and impactful organization, contributing significantly to the overall wellbeing of the Assam community. We are committed to continuous growth and development, adapting our services to meet the evolving needs of our clients while maintaining our commitment to holistic wellness and community engagement.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in fostering a culture of wellbeing, not just within our center but throughout the wider community. We are confident that our unique approach, coupled with our dedication to personalized care and community engagement, will position Protisthaa Wellness Society as a trusted and respected leader in the Assamese wellness landscape for years to come.</p>', 'House No.3A, By Lane, 3, Juripar Path, near CAPUCHIN House', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6000284322', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:40:44', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(627, 'ABHIGYA DE-ADDICTION CUM REHABILITATION CENTRE', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>ABHIGYA De-Addiction Cum Rehabilitation Centre</h1>\n<p>Located at Uttar Pub, Mother Teresa Road, 35, Pani Path, Guwahati, Assam, ABHIGYA De-Addiction Cum Rehabilitation Centre stands as a beacon of hope and recovery for individuals struggling with substance abuse and addiction.  We recognize the profound impact addiction has on individuals, families, and the wider community in Assam, and our centre is committed to providing comprehensive, compassionate, and evidence-based care to facilitate lasting recovery.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our centre distinguishes itself from others by its holistic approach to treatment, blending the best practices of modern addiction medicine with traditional Assamese healing methods and cultural sensitivity. We understand that addiction is a complex issue with multifaceted origins, and our individualized treatment plans consider each patient\'s unique physical, psychological, social, and spiritual needs. This personalized approach ensures maximum effectiveness and sustainability of recovery.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>At ABHIGYA, we offer a comprehensive range of services designed to address all aspects of addiction. Our primary services include medically supervised detoxification, individual and group therapy sessions, family therapy, relapse prevention planning, and aftercare support.  We utilize a variety of therapeutic modalities, including Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (CBT), Dialectical Behaviour Therapy (DBT), motivational interviewing, and mindfulness practices.  A key differentiator is our integration of traditional Assamese healing practices, such as yoga, meditation, and herbal remedies, into our treatment plans, fostering a culturally sensitive and supportive environment.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling points lie in our personalized treatment plans, the integration of traditional healing modalities, our strong emphasis on family involvement, and the comprehensive aftercare support provided to ensure long-term recovery.  We address the specific needs of the Assamese community by employing therapists and counselors who are fluent in Assamese and possess a deep understanding of local cultural nuances.  This cultural sensitivity plays a crucial role in building trust and rapport with patients, leading to better treatment outcomes.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The need for specialized addiction treatment centres is critical in Assam, as substance abuse continues to affect a significant portion of the population.  ABHIGYA fills a gap in the market by providing high-quality, culturally sensitive care that is otherwise inaccessible or insufficiently available to many.  We aim to reduce the stigma surrounding addiction and provide hope and support to those seeking a path to recovery.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>At the heart of ABHIGYA’s operations is a commitment to providing compassionate and supportive care. We strive to create a safe, nurturing, and respectful environment where patients feel comfortable sharing their vulnerabilities and participating actively in their recovery journey. Our staff, including medical professionals, therapists, and support staff, are highly trained and empathetic, providing individualised attention to each patient\'s needs.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our approach to customer service extends beyond the confines of the centre. We actively engage with the local community through awareness campaigns, workshops, and educational programs to address the stigma surrounding addiction and promote early intervention. We foster strong relationships with local healthcare providers, community leaders, and families to ensure seamless referrals and support for our patients.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe that successful recovery is not just an individual journey but a collective effort.  We engage families and loved ones in the treatment process, providing them with education, support, and guidance to foster a strong support system for their recovering family members.  This proactive approach strengthens the chances of long-term recovery and helps prevent relapse.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>ABHIGYA envisions becoming a leading de-addiction and rehabilitation centre in Assam, renowned for its holistic approach, excellent treatment outcomes, and strong community engagement. We plan to expand our services to include specialized programs for different types of addiction, such as alcohol, opioid, and gambling addiction. We are also exploring the development of community-based support groups and aftercare programs to ensure continued support for our patients long after they complete their treatment.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute significantly to reducing the burden of addiction in Assam. This involves investing in research, developing innovative treatment strategies, and advocating for policy changes that promote early intervention and reduce the stigma associated with addiction. We aim to build a sustainable organization that can continue providing high-quality care to the community for years to come, and to continue developing our unique strengths in culturally sensitive treatment approaches and integrated holistic care.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>By combining evidence-based practices with cultural sensitivity and community engagement, ABHIGYA strives to be more than just a treatment centre; we aim to be a catalyst for positive change, empowering individuals to reclaim their lives and build a healthier future, free from the grip of addiction.</p>', 'UTTAR PUB, MOTHER TERRESA ROAD, 35, Pani Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864026911', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:50:11', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(628, 'THE REDEMPTION WELFARE FOUNDATION', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>THE REDEMPTION WELFARE FOUNDATION</h1>\n<p>Located at Bongaon, Beltola College, Sudhakantha Path, The Redemption Welfare Foundation stands as a beacon of hope and positive change within the vibrant community of Assam.  Established with a deep-rooted commitment to social upliftment, the foundation distinguishes itself through its holistic approach to welfare, addressing the multifaceted needs of vulnerable populations and fostering sustainable development within the region. Unlike many organizations that focus on a single aspect of social welfare, The Redemption Welfare Foundation adopts a multifaceted strategy, ensuring a comprehensive and lasting impact on the lives it touches. This commitment to holistic improvement sets it apart in the local business landscape and establishes it as a truly unique entity.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>The foundation\'s unwavering dedication to transparency and accountability further enhances its credibility and trustworthiness within the community.  Rigorous financial management and meticulous record-keeping ensure that every donation makes a tangible difference, directly contributing to the programs and initiatives designed to alleviate suffering and empower individuals.  This commitment to accountability not only strengthens the foundation\'s reputation but also fosters a culture of trust and confidence amongst donors, volunteers, and beneficiaries alike.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>The Redemption Welfare Foundation provides a wide range of services designed to address pressing social issues prevalent in the Bongaon and surrounding areas.  These core services encompass several key areas: education, healthcare, skill development, and disaster relief.  The foundation\'s educational initiatives focus on providing access to quality education for underprivileged children, including scholarships, tuition assistance, and educational resource centers.  Healthcare services include organizing medical camps, providing essential medications, and facilitating access to specialized medical care for those in need.  Furthermore, recognizing the vital link between economic empowerment and social mobility, the foundation offers comprehensive skill development programs to equip individuals with the necessary tools for self-reliance and sustainable livelihoods. These programs range from vocational training to entrepreneurship development initiatives.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>A unique selling proposition of The Redemption Welfare Foundation is its integrated approach.  For example, the skill development programs are often linked to specific employment opportunities, ensuring a practical and impactful outcome. Similarly, healthcare initiatives are often coupled with awareness campaigns about preventative measures, promoting long-term health and well-being.  The foundation understands that addressing poverty and social inequality requires a multi-pronged strategy, and this integrated approach ensures that its services are mutually reinforcing and highly effective.  In a region facing significant challenges in these areas, the Foundation\'s services directly meet the most pressing needs of the local market by providing solutions that are comprehensive, accessible, and sustainable.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>The Redemption Welfare Foundation prioritizes a compassionate and client-centric approach to service delivery. The foundation understands that each individual’s situation is unique and requires tailored support. This personalized approach ensures that the assistance provided is not only effective but also respectful and empowering. The emphasis is on building trusting relationships with beneficiaries, creating a supportive environment where individuals feel heard, understood, and valued.  This commitment to empathy extends to all stakeholders, including donors, volunteers, and partners. Open communication channels and regular updates on program progress ensure that everyone involved feels connected to the foundation\'s mission.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>What truly sets the foundation apart is its deep engagement with the local community.  The Redemption Welfare Foundation operates on a foundation of community participation and collaboration.  Local volunteers play an integral role in program implementation, ensuring that the services delivered are culturally relevant and sensitive to the specific needs of the region.  The foundation also actively collaborates with other local organizations and businesses, fostering a network of support that amplifies its impact and expands its reach.  This deep integration within the community fosters a sense of ownership and strengthens the foundation\'s long-term sustainability.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>The Redemption Welfare Foundation envisions a future where poverty and social inequality are significantly reduced within the Bongaon and surrounding communities.  The foundation plans to expand its reach by establishing new programs and partnerships, strengthening its capacity to serve a larger population.  This involves investing in technology and infrastructure to enhance efficiency and effectiveness.  Future plans include exploring innovative funding models to ensure long-term financial stability and sustainability.  A key focus will be on strengthening the capacity of local communities to address their own challenges, fostering self-reliance and reducing dependency on external aid.  The long-term goal is to create a thriving and equitable community where every individual has the opportunity to reach their full potential.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>The foundation is also committed to ongoing evaluation and improvement.  Regular monitoring and assessment of program effectiveness will guide future strategies and ensure that resources are allocated efficiently and effectively. The foundation aims to be a leader in promoting sustainable development practices, creating a model for other organizations working in similar contexts. By fostering a culture of continuous learning and adaptation, The Redemption Welfare Foundation is poised for significant growth and lasting impact on the lives of those it serves.  Its commitment to social justice, coupled with its innovative approach and unwavering dedication, ensures a promising future for the organization and the communities it serves in Assam.</p><br><br>', 'Bongaon, Beltola college, Sudhakantha Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7896761566', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:50:20', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(629, 'Shristi Wellness Home-Best/Male/Rehab Centre/Nasha Mukti Kendra in Assam/Guwahati', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Shristi Wellness Home: A Beacon of Hope in Assam\'s Substance Abuse Recovery Landscape</h1>\n\n<p>Shristi Wellness Home, located at House No. 24, Nabodoi Path, near the BJP office in Guwahati, Assam, stands as a leading rehabilitation center dedicated to providing comprehensive and compassionate care for individuals struggling with substance abuse.  We recognize the pervasive impact of addiction on families and communities in Assam, and we are committed to offering a lifeline of hope through evidence-based treatment, holistic wellness practices, and unwavering support.  Our unique approach combines the best of traditional Indian healing philosophies with modern therapeutic methodologies to foster lasting recovery.  This sets us apart in the Assam market, offering a uniquely tailored and culturally sensitive pathway to wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Recovery</h2>\n\n<p>At Shristi Wellness Home, we offer a wide array of services designed to address the multifaceted nature of addiction. Our primary focus is on individualized treatment plans, tailored to the specific needs and circumstances of each individual. These plans typically incorporate detoxification (under strict medical supervision), individual and group therapy sessions, family counseling, and life skills training.  We understand that addiction is not merely a physical dependence; it\'s a complex interplay of psychological, social, and environmental factors. Our approach therefore encompasses these various dimensions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our integration of traditional Assamese healing practices with proven Western therapeutic techniques.  We incorporate elements of yoga, meditation, and Ayurveda into our treatment regimen, promoting physical and mental well-being.  This holistic approach fosters a sense of calm and balance, crucial for successful long-term recovery.  Furthermore, we prioritize a comfortable and supportive environment, ensuring that clients feel safe, respected, and understood throughout their journey.  We understand the local sensitivities and cultural nuances, ensuring our approach respects and integrates with the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also provide post-rehabilitation support services, including aftercare planning and relapse prevention strategies.  This ensures that clients have continued access to the support they need to maintain their sobriety long after leaving our care. We recognize the importance of community reintegration and strive to connect clients with appropriate resources and support networks within the Guwahati community.  This ongoing support is a critical element differentiating Shristi from other facilities.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Exceptional Customer Experience: Compassion, Confidentiality, and Commitment</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of Shristi Wellness Home is our unwavering commitment to providing a compassionate and supportive environment.  We understand the courage it takes for individuals to seek help, and we treat each client with the utmost respect, dignity, and confidentiality.  Our dedicated team of medical professionals, therapists, and support staff works collaboratively to create a nurturing atmosphere where healing can flourish.  We prioritize open communication and active listening, fostering a therapeutic alliance built on trust and mutual respect.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond the walls of our facility. We actively engage with the local community, conducting awareness campaigns to combat the stigma surrounding addiction and educate the public about the importance of seeking help. We also collaborate with local organizations and healthcare providers to create a strong network of support for individuals in recovery. This commitment reflects our belief in the power of community engagement to foster lasting change within Assam\'s substance abuse landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We continually seek feedback from our clients and their families to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their needs effectively. This dedication to quality and improvement is a hallmark of our approach, emphasizing our commitment to providing the highest standard of care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Access to Quality Care</h2>\n\n<p>Shristi Wellness Home envisions a future where substance abuse is treated with compassion, understanding, and readily accessible, evidence-based care.  We plan to expand our services in the coming years, potentially increasing our capacity to meet the growing demand for quality rehabilitation services in Assam.  This may involve expanding our physical facilities, incorporating new therapeutic modalities, and developing specialized programs to address the unique needs of different populations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are also committed to advancing research and training in the field of addiction treatment.  By collaborating with universities and other research institutions, we aim to contribute to a deeper understanding of addiction and its treatment, ultimately improving the lives of those struggling with substance use disorders. We aspire to become a regional center of excellence in addiction treatment, setting a new standard for comprehensive, culturally sensitive care in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Shristi Wellness Home as a symbol of hope and healing in Assam, a place where individuals can find the strength and support they need to reclaim their lives and build a brighter future, free from the grip of addiction.  We are dedicated to making a lasting, positive impact on the lives of individuals and families affected by substance abuse, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant Assam.</p> <br> <br>', 'House, 24, Nabodoi Path, near bjp office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002553009', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:50:29', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
