(630, 'Phoenix Wellness Home cum Rehabilitation Center', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h2>Phoenix Wellness Home cum Rehabilitation Center: A Beacon of Hope in Assam</h2><p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, on Satgaon Road near Idgah Maidan, Phoenix Wellness Home cum Rehabilitation Center stands as a leading provider of comprehensive addiction treatment and rehabilitation services. We are committed to offering a holistic and compassionate approach to recovery, addressing the urgent need for quality care within the local community and beyond. Our unique blend of evidence-based therapies, personalized care, and strong community ties distinguishes us in the Assam landscape, making us more than just a rehabilitation center; we are a lifeline for individuals and families struggling with substance abuse.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>Recognizing the devastating impact of alcohol and drug addiction on individuals, families, and the wider community, Phoenix Wellness Home prioritizes a multi-faceted approach to recovery. Our integrated program combines medical detoxification, individual and group therapy, family counseling, and aftercare planning. We understand that addiction is a complex issue with underlying mental health and social factors, and our comprehensive approach addresses these interconnected elements. Our unique selling point lies in our culturally sensitive and personalized treatment plans, tailored to meet the specific needs and cultural backgrounds of our clients. This understanding of the local context ensures effective engagement and positive outcomes. We are also proud to offer specialized programs tailored for women and for individuals struggling with specific substances like opioids or benzodiazepines. This nuanced approach reflects our dedication to providing the most effective care possible within the unique challenges faced by individuals in Assam.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>At Phoenix Wellness Home, we prioritize a client-centered approach, fostering a supportive and respectful environment. Our highly skilled and compassionate team of medical professionals, therapists, and counselors are dedicated to creating a safe and nurturing space where individuals feel empowered to embark on their healing journey. We utilize a holistic approach, combining individual and group therapies including Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT), Dialectical Behavior Therapy (DBT), and motivational interviewing. We strongly emphasize family involvement and offer dedicated family counseling sessions to strengthen support systems and facilitate a successful reintegration into family and community life. Furthermore, we collaborate closely with local community organizations, religious leaders, and support groups to build a strong network of support that extends beyond the walls of our center. This community engagement creates a supportive environment for long-term recovery, promoting successful reintegration and reducing the risk of relapse.</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends beyond our clinical approach. We provide a comfortable and welcoming environment, with modern facilities and amenities designed to promote healing and comfort. Our transparent communication, regular updates, and ongoing support for clients and their families are integral to our approach. We believe that open communication is key to building trust and fostering collaboration, ensuring clients and their families feel informed and supported every step of the way. We also provide resources and support that extend beyond the formal treatment period, offering aftercare planning and ongoing support groups to help sustain long-term recovery and well-being. Our approach emphasizes respect, dignity, and the belief in each individual’s inherent capacity for healing and growth.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Phoenix Wellness Home has a clear vision for the future: to become a nationally recognized leader in addiction treatment and rehabilitation within Assam and beyond. We plan to achieve this through continuous improvement of our programs and services, incorporating the latest research and advancements in addiction treatment. We are committed to expanding our capacity to reach more individuals in need, and to providing specialized care for diverse populations, including those facing co-occurring disorders. We also envision establishing partnerships with other healthcare providers and community organizations to create a comprehensive network of support for individuals recovering from addiction. Our long-term goal is not simply to treat addiction but to promote a culture of wellness, prevention, and recovery within the wider community through educational initiatives and community outreach programs. We aim to be a beacon of hope, offering a path to recovery and a celebration of life\'s second chance for every individual we serve.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>In conclusion, Phoenix Wellness Home cum Rehabilitation Center is more than just a treatment facility; it is a testament to our dedication to improving the lives of individuals and families struggling with addiction in Assam. Our holistic, compassionate, and community-focused approach sets us apart, offering a genuine pathway to recovery and hope. We invite you to learn more about our services and join us in our mission to build a healthier and more vibrant community for everyone.</p>', 'Satgaon Road, near Idgah maidan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8453540998', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:50:36', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(631, 'Advent Care Foundation - Best Rehab Center | Psychological Disorder Rehabilitation Center | Best Rehabilitation in Guwahati', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Advent Care Foundation: Redefining Rehabilitation in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Advent Care Foundation stands as a beacon of hope and healing in Guwahati, Assam, providing comprehensive rehabilitation services for individuals grappling with psychological disorders.  Located conveniently at 5P4J+924, AK Dev Rd, we are committed to delivering high-quality, compassionate care tailored to the unique needs of each patient.  Our significance in the Assam business landscape stems from a critical gap we fill – providing accessible and specialized mental health rehabilitation services within a culturally sensitive and supportive environment.  We are not merely a rehabilitation center; we are a community dedicated to restoring lives and empowering individuals to regain their full potential. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Advent Care Foundation distinguishes itself through a holistic approach that integrates evidence-based therapeutic interventions with personalized care plans. We recognize that mental health challenges are complex and multifaceted, requiring a comprehensive strategy that addresses the individual’s physical, emotional, and social well-being.  This holistic approach sets us apart from other providers in the region who might focus solely on medication or a single therapeutic modality. Our commitment is to empowering individuals to navigate their recovery journey effectively and achieve long-term stability. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our primary services encompass a wide spectrum of evidence-based therapeutic interventions designed to address various psychological disorders.  These include but are not limited to individual and group therapy, cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT), dialectical behavior therapy (DBT), family therapy, and medication management (in coordination with prescribing physicians). We offer specialized programs tailored to specific conditions such as anxiety disorders, depression, trauma, addiction, and personality disorders. Our commitment extends to providing comprehensive assessment, diagnosis, and ongoing support throughout the rehabilitation process.  One unique selling proposition is our focus on integrating traditional Assamese healing practices where appropriate and ethically sound, complementing our modern therapeutic approaches. This cultural sensitivity ensures a more comfortable and effective therapeutic experience for our patients. We also strive to create a flexible, adaptive treatment plan according to each individual\'s needs, accommodating the unique challenges and resources available within the community.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>The significant need for specialized mental health services in Assam is unmet by many existing facilities, leading to a significant treatment gap. Advent Care Foundation addresses this by providing accessible and affordable options, working with various insurance providers and offering flexible payment plans to remove financial barriers to treatment.  Our focus on community engagement initiatives also extends the reach of our services beyond our immediate patient base, promoting mental health awareness and reducing stigma surrounding these challenges. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Advent Care Foundation, our commitment to excellence extends far beyond providing quality therapeutic services. We prioritize building strong, trusting relationships with our patients based on empathy, respect, and understanding.  Our team of highly qualified and experienced mental health professionals fosters a supportive and non-judgmental environment where patients feel comfortable sharing their experiences and working towards their recovery goals.  Personalized care plans are developed in collaboration with each patient, ensuring that their individual needs and preferences are at the forefront of the treatment process. We recognize that the journey to recovery is unique to each individual and maintain consistent communication with family members to ensure comprehensive support. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends to our community engagement. We actively participate in local awareness campaigns, educational workshops, and collaborative partnerships to promote mental health literacy and reduce stigma.  We believe in empowering individuals and families through education and support. By partnering with local community organizations and leaders, we are building a more supportive and inclusive network for individuals facing mental health challenges.  This proactive approach allows us to effectively address the needs of the community at large, not simply as patients but as valued members of society.  Furthermore, we consistently seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our service delivery and create an even more patient-centric environment. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Advent Care Foundation envisions a future where mental health is prioritized, and individuals have access to high-quality, compassionate care regardless of their socioeconomic background.  Our growth strategy includes expanding our service offerings to encompass a wider range of therapeutic interventions and specialized programs.  We plan on expanding our team of qualified professionals to better serve our increasing patient population and to respond to the evolving needs of our community.  We will also explore the opportunities to use technology to enhance our service delivery, improving access to care and potentially reaching a larger population beyond our immediate vicinity through telehealth or online support groups. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Advent Care Foundation as a leading mental health rehabilitation center in Assam, recognized for its excellence in clinical care, innovative treatment approaches, and unwavering commitment to community engagement. We are dedicated to contributing meaningfully to the overall mental health and well-being of the population in Assam by fostering a culture of understanding, support, and hope. Through continued innovation, collaboration, and unwavering dedication, we aim to transform the landscape of mental health care in Guwahati and beyond, providing a pathway to recovery and empowering individuals to live fulfilling lives. <br> <br> </p>', '5P4J+924, AK Dev Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9957228684', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:00:12', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(632, 'Helping Hand Foundation Rehabilitation Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Helping Hand Foundation Rehabilitation Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at House No. - 51, Harihar Path, near Golden Wood Luxuria Apartment, the Helping Hand Foundation Rehabilitation Centre stands as a beacon of hope and recovery for individuals in Assam striving to overcome physical and cognitive challenges.  Our centre is uniquely positioned to address the growing need for specialized rehabilitation services within the region, offering a comprehensive and compassionate approach to care that sets us apart in the local landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike many larger, impersonal rehabilitation facilities, Helping Hand Foundation prioritizes individualized care plans and a strong emphasis on patient-centered treatment.  We recognize that each individual’s journey to recovery is unique, demanding a tailored approach that considers their specific needs, limitations, and personal goals. This commitment to personalized care, coupled with our team of highly skilled and empathetic professionals, forms the cornerstone of our philosophy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our comprehensive range of services caters to a diverse spectrum of needs.  We offer specialized physiotherapy, occupational therapy, and speech therapy, all delivered by licensed and experienced practitioners.  Our physiotherapy services encompass a wide array of techniques, including manual therapy, electrotherapy, and exercise programs designed to improve mobility, reduce pain, and enhance functional capabilities. Occupational therapy focuses on adapting daily routines and fostering independence through the development of practical skills.  Speech therapy assists individuals in improving their communication abilities and swallowing function.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique aspect of our centre is our integration of holistic therapies, such as yoga and meditation, into our rehabilitation programs.  These complementary practices are proven to reduce stress, enhance mental well-being, and support the overall healing process.  Furthermore, we provide counseling services to address the emotional and psychological impact of injury or illness, recognizing the vital link between mental and physical recovery. This holistic approach directly meets a significant need within Assam, where access to integrated rehabilitation services remains limited.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The demand for quality rehabilitation services in Assam is substantial and continues to grow.  Our facility directly addresses this need by providing a comprehensive, accessible, and high-quality service in a supportive and culturally sensitive environment.  Our proximity to residential areas ensures easy access for patients and their families, minimizing the challenges often associated with seeking specialized care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At the Helping Hand Foundation Rehabilitation Centre, we strive to create a comfortable, welcoming, and respectful atmosphere for our patients. We firmly believe that a positive and supportive environment is paramount to successful rehabilitation.  Our staff is dedicated to providing compassionate, respectful, and culturally sensitive care to each individual, ensuring their comfort and dignity throughout their treatment journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We foster open communication between patients, their families, and our therapy team. Regular progress reports and ongoing consultations are integral to our approach, ensuring transparency and shared decision-making. We prioritize patient feedback and actively seek to improve our services based on their input, building trust and fostering a positive therapeutic relationship.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through workshops, awareness campaigns, and collaborative initiatives with other healthcare providers.  This commitment to community outreach allows us to raise awareness about the importance of rehabilitation and build stronger relationships with our patients and their families.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>The Helping Hand Foundation Rehabilitation Centre has ambitious plans for the future. We aim to expand our services to include more specialized programs, such as neurological rehabilitation and pediatric therapy, to meet the evolving needs of the community.  We are exploring opportunities for collaboration with local hospitals and medical institutions to facilitate seamless transitions of care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Investment in advanced technology and equipment is a key part of our growth strategy. We plan to integrate innovative rehabilitation tools and techniques to enhance the effectiveness of our treatments and improve patient outcomes.  Furthermore, we are committed to fostering a culture of continuous professional development among our staff, ensuring they possess the latest skills and knowledge to provide exceptional care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish the Helping Hand Foundation Rehabilitation Centre as a leading provider of rehabilitation services in Assam, renowned for its high-quality care, compassionate approach, and significant contribution to the overall well-being of the community.  We envision a future where every individual has access to the rehabilitation support they need to achieve their full potential.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Helping Hand Foundation Rehabilitation Centre is more than just a rehabilitation facility; it\'s a testament to our commitment to improving the lives of individuals in Assam, one step at a time. We invite you to join us in our journey toward building a healthier and more inclusive community.</p>', 'House No. - 51, Harihar Path, near Golden Wood Luxuria Apartment', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9706948704', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:55:12', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(633, 'Shrijan Rehabilitation Care', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Shrijan Rehabilitation Care: Restoring Lives, Strengthening Communities</h1>\n\n<p>Shrijan Rehabilitation Care, located at House no. 34, Tiwa Path, stands as a beacon of hope and healing in the heart of Assam.  We are a dedicated rehabilitation center committed to providing comprehensive and compassionate care to individuals recovering from a wide range of physical and cognitive challenges.  Our unique approach blends traditional healing practices with cutting-edge therapeutic methodologies, resulting in personalized care plans tailored to meet the specific needs of each patient.  In a region where access to specialized rehabilitation services can be limited, Shrijan Rehabilitation Care plays a crucial role in improving the quality of life for individuals and families across the community. We are proud to contribute to the growing healthcare landscape of Assam, offering a level of expertise and personalized attention rarely found elsewhere.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond simply providing services; it encompasses fostering a supportive and nurturing environment conducive to healing and recovery.  We recognize the profound impact that rehabilitation has not only on the individual but also on their families and the wider community.  Therefore, we strive to create a space where patients feel safe, respected, and empowered to take control of their rehabilitation journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Shrijan Rehabilitation Care offers a comprehensive suite of rehabilitation services designed to address a wide spectrum of needs. Our core offerings include physiotherapy, occupational therapy, speech therapy, and cognitive rehabilitation.  Physiotherapy services focus on restoring physical function, mobility, and reducing pain through various techniques such as manual therapy, exercise programs, and electrotherapy. Occupational therapy helps individuals regain independence in daily living activities, adapting their environment and developing compensatory strategies to overcome functional limitations.  Speech therapy assists with communication and swallowing disorders, improving articulation, fluency, and overall communication skills.  Our cognitive rehabilitation programs target cognitive impairments, aiding in memory improvement, attention enhancement, and problem-solving skills.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Shrijan Rehabilitation Care is our emphasis on holistic care.  We understand that rehabilitation extends beyond the physical and cognitive; it also encompasses emotional and psychological well-being.  Therefore, our approach incorporates elements of counseling and emotional support, recognizing the importance of addressing the whole person. This holistic approach, coupled with our commitment to using evidence-based practices and advanced technologies, sets us apart in the local market.  We cater specifically to the needs of the local community by providing services in Assamese and other regional languages, ensuring that every individual feels comfortable and understood.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Shrijan Rehabilitation Care, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of successful rehabilitation. We prioritize building strong, trusting relationships with our patients and their families. Our dedicated team of highly trained and compassionate professionals works collaboratively to develop personalized treatment plans and provide ongoing support throughout the recovery process.  Regular communication, empathetic listening, and a genuine commitment to understanding each patient\'s unique needs are integral to our approach.  Beyond individual care, we actively engage with the community through health awareness programs and workshops, educating the public about the importance of rehabilitation and promoting early intervention.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends to ensuring accessibility and affordability. We work with insurance providers and offer flexible payment options to make our services accessible to a broader range of individuals.  We regularly review our pricing to ensure it remains competitive and reflects the value we deliver. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where diversity is celebrated and every individual feels valued and respected.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Shrijan Rehabilitation Care envisions a future where comprehensive rehabilitation services are readily available to all those who need them in Assam.  Our long-term goals include expanding our range of services, investing in advanced technologies, and further strengthening our team through continuous professional development.  We plan to establish collaborations with other healthcare providers and community organizations to create a comprehensive network of support for individuals undergoing rehabilitation.  This includes exploring opportunities for outreach programs to remote areas, bringing much-needed rehabilitation services to underserved communities.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also aim to become a leading center for research and innovation in rehabilitation practices within Assam.  By conducting research and sharing our findings, we hope to contribute to advancements in the field and improve outcomes for patients across the state.  Ultimately, our vision is to create a thriving community where individuals are empowered to overcome challenges, lead fulfilling lives, and achieve their full potential. Shrijan Rehabilitation Care is committed to being a driving force in this transformation, ensuring that every individual receives the highest quality of care and support they deserve.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our dedication to providing exceptional care, coupled with a strong commitment to community engagement and ongoing development, positions Shrijan Rehabilitation Care for continued growth and success in the years to come. We are confident in our ability to make a significant and lasting impact on the lives of individuals and the community we serve.</p>', 'House no. 34, Shrijan Rehabilitation Care, Tiwa Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9101476788', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:55:20', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(634, 'Willing-Way Wellness Society Guwahati', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h2>Willing-Way Wellness Society - Best Rehabilitation Centre</h2><p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at Bagharbari Tiniali, Satgaon Road, near the renowned Srimanta Sankardev Kalakshetra, Willing-Way Wellness Society stands as a beacon of hope and recovery for the people of Assam. We are a premier rehabilitation centre dedicated to providing comprehensive and compassionate care to individuals striving to regain their physical, cognitive, and emotional well-being. Our commitment to holistic healing and personalized treatment distinguishes us within the Assam healthcare landscape, offering a unique blend of modern therapeutic techniques and traditional Assamese values of care and community support.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>In a region where access to specialized rehabilitation services can sometimes be limited, Willing-Way Wellness Society fills a crucial gap. We recognise the unique challenges faced by individuals recovering from illness, injury, or disability in Assam, and we strive to create an environment that promotes healing and empowers individuals to achieve their full potential. Our multidisciplinary approach and culturally sensitive care create a supportive ecosystem for optimal recovery.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Core Services and Products</h2><p>Willing-Way Wellness Society offers a comprehensive range of rehabilitation services tailored to meet the diverse needs of our patients. Our core services include physiotherapy, occupational therapy, speech therapy, and psychological counselling. We also offer specialized programs for stroke recovery, neurological rehabilitation, orthopaedic rehabilitation, and geriatric care. Our state-of-the-art facility is equipped with advanced therapeutic equipment, ensuring patients receive the highest quality of care.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>A unique aspect of our service is the integration of traditional Assamese healing practices where appropriate, complementing modern therapies. This holistic approach recognizes the importance of mind-body connection and fosters a sense of familiarity and comfort for our patients. We also pride ourselves on our individualized treatment plans, ensuring that each patient\'s specific needs and goals are addressed. Our team regularly evaluates progress and adjusts the plan accordingly, optimizing the effectiveness of the rehabilitation process. We believe this personalized touch is vital in achieving lasting and meaningful results, a significant differentiator in our market.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Recognizing the diverse economic realities of the community, we also strive to offer flexible payment options and work closely with local insurance providers to ensure accessibility for all. Our commitment extends beyond immediate care, with ongoing support and resources to facilitate seamless reintegration into daily life.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Customer Experience</h2><p>At Willing-Way Wellness Society, we place paramount importance on providing a supportive and empathetic environment. Our dedicated team of highly qualified and experienced therapists, nurses, and support staff are committed to creating a warm, welcoming atmosphere where patients feel comfortable and respected. We believe that excellent customer service extends beyond efficient care; it\'s about building trust and fostering a genuine connection with each patient and their family.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>We engage proactively with the local community through health awareness campaigns and workshops, promoting healthy lifestyles and preventing potential need for rehabilitation services. This engagement strengthens our ties with the community and allows us to better understand and address the specific needs of our patients. We encourage regular feedback, utilizing it to continuously improve our services and ensure we are exceeding expectations.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Transparency is crucial to us. We strive to maintain open communication with patients and their families, providing regular updates on progress and addressing any concerns promptly and efficiently. This open dialogue helps to foster a collaborative approach to recovery, empowering patients to take an active role in their healing journey. We also maintain a comfortable and easily accessible facility that takes into account the needs of people with mobility challenges.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><h2>Future Vision</h2><p>Willing-Way Wellness Society envisions becoming the leading rehabilitation centre in Assam, recognized for its excellence in care, its commitment to community engagement, and its innovative approach to rehabilitation. We plan to expand our services to include specialized programs addressing specific needs within the community and explore opportunities for research and collaboration with other healthcare providers.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Our future goals include expanding our facility to accommodate a larger number of patients, investing in cutting-edge technology to enhance the effectiveness of our treatments, and training more qualified rehabilitation professionals in the region. We plan to actively participate in professional development initiatives to keep our team at the forefront of advancements in rehabilitation practices. By doing so, we aim to not only meet the growing demand for rehabilitation services but to also raise the standard of care in Assam.</p><p><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p>Ultimately, our vision is to empower individuals to overcome challenges, achieve their full potential, and live fulfilling lives. Willing-Way Wellness Society is committed to being a trusted partner in the community\'s journey towards improved health and well-being, upholding a legacy of care and compassion for generations to come.</p>', 'Bagharbari Tiniali, Satgaon, Road, near Srimanta Sankardev Kalakshetra', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8822646942', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:55:28', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(635, 'Prayukti N.G.O/Rehab Center/Rehabilitation center/Nasha Mukti Kendra', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Prayukti: A Beacon of Hope in Assam\'s Fight Against Addiction</h1>\n\n<p>Prayukti, located at H/no 14, Uttaran Path, stands as a leading Non-Governmental Organization (NGO) and rehabilitation center in Assam, dedicated to providing comprehensive care and support for individuals struggling with substance abuse.  We are more than just a rehabilitation center; we are a lifeline, offering a holistic approach that addresses the physical, psychological, and social aspects of addiction.  In a region where substance abuse remains a significant challenge, Prayukti’s commitment to evidence-based treatment and community engagement sets us apart, making a tangible difference in the lives of countless individuals and families.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique approach combines the best practices of modern addiction treatment with a deep understanding of the cultural nuances of Assam.  We recognize that addiction is a complex issue with multifaceted roots, and our programs are meticulously designed to address these complexities. We avoid a one-size-fits-all approach, instead tailoring treatment plans to the unique needs of each individual.  This personalized approach fosters a supportive and empowering environment where individuals feel safe, respected, and encouraged to embark on their journey to recovery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Prayukti offers a comprehensive range of services aimed at achieving long-term recovery and reintegration into society.  Our core services include detoxification programs, individual and group therapy sessions, family counseling, vocational training, and aftercare support.  Our detoxification program is medically supervised, ensuring a safe and comfortable transition from active addiction. We utilize evidence-based therapies, such as Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT) and Dialectical Behavior Therapy (DBT), to help individuals identify and address the underlying issues contributing to their addiction.  Our vocational training programs equip individuals with marketable skills, increasing their chances of successful reintegration into the workforce.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A significant differentiator for Prayukti is our unwavering focus on aftercare support.  We understand that recovery is a journey, not a destination. Our aftercare programs provide ongoing support, guidance, and resources to help individuals maintain their sobriety and navigate the challenges of life after treatment.  We facilitate support groups, offer relapse prevention strategies, and maintain close contact with individuals even after they complete their formal rehabilitation program. This continuous support network is crucial for sustaining long-term recovery and prevents relapse.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The local market needs in Assam are significantly addressed by our culturally sensitive approach.  Understanding the socio-economic realities of the region and integrating them into our treatment plans is critical.  Our programs are designed to be accessible and affordable for individuals from diverse backgrounds. We work closely with local communities, fostering trust and eliminating the stigma associated with addiction, thereby promoting help-seeking behavior.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Prayukti, we believe that exceptional customer service is not just a policy, but a fundamental principle that underpins our entire mission. We foster a compassionate and empathetic environment where individuals feel understood, valued, and empowered.  Our staff is comprised of highly trained professionals, including medical doctors, psychologists, counselors, and social workers, who are dedicated to providing personalized and holistic care.  We strive to create a safe, confidential, and respectful atmosphere that encourages open communication and active participation in the recovery process.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to building strong relationships with our clients and their families. We understand that addiction affects not just the individual but the entire family system.  Therefore, we actively involve family members in the treatment process, providing them with support, education, and guidance. This family-centered approach strengthens family bonds and creates a supportive network essential for long-term recovery. We actively engage with the local community through awareness campaigns, educational workshops, and partnerships with local organizations. We aim to foster a culture of understanding and acceptance, reducing stigma and encouraging help-seeking behavior.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Prayukti envisions a future where addiction is treated not as a moral failing but as a treatable health condition.  Our long-term goals include expanding our services to reach a wider population across Assam, establishing additional rehabilitation centers in underserved areas, and developing specialized programs to address specific addiction challenges prevalent in the region. We are committed to conducting research and promoting evidence-based practices in the field of addiction treatment. We aim to contribute significantly to the development of a robust and comprehensive addiction treatment system in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We plan to achieve this through strategic partnerships with governmental agencies, non-profit organizations, and community leaders.  We will continue to invest in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of addiction treatment practices. We also aim to enhance our technological capabilities to improve efficiency and reach, potentially leveraging technology for remote support and telehealth services.  Our ultimate vision is to create a society where individuals struggling with addiction receive the timely, compassionate, and effective care they deserve, leading to a healthier and more vibrant community in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Prayukti is more than just a rehabilitation center; it is a beacon of hope, a testament to the power of compassion, and a catalyst for positive change in Assam’s fight against addiction. Our commitment to evidence-based treatment, our culturally sensitive approach, and our unwavering dedication to our clients are the cornerstones of our success and the foundation for a brighter future.</p>', 'H/no 14, Uttaran Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8011789663', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 20:55:37', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(636, 'AAKAAR REHABILITATION FACILITY, DRUG ADDICTION TREATMENT CENTER', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>AAKAAR REHABILITATION FACILITY, DRUG ADDICTION TREATMENT CENTER</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, near Dakhingaon on Dakhingaon Road, Eidgah Maidan, Aakaar Rehabilitation Facility stands as a beacon of hope for individuals struggling with drug addiction.  More than just a treatment center, Aakaar is a comprehensive rehabilitation facility dedicated to providing holistic care and fostering lasting recovery.  Recognizing the significant impact of substance abuse on families and communities in the region, Aakaar addresses this critical need with a compassionate and evidence-based approach, filling a vital gap in Assam\'s healthcare landscape.  Our commitment to individualized care and community engagement sets us apart, making us a crucial resource for those seeking a path to a healthier, more fulfilling life.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Aakaar Rehabilitation Facility offers a wide range of services designed to address the multifaceted nature of drug addiction.  Our comprehensive program incorporates medically supervised detoxification, individual and group therapy, family counseling, and vocational training.  We utilize evidence-based therapeutic modalities tailored to meet the unique needs of each patient.  This personalized approach ensures that treatment plans are effective and sustainable, maximizing the chances of long-term recovery. Our programs encompass various substance abuse issues, including but not limited to opioid addiction, alcohol dependence, and substance abuse related mental health issues. A dedicated team of medical professionals, therapists, and counselors ensures comprehensive and empathetic care. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Aakaar apart is our commitment to holistic healing.  We understand that addiction is not just a physical or psychological issue but also a social one.  Therefore, our programs incorporate social reintegration strategies, connecting patients with community resources and support networks that promote long-term well-being and reduce the risk of relapse. This includes assistance in securing employment, finding suitable housing, and rebuilding healthy relationships. Our unique selling proposition lies in our integrated approach, encompassing the medical, psychological, social, and vocational aspects of recovery, promoting a sustainable and holistic path toward recovery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The services offered by Aakaar directly address the pressing needs of the local community in Assam.  Drug addiction is a significant social problem, and the lack of accessible and comprehensive treatment options has created a significant demand for specialized care. Aakaar fills this gap by providing high-quality, affordable, and culturally sensitive services.  Our proximity to Dakhingaon ensures accessibility for individuals across the region, removing geographical barriers to treatment and promoting timely intervention. </p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Aakaar, we prioritize a patient-centered approach to care. We believe that recovery is best achieved within an environment of compassion, respect, and understanding.  Our team is committed to building trusting relationships with patients and their families, creating a supportive and encouraging atmosphere conducive to healing.  We work collaboratively with each individual to develop a personalized treatment plan, ensuring their active involvement in the recovery process.  Regular assessments and progress evaluations allow us to adapt the treatment approach as needed, ensuring its effectiveness and relevance. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We strive to create a comfortable and supportive environment, fostering a sense of community among our patients.  We organize regular group sessions, recreational activities, and workshops that promote social interaction and emotional well-being.  Beyond the immediate treatment period, Aakaar provides ongoing support and follow-up care to help patients maintain their sobriety and navigate the challenges of reintegrating into society.  This post-treatment support significantly increases the likelihood of lasting recovery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Aakaar actively engages with the local community through educational programs, awareness campaigns, and collaborations with local organizations.  We believe that combating drug addiction requires a collaborative effort, involving families, community leaders, and healthcare professionals.  By fostering open communication and building strong relationships with community stakeholders, we work towards creating a more supportive and understanding environment for individuals recovering from addiction.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Aakaar Rehabilitation Facility envisions a future where addiction is understood, prevented, and treated effectively within our community. We aim to expand our services to include additional specialized programs to cater to diverse needs. This may involve developing specialized treatment modules for adolescents, expanding our capacity to accommodate a larger number of patients, and potentially offering outpatient services to those who require less intensive care. We also plan on establishing a robust aftercare program, strengthening our community engagement and advocacy initiatives to continue supporting individuals long after they complete their treatment. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to become a leading provider of drug addiction treatment in Assam, recognized for our high-quality care, compassionate approach, and lasting impact on the lives of those we serve.  We aim to contribute to a reduction in substance abuse within the region and promote a culture of understanding and support for individuals struggling with addiction.  We will achieve this through continued innovation in treatment approaches, strengthening our collaborations with local organizations, and expanding our capacity to serve a wider community of those affected by substance use disorder.  Through continuous improvement and a steadfast commitment to our mission, Aakaar strives to make a substantial contribution to the betterment of the lives of individuals and families within the Assam region.</p> <br> <br>', 'Eidgah Maidan, Aakaar Rehabilitation Facility, Dakhingaon Rd, near Dakhingaon', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7896267828', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:00:21', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
