(683, 'Nisha Mukti Kendra', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Nisha Mukti Kendra: A Beacon of Hope in Bhabananda</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Nowagaon Tiniali, Bhabananda, Bhabananda Boro Path, Nisha Mukti Kendra stands as a testament to compassionate care and unwavering commitment to the well-being of the local community.  More than just a service provider, Nisha Mukti Kendra is a vital part of the social fabric of Bhabananda, offering much-needed support and resources to individuals and families facing challenging circumstances.  Our unique approach blends traditional understanding with modern methodologies, resulting in a holistic and effective service delivery model that sets us apart in the Assam business landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our establishment recognizes the specific needs and challenges faced by the people of Bhabananda and the surrounding areas. We strive to address these needs through a compassionate and culturally sensitive approach, ensuring that our services are accessible and beneficial to everyone. We are deeply committed to fostering a supportive environment where individuals feel safe, respected, and empowered to overcome their challenges.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Empowering Individuals and Families</h2>\n\n<p>Nisha Mukti Kendra\'s core services are focused on providing comprehensive support to individuals and families facing various difficulties. This includes, but is not limited to, counseling services for individuals grappling with emotional distress, addiction, or family conflicts. We also offer crucial support to victims of domestic violence and abuse, providing a safe haven and resources for recovery.  Furthermore, our services extend to community outreach programs designed to raise awareness about critical social issues, promote mental health and well-being, and strengthen community bonds.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Nisha Mukti Kendra lies in our commitment to culturally sensitive and holistic care.  We understand the importance of incorporating traditional Assamese values and practices into our support strategies, ensuring our services are deeply relevant and effective within the local context.  Our team comprises experienced and compassionate professionals who are adept at understanding the unique challenges faced by the local community and tailoring their support accordingly. This approach ensures that our interventions are effective and sustainable, addressing the root causes of the issues rather than just providing superficial solutions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The services provided by Nisha Mukti Kendra directly address critical gaps in the local market.  Access to mental health support and resources for vulnerable populations remains limited in many rural areas of Assam. Nisha Mukti Kendra fills this crucial gap by providing accessible, affordable, and culturally sensitive services that meet the unique needs of the Bhabananda community.  Our commitment to providing holistic care, including social, emotional, and practical support, sets us apart and ensures that our clients receive the comprehensive assistance they need to thrive.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: A Foundation of Trust and Compassion</h2>\n\n<p>At Nisha Mukti Kendra, we prioritize building strong, trusting relationships with our clients. We believe that a supportive and non-judgmental environment is crucial for effective healing and recovery. Our team is trained to provide empathetic, compassionate care, ensuring that each individual feels heard, understood, and respected.  We maintain strict confidentiality and adhere to the highest ethical standards in our practice.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets us apart is our deeply rooted connection with the local community.  We actively engage with community leaders, local organizations, and residents to understand their needs and tailor our services accordingly.  We believe in empowering individuals and families through collaboration and partnership, ensuring that our efforts align with the community\'s overall goals and aspirations. This approach fosters trust and strengthens our position as a reliable and valuable asset within the Bhabananda community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to building strong relationships extends beyond our direct clients. We actively engage with schools, religious organizations, and community groups to raise awareness about our services and promote mental health and well-being. This proactive outreach ensures that more individuals and families can benefit from our support and resources. We strive to create a network of support that extends beyond the walls of our center, fostering a sense of community and shared responsibility.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Our Reach and Impact</h2>\n\n<p>Nisha Mukti Kendra has ambitious plans for the future.  We aim to expand our service offerings to meet the evolving needs of the community. This includes exploring the possibility of incorporating additional specialized services, such as vocational training and employment support programs, to empower individuals to achieve greater economic independence.  We are also committed to expanding our outreach programs to reach more remote and underserved communities in the surrounding areas.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to become a leading provider of holistic support and resources in the Bhabananda region.  We envision a future where everyone has access to the mental health support and resources they need to lead fulfilling and healthy lives. We will achieve this through strategic partnerships, community engagement, and continuous improvement of our services.  We are committed to investing in our team\'s professional development and expanding our infrastructure to better serve the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Nisha Mukti Kendra is more than a business; it\'s a commitment to the well-being of the Bhabananda community.  Our dedicated team is passionate about making a positive impact on the lives of individuals and families.  We invite you to learn more about our services and join us in our mission to create a brighter future for Bhabananda.</p>', 'Nowagaon Tiniali, Bhabananda, Bhabananda Boro Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:50:21', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(684, 'Sanjivan Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Sanjivan Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre: Restoring Health, Revitalizing Lives</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Sewali Path, Sanjivan Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre stands as a beacon of hope and healing for the people of Assam.  We are a dedicated physiotherapy and rehabilitation centre committed to providing comprehensive, patient-centered care that addresses a wide spectrum of musculoskeletal and neurological conditions. Our commitment to evidence-based practices, coupled with a personalized approach, distinguishes us within the local healthcare landscape and establishes us as a trusted resource for individuals seeking to regain their mobility, strength, and overall well-being.  We strive to not just treat symptoms, but to understand the root causes of discomfort, empowering patients to lead healthier, more active lives. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Sanjivan\'s significance in the Assam business landscape lies in its direct response to the growing need for specialized physiotherapy and rehabilitation services.  The increasing prevalence of lifestyle-related diseases and the aging population necessitates accessible and high-quality care.  We fill this crucial gap by offering advanced therapeutic interventions in a comfortable and supportive environment. We firmly believe that everyone deserves access to quality healthcare, and we actively work to make our services accessible to all members of the community. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our comprehensive range of services caters to a diverse clientele, encompassing both preventative and rehabilitative care.  We offer manual therapy techniques, including massage, mobilization, and manipulation, to address pain and improve joint mobility.  We also utilize advanced therapeutic modalities such as ultrasound, electrical stimulation, and laser therapy to accelerate healing and reduce inflammation.  Our expertise extends to neurological rehabilitation, helping patients recover from strokes, traumatic brain injuries, and other neurological conditions.  Personalized exercise programs, tailored to each individual\'s needs and capabilities, form a cornerstone of our treatment approach, helping to restore strength, endurance, and functional independence.  Beyond individual treatment, we also offer group exercise classes designed to promote community interaction and shared support. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Sanjivan is our holistic approach. We recognize that physical health is intertwined with mental and emotional well-being. Therefore, we integrate elements of stress management and mindfulness techniques into our treatment plans, fostering a comprehensive healing experience.  We also emphasize patient education, empowering individuals to understand their condition, participate actively in their recovery, and adopt healthy lifestyle changes to prevent future problems. This commitment to education extends to providing workshops and seminars on relevant health topics to the wider community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our services directly meet the local market needs by offering a convenient and accessible alternative to larger, often impersonal healthcare facilities.  We provide a personalized experience, fostering strong patient-therapist relationships and ensuring that every individual receives tailored attention. Our multilingual staff ensures effective communication with patients from diverse linguistic backgrounds, making our services accessible to a wider segment of the population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Sanjivan, we prioritize creating a warm, welcoming, and supportive atmosphere. We believe that a positive and comfortable environment is crucial for successful rehabilitation. Our dedicated team of highly qualified and experienced physiotherapists are not only skilled practitioners but also compassionate caregivers, committed to providing empathetic and respectful care.  We actively listen to our patients, understanding their concerns, and collaboratively developing treatment plans that are tailored to their individual needs and goals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to personalized care.  We go beyond simply administering treatments; we build relationships with our patients, providing ongoing support and guidance throughout their recovery journey.  We maintain open communication channels, ensuring that patients feel heard and understood.  Regular follow-ups and progress evaluations allow us to adapt our treatment plans as needed, maximizing the effectiveness of our interventions. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, including sponsoring local sports teams, offering free health screenings, and conducting workshops on injury prevention. Our commitment to community well-being reflects our belief that health is a shared responsibility and that collaboration is essential for creating a healthier society.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Sanjivan envisions becoming a leading physiotherapy and rehabilitation centre in Assam, recognized for its excellence in patient care, innovative treatment approaches, and community engagement.  Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to incorporate new technologies and advanced therapeutic modalities, ensuring we remain at the forefront of the field.  We also aim to expand our team, bringing in additional skilled professionals to meet the growing demand for our services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we plan to establish partnerships with local hospitals and healthcare providers to create a comprehensive network of care. This collaboration will enhance patient access to holistic care and ensure seamless transitions between different levels of treatment.  We also aspire to conduct research and contribute to the advancement of physiotherapy knowledge and practice, sharing our expertise and contributing to the professional development of other healthcare professionals.  Our ultimate goal is to empower individuals to live healthier, more fulfilling lives, contributing significantly to the overall health and well-being of the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Sanjivan Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre is more than just a clinic; it\'s a testament to the power of healing, restoration, and community.  We are deeply committed to the people of Assam, providing the highest quality care and fostering a brighter, healthier future for all.</p>', 'Sewali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8638943749', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:50:29', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(685, 'Vibrant Wellness Society', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Vibrant Wellness Society: Nurturing Holistic Wellbeing in Amingaon</h1>\n\n<p>Vibrant Wellness Society, located at Panipara Amingaon Hajo Road, North, near the Honda showroom in Amingaon, is a rapidly growing wellness center dedicated to providing comprehensive and holistic healthcare services to the vibrant community of Amingaon and its surrounding areas.  We recognize the unique needs of our community and strive to provide accessible, affordable, and high-quality services that promote physical, mental, and emotional well-being.  Our commitment to personalized care and community engagement sets us apart in the Assam business landscape, establishing us as a trusted resource for individuals seeking a path towards healthier, more fulfilling lives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike many generic wellness centers, Vibrant Wellness Society takes a truly holistic approach.  We understand that health is not merely the absence of disease, but a dynamic interplay of physical, mental, and emotional factors. Our services are designed to address these interconnected aspects of wellbeing, catering to the specific needs and cultural context of the Assamese population. We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, tailoring our services to individual requirements, and creating a supportive environment where individuals feel empowered to take control of their health journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our primary services encompass a wide range of therapeutic modalities designed to address diverse wellness needs.  These include, but are not limited to, personalized yoga and meditation programs adapted to suit various fitness levels and age groups;  traditional Ayurvedic treatments incorporating locally sourced herbs and practices;  nutritional counseling informed by both modern scientific understanding and traditional Assamese dietary wisdom; and stress management workshops tailored to the challenges of modern life in Amingaon. We also offer specialized programs for prenatal and postnatal care, focusing on the physical and emotional support mothers need during this crucial life stage.  These services are delivered by highly trained and experienced professionals committed to providing compassionate, effective care. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>One of our unique selling points is our unwavering commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible.  This reflects our commitment to supporting local farmers and businesses, while also ensuring the highest quality and authenticity of our treatments. We believe in the power of natural remedies and traditional practices, combined with evidence-based modern approaches, to achieve optimal wellbeing.  Our nutritional counseling, for example, integrates the nutritional benefits of locally available fruits, vegetables, and grains with up-to-date dietary guidelines. This approach resonates deeply with the community\'s cultural preferences and contributes to a more sustainable and responsible wellness model.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The growing demand for accessible and culturally sensitive wellness solutions in Amingaon highlights the critical need for a center like Vibrant Wellness Society.  Many individuals lack access to quality healthcare, or face cultural barriers to receiving appropriate support for their wellbeing. We aim to fill this gap by providing convenient, affordable, and culturally sensitive services that promote health equity across our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Vibrant Wellness Society, exceptional customer service is paramount.  We cultivate a welcoming and supportive environment where clients feel comfortable, respected, and understood.  We prioritize open communication, active listening, and personalized care plans. Each client\'s experience is tailored to their specific needs and goals, creating a truly individualized journey towards improved well-being. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond our immediate clients.  We actively engage with the Amingaon community through various outreach initiatives, such as workshops, health awareness campaigns, and collaborations with local organizations.  We believe in fostering a sense of community and shared responsibility for health and wellness.  By building strong relationships with our clients and the broader community, we aim to create a ripple effect of positive change, empowering individuals and strengthening the social fabric of Amingaon.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Vibrant Wellness Society envisions becoming the leading holistic wellness center in Amingaon and the surrounding regions.  We plan to expand our range of services to include additional therapeutic modalities, such as physiotherapy and acupuncture, based on evolving community needs and emerging trends in the wellness industry.  Furthermore, we aspire to develop specialized programs addressing specific health concerns prevalent in the region, such as diabetes management and cardiovascular health.  Our commitment to ongoing professional development for our staff ensures that we remain at the forefront of innovative wellness practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also plan to strengthen our community outreach programs through collaborations with local schools, businesses, and NGOs.  Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable model for accessible and affordable wellness services, contributing to the overall health and prosperity of the Amingaon community.  We believe that a thriving community is built on the foundation of healthy individuals, and we are committed to playing a vital role in achieving this vision.  Through ongoing innovation, community engagement, and a steadfast commitment to excellence, Vibrant Wellness Society aims to become a beacon of holistic well-being in Amingaon for years to come.</p>', 'Amingaon, Panipara Amingaon Hajo Road, North, near Honda showroom', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9678437554', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:50:37', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(686, 'Swabhabik foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Swabhabik Foundation: Nurturing Assam\'s Potential</h1>\n\n<p>Swabhabik Foundation, located at 4RQ3+H6X, Pragati Path, is a dynamic and impactful organization dedicated to fostering sustainable development and community empowerment within Assam.  We are deeply committed to addressing critical local challenges through innovative programs and collaborative partnerships.  Our unique approach combines traditional wisdom with modern methodologies, creating a holistic and effective framework for positive change.  Unlike many organizations that operate from a distance, Swabhabik is firmly rooted in the Assamese community, understanding its nuances and contributing directly to its advancement. This localized approach allows us to deliver targeted solutions with maximum impact and lasting benefits.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Assamese business landscape presents a diverse array of needs and opportunities. Swabhabik Foundation actively engages with these needs, prioritizing initiatives that demonstrate significant potential for long-term, sustainable growth.  Our deep understanding of local contexts allows us to identify underserved communities and tailor our programs to their specific requirements.  This commitment to relevance distinguishes Swabhabik from broader, less focused development initiatives.  We are committed to building resilience and fostering self-reliance within the communities we serve.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Swabhabik Foundation offers a range of services focused on capacity building, sustainable livelihoods, and community development.  Our core offerings include skills development programs tailored to the local job market, providing crucial training in areas such as agriculture, handicrafts, and information technology.  We also work extensively in promoting sustainable agricultural practices, empowering farmers with knowledge and resources to enhance their productivity and income.  This includes training in organic farming techniques, water management, and efficient resource utilization.  Furthermore, we support the development of micro, small, and medium enterprises (MSMEs) by offering business management training, access to microfinance, and market linkage opportunities.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Swabhabik is our focus on integrating traditional Assamese crafts and skills into modern markets.  We work closely with artisans, helping them to improve their techniques, access wider markets, and receive fair compensation for their work.  This preservation and promotion of cultural heritage is integral to our mission, creating both economic opportunity and cultural preservation. We also actively engage in environmental conservation initiatives, promoting sustainable practices and raising awareness about the importance of biodiversity in the region. Our unique selling point lies in our holistic approach, recognizing the interconnectedness of economic, social, and environmental factors in achieving sustainable development.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Swabhabik Foundation, our approach to customer service is built on trust, transparency, and genuine engagement.  We believe that lasting change requires collaborative partnerships, and we work closely with beneficiaries to co-create solutions that meet their needs and reflect their aspirations. Our engagement extends beyond merely providing services; it\'s about fostering long-term relationships built on mutual respect and shared responsibility.  We strive to empower individuals and communities to become self-reliant, fostering a sense of ownership and pride in their accomplishments.  This personalized and participatory approach distinguishes us from organizations that adopt a more transactional model.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our deep roots within the local community ensure that our efforts are aligned with the cultural values and social fabric of Assam. We utilize local languages and culturally appropriate communication strategies to ensure inclusivity and accessibility for all.  Regular community meetings, feedback sessions, and transparent reporting mechanisms are utilized to strengthen our accountability and foster trust with our stakeholders. We are committed to continuous improvement, constantly seeking feedback and adapting our approaches to maximize our impact.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Swabhabik Foundation envisions a future where Assamese communities are thriving, resilient, and empowered to shape their own destinies. We aim to expand our reach, both geographically and in terms of program scope, reaching more individuals and communities across the state. This includes exploring new partnerships with other organizations, government bodies, and private sector entities to leverage resources and amplify our impact. We will continue to invest in innovative approaches to capacity building, using technology and data-driven approaches to enhance efficiency and effectiveness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a sustainable financial model for the foundation, enabling long-term programmatic impact without relying solely on external funding.  This includes exploring opportunities for social enterprises and income-generating activities linked to our core programs.  We also aim to build a strong network of alumni and community leaders, creating a legacy of empowered individuals who continue to drive positive change within their communities.  Ultimately, our vision is to contribute significantly to the economic and social prosperity of Assam, creating a more inclusive and sustainable future for generations to come.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Swabhabik Foundation is more than just an organization; it\'s a commitment to the people of Assam.  We are dedicated to working alongside communities, nurturing their potential, and building a brighter future together.</p>', '4RQ3+H6X, Pragati Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:50:45', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(687, 'Sanjeevan Wellness Home', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Sanjeevan Wellness Home: Nurturing Wellbeing in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam at House no- 62, Bye Lane Number 1, Sanjeevan Wellness Home stands as a beacon of holistic wellbeing, offering a unique blend of traditional Ayurvedic practices and modern wellness therapies.  We are committed to providing personalized care that addresses the specific needs of the Assamese community, fostering a sense of serenity and promoting a vibrant, healthy lifestyle. Our approach distinguishes us within the growing wellness sector of Assam, setting a new standard for comprehensive and compassionate care. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At Sanjeevan Wellness Home, we offer a comprehensive range of services designed to rejuvenate the mind, body, and spirit. Our primary focus lies in delivering authentic Ayurvedic treatments, utilizing time-tested techniques and locally sourced, high-quality ingredients. These include personalized Ayurvedic consultations, herbal therapies, Panchakarma treatments (a traditional detoxification process), and yoga and meditation sessions tailored to individual needs and physical capabilities.  We also offer a selection of carefully curated Ayurvedic products, including herbal oils, balms, and teas, all made with locally sourced, organically grown ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to personalized care.  We understand that each individual’s wellness journey is unique, and therefore we prioritize a detailed consultation process to understand our clients\' specific health concerns, lifestyle habits, and overall wellbeing goals.  This allows us to tailor our services to achieve optimal results.  Furthermore, our deep understanding of Assamese culture and the prevalent health challenges within the community enables us to provide culturally sensitive and highly effective treatments.  We address the specific needs of our clients, understanding the prevalence of certain conditions and tailoring our approaches accordingly. This personalized approach, combined with our focus on traditional Ayurvedic methods alongside modern wellness practices, sets us apart in the local market. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Sanjeevan Wellness Home, our clients are not just patients; they are individuals on a journey towards optimal health and well-being. We strive to create a serene and welcoming atmosphere, fostering a sense of trust and comfort from the moment they step through our doors. Our team of highly trained and experienced professionals is dedicated to providing exceptional customer service, offering personalized attention and compassionate care throughout the entire wellness journey. We believe in open communication and actively involve our clients in their treatment plans, ensuring they feel empowered and informed every step of the way.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We build strong relationships with our clients, providing ongoing support and guidance even after their initial treatment is complete.  This commitment to building a strong local community is vital to our success. We actively participate in local health initiatives and workshops, sharing our knowledge and expertise to promote wellness within the wider community. We believe in fostering a sense of community around wellbeing, encouraging individuals to take an active role in their own health and contributing to a healthier Assam.  Our commitment extends beyond providing excellent services; we strive to be a positive force within the local community. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Sanjeevan Wellness Home has ambitious plans for growth and expansion.  We envision becoming a leading provider of holistic wellness services in Assam, expanding our range of services to include additional therapies and wellness programs.  This includes exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote a holistic approach to wellbeing. We plan to expand our team of highly skilled professionals, further enhancing our ability to serve a wider client base.  <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish a renowned center of excellence for Ayurvedic and holistic wellness, recognized both within Assam and beyond.  We plan to achieve this through a commitment to continuous improvement, ongoing training for our staff, and a relentless focus on delivering exceptional customer experiences. We also aim to conduct research and contribute to the advancement of traditional Ayurvedic practices, ensuring their continued relevance in a modern world.  Through our dedication to providing high-quality, culturally sensitive care, Sanjeevan Wellness Home is poised to become a leading contributor to the health and wellbeing of the Assamese community for years to come. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We are committed to sustainability and ethical business practices. Our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients and supporting local farmers is integral to our vision.  We are continually seeking ways to minimize our environmental impact and promote responsible practices throughout our operations. Our future vision is one of growth, sustainability, and community impact, ensuring that Sanjeevan Wellness Home remains a trusted and respected institution within the Assamese landscape.  <br> <br> </p>', 'House no- 62, Bye Lane Number 1', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9678817275', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:55:11', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(688, 'ASHADEEP Day Rehabilitation Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>ASHADEEP Day Rehabilitation Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Located at 5PCW+XCP, Bilpar Rd, ASHADEEP Day Rehabilitation Centre stands as a beacon of hope and recovery in the heart of Assam.  We are a dedicated day rehabilitation centre providing comprehensive, compassionate, and evidence-based care to individuals striving to overcome various physical and cognitive challenges.  Our unique approach combines modern therapeutic techniques with a deep understanding of the local cultural context, ensuring our services are both effective and culturally sensitive. This sets us apart in the Assam healthcare landscape, where access to specialized rehabilitation services remains a critical need.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>ASHADEEP recognizes the vital role rehabilitation plays in improving the quality of life for individuals facing diverse health issues.  The lack of readily accessible, high-quality rehabilitation options in the region inspired our founding. We are committed to filling this gap by providing exceptional care and support tailored to the individual needs of each client. Our commitment to excellence is reflected in our rigorous standards, qualified staff, and dedication to continuous improvement. We believe in empowering individuals to regain their independence and participate fully in their communities.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of therapeutic interventions designed to address diverse needs.  These include, but are not limited to, physiotherapy, occupational therapy, speech therapy, and cognitive rehabilitation.  Our physiotherapy program utilizes advanced techniques to improve mobility, reduce pain, and enhance functional abilities.  Occupational therapy focuses on adapting daily living skills, fostering independence, and promoting participation in meaningful activities.  Speech therapy addresses communication challenges, helping individuals regain clarity and fluency.  Cognitive rehabilitation programs work to improve memory, attention, and problem-solving skills.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for ASHADEEP is our integration of traditional Assamese healing practices where appropriate, alongside modern therapeutic interventions. This holistic approach acknowledges the importance of cultural context in the healing process. We carefully consider individual needs and preferences, adapting our approach to create a personalized plan for each client.  Our focus extends beyond individual therapy; we offer support groups and educational workshops to promote community engagement and shared learning experiences, addressing the social determinants of health often neglected in rehabilitation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The local market needs in Assam include increased access to affordable and high-quality rehabilitation services.  Many individuals face significant travel barriers to access specialist care in larger cities. ASHADEEP addresses this by offering easily accessible, high-quality care within the community, utilizing readily available local resources.  Our pricing structure is designed to be affordable and inclusive, ensuring that our services are reachable for a wide range of individuals, irrespective of socio-economic status.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At ASHADEEP, we are committed to providing a warm, supportive, and respectful environment for all our clients. We believe that a positive and comfortable atmosphere is crucial for successful rehabilitation. Our dedicated and experienced team prioritizes building strong therapeutic relationships based on trust, empathy, and mutual respect. Regular communication with clients and their families is a cornerstone of our approach, ensuring a collaborative and informed journey toward recovery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond clinical care. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment that fosters a sense of community and belonging. We organize regular social events and support groups, encouraging interaction and shared experiences among clients.  We also work closely with local community organizations and healthcare providers to build strong referral networks and create a comprehensive support system for those we serve. We understand that rehabilitation is not solely a clinical process; it\'s a journey of personal growth and reintegration into society.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>ASHADEEP envisions a future where all individuals in Assam have access to high-quality rehabilitation services.  We plan to expand our services to incorporate new therapeutic modalities and specialized programs, adapting to the evolving needs of the community. This includes exploring partnerships with local medical institutions and expanding our team of highly skilled professionals.  We also aim to increase community outreach programs, educating the public about the benefits of rehabilitation and reducing the stigma often associated with disability.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish ASHADEEP as a leading rehabilitation centre in Assam, recognized for its excellence in care, innovative approaches, and commitment to community engagement. We are dedicated to continuously improving our services, expanding our reach, and making a lasting impact on the lives of those we serve. Through continued investment in training, technology, and community partnerships, we will strive to be a centre of excellence for rehabilitation in Assam, promoting a healthier, more inclusive, and vibrant community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>ASHADEEP Day Rehabilitation Centre is more than just a rehabilitation facility; it is a place of hope, healing, and empowerment. We are dedicated to helping individuals regain their independence, enhance their quality of life, and reintegrate into the community with dignity and confidence.</p>', '5PCW+XCP, Bilpar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9435043308', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:55:18', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(689, 'Natun Anubhuti wellness home', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Natun Anubhuti Wellness Home: A Haven of Holistic Healing in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at House no: 14, Vivekananda Path, Natun Anubhuti Wellness Home offers a unique and transformative wellness experience, deeply rooted in the rich cultural heritage of Assam while embracing modern holistic practices.  We strive to be more than just a wellness center; we aim to be a sanctuary where individuals can reconnect with their inner selves, nurture their physical and mental well-being, and discover a renewed sense of balance and vitality.  In a region increasingly focused on fast-paced urban life, Natun Anubhuti offers a much-needed respite, providing a space for mindful rejuvenation and self-discovery, distinct from the typical wellness offerings in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to providing authentic and personalized wellness solutions sets us apart. We understand that each individual\'s journey to wellness is unique, and therefore, our services are tailored to meet specific needs and preferences.  We believe in a holistic approach that integrates traditional Assamese healing practices with contemporary wellness therapies, creating a truly integrated and effective experience.  This unique blend caters perfectly to the local market\'s growing interest in both traditional and modern wellness solutions, bridging the gap between ancient wisdom and cutting-edge techniques.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At Natun Anubhuti, we offer a diverse range of services designed to promote holistic well-being. Our primary offerings include traditional Assamese massage therapies, incorporating locally sourced herbal oils and techniques passed down through generations.  These massages not only relax the body but also aim to improve circulation and energy flow, aligning with the principles of Ayurvedic medicine.  In addition to massage, we offer yoga and meditation classes, guided by experienced instructors.  These sessions emphasize mindful movement and breathwork, promoting both physical and mental strength and flexibility. We also incorporate aromatherapy using essential oils derived from indigenous Assamese plants, creating a truly immersive and locally sourced wellness experience.   Furthermore, we provide personalized consultations to help clients develop tailored wellness plans that meet their individual needs, goals, and lifestyles. This personalized approach differentiates us from broader wellness offerings, focusing on the individual\'s specific journey to health.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in the seamless integration of traditional Assamese practices with contemporary wellness modalities. This creates a truly unique and authentic experience, unavailable elsewhere in the region. We use only locally sourced, ethically produced materials whenever possible, supporting the local economy and promoting sustainable practices. This commitment to local resources reflects our dedication to providing authentic Assamese wellness and contributes to the sustainability of both our business and the community we serve.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Natun Anubhuti, we prioritize creating a warm, welcoming, and nurturing environment where clients feel comfortable and respected. Our team of highly trained and experienced professionals is committed to providing exceptional customer service, exceeding expectations and building strong, lasting relationships with our clients. We believe that exceptional customer service is an integral part of the healing process, and we strive to create a space where individuals feel completely at ease and supported on their journey to wellness.  This personalized approach is crucial in a context where trust and a genuine connection are paramount.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We foster a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events, supporting local artisans, and employing local practitioners. We prioritize using locally sourced materials and products, contributing to the economic development of the region. We also offer workshops and educational programs to promote awareness of holistic wellness practices and their benefits within the community, aiming to increase overall well-being. Our commitment to community engagement is not merely a business strategy; it is a core value that reflects our deep respect for our local environment and the people who make it thrive.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Natun Anubhuti Wellness Home envisions becoming a leading holistic wellness center in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, authentic approach, and strong community ties.  We plan to expand our range of services to include additional therapies and wellness programs, such as specialized workshops on stress management, healthy eating, and mindfulness techniques.  We also plan to develop strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to further strengthen our community presence and reach.  This expansion will not only increase our service offerings but will also bolster our position as a key contributor to the wellness ecosystem of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing Natun Anubhuti as a nationally recognized wellness destination, attracting both domestic and international clients.  This involves developing a robust online presence, expanding our marketing efforts, and continuously upgrading our facilities and services to maintain the highest standards of quality and excellence.  We believe that by staying true to our core values and continually adapting to the changing needs of our clients, we can achieve our ambitious goals and establish Natun Anubhuti as a leading force in promoting holistic wellness in Assam and beyond. Our commitment to providing a truly transformative wellness experience will remain our driving force, ensuring that Natun Anubhuti continues to be a beacon of well-being for years to come.</p> <br> <br>', 'House no : 14, vivekananda path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:55:26', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(690, 'Awakening Foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Awakening Foundation: Empowering Communities in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Awakening Foundation, located at H/no.3, Gharmora Satra path, M. T. Road, near Gate Hospital, is a dynamic and impactful organization dedicated to fostering sustainable development and positive social change within the local communities of Assam.  We recognize the unique challenges and opportunities present in the region and strive to create impactful, long-lasting solutions that empower individuals and uplift entire communities.  Unlike generic development organizations, Awakening Foundation focuses on a holistic approach, addressing interconnected issues of education, healthcare, and economic empowerment simultaneously. Our deep understanding of the local context and strong commitment to community participation sets us apart in the Assam business landscape.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our unique approach stems from a belief that lasting transformation necessitates a multi-pronged strategy. We avoid the pitfalls of siloed interventions, recognizing that poverty and underdevelopment are multifaceted problems.  Our work is driven by a commitment to transparency, accountability, and evidence-based programming, ensuring that our efforts translate into tangible and measurable results for the communities we serve.  We believe in fostering partnerships and collaborations, working closely with local governments, NGOs, and community leaders to maximize impact and sustainability. This collaborative approach ensures that our programs are culturally sensitive and responsive to the specific needs of the people we aim to serve.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Awakening Foundation offers a range of integrated services designed to address critical development needs.  Our primary focus areas include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Educational Initiatives:</strong>  We work to improve access to quality education, focusing on both formal and non-formal learning. This includes providing educational resources, teacher training programs, scholarships for underprivileged students, and initiatives promoting adult literacy.  Our unique selling point here lies in our emphasis on skill-building and vocational training, ensuring that education leads to improved economic opportunities.</li><br>\n    <li><strong>Healthcare Access and Promotion:</strong> We strive to improve healthcare access and promote preventive health practices. This includes organizing health camps, raising awareness on hygiene and sanitation, and facilitating access to basic healthcare services for marginalized communities. We differentiate ourselves through a strong focus on community health workers and empowering local individuals to act as first responders and health educators.</li><br>\n    <li><strong>Economic Empowerment Programs:</strong> We facilitate economic empowerment through various initiatives, including skill development workshops, microfinance schemes, and support for entrepreneurship.  Our unique approach involves fostering sustainable livelihoods through initiatives aligned with local resources and traditions, promoting self-reliance and economic independence.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These services are designed to meet the specific needs of the local market, addressing prevalent challenges such as unemployment, lack of access to quality education and healthcare, and limited economic opportunities.  Our approach is uniquely tailored to the socio-economic realities of Assam, making us a vital partner in driving positive change.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Awakening Foundation, our commitment extends beyond service delivery. We prioritize building strong and trusting relationships with the communities we serve.  Our customer experience is defined by our commitment to transparency, participatory decision-making, and ongoing engagement. We actively seek feedback from beneficiaries, ensuring that our programs remain relevant and impactful. We believe in empowering communities to take ownership of their development, acting as facilitators and catalysts for change, rather than simply delivering services from a distance.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to community engagement also extends to our approach to internal operations. We prioritize employing local staff, promoting sustainable employment opportunities within the community, and fostering a strong sense of ownership and responsibility within our team.  This approach builds trust, ensuring our work resonates deeply with the local population and leading to more effective and sustainable outcomes. We regularly organize community events and awareness campaigns, strengthening our connection with the local population and promoting our ongoing work.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Awakening Foundation envisions a future where all communities in Assam have equal access to quality education, healthcare, and economic opportunities. Our long-term goal is to establish ourselves as a leading development organization in the region, recognized for our impact and commitment to sustainable change.  We plan to expand our operational reach, develop new programs aligned with evolving community needs, and strengthen our collaborations with local and international partners.  This expansion will be guided by rigorous monitoring and evaluation, ensuring the continued effectiveness and impact of our initiatives.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>We aim to leverage technology and innovative approaches to improve the efficiency and reach of our programs.  We are exploring the use of digital tools to enhance communication, data management, and service delivery.  We also plan to invest in capacity building initiatives, ensuring that we have a strong and skilled team capable of meeting the challenges of sustainable development.  We believe that by combining our deep understanding of local needs with innovative strategies and a strong commitment to community empowerment, Awakening Foundation can play a crucial role in shaping a brighter future for Assam.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Through our continued dedication to these core values and our unwavering commitment to the communities we serve, Awakening Foundation is poised for significant growth and long-term impact in the region. We invite you to join us in our mission to awaken potential and empower communities across Assam.</p>', 'H/no.3, Gharmora Satra path, M. T. Road, near gate hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:55:34', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(691, 'Phoenix Multi Speciality Wellness Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Phoenix Multi Speciality Wellness Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at Ashoka Byelane, Ajanta Path, House no 37 A, the Phoenix Multi Speciality Wellness Centre stands as a beacon of holistic well-being in the vibrant Assamese landscape.  We are not merely a clinic; we are a comprehensive wellness destination, meticulously designed to cater to the diverse healthcare needs of the local community.  Our unique approach blends traditional Assamese healing practices with cutting-edge medical advancements, providing a truly integrated and personalized experience. We are committed to setting a new standard of excellence in healthcare accessibility and affordability within the region. <br> <br></p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Phoenix Multi Speciality Wellness Centre offers a wide array of services designed to address the multifaceted aspects of health and well-being. Our core services include general medical consultations, encompassing preventative care and the management of chronic conditions.  We boast a dedicated team of qualified specialists, providing expert care in areas such as cardiology, diabetology, gastroenterology and pulmonology.  This multi-disciplinary approach ensures comprehensive diagnosis and treatment plans, saving our patients valuable time and effort. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Beyond general medicine, we offer specialized services that respond to specific needs within the Assamese community.  Our emphasis on preventive care includes health check-up packages tailored to different age groups and risk profiles.  We recognize the unique health challenges faced by the local population and have designed programs that directly address them. We also provide physiotherapy and rehabilitation services, utilizing advanced techniques to aid recovery and improve physical function. Our commitment extends to mental wellness, with dedicated consultations and therapies designed to promote mental well-being and resilience within a culturally sensitive context.  This includes incorporating elements of traditional Assamese practices to enhance the efficacy and acceptance of these treatments. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Phoenix is our focus on affordable and accessible healthcare. We understand the economic realities of the community and strive to offer competitive pricing and flexible payment options. We actively engage with local insurance providers to ensure our services are easily accessible to those with health insurance coverage. Our dedication to providing high-quality, affordable care contributes to bridging the healthcare gap in the region. <br> <br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Phoenix Multi Speciality Wellness Centre, patient care is our paramount concern. We believe in fostering a warm, welcoming, and patient-centered environment.  Our highly trained and compassionate staff are dedicated to providing personalized care, taking the time to understand each patient’s unique needs and concerns.  We emphasize clear and transparent communication, ensuring patients are fully informed about their health status, treatment options, and expected outcomes. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>We prioritize building strong relationships with our patients, creating a sense of trust and mutual respect. We understand that healthcare can be a daunting experience, and we strive to make the process as comfortable and stress-free as possible. We also recognize the importance of cultural sensitivity in healthcare delivery. Our staff is trained to interact respectfully with patients from diverse backgrounds, ensuring everyone feels understood and valued. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Connecting with the local community is integral to our mission. We actively participate in local health awareness campaigns, providing education and resources to promote preventative healthcare practices. We work in collaboration with local organizations and community leaders to address specific health challenges and improve overall well-being within the region. Our commitment to community engagement underscores our dedication to improving the health and wellness of the people of Assam.  We believe in being more than just a healthcare provider – we aim to be a trusted partner in the community\'s journey towards better health. <br> <br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Phoenix Multi Speciality Wellness Centre has ambitious growth plans for the future.  We envision expanding our service offerings to include more specialized medical areas, based on the evolving needs of the community. This includes exploring opportunities in advanced diagnostic imaging and minimally invasive surgical procedures.  We are committed to investing in state-of-the-art medical technology and equipment to ensure we provide the most effective and up-to-date care. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Phoenix as the leading multi-specialty wellness centre in the Assam region, renowned for its exceptional quality of care, commitment to community engagement, and dedication to affordable healthcare. We plan to achieve this through strategic partnerships, continuous professional development of our staff, and a relentless focus on improving the health and well-being of our patients.  We are committed to ongoing research and development, exploring innovative approaches to healthcare delivery and embracing technological advancements to optimize patient outcomes and enhance the overall patient experience. <br> <br></p>\n\n<p>We aspire to become a model for integrated, community-focused healthcare in Assam, setting a new standard of excellence that inspires other healthcare providers and positively impacts the health of the entire region.  Our vision is not merely about providing healthcare services; it\'s about building a healthier, happier, and more vibrant community, one patient at a time. <br> <br></p>', 'Ashoka Byelane , Ajanta Path , House no 37 A', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8471935700', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 21:55:42', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(692, 'Saanvi Wellness Foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Saanvi Wellness Foundation</h1>\n<p>Located at 5P7C+P64, PNGB Road, Saanvi Wellness Foundation is a rapidly growing organization dedicated to improving the holistic well-being of individuals and communities in Assam.  We recognize the unique health challenges faced by the region and strive to provide accessible, culturally sensitive, and high-quality wellness services.  Our commitment to community engagement and personalized care sets us apart in the vibrant and evolving Assam healthcare landscape, fostering a healthier and more vibrant society.<br><br></p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>Saanvi Wellness Foundation offers a comprehensive range of services designed to address the diverse wellness needs of the Assamese population.  Our primary focus is on preventive healthcare, promoting healthy lifestyles, and providing accessible support for individuals navigating various health concerns. This includes, but is not limited to, conducting health awareness programs focused on nutrition, hygiene, and disease prevention. We also offer tailored yoga and meditation sessions, incorporating traditional Assamese practices to enhance physical and mental well-being.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Saanvi Wellness Foundation is our commitment to integrating traditional Assamese healing practices with modern healthcare approaches. We believe that a holistic approach, respecting the rich cultural heritage of the region, is crucial for effective and sustainable wellness solutions. Our team includes qualified healthcare professionals with expertise in both modern medicine and traditional healing methods, ensuring a unique and comprehensive service offering. We also provide counselling services, assisting individuals in managing stress, anxiety, and other mental health challenges, utilizing evidence-based practices adapted to the cultural context of Assam.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we actively collaborate with local communities and organizations to promote health equity and accessibility.  Our outreach programs extend to underserved populations, providing essential healthcare information and resources. We believe in empowering individuals to take control of their health and well-being through education, awareness, and accessible support. We understand the specific needs of our local communities and are committed to addressing these needs through our culturally sensitive and comprehensive approach.<br><br></p>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>At Saanvi Wellness Foundation, we prioritize a personalized and empathetic approach to customer service.  We understand that each individual\'s journey to wellness is unique, and we strive to create a supportive and nurturing environment where clients feel heard, understood, and empowered.  Our commitment to building strong relationships with our clients extends beyond the provision of services; we aim to create a sense of community and shared responsibility for health and well-being.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>Our team is comprised of compassionate and skilled professionals who are deeply committed to providing high-quality care. We place a strong emphasis on open communication, actively listening to client needs and preferences, and tailoring our services to meet their individual goals. We offer flexible appointment scheduling to accommodate busy lifestyles, and we maintain transparent communication regarding treatment plans and costs. We believe in fostering trust and building long-term relationships based on mutual respect and understanding.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>Beyond our individual client interactions, we actively engage with the local community through health workshops, seminars, and collaborative projects.  We believe in fostering a culture of wellness that extends beyond our clinic walls and permeates the entire community. This commitment to community engagement reflects our dedication to building a healthier and more vibrant Assam, one person at a time. We also participate in local health fairs and initiatives to reach a wider audience and increase awareness of our services. We believe in the power of community engagement as a crucial aspect of our overall mission.<br><br></p>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>Saanvi Wellness Foundation has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  We envision becoming a leading provider of holistic wellness services in Assam, extending our reach to more communities and expanding our range of services to meet the evolving needs of the population. This includes exploring opportunities to integrate technology into our services, improving accessibility and efficiency. We are also committed to fostering partnerships with other healthcare providers and organizations to strengthen our network and collectively enhance the overall health outcomes for the region.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Saanvi Wellness Foundation as a center of excellence for holistic well-being in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement.  We aim to contribute significantly to improving the health and well-being of the Assamese population, promoting a healthier and more prosperous future for all. We will achieve this through continuous improvement, strategic partnerships, and a steadfast commitment to our core values of compassion, integrity, and excellence. We also aim to conduct further research on the effectiveness of traditional Assamese healing methods, combining them with modern medical practices for optimal outcomes.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>In addition to service expansion, Saanvi Wellness Foundation plans to invest in the professional development of our staff, ensuring they possess the latest skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional care.  We believe that continuous learning and improvement are crucial to providing the highest quality services. We will strive to stay at the forefront of advancements in holistic healthcare, adapting our approach to meet the ever-evolving needs of our clients and the community we serve.  Our commitment to excellence and our unwavering dedication to the well-being of the people of Assam will remain at the heart of our future endeavors.<br><br></p>', '5P7C+P64, PNGB Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:00:11', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(693, 'Elite Care Home Healthcare cum physiotherapy center', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Elite Care Home Healthcare cum Physiotherapy Center</h1>\n<p>Located at 117, Tripura Rd, Elite Care Home Healthcare cum Physiotherapy Center stands as a beacon of comprehensive healthcare in the heart of Assam.  We are committed to providing superior, personalized care, bridging the gap between traditional home healthcare and advanced physiotherapy services.  Our unique approach combines the warmth and comfort of home-based care with the expertise of skilled physiotherapists, creating a holistic and effective healthcare solution tailored to the specific needs of our community.  This integrated model differentiates us significantly within the local healthcare landscape, offering a level of convenience and comprehensive care seldom found in Assam\'s existing healthcare infrastructure. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>Elite Care Home Healthcare cum Physiotherapy Center offers a comprehensive range of services designed to improve the overall well-being of our patients.  Our home healthcare services encompass a broad spectrum, from post-operative care and wound management to assistance with daily living activities for elderly individuals or those recovering from illness or injury. We employ registered nurses and trained caregivers who provide compassionate and efficient care in the comfort of a patient\'s home. This minimizes disruption to the patient\'s daily routine and offers a personalized level of attention not always found in larger healthcare settings. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our physiotherapy department is equally robust, staffed by licensed and experienced physiotherapists. We offer a wide range of therapeutic modalities, including manual therapy, electrotherapy, and exercise prescription.  We address a diverse range of conditions, from sports injuries and musculoskeletal problems to neurological rehabilitation and post-stroke recovery.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized approach to treatment. Each patient receives a comprehensive assessment, leading to a tailored treatment plan designed to achieve their specific functional goals and improve their quality of life.  This individual focus ensures that our patients receive the most effective and targeted care possible. We also utilize evidence-based practices and continually update our techniques to ensure we offer the most advanced and effective therapies available.  The integration of our home healthcare and physiotherapy services allows us to seamlessly address both the immediate and long-term needs of our patients, fostering a more efficient and holistic recovery process. This integrated approach is particularly relevant to the local market needs in Assam, where access to specialized care can be limited. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>At Elite Care Home Healthcare cum Physiotherapy Center, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success.  We prioritize building strong relationships with our patients and their families, providing a caring and supportive environment where their concerns are heard and addressed. Open communication is key; we maintain regular contact with patients and their loved ones, providing updates on their progress and addressing any questions or concerns promptly.  We understand that healthcare can be a stressful experience, and we strive to create a comforting and reassuring atmosphere, making the process as smooth and manageable as possible. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and collaborations with local healthcare providers and organizations.  This commitment to community outreach strengthens our bond with our patients and reinforces our role as a trusted provider of healthcare in the region. Our aim is to be more than just a healthcare provider; we strive to be a vital part of the community fabric, contributing to the well-being of the people we serve. We foster a culture of empathy and understanding, ensuring that each interaction with our patients reflects our dedication to their overall well-being, going beyond the purely clinical aspects of care. This approach contributes significantly to our strong reputation and positive feedback within the local community. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>Elite Care Home Healthcare cum Physiotherapy Center has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We envision becoming the leading provider of integrated home healthcare and physiotherapy services in Assam, further enhancing our reputation for excellence and extending our reach to serve a wider population.  This includes exploring strategic partnerships with local hospitals and clinics to enhance referral networks and broaden access to our services.  We also plan to invest in advanced technologies and training to ensure our team remains at the forefront of healthcare innovation. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include developing specialized programs to address specific healthcare needs within the community, such as geriatric care and rehabilitation services for individuals with chronic conditions. We aim to continually improve our infrastructure and expand our services to better meet the evolving needs of our patients and the community. We also intend to further develop our community engagement initiatives, enhancing our role as a trusted resource for health information and support. We are committed to fostering a culture of continuous improvement, incorporating feedback from patients and staff to refine our services and enhance the overall quality of care we provide.  Ultimately, our vision is to create a thriving healthcare center that sets a new standard for integrated care in Assam, improving the lives of individuals and contributing positively to the overall health and well-being of our community. <br> <br> </p>', '117, Tripura Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:00:18', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(694, 'PRATIKAR - Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>PRATIKAR - Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at Last Gate, House No. 22, Devdaru Path, near Rajdhani Masjid Path, PRATIKAR - Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre stands as a beacon of hope and healing for the community.  We are a dedicated physiotherapy and rehabilitation centre committed to providing high-quality, personalized care to individuals of all ages and backgrounds striving for optimal physical well-being.  In a region where access to specialized physiotherapy can sometimes be limited, PRATIKAR aims to bridge this gap, offering comprehensive services tailored to the unique needs of the Assamese population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment goes beyond simply treating symptoms. We strive to understand the root causes of our patients\' conditions, employing a holistic approach that combines evidence-based techniques with a deep understanding of individual needs and cultural sensitivities. This patient-centric approach, coupled with our state-of-the-art facilities and highly qualified professionals, differentiates PRATIKAR from other physiotherapy centers in the region. We understand the unique challenges faced by our community, and our services are designed to address these challenges effectively and compassionately.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At PRATIKAR, we offer a wide range of physiotherapy and rehabilitation services, catering to a diverse spectrum of needs. Our core services include, but are not limited to, musculoskeletal rehabilitation, neurological rehabilitation, sports physiotherapy, geriatric physiotherapy, and pediatric physiotherapy.  We utilize a variety of advanced techniques, including manual therapy, therapeutic exercise, electrotherapy, and ultrasound therapy, to help our patients regain strength, mobility, and function.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized treatment plans.  Each patient undergoes a thorough assessment to determine their specific needs and goals, ensuring that the treatment plan is tailored to their unique circumstances and progress is meticulously monitored.  This individualised approach, coupled with our commitment to ongoing professional development, allows us to provide the most effective and efficient care possible.  We understand that the needs of the Assamese community are diverse, ranging from age-related issues to sports injuries and post-surgical rehabilitation, and we are equipped to address them all.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the importance of patient education, we actively involve our patients in their treatment process.  We provide detailed explanations of their conditions, treatment plans, and home exercise programs, empowering them to take an active role in their recovery.  Our focus on preventative care further sets us apart.  We provide guidance on posture correction, ergonomics, and injury prevention strategies, helping individuals avoid future problems and maintain long-term well-being. This proactive approach aligns perfectly with the increasing health consciousness within the community, and we\'re proud to contribute to a healthier Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At PRATIKAR, we are committed to creating a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment for our patients.  We believe that exceptional customer service is not just a matter of politeness; it\'s about building trust and fostering a genuine connection with each individual.  Our staff, comprised of experienced and compassionate physiotherapists and support personnel, are dedicated to providing a personalized and attentive experience. We go the extra mile to understand our patients\' concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and ensure their comfort throughout their treatment journey.  We also strive to make our services accessible to the wider community, considering factors such as language barriers and transportation challenges.  Our commitment to building a strong relationship with our patients extends beyond their immediate treatment, providing ongoing support and resources as needed.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives such as health awareness programs and workshops.  These activities allow us to educate the public on the importance of physiotherapy, injury prevention, and healthy lifestyles, fostering a strong sense of community engagement.  We believe that a healthy community is a strong community, and we are committed to playing our part in promoting the well-being of all Assamese people.  This local focus helps us understand and respond to the specific health needs of the region, strengthening our commitment to personalized care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>PRATIKAR envisions a future where we become the leading physiotherapy and rehabilitation centre in Guwahati, renowned for our exceptional service, advanced techniques, and unwavering commitment to our patients.  We plan to expand our services to include additional specialized areas within physiotherapy, potentially incorporating advanced technologies and treatment modalities as they become available.  Our long-term goal is to establish a network of PRATIKAR centres across Assam, bringing high-quality physiotherapy and rehabilitation services to a wider population.  We will achieve this through strategic partnerships, continuous staff training, and ongoing investment in state-of-the-art equipment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we are committed to fostering a culture of ongoing learning and development within our team.  This involves regular participation in professional conferences, workshops, and continuing education programs to ensure that our staff stays abreast of the latest advancements in physiotherapy and rehabilitation techniques.  Our vision is to not only treat patients but also to empower them to lead healthier, more active lives.  This commitment to continuous improvement and expansion will allow us to remain at the forefront of the physiotherapy field, consistently delivering exceptional care and achieving our vision of a healthier Assam.</p> <br> <br>', 'last gate, House no 22, Devdaru Path, near Rajdhani Masjid Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8486348771', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:05:10', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(695, 'Regain life foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Regain Life Foundation: Restoring Hope and Wellbeing in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Regain Life Foundation, located at 4RRC+MF5, is a non-profit organization dedicated to improving the quality of life for vulnerable communities in Assam.  We are committed to holistic well-being, addressing critical needs through a comprehensive suite of programs and services. Our unique approach combines traditional values with modern methodologies, creating impactful interventions tailored to the specific challenges faced by the people of Assam.  We are not merely providing assistance; we are building a sustainable ecosystem of support that empowers individuals and strengthens communities.  In the dynamic landscape of Assam\'s social development sector, Regain Life Foundation stands out through its unwavering commitment to long-term impact and collaborative partnerships.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our focus is on fostering self-reliance and promoting sustainable development within the communities we serve.  This commitment differentiates us from many other organizations, as we prioritize capacity building and empowerment over short-term relief efforts.  We believe in investing in the potential of individuals and communities, ensuring that our interventions create lasting positive change.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Regain Life Foundation offers a range of services designed to address critical needs within the local community.  Our core programs include:  comprehensive healthcare initiatives focusing on preventative care and access to essential medical services, particularly in underserved areas; educational programs aimed at improving literacy rates and providing vocational training to enhance employability; and sustainable livelihood projects focusing on empowering individuals and families through income-generating activities.  These initiatives are tailored to the specific needs identified within the communities, ensuring relevance and maximizing impact.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Regain Life Foundation is our deep understanding of the cultural context and the unique challenges faced by the people of Assam.  Our programs are carefully designed to be culturally sensitive and to respect the traditions and values of the communities we serve. This ensures that our interventions are not only effective but also sustainable and embraced by the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we leverage technology to enhance the efficiency and reach of our services.  Our data-driven approach allows us to monitor and evaluate our programs rigorously, ensuring that we are constantly adapting and improving our interventions to achieve optimal results. This ensures we meet the specific needs of the local market effectively and efficiently.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of Regain Life Foundation’s philosophy is a profound commitment to compassionate and respectful customer service.  We recognize that the individuals and communities we serve are facing significant challenges, and we approach our work with empathy and understanding. We believe in building strong, trusting relationships based on mutual respect and collaboration.  Our team consists of dedicated professionals with extensive experience in community development and social work who are deeply committed to our mission.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond simply providing services. We actively engage with the local community through regular meetings, community events, and participatory planning processes. This ensures that our interventions are responsive to the evolving needs of the community and that they are implemented in a collaborative and transparent manner. We actively seek feedback and incorporate it into our operations to continually improve our service delivery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Transparency and accountability are cornerstones of our operations.  We maintain meticulous records of our activities and regularly publish reports to ensure that our stakeholders are informed about our progress and impact. This commitment to transparency builds trust and confidence within the community and fosters stronger relationships with our partners and funders.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Regain Life Foundation envisions a future where all communities in Assam have access to quality healthcare, education, and livelihood opportunities.  Our long-term goal is to become a leading organization in the social development sector in Assam, known for its innovative approaches, impactful interventions, and unwavering commitment to serving vulnerable populations. We are committed to scaling our existing programs, expanding our reach to new communities, and developing innovative strategies to address emerging challenges.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We plan to achieve this through strategic partnerships with government agencies, non-governmental organizations, and the private sector.  We are actively seeking opportunities for collaboration to enhance our impact and reach a wider audience. This collaborative approach is crucial to achieving our ambitious goals and creating sustainable change.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our future plans also include investing in research and development to identify innovative solutions to address emerging challenges.  We believe in harnessing the power of data and technology to improve the effectiveness and efficiency of our interventions.  Our dedication to continuous improvement ensures that we remain at the forefront of social development in Assam, constantly adapting and evolving to meet the changing needs of the communities we serve.  Regain Life Foundation is committed to building a brighter future for Assam, one life at a time.</p> <br> <br>', '4RRC+MF5', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:05:19', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(696, 'Ressurected foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Ressurected Foundation: Revitalizing Communities in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Ressurected Foundation, located at 4RP7+JH2, Six Mile, Panjabari Road, F.A Ahmed Road, Citizen Lane, is a dynamic and impactful organization dedicated to the sustainable development and upliftment of communities in Assam.  We are committed to fostering positive change through targeted initiatives that address critical social and economic needs, thereby contributing significantly to the evolving business landscape of the region.  Our approach is rooted in collaboration, transparency, and a deep understanding of the specific challenges and opportunities present in our local context. We strive to be more than just a foundation; we aim to be a catalyst for lasting positive transformation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike many larger, externally funded organizations, Ressurected Foundation maintains a strong focus on local partnerships and resource mobilization. This allows us to tailor our projects to the unique requirements of the communities we serve, ensuring maximum impact and sustainability. Our work is guided by a commitment to empowerment, fostering self-reliance and promoting inclusive growth. We believe in building capacity within communities, enabling them to lead their own development initiatives rather than relying on external assistance indefinitely.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Ressurected Foundation offers a diverse range of services focused on community empowerment and sustainable development.  Our core programs include skill development training for youth and women, focusing on marketable skills relevant to the local economy. This may include vocational training in areas like tailoring, carpentry, or digital literacy, equipping individuals with the tools they need to secure gainful employment. We also undertake environmental conservation projects, such as afforestation initiatives and promoting sustainable agricultural practices, contributing to the long-term health and prosperity of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique aspect of our approach is the integration of microfinance initiatives into our programs. We provide access to small loans and financial literacy training, empowering individuals to start their own businesses and create economic opportunities within their communities. This holistic approach, combining skill development and financial support, ensures greater long-term impact and sustainability of our projects. We also provide support for education, focusing on improving access to quality education for underprivileged children.  Our unique selling point is our deeply embedded approach, building strong relationships with community members to ensure project relevance and sustainability. We understand that each community has specific needs, and we work closely with them to tailor our projects to effectively address those needs. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of Ressurected Foundation is a commitment to exceptional customer service.  Our \"customer\" in this context includes the communities we serve and the various stakeholders involved in our projects.  We maintain open and transparent communication, regularly engaging with community members to ensure their needs are met and their voices are heard.  Our participatory approach fosters a sense of ownership and responsibility, encouraging community members to actively participate in the design and implementation of projects.  This fosters a sense of collaboration and strengthens community cohesion.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with local leaders, government agencies, and other non-governmental organizations to build strong partnerships and leverage resources effectively. We believe in building trust and lasting relationships, creating a supportive network that works together for the betterment of the region.  Our dedication to transparency and accountability ensures that resources are utilized efficiently and effectively, maximizing the impact of our initiatives. We also invest in regular evaluations to monitor progress, assess the impact of our work, and make adjustments as needed to ensure optimal outcomes. We firmly believe that continuous improvement is essential to achieving our long-term goals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Ressurected Foundation envisions a future where the communities we serve are thriving and self-reliant.  Our long-term goals include expanding our reach to serve more communities across Assam, replicating our successful programs in other regions, and developing new initiatives that address emerging challenges. We plan to expand our skill development programs, incorporating new and in-demand skills to ensure that our training remains relevant to the evolving job market.  This includes exploring opportunities in renewable energy, sustainable tourism, and other sectors with high growth potential in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are also committed to strengthening our organizational capacity, building a more robust infrastructure, and attracting skilled professionals to our team.  This will enable us to effectively manage larger-scale projects and implement more complex initiatives. We plan to explore opportunities for strategic partnerships with both local and international organizations to leverage expertise and resources. We aim to become a leading organization in community development in Assam, recognized for our impact and commitment to sustainable and inclusive growth. We are committed to using technology to enhance our efficiency and impact, exploring innovative approaches to project management and community engagement. By continuously adapting and evolving, we aim to ensure that Ressurected Foundation remains a vital force for positive change in Assam for many years to come.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Ressurected Foundation aims to be a beacon of hope and progress, empowering communities to build a brighter future for themselves and future generations. We are committed to being a positive and enduring presence in the Assam business landscape, contributing significantly to the region\'s economic and social progress.</p>', '4RP7+JH2, Six mile, panjabari road, F.A ahmed road, Citizen Ln', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:05:28', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
