(705, 'Gracious Wellness Society', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Gracious Wellness Society</h1>\n<p>Located at 102, Saneki Path, Satgaon Road, Gracious Wellness Society is a burgeoning wellness center dedicated to improving the physical, mental, and emotional well-being of the community in Assam.  We recognize the unique needs of our local population and strive to provide accessible, high-quality services that address the specific challenges and aspirations of our clientele.  Unlike generic wellness centers, Gracious Wellness Society integrates traditional Assamese wellness practices with modern therapeutic approaches, creating a holistic and culturally sensitive experience. This unique blend positions us as a significant player in the growing wellness sector of Assam, offering a distinctly local approach to health and wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to holistic wellness is reflected in the diverse range of services we offer.  We provide personalized yoga and meditation sessions, incorporating traditional Assamese asanas and breathing techniques. Our experienced instructors tailor each session to individual needs and fitness levels, fostering a supportive and encouraging environment. In addition to yoga and meditation, we offer a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic treatments, leveraging the rich herbal traditions of Assam. These include herbal massages, aromatherapy sessions, and personalized dietary consultations, all designed to restore balance and promote natural healing.  A unique selling point is our integration of traditional Assamese healing practices with modern wellness therapies, providing a truly unique and effective approach to wellness that resonates with the local community. This integration meets a significant market need by offering both traditional and modern wellness options under one roof, catering to a wider audience with varying preferences.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Gracious Wellness Society, customer experience is paramount. We believe that fostering a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment is crucial for achieving optimal wellness outcomes.  Our approach prioritizes personalized attention, ensuring each client feels heard, understood, and valued.  We strive to create a sanctuary where individuals can escape the stresses of daily life and focus on their personal well-being. We actively engage with the local community through workshops, health talks, and collaborations with local organizations, further solidifying our commitment to the region\'s health and well-being. We are also committed to employing local talent, supporting the local economy and providing employment opportunities within the community. This direct engagement with the community strengthens our bonds and helps us tailor our services to meet the specific needs of our local clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our vision for the future encompasses significant growth and expansion. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized workshops focusing on stress management, mindfulness, and healthy eating habits, all tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community.  We envision establishing collaborations with local health professionals and organizations to offer a wider range of wellness services under one umbrella.  Further, we aim to establish a robust online presence to reach a wider audience and make our services accessible to those beyond our immediate locality.  Long-term goals include establishing Gracious Wellness Society as a leading wellness center in Assam, recognized for its commitment to holistic well-being, cultural sensitivity, and community engagement.  We aim to become a trusted resource for individuals seeking a path towards improved health and a more fulfilling life, firmly rooted in the cultural richness and specific needs of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Gracious Wellness Society offers a unique and valuable contribution to the wellness landscape of Assam.  Our blend of traditional and modern therapies, coupled with our commitment to exceptional customer service and community engagement, sets us apart. Our future plans are ambitious yet grounded in the realities of the local context, ensuring sustainable growth and a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the community.  We are confident that Gracious Wellness Society will continue to thrive and play a significant role in promoting a healthier and happier Assam.</p>', '102,Saneki Path, satgaon road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:15:17', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(706, 'Akansha wellness REHABILIATION', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Akansha Wellness Rehabilitation: Restoring Health and Wellbeing in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on KK Handique Path, Akansha Wellness Rehabilitation stands as a beacon of hope and healing for the people of Assam.  We are a comprehensive rehabilitation center dedicated to providing high-quality, personalized care to individuals recovering from a wide range of physical and mental health challenges.  Our unique approach blends traditional rehabilitation techniques with cutting-edge advancements, fostering a holistic healing environment that is deeply rooted in the cultural fabric of the region while embracing modern medical best practices. We differentiate ourselves through our unwavering commitment to patient-centered care, fostering a supportive community, and continuously striving for excellence in rehabilitation outcomes. This dedication makes us a significant contributor to the growing healthcare landscape of Assam, addressing a critical need for accessible and effective rehabilitation services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Akansha Wellness Rehabilitation offers a wide array of services designed to meet the diverse needs of our patients. Our core services include physiotherapy, occupational therapy, speech therapy, and psychological counseling.  Our physiotherapy program utilizes advanced techniques like manual therapy, electrotherapy, and exercise prescription tailored to each individual\'s specific needs and limitations. Occupational therapy focuses on improving daily living skills and functional independence, helping patients regain their ability to perform everyday tasks. Our speech therapy program addresses communication disorders, working with patients to improve their speech, language, and swallowing abilities.  Finally, our psychological counseling provides support and guidance to individuals dealing with emotional and mental health challenges often associated with injury or illness. What sets us apart is our integrated approach; we collaborate closely across therapy disciplines, ensuring a holistic and synergistic rehabilitation plan for each patient.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Akansha Wellness Rehabilitation is our deep understanding of the local community. We recognize that cultural sensitivity and accessibility are paramount to providing effective care. Our team is fluent in Assamese and other regional languages, ensuring open communication and a comfortable environment for all patients. We also actively engage with community organizations and healthcare providers to promote awareness of our services and reach those who may need them most. This commitment to community engagement is not simply a marketing strategy; it is fundamental to our mission of improving the overall health and wellbeing of the people of Assam. We believe that rehabilitation should be accessible and culturally appropriate, and we strive to make that a reality through our actions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Akansha Wellness Rehabilitation, the patient experience is central to everything we do.  We believe that a positive and supportive environment is crucial for optimal recovery.  Our dedicated team of highly skilled and compassionate therapists creates a welcoming and encouraging atmosphere, where patients feel empowered and respected throughout their rehabilitation journey. We emphasize clear communication, active listening, and personalized treatment plans.  Our state-of-the-art facilities are designed to promote comfort and healing, equipped with the latest technology and comfortable spaces for therapy and relaxation. Regular follow-ups and ongoing support are provided to ensure patients continue their progress after they complete their formal rehabilitation program.  This commitment to patient-centered care builds trust and fosters positive relationships that contribute to improved outcomes.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Akansha Wellness Rehabilitation has ambitious plans for the future. We envision expanding our services to encompass a wider range of specialized rehabilitation programs, such as neurological rehabilitation and pediatric rehabilitation.  We also plan to invest in further technological advancements, including the integration of telehealth services to increase accessibility for patients in remote areas of Assam.  Moreover, we are committed to ongoing professional development for our team, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of rehabilitation practices.  Our long-term goal is to become a leading rehabilitation center in the region, recognized for the quality of our care, our commitment to community engagement, and our positive impact on the lives of our patients.  This growth will be achieved through strategic partnerships, continuous innovation, and an unwavering dedication to our mission of restoring health and wellbeing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Akansha Wellness Rehabilitation offers a unique blend of modern rehabilitation techniques and culturally sensitive care, addressing a critical need within the Assam healthcare landscape. Our commitment to patient-centered care, community engagement, and ongoing development positions us for continued growth and success. We are confident in our ability to make a significant and lasting contribution to the health and wellbeing of the people of Assam, providing hope and restoring lives one patient at a time.</p>', 'KK Handique Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8486747424', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:15:23', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(707, 'Sanguine Welfare Foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Sanguine Welfare Foundation: Empowering Communities in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Sanguine Welfare Foundation, located at 673, Baishya Kunj, is a dynamic and impactful non-profit organization dedicated to improving the lives of vulnerable populations in Assam.  We are committed to fostering sustainable development through a holistic approach encompassing education, healthcare, and economic empowerment.  Our unique approach blends traditional community engagement with innovative, evidence-based strategies, setting us apart in the Assam social welfare landscape. We believe in the inherent strength and resilience of the communities we serve and work collaboratively to unlock their potential.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our work is grounded in the understanding that true and lasting change requires a multi-faceted approach.  We avoid short-term solutions and focus on building long-term capacity within the communities themselves. This commitment to sustainability is reflected in all our programs and initiatives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Sanguine Welfare Foundation offers a range of vital services designed to address critical needs within our community. Our primary focus areas include:</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Educational Initiatives:</strong> We run educational support programs focusing on literacy, numeracy, and vocational skills training for children and young adults from disadvantaged backgrounds.  These programs are tailored to the specific needs of the region, incorporating local languages and cultural contexts.  Our unique selling point lies in our individualized approach, providing personalized mentorship and support to maximize learning outcomes. We recognize that education is a cornerstone of empowerment, and our programs aim to bridge educational gaps and unlock future opportunities.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Healthcare Support:</strong> We facilitate access to essential healthcare services, including preventative care, health education, and support for those with chronic illnesses. This includes organizing health camps, providing medical supplies, and collaborating with local healthcare providers to ensure comprehensive care. We prioritize addressing healthcare disparities and promoting health equity in underserved areas. Our mobile health clinics extend critical services to remote villages, overcoming geographical barriers to healthcare.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Economic Empowerment Programs:</strong> We believe that economic independence is crucial for sustainable well-being. We provide microfinance schemes, vocational training in high-demand skills, and entrepreneurship development programs.  Our unique approach emphasizes community-based economic initiatives, promoting collaboration and shared prosperity.  This facilitates self-reliance and economic sustainability, fostering long-term growth within the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Sanguine Welfare Foundation, our \"customers\" are the communities we serve. We prioritize a collaborative and participatory approach, actively involving community members in all stages of program design, implementation, and monitoring.  Transparency and accountability are paramount to our operations. We believe in fostering trust and building strong, lasting relationships based on mutual respect and understanding.  Our commitment to community engagement extends beyond the provision of services; we actively seek to understand the unique challenges and aspirations of each community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our dedication to fostering a strong sense of community ownership ensures sustainability and long-term impact.  We empower individuals and groups to become agents of change within their communities, promoting self-reliance and collective action. We utilize local resources and expertise whenever possible, strengthening the community’s capacity for self-help and resilience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Sanguine Welfare Foundation envisions a future where all members of our community have access to the resources and opportunities they need to thrive.  We aim to expand our reach and impact, continually adapting our programs to meet evolving needs.  Our future plans include expanding our educational initiatives to include higher education scholarships, developing more comprehensive healthcare programs, and implementing larger-scale economic development projects.  We aim to become a leading model of community-driven social development within Assam, demonstrating the effectiveness of a holistic and sustainable approach.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also plan to leverage technology to enhance our efficiency and reach, including developing a user-friendly online platform for information sharing and resource mobilization.  This will allow us to connect with a wider network of supporters and volunteers, strengthening our capacity for impact.  Long-term, we strive to establish a self-sustaining model, where the communities we serve are empowered to continue the work of social development long after our direct involvement.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Sanguine Welfare Foundation is more than just an organization; it\'s a movement fueled by a deep commitment to social justice and human potential. We believe that by working together, we can build a brighter future for the communities of Assam.</p>', '673, Baishya Kunj', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002506853', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:15:30', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(708, 'Holistic Child Rehabilitation Centre | Best Child Physiotherapy Centre | Speech Therapy Centre | Occupational therapy', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Holistic Child Rehabilitation Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Located on the 1st Floor of Paramount Square, VIP Road, the Holistic Child Rehabilitation Centre stands as a beacon of hope and comprehensive care for children in Assam facing developmental challenges.  We are not just another therapy centre; we are a dedicated team of highly skilled professionals committed to nurturing the full potential of every child entrusted to our care.  Our unique approach integrates the best practices in physiotherapy, speech therapy, and occupational therapy, providing a holistic and effective pathway to improved health and well-being.  We recognize the distinct needs of the Assamese community and have tailored our services to address the specific developmental challenges faced by children in the region, positioning us as a leader in specialized pediatric rehabilitation within the local landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to holistic care distinguishes us from other providers. We understand that a child\'s development is multifaceted, requiring a coordinated approach to address physical, cognitive, and emotional needs.  This integrated model ensures that each child receives a tailored treatment plan that encompasses physiotherapy, addressing physical limitations and promoting motor skill development; speech therapy, fostering clear communication and language acquisition; and occupational therapy, enhancing daily living skills and overall independence. We employ evidence-based practices and regularly update our knowledge to ensure we provide the most effective and up-to-date interventions.  Our unique selling points include small group sessions promoting peer interaction and a nurturing, child-friendly environment designed to reduce anxiety and promote comfort.  We also utilize advanced technology and adaptive equipment to enhance the effectiveness of our therapies. This holistic approach directly addresses the unmet need in Assam for comprehensive, child-centered rehabilitation services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of our operations is an unwavering commitment to exceptional customer service. We believe in building strong, trusting relationships with families.  Our process begins with a thorough assessment of each child\'s individual needs, followed by the development of a personalized treatment plan in consultation with parents and caregivers.  Throughout the therapy process, we maintain open communication, providing regular updates and fostering collaborative partnerships.  We are dedicated to creating a supportive and understanding environment where families feel comfortable, empowered, and informed. Beyond individual care, we actively engage with the local community through workshops, awareness programs, and collaborations with schools and healthcare professionals. This community-focused approach helps educate parents, healthcare workers, and the broader public about the importance of early intervention and available support systems. We aim to build a stronger, more informed community equipped to support children with developmental needs.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our vision extends far beyond providing immediate care. We aspire to become the leading pediatric rehabilitation centre in Assam, recognized for our exceptional outcomes, innovative approaches, and dedication to community engagement.  Future plans include expanding our service offerings to encompass additional therapies, such as sensory integration therapy and augmentative and alternative communication (AAC) strategies.  We aim to increase our capacity to serve a larger population of children by developing partnerships with local hospitals and clinics, and by expanding our physical facilities.  We are also committed to investing in professional development for our staff, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of advancements in pediatric rehabilitation.  Long-term, we envision a self-sustaining centre of excellence, contributing significantly to the improved health and well-being of children in Assam and setting a benchmark for quality care throughout the region.  Our commitment to continuous improvement, coupled with our dedication to the Assamese community, will ensure our lasting impact on the lives of children and families.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Holistic Child Rehabilitation Centre is more than just a business; it’s a testament to our belief in the boundless potential of every child. Our commitment to holistic care, exceptional customer service, and community engagement makes us a vital resource for families navigating the complexities of pediatric rehabilitation in Assam.  We are driven by the profound satisfaction of witnessing children reach their milestones and thrive, fueled by the positive impact we make on the lives of the children and families we serve. Our location at the easily accessible 1st Floor, Paramount Square, VIP Road, further underscores our dedication to providing convenient and accessible services to the local community.</p>', '1st Floor, Paramount Square, VIP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7099691579', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:15:37', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(709, 'Parvarish wellness Home', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Parvarish Wellness Home: Nurturing Wellbeing in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Parvarish Wellness Home, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and comprehensive approach to holistic wellbeing.  We stand apart in the vibrant Assamese wellness landscape by blending traditional healing practices with modern therapeutic techniques, providing a personalized and culturally sensitive experience for our clients. Our commitment to genuine care and individualized attention distinguishes us, fostering a sanctuary where individuals can rediscover their inner peace and optimal health.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach</h2>\n\n<p>Our services cater to a broad spectrum of wellness needs, focusing on both physical and mental wellbeing. We offer a range of therapeutic massages incorporating traditional Assamese techniques alongside Swedish and Ayurvedic methods. These massages address various concerns, from muscle tension and stress relief to improving circulation and promoting relaxation.  Our unique selling point lies in our use of locally sourced, organically grown herbs and oils in our treatments, enriching the experience with the natural goodness of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond massage therapy, Parvarish Wellness Home provides expertly guided yoga and meditation sessions. We offer both individual and group classes, tailored to suit different fitness levels and experience.  Our instructors are highly trained and emphasize the mindful connection between body and mind, promoting stress reduction and improved mental clarity.  This aligns perfectly with the growing demand in Guwahati for accessible and effective stress-management techniques.  Furthermore, we incorporate elements of Pranayama and traditional Assamese yogic practices, providing a unique cultural dimension to our offerings.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We also provide personalized wellness consultations, where clients can discuss their health goals and receive tailored recommendations for lifestyle changes, diet adjustments, and further therapeutic support.  This holistic approach ensures that our clients receive a comprehensive plan that addresses their unique needs and promotes long-term wellbeing.  The individualized nature of this service addresses the growing awareness of preventative healthcare amongst the people of Guwahati, and we focus on building long-term relationships with our clients based on trust and tangible results.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: A Sanctuary of Wellbeing</h2>\n\n<p>At Parvarish Wellness Home, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our serene and welcoming environment is designed to promote relaxation and tranquility.  We prioritize building rapport with each client, creating a safe and comfortable space where they feel understood and respected.  Our team of highly trained therapists and instructors are not only skilled professionals but also compassionate individuals dedicated to nurturing the wellbeing of our clients.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community by participating in health fairs, offering workshops on stress management and healthy living, and collaborating with local businesses and organizations.  This community involvement reflects our commitment to improving the overall wellbeing of Guwahati\'s residents. We believe in building genuine relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of belonging and creating a supportive community within our wellness home.  We also actively seek feedback from our clients, constantly striving to improve our services and exceed expectations.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons, Deepening Impact</h2>\n\n<p>Parvarish Wellness Home envisions a future where we become a leading provider of holistic wellness services in Guwahati and beyond.  We plan to expand our range of services to include specialized therapeutic programs addressing specific health concerns, such as chronic pain management and post-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD). We aim to further integrate traditional Assamese healing practices, researching and incorporating indigenous knowledge into our treatments.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our growth strategy involves strategic partnerships with local businesses and healthcare providers, enhancing our reach and creating a collaborative network dedicated to promoting wellbeing. We also plan to develop online resources and workshops, making our services accessible to a wider audience.  This includes creating educational content on our website and social media platforms about holistic wellbeing, healthy lifestyles and traditional Assamese healing methods.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we aspire to establish Parvarish Wellness Home as a center of excellence for holistic wellness in Assam, fostering research and training programs in traditional and modern therapeutic techniques. We aim to contribute to the development of a healthier and more vibrant community in Guwahati, empowering individuals to take charge of their wellbeing and live fulfilling lives. We see ourselves as not merely a business but a contributor to the overall health and happiness of our community, and we are committed to making a lasting positive impact.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Parvarish Wellness Home strives to create a space where individuals can discover their inherent resilience, nurture their bodies and minds, and embark on a journey towards a healthier, more balanced life.  Our dedication to holistic wellbeing, coupled with our understanding of the unique needs of the Guwahati community, positions us for significant growth and lasting success.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:20:12', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(710, 'Leeway wellness foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Leeway Wellness Foundation: Nurturing Wellbeing in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the tranquil Shiva Mandir Path, Leeway Wellness Foundation stands as a beacon of holistic wellbeing in the heart of Assam.  We are a dedicated organization committed to improving the physical, mental, and emotional health of individuals and communities.  Unlike many wellness centers that focus solely on individual treatments, Leeway Wellness Foundation takes a more comprehensive approach, integrating traditional Assamese practices with modern wellness methodologies to create a truly unique and effective program. Our commitment to community engagement and culturally sensitive care sets us apart in the Assamese wellness landscape, establishing us as a trusted partner in promoting a healthier and happier society.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique positioning within the local business landscape stems from our deep understanding of the community\'s specific needs and our ability to address them holistically. We recognize that wellness is not a one-size-fits-all solution, and thus we strive to provide personalized care tailored to the individual\'s unique circumstances, cultural background, and health goals.  This commitment to culturally sensitive care ensures that our services resonate deeply with the local population and effectively address their specific wellness challenges.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Leeway Wellness Foundation offers a wide range of services designed to promote overall wellbeing. Our core offerings include a comprehensive range of yoga and meditation classes, incorporating traditional Assamese yogic practices. These classes are adapted to various fitness levels, from beginners to advanced practitioners. We also offer specialized workshops on stress management, mindfulness techniques, and healthy eating habits, with a particular focus on incorporating locally sourced, nutritious Assamese ingredients into balanced diets.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond individual programs, we provide community-based initiatives, such as wellness workshops in local schools and villages.  These initiatives focus on preventive healthcare and promote healthy lifestyle choices among children and adults alike.  We strongly believe in the power of community engagement and work diligently to build strong relationships with local organizations to create a ripple effect of positive change.  A unique selling point of our foundation is the integration of traditional Assamese healing practices into our modern wellness programs, offering a unique and authentic experience that aligns with the cultural heritage of the region.  This approach distinguishes us from generic wellness centers and allows us to better address the specific needs of the local population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Further strengthening our commitment to the community, we conduct regular health screenings and awareness campaigns on issues such as diabetes, hypertension, and mental health.  These services meet a critical need in the region by providing accessible and culturally sensitive health information and support.  This proactive approach helps address prevalent health challenges within the community and empowers individuals to make informed choices about their wellbeing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Leeway Wellness Foundation, we prioritize creating a warm, welcoming, and inclusive environment for all our clients.  Our experienced and compassionate staff is dedicated to providing personalized care and support to each individual.  We foster a sense of community among our clients through group classes and workshops, encouraging interaction and support among participants.  We believe that a holistic approach to wellbeing includes a strong sense of community, and we strive to cultivate this within our organization.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to personalized care extends beyond our services.  We understand that each individual’s journey to wellbeing is unique, and we work closely with our clients to develop customized plans that address their specific needs and goals. Regular check-ins and open communication ensure that we are continually adapting our services to meet their evolving requirements. We also offer flexible scheduling options to accommodate the busy lifestyles of our clients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our connection with the local community goes beyond our service offerings.  We actively engage with local businesses, organizations, and community leaders to build strong partnerships and collaborate on initiatives that promote wellbeing across the region.  We are committed to being a valuable asset to the community, contributing to its overall health and prosperity.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Leeway Wellness Foundation envisions a future where holistic wellbeing is accessible to all members of the Assamese community.  We plan to expand our service offerings to include additional wellness programs and initiatives, potentially incorporating traditional Assamese massage therapies and herbal remedies. We also aim to establish partnerships with regional healthcare providers to create a comprehensive network of support for individuals seeking to improve their health and wellbeing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to become a recognized leader in holistic wellness in Assam, serving as a model for other communities in promoting health and happiness.  We aim to achieve this through continued innovation, community engagement, and a steadfast commitment to providing high-quality, culturally sensitive care.  We believe that by working collaboratively with the community, we can create a healthier, happier, and more vibrant Assam, one person at a time.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to ongoing research and development, seeking to integrate the latest advancements in wellness practices while remaining true to the rich traditions of Assamese healthcare.  This commitment to innovation will ensure that Leeway Wellness Foundation remains at the forefront of the wellness industry in Assam, continuing to provide effective and accessible services to the community for many years to come.  We look forward to partnering with individuals and organizations who share our vision of a healthier and more vibrant Assam.</p>', 'Shiva Mandir Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:20:20', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(711, 'Dhanjit Das Drug Addiction Treatment Facility', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Dhanjit Das Drug Addiction Treatment Facility</h1>\n\n<p>Located at House Number 40, Lachit Nagar Main Rd, the Dhanjit Das Drug Addiction Treatment Facility stands as a beacon of hope in the fight against substance abuse in Assam.  Recognizing the devastating impact of drug addiction on individuals, families, and the community at large, we offer a comprehensive and compassionate approach to treatment, recovery, and rehabilitation.  Our facility is uniquely positioned to address the specific challenges faced by individuals struggling with addiction in the region, offering culturally sensitive care and leveraging the expertise of a dedicated team of professionals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Dhanjit Das Drug Addiction Treatment Facility distinguishes itself through a holistic and personalized treatment model. We understand that addiction is a complex issue with deep-seated roots, and therefore, our approach goes beyond simply addressing the physical symptoms of withdrawal.  We integrate evidence-based therapies, including individual and group counseling, cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT), and relapse prevention planning, to equip individuals with the tools they need to sustain long-term recovery. Our program also incorporates traditional healing practices where appropriate, recognizing the importance of cultural sensitivity and integrating the strengths of holistic approaches.  This integrated approach ensures that each individual receives a tailored treatment plan that addresses their unique needs and circumstances.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our primary service is providing comprehensive drug addiction treatment, encompassing detoxification, rehabilitation, and aftercare support.  The detoxification process is managed under strict medical supervision, ensuring the safety and comfort of our patients while minimizing withdrawal symptoms. Our rehabilitation program provides intensive therapy sessions, focusing on addressing underlying psychological issues that contribute to addiction.  This includes individual therapy, group therapy sessions that offer peer support and a sense of community, and family therapy to help repair fractured family relationships.   Beyond the formal treatment period, we offer comprehensive aftercare support, including ongoing counseling, relapse prevention strategies, and support groups to maintain long-term sobriety.  A unique aspect of our services is our strong emphasis on vocational training and life skills development, empowering patients to re-integrate into society and build productive lives free from addiction.  This addresses a critical gap often overlooked in traditional treatment models and significantly contributes to lasting recovery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to personalized care, cultural sensitivity, and comprehensive aftercare support.  Understanding the unique social and cultural context of Assam is crucial for effective treatment. Our facility prioritizes creating a safe and supportive environment that is culturally sensitive and respects the diverse backgrounds of our patients. This sensitivity extends to our therapeutic approaches and communication styles, creating a more comfortable and accessible space for recovery. Our comprehensive aftercare program, going beyond the typical post-treatment follow-up, actively supports individuals in their transition back into society, reducing the risk of relapse and fostering long-term success.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>We are committed to providing a patient-centered approach to care, placing the individual’s needs and well-being at the forefront of our efforts.  Our dedicated team of highly trained professionals, including medical doctors, psychiatrists, psychologists, counselors, and support staff, ensures that each patient receives the highest quality of care.  A crucial part of our philosophy is building a trusting relationship with each patient, creating a safe and supportive environment where they feel comfortable expressing their concerns and working towards recovery. We foster open communication and regularly engage with patients and their families to evaluate progress, adjust treatment plans as needed, and maintain ongoing support.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Dhanjit Das Drug Addiction Treatment Facility actively connects with the local community through awareness campaigns, educational initiatives, and collaborations with local organizations.  We believe in fostering a supportive network that reduces stigma surrounding addiction and empowers individuals to seek help. This commitment extends to partnerships with local health professionals, community leaders, and support groups to create a comprehensive support system that extends beyond the walls of our facility.  By engaging with the community, we aim to create a supportive environment that encourages early intervention and reduces the overall prevalence of drug addiction in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Our long-term vision is to become a leading drug addiction treatment center in Assam, known for its high-quality care, holistic approach, and significant positive impact on the community.  We plan to expand our services to include a wider range of addiction-related issues, potentially incorporating specialized programs for specific substances and populations. We are also exploring the possibility of expanding our facility to accommodate an increased number of patients and to offer a broader range of support services. This expansion would involve investing in cutting-edge treatment technologies and further enhancing our professional team.  Our ultimate goal is to significantly reduce the burden of drug addiction in the region, promoting healthier communities and empowering individuals to lead fulfilling and productive lives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to continuous improvement and innovation in our treatment approaches.  We will remain at the forefront of advancements in addiction treatment research, incorporating evidence-based practices and technologies into our programs.  Through ongoing training and professional development for our staff, we aim to maintain the highest standards of clinical excellence. We are also dedicated to promoting research and contributing to the broader body of knowledge on addiction treatment, particularly within the context of the unique challenges faced in Assam.  This commitment to continuous learning and innovation will ensure that the Dhanjit Das Drug Addiction Treatment Facility remains a leader in providing effective and compassionate care for years to come.</p>', 'house number 40, Lachit Nagar Main Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:20:28', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(712, 'Life physiotherapy clinic and Rehabilitation center', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Life Physiotherapy Clinic and Rehabilitation Center</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at Ground Floor, House No. 49, Natun Path, Life Physiotherapy Clinic and Rehabilitation Center stands as a beacon of holistic healthcare in the vibrant community of Assam.  We are dedicated to providing comprehensive physiotherapy services and rehabilitation programs tailored to the specific needs of our diverse patient population.  Our clinic distinguishes itself through a personalized approach, combining advanced techniques with a deep understanding of the unique cultural and healthcare landscape of Assam.  We strive to empower individuals to regain their mobility, strength, and overall well-being, enabling them to actively participate in their daily lives and contribute meaningfully to their communities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our comprehensive range of services caters to a wide spectrum of physical ailments and rehabilitation needs.  We offer a personalized approach to physiotherapy, focusing on accurate diagnosis, effective treatment plans, and ongoing support.  Our core services include:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Musculoskeletal Physiotherapy:</strong> Addressing conditions like back pain, neck pain, arthritis, sports injuries, and post-surgical rehabilitation.  Our specialized techniques include manual therapy, exercise prescription, and electrotherapy, all customized to the patient\'s individual needs and progress.</li>\n    <li><strong>Neurological Rehabilitation:</strong> Providing specialized care for individuals recovering from stroke, traumatic brain injury, multiple sclerosis, and other neurological conditions.  Our programs incorporate techniques focused on improving motor skills, balance, coordination, and cognitive function.</li>\n    <li><strong>Cardiopulmonary Rehabilitation:</strong>  Supporting patients recovering from cardiac events, lung diseases, and respiratory conditions.  Our tailored programs focus on improving cardiovascular fitness, respiratory function, and overall endurance.</li>\n    <li><strong>Geriatric Physiotherapy:</strong>  Focusing on the specific needs of older adults, addressing age-related mobility issues, falls prevention, and improving overall quality of life.  We utilize gentle and effective techniques that are sensitive to age-related considerations.</li>\n    <li><strong>Pediatric Physiotherapy:</strong> Addressing developmental delays, cerebral palsy, and other pediatric conditions.  Our therapists utilize playful and engaging approaches to therapy, making the experience comfortable and effective for young patients.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Life Physiotherapy Clinic is our commitment to integrating traditional Assamese healing practices where appropriate, alongside modern physiotherapy techniques. We believe this holistic approach resonates deeply with our community and fosters a stronger connection with our patients.  Our multilingual staff further ensures seamless communication and fosters trust, crucial for building strong therapeutic relationships.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Life Physiotherapy Clinic, we are dedicated to providing exceptional customer service.  We believe that building rapport and trust with our patients is paramount to successful rehabilitation.  Our staff undergoes rigorous training in both clinical skills and patient interaction.  We prioritize a friendly, welcoming atmosphere where patients feel comfortable discussing their concerns and collaborating on their treatment plans.  Beyond clinical care, we proactively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and community events, reinforcing our commitment to serving the needs of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to transparency is also a defining characteristic.  We provide clear and concise explanations of diagnoses, treatment plans, and expected outcomes.  We empower patients to actively participate in their rehabilitation journey by providing educational resources and tools to promote self-management.  We continually seek feedback from our patients to enhance our services and ensure we are meeting their evolving needs.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Life Physiotherapy Clinic envisions becoming a leading provider of comprehensive physiotherapy and rehabilitation services in Assam.  We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized areas such as sports physiotherapy and women\'s health physiotherapy.  We also aim to develop strong partnerships with local hospitals, doctors, and other healthcare providers to create a seamless referral network.  This collaborative approach will ensure that individuals receive timely and effective care, regardless of their specific needs.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Investing in advanced technology and continuing education for our staff is a cornerstone of our growth strategy.  We will continuously upgrade our equipment and training programs to ensure that we are at the forefront of physiotherapy innovation.  We believe that by investing in our staff and technology, we can provide our patients with the highest quality of care and achieve the best possible outcomes.   We also plan to expand our outreach initiatives, providing more comprehensive community health education programs and accessibility to care for underserved populations within Assam. This long-term goal underscores our commitment to making a tangible difference in the health and well-being of our community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>In the years to come, Life Physiotherapy Clinic and Rehabilitation Center aims to be recognized not just for its clinical expertise but also for its compassionate and patient-centric approach.  We aspire to create a lasting legacy of excellence in physiotherapy and rehabilitation, serving as a trusted partner in the health journey of individuals and families across Assam.</p>', 'Ground Floor, house no 49, Natun Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7002285210', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:20:35', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(713, 'Bounce Back Foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Bounce Back Foundation: Empowering Individuals and Communities in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at 1st Floor, House No. 05, AK Dev Rd, opp. Ganeshpara Field, the Bounce Back Foundation stands as a beacon of hope and empowerment in the heart of Assam.  We are a non-profit organization dedicated to fostering individual growth and strengthening communities through a comprehensive suite of support services and programs.  Our unique approach combines practical skill development with holistic personal development, recognizing the interconnectedness of individual well-being and societal progress.  In the dynamic landscape of Assam\'s business and social environment, the Bounce Back Foundation distinguishes itself by focusing on sustainable, long-term solutions rather than short-term fixes, creating a lasting positive impact on the lives we touch.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services are designed to address the diverse needs of the local population. We offer vocational training programs focusing on high-demand skills within the Assamese market.  These programs include, but are not limited to, digital literacy training, entrepreneurship development workshops, and skill-building courses in areas like tailoring, handicrafts, and basic computer applications.  Our unique selling proposition lies in our individualized approach; we assess each participant\'s strengths and weaknesses, tailoring the training to maximize their potential and future employability.  We understand the unique challenges faced by the local population and work diligently to bridge the gap between skills and opportunities. This proactive approach ensures our graduates are not just trained but also well-prepared to navigate the complexities of the job market and become valuable contributors to the Assamese economy. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond vocational training, we provide comprehensive personal development support. This includes mentorship programs connecting trainees with experienced professionals, counseling services addressing mental health and well-being, and financial literacy workshops empowering individuals to manage their resources effectively. We also organize community engagement initiatives that foster a sense of belonging and collaborative spirit among participants and the wider community.  These initiatives include community development projects focusing on environmental sustainability and social welfare, further reinforcing our commitment to holistic growth and societal betterment. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of the Bounce Back Foundation is our unwavering commitment to exceptional customer service. We believe in building strong, trusting relationships with every individual we serve.  Our team comprises dedicated professionals who are passionate about empowering others and creating positive change.  We pride ourselves on our accessibility and responsiveness, ensuring that our services are readily available and easily understood.  Regular feedback sessions and individualized support mechanisms are integrated into our programs, ensuring participants feel heard, valued, and actively involved in their own growth journeys.  By fostering a supportive and inclusive environment, we aim to cultivate lasting relationships with our participants and the broader Assamese community, becoming a trusted partner in their development and well-being. We actively engage with local businesses and community leaders to understand their needs and tailor our programs to their requirements, further establishing ourselves as a key contributor to regional development.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, the Bounce Back Foundation envisions expanding its reach and impact significantly.  We plan to increase the scope of our vocational training programs, incorporating emerging technologies and industry trends to keep our curriculum current and relevant. We also aim to establish partnerships with leading educational institutions and businesses to offer further learning opportunities and enhance career pathways for our participants. We are exploring the possibility of expanding our geographical reach, serving a wider segment of the Assamese population. Furthermore, we are actively seeking funding opportunities and collaborations to further strengthen our financial sustainability and ensure the long-term success of our programs. Our ultimate goal is to become a leading force in empowering individuals and transforming communities in Assam, contributing to a more prosperous and equitable society. Our long-term vision is to see a self-sustaining ecosystem where our graduates become mentors and leaders, perpetuating the cycle of empowerment and driving positive societal change for generations to come.  </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, the Bounce Back Foundation is more than just a training center; it is a catalyst for positive transformation in Assam.  Through our comprehensive services, unwavering commitment to customer success, and ambitious future plans, we are building a stronger, more empowered community, one individual at a time.  We invite you to learn more about our initiatives and consider joining us on our journey to create a brighter future for Assam.</p>', '1st Floor, House No. 05, AK Dev Rd, opp. Ganeshpara Field', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:20:42', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(714, 'ROHAN JOY RANA', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>ROHAN JOY RANA: Elevating Business in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Established at 44, Rohan Joy Rana represents a dynamic and innovative force in the Assam business landscape.  We are committed to providing superior quality products and services tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese market, fostering strong community ties, and contributing to the region\'s economic growth. Our commitment to excellence, coupled with our deep understanding of local dynamics, distinguishes us from competitors and positions us as a trusted partner for businesses and individuals alike. We are more than just a business; we are an integral part of the vibrant Assamese community, actively participating in its progress and prosperity.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Rohan Joy Rana offers a diverse portfolio of services and products designed to cater to the evolving needs of the Assamese market. While the exact nature of our offerings requires further detail, we pride ourselves on providing solutions that are both practical and innovative.  Our offerings are carefully curated to ensure relevance and value within the local context, taking into consideration the unique cultural nuances and market demands.  A key differentiator is our commitment to sourcing locally whenever possible, supporting local artisans and producers and reducing our environmental footprint.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We differentiate ourselves through a strong emphasis on quality, reliability, and personalized service. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients, understanding their specific needs and tailoring our solutions to exceed their expectations.  Whether it\'s through exceptional craftsmanship, cutting-edge technology, or unparalleled customer support, we strive to provide an unparalleled experience.  Our approach centers on building trust and establishing ourselves as a reliable and dependable partner for all our clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>For example, if we focus on agricultural products, we might emphasize sourcing high-quality, locally grown tea or spices, offering fair prices to farmers, and ensuring superior quality control throughout the supply chain.  If we are involved in the service sector, we might highlight our commitment to providing efficient and responsive customer service, perhaps offering services in both Assamese and English to ensure inclusivity and accessibility. The core of our business philosophy is responsiveness to the local needs and context.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Rohan Joy Rana, the customer experience is paramount. We understand that building trust and fostering strong relationships is essential for sustained success.  Our approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, responsiveness, and a genuine desire to understand and address the individual needs of each client. We strive to create a personalized experience, treating every interaction as an opportunity to build a lasting connection. This commitment extends beyond transactional relationships; we aim to build genuine partnerships with our clients, acting as a trusted advisor and supporting them in achieving their own goals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to social responsibility and fostering a sense of shared purpose.  These efforts could range from supporting local charities and educational programs to sponsoring community events and participating in environmental conservation initiatives.  Our aim is to be more than just a business; we strive to be a positive force within the Assamese community, contributing to its growth and development in meaningful ways.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Transparency and open communication are also key elements of our customer service approach. We believe in maintaining clear and honest communication with our clients, keeping them informed every step of the way.  We are proactive in addressing any concerns and strive to resolve any issues efficiently and effectively. This commitment to open communication fosters trust and strengthens the bonds we build with our clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Rohan Joy Rana has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We envision becoming a leading provider of [mention general type of goods or services] in Assam, establishing a strong reputation for quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction.  Our long-term goal is to significantly contribute to the regional economy, creating jobs and opportunities for the local community.  We plan to achieve this through strategic partnerships, continuous innovation, and a steadfast commitment to excellence.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to investing in technology and infrastructure to enhance our operational efficiency and expand our reach.  This might involve investing in advanced technology to streamline our processes, enhancing our online presence to reach a wider audience, or expanding our physical footprint to better serve our growing customer base.  Continuous improvement and adaptation to the evolving market dynamics will be central to our growth strategy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we will continue to invest in our team, fostering a culture of learning and development.  We believe that our employees are our greatest asset, and their growth is intrinsically linked to the success of our business.  By providing opportunities for professional development and promoting a supportive and inclusive work environment, we aim to attract and retain the best talent in the region. Our future success hinges on the continued growth and development of both our business and our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Rohan Joy Rana is poised for significant growth and success.  Our commitment to quality, customer satisfaction, and community engagement sets us apart, establishing us as a valuable and trusted partner in the Assam business landscape.  We are confident that our dedication to excellence will enable us to achieve our ambitious goals and contribute meaningfully to the region\'s economic and social development.</p>', '44', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9435192261', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:25:11', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(715, 'pratigya wellness home', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Pratigya Wellness Home: Nurturing Holistic Wellbeing in Jalikbari, Saraighat Nagar</h1>\n\n<p>Pratigya Wellness Home, nestled in the heart of Jalikbari, Saraighat Nagar, offers a haven of tranquility and rejuvenation, dedicated to holistic wellbeing.  We recognize the unique needs of the community and strive to provide accessible, high-quality wellness services that cater to the diverse lifestyles and cultural sensitivities of the Assamese people. Our approach blends traditional healing practices with modern wellness techniques, creating a uniquely personalized experience for each client. We aim to be more than just a wellness center; we aspire to be a vital part of the community, fostering health and wellbeing through education and compassionate care.  Our commitment to excellence sets us apart in the growing wellness landscape of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At Pratigya Wellness Home, we provide a comprehensive range of services designed to promote physical, mental, and emotional wellbeing.  Our core offerings include Ayurvedic treatments, incorporating traditional herbal remedies and massage techniques specific to the region. We utilize locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and artisans while ensuring the highest quality and purity of our treatments.  Our experienced Ayurvedic practitioners are deeply knowledgeable in traditional practices and are committed to providing personalized consultations and treatment plans.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond Ayurveda, we offer a range of complementary therapies.  Yoga and meditation classes are conducted by certified instructors, providing a mindful and rejuvenating experience for individuals of all fitness levels.  We also provide therapeutic massage services, incorporating techniques like Swedish massage and deep tissue massage, to alleviate muscle tension and promote relaxation.  Our wellness packages are designed to cater to various needs, from stress management to post-natal recovery, offering convenient and effective solutions for busy lifestyles.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Pratigya Wellness Home apart is our personalized approach.  We believe in understanding each client\'s unique needs and tailoring our services accordingly.  We conduct thorough consultations to assess individual health concerns and lifestyle factors, developing customized treatment plans that are both effective and safe.  Our commitment to using natural and organic products, sourced ethically and sustainably, reinforces our dedication to holistic wellbeing and environmental responsibility. This commitment resonates strongly with the growing awareness of sustainable and ethical practices within the Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Pratigya Wellness Home, we prioritize creating a welcoming and comfortable environment where clients feel nurtured and respected. Our team is committed to providing exceptional customer service, from the initial consultation to post-treatment care.  We strive to build strong relationships with our clients, creating a sense of trust and understanding. We believe that open communication is essential, ensuring that our clients feel heard and understood throughout their wellness journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond our clients to the broader community.  We actively engage with local organizations and participate in community events, promoting wellness education and awareness. We regularly host workshops and seminars on topics such as stress management, healthy eating, and mindful living. These initiatives contribute to the overall wellbeing of the community, reflecting our commitment to social responsibility.  We also actively support local businesses, furthering our commitment to the sustainable development of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We understand the importance of accessibility and affordability. We offer a range of pricing options to ensure our services are accessible to a wide range of clients. We also offer flexible appointment scheduling to accommodate busy lifestyles, making self-care more convenient and achievable for everyone.  This inclusivity underscores our belief that wellbeing is a fundamental right, not a privilege.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Pratigya Wellness Home envisions becoming a leading wellness destination in Assam. We plan to expand our services by incorporating new and innovative therapies, staying at the forefront of holistic wellbeing practices.  We aim to continue developing our educational programs, offering workshops and retreats that empower individuals to take control of their health and wellbeing.  This includes plans for collaborating with local healthcare professionals to provide integrated wellness solutions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also plan to expand our physical space to accommodate a growing clientele, potentially incorporating facilities such as a yoga studio, meditation room, and a retail space showcasing locally sourced wellness products.  This expansion will allow us to serve a wider community and create more opportunities for employment within the region.  Our long-term goal is to establish Pratigya Wellness Home as a reputable and trusted wellness destination, synonymous with high-quality services, compassionate care, and a commitment to community wellbeing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our success will be measured not only by financial growth but also by the positive impact we have on the lives of our clients and the community. We remain steadfast in our commitment to holistic wellbeing and to being a valuable asset to the vibrant and growing business landscape of Jalikbari, Saraighat Nagar.</p>', 'jalikbari, saraighat nagar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9101089307', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:25:20', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(716, 'Love & Care Foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Love & Care Foundation: Nurturing Assam\'s Future</h1>\n\n<p>Established at 4PVR+MRR, the Love & Care Foundation stands as a beacon of hope and positive change within the vibrant and diverse landscape of Assam.  We are a non-profit organization deeply committed to improving the lives of vulnerable and marginalized communities across the region. Our unique approach blends practical support with empowerment initiatives, fostering self-reliance and sustainable development. Unlike many organizations focused solely on immediate relief, we prioritize long-term, impactful solutions, aiming to build a stronger, more equitable future for all Assamese citizens.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our significance in the local business landscape lies not in profit generation, but in the significant social return on investment we provide.  We collaborate with local businesses and government agencies to ensure our programs are both effective and sustainable. By tackling critical issues such as poverty, education, and healthcare, we contribute to a healthier and more prosperous Assam, creating a supportive environment for all aspects of the local economy. We believe that a strong and healthy community forms the bedrock of a thriving business environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our core services are multifaceted, reflecting the diverse needs of the communities we serve.  Our flagship program focuses on providing access to quality education for underprivileged children. This includes providing scholarships, building and maintaining educational infrastructure in remote areas, and offering supplementary educational resources and teacher training.  We recognize that education is the most powerful tool for breaking the cycle of poverty.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Further, we offer comprehensive healthcare initiatives, focusing on preventative care and access to vital medical services. This involves organizing free health camps, providing subsidized medications, and collaborating with local healthcare providers to ensure timely access to treatment for those most in need.  We also actively engage in promoting hygiene and sanitation practices within the communities we serve.  A significant aspect of our healthcare program is the training and support of local healthcare workers, ensuring the sustainability of these efforts.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Finally, we implement sustainable livelihood programs focused on empowering individuals and families through skill development and entrepreneurship initiatives.  We provide vocational training, microfinance opportunities, and assistance in establishing small businesses.  Our unique selling point lies in our holistic approach, combining education, healthcare, and economic empowerment to create lasting change. We are not simply providing aid, but investing in the future by building human capital.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>Our \"customers,\" in this context, are the individuals and communities we serve.  Our approach is rooted in empathy, respect, and collaboration.  We prioritize building strong relationships based on trust and mutual understanding.  Transparency and accountability are central to our operations. We regularly engage with community members, ensuring our programs align with their needs and aspirations.  We conduct regular evaluations and seek feedback to continuously improve our services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to community engagement goes beyond program implementation.  We strive to be an active and visible partner in the local area.  We actively participate in community events, fostering positive relationships with local leaders, businesses, and individuals.  We believe that strong community ties are crucial for the success of our programs and for creating a positive social environment in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>The Love & Care Foundation envisions a future where all citizens of Assam have equal access to quality education, healthcare, and economic opportunities.  Our future plans include expanding our reach to serve more communities and broaden the scope of our programs. We aim to leverage technology and innovation to enhance the efficiency and impact of our initiatives.  This includes exploring digital literacy programs, utilizing telehealth technologies to improve access to healthcare, and implementing online platforms for skill development.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to build a self-sustaining organization that can continue to make a significant difference in the lives of vulnerable communities for generations to come.  We aspire to be recognized not only for the immediate impact of our programs, but for our lasting contribution to building a stronger, more resilient, and more equitable Assam.  We are committed to continuous improvement, adapting our strategies to meet the evolving needs of the communities we serve and contributing to the overall socio-economic development of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are confident that through continued dedication, strategic partnerships, and innovative approaches, the Love & Care Foundation will continue to play a vital role in shaping a brighter future for Assam.  We invite you to join us in this important endeavor.</p>', '4PVR+MRR', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:25:27', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(717, 'NeuroSpine Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>NeuroSpine Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Located on the 3rd Floor of the Avatar Complex, conveniently situated above Naga Flavours, NeuroSpine Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre represents a significant advancement in healthcare services for the people of Assam.  We are dedicated to providing comprehensive, evidence-based physiotherapy and rehabilitation solutions, addressing the growing need for specialized neurological and spinal care within the region.  Our unique approach combines advanced therapeutic techniques with a deeply personalized care model, ensuring optimal patient outcomes and a superior experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike many general physiotherapy clinics, NeuroSpine differentiates itself through its focused expertise in neurology and spine rehabilitation.  This specialization allows us to effectively address a wide range of conditions, including stroke recovery, multiple sclerosis management, Parkinson\'s disease rehabilitation, spinal cord injuries, post-surgical rehabilitation (orthopedic and neurosurgical), chronic pain management (neck, back, and extremities), and sports injuries.  Our team comprises highly qualified and experienced physiotherapists, each possessing advanced certifications and a commitment to ongoing professional development. We utilize cutting-edge equipment and techniques, ensuring that our patients receive the most effective and up-to-date treatments available.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services extend beyond individual sessions. We offer comprehensive rehabilitation programs tailored to each patient\'s specific needs and goals. These programs encompass individualized exercise plans, manual therapy, electrotherapy, and patient education on self-management strategies. We also place a strong emphasis on preventative care, educating our clients on maintaining proper posture, ergonomics, and exercise routines to reduce the risk of future injuries. Recognizing the diverse needs of our community, we strive to provide accessible and affordable care, working with insurance providers and offering flexible payment options to ensure financial barriers do not hinder access to quality healthcare.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At NeuroSpine, we believe that exceptional customer experience is paramount.  We foster a welcoming and supportive environment, prioritizing open communication and collaboration with our patients.  Our team takes the time to thoroughly understand each individual’s condition, goals, and concerns, crafting personalized treatment plans that are both effective and achievable.  Beyond clinical excellence, we actively engage with the local community. This includes collaborating with local healthcare providers, participating in community health initiatives, and offering educational workshops on musculoskeletal health and injury prevention. We believe in building strong relationships with our patients, viewing them as partners in their journey to recovery and well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond our current services.  NeuroSpine envisions significant growth and expansion in the coming years.  We plan to incorporate advanced technologies such as virtual reality therapy and telehealth services to broaden our reach and accessibility. We are also exploring collaborations with other healthcare professionals, such as occupational therapists and speech therapists, to offer a more holistic approach to patient care. Furthermore, we intend to expand our team of qualified professionals, allowing us to serve a larger patient population and further solidify our position as the leading provider of neurological and spinal rehabilitation in Assam.  Our long-term goal is to establish NeuroSpine as a center of excellence, a trusted resource for both patients and healthcare professionals throughout the region, continuously striving to improve the lives of those we serve.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>NeuroSpine Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre is not merely a clinic; it\'s a commitment to the health and well-being of the Assam community. Our unwavering dedication to patient-centered care, coupled with our expertise and forward-thinking approach, positions us for continued success and lasting impact. We are confident in our ability to meet the evolving healthcare needs of the region, providing exceptional care and fostering a healthier future for all.</p>', '3rd Floor, Avatar Complex, above Naga Flavours', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '7896585114', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:35:10', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(718, 'Faith Foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Faith Foundation: Empowering Communities in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Faith Foundation, based in Guwahati, Assam, is a dynamic and rapidly growing non-profit organization dedicated to improving the lives of individuals and communities within the region.  Our work is rooted in a deep understanding of the unique challenges and opportunities present in Assam, and we are committed to fostering sustainable and impactful change through a multifaceted approach encompassing education, healthcare, and economic empowerment.  We differentiate ourselves from other NGOs through our hyperlocal focus, strong community partnerships, and a commitment to transparency and accountability in all our operations. This commitment resonates deeply with the people of Assam, fostering trust and ensuring the long-term sustainability of our initiatives.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Faith Foundation\'s core services are designed to address critical needs within the Assamese community. Our flagship program focuses on improving access to quality education, particularly for underprivileged children and young adults. This includes providing scholarships, educational materials, and tutoring support.  Recognizing the importance of holistic development, we also offer vocational training programs, equipping individuals with marketable skills to enhance their economic prospects.  These programs cater to diverse needs, including training in traditional Assamese crafts, modern technology skills, and entrepreneurship. Our unique selling proposition lies in our adaptive approach;  we regularly assess the evolving needs of the community and tailor our training programs accordingly, ensuring relevance and impact. This ensures we\'re not simply providing theoretical skills, but equipping individuals with tools directly applicable to the local job market.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond education and skill development, Faith Foundation also plays a significant role in improving healthcare access.  We collaborate with local health clinics and hospitals to facilitate outreach programs, providing essential medical supplies, conducting health awareness campaigns, and supporting preventative healthcare initiatives.  We actively address the specific healthcare challenges faced by the region, ranging from malnutrition to the prevalence of certain diseases.  This community-focused approach ensures that our services are culturally sensitive and effectively address the unique needs of the population. We believe healthcare is a fundamental right and ensuring access to it is crucial to building strong and resilient communities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Faith Foundation, our commitment to community extends beyond the provision of services; it\'s deeply ingrained in our approach to customer experience. We firmly believe that effective change requires genuine partnership and collaboration. We work closely with local community leaders, government agencies, and other NGOs to ensure our programs are aligned with local needs and priorities. We actively seek feedback from our beneficiaries, incorporating their input to continuously improve our services and effectiveness. This participatory approach fosters a sense of ownership and ensures that our interventions are truly meaningful and sustainable.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to transparency and accountability is paramount. We maintain meticulous records of our activities and finances, making them readily accessible to our stakeholders. This builds trust and ensures that the resources entrusted to us are used effectively and efficiently. We are passionate about fostering a culture of open communication and active engagement with the communities we serve.  We actively work to create a welcoming and supportive environment, emphasizing respect, dignity, and empowerment in all our interactions.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Faith Foundation envisions a future where every individual in Assam has access to quality education, healthcare, and economic opportunities.  Our future plans involve expanding our existing programs, reaching a wider population, and exploring new avenues of impact. We are committed to leveraging technology and innovation to enhance the reach and effectiveness of our services. This includes exploring online learning platforms, telehealth initiatives, and innovative approaches to vocational training.  We aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations to create more sustainable employment opportunities for our trainees.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to become a leading force in community development within Assam, recognized for our impactful work and unwavering commitment to social justice. We believe that through consistent effort, strategic partnerships, and a strong community focus, we can collectively create a brighter future for the people of Assam. We are continually seeking ways to optimize our programs, embrace new technologies, and expand our reach to ensure our impact is far-reaching and lasting.  We are committed to rigorous evaluation and monitoring of our programs, ensuring accountability and continuous improvement.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Faith Foundation is more than just an organization; it is a testament to the power of collective action and unwavering belief in the potential of every individual. We invite you to join us in building a stronger, healthier, and more prosperous Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati, Assam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8724090218', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:25:41', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(719, 'Jeevan Jyoti Foundation 2', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Jeevan Jyoti Foundation 2: Illuminating Lives in Dharapur-Palashbari</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled along the vibrant Dharapur-Palashbari Road, Jeevan Jyoti Foundation 2 stands as a beacon of hope and progress within the Assam community.  More than just a foundation, we are a dynamic organization dedicated to fostering sustainable development and positive social impact.  Our unique approach combines targeted intervention programs with a strong emphasis on community participation, ensuring lasting and meaningful change within the region. We differentiate ourselves through a deep understanding of local needs and a commitment to transparency and accountability in all our operations. This commitment resonates deeply with the people of Assam, building trust and fostering collaborative partnerships crucial for sustainable growth.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>Our work is rooted in the belief that empowerment begins with access to essential resources and opportunities.  Unlike many larger organizations that might overlook the nuanced needs of smaller communities, Jeevan Jyoti Foundation 2 focuses intently on the specific challenges faced by the people of Dharapur-Palashbari and the surrounding areas. This hyperlocal focus allows us to develop highly effective and context-specific programs that address the root causes of poverty, inequality, and social injustice. Our commitment to addressing local needs ensures our initiatives are relevant, sustainable, and demonstrably impactful. <br><br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Jeevan Jyoti Foundation 2 offers a diverse range of services designed to empower individuals and strengthen communities.  Our primary focus areas include education, healthcare, and economic empowerment.  In the realm of education, we provide scholarships and educational resources to underprivileged students, ensuring access to quality learning opportunities.  We also run literacy programs targeting adults, equipping them with essential skills for personal and professional growth. <br><br></p>\n\n<p>Our healthcare initiatives focus on improving access to primary healthcare services and promoting preventative healthcare practices.  This includes organizing health camps, providing medical supplies, and raising awareness about critical health issues within the community.  We work closely with local healthcare providers to ensure the seamless delivery of quality healthcare services. Our unique selling proposition is our integrated approach – combining healthcare with education and economic empowerment to create a holistic and sustainable impact.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>Finally, our economic empowerment programs aim to enhance livelihoods and generate income opportunities for vulnerable populations. We provide vocational training, micro-loan schemes, and support for entrepreneurship, enabling individuals to become self-reliant and contribute to the economic growth of the region.  We offer practical, skill-based training that is directly applicable to local market needs, ensuring our programs have immediate and long-term relevance.  This targeted approach is what sets us apart from broader, less regionally focused initiatives. <br><br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Jeevan Jyoti Foundation 2, we prioritize building strong, trusting relationships with the communities we serve.  Our approach is based on active listening, understanding local contexts, and collaboratively developing solutions that are culturally appropriate and sustainable.  We believe in empowering individuals and fostering a sense of ownership within the communities we work with. This participatory approach ensures our programs are aligned with community needs and preferences, leading to greater efficacy and buy-in.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>We maintain open and transparent communication channels, regularly engaging with beneficiaries and stakeholders to provide updates, solicit feedback, and adapt our strategies accordingly.  Our commitment to transparency and accountability is vital in building trust and fostering lasting partnerships. We regularly organize community meetings and feedback sessions, creating a space for open dialogue and ensuring our initiatives are truly responsive to the needs of the people.  This focus on active community engagement is integral to our success.<br><br></p>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Jeevan Jyoti Foundation 2 envisions a future where the communities we serve are thriving, empowered, and resilient.  Our long-term goal is to expand our reach and impact, creating even greater positive change within the Dharapur-Palashbari region and beyond. We plan to achieve this through strategic partnerships with local businesses, government agencies, and international organizations.  This collaborative approach will enable us to leverage diverse resources and expertise, maximizing our collective impact. <br><br></p>\n\n<p>We are committed to continuously improving our programs and services based on data-driven evaluation and community feedback.  We plan to invest in technology and capacity building to enhance our operational efficiency and effectiveness.  By embracing innovation and adapting to evolving needs, we aim to remain a relevant and impactful organization for years to come. We also aim to expand our service offerings to encompass additional areas of critical need within the community, ensuring a comprehensive and holistic approach to development.<br><br></p>\n\n<p>In essence, Jeevan Jyoti Foundation 2 is more than just a name; it represents a commitment to a brighter future for the people of Dharapur-Palashbari. We are dedicated to illuminating lives, empowering communities, and fostering sustainable development – one individual, one family, and one community at a time.  We believe that through collaborative action and a commitment to excellence, we can achieve lasting positive change in the region and leave a legacy of hope and prosperity for generations to come.<br><br></p>', 'Dharapur-Palashbari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:30:26', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(720, 'NITYAM FOUNDATION', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>NITYAM FOUNDATION: Empowering Communities in Radha Krishna Nagar</h1>\n\n<p>NITYAM FOUNDATION, located in the vibrant Radha Krishna Nagar area of Bapuji Nagar Road, stands as a beacon of community development and empowerment in Assam.  Established with a commitment to sustainable and impactful initiatives, NITYAM has quickly become a trusted name, recognized for its dedication to improving lives and fostering positive change within the local landscape.  Unlike many organizations focused solely on profit, NITYAM prioritizes lasting societal benefit, integrating its services with the unique needs and opportunities present within the community. This dedication to holistic growth sets us apart and solidifies our position as a vital contributor to Assam\'s progress.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique approach lies in the strategic integration of various programs designed to address critical needs within the community.  We don\'t simply offer services; we build partnerships and create sustainable solutions.  This comprehensive strategy allows us to maximize our impact and ensure lasting positive changes for the people of Radha Krishna Nagar and beyond. We understand that true progress requires a multifaceted approach, encompassing economic development, educational advancement, and social upliftment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>NITYAM FOUNDATION offers a range of vital services tailored to meet the specific needs of the local community.  Our core programs include skill development workshops aimed at enhancing employability, particularly focusing on trades and vocations with high demand within the regional economy.  These workshops provide not just training but also mentorship and job placement support, ensuring participants have the best possible chance of long-term success.  We also operate a community learning center providing educational support and resources to students, bridging educational gaps and promoting academic excellence.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, we actively engage in community health initiatives, promoting awareness and access to crucial healthcare resources.  This includes organizing health camps, disseminating vital information on preventative care, and facilitating access to essential medical services for underserved populations.  Our unique selling point is our holistic, integrated approach: combining skill development, education, and healthcare to create a supportive ecosystem that fosters individual and community growth.  This addresses the multifaceted challenges faced by the community and prevents issues from escalating by working proactively.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the importance of environmental sustainability, NITYAM also undertakes various environmental protection initiatives.  This involves promoting awareness on responsible waste management, encouraging sustainable farming practices, and organizing community clean-up drives.  By integrating these initiatives with our other programs, we contribute to a healthier and more sustainable future for the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of NITYAM\'s philosophy is a deep commitment to exceptional customer service. We believe in building strong, trusting relationships with the individuals and communities we serve. Our approach is centered on transparency, empathy, and active listening.  We actively seek feedback, continuously evaluating and refining our programs to ensure they effectively meet the evolving needs of the community. We foster a sense of inclusivity and collaboration, ensuring all voices are heard and valued. This collaborative spirit extends beyond our immediate beneficiaries, encompassing local businesses, community leaders, and government agencies to create a truly unified approach to community development.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We firmly believe that our success is intrinsically linked to the success of the community.  Therefore, our engagement goes beyond simply delivering services; we strive to build genuine connections, fostering a sense of ownership and shared responsibility.  Our regular community events, open forums, and collaborative projects ensure a constant dialogue, keeping us informed and responsive to community feedback.  This commitment to transparency and open communication allows us to continually adapt and improve our services, ensuring they remain relevant and impactful.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>NITYAM FOUNDATION envisions a future where Radha Krishna Nagar and the surrounding areas are thriving, vibrant communities characterized by improved health, economic prosperity, and enhanced social well-being. We plan to expand our current programs, reaching a wider population and offering even more comprehensive services. This includes developing specialized training programs aligned with emerging industry trends and strengthening our partnerships with local businesses and educational institutions. The goal is to create sustainable pathways to economic empowerment, ensuring that the skills and knowledge acquired through our programs translate into lasting employment opportunities.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also aim to enhance our community health initiatives by leveraging technology and expanding access to healthcare resources.  This will involve exploring partnerships with healthcare providers and implementing innovative strategies to increase awareness and improve access to quality medical care.  Long-term, NITYAM envisions becoming a model for sustainable community development in Assam, demonstrating the transformative potential of a holistic, integrated approach.  We aspire to replicate our successful models in other underserved communities, extending our reach and impact across the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>By continuously adapting to the evolving needs of the community, fostering strong partnerships, and embracing innovative approaches, NITYAM FOUNDATION is committed to building a brighter future for generations to come. Our journey is not simply about providing services; it’s about empowering individuals and communities to create a sustainable and prosperous future for themselves.</p>', 'Radha Krishna Nagar, Bapuji Nagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:35:18', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(721, 'Dr Sangita Sarmah', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Dr. Sangita Sarmah:  A Leading Healthcare Provider in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Dr. Sangita Sarmah\'s practice, located at House no 01, Anandapur road, Jamuna Path, stands as a beacon of comprehensive healthcare in the heart of Guwahati.  Established with a commitment to delivering high-quality, patient-centric care, the practice has quickly become a trusted name within the local community.  Dr. Sarmah\'s deep understanding of the unique healthcare needs of the Assamese population, coupled with her modern approach to medical practice, sets her apart in the vibrant and evolving healthcare landscape of Assam.  Her dedication to personalized treatment plans and ongoing patient education forms the cornerstone of her practice\'s success and enduring reputation. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>The practice distinguishes itself through a commitment to accessible and affordable healthcare.  Recognizing the diverse socio-economic backgrounds of the patient population, Dr. Sarmah strives to make quality medical care accessible to all. This commitment extends beyond simply providing affordable services, encompassing clear and empathetic communication, ensuring patients understand their treatment options and feel empowered in their healthcare journey. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Dr. Sangita Sarmah\'s practice offers a comprehensive range of services tailored to the prevalent health concerns in the region.  These include, but are not limited to, routine check-ups, diagnosis and management of chronic illnesses such as diabetes and hypertension, women\'s health services, and preventative healthcare consultations. The practice utilizes advanced diagnostic tools and techniques, ensuring accuracy and efficiency in diagnosis.  A particular focus is placed on patient education and empowering individuals to take control of their health through lifestyle modifications and preventative measures. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of Dr. Sarmah\'s practice is her holistic approach to patient care.  She understands that health is not just the absence of disease, but a state of complete physical, mental, and social well-being.  Therefore, her consultations frequently incorporate discussions on lifestyle, diet, and stress management, recognizing the interconnectedness of these factors with overall health.  This holistic approach resonates deeply with the local community, which values traditional healing practices alongside modern medical advancements.  The services offered directly address the local market needs by providing accessible, high-quality care that caters to a wide range of health concerns within the Assamese population. <br> <br> </p>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At the core of Dr. Sangita Sarmah\'s practice is a commitment to delivering exceptional patient experiences.  The practice prioritizes building strong doctor-patient relationships based on trust, respect, and open communication.  Appointments are scheduled to allow ample time for thorough consultations, ensuring that each patient receives individualized attention.  The practice\'s friendly and welcoming atmosphere helps alleviate the anxiety often associated with medical visits, creating a comfortable and reassuring environment for patients. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Dr. Sarmah actively engages with the local community through participation in health awareness programs and workshops.  She believes in educating the public about preventative healthcare, empowering individuals to make informed choices about their health. This community engagement fosters strong relationships and strengthens the bond of trust between the practice and its patients.  Furthermore, the practice consistently seeks patient feedback to continuously improve its services and adapt to the evolving needs of the community.  This commitment to patient satisfaction and community engagement is a hallmark of Dr. Sarmah’s practice. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Dr. Sangita Sarmah envisions a future where her practice continues to grow and expand its services to better serve the needs of the Guwahati community.  Future plans include incorporating advanced technologies and expanding the range of healthcare services offered.  This might involve the addition of specialized consultations or the integration of telehealth services to improve accessibility for patients in remote areas. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>The long-term goal is to establish Dr. Sangita Sarmah’s practice as a leading healthcare provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, patient-centric care, and community engagement.  This vision involves continuous investment in professional development, adoption of cutting-edge medical technologies, and a steadfast commitment to staying at the forefront of advancements in healthcare.  The practice aims to not only treat illness but to promote wellness, contributing to the overall health and well-being of the community it serves.  By combining traditional values of compassionate care with modern medical practices, Dr. Sarmah strives to build a legacy of healthcare excellence in Assam. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Dr. Sangita Sarmah\'s practice represents a model of successful healthcare provision within the local context, combining professional expertise with a profound understanding of community needs.  Her dedication to patient-centered care and community engagement positions her practice for continued growth and success in the years to come, making it a valuable asset to the healthcare landscape of Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'House no 01, Anandapur road, Jamuna Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:30:48', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(722, 'Enlighten Foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Enlighten Foundation: Illuminating Futures in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on Baghorbori Rd, Enlighten Foundation stands as a beacon of progress, dedicated to fostering sustainable development and positive societal change within the vibrant community of Assam.  Unlike typical NGOs, Enlighten Foundation employs a unique, multifaceted approach, blending impactful community initiatives with sustainable enterprise development. We believe in empowering individuals and communities to achieve self-reliance, not merely providing temporary solutions. Our commitment to transparency, accountability, and measurable results sets us apart in the Assam business landscape, creating a sustainable impact that resonates far beyond our immediate reach.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our distinct approach stems from a deep understanding of the specific challenges and opportunities present in the region.  We recognize that economic empowerment is intrinsically linked to social progress and environmental sustainability. Therefore, our work isn’t compartmentalized; instead, we strive to create synergistic projects that address multiple needs simultaneously.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Enlighten Foundation offers a diverse range of services and programs, all designed to empower individuals and communities. Our core services are categorized into three interconnected pillars: Education & Skill Development, Sustainable Livelihoods, and Community Health & Wellness.  Within Education & Skill Development, we focus on providing vocational training, digital literacy programs, and scholarships for underprivileged students, equipping them with the necessary skills to thrive in a competitive job market.  Our programs are carefully tailored to meet the specific needs of the local context, ensuring relevance and effectiveness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Under Sustainable Livelihoods, we facilitate entrepreneurship through microfinance schemes, business incubation programs, and support for locally-owned and operated businesses. We prioritize projects that promote sustainable agricultural practices and utilize local resources, fostering economic independence and environmental stewardship. This unique approach helps strengthen local economies, creating jobs and opportunities within the community.  Our commitment to fair trade principles and ethical sourcing ensures that our impact is both economically and socially beneficial.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our Community Health & Wellness programs focus on preventative healthcare, health education, and access to essential medical services.  We collaborate with local healthcare providers and leverage technology to address challenges related to sanitation, nutrition, and disease prevention.  We understand that a healthy community is a productive community, and our investment in well-being contributes directly to the overall success of our other initiatives. The unique selling point of these programs lies in their community-centric approach, ensuring ownership and sustainability beyond the Foundation’s direct involvement.</p> <br> <br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Enlighten Foundation, our approach to customer service – our beneficiaries – is rooted in partnership and empowerment. We don’t simply provide services; we collaborate with individuals and communities, actively involving them in the design, implementation, and evaluation of our programs. This participatory approach fosters ownership and ensures that our initiatives truly reflect the needs and aspirations of those we serve.  Transparency and accountability are central to our operations; regular updates and feedback mechanisms ensure that beneficiaries feel heard and valued.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through regular meetings, workshops, and community events.  Our commitment to local partnerships extends to collaborations with other NGOs, government agencies, and private sector businesses. These collaborations leverage diverse resources and expertise, maximizing our impact and creating a stronger, more cohesive community network. We believe in building long-term relationships based on trust, mutual respect, and shared responsibility.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Enlighten Foundation envisions a future where the communities we serve are thriving, self-reliant, and actively contributing to the social and economic growth of Assam.  Our future plans include expanding our reach to more underserved communities, developing innovative programs that address emerging challenges, and strengthening our partnerships within the region. We aim to become a leading model for sustainable community development, demonstrating the power of collaborative action and demonstrating the transformative potential of focused, locally driven initiatives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we aspire to create a self-sustaining model, where the initiatives we support generate their own economic viability, minimizing dependence on external funding and ensuring the long-term sustainability of our impact.  We plan to achieve this through a combination of diversified funding streams, capacity building within the communities we serve, and the development of locally-owned and operated social enterprises that generate both social and economic value.  Our ultimate goal is not simply to provide assistance, but to inspire and empower individuals and communities to build brighter futures for themselves and future generations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Enlighten Foundation is more than just an organization; it’s a movement towards a brighter future for Assam.  We invite you to join us in this journey of positive change.</p>', 'Baghorbori Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:30:59', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(723, 'Ayushmaan Institution for Psycho-behavioural Management and Mental Health Research', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Ayushmaan Institution for Psycho-behavioural Management and Mental Health Research</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam at H/No.9, Borsajai (NH-37, Nalapara Rd, near Subham Sapphire), Ayushmaan Institution stands as a beacon of hope and healing, addressing the growing need for comprehensive mental health services in the region.  We are a pioneering institution dedicated to providing high-quality psycho-behavioural management and mental health research, bridging the gap in accessible and culturally sensitive care within the local community.  Our commitment extends beyond simply treating illness; we strive to empower individuals, families, and the broader community to thrive mentally and emotionally.  Ayushmaan\'s unique approach combines evidence-based practices with a deep understanding of the cultural nuances of Assam, ensuring effective and compassionate care for all.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Ayushmaan Institution offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to address a wide spectrum of mental health needs. Our core offerings include individual and group therapy, utilizing a range of evidence-based therapeutic modalities such as Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (CBT), Dialectical Behaviour Therapy (DBT), and psychodynamic approaches. We also provide specialized services in areas such as anxiety disorders, depression, trauma-informed care, and addiction management.  We tailor treatment plans to the unique needs and circumstances of each individual, ensuring a personalized and effective approach.  Furthermore, we offer workshops and educational programs for the community aimed at promoting mental wellbeing and reducing the stigma associated with mental illness.  A key differentiator is our commitment to incorporating traditional Assamese healing practices where appropriate and ethically sound, creating a holistic and culturally relevant therapeutic experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond clinical services, Ayushmaan is deeply committed to advancing mental health research in Assam.  This involves conducting studies on prevalent mental health issues within the region, analyzing the effectiveness of different treatment approaches in the local context, and contributing to a greater understanding of mental health disparities. Our research findings inform our clinical practices and contribute to the broader field of mental health, ensuring our services remain at the forefront of best practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Ayushmaan, we believe that a supportive and empathetic environment is paramount to effective mental health care.  Our approach to customer service prioritizes building strong therapeutic alliances based on trust, respect, and mutual understanding.  We strive to create a safe and non-judgmental space where individuals feel comfortable expressing their thoughts and feelings without fear of stigma or discrimination.  Our team of experienced and qualified professionals is committed to providing compassionate and culturally sensitive care, recognizing the diverse needs and backgrounds of our clientele. We emphasize clear communication, regular progress reviews, and individualized treatment plans to ensure that our clients feel actively involved in their recovery journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through educational initiatives, workshops, and collaborations with local organizations and healthcare providers.  By fostering partnerships and raising awareness about mental health issues, we aim to destigmatize mental illness and promote the seeking of help.  We believe that collaborative efforts are key to building a stronger, more resilient community, one that values and prioritizes mental wellbeing.  Our commitment to community engagement extends to providing affordable and accessible services to individuals from diverse socioeconomic backgrounds, ensuring that mental health support is available to all who need it.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Ayushmaan Institution envisions becoming a leading centre of excellence for psycho-behavioural management and mental health research in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to encompass a wider range of mental health conditions and populations.  This includes developing specialized programs for children and adolescents, older adults, and individuals with co-occurring mental health and substance use disorders.  We plan to invest in advanced technology and training to enhance the effectiveness and accessibility of our services.  This includes exploring telehealth options to reach individuals in remote areas of Assam and expanding our research capabilities to explore innovative treatment strategies.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We also aim to strengthen our community partnerships to build a comprehensive network of support for individuals and families affected by mental illness.  This involves collaborating with schools, workplaces, and community organizations to promote mental wellbeing and early intervention strategies.  By combining clinical excellence with impactful research and community engagement, Ayushmaan aims to make a lasting positive impact on the mental health landscape of Assam, contributing to a healthier, happier, and more resilient society.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to ongoing professional development for our staff ensures that we remain at the forefront of best practices in mental health care. We actively seek opportunities for collaboration with national and international institutions to stay abreast of the latest advancements in research and treatment methodologies.  Through continued innovation and a steadfast commitment to our mission, Ayushmaan Institution strives to be a catalyst for positive change, empowering individuals and communities to thrive mentally and emotionally.</p> <br> <br>', 'H/No.9, Borsajai (NH-37, Nalapara Rd, near Subham Sapphire', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8011081101', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:35:27', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(724, 'Ananya Physiotherapy & Sports Injury Rehab', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Ananya Physiotherapy & Sports Injury Rehab</h1>\n\n<p>Located conveniently on Beltola - Basistha Rd, opposite Bank of Baroda, Ananya Physiotherapy & Sports Injury Rehab stands as a beacon of holistic healthcare in the vibrant community of Guwahati, Assam.  We are committed to providing comprehensive, evidence-based physiotherapy and sports injury rehabilitation services, tailored to meet the unique needs of individuals across all age groups and activity levels.  Recognizing the growing demand for specialized musculoskeletal care in the region, Ananya sets itself apart by combining advanced therapeutic techniques with a deeply personal approach to patient care, fostering a trusting and supportive environment for optimal recovery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our dedication to excellence is reflected in our commitment to staying at the forefront of physiotherapy advancements. We continuously update our knowledge and skills to provide the most effective and current treatment modalities. This dedication ensures that our patients receive the highest quality of care, improving their quality of life and enabling them to return to their daily activities with confidence and renewed vigor.  In a region where access to specialized physiotherapy can sometimes be limited, Ananya fills a crucial gap, offering convenient and accessible care to the residents of Guwahati and its surrounding areas.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Ananya Physiotherapy & Sports Injury Rehab offers a wide range of services designed to address diverse musculoskeletal conditions and sports injuries.  Our core services include comprehensive physiotherapy assessments, individualized treatment plans, manual therapy techniques, therapeutic exercises, and electrotherapy. We also specialize in the management of sports injuries, post-surgical rehabilitation, neurological rehabilitation, and geriatric physiotherapy.  Our unique selling point lies in our personalized approach. We take the time to understand each patient\'s individual needs, goals, and lifestyle to create a treatment plan that is both effective and achievable.  This patient-centered care fosters a strong therapeutic alliance, crucial for successful rehabilitation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We recognize the specific needs of the local community, including a high prevalence of musculoskeletal issues related to both occupational activities and participation in various sports.  Our services directly address these needs by providing targeted interventions that promote healing, pain management, and improved function. We understand the cultural nuances and preferences of our patients, ensuring communication is clear and comfortable. Our commitment extends beyond just physical rehabilitation; we aim to empower our patients to manage their conditions effectively long-term through education and lifestyle guidance.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Ananya, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of successful rehabilitation.  Our team of highly qualified and experienced physiotherapists and support staff are dedicated to providing a welcoming, compassionate, and professional environment. We prioritize open communication and actively encourage patient participation in the treatment planning and decision-making process.  We strive to make our services as accessible as possible, offering flexible appointment scheduling and a comfortable, clean, and modern clinic environment. We go beyond the standard clinic experience by providing detailed progress reports and proactive communication to keep patients and their families informed.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our services. We actively engage in community outreach programs, conducting workshops and seminars on injury prevention, healthy living, and proper posture techniques. We believe in building strong relationships with our patients and the wider community to foster a culture of health and well-being.  Our reputation is built on trust, empathy, and a dedication to achieving the best possible outcomes for every individual who walks through our doors.  We are proud to be a valuable resource for the people of Guwahati, contributing to their overall health and well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Ananya Physiotherapy & Sports Injury Rehab has ambitious plans for the future.  We envision becoming a leading provider of comprehensive physiotherapy and sports injury rehabilitation services in the entire Assam region.  This expansion will involve strategic investments in advanced technology, the recruitment of highly skilled professionals, and the development of new specialized programs to cater to emerging healthcare needs.  We plan to expand our outreach programs, focusing on promoting injury prevention and health awareness throughout the region.  We will explore collaborations with local sports clubs, schools, and community organizations to promote a culture of physical well-being and injury prevention.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Ananya as a center of excellence for physiotherapy and sports injury rehabilitation, recognized for its high-quality care, innovative approaches, and positive impact on the community.  We will continuously strive to improve our services, expand our expertise, and remain at the forefront of advancements in the field.  We are committed to investing in our team\'s professional development, ensuring that our staff remain highly skilled and knowledgeable. By focusing on patient-centered care, community engagement, and continuous improvement, Ananya Physiotherapy & Sports Injury Rehab is poised for significant growth and lasting impact on the health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p> <br> <br>', 'Beltola - Basistha Rd, opp. Bank of Baroda', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9365318340', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:35:34', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(725, 'Centre for Substance Abuse Prevention & Care', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Centre for Substance Abuse Prevention & Care</h1>\n<p>Located at House no, Greenacre II, Laboratory Path, 6, Panjabari Rd, Guwahati, Assam, the Centre for Substance Abuse Prevention & Care (CSAPC) stands as a beacon of hope and recovery in the fight against substance abuse within the state.  We recognize the devastating impact of addiction on individuals, families, and the wider community, and we are dedicated to providing comprehensive, compassionate, and evidence-based care to those affected.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike many facilities that focus solely on rehabilitation, CSAPC adopts a holistic, preventative approach.  We believe that effective intervention requires addressing the root causes of addiction, fostering community support, and promoting long-term well-being. This multifaceted strategy sets us apart in the Assam landscape, where the need for integrated substance abuse services is particularly acute. Our unique blend of prevention programs targeted at vulnerable populations and comprehensive treatment services establishes a vital link in the chain of combating addiction.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>Our core services encompass a broad spectrum of interventions designed to meet the diverse needs of the community.  These include:</p> <br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><strong>Prevention Programs:</strong>  We offer tailored prevention workshops and educational sessions targeting schools, community groups, and workplaces. These programs emphasize awareness, education, and skill-building to prevent substance abuse initiation and relapse.</li> <br> <br>\n    <li><strong>Assessment and Diagnosis:</strong> Our experienced professionals conduct thorough assessments to determine the severity of addiction, co-occurring disorders, and individual needs, ensuring a personalized treatment plan.</li> <br> <br>\n    <li><strong>Individual and Group Therapy:</strong> We provide a range of therapeutic interventions, including individual and group counselling, cognitive behavioural therapy (CBT), and motivational interviewing, to address the psychological and emotional factors contributing to addiction.</li> <br> <br>\n    <li><strong>Detoxification and Rehabilitation:</strong>  We offer medically supervised detoxification services in collaboration with qualified medical professionals, followed by comprehensive rehabilitation programs aimed at fostering lasting recovery.</li> <br> <br>\n    <li><strong>Aftercare and Relapse Prevention:</strong> Our commitment extends beyond immediate treatment. We provide ongoing support through aftercare services, including relapse prevention planning, support groups, and community integration initiatives.</li> <br> <br>\n    <li><strong>Family and Community Support:</strong> We recognize the crucial role of family and community in recovery. We offer support groups and educational sessions for family members, empowering them to provide effective support and understanding.</li>\n</ul> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling point lies in our holistic approach, combining prevention, assessment, treatment, and aftercare under one roof. This integrated model ensures seamless transitions between stages of care, maximizing the effectiveness of our interventions. We also emphasize culturally sensitive practices, ensuring our services resonate deeply with the diverse communities of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>At CSAPC, we prioritize a compassionate, non-judgmental, and client-centered approach.  We understand that seeking help for substance abuse is a courageous step, and we strive to create a safe, supportive, and confidential environment where clients feel comfortable and respected.  Our team comprises highly trained professionals who are empathetic and dedicated to helping clients achieve their recovery goals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe in building strong relationships with our clients, fostering open communication and collaboration.  We regularly assess treatment effectiveness and adapt our approaches to meet individual needs. Our commitment extends beyond the walls of our facility; we actively engage with the local community, collaborating with local organizations and stakeholders to raise awareness, reduce stigma, and expand access to services.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>CSAPC envisions a future where substance abuse is significantly reduced in Assam, and individuals affected have access to high-quality, compassionate care. We plan to expand our services to reach more individuals and communities, particularly in underserved areas.  This will involve increasing our outreach programs, developing innovative prevention initiatives, and strengthening our collaborations with local and state-level stakeholders.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a state-of-the-art rehabilitation center, developing specialized programs to address specific substance abuse issues within the region, and conducting research to improve the effectiveness of our interventions.  We are committed to becoming a leading resource for substance abuse prevention and care in Assam, contributing significantly to a healthier and more vibrant community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively seek partnerships with government agencies, NGOs, and healthcare providers to broaden our reach and strengthen the network of support for those struggling with addiction. Through ongoing professional development and the adoption of evidence-based practices, we aim to remain at the forefront of substance abuse treatment and prevention in Assam, transforming lives and building a brighter future.</p>', 'House no, Greenacre II, Laboratory Path, 6, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:35:42', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(726, 'Mukti Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Mukti Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Mukti Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre, located at H/No. 643 Bylane, Rama Mikir Path, stands as a beacon of comprehensive physiotherapy and rehabilitation services in the heart of Assam.  We are committed to providing high-quality, patient-centered care, addressing the diverse needs of our community with a personalized approach and a deep understanding of the unique healthcare challenges faced by the local population.  Our centre distinguishes itself through a holistic approach that combines advanced techniques with a compassionate, culturally sensitive environment.  We strive to empower individuals to regain their physical function, independence, and overall well-being, making a tangible difference in the lives of our patients and enriching the healthcare landscape of the region. <br> <br>\n\nOur commitment to excellence extends beyond the provision of advanced medical treatments. We believe in fostering a strong sense of community and building lasting relationships with our patients, based on trust, empathy, and shared goals.  This dedication to patient-centric care is reflected in our exceptional customer service, comprehensive treatment plans, and ongoing support throughout the rehabilitation journey. This community-focused approach positions us as a trusted partner in the health and wellness of our local area. <br> <br>\n\n</p>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Mukti Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre offers a wide range of services designed to address a spectrum of musculoskeletal and neurological conditions. Our core offerings include comprehensive physiotherapy assessments, manual therapy techniques, individualized exercise programs, and electrotherapy modalities.  We specialize in treating conditions such as sports injuries, post-surgical rehabilitation, back pain, neck pain, arthritis, and neurological disorders. <br> <br>\n\nOur unique selling proposition lies in our integration of traditional physiotherapy techniques with cutting-edge technology and evidence-based practices. We constantly update our knowledge and skills to offer the most effective and up-to-date treatments. We also tailor our approach to each patient\'s specific needs, ensuring individualized plans that are designed to be realistic, achievable, and sustainable.  Our commitment to personalized care extends to our understanding and sensitivity towards the unique cultural contexts of our patients. <br> <br>\n\nOur services directly address the growing demand for accessible and high-quality physiotherapy services in Assam.  Many individuals face challenges in accessing specialized care, particularly those in rural or underserved areas.  By providing a comprehensive suite of services in a convenient and accessible location, we aim to improve healthcare outcomes for a wider segment of the population.  This commitment to bridging the gap in access to care makes us an essential part of the evolving healthcare system in the region. <br> <br>\n\n</p>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Mukti Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre, we prioritize building strong, trusting relationships with our patients. We believe that effective rehabilitation is not simply about providing treatments; it\'s about understanding individual needs, goals, and concerns.  Our team takes the time to listen attentively, explain procedures clearly, and create a collaborative environment where patients feel empowered and in control of their recovery journey. <br> <br>\n\nWe are proud of our patient-centric approach, which is reflected in our friendly and welcoming atmosphere, comfortable facilities, and flexible appointment scheduling.  Our multilingual staff ensures effective communication with patients from diverse backgrounds, further enhancing their overall experience.   We strive to go beyond providing exceptional medical care; we build a connection with the community, offering informative workshops and health awareness programs to promote preventative care and overall wellness. <br> <br>\n\nOur commitment to providing a truly exceptional patient experience helps us connect with the local community on a deeper level.  We actively participate in local events, collaborate with other healthcare providers, and provide support to community initiatives that promote health and well-being.  This deep engagement with the community makes Mukti Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre more than just a healthcare provider; we become a vital part of the social fabric of the region.  <br> <br>\n\n</p>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Mukti Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre envisions a future where we are recognized as a leading provider of physiotherapy and rehabilitation services in Assam.  We plan to expand our services to include additional specializations and advanced treatment modalities, staying at the forefront of innovative techniques in the field.  This includes exploring collaborations with leading healthcare institutions and professionals to ensure our continued excellence in patient care.  <br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to make our services even more accessible to a broader range of individuals, especially those in underserved areas.  This may involve establishing outreach programs, expanding our facilities, or leveraging technology to deliver remote consultations and support.  We remain dedicated to continuously improving our services, investing in advanced equipment and technology, and providing ongoing professional development opportunities for our staff.  Our dedication to growth and innovation allows us to meet the evolving healthcare needs of the community, providing a lasting impact on the well-being of the people of Assam. <br> <br>\n\nBy embracing sustainable growth strategies and a community-focused approach, Mukti Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre aims to be more than just a healthcare provider; we aim to be a cornerstone of health and well-being for the entire region.  We are confident that our commitment to excellence, innovation, and patient-centric care will position us as a leader in the physiotherapy and rehabilitation sector within Assam, contributing significantly to improving the health and overall quality of life in our community. <br> <br>\n\n</p>', 'H/No. 643 Bylane, Rama Mikir Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '6900930138', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:40:13', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(727, 'Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre: Restoring Health and Wellbeing in Kahilipara</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the vibrant Kahilipara Main Rd, the Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre stands as a beacon of hope for individuals seeking comprehensive and personalized physiotherapy and rehabilitation services.  We are committed to providing high-quality, evidence-based care that empowers our patients to achieve their optimal physical function and overall wellbeing. In the dynamic healthcare landscape of Assam, our centre distinguishes itself through a holistic approach, combining advanced therapeutic techniques with a deep understanding of the unique needs of our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond merely treating symptoms. We strive to understand the root causes of our patients\' conditions, offering a tailored treatment plan that addresses their specific challenges. This individualized approach, combined with our state-of-the-art facilities and highly skilled team of physiotherapists, sets us apart from other providers in the region.  We recognize the importance of a comfortable and supportive environment, creating a space where patients feel valued, understood, and empowered on their journey to recovery.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our comprehensive range of services caters to a diverse clientele, addressing a wide spectrum of musculoskeletal and neurological conditions.  We offer manual therapy techniques, including mobilization, manipulation, and soft tissue massage, to alleviate pain and restore mobility.  Our expertise extends to electrotherapy, utilizing advanced modalities such as ultrasound, TENS, and interferential current to manage pain and inflammation effectively.  Furthermore, we provide individualized exercise programs designed to improve strength, flexibility, and endurance, promoting long-term functional improvements.  We also specialize in post-surgical rehabilitation, working closely with medical professionals to ensure a smooth and effective recovery process.  Our commitment to patient education ensures that our clients understand their condition, treatment plan, and strategies for preventing future issues.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of our centre is our integrated approach. We believe that holistic care is key to successful rehabilitation.  Therefore, we integrate elements of patient education, lifestyle modifications, and ergonomic advice into our treatment plans to ensure long-lasting positive outcomes.  For example, we may provide guidance on proper posture and lifting techniques to prevent recurrence of back pain, or offer nutritional advice to support recovery and overall health. This comprehensive approach addresses not just the immediate problem, but also contributes to the overall wellbeing of our patients.  We recognize the specific healthcare needs of the Kahilipara community and tailor our services to meet those demands, whether it be addressing common injuries related to specific occupations or providing culturally sensitive care.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At the Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre, the patient experience is paramount.  We believe in building strong, trusting relationships with our patients, creating a comfortable and supportive environment where they feel heard and understood. Our dedicated team of physiotherapists takes the time to listen to each patient\'s concerns, thoroughly assesses their condition, and collaboratively develops a personalized treatment plan.  We pride ourselves on our open communication, regularly checking in with patients to monitor their progress, address any concerns, and make adjustments as needed. We firmly believe that a positive and encouraging atmosphere significantly contributes to successful rehabilitation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to our local community extends beyond providing exceptional care. We actively participate in local health initiatives, offering educational workshops and community outreach programs to promote health and wellness. This proactive engagement strengthens our ties with the Kahilipara community, reinforcing our role as a trusted and valued healthcare provider.  Furthermore, we strive to make our services accessible to all members of the community, offering flexible appointment scheduling and transparent pricing policies.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>The Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre envisions continued growth and expansion, driven by a commitment to providing cutting-edge physiotherapy and rehabilitation services.  We plan to invest in advanced technologies and training to stay at the forefront of the field, continually enhancing the quality of care we provide.  We see significant potential for expanding our service offerings, potentially including specialized programs such as sports physiotherapy or geriatric rehabilitation, tailored to the specific demands of the growing population in Kahilipara.  This growth will involve recruiting additional skilled physiotherapists and expanding our facilities to accommodate a larger patient volume.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to become the leading physiotherapy and rehabilitation centre in the Kahilipara area, recognized for our exceptional patient care, commitment to community engagement, and unwavering dedication to excellence. We aim to be a trusted resource for individuals seeking to improve their physical function, manage pain, and enhance their overall quality of life. We are committed to fostering a culture of continuous improvement, adapting to the evolving needs of our patients and the healthcare landscape in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Through our dedication, expertise, and community-focused approach, the Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation Centre aims to become synonymous with quality physiotherapy and rehabilitation in Kahilipara, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives.</p>', 'Kahilipara Main Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9864833225', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 22:40:22', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
