(766, 'MEDWELL', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>MEDWELL: Elevating Healthcare in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>MEDWELL, located at House no 4, Byelane 6, Lakhminagar, RG Baruah Rd, Guwahati, is a dynamic healthcare provider committed to enhancing the well-being of the community.  We are a significant addition to the burgeoning healthcare landscape of Assam, distinguishing ourselves through a unique blend of personalized care, advanced technology, and a strong commitment to community engagement.  Our approach is rooted in a deep understanding of the specific healthcare needs of the local population, ensuring access to high-quality services previously unavailable or difficult to obtain. We are dedicated to building trust and fostering long-term relationships with our patients, solidifying our position as a trusted healthcare partner in the region. </p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive range of medical solutions designed to address the most prevalent health concerns in the area.  We offer advanced diagnostic services, utilizing state-of-the-art equipment to ensure accurate and timely results. This includes comprehensive blood tests, X-ray, ultrasound, and ECG facilities.  Beyond diagnostics, we provide a range of specialist consultations, focusing on areas of high community need, such as cardiology, general medicine, and pediatrics.  Our unique selling proposition lies not only in the quality of our services but also in our personalized and compassionate approach. We emphasize building strong doctor-patient relationships, fostering open communication, and taking the time to understand each individual\'s specific health concerns. This commitment to personalized care is crucial in a region where building trust is paramount to effective healthcare delivery.  We further complement our services with a dedicated pharmacy stocking a comprehensive range of prescription and over-the-counter medications, ensuring seamless access to necessary treatments.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>At MEDWELL, exceptional customer experience is at the heart of everything we do.  We are committed to providing a comfortable and welcoming environment for all our patients.  Our friendly and highly trained staff are dedicated to making each visit as smooth and stress-free as possible. We understand that a trip to the doctor can be daunting, particularly for those who may not be familiar with modern healthcare facilities.  Therefore, we strive to create a welcoming, accessible, and patient-centric environment, where individuals feel listened to, respected, and understood.  We emphasize clear, concise communication, ensuring that patients fully understand their diagnoses, treatment options, and aftercare instructions. We actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs and educational initiatives, focusing on preventive care and promoting healthy lifestyles.  We actively participate in local health fairs, community events, and school outreach programs to educate the population about important health issues and encourage regular check-ups.  This proactive engagement is crucial in strengthening our ties with the community and demonstrating our commitment to its well-being.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>MEDWELL\'s future vision is ambitious yet grounded in the needs of the community.  We envision expanding our services to include a wider range of specialties and advanced medical technologies. We plan to establish strategic partnerships with other healthcare providers and institutions to enhance our service offerings and expand access to specialized care within the region.  This includes exploring collaborations with leading hospitals and research institutions in Assam and beyond.  We are committed to investing in the latest medical technology to ensure that our patients have access to the most accurate and effective diagnostic and treatment options.  Our long-term goal is to establish MEDWELL as the leading provider of high-quality, accessible, and compassionate healthcare in Guwahati and beyond, playing a pivotal role in improving the overall health and well-being of the population.  This growth will be driven by a continued focus on patient-centric care, community engagement, and the recruitment and retention of highly skilled and dedicated medical professionals. We aspire to be a center of excellence for healthcare in the region, continually striving to improve and expand our services to meet the evolving needs of the community.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, MEDWELL is more than just a healthcare provider; we are a community partner committed to making a significant and lasting difference in the lives of our patients. We are building a legacy of excellence, one patient at a time, through our unwavering dedication to quality care, patient-centric approach, and strong community ties. We are confident that our commitment to innovation, compassion, and community engagement will enable us to achieve our ambitious goals and make a significant impact on the health and well-being of the people of Guwahati and Assam.</p>', 'House no 4, Byelane 6, Lakhminagar, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9954411303', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 23:20:58', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(767, 'Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic</h1>\n<p>Located on VIP Road, near Rahman Hospital Pvt Ltd., Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic stands as a beacon of comprehensive and advanced physiotherapy care in the heart of Assam. We are not merely a clinic; we are a dedicated team of experienced professionals committed to restoring movement, alleviating pain, and enhancing the overall well-being of our patients.  Our unique approach blends cutting-edge technology with traditional therapeutic techniques, providing a holistic and personalized experience that sets us apart in the local healthcare landscape.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>The rising prevalence of musculoskeletal disorders and chronic pain in Assam underscores the critical need for accessible and high-quality physiotherapy services.  Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic directly addresses this need, providing a vital link in the region\'s healthcare ecosystem. Our presence complements existing medical facilities, offering specialized care that is often unavailable or limited within the broader healthcare network.  This commitment to improving the health and mobility of Assam\'s residents solidifies our position as a significant contributor to the local business community.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic offers a wide range of specialized physiotherapy services tailored to meet the diverse needs of our patients.  Our core services include, but are not limited to, manual therapy, electrotherapy, exercise prescription, sports rehabilitation, neurological rehabilitation, and geriatric physiotherapy.  We employ evidence-based practices and utilize advanced diagnostic tools to ensure accurate assessments and personalized treatment plans. Our unique selling proposition lies in our holistic approach, combining advanced techniques with a patient-centric philosophy that prioritizes individual needs and goals.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>We differentiate ourselves through our commitment to continuous professional development. Our therapists regularly participate in advanced training programs to stay abreast of the latest advancements in physiotherapy techniques and technologies.  This ensures our patients receive the most effective and up-to-date care.  Furthermore, our commitment to utilizing technologically advanced equipment, such as state-of-the-art ultrasound machines and other electrotherapy devices, provides a level of precision and effectiveness unmatched by many in the region, directly addressing the local market\'s demand for advanced physiotherapy solutions.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>At Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic, we prioritize creating a comfortable and supportive environment where patients feel valued and understood.  Our approach emphasizes open communication, active listening, and personalized care plans collaboratively developed with each patient. We believe that building strong patient-therapist relationships is crucial for successful rehabilitation. We strive to make the entire process accessible and convenient, from scheduling appointments to providing clear and concise explanations of treatment plans.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment extends beyond the clinical setting. We actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and collaborations with local organizations.  This community involvement strengthens our ties with our patients and the wider Assam region, fostering a sense of trust and reinforcing our role as a responsible corporate citizen.  We believe in empowering our patients to take an active role in their recovery, providing education and resources to support their long-term health and well-being.  This proactive approach distinguishes us from other clinics and fosters strong, lasting patient relationships.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic envisions becoming the leading provider of advanced physiotherapy services in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to encompass new specializations and technologies, ensuring we remain at the forefront of the field. This expansion will allow us to cater to an even wider range of patient needs and further solidify our position as a regional leader in physiotherapy care.  We also plan to invest in further professional development for our team, maintaining our commitment to delivering the highest quality care.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Long-term, we aim to establish a network of clinics across Assam, increasing access to high-quality physiotherapy for individuals throughout the state. This expansion will not only broaden our reach but also contribute significantly to improving the overall health and well-being of the population. We envision a future where Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic becomes synonymous with excellence in physiotherapy care, setting new standards for patient care and professional practice within the Assam region and beyond. Our commitment to continuous improvement, community engagement, and cutting-edge technology will propel us towards realizing this ambitious vision.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Advanced Physiotherapy Clinic is more than just a healthcare provider; we are an integral part of the Assam community, dedicated to improving the lives of our patients and contributing positively to the regional healthcare landscape.  Our commitment to excellence, innovation, and patient-centric care positions us for continued growth and success in the years to come.</p>', 'VIP Rd, Near Rahman Hospital Pvt Ltd.', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9435010489', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 23:25:11', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(768, 'Consultant physiotherapist(Dr.Quizeen Borah)', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Consultant Physiotherapist (Dr. Quizeen Borah)</h1>\n\n<p>Located at 4QQJ+PH4, Baran Path, Consultant Physiotherapist (Dr. Quizeen Borah) offers a comprehensive range of physiotherapy services to the residents of Assam.  Dr. Borah brings years of experience and a commitment to evidence-based practice, establishing a clinic that prioritizes personalized care and exceptional patient outcomes.  In a region where access to specialized physiotherapy can sometimes be limited, the clinic plays a vital role in improving the health and well-being of the local community, bridging the gap between accessible healthcare and specialized rehabilitation.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The clinic\'s significance in the Assam business landscape lies in its dedication to providing high-quality, individualized physiotherapy care. Unlike larger, more generalized clinics, Dr. Borah emphasizes a personal and attentive approach, fostering strong patient-therapist relationships built on trust and mutual understanding.  This personal touch, combined with Dr. Borah\'s professional expertise, creates a unique and valuable service offering within the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Consultant Physiotherapist (Dr. Quizeen Borah) offers a broad spectrum of physiotherapy services designed to address a wide range of musculoskeletal and neurological conditions.  These include, but are not limited to, assessment and treatment of sports injuries, post-surgical rehabilitation, management of chronic pain conditions (such as back pain, neck pain, and arthritis), neurological rehabilitation following stroke or other neurological events, and the provision of tailored exercise programs for improved mobility and strength.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator is the clinic\'s emphasis on patient education.  Dr. Borah believes that empowering patients with knowledge about their condition and treatment plan is crucial for successful recovery.  Each patient receives detailed explanations, individualized home exercise programs, and ongoing support to ensure they are actively involved in their rehabilitation journey.  This holistic approach, combining expert treatment with patient education, sets the clinic apart and ensures long-term positive outcomes.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The services offered directly address the local market needs in Assam by providing access to specialized physiotherapy care within the community.  Many individuals in the region may otherwise have to travel significant distances for comparable services, incurring additional costs and inconvenience.  Dr. Borah’s clinic offers a convenient and accessible alternative, ensuring that high-quality care is readily available to those who need it.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>The clinic prioritizes a patient-centered approach, ensuring that every individual receives personalized attention and care.  Appointments are scheduled to allow ample time for thorough assessments and treatment sessions, minimizing rushed interactions and maximizing the effectiveness of the therapy.  Dr. Borah actively listens to patient concerns, taking the time to understand their individual needs and tailoring treatment plans accordingly.   This commitment to building strong patient relationships fosters trust and improves the overall effectiveness of the rehabilitation process.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond clinical excellence, the clinic strives to create a welcoming and comfortable environment for all patients. The clinic\'s atmosphere is designed to be calming and supportive, helping patients feel relaxed and at ease during their sessions.  Dr. Borah and the clinic staff are known for their friendly and approachable demeanor, creating a positive and encouraging experience for every patient.  The clinic also actively engages with the local community through participation in health fairs and awareness campaigns, further strengthening its connection with the people it serves.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Consultant Physiotherapist (Dr. Quizeen Borah) has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion.  The clinic aims to further enhance its service offerings by incorporating the latest advancements in physiotherapy techniques and technologies. This may include exploring new treatment modalities, expanding the range of conditions treated, and investing in cutting-edge rehabilitation equipment.  The ultimate goal is to remain at the forefront of physiotherapy care within the Assam region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Expansion plans may also include increasing the clinic\'s team size to meet growing patient demand and further improve accessibility.  This could involve recruiting additional physiotherapists and support staff, allowing the clinic to serve a broader patient population and offer a wider range of services.  The clinic is also exploring opportunities to collaborate with other healthcare providers in the region, creating a more integrated and comprehensive healthcare network for the local community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term, the clinic envisions becoming a leading provider of physiotherapy services in Assam, recognized for its exceptional quality of care, commitment to patient well-being, and dedication to the community. Dr. Borah\'s vision extends beyond individual patient care, encompassing a broader commitment to improving the overall health and well-being of the Assam community through continued education, outreach, and the development of innovative rehabilitation programs.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In conclusion, Consultant Physiotherapist (Dr. Quizeen Borah) represents a significant contribution to the healthcare landscape of Assam, offering specialized, accessible, and patient-centered physiotherapy services.  The clinic’s dedication to excellence, its commitment to community engagement, and its ambitious future plans ensure its continued success and enduring impact on the lives of its patients.</p>', '4QQJ+PH4, Baran Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 23:25:19', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(769, 'IP PHYSIOTHERAPY & REHABILITATION CENTRE', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>IP Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre: Restoring Movement, Enhancing Lives</h1>\n\n<p>IP Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre, located at 5R4P+H67, Milijuli Path, is a leading provider of comprehensive physiotherapy and rehabilitation services in the heart of Assam.  We are committed to delivering exceptional patient care through evidence-based practices, personalized treatment plans, and a compassionate approach.  In a region where access to advanced physiotherapy can be limited, IP Physiotherapy stands out as a beacon of hope, offering a holistic and advanced approach to restoring mobility and improving overall well-being. We distinguish ourselves by combining cutting-edge technology with a deep understanding of the specific needs and cultural context of our community.  </p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our establishment recognizes the unique challenges faced by individuals in Assam in accessing quality healthcare, particularly specialized physiotherapy services. We aim to bridge this gap by providing convenient access to high-quality, personalized care. The centre\'s strategic location in Milijuli Path ensures accessibility for a wide range of patients, contributing significantly to the improved health outcomes within the local community. </p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>IP Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre offers a wide array of services designed to address a broad spectrum of musculoskeletal and neurological conditions. Our core offerings include, but are not limited to, manual therapy, therapeutic exercise, electrotherapy, and individualized rehabilitation programs. We specialize in the treatment of sports injuries, post-surgical rehabilitation, neurological rehabilitation (including stroke rehabilitation), geriatric physiotherapy, and pain management.  We utilize state-of-the-art equipment and techniques, ensuring our treatments are effective and efficient. </p><br><br>\n\n<p>A unique selling point of IP Physiotherapy is our holistic approach. We don\'t just treat symptoms; we address the root cause of the problem through a thorough assessment and personalized treatment plan. We believe in empowering our patients through education and self-management strategies, enabling them to maintain their progress long after their formal treatment concludes. Our commitment to ongoing professional development ensures we remain at the forefront of physiotherapy advancements, translating into superior patient outcomes. </p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our services directly address the unmet needs of the local market by providing specialized care that was previously unavailable or difficult to access. This includes providing expert treatment for common injuries in the region, such as those related to agricultural work or sports, and catering to the growing elderly population\'s specific rehabilitation requirements. We are actively working to overcome language barriers and cultural sensitivities to ensure accessibility for all members of our community.</p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At IP Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre, patient care is paramount. Our commitment to providing a positive and supportive environment extends beyond simply providing effective treatment. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere where patients feel understood and valued. Our highly skilled and compassionate team of physiotherapists and support staff are dedicated to building strong therapeutic relationships with each patient, ensuring personalized care and a collaborative approach to recovery. </p><br><br>\n\n<p>We distinguish ourselves through exceptional communication, prompt appointment scheduling, and readily accessible consultation options.  We believe in transparent communication, ensuring patients are fully informed about their treatment plan and progress. We actively encourage patient feedback to continuously improve our services and better meet the needs of our community.  We engage with local community groups and organizations to raise awareness about the benefits of physiotherapy and promote preventative healthcare strategies.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our connection to the local community is a significant aspect of our business model. We actively participate in community health initiatives, provide educational workshops, and sponsor local sporting events.  This proactive engagement builds trust and fosters a strong sense of mutual respect and understanding within the community we serve. </p><br><br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>IP Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre has ambitious plans for the future. We envision expanding our services to include specialized areas such as women\'s health physiotherapy and pediatric physiotherapy, to further address the diverse needs within the community.  We also plan to invest in advanced technology and equipment to further enhance our treatment capabilities and expand our team of highly qualified physiotherapists. </p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish IP Physiotherapy as the leading physiotherapy and rehabilitation center in Assam, recognized for its excellence in patient care, innovation, and community engagement.  We are committed to continuous improvement, pursuing opportunities for professional development, and staying abreast of the latest research and advancements in the field of physiotherapy. This commitment to excellence ensures we remain at the forefront of providing high-quality, accessible, and effective care to the residents of Assam.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>We are confident that our dedication to patient well-being, combined with our strategic growth plans and strong community ties, will enable IP Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation Centre to continue thriving and positively impacting the health and lives of individuals in the region for years to come.</p>', '5R4P+H67, Milijuli Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 23:25:26', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(770, 'The Oja\'s Foundation', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>The Oja\'s Foundation: Empowering Assam Through Sustainable Development</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled at 5Q7J+G52, Zoo Rd, The Oja\'s Foundation stands as a beacon of sustainable development and community empowerment in Assam.  Unlike typical charitable organizations, we operate with a unique blend of impactful initiatives and a robust, self-sustaining business model.  Our commitment goes beyond short-term aid; we aim to foster lasting change by empowering individuals and communities to build a brighter future.  This commitment is reflected in our diverse portfolio of services and our deep engagement with the local ecosystem.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Oja\'s Foundation differentiates itself through its holistic approach to development. We recognize that true progress necessitates addressing interconnected societal challenges simultaneously.  Therefore, our work spans several key areas, forging a cohesive strategy for lasting positive change within the Assamese landscape. We don\'t simply provide solutions; we build capabilities and foster self-reliance within the communities we serve. This approach ensures the sustainability of our impact and allows us to scale our efforts effectively.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around three interconnected pillars: sustainable agriculture, skill development, and community health initiatives.  In sustainable agriculture, we work closely with local farmers, providing training on modern farming techniques, access to improved seeds and fertilizers, and support for marketing their produce. We emphasize organic farming practices and sustainable water management, aligning with the region\'s ecological sensitivity.  This not only increases crop yields but also improves the quality of life for farmers and their families.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Skill development is another cornerstone of our work. We offer vocational training programs tailored to the specific needs of the local population, focusing on trades and skills that are in high demand within the regional economy.  These programs equip individuals with the tools and expertise to secure sustainable livelihoods, reducing dependency and fostering economic self-sufficiency. Our unique selling point lies in the practical, hands-on nature of these programs, ensuring trainees gain real-world experience and valuable job skills.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Finally, our community health initiatives focus on improving access to healthcare and promoting preventative health measures.  We work in partnership with local healthcare providers and organizations to deliver essential health services, conduct health awareness campaigns, and advocate for improved healthcare infrastructure in underserved areas. We prioritize maternal and child health, recognizing their crucial role in overall community wellbeing. This multi-pronged strategy ensures a holistic approach to community development.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At The Oja\'s Foundation, customer experience is not just about satisfying beneficiaries; it\'s about building genuine partnerships.  We prioritize open communication, active listening, and mutual respect in all our interactions.  We work closely with community leaders and individuals to understand their unique needs and tailor our programs accordingly. Our approach emphasizes participatory development, ensuring that the communities we serve are active partners in the process of change.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to transparency and accountability further distinguishes our approach. We maintain detailed records of our activities and regularly report on our progress to stakeholders. This commitment fosters trust and ensures the effectiveness of our interventions.  By actively engaging with the local community, we strive to create a sense of ownership and shared responsibility, fostering long-term sustainability and lasting impact.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe that true community engagement requires a deep understanding of local context and customs. We actively seek the input and participation of community members at every stage of our projects.  This collaborative approach ensures the relevance and effectiveness of our programs while strengthening the bonds between The Oja\'s Foundation and the communities we serve.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>The Oja\'s Foundation envisions a future where Assam’s communities are empowered, resilient, and thriving.  Our long-term goal is to expand our reach and impact, replicating our successful models in other regions of Assam and potentially beyond.  We aim to achieve this through strategic partnerships with government agencies, private sector organizations, and international development partners.  We believe that collaboration is essential for achieving large-scale, sustainable change.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are continuously exploring innovative approaches to enhance the effectiveness of our programs. This includes leveraging technology to improve data collection and analysis, optimizing resource allocation, and expanding our reach through online platforms and digital outreach. We are also committed to developing our capacity for impact measurement and evaluation, ensuring that our efforts are consistently aligned with our goals and generating tangible, measurable results.  This data-driven approach will guide our future initiatives and help us refine our strategies for maximum effectiveness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Oja\'s Foundation\'s future is one of growth, innovation, and continued commitment to empowering the people of Assam.  We believe in the power of collaboration, sustainable development, and community-driven initiatives to create a brighter, more prosperous future for all.  Our journey is ongoing, but our dedication to serving the people of Assam remains unwavering.</p> <br> <br>', '5Q7J+G52, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 23:25:34', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(771, 'Dr Rituraj Bailung Sonowal', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Dr. Rituraj Bailung Sonowal:  A Leading Medical Practice in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Established in Medicity Guwahati, strategically located on the Dispur Hatigaon main road opposite Sankar Path and near Sewali Path, Dr. Rituraj Bailung Sonowal represents a commitment to delivering high-quality medical care to the people of Assam.  The practice distinguishes itself through a blend of advanced medical expertise, personalized patient care, and a deep understanding of the unique healthcare needs within the local community.  Dr. Sonowal\'s practice plays a vital role in providing accessible and comprehensive medical services, contributing significantly to the overall healthcare landscape of Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Expertise and Compassion Combined</h2>\n\n<p>Dr. Rituraj Bailung Sonowal offers a comprehensive range of medical services tailored to meet the diverse healthcare requirements of the local population. While the precise specialization is not explicitly stated, the practice\'s location within Medicity Guwahati suggests a focus on modern medical technologies and advanced treatments. This may include routine check-ups, diagnosis and management of various illnesses,  preventive healthcare consultations, and referrals to specialists as needed.  The emphasis is consistently placed on a holistic approach, addressing both the physical and emotional well-being of patients.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Dr. Sonowal\'s practice is its commitment to personalized care. This goes beyond simply providing medical treatment; it encompasses building strong doctor-patient relationships based on trust and mutual understanding.  This personalized approach allows for a more effective diagnosis and treatment plan tailored to the individual needs and preferences of each patient. The practice fosters a comfortable and welcoming environment, recognizing that a patient\'s emotional state plays a crucial role in their overall recovery.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, the practice actively seeks to bridge the gap in healthcare access for the community.  By being located in a readily accessible area of Guwahati, it strives to make quality medical services easily available to a broad spectrum of the population.  Understanding the specific needs of the local community is central to the practice\'s philosophy, ensuring that services are culturally sensitive and responsive to local healthcare challenges.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience:  Building Trust and Lasting Relationships</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of Dr. Rituraj Bailung Sonowal\'s practice lies a commitment to exceptional customer service.  The practice prioritizes clear and effective communication, ensuring patients feel informed and empowered throughout their healthcare journey.  Appointments are scheduled efficiently, minimizing wait times and respecting patients\' valuable time.  The staff is trained to be compassionate, understanding, and responsive to the diverse needs of each individual patient.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Building trust is paramount. This is achieved through transparency in treatment plans, open communication about costs, and providing patients with the necessary information to make informed decisions about their care. The practice actively encourages patient feedback, utilizing it to continually improve services and ensure that the highest standards of care are consistently maintained. The practice actively engages with the community through participation in local health initiatives and educational programs, fostering a deeper sense of connection and mutual responsibility.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Growth and Continued Community Engagement</h2>\n\n<p>Dr. Rituraj Bailung Sonowal\'s practice envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, always rooted in its commitment to serving the local community. This may involve exploring opportunities to incorporate new medical technologies and treatments, enhancing the scope of services offered, and potentially expanding the practice\'s physical capacity to better meet the growing healthcare demands of Guwahati.  Maintaining a strong focus on patient satisfaction and community engagement will remain central to this growth strategy.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term goals include becoming a recognized leader in providing high-quality, accessible healthcare within the region.  This involves not just expanding the services offered but also strengthening partnerships with other healthcare providers and institutions to create a comprehensive network of care. The practice aims to contribute significantly to the improvement of public health outcomes in Assam, fostering a healthier and more vibrant community.  Continuous professional development and the adoption of innovative practices will remain crucial elements in achieving this vision.</p>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>In summary, Dr. Rituraj Bailung Sonowal\'s medical practice represents a significant contribution to the healthcare landscape of Guwahati.  Its blend of advanced medical expertise, personalized patient care, and strong community engagement positions it as a valuable resource for individuals and families in the region.  The practice\'s commitment to continuous improvement and its future vision promise a continued positive impact on the health and well-being of the community it serves.</p>', 'Medicity Guwahati, dispur hatigaon main road opp Sankar path, near Sewali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '8486483479', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 23:25:41', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(772, 'ALIVIO PHYSIOTHERAPY AND SPORTS REHAB CENTRE', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>ALIVIO Physiotherapy and Sports Rehab Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled on the bustling VIP Airport Road, ALIVIO Physiotherapy and Sports Rehab Centre stands as a beacon of holistic healthcare in Assam.  We are dedicated to providing comprehensive physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation services, tailored to meet the diverse needs of our community.  Our commitment to evidence-based practice, coupled with a personalized approach to patient care, sets us apart in the competitive landscape of Assam\'s healthcare sector. We strive to be more than just a clinic; we aim to be a trusted partner in our clients\' journey towards physical well-being and improved quality of life.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>ALIVIO’s significance lies in bridging the gap in access to high-quality physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation services within the region.  Recognizing the growing demand for specialized care for athletic injuries, musculoskeletal disorders, and post-surgical rehabilitation, we have curated a range of services designed to address these prevalent needs.  Our strategic location on VIP Airport Road provides convenient accessibility for residents and travellers alike, emphasizing our commitment to serving a wide spectrum of the population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Our comprehensive service portfolio encompasses a wide array of treatments and rehabilitation programs.  We offer specialized physiotherapy for conditions such as back pain, neck pain, arthritis, sports injuries (including those common in popular Assamese sports), and post-operative rehabilitation. Our services extend to manual therapy, electrotherapy, therapeutic exercises, and individualized exercise prescription.  We also offer specialized programs for pre and post-natal care, addressing the specific physical demands of pregnancy and postpartum recovery. Our sports rehabilitation program focuses on injury prevention, performance enhancement, and the safe return to athletic activity.  This includes biomechanical assessments, strength and conditioning programs, and sports-specific rehabilitation protocols.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets ALIVIO apart is our commitment to personalized care.  We don\'t believe in a \"one-size-fits-all\" approach. Our experienced physiotherapists conduct thorough assessments to understand each patient\'s unique needs and develop customized treatment plans accordingly. We utilize advanced technology and evidence-based techniques to ensure the highest standards of care, making us a leader in innovative physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation within Assam.  We also strive to make our services accessible to a wide range of individuals, offering flexible appointment scheduling and transparent pricing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At ALIVIO, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful healthcare practice. From the moment a patient walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere.  We strive to create a comfortable and supportive environment where patients feel heard, understood, and empowered to take an active role in their recovery. Our team of physiotherapists and support staff are not only highly skilled professionals but also compassionate individuals dedicated to providing personalized attention to each patient.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We are committed to building strong relationships with our patients, fostering open communication and transparency throughout the treatment process.  We provide regular progress updates, encourage patient feedback, and actively involve them in developing their individualized rehabilitation programs.  We also actively engage with the local community through health awareness campaigns, workshops, and collaborations with local sports clubs and organizations, promoting proactive health and injury prevention. We believe in building trust and fostering a sense of community, vital to long-term success and patient satisfaction.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>ALIVIO Physiotherapy and Sports Rehab Centre envisions becoming a leading provider of physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation services in Assam.  We plan to expand our service offerings to encompass new areas of specialization, such as pediatric physiotherapy and neurological rehabilitation, in response to the evolving needs of our community. We are committed to investing in advanced technologies and continuing professional development for our team to maintain our position at the forefront of physiotherapy practice. This includes staying abreast of the latest research and implementing the most effective and innovative treatment techniques.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a strong network of referral partners, including physicians, athletic trainers, and other healthcare professionals, to facilitate seamless access to our services. We also plan to develop strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote workplace wellness and injury prevention programs.  We aspire to become a recognized leader in advocating for improved access to quality physiotherapy care throughout Assam, contributing to a healthier and more active population. Through continuous improvement and a unwavering commitment to our patients, we aim to make ALIVIO the premier choice for physiotherapy and sports rehabilitation in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, ALIVIO\'s success will be measured by the positive impact we have on the lives of our patients.  Our commitment to excellence, personalized care, and community engagement will drive our continued growth and solidify our position as a trusted and respected healthcare provider within the heart of Assam.</p>', 'VIP Airport Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 23:30:12', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL),
(773, 'Seedlings ABA Therapy & Child Skill Development Centre', 'Rehabilitation Center', '', '<h1>Seedlings ABA Therapy & Child Skill Development Centre</h1>\n\n<p>Seedlings ABA Therapy & Child Skill Development Centre, located at Wireless, House No 33, Rupalim Path, Rangamancha Path, is a pioneering centre dedicated to providing high-quality Applied Behavior Analysis (ABA) therapy and comprehensive child skill development services in the heart of Assam.  We recognise the critical need for specialized support for children with autism spectrum disorder (ASD) and other developmental challenges within our community, and we are committed to filling that gap with compassionate, evidence-based care. Our centre differentiates itself through a holistic approach, combining cutting-edge ABA techniques with a nurturing environment that fosters individual growth and empowers families.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In a region where access to specialized developmental services may be limited, Seedlings strives to be a beacon of hope and support. We understand the unique challenges faced by families navigating the complexities of developmental disabilities, and we are dedicated to providing a supportive and understanding environment. Our commitment to inclusivity ensures that every child, regardless of their background or abilities, feels welcome, valued, and empowered to reach their full potential. We believe that early intervention is key and that with the right support, every child can thrive.  Seedlings aims to be a leading provider of such essential support in Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Seedlings offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to meet the diverse needs of children and their families.  Our core services include individualized ABA therapy programs tailored to each child\'s specific developmental profile and goals.  These programs are developed and overseen by Board Certified Behavior Analysts (BCBAs) and implemented by highly trained Registered Behavior Technicians (RBTs).  We utilize evidence-based practices to address a wide range of challenges, including communication deficits, social skills development, and adaptive behavior enhancement.  Beyond ABA therapy, we also offer speech therapy, occupational therapy, and play therapy, ensuring a holistic approach to child development.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling points include our small group sizes, which allow for individualized attention and customized learning plans. We also prioritize parent training and involvement, equipping families with the tools and knowledge to support their child\'s development at home.  We understand the importance of creating a comfortable and stimulating learning environment, and our centre is designed to be a welcoming and enriching space for children.  Furthermore, we are committed to ongoing professional development for our team, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of best practices in ABA therapy and child development.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The demand for specialized services like ABA therapy and comprehensive child development programs is rapidly growing in Assam.  Seedlings directly addresses this unmet need by providing accessible, high-quality care to children and families who might otherwise lack access to these essential services. We recognize the cultural nuances of our community and tailor our approach accordingly, ensuring that our services are culturally sensitive and respectful.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Seedlings, we prioritize building strong, trusting relationships with our clients.  We believe that open communication and collaboration are crucial to achieving optimal outcomes. Our approach is rooted in empathy, understanding, and a deep commitment to empowering families.  We provide regular progress reports, parent consultations, and opportunities for feedback, ensuring that families are actively involved in their child\'s treatment plan.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to personalized care. We don’t believe in a “one-size-fits-all” approach. Each child is unique, with their own strengths, challenges, and learning styles.  We meticulously assess each child\'s needs and tailor our interventions to their individual profile, ensuring that every child receives the most effective and appropriate support.  This commitment to personalized care extends beyond the therapy sessions; we also strive to create a supportive community for families, providing resources, workshops, and networking opportunities.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools, hospitals, and other relevant organizations.  This allows us to extend our reach and contribute to the overall well-being of children in the region. We believe that by working collaboratively with other professionals and community stakeholders, we can create a more supportive and inclusive environment for children with developmental needs.  We participate in local events and workshops, raising awareness about autism and other developmental disabilities, and providing resources and support to families in need.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Seedlings envisions a future where every child in Assam has access to high-quality developmental services. We plan to expand our services to include a wider range of therapeutic interventions and support programs.  This may involve expanding our physical space, recruiting additional qualified professionals, and developing innovative programs tailored to the evolving needs of our community. We also aim to become a leading research and training center in ABA therapy and child development, contributing to the advancement of the field and empowering future professionals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a sustainable and impactful organization that continues to make a positive difference in the lives of children and families for generations to come. We are committed to continuous improvement, staying abreast of the latest research and best practices, and adapting our services to meet the evolving needs of our clients.  We aspire to be a model for excellence in ABA therapy and child skill development, setting a high standard for quality and compassionate care within Assam and beyond.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Seedlings’ vision is to build a brighter future for children with developmental challenges, empowering them to reach their full potential and lead fulfilling lives. We believe that with dedication, innovation, and a commitment to excellence, we can make a lasting impact on the lives of children and families in our community.</p>', 'Wireless, House No 33, Rupalim Path, Rangamancha Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '9395919009', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-12 23:30:21', 'Active', '2025-08-12 15:27:53', NULL);
