(919, 'Potential & Concept Educations Dharapur', 'Coaching Center', '', '<h1>Potential & Concept Educations Dharapur</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled within the vibrant Bhaben Thakuria Complex in Dharapur, Potential & Concept Educations stands as a beacon of educational excellence in the heart of Assam.  We are not simply a coaching center; we are a catalyst for transformation, empowering individuals to reach their full potential and contribute meaningfully to their communities.  Our unique approach combines rigorous academic preparation with holistic personal development, setting us apart in the competitive educational landscape of the region. We recognize the specific needs and aspirations of the local populace and tailor our programs accordingly, ensuring relevance and impact.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to quality and personalized learning is the cornerstone of our success. Unlike large, impersonal institutions, we prioritize small class sizes and individualized attention. This allows our experienced educators to understand each student\'s strengths and weaknesses, providing targeted support and fostering a nurturing learning environment. This intimate approach promotes a strong sense of community and camaraderie amongst students, further enhancing their learning journey.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Potential & Concept Educations offers a comprehensive range of educational services designed to meet the diverse needs of our students. Our core offerings include specialized coaching for competitive examinations such as the JEE, NEET, and various state-level entrance tests. We also provide comprehensive tutoring programs for students across various academic boards and levels, focusing on core subjects like mathematics, science, and languages.  Furthermore, we offer skill-building workshops and personality development programs designed to equip students with the essential soft skills necessary for success in higher education and beyond.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our integrated approach. We don\'t simply focus on academic achievement; we invest in the holistic development of our students.  Our programs incorporate elements of leadership training, communication skills development, and critical thinking, creating well-rounded individuals prepared for the challenges of the modern world. This holistic approach sets us apart from traditional coaching centers that primarily concentrate on exam preparation. This comprehensive development ensures our students are not only academically successful but also equipped to thrive personally and professionally.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the specific needs of the Dharapur community, our curriculum and teaching methodologies are carefully designed to address the local context. We understand the educational challenges faced by students in the region and strive to bridge the gap through innovative teaching strategies and personalized learning plans.  Our focus on affordability also ensures that quality education remains accessible to a wide range of students, regardless of their socio-economic background.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Potential & Concept Educations, we believe that a positive and supportive learning environment is crucial for student success.  Our commitment to exceptional customer service begins with a thorough understanding of individual student needs.  We conduct regular parent-teacher meetings and provide personalized feedback to monitor progress and address any concerns promptly. Our dedicated team of counselors provides constant guidance and support to students, addressing their academic, personal, and emotional well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets us apart is our deep connection with the local community.  We actively engage with local schools, organizations, and community leaders to understand the evolving educational needs of the region.  This engagement informs our curriculum development and ensures that our programs remain relevant and responsive to the specific demands of the local job market. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and actively participate in various social initiatives aimed at promoting education and empowerment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Potential & Concept Educations envisions a future where we become a leading educational institution in Assam, renowned for our commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We plan to expand our range of programs to encompass a wider spectrum of educational needs, including vocational training and higher education guidance. This expansion will not only benefit our students but also contribute to the overall economic development of the region by creating a skilled and empowered workforce.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish a network of learning centers across Assam, replicating our successful model and providing quality education to students in underserved communities.  We aim to achieve this through strategic partnerships with local stakeholders, leveraging technology to enhance learning experiences, and constantly adapting our curriculum to meet the evolving demands of the 21st-century workplace.  We are committed to fostering a culture of continuous improvement and innovation, ensuring that Potential & Concept Educations remains a leading force in transforming lives through education.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Through our unwavering commitment to quality education, holistic development, and community engagement, Potential & Concept Educations aims to empower the youth of Dharapur and beyond, equipping them with the knowledge and skills necessary to achieve their full potential and become productive members of society. We believe that education is the key to unlocking individual and collective progress, and we are dedicated to making a lasting impact on the lives we touch.</p>', 'Bhaben Thakuria Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-19 12:05:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL),
(920, 'Potential and Concept Educations Dighalipukhuri Block 2', 'Coaching Center', '', '<h1>Potential and Concept Educations Dighalipukhuri Block 2</h1>\n\n<p>Potential and Concept Educations, situated in Dighalipukhuri Block 2, is a dynamic educational institution playing a vital role in shaping the future of Assam\'s youth.  We are committed to providing high-quality education and fostering a learning environment that empowers students to reach their full potential. Our unique approach blends traditional academic excellence with innovative teaching methodologies, ensuring our students are well-prepared for the challenges and opportunities of the 21st century.  We differentiate ourselves through a strong focus on individual student needs and a deep connection with the local community, actively contributing to the region\'s intellectual and social growth. </p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to excellence extends beyond the classroom. We actively cultivate a supportive and nurturing learning environment where students feel comfortable exploring their interests, developing their critical thinking skills, and building lasting relationships with their peers and mentors. We believe that education is a transformative journey, and we are dedicated to guiding our students every step of the way. In a region where access to quality education can be limited, Potential and Concept Educations serves as a beacon of hope, providing a pathway to success for students from diverse backgrounds.</p><br><br>\n\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Potential and Concept Educations offers a comprehensive range of educational services catering to the diverse needs of students in the region.  Our core offerings include tailored tutoring programs focusing on various academic subjects, from primary school levels through secondary and beyond.  We also provide specialized exam preparation courses for crucial examinations like the Higher Secondary Leaving Certificate (HSLC) and the Higher Secondary (HS) examinations, equipping students with the knowledge and skills necessary to excel. Recognizing the importance of practical skills, we incorporate vocational training programs designed to equip students with employable skills, enhancing their career prospects within the local and national job markets.  Our curriculum is regularly updated to meet the evolving needs of the educational landscape, incorporating contemporary teaching methodologies and modern technological tools.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>A unique selling proposition of Potential and Concept Educations is our personalized learning approach. We believe in understanding each student\'s individual learning style, strengths, and weaknesses to create a customized learning plan that maximizes their potential.  Our small class sizes and dedicated instructors allow for individualized attention, ensuring every student receives the support they need to succeed. This commitment to personalized learning, coupled with our strong emphasis on practical application, sets us apart in the competitive educational landscape of Assam.  We directly address the local market need for quality education by providing accessible, affordable, and effective learning opportunities, bridging the gap between aspirational students and the resources required for success.</p><br><br>\n\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>At Potential and Concept Educations, we prioritize building strong, lasting relationships with our students and their families.  We foster an open communication channel, ensuring parents are kept informed about their child\'s progress and are actively involved in the learning process.  We believe that a collaborative approach between the institution, students, and parents is essential for achieving optimal learning outcomes. Our customer service extends beyond academic support; we provide guidance and mentorship to help students navigate the complexities of choosing a career path and preparing for higher education.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to the local community is a cornerstone of our philosophy.  We regularly organize workshops, seminars, and community outreach programs to promote education and empower individuals in the Dighalipukhuri Block 2 area. We actively engage with local organizations and leaders to identify and address the specific educational needs of our community.  This dedication to community engagement reflects our belief that education is a catalyst for positive social change and that we have a responsibility to contribute to the overall well-being of our region. We strive to create a warm and welcoming learning environment where students feel valued, respected, and empowered.</p><br><br>\n\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Potential and Concept Educations envisions a future where we become a leading educational institution in Assam, recognized for our commitment to excellence, innovation, and community engagement.  Our future plans include expanding our range of educational services to meet the growing demand for specialized training programs in emerging fields.  We aim to integrate more advanced technologies into our teaching methods, leveraging the power of digital learning tools to enhance the learning experience. We also plan to further strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and industries to create more opportunities for internships and apprenticeships for our students.</p><br><br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to empower generations of students from Dighalipukhuri Block 2 and the surrounding areas by providing them with the knowledge, skills, and confidence to achieve their full potential.  We aspire to contribute to the economic and social development of Assam by fostering a highly skilled and educated workforce.  We will continue to invest in our infrastructure, curriculum, and faculty to ensure we remain at the forefront of educational innovation, always adapting to the evolving needs of our students and community.  We envision a future where Potential and Concept Educations becomes synonymous with quality education and transformative learning in the heart of Assam.</p><br><br>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-08-19 12:05:41', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', NULL),
(922, 'Kairali Ayurvedic Centre, Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Kairali Ayurvedic Centre, Guwahati, nestled at 1, B N SAIKIA PATH, represents a haven of traditional healing amidst the bustling cityscape. More than just a wellness center, Kairali Ayurvedic Centre stands as a beacon of authentic Ayurvedic practices, bringing the ancient wisdom of Kerala to the heart of Assam. Its presence significantly contributes to the growing health and wellness sector in Guwahati, offering a holistic alternative to conventional healthcare. By focusing on personalized treatments rooted in centuries-old traditions, the center distinguishes itself from generic spas and wellness clinics, catering to a growing demand for natural and sustainable health solutions within the local community. Its strategic location ensures accessibility for residents seeking authentic Ayurvedic care.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Kairali Ayurvedic Centre offers a comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic services and products designed to restore balance and promote overall well-being. These services encompass personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to create tailored treatment plans. These plans typically include specialized Ayurvedic therapies such as Abhyangam (full body massage with medicated oils), Shirodhara (gentle pouring of oil on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation therapies), and other traditional Ayurvedic treatments. Furthermore, the centre provides dietary guidance based on Ayurvedic principles, empowering clients to make informed choices that support their health goals.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA key differentiator for Kairali Ayurvedic Centre lies in its commitment to authenticity. The centre utilizes genuine Ayurvedic oils and herbs, many sourced directly from Kerala, ensuring the efficacy and purity of its treatments. This dedication to quality, coupled with the expertise of its therapists trained in traditional Ayurvedic techniques, sets it apart from competitors who may offer diluted or superficial versions of these therapies. The centre also addresses specific local market needs, such as managing lifestyle-related ailments common in the region, including stress, digestive issues, and joint pain, through targeted Ayurvedic interventions. Additionally, it offers personalized wellness packages catering to different needs, such as stress management, weight management, and rejuvenation, further enhancing its appeal to the local populace.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nKairali Ayurvedic Centre prioritizes creating a nurturing and supportive environment for its clients. From the moment a client walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care. The centre\'s staff takes the time to understand each individual\'s unique needs and concerns, providing personalized attention throughout their treatment journey. The therapists are not only skilled in their techniques but also empathetic and attentive, ensuring that clients feel comfortable and relaxed during their sessions. To foster a deeper connection with the local community, the centre actively participates in health awareness programs and workshops, educating people about the benefits of Ayurveda and promoting holistic well-being. This active engagement demonstrates a commitment beyond mere service provision, establishing Kairali Ayurvedic Centre as a trusted partner in the community\'s health and wellness journey. Feedback is actively sought and integrated to continually improve the client experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Kairali Ayurvedic Centre, Guwahati envisions becoming the premier destination for authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in the region. Future plans include expanding its service offerings to incorporate specialized Ayurvedic treatments for specific conditions, such as diabetes and cardiovascular diseases. The centre also aims to establish partnerships with local healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices. Exploring opportunities to cultivate medicinal herbs locally and creating Ayurvedic products tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese population is also a long-term goal. The centre anticipates leveraging digital platforms to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations, making Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible. Ultimately, Kairali Ayurvedic Centre seeks to empower individuals to take control of their health through the wisdom of Ayurveda, contributing to a healthier and more balanced community in Guwahati and beyond. This growth strategy is predicated on upholding the highest standards of quality, authenticity, and customer satisfaction, solidifying its position as a trusted and respected Ayurvedic center.', '1, B N SAIKIA PATH', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:16:58', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(923, 'Jiva Ayurveda Clinic & Panchakarma Centre, Guwahati, Assam', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Jiva Ayurveda Clinic & Panchakarma Centre, Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of traditional healing, offering authentic Ayurvedic treatments and Panchakarma therapies in the heart of Guwahati. Located at No 1, 1st Flr, Anupama Mention, H No 316, Bajrakbati Road, near Nabajyoti Club, the clinic provides a serene and accessible environment for individuals seeking natural and holistic wellness solutions. Jiva Ayurveda is not just a clinic; it represents a commitment to reviving and promoting the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda in a modern context, catering specifically to the health needs of the Assamese community and beyond. Its presence significantly contributes to the growing wellness industry in the region, offering a credible alternative to conventional medicine and empowering individuals to take charge of their health through natural and sustainable practices.\n<br> <br>\nThe core of Jiva Ayurveda\'s offering lies in its comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and authentic Panchakarma therapies. The clinic provides expert Ayurvedic consultations by qualified and experienced Ayurvedic doctors who meticulously assess each patient\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to diagnose the root cause of their health concerns. Based on this thorough assessment, individualized treatment plans are developed, incorporating dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and specific Ayurvedic therapies.\n\n<br> <br>\nPanchakarma, the cornerstone of Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation, is a specialized offering at the centre. The clinic provides a range of Panchakarma procedures, including Vamana (emesis therapy), Virechana (purgation therapy), Basti (enema therapy), Nasya (nasal administration), and Raktamokshana (bloodletting therapy), each meticulously performed under the supervision of skilled therapists and doctors. These therapies are instrumental in eliminating accumulated toxins, restoring balance to the body\'s doshas, and promoting overall well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\nA key differentiating factor for Jiva Ayurveda is its unwavering commitment to using authentic Ayurvedic principles and high-quality herbal formulations. The clinic sources its herbs and ingredients from reputable suppliers, ensuring their purity and potency. Furthermore, the doctors and therapists at Jiva Ayurveda possess extensive knowledge and experience in Ayurvedic medicine, enabling them to provide effective and safe treatments. By offering personalized and authentic Ayurvedic solutions, Jiva Ayurveda directly addresses the growing need for natural and holistic healthcare options in Guwahati and the surrounding areas, where there is a rising awareness of the benefits of traditional medicine. It fulfills a vital niche by providing accessible and effective Ayurvedic care rooted in time-tested principles.\n<br> <br>\nJiva Ayurveda Clinic & Panchakarma Centre prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every patient. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and compassion. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized care, ensuring that each patient feels comfortable and respected throughout their treatment journey. The clinic’s approach to customer service emphasizes education and empowerment. Patients are actively involved in their treatment plans, receiving clear explanations of their condition, the recommended therapies, and lifestyle adjustments. This collaborative approach fosters a sense of ownership and encourages patients to take an active role in their healing process.\n\n<br> <br>\nFurthermore, Jiva Ayurveda actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the principles of Ayurveda, its benefits, and its relevance to modern lifestyles. By participating in local events and partnering with community organizations, Jiva Ayurveda strengthens its connection with the community and establishes itself as a trusted resource for health and wellness information. The clinic also focuses on providing culturally sensitive care, understanding and respecting the local customs and traditions of the Assamese community. This approach ensures that patients feel comfortable and understood, fostering a strong sense of trust and loyalty.\n<br> <br>\nLooking ahead, Jiva Ayurveda Clinic & Panchakarma Centre envisions expanding its reach and impact within Guwahati and beyond. The clinic plans to introduce specialized Ayurvedic programs targeting specific health concerns prevalent in the region, such as diabetes, arthritis, and respiratory disorders. This strategic focus will allow the clinic to cater to the unique healthcare needs of the local population and establish itself as a center of excellence for specific Ayurvedic treatments.\n\n<br> <br>\nThe clinic also aims to enhance its infrastructure and services, potentially incorporating additional wellness modalities such as yoga and meditation to complement its Ayurvedic offerings. Furthermore, there are plans to expand the team of doctors and therapists, ensuring that the clinic can meet the growing demand for its services. In the long term, Jiva Ayurveda aspires to become a leading Ayurvedic healthcare provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authentic Ayurvedic principles, personalized care, and community engagement. The vision is to empower individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through the transformative power of Ayurveda, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community. The clinic also intends to leverage digital platforms to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations and educational resources, making Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible to individuals in remote areas.', 'No 1, 1st Flr, Anupama Mention, H No 316, Bajrakbati Road, near Nabajyoti Club', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '069013 70770', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:17:05', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(924, 'AYONext Healthcare- A Multispeciality Ayurveda & Holistic clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>AYONext Healthcare: Bridging Tradition and Modernity in Holistic Wellness</p>\n\n<p>Nestled opposite Cafe Coffee Day at House fed, Bus stop, Beltola - Basistha Rd, AYONext Healthcare stands as a beacon of holistic wellness in Guwahati. More than just a clinic, AYONext Healthcare is a multispeciality Ayurveda and holistic center dedicated to providing comprehensive and personalized healthcare solutions rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, integrated with modern diagnostic and therapeutic approaches. In the vibrant and rapidly evolving business landscape of Assam, AYONext Healthcare fills a crucial niche by offering a unique blend of traditional healing and contemporary medical understanding. This approach addresses the growing demand for natural, preventative, and personalized healthcare solutions, distinguishing it from conventional medical practices and contributing significantly to the local wellness ecosystem. AYONext Healthcare aims to be the premier destination for individuals seeking authentic and effective Ayurvedic care, promoting a healthier and more balanced lifestyle within the community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Holistic Healthcare Tailored to Your Needs: Core Services and Products</p>\n\n<p>At the heart of AYONext Healthcare lies a commitment to providing a wide array of services designed to cater to diverse health and wellness needs. Our core offerings include: Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, Panchakarma therapies, specialized Ayurvedic treatments for chronic conditions, yoga and meditation sessions, dietary and lifestyle counseling, and herbal remedies. What truly sets AYONext Healthcare apart is its integrated approach. Our experienced Ayurvedic physicians conduct thorough assessments, considering not only physical symptoms but also mental and emotional well-being. This holistic understanding allows for the creation of customized treatment plans that address the root cause of ailments, promoting long-term healing. <br> <br> Our Panchakarma therapies, a cornerstone of Ayurvedic detoxification, are meticulously performed by trained therapists using authentic Ayurvedic principles. These therapies aim to eliminate toxins, restore balance, and rejuvenate the body. Furthermore, our specialized Ayurvedic treatments cater to a range of chronic conditions, such as arthritis, diabetes, skin disorders, and digestive issues. We also offer yoga and meditation sessions, guided by certified instructors, to enhance physical flexibility, reduce stress, and promote mental clarity. Dietary and lifestyle counseling forms an integral part of our approach, empowering individuals to make informed choices that support their overall health and well-being. Our carefully curated selection of herbal remedies, sourced from trusted suppliers, complements our therapies, offering natural and effective solutions for various health concerns. We differentiate ourselves by emphasizing education and empowerment, ensuring our clients understand their conditions and actively participate in their healing journey. By providing comprehensive, personalized, and authentic Ayurvedic care, AYONext Healthcare effectively meets the growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions in the local market, offering a valuable alternative or complement to conventional medical treatments.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Building Trust, Nurturing Well-being: The AYONext Healthcare Customer Experience</p>\n\n<p>The customer experience at AYONext Healthcare is built upon a foundation of empathy, respect, and personalized attention. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care. Our staff is dedicated to creating a welcoming and comfortable environment, fostering a sense of trust and openness. We prioritize active listening, taking the time to understand each client\'s individual needs, concerns, and goals. Our Ayurvedic physicians conduct thorough consultations, explaining diagnoses and treatment plans in a clear and accessible manner, ensuring clients feel informed and empowered. <br> <br> We go the extra mile to provide exceptional customer service, offering personalized follow-up care and ongoing support. Our commitment extends beyond the clinic walls, as we actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health awareness programs. These initiatives aim to educate individuals about the benefits of Ayurveda and holistic living, empowering them to take proactive steps towards their well-being. We actively seek feedback from our clients, using their insights to continuously improve our services and enhance their experience. By fostering strong relationships and building a reputation for integrity and excellence, AYONext Healthcare has established itself as a trusted healthcare partner within the local community. We believe that healing is a collaborative process, and we are dedicated to providing our clients with the support, guidance, and resources they need to achieve optimal health and well-being. Our dedication to personalized care, community engagement, and continuous improvement sets us apart, fostering a loyal client base and contributing to the overall health and vitality of the region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>A Vision for a Healthier Tomorrow: Future Growth and Long-Term Goals</p>\n\n<p>AYONext Healthcare envisions a future where Ayurveda and holistic healthcare are integral components of mainstream healthcare in Assam and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our services to reach a wider audience, establishing ourselves as a leading center for Ayurvedic education and research, and contributing to the development of sustainable healthcare practices. We plan to expand our range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments, incorporating advanced diagnostic technologies to enhance accuracy and effectiveness. <br> <br> We also aim to establish partnerships with local businesses, schools, and community organizations to promote wellness initiatives and raise awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda. Investing in research and development is a key priority, as we seek to validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments through scientific studies and contribute to the growing body of evidence-based Ayurvedic medicine. We also envision establishing a training center to educate and empower the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners. Furthermore, we are committed to sustainable practices, sourcing our herbal remedies from ethical and environmentally responsible suppliers, and minimizing our environmental impact. By pursuing these goals, AYONext Healthcare aspires to become a catalyst for positive change in the healthcare landscape, promoting a holistic approach to wellness that integrates mind, body, and spirit. Our vision is to create a healthier and more vibrant community, empowering individuals to live their lives to the fullest.</p>', 'House fed, Bus stop, Beltola - Basistha Rd, opposite Cafe Coffee Day', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '080113 93135', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:17:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(925, 'Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved | Apollo Clinic Dispur', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved | Apollo Clinic Dispur: Reimagining Wellness Through Ancient Wisdom</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Dispur, Guwahati, at 4QQX+8HH Abode Grand, near SBI ATM, opposite Downtown Hospital, Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved operates within the prestigious Apollo Clinic Dispur, offering a unique and integrated approach to healthcare. More than just a clinic, it represents a confluence of traditional Ayurvedic practices and modern medical understanding. In the burgeoning Assam healthcare landscape, this practice stands out by providing personalized, holistic wellness solutions deeply rooted in Ayurvedic principles, tailored to address the specific health needs of the local community. This synergy allows for a comprehensive treatment paradigm, offering patients the best of both worlds – the time-tested efficacy of Ayurveda and the assurance of Apollo Clinic\'s quality and infrastructure.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Well-being</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved offers a wide spectrum of Ayurvedic services designed to promote health and well-being. The cornerstone of the practice is personalized Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of the individual\'s <i>prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>vikriti</i> (imbalance), allowing Dr. Kalita to create tailored treatment plans that address the root cause of ailments. These plans may encompass dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and specialized Ayurvedic therapies.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Key service offerings include:\n<ul>\n    <li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> A comprehensive detoxification and rejuvenation program, customized to the individual\'s needs and administered under expert supervision.</li>\n    <li><b>Herbal Medicine:</b> A curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations, sourced from reputable suppliers, to support various health conditions.</li>\n    <li><b>Diet and Lifestyle Counseling:</b> Personalized guidance on diet and lifestyle adjustments to promote optimal health and prevent disease.</li>\n    <li><b>Stress Management Programs:</b> Utilizing Ayurvedic techniques such as yoga, meditation, and aromatherapy to reduce stress and improve mental well-being.</li>\n    <li><b>Management of Chronic Diseases:</b> Ayurvedic approaches for managing chronic conditions such as diabetes, arthritis, and respiratory disorders, often complementing conventional medical treatments.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Dr. Kalita\'s practice apart is the emphasis on personalized care and the integration of Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostic tools. The practice leverages the resources of Apollo Clinic Dispur, allowing for comprehensive diagnostic testing when needed to ensure accurate assessment and effective treatment. Furthermore, the focus extends beyond symptom management to address the underlying imbalances that contribute to disease, promoting long-term health and well-being. This unique combination addresses the growing local demand for holistic healthcare options that are both effective and sustainable.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Customer Experience: Nurturing a Community of Wellness</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved, patient well-being is paramount. The clinic cultivates a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment where patients feel heard, understood, and empowered to take control of their health. The approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, respect, and a genuine commitment to providing personalized care. Time is taken to thoroughly understand each patient\'s concerns, answer their questions, and explain treatment options in a clear and accessible manner. Follow-up consultations are conducted to monitor progress and make necessary adjustments to the treatment plan.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The practice actively connects with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and educational seminars on Ayurvedic principles and healthy living. These initiatives aim to empower individuals with the knowledge and tools they need to make informed decisions about their health and well-being. By fostering a strong sense of community and promoting a holistic approach to health, Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved is not only providing healthcare but also building a community of wellness within Dispur.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Future Vision: Expanding the Reach of Authentic Ayurveda</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The vision for Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved is to become a leading center for authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, personalized care, and integrated approach. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, incorporating advanced Ayurvedic therapies, and developing specialized programs for specific health conditions. Collaboration with other healthcare professionals and organizations is a key focus, aiming to promote the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare and foster a more holistic approach to patient care.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>There\'s also an aspiration to increase community outreach efforts, extending health awareness programs to a wider audience and promoting the benefits of Ayurveda through various channels. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the community, Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Best Ayurved aims to play a significant role in shaping the future of healthcare in Assam, ensuring that the timeless wisdom of Ayurveda is accessible to all those seeking a path to holistic health and well-being. This involves leveraging digital platforms to reach a broader audience and offer virtual consultations, making Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible to individuals in remote areas.</p>', '4QQX+8HH Abode Grand, near SBI ATM, opp. Downtown Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:17:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(926, 'SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre offers a haven of holistic healing nestled in the heart of Assam. Located at House no 28, Wireless, Namghar Path 2, opposite the BSNL office, SIDDHI is more than just a wellness centre; it\'s a sanctuary dedicated to restoring balance and promoting optimal well-being through the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and Panchakarma therapies. Recognizing the growing need for authentic and accessible Ayurvedic care in the region, SIDDHI aims to bridge the gap between traditional practices and modern lifestyles, providing a path to rejuvenation and lasting health. The centre distinguishes itself by focusing on personalized treatments, expert consultations, and a serene environment conducive to healing. Its presence strengthens the local business landscape by offering a unique service that aligns with a growing global interest in natural and holistic health solutions, catering to both local residents and visitors seeking authentic Ayurvedic experiences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre lies a comprehensive range of services designed to address various health concerns and promote overall well-being. The primary offerings include: Ayurvedic Consultations, providing in-depth assessments of individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to determine personalized treatment plans. Panchakarma Therapies, encompassing a variety of detoxification and rejuvenation treatments like Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy), Basti (medicated enema), Nasya (nasal administration), and Vamana (therapeutic emesis), each tailored to individual needs and health conditions. Additionally, the centre offers specialized Ayurvedic treatments for various ailments, including joint pain, digestive disorders, stress management, and skin conditions. Complementing these core therapies, SIDDHI provides wellness programs focused on lifestyle modifications, dietary recommendations, and yoga and meditation practices. A unique selling point is the centre\'s commitment to using only high-quality, ethically sourced Ayurvedic herbs and oils, ensuring the efficacy and safety of all treatments. The services offered are carefully curated to meet the specific health needs prevalent in the local market, addressing lifestyle-related disorders and promoting preventative healthcare practices rooted in traditional Ayurvedic principles.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience at SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre is paramount. The approach is built on creating a warm, welcoming, and personalized environment where each individual feels valued and supported throughout their wellness journey. From the moment a client enters the centre, they are greeted with genuine care and attention. The team is committed to providing clear and informative consultations, ensuring that clients understand their individual constitution, health concerns, and proposed treatment plans. Therapists are highly trained and experienced in administering Ayurvedic treatments with precision and compassion. The centre maintains a clean, serene, and aesthetically pleasing environment to enhance relaxation and promote a sense of tranquility. SIDDHI actively engages with the local community by participating in health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars to promote the benefits of Ayurveda and holistic living. Building strong relationships with local residents and businesses fosters trust and establishes SIDDHI as a reliable resource for authentic Ayurvedic care. This dedication to exceptional customer service, combined with community engagement, sets SIDDHI apart and contributes to its positive reputation within the local area.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for SIDDHI Ayurveda Panchakarma & Wellness Centre is one of sustainable growth and expanding its reach as a leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam and beyond. Future plans include expanding the range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments offered, incorporating advanced diagnostic techniques, and establishing partnerships with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic therapies into mainstream healthcare. There is also a vision to develop a line of high-quality, locally produced Ayurvedic products, further supporting the local economy and promoting the use of natural remedies. Long-term goals encompass establishing a dedicated training program for Ayurvedic therapists, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing system. SIDDHI aims to become a recognized centre of excellence in Ayurvedic education and research, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and practices in the field. Furthermore, the centre aspires to explore opportunities for expanding its services to other locations, making authentic Ayurvedic care more accessible to a wider population. By continuously innovating, adapting to evolving healthcare needs, and upholding its commitment to quality and authenticity, SIDDHI is poised to achieve significant growth and solidify its position as a trusted and respected wellness centre in the region.</p>', 'House no 28, Wireless, Namghar Path 2, opposite BSNL office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '090855 03254', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:17:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(927, 'Vivekananda Health Global - Ayurveda, Yoga & Naturopathy Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Vivekananda Health Global - Ayurveda, Yoga & Naturopathy Guwahati is a comprehensive wellness center dedicated to providing holistic healthcare solutions rooted in the ancient Indian traditions of Ayurveda, Yoga, and Naturopathy. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, this center addresses the growing demand for natural and preventive healthcare options within the region. Vivekananda Health Global aims to empower individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through personalized treatment plans and lifestyle modifications, making a significant contribution to the local healthcare ecosystem by offering an integrated and alternative approach to conventional medicine.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The center\'s core services encompass a wide range of therapeutic modalities designed to cater to diverse health needs. Ayurvedic consultations form the foundation, where qualified Ayurvedic practitioners assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to devise tailored dietary and lifestyle recommendations, along with herbal remedies. Yoga therapy, another cornerstone, offers structured yoga sessions designed to improve flexibility, strength, and mental clarity, addressing specific health conditions under the guidance of experienced instructors. Naturopathy treatments, including hydrotherapy, mud therapy, and massage, are employed to detoxify the body and stimulate its inherent healing capabilities. A key differentiator lies in the integrated approach, where these three disciplines are synergistically combined to create holistic treatment plans. For example, a patient suffering from chronic back pain might receive Ayurvedic herbal remedies to reduce inflammation, combined with targeted yoga asanas to strengthen core muscles and naturopathic hydrotherapy to alleviate muscle tension. This personalized and integrated approach, tailored to the unique needs of each patient, sets Vivekananda Health Global apart from other wellness centers in Guwahati and meets the growing local demand for natural and effective healthcare solutions. The center also offers wellness packages focusing on detoxification, weight management, and stress reduction, reflecting the specific health challenges prevalent in the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Vivekananda Health Global. The center strives to create a welcoming and supportive environment where patients feel heard, understood, and empowered throughout their healing journey. A key element of their approach is personalized attention, beginning with an in-depth initial consultation to thoroughly understand the patient\'s health history, lifestyle, and goals. Treatment plans are co-created with the patient, ensuring their active participation and understanding. The center invests in highly qualified and compassionate practitioners who are dedicated to providing individualized care. Beyond the treatments themselves, Vivekananda Health Global actively engages with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda, Yoga, and Naturopathy, fostering a greater understanding of holistic health principles and promoting preventive healthcare practices. This community outreach not only builds trust and credibility but also contributes to a healthier and more informed society in Guwahati. The center fosters a strong doctor-patient relationship. Regular follow-up consultations are conducted to monitor progress, adjust treatment plans as needed, and provide ongoing support and encouragement. This comprehensive approach ensures that patients receive the personalized care and attention they need to achieve lasting health improvements.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Vivekananda Health Global envisions becoming a leading center for integrated healthcare in Guwahati and a recognized hub for promoting Ayurvedic, Yoga, and Naturopathic principles throughout Assam. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered to encompass specialized therapies such as Panchakarma (Ayurvedic detoxification), advanced yoga techniques, and customized dietary programs. The center also aims to establish collaborations with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate traditional medicine into mainstream healthcare. This collaborative approach would facilitate referrals, promote a more holistic approach to patient care, and contribute to the overall advancement of healthcare in the region. Furthermore, Vivekananda Health Global plans to invest in research and development to validate the efficacy of its treatments and contribute to the growing body of scientific evidence supporting traditional medicine. Long-term goals include establishing a training center to educate and empower future practitioners of Ayurveda, Yoga, and Naturopathy, ensuring the continued availability of qualified healthcare professionals in the region. By focusing on innovation, collaboration, and education, Vivekananda Health Global aims to solidify its position as a trusted and respected provider of holistic healthcare, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community in Guwahati and beyond. The business also intends to leverage digital platforms to reach a wider audience, offering online consultations, educational resources, and virtual yoga classes to promote accessibility and convenience.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098646 28232', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:20:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
