(928, 'Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic: Restoring Balance and Well-being in the Heart of Assam\n\nKayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic, strategically located on G. S. Road, near PNB Bank, stands as a beacon of traditional healing and holistic well-being in the bustling landscape of Assam. Rooted in the ancient science of Ayurveda, Kayachikitsa offers a comprehensive approach to health, focusing on restoring balance and harmony within the individual. Unlike conventional medical practices that primarily address symptoms, Kayachikitsa delves into the root causes of ailments, offering personalized treatments that consider each individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). The clinic\'s presence enriches the local business environment by providing a valuable alternative and complementary healthcare option that is deeply connected to India\'s rich heritage.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic are its diverse range of services designed to address a spectrum of health concerns. Primary services include thorough Ayurvedic consultations, Panchakarma therapies, specialized Ayurvedic treatments for chronic conditions, and personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations. The clinic specializes in addressing common ailments prevalent in the region, such as digestive disorders, respiratory issues, joint pain, skin conditions, and stress-related imbalances. Each service is tailored to meet the specific needs of the individual, following a detailed assessment of their physical, mental, and emotional well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA key differentiator for Kayachikitsa is its unwavering commitment to authentic Ayurvedic principles. The clinic utilizes high-quality, ethically sourced herbs and natural ingredients in its formulations and treatments. Experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners, trained in traditional techniques, administer these therapies with precision and care. Furthermore, the clinic emphasizes patient education, empowering individuals with the knowledge and tools to actively participate in their own healing journey. This holistic approach, combining traditional wisdom with modern understanding, sets Kayachikitsa apart as a trusted center for authentic Ayurvedic care in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic. The clinic strives to create a warm, welcoming, and nurturing environment where patients feel comfortable and supported. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with genuine care and attention. Consultations are conducted with empathy and patience, ensuring that patients feel heard and understood. Treatment plans are clearly explained, and patients are actively involved in the decision-making process. The clinic also provides ongoing support and guidance, helping patients to integrate Ayurvedic principles into their daily lives.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe clinic fosters a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives. It conducts regular workshops and seminars on Ayurvedic principles, healthy living, and stress management, providing valuable knowledge to the community. Kayachikitsa also collaborates with local organizations to promote health and wellness, participating in health camps and awareness programs. By actively engaging with the community, the clinic seeks to promote a deeper understanding and appreciation for the benefits of Ayurveda. Furthermore, the clinic actively sources some of its ingredients locally, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Kayachikitsa Ayurvedic Clinic envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare and wellness in Assam and beyond. The clinic plans to expand its range of services to include specialized programs for specific health conditions, such as diabetes management and women\'s health. It also aims to establish a training center to nurture the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners. In the long term, Kayachikitsa aspires to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare, working collaboratively with other healthcare providers to offer a truly integrated and holistic approach to health and well-being. Expansion into related product lines, such as Ayurvedic supplements and personal care items, is also being considered to further enhance the clinic\'s offerings and reach a wider audience. The ultimate goal is to empower individuals to take control of their health and live a balanced, fulfilling life through the wisdom of Ayurveda.', 'G. S.road, near PNB bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070022 35198', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:20:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(929, 'Amrit clinic, Ayurvedic holistic centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Amrit Clinic, Ayurvedic Holistic Centre, nestled at H/no 56, Dr. Zakir Hussain Rd, is a dedicated wellness haven bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the heart of Assam. More than just a clinic, Amrit Clinic is a sanctuary designed to restore balance and promote holistic well-being through personalized Ayurvedic treatments, therapies, and lifestyle guidance. In a region deeply rooted in traditional practices, Amrit Clinic stands out by blending authentic Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostics and a commitment to individualized care, addressing the growing need for natural and preventative healthcare solutions within the local community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the core of Amrit Clinic\'s offerings are personalized Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations, conducted by experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners, delve into an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any existing imbalances (Vikriti). This forms the foundation for crafting tailored treatment plans encompassing dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and specific Ayurvedic therapies. The clinic offers a range of authentic Ayurvedic treatments, including Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification therapies), and various other therapeutic massages and herbal treatments. These therapies are meticulously performed using high-quality, ethically sourced Ayurvedic herbs and oils, ensuring optimal therapeutic benefits. Furthermore, Amrit Clinic provides guidance on incorporating Ayurvedic principles into daily life, offering workshops and educational sessions on topics such as mindful eating, stress management techniques, and herbal remedies for common ailments. A key differentiator is the clinic\'s focus on preventative care, empowering individuals to proactively manage their health and prevent the onset of disease through a holistic and sustainable approach. This proactive approach resonates strongly with the local community, seeking natural and sustainable solutions for long-term well-being, and addresses the limitations of conventional healthcare systems in managing chronic conditions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Amrit Clinic prioritizes creating a warm, welcoming, and healing environment for every individual who walks through its doors. From the moment a patient arrives, they are greeted with genuine care and attention, fostering a sense of trust and comfort. The practitioners at Amrit Clinic are not just healthcare providers; they are dedicated guides on each patient\'s journey towards holistic well-being. They take the time to listen attentively to individual concerns, answer questions thoroughly, and provide personalized support throughout the treatment process. Beyond individual care, Amrit Clinic actively engages with the local community through health awareness camps, workshops on Ayurvedic cooking and lifestyle practices, and collaborations with local organizations. This commitment to community outreach fosters a sense of belonging and reinforces Amrit Clinic\'s position as a trusted resource for holistic health and well-being within the region. The emphasis on building strong relationships with patients and community members sets Amrit Clinic apart, creating a loyal following and fostering positive word-of-mouth referrals. The clinic actively seeks feedback from patients to continuously improve its services and ensure that it is meeting the evolving needs of the community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Amrit Clinic envisions becoming a leading Ayurvedic holistic centre in Assam, recognized for its commitment to providing authentic, personalized, and effective Ayurvedic care. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic therapies offered, incorporating advanced diagnostic tools for a more comprehensive assessment of individual health needs, and establishing a dedicated herbal pharmacy to ensure access to high-quality Ayurvedic medicines. The clinic also aims to strengthen its community outreach initiatives by partnering with local schools and workplaces to promote Ayurvedic principles of health and wellness. Furthermore, Amrit Clinic is exploring opportunities to develop specialized programs for specific health conditions, such as diabetes, arthritis, and stress-related disorders, tailoring Ayurvedic treatments and lifestyle recommendations to address the unique needs of these patient populations. The long-term goal is to establish Amrit Clinic as a centre of excellence for Ayurvedic education and research, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition and empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. The expansion of online consultation services is also under consideration, extending the reach of Amrit Clinic\'s expertise to individuals beyond the local area and providing convenient access to Ayurvedic guidance and support.</p>', 'H/no 56, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:20:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(930, 'Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar, a trusted name in traditional healthcare, stands prominently on G.S. Road, near Hotel Ambarish and opposite Shah Petrol Pump, serving the community with authentic Ayurvedic products and remedies. For years, this establishment has been a cornerstone of holistic wellness in Assam, offering a curated selection of herbs, medicines, and personal care items rooted in the ancient science of Ayurveda. In a region where traditional healing practices are deeply respected, Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar distinguishes itself by upholding the principles of quality, authenticity, and personalized service, becoming a vital resource for those seeking natural and effective healthcare solutions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar lies a commitment to providing a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic products. This includes classical Ayurvedic medicines formulated according to traditional recipes, single herbs and herbal blends sourced from reputable suppliers, and a variety of Ayurvedic personal care products such as soaps, shampoos, and oils. The store also offers a selection of Ayurvedic supplements designed to promote overall well-being and address specific health concerns. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing products from companies that adhere to stringent quality control measures and ethical sourcing practices. Furthermore, the availability of knowledgeable staff who can provide guidance and recommendations based on individual needs sets Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar apart from generic pharmacies and online retailers. The business strategically caters to the local market\'s preference for natural and time-tested remedies, providing access to products that are often difficult to find elsewhere.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar. The staff is trained not just to sell products, but to understand the principles of Ayurveda and provide informed advice. They take the time to listen to customers\' concerns, assess their individual needs, and recommend appropriate products or suggest lifestyle modifications that align with Ayurvedic principles. This personalized approach fosters trust and loyalty among customers who value the expertise and genuine care offered. The store environment is designed to be welcoming and calming, reflecting the holistic nature of Ayurveda. Beyond individual consultations, Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar actively engages with the local community through workshops and educational events on topics related to Ayurvedic health and wellness. This commitment to education and community engagement strengthens the business\'s reputation as a trusted source of information and support, solidifying its position as a vital part of the local healthcare landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar envisions expanding its reach and impact within the region. Future plans include increasing the selection of specialized Ayurvedic products to cater to a wider range of health needs. The business also aims to enhance its online presence to provide convenient access to its products and services for customers beyond its immediate geographical location. Exploring partnerships with local Ayurvedic practitioners and healthcare providers to offer integrated healthcare solutions is another key objective. Long-term goals include establishing a reputation as a leading center for Ayurvedic knowledge and wellness in Assam, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition. By continuing to prioritize quality, authenticity, and customer-centricity, Vasudeo Ayurvedic Bhandar is poised for sustainable growth and a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the community it serves.</p>', 'G.S. Road, near Hotel Ambarish, opposite Shah Petrol Pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '086385 67937', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:20:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(931, 'Jagati Nature Care', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Jagati Nature Care stands as a beacon of sustainable living and holistic well-being within the vibrant business environment of Assam. More than just a provider of nature-based products, Jagati Nature Care embodies a philosophy that harmonizes human needs with environmental preservation. Recognizing the rich biodiversity and traditional knowledge inherent in Assam, the business is dedicated to ethically sourcing, processing, and delivering products that promote a healthier lifestyle while simultaneously supporting local communities and safeguarding the region\'s natural heritage. In a market increasingly aware of the importance of sustainable practices, Jagati Nature Care differentiates itself through its unwavering commitment to authenticity, traceability, and social responsibility, carving a unique niche as a purveyor of truly ethical and nature-inspired solutions.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Jagati Nature Care lies a carefully curated selection of products designed to cater to diverse needs. The business specializes in handcrafted soaps made with locally sourced ingredients like Assam tea, aromatic herbs, and pure essential oils. These soaps are crafted using traditional cold-process methods, ensuring the preservation of natural glycerine and maximizing their skin-nourishing properties. Beyond soaps, Jagati Nature Care offers a range of herbal teas, each blend carefully formulated to address specific wellness needs, drawing upon the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and local botanical knowledge. Furthermore, the business offers a selection of locally sourced honey, renowned for its purity and unique floral profiles. These products are unique not only for their natural composition but also for their cultural significance, representing a fusion of traditional practices and modern demands. The unique selling point lies in the transparent supply chain, ensuring that customers are aware of the origin of the ingredients and the positive impact of their purchase on local farmers and artisans. Each product is meticulously crafted to meet the specific needs of the local market, addressing concerns such as skin sensitivity, digestive health, and the desire for natural, chemical-free alternatives.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Jagati Nature Care. The business strives to create a welcoming and informative environment, whether online or in person. Staff members are trained to provide expert advice on product selection and usage, ensuring that each customer finds the solution best suited to their individual needs. Jagati Nature Care goes beyond simply selling products; it fosters a sense of community through workshops and educational programs on topics such as sustainable living, herbal remedies, and the importance of preserving local biodiversity. The business actively participates in local farmers\' markets and community events, further strengthening its connection to the community and promoting awareness of its mission. This dedication to building relationships and providing exceptional service has cultivated a loyal customer base that values not only the quality of the products but also the ethical values and social responsibility that Jagati Nature Care represents.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking towards the future, Jagati Nature Care envisions expanding its product line while maintaining its unwavering commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing. Plans are underway to introduce a range of natural skincare products, including face masks, serums, and lotions, all formulated with locally sourced ingredients. The business also aims to establish partnerships with more local farmers and artisans, providing them with fair prices and access to wider markets. Expansion into neighboring regions of Northeast India is also a strategic goal, allowing Jagati Nature Care to share its unique blend of nature-based products and sustainable practices with a broader audience. Long-term, the goal is to establish Jagati Nature Care as a leading brand in the region, synonymous with quality, ethical practices, and a deep commitment to preserving the natural heritage of Assam. The business is exploring opportunities to implement more environmentally friendly packaging solutions and to further reduce its carbon footprint. Furthermore, Jagati Nature Care intends to invest in research and development to discover new applications for local botanicals and to develop innovative products that address emerging market needs, solidifying its position as a pioneer in the field of sustainable and holistic well-being. This commitment to innovation and expansion will ensure that Jagati Nature Care continues to thrive and make a positive impact on the local community and the environment for years to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094385 94891', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:20:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(932, 'Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP, located at 28, Namghar Path 1, represents a dedicated endeavor to bring the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the forefront of modern wellness in Assam. Situated in the heart of the community, Pranasara isn\'t just another health center; it\'s a sanctuary committed to holistic healing, preventative care, and personalized well-being, deeply rooted in the principles of Ayurvedic science. Recognizing the increasing demand for natural and sustainable health solutions, Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP aims to bridge the gap between traditional practices and contemporary lifestyles, offering comprehensive and accessible Ayurvedic solutions to the local community and beyond. It stands as a beacon of natural healing, promoting not just the absence of disease, but the attainment of optimal health – encompassing physical, mental, and spiritual well-being. Its strategic location makes it easily accessible for residents seeking authentic Ayurvedic treatments and consultations. In a region rich in natural resources and cultural heritage, Pranasara is positioned to significantly contribute to the local economy by providing employment opportunities and promoting sustainable health practices, while also preserving and promoting the rich heritage of Ayurveda.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP are its core services, designed to address a wide range of health concerns and promote overall wellness. These include personalized Ayurvedic consultations, Panchakarma detoxification therapies, specialized Ayurvedic treatments for various ailments, yoga and meditation sessions, and the provision of authentic Ayurvedic medicines and herbal products. The cornerstone of the practice lies in the individualized approach to each client. Initial consultations involve a thorough assessment of the individual\'s \'prakriti\' (constitution) and \'vikriti\' (imbalance) to determine the root cause of any health issues. This allows for the creation of bespoke treatment plans that address specific needs and promote long-term healing. A significant unique selling point is the commitment to sourcing the highest quality herbs and ingredients, many of which are locally sourced, supporting local farmers and ensuring the efficacy of the treatments. The Panchakarma therapies, meticulously administered by experienced therapists, offer a deep cleanse and rejuvenation, helping to eliminate toxins and restore balance within the body. Understanding the prevalence of certain health issues within the local population, such as digestive disorders, stress-related conditions, and joint pains, Pranasara\'s services are specifically tailored to address these needs. For example, the availability of specific therapies for arthritis and back pain caters directly to the common ailments faced by the aging population in the region. Furthermore, the emphasis on preventive care through lifestyle guidance and dietary recommendations helps individuals adopt healthier habits and reduce their risk of developing chronic diseases.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP prides itself on providing an exceptional customer experience, built on empathy, respect, and genuine care. The team is dedicated to creating a welcoming and supportive environment where clients feel comfortable and understood. The focus extends beyond just providing treatments; it encompasses educating clients about Ayurveda and empowering them to take an active role in their own health and well-being. Every interaction, from the initial consultation to the follow-up appointments, is designed to be informative and personalized. The therapists and practitioners are not only highly skilled in Ayurvedic techniques but also possess excellent communication skills, ensuring that clients fully understand the treatments they are receiving and the rationale behind them. What sets Pranasara apart is the deep connection it fosters with the local community. Beyond providing healthcare services, Pranasara actively participates in community events, conducting workshops on Ayurvedic principles and promoting healthy living practices. This outreach extends to local schools and organizations, raising awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda and encouraging individuals to adopt a holistic approach to health. By actively engaging with the community, Pranasara aims to build trust and establish itself as a trusted resource for health and wellness information. This commitment to community engagement is further exemplified through collaborations with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable health initiatives. For instance, partnerships with local farmers to source organic produce not only ensures the quality of ingredients used in treatments but also supports the local economy and promotes environmentally friendly practices.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP is to expand its reach and impact, becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healing and education in Assam and beyond. The long-term goal is to establish a comprehensive wellness center that integrates Ayurvedic treatments with other complementary therapies, such as yoga, meditation, and naturopathy, to offer a truly holistic approach to health. Expansion plans include increasing the range of specialized treatments offered, developing educational programs for aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners, and establishing a network of satellite clinics in neighboring communities to make Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible to a wider population. The business also aims to leverage technology to enhance its services, such as through online consultations, personalized wellness apps, and digital resources for clients. Furthermore, Pranasara envisions establishing collaborations with research institutions to conduct clinical trials on the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments and contribute to the growing body of scientific evidence supporting the benefits of Ayurveda. This commitment to research and innovation will help to solidify Ayurveda\'s position as a credible and effective healthcare modality. Ultimately, Pranasara Ayurveda Health and Wellness LLP aspires to be more than just a healthcare provider; it aims to be a catalyst for positive change, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the wisdom of Ayurveda.</p>', '28, Namghar Path 1', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:25:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(933, 'Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit, strategically located at 68, Dr RP Rd, Guwahati, stands as a dedicated provider of authentic Ayurvedic therapies delivered directly to the comfort of your home. In the bustling business landscape of Assam, where traditional healing practices hold deep cultural significance, we distinguish ourselves by offering personalized, convenient, and highly effective Panchakarma treatments, bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to modern lifestyles. Our focus is on providing accessible and affordable holistic wellness solutions, addressing the growing need for natural and preventative healthcare within the community. <br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around Panchakarma, the cornerstone of Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation. We provide a range of customized Panchakarma therapies, including Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Swedana (herbal steam therapy), Basti (medicated enema), Nasya (nasal administration of medication), and Vamana (therapeutic emesis), all administered by experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners. Each treatment plan is meticulously tailored to an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) after a thorough consultation. This personalized approach ensures maximum efficacy and safety. Beyond Panchakarma, we also offer Shirodhara (pouring medicated oil on the forehead), Kati Basti (local retention of warm oil for back pain), and other specialized Ayurvedic treatments designed to address specific health concerns such as stress, digestive issues, joint pain, and skin disorders. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to bring the clinic to the client. This eliminates the need for travel and allows patients to receive treatment in a familiar and relaxed environment, promoting deeper healing and relaxation. By making Panchakarma more accessible, we address a key market need – the increasing demand for convenient and effective wellness solutions that seamlessly integrate into busy schedules. <br> <br>\n\nAt Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit, customer experience is paramount. From the initial consultation to the completion of the treatment plan, we are committed to providing compassionate, professional, and individualized care. Our practitioners take the time to thoroughly understand each client\'s health history, lifestyle, and specific concerns. We prioritize open communication and patient education, empowering individuals to actively participate in their healing journey. We build trust by maintaining the highest standards of hygiene, using authentic Ayurvedic herbs and oils, and adhering to traditional protocols. Our commitment to excellence extends beyond the treatment itself. We provide comprehensive post-treatment guidance on diet, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies to help clients maintain the benefits of Panchakarma and cultivate long-term well-being. We connect with the local community through collaborations with yoga studios, wellness centers, and community events, raising awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda and promoting a holistic approach to health. Furthermore, we actively seek feedback from our clients to continually improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. <br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit envisions becoming the leading provider of accessible and authentic Ayurvedic therapies in Assam and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our service area to reach more communities and offering a wider range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments. We also aim to develop educational programs and workshops to promote Ayurvedic principles and empower individuals to take control of their health. We are exploring partnerships with local businesses and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic therapies into mainstream wellness programs. A key aspect of our growth strategy involves leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform for booking appointments, accessing educational resources, and tracking treatment progress. We are committed to maintaining the highest standards of quality and authenticity as we scale our business. Our long-term goal is to establish Ayurveda Panchakarma Therapy Home visit as a trusted resource for holistic health and well-being, contributing to a healthier and more balanced community in Assam and beyond. We are dedicated to preserving and promoting the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, making it accessible to all who seek natural and effective solutions for their health challenges.', '68, Dr RP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:25:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(934, 'Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic stands as a beacon of traditional healing in Assam, dedicated to providing authentic Ayurvedic healthcare solutions and promoting holistic wellness. Rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, our clinic and pharmacy offer a unique blend of traditional practices and modern understanding to address the health and wellness needs of the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Located at ·, we are committed to serving the specific healthcare needs of the local population while upholding the highest standards of Ayurvedic practice. Assam, with its rich biodiversity and traditional knowledge of herbal remedies, provides a fertile ground for Ayurvedic practices. We aim to leverage this heritage by sourcing many of our herbal ingredients locally, contributing to the economic empowerment of local farmers and promoting sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around providing comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and access to a wide range of authentic Ayurvedic medicines and products. We offer detailed consultations with qualified Ayurvedic practitioners who carefully assess each individual\'s <i>prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>vikriti</i> (imbalance) to identify the root cause of their ailments. Based on this assessment, we develop personalized treatment plans that may include herbal remedies, dietary modifications, lifestyle recommendations, and therapeutic procedures.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our pharmacy stocks a comprehensive selection of classical Ayurvedic formulations, proprietary medicines, and herbal supplements sourced from reputable manufacturers committed to quality and authenticity. We emphasize the use of high-quality, ethically sourced ingredients to ensure the efficacy and safety of our products. We also prepare customized herbal formulations based on individual prescriptions, catering to specific patient needs.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to authentic Ayurvedic principles and our holistic approach to healing. Unlike conventional medicine, which often focuses on treating symptoms, Ayurveda seeks to restore balance and harmony within the individual by addressing the underlying causes of disease. Our practitioners take the time to understand each patient\'s unique circumstances and develop personalized treatment plans that consider their physical, mental, and emotional well-being. Furthermore, our dedication to sourcing local ingredients when possible strengthens our connection with the local community and ensures the freshness and potency of our herbal remedies.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We understand the specific health challenges faced by the local population in Assam, including issues related to digestion, respiratory health, and lifestyle disorders. Our services are designed to address these concerns through traditional Ayurvedic practices. For example, we offer specialized treatments for digestive ailments such as acidity, indigestion, and constipation, which are common concerns in the region. We also provide herbal remedies and lifestyle recommendations to support respiratory health, particularly during the monsoon season.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic, we prioritize customer experience above all else. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where patients feel comfortable and empowered to take charge of their health. Our staff is trained to provide compassionate and personalized care, guiding patients through their healing journey with empathy and understanding. We emphasize clear communication, ensuring that patients understand their condition, treatment plan, and the importance of adherence to Ayurvedic principles.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars on Ayurveda and holistic wellness. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda and empower them to make informed choices about their health. We also collaborate with local community organizations to provide healthcare services to underserved populations, promoting health equity and social responsibility.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authenticity, quality, and patient-centered care. We plan to expand our services to include specialized treatments for chronic diseases such as diabetes, arthritis, and cardiovascular conditions. We also aim to establish a training center for Ayurvedic practitioners, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition. Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers to ensure a sustainable and ethical supply chain of herbal ingredients.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to integrate Ayurveda into the mainstream healthcare system in Assam, working in collaboration with conventional medical practitioners to provide comprehensive and holistic healthcare solutions. We believe that Ayurveda has a valuable role to play in promoting health, preventing disease, and improving the quality of life for the people of Assam. By staying true to our values and embracing innovation, we are confident that Indian Ayurvedic Pharmacy and Clinic will continue to serve as a trusted source of healing and wellness for generations to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '099546 50853', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:25:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(935, 'Sri Krishna Ayurveda', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Sri Krishna Ayurveda, nestled at H.no 01 Sanjog Path, behind Government Junior Basic School, Sixmile, Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of traditional healing in the heart of the city. More than just a business, Sri Krishna Ayurveda is a commitment to holistic wellness, drawing upon the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to serve the modern needs of the local community. In a region rich in cultural heritage and a growing awareness of natural healthcare alternatives, Sri Krishna Ayurveda plays a vital role in providing authentic Ayurvedic solutions for a healthier and more balanced life. The business is deeply rooted in the principles of personalized care and utilizes time-tested Ayurvedic practices to address a wide range of health concerns.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nSri Krishna Ayurveda’s core offerings revolve around providing authentic Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and a curated selection of Ayurvedic products. At the heart of the business is the Ayurvedic consultation service, where experienced practitioners thoroughly assess each individual’s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). This detailed assessment forms the basis of a tailored treatment plan that may incorporate dietary recommendations, lifestyle adjustments, herbal remedies, and therapeutic treatments. The clinic offers a variety of traditional Ayurvedic therapies, including Abhyanga (therapeutic oil massage), Shirodhara (warm oil stream on the forehead), and other Panchakarma treatments designed to detoxify and rejuvenate the body. In addition to services, Sri Krishna Ayurveda also provides a range of high-quality Ayurvedic products, from herbal supplements and classical formulations to skincare and personal care items. These products are carefully selected to ensure authenticity, purity, and effectiveness, aligning with the business\'s commitment to providing the best of Ayurveda. The unique selling point lies in the personalized approach to healing and the emphasis on using traditional methods combined with a deep understanding of the local community\'s health needs and lifestyle. Sri Krishna Ayurveda caters to the growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions, particularly among those seeking alternatives to conventional medicine or those looking to complement their existing healthcare regimen.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at Sri Krishna Ayurveda is centered around building trust, providing personalized care, and fostering a sense of community. From the moment a client walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and respect. The practitioners take the time to listen attentively to their concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and educate them about Ayurvedic principles and practices. This emphasis on education empowers clients to take an active role in their own healing journey. Sri Krishna Ayurveda distinguishes itself through its commitment to maintaining a serene and welcoming atmosphere, creating a space where clients feel comfortable and supported. The business also actively engages with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness about Ayurveda and its benefits. By participating in local events and partnering with community organizations, Sri Krishna Ayurveda strengthens its connection with the community and reinforces its commitment to serving the well-being of its neighbors. This dedication to community engagement not only builds brand loyalty but also establishes Sri Krishna Ayurveda as a trusted resource for holistic health and wellness within the Sixmile area and beyond.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Sri Krishna Ayurveda envisions expanding its reach and deepening its impact on the health and well-being of the local community. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic therapies offered, incorporating new and innovative approaches while staying true to traditional principles. There is also a strategic intent to introduce specialized programs tailored to specific health concerns, such as stress management, weight management, and women\'s health. Further expansion may include establishing a dedicated space for Ayurvedic education and training, offering courses and workshops for both healthcare professionals and the general public. Long-term goals involve becoming a recognized center of excellence for Ayurveda in the region, attracting clients from across Assam and beyond. This vision encompasses not only providing high-quality healthcare services but also contributing to the preservation and promotion of Ayurvedic knowledge for future generations. Sri Krishna Ayurveda aims to be a catalyst for positive change in the healthcare landscape, fostering a greater appreciation for the wisdom of Ayurveda and its potential to transform lives. The business is poised for sustainable growth, driven by its commitment to quality, integrity, and a genuine desire to serve the community.', 'H.no 01 Sanjog Path behind Government Junior Basic School Sixmile', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097065 99256', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:25:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(936, 'Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander, strategically situated on Dr. Zakir Hussain Road, G.S. Road, opposite Down Town Hospital in Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of traditional Ayurvedic healthcare and well-being. More than just a retail outlet, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander is a trusted institution, deeply rooted in the community and dedicated to providing authentic Ayurvedic products and expert guidance to promote holistic health. In the vibrant and increasingly health-conscious Assam business landscape, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander fills a crucial niche, offering a time-tested alternative and complement to conventional medical practices. The business distinguishes itself through its unwavering commitment to quality, sourcing genuine Ayurvedic herbs and formulations, and its knowledgeable staff who are dedicated to educating and empowering customers to make informed choices about their health.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander’s offerings lies a comprehensive selection of Ayurvedic products sourced from reputable manufacturers known for their adherence to traditional preparation methods and rigorous quality control. This includes a wide array of classical Ayurvedic medicines (<em>shastriya yogas</em>), proprietary formulations designed to address specific health concerns, herbal supplements, and personal care products. Furthermore, the Bhander offers raw Ayurvedic herbs, catering to individuals who prefer to prepare their own remedies or are practitioners of Ayurveda. Uniquely, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander specializes in sourcing locally cultivated herbs whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and potency of ingredients. Understanding that Ayurveda is not just about treating ailments but also about preventative care, the Bhander also stocks Ayurvedic food products and beverages known for their health-promoting properties. The products are carefully categorized and displayed, and detailed information on each product\'s uses, ingredients, and potential benefits are readily available to customers. This emphasis on transparency and education is a key differentiator, setting Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander apart from generic retail outlets.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander prides itself on delivering an exceptional customer experience built on trust, personalized attention, and a genuine desire to help customers achieve optimal health. The staff consists of individuals trained in basic Ayurvedic principles, capable of providing knowledgeable guidance and answering customer inquiries about products and their applications. More than just salespeople, they act as health advisors, taking the time to understand each customer\'s unique needs and recommending appropriate products or suggesting lifestyle adjustments. The Bhander cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, fostering a sense of community among its customers. Regular workshops and seminars on various aspects of Ayurvedic health and wellness are organized, featuring guest speakers who are experts in the field. This interactive approach strengthens the Bhander\'s connection with the local community, transforming it into a hub for Ayurvedic knowledge and support. Further emphasizing its commitment to the community, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander actively participates in local health initiatives and collaborates with Ayurvedic practitioners in the region to promote awareness and access to Ayurvedic healthcare.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking towards the future, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander envisions itself as a leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic healthcare solutions in the region. The business aims to expand its product line to include a wider range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments and therapies. This includes exploring opportunities to offer consultations with qualified Ayurvedic practitioners directly within the Bhander, providing customers with access to personalized treatment plans. Recognizing the growing importance of online accessibility, Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander plans to establish an online presence, allowing customers to easily browse and purchase products from the comfort of their homes. This expansion will also enable the Bhander to reach a wider audience beyond its immediate geographical location. Long-term goals include establishing partnerships with Ayurvedic research institutions to contribute to the advancement of Ayurvedic knowledge and the development of innovative Ayurvedic products. Sarma Ayurvedic Bhander is committed to upholding the highest standards of quality and authenticity, ensuring that future growth is aligned with its core values of promoting holistic health and well-being through the principles of Ayurveda. The business strives to be more than just a retail establishment; it aspires to be a trusted partner in its customers\' journey towards a healthier and more balanced life, contributing to the rich tapestry of the Assamese community.</p>', 'Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, G.S.Road, opposite down town hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097064 82270', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:25:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
