(937, 'UPAVEDA- Pain Treatment & Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>UPAVEDA- Pain Treatment & Ayurvedic Clinic, located on the 1st Floor of Ambika Complex, is a dedicated center focused on providing holistic pain management and promoting overall wellness through authentic Ayurvedic practices. UPAVEDA stands out in the Assam healthcare landscape by integrating traditional Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostic techniques to offer personalized treatment plans tailored to the specific needs of each patient. Our commitment extends beyond mere symptom relief; we strive to address the root cause of ailments, empowering individuals to achieve lasting health and vitality. Recognizing the rich Ayurvedic heritage in India, and specifically its potential within Assam, UPAVEDA aims to be a leading provider of natural and effective healthcare solutions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At UPAVEDA, our core services revolve around addressing various types of pain, ranging from chronic back pain and arthritis to sports injuries and neuropathic pain. We offer a comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic treatments including Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy for mental relaxation), Kati Basti (localized oil retention therapy for lower back pain), and Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation therapy). In addition to these traditional therapies, we also provide personalized dietary and lifestyle consultations, as these are integral to achieving long-term health and well-being within the Ayurvedic framework. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of experienced Ayurvedic practitioners, high-quality herbal formulations sourced responsibly, and a patient-centric approach that emphasizes individualized care. We understand the specific health challenges faced by the local community, which may include lifestyle-related disorders and musculoskeletal issues. Our services are specifically designed to address these concerns, offering a natural and sustainable alternative to conventional pain management methods. The clinic also offers a selection of Ayurvedic herbal products, formulated in-house or sourced from trusted suppliers, designed to complement the treatments and support overall wellness.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at UPAVEDA. From the moment a patient walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and compassion. Our approach is built on active listening, thorough assessment, and clear communication. We take the time to understand each patient\'s unique medical history, lifestyle, and health goals, ensuring that the treatment plan is tailored to their individual needs. We believe in empowering our patients through education, providing them with the knowledge and tools they need to take control of their health. What sets UPAVEDA apart is our unwavering commitment to providing personalized care and building strong relationships with our patients. We strive to create a supportive and nurturing environment where patients feel comfortable and confident in their healing journey. We are actively involved in the local community through health awareness programs and workshops, promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and a healthy lifestyle. Building trust and fostering a sense of connection with the community is essential to our mission.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>UPAVEDA envisions a future where Ayurveda is recognized as a primary healthcare choice for pain management and overall well-being in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our services to offer specialized treatments for specific conditions, such as diabetes, hypertension, and respiratory ailments, all within the Ayurvedic paradigm. We also intend to invest in research and development to further enhance the efficacy of our treatments and develop new and innovative Ayurvedic solutions. A key component of our growth strategy involves establishing strategic partnerships with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare. We aspire to become a center of excellence for Ayurvedic education and training, empowering future generations of practitioners to carry on the legacy of this ancient healing tradition. Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the health and well-being of the community while upholding the highest standards of Ayurvedic practice. We believe that through dedication, innovation, and a commitment to patient care, UPAVEDA can play a significant role in shaping the future of healthcare in Assam.</p>', '1st Floor, Ambika Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '087248 72789', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:30:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(938, 'Heritage Ayurveda- Dr. Mofida Khatun', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Heritage Ayurveda - Dr. Mofida Khatun, nestled in the serene environs of House no. 24, Neel Kamal Path, represents a harmonious blend of ancient Ayurvedic wisdom and modern healthcare practices. More than just a clinic, it is a sanctuary for holistic wellness, deeply rooted in the Assamese tradition and dedicated to providing personalized care to the community. Located in a region rich with indigenous medicinal knowledge, Heritage Ayurveda stands out by offering authentic Ayurvedic treatments tailored to the unique needs and constitutions of its clients, while actively promoting awareness about preventive healthcare.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Dr. Mofida Khatun brings a wealth of experience and expertise to Heritage Ayurveda. The core of the business lies in offering a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services designed to address a variety of health concerns. These include detailed consultations, personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations, therapeutic massages (Abhyanga), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy), Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation therapy), and specialized treatments for specific ailments. Each service is carefully administered, using high-quality, ethically sourced herbal formulations. A key differentiator is the focus on Prakriti analysis – understanding an individual\'s unique constitution – to provide treatments that are not only effective but also perfectly aligned with their inherent nature. This personalized approach, coupled with the use of locally sourced herbs where possible, ensures that the treatments are both potent and relevant to the local environment and its inhabitants. The clinic addresses common health issues prevalent in Assam, such as digestive disorders, respiratory problems, joint pain, and stress-related ailments, offering natural and sustainable solutions that go beyond simply alleviating symptoms.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Heritage Ayurveda prioritizes creating a warm and welcoming environment for every individual who walks through its doors. Dr. Khatun believes in building strong, trusting relationships with her clients, taking the time to listen to their concerns and understand their health goals. The clinic staff is trained to provide compassionate and attentive service, ensuring that each visit is a positive and enriching experience. Beyond individual treatments, Heritage Ayurveda actively engages with the local community through health awareness workshops, educational seminars, and participation in local health initiatives. This commitment to community outreach not only promotes Ayurvedic principles but also fosters a sense of connection and shared well-being. By emphasizing preventative care and empowering individuals to take control of their health, Heritage Ayurveda aims to be a trusted resource and a positive force within the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Heritage Ayurveda envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and personalized care. Future plans include expanding the range of services to include specialized Ayurvedic programs for specific conditions, such as diabetes management and women\'s health. There is also a long-term goal to establish a small-scale herbal garden, allowing the clinic to cultivate and utilize fresh, locally grown herbs in its formulations, further enhancing the potency and sustainability of its treatments. Furthermore, the business aspires to partner with local organizations and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices, contributing to a more holistic and comprehensive approach to well-being. Heritage Ayurveda’s ultimate goal is to empower individuals to live healthier, happier lives by embracing the wisdom of Ayurveda and fostering a deep connection with their own innate healing potential.</p>', 'House no. 24, Neel Kamal Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '084719 35978', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:30:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(939, 'Ayurvedic center', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Ayurvedic Center: Nurturing Wellness on Hengrabari Road</p>\n\n<p>Located on the bustling Hengrabari Road, Ayurvedic Center stands as a sanctuary of traditional healing and holistic wellness, bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the heart of Guwahati, Assam. In a region rich with natural resources and a deep appreciation for traditional practices, Ayurvedic Center offers a unique approach to health, focusing on preventive care, personalized treatments, and the restoration of balance within the individual. Recognizing the growing demand for authentic and natural healthcare solutions, Ayurvedic Center distinguishes itself by providing time-tested therapies and herbal remedies, contributing to the overall well-being of the local community and beyond. The center operates with a strong commitment to ethical practices and the preservation of the integrity of Ayurvedic principles, setting it apart within the evolving landscape of wellness businesses in Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Healing</p>\n\n<p>Ayurvedic Center offers a comprehensive range of services designed to address various health concerns and promote overall wellness. Our primary services include personalized Ayurvedic consultations, Panchakarma detoxification therapies, Abhyanga (therapeutic oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy for stress relief), and specialized treatments for chronic conditions such as arthritis, diabetes, and skin disorders. Central to our approach is a focus on individualized care. Each client undergoes a thorough assessment, including pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha) and a detailed review of their lifestyle and medical history, to determine their unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti). This allows our experienced Ayurvedic practitioners to tailor treatment plans specifically to each individual\'s needs, ensuring optimal results. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge with modern diagnostic techniques, providing a holistic and effective approach to health management. We also offer a range of authentic Ayurvedic herbal remedies, sourced from reputable suppliers committed to sustainable harvesting and quality control. These remedies, prescribed by our practitioners, complement our therapies and support the body\'s natural healing processes. By addressing the root causes of illness and promoting balance within the body, mind, and spirit, Ayurvedic Center meets the growing demand for natural and personalized healthcare solutions in the local market, offering an alternative to conventional medicine.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Fostering Well-being</p>\n\n<p>At Ayurvedic Center, we prioritize creating a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment for our clients. Our approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, respect, and a genuine desire to help individuals achieve their health goals. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with personalized attention and care. Our staff is trained to listen attentively to their concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and provide clear explanations of our treatments and therapies. We believe in empowering our clients with knowledge, encouraging them to actively participate in their healing journey. We go beyond providing treatments; we offer guidance on lifestyle modifications, dietary recommendations, and stress management techniques to support long-term well-being. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the treatment room. We regularly follow up with clients to monitor their progress, address any concerns, and provide ongoing support. We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness of Ayurveda and its benefits. We believe in building strong relationships with our clients and becoming a trusted resource for health and wellness in the Hengrabari Road area and beyond. Our emphasis on personalized care, authentic Ayurvedic practices, and community engagement sets us apart and allows us to connect deeply with the local population, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Deepening Impact</p>\n\n<p>Ayurvedic Center envisions a future where traditional Ayurvedic medicine is recognized and integrated as a vital component of mainstream healthcare in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our services to reach a wider audience, establishing ourselves as a leading center for Ayurvedic education and research, and contributing to the preservation and promotion of Ayurvedic knowledge. We plan to introduce specialized programs for specific health conditions, such as women\'s health, geriatric care, and pediatric wellness. We also aim to develop partnerships with local hospitals and healthcare providers to offer integrated treatment options. We are exploring opportunities to expand our product line, introducing new herbal formulations and wellness products that align with our commitment to natural and sustainable practices. Furthermore, we aspire to establish a training institute where aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners can receive comprehensive education and practical experience. By investing in research and development, we aim to contribute to the growing body of scientific evidence supporting the efficacy of Ayurvedic therapies. We believe that by combining traditional wisdom with modern advancements, Ayurvedic Center can play a significant role in improving the health and well-being of the community and promoting a more holistic and sustainable approach to healthcare in Assam. Our dedication to quality, innovation, and community engagement will be instrumental in realizing our vision and solidifying our position as a trusted and respected center for Ayurvedic healing on Hengrabari Road and beyond.</p>', 'Hengrabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:30:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(940, 'Santhigiri Hospital', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Santhigiri Hospital stands as a beacon of healthcare excellence in Assam, dedicated to providing comprehensive and compassionate medical services. While the precise location is intentionally withheld, Santhigiri Hospital strives to be an integral part of the community it serves, offering advanced medical solutions within a framework of ethical and patient-centric care. It distinguishes itself through a commitment to affordability, accessibility, and a holistic approach to well-being, addressing the diverse healthcare needs of the region. Santhigiri Hospital aims to be more than just a medical facility; it aspires to be a trusted partner in promoting health and wellness within the local landscape.\n<br> <br>\nSanthigiri Hospital provides a wide spectrum of medical services, encompassing both inpatient and outpatient care. Core offerings include general medicine, surgery, obstetrics and gynecology, pediatrics, and a range of specialized diagnostic services. Equipped with modern medical technology, the hospital boasts a well-equipped laboratory, advanced imaging facilities, and a pharmacy stocked with essential medications. The hospital\'s strength lies in its team of experienced and dedicated medical professionals, including physicians, surgeons, nurses, and support staff, all committed to delivering the highest standards of medical care. A unique selling point is the hospital\'s focus on preventative care, offering comprehensive health check-up packages designed to detect potential health issues early and promote proactive health management. This proactive approach fills a crucial need in the local market, where awareness of preventative healthcare practices is growing. Furthermore, Santhigiri Hospital is committed to providing affordable healthcare solutions, understanding the economic realities of the region and striving to make quality medical care accessible to all segments of the population.\n<br> <br>\nCustomer experience is paramount at Santhigiri Hospital. The hospital fosters a patient-centric environment, prioritizing clear communication, empathy, and respect in all interactions. From the moment a patient arrives, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The hospital employs a dedicated patient relations team to address concerns, provide information, and ensure a smooth and comfortable experience. What sets Santhigiri Hospital apart is its emphasis on building strong relationships with patients and their families. Doctors take the time to explain diagnoses and treatment plans clearly, empowering patients to make informed decisions about their health. The nursing staff provides compassionate care and emotional support, creating a healing environment that fosters recovery. The hospital actively engages with the local community through health awareness campaigns, free medical camps, and educational programs. This commitment to community outreach demonstrates Santhigiri Hospital\'s dedication to improving the overall health and well-being of the region it serves, building trust and fostering a sense of shared responsibility.\n<br> <br>\nLooking ahead, Santhigiri Hospital envisions a future of continued growth and innovation. The hospital aims to expand its range of specialized services, potentially including cardiology, neurology, and orthopedics, to address the evolving healthcare needs of the region. Investment in advanced medical technology and infrastructure is a priority, ensuring that the hospital remains at the forefront of medical advancements. Plans are underway to enhance the hospital\'s digital capabilities, implementing electronic health records and telemedicine services to improve efficiency and accessibility. Furthermore, Santhigiri Hospital is committed to developing its human resources, providing ongoing training and professional development opportunities for its staff. This investment in people will ensure that the hospital continues to deliver exceptional care and maintain its reputation as a leading healthcare provider in Assam. The long-term goal is to establish Santhigiri Hospital as a center of excellence, attracting patients from across the region and contributing to the overall improvement of healthcare standards in Assam. The hospital\'s commitment to quality, affordability, and community engagement will be the driving forces behind its continued success.\n</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094351 93115', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:30:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(941, 'Dr ANJALI UDAY .MS Ayurveda Specialist Doctor Kerala', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '```html\n<h1>Dr. ANJALI UDAY .MS Ayurveda Specialist Doctor Kerala: A Holistic Healthcare Haven in Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at FRONT BLOCK (4F Officers Library Building, Near ST MARY\'S SCHOOL MC Road GUWAHATI CLUB GUWAHATI -3), Dr. ANJALI UDAY .MS Ayurveda Specialist Doctor Kerala, offers a comprehensive approach to health and wellness rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda. More than just a clinic, it\'s a sanctuary where traditional healing practices are meticulously blended with modern understanding to provide personalized care. In a region where traditional medicine still holds significant cultural relevance, Dr. Anjali Uday\'s practice stands out as a trusted source for authentic Ayurvedic treatments, bridging the gap between conventional healthcare and time-tested natural remedies. Her presence adds a unique dimension to the local Assam business landscape, providing accessible and holistic healthcare solutions for a healthier community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Rejuvenating Body, Mind, and Spirit</h2>\n\n<p>Dr. Anjali Uday\'s practice provides a wide spectrum of Ayurvedic services designed to address a variety of health concerns and promote overall well-being. Key offerings include:\n<br>\n<b>Comprehensive Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> In-depth assessments to determine an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti), forming the foundation for personalized treatment plans. This involves detailed questioning, pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha), and physical examination to gain a holistic understanding of the patient\'s health status.\n<br>\n<b>Personalized Ayurvedic Treatments (Panchakarma):</b> Tailored detoxification and rejuvenation programs that aim to eliminate toxins, restore balance, and revitalize the body. These treatments may include Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), Basti (enema therapy), Nasya (nasal administration), and Vamana (emesis therapy), all performed under strict supervision and with meticulous attention to detail.\n<br>\n<b>Herbal Remedies and Formulations:</b> The practice utilizes a range of authentic Ayurvedic herbs and formulations, carefully sourced to ensure quality and potency. These remedies are prescribed based on individual needs and are designed to support the healing process and maintain long-term health.\n<br>\n<b>Dietary and Lifestyle Guidance:</b> Dr. Anjali Uday provides personalized recommendations on diet, exercise, and lifestyle practices that align with Ayurvedic principles. These guidelines empower patients to take an active role in their health and well-being, promoting sustainable lifestyle changes.\n<br>\nThe unique selling point lies in the combination of Dr. Anjali Uday\'s expertise in Ayurveda, honed through rigorous academic training and practical experience, with her dedication to providing compassionate and individualized care. Her Kerala roots bring authentic knowledge of Ayurvedic principles to Guwahati, providing specialized treatments that meet the growing local demand for natural and holistic healthcare options. Recognizing the prevalence of lifestyle-related disorders and chronic conditions in the region, her services cater specifically to addressing these needs through the principles of restoring balance and strengthening the body\'s natural healing capabilities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Care and Community Connection</h2>\n\n<p>Dr. Anjali Uday\'s practice is committed to providing an exceptional customer experience that extends beyond the clinical setting. The approach is characterized by:\n<br>\n<b>Personalized Attention:</b> Every patient receives individualized attention and care, with treatment plans tailored to their unique needs and constitution. Dr. Anjali Uday takes the time to listen to her patients, understand their concerns, and provide clear and concise explanations about their condition and treatment options.\n<br>\n<b>Compassionate Care:</b> The practice fosters a warm and welcoming environment where patients feel comfortable and supported throughout their healing journey. Dr. Anjali Uday believes in building strong relationships with her patients based on trust, empathy, and mutual respect.\n<br>\n<b>Emphasis on Education:</b> Patients are empowered with knowledge about Ayurveda and its principles, enabling them to make informed decisions about their health and well-being. Educational resources and workshops may be provided to further enhance understanding and promote self-care practices.\n<br>\n<b>Community Engagement:</b> Dr. Anjali Uday aims to connect with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and collaborations with local organizations. This outreach helps to promote the benefits of Ayurveda and make it accessible to a wider audience. The clinic aspires to be an integral part of the community, fostering a culture of health and wellness.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Deepening Roots</h2>\n\n<p>Dr. Anjali Uday envisions a future where her practice becomes a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Guwahati and the surrounding region. Future plans include:\n<br>\n<b>Expanding Service Offerings:</b> Introducing specialized Ayurvedic treatments for specific conditions, such as women\'s health, children\'s health, and geriatric care. This may involve collaborating with other healthcare professionals to provide integrated care solutions.\n<br>\n<b>Establishing a Training Center:</b> Providing training and education in Ayurveda to local practitioners and students, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing system.\n<br>\n<b>Developing Ayurvedic Products:</b> Creating a line of high-quality Ayurvedic products, such as herbal supplements, skincare products, and wellness products, that are locally sourced and sustainably produced.\n<br>\n<b>Strengthening Community Partnerships:</b> Collaborating with local schools, businesses, and community organizations to promote health and wellness initiatives, creating a positive impact on the community.\n<br>\nThe long-term goal is to establish a comprehensive Ayurvedic wellness center that integrates clinical care, education, and research, serving as a beacon of health and healing for the community. Dr. Anjali Uday is dedicated to building a sustainable business that not only provides high-quality healthcare but also contributes to the overall well-being of society.</p>\n```', 'FRONT BLOCK (4F Officers Library Building , Near ST MARY\'S SCHOOL MC Road GUWAHATI CLUB GUWAHATI -3', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098462 26314', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:30:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(942, 'Ayurmantra', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Ayurmantra: Weaving Tradition with Wellness on Udayachal Road</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled on Udayachal Road, Ayurmantra is a haven dedicated to holistic well-being, bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the heart of Assam. More than just a wellness center, Ayurmantra serves as a bridge, connecting the rich traditions of Ayurvedic healing with the modern needs of the local community. In a region deeply rooted in natural remedies and traditional practices, Ayurmantra stands out by offering authentic Ayurvedic treatments and products, tailored to promote balance and vitality in a serene and supportive environment. Its location on Udayachal Road makes it accessible to residents seeking a natural and effective approach to health and wellness. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Ayurmantra provides a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services and products designed to address various health concerns and promote overall well-being. Our core services encompass personalized Ayurvedic consultations, traditional Panchakarma therapies, rejuvenating massage treatments, and specialized programs for stress management, weight management, and detoxification. These services are delivered by experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners who possess in-depth knowledge of Ayurvedic principles and techniques. Each treatment is customized to the individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti), ensuring optimal efficacy and long-lasting results.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond therapies, Ayurmantra offers a curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic products, including herbal supplements, medicinal oils, skincare formulations, and wellness teas. These products are sourced from reputable suppliers who adhere to stringent quality control standards, guaranteeing the purity and potency of each item. What sets Ayurmantra apart is its commitment to providing genuine Ayurvedic solutions, steering clear of generic wellness trends and focusing on the time-tested efficacy of traditional practices. We emphasize educating our clients about the principles of Ayurveda and empowering them to make informed choices about their health and lifestyle. Our focus on providing tailored solutions ensures we meet the unique health needs prevalent within the local Assamese community, addressing common concerns with time tested remedies and lifestyle modifications.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Ayurmantra, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment a client steps through our doors, they are greeted with warmth, empathy, and respect. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, based on trust, open communication, and personalized care. Our practitioners take the time to listen attentively to each client\'s concerns, conduct thorough assessments, and develop customized treatment plans that align with their individual goals and preferences. The ambiance at Ayurmantra is designed to be tranquil and restorative, providing a sanctuary where clients can escape the stresses of daily life and reconnect with their inner selves.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and wellness events, sharing valuable insights into Ayurvedic principles and promoting a holistic approach to health and well-being. This community engagement helps build trust and establishes Ayurmantra as a reliable resource for natural healthcare solutions. Furthermore, we prioritize sourcing locally produced ingredients and collaborating with local artisans and suppliers, contributing to the economic growth and sustainability of the region. By integrating traditional Ayurvedic practices with a customer-centric approach and community involvement, Ayurmantra creates a unique and impactful wellness experience that resonates deeply with the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Ayurmantra envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic wellness in Assam, expanding its reach and impact through strategic initiatives. Our future plans include establishing a dedicated Ayurvedic clinic offering a wider range of specialized treatments, expanding our product line to include locally sourced Ayurvedic herbs and formulations, and developing educational programs to train aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic therapies into mainstream healthcare settings, promoting a more holistic and integrative approach to patient care.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Ayurmantra\'s long-term goal is to empower individuals to take control of their health and well-being through the wisdom of Ayurveda, creating a healthier and more vibrant community on Udayachal Road and beyond. We aim to preserve and promote the rich heritage of Ayurvedic medicine, ensuring that its benefits are accessible to future generations. By staying true to our core values of authenticity, integrity, and compassion, Ayurmantra is poised to make a significant and lasting contribution to the health and well-being of the region, solidifying its position as a trusted and respected provider of Ayurvedic solutions.</p>', 'Udayachal Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097061 92922', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:35:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(943, 'SKM Ayurvedic Institute-Ayurvedic Cancer/Medicine/Panchakarma Treatment in Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>SKM Ayurvedic Institute stands as a beacon of holistic wellness in Guwahati, Assam, providing authentic Ayurvedic treatments and specialized care for cancer support, general medicine, and Panchakarma detoxification. Situated on Mother Teresa Rd, the institute offers a sanctuary of healing that blends traditional Ayurvedic wisdom with modern diagnostic understanding. It distinguishes itself within the local healthcare landscape by providing an integrated approach, recognizing the unique needs and constitution (Prakriti) of each individual, thereby offering truly personalized treatment plans.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of SKM Ayurvedic Institute\'s offerings lies a comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic services and medicines. The institute’s primary focus includes Ayurvedic cancer support, aimed at improving the quality of life for patients undergoing conventional treatments or seeking alternative pathways to wellness. This support encompasses personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations, herbal remedies to manage side effects, and therapies designed to strengthen the body\'s natural defenses. Beyond cancer support, the institute provides Ayurvedic treatments for a wide range of general medical conditions, addressing issues like digestive disorders, respiratory ailments, skin conditions, and musculoskeletal problems. These treatments utilize a combination of herbal formulations, dietary modifications, and lifestyle adjustments tailored to restore balance and promote healing. A significant aspect of SKM Ayurvedic Institute is its dedication to Panchakarma, a powerful detoxification and rejuvenation therapy. This five-fold treatment process aims to eliminate accumulated toxins (Ama) from the body, promoting cellular regeneration and overall well-being. The institute\'s Panchakarma programs are meticulously designed and supervised by experienced Ayurvedic physicians, ensuring safety and efficacy. The unique selling point of SKM Ayurvedic Institute lies in its commitment to authenticity, personalized care, and the integration of Ayurvedic principles with a modern understanding of disease. By addressing the root cause of ailments, rather than merely treating symptoms, the institute aims to provide long-term health benefits and empower individuals to take control of their well-being. These services are especially relevant in Guwahati, where there is a growing demand for natural and holistic approaches to healthcare, complementing the existing allopathic system.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>SKM Ayurvedic Institute prioritizes a customer-centric approach that fosters trust and builds lasting relationships. Every patient journey begins with a detailed consultation, during which experienced Ayurvedic doctors carefully assess the individual\'s health history, current symptoms, and constitutional type (Prakriti). This in-depth evaluation forms the basis for a personalized treatment plan, ensuring that each patient receives the most appropriate and effective therapies. The institute\'s commitment to customer service extends beyond the treatment room. Patients are provided with ongoing support and guidance, including dietary and lifestyle recommendations, herbal remedies, and follow-up consultations. The staff at SKM Ayurvedic Institute is dedicated to creating a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment, where patients feel comfortable and empowered throughout their healing journey. The institute actively connects with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and educational seminars. These initiatives aim to promote the benefits of Ayurveda and empower individuals to adopt healthier lifestyles. By actively engaging with the community, SKM Ayurvedic Institute strives to become a trusted resource for holistic health and wellness in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for SKM Ayurvedic Institute is one of sustainable growth and expansion, driven by a commitment to excellence and a passion for promoting holistic health. The institute plans to enhance its existing infrastructure and services, incorporating advanced diagnostic tools and treatment modalities, while remaining true to the core principles of Ayurveda. This includes exploring collaborations with other healthcare providers to offer integrated and comprehensive care for patients. One long-term goal is to establish a dedicated Ayurvedic training center, aimed at educating future generations of Ayurvedic practitioners and promoting the knowledge of Ayurveda within the region. This initiative would contribute to the preservation and propagation of this ancient healing system. SKM Ayurvedic Institute also envisions expanding its outreach programs, reaching more communities and individuals in need of holistic healthcare. By leveraging technology and strategic partnerships, the institute aims to make Ayurvedic treatments more accessible and affordable, ultimately contributing to a healthier and more vibrant society. The institute aspires to be recognized as a leading center of Ayurvedic excellence in Northeast India, providing authentic, personalized, and effective treatments that empower individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being.</p>', 'Mother Teresa Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 63275', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:35:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(944, 'Unora by Tattva Wellness Spa', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Unora by Tattva Wellness Spa: A Sanctuary of Serenity in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nUnora by Tattva Wellness Spa, nestled in the vibrant Down Town area within the prestigious Novotel Hotel on GS Road, offers a haven of tranquility and holistic well-being. More than just a spa, Unora is a sanctuary dedicated to rejuvenation, blending ancient Ayurvedic principles with contemporary wellness practices. As a distinguished member of the Tattva Wellness Spa family, Unora brings a legacy of excellence and personalized care to the discerning clientele of Guwahati and beyond, contributing significantly to the growing wellness sector within the Assam business landscape. It stands as a testament to the rising demand for holistic health solutions in the region, offering a refined escape from the demands of modern life.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Unora lies a comprehensive suite of wellness services designed to nourish the body, mind, and spirit. The core offerings include a diverse range of Ayurvedic therapies, traditional massages, revitalizing facials, and specialized body treatments. Each treatment is meticulously crafted and personalized to meet the unique needs of every individual, ensuring optimal results and a truly transformative experience. Unora\'s unique selling point resides in its commitment to authenticity and the seamless integration of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge with modern techniques. The spa utilizes premium, ethically sourced ingredients, including locally sourced herbs and oils whenever possible, enhancing the connection to the surrounding environment. Addressing a clear need in the local market, Unora provides an accessible yet luxurious wellness destination, catering to both residents seeking respite from urban life and travelers desiring a rejuvenating experience during their stay. The focus is on preventative wellness and promoting a balanced lifestyle, differentiating Unora from conventional spas.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Unora. From the moment guests step through the doors, they are enveloped in an atmosphere of serene elegance and personalized attention. The highly trained and experienced therapists at Unora are dedicated to providing exceptional service and ensuring the comfort and well-being of each guest. Beyond the technical expertise, the team embodies genuine warmth and empathy, creating a strong connection with clients and fostering a sense of trust and care. Unora actively engages with the local community through wellness workshops, collaborative events, and special promotions tailored to local festivals and celebrations. This proactive approach fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the spa\'s connection to the cultural fabric of Guwahati. By prioritizing personalized service and community engagement, Unora aims to cultivate long-lasting relationships with its clients, becoming a trusted partner in their wellness journey. The focus is on creating memorable experiences that resonate with the local culture and values.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Unora by Tattva Wellness Spa envisions becoming the leading wellness destination in Guwahati, recognized for its commitment to excellence, authenticity, and community engagement. The business plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized wellness programs, incorporating yoga, meditation, and nutritional guidance, to provide a more holistic and integrated approach to well-being. There are also aspirations to develop partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote wellness initiatives and contribute to the overall health and vitality of the community. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to incorporate more locally sourced ingredients into its treatments and to further enhance the spa\'s sustainable practices. Unora aims to continuously innovate and adapt to the evolving needs of its clientele, while remaining true to its core values of authenticity, personalized care, and holistic well-being. The long-term vision encompasses establishing Unora as a beacon of wellness, contributing to the overall health and happiness of the Guwahati community and solidifying its position as a key player in the regional wellness industry.', 'Down Town, Novotel Hotel, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '099991 20413', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:35:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(945, 'Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy, nestled at 68, SRCB Rd in the heart of Assam, stands as a beacon of traditional healing, seamlessly blending ancient Ayurvedic principles with modern pharmaceutical practices. More than just a dispensary, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy is a dedicated center for holistic well-being, committed to providing the community with authentic Ayurvedic medicines, personalized consultations, and a comprehensive range of natural health products. In a region steeped in cultural heritage and a growing awareness of alternative medicine, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy plays a vital role in preserving and promoting the rich tradition of Ayurveda, while addressing the contemporary healthcare needs of the local population. The pharmacy’s commitment to quality, authenticity, and personalized care sets it apart, making it a trusted and valued resource in the Assam business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy\'s offerings are a meticulously curated selection of Ayurvedic medicines, sourced from reputable manufacturers known for their adherence to stringent quality control measures. This includes classical formulations like Chyawanprash, Dashmularishta, and various herbal decoctions, along with proprietary Ayurvedic products designed to address a wide array of health concerns, from digestive issues and respiratory ailments to skin conditions and joint pain. A key differentiator lies in the pharmacy\'s emphasis on providing authentic Ayurvedic medicines, free from adulteration and formulated according to traditional recipes. Beyond medicines, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy offers a comprehensive range of natural health products, including herbal teas, dietary supplements, personal care items, and organic food products. The pharmacy also specializes in offering personalized Ayurvedic consultations with experienced practitioners, who assess individual health conditions based on Ayurvedic principles and recommend tailored treatment plans encompassing dietary modifications, lifestyle adjustments, and herbal remedies. This holistic approach ensures that customers receive not just symptom relief, but also guidance towards achieving long-term health and well-being. By combining traditional wisdom with a modern understanding of healthcare needs, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy effectively bridges the gap between ancient practices and contemporary lifestyles, meeting the growing demand for natural and holistic health solutions in the local market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy distinguishes itself through an unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction and a personalized approach to healthcare. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide informed advice and compassionate support to customers, ensuring a positive and empowering experience. Beyond simply dispensing medications, the pharmacy fosters a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel comfortable discussing their health concerns and exploring natural treatment options. Emphasis is placed on building long-term relationships with customers, understanding their individual needs, and providing ongoing support and guidance. The pharmacy actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops on Ayurvedic principles, and participation in local events. By fostering a sense of trust and community, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy has established itself as more than just a business; it is a trusted resource and a vital part of the local healthcare ecosystem. This strong community connection is further reinforced through personalized service, remembering regular customers, and proactively reaching out to address their specific needs, fostering a sense of belonging and loyalty.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy envisions itself as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, expanding its reach and deepening its impact on the community\'s well-being. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic medicines and natural health products, introducing new services such as Panchakarma therapies (Ayurvedic detoxification treatments), and establishing a dedicated wellness center offering yoga, meditation, and other holistic practices. The pharmacy also aims to leverage technology to enhance customer experience, through online consultations, telemedicine services, and an e-commerce platform that allows customers to access products and information conveniently. A key focus will be on strengthening collaborations with local Ayurvedic practitioners and healthcare providers, fostering a collaborative approach to healthcare and ensuring that customers receive the best possible care. Furthermore, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy is committed to promoting sustainable and ethical practices, by sourcing products from environmentally responsible suppliers and supporting local farmers and artisans. By staying true to its core values of authenticity, quality, and personalized care, while embracing innovation and expanding its reach, Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy is poised for continued growth and success, solidifying its position as a trusted and valued resource in the Assam business landscape and beyond. The long-term goal is to establish Lohia Ayurvedic Pharmacy as a brand synonymous with holistic health and well-being, inspiring individuals to embrace the wisdom of Ayurveda and live healthier, more fulfilling lives.</p>', '68, SRCB Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094351 96799', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:35:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
