(946, 'ASSAM UNANI CLINIC ( Ayurvedic,UNANI, Sexologist, Piles and Pain Specialist)', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>ASSAM UNANI CLINIC (Ayurvedic, UNANI, Sexologist, Piles and Pain Specialist) is a comprehensive healthcare provider located in the heart of Assam, offering a unique blend of traditional and specialized medical services. Recognizing the growing need for holistic and accessible healthcare in the region, our clinic is dedicated to providing personalized and effective treatments rooted in the ancient sciences of Ayurveda and Unani medicine, complemented by specialized expertise in sexual health, piles management, and pain relief. We strive to be a beacon of health and wellness, addressing the diverse healthcare needs of our community with compassion and expertise.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our clinic distinguishes itself by integrating traditional Ayurvedic and Unani practices with modern diagnostic approaches. This allows us to provide a truly holistic treatment experience, addressing not just the symptoms but also the underlying causes of illness. Unlike conventional healthcare providers that may focus solely on allopathic medicine, we offer a wider spectrum of treatment options, empowering patients to make informed choices about their health. Our commitment to traditional medicine, particularly Unani, a relatively less common practice in Assam, makes us a unique healthcare destination in the region, catering to those seeking alternative and time-tested remedies.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core services offered at ASSAM UNANI CLINIC encompass a wide range of healthcare needs. Firstly, our Ayurvedic consultations provide personalized treatment plans based on individual constitution and imbalances, utilizing herbal remedies, dietary adjustments, and lifestyle modifications. Secondly, our Unani medicine specialists offer diagnosis and treatment through the Unani system, which emphasizes the balance of the body\'s natural humors and the power of natural healing. Thirdly, our specialized sexologists provide confidential and sensitive care for various sexual health concerns, addressing both physical and psychological aspects. Fourthly, our expertise in piles management involves comprehensive diagnosis and treatment, including non-surgical and surgical options depending on the severity. Finally, our pain management services utilize a combination of Ayurvedic and Unani therapies, along with modern techniques, to provide effective relief from chronic pain conditions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A key unique selling point is our integrated approach, combining the strengths of different medical systems. We don\'t see Ayurveda, Unani, and modern medicine as mutually exclusive but rather as complementary tools in the pursuit of optimal health. Our ability to offer a wide array of treatment options under one roof, from herbal remedies to specialized consultations, is a significant advantage for our patients. Furthermore, we prioritize the use of high-quality, ethically sourced ingredients in our herbal formulations, ensuring safety and efficacy. Our services directly address the local market needs by providing culturally sensitive and affordable healthcare options, particularly for those who prefer traditional medicine or have found limited relief from conventional treatments. We acknowledge the prevalence of certain health issues in Assam, such as lifestyle-related diseases and pain conditions, and tailor our services to effectively address these concerns.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At ASSAM UNANI CLINIC, we are committed to providing a patient-centric experience that is built on trust, respect, and empathy. Our approach to customer service is rooted in active listening and personalized attention. We understand that each patient is unique, and we take the time to thoroughly assess their individual needs and concerns. Our team of healthcare professionals is not only highly skilled but also deeply compassionate, creating a safe and supportive environment for patients to discuss their health challenges. We strive to make the clinic environment welcoming and comfortable, ensuring that patients feel at ease throughout their treatment journey. We actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and free medical camps, promoting preventive healthcare and empowering individuals to take control of their well-being. We believe that building strong relationships with our patients and the community is essential to our success.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, ASSAM UNANI CLINIC envisions becoming a leading integrated healthcare provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate more advanced diagnostic technologies and treatment modalities while maintaining our core focus on traditional medicine. We plan to establish strategic partnerships with other healthcare providers and organizations to enhance our referral network and expand our reach. We also aim to invest in research and development to further validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic and Unani treatments and contribute to the growing body of knowledge in these fields. Long-term, we aspire to establish a state-of-the-art wellness center that offers a comprehensive range of holistic therapies, including yoga, meditation, and nutritional counseling, creating a true haven for health and well-being. Our ultimate goal is to empower individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the power of integrated healthcare.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '080119 85992', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:35:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(947, 'Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati stands as a beacon of holistic healthcare in the heart of Assam, bringing a unique and integrated approach to wellness that sets it apart within the regional healthcare landscape. Committed to providing comprehensive and compassionate care, the hospital combines the best of modern medicine with the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and other traditional healing systems, creating a synergy that addresses the root causes of illness and promotes lasting well-being. While the exact founding year is not publicly available, the hospital’s presence has already begun to impact the Guwahati community and beyond, offering an alternative and complementary path to health and healing.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The core services offered at Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati encompass a wide spectrum of healthcare needs, focusing particularly on chronic and lifestyle-related diseases. These services include:\n<br>\n*   <b>Integrated Medical Consultations:</b> Combining diagnostic expertise with Ayurvedic principles to create personalized treatment plans.\n<br>\n*   <b>Panchakarma Therapies:</b> Offering authentic Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation treatments under the guidance of experienced practitioners.\n<br>\n*   <b>Naturopathy Treatments:</b> Utilizing natural therapies like hydrotherapy, mud therapy, and yoga to stimulate the body\'s self-healing mechanisms.\n<br>\n*   <b>Diet and Lifestyle Counseling:</b> Providing customized dietary and lifestyle recommendations based on individual needs and Ayurvedic principles.\n<br>\n*   <b>Allopathic Medical Support:</b> Integrating conventional medical treatments when necessary, ensuring a comprehensive and well-rounded approach to patient care.\n<br>\n*   <b>Specialized Programs:</b> Tailored programs designed for specific conditions like diabetes, hypertension, arthritis, and digestive disorders.\n<br>\nThe unique selling point of Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati lies in its holistic approach, emphasizing not only the treatment of symptoms but also the restoration of balance within the body and mind. This integrated approach is particularly relevant to the local market, where there is a growing awareness of the limitations of conventional medicine and a desire for more natural and sustainable healthcare solutions. The hospital\'s focus on preventative care and lifestyle modification also addresses the increasing prevalence of chronic diseases in the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati is dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience characterized by compassion, respect, and individualized attention. The hospital strives to create a welcoming and healing environment where patients feel comfortable and supported throughout their journey. A patient-centric approach is embedded in every aspect of the hospital\'s operations, from the initial consultation to the follow-up care. This includes:\n<br>\n*   <b>Personalized Care Plans:</b> Developing customized treatment plans that address the unique needs and preferences of each patient.\n<br>\n*   <b>Experienced and Compassionate Staff:</b> Employing a team of highly qualified doctors, therapists, and support staff who are dedicated to providing compassionate and attentive care.\n<br>\n*   <b>Holistic Healing Environment:</b> Creating a calming and restorative atmosphere that promotes relaxation and well-being.\n<br>\n*   <b>Patient Education and Empowerment:</b> Empowering patients with knowledge and tools to take control of their health and well-being.\n<br>\nThe hospital actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and camps. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the benefits of holistic healthcare and empower individuals to make informed decisions about their health. By fostering strong relationships with local communities and healthcare providers, Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati strives to become a trusted resource for health and wellness in the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati is to establish itself as a leading center for integrated healthcare in Assam and the Northeast region. The hospital aims to expand its services and facilities to meet the growing demand for holistic healthcare solutions. This may include:\n<br>\n*   <b>Expanding Treatment Offerings:</b> Introducing new therapies and programs to address a wider range of health conditions.\n<br>\n*   <b>Developing Research and Training Programs:</b> Conducting research to validate the efficacy of integrated healthcare approaches and training healthcare professionals in these modalities.\n<br>\n*   <b>Expanding Outreach Programs:</b> Reaching out to more communities through health camps and educational initiatives.\n<br>\n*   <b>Telemedicine and Remote Consultations:</b> Offering remote consultations and telemedicine services to reach patients in remote areas.\n<br>\n*   <b>Strategic Partnerships:</b> Collaborating with other healthcare providers and organizations to expand its reach and impact.\n<br>\nBy continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the community, Jeena Sikho HiiMS Hospital Guwahati is committed to providing accessible, affordable, and effective holistic healthcare solutions that empower individuals to live healthier and more fulfilling lives. The hospital strives to become a symbol of hope and healing, contributing to the overall well-being of the people of Assam and beyond. The long-term goal is not merely to treat illness, but to cultivate a culture of wellness and prevention, fostering a community where individuals thrive in body, mind, and spirit.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '087920 87920', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:40:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(948, 'Namaste Ayurveda & Panchakarma therapeutics centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Namaste Ayurveda & Panchakarma Therapeutics Centre is a dedicated wellness sanctuary nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, specifically located at Sreenagar Path, Kali Mandir Path, opposite Sreenagar. We offer authentic Ayurvedic treatments and Panchakarma therapies designed to restore balance, promote healing, and enhance overall well-being. In a region steeped in traditional healing practices, yet increasingly influenced by modern lifestyles, Namaste Ayurveda bridges the gap, offering accessible and effective solutions rooted in ancient wisdom.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around the principles of Ayurveda, the ancient Indian science of life. We provide personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who carefully assess each individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). Based on this assessment, a customized treatment plan is developed, encompassing dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and therapeutic procedures. Panchakarma, the cornerstone of Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation, is a central offering. This involves a series of cleansing therapies designed to eliminate toxins from the body, restore cellular function, and enhance immunity. We offer a range of Panchakarma procedures, including Vamana (emesis), Virechana (purgation), Basti (enema), Nasya (nasal administration), and Raktamokshana (bloodletting), performed under strict medical supervision and adhering to traditional Ayurvedic protocols. Beyond Panchakarma, we provide specialized Ayurvedic treatments for a variety of health concerns, such as arthritis, diabetes, skin disorders, respiratory ailments, and stress-related conditions. These treatments often involve Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (warm oil stream on the forehead), Pinda Sweda (herbal bolus massage), and other targeted therapies. We also offer a selection of high-quality Ayurvedic herbal formulations, sourced from reputable suppliers, to complement our therapies and support long-term wellness. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to providing authentic Ayurvedic treatments in a serene and comfortable environment, combined with a deep understanding of the specific health needs of the local population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Namaste Ayurveda, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where clients feel comfortable and cared for. Our approach is centered on building strong relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual health goals and concerns. From the moment they step through our doors, clients are greeted with warmth and respect. Our staff is trained to be attentive, responsive, and knowledgeable, ensuring that every interaction is positive and informative. We prioritize clear communication, explaining treatment procedures in detail and addressing any questions or concerns that clients may have. We also place a strong emphasis on follow-up care, providing ongoing support and guidance to help clients maintain their health and well-being long after their treatment is completed. We are actively involved in the local community, participating in health awareness campaigns and workshops to promote the benefits of Ayurveda. We also collaborate with local businesses and organizations to offer wellness programs and initiatives. By fostering strong relationships with our community, we aim to become a trusted resource for Ayurvedic healthcare and holistic wellness in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Namaste Ayurveda & Panchakarma Therapeutics Centre envisions becoming a leading provider of Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam and beyond. We plan to expand our services to include specialized Ayurvedic programs for women\'s health, children\'s health, and geriatric care. We also aim to establish a training center to educate and empower individuals interested in learning the principles and practices of Ayurveda. We intend to incorporate technology to enhance our service delivery, such as online consultations, remote monitoring, and personalized health tracking. This will allow us to reach a wider audience and provide more convenient and accessible care. Furthermore, we aspire to collaborate with research institutions to conduct clinical studies on the effectiveness of Ayurvedic treatments for various health conditions. This will contribute to the growing body of evidence supporting the benefits of Ayurveda and help to integrate it more fully into mainstream healthcare. Our long-term goal is to create a holistic wellness ecosystem that encompasses not only treatment but also education, research, and community outreach, making Ayurveda an integral part of people\'s lives.</p>', 'Sreenagar Path, Kali Mandir Path, opp. Sreenagar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '060038 29300', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:40:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(949, 'Miracle Nest: Achieving Wellness Inside and Out', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><strong>Miracle Nest: Achieving Wellness Inside and Out</strong></p>\n<p>Located at Ground Floor, Anand Abashsthali, Miracle Nest, 38, Lakhimi Nagar Rd, Miracle Nest is a holistic wellness center dedicated to fostering physical, mental, and emotional well-being within the vibrant community of Assam. We offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to address the diverse needs of individuals seeking a balanced and fulfilling lifestyle. Recognizing the growing demand for accessible and personalized wellness solutions in the region, Miracle Nest aims to be a sanctuary where individuals can embark on their unique journey towards inner and outer harmony. We distinguish ourselves by integrating traditional Assamese practices with modern wellness techniques, creating a unique and culturally relevant experience for our clients.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of wellness modalities, catering to diverse needs and preferences. At the heart of our offerings is our specialized yoga and meditation program. This program incorporates traditional Hatha yoga, mindfulness practices, and pranayama techniques, adapted to the specific climate and lifestyle of Assam. We also offer Ayurvedic consultations, providing personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations based on individual doshas (body types). These consultations are augmented by access to traditionally prepared Ayurvedic herbs and remedies, sourced locally where possible, ensuring both potency and authenticity. Furthermore, we provide massage therapy services, including Abhyanga (Ayurvedic massage) and therapeutic deep tissue massage, administered by certified and experienced therapists. These services are complemented by nutritional counseling, focused on promoting healthy eating habits and addressing specific dietary concerns prevalent in the local community. What truly sets Miracle Nest apart is the integration of these distinct services into tailored wellness packages, providing a cohesive and personalized approach to achieving optimal well-being. These packages are designed to address specific concerns such as stress management, weight management, and improved sleep quality, ensuring tangible and sustainable results for our clients.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Miracle Nest, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in fostering a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment where every individual feels valued and understood. Our approach is characterized by attentive listening, personalized care, and a genuine commitment to helping our clients achieve their wellness goals. From the moment a client enters our center, they are greeted by friendly and knowledgeable staff who are dedicated to providing exceptional service. We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. Our practitioners are not only highly skilled in their respective fields but also possess a deep understanding of the local culture and traditions, allowing them to provide culturally sensitive and relevant care. We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and community events, promoting awareness of wellness and healthy living practices. Our commitment to community engagement extends to supporting local artisans and suppliers, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. We strive to create a space where wellness is not just a service but a shared experience, fostering a sense of belonging and connection within the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Miracle Nest envisions becoming the leading wellness destination in Assam, renowned for its holistic approach, exceptional customer service, and commitment to community well-being. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate other complementary therapies, such as acupuncture and traditional Assamese healing practices. We also aim to establish partnerships with local healthcare providers and educational institutions to promote integrated wellness programs. A key focus will be on developing innovative wellness retreats and workshops that cater to specific needs and interests, such as stress management retreats for corporate professionals and wellness workshops for students. We are committed to investing in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of wellness knowledge and practice. In the long term, we aspire to establish a research and development center dedicated to studying the efficacy of traditional Assamese wellness practices and integrating them with modern scientific approaches. Ultimately, our goal is to empower individuals to take control of their health and well-being, fostering a healthier and more vibrant community for generations to come. We see the business growing beyond just a physical location to encompass online resources and virtual consultations, expanding our reach and impact across the region and beyond.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Anand Abashsthali, Miracle Nest, 38, Lakhimi Nagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '069004 92656', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:40:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(950, 'jeevak ayurveda and holistic centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre: Nurturing Wellness in the Heart of Assam</b></p>\n\n<p>Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre stands as a beacon of traditional healing and modern wellness, nestled on the second floor of Alankar Premises, conveniently located behind HDFC Bank. Situated in the heart of Assam, Jeevak is more than just a wellness centre; it\'s a sanctuary dedicated to promoting holistic well-being through the time-tested principles of Ayurveda and complementary therapies. Understanding the unique cultural landscape of Assam, Jeevak integrates traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern diagnostic techniques, offering a personalized and comprehensive approach to health. In a region rich in natural resources and a deep-rooted understanding of herbal medicine, Jeevak Ayurveda aims to revitalize and preserve this heritage by providing authentic and accessible Ayurvedic solutions to the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre are its diverse and specialized services, all designed to cater to a wide spectrum of health needs. Our primary offerings include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> Personalized health assessments conducted by experienced Ayurvedic doctors to determine individual <i>Prakriti</i> (body constitution) and identify imbalances. These consultations form the foundation for tailored treatment plans.</li>\n<li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> Offering the full range of traditional Panchakarma detoxification treatments, including Vamana (emesis), Virechana (purgation), Basti (enema), Nasya (nasal administration), and Raktamokshana (bloodletting), performed under strict medical supervision to eliminate accumulated toxins and restore balance.</li>\n<li><b>Herbal Remedies:</b> Providing a wide array of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations, sourced ethically and prepared according to traditional recipes, addressing various health concerns from digestive issues to skin ailments. Custom formulations are also available based on individual needs.</li>\n<li><b>Yoga and Meditation:</b> Guided yoga sessions and meditation classes tailored to different skill levels, promoting physical flexibility, mental clarity, and emotional well-being. These classes are designed to complement Ayurvedic treatments and enhance overall health.</li>\n<li><b>Nutritional Counseling:</b> Personalized dietary recommendations based on Ayurvedic principles, emphasizing the importance of food as medicine and promoting a balanced and healthy lifestyle.</li>\n<li><b>Specialized Therapies:</b> A range of specialized therapies like Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), Kati Basti (lower back oil retention), and others addressing specific health concerns and promoting relaxation and rejuvenation.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Jeevak Ayurveda distinguishes itself through its commitment to authenticity, personalized care, and a holistic approach. Our unique selling points include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Experienced Practitioners:</b> A team of highly qualified and experienced Ayurvedic doctors, therapists, and yoga instructors dedicated to providing the highest quality of care.</li>\n<li><b>Authentic Ayurvedic Practices:</b> Adherence to traditional Ayurvedic principles and practices, ensuring the efficacy and safety of all treatments.</li>\n<li><b>Customized Treatment Plans:</b> Tailoring treatment plans to individual needs and health goals, considering their unique constitution, lifestyle, and medical history.</li>\n<li><b>High-Quality Herbal Products:</b> Sourcing only the finest quality herbal ingredients, ensuring the potency and effectiveness of our remedies.</li>\n<li><b>Holistic Approach:</b> Addressing the root cause of health issues by considering the physical, mental, and emotional aspects of well-being.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>These services directly address the local market needs by providing a natural and holistic alternative to conventional medicine. With a growing awareness of the benefits of Ayurveda and a desire for preventative healthcare, Jeevak Ayurveda offers a valuable resource for the community to achieve optimal health and well-being.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre. We believe in creating a welcoming and nurturing environment where individuals feel supported and empowered on their wellness journey. From the moment a client enters our centre, they are greeted with warmth and compassion. Our staff is trained to provide exceptional customer service, ensuring that every individual feels heard, understood, and respected.</p>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our commitment to building genuine relationships with our clients. We take the time to understand their unique needs and concerns, providing personalized attention and support throughout their treatment. We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness about Ayurveda and holistic living. We collaborate with local organizations and healthcare providers to create a network of support for our clients. Furthermore, we actively participate in community events and initiatives, contributing to the well-being of the local population. By fostering strong connections with the community, Jeevak Ayurveda aims to become a trusted resource for health and wellness in Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Jeevak Ayurveda and Holistic Centre envisions becoming a leading provider of Ayurvedic and holistic healthcare in Assam and beyond. Our potential for growth is significant, driven by the increasing demand for natural and preventative healthcare solutions. Our future plans include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Expanding our Service Offerings:</b> Introducing new therapies and treatments to cater to a wider range of health needs, including specialized programs for women\'s health, children\'s health, and senior care.</li>\n<li><b>Establishing a Training Centre:</b> Creating a training centre to educate and train aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners, ensuring the preservation and propagation of this ancient healing art.</li>\n<li><b>Developing a Line of Ayurvedic Products:</b> Formulating and manufacturing our own line of high-quality Ayurvedic products, using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible.</li>\n<li><b>Expanding our Reach:</b> Opening additional centres in other locations, making our services more accessible to a wider population.</li>\n<li><b>Integrating Technology:</b> Incorporating technology to enhance our services, such as online consultations, digital health records, and personalized wellness apps.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing Jeevak Ayurveda as a centre of excellence for Ayurvedic research and education, contributing to the advancement of knowledge and the promotion of holistic health. We are committed to staying true to our values of authenticity, compassion, and integrity, ensuring that we continue to provide the highest quality of care to our clients and contribute to the well-being of the community for generations to come.</p>', 'second floor, Alankar Premises, behind hdfc bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:40:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(951, 'Assam Ayurvedic Products', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Assam Ayurvedic Products, nestled in the heart of Assam at 5QMQ+G6W, Maniram Dewan Rd, represents a modern revival of ancient healing traditions. More than just a purveyor of Ayurvedic remedies, the business stands as a testament to the rich botanical heritage of the region, offering products sourced directly from the verdant landscapes of Assam. This commitment to local sourcing and traditional knowledge sets Assam Ayurvedic Products apart, solidifying its position as a key player in promoting wellness within the local community and beyond.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The business operates on the core principle of bringing authentic Ayurvedic solutions to contemporary health concerns. Assam Ayurvedic Products specializes in a range of health and wellness products, including herbal supplements, medicinal oils, personal care items, and traditional Assamese remedies passed down through generations. The unique selling point lies not only in the efficacy of the formulations, drawing on centuries of Ayurvedic wisdom, but also in the uncompromised quality of the ingredients. Herbs are meticulously sourced from local farms, often employing sustainable harvesting practices to ensure minimal environmental impact and to support the livelihoods of local cultivators. Each product is carefully crafted, blending traditional Ayurvedic principles with modern manufacturing standards to guarantee purity, potency, and safety. This commitment to quality and authenticity directly addresses the local market\'s growing demand for natural and holistic health solutions, catering to consumers seeking alternatives to conventional medicine and embracing a preventive approach to wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Assam Ayurvedic Products. The business strives to create a welcoming and informative environment for every customer, fostering a deep understanding of Ayurveda and its benefits. Knowledgeable staff are readily available to provide personalized consultations, guiding customers through the product range and offering tailored recommendations based on individual health needs and concerns. This personalized approach extends beyond the point of sale. Assam Ayurvedic Products actively engages with the local community through workshops and seminars, educating individuals on the principles of Ayurveda, the benefits of local herbs, and the importance of a balanced lifestyle. Furthermore, the business actively solicits feedback from customers to continuously improve its products and services, demonstrating a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction and building lasting relationships within the community. This emphasis on education and personalized care cultivates trust and loyalty, transforming customers into advocates for the brand and Ayurveda itself.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Assam Ayurvedic Products envisions significant growth and expansion, while remaining firmly rooted in its core values of authenticity, sustainability, and community engagement. The business aims to expand its product line, introducing innovative formulations that address contemporary health challenges, while simultaneously preserving the integrity of traditional Ayurvedic practices. This includes exploring opportunities for research and development, collaborating with Ayurvedic practitioners and scientists to validate the efficacy of traditional remedies and develop new and improved products. Furthermore, Assam Ayurvedic Products plans to expand its reach beyond the local market, leveraging e-commerce platforms and strategic partnerships to make its products accessible to a wider audience, both nationally and internationally. The long-term goal is to establish Assam Ayurvedic Products as a leading brand in the Ayurvedic sector, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and the preservation of traditional knowledge, thereby contributing to the economic prosperity of the local community and promoting the holistic well-being of individuals worldwide.</p>', '5QMQ+G6W, Maniram Dewan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '088768 22848', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:40:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(952, 'ASSAM AYURVEDIC BHANDAR', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>ASSAM AYURVEDIC BHANDAR: Bridging Tradition and Wellness in the Heart of Assam</b></p>\n\n<p>Nestled on Assam Trunk Road, opposite the landmark Vishwaratna Hotel, Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar stands as a trusted and established purveyor of authentic Ayurvedic products and knowledge. More than just a retail outlet, it\'s a cultural touchstone, deeply rooted in the region’s rich heritage of traditional medicine. Situated in a prime location, Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar plays a vital role in preserving and promoting Ayurvedic practices, offering the local community and beyond a gateway to holistic well-being. We distinguish ourselves by carefully sourcing our products, emphasizing quality and authenticity, and fostering a deep understanding of Ayurveda within our team to best serve our customers. The Bhandar represents a commitment to accessible and reliable Ayurvedic care, contributing significantly to the health and wellness of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Core Offerings: A Comprehensive Spectrum of Ayurvedic Solutions</b></p>\n\n<p>Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar offers a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic products designed to address diverse health and wellness needs. This includes a wide selection of classical Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, personal care items, and traditional remedies. We carefully curate our inventory, prioritizing products formulated with high-quality, ethically sourced ingredients. Our selection extends to include specific Assamese traditional medicines and preparations that leverage the unique flora and fauna of the region, providing localized solutions for prevalent health concerns. We also provide authentic Ayurvedic formulations prepared using traditional methods. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local health challenges and our ability to recommend tailored solutions based on Ayurvedic principles. Furthermore, we offer consultations with experienced practitioners, providing customers with personalized guidance on incorporating Ayurvedic practices into their daily lives. We stock a wide variety of Ayurvedic products that cater to different needs and age groups.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Customer Experience: Cultivating Wellness Through Personalized Service</b></p>\n\n<p>At Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar, we believe in providing exceptional customer service rooted in empathy, knowledge, and genuine care. Our team members are not merely sales associates; they are trained to understand the fundamentals of Ayurveda and assist customers in making informed decisions about their health. We dedicate time to understand each customer\'s unique needs and concerns, offering personalized recommendations based on their individual constitution and health goals. We are committed to creating a welcoming and informative environment, where customers feel comfortable asking questions and exploring the world of Ayurveda. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through workshops and educational events, promoting awareness of Ayurvedic principles and healthy living practices. This commitment to customer education and personalized service sets us apart and fosters long-term relationships with our valued patrons. Our commitment extends to sourcing products that are not only effective but also sustainable and environmentally responsible.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons While Upholding Tradition</b></p>\n\n<p>The future of Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar lies in expanding its reach while upholding its commitment to authenticity and quality. We envision growing our product line to include a wider range of specialized Ayurvedic formulations and customized wellness programs. This includes exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and producers to source ingredients sustainably, supporting the local economy and ensuring the purity of our products. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing an online platform for product information, consultations, and ordering. We aim to become a leading center for Ayurvedic knowledge and practice in the region, offering comprehensive training programs for aspiring practitioners and promoting research into the efficacy of traditional Ayurvedic treatments. By combining our deep-rooted traditions with modern advancements, we aspire to create a sustainable and impactful business that contributes to the health and well-being of the community for generations to come. We also are exploring the possibility of partnering with Ayurvedic doctors to provide in-house consultations and treatment plans.</p>', 'Assam Ayurvedic Bhandar, Assam Trunk Rd, opposite Vishwaratna Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 61800', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:45:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(953, 'DreamLife Ayurveda- Ayurvedic Clinic and Medicine', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'DreamLife Ayurveda: Revitalizing Wellness in the Heart of Assam\n\nDreamLife Ayurveda, situated opposite Saraighat Bazaar, is a dedicated Ayurvedic clinic and medicine provider committed to bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to the people of Assam. We are more than just a healthcare provider; we are a sanctuary for holistic well-being, offering personalized consultations, authentic Ayurvedic treatments, and genuine Ayurvedic medicines, all rooted in the profound principles of natural healing. In a region where traditional practices are deeply valued, DreamLife Ayurveda stands out by blending time-tested Ayurvedic knowledge with contemporary diagnostic approaches, providing effective and sustainable healthcare solutions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nIn the bustling business landscape of Assam, DreamLife Ayurveda fills a vital niche. The increasing awareness and demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions present a significant opportunity. Our clinic distinguishes itself by focusing on individualized patient care, emphasizing preventive medicine, and promoting a balanced lifestyle, thereby addressing the root causes of illness rather than merely treating symptoms. We are dedicated to preserving and promoting the rich Ayurvedic heritage, making it accessible and relevant to the modern Assamese lifestyle. We see ourselves as partners in the community\'s journey towards optimal health and well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings are centered around authentic Ayurvedic principles. We provide comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations with qualified and experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who assess each individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). Based on this assessment, personalized treatment plans are developed, encompassing dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and specialized Ayurvedic therapies. These therapies include Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil stream on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification), and other rejuvenation treatments designed to restore balance and promote healing.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nDreamLife Ayurveda also offers a curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic medicines, sourced from reputable manufacturers and prepared according to traditional formulations. We prioritize quality and efficacy, ensuring that our patients receive the best possible therapeutic benefits. Our range includes classical Ayurvedic formulations, proprietary medicines, and herbal supplements, addressing a wide spectrum of health concerns, from chronic ailments to general well-being. What sets us apart is our commitment to educating our patients about the benefits of each medicine and how to incorporate it effectively into their daily routine. Our unique selling point lies in the integration of traditional knowledge with modern quality control measures, ensuring the safety and effectiveness of our products and treatments.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nUnderstanding the local market needs is crucial to our success. Assam, with its rich cultural heritage and diverse population, has a long history of using traditional medicine. DreamLife Ayurveda caters to this existing affinity for natural healing while addressing contemporary health challenges. We are particularly focused on providing solutions for prevalent health issues in the region, such as digestive disorders, respiratory problems, joint pain, and stress-related ailments. By offering accessible and affordable Ayurvedic healthcare, we aim to empower the community to take control of their health and well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt DreamLife Ayurveda, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a patient walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth, compassion, and respect. Our staff is trained to provide personalized attention, ensuring that each individual feels heard, understood, and supported throughout their healing journey. We take the time to educate our patients about their health conditions and treatment options, empowering them to make informed decisions. We also provide ongoing support and guidance, helping our patients integrate Ayurvedic principles into their daily lives.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur commitment to the local community extends beyond providing healthcare services. We actively participate in community health initiatives, organizing workshops, seminars, and health camps to raise awareness about Ayurveda and promote preventive healthcare practices. We believe in building strong relationships with local organizations and community leaders to collectively address the health needs of the region. This dedication to community engagement sets us apart and fosters a sense of trust and loyalty among our patients.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, DreamLife Ayurveda envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our clinic facilities to accommodate a wider range of treatments and therapies. We also plan to introduce specialized Ayurvedic programs tailored to specific health conditions, such as diabetes management, women\'s health, and geriatric care. Furthermore, we aspire to establish a training center to educate and empower aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners, thereby contributing to the growth and development of Ayurveda in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are committed to leveraging technology to enhance our services and reach a wider audience. This includes developing an online platform for consultations, medicine ordering, and health education. We also aim to integrate digital tools for patient monitoring and follow-up, ensuring seamless and personalized care. Our ultimate goal is to make Ayurveda accessible and convenient for everyone, empowering them to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. DreamLife Ayurveda remains steadfast in its commitment to revitalizing wellness in Assam, one patient at a time.', 'opposite Saraighat Bazaar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070020 41373', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:45:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
