(962, 'Elysium Spa', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<article>\n<h1>Elysium Spa: A Sanctuary of Wellness in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Elysium Spa offers a haven of tranquility and rejuvenation in the heart of Assam, providing a comprehensive range of wellness services tailored to the unique needs and preferences of the local community. More than just a spa, Elysium strives to be a destination where individuals can escape the stresses of daily life, reconnect with themselves, and embark on a journey toward holistic well-being. Elysium Spa recognizes the growing demand for high-quality wellness services in Assam, catering to a discerning clientele seeking authentic and effective treatments.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Elysium Spa\'s core offerings center around providing a diverse and carefully curated menu of spa treatments, body therapies, and wellness programs. These include a variety of massage therapies, such as traditional Ayurvedic massage, Swedish massage, deep tissue massage, and aromatherapy massage, all delivered by highly trained and experienced therapists. Facial treatments utilize premium skincare products and incorporate modern techniques to address a wide range of skin concerns, from anti-aging to acne treatment. Body wraps and scrubs, using natural and locally sourced ingredients where possible, offer detoxification and exfoliation, leaving skin feeling refreshed and revitalized. Elysium Spa also features specialized treatments like reflexology, which focuses on stimulating pressure points on the feet to promote overall health, and hot stone therapy, which uses heated stones to ease muscle tension and improve circulation.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiating factor for Elysium Spa is its commitment to integrating traditional Assamese wellness practices with modern spa techniques. This includes incorporating local herbs and ingredients into treatments, offering traditional Assamese massage techniques, and creating wellness programs that reflect the region\'s rich cultural heritage. This approach not only provides a unique and authentic experience for clients but also supports local businesses and promotes the sustainable use of natural resources. Furthermore, Elysium Spa offers personalized consultations to understand each client\'s specific needs and goals, allowing for the creation of customized treatment plans that deliver optimal results. The spa retail area features a selection of high-quality skincare products, aromatherapy oils, and wellness accessories, allowing clients to continue their self-care journey at home.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the fast-paced lifestyle of many Assam residents, Elysium Spa provides express treatments for those seeking a quick and effective way to relax and rejuvenate. These treatments, such as express facials and chair massages, are designed to fit seamlessly into busy schedules without compromising on quality or effectiveness. Elysium Spa aims to meet a need for accessible wellness solutions in the local market, promoting a healthier and more balanced lifestyle for the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>Elysium Spa is committed to providing an exceptional customer experience that exceeds expectations. From the moment clients enter the spa, they are greeted with warmth, professionalism, and a genuine desire to help them achieve their wellness goals. The spa\'s ambiance is carefully designed to create a sense of tranquility and serenity, with calming music, soothing lighting, and comfortable furnishings. All staff members are trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each client feels valued and cared for.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Elysium Spa actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations. The spa participates in local events and festivals, offering mini-spa treatments and promoting wellness awareness. Elysium Spa also supports local charities and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility. Feedback is actively solicited from clients to continuously improve the spa\'s services and offerings, ensuring that it remains responsive to the evolving needs of the community. By fostering a strong sense of community and providing exceptional customer service, Elysium Spa aims to build long-lasting relationships with its clients and become a trusted destination for wellness in Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Elysium Spa envisions becoming the leading wellness destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and customer satisfaction. Future plans include expanding the spa\'s range of services to include holistic wellness programs that address not only physical health but also mental and emotional well-being. This may involve offering yoga classes, meditation sessions, and stress management workshops. Elysium Spa is also exploring opportunities to develop its own line of natural skincare products, using locally sourced ingredients and traditional Assamese formulations.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Further expansion within Assam is also a key part of the long-term strategy. This could involve opening additional spa locations in other cities or towns, or partnering with resorts and hotels to offer spa services to their guests. Elysium Spa also aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as through online booking systems, virtual consultations, and personalized wellness apps. By embracing innovation and expanding its reach, Elysium Spa is committed to making wellness accessible to a wider audience and contributing to the overall health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p>\n</article>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094351 50544', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:55:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(963, 'Ayush (Bajrang Ayurved Bhandar)', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Ayush (Bajrang Ayurved Bhandar) stands as a trusted and established name in Guwahati’s healthcare landscape, situated at the bustling ABC, NBS Commercial Complex, GS Rd, opposite Rajiv Bhawan. More than just a purveyor of Ayurvedic medicines and products, Ayush represents a commitment to holistic well-being, deeply rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and tailored to the specific health needs of the Assamese community. Its location, strategically positioned in a commercial hub, makes it easily accessible to a broad range of customers seeking natural and effective health solutions. The business distinguishes itself through its dedication to authentic Ayurvedic practices, offering a blend of traditional remedies and modern understanding of health and wellness. Ayush plays a vital role in preserving and promoting Ayurvedic healthcare in a region known for its rich cultural heritage and appreciation for natural remedies.\n<br> <br>\nAyush (Bajrang Ayurved Bhandar) offers a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic products and services, focusing on preventative healthcare and the management of various health conditions. The core offerings include a wide selection of classical Ayurvedic medicines sourced from reputable manufacturers, ensuring authenticity and efficacy. These medicines address a broad spectrum of ailments, from common colds and digestive issues to chronic conditions like arthritis and diabetes. In addition to medicines, Ayush provides a diverse array of herbal supplements, personal care products based on Ayurvedic principles, and traditional remedies tailored to the local climate and lifestyle. One of the unique selling points is the availability of freshly prepared Ayurvedic formulations under the guidance of experienced practitioners (where applicable, if a qualified Ayurvedic doctor/vaidya consults at the premises). This allows for personalized remedies catering to individual needs. Furthermore, Ayush distinguishes itself by providing expert consultations, offering customers informed guidance on choosing the right products and adopting appropriate lifestyle modifications for optimal health. This holistic approach addresses the underlying imbalances that contribute to illness, promoting long-term well-being rather than simply treating symptoms. The products and services are designed to meet the growing demand for natural, safe, and effective healthcare solutions in the local market, catering to individuals seeking alternatives to conventional medicine or complementary therapies.\n<br> <br>\nAt Ayush (Bajrang Ayurved Bhandar), customer satisfaction is paramount. The business prioritizes building strong relationships with its clientele, fostering an environment of trust and personalized attention. The staff is trained to provide knowledgeable and empathetic service, understanding the unique health concerns of each customer. They are equipped to answer questions about Ayurvedic principles, product ingredients, and usage guidelines. Ayush distinguishes itself by offering a consultative approach, taking the time to understand each customer\'s health history and lifestyle factors before recommending specific products or treatments. This commitment to personalized care sets it apart from generic retail outlets. Moreover, Ayush actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs and workshops (if applicable). These initiatives aim to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda and empower them to take control of their health. By participating in local events and collaborating with community organizations, Ayush strengthens its connection with the people of Guwahati and reinforces its commitment to serving their health and wellness needs. The overall goal is to create a welcoming and supportive environment where customers feel valued, informed, and empowered to make healthy choices.\n<br> <br>\nLooking ahead, Ayush (Bajrang Ayurved Bhandar) envisions significant growth and expansion while staying true to its core values of authenticity and customer-centricity. Future plans may include expanding the product line to encompass a wider range of Ayurvedic therapies and wellness services, catering to the evolving needs of the local market. This could involve incorporating specialized treatments like Panchakarma or introducing new product categories such as organic foods and sustainable living products. The business also aims to enhance its online presence, providing customers with convenient access to information, products, and services through a user-friendly website and social media platforms. Strengthening relationships with local Ayurvedic practitioners and healthcare providers is another key priority. Collaborations with these professionals can facilitate referrals, promote integrated healthcare approaches, and enhance the credibility of Ayush as a trusted source of Ayurvedic expertise. The long-term goal is to establish Ayush (Bajrang Ayurved Bhandar) as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and community well-being. By continuously adapting to the changing needs of the market and embracing innovation while upholding traditional values, Ayush is poised to make a lasting impact on the health and wellness of the Assamese community.\n</p>', 'ABC, NBS Commercial Complex, GS Rd, opposite Rajiv Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 21329', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:55:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(964, 'Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<article>\n<h1>Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital: Nurturing Health Through Tradition in Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital stands as a beacon of traditional Indian medicine, serving the health and wellness needs of the local community in Assam. More than just a healthcare provider, it is an institution dedicated to preserving and promoting the ancient science of Ayurveda. The College and Hospital function as a single, integrated unit, offering a unique blend of academic rigor and practical application, making it a vital component of the Assam healthcare system and a respected center for Ayurvedic education and treatment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Strategically located at a currently undisclosed location, the Hospital\'s location is easily accessible to a significant portion of the population, facilitating access to quality Ayurvedic care. This accessibility is particularly crucial in a region where traditional medicine holds a strong cultural significance and is often the preferred or first point of contact for many seeking healthcare solutions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital offers a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services designed to address a diverse spectrum of health concerns. These services include:</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Outpatient Consultations:</b> Expert Ayurvedic physicians provide thorough consultations, diagnosing ailments based on Ayurvedic principles and formulating personalized treatment plans. This holistic approach considers the individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti).</li>\n<li><b>Inpatient Treatment:</b> The hospital provides comprehensive inpatient care, offering a serene and supportive environment for patients undergoing intensive Ayurvedic therapies. Dedicated nursing staff and specialized equipment contribute to a comfortable and effective healing experience.</li>\n<li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> As a cornerstone of Ayurvedic treatment, Panchakarma, a detoxification and rejuvenation therapy, is offered under the supervision of experienced therapists. This multi-step process aims to eliminate toxins, restore balance, and enhance overall well-being.</li>\n<li><b>Specialized Clinics:</b> The hospital houses specialized clinics focusing on specific ailments, such as skin disorders, digestive issues, musculoskeletal problems, and women\'s health concerns. These clinics offer targeted Ayurvedic treatments tailored to the particular needs of the patients.</li>\n<li><b>Herbal Pharmacy:</b> An on-site herbal pharmacy ensures the availability of authentic and high-quality Ayurvedic medicines. These medicines are prepared using traditional methods and adhere to strict quality control standards. The pharmacy also provides personalized herbal formulations prescribed by the physicians.</li>\n<li><b>Yoga and Lifestyle Counseling:</b> Recognizing the importance of lifestyle in maintaining health, the hospital offers yoga classes and lifestyle counseling sessions. These sessions educate patients on incorporating Ayurvedic principles into their daily routines, promoting long-term health and disease prevention.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The unique selling points of Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital lie in its commitment to authenticity, its integrated approach to healthcare, and its focus on patient education. The Hospital prioritizes the use of genuine Ayurvedic principles and practices, ensuring that patients receive the most effective and traditional treatments. The integration of the College with the Hospital allows for the continuous development and refinement of Ayurvedic knowledge and practices. By empowering patients with knowledge about Ayurveda and healthy living, the Hospital fosters a proactive approach to health management.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>These services directly address the local market\'s needs by providing a culturally relevant and accessible healthcare option. In Assam, where traditional medicine enjoys widespread acceptance, Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital offers a trusted and reliable source of Ayurvedic care. The Hospital also plays a crucial role in addressing the growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n\n<p>Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital is committed to providing a compassionate and patient-centered experience. The staff is trained to treat patients with respect, empathy, and understanding. The Hospital strives to create a welcoming and healing environment, fostering a sense of trust and confidence among patients. The emphasis on personalized care ensures that each patient receives a treatment plan tailored to their unique needs and circumstances.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Hospital connects with the local community through various outreach programs, including health camps, awareness campaigns, and educational workshops. These initiatives aim to promote Ayurvedic knowledge and healthy living practices among the general public. By actively engaging with the community, the Hospital strengthens its role as a trusted healthcare provider and a valuable resource for health information.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n\n<p>Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital envisions a future where Ayurveda plays an increasingly significant role in the healthcare landscape of Assam and beyond. Future plans include:</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Expanding infrastructure:</b> To accommodate the growing demand for its services, the Hospital plans to expand its infrastructure, adding more beds, treatment rooms, and specialized facilities.</li>\n<li><b>Introducing new treatment modalities:</b> The Hospital aims to incorporate new and innovative Ayurvedic treatment modalities, enhancing its ability to address a wider range of health conditions.</li>\n<li><b>Strengthening research activities:</b> The College plans to strengthen its research activities, contributing to the evidence-based validation of Ayurvedic practices.</li>\n<li><b>Developing specialized training programs:</b> The College intends to develop specialized training programs for Ayurvedic practitioners, ensuring the availability of qualified and skilled professionals.</li>\n<li><b>Establishing partnerships:</b> The Hospital seeks to establish partnerships with other healthcare institutions and organizations, facilitating the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>By pursuing these goals, Govt Ayurvedic College & Hospital aims to become a leading center for Ayurvedic education, research, and treatment, contributing to the health and well-being of the community and promoting the global recognition of Ayurveda as a valuable healthcare system.</p>\n</article>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '0361 257 0455', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:55:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(965, 'Kerala Ayurveda Clinic, Dighalipukhuri East, Guwahati, Assam', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Kerala Ayurveda Clinic, nestled in the heart of Dighalipukhuri East, Guwahati, Assam, marked by its easily accessible location at 5QQ2+HRR, Md Tayabulla Rd, represents a unique confluence of ancient healing traditions and modern wellness practices. This clinic stands as a beacon of authentic Ayurvedic care within the dynamic Assam business landscape, offering a holistic approach to health and well-being that resonates deeply with the region\'s cultural appreciation for natural remedies. Recognizing the growing demand for comprehensive healthcare solutions, Kerala Ayurveda Clinic distinguishes itself by providing personalized Ayurvedic treatments rooted in the principles of dosha balancing and rejuvenation. The clinic not only addresses specific ailments but also emphasizes preventative care and lifestyle modifications to promote long-term health, setting it apart from conventional healthcare providers in Guwahati. Its presence contributes significantly to the diversification of the healthcare sector, offering a valuable alternative for individuals seeking natural and sustainable wellness options.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core offering of Kerala Ayurveda Clinic revolves around providing authentic Ayurvedic consultations and treatments tailored to the individual needs of each patient. These services include a comprehensive assessment of a patient\'s constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) through pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha) and detailed health history taking. Based on this assessment, personalized treatment plans are developed, incorporating various Ayurvedic therapies such as Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy), Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation), and other specialized procedures. The clinic also offers herbal remedies prepared according to traditional Ayurvedic formulations, using high-quality ingredients sourced ethically and sustainably. A key unique selling point is the emphasis on personalized care, where experienced Ayurvedic practitioners dedicate time to understand each patient\'s unique circumstances and tailor treatments accordingly. This holistic approach, combined with the authenticity of the Ayurvedic practices, caters to the increasing awareness and demand for natural and preventative healthcare solutions within the local market. Recognizing the prevalence of lifestyle-related disorders and the growing interest in natural remedies, the clinic\'s services address critical local market needs by providing accessible and effective Ayurvedic healthcare options.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Kerala Ayurveda Clinic, customer experience is paramount. The clinic strives to create a welcoming and nurturing environment where patients feel comfortable and supported throughout their healing journey. From the moment a patient enters the clinic, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The consultation process is designed to be thorough and informative, ensuring that patients fully understand their health condition and the proposed treatment plan. The therapists are highly skilled and compassionate, providing treatments with care and precision. The clinic maintains a clean and serene atmosphere, promoting relaxation and healing. What truly distinguishes Kerala Ayurveda Clinic is its commitment to building long-term relationships with its patients. The practitioners take the time to educate patients about Ayurvedic principles and empower them to take control of their health through lifestyle modifications and dietary recommendations. The clinic actively engages with the local community by participating in health awareness programs and workshops, promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and fostering a sense of community well-being. This dedication to customer service and community engagement has earned Kerala Ayurveda Clinic a reputation for excellence and trustworthiness within the Guwahati area.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Kerala Ayurveda Clinic envisions becoming a leading center for authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in Guwahati and beyond. The business aims to expand its services to include specialized programs for specific health conditions, such as stress management, weight management, and women\'s health. Future plans include incorporating advanced diagnostic tools and integrating technology to enhance the patient experience. The clinic also intends to collaborate with local healthcare providers and organizations to promote the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare. Long-term goals include establishing a training center to educate and train future Ayurvedic practitioners, ensuring the preservation and dissemination of this ancient healing tradition. By continuing to provide high-quality Ayurvedic care and expanding its reach within the community, Kerala Ayurveda Clinic is poised for significant growth and is committed to contributing to the overall health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p>', '5QQ2+HRR, Md Tayabulla Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '099548 86906', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:55:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(966, 'Nature Health Care', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Nature Health Care, nestled at Rajat Kamal Path, House No. 225A, Zoo Rd, stands as a beacon of holistic wellness in the heart of Assam. We are dedicated to providing a comprehensive range of natural health solutions, tailored to the unique needs and preferences of the local community. Our commitment extends beyond simply offering products and services; we strive to cultivate a deeper understanding of well-being, empowering individuals to make informed choices and lead healthier, more fulfilling lives. Nature Health Care recognizes the rich tradition of natural remedies prevalent in Assam and integrates these time-honored practices with modern scientific knowledge to deliver effective and accessible healthcare alternatives. We believe in the power of nature to heal and nurture, and we are passionate about sharing this wisdom with our community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Nature Health Care, our core offerings are designed to address a wide spectrum of health and wellness needs. We specialize in providing high-quality Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, and natural skincare products, sourced from reputable suppliers who adhere to stringent quality control measures. Beyond product sales, we offer expert consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who provide personalized guidance on diet, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies best suited to individual constitutions and health concerns. A key differentiating factor is our emphasis on educating our customers about the benefits of natural healthcare. We conduct regular workshops and seminars on topics ranging from stress management techniques and healthy eating habits to the proper use of herbal remedies for common ailments. Our unique selling proposition lies in our ability to combine traditional wisdom with a modern, customer-centric approach, making natural healthcare accessible, understandable, and effective for everyone. Recognizing the growing demand for preventative healthcare, we focus on empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards maintaining optimal health and preventing disease through natural means.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Nature Health Care. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers based on trust, respect, and genuine care. From the moment someone walks through our doors or contacts us online, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our staff is highly knowledgeable and passionate about natural healthcare, and they are dedicated to providing personalized support and guidance. We actively listen to our customers\' concerns, understand their individual needs, and offer tailored solutions that address their specific health goals. We foster a sense of community by creating a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals can openly share their experiences and learn from one another. Beyond direct interactions, we actively engage with the local community through health awareness campaigns, participation in local events, and collaborations with other healthcare providers. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we are committed to promoting health and wellness throughout Assam. Our online presence complements our physical store, providing convenient access to information, products, and support for those unable to visit in person. We continually seek feedback from our customers to improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Nature Health Care envisions a future where natural healthcare is integrated into the mainstream healthcare system in Assam. Our long-term goal is to expand our reach and impact by establishing a network of wellness centers across the region, bringing our holistic approach to health and well-being to a wider audience. We plan to further enhance our product offerings by collaborating with local farmers and producers to source indigenous herbs and ingredients, promoting sustainable agriculture and supporting local livelihoods. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own line of proprietary herbal formulations, based on traditional knowledge and modern scientific research. In addition to expanding our physical presence, we are committed to leveraging technology to reach more people and provide convenient access to our services. This includes developing a mobile app for online consultations, personalized health tracking, and access to educational resources. We believe that Nature Health Care has the potential to become a leading provider of natural healthcare solutions in Assam, contributing to the overall health and well-being of the community and promoting a more sustainable and holistic approach to healthcare.', 'Rajat Kamal Path, House No, 225A, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 08:55:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(967, 'AYUS PILES AND FISTULA AYURVEDIC TREATMENT CENTRE', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'AYUS PILES AND FISTULA AYURVEDIC TREATMENT CENTRE: A Holistic Approach to Well-being in Assam\n\nAYUS PILES AND FISTULA AYURVEDIC TREATMENT CENTRE, located in the heart of Noonmati Kharghuli road 2no Madhabpur, opposite Uttar, represents a significant commitment to providing specialized, natural, and effective healthcare solutions for individuals suffering from piles (hemorrhoids) and fistula in the Assam region. We are dedicated to offering a gentler, more holistic alternative to conventional treatments, leveraging the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda to address the root causes of these conditions and promote long-term healing and well-being. As a specialized Ayurvedic center, we stand out by combining traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern diagnostic approaches to ensure accurate assessments and personalized treatment plans. This approach distinguishes us within the local business landscape, particularly given the increasing awareness and preference for natural and holistic healthcare options in Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core service revolves around the Ayurvedic management and treatment of piles and fistula. We offer comprehensive consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who carefully evaluate each patient\'s condition, considering their individual constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to create a tailored treatment strategy. This strategy typically encompasses a combination of:\n\n*   **Herbal Medications:** Utilizing a carefully selected range of Ayurvedic herbs known for their anti-inflammatory, healing, and digestive properties. These formulations are designed to alleviate symptoms, reduce inflammation, and promote tissue repair.\n\n*   **Dietary Modifications:** Providing personalized dietary recommendations based on Ayurvedic principles to support digestive health and prevent recurrence of the condition. This involves identifying specific foods to avoid and incorporating those that promote healing and balance.\n\n*   **Lifestyle Adjustments:** Recommending lifestyle changes, including stress management techniques, appropriate physical activity, and improved bowel habits, to address underlying factors contributing to the development of piles and fistula.\n\n*   **Ksharasutra Therapy:** Offering Ksharasutra treatment, a minimally invasive Ayurvedic surgical technique for managing fistula-in-ano. This involves the use of a medicated thread that gradually cuts through the fistula tract, promoting healing with minimal discomfort and a lower risk of recurrence compared to conventional surgery. This is one of our unique selling points as it provides an effective alternative to surgery with reduced post-operative complications.\n\nOur treatments address the specific needs of the local market by providing accessible and affordable healthcare solutions that align with the cultural understanding and acceptance of Ayurvedic medicine in Assam. We recognize that many individuals in the region prefer natural and traditional treatments, and we strive to offer a reliable and trustworthy alternative to conventional medical interventions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt AYUS PILES AND FISTULA AYURVEDIC TREATMENT CENTRE, we prioritize creating a positive and supportive customer experience. We understand that dealing with conditions like piles and fistula can be emotionally challenging, and we are committed to providing compassionate care and personalized attention to each patient. Our approach to customer service is built on:\n\n*   **Empathy and Understanding:** Creating a welcoming and non-judgmental environment where patients feel comfortable discussing their concerns and receiving the support they need.\n\n*   **Clear and Transparent Communication:** Providing detailed explanations of the diagnosis, treatment plan, and expected outcomes, ensuring that patients are fully informed and actively involved in their care.\n\n*   **Personalized Care:** Tailoring treatment plans to each patient\'s individual needs and preferences, considering their unique circumstances and health goals.\n\n*   **Follow-up and Support:** Providing ongoing support and guidance throughout the treatment process, including regular follow-up consultations and access to resources that promote long-term well-being.\n\nWe are committed to building strong connections with the local community through health awareness programs, educational workshops, and collaborations with local organizations. We believe in empowering individuals with knowledge about preventive measures and natural remedies for maintaining digestive health and preventing the recurrence of piles and fistula. This active engagement allows us to understand the community\'s specific health needs and tailor our services accordingly, fostering a sense of trust and belonging.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for AYUS PILES AND FISTULA AYURVEDIC TREATMENT CENTRE is to become a leading provider of Ayurvedic solutions for digestive health and well-being in Assam. We aim to expand our services to include a wider range of Ayurvedic treatments for other related conditions, such as irritable bowel syndrome (IBS) and constipation. We plan to invest in advanced diagnostic equipment and training for our staff to enhance the accuracy and effectiveness of our treatments.\n\nLong-term, we envision establishing a comprehensive Ayurvedic wellness center that integrates traditional healing practices with modern healthcare principles. This center would offer a holistic range of services, including Ayurvedic consultations, herbal therapies, dietary counseling, lifestyle coaching, and Panchakarma detoxification treatments. We also aspire to collaborate with research institutions to conduct clinical trials and validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments for piles and fistula, contributing to the growing body of scientific evidence supporting the benefits of traditional medicine. Our ultimate goal is to promote the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare and empower individuals to take control of their health and well-being through natural and holistic approaches.', 'Noonmati Kharghuli road 2no Madhabpur, opposite Uttar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070028 08515', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:00:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(968, 'Marma therapy,Acupressure,Ayurveda,Neuro therapy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Marma therapy, Acupressure, Ayurveda, Neuro therapy, nestled at house no 13, bye lane 12, Rajgarh Rd, Guwahati, represents a holistic healthcare haven deeply rooted in ancient Indian traditions. In the bustling landscape of Assam\'s health and wellness sector, this establishment distinguishes itself by offering a comprehensive and integrated approach, combining the benefits of Marma therapy, Acupressure, Ayurveda, and Neuro therapy under one roof. This unique amalgamation caters to a growing demand for natural and preventative healthcare solutions, setting it apart from conventional, symptom-focused medical practices commonly found in the region. The business provides a sanctuary for those seeking to restore balance, alleviate pain, and enhance overall well-being through time-tested healing modalities.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Marma therapy, Acupressure, Ayurveda, Neuro therapy lies a commitment to providing personalized care tailored to each individual\'s specific needs. The core services include:\n\n*   **Marma Therapy:** This ancient healing art focuses on stimulating vital energy points (marmas) on the body to release blockages, promote circulation, and restore vitality. Practitioners utilize gentle pressure and massage techniques to activate these points, addressing a wide range of physical and emotional imbalances.\n\n*   **Acupressure:** Similar to acupuncture, acupressure involves applying pressure to specific points on the body to stimulate self-healing mechanisms. This non-invasive technique is effective in relieving pain, reducing stress, and improving sleep quality.\n\n*   **Ayurveda:** As a holistic system of medicine, Ayurveda emphasizes restoring balance within the mind, body, and spirit. The business offers Ayurvedic consultations to determine an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and provides personalized recommendations for diet, lifestyle, and herbal remedies to promote optimal health. This could include Panchakarma therapies, customized herbal preparations, and lifestyle guidance.\n\n*   **Neuro therapy:** This specialized therapy focuses on addressing neurological conditions and musculoskeletal imbalances through targeted manual techniques. It aims to improve nerve function, reduce pain, and restore mobility.\n\nThese services are uniquely positioned to meet the health challenges prevalent in the local market. Conditions such as chronic pain, stress-related ailments, digestive disorders, and musculoskeletal issues are increasingly common, and individuals are seeking natural and effective alternatives to conventional treatments. The integrated approach offered by Marma therapy, Acupressure, Ayurveda, Neuro therapy provides a holistic solution by addressing the root causes of these conditions rather than simply managing the symptoms.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at Marma therapy, Acupressure, Ayurveda, Neuro therapy is built on a foundation of compassion, respect, and personalized attention. From the moment a client steps through the door, they are greeted with warmth and understanding. A thorough consultation process allows practitioners to gain a deep understanding of the client\'s health history, current concerns, and individual goals. Treatment plans are then carefully crafted to address their specific needs, taking into account their unique constitution and lifestyle. The business strives to create a safe and supportive environment where clients feel empowered to take control of their health and well-being.\n\nWhat truly sets the business apart is its dedication to building strong relationships with the local community. This is achieved through several avenues, including:\n\n*   **Educational workshops and seminars:** Regular workshops are conducted to educate the public about the principles of Ayurveda, Marma therapy, Acupressure, and Neuro therapy, empowering them to make informed decisions about their health.\n*   **Community outreach programs:** Participation in local health fairs and community events helps to raise awareness about the benefits of holistic healthcare and make these services accessible to a wider audience.\n*   **Collaborations with local businesses:** Partnering with other businesses in the health and wellness sector, such as yoga studios and organic food stores, helps to create a network of support for individuals seeking a holistic lifestyle.\n\nBy actively engaging with the local community, the business fosters a sense of trust and connection, establishing itself as a valuable resource for health and well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for Marma therapy, Acupressure, Ayurveda, Neuro therapy is one of continued growth and expansion, with a steadfast commitment to providing high-quality, personalized care. Future plans include:\n\n*   **Expanding the range of services:** Exploring the integration of other complementary therapies, such as yoga therapy and meditation, to further enhance the holistic approach.\n*   **Developing specialized programs:** Creating targeted programs for specific health conditions, such as stress management, pain relief, and digestive health, to cater to the evolving needs of the local community.\n*   **Establishing a training center:** Providing training programs for aspiring practitioners of Marma therapy, Acupressure, and Ayurveda, contributing to the growth and development of the holistic healthcare sector in Assam.\n*   **Strategic partnerships:** Forging alliances with hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare settings, thereby increasing accessibility and acceptance of these traditional healing modalities.\n\nThe long-term goal is to establish Marma therapy, Acupressure, Ayurveda, Neuro therapy as a leading center for holistic healthcare in Guwahati and beyond, promoting the principles of natural healing and empowering individuals to live healthier, happier lives. The business aims to be a beacon of wellness, deeply woven into the fabric of the community, offering sustainable and preventative solutions for generations to come.', 'house no 13, bye lane 12, Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '089176 70928', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:00:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(969, 'Nawab Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Nawab Ayurvedic Clinic, nestled at 53, MD Shah Rd, stands as a beacon of traditional healing and holistic wellness within the vibrant business landscape of Assam. More than just a clinic, it is a sanctuary where the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda converges with modern healthcare practices to offer personalized and effective solutions for a wide range of health concerns. Recognizing the growing need for natural and sustainable healthcare options, Nawab Ayurvedic Clinic provides a valuable alternative and complement to conventional medicine, catering to the specific health needs and cultural sensitivities of the local community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The clinic\'s core offerings revolve around the principles of Ayurveda, an age-old Indian system of medicine that emphasizes the balance of mind, body, and spirit. Our primary services include comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations, personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations, specialized herbal therapies, and rejuvenating Panchakarma treatments. These treatments, tailored to each individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti), aim to not only alleviate symptoms but also address the root cause of disease, promoting long-term health and well-being. The clinic prides itself on sourcing high-quality, ethically sourced Ayurvedic herbs and preparations, ensuring their potency and efficacy. A key differentiator lies in our emphasis on educating patients about their health conditions and empowering them to take an active role in their healing journey. We also offer specialized programs for stress management, weight management, and chronic disease management, aligning with the prevalent health challenges observed in the local population. Nawab Ayurvedic Clinic provides a unique blend of traditional knowledge and contemporary understanding to address the specific health needs of the Assam community, such as digestive issues, respiratory ailments, and joint pains, often associated with the region\'s climate and lifestyle.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Nawab Ayurvedic Clinic, customer experience is paramount. From the moment a patient steps through our doors, they are greeted with warmth, empathy, and respect. We believe in fostering a strong doctor-patient relationship built on trust and open communication. Our consultations are thorough and unhurried, allowing ample time for patients to express their concerns and receive personalized guidance. Beyond the clinical setting, we actively engage with the local community through health awareness workshops, seminars, and free health camps. These initiatives are designed to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda, promote preventive healthcare practices, and provide access to quality healthcare services to those who may not otherwise have it. We are committed to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment that reflects the rich cultural diversity of Assam. Our staff is trained to be culturally sensitive and communicate effectively with patients from all backgrounds. We strive to go above and beyond to meet the individual needs of each patient, ensuring that they feel supported and empowered throughout their healing journey. Furthermore, the clinic actively seeks feedback from patients to continuously improve its services and ensure that it is meeting the evolving needs of the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking towards the future, Nawab Ayurvedic Clinic envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare and wellness in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of services to include specialized treatments for women\'s health, pediatric care, and geriatric care. We also plan to establish a dedicated Panchakarma center equipped with state-of-the-art facilities to provide comprehensive detoxification and rejuvenation therapies. Furthermore, we aspire to collaborate with local educational institutions to promote Ayurvedic education and research, contributing to the preservation and advancement of this ancient healing system. A key aspect of our growth strategy involves leveraging technology to enhance our services and reach a wider audience. This includes developing an online platform for consultations, providing educational resources, and offering online access to our products. We are also committed to sustainable business practices, sourcing our herbs responsibly and minimizing our environmental impact. By combining our unwavering commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement, Nawab Ayurvedic Clinic aims to play a vital role in promoting the health and well-being of the people of Assam for generations to come. We also envision expanding our reach through strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to offer corporate wellness programs and promote Ayurvedic principles in the workplace.</p>', '53, MD Shah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:00:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
