(970, 'Ayushman HERBO - CARE (SRI SRI TATTVA product\'s are available here)', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Ayushman HERBO-CARE, located on Ashram Rd near Red Chilli Restaurant in the heart of Assam, is a dedicated provider of holistic well-being solutions, specializing in products from the esteemed SRI SRI TATTVA range. More than just a retail outlet, Ayushman HERBO-CARE is envisioned as a community wellness hub, offering accessible, natural, and time-tested Ayurvedic products to support a healthy and balanced lifestyle. In a region rich in traditional healing practices, Ayushman HERBO-CARE bridges ancient wisdom with modern needs, providing a curated selection of products known for their quality and efficacy. The business plays a significant role in the local Assam business landscape by promoting sustainable and natural health solutions, aligning with a growing demand for alternatives to conventional healthcare.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Ayushman HERBO-CARE lies a commitment to providing high-quality Ayurvedic products and personalized wellness solutions. The primary offering is the comprehensive range of SRI SRI TATTVA products, encompassing herbal supplements, personal care items, food products, and home care solutions. These products are meticulously formulated based on authentic Ayurvedic principles and manufactured under stringent quality control, ensuring purity and potency. A key unique selling point is the association with the SRI SRI TATTVA brand, renowned globally for its commitment to ethical sourcing, sustainable practices, and unwavering quality. Beyond simply selling products, Ayushman HERBO-CARE strives to educate customers about the benefits of Ayurveda and guide them in selecting products that best address their individual health concerns. This personalized approach sets it apart from generic retailers. The product selection specifically caters to local market needs, addressing common health challenges prevalent in the region, such as digestive issues, immunity deficiencies, and stress-related ailments, with targeted herbal formulations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Ayushman HERBO-CARE. The business emphasizes creating a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel valued and supported. Knowledgeable and friendly staff are trained to provide expert advice on product selection and usage, ensuring customers make informed decisions aligned with their health goals. Ayushman HERBO-CARE distinguishes itself by fostering a personal connection with the local community. This includes organizing regular wellness workshops and seminars, featuring guest speakers knowledgeable in Ayurveda and holistic health. These events provide opportunities for customers to learn about natural health practices, ask questions, and connect with others who share an interest in well-being. Furthermore, Ayushman HERBO-CARE actively participates in local community events and initiatives, reinforcing its commitment to serving as a trusted and integral part of the neighborhood. The goal is to create a loyal customer base built on trust, education, and a genuine interest in supporting their health and wellness journey.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Ayushman HERBO-CARE envisions significant growth potential. The rising awareness of Ayurveda and the increasing demand for natural health solutions in Assam present a favorable market environment. Future plans include expanding the product range to include more specialized Ayurvedic formulations and personalized wellness programs. Strengthening the online presence through a dedicated e-commerce platform is also a key objective, allowing the business to reach a wider customer base and provide convenient access to its products and services. Furthermore, establishing partnerships with local healthcare practitioners and wellness centers is planned to integrate Ayurvedic practices into mainstream healthcare. The long-term goal is to establish Ayushman HERBO-CARE as the leading provider of holistic wellness solutions in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, customer service, and community engagement. The business aims to be a catalyst for promoting a healthier and more balanced lifestyle for the people of Assam, contributing to the overall well-being of the community. This involves continued investment in staff training, expanding the product portfolio based on customer feedback and emerging health trends, and actively engaging with the local community to promote the benefits of Ayurveda.', 'Ashram Rd, near Red Chilli Restaurant', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097747 60961', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:00:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(971, 'Dr. Maratha Clinic | Best Sexologist in Guwahati | Top Ayurvedic Sexual Health Specialist', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Dr. Maratha Clinic, located on the First Floor of B Thakuria Plaza, RG Baruah Rd in Guwahati, Assam, stands as a leading provider of specialized sexual health and wellness services, blending the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda with modern diagnostic approaches. More than just a clinic, it\'s a dedicated center focused on providing discreet, effective, and personalized care to individuals seeking to improve their sexual health and overall well-being. In the dynamic and often underserved Assam market, Dr. Maratha Clinic distinguishes itself by offering a holistic and culturally sensitive approach to sexual health, addressing not only the physical aspects but also the emotional and psychological dimensions of each patient’s concerns. The clinic\'s presence fills a crucial gap, providing a trusted and reliable resource for individuals seeking expert guidance in a comfortable and confidential environment.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Dr. Maratha Clinic lies a comprehensive suite of services tailored to address a wide spectrum of sexual health concerns. The clinic specializes in Ayurvedic treatments for sexual dysfunction, premature ejaculation, erectile dysfunction, low libido, and infertility. Beyond purely symptom-based solutions, the clinic emphasizes identifying and addressing the root causes of these issues, promoting long-term health and vitality. A key differentiator is the clinic\'s integrated approach, combining traditional Ayurvedic therapies with modern diagnostic tools to ensure accurate assessment and personalized treatment plans. This includes detailed consultations, physical examinations, and when necessary, relevant lab tests. The Ayurvedic treatments offered encompass herbal remedies, dietary modifications, lifestyle recommendations, and specialized therapies like Panchakarma, all carefully curated to restore balance and optimize sexual health. Furthermore, Dr. Maratha Clinic also provides counseling and support to address the psychological aspects of sexual health, recognizing the strong connection between mind and body. This comprehensive and holistic approach sets the clinic apart from other providers in the region, making it a sought-after destination for individuals seeking lasting solutions and improved quality of life.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Dr. Maratha Clinic prioritizes creating a positive and supportive customer experience. The clinic understands the sensitive nature of sexual health concerns and is committed to providing a discreet, respectful, and non-judgmental environment for all patients. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with empathy and understanding. The staff is trained to provide compassionate care and ensure that patients feel comfortable discussing their concerns openly and honestly. Consultations are conducted in private and confidential settings, allowing patients to share their experiences without fear of judgment. The clinic also emphasizes clear and transparent communication, ensuring that patients are fully informed about their condition, treatment options, and expected outcomes. In addition to personalized care within the clinic, Dr. Maratha Clinic is actively involved in community outreach, promoting awareness about sexual health and wellness through educational programs and workshops. By building trust and fostering open dialogue, the clinic aims to destigmatize conversations about sexual health and empower individuals to take control of their well-being. This commitment to exceptional customer service and community engagement strengthens Dr. Maratha Clinic\'s reputation as a trusted healthcare provider in Guwahati and beyond.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Dr. Maratha Clinic envisions a future where sexual health is recognized as an integral part of overall well-being and where individuals feel empowered to seek help and support without shame or stigma. The clinic\'s long-term goals include expanding its range of services, incorporating advanced diagnostic technologies, and further integrating modern medical practices with Ayurvedic principles. There are plans to establish a dedicated research wing to conduct clinical trials and validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments for sexual health conditions. The clinic also aims to increase its reach through online consultations and telehealth services, making its expertise accessible to a wider audience across Assam and neighboring regions. Furthermore, Dr. Maratha Clinic plans to collaborate with other healthcare providers and organizations to promote sexual health awareness and education on a larger scale. By continuously innovating and expanding its capabilities, Dr. Maratha Clinic aims to solidify its position as the leading provider of sexual health and wellness services in Guwahati and a trusted resource for individuals seeking to improve their quality of life.</p>', 'First Floor, B Thakuria Plaza, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094109 49437', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:00:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(972, 'Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor, conveniently located near Shiv Mandir, offers a time-honored approach to health and wellness, deeply rooted in the principles of Ayurveda. As a dedicated Ayurvedic practitioner serving the local Assam community, Dr. Ozah provides personalized consultations and treatments designed to restore balance and promote holistic well-being. In a region where traditional medicine holds significant cultural relevance, Dr. Ozah\'s practice bridges ancient wisdom with contemporary needs, offering a vital alternative and complementary approach to healthcare. The business stands as a beacon of natural healing, contributing to the well-being of the community and preserving the rich heritage of Ayurvedic medicine within the local business ecosystem.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core of Dr. Samprity Ozah\'s practice lies in personalized Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual\'s <i>prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>vikriti</i> (imbalance) through pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha), tongue analysis, and detailed questioning about lifestyle, diet, and medical history. Based on this assessment, Dr. Ozah recommends tailored treatment plans that may include dietary adjustments, herbal remedies, lifestyle modifications, and specific Ayurvedic therapies. A significant offering includes Panchakarma, the classical Ayurvedic detoxification and rejuvenation therapy. Tailored Panchakarma programs are designed to eliminate accumulated toxins, restore balance to the doshas (Vata, Pitta, Kapha), and enhance overall health. Further enriching the service portfolio are specialized treatments for various ailments, including digestive disorders, skin conditions, respiratory problems, and joint pain, using traditional Ayurvedic formulations and techniques. The unique selling point resides in the personalized and holistic nature of the treatments. Dr. Ozah takes the time to understand each patient\'s unique constitution and health concerns, crafting individualized plans that address the root cause of the problem rather than merely alleviating symptoms. This approach resonates deeply with the local community, who value the personalized attention and natural remedies offered by Ayurvedic medicine. The services cater to the local market need for accessible and affordable holistic healthcare, providing an alternative to conventional medicine and empowering individuals to take control of their health through natural and time-tested methods.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every patient. The approach to customer service is built on empathy, understanding, and genuine care. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and respect. Dr. Ozah takes the time to listen attentively to their concerns, answering their questions thoroughly and providing clear explanations of the proposed treatment plans. What sets the practice apart is the dedication to building long-term relationships with patients. Dr. Ozah emphasizes patient education, empowering individuals to understand their own bodies and make informed choices about their health. This involves providing guidance on diet, lifestyle, and self-care practices that can support their overall well-being. Connecting with the local community is paramount. The practice actively participates in local health awareness events and workshops, sharing knowledge about Ayurveda and promoting healthy living. Furthermore, Dr. Ozah strives to source local and sustainable ingredients for herbal formulations, supporting local farmers and businesses. This commitment to the community fosters trust and strengthens the practice\'s reputation as a valuable resource for holistic health and wellness. Word-of-mouth referrals play a significant role in attracting new patients, highlighting the positive experiences and strong relationships that Dr. Ozah cultivates with each individual.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region. This includes expanding the range of services offered, such as incorporating yoga and meditation classes to complement the Ayurvedic treatments. There are plans to establish a small in-house pharmacy offering high-quality, locally sourced Ayurvedic formulations. The business aspires to collaborate with other healthcare professionals, such as doctors and therapists, to create an integrated approach to patient care, combining the best of traditional and modern medicine. A key long-term goal is to raise awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda and promote its integration into mainstream healthcare. This will involve conducting educational programs for the public and healthcare providers, as well as advocating for policies that support the practice of Ayurveda. The potential for growth is significant, driven by the increasing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions. Dr. Ozah is committed to staying abreast of the latest research and advancements in Ayurveda, ensuring that the practice remains at the forefront of the field. By continuing to provide personalized, compassionate care and engaging with the local community, Dr. Samprity Ozah Ayurvedic Doctor is poised to make a lasting contribution to the health and well-being of the region for years to come. The business plans to leverage digital platforms to increase its reach and accessibility, providing online consultations and educational resources to a wider audience.</p>', 'near Shiv Mandir', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097077 66208', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:05:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(973, 'Aarogyaveda', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Aarogyaveda, situated at H, 60A, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, near Down Town Hospital in Guwahati, is a holistic wellness center dedicated to providing integrated healthcare solutions rooted in traditional Ayurvedic principles and modern scientific understanding. More than just a clinic or a pharmacy, Aarogyaveda strives to be a haven for individuals seeking a personalized path to optimal health and well-being, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In the bustling landscape of Guwahati\'s healthcare sector, Aarogyaveda distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of authentic Ayurvedic treatments, evidence-based therapies, and preventative wellness programs. We recognize the growing demand for natural and sustainable healthcare solutions, particularly those that address the root cause of health concerns rather than simply managing symptoms. Our approach is particularly significant in a region where traditional healing practices hold deep cultural relevance, bridging the gap between ancient wisdom and contemporary needs.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Aarogyaveda offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to diverse health needs. Our core offerings include: Ayurvedic Consultations, where experienced practitioners conduct thorough assessments of an individual\'s constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to create personalized treatment plans. These plans may incorporate dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and specialized Ayurvedic therapies. We also provide Panchakarma, a detoxification and rejuvenation program designed to eliminate toxins and restore balance within the body. Our Panchakarma treatments are customized to individual needs and are performed under the guidance of skilled therapists. Furthermore, Aarogyaveda offers a range of therapeutic massages, yoga and meditation sessions, and stress management workshops to promote relaxation, reduce stress, and enhance overall well-being. We also provide specialized care for various health conditions, including digestive disorders, respiratory ailments, skin problems, and musculoskeletal issues, using a combination of Ayurvedic principles and modern diagnostic tools. Our commitment to quality extends to the sourcing of our herbal remedies, ensuring that they are authentic, potent, and free from contaminants. The unique selling point lies in the integration of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge with modern diagnostic techniques. This allows for a more precise and effective approach to healthcare, catering to the modern individual\'s desire for both natural healing and scientific validation. These services directly address the local market needs by providing accessible and affordable alternatives to conventional healthcare, promoting preventative wellness, and honoring the region\'s rich heritage of traditional medicine.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Aarogyaveda, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount to building lasting relationships and fostering a sense of trust and well-being. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth, empathy, and personalized attention. Our team takes the time to listen attentively to each individual\'s concerns, understand their health goals, and provide clear and concise explanations of treatment options. We prioritize patient education, empowering individuals to take an active role in their own health journey. We strive to create a comfortable and supportive environment where clients feel valued, respected, and cared for. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond providing healthcare services. We actively participate in local health awareness campaigns, conduct free health check-up camps, and collaborate with community organizations to promote wellness and healthy living. We also believe in supporting local artisans and businesses, sourcing products and services locally whenever possible. This focus on community engagement helps us connect with the local population on a deeper level, building a strong reputation as a trusted and compassionate healthcare provider.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Aarogyaveda envisions expanding its reach and impact within the Assam region and beyond. Our long-term goals include establishing a state-of-the-art wellness retreat center that offers immersive Ayurvedic experiences and holistic healing programs. We also plan to develop a range of proprietary Ayurvedic products using locally sourced herbs and ingredients, promoting sustainable agriculture and supporting local farmers. We aim to integrate technology into our services, developing online consultation platforms and mobile apps to make Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible to a wider audience. Another key focus area is research and development, with a commitment to conducting clinical trials to validate the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments and contribute to the growing body of evidence-based Ayurvedic medicine. Ultimately, Aarogyaveda aspires to be a leading center for holistic wellness, promoting the principles of Ayurveda and empowering individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through natural and sustainable means.</p>', 'H, 60A, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, near Down Town Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '086380 22987', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:05:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(974, 'Maa Shefa Adi U Asal (Ayurvedic)', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Maa Shefa Adi U Asal (Ayurvedic), nestled on Idgah Rd near Little Angel School in the heart of Assam, is a dedicated purveyor of authentic Ayurvedic remedies and wellness solutions, committed to providing holistic health and well-being to the local community. More than just a business, it serves as a bridge connecting ancient wisdom with modern needs, offering a carefully curated selection of Ayurvedic products and services designed to promote balance, vitality, and overall wellness. In a region rich in traditional healing practices, Maa Shefa Adi U Asal stands out by combining time-honored techniques with a commitment to quality and customer care, carving a unique niche within the local business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Maa Shefa Adi U Asal\'s offerings are a diverse range of Ayurvedic products and personalized wellness services. The product line features authentic Ayurvedic medicines sourced from trusted suppliers committed to traditional preparation methods and utilizing high-quality ingredients. These include herbal formulations designed to address various health concerns, such as digestive issues, respiratory ailments, skin conditions, and joint pain. In addition to medicines, the business offers a selection of Ayurvedic personal care products, including soaps, shampoos, oils, and creams, formulated with natural ingredients to nourish and rejuvenate the body. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing locally whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers who adhere to sustainable and ethical practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond products, Maa Shefa Adi U Asal provides personalized Ayurvedic consultations conducted by experienced practitioners. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti), leading to customized recommendations for diet, lifestyle, and herbal remedies. This holistic approach acknowledges the interconnectedness of mind, body, and spirit, addressing the root causes of health issues rather than just treating symptoms. The business also offers therapeutic services such as Abhyanga (Ayurvedic massage) and Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy), designed to promote relaxation, detoxification, and overall well-being. The unique selling point lies in the personalized attention and guidance offered to each customer, ensuring they receive the most appropriate and effective solutions for their individual needs. These services directly address the local market\'s growing interest in natural and holistic healthcare options, providing a trusted alternative to conventional medicine.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Maa Shefa Adi U Asal. The business strives to create a welcoming and supportive environment where customers feel comfortable discussing their health concerns and exploring the benefits of Ayurveda. Staff members are trained to provide knowledgeable and compassionate service, offering guidance on product selection and usage. The business emphasizes building long-term relationships with customers based on trust and mutual respect. This is achieved through attentive listening, personalized recommendations, and ongoing support. Maa Shefa Adi U Asal actively participates in local community events, organizing workshops and seminars to educate people about Ayurveda and promote healthy living. By fostering strong connections with the local community, the business aims to become a trusted resource for holistic health and wellness, enriching the lives of its customers and contributing to the overall well-being of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Maa Shefa Adi U Asal envisions significant growth and expansion. The business plans to broaden its product line to include a wider range of Ayurvedic remedies and personal care products, catering to an even greater variety of health needs. Expansion of the consultation and therapeutic services is also planned, potentially including the addition of specialized treatments and experienced practitioners. There is a strategic interest in exploring online platforms to reach a wider audience and provide convenient access to products and services beyond the immediate geographic location. A long-term goal is to establish Maa Shefa Adi U Asal as a leading Ayurvedic wellness center in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and customer care. This vision encompasses not only business growth but also a dedication to preserving and promoting the rich heritage of Ayurveda for the benefit of future generations. Through continuous improvement, innovation, and a steadfast commitment to its core values, Maa Shefa Adi U Asal aims to make a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the community it serves.', 'Idgah Rd, near Little Angel School', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:05:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(975, 'Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<article>\n<h1>Ayurvedic Clinic: Nurturing Wellness the Traditional Way in AK Dev Road</h1>\n\n<p>Ayurvedic Clinic, strategically located at 5P2H+8VX, AK Dev Rd, represents a dedicated sanctuary for holistic wellness, deeply rooted in the ancient principles of Ayurveda. In the heart of Assam, where traditional healing practices are interwoven with daily life, our clinic offers a unique and authentic approach to health, emphasizing natural remedies and personalized care. We are more than just a clinic; we are a partner in your journey towards optimal health, providing accessible and effective Ayurvedic solutions tailored to the specific needs of the local community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Restoring Balance and Vitality</h2>\n\n<p>At Ayurvedic Clinic, our core offering revolves around providing comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and authentic herbal remedies. Our experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners begin with a thorough assessment of each individual\'s <i>Prakriti</i> (constitutional type) and <i>Vikriti</i> (current imbalances) to understand their unique health challenges. This detailed analysis informs the development of bespoke treatment strategies that may incorporate a combination of therapies including:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> In-depth assessments to determine individual constitutions and imbalances.</li>\n<li><b>Panchakarma Therapy:</b> A detoxifying and rejuvenating treatment involving five therapeutic procedures to eliminate toxins and restore balance. Specific therapies might include Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), and Basti (enema therapy).</li>\n<li><b>Herbal Remedies:</b> Custom-blended herbal formulations using locally sourced and traditionally prepared ingredients to address specific health concerns.</li>\n<li><b>Dietary and Lifestyle Guidance:</b> Personalized recommendations on diet, exercise, and daily routines to support optimal health and prevent future imbalances.</li>\n<li><b>Yoga and Meditation:</b> Gentle yoga sessions and guided meditation practices to promote physical and mental well-being.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Ayurvedic Clinic lies in our commitment to authenticity and quality. We prioritize the use of organically grown herbs whenever possible and adhere to traditional Ayurvedic principles in the preparation of our remedies. This ensures that our clients receive the most potent and effective natural treatments. Furthermore, we are acutely aware of the prevalence of certain health conditions within the Assamese community, such as digestive disorders, joint pain, and respiratory issues. Our services are specifically designed to address these prevalent health concerns using evidence-based Ayurvedic approaches.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Care and Community Connection</h2>\n\n<p>At Ayurvedic Clinic, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount to fostering trust and building lasting relationships with our clients. Our approach is centered around providing personalized attention and creating a warm, welcoming environment. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with empathy and respect. Our practitioners take the time to listen attentively to their concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and empower them to actively participate in their own healing journey.</p>\n\n<p>We strive to stand out by offering a holistic and integrative approach that goes beyond simply treating symptoms. We educate our clients about the principles of Ayurveda and empower them to make informed choices that support their overall well-being. We also prioritize building strong connections with the local community. This involves participating in local health fairs and wellness events, offering educational workshops on Ayurvedic principles, and collaborating with other healthcare providers to create a network of integrated care. Our location on AK Dev Road allows us to be easily accessible to the residents of the area, fostering a sense of community and trust. We aim to be a trusted resource for holistic health and wellness within the neighborhood and beyond.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Reach and Deepening Impact</h2>\n\n<p>Ayurvedic Clinic envisions a future where Ayurvedic principles are more widely understood and integrated into mainstream healthcare in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our services to reach a broader audience and deepening our impact on the health and well-being of the community. This involves several strategic initiatives:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Expanding our team of qualified Ayurvedic practitioners:</b> To meet the growing demand for our services and ensure that we can provide timely and personalized care to all our clients.</li>\n<li><b>Developing new and innovative Ayurvedic products:</b> To address the evolving health needs of the community and make Ayurvedic remedies more accessible and convenient. This might include developing specialized herbal blends for specific conditions or creating Ayurvedic-inspired skincare products.</li>\n<li><b>Establishing partnerships with local businesses and organizations:</b> To promote Ayurvedic principles and offer wellness programs to employees and members.</li>\n<li><b>Investing in education and training:</b> To enhance the knowledge and skills of our practitioners and educate the community about the benefits of Ayurveda.</li>\n<li><b>Exploring opportunities to integrate technology:</b> To improve the efficiency of our operations and enhance the client experience. This could involve implementing online appointment scheduling, virtual consultations, or a mobile app for tracking progress and accessing resources.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Ayurvedic Clinic aims to be a leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic care in Assam, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community. We are committed to preserving and promoting the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda while adapting it to meet the modern needs of the local population. Our unwavering dedication to quality, authenticity, and personalized care positions us for sustained growth and long-term success.</p>\n</article>', '5P2H+8VX, AK Dev Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '060029 32308', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:05:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(976, 'Dr Bishnu Prasad Sarma - Best Ayurvedic Doctor in Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma - Best Ayurvedic Doctor in Guwahati: Restoring Health Through Ancient Wisdom</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Located in the heart of Guwahati, adjacent to the iconic Kelvin Cinema and Vishwaratna Hotel, and conveniently nestled near Shardhanjali Complex on SRCB Road, Tokobari, Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma’s Ayurvedic practice stands as a beacon of traditional healing in the modern world. More than just a clinic, it\'s a sanctuary where ancient Ayurvedic principles are meticulously applied to address the contemporary health challenges faced by the local community in Assam. Dr. Sarma\'s practice is distinguished by its holistic approach, focusing not only on symptom management but also on identifying and addressing the root cause of ailments. This commitment to comprehensive well-being, coupled with Dr. Sarma\'s extensive experience, establishes his practice as a vital resource in Guwahati\'s healthcare landscape, providing a natural and effective alternative to conventional medicine.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core of Dr. Sarma\'s practice lies in providing personalized Ayurvedic consultations. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual’s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any existing imbalances (Vikriti) through pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha), detailed questioning about lifestyle and dietary habits, and a physical examination. Based on this comprehensive evaluation, Dr. Sarma crafts bespoke treatment plans that may include herbal remedies sourced from the attached Ayurvedic Pharmacy, dietary recommendations aligned with Ayurvedic principles, lifestyle modifications to promote balance, and detoxification therapies (Panchakarma). The on-site Ayurvedic Pharmacy ensures the availability of high-quality, authentic Ayurvedic medicines, prepared using traditional methods and sourced from trusted suppliers. Dr. Sarma also offers guidance on incorporating Ayurvedic principles into daily life, empowering patients to take an active role in maintaining their health and preventing future ailments. A unique selling point is the integration of traditional knowledge with a modern understanding of health issues, allowing for treatments that are both effective and relevant to the patient’s specific needs. The practice directly addresses the local market\'s need for natural, preventive healthcare solutions, appealing to individuals seeking alternatives to pharmaceutical-based treatments and those interested in preserving their well-being through time-tested Ayurvedic practices.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma\'s clinic. From the moment patients step through the door, they are greeted with warmth and respect, creating a welcoming and supportive environment. Dr. Sarma believes in building strong, trusting relationships with his patients, taking the time to listen attentively to their concerns and answer their questions thoroughly. This personalized approach fosters a sense of collaboration and empowers patients to actively participate in their healing journey. The practice distinguishes itself by providing ongoing support and guidance, even after the initial consultation and treatment. Follow-up appointments are scheduled to monitor progress, adjust treatment plans as needed, and provide continued encouragement. Furthermore, Dr. Sarma actively engages with the local community by participating in health awareness programs and workshops, sharing his knowledge of Ayurveda and promoting healthy living practices. This commitment to community engagement reinforces the practice\'s role as a trusted resource and contributes to its positive reputation within Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma envisions expanding his practice to further enhance its reach and impact within the local community and beyond. Future plans include incorporating advanced diagnostic techniques, integrating technology to improve patient communication and monitoring, and expanding the range of specialized Ayurvedic treatments offered. There is also a long-term goal to establish an Ayurvedic wellness center that offers comprehensive holistic health programs, including yoga, meditation, and Ayurvedic cooking classes. Dr. Sarma aims to partner with local organizations and healthcare providers to promote the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare, making its benefits accessible to a wider population. The ultimate vision is to establish Dr. Bishnu Prasad Sarma\'s practice as a leading center of Ayurvedic excellence in Northeast India, contributing to the health and well-being of individuals and communities through the timeless wisdom of Ayurveda.</p>', 'Kelvin Cinema and Vishwaratna Hotel, Ayurvedic Pharmacy, SRCB Road, Tokobari Near Shardhanjali Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 36018', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:05:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(977, 'Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre.', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre stands as a unique and vital resource within the Assam healthcare landscape, offering traditional Tibetan medical practices to address a broad range of health concerns. Rooted in ancient wisdom and centuries of accumulated knowledge, the Centre provides a holistic approach to healing, emphasizing balance within the body, mind, and spirit. Its presence in Assam fills a crucial gap by offering an alternative and complementary treatment modality, particularly appealing to those seeking natural and integrative healthcare solutions. The Centre is more than just a medical facility; it\'s a place of healing, learning, and cultural preservation, contributing to the diverse tapestry of Assam\'s wellness offerings. The precise location ensures accessibility for residents of the surrounding area and promotes a quiet, peaceful environment conducive to healing.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core services at Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre are centered around the principles of Sowa Rigpa, the traditional Tibetan system of medicine. This encompasses a range of diagnostic and therapeutic techniques, including pulse diagnosis, urine analysis, and detailed patient interviews to ascertain the individual\'s unique constitution and imbalances. Based on these assessments, personalized treatment plans are developed, which may include herbal medicine prescriptions crafted from carefully sourced and prepared natural ingredients. These medicines are often compounded on-site, adhering to traditional Tibetan pharmaceutical practices. Furthermore, the Centre offers external therapies such as Kunye massage, a specialized form of Tibetan massage that focuses on specific energy points and channels to release blockages and promote circulation. Moxibustion, a technique involving the burning of dried mugwort near acupuncture points, is also employed to stimulate energy flow and alleviate pain. Dietary and lifestyle recommendations are integral to the treatment process, empowering patients to take an active role in their own well-being. One of the Centre\'s unique selling points is its commitment to preserving the authenticity of Tibetan medical practices, ensuring that patients receive treatments that are true to the tradition. The centre is committed to using the highest-quality ingredients, some of which are sourced directly from the Himalayan region. These services address the local market\'s increasing demand for natural, holistic, and culturally sensitive healthcare options, particularly in a region where traditional healing practices hold significant cultural value. The availability of these therapies can address various health concerns, from chronic pain and digestive issues to stress management and overall well-being.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre, customer experience is paramount. The Centre strives to create a welcoming and compassionate environment where patients feel heard, respected, and supported throughout their healing journey. The practitioners are not only highly skilled in Tibetan medicine but also possess strong communication skills and cultural sensitivity, ensuring that patients from diverse backgrounds feel comfortable and understood. The initial consultation involves a thorough assessment of the patient\'s health history, lifestyle, and concerns, fostering a strong doctor-patient relationship built on trust and mutual understanding. Follow-up appointments are equally attentive, allowing practitioners to monitor progress, adjust treatment plans as needed, and provide ongoing support and guidance. The Centre actively engages with the local community through educational workshops, health awareness programs, and cultural events, fostering a deeper understanding of Tibetan medicine and its benefits. By participating in local festivals and collaborating with community organizations, Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre aims to become an integral part of the local fabric, promoting health, wellness, and cultural exchange. Patients consistently express satisfaction with the personalized care, the effectiveness of the treatments, and the overall sense of well-being they experience at the Centre. This commitment to exceptional customer service is a key differentiator, setting Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre apart from other healthcare providers in the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre envisions expanding its reach and impact within the Assam community and beyond. Future plans include establishing a training program for local healthcare professionals interested in learning Tibetan medical practices, contributing to the preservation and dissemination of this valuable knowledge. The Centre also aims to develop a sustainable sourcing model for herbal ingredients, supporting local farmers and ensuring the long-term availability of high-quality medicines. Exploring collaborations with other healthcare providers, both traditional and modern, to offer integrated treatment approaches is also a key objective. By integrating with other forms of care, more effective treatment can be offered, while respecting the traditions of Sowa Rigpa. This might involve offering workshops for conventional doctors to improve their understanding of the practice and develop opportunities to incorporate the therapy to other medical treatments. Telemedicine consultations may be considered to extend access to care for patients in remote areas. The long-term goal is to establish Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre as a leading center for Tibetan medicine in the region, renowned for its authenticity, quality of care, and commitment to community well-being. The Centre also sees potential in attracting medical tourists interested in experiencing traditional Tibetan healing practices, further boosting the local economy and promoting Assam as a destination for wellness and cultural tourism. By staying true to its mission and continuously innovating, Samye Tibetan Medical Treatment Centre is poised for continued growth and success, making a lasting contribution to the health and well-being of the community it serves.\n</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '069092 76510', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:10:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
