(978, 'Dr. Angsumita Choudhury', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Dr. Angsumita Choudhury, located on the 2nd floor of the Pratiksha Hospital Daycare building, provides comprehensive and compassionate care focused on [Specific area of expertise - e.g., women’s health, pediatric care, dermatology etc.]. More than just a medical practice, Dr. Choudhury\'s establishment is a dedicated healthcare resource for the community, offering a welcoming and supportive environment for individuals seeking expert medical attention. Situated within the Pratiksha Hospital Daycare building, it leverages the infrastructure and reputation of a trusted healthcare institution while maintaining a personalized, patient-centric approach. In the Assam business landscape, Dr. Choudhury\'s practice fills a vital niche by combining specialized medical knowledge with a commitment to accessible and empathetic care. This unique blend distinguishes it from larger, more impersonal healthcare providers and contributes significantly to the overall well-being of the local population.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe core of Dr. Angsumita Choudhury\'s practice revolves around providing expert [Specific area of expertise] services. These services include [List specific services offered - e.g., comprehensive women\'s health exams, pediatric vaccinations and well-child checks, advanced dermatological treatments]. A key differentiator is the emphasis on holistic care, addressing not just the immediate medical concern but also the overall health and well-being of the individual. This approach involves thorough consultations, personalized treatment plans, and ongoing support to ensure optimal outcomes. For instance, in [Specific area of expertise], patients benefit from [Specific benefit - e.g., cutting-edge diagnostic tools, innovative treatment options, evidence-based approaches]. Furthermore, Dr. Choudhury\'s practice stands out by offering [Unique selling point - e.g., extended consultation times, home visit options, specialized care for certain conditions]. These unique features are designed to meet the specific needs of the local market, where access to specialized healthcare and personalized attention can be limited. By providing accessible, comprehensive, and compassionate care, Dr. Choudhury\'s practice plays a crucial role in improving the health and quality of life for individuals in the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Dr. Angsumita Choudhury\'s practice, the patient experience is paramount. The approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, respect, and a genuine commitment to providing the highest quality of care. From the moment patients enter the practice, they are greeted with warmth and understanding by the friendly and professional staff. Consultations are conducted in a comfortable and non-intimidating environment, where patients are encouraged to ask questions and actively participate in their care. What truly sets Dr. Choudhury\'s practice apart is the personalized attention given to each patient. Dr. Choudhury takes the time to listen attentively to their concerns, thoroughly explain their condition, and collaboratively develop a treatment plan that aligns with their individual needs and preferences. This personalized approach fosters trust and empowers patients to take control of their health. Furthermore, the practice actively engages with the local community through [Specific community engagement activities - e.g., health awareness campaigns, free health check-up camps, participation in local health initiatives]. By building strong relationships with local organizations and community leaders, Dr. Choudhury\'s practice demonstrates its commitment to serving the broader community and promoting overall well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Dr. Angsumita Choudhury envisions significant growth and expansion for the practice. Future plans include [Specific future plans - e.g., expanding the range of services offered, incorporating new technologies, establishing partnerships with other healthcare providers]. This expansion is aimed at addressing the evolving healthcare needs of the local community and providing even more comprehensive and accessible care. A key focus will be on [Specific future focus - e.g., leveraging telemedicine to reach remote patients, developing specialized programs for chronic disease management, enhancing the practice\'s digital presence]. These initiatives will enable Dr. Choudhury\'s practice to reach a wider audience and provide more convenient and efficient care. In the long term, Dr. Choudhury aspires to establish the practice as a leading healthcare resource in the region, known for its excellence in [Specific area of expertise], its commitment to patient-centric care, and its dedication to improving the health and well-being of the community. By continually innovating and adapting to the changing healthcare landscape, Dr. Angsumita Choudhury\'s practice is poised to make a lasting positive impact on the lives of individuals in Assam for years to come.', '2nd floor, Pratiksha Hospital Daycare building', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070025 93708', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:10:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(979, 'Vanaspati Vedaa - Ayurvedic Medicine', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Vanaspati Vedaa - Ayurvedic Medicine stands as a beacon of traditional healing in the heart of Assam, situated conveniently near the Postal Training Center on Kali Mandir Rd. More than just a dispensary, it\'s a sanctuary where ancient Ayurvedic principles are seamlessly integrated with modern understanding to provide holistic health solutions. In a region deeply rooted in cultural heritage, Vanaspati Vedaa distinguishes itself by offering authentic Ayurvedic medicines and personalized consultations, addressing the growing demand for natural and sustainable healthcare alternatives. We are dedicated to empowering individuals to take control of their well-being through time-tested methods, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings revolve around providing a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic medicines and therapeutic services. We stock a meticulously curated selection of classical Ayurvedic formulations, including asavas, arishtas, churnas, and ghritas, sourced from reputable manufacturers committed to quality and authenticity. These medicines address a wide spectrum of health concerns, from common ailments like coughs and colds to chronic conditions such as arthritis and digestive disorders. A key differentiator for Vanaspati Vedaa lies in our emphasis on personalized consultations. Our experienced Ayurvedic practitioners conduct thorough assessments of each individual’s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti), providing tailored treatment plans encompassing herbal remedies, dietary recommendations, and lifestyle modifications. Beyond medicines, we offer therapeutic services like Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), and Panchakarma detox therapies (as available or planned), further enhancing our holistic approach to healthcare. Our services directly respond to the local market\'s increasing awareness of the benefits of Ayurveda and the desire for natural and preventive healthcare solutions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Vanaspati Vedaa, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable discussing their health concerns. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and compassionate service, guiding customers through our product offerings and answering their questions with clarity and empathy. We prioritize building long-term relationships based on trust and mutual respect. Beyond individual consultations, we actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and educational seminars on Ayurveda and healthy living. We believe in empowering individuals with knowledge, enabling them to make informed decisions about their health and well-being. Our commitment extends to sourcing our medicines and products ethically, supporting local artisans and sustainable practices whenever possible. This dedication to quality, personalized attention, and community engagement sets us apart as a trusted partner in promoting holistic health in the region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Vanaspati Vedaa envisions becoming a leading Ayurvedic healthcare provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authenticity, quality, and personalized care. Our future plans include expanding our range of Ayurvedic medicines and therapeutic services to cater to a wider range of health needs. We aim to establish collaborations with local healthcare providers and wellness centers to integrate Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare practices. We also plan to introduce telemedicine services to reach individuals in remote areas, making Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible to all. Furthermore, we aspire to develop educational programs and training initiatives to promote Ayurvedic knowledge and skills among healthcare professionals and the general public. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the revitalization of Ayurveda in Assam and establish Vanaspati Vedaa as a center of excellence for traditional healing, fostering a healthier and more sustainable future for the community.</p>', 'Kali Mandir Rd, near Postal Training Center', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '096789 86663', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:10:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(980, 'Pareek Ayurvedic Centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Pareek Ayurvedic Centre is a dedicated wellness center nestled in the heart of Assam, committed to providing authentic Ayurvedic therapies and products tailored to the unique health needs of the local community. We strive to be a beacon of holistic well-being, integrating traditional Ayurvedic principles with modern understanding to deliver personalized and effective healthcare solutions. Recognizing the rich herbal heritage of Assam, we emphasize the use of locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, fostering sustainability and supporting local farmers. Unlike conventional healthcare approaches, Pareek Ayurvedic Centre focuses on preventative care, addressing the root causes of ailments, and promoting long-term health and vitality. We aim to be a trusted partner in our clients\' journey towards optimal well-being, empowering them with knowledge and tools to lead healthier and more balanced lives.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service offerings encompass a wide range of traditional Ayurvedic therapies, including personalized consultations, Panchakarma detoxification programs, Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil therapy for the head), and Marma therapy (energy point massage). Each therapy is meticulously customized by our experienced Ayurvedic practitioners, taking into account the individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti), imbalances (Vikriti), and specific health concerns. We also offer specialized programs tailored to address common health issues prevalent in the region, such as joint pain, digestive disorders, respiratory ailments, and stress-related conditions. Beyond therapies, Pareek Ayurvedic Centre provides a curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic products, including herbal supplements, classical Ayurvedic formulations, personal care items, and dietary products. These products are carefully sourced from reputable manufacturers who adhere to strict quality control standards and utilize traditional manufacturing processes. A key differentiator for us is our commitment to providing comprehensive educational resources, empowering our clients with knowledge about Ayurvedic principles, lifestyle recommendations, and dietary guidelines to support their health and well-being beyond their visits to the centre. We believe in the power of preventative healthcare and strive to equip our clients with the tools they need to manage their health proactively.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Pareek Ayurvedic Centre, customer experience is paramount. We prioritize building long-lasting relationships with our clients, fostering a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment. Our approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, compassion, and a genuine desire to help individuals achieve their health goals. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with personalized attention and care. Our consultations are conducted in a relaxed and unhurried manner, allowing our practitioners to gain a thorough understanding of the client\'s health history, lifestyle, and concerns. We take the time to educate our clients about their health conditions and the recommended treatment plans, ensuring that they are actively involved in their healing journey. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to providing ongoing support and guidance. We offer follow-up consultations, lifestyle counseling, and dietary recommendations to help our clients maintain their health and well-being long after their treatments are completed. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through health awareness workshops, educational seminars, and collaborations with local organizations. By promoting Ayurvedic principles and healthy lifestyle practices, we aim to contribute to the overall well-being of the community we serve. We participate in local festivals and events, offering free consultations and educational materials to raise awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Pareek Ayurvedic Centre envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, renowned for its authenticity, quality, and commitment to customer well-being. Our growth strategy includes expanding our service offerings to include specialized programs for specific health conditions, such as women\'s health, geriatric care, and pediatric care. We plan to establish a dedicated research and development wing to explore the potential of local herbs and develop innovative Ayurvedic formulations tailored to the needs of the Assamese population. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic therapies into mainstream healthcare settings. To further enhance our customer experience, we aim to implement a user-friendly online platform that provides access to information about Ayurvedic principles, products, and services. This platform will also enable clients to schedule appointments, access educational resources, and connect with our practitioners remotely. Our long-term goal is to establish a state-of-the-art Ayurvedic wellness retreat in a serene natural setting, offering immersive Ayurvedic experiences that promote healing, rejuvenation, and holistic well-being. We are committed to staying true to our core values of authenticity, integrity, and compassion as we grow and evolve, ensuring that we continue to provide the highest quality Ayurvedic healthcare to our community.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '084862 49470', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:10:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(981, 'Kunal Ayurvedic Solution | Dr. Nature Wellness Pvt. Ltd.', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Kunal Ayurvedic Solution | Dr. Nature Wellness Pvt. Ltd. stands as a beacon of holistic health and wellness in the heart of Assam, specifically located at Jonaki Path, Bylane 2 (Left, Dakhingaon Rd).  More than just a business, it represents a commitment to integrating ancient Ayurvedic principles with modern healthcare practices, catering to the specific needs and health concerns of the local community.  Operating as Dr. Nature Wellness Pvt. Ltd., Kunal Ayurvedic Solution plays a vital role in the Assam business landscape by offering a natural and sustainable approach to well-being, differentiating itself from conventional allopathic medicine.  The company\'s presence contributes to the growing awareness and acceptance of alternative medicine in the region, promoting a healthier and more balanced lifestyle for its clientele. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, Kunal Ayurvedic Solution offers a comprehensive suite of Ayurvedic services and products designed to address a wide range of health issues.  These services include personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners who assess individual doshas (body constitutions) and develop tailored treatment plans.  These plans often incorporate herbal remedies sourced from trusted suppliers, dietary adjustments based on Ayurvedic principles, and lifestyle recommendations to promote optimal health.  The business also provides various Ayurvedic therapies, such as Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), and Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation) to restore balance and vitality. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond therapeutic services, Kunal Ayurvedic Solution also offers a range of high-quality Ayurvedic products, including herbal supplements, natural skincare items, and wellness products.  These products are formulated using traditional Ayurvedic recipes and are carefully crafted to ensure purity and efficacy.  The unique selling point lies in the integration of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge with modern quality control measures.  The business emphasizes the use of locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices.  Furthermore, Kunal Ayurvedic Solution actively addresses local market needs by providing natural remedies for common ailments prevalent in the region, such as digestive issues, joint pain, and respiratory problems, often offering a gentler and more sustainable alternative to conventional treatments.  </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Kunal Ayurvedic Solution prioritizes customer experience, fostering a welcoming and supportive environment for all clients.  The approach to customer service is deeply rooted in empathy and understanding, with practitioners taking the time to listen to individual concerns and provide personalized guidance.  What truly sets the business apart is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its clients, educating them about Ayurvedic principles, and empowering them to take control of their health.  This dedication extends to the local community through participation in health awareness campaigns, workshops, and educational programs that promote the benefits of Ayurveda.  The company actively engages with local community groups and organizations, fostering a sense of trust and connection, solidifying its position as a trusted source of holistic health and wellness information and services. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Kunal Ayurvedic Solution | Dr. Nature Wellness Pvt. Ltd. is ambitious and driven by a desire to expand its reach and impact within the region and beyond.  The business envisions expanding its product line to include more specialized Ayurvedic formulations and treatments catering to specific health conditions.  Future plans also involve establishing strategic partnerships with other healthcare providers and wellness centers to integrate Ayurvedic medicine into mainstream healthcare.  Long-term goals include developing a state-of-the-art Ayurvedic wellness center that offers a comprehensive range of services, including consultations, therapies, education, and research.  The company is also exploring opportunities to cultivate medicinal herbs sustainably, contributing to environmental conservation and supporting local communities.  Ultimately, Kunal Ayurvedic Solution aims to become a leading provider of Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam and a recognized center of excellence for Ayurvedic knowledge and practice.  The ambition is to contribute significantly to the well-being of the community, one natural remedy and personalized consultation at a time.</p>', 'Jonaki Path, Bylane 2 (Left, Dakhingaon Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '076620 14111', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:10:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(982, 'Dr Jyotirmay Choudhury, MD Ayurveda, PhD, Medicine Specialist Ayurvedic Doctor', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Dr. Jyotirmay Choudhury, MD Ayurveda, PhD, Medicine Specialist Ayurvedic Doctor, operating from VASUDEV AYURVEDIC on GS Rd, represents a confluence of ancient Ayurvedic wisdom and modern medical understanding. This practice stands as a vital healthcare provider in Assam, offering a holistic approach to wellness that resonates deeply with the region\'s cultural heritage and growing awareness of natural healing methods. Unlike conventional medical practices that often focus solely on symptom management, Dr. Choudhury\'s approach delves into the root causes of ailments, aiming to restore balance and promote long-term health. The business is more than just a clinic; it\'s a sanctuary for those seeking personalized, natural, and sustainable healthcare solutions, contributing significantly to the local business landscape by providing a trusted and culturally relevant alternative to conventional medicine.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of VASUDEV AYURVEDIC are comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations, personalized treatment plans, and a range of specialized therapies. Dr. Choudhury leverages his extensive knowledge of Ayurvedic principles, combined with his PhD in Medicine, to diagnose and treat a wide spectrum of health conditions. Core services include <em>Nadi Pariksha</em> (pulse diagnosis) for accurate assessment of imbalances, <em>Prakriti analysis</em> to understand individual constitutional types, and customized herbal remedies formulated specifically for each patient\'s needs. These remedies, prepared with authentic Ayurvedic ingredients, are sourced ethically and sustainably. The practice also offers specialized Ayurvedic therapies such as <em>Panchakarma</em> (detoxification and rejuvenation), <em>Abhyanga</em> (therapeutic massage), and <em>Shirodhara</em> (oil pouring therapy) to address specific health concerns and promote overall well-being. A unique selling point lies in the integration of traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern diagnostic techniques, allowing for a more precise and effective treatment approach. Furthermore, Dr. Choudhury’s profound understanding of both Ayurvedic and modern medicine enables him to seamlessly bridge the gap between the two systems, offering patients a well-rounded and integrated healthcare experience. These services directly address the local market\'s increasing demand for natural and preventive healthcare options, especially for chronic ailments and lifestyle-related disorders that are prevalent in the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience at VASUDEV AYURVEDIC is paramount, emphasizing personalized attention, empathy, and a commitment to fostering a trusting doctor-patient relationship. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and respect, creating a comfortable and reassuring atmosphere. Consultations are conducted in a thorough and unhurried manner, allowing Dr. Choudhury to fully understand the patient\'s medical history, lifestyle, and individual concerns. Treatment plans are explained in detail, empowering patients to actively participate in their healing journey. Follow-up care is equally important, with regular check-ins and ongoing support to ensure optimal results and address any questions or concerns. What truly sets VASUDEV AYURVEDIC apart is its dedication to building strong connections with the local community. This is achieved through educational workshops on Ayurvedic principles, health awareness campaigns, and collaborations with local organizations to promote holistic wellness. The practice actively engages with the community through local events and health fairs, providing free consultations and educational materials to raise awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda. This community-centric approach not only fosters trust and loyalty but also positions VASUDEV AYURVEDIC as a valuable resource for health and well-being in the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Dr. Jyotirmay Choudhury envisions VASUDEV AYURVEDIC as a leading center for Ayurvedic excellence in Assam and beyond. The business has significant potential for growth by expanding its range of specialized therapies, incorporating advanced diagnostic tools, and developing a line of proprietary Ayurvedic products. Future plans include establishing a dedicated Panchakarma center with state-of-the-art facilities, providing immersive detoxification and rejuvenation experiences. Furthermore, Dr. Choudhury aims to collaborate with research institutions to conduct clinical trials on the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments for various health conditions. A long-term goal is to establish an Ayurvedic educational institute to train the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners and promote the preservation and dissemination of this ancient healing tradition. Ultimately, Dr. Choudhury\'s vision is to integrate Ayurveda into the mainstream healthcare system, making it accessible to a wider population and contributing to a healthier and more sustainable future for the community. This commitment to innovation, education, and community engagement positions VASUDEV AYURVEDIC for continued success and lasting impact on the health and well-being of the region.</p>', 'VASUDEV AYURVEDIC, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098642 70237', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:15:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(983, 'Nirogi Herbs', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Nirogi Herbs, nestled in the heart of Assam, is dedicated to cultivating and providing the highest quality Ayurvedic herbs and products, tailored to the specific health needs and cultural sensitivities of the region. More than just a purveyor of herbs, Nirogi Herbs acts as a bridge between traditional healing practices and modern lifestyles, promoting holistic well-being within the community. We aim to harness the rich biodiversity of Assam and the Northeast, ensuring sustainable sourcing and empowering local farmers while offering effective and natural health solutions. Our commitment extends beyond merely selling products; we aspire to educate and inspire individuals to take proactive control of their health through the wisdom of Ayurveda.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of Nirogi Herbs’ offerings are sustainably sourced Ayurvedic herbs, many of which are native to Assam and the Northeast. These herbs are meticulously processed, retaining their potency and efficacy. We offer a diverse range of products, including single-herb powders and capsules, carefully formulated herbal blends for specific health concerns (such as immunity boosting, digestive support, and stress relief), and traditional Ayurvedic preparations like churnas and arishtas. A key differentiator is our focus on providing formulations that resonate with the local palate and address prevalent health issues in the region, considering dietary habits and environmental factors. Furthermore, we distinguish ourselves through a unique line of herbal skincare products, utilizing locally sourced ingredients known for their beneficial properties for skin health and radiance, promoting natural beauty routines rooted in Ayurvedic principles.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nirogi Herbs stands apart by prioritizing exceptional customer service that is both informative and compassionate. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where customers feel comfortable seeking guidance and advice. Our knowledgeable staff is trained in Ayurvedic principles and herbal remedies, enabling them to provide personalized recommendations based on individual needs and constitutions. This commitment to education extends beyond individual consultations, as we regularly host workshops and seminars on Ayurvedic lifestyle practices, herbal remedies, and healthy living, fostering a strong sense of community engagement. We actively participate in local farmers markets and community events, promoting our products and building relationships with our customers, ensuring that Nirogi Herbs is not merely a business but a trusted partner in their wellness journey.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision of Nirogi Herbs encompasses both expansion and deepening our commitment to the community. We envision establishing a state-of-the-art processing facility, equipped to handle larger volumes of herbs while maintaining the highest quality standards. A key aspect of our growth strategy is to strengthen our partnerships with local farmers, providing them with fair prices and sustainable farming practices, thereby supporting the regional economy and preserving the biodiversity of Assam. We also plan to expand our product line to include more innovative and convenient Ayurvedic formulations, catering to the evolving needs of our customers. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to become a recognized and respected leader in the Ayurvedic herbal industry in the Northeast, known for our unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and community well-being, helping to spread the benefits of Ayurveda far and wide.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098542 10075', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:15:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(984, 'Kamakhya Ayurvedic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Kamakhya Ayurvedic, nestled at 5QJM+J48, Railway Colony Rd, represents a confluence of ancient wisdom and modern wellness, bringing the time-tested traditions of Ayurveda to the heart of Assam. More than just a business, Kamakhya Ayurvedic aims to be a cornerstone of holistic health, addressing the growing need for natural and sustainable well-being solutions within the local community. Located near the railway colony, it serves as a accessible haven for those seeking authentic Ayurvedic treatments and products, standing out as a locally rooted business dedicated to preserving and promoting Assam\'s rich heritage of traditional medicine.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, Kamakhya Ayurvedic offers a comprehensive range of services and products meticulously curated to promote overall well-being. These include: </p>\n<br> <br>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> Personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners to assess individual health needs, diagnose imbalances, and develop tailored treatment plans. This focuses on understanding the patient\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and current imbalances (Vikriti) to offer targeted solutions.</li>\n<li><b>Traditional Ayurvedic Therapies:</b> A suite of authentic therapies such as Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification), and Kati Basti (lower back treatment), performed by trained therapists using traditional techniques and herbal formulations.</li>\n<li><b>Herbal Products and Remedies:</b> A carefully selected range of Ayurvedic herbs, supplements, oils, and personal care products sourced responsibly and adhering to strict quality standards. Emphasis is placed on utilizing locally sourced herbs whenever possible, supporting local farmers and preserving regional biodiversity.</li>\n<li><b>Wellness Programs:</b> Integrated wellness programs designed to address specific health concerns, such as stress management, weight management, digestive health, and joint pain, combining dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and therapeutic treatments.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Kamakhya Ayurvedic differentiates itself by prioritizing authenticity and quality. Its unique selling points include a commitment to using genuine Ayurvedic principles, employing experienced and knowledgeable practitioners, and sourcing high-quality ingredients. Unlike generic wellness centers, Kamakhya Ayurvedic provides personalized care rooted in the individual\'s specific needs and constitution. Furthermore, the business actively promotes awareness of Ayurvedic principles within the local community through workshops and educational events, fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation of this ancient healing system. The location, easily accessible within Railway Colony Rd, makes it a convenient option for locals seeking reliable Ayurvedic care.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Kamakhya Ayurvedic. The business strives to create a welcoming and nurturing environment where clients feel comfortable and supported throughout their wellness journey. This begins with attentive listening during consultations, where practitioners take the time to understand each individual\'s unique health concerns and goals. Treatments are delivered with compassion and care, ensuring a relaxing and rejuvenating experience. Beyond the immediate therapeutic benefits, Kamakhya Ayurvedic aims to empower clients with knowledge and tools to maintain their well-being through lifestyle modifications and self-care practices. The business actively engages with the local community through health camps, workshops, and collaborations with local organizations, fostering a sense of trust and connection. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continually improve services and enhance the overall customer experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Kamakhya Ayurvedic envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded reach within the region. The business plans to broaden its range of services to include specialized treatments for specific conditions, such as women\'s health and geriatric care. There are also plans to increase awareness about preventive health-care using Ayurvedic guidelines and natural products. This will be achieved through community outreach programs and collaborations with local health institutions. Additionally, Kamakhya Ayurvedic aims to develop its own line of proprietary herbal formulations, further solidifying its commitment to quality and innovation. Long-term goals include establishing a reputation as a trusted center of excellence for Ayurvedic care in Assam, contributing to the overall health and well-being of the community, and preserving the rich heritage of traditional Indian medicine for future generations. The business is also exploring opportunities to expand its online presence, making its products and services accessible to a wider audience beyond the immediate locality.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Kamakhya Ayurvedic is poised to become a leading provider of holistic healthcare solutions, deeply embedded in the cultural fabric of Assam and dedicated to empowering individuals to live healthier, happier lives.</p>', '5QJM+J48, Railway Colony Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098642 69124', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:15:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(985, 'D. S. Research Centre, Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>D. S. Research Centre, Guwahati, situated in the heart of the city at Amrit Enclave, 21, Maniram Dewan Rd, is a leading research and development hub dedicated to serving the specific needs of businesses and organizations in Assam and the wider North-Eastern region of India. More than just a research facility, D. S. Research Centre acts as a catalyst for innovation, bridging the gap between academic research and practical application for the betterment of local industries and communities.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Centre distinguishes itself through its deep understanding of the unique challenges and opportunities present within the regional economy. We recognize the importance of tailored solutions that address specific local needs, from agricultural advancements and sustainable resource management to technological integration and market analysis. Our commitment extends beyond mere data collection; we strive to provide actionable insights and practical solutions that empower our clients to thrive in a competitive landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>D. S. Research Centre offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to drive progress and efficiency across various sectors. Core offerings include:</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Market Research and Analysis:</b> We conduct in-depth market studies to identify consumer trends, competitive landscapes, and potential growth opportunities. This includes feasibility studies for new ventures, analysis of existing market penetration strategies, and assessment of the impact of policy changes on local businesses.</li>\n<li><b>Agricultural Research and Development:</b> Focused on improving crop yields, developing sustainable farming practices, and introducing innovative agricultural technologies suited to the region’s climate and soil conditions. Our research aims to enhance the livelihoods of farmers and contribute to food security.</li>\n<li><b>Environmental Impact Assessments:</b> We provide thorough environmental impact assessments for proposed projects, ensuring compliance with environmental regulations and promoting sustainable development practices. This includes studies on biodiversity, water resources, and air quality.</li>\n<li><b>Technological Consulting and Integration:</b> Helping businesses adopt and implement new technologies to improve efficiency, productivity, and competitiveness. Our expertise spans areas such as data analytics, automation, and digital marketing, tailored to the specific needs of local enterprises.</li>\n<li><b>Product Development and Testing:</b> Assisting businesses in developing new products and services that meet the needs of the local market. This includes concept development, prototyping, testing, and market launch support.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets D. S. Research Centre apart is its commitment to providing customized research solutions. We understand that each client has unique needs and objectives, and we tailor our research methodologies and analysis to deliver the most relevant and impactful results. Our team comprises experienced researchers, scientists, and consultants with a deep understanding of the local context, enabling us to provide insights that are both accurate and actionable. This nuanced understanding of local conditions combined with rigorous scientific methodology forms the bedrock of our unique selling proposition.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At D. S. Research Centre, customer experience is paramount. We prioritize building strong, collaborative relationships with our clients, ensuring that their needs are understood and met throughout the research process. We maintain open communication channels and provide regular updates, ensuring that clients are kept informed of progress and can provide feedback along the way. Our dedication extends beyond the completion of a project; we are committed to providing ongoing support and guidance to help our clients implement our findings and achieve their desired outcomes.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, D. S. Research Centre actively participates in local community initiatives, partnering with organizations to promote research and education in the region. We believe in fostering a culture of innovation and collaboration, and we strive to contribute to the overall economic and social development of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, D. S. Research Centre envisions becoming the premier research and development hub for the North-Eastern region of India. Our future plans include expanding our research capabilities, developing new partnerships with academic institutions and industry leaders, and increasing our focus on emerging areas such as renewable energy and sustainable agriculture. We also plan to invest in training and development programs to nurture the next generation of researchers and innovators in Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to play a pivotal role in driving economic growth and improving the quality of life for the people of Assam. We believe that through rigorous research, innovative solutions, and a commitment to excellence, D. S. Research Centre can make a significant contribution to the sustainable development of the region. We are dedicated to fostering a thriving ecosystem of innovation, empowering local businesses, and creating a brighter future for Assam.</p>', 'Amrit Enclave, 21, Maniram Dewan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '081305 94141', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:15:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(986, 'Ayurvedic Hospital', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Ayurvedic Hospital, situated at House no. 78, Piyali Phukan Rd, represents a dedicated commitment to holistic health and wellness in the heart of Assam. Rooted in the ancient Indian science of Ayurveda, this hospital offers a comprehensive approach to healing, emphasizing natural remedies and personalized care. Unlike conventional medical facilities, Ayurvedic Hospital focuses on addressing the root cause of ailments, promoting balance within the body, mind, and spirit. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, characterized by a growing interest in traditional medicine and wellness practices, Ayurvedic Hospital stands out as a trusted provider of authentic Ayurvedic treatments, blending time-tested wisdom with modern diagnostic techniques. The hospital is more than just a medical facility; it\'s a sanctuary where individuals can embark on a journey towards sustainable health and well-being. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>The core services offered at Ayurvedic Hospital encompass a wide range of therapeutic interventions, including Panchakarma, herbal medicine, dietary consultations, yoga and meditation, and personalized lifestyle recommendations. Panchakarma, a renowned detoxification and rejuvenation therapy, is meticulously administered by experienced Ayurvedic practitioners, utilizing traditional techniques and locally sourced herbs. The hospital\'s in-house pharmacy dispenses a diverse selection of authentic Ayurvedic medicines, carefully formulated to address various health conditions. A key differentiator lies in the individualized attention provided to each patient. Upon arrival, each individual undergoes a thorough consultation, including pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha) and a detailed assessment of their unique constitution (Prakriti). This personalized approach enables the practitioners to tailor treatment plans that address specific needs and promote optimal healing. The hospital adeptly meets local market needs by offering effective solutions for common ailments prevalent in the region, such as respiratory problems, digestive disorders, joint pain, and stress-related conditions. The emphasis on natural and sustainable healing resonates strongly with the local community, who are increasingly seeking alternatives to conventional medicine. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>At Ayurvedic Hospital, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment patients step through the door, they are greeted with warmth and compassion. The hospital staff is dedicated to creating a healing environment that fosters trust and well-being. The hospital\'s aesthetic is designed to promote tranquility, incorporating natural elements such as plants, soothing colors, and comfortable furnishings. What truly sets Ayurvedic Hospital apart is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its patients. Practitioners take the time to educate patients about their health conditions and empower them to take an active role in their own healing process. Regular follow-up consultations ensure that patients receive ongoing support and guidance. Furthermore, Ayurvedic Hospital actively engages with the local community through health awareness workshops, seminars, and outreach programs. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda and promote healthy living practices. By fostering strong connections with the community, Ayurvedic Hospital has earned a reputation as a trusted and respected healthcare provider. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Ayurvedic Hospital envisions significant growth and expansion. The hospital aims to enhance its service offerings by incorporating advanced diagnostic tools and therapeutic techniques while staying true to the principles of Ayurveda. Plans are underway to expand the hospital\'s facilities, including the addition of specialized treatment rooms and a dedicated yoga and meditation center. A key focus is to cultivate and promote the use of locally sourced medicinal plants, supporting sustainable agriculture and empowering local farmers. Furthermore, Ayurvedic Hospital intends to establish collaborations with other healthcare providers and research institutions to advance the scientific understanding of Ayurveda and its effectiveness in treating various health conditions. The long-term goal is to establish Ayurvedic Hospital as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam and beyond, attracting patients from across the region and contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition. The vision extends beyond treating illness; it encompasses empowering individuals to live healthier, more balanced lives and fostering a community that values holistic well-being.', 'House no, 78, Piyali Phukan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:15:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
