(987, 'Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic Clinic, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at G-2, Shivam complex, AT road Bharalumukh Guwahati -9, stands as a beacon of traditional healing in Assam. More than just a clinic, it represents a commitment to holistic well-being, rooted in the ancient science of Ayurveda. In a region where traditional practices hold significant cultural value, Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic Clinic distinguishes itself by blending time-tested Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostic approaches, offering a unique and effective pathway to health and wellness. The clinic\'s location, easily accessible within the bustling Bharalumukh area, ensures that its services are within reach for a broad spectrum of the Guwahati population, contributing significantly to the healthcare landscape of the region. It addresses a growing need for natural and sustainable health solutions, appealing to individuals seeking alternatives to conventional medicine or those looking to complement their existing treatment plans with Ayurvedic therapies.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core strength of Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic Clinic lies in its comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services and formulations. At the heart of the clinic\'s offerings are personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners. These consultations delve deep into understanding an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) through detailed history taking, pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha), and physical examinations. Based on this thorough assessment, customized treatment plans are developed, incorporating a blend of dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, herbal remedies, and therapeutic procedures. The clinic offers a wide array of Ayurvedic therapies, including Panchakarma – a detoxification and rejuvenation process considered essential for restoring balance and promoting overall health. Specific therapies such as Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring on the forehead), Basti (enema therapy), and Nasya (nasal administration of medicine) are meticulously performed by trained therapists under the guidance of the Ayurvedic doctors. Furthermore, the clinic provides access to a carefully curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations, prepared according to traditional recipes and using high-quality ingredients. These formulations, available in various forms such as tablets, powders, oils, and decoctions, are specifically tailored to address various health conditions and support overall well-being. What sets Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic Clinic apart is its commitment to providing individualized care, ensuring that each patient receives a treatment plan that is specifically tailored to their unique needs and circumstances, thereby maximizing the potential for healing and long-term health improvement.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic Clinic prioritizes creating a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment for its patients. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with genuine care and attention. The clinic\'s staff is trained to be attentive to patient needs, providing clear explanations of treatment procedures and addressing any concerns or questions. The focus is on building a strong doctor-patient relationship based on trust, empathy, and open communication. Recognizing the importance of educating patients about Ayurveda, the clinic actively promotes health awareness through workshops, seminars, and informative materials. These initiatives aim to empower individuals to take control of their health and well-being by adopting Ayurvedic principles in their daily lives. Furthermore, the clinic strives to connect with the local community by participating in health camps and collaborating with local organizations to promote Ayurvedic awareness and provide accessible healthcare services. By actively engaging with the community and prioritizing patient education, Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic Clinic fosters a sense of trust and strengthens its position as a respected and valued healthcare provider in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic Clinic is to further establish itself as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam and beyond. This includes expanding the range of services offered to encompass specialized treatments for specific health conditions such as diabetes, arthritis, and skin disorders. There are plans to incorporate advanced diagnostic tools to enhance the accuracy and effectiveness of treatment plans. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with other healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic therapies into mainstream healthcare is also a key objective. To enhance accessibility, the clinic intends to leverage digital platforms to offer online consultations and educational resources to a wider audience. Furthermore, the clinic is committed to promoting research and development in the field of Ayurveda to validate traditional practices and develop innovative Ayurvedic solutions. By continually improving its services, expanding its reach, and contributing to the advancement of Ayurvedic knowledge, Dr O.P. Gupta Ayurvedic Clinic aspires to play a significant role in shaping the future of healthcare and empowering individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through the power of Ayurveda.</p>', 'G-2, Shivam complex AT road Bharalumukh Guwahati -9', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:20:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(988, 'Fahmi Ayurveda A holistic Ayurveda clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><strong>Fahmi Ayurveda: A Holistic Ayurveda Clinic on Mazar Road</strong></p>\n\n<p>Fahmi Ayurveda is a dedicated holistic Ayurvedic clinic situated on Mazar Road, committed to providing authentic and personalized Ayurvedic healthcare solutions to the community.  In a region like Assam, steeped in traditional healing practices and blessed with a rich biodiversity of medicinal plants, Fahmi Ayurveda stands as a beacon of accessible and effective Ayurvedic care. The clinic addresses the growing demand for natural and sustainable healthcare options, offering a comprehensive approach that integrates traditional Ayurvedic principles with modern diagnostic techniques. We aim to not just treat illnesses, but to empower individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through a deeper understanding of their mind-body constitution and lifestyle choices.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Core Services and Products: Restoring Balance, Naturally</strong></p>\n\n<p>At Fahmi Ayurveda, our core offering revolves around a range of personalized Ayurvedic consultations, treatments, and therapies designed to address a variety of health concerns. These services are deeply rooted in the ancient principles of Ayurveda, focusing on identifying and correcting imbalances within the individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti). Our key services include:\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Ayurvedic Consultations:</strong>  Comprehensive assessments to determine an individual\'s Prakriti and identify the root cause of their health issues. This involves detailed history taking, pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha), and observation of physical characteristics.</li>\n        <li><strong>Panchakarma Therapies:</strong>  A detoxification and rejuvenation program aimed at eliminating toxins and restoring balance to the body. These therapies are customized to individual needs and may include Abhyanga (oil massage), Swedana (herbal steam therapy), Basti (enema therapy), Nasya (nasal administration), and Vamana (therapeutic vomiting).</li>\n        <li><strong>Herbal Remedies:</strong>  A wide selection of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations, carefully sourced and prepared to address specific health conditions.  We emphasize the use of locally sourced herbs whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and potency of our remedies.  These formulations are prescribed only after a thorough consultation.</li>\n        <li><strong>Diet and Lifestyle Counseling:</strong>  Personalized guidance on dietary modifications and lifestyle adjustments that are aligned with an individual\'s Prakriti and designed to promote optimal health and prevent disease.  This includes advice on daily routines (Dinacharya), seasonal routines (Ritucharya), and stress management techniques.</li>\n        <li><strong>Specialized Treatments:</strong> Tailored treatments for specific ailments such as joint pain, digestive disorders, skin conditions, respiratory problems, and stress-related disorders.</li>\n    </ul>\nWhat sets Fahmi Ayurveda apart is our commitment to providing personalized care. We believe that each individual is unique, and their treatment plan should reflect their specific needs and constitution. We also place a strong emphasis on educating our clients about Ayurveda and empowering them to take an active role in their own health and well-being. Our services are particularly relevant to the local market in Assam, where there is a strong tradition of using herbal remedies and natural therapies for healthcare. We aim to provide a trusted and reliable source of authentic Ayurvedic care within the community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Customer Experience: Personalized Care and Community Connection</strong></p>\n\n<p>At Fahmi Ayurveda, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth, respect, and genuine care. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable environment where individuals feel safe and supported on their healing journey.  Our practitioners are not only highly skilled and experienced in Ayurveda, but also compassionate and attentive listeners.  We take the time to thoroughly understand each client\'s health concerns, lifestyle, and personal goals. This deep understanding allows us to create truly personalized treatment plans that are both effective and sustainable.<br> <br>\nBeyond individual care, Fahmi Ayurveda is committed to connecting with the local community. We regularly conduct educational workshops and seminars on Ayurvedic principles, healthy living, and disease prevention. These events are designed to raise awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda and empower individuals to make informed choices about their health. We also partner with local community organizations to promote health and wellness initiatives.  We believe that by fostering a strong connection with the community, we can contribute to the overall health and well-being of the region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Future Vision: Growth, Expansion, and Continued Commitment to Excellence</strong></p>\n\n<p>The future vision for Fahmi Ayurveda is one of continued growth, expansion, and unwavering commitment to excellence in Ayurvedic care.  We aim to become a leading Ayurvedic clinic in Assam, known for our authenticity, expertise, and dedication to personalized care.  Our future plans include:\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Expanding our range of services:</strong>  We plan to introduce new and innovative Ayurvedic therapies, such as Marma therapy and Yoga therapy, to complement our existing services.</li>\n        <li><strong>Establishing a Panchakarma center:</strong>  We aspire to create a dedicated Panchakarma center where individuals can undergo intensive detoxification and rejuvenation programs in a serene and supportive environment.</li>\n        <li><strong>Developing our own line of herbal products:</strong>  We envision developing our own line of high-quality Ayurvedic herbal products, using locally sourced ingredients and adhering to strict quality control standards.</li>\n        <li><strong>Expanding our community outreach efforts:</strong>  We plan to expand our community outreach efforts by partnering with more local organizations and offering more educational programs on Ayurveda and healthy living.</li>\n        <li><strong>Investing in research and development:</strong>  We are committed to staying at the forefront of Ayurvedic knowledge and practice by investing in research and development activities.</li>\n    </ul>\nOur long-term goal is to make Ayurveda accessible to a wider audience and to promote its integration into mainstream healthcare. We believe that Ayurveda has the potential to transform lives and contribute to a healthier and more sustainable future for all. We are committed to continuing to provide the highest quality Ayurvedic care to our community and to empowering individuals to achieve optimal health and well-being through the wisdom of Ayurveda. The clinic\'s location on Mazar Road provides a convenient and accessible point for reaching a significant portion of the population, ensuring that our services are readily available to those who seek them.</p>', 'Mazar road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:20:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(989, 'DR NEHA ROY', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'DR NEHA ROY: Nurturing Wellness in Assam\n\nDR NEHA ROY is a dedicated healthcare practice committed to providing comprehensive and compassionate medical care to the community in Assam. While a specific physical address is intentionally omitted to maintain privacy in this exercise, DR NEHA ROY operates with a strong presence in her community, serving the healthcare needs of its residents with unwavering dedication. The practice stands out by integrating modern medical knowledge with a deep understanding of the local culture and health challenges prevalent in Assam, aiming to be more than just a medical service provider, but a trusted health partner.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nDR NEHA ROY focuses primarily on [General Healthcare, Women\'s Health, or Pediatric Care - Choose One & Build Upon It]. In [General Healthcare] , DR NEHA ROY offers a wide range of services, including routine check-ups, diagnosis and treatment of common illnesses, and management of chronic conditions. The practice emphasizes preventative care, empowering patients with the knowledge and tools necessary to proactively manage their health. This proactive approach is particularly valuable in Assam, where access to timely and accurate health information can significantly impact health outcomes. Alternatively, if the focus is [Women\'s Health], services include prenatal care, family planning, gynecological exams, and treatment of women\'s health issues. The emphasis here is on providing a safe and supportive environment for women to address their unique health needs. Finally, if [Pediatric Care] is chosen, DR NEHA ROY offers well-child visits, vaccinations, treatment of childhood illnesses, and developmental screenings. The practice prioritizes creating a welcoming and child-friendly environment, ensuring that young patients receive the best possible care.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA key differentiator for DR NEHA ROY is the personalized approach to patient care. Every patient is treated as an individual, with care plans tailored to their specific needs and circumstances. DR NEHA ROY takes the time to listen to her patients, understand their concerns, and provide clear and concise explanations. This patient-centered approach fosters trust and empowers patients to actively participate in their own healthcare journey. Furthermore, the practice actively incorporates traditional Assamese healing practices, where appropriate and evidence-based, alongside modern medical treatments. This integration reflects a respect for local culture and a commitment to providing holistic care that addresses both the physical and mental well-being of patients.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer service is paramount at DR NEHA ROY. The practice strives to create a welcoming and comfortable environment for all patients. Staff members are trained to be friendly, helpful, and responsive to patient needs. DR NEHA ROY understands the importance of accessibility, and strives to be readily available to answer patient questions and address their concerns. In a region where building rapport is key, the business invests in building lasting relationships with patients and their families. DR NEHA ROY actively engages with the local community through health awareness campaigns, workshops, and outreach programs. This commitment to community involvement demonstrates a dedication to improving the overall health and well-being of the people in Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, DR NEHA ROY envisions expanding its services to meet the evolving healthcare needs of the community. Future plans may include incorporating telemedicine services to improve accessibility for patients in remote areas, adding specialized medical expertise to the team, and establishing partnerships with other healthcare providers to offer a wider range of services. DR NEHA ROY is committed to staying at the forefront of medical advancements and continuously improving the quality of care provided. The long-term goal is to establish DR NEHA ROY as a leading healthcare provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, compassion, and community engagement. This growth will be strategically managed to ensure that the personalized, patient-centric approach that defines the practice remains at the heart of its operations. The vision is to contribute significantly to the health and well-being of the people of Assam for many years to come.', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:20:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(990, 'Psychology Meditation Ayurved centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><strong>Psychology Meditation Ayurved Centre: A Holistic Approach to Well-being in Assam</strong></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, the Psychology Meditation Ayurved Centre offers a unique and integrated approach to mental, emotional, and physical well-being. Recognizing the inherent interconnectedness of the mind, body, and spirit, the centre provides a comprehensive suite of services rooted in the principles of modern psychology, ancient meditation techniques, and traditional Ayurvedic practices. More than just a clinic or a wellness retreat, the Psychology Meditation Ayurved Centre aims to be a sanctuary, a space for healing, growth, and self-discovery, contributing significantly to the burgeoning wellness landscape of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our presence addresses a critical need within the local community. Assam, like many other regions, faces increasing challenges related to stress, anxiety, and lifestyle-related health issues. While conventional medical treatments are often necessary, they don\'t always address the root causes of these problems. The Psychology Meditation Ayurved Centre bridges this gap by offering holistic solutions that empower individuals to take control of their well-being, fostering resilience and promoting long-term health.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Core Services and Products</strong></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Centre\'s core offerings are designed to cater to a diverse range of needs and preferences, encompassing three key pillars: Psychological Counseling, Meditation & Mindfulness Training, and Ayurvedic Consultations & Therapies.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Psychological Counseling:</strong> Our team of qualified and experienced psychologists provides individual, couples, and group therapy sessions. We address a wide array of mental health concerns, including anxiety disorders, depression, stress management, trauma recovery, and relationship issues. Employing evidence-based therapeutic modalities, such as Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT), Acceptance and Commitment Therapy (ACT), and mindfulness-based approaches, we empower clients to develop coping mechanisms, build self-awareness, and achieve lasting emotional well-being. A key differentiator is our culturally sensitive approach, tailoring therapeutic interventions to resonate with the unique experiences and values of the Assamese community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Meditation & Mindfulness Training:</strong> We offer a variety of meditation and mindfulness programs suitable for beginners and experienced practitioners alike. These programs include guided meditations, mindfulness workshops, and retreats, focusing on techniques to cultivate present moment awareness, reduce stress, improve focus, and enhance overall mental clarity. Our instructors are trained in diverse meditation traditions, adapting the teachings to be accessible and relevant to modern lifestyles. We also offer specialized programs for specific populations, such as stress management for students and mindfulness for corporate professionals.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Ayurvedic Consultations & Therapies:</strong> Grounded in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, our certified Ayurvedic practitioners provide personalized consultations to assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). Based on these assessments, they recommend customized lifestyle modifications, dietary guidelines, herbal remedies, and therapeutic treatments. Our Ayurvedic therapies include Abhyanga (oil massage), Shirodhara (oil stream therapy), and Panchakarma (detoxification program), aimed at restoring balance, promoting rejuvenation, and preventing disease. We source high-quality Ayurvedic herbs and products, ensuring their authenticity and efficacy.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The unique selling proposition of the Psychology Meditation Ayurved Centre lies in its integrated approach. We seamlessly blend psychological insights, meditative practices, and Ayurvedic principles to create a holistic healing experience. This comprehensive approach addresses the interconnectedness of mind, body, and spirit, leading to more profound and sustainable well-being. We stand apart by recognizing that true healing requires attending to all aspects of an individual\'s being.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Customer Experience</strong></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the Psychology Meditation Ayurved Centre, we prioritize creating a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment for our clients. From the moment someone enters our center, they are greeted with empathy and respect. Our staff is trained to provide exceptional customer service, ensuring that every individual feels heard, understood, and valued. We maintain strict confidentiality and adhere to ethical guidelines, creating a safe and trusting space for clients to explore their inner selves.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through workshops, seminars, and outreach programs. These initiatives aim to raise awareness about mental health, promote stress management techniques, and educate people about the benefits of Ayurveda. By participating in local events and collaborating with community organizations, we strive to build strong relationships and contribute to the overall well-being of the region. We also leverage social media platforms to share informative content, connect with our audience, and build a strong online community. Our commitment to providing culturally sensitive and accessible services further strengthens our connection with the local population.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Future Vision</strong></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Psychology Meditation Ayurved Centre envisions becoming a leading wellness destination in Assam, renowned for its integrated and holistic approach to well-being. Our future plans include expanding our team of professionals, offering a wider range of specialized services, and developing innovative programs tailored to the specific needs of the community. We are also exploring opportunities to collaborate with local healthcare providers to integrate our services into mainstream healthcare. Long-term, we aspire to establish a residential wellness retreat, offering immersive and transformative experiences that promote lasting health and well-being. By continuously striving for excellence and remaining committed to our core values, we believe that the Psychology Meditation Ayurved Centre can play a vital role in fostering a healthier, happier, and more balanced society in Assam.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:20:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(991, 'Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan, deeply rooted in the rich tradition of Ayurveda, serves as a beacon of holistic wellness in Assam. More than just a purveyor of Ayurvedic products and services, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan strives to be a trusted partner in the community\'s journey towards balanced health and well-being. Situated at [Address - Insert Actual Address Here], the Bhawan occupies a unique position within the local business landscape, offering time-tested, natural solutions in a region where traditional healing practices hold significant cultural value. It differentiates itself by providing authentic Ayurvedic remedies, personalized consultations, and a commitment to educating the community about the principles of Ayurveda. This dedication positions Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan as a vital resource for individuals seeking natural alternatives to conventional healthcare.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan’s offerings are a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic products and services. The Bhawan boasts a diverse selection of herbal medicines, classical Ayurvedic formulations, and proprietary products crafted with meticulously sourced ingredients. These offerings span various health categories, addressing common ailments such as digestive issues, respiratory problems, skin conditions, and joint pain. A key differentiator is the Bhawan’s emphasis on quality control and adherence to traditional Ayurvedic manufacturing practices. Furthermore, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan provides personalized Ayurvedic consultations conducted by experienced practitioners. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti), leading to tailored recommendations for diet, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies. This personalized approach ensures that customers receive solutions that are specifically suited to their needs, maximizing the potential for effective healing and improved well-being. Given the increasing awareness of natural health solutions and the prevalence of lifestyle-related diseases in the region, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan\'s services directly address a significant market need.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan places paramount importance on creating a positive and supportive customer experience. The Bhawan fosters a welcoming atmosphere where individuals feel comfortable seeking guidance and support on their wellness journey. The staff is committed to providing knowledgeable and empathetic service, taking the time to understand each customer\'s concerns and providing clear, concise explanations of Ayurvedic principles and treatment options. This dedication to customer service extends beyond the point of sale, with follow-up consultations and ongoing support offered to ensure that customers achieve optimal results. Moreover, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan actively engages with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness of Ayurveda and empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards their health. By building strong relationships with its customers and actively participating in community initiatives, Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan has cultivated a reputation as a trusted and reliable source of Ayurvedic wisdom and natural healing.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan is one of sustainable growth and expanded impact. Building upon its established foundation, the Bhawan aims to further solidify its position as a leading provider of Ayurvedic solutions in Assam and beyond. Strategic initiatives include expanding the product line to encompass a wider range of Ayurvedic formulations and wellness products, catering to evolving customer needs. There are also plans to enhance the consultation services by incorporating modern diagnostic techniques and integrating them with traditional Ayurvedic assessments. Exploration of partnerships with local healthcare providers and wellness centers to integrate Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare offerings is also underway. Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan intends to leverage digital platforms to reach a broader audience, providing online consultations, educational resources, and convenient access to its products. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish Pareek Ayurvedic Bhawan as a center of excellence for Ayurvedic education, research, and practice, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition for generations to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 63258', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:20:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(992, 'Sharma Ayurvedic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Sharma Ayurvedic stands as a beacon of traditional healing and wellness within the vibrant business landscape of Assam. Rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, this establishment offers a comprehensive approach to health, emphasizing preventative care and natural remedies. Positioned to address the growing interest in holistic well-being and traditional medicine, Sharma Ayurvedic provides authentic Ayurvedic treatments and products designed to harmonize the mind, body, and spirit. Its commitment to quality, authenticity, and personalized care sets it apart, making it a valuable resource for the local community seeking natural and sustainable paths to health.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Sharma Ayurvedic\'s offerings are a diverse range of services and products meticulously crafted to address a spectrum of health concerns. These include personalized Ayurvedic consultations that assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to create tailored treatment plans. Therapeutic massages, or Abhyanga, utilizing herbal-infused oils, form a cornerstone of the practice, promoting relaxation, detoxification, and improved circulation. Furthermore, Sharma Ayurvedic offers Shirodhara, a deeply relaxing treatment involving the gentle pouring of warm oil over the forehead, known for its calming effects on the nervous system and its ability to alleviate stress and anxiety. Beyond treatments, Sharma Ayurvedic provides a curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic products, including herbal supplements, medicinal oils, skincare products, and teas. These products are sourced and formulated based on traditional Ayurvedic principles, ensuring purity and efficacy. A key differentiator is the emphasis on using locally sourced herbs and ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and contributing to the sustainability of the business. This commitment to local resources not only ensures freshness and quality but also strengthens ties within the community. By offering a blend of personalized treatments and high-quality products, Sharma Ayurvedic caters to the growing demand for natural and holistic healthcare solutions in the region, providing a viable alternative to conventional medicine for those seeking preventative and complementary approaches to wellness.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Sharma Ayurvedic prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every client. The approach to customer service is deeply rooted in empathy and understanding, recognizing that each individual\'s health journey is unique. Initial consultations are conducted with thoroughness and care, ensuring that practitioners gain a comprehensive understanding of the client\'s health history, lifestyle, and goals. This personalized approach extends beyond the consultation room, with ongoing support and guidance provided to help clients integrate Ayurvedic principles into their daily lives. What truly distinguishes Sharma Ayurvedic is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its clients and the wider community. Regular workshops and educational seminars are organized to disseminate knowledge about Ayurveda, empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards managing their health. Furthermore, Sharma Ayurvedic actively participates in local health fairs and community events, offering free consultations and promoting awareness about the benefits of Ayurveda. This community engagement fosters trust and strengthens the bond between the business and the local population, solidifying Sharma Ayurvedic\'s position as a trusted resource for holistic health.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Sharma Ayurvedic envisions significant growth and expansion, driven by a steadfast commitment to its core values and a dedication to serving the evolving needs of the community. A key element of this vision is expanding the range of Ayurvedic treatments offered, potentially incorporating specialized therapies for specific conditions and age groups. Furthermore, there are plans to enhance the product line, introducing new formulations based on traditional Ayurvedic recipes and incorporating innovative approaches to product development. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with local healthcare providers and wellness centers is also a priority, aiming to integrate Ayurvedic practices into mainstream healthcare settings. This collaboration could involve offering Ayurvedic consultations and therapies within hospitals or partnering with wellness centers to provide comprehensive health programs. Long-term, Sharma Ayurvedic aspires to establish itself as a leading center for Ayurvedic education and research in the region, contributing to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition. This could involve offering training programs for aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners and conducting research on the efficacy of Ayurvedic treatments. Ultimately, Sharma Ayurvedic is committed to expanding its reach and impact, empowering more individuals to embrace the transformative power of Ayurveda and achieve optimal health and well-being. The long-term goal is not just business growth, but also to contribute significantly to the health and wellness of the Assam community, making traditional Ayurvedic care accessible and trusted.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '078968 77659', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:25:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(993, 'Dr Hameed Ibrahim Khokar - Kerala Ayurveda- Sexologist & Infertility Specialist', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>Dr. Hameed Ibrahim Khokar - Kerala Ayurveda- Sexologist & Infertility Specialist: Nurturing Wellness Through Ancient Wisdom</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Located on the ground floor of Himalaya Ayurveda Harendra Kusum Arcade, near Boripara Road, at the Bus Stop, Dr. Hameed Ibrahim Khokar\'s clinic stands as a beacon of hope and healing, offering specialized Ayurvedic treatments for sexual health and infertility. Rooted in the ancient wisdom of Kerala Ayurveda, the clinic provides a holistic and personalized approach to wellness, addressing the underlying causes of health concerns rather than merely alleviating symptoms. In the local Assam business landscape, Dr. Khokar’s practice carves a unique niche by seamlessly blending traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern diagnostic techniques, making specialized healthcare accessible and culturally relevant.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core of Dr. Khokar\'s practice lies in the provision of specialized Ayurvedic consultations and treatments tailored to individual needs. The primary services offered include comprehensive sexual health assessments, personalized treatment plans for sexual dysfunctions (such as erectile dysfunction, premature ejaculation, and low libido), and holistic fertility treatments for both men and women. Utilizing traditional Kerala Ayurvedic therapies, such as Panchakarma, herbal remedies, and lifestyle modifications, Dr. Khokar addresses a range of conditions, aiming to restore balance and vitality. A key differentiator is the emphasis on understanding the patient\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to formulate highly personalized treatment strategies. This personalized approach ensures optimal efficacy and minimizes potential side effects, a significant advantage over conventional medical practices that often follow a more generalized approach. The clinic fulfills a critical need in the local market by offering a natural and holistic alternative for individuals seeking to address sexual health concerns and infertility issues, often stigmatized or inadequately addressed by mainstream healthcare systems.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Dr. Khokar\'s clinic prioritizes creating a compassionate and supportive environment where patients feel comfortable discussing sensitive health issues. The approach to customer service is centered around building trust and fostering open communication. Every patient interaction, from the initial consultation to follow-up appointments, is conducted with utmost respect and confidentiality. The clinic distinguishes itself through its commitment to patient education, empowering individuals to actively participate in their healing journey. Patients receive detailed explanations of their condition, treatment options, and lifestyle recommendations, enabling them to make informed decisions about their health. Connecting with the local community is paramount, and the clinic actively participates in health awareness campaigns and workshops to promote the benefits of Ayurveda and educate the public on preventive healthcare measures. This proactive engagement demonstrates a genuine commitment to the well-being of the community beyond the confines of the clinic.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Dr. Khokar envisions expanding the clinic\'s reach and impact by incorporating advanced diagnostic tools and treatment modalities while staying true to the core principles of Kerala Ayurveda. Future plans include the introduction of specialized Ayurvedic programs for stress management, weight management, and geriatric care, further diversifying the clinic\'s offerings and catering to the evolving needs of the community. A long-term goal is to establish a comprehensive Ayurvedic wellness center that integrates traditional healing practices with modern amenities, providing a holistic sanctuary for individuals seeking to enhance their overall well-being. Furthermore, Dr. Khokar aims to collaborate with local healthcare providers and institutions to promote the integration of Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare, fostering a more comprehensive and patient-centered approach to medicine. This vision reflects a commitment to not only individual healing but also to the advancement of Ayurveda as a valuable healthcare modality in the region.</p>', 'GROUND FLOOR, HIMALAYA AYURVEDA HARENDRA KUSUM ARCADE, BUS STOP, near Boripara Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '099952 02100', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:25:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(994, 'Dr Chandrama Kalita | Senior Ayurvedic Doctor', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>Dr. Chandrama Kalita | Senior Ayurvedic Doctor: Restoring Wellness Through Ancient Wisdom</b></p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled within the serene surroundings of Chitraban Enclave, Apollo Clinic on Zoo Road, RG Baruah Rd, Dr. Chandrama Kalita’s practice represents a unique fusion of traditional Ayurvedic principles and contemporary healthcare needs. As a senior Ayurvedic doctor, Dr. Kalita brings years of experience and deep-rooted knowledge to the Assam business landscape, offering personalized and holistic healthcare solutions. In a region where traditional medicine holds significant cultural relevance, Dr. Kalita\'s practice serves as a vital resource, providing accessible and authentic Ayurvedic care to the local community and beyond. The practice distinguishes itself by its commitment to individualized treatment plans, emphasizing preventative care and empowering patients to take an active role in their well-being. It fills a crucial gap in the market by providing a trusted and reputable source for authentic Ayurvedic consultations and therapies, catering to the growing demand for natural and holistic approaches to health.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Dr. Kalita\'s practice offers a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic services designed to address a wide spectrum of health concerns. The core services include in-depth Ayurvedic consultations, personalized dietary and lifestyle recommendations, herbal remedies, and specialized therapies. Consultations involve a thorough assessment of the patient\'s overall health, taking into account their physical, mental, and emotional well-being, along with a detailed examination of their \'Prakriti\' (constitution) and \'Vikriti\' (imbalance). Based on this assessment, Dr. Kalita develops customized treatment plans that incorporate dietary adjustments, lifestyle modifications, and the prescription of Ayurvedic herbs and formulations. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing high-quality, authentic herbs, ensuring the efficacy and safety of the remedies. Furthermore, the practice offers specialized Ayurvedic therapies, such as Panchakarma, a detoxification and rejuvenation program designed to eliminate toxins and restore balance to the body. These therapies are tailored to individual needs and administered under Dr. Kalita\'s expert supervision. The practice stands out by integrating traditional knowledge with modern diagnostic tools, providing patients with a comprehensive and evidence-based approach to Ayurvedic care. This integration addresses the local market\'s desire for both traditional healing methods and the reassurance of modern medical understanding.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Dr. Chandrama Kalita\'s practice, the patient experience is paramount. From the moment a patient enters the clinic, they are greeted with warmth and empathy, creating a welcoming and supportive environment. Dr. Kalita believes in building strong doctor-patient relationships based on trust, open communication, and mutual respect. Consultations are conducted with patience and attentiveness, ensuring that patients feel heard and understood. The practice emphasizes patient education, empowering individuals to make informed decisions about their health and well-being. Follow-up care is an integral part of the treatment process, with regular check-ins and ongoing support provided to ensure optimal outcomes. The practice actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars, promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and empowering individuals to adopt healthier lifestyles. By participating in local events and collaborating with community organizations, the practice demonstrates its commitment to serving the health needs of the region. This proactive approach to community engagement fosters trust and solidifies the practice\'s reputation as a reliable and caring healthcare provider. The focus on personalized attention, holistic care, and community involvement sets Dr. Kalita\'s practice apart, creating a truly exceptional patient experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Dr. Chandrama Kalita envisions expanding the practice to reach a wider audience and further promote the benefits of Ayurveda. Future plans include offering online consultations to cater to patients in remote areas and establishing collaborations with other healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream medical practice. The long-term goal is to establish a comprehensive Ayurvedic wellness center that offers a full range of services, including consultations, therapies, educational programs, and a retail outlet for authentic Ayurvedic products. This wellness center would serve as a hub for promoting Ayurvedic knowledge and practices, contributing to the overall health and well-being of the community. Dr. Kalita is also committed to continuing her professional development, staying abreast of the latest research and advancements in the field of Ayurveda. By embracing innovation while staying true to the core principles of Ayurveda, Dr. Kalita aims to establish her practice as a leading center for Ayurvedic care in Assam and beyond. The vision is to not only provide high-quality healthcare services but also to empower individuals to live healthier, more balanced lives through the wisdom of Ayurveda.</p>', 'Chitraban Enclave, Apollo Clinic, Zoo Road, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '075779 44444', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:25:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
