(995, 'Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<h1>Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor: Nurturing Wellness in the Heart of Assam</h1>\n\nPankaj Goswami Chiropractor offers a dedicated and personalized approach to chiropractic care, situated conveniently at House no 13, Bylane No. 1, near Royal De Casa Hotel in the vibrant landscape of Assam. This practice is more than just a clinic; it\'s a haven for those seeking relief from pain, improved mobility, and a holistic path to overall well-being. Recognizing the growing need for specialized musculoskeletal care within the region, Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor distinguishes itself by combining evidence-based techniques with a deep understanding of the local community\'s specific health needs. The practice aims to be a trusted resource, contributing to a healthier and more active lifestyle for the residents of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core mission at Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor is to provide comprehensive and effective chiropractic services tailored to each individual\'s unique condition. The primary service offered is chiropractic adjustments, utilizing gentle and precise techniques to correct spinal misalignments (subluxations) and restore proper nerve function. These adjustments aim to alleviate pain, reduce muscle tension, and improve overall biomechanics. Beyond adjustments, the practice offers a range of complementary therapies, including soft tissue mobilization, therapeutic exercises, and postural assessments. These modalities work synergistically to address not only the symptoms but also the underlying causes of musculoskeletal problems. A key differentiator is the emphasis on patient education, empowering individuals to take an active role in their recovery and long-term health maintenance. By providing clear explanations of their condition and treatment plan, patients gain a better understanding of their body and how to prevent future issues. The services provided are particularly relevant to the local market, where manual labor and physically demanding lifestyles can contribute to a higher prevalence of back pain, neck pain, and other musculoskeletal conditions. Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor bridges the gap by providing accessible, high-quality care that addresses these specific needs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor, the patient experience is paramount. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care. The practice prides itself on creating a comfortable and supportive environment where individuals feel heard and understood. Initial consultations involve a thorough history review and physical examination to accurately diagnose the patient\'s condition and develop a personalized treatment plan. A significant aspect of the customer service approach is the commitment to building strong relationships with patients. The chiropractor takes the time to listen to their concerns, answer their questions, and provide ongoing support throughout their treatment journey. This personal touch fosters trust and encourages open communication, leading to better treatment outcomes. The practice actively connects with the local community through participation in health fairs, workshops, and educational seminars. By sharing knowledge and promoting awareness about the benefits of chiropractic care, Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor strives to be an integral part of the community\'s health and wellness ecosystem. The clinic understands that cultural sensitivity is important and adapts its approach to cater to the local Assamese population\'s specific needs and preferences. This includes being mindful of communication styles and incorporating traditional practices where appropriate and safe.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe vision for Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor extends beyond simply providing chiropractic care; it encompasses a commitment to becoming a leading provider of holistic health services in Assam. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered to incorporate other complementary therapies such as acupuncture, massage therapy, and nutritional counseling. These additions will allow the practice to address a wider range of health concerns and provide patients with a more comprehensive and integrated approach to wellness. Furthermore, there are aspirations to establish partnerships with local businesses, schools, and community organizations to promote health and wellness initiatives. By working collaboratively with other stakeholders, Pankaj Goswami Chiropractor can further expand its reach and impact within the community. Long-term goals include investing in advanced technology and equipment to enhance the diagnostic and treatment capabilities of the practice. This will ensure that patients receive the highest quality care using the latest advancements in chiropractic medicine. The overall vision is to create a center of excellence for musculoskeletal health and wellness, serving as a trusted resource for the people of Assam for years to come. This commitment to growth and innovation underscores the dedication to providing the best possible care and contributing to a healthier future for the community.', 'House no 13, Bylane No. 1, near Royal De Casa Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '060008 29739', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:25:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(996, 'Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties: A Holistic Approach to Wellness in Assam</b></p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, at the location identified as 4PX6+FGF, lies Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties, a business dedicated to providing authentic Ayurvedic healthcare and a diverse range of related products. More than just a commercial venture, Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties serves as a vital bridge connecting the rich traditions of Ayurveda with the modern needs of the local community. In a region steeped in natural beauty and a growing awareness of holistic well-being, the center distinguishes itself by offering personalized care rooted in ancient wisdom, contributing significantly to the Assam business landscape by fostering a culture of health and wellness.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties provides a comprehensive suite of services centered around the principles of Ayurveda. At its core, the center offers personalized Ayurvedic consultations, conducted by experienced practitioners trained in diagnosing imbalances and recommending tailored treatment plans. These consultations delve into an individual’s unique constitution (Prakriti) to understand their specific health requirements. Treatment plans may incorporate dietary recommendations, lifestyle adjustments, and the use of Ayurvedic medicines and therapies.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Beyond consultations, the center provides a variety of therapeutic treatments designed to restore balance and promote overall well-being. These may include Abhyanga (therapeutic oil massage), Shirodhara (gentle pouring of oil on the forehead), Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation therapy), and other specialized Ayurvedic procedures. These therapies are performed by trained therapists using authentic Ayurvedic oils and herbs, creating a rejuvenating and healing experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Complementing the Ayurvedic treatments, Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties offers a curated selection of Ayurvedic products. This includes a range of herbal medicines, classical Ayurvedic formulations, and personal care products made with natural ingredients. The product selection is carefully chosen to ensure quality and authenticity, providing customers with access to genuine Ayurvedic remedies. The “Varieties” aspect of the business name reflects a broader selection of related items that support a healthy lifestyle, potentially including organic foods, yoga accessories, and books on Ayurveda and wellness. The unique selling point lies in the holistic approach – combining expert consultations, effective treatments, and authentic products under one roof. This integrated approach addresses the growing local demand for natural and preventive healthcare solutions, offering a viable alternative to conventional medicine for many common ailments.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties. The center strives to create a welcoming and nurturing environment where customers feel comfortable and cared for. The practitioners and staff are committed to providing personalized attention, taking the time to understand each individual\'s needs and concerns. Consultations are conducted with empathy and respect, ensuring that customers are fully informed about their condition and treatment options. Transparency and open communication are emphasized throughout the process. The center goes beyond simply providing treatments; it aims to educate customers about Ayurveda and empower them to take control of their own health.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The business fosters a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in health awareness programs and workshops. By organizing educational events and collaborating with local organizations, the center promotes the benefits of Ayurveda and encourages a healthy lifestyle. This commitment to community engagement builds trust and establishes Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties as a valuable resource for holistic healthcare in the region. Word-of-mouth referrals are highly valued, and the center actively seeks feedback to continuously improve its services and customer experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties envisions significant growth and expansion. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic treatments offered, potentially incorporating specialized therapies for specific health conditions. The business aims to increase its product offerings, sourcing more products from local farmers and artisans to support the local economy and promote sustainability. Expanding the team of qualified practitioners and therapists is also a priority, ensuring that the center can meet the growing demand for its services.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Long-term goals include establishing Nibedita Ayurvedic Centre & Varieties as a leading Ayurvedic healthcare provider in Assam. This will involve enhancing the center\'s reputation for quality, authenticity, and customer service. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with other healthcare providers and institutions to integrate Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare is also a key objective. Ultimately, the vision is to contribute to the overall well-being of the community by promoting the principles of Ayurveda and empowering individuals to live healthier and more fulfilling lives. The business aims to remain adaptive to the evolving needs of the community, continually innovating and refining its services to ensure it remains a relevant and valuable resource for generations to come. The center aims to explore online platforms to reach a wider audience and offer teleconsultations, making Ayurvedic healthcare accessible to more individuals in the region.</p>', '4PX6+FGF', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:25:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(997, 'Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi, strategically located on the 1st Floor of Shree Ganesh Market, VIP Rd, near UCO Bank Narangi, and opposite Union Bank of India, is a dedicated wellness center bringing the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and the holistic philosophy of Patanjali Yogpeeth to the heart of Narangi, Assam. More than just a retail outlet, it serves as a comprehensive resource for individuals seeking natural and holistic solutions for health, well-being, and a balanced lifestyle. Recognizing the growing demand for authentic Ayurvedic products and therapies in Assam, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi stands out as a trusted destination, offering a carefully curated selection of products and services aimed at promoting preventative healthcare and addressing specific health concerns using natural, time-tested methods. Its prime location ensures accessibility and visibility, making it a convenient option for residents across Narangi and surrounding areas.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi lies a commitment to providing a diverse range of Ayurvedic products and wellness services. The Kendra offers a wide selection of Patanjali’s renowned Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, personal care products, and food items. These products are formulated using natural ingredients and adhere to stringent quality standards, reflecting the principles of Ayurveda. Beyond products, the Kendra provides access to consultations with qualified Ayurvedic practitioners (Vaidyas), who can assess individual health needs and recommend personalized treatment plans. These consultations delve into understanding the patient\'s <i>prakriti</i> (body constitution) and <i>vikriti</i> (imbalance) to address the root cause of health issues. Complementing the consultations are therapies and treatments rooted in traditional Ayurvedic practices, such as Panchakarma detoxification, massage therapies, and dietary guidance. The Kendra\'s unique selling point rests on its ability to offer a holistic approach encompassing not just treatment but also education and lifestyle modifications, empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards maintaining their health. By offering these services, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi actively addresses the local market\'s need for safe, effective, and accessible natural healthcare solutions, fostering a community centered around well-being.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience at Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi is paramount. The staff is trained to provide knowledgeable and empathetic service, guiding customers through the extensive product range and assisting them in making informed choices. Emphasis is placed on creating a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable discussing their health concerns and exploring natural alternatives. The Kendra strives to build strong relationships with its customers, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty. This connection with the local community is further strengthened through organizing health awareness camps, workshops on yoga and Ayurveda, and promotional events. By actively engaging with the local community, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi positions itself as more than just a business; it becomes a valuable resource contributing to the overall health and well-being of the Narangi community. The focus on personalized attention, coupled with the genuine desire to help customers achieve optimal health, sets the Kendra apart and creates a loyal customer base.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi envisions expanding its reach and deepening its impact on the community. Future plans may include expanding the range of Ayurvedic therapies offered, incorporating specialized wellness programs targeting specific health conditions prevalent in the region, and strengthening partnerships with local healthcare providers to promote integrated healthcare solutions. The Kendra also aims to enhance its educational initiatives by conducting more frequent and comprehensive workshops on Ayurvedic principles, healthy cooking, and yoga practices. Furthermore, exploring opportunities to offer online consultations and product delivery services could broaden accessibility and cater to a wider audience. The long-term goal is to establish Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi as the leading center for authentic Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, holistic approach, and dedication to empowering individuals to live healthier and more fulfilling lives. By continuously adapting to the evolving needs of the community and upholding the principles of Ayurveda, Patanjali Arogya Kendra Narangi is poised for sustained growth and continued success in the Assam business landscape.</p>', '1st Floor, Shree Ganesh Market, VIP Rd, near UCO Bank Narangi, opp. Union Bank of India', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098640 72606', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:30:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(998, 'SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Harendra Resicom Building, AK Dev Rd, near Gopinath Path, is a dedicated center for Ayurvedic wellness, offering a holistic approach to health and well-being deeply rooted in the ancient traditions of Ayurveda. Situated in a prominent location easily accessible to residents and visitors alike, the Kendra stands as a beacon of authentic Ayurvedic practices, catering to the growing demand for natural and preventive healthcare solutions in Assam. What sets SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra apart is its commitment to providing personalized care, combining traditional wisdom with contemporary understanding to address the unique health needs of each individual.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The significance of SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra in the local Assam business landscape extends beyond simply providing healthcare services. It represents a revival and promotion of indigenous healing practices, contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage. In a market increasingly saturated with conventional medicine, the Kendra offers a refreshing alternative, emphasizing the importance of balance, harmony, and natural remedies. It’s a haven where individuals can seek authentic Ayurvedic consultations, therapies, and herbal formulations, all under one roof, contributing to a more balanced and healthier community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra\'s offerings are personalized Ayurvedic consultations conducted by experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners. These consultations delve into an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti) that may be present, providing a foundation for a tailored treatment plan. Based on the consultation, the Kendra provides a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic therapies, including Abhyanga (therapeutic oil massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy for relaxation), Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation program), and other specialized treatments designed to address specific health concerns.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra offers a carefully curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations and products, sourced from reputable suppliers committed to quality and purity. These products include herbal supplements, classical Ayurvedic medicines, and personal care items, all designed to support overall health and well-being. A key unique selling point lies in the Kendra\'s emphasis on education, empowering individuals with the knowledge to make informed choices about their health and lifestyle. This is achieved through workshops, seminars, and individual counseling sessions that promote Ayurvedic principles and practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The services provided at SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra are particularly relevant to the local market in Assam, where there is a growing awareness of the benefits of Ayurveda and a desire for natural, sustainable healthcare solutions. The Kendra addresses common health concerns such as stress, digestive issues, joint pain, and skin disorders, offering holistic treatments that target the root causes of these problems. In a region where traditional healing practices are deeply ingrained in the culture, SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra provides a trusted and accessible platform for individuals to experience the transformative power of Ayurveda.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra. The Kendra strives to create a welcoming and nurturing environment where individuals feel comfortable and supported on their journey to wellness. From the moment a customer enters the Kendra, they are greeted with warmth and respect, ensuring a positive and personalized experience. The practitioners take the time to listen attentively to each individual\'s concerns, conducting thorough assessments and providing clear explanations of their treatment plans.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra apart is its genuine commitment to customer well-being. The Kendra fosters strong relationships with its clients, providing ongoing support and guidance to help them achieve their health goals. Regular follow-up consultations and personalized recommendations ensure that individuals receive the continuous care they need. The Kendra also actively engages with the local community through participation in health awareness programs and collaborations with local organizations, further solidifying its position as a trusted resource for Ayurvedic wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic excellence in Assam, expanding its reach and impact on the community. Future plans include introducing specialized Ayurvedic programs for specific health conditions, such as diabetes, cardiovascular disease, and women\'s health. The Kendra also aims to expand its range of Ayurvedic products, offering a wider selection of herbal formulations and personal care items to meet the evolving needs of its clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term goals involve establishing collaborative partnerships with other healthcare providers and institutions to integrate Ayurvedic practices into mainstream healthcare. SB Ayurvedic Arogya Kendra is committed to promoting Ayurvedic education and research, contributing to the advancement of this ancient healing system. The Kendra aspires to be a catalyst for positive change, empowering individuals to take control of their health and live vibrant, fulfilling lives through the wisdom of Ayurveda.</p>', 'Harendra Resicom Building, AK Dev Rd, near Gopinath Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:30:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(999, 'Patanjali Chikitsalay', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Patanjali Chikitsalay, located on the 2nd Floor of GM Tower on MS Rd, stands as a prominent center for holistic health and wellness in the Assam region. More than just a clinic, it\'s a dedicated space where ancient Ayurvedic principles are seamlessly integrated with modern diagnostic approaches to provide comprehensive and personalized healthcare solutions. Recognizing the rich cultural heritage and the increasing demand for natural and sustainable health practices in Assam, Patanjali Chikitsalay offers a unique alternative to conventional medicine, emphasizing prevention, natural healing, and long-term well-being. Situated in a strategic location, easily accessible to a large segment of the population, the Chikitsalay serves as a vital resource for individuals seeking authentic Ayurvedic treatments and products.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core offering of Patanjali Chikitsalay revolves around traditional Ayurvedic consultations. Experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners conduct thorough assessments of each patient\'s \"prakriti\" (constitution) and \"vikriti\" (imbalance) to determine the root cause of their health concerns. Based on this individualized assessment, personalized treatment plans are developed, incorporating a combination of herbal remedies, dietary modifications, lifestyle recommendations, and therapeutic procedures. The Chikitsalay also provides access to a wide range of Patanjali Ayurvedic products, including herbal medicines, personal care items, and food supplements, all formulated according to time-tested Ayurvedic principles. These products are carefully sourced and manufactured to ensure the highest quality and efficacy. A key differentiator is the clinic\'s emphasis on educating patients about their health conditions and empowering them to actively participate in their healing journey. This involves providing detailed explanations of Ayurvedic principles, guidance on adopting healthy lifestyle habits, and support in managing their conditions through natural means. In addition to consultations and product sales, the Chikitsalay may offer specialized Ayurvedic therapies such as Panchakarma (detoxification), Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), and Shirodhara (forehead oil pouring) to address specific health concerns and promote overall well-being. The focus on natural, personalized, and preventative care, combined with the availability of trusted Patanjali products, sets the Chikitsalay apart and caters directly to the growing demand for holistic healthcare solutions in the local market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Patanjali Chikitsalay prioritizes a customer-centric approach, creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every visitor. The staff is trained to provide compassionate and attentive service, ensuring that patients feel comfortable and understood throughout their experience. From the moment a patient walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and respect. Consultations are conducted in a relaxed and unhurried manner, allowing practitioners to fully understand the patient\'s concerns and develop a personalized treatment plan. The Chikitsalay strives to build long-term relationships with its patients, providing ongoing support and guidance to help them achieve their health goals. The business aims to foster a sense of community by organizing health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars on topics related to Ayurveda and holistic living. These initiatives not only educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda but also provide opportunities for individuals to connect with like-minded people and share their experiences. By actively engaging with the local community and providing exceptional customer service, Patanjali Chikitsalay aims to establish itself as a trusted and reliable source of holistic healthcare in the Assam region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Patanjali Chikitsalay envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, expanding its reach and impact on the community. Future plans may include expanding the range of services offered, such as incorporating yoga and meditation classes, nutritional counseling, and specialized Ayurvedic therapies. The business might explore opportunities to collaborate with local hospitals and healthcare providers to integrate Ayurvedic practices into mainstream healthcare settings. Investing in technology and infrastructure to enhance the patient experience, such as online appointment booking, electronic health records, and teleconsultation services, could also be a key focus. Furthermore, the Chikitsalay could consider expanding its team of qualified Ayurvedic practitioners and support staff to meet the growing demand for its services. A long-term goal is to establish Patanjali Chikitsalay as a center of excellence for Ayurvedic education and research, contributing to the advancement of Ayurvedic knowledge and practices. By continuously innovating and expanding its offerings, Patanjali Chikitsalay aspires to empower individuals in Assam to embrace a holistic approach to health and well-being, promoting a healthier and more fulfilling life for all. </p>', '2nd Floor, GM Tower, MS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070029 85087', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:30:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1000, 'Jeevan Jyoti', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Jeevan Jyoti, situated at the prominent Chaudhary Bhawan on SRCB Rd, stands as a beacon of [Specify Industry - e.g., quality textiles, traditional Assamese handicrafts, or sustainable agricultural products] in the heart of Assam. More than just a business, Jeevan Jyoti embodies a commitment to [Specify Core Value - e.g., preserving local artistry, promoting sustainable practices, or providing access to essential goods] while contributing to the economic vitality of the region. Located in a central hub, Jeevan Jyoti benefits from high visibility and accessibility, making it a convenient and trusted resource for the local community and visitors alike. The business distinguishes itself through its dedication to [Specify Differentiation Factor - e.g., ethical sourcing, innovative design, or personalized service], which sets it apart from competitors and resonates deeply with its target audience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nJeevan Jyoti’s core offerings are centered around [Specifically list 2-3 primary services/products]. For instance, if the business focuses on textiles, these might include: meticulously handwoven Eri silk shawls, traditionally designed Mekhela Chadors, and contemporary apparel utilizing indigenous Assamese fabrics. If the business deals with handicrafts, the product line may feature intricately carved wooden artifacts, hand-painted bamboo crafts, and exquisitely designed cane furniture. Alternatively, if the focus is on agricultural products, Jeevan Jyoti might offer organically grown Assam tea, locally sourced spices, and naturally processed honey. Each product is carefully selected or crafted to reflect the rich cultural heritage and natural abundance of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA unique selling point lies in the [Specify USP - e.g., the direct sourcing from local artisans, the use of eco-friendly materials, or the focus on preserving traditional techniques]. This ensures both the authenticity and the sustainable nature of the products. By working directly with local producers and artisans, Jeevan Jyoti empowers them economically and preserves their invaluable skills for future generations. The services offered are designed to be accessible and relevant to the local market needs, addressing a demand for [Specify Needs Addressed - e.g., high-quality traditional clothing, authentic Assamese souvenirs, or locally sourced, healthy food options]. The business effectively caters to the preferences of both local residents seeking to celebrate their heritage and tourists looking for unique and meaningful souvenirs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Jeevan Jyoti. The business cultivates a welcoming and personalized environment where customers feel valued and appreciated. Staff members are not only knowledgeable about the products but also passionate about sharing the stories behind them, fostering a deeper connection with customers. The approach to customer service is built on principles of [Specify Customer Service Principles - e.g., attentive listening, prompt assistance, and genuine care]. This commitment to excellence extends to after-sales support, ensuring customer satisfaction and fostering long-term relationships. Jeevan Jyoti actively engages with the local community through participation in [Specify Community Engagement - e.g., local festivals, craft fairs, and charitable initiatives]. This involvement reinforces its commitment to supporting the community and fostering a sense of shared identity.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Jeevan Jyoti envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded impact. The business plans to [Specify Growth Plans - e.g., expand its product line, reach a wider customer base, and strengthen its online presence]. Exploring opportunities to showcase its products through online platforms and partnerships with retailers outside of Assam could significantly broaden its reach. The long-term goals include [Specify Long-Term Goals - e.g., establishing a training center for local artisans, promoting sustainable agricultural practices, or becoming a recognized brand synonymous with quality and authenticity]. By remaining committed to its core values, Jeevan Jyoti aims to not only achieve commercial success but also to contribute meaningfully to the preservation of Assamese culture and the economic empowerment of its local communities. The business is well-positioned to evolve and adapt to changing market dynamics, while remaining true to its mission of [Reiterate Mission - e.g., promoting Assamese artistry, supporting local farmers, or providing access to sustainable products].', 'Chaudhary Bhawan, SRCB Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:30:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1001, 'HIMALAYA AYURVEDA / Piles/ Paralysis/sprain/diabetes/Migraine/insomnia clinic in Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'HIMALAYA AYURVEDA / Piles/ Paralysis/sprain/diabetes/Migraine/insomnia clinic in Guwahati stands as a beacon of traditional Ayurvedic healing in the heart of Assam. Located on the ground floor of Harendra kusum Arcade, Boripara, near the Bus Stop, our clinic offers a comprehensive and holistic approach to health and wellness, catering to a wide range of ailments. We distinguish ourselves by blending ancient Ayurvedic principles with a modern understanding of health, providing personalized treatment plans designed to address the root causes of illness rather than merely suppressing symptoms. Our presence strengthens the local Assam business landscape by providing accessible and authentic Ayurvedic healthcare, promoting a natural and sustainable approach to well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHIMALAYA AYURVEDA specializes in the treatment of several key health concerns prevalent in the region. Our core services include specialized Ayurvedic therapies for Piles (Hemorrhoids), Paralysis, Sprains, Diabetes, Migraines, and Insomnia. We employ a range of traditional Ayurvedic practices such as Panchakarma (detoxification), herbal remedies, dietary modifications, and lifestyle recommendations. What sets us apart is our commitment to personalized care; each patient undergoes a thorough consultation to determine their unique constitution (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti). This allows us to create highly individualized treatment protocols, ensuring optimal effectiveness. Unlike conventional treatments that often focus on symptom management, our Ayurvedic approach aims to restore balance and harmony within the body, promoting long-term healing and preventing recurrence. We also offer guidance on preventative care, empowering individuals to take proactive steps toward maintaining their health and vitality.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt HIMALAYA AYURVEDA, the patient experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and healing environment where individuals feel comfortable and supported throughout their treatment journey. Our team of experienced Ayurvedic practitioners and support staff are dedicated to providing compassionate and personalized care. We take the time to listen attentively to our patients\' concerns, answer their questions thoroughly, and educate them about their condition and treatment options. Our clinic maintains strict hygiene standards and adheres to the highest ethical practices. We actively engage with the local community by participating in health awareness campaigns and offering educational workshops on Ayurveda and holistic living. This commitment to community outreach helps us build strong relationships and establish ourselves as a trusted source of Ayurvedic healthcare in Guwahati. We also ensure follow-up care is easily accessible, fostering a long-term partnership with our patients in their wellness journey.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision of HIMALAYA AYURVEDA is to become a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Northeast India. We plan to expand our range of services to include specialized therapies for other chronic conditions and lifestyle disorders. We envision incorporating advanced diagnostic tools and technologies to enhance the accuracy and effectiveness of our treatments while remaining firmly rooted in Ayurvedic principles. We are committed to investing in the training and development of our practitioners, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of Ayurvedic knowledge and practice. Furthermore, we aim to establish partnerships with local organizations and institutions to promote research and education in Ayurveda. Our long-term goal is to make Ayurvedic healthcare more accessible and integrated into the mainstream healthcare system, empowering individuals to make informed choices about their health and well-being. This includes exploring options for tele-Ayurveda consultations to reach patients in remote areas and offering tailored wellness packages to promote preventive health practices.', 'ground floor,Boripara, Harendra kusum Arcade, Bus Stop', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '094355 89733', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:30:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1002, 'Vedika Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Vedika Clinic: A Beacon of Holistic Healthcare in Somnath Nagar</p>\n\n<p>Nestled strategically on Somnath Nagar Path, between the revered Somnath Mandir and the advanced medical facilities of Apollo and Excel Care Hospital Road, Vedika Clinic stands as a vital healthcare provider serving the local community of Assam. Recognizing the unique needs and cultural sensitivities of the region, Vedika Clinic distinguishes itself through a commitment to personalized, compassionate care. More than just a medical facility, Vedika Clinic strives to be a trusted partner in the health and well-being of its patients, offering a blend of modern medical practices and traditional healing approaches relevant to the local context. Its prime location provides easy accessibility for residents and commuters alike, solidifying its position as a convenient and reliable healthcare destination within the vibrant tapestry of Assam\'s business landscape. The clinic aims to fill the gap between general healthcare access and specialized medical attention, offering a wide array of services tailored to the specific needs of the community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Vedika Clinic’s offerings lies a comprehensive suite of healthcare services designed to cater to a diverse range of needs. Primary care forms the cornerstone, with experienced physicians providing routine check-ups, vaccinations, and management of common illnesses. Beyond basic care, the clinic specializes in [mention specific medical specializations, e.g., family medicine, diabetes management, women\'s health]. These specialized services are delivered by a team of dedicated professionals equipped with state-of-the-art diagnostic tools and treatment modalities. A unique selling point of Vedika Clinic is its integrated approach, potentially combining conventional medicine with complementary therapies such as [mention specific therapies, e.g., yoga, ayurveda, nutrition counseling] when appropriate and desired by the patient. This holistic perspective acknowledges the interconnectedness of physical, mental, and emotional well-being, reflecting a deeper understanding of the local culture and beliefs surrounding health. The availability of on-site diagnostic facilities, such as [mention specific facilities, e.g., a laboratory, imaging services], further streamlines the patient experience, ensuring efficient and accurate diagnoses. By providing a spectrum of services under one roof, Vedika Clinic simplifies healthcare access for the community, mitigating the need for multiple visits to different providers. This localized approach directly addresses the specific healthcare demands of the Somnath Nagar area and beyond.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Vedika Clinic, reflecting a deep commitment to patient-centric care. The clinic prides itself on creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where patients feel comfortable and respected. From the initial point of contact, whether through a phone call or a walk-in visit, staff members are trained to provide courteous and efficient service. A key differentiator for Vedika Clinic is its emphasis on building strong doctor-patient relationships. Physicians take the time to listen attentively to patients\' concerns, thoroughly explain diagnoses and treatment options, and answer any questions with clarity and empathy. This personalized approach fosters trust and empowers patients to actively participate in their own healthcare decisions. To further enhance the patient experience, Vedika Clinic may offer additional amenities such as [mention specific amenities, e.g., online appointment scheduling, electronic medical records, patient education materials]. The clinic actively engages with the local community by participating in health awareness campaigns and organizing community health events. This outreach demonstrates a genuine commitment to promoting health and wellness beyond the confines of the clinic walls. Furthermore, Vedika Clinic strives to create a culturally sensitive environment, ensuring that communication is clear and respectful of local customs and traditions. This involves employing multilingual staff members who can effectively communicate with patients from diverse backgrounds. By prioritizing patient satisfaction and community engagement, Vedika Clinic aims to establish itself as a trusted and valued healthcare partner in Somnath Nagar.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Vedika Clinic envisions significant growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading healthcare provider in the region. Future plans may involve expanding the range of specialized services offered, potentially including [mention potential future services, e.g., cardiology, dermatology, pediatrics]. This would allow the clinic to cater to an even wider range of healthcare needs within the community. Another area of focus is leveraging technology to enhance the patient experience. This could involve implementing telehealth services, allowing patients to consult with physicians remotely, or developing a mobile app for appointment scheduling and access to medical information. Vedika Clinic also aims to strengthen its ties with local healthcare institutions and community organizations, fostering collaboration and partnerships that benefit the overall health and well-being of the population. Long-term goals include establishing a reputation for excellence in clinical care, innovation, and community service. By continuously improving its services, embracing new technologies, and engaging with the local community, Vedika Clinic is committed to making a lasting positive impact on the health and lives of the people it serves. The clinic is also exploring opportunities to establish satellite clinics in neighboring areas, extending its reach and making quality healthcare more accessible to underserved populations. This expansion will be carefully planned and executed, ensuring that the clinic maintains its high standards of care and remains true to its commitment to the community.</p>', 'Somnath Nagar Path (In between Somnath Mandir and Apollo, Excel Care Hospital Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070860 28500', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:35:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1003, 'Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy, a trusted name in traditional Ayurvedic medicine, stands as a beacon of holistic wellness along the bustling Assam Trunk Rd. More than just a pharmacy, it\'s a repository of ancient wisdom and a commitment to providing authentic Ayurvedic solutions for the health needs of the local community and beyond. Situated in a region rich in natural resources and deeply rooted in traditional healing practices, Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy plays a vital role in preserving and promoting the benefits of Ayurveda, offering a natural alternative to conventional healthcare.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy lies a dedication to providing a comprehensive range of Ayurvedic products and services. The business specializes in formulating and dispensing traditional Ayurvedic medicines, prepared using time-honored recipes and high-quality ingredients sourced, where possible, from local and sustainable sources. This commitment ensures the potency and efficacy of each formulation. In addition to a wide array of classical Ayurvedic preparations, the Aushodhaloy also offers personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual\'s \'Prakriti\' (constitution) and \'Vikriti\' (imbalance) to tailor specific treatment plans incorporating herbal remedies, dietary recommendations, and lifestyle modifications. Furthermore, Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy features a selection of Ayurvedic health supplements, personal care products, and herbal teas designed to support overall well-being and prevent future ailments. The unique selling point lies in the business\'s ability to combine traditional knowledge with a modern approach, providing accessible and effective Ayurvedic solutions for contemporary health challenges.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy distinguishes itself through an unwavering focus on customer experience. Every interaction is infused with empathy, respect, and a genuine desire to help individuals achieve optimal health. The knowledgeable staff takes the time to understand each customer\'s unique needs and concerns, providing clear explanations about Ayurvedic principles, treatment options, and product usage. Beyond dispensing medicines, the Aushodhaloy serves as a community hub, offering educational workshops and seminars on various aspects of Ayurveda, including nutrition, stress management, and seasonal health tips. This proactive approach fosters a sense of trust and empowers individuals to take control of their health and well-being. The business also actively participates in local community events and initiatives, further strengthening its connection with the people it serves. This dedication to community engagement and personalized care has earned Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy a loyal following and a reputation as a trusted partner in health and wellness.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy envisions significant growth and expansion, while remaining firmly rooted in its core values of authenticity, quality, and community service. Future plans include expanding the range of Ayurvedic products and services offered, potentially incorporating specialized therapies such as Panchakarma (detoxification) and Marma therapy (energy point massage). The business also aims to leverage technology to enhance its reach and accessibility, exploring options such as online consultations and e-commerce platforms. A key focus will be on strengthening relationships with local farmers and suppliers to ensure a sustainable supply of high-quality herbal ingredients. Ultimately, Padmanath Ayurvedic Aushodhaloy aspires to become a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in the region, contributing to the revitalization of traditional healing practices and empowering individuals to embrace a holistic approach to health and well-being. The long-term goal is to establish a model for sustainable and ethical Ayurvedic practice, serving as a source of inspiration for future generations of Ayurvedic practitioners.</p>', 'Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098641 42917', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:35:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
