(1004, 'Apeksha Healthcare & Wellness Centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Apeksha Healthcare & Wellness Centre: Nurturing Holistic Well-being in Assam</p>\n\n<p>Located at 4RP4+7FJ, Apeksha Healthcare & Wellness Centre is a dedicated provider of comprehensive healthcare and wellness solutions, strategically positioned to serve the growing needs of the local community in Assam. More than just a healthcare provider, Apeksha is envisioned as a sanctuary for individuals seeking to enhance their physical, mental, and emotional well-being. Recognizing the unique healthcare challenges and cultural nuances of the region, the centre is committed to delivering personalized and accessible services that promote a healthier and more vibrant community. Apeksha stands out by integrating modern medical practices with traditional wellness philosophies, creating a unique and impactful approach to healthcare delivery in the local Assam business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Health</p>\n\n<p>Apeksha Healthcare & Wellness Centre offers a diverse range of services tailored to meet the specific needs of its clientele. These services encompass several key areas, including: Primary Care & General Consultation: Offering routine check-ups, diagnosis and treatment of common ailments, and preventative care services, ensuring accessible and affordable healthcare for all. Specialized Medical Consultations: Providing access to specialists in areas such as cardiology, dermatology, gynecology, and pediatrics, bringing expert medical care closer to home. Diagnostics & Laboratory Services: Equipped with modern diagnostic equipment, the centre provides accurate and timely diagnostic testing, including blood tests, imaging services, and other essential screenings. Wellness Programs: A cornerstone of Apeksha’s philosophy, these programs focus on promoting overall well-being through yoga and meditation classes, nutritional counseling, stress management workshops, and personalized fitness plans. Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation: Offering comprehensive physiotherapy services to aid in recovery from injuries, manage chronic pain, and improve mobility. Mental Wellness Services: Recognizing the importance of mental health, Apeksha provides counseling services, support groups, and other resources to address mental health concerns and promote emotional well-being. What sets Apeksha apart is its integrated approach, where medical and wellness services are seamlessly combined to provide a holistic and personalized healthcare experience. This focus on preventative care and lifestyle management, alongside traditional medical treatments, caters to the increasing local demand for comprehensive wellness solutions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Trust and Community Connections</p>\n\n<p>At Apeksha Healthcare & Wellness Centre, the patient experience is paramount. The centre prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable and empowered to take charge of their health. Every interaction is guided by principles of empathy, respect, and clear communication. The staff is trained to be attentive to individual needs and to provide personalized care that goes beyond simply treating symptoms. The centre actively solicits feedback from patients to continuously improve its services and ensure that their needs are being met. Apeksha fosters a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives, including health awareness campaigns, free health check-up camps, and partnerships with local organizations. These efforts not only promote health education but also build trust and establish Apeksha as a reliable and engaged member of the community. Moreover, the centre leverages local languages and cultural sensitivity in its communication and service delivery, further strengthening its connection with the community. The dedication to building strong patient relationships, coupled with community engagement, differentiates Apeksha and fosters long-term loyalty.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Growth and Expansion for a Healthier Assam</p>\n\n<p>Apeksha Healthcare & Wellness Centre envisions a future of continued growth and expanded services to better serve the healthcare needs of Assam. The centre aims to broaden its range of specialized medical consultations and diagnostic capabilities, ensuring access to cutting-edge healthcare technologies. Expansion plans include developing specialized wellness programs tailored to address specific health challenges prevalent in the region, such as diabetes management, maternal and child health, and geriatric care. Apeksha also explores the potential for establishing satellite clinics in underserved areas, extending its reach and making healthcare more accessible to remote communities. Furthermore, the centre intends to leverage technology to enhance its service delivery, including the implementation of telehealth services for remote consultations and monitoring. Apeksha is committed to fostering a culture of continuous learning and professional development among its staff, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of healthcare innovation. Long-term, Apeksha aspires to become a leading healthcare provider in Assam, renowned for its commitment to quality, patient-centered care, and community engagement, ultimately contributing to a healthier and more prosperous future for the region.</p>', '4RP4+7FJ', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:35:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1005, 'Dr. Nabanita Das | Best Ayurvedic Practitioner Doctor Near Me | 18 Years Exp. | Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Dr. Nabanita Das stands as a beacon of Ayurvedic healing in Guwahati, Assam, offering a blend of traditional wisdom and modern understanding to promote holistic well-being. Located on Assam Trunk Road, this practice brings 18 years of dedicated experience in Ayurvedic medicine to the local community. Dr. Das\'s commitment to patient-centric care and deep understanding of Ayurvedic principles distinguishes her practice within the region\'s healthcare landscape. She provides personalized treatment plans that address the root cause of ailments, fostering long-term health and vitality. The practice offers a unique approach to healthcare, providing a natural and sustainable alternative to conventional medicine, a growing need in a society increasingly conscious of preventative care and holistic living.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe core of Dr. Nabanita Das\'s practice lies in providing comprehensive Ayurvedic consultations and personalized treatment plans. These consultations involve a detailed assessment of an individual\'s unique constitution (Prakriti) and any imbalances (Vikriti) that may be contributing to their health concerns. Beyond consultations, the practice offers a range of specialized Ayurvedic therapies, including Panchakarma (detoxification), Abhyanga (therapeutic massage), Shirodhara (oil pouring therapy), and various herbal remedies tailored to specific needs. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing authentic and high-quality Ayurvedic herbs, many of which are sourced locally or directly from trusted suppliers known for their sustainable and ethical practices. This commitment to quality ensures the efficacy of the treatments and minimizes the risk of adverse effects. The practice effectively addresses a wide range of health issues prevalent in the local population, including digestive disorders, respiratory problems, skin conditions, stress-related ailments, and chronic diseases. By providing natural and individualized treatment solutions, Dr. Das aims to bridge the gap in the current healthcare system and offer a more holistic approach to wellness.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Dr. Nabanita Das\'s practice, patient experience is paramount. The approach is built on empathy, respect, and genuine care. Every patient is treated as an individual, with their unique needs and concerns carefully considered. The practice emphasizes clear communication, ensuring that patients fully understand their condition, the proposed treatment plan, and the rationale behind it. Dr. Das actively listens to patient feedback and adapts treatment plans accordingly, fostering a collaborative and trusting relationship. The clinic environment is designed to be calming and welcoming, reflecting the principles of Ayurveda, creating a sanctuary for healing and rejuvenation. Beyond individual consultations, the practice actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops on Ayurvedic lifestyle principles, and participation in local health initiatives. This active involvement strengthens the connection with the community and reinforces Dr. Das\'s commitment to promoting overall well-being in Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Dr. Nabanita Das envisions expanding her practice to further serve the growing demand for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam. This includes plans to incorporate specialized diagnostic tools based on Ayurvedic principles to enhance the accuracy and effectiveness of treatment plans. There are also ambitions to develop a range of proprietary herbal formulations, utilizing locally sourced ingredients, to address specific health needs of the Assamese population. Furthermore, Dr. Das aims to establish collaborative partnerships with other healthcare providers, integrating Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices. This collaborative approach seeks to create a more comprehensive and integrated healthcare system that benefits the entire community. The long-term goal is to establish Dr. Nabanita Das\'s practice as a leading center of excellence for Ayurvedic medicine in Northeast India, providing accessible, affordable, and effective healthcare solutions rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda. This includes mentoring aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners and contributing to the preservation and promotion of Ayurvedic knowledge for future generations.', 'Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '080 4628 7161', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:35:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1006, 'Wellness centre', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Wellness Centre, strategically located at 4QR6+FR7 in the heart of Assam, is a dedicated haven for holistic well-being. More than just a business, it represents a commitment to fostering a healthier and more balanced lifestyle for the local community, acknowledging the unique needs and cultural nuances of the region. In a fast-paced world, Wellness Centre offers a serene escape and a comprehensive range of services designed to rejuvenate the mind, body, and spirit. We strive to be a trusted partner in our client\'s journey towards optimal wellness, providing personalized care and evidence-based practices in a supportive and welcoming environment. Our presence significantly contributes to the local business landscape by promoting preventative healthcare and enhancing the overall quality of life within the community. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core offerings encompass a diverse array of services meticulously curated to address various aspects of wellness. These include: Therapeutic Massage, offering specialized techniques to alleviate muscle tension, reduce stress, and promote relaxation; Yoga and Meditation classes, catering to all levels from beginners to experienced practitioners, focusing on mindful movement and inner peace; Nutritional Counselling, providing personalized dietary guidance and support to achieve individual health goals; and Ayurvedic Consultations, leveraging traditional Indian medicine principles for holistic healing and disease prevention. Each service is delivered by qualified and experienced professionals committed to providing the highest standards of care. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What sets Wellness Centre apart is our unwavering dedication to personalized care and a holistic approach. We understand that each individual has unique needs and aspirations. Therefore, we invest time in getting to know our clients, understanding their specific concerns, and tailoring our services to meet their individual requirements. Our yoga and meditation classes, for instance, incorporate modifications to accommodate various physical limitations and skill levels. Our nutritional counselling services take into account cultural dietary preferences and locally available resources. The integration of Ayurvedic principles provides a unique selling point, particularly relevant in a region with a strong tradition of natural healing practices. We actively respond to the increasing local demand for accessible and effective wellness solutions by offering services that are both contemporary and culturally sensitive, creating a welcoming space for all. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Wellness Centre. From the moment a client walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and respect. We prioritize creating a calming and inviting atmosphere where individuals feel comfortable and supported. Our team is trained to provide attentive and compassionate service, ensuring that every client feels valued and heard. We actively seek feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and customer experience. To strengthen our connection with the local community, we regularly host workshops, seminars, and community events focused on health and wellness. These events provide opportunities for individuals to learn about various wellness topics, connect with like-minded people, and experience our services firsthand. We also partner with local organizations and businesses to promote wellness initiatives and contribute to the overall well-being of the community. We strive to be more than just a service provider; we aim to be a trusted and integral part of the local community. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Wellness Centre envisions significant growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include broadening our range of services to encompass complementary therapies such as physiotherapy and acupuncture. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local corporations to provide workplace wellness programs, promoting employee health and productivity. Another key area of focus is expanding our reach through online platforms, offering virtual consultations, online classes, and educational resources to a wider audience. We are dedicated to staying at the forefront of the wellness industry by continuously investing in training and development for our team, and by adopting innovative technologies and evidence-based practices. We aim to establish Wellness Centre as a leading provider of holistic wellness solutions in Assam and beyond, contributing to a healthier and happier community. We see potential for expansion into neighboring areas of Assam to address a greater population with our wellness-centric services. We further plan to introduce specialized programs catered to specific demographics, such as prenatal wellness programs or senior citizen fitness classes, solidifying our position as a diverse and accessible wellness provider. </p>', '4QR6+FR7', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '089548 88000', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:35:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1007, 'Patanjali Arogya Kendra, Basistha Chariali, Beltola.', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Patanjali Arogya Kendra, Basistha Chariali, Beltola: Your Gateway to Holistic Wellness in Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant commercial hub of Natun Bazar, on the 1st Floor of Shiva Complex, Basistha Chariali, Basistha Rd, Patanjali Arogya Kendra, Basistha Chariali, Beltola, stands as a beacon of holistic health and wellness in Guwahati. More than just a retail outlet, it’s a dedicated center committed to providing authentic Patanjali products and promoting a lifestyle rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda and Yoga. The Kendra addresses a growing demand in Assam for natural, sustainable, and effective healthcare solutions, catering to individuals seeking to improve their physical, mental, and spiritual well-being. Its strategic location makes it easily accessible to residents of Basistha, Beltola, and surrounding areas, making it a convenient and trusted resource for their health needs.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Patanjali Arogya Kendra lies a comprehensive range of products and services meticulously designed to cater to diverse health requirements. The core offering includes a complete spectrum of Patanjali Ayurveda medicines, food products, personal care items, and home care solutions. From herbal remedies for common ailments to specialized formulations addressing chronic conditions, the Kendra provides access to a wide array of authentic and quality-assured products. Beyond product sales, the Kendra often hosts consultations with qualified Ayurvedic practitioners (availability may vary and is advisable to confirm beforehand), who offer personalized advice and guidance on incorporating Ayurvedic principles into daily life. Furthermore, the Kendra frequently organizes workshops and seminars on topics related to yoga, meditation, healthy eating, and stress management, fostering a sense of community and empowering individuals to take proactive control of their health. What sets this Kendra apart is its unwavering commitment to authenticity and quality, ensuring that customers receive genuine Patanjali products and reliable information. The emphasis on preventative healthcare, coupled with readily available Ayurvedic expertise, addresses a critical need in the local market, where awareness of natural and holistic healing methods is steadily increasing.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Patanjali Arogya Kendra, Basistha Chariali, Beltola, prioritizes creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every customer. The staff is trained to provide knowledgeable and courteous assistance, guiding customers through the extensive product range and answering their queries with patience and clarity. The Kendra strives to build lasting relationships with its clientele, understanding their individual health goals and offering tailored recommendations. This personalized approach fosters trust and encourages customers to return not just for products but for guidance and support on their wellness journey. The Kendra also actively engages with the local community by participating in health awareness campaigns, supporting local initiatives, and organizing events that promote healthy living. By actively integrating itself into the fabric of the community, the Kendra strengthens its connection with its customers and establishes itself as a trusted partner in their pursuit of well-being.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Patanjali Arogya Kendra, Basistha Chariali, Beltola, is one of continued growth and expansion, driven by a commitment to serving the evolving health needs of the community. While specific expansion plans are proprietary, potential avenues for growth may include expanding the range of services offered, such as incorporating yoga classes or advanced Ayurvedic therapies (subject to the availability of qualified personnel and infrastructure). Strengthening partnerships with local healthcare providers and organizations could further enhance the Kendra’s reach and impact. Investing in digital platforms to offer online consultations, product ordering, and educational resources would also cater to the growing demand for convenient and accessible healthcare solutions. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish Patanjali Arogya Kendra, Basistha Chariali, Beltola, as the leading center for holistic wellness in Guwahati, empowering individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives through the wisdom of Ayurveda and Yoga.</p>', 'Natun Bazar, 1st Floor, Shiva Complex, Basistha Chariali, Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '093650 66071', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:40:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1008, 'SCIM Assam State Council of Indian Medicine', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'SCIM Assam State Council of Indian Medicine (SCIM Assam), located at 5Q69+RV8, Himadri Path, serves as a pivotal institution dedicated to the advancement and regulation of traditional Indian medicine practices within the state of Assam. Recognizing the rich heritage and enduring relevance of Ayurveda, Yoga & Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha, and Sowa-Rigpa (AYUSH) systems, SCIM Assam plays a crucial role in safeguarding the quality of education, ensuring ethical practices, and promoting the integration of these traditional systems into the mainstream healthcare landscape of Assam. Its significance lies in bridging the gap between ancient wisdom and modern healthcare needs, fostering a holistic approach to well-being that resonates deeply with the local community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nSCIM Assam\'s core functions revolve around several key areas. Firstly, it regulates and accredits educational institutions offering courses in various AYUSH disciplines. This includes ensuring adherence to established curricula, maintaining qualified faculty, and providing adequate infrastructure to nurture competent practitioners. Secondly, it serves as a regulatory body for registered practitioners of Indian medicine in Assam, upholding ethical standards, addressing grievances, and promoting continuing professional development. Thirdly, SCIM Assam actively promotes awareness and adoption of AYUSH systems through public health initiatives, workshops, and collaborations with government and non-governmental organizations. Finally, it acts as a liaison between the practitioners of Indian medicine and the state government, advocating for policies that support the growth and integration of these systems into the broader healthcare framework. A unique selling point is its commitment to maintaining the authenticity of traditional practices while embracing evidence-based approaches and modern advancements. These services directly address the growing local demand for holistic and preventative healthcare options, particularly in rural and underserved areas where access to conventional medicine may be limited.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nSCIM Assam prioritizes a patient-centric and community-focused approach. While it primarily oversees the regulatory and educational aspects of Indian medicine, it indirectly contributes to enhanced patient care by ensuring that practitioners are well-trained, ethical, and accountable. Furthermore, its outreach programs and awareness campaigns aim to empower the local community with knowledge about the benefits of AYUSH systems, encouraging them to make informed choices about their health and well-being. The council understands the importance of cultural sensitivity and incorporates local traditions and practices into its programs, fostering a sense of trust and connection with the community. SCIM Assam actively seeks feedback from stakeholders, including practitioners, patients, and community leaders, to continuously improve its services and ensure that they are relevant and responsive to the evolving needs of the population. This commitment to community engagement distinguishes SCIM Assam as a proactive and responsible steward of Indian medicine in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, SCIM Assam envisions a future where traditional Indian medicine is seamlessly integrated into the mainstream healthcare system of Assam, providing accessible and affordable options for all. The council aims to expand its educational initiatives, fostering collaborations with leading institutions to offer advanced courses and research opportunities in AYUSH disciplines. It also plans to strengthen its regulatory framework, ensuring that practitioners adhere to the highest ethical standards and providing robust mechanisms for addressing grievances. SCIM Assam is committed to leveraging technology to enhance its services, developing online platforms for registration, continuing education, and information dissemination. The long-term goal is to establish Assam as a center of excellence for traditional Indian medicine, attracting patients and researchers from across the region and contributing to the overall health and well-being of the state\'s population. Furthermore, the council aims to actively participate in national and international forums to promote the recognition and acceptance of Indian medicine as a valuable component of global healthcare.', '5Q69+RV8, Himadri path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '073810 59269', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:40:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1009, 'Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy: Rejuvenating Health the Natural Way in Assam</b></p>\n\n<p>Nestled below the trusted SBI branch at Maa Rukmini Agencies, Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy stands as a beacon of holistic health in the heart of Assam. More than just a clinic and pharmacy, it\'s a sanctuary where ancient Ayurvedic principles are seamlessly integrated with modern understanding to provide personalized and comprehensive wellness solutions. In a region rich with traditional healing practices, Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy distinguishes itself through its commitment to authenticity, quality, and patient-centric care, offering a vital alternative and complementary approach to healthcare within the local business landscape.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings revolve around the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, providing a diverse range of services and products designed to address the root cause of ailments and promote overall well-being. Our Ayurvedic Clinic offers consultations with experienced and qualified Ayurvedic practitioners. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual’s <i>Prakriti</i> (constitution) and <i>Vikriti</i> (imbalance), leading to personalized treatment plans that encompass dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies. We specialize in addressing a variety of health concerns, including digestive disorders, respiratory issues, skin ailments, joint pain, stress management, and women’s health. Beyond individual consultations, we also offer specialized Ayurvedic therapies such as <i>Panchakarma</i>, a detoxification and rejuvenation process, tailored to individual needs and administered under expert supervision.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Complementing our clinic services is our well-stocked Ayurvedic Pharmacy, where we dispense a wide range of authentic Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, and wellness products. We meticulously source our products from reputable manufacturers known for their adherence to traditional Ayurvedic formulations and stringent quality control measures. Our pharmacy staff are trained to provide guidance on the appropriate usage and dosage of these products, ensuring safe and effective self-care. We also offer a selection of Ayurvedic personal care products, including herbal shampoos, soaps, and skin creams, promoting natural beauty and wellness from the outside in. A key differentiator is our focus on sourcing locally grown herbs whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and potency of our ingredients. This dedication to local sourcing contributes to the economic well-being of the community and enhances the sustainability of our practices.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment where patients feel comfortable and supported throughout their healing journey. Our staff is trained to listen attentively to patient concerns, answer questions thoroughly, and provide personalized guidance with empathy and understanding. We go beyond simply providing treatments and medications; we empower our patients with the knowledge and tools they need to take control of their health and well-being. We actively engage with the local community by organizing health awareness workshops, seminars, and camps, promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and preventive healthcare. We participate in local festivals and events, further strengthening our connection with the community and demonstrating our commitment to their health and well-being. We understand the cultural nuances and healthcare needs of the Assamese people, and we tailor our services accordingly, ensuring that our approach is both effective and culturally sensitive. This deep understanding of the local context allows us to build strong relationships with our patients and establish ourselves as a trusted healthcare provider.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Ayurvedic Clinic & Pharmacy envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of services to encompass specialized Ayurvedic treatments, such as <i>Ksharasutra</i> therapy for piles and fistulas, and establishing a dedicated research and development wing to explore the potential of local herbs and traditional formulations. We plan to forge partnerships with local educational institutions to offer training programs in Ayurveda, contributing to the growth of a skilled workforce in this field. We also aim to leverage digital technologies to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations and educational resources. Our vision is to not only provide effective healthcare but also to promote the rich heritage of Ayurveda and empower individuals to live healthier, happier, and more fulfilling lives. We are committed to continuous improvement and innovation, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of Ayurvedic healthcare and continue to serve the evolving needs of our community. Our commitment to sustainable practices and ethical sourcing will remain central to our operations, ensuring that we contribute to the well-being of both people and the planet.</p>', 'Maa Rukmini Agencies, below SBI', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098641 53865', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:40:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1010, 'Ayurvedic hospital', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<article>\n<h1>Ayurvedic Hospital: Nurturing Wellness at 81A, Assam</h1>\n\n<p>Ayurvedic Hospital, located at 81A, stands as a beacon of holistic healing and wellness within the vibrant business landscape of Assam. Rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, we offer a comprehensive approach to healthcare, emphasizing prevention, natural remedies, and personalized treatment plans. Unlike conventional medical facilities, our focus extends beyond symptom management to addressing the root causes of illness, promoting long-term health, and fostering a harmonious balance between mind, body, and spirit. Our unique position lies in seamlessly blending traditional Ayurvedic practices with modern diagnostic techniques to provide effective and sustainable solutions for our patients. We are committed to upholding the rich Ayurvedic heritage while adapting to the evolving healthcare needs of the community we serve in Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Holistic Approach to Healing</h2>\n\n<p>Our primary services encompass a wide range of Ayurvedic treatments and therapies, meticulously designed to address various health conditions and promote overall well-being. These include:\n<br> <br>\n*   **Panchakarma:** This is a specialized detoxification and rejuvenation therapy, involving five cleansing procedures to eliminate toxins from the body, restore balance, and enhance vitality. We tailor each Panchakarma program to the individual\'s specific constitution (Prakriti) and health needs.\n<br> <br>\n*   **Ayurvedic Consultations:** Our experienced Ayurvedic physicians conduct thorough consultations, assessing an individual\'s health history, lifestyle, and Prakriti to formulate personalized treatment plans. These plans may include dietary recommendations, herbal remedies, lifestyle modifications, and therapeutic procedures.\n<br> <br>\n*   **Herbal Medicine:** We offer a wide range of authentic Ayurvedic herbal formulations, prepared using traditional methods and sourced from trusted suppliers. These remedies are carefully selected to address specific health concerns and support the body\'s natural healing processes.\n<br> <br>\n*   **Yoga and Meditation:** Recognizing the crucial role of mental and emotional well-being in overall health, we provide yoga and meditation sessions guided by qualified instructors. These practices help reduce stress, improve flexibility, enhance mental clarity, and promote inner peace.\n<br> <br>\n*   **Specialized Therapies:** We offer specialized therapies for various conditions, including joint pain, skin disorders, respiratory problems, digestive issues, and stress-related ailments. These therapies may involve specific massage techniques, herbal applications, and other Ayurvedic procedures.\n<br> <br>\nWhat sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to providing authentic Ayurvedic treatments, tailored to the individual needs of each patient. We prioritize the use of high-quality herbal ingredients, sourced ethically and sustainably. Furthermore, our emphasis on patient education empowers individuals to take control of their health and make informed decisions about their well-being. Our services directly address the local market needs in Assam, where there is a growing awareness and appreciation for traditional healing systems like Ayurveda. Many individuals seek natural and holistic approaches to healthcare, particularly for chronic conditions and lifestyle-related ailments, aligning perfectly with our core offerings.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Care and Community Connection</h2>\n\n<p>At Ayurvedic Hospital, we believe in providing a warm, compassionate, and personalized experience for every patient. From the moment they step through our doors, they are greeted with respect, empathy, and genuine care. Our team is dedicated to creating a comfortable and supportive environment, where patients feel heard, understood, and empowered.\n<br> <br>\nWe prioritize clear and open communication, ensuring that patients are fully informed about their condition, treatment options, and progress. Our physicians take the time to explain Ayurvedic principles in a simple and accessible manner, empowering patients to actively participate in their healing journey. We foster a strong doctor-patient relationship, built on trust, respect, and mutual understanding.\n<br> <br>\nBeyond individual care, we actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and educational seminars. These initiatives aim to promote the benefits of Ayurveda, educate the public about preventive healthcare, and empower individuals to adopt healthy lifestyle habits. We collaborate with local organizations and community leaders to reach a wider audience and make a positive impact on the health and well-being of the community. We source locally whenever possible, supporting other Assam businesses and reducing our environmental footprint, strengthening our ties with the people around us.\n<br> <br>\nWe continuously seek feedback from our patients to improve our services and enhance their experience. We are committed to upholding the highest standards of ethical and professional conduct, ensuring that our patients receive the best possible care in a safe and supportive environment.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Wellness Horizons</h2>\n\n<p>Ayurvedic Hospital envisions a future where Ayurvedic healthcare is accessible to all, playing a significant role in promoting overall health and well-being in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our facilities to accommodate a growing patient base and offering a wider range of specialized treatments. We plan to establish a state-of-the-art Ayurvedic research center to conduct clinical trials and validate the efficacy of traditional Ayurvedic therapies.\n<br> <br>\nWe aim to integrate technology into our practice, utilizing digital platforms to enhance patient care, streamline administrative processes, and expand our reach to remote areas. We are exploring the possibility of offering online consultations and telemedicine services to individuals who may not be able to visit our hospital in person.\n<br> <br>\nFurthermore, we are committed to training and educating the next generation of Ayurvedic practitioners. We plan to establish an Ayurvedic educational institution to provide comprehensive training in Ayurvedic medicine and therapy, ensuring that the rich heritage of Ayurveda is preserved and passed on to future generations. We strive to become a leading center of excellence for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, recognized for our commitment to quality, innovation, and patient-centered care. We believe that by combining the wisdom of Ayurveda with modern advancements, we can create a healthier and more vibrant community for all.</p>\n</article>', '81A', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:40:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1011, 'Prachin Herbs Healthcare Pvt Ltd', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Prachin Herbs Healthcare Pvt Ltd, situated at House no 8, 1, Pragati Path, Guwahati, Assam, is a dedicated healthcare company focused on harnessing the power of traditional Ayurvedic knowledge combined with modern scientific principles to provide holistic health and wellness solutions. Positioned strategically within the vibrant Assam business ecosystem, Prachin Herbs stands out by offering locally relevant and sustainably sourced herbal products and healthcare services designed to improve the overall well-being of the community. The company\'s unique approach centers on respecting ancient healing traditions while adhering to stringent quality control measures, ensuring that customers receive safe, effective, and trustworthy solutions. Prachin Herbs Healthcare fills a crucial need in a region where traditional medicine holds deep cultural significance and where a growing awareness of natural healthcare alternatives is evident.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Prachin Herbs Healthcare lies a commitment to delivering comprehensive and authentic Ayurvedic services and herbal products. The company\'s primary offerings include: a diverse range of herbal supplements formulated to address common health concerns such as immunity, digestion, and stress; personalized Ayurvedic consultations provided by qualified practitioners to assess individual health needs and recommend tailored treatment plans; and a selection of natural skincare and haircare products crafted with locally sourced ingredients, promoting beauty and wellness from within. What sets Prachin Herbs apart is its unwavering dedication to quality and authenticity. The company works closely with local farmers and suppliers to ensure that all herbs are cultivated sustainably and ethically, preserving the rich biodiversity of the region. Furthermore, Prachin Herbs adheres to rigorous testing protocols at every stage of production, from raw material sourcing to final product packaging, guaranteeing purity, potency, and safety. By blending time-tested Ayurvedic principles with modern scientific validation, Prachin Herbs provides healthcare solutions that are both effective and accessible to the local market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nPrachin Herbs Healthcare believes that exceptional customer experience is paramount to its success. The company strives to create a welcoming and supportive environment for every individual who interacts with its services or products. The approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, respect, and a genuine desire to help customers achieve their health and wellness goals. Whether it\'s providing personalized guidance on product selection, offering detailed explanations of Ayurvedic principles, or addressing customer concerns promptly and efficiently, the team at Prachin Herbs goes the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. Beyond individual interactions, Prachin Herbs actively engages with the local community through educational workshops, health awareness campaigns, and partnerships with local organizations. These initiatives aim to promote a holistic approach to health and wellness, fostering a sense of community and shared responsibility for well-being. By building strong relationships with its customers and actively participating in community events, Prachin Herbs strengthens its connection to the local culture and reinforces its commitment to serving the needs of the people of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nPrachin Herbs Healthcare envisions a future where traditional Ayurvedic medicine plays an increasingly important role in promoting the health and well-being of individuals and communities across Assam and beyond. The company’s growth strategy focuses on expanding its product line to address a wider range of health needs, leveraging research and development to innovate new and improved formulations, and increasing its reach through strategic partnerships and online channels. In the long term, Prachin Herbs aims to establish itself as a leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic healthcare solutions in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. The company plans to invest in training and development programs to nurture a skilled workforce of Ayurvedic practitioners and herbal specialists, ensuring the continued growth and success of the business. Moreover, Prachin Herbs is committed to preserving and promoting the rich heritage of traditional Assamese medicine, working closely with local communities to document and safeguard indigenous knowledge for future generations. By staying true to its core values and embracing innovation, Prachin Herbs Healthcare is poised to achieve significant growth and make a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the communities it serves.', 'House no 8, 1, Pragati Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '084730 07089', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:40:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1012, 'AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP, strategically located near LUCKY MOBAIL CENTRE, stands as a dedicated purveyor of authentic Ayurvedic remedies and herbal products, deeply rooted in the ancient traditions of healing and wellness. Situated within the vibrant Assam business landscape, we aim to bridge the gap between traditional Ayurvedic practices and the growing demand for natural, holistic healthcare solutions within the community. Our commitment is to providing high-quality, ethically sourced herbal medicines and personalized consultations, empowering individuals to take proactive control of their health and well-being through time-tested natural methods.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP lies a carefully curated selection of Ayurvedic products, encompassing a wide range of therapeutic needs. Our offerings include: meticulously prepared herbal formulations addressing common ailments such as digestive issues, respiratory problems, skin conditions, and joint pain; single herbs and herbal blends sourced directly from reputable growers and suppliers, ensuring purity and potency; and traditional Ayurvedic oils and massage products designed to promote relaxation, rejuvenation, and therapeutic relief. A key differentiator is our emphasis on sourcing herbs grown locally or within India, supporting sustainable agricultural practices and reducing our environmental footprint. We meticulously verify the authenticity and quality of our products through rigorous quality control measures, ensuring that our customers receive safe and effective remedies. Furthermore, we offer personalized Ayurvedic consultations, guiding individuals toward tailored herbal regimens and lifestyle recommendations based on their unique constitution and health concerns. This personalized approach distinguishes us from generic pharmacies and positions us as trusted advisors in the realm of Ayurvedic health.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel comfortable seeking guidance and exploring the world of Ayurveda. Our staff is trained to provide knowledgeable assistance, explaining the benefits of different herbs and formulations, and answering questions with clarity and patience. We emphasize building lasting relationships with our customers, fostering trust and understanding as we work together to support their health goals. Beyond individual consultations, we aim to actively engage with the local community by organizing workshops and seminars on Ayurvedic principles, healthy lifestyle practices, and the benefits of herbal remedies. We also collaborate with local healthcare practitioners, promoting the integration of Ayurvedic medicine with conventional healthcare approaches. By actively participating in community events and supporting local initiatives, we demonstrate our commitment to the well-being of the community we serve and solidify our position as a trusted resource for natural healthcare solutions. We encourage feedback from our customers and continually strive to improve our products and services based on their needs and preferences. This commitment to customer-centricity is what truly sets us apart.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP involves expanding our reach and deepening our impact within the local community and beyond. We plan to introduce a wider range of Ayurvedic products, including specialized formulations for specific health conditions and a selection of Ayurvedic personal care items. We envision establishing strategic partnerships with Ayurvedic doctors and wellness centers, creating a referral network to provide comprehensive healthcare services. We are also exploring the possibility of offering online consultations and developing an e-commerce platform to reach a wider audience and make our products more accessible. A key long-term goal is to establish a small-scale herbal processing unit, allowing us to directly source and process local herbs, ensuring the highest quality and supporting local farmers. We are also committed to promoting research and education in the field of Ayurveda, collaborating with academic institutions and organizations to advance the understanding and application of this ancient healing system. By continuously innovating, expanding our services, and staying true to our core values of quality, authenticity, and customer care, AL BADIU AYURVEDIC HERBAL MEDI-SHOP aims to become a leading provider of Ayurvedic healthcare solutions in the region and beyond, contributing to a healthier and more balanced community.</p>', 'near LUCKY MOBAIL CENTRE', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '093953 32676', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:45:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
