(1022, 'My recharge Ayurbeda Tushar Baruah', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><strong>My recharge Ayurbeda Tushar Baruah: Nurturing Wellness the Ayurvedic Way in Assam</strong></p>\n\n<p>Nestled near Cerry City Cotege OYO on Sakuntala Path HN11, My recharge Ayurbeda Tushar Baruah offers a sanctuary of holistic wellness, rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda. In the heart of Assam, where traditional remedies hold a revered place, My recharge Ayurbeda stands out as a modern expression of this timeless healing system. More than just a provider of Ayurvedic products and services, it is a dedicated space for individuals seeking natural and sustainable approaches to health and well-being. By blending authentic Ayurvedic principles with a personalized touch, My recharge Ayurbeda contributes significantly to the local business landscape, providing not just products, but a pathway to a balanced and harmonious life. The business is committed to sourcing the highest quality ingredients and adhering to traditional preparation methods, ensuring that its offerings are both effective and deeply rooted in Ayurvedic tradition.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Core Services and Products: A Gateway to Holistic Health</strong></p>\n\n<p>My recharge Ayurbeda provides a range of services and products designed to cater to various health and wellness needs. Central to its offerings are personalized Ayurvedic consultations, where trained practitioners assess individual constitutions (Prakriti) and imbalances (Vikriti) to create tailored wellness plans. These plans may encompass dietary recommendations, lifestyle adjustments, and the use of specific Ayurvedic herbs and formulations. The business also offers specialized Ayurvedic treatments, which are designed to address a wide spectrum of health concerns, from stress management and detoxification to skin rejuvenation and pain relief. These treatments are performed by experienced therapists using traditional techniques and high-quality herbal oils.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Complementing these services is a curated selection of authentic Ayurvedic products. This includes herbal supplements, classical Ayurvedic medicines, personal care items, and organic teas, all carefully chosen for their efficacy and purity. What sets My recharge Ayurbeda apart is its commitment to sourcing products from reputable manufacturers who adhere to stringent quality control standards. Furthermore, the business prioritizes locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and minimizing its environmental impact. A particular area of focus is promoting the use of Assam\'s rich biodiversity in Ayurvedic formulations, leveraging the region\'s unique flora for its therapeutic benefits. This commitment to local sourcing and traditional preparation methods contributes to the authenticity and effectiveness of My recharge Ayurbeda\'s offerings, meeting the growing demand for natural and sustainable healthcare solutions within the local market.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Fostering Wellness</strong></p>\n\n<p>At My recharge Ayurbeda, the customer experience is paramount. The business strives to create a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable exploring the principles of Ayurveda and embarking on their wellness journey. Each customer interaction is characterized by personalized attention, genuine care, and a deep understanding of individual needs. Consultations are conducted with empathy and thoroughness, ensuring that customers receive clear and practical guidance. The staff are not only knowledgeable about Ayurveda but also passionate about sharing its wisdom and empowering individuals to take control of their health.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>My recharge Ayurbeda actively engages with the local community through workshops, seminars, and health camps, promoting awareness about Ayurveda and its benefits. These initiatives are designed to educate individuals about healthy lifestyle choices, preventive healthcare, and the importance of connecting with nature. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, My recharge Ayurbeda builds trust and establishes itself as a valuable resource for holistic wellness. The business also uses local languages and cultural nuances in its communications, making Ayurveda more accessible and relatable to the local population. Feedback from customers is actively solicited and incorporated into the business\'s operations, ensuring that its services and products continue to meet the evolving needs of the community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Future Vision: Expanding the Reach of Ayurvedic Wellness</strong></p>\n\n<p>My recharge Ayurbeda envisions a future where Ayurvedic principles are integrated into mainstream healthcare, empowering individuals to lead healthier and more fulfilling lives. The business plans to expand its range of services and products, introducing new and innovative Ayurvedic treatments and formulations. This includes exploring the potential of incorporating modern scientific research into traditional Ayurvedic practices, validating their efficacy and enhancing their effectiveness.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Future plans also include expanding its physical presence, potentially opening additional locations in Assam and beyond, bringing the benefits of Ayurveda to a wider audience. Furthermore, My recharge Ayurbeda aims to develop partnerships with local healthcare providers and educational institutions, promoting the integration of Ayurveda into their respective fields. By investing in research, education, and community outreach, My recharge Ayurbeda is committed to becoming a leading provider of Ayurvedic wellness solutions in Assam and a catalyst for the widespread adoption of Ayurveda as a complementary healthcare modality. The long-term goal is to establish My recharge Ayurbeda as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with authentic Ayurvedic principles, personalized care, and sustainable health practices.</p>', 'near Cerry city cotege OYO, Sakuntala Path HN11', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070869 30154', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:55:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1023, 'Department of Yogic Science and Naturopathy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>The Department of Yogic Science and Naturopathy, situated at 5Q75+PH6, Mahapurusha Srimanta Sankaradeva Viswavidyalaya, Guwahati Campus, Rupanagar Rd, is a pioneering institution dedicated to promoting holistic well-being through the integrated practices of Yoga and Naturopathy. Located within the esteemed university setting, the department plays a crucial role in bridging traditional wisdom with contemporary healthcare needs, contributing significantly to the health and wellness sector in Assam. It distinguishes itself by providing academic rigor coupled with practical application, nurturing skilled professionals and fostering a deeper understanding of these ancient sciences. Its presence fills a crucial gap in the regional landscape, where there\'s an increasing demand for natural and preventive healthcare solutions. The department contributes not only to the health of individuals but also the development of a more health-conscious community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The department offers a comprehensive range of services and educational programs. These include degree programs in Yogic Science and Naturopathy, encompassing in-depth study of asanas, pranayama, meditation, naturopathic dietetics, hydrotherapy, massage therapy, and other natural healing modalities. A key offering is therapeutic Yoga sessions tailored to address specific health conditions, conducted by qualified instructors. These sessions are designed based on individual needs and medical history, providing a personalized approach to healing. Additionally, the department offers naturopathic consultations, providing dietary and lifestyle recommendations rooted in natural principles. Workshops and seminars are regularly organized to educate the public on the benefits of Yoga and Naturopathy in promoting overall health and preventing diseases. What sets the department apart is its commitment to evidence-based practice, integrating traditional knowledge with modern scientific understanding. It uniquely caters to the local market\'s growing need for accessible and effective natural healthcare, offering a credible alternative and complement to conventional medical treatments.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Department of Yogic Science and Naturopathy prioritizes a customer-centric approach that emphasizes empathy, understanding, and personalized attention. The department is committed to creating a welcoming and supportive environment for all individuals, regardless of their background or experience level. Qualified instructors and practitioners take the time to listen to each student\'s concerns and tailor their guidance accordingly. The department actively engages with the local community through outreach programs, health camps, and awareness campaigns, promoting the benefits of Yoga and Naturopathy to a wider audience. This connection to the community strengthens its position as a trusted source of information and a reliable provider of natural healthcare solutions. Furthermore, the department fosters a sense of community among its students, creating a supportive network where individuals can share their experiences and learn from one another. This holistic approach to customer service, combined with the expertise of its staff, sets the department apart as a leader in the field of Yogic Science and Naturopathy in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision of the Department of Yogic Science and Naturopathy is to establish itself as a leading center of excellence in the field, recognized both nationally and internationally. The department intends to expand its academic offerings, introducing specialized courses and research programs to further advance the knowledge and practice of Yoga and Naturopathy. Plans are in place to develop a state-of-the-art wellness center, equipped with modern facilities and equipment, to provide comprehensive and integrated healthcare services. The department also envisions establishing collaborative partnerships with other academic institutions, healthcare organizations, and community groups to promote the wider adoption of Yoga and Naturopathy. Furthermore, the department is committed to conducting cutting-edge research to explore the therapeutic benefits of Yoga and Naturopathy in addressing various health challenges. By pursuing these initiatives, the Department of Yogic Science and Naturopathy aims to empower individuals to take control of their health and well-being, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community in Assam and beyond. The long-term goal is to make Yoga and Naturopathy an integral part of mainstream healthcare, promoting a holistic and integrated approach to health and wellness.</p>', '5Q75+PH6, Mahapurusha Srimanta Sankaradeva Viswavidyalaya, Guwahati Campus, Rupanagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '096756 52526', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:55:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1024, 'Ancient Nature Care', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Ancient Nature Care, nestled near Assam Valley English High School at 5Q72+9RV, RK Mission Rd, represents a harmonious blend of traditional Assamese wellness practices and modern scientific understanding. In the heart of Assam, where ancient remedies are deeply ingrained in the culture, Ancient Nature Care stands as a beacon of authentic, nature-based healing, offering a unique approach to holistic well-being. The business addresses a growing demand within the local community for natural alternatives to conventional healthcare, capitalizing on the region\'s rich biodiversity and time-honored traditions.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, Ancient Nature Care offers a curated selection of herbal remedies, handcrafted skincare products, and personalized wellness consultations. The herbal remedies draw upon the extensive knowledge of traditional Assamese medicine, utilizing locally sourced ingredients known for their therapeutic properties. These remedies address a range of common ailments, from digestive issues and respiratory problems to skin conditions and sleep disturbances. The handcrafted skincare line features formulations that harness the power of botanicals to nourish and rejuvenate the skin, promoting a healthy, radiant complexion. A key differentiator is the commitment to using only ethically sourced, sustainable ingredients, often procured directly from local farmers and indigenous communities. The personalized wellness consultations provide a holistic assessment of an individual\'s health and well-being, taking into account their lifestyle, dietary habits, and health goals. Based on this assessment, a customized wellness plan is developed, incorporating herbal remedies, dietary recommendations, and lifestyle modifications. This personalized approach ensures that clients receive the most effective and appropriate care for their specific needs.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ancient Nature Care distinguishes itself through an unwavering commitment to exceptional customer service and fostering strong connections with the local community. The staff is comprised of knowledgeable and compassionate individuals who are passionate about promoting natural health and well-being. They take the time to understand each customer\'s needs and provide personalized recommendations based on their individual circumstances. The business actively engages with the local community by participating in farmers\' markets, health fairs, and workshops on traditional Assamese medicine. These events provide opportunities to educate the public about the benefits of natural remedies and promote a healthier lifestyle. Furthermore, Ancient Nature Care collaborates with local artisans and entrepreneurs to source ingredients and create products, thereby supporting the local economy and preserving traditional crafts. By building strong relationships with its customers and the community, Ancient Nature Care has cultivated a reputation for trust, integrity, and genuine care.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Ancient Nature Care envisions expanding its reach within Assam and beyond, becoming a recognized leader in the field of natural health and wellness. Future plans include expanding the product line to include a wider range of herbal remedies, skincare products, and wellness supplements. There are also plans to develop educational programs and workshops to further promote the understanding and appreciation of traditional Assamese medicine. The business aims to establish partnerships with healthcare professionals and integrate its services into mainstream healthcare settings. A long-term goal is to create a sustainable and ethical business model that benefits both the environment and the local community. By continuing to uphold its commitment to quality, authenticity, and customer service, Ancient Nature Care is poised for continued growth and success in the years to come. The potential lies in leveraging the growing global interest in natural and sustainable products, while remaining deeply rooted in the traditions and values of Assam.</p>', '5Q72+9RV, RK Mission Rd, near Assam valley English High School', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '096786 36762', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:55:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1025, 'Care Ayurveda. c/o D & J Enterprise', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Care Ayurveda, operating under the umbrella of D & J Enterprise and located on Ashram Rd, S Sarania Rd, represents a revitalizing force in Assam\'s wellness sector. It is more than just a provider of Ayurvedic products and services; it is a commitment to holistic well-being, deeply rooted in the ancient traditions of Ayurveda while catering to the modern health needs of the local community. In a region rich in natural resources and cultural heritage, Care Ayurveda aims to bridge the gap between traditional healing practices and contemporary lifestyles, contributing to a healthier and more balanced society. <br> <br>\n\nCare Ayurveda\'s core offering revolves around providing authentic Ayurvedic products and personalized wellness consultations. The product line encompasses a wide array of Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, skincare products, and personal care items, all carefully formulated using traditional recipes and sourced from trusted suppliers. Recognizing the importance of purity and efficacy, Care Ayurveda emphasizes the quality and authenticity of its ingredients, ensuring that customers receive genuine and effective products. In addition to products, the business provides personalized Ayurvedic consultations with experienced practitioners. These consultations involve a thorough assessment of an individual\'s physical and mental constitution (Prakriti) to identify imbalances and develop customized treatment plans encompassing dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies. <br> <br>\n\nThe unique selling proposition of Care Ayurveda lies in its commitment to providing a comprehensive and holistic approach to wellness. Unlike conventional healthcare providers that often focus on treating symptoms, Care Ayurveda emphasizes addressing the root cause of health issues through personalized interventions and lifestyle modifications. This individualized approach, coupled with the use of authentic Ayurvedic products, sets Care Ayurveda apart and resonates strongly with customers seeking a natural and sustainable path to well-being. The business directly addresses local market needs by providing accessible and affordable Ayurvedic solutions for common health concerns such as stress, digestive issues, skin problems, and joint pain. By promoting preventative healthcare and empowering individuals to take control of their health, Care Ayurveda contributes to a healthier and more resilient community. <br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of Care Ayurveda\'s operational philosophy. The business strives to create a welcoming and supportive environment where customers feel valued, respected, and empowered to make informed decisions about their health. From the moment a customer walks through the door or engages with the business online, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The staff is knowledgeable, approachable, and dedicated to providing personalized assistance and guidance. Care Ayurveda actively engages with the local community through health awareness campaigns, workshops, and seminars on Ayurvedic principles and practices. These initiatives aim to educate the public about the benefits of Ayurveda and empower them to adopt healthier lifestyles. By fostering a sense of community and promoting open communication, Care Ayurveda builds strong relationships with its customers and establishes itself as a trusted source of wellness information and support. This includes actively participating in local festivals and events, offering discounts to senior citizens and students, and collaborating with local organizations to promote health and well-being. <br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Care Ayurveda envisions becoming a leading provider of Ayurvedic products and services in Assam, expanding its reach and impact on the local community. Future plans include expanding the product line to incorporate a wider range of Ayurvedic formulations and personal care items, catering to diverse health needs and preferences. Furthermore, the business aims to establish a state-of-the-art Ayurvedic wellness center that offers a comprehensive range of therapies, including Panchakarma, massage, and yoga, providing a holistic and immersive wellness experience. Investing in technology and online platforms to enhance accessibility and convenience for customers, by offering online consultations, product ordering, and educational resources is also a priority. The long-term goal is to promote Ayurveda as a viable and sustainable healthcare option, contributing to a healthier and more balanced society. This involves collaborating with healthcare professionals, academic institutions, and government agencies to integrate Ayurveda into mainstream healthcare and promote its recognition as a valuable system of medicine. By staying true to its values, embracing innovation, and continuously improving its offerings, Care Ayurveda is well-positioned to achieve its vision and make a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the community.', 'Ashram Rd, S Sarania Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '086382 39050', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:55:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1026, 'Drugs Union', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Drugs Union, strategically located on Lokhra Rd, Opposite ICICI Bank, stands as a vital and trusted pharmacy serving the Lokhra and wider Guwahati community in Assam. We are more than just a dispensary; we are a healthcare partner committed to providing accessible, reliable, and comprehensive pharmaceutical services, contributing to the well-being of our neighbors and strengthening the local Assam business ecosystem.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our prime location, easily accessible and prominently situated opposite ICICI Bank on Lokhra Road, ensures convenience for our customers. We recognize the importance of prompt and efficient service, especially when health is a concern. Drugs Union aims to be the first choice for pharmaceutical needs, recognized for our knowledgeable staff, extensive product range, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Drugs Union offers a comprehensive range of pharmaceutical products and services, catering to diverse healthcare needs. Our core offerings include: prescription fulfillment, over-the-counter (OTC) medications, health and wellness products, personal care items, and specialized pharmaceutical advice. We meticulously source our products from reputable manufacturers and distributors, ensuring the authenticity and quality of every item on our shelves. We understand the importance of affordability, and strive to offer competitive pricing while maintaining the highest standards of quality. A key differentiator is our commitment to stocking essential medicines that are frequently required by the local population, proactively anticipating needs based on prevalent health concerns in the region. Further, we offer specialized services such as medication adherence counseling, where our pharmacists work one-on-one with patients to ensure they understand their prescriptions and are taking them correctly. This personalized approach sets us apart and helps improve health outcomes within the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling point lies in our blend of accessibility, expertise, and genuine care for our customers. We are deeply rooted in the local community and understand the specific healthcare needs of the people we serve. We go beyond simply dispensing medications; our qualified pharmacists are readily available to provide expert advice, answer questions, and offer guidance on health-related matters. We take the time to build relationships with our customers, understanding their individual needs and preferences. This personalized approach fosters trust and loyalty, making Drugs Union a preferred choice for pharmaceutical care in the Lokhra area. We also actively participate in community health initiatives, such as health awareness campaigns and free health check-up camps, further demonstrating our commitment to the well-being of our neighbors.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Drugs Union, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where customers feel comfortable and confident in the care they receive. Our staff is trained to be attentive, empathetic, and knowledgeable, providing exceptional service with a personal touch. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continually improve our services and offerings. We understand that health concerns can be stressful, and we aim to alleviate that stress by providing a hassle-free and reliable pharmaceutical experience. This commitment to customer satisfaction is the cornerstone of our business and the foundation upon which we build lasting relationships with our community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Drugs Union envisions becoming the leading pharmacy in the Lokhra area and a trusted healthcare partner for the entire Guwahati region. Our future plans include expanding our product range to include specialized medications and healthcare equipment, enhancing our online presence to offer convenient online ordering and delivery services, and establishing strategic partnerships with local healthcare providers to further improve patient care. We also plan to invest in advanced technology to streamline our operations and enhance efficiency, allowing us to better serve our customers. We are committed to staying abreast of the latest advancements in pharmaceutical science and healthcare practices, ensuring that we provide our customers with the most up-to-date and effective solutions. Our long-term goal is to contribute to a healthier and more vibrant community by providing accessible, affordable, and high-quality pharmaceutical care.</p>', 'Lokhra Rd, Opposite ICICI Bank.', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098641 24978', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 09:55:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1027, 'Ira Pharmacy', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Ira Pharmacy, strategically located at Shop No.-5, Kalita\'s Commercial, VIP Road, Mahapurush Mahadev Path, Guwahati, Assam, stands as a cornerstone of healthcare accessibility and well-being for the surrounding community. Beyond simply dispensing medications, Ira Pharmacy is committed to providing personalized care, fostering trust, and contributing to the overall health landscape of the region. Situated on VIP Road, a bustling thoroughfare, Ira Pharmacy benefits from high visibility and accessibility, making it a convenient and reliable destination for residents seeking pharmaceutical needs and health advice.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ira Pharmacy distinguishes itself within the local Assam business landscape by emphasizing a holistic approach to patient care. This goes beyond simply fulfilling prescriptions. The pharmacy proactively engages with customers, offering guidance on medication management, potential side effects, and lifestyle adjustments that can enhance their overall health. Furthermore, Ira Pharmacy actively participates in local health initiatives, partnering with community organizations to promote preventative care and raise awareness about prevalent health issues affecting the region. This commitment to community well-being sets Ira Pharmacy apart from larger, more impersonal chain pharmacies and solidifies its role as a trusted local resource.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Ira Pharmacy\'s operations lies its comprehensive range of pharmaceutical services and products. The pharmacy provides a full spectrum of prescription medications, catering to a diverse range of healthcare needs. This includes sourcing both common and specialized medications, ensuring a consistent supply to meet the demands of its customer base. Beyond prescription fulfillment, Ira Pharmacy offers a wide array of over-the-counter (OTC) medications, vitamins, supplements, and personal care products. These products are carefully curated to meet the specific needs of the local population, taking into consideration regional health trends and prevalent conditions. The pharmacy also stocks essential medical supplies such as bandages, first-aid kits, and mobility aids, making it a one-stop shop for health-related necessities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>A unique selling point of Ira Pharmacy is its emphasis on pharmaceutical compounding. This service allows the pharmacy to create customized medications tailored to individual patient needs. This is particularly beneficial for patients with allergies, sensitivities to certain ingredients, or those requiring specific dosages not readily available in commercially manufactured medications. The compounding service showcases Ira Pharmacy\'s commitment to personalized care and its ability to meet the unique needs of its clientele. Furthermore, the pharmacy offers medication counseling services, where trained pharmacists provide detailed information about medications, potential interactions, and proper usage. This service empowers patients to take control of their health and make informed decisions about their treatment plans. This proactive approach significantly addresses the local market need for accessible and understandable healthcare information.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Ira Pharmacy. The pharmacy cultivates a welcoming and supportive environment where customers feel comfortable seeking advice and discussing their health concerns. The staff is carefully selected for their empathy, knowledge, and dedication to providing exceptional service. Pharmacists are readily available to answer questions, provide guidance, and address any concerns related to medications or health conditions. The pharmacy also invests in ongoing training for its staff to ensure they are up-to-date on the latest pharmaceutical advancements and best practices. Ira Pharmacy strives to build lasting relationships with its customers, treating them as individuals rather than just transactions. This personalized approach fosters trust and loyalty, making Ira Pharmacy the preferred choice for many in the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ira Pharmacy actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. The pharmacy participates in local health fairs, offering free health screenings and educational materials. It also collaborates with local doctors and healthcare providers to ensure seamless communication and coordinated patient care. By actively engaging with the community, Ira Pharmacy demonstrates its commitment to improving the overall health and well-being of the region. This commitment is further reinforced through the provision of medication adherence programs designed to help patients manage their medications effectively and avoid potential complications.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Ira Pharmacy envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading provider of pharmaceutical services in the region. Future plans include expanding the pharmacy\'s range of services to include specialized clinics or health consultation centers. The pharmacy also aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, potentially through online prescription refills, telehealth consultations, or a mobile app. Ira Pharmacy is committed to staying at the forefront of pharmaceutical innovation and adapting to the evolving needs of the healthcare landscape. Long-term goals include establishing a network of Ira Pharmacy locations throughout Assam, further expanding its reach and impact on the health and well-being of the population. This ambitious vision is driven by a deep commitment to providing accessible, personalized, and comprehensive healthcare services to the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ultimately, Ira Pharmacy is more than just a place to fill prescriptions; it is a vital community resource dedicated to improving the health and well-being of the residents of Guwahati and beyond. Through its commitment to personalized care, comprehensive services, and community engagement, Ira Pharmacy is poised to continue making a significant and positive impact on the local healthcare landscape for years to come.</p>', 'Shop No.-5, Kalita\'s Commercial VIP Road, Mahapurush Mahadev Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '088229 84929', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:00:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1028, 'Herbs Ayurvedic Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Herbs Ayurvedic Clinic: Nurturing Wellness Through Traditional Healing\n\nHerbs Ayurvedic Clinic, located at 5M5X+M5V, Assam Trunk Rd, represents a dedicated approach to holistic health and well-being, rooted in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda. Situated in a region steeped in natural beauty and cultural heritage, the clinic serves as a haven for individuals seeking natural and sustainable solutions to their health concerns. We distinguish ourselves by offering personalized Ayurvedic consultations and treatments, tailored to the unique constitution and needs of each individual, integrating traditional knowledge with a modern understanding of health and wellness. Our commitment to authentic Ayurvedic principles makes us a vital resource in the Assam healthcare landscape, promoting preventive care and addressing the root causes of imbalances rather than merely treating symptoms.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core services revolve around providing comprehensive Ayurvedic care, encompassing diagnosis, treatment, and lifestyle recommendations. The cornerstone of our practice is the individualized consultation. Our experienced Ayurvedic practitioners conduct thorough assessments, including pulse diagnosis (Nadi Pariksha), tongue analysis, and detailed questioning to determine an individual’s unique body constitution (Prakriti) and any existing imbalances (Vikriti). Based on this in-depth understanding, we offer personalized treatment plans that may include:\n\n*   **Herbal Remedies:** We utilize a wide range of authentic Ayurvedic herbs, carefully selected and prepared according to traditional methods. These herbs are sourced from trusted suppliers and are known for their therapeutic properties in restoring balance and promoting healing.\n*   **Dietary and Lifestyle Recommendations:** Recognizing the crucial role of diet and lifestyle in maintaining health, we provide customized dietary plans and lifestyle adjustments to support the healing process and prevent future imbalances.\n*   **Panchakarma Therapy:** This powerful detoxification and rejuvenation therapy involves a series of cleansing procedures designed to eliminate toxins from the body and restore balance. We offer various Panchakarma treatments, tailored to individual needs, under the guidance of skilled therapists.\n*   **Yoga and Meditation:** We integrate Yoga and meditation practices into our treatment protocols to promote physical and mental well-being. Our experienced instructors guide individuals in specific Yoga postures (Asanas) and breathing exercises (Pranayama) to enhance flexibility, strength, and relaxation.\n*   **Marma Therapy:** This ancient healing art involves stimulating specific energy points (Marma points) on the body to release blocked energy and promote healing.\n\nOur unique selling point lies in our unwavering commitment to providing authentic Ayurvedic care, delivered with compassion and personalized attention. We understand the specific health concerns prevalent in the local Assam community, such as lifestyle-related disorders and seasonal imbalances, and tailor our services to address these needs effectively. We prioritize educating our clients about Ayurvedic principles, empowering them to take an active role in their own health and well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Herbs Ayurvedic Clinic, we are dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience that fosters trust, comfort, and lasting results. From the moment a client enters our clinic, they are greeted with warmth and empathy. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized care, ensuring that each individual feels heard, understood, and supported throughout their journey. We maintain a serene and welcoming environment that promotes relaxation and healing. We strive to build long-term relationships with our clients, providing ongoing support and guidance to help them achieve optimal health and well-being.\n\nWe actively engage with the local community through health awareness programs, workshops, and seminars on Ayurvedic principles and practices. We participate in local events to promote the benefits of natural healing and preventive care. We collaborate with local businesses and organizations to offer wellness programs and promote healthy lifestyles. Our goal is to be a trusted resource for the community, empowering individuals to embrace a holistic approach to health and well-being. We also ensure that we source locally whenever possible, supporting other businesses within our community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Herbs Ayurvedic Clinic envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic care in Assam, recognized for our commitment to authenticity, quality, and personalized service. We plan to expand our range of services to include specialized treatments for various health conditions, such as women\'s health, children\'s health, and geriatric care. We aim to establish a training center to educate and train aspiring Ayurvedic practitioners, ensuring the preservation and propagation of this ancient healing tradition. We also plan to develop our own line of high-quality Ayurvedic herbal products, sourced from sustainable and ethical sources.\n\nOur long-term goals include expanding our reach to serve a wider population, both within Assam and beyond. We are committed to continuously improving our services and staying abreast of the latest advancements in Ayurvedic research and practice. We believe that Ayurveda has the power to transform lives, and we are dedicated to making it accessible to all who seek natural and sustainable solutions to their health concerns. We are committed to nurturing wellness and promoting a healthier, more balanced community through the timeless wisdom of Ayurveda. We will continue to uphold the highest ethical standards in our practice and contribute to the preservation and promotion of this ancient healing tradition.', '5M5X+M5V, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:00:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1029, 'M.M.Ayurvedic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>M.M.Ayurvedic, nestled in the heart of Assam, is dedicated to providing authentic Ayurvedic solutions that promote holistic wellness. Grounded in the ancient wisdom of Ayurveda, M.M.Ayurvedic offers a range of products and services meticulously crafted to address the specific health needs of the local community, blending traditional knowledge with contemporary applications. As a business deeply rooted in Assamese culture, M.M.Ayurvedic aspires to be a trusted partner in enhancing the well-being of its customers through natural and sustainable practices, making it a noteworthy contributor to the region’s burgeoning health and wellness sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of M.M.Ayurvedic\'s offerings are its carefully curated range of Ayurvedic products and personalized wellness services. The business provides an array of herbal formulations, including traditional medicines, health supplements, and natural skincare products. These products are formulated using locally sourced herbs and ingredients, whenever possible, ensuring freshness and potency while supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable agriculture. Each product undergoes rigorous quality checks to maintain the highest standards of efficacy and safety, reflecting a commitment to providing customers with reliable and trustworthy solutions. Beyond products, M.M.Ayurvedic offers personalized consultations with experienced Ayurvedic practitioners. These consultations involve a detailed assessment of an individual\'s \'Prakriti\' (body constitution) and \'Vikriti\' (imbalance) to develop tailored wellness plans encompassing dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and herbal remedies. This holistic approach differentiates M.M.Ayurvedic, addressing the root cause of ailments rather than merely treating symptoms. The business distinguishes itself by focusing on preventative care and empowering individuals to take proactive steps towards maintaining optimal health, aligning perfectly with the increasing awareness of natural and holistic approaches to wellness in the local market. M.M.Ayurvedic actively bridges the gap between traditional Ayurvedic practices and modern lifestyles, making ancient wisdom accessible and relevant to the contemporary needs of the Assamese community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience at M.M.Ayurvedic is built on a foundation of trust, empathy, and personalized attention. The business prioritizes creating a warm and welcoming environment where customers feel comfortable seeking advice and guidance on their wellness journey. Staff members are thoroughly trained in Ayurvedic principles and possess a deep understanding of the products and services offered. They are committed to providing informative and supportive consultations, ensuring that customers receive the right solutions tailored to their individual needs. M.M.Ayurvedic actively fosters a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives, such as organizing health awareness workshops, participating in local festivals, and collaborating with community organizations. This active engagement demonstrates a commitment to not only providing products and services but also contributing to the overall well-being of the community. The business further enhances customer experience through readily available online resources, including informative articles, product guides, and customer testimonials. M.M.Ayurvedic encourages feedback from its customers and continuously strives to improve its offerings and services based on their valuable insights. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and actively engaging with the local community, M.M.Ayurvedic aims to build lasting relationships and establish itself as a trusted and reliable partner in promoting holistic wellness.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, M.M.Ayurvedic envisions significant growth and expansion, driven by a commitment to innovation and a deep understanding of the evolving health needs of the local community. The business plans to expand its product line by introducing new and innovative Ayurvedic formulations that address specific health concerns prevalent in the region. This includes exploring the potential of locally sourced medicinal plants and incorporating them into new product offerings. M.M.Ayurvedic is also exploring opportunities to expand its reach beyond the local market, potentially through online channels or collaborations with other Ayurvedic practitioners and businesses. Furthermore, the business aims to enhance its educational initiatives by offering more comprehensive workshops and training programs on Ayurvedic principles and practices. These programs will be designed to empower individuals with the knowledge and skills to make informed decisions about their health and well-being. M.M.Ayurvedic is also committed to investing in research and development to further validate the efficacy of its products and services. By embracing innovation, expanding its reach, and investing in education and research, M.M.Ayurvedic aspires to become a leading provider of Ayurvedic solutions in Assam and beyond, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant community.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '091014 98166', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:00:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1030, 'Maa Sabhya Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Maa Sabhya Clinic, strategically located at 4MFV+X69, Maligaon Goshala Rd, represents a vital healthcare resource within the bustling community of Maligaon and greater Guwahati, Assam. More than just a medical facility, Maa Sabhya Clinic strives to be a trusted partner in promoting wellness, offering accessible and comprehensive care tailored to the specific health needs of the local population. The clinic\'s significance stems from its commitment to blending modern medical practices with a deeply rooted understanding of the cultural sensitivities and healthcare preferences prevalent in the region. By fostering a patient-centric environment, Maa Sabhya Clinic aims to bridge the gap between quality healthcare and community well-being, solidifying its position as a cornerstone of health support in Maligaon.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The clinic’s core services encompass a range of essential medical provisions designed to address the most pressing healthcare demands within the community. These services include general medical consultations, covering diagnosis and treatment for common ailments, preventive care strategies like vaccinations and health screenings, and management of chronic conditions. Maa Sabhya Clinic also offers specialized services that distinguish it from standard clinics, potentially including areas like maternal and child health, geriatric care, or specific disease management programs, depending on the expertise of the medical professionals associated with the clinic. A key unique selling point lies in the personalized attention given to each patient, emphasizing thorough consultations and individualized treatment plans. This patient-focused approach acknowledges that healthcare is not a one-size-fits-all solution, ensuring that patients receive the most appropriate and effective care. By catering to the specific health needs of the local market, Maa Sabhya Clinic strives to improve health outcomes and overall well-being in the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Maa Sabhya Clinic. The clinic strives to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, recognizing that a positive patient experience contributes significantly to healing and adherence to treatment plans. This is achieved through several key initiatives. First, the clinic prioritizes clear and effective communication, ensuring patients fully understand their medical conditions, treatment options, and preventative measures. Secondly, Maa Sabhya Clinic cultivates a culture of empathy and respect, where patients feel heard, valued, and supported throughout their healthcare journey. The clinic likely engages with the local community through health awareness programs, participation in local events, and collaborations with community organizations. This outreach solidifies Maa Sabhya Clinic’s commitment to not only providing medical care but also fostering a proactive approach to health and wellness within the community. By understanding and responding to the cultural nuances of the local population, the clinic ensures its services are accessible, relevant, and deeply connected to the needs of the people it serves.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Maa Sabhya Clinic envisions a future marked by continued growth and expansion of its services to better serve the evolving healthcare needs of the Maligaon community and beyond. Potential growth strategies include expanding the team of medical professionals to offer a wider range of specialties, investing in advanced medical equipment to enhance diagnostic capabilities, and establishing satellite clinics in underserved areas. The clinic might also explore partnerships with established hospitals or healthcare networks to further enhance its service offerings and referral pathways. Long-term goals focus on solidifying Maa Sabhya Clinic as the premier healthcare provider of choice in the region, recognized for its commitment to excellence, patient-centered care, and community engagement. This involves continuously improving the quality of services, adapting to advancements in medical technology, and fostering a culture of continuous learning and professional development among the staff. By consistently striving to improve and innovate, Maa Sabhya Clinic aims to create a lasting positive impact on the health and well-being of the community it serves, contributing to a healthier and more vibrant Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Maa Sabhya Clinic is dedicated to providing the very best care possible and expanding services to meet all community needs. </p>', '4MFV+X69, Maligaon Goshala Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:00:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
