(1031, 'Ayurvedic lady gynaecologist in Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Ayurvedic Lady Gynaecologist in Guwahati offers a unique and holistic approach to women\'s health and well-being. Nestled within the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, this practice addresses the specific healthcare needs of women through the lens of Ayurveda, a traditional Indian system of medicine. Recognizing a gap in specialized, naturally-oriented gynaecological care in the region, this practice provides a safe and supportive environment where women can find effective, personalized solutions for a range of health concerns.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In the Assam business landscape, where a growing awareness of alternative medicine is evident, this practice stands out by offering a blend of ancient wisdom and modern understanding. It caters to women seeking natural and sustainable solutions for gynaecological problems, providing an alternative to conventional medicine or a complementary approach to existing treatments. The emphasis on personalized care and holistic well-being differentiates it from standard gynaecological clinics, making it a significant contributor to the local healthcare ecosystem. This focus aligns with the cultural values of Assam, where natural remedies and traditional practices are often deeply ingrained.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The core of the practice lies in offering comprehensive Ayurvedic gynaecological services. These services encompass: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Comprehensive Ayurvedic Consultations:</b> Detailed assessments to understand individual health concerns, considering physical, mental, and emotional well-being based on Ayurvedic principles.</li>\n<li><b>Personalized Treatment Plans:</b> Tailored recommendations that may include herbal remedies, dietary adjustments, lifestyle modifications, and Ayurvedic therapies.</li>\n<li><b>Management of Gynaecological Conditions:</b> Addressing a wide range of issues such as menstrual irregularities, PCOS (Polycystic Ovary Syndrome), infertility, menopausal symptoms, and uterine fibroids through Ayurvedic approaches.</li>\n<li><b>Prenatal and Postnatal Care:</b> Providing holistic support and guidance during pregnancy and postpartum, promoting maternal and infant health through Ayurvedic principles.</li>\n<li><b>Panchakarma Therapies:</b> Offering detoxification and rejuvenation therapies specifically designed for women\'s health, aimed at restoring balance and promoting overall well-being.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A key unique selling point is the integration of Ayurvedic principles with a modern understanding of gynaecology. This allows for a more nuanced and personalized approach to treatment, addressing the root cause of health issues rather than just managing symptoms. The emphasis on natural remedies and lifestyle modifications also appeals to women seeking a gentler, more sustainable approach to healthcare. These services effectively meet the local market needs by providing an alternative or complement to conventional gynaecological care, particularly for women seeking natural and holistic solutions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount. The practice strives to create a warm, welcoming, and supportive environment where women feel comfortable discussing their health concerns openly. Building trust and rapport is essential, and the practitioner dedicates ample time to understanding each patient\'s individual needs and concerns. Emphasis is placed on clear and compassionate communication, ensuring that patients are fully informed about their condition and treatment options. The commitment to personalized care and holistic well-being sets the practice apart, creating a positive and empowering experience for every woman.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond individualized care, the practice actively engages with the local community through health awareness programs and workshops. These initiatives aim to educate women about Ayurvedic approaches to gynaecological health and empower them to take control of their well-being. By fostering a sense of community and providing valuable information, the practice strengthens its connection with the local population and contributes to the overall health and well-being of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Ayurvedic Lady Gynaecologist in Guwahati involves expanding its reach and impact within the region. Potential growth plans include: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Expanding Service Offerings:</b> Introducing specialized Ayurvedic therapies and treatments, such as fertility enhancement programs and post-menopausal care packages.</li>\n<li><b>Collaborating with Other Healthcare Providers:</b> Building partnerships with other medical professionals and hospitals to integrate Ayurvedic approaches into mainstream healthcare.</li>\n<li><b>Establishing a Wellness Center:</b> Creating a dedicated space for Ayurvedic treatments, yoga, and meditation, offering a comprehensive approach to women\'s health and well-being.</li>\n<li><b>Expanding Outreach Programs:</b> Conducting more health awareness camps and workshops in rural areas, bringing Ayurvedic healthcare to underserved communities.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The long-term goal is to establish Ayurvedic Lady Gynaecologist in Guwahati as a leading provider of holistic women\'s healthcare in Assam, recognized for its commitment to personalized care, natural remedies, and community engagement. The business aspires to empower women to achieve optimal health and well-being through the wisdom of Ayurveda, contributing to a healthier and happier community.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '070021 71813', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:00:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1032, 'Dr. Subhendu Buzarbaruah', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Dr. Subhendu Buzarbaruah, located within Down Town Hospital on GS Road in Guwahati, Assam, represents a significant contribution to the region\'s healthcare landscape. As a consultant specializing in [Specify Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s Specialization - e.g., cardiology, neurology, gastroenterology, etc.], the practice provides specialized medical care and expertise, directly addressing the growing need for advanced healthcare services in Assam and surrounding areas. The practice distinguishes itself through its commitment to patient-centric care, utilizing evidence-based medicine and integrating the latest advancements in [Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s Specialization] to deliver optimal health outcomes. By operating within the established infrastructure of Down Town Hospital, patients benefit from convenient access to comprehensive diagnostic and treatment facilities, creating a seamless and integrated healthcare experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s core service revolves around the diagnosis, treatment, and management of conditions related to [Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s Specialization]. This encompasses a range of services, including [Specifically list 3-5 core services - e.g., diagnostic testing, interventional procedures, medical management, preventative care, second opinions]. A key differentiator lies in the personalized approach to each patient\'s care. Rather than a one-size-fits-all approach, Dr. Buzarbaruah emphasizes a thorough understanding of each patient\'s medical history, lifestyle, and individual needs. This enables the creation of tailored treatment plans designed to maximize effectiveness and minimize potential side effects. Further enhancing the service is the utilization of advanced diagnostic technology available within Down Town Hospital, allowing for precise and timely assessments. The combination of specialized expertise, personalized care, and access to state-of-the-art technology positions Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s practice as a leading provider of [Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s Specialization] services in the region, directly addressing the local market\'s demand for accessible, high-quality healthcare.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s practice is a deep commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience. This begins with creating a welcoming and comfortable environment for patients, fostering a sense of trust and open communication. The practice prioritizes clear and concise communication, ensuring that patients fully understand their condition, treatment options, and potential outcomes. Staff members are trained to be empathetic and responsive to patient needs, providing support and guidance throughout their healthcare journey. Recognizing the importance of accessibility, the practice strives to minimize wait times and offer flexible appointment scheduling. Patient feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the quality of care and the overall patient experience. By fostering a strong doctor-patient relationship built on trust, respect, and open communication, Dr. Buzarbaruah aims to empower patients to actively participate in their own healthcare decisions and achieve optimal health and well-being. The location within Down Town Hospital, a well-respected institution in Guwahati, also contributes to the overall patient experience, offering familiarity and convenience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Dr. Subhendu Buzarbaruah envisions expanding the practice to further enhance its impact on the healthcare landscape of Assam. This may involve incorporating additional specialized services to address unmet needs within the community. Investing in continuous professional development and staying abreast of the latest advancements in [Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s Specialization] is crucial to maintaining the highest standards of care. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with other healthcare providers and organizations within the region could further enhance the practice\'s ability to provide comprehensive and coordinated care. Long-term goals include establishing a reputation as a center of excellence for [Dr. Buzarbaruah\'s Specialization] in Assam, attracting patients from across the region and contributing to the overall improvement of healthcare outcomes. This may involve participating in research initiatives and educational programs to advance knowledge and promote best practices in the field. Ultimately, the vision is to create a sustainable and impactful practice that serves as a trusted resource for patients seeking specialized medical care and contributes to the well-being of the community.</p>', 'Down town hospital, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098641 01111', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:05:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1033, 'Arogyam Multi Speciality Health Clinic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p><b>Arogyam Multi Speciality Health Clinic: Nurturing Wellness in Assam</b></p>\n\n<br><br>\n\nArogyam Multi Speciality Health Clinic is emerging as a trusted healthcare provider in Assam, committed to delivering comprehensive and compassionate medical care. Located at a central and easily accessible location in Assam, the clinic strives to bridge the gap between advanced medical practices and the specific healthcare needs of the local community. Arogyam envisions a healthier Assam by providing accessible, affordable, and high-quality medical services. Recognizing the unique health challenges and cultural sensitivities prevalent in the region, Arogyam distinguishes itself by adopting a patient-centric approach that prioritizes individual well-being and builds lasting relationships based on trust and respect. Arogyam seeks to be more than just a clinic; it aspires to be a vital pillar of community health and wellness.\n\n<br><br>\n\n<b>Core Services and Products</b>\n\n<br><br>\n\nArogyam Multi Speciality Health Clinic offers a wide array of medical services catering to diverse healthcare requirements. These include:\n\n<br><br>\n\n*   <b>General Medicine:</b> Providing primary care services, diagnosis, and treatment for common illnesses and health concerns. This serves as the first point of contact for many patients, offering preventative care and managing chronic conditions.\n\n<br><br>\n\n*   <b>Specialized Consultations:</b> Offering consultations with specialists in various fields such as cardiology, gynecology, pediatrics, dermatology, and orthopedics. This ensures patients have access to expert opinions and tailored treatment plans for specific medical conditions.\n\n<br><br>\n\n*   <b>Diagnostic Services:</b> Featuring an in-house laboratory and imaging facilities, including X-ray and ultrasound, enabling quick and accurate diagnoses. This minimizes wait times and facilitates prompt treatment decisions.\n\n<br><br>\n\n*   <b>Preventive Health Check-ups:</b> Promoting proactive healthcare through comprehensive health check-up packages tailored to different age groups and risk profiles. These check-ups help identify potential health issues early, enabling timely intervention and improved health outcomes.\n\n<br><br>\n\n*   <b>Pharmacy:</b> Stocking a wide range of medications and healthcare products, ensuring patients can conveniently access prescribed treatments and essential over-the-counter remedies. The pharmacy is staffed with qualified pharmacists who provide expert advice on medication usage and potential side effects.\n\n<br><br>\n\nArogyam\'s unique selling proposition lies in its integrated approach to healthcare. The clinic emphasizes coordinated care, ensuring seamless communication between different departments and specialists to provide patients with a holistic and personalized treatment experience. Furthermore, Arogyam distinguishes itself through its commitment to using state-of-the-art medical equipment and adhering to the highest standards of hygiene and safety. The clinic\'s services are specifically tailored to address the prevalent health needs of the local population, including management of infectious diseases, maternal and child health, and chronic disease prevention.\n\n<br><br>\n\n<b>Customer Experience</b>\n\n<br><br>\n\nAt Arogyam Multi Speciality Health Clinic, patient satisfaction is paramount. The clinic is committed to providing a welcoming and supportive environment where patients feel comfortable and valued. The staff is trained to provide compassionate and empathetic care, actively listening to patients\' concerns and addressing their needs with sensitivity and respect. Arogyam fosters a culture of open communication, ensuring patients are well-informed about their medical conditions, treatment options, and potential outcomes. To enhance convenience, the clinic offers online appointment booking and strives to minimize wait times. Furthermore, Arogyam actively engages with the local community through health awareness campaigns, educational workshops, and participation in local health initiatives. By fostering strong relationships with community leaders and organizations, Arogyam aims to build trust and promote health literacy within the region.\n\n<br><br>\n\n<b>Future Vision</b>\n\n<br><br>\n\nArogyam Multi Speciality Health Clinic envisions a future of continued growth and expanded services to better serve the healthcare needs of Assam. Future plans include expanding the range of specialties offered, introducing advanced diagnostic technologies, and establishing satellite clinics in underserved areas. Arogyam also aims to enhance its preventive health programs and develop specialized services for specific population groups, such as elderly care and women\'s health. The clinic is committed to investing in the professional development of its staff, ensuring they remain at the forefront of medical knowledge and best practices. Long-term goals include establishing a comprehensive healthcare network across the region, offering a full spectrum of medical services from primary care to specialized treatments. Arogyam aspires to be a leading healthcare provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement, ultimately contributing to a healthier and more prosperous future for the region.', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098540 41111', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:05:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1034, 'Maa Rukmini Agencie', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Maa Rukmini Agencies, strategically located at C/O-Navjeewan Ayurvedic Center, below the SBI Kalipur branch, is a dynamic agency serving the Assam region with a commitment to connecting businesses with essential resources and opportunities. Nestled in the heart of Kalipur, a vibrant commercial area, Maa Rukmini Agencies acts as a vital link between suppliers and retailers, facilitating seamless trade and contributing to the economic vitality of the local community. As a burgeoning enterprise in Assam’s evolving business landscape, the agency prioritizes understanding the unique needs of its clientele, fostering strong relationships built on trust, reliability, and mutual growth. The agency\'s physical location, sharing space with the esteemed Navjeewan Ayurvedic Center, lends it a distinctive character, emphasizing a commitment to well-being and holistic growth within the community it serves.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, Maa Rukmini Agencies focuses on providing comprehensive distribution and agency services. The primary offering revolves around connecting manufacturers and suppliers with local retailers and businesses seeking reliable sources for their products. While specific product lines may vary depending on market demands and partnerships, the agency specializes in identifying and representing quality goods that cater to the specific needs of the Assam market. This may include fast-moving consumer goods (FMCG), agricultural inputs, healthcare products (leveraging the location\'s association with Navjeewan Ayurvedic Center), or other essential supplies. The agency’s unique selling point lies in its deep understanding of the local market dynamics. Unlike larger, national-level agencies, Maa Rukmini Agencies possesses an intimate knowledge of regional consumer preferences, distribution channels, and competitive landscapes. This allows the agency to effectively position products and services for optimal market penetration and success. By acting as a trusted intermediary, Maa Rukmini Agencies streamlines the supply chain, reducing logistical complexities and ensuring timely delivery of goods to local businesses, ultimately helping them thrive in a competitive environment.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Maa Rukmini Agencies places a high premium on delivering exceptional customer experiences. The agency understands that building strong, long-lasting relationships is crucial for sustained success. The approach to customer service is characterized by responsiveness, transparency, and a genuine commitment to meeting the individual needs of each client. Rather than adopting a one-size-fits-all approach, the agency invests time in understanding the specific challenges and opportunities faced by its clients, tailoring its services to provide customized solutions. This commitment to personalized service extends to both suppliers and retailers, fostering a collaborative environment where mutual success is prioritized. The agency\'s connection with the local community is strengthened by its physical presence alongside the well-respected Navjeewan Ayurvedic Center. This association not only provides visibility but also reinforces the agency\'s commitment to contributing to the well-being and prosperity of the region. By actively participating in local events and initiatives, Maa Rukmini Agencies aims to become an integral part of the community fabric, fostering trust and goodwill among its clientele.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Maa Rukmini Agencies is one of sustained growth and expanded impact within the Assam business landscape. The agency aims to become a leading distribution and agency partner for businesses operating in the region, known for its reliability, integrity, and commitment to customer success. Future plans include expanding the product portfolio to encompass a wider range of essential goods and services, catering to the evolving needs of the local market. This may involve forging strategic partnerships with new suppliers and manufacturers, both within and outside the region. Furthermore, the agency intends to leverage technology to streamline its operations, improve efficiency, and enhance the customer experience. This may include implementing online ordering platforms, developing mobile applications for order tracking and inventory management, and utilizing data analytics to gain insights into market trends and customer preferences. Long-term goals involve establishing a strong brand reputation as a trusted and reliable partner, contributing to the economic development of Assam, and creating opportunities for local businesses to thrive. By focusing on innovation, collaboration, and a deep understanding of the local market, Maa Rukmini Agencies is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and become a significant player in the region’s business ecosystem.</p>', 'C/O-Navjeewan Ayurbedic Center, below SBI Kalipur branch', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '098641 53865', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:05:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1035, 'Ayushman Herbo Care (SRI SRI TATTVA products available)', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', 'Ayushman Herbo Care (SRI SRI TATTVA products available) is a dedicated wellness retailer situated in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, specifically at the bustling Danish Market, A. K. Deb Road, directly opposite the renowned Kamakhya Sweets. More than just a store, Ayushman Herbo Care is a portal to holistic well-being, offering a curated selection of authentic SRI SRI TATTVA products designed to promote health, vitality, and balance. In a region steeped in traditional medicine and a growing awareness of natural health solutions, Ayushman Herbo Care serves as a trusted source for individuals seeking genuine and effective Ayurvedic remedies. We are committed to providing access to high-quality products that seamlessly integrate ancient wisdom with modern lifestyles.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Ayushman Herbo Care\'s offerings lies a comprehensive range of SRI SRI TATTVA products. This includes a wide array of Ayurvedic medicines, herbal supplements, personal care items, and nutritious food products. From immunity-boosting formulations like Chyawanprash and Giloy tablets to calming herbal teas and natural skin care solutions, the selection caters to a diverse range of health needs. A key differentiator for Ayushman Herbo Care is our focus on authentic SRI SRI TATTVA products. SRI SRI TATTVA is known for its rigorous quality control measures, ethical sourcing practices, and commitment to preserving the integrity of Ayurvedic formulations. This assures our customers that they are receiving products that are not only effective but also safe and trustworthy. Recognizing the specific health challenges and lifestyle preferences of the local community, we also stock products designed to address common ailments such as digestive issues, stress, and respiratory problems prevalent in the region. By providing a curated selection of readily available and reliable herbal solutions, Ayushman Herbo Care empowers individuals to proactively manage their health and well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Ayushman Herbo Care. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel comfortable exploring the world of Ayurveda. Our knowledgeable staff is trained to provide personalized guidance, answering questions about products, offering recommendations based on individual needs, and educating customers about the principles of Ayurvedic living. We understand that many people may be new to Ayurveda, so we take the time to explain the benefits of different herbs and formulations in a clear and accessible manner. Beyond simply selling products, Ayushman Herbo Care aims to build lasting relationships with our customers. We regularly host in-store events and workshops on topics such as healthy eating, stress management, and Ayurvedic self-care practices. By fostering a sense of community and providing valuable educational resources, we strive to empower our customers to make informed choices about their health. Our location, directly opposite Kamakhya Sweets, a well-known landmark, further enhances our accessibility and integration within the local community. We view ourselves not just as a retailer, but as a partner in our customers\' journey towards optimal health and wellness.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Ayushman Herbo Care envisions becoming the leading provider of authentic Ayurvedic solutions in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our product offerings to include a wider range of SRI SRI TATTVA products, catering to the evolving health needs of our customers. Furthermore, we intend to strengthen our online presence, allowing customers to conveniently access our products and services from the comfort of their homes. A key focus will be on developing educational content and resources to further promote awareness about Ayurveda and its benefits. We aspire to collaborate with local healthcare professionals and wellness practitioners to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices. Ultimately, Ayushman Herbo Care\'s long-term goal is to empower individuals to take control of their health through the power of Ayurveda, fostering a healthier and more vibrant community in Assam and contributing to the growing global movement towards natural and holistic wellness. We are committed to remaining a trusted and reliable source for authentic SRI SRI TATTVA products, consistently upholding the highest standards of quality, integrity, and customer service.', 'Danish Market, A. K, Deb Road, opposite to Kamakhya Sweets', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '097747 60961', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:05:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1036, 'Rejuve Aesthetics : Aesthetic clinic | Chemical Peel | Laser Hair Removal | Hydra Facial Guwahati', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Rejuve Aesthetics stands as a premier aesthetic clinic in Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to providing advanced and personalized skincare solutions. Positioned at a convenient location in the heart of the city, Rejuve Aesthetics addresses the growing demand for sophisticated and effective aesthetic treatments within the local community. The clinic distinguishes itself by offering a comprehensive range of services, including expertly administered chemical peels, state-of-the-art laser hair removal, and rejuvenating HydraFacial treatments, all delivered in a comfortable and professional environment. Recognizing the unique needs of its clientele, Rejuve Aesthetics blends cutting-edge technology with a deep understanding of individual skin types and concerns, making it a trusted destination for enhancing natural beauty and promoting skin health in the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of Rejuve Aesthetics\' service offerings are three key treatments: Chemical Peels, Laser Hair Removal, and HydraFacial. The Chemical Peel services are tailored to address various skin concerns, from acne and hyperpigmentation to fine lines and wrinkles. Using a range of peel formulations, skilled aestheticians customize treatments to suit individual skin types and desired outcomes. Laser Hair Removal utilizes advanced laser technology to provide a safe and effective solution for long-term hair reduction. This service offers a convenient and less invasive alternative to traditional hair removal methods, catering to the demand for permanent hair reduction solutions. HydraFacial treatments offer a multi-step approach to cleansing, exfoliating, extracting, hydrating, and protecting the skin. This non-invasive procedure delivers immediate and visible results, leaving the skin refreshed, radiant, and deeply hydrated. These services are carefully selected and meticulously executed to meet the specific needs and preferences of the local market, ensuring that clients receive the most effective and appropriate treatments for their skin concerns. Rejuve Aesthetics distinguishes itself by employing highly trained and experienced professionals who are committed to providing the highest quality of care using industry-leading technologies.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Rejuve Aesthetics prioritizes customer satisfaction and strives to create a positive and welcoming experience for every client. From the initial consultation to the completion of treatment, the clinic\'s staff is dedicated to providing personalized attention and guidance. Each client receives a thorough skin assessment to determine the most suitable treatment plan, ensuring that individual needs and expectations are met. The clinic fosters a relaxing and comfortable atmosphere, designed to put clients at ease and enhance their overall experience. Recognizing the importance of building strong relationships with the local community, Rejuve Aesthetics actively participates in local events and initiatives, promoting skin health awareness and providing valuable information on skincare best practices. The clinic also leverages social media and other digital platforms to engage with its audience, share informative content, and foster a sense of community among its clients. Customer feedback is highly valued and used to continuously improve services and ensure that Rejuve Aesthetics remains a trusted and respected provider of aesthetic treatments in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking towards the future, Rejuve Aesthetics envisions becoming the leading aesthetic clinic in Guwahati and the surrounding region. The clinic plans to expand its range of services to include advanced skincare treatments and innovative technologies, staying at the forefront of the aesthetic industry. Future plans involve investing in further training and education for the staff, ensuring that they remain knowledgeable and skilled in the latest techniques and procedures. Rejuve Aesthetics also aims to expand its physical presence, potentially opening additional locations to better serve a wider client base. By continuously striving for excellence and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Rejuve Aesthetics is committed to providing exceptional aesthetic services and empowering individuals to feel confident and beautiful in their own skin. The long-term goal is to establish Rejuve Aesthetics as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and personalized care in the aesthetic industry.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '080116 11002', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:05:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1037, 'Patanjali Chikitsalay', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Patanjali Chikitsalay, strategically located on the 1st floor, No 191, Road, opposite the MLA Hostel in Assam, serves as a vital center for holistic health and well-being within the local community. Distinguishing itself through its commitment to traditional Ayurvedic principles and the integration of Patanjali\'s extensive range of products, the Chikitsalay offers a unique approach to healthcare that resonates deeply with the cultural values and preferences of the Assamese people. It stands as a beacon of natural and preventative healthcare, addressing the growing demand for alternative and complementary medicine within the region. This business is more than just a retail outlet; it is a health and wellness hub fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation of Ayurveda.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Patanjali Chikitsalay\'s offerings lie personalized Ayurvedic consultations conducted by experienced and knowledgeable practitioners. These consultations are designed to identify individual <i>prakriti</i> (body constitution) and imbalances (<i>vikriti</i>), paving the way for tailored treatment plans. These plans often incorporate a combination of herbal remedies, dietary recommendations, lifestyle modifications, and yoga practices. The Chikitsalay provides access to a comprehensive range of Patanjali products, including herbal supplements, Ayurvedic medicines, personal care items, and food products. A key differentiator is the emphasis on education and guidance. Staff are trained to provide detailed information about the benefits and appropriate usage of each product, ensuring customers can make informed decisions about their health and well-being. This focus on personalized care and readily available product knowledge distinguishes Patanjali Chikitsalay from conventional pharmacies and general stores, establishing it as a trusted resource for Ayurvedic solutions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience at Patanjali Chikitsalay is paramount. The team fosters a welcoming and supportive environment where individuals feel comfortable discussing their health concerns and exploring natural treatment options. A patient-centric approach emphasizes building long-term relationships based on trust and understanding. This involves active listening, empathy, and a genuine commitment to helping individuals achieve their health goals. What sets this Chikitsalay apart is its active engagement with the local community. This often includes organizing health awareness camps, workshops on yoga and meditation, and educational sessions on Ayurvedic principles. By actively participating in community events and fostering relationships with local organizations, Patanjali Chikitsalay strengthens its connection with the people of Assam and reinforces its role as a reliable source of holistic health information and resources. This proactive approach goes beyond mere transactions; it cultivates a sense of shared well-being and community ownership.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Patanjali Chikitsalay is one of sustainable growth and expanded impact. The business aims to enhance its offerings by incorporating advanced diagnostic techniques rooted in Ayurveda, potentially including pulse diagnosis (<i>Nadi Pariksha</i>) and tongue analysis. There is potential to expand the range of services to include specialized therapies like Panchakarma (detoxification and rejuvenation) in a dedicated and appropriately equipped space, although this would be subject to careful planning and resource allocation. Furthermore, the Chikitsalay plans to leverage digital platforms to reach a wider audience and provide online consultations and product information. Collaborations with local healthcare providers and organizations are also envisioned to integrate Ayurvedic principles into mainstream healthcare practices, contributing to a more holistic and integrated approach to health management. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish Patanjali Chikitsalay as a leading center for Ayurvedic healthcare in Assam, empowering individuals to take control of their health and well-being through natural and time-tested methods. The aim is to create a model Chikitsalay that can be replicated across the region, further promoting the benefits of Ayurveda and contributing to a healthier society.</p>', '1st floor, No 191, Road, opposite Mla Hostel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '0373 232 8191', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:10:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1038, 'BALARAM PILES CLINIC', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>BALARAM PILES CLINIC is a dedicated healthcare provider located in Assam, specializing in the diagnosis and treatment of hemorrhoids (piles) and other anorectal conditions. Understanding the sensitive nature of these ailments and the often-stigmatized approach to seeking treatment, the clinic has established itself as a trusted and compassionate center for comprehensive care. The clinic distinguishes itself through a patient-centric philosophy, emphasizing personalized treatment plans tailored to each individual\'s specific needs and medical history. By combining modern medical advancements with a culturally sensitive approach, BALARAM PILES CLINIC addresses a significant healthcare need within the Assam community, promoting well-being and restoring quality of life for its patients.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of BALARAM PILES CLINIC lies its core offering: a comprehensive suite of services dedicated to the management of piles and related conditions. These services encompass a wide range, starting with thorough and discrete diagnostic assessments. These assessments may involve physical examinations, anoscopy, and sigmoidoscopy, ensuring accurate identification and staging of the condition. Based on the diagnosis, the clinic offers both non-surgical and surgical treatment options. Non-surgical treatments include lifestyle modifications, dietary recommendations, topical creams, and minimally invasive procedures such as sclerotherapy and rubber band ligation. When surgery is deemed necessary, the clinic utilizes advanced techniques to minimize discomfort, speed up recovery, and reduce the risk of recurrence. The clinic’s unique selling point is its commitment to offering a complete spectrum of treatment options, ensuring patients receive the most appropriate and effective care tailored to their individual circumstances. This comprehensive approach is crucial in a region where access to specialized medical care can be limited, offering a vital service that addresses a prevalent health concern within the local population.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>BALARAM PILES CLINIC places paramount importance on the patient experience. From the moment a patient contacts the clinic, they are met with empathy, respect, and discretion. The clinic environment is designed to be comfortable and reassuring, fostering a sense of trust and openness. Medical professionals at BALARAM PILES CLINIC prioritize clear and concise communication, ensuring patients fully understand their condition, treatment options, and expected outcomes. Emphasis is placed on answering all questions thoroughly and addressing any anxieties or concerns patients may have. Beyond the immediate treatment, the clinic provides ongoing support and guidance, including post-operative care and lifestyle recommendations to prevent recurrence. The clinic fosters strong connections with the local community through educational initiatives and awareness programs about piles and related health issues. By actively engaging with the community and fostering a culture of open dialogue, BALARAM PILES CLINIC builds trust and reinforces its commitment to the well-being of the people it serves.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, BALARAM PILES CLINIC envisions becoming the leading center for anorectal care in Assam. The clinic is actively exploring opportunities to expand its services and reach, potentially through establishing satellite clinics in underserved areas and partnering with local healthcare providers to enhance accessibility. Furthermore, the clinic is committed to staying at the forefront of medical advancements, continuously updating its treatment protocols and incorporating innovative technologies to improve patient outcomes. Investing in staff training and professional development is also a key priority, ensuring the clinic maintains a high standard of expertise and remains equipped to address the evolving healthcare needs of the community. Long-term goals include establishing a research component to contribute to the understanding and treatment of piles in the context of the local population, and ultimately, reducing the burden of this condition in the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>BALARAM PILES CLINIC is not just a healthcare provider; it is a vital community resource dedicated to providing compassionate and comprehensive care for a sensitive and often overlooked health issue. Through its commitment to patient-centric service, innovative treatment options, and community engagement, the clinic plays a significant role in promoting the health and well-being of the people of Assam.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '084866 88424', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:10:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1039, 'Patanjali Ayurvedic', 'Ayurvedic Centers', '', '<p>Patanjali Ayurvedic, nestled at the heart of Assam (4RMG+77H), stands as a beacon of traditional wellness, bringing the time-tested wisdom of Ayurveda to the local community. More than just a retail outlet, it\'s a sanctuary where ancient healing practices meet contemporary needs. In a region steeped in rich cultural heritage and a growing awareness of holistic health, Patanjali Ayurvedic fills a crucial gap, offering authentic Ayurvedic products and guidance that promote well-being and balance. Its presence significantly contributes to the local business landscape by championing sustainable, natural alternatives and fostering a deeper appreciation for India\'s ancient healing traditions. The business is deeply rooted in the principles of Patanjali, a name synonymous with quality and purity in the Ayurvedic world.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Patanjali Ayurvedic provides a wide spectrum of Ayurvedic products, carefully formulated and sourced using traditional methods and high-quality ingredients. The product range encompasses everything from herbal medicines and dietary supplements to personal care items like shampoos, soaps, and skincare solutions. A significant portion of the offerings cater to specific health concerns prevalent in the region, such as digestive issues, joint pain, and respiratory ailments. These products are meticulously crafted to address these needs effectively and naturally. A key unique selling point lies in the authenticity and purity of the ingredients, many of which are sourced directly from local farms and ethically harvested. This commitment to quality ensures that customers receive genuine Ayurvedic solutions that are both safe and effective. Furthermore, the store provides personalized consultations, offering guidance from experienced practitioners who can recommend suitable products and lifestyle modifications based on individual needs and health conditions. This emphasis on personalized care distinguishes Patanjali Ayurvedic from standard retail outlets, positioning it as a trusted partner in the pursuit of holistic wellness for the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Patanjali Ayurvedic. The approach to customer service is rooted in the Ayurvedic philosophy of \"Atithi Devo Bhava\" – treating guests as God. Every customer is greeted with warmth and respect, fostering a welcoming and supportive environment. The staff is trained not only on product knowledge but also on the basic principles of Ayurveda, enabling them to provide informed guidance and address customer concerns effectively. What truly sets Patanjali Ayurvedic apart is its commitment to building genuine relationships with customers. This goes beyond simply selling products; it involves educating the community about the benefits of Ayurveda, organizing workshops on healthy living, and participating in local events to promote wellness. The store actively seeks feedback from customers, using it to continuously improve its offerings and services. By actively engaging with the local community and prioritizing customer well-being, Patanjali Ayurvedic has cultivated a strong reputation as a trusted source of authentic Ayurvedic solutions and a valuable contributor to the region\'s health and wellness ecosystem.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Patanjali Ayurvedic envisions becoming a leading center for Ayurvedic wellness in Assam. This involves expanding its product range to include a wider variety of specialized Ayurvedic formulations and therapies. Future plans also include establishing a dedicated wellness center, offering traditional Ayurvedic treatments such as Panchakarma, Abhyanga, and Shirodhara, under the guidance of qualified Ayurvedic doctors and therapists. Another key focus is on strengthening partnerships with local farmers and suppliers to promote sustainable sourcing practices and support the local economy. The long-term goal is to not only provide access to high-quality Ayurvedic products and services but also to empower the community with the knowledge and tools to lead healthier, more balanced lives. By staying true to its core values of authenticity, quality, and customer-centricity, Patanjali Ayurvedic is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of healthcare and wellness in Assam, while remaining deeply connected to its local roots and contributing to the prosperity of the region.</p>', '4RMG+77H', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:10:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
