(1065, 'Pankhiraj resort', 'Resorts', '', 'Pankhiraj Resort, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offers a serene escape from the bustling city life, while remaining conveniently accessible to all its amenities. As a premier hospitality destination in Assam, Pankhiraj Resort distinguishes itself through its commitment to providing an authentic Assamese experience blended with modern comforts and impeccable service. Unlike typical hotels, the resort emphasizes a connection with nature, local culture, and personalized attention, making it a significant contributor to the tourism sector of the region. Its tranquil setting, coupled with its dedication to promoting local arts and crafts, positions Pankhiraj Resort as a unique and valued entity within the local business ecosystem.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Pankhiraj Resort provides a comprehensive range of hospitality services designed to cater to a diverse clientele. Accommodation options range from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, each meticulously designed to offer a blend of comfort and aesthetic appeal. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. Beyond accommodation, the resort boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both local Assamese delicacies and international favorites, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. This focus on local produce supports local farmers and contributes to the authenticity of the dining experience. A standout feature is the resort\'s expansive outdoor space, including lush gardens, a swimming pool, and dedicated areas for recreational activities. This ample space allows for hosting events ranging from corporate retreats and conferences to weddings and family gatherings. The availability of customized event planning services further enhances the resort’s appeal. Unique selling points include curated experiences such as tea garden tours, traditional Assamese cooking classes, and cultural performances showcasing local music and dance. These offerings allow guests to immerse themselves in the rich culture of Assam, setting Pankhiraj Resort apart from conventional accommodation providers. By offering such authentic experiences, the resort caters to the growing demand for experiential travel and contributes to the promotion of Assam\'s unique cultural heritage.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Pankhiraj Resort, shaping every aspect of its operations. The resort\'s staff is trained to anticipate and cater to the individual needs of each guest, ensuring a personalized and memorable stay. From the warm welcome at reception to the attentive service in the restaurant, the emphasis is on creating a genuine and hospitable atmosphere. The resort actively seeks feedback from guests through surveys and direct interactions, continuously refining its services to meet evolving expectations. Beyond providing exceptional service, Pankhiraj Resort actively engages with the local community. It supports local artisans by showcasing their products in the resort\'s gift shop and incorporating local crafts into the décor. It also participates in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of community and contributing to the preservation of Assamese traditions. Furthermore, the resort prioritizes employing local residents, providing economic opportunities and contributing to the overall well-being of the community. By focusing on personalized service and actively engaging with the local community, Pankhiraj Resort fosters strong relationships with its guests and solidifies its position as a respected and valued member of the Guwahati community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for Pankhiraj Resort is ambitious, focused on sustainable growth and enhancing its contribution to the region\'s tourism sector. Plans are underway to expand the resort\'s facilities, including adding more rooms and developing specialized wellness programs centered on traditional Assamese healing practices. A key focus is on embracing sustainable tourism practices, minimizing the resort\'s environmental footprint, and promoting responsible travel. This includes initiatives such as implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. The resort also intends to strengthen its partnerships with local tour operators and travel agencies to attract a wider range of visitors and promote Assam as a premier tourist destination. Exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism initiatives, such as guided nature walks and birdwatching tours, is also on the horizon. Furthermore, the resort aims to become a hub for cultural exchange, hosting workshops and seminars on Assamese art, music, and literature. By focusing on sustainable practices, expanding its offerings, and actively promoting Assam\'s cultural heritage, Pankhiraj Resort envisions a future where it continues to thrive as a premier hospitality destination, contributing significantly to the economic and cultural prosperity of the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:35:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1066, 'Arya Eco Resort, Pobitora', 'Resorts', '', 'Arya Eco Resort, Pobitora: A Sanctuary of Sustainability and Assam\'s Untamed Beauty\n\nArya Eco Resort, Pobitora, stands as a testament to responsible tourism and a celebration of Assam\'s rich biodiversity. Nestled near the famed Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary, often dubbed \"Mini Kaziranga\" for its high density of Indian rhinoceros, the resort offers a unique and immersive experience that blends comfortable accommodations with a commitment to ecological preservation and community engagement. Unlike conventional hotels, Arya Eco Resort is deeply rooted in sustainable practices and strives to minimize its environmental impact while simultaneously contributing to the socio-economic well-being of the surrounding villages. The resort\'s significance lies not just in providing a tranquil escape, but in fostering environmental awareness and supporting the conservation efforts vital to protecting Pobitora\'s unique ecosystem. It represents a growing trend in the Assam tourism sector, catering to discerning travelers who seek authentic experiences and prioritize ethical and sustainable travel choices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe core of Arya Eco Resort\'s offerings revolves around providing comfortable and ecologically responsible accommodation options. These range from traditionally styled cottages that reflect the local architecture to well-appointed rooms designed to minimize energy consumption. Beyond accommodation, the resort provides a comprehensive suite of services designed to enhance the visitor\'s experience of Pobitora and Assam. These include guided tours of the wildlife sanctuary led by experienced and knowledgeable local guides, nature walks that delve into the region\'s flora and fauna, and opportunities to engage with the local community through cultural performances and village visits.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA key differentiator for Arya Eco Resort is its unwavering commitment to sustainability. This is evident in its use of locally sourced materials in construction, its reliance on renewable energy sources wherever possible, and its implementation of waste management and water conservation practices. Furthermore, the resort actively promotes responsible tourism by educating guests about the importance of conservation and encouraging them to adopt eco-friendly habits during their stay. The resort also boasts a farm-to-table dining experience, sourcing fresh produce from local farmers and minimizing its carbon footprint. This commitment to sustainability is a major selling point, attracting environmentally conscious travelers who are increasingly seeking destinations that align with their values. By directly supporting local communities through employment and procurement, Arya Eco Resort contributes to the economic empowerment of the region, creating a symbiotic relationship between tourism and local development.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Arya Eco Resort, customer experience is paramount. The staff is dedicated to providing personalized service and ensuring that each guest feels welcomed and cared for. The resort prides itself on its ability to create a warm and authentic atmosphere, allowing visitors to connect with the local culture and environment on a deeper level. The team are almost exclusively recruited from local villages and are trained not only in hospitality but also in environmental awareness and cultural sensitivity. This ensures that guests receive informed and respectful guidance throughout their stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe resort actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local schools and healthcare facilities, participating in conservation projects, and promoting local handicrafts. These efforts not only strengthen the resort\'s ties to the community but also enhance the visitor\'s experience by providing opportunities to interact with local people and learn about their traditions and way of life. The resort strives to create a mutually beneficial relationship, ensuring that tourism contributes to the well-being of the community while preserving its cultural heritage. This approach not only differentiates Arya Eco Resort from other accommodations but also fosters a sense of responsibility and shared purpose among guests and staff alike.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Arya Eco Resort envisions becoming a leading example of sustainable tourism in Assam, setting a benchmark for responsible hospitality practices. Future plans include expanding its accommodation capacity while maintaining its commitment to low-impact development. The resort also aims to develop more immersive and educational programs focused on wildlife conservation and local culture, further enriching the visitor experience. A key long-term goal is to establish a training center for sustainable tourism practices, empowering local communities to develop their own eco-tourism initiatives and contribute to the economic growth of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nMoreover, Arya Eco Resort seeks to collaborate with local conservation organizations and government agencies to strengthen the protection of the Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary and its surrounding areas. This includes supporting anti-poaching efforts, promoting sustainable land management practices, and raising awareness about the importance of biodiversity conservation. By playing an active role in conservation efforts, Arya Eco Resort aims to ensure the long-term sustainability of its operations and contribute to the preservation of Assam\'s natural heritage for future generations. The vision is to not only provide a memorable experience for visitors but also to create a lasting positive impact on the environment and the community. Ultimately, Arya Eco Resort aspires to be more than just a place to stay; it strives to be a catalyst for sustainable development and a guardian of Assam\'s natural treasures.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:35:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1067, 'The Residency Tourist Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>The Residency Tourist Resort stands as a distinguished hospitality landmark in Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil escape coupled with modern amenities and an authentic cultural experience. Situated strategically to provide easy access to the city’s key attractions while maintaining a serene atmosphere, The Residency caters to both leisure and business travelers seeking a refined and memorable stay. More than just a place to rest, The Residency embodies the spirit of Assamese hospitality, acting as a gateway to exploring the rich heritage and natural beauty of the region. Its significance in the local business landscape stems from its commitment to providing exceptional service, supporting local artisans and businesses, and contributing to the sustainable growth of tourism in Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The Residency Tourist Resort offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. At its core, the resort provides luxurious accommodation, ranging from elegantly appointed rooms to spacious suites, each meticulously designed to offer comfort and relaxation. These accommodations are equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and climate control systems. Beyond accommodation, The Residency boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant, \"Flavors of Assam,\" specializing in authentic Assamese cuisine alongside international favorites, providing a gastronomic journey that delights the palate. For corporate guests and event organizers, the resort offers state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, capable of hosting a wide range of events, from small meetings to large-scale conferences. A unique selling point lies in the resort\'s focus on curating personalized experiences, such as guided tours of local tea gardens, cultural performances showcasing Bihu dance and music, and workshops on Assamese handicrafts. These offerings address the growing demand for immersive travel experiences that connect visitors with the local culture and heritage, thereby fulfilling a crucial need in the Guwahati tourism market.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At The Residency, customer experience is paramount. The resort cultivates a culture of genuine hospitality, where every guest is treated with personalized attention and care. Staff members are trained to anticipate guest needs and exceed their expectations, fostering a welcoming and memorable stay. The resort\'s commitment to service excellence extends beyond the provision of amenities; it encompasses creating a sense of belonging and connection. The Residency actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as sourcing fresh produce from local farmers, partnering with artisans to showcase their crafts in the resort\'s gift shop, and supporting local schools and charities. This commitment to social responsibility not only enhances the resort\'s reputation but also fosters a strong connection with the local community, making The Residency a beloved institution in Guwahati. Customer feedback is actively sought and valued, with the resort continuously striving to improve its services and offerings based on guest preferences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, The Residency Tourist Resort envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and the broader Assam region. Future plans include expanding the resort\'s accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand for quality lodging. This expansion will be carefully planned to maintain the resort\'s tranquil atmosphere and preserve its commitment to sustainable practices. The resort also intends to further develop its offerings of curated experiences, introducing new tours and activities that showcase the diverse cultural and natural attractions of Assam. This includes exploring partnerships with local tour operators to offer specialized itineraries focused on wildlife tourism, adventure tourism, and cultural immersion. The long-term goals of The Residency include establishing itself as a benchmark for sustainable tourism in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices, and contributing to the economic development of the local community. This will involve implementing eco-friendly initiatives, such as reducing waste, conserving energy, and supporting local conservation efforts. Furthermore, The Residency aims to foster a strong sense of corporate social responsibility, actively engaging in community development projects and contributing to the well-being of the region. By pursuing these goals, The Residency Tourist Resort seeks to create a lasting positive impact on the local environment and community, while providing exceptional hospitality experiences for its guests.</p>\n</body>\n</html>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:40:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1068, 'Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort in Chanaka', 'Resorts', '', '<h1>Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort in Chanaka, Guwahati: A Tranquil Escape Rooted in Assamese Hospitality</h1>\n\nHill Mynah Bamboo Resort, nestled in the serene landscape of Chanaka, Guwahati, offers a unique and immersive experience that blends the tranquility of nature with the rich cultural heritage of Assam. More than just a resort, it’s a haven designed to provide guests with an authentic and rejuvenating escape from the everyday, contributing meaningfully to the local tourism sector by showcasing sustainable practices and promoting regional artistry. Situated just a short drive from the bustling city of Guwahati, the resort provides a readily accessible retreat, catering to both domestic and international travelers seeking solace and cultural immersion. The resort strives to be a benchmark for sustainable tourism in the region, demonstrating responsible environmental stewardship alongside excellent customer service. <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Nature, Comfort, and Culture</h2>\n\nAt the heart of Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality within an environmentally conscious framework. The resort\'s core offerings center around providing comfortable and thoughtfully designed accommodations, authentic Assamese cuisine, and curated experiences that showcase the region\'s natural beauty and cultural traditions. <br> <br>\n\nOur accommodations are crafted primarily from locally sourced bamboo, reflecting Assam\'s rich tradition of bamboo craftsmanship. These eco-friendly cottages and suites offer a blend of rustic charm and modern amenities, ensuring a comfortable and relaxing stay. Each dwelling is designed to maximize natural light and ventilation, minimizing the resort\'s environmental footprint while providing guests with stunning views of the surrounding landscape. We offer a range of room types to cater to diverse needs, from solo travelers seeking quiet contemplation to families desiring a memorable vacation. <br> <br>\n\nThe resort\'s dining experience is a celebration of Assamese cuisine, featuring fresh, locally sourced ingredients prepared with traditional techniques. Our chefs are dedicated to showcasing the diverse flavors of the region, from aromatic curries and flavorful fish preparations to delectable sweets and refreshing beverages. We also offer cooking classes that allow guests to learn about the art of Assamese cooking and create their own culinary masterpieces. Emphasis is placed on utilizing seasonal produce and supporting local farmers and producers, further bolstering the regional economy. <br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodations and dining, Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort offers a range of curated experiences designed to connect guests with the region\'s natural beauty and cultural heritage. These include guided nature walks through the surrounding hills, birdwatching tours led by knowledgeable local guides, visits to nearby tea gardens, and cultural performances showcasing traditional Assamese music and dance. We also offer opportunities for guests to participate in local craft workshops, learning about traditional weaving, pottery, and bamboo art from skilled artisans. These experiences provide a deeper understanding of Assamese culture and foster a sense of connection to the local community. The resort also focuses on wellness, offering yoga sessions, massage services utilizing local herbs and oils, and meditative spaces for relaxation and rejuvenation. <br> <br>\n\nOur unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of sustainable practices, authentic cultural experiences, and personalized service. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact while maximizing the positive impact we have on the local community. This commitment resonates with environmentally conscious travelers seeking authentic and meaningful experiences. <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Hospitality and Community Engagement</h2>\n\nHill Mynah Bamboo Resort prioritizes creating a memorable and personalized experience for each guest. Our dedicated staff is committed to providing attentive and friendly service, ensuring that every need is met with warmth and efficiency. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality and treated as valued members of our extended family. We understand that every guest is unique, and we strive to tailor our services to meet their individual preferences and needs. <br> <br>\n\nWe actively engage with the local community, sourcing our products and services from local suppliers and artisans whenever possible. This not only supports the local economy but also provides guests with an authentic taste of Assamese culture. We also host regular community events, such as cultural festivals and workshops, that bring together locals and visitors to celebrate the region\'s rich heritage. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we create a mutually beneficial partnership that enhances the overall guest experience. The resort participates in local tourism initiatives, promoting the region as a desirable destination for responsible and sustainable travel. We also strive to educate our guests about Assamese culture and environmental conservation, encouraging them to become ambassadors for the region. <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Sustainable Growth and Regional Leadership</h2>\n\nHill Mynah Bamboo Resort envisions a future of sustainable growth, becoming a leading example of responsible tourism in the region. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodations while maintaining our commitment to eco-friendly practices, developing new and innovative experiences that showcase the region\'s unique cultural and natural assets, and further strengthening our relationships with the local community. We plan to implement more advanced sustainability measures, such as solar power generation and rainwater harvesting, to minimize our environmental footprint. We also aim to create educational programs that empower local communities to participate in the tourism industry and benefit from its economic opportunities. In the coming years, we hope to achieve certifications for our sustainable practices, ensuring we adhere to high standards of environmental and social responsibility. Ultimately, Hill Mynah Bamboo Resort aims to be more than just a resort; it aspires to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable tourism, cultural preservation, and community development in the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:40:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1069, 'Hill View Holiday Home & Resort, Guwahati', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Hill View Holiday Home & Resort stands as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, offering a serene escape from the bustling city life while providing easy access to the region’s rich cultural and natural attractions. More than just accommodation, Hill View is an experience, carefully crafted to provide both leisure and convenience for discerning travelers and local residents seeking a refreshing getaway. Positioned uniquely within the Guwahati hospitality sector, it combines the tranquility of a secluded retreat with the accessibility of a city-adjacent location, filling a crucial need for high-quality, restorative experiences.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodations catering to a diverse clientele. These range from cozy, family-friendly rooms in our Holiday Home section to luxurious suites within the Resort, each designed with meticulous attention to detail. Beyond accommodation, Hill View boasts a range of complementary services, including an on-site restaurant serving authentic Assamese cuisine alongside popular international dishes, a well-maintained swimming pool, and beautifully landscaped gardens perfect for relaxation and leisurely strolls. We also provide event spaces suitable for weddings, corporate retreats, and family gatherings, equipped with modern amenities and customizable packages. A key differentiator is our focus on showcasing the local culture and heritage. This is reflected in our decor, cuisine, and curated experiences like guided tours to nearby tea gardens and cultural sites. We understand the needs of the local market, which values authenticity, personalized service, and a strong connection to the region\'s identity. We strive to fulfill these needs by offering a genuine Assamese hospitality experience coupled with modern comforts and conveniences.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Hill View\'s operations. We aim to create a welcoming and personalized atmosphere for every guest. Our staff is meticulously trained to anticipate needs and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a seamless and memorable stay. From the moment a guest arrives until their departure, we prioritize attentiveness and responsiveness. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing a room; we strive to create a connection with our guests and the local community. We actively engage with local artisans and suppliers, promoting their products and showcasing the region\'s talent. We also participate in local events and initiatives, contributing to the community\'s well-being. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Our online presence is equally important, with dedicated channels for responding to inquiries, addressing concerns, and maintaining transparent communication. We believe in building lasting relationships with our guests, fostering a sense of loyalty and trust that extends beyond a single visit. By offering a personalized and culturally immersive experience, we aim to stand out from generic hotel chains and become a preferred destination for travelers seeking an authentic connection with Guwahati and Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Hill View Holiday Home & Resort envisions a future where it stands as a landmark destination, synonymous with quality hospitality and authentic Assamese experiences. Our long-term goals involve expanding our accommodation capacity to cater to the growing demand for tourism in the region. We plan to introduce new amenities and services, such as a spa and wellness center, and further enhance our event facilities to accommodate larger gatherings. Sustainability is also a key consideration, and we aim to implement eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, reducing our environmental footprint and promoting responsible tourism. We are exploring partnerships with local tourism operators to offer enhanced tour packages and curated experiences, showcasing the diverse attractions of Assam. We also plan to invest in technology to streamline our operations, improve communication with guests, and enhance the overall customer experience. Furthermore, we intend to develop training programs for local youth, equipping them with the skills and knowledge necessary to pursue careers in the hospitality industry, thus contributing to the region\'s economic development. Ultimately, our vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that benefits both our guests and the local community, solidifying Hill View Holiday Home & Resort as a leading destination in Guwahati\'s hospitality landscape for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:40:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1070, 'Brahmaputra Calling!', 'Resorts', '', '<p><b>Brahmaputra Calling!: Unveiling Assam\'s Treasures to the World</b></p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Brahmaputra Calling! is more than just a business; it\'s a vibrant gateway to the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Northeast India. We are a specialized tourism and cultural experience provider dedicated to showcasing the authentic essence of Assam, offering curated journeys that resonate with discerning travelers seeking unique and immersive encounters. In a region often overlooked by mainstream tourism, Brahmaputra Calling! stands out by prioritizing sustainable practices, supporting local communities, and providing unparalleled access to Assam\'s hidden gems.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core strength lies in crafting bespoke travel itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We offer a diverse portfolio of services, including:</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><b>Curated Tours:</b> We design thematic tours focusing on various aspects of Assamese culture, wildlife, and adventure. These include tea garden tours showcasing the art of tea making, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park (home to the one-horned rhinoceros), river cruises along the mighty Brahmaputra, and cultural immersion experiences in tribal villages.</li>\n    <li><b>Homestays and Eco-Lodges:</b> We partner with local families and eco-conscious accommodations to provide authentic and sustainable lodging options that immerse travelers in the local way of life. This fosters cultural exchange and contributes directly to the economic well-being of the communities we work with.</li>\n    <li><b>Cultural Experiences:</b> We arrange interactive workshops and demonstrations featuring traditional Assamese crafts, cuisine, music, and dance. These experiences offer a deeper understanding of Assam\'s heritage and provide opportunities for guests to connect with local artisans and performers.</li>\n    <li><b>Customized Itineraries:</b> We understand that every traveler has unique interests and preferences. Our team works closely with clients to create personalized itineraries that cater to their specific needs and ensure an unforgettable journey.</li>\n    <li><b>Corporate Retreats & Team Building:</b> We design unique corporate events incorporating elements of Assamese culture and adventure, fostering collaboration and team spirit amidst the serene landscape.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our unwavering commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and community engagement. We prioritize ethical tourism practices that minimize environmental impact and maximize benefits for local communities. We work with experienced local guides who possess in-depth knowledge of the region\'s history, culture, and natural environment. This ensures that our guests receive accurate information and gain a genuine appreciation for Assam\'s unique identity. Furthermore, our commitment to using locally sourced products and services helps to support the local economy and promote sustainable development.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Brahmaputra Calling!, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment for our guests, ensuring that their needs are met with professionalism and care. From the moment they make their inquiry to the completion of their journey, our team is dedicated to providing personalized attention and seamless support. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services. Our commitment to building strong relationships with local communities is reflected in the positive feedback we receive from our partners and the long-lasting memories we create for our guests. We actively participate in local festivals and events, showcasing Assamese culture to a wider audience and fostering a sense of pride within the community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Brahmaputra Calling! envisions becoming the leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Northeast India. We plan to expand our network of partner homestays and eco-lodges, further enhancing our commitment to community-based tourism. We are also exploring opportunities to develop new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, such as wellness tourism and adventure travel. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in training and development programs for our local guides and staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to provide world-class service. We are also actively working on creating partnerships with international tourism organizations to promote Assam as a premier travel destination. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the region, preserving its rich cultural heritage and natural environment for future generations to enjoy. We aim to be a catalyst for responsible tourism, inspiring travelers to connect with Assam in a meaningful way and make a positive impact on the local communities.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:40:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1071, 'Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp is a unique and immersive nature-based tourism venture nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. It offers a sustainable and enriching experience, catering to travelers seeking authentic connection with the region\'s rich biodiversity and cultural heritage. In a landscape increasingly aware of environmental responsibility, Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp stands out as a pioneer, promoting eco-tourism practices while providing an unforgettable experience for its guests. It contributes significantly to the local economy by creating employment opportunities and supporting local artisans, farmers, and communities. As Assam\'s tourism sector grows, Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp provides a refreshing alternative to conventional tourism, emphasizing responsible travel and fostering a deep appreciation for the natural world. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core offerings of Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp revolve around providing comfortable and sustainable accommodation amidst nature. Guests can choose from a range of eco-friendly options, including thoughtfully designed bamboo cottages and elevated treehouses that blend seamlessly with the surrounding environment. These accommodations are crafted using locally sourced materials and designed to minimize environmental impact. Beyond accommodation, the camp offers a variety of guided nature treks and birdwatching tours, led by experienced local guides who share their intimate knowledge of the region\'s flora and fauna. These treks are tailored to different fitness levels and interests, ensuring a rewarding experience for all. A key differentiator is the focus on immersive cultural experiences, which allows guests to interact directly with local communities. This includes opportunities to learn about traditional Assamese crafts, participate in cooking demonstrations featuring local ingredients, and witness cultural performances that showcase the region\'s vibrant heritage. The camp also features a farm-to-table dining experience, serving fresh, seasonal meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients, promoting sustainable agriculture and supporting local farmers. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp\'s philosophy. The business prides itself on providing personalized and attentive service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. Upon arrival, guests are greeted with warm hospitality and provided with a comprehensive orientation to the camp\'s facilities and activities. The staff, drawn from the local community, are passionate about sharing their knowledge and love for the region with guests. The camp fosters a friendly and inclusive atmosphere, encouraging interaction between guests and staff, creating a sense of community. What truly sets Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp apart is its commitment to responsible tourism. The business actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local schools, promoting sustainable farming practices, and empowering local artisans. Guests are encouraged to participate in these initiatives, further enhancing their understanding of the local culture and environment. The camp also prioritizes environmental sustainability by implementing waste reduction programs, using renewable energy sources, and minimizing its carbon footprint. By focusing on responsible tourism and community engagement, Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp provides a unique and meaningful experience for its guests, while also contributing to the well-being of the local community. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp envisions becoming a leading eco-tourism destination in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to sustainability, community engagement, and exceptional customer experiences. Future plans include expanding the range of accommodation options, adding more treehouses and perhaps glamping sites, while maintaining the focus on minimal environmental impact. The business aims to enhance its educational offerings by developing interpretive trails and workshops on local ecology and culture. There are also plans to establish a dedicated research center focused on biodiversity conservation and sustainable tourism practices in the region. Another key goal is to strengthen partnerships with local communities, providing greater economic opportunities and empowering them to become active participants in the tourism industry. Long-term, Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp aspires to serve as a model for sustainable tourism development, demonstrating how tourism can be a force for good, benefiting both the environment and the local community. By continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Georgie\'s Retreat Eco Camp is poised to achieve its ambitious vision and solidify its position as a leader in the eco-tourism sector in Assam. </p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:40:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1072, 'Exotic Villa Homestay', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Exotic Villa Homestay: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Exotic Villa Homestay offers a distinctive accommodation experience in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, blending the comforts of a modern guesthouse with the warmth and personalized service of a traditional Assamese home. Situated amidst the vibrant tapestry of the city, yet nestled away from the hustle and bustle, we provide a tranquil haven for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching stay. Unlike conventional hotels, Exotic Villa Homestay aims to immerse guests in the local culture, fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation for the region\'s unique heritage and hospitality. In a market increasingly dominated by standardized hotel chains, Exotic Villa Homestay distinguishes itself by providing a personalized, culturally relevant experience that resonates with both domestic and international visitors. We contribute to the local economy by sourcing local produce, supporting regional artisans, and employing members of the community, thereby reinforcing Assam\'s rich cultural identity and promoting sustainable tourism.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and tastefully decorated rooms, each designed to reflect the essence of Assam\'s artistic traditions. Rooms are equipped with modern amenities, including air conditioning, high-speed internet, and private bathrooms, ensuring a seamless blend of convenience and cultural immersion. Beyond accommodation, we offer a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. This includes: customized guided tours of Guwahati and surrounding areas, tailored to individual interests; cooking classes focused on authentic Assamese cuisine, allowing guests to learn the secrets of local delicacies; cultural performances showcasing traditional Assamese music and dance; and assistance with travel arrangements, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free journey. One of our key differentiators is the emphasis on personalized service. We strive to understand each guest\'s needs and preferences, curating experiences that cater to their individual interests. Whether it\'s arranging a visit to a local tea garden, organizing a trek in the nearby hills, or simply recommending the best places to sample local street food, we go the extra mile to ensure that our guests have an unforgettable stay. Furthermore, we actively promote eco-tourism principles, encouraging responsible travel practices and minimizing our environmental impact. We source organic produce whenever possible, support local artisans, and actively participate in community initiatives aimed at preserving Assam\'s natural beauty.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Exotic Villa Homestay, we believe that customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel valued and respected. Our staff are carefully selected and trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating guests\' needs and exceeding their expectations. We prioritize building genuine connections with our guests, fostering a sense of community and belonging. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and enhance the guest experience. One aspect that distinguishes us is our commitment to promoting local culture. We organize cultural events and workshops, providing opportunities for guests to interact with local artists and artisans. We also work closely with community organizations to support local initiatives and promote sustainable tourism. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by participating in local festivals, sponsoring community events, and supporting local businesses. We believe that by working together, we can create a vibrant and sustainable tourism ecosystem that benefits both visitors and residents alike. We regularly receive positive feedback regarding the cleanliness of our accommodations, the friendliness of our staff, and the authenticity of the cultural experiences we offer. Our commitment to providing exceptional customer service has resulted in a high rate of repeat customers and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Exotic Villa Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our long-term goal is to expand our operations, adding new locations and services while maintaining our commitment to quality and personalized service. We plan to introduce new cultural experiences, such as weaving workshops and pottery classes, further immersing guests in the rich artistic traditions of Assam. We also aim to develop partnerships with local tour operators and transportation providers, creating integrated travel packages that showcase the best of the region. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to expand our online presence, reaching a wider audience and facilitating online bookings. We are committed to investing in technology and innovation, leveraging digital platforms to enhance the guest experience and streamline our operations. Our commitment to sustainability will remain a core focus as we grow. We plan to implement new environmental initiatives, such as rainwater harvesting and solar energy, further reducing our environmental impact. Ultimately, our vision is to create a business that not only provides exceptional travel experiences but also contributes to the economic and social well-being of the local community. We believe that by fostering a culture of innovation, collaboration, and sustainability, we can achieve our goals and create a lasting positive impact on the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:45:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1073, 'Zisuku Villa & Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Zisuku Villa & Resort: A Sanctuary of Tranquility in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled amidst the lush landscapes of Guwahati, Assam, Zisuku Villa & Resort offers a premium hospitality experience, blending modern comfort with the serene beauty of the region. More than just a place to stay, Zisuku is designed as a destination – a tranquil escape where guests can reconnect with nature, rejuvenate their senses, and experience the authentic charm of Assamese culture. In a region known for its burgeoning tourism sector, Zisuku distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, sustainable practices, and a deeply rooted connection to the local community. By offering a unique blend of luxury and authenticity, Zisuku Villa & Resort aims to redefine hospitality standards within Guwahati and become a preferred destination for both domestic and international travelers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Zisuku\'s offerings lies a diverse range of services tailored to meet the needs of discerning travelers. Accommodation options include exquisitely designed villas that offer privacy and exclusivity, along with well-appointed resort rooms that provide unparalleled comfort. Each space is meticulously crafted to create a harmonious blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese aesthetics, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region. Beyond accommodation, Zisuku boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant that serves a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies alongside international favorites, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. The resort also features a state-of-the-art spa and wellness center, offering a range of rejuvenating treatments designed to promote relaxation and well-being.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Zisuku apart is its commitment to providing immersive experiences that showcase the unique beauty and cultural richness of Assam. Guests can participate in guided tours of nearby tea gardens, explore the vibrant local markets, or embark on wildlife safaris to Kaziranga National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage site. Zisuku also offers cultural performances that showcase traditional Assamese music and dance, providing guests with an authentic and unforgettable cultural experience. These unique selling points not only cater to the growing demand for experiential travel but also contribute to the sustainable development of the local community by supporting local artisans, farmers, and cultural performers. By offering a holistic and immersive travel experience, Zisuku addresses the evolving needs of the modern traveler seeking authenticity and connection.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Zisuku Villa & Resort. Every interaction is carefully orchestrated to ensure that guests feel valued, respected, and cared for. From personalized check-in procedures to attentive concierge services, the staff at Zisuku are dedicated to exceeding expectations. The resort prides itself on its warm and welcoming atmosphere, where guests are treated as individuals rather than just room numbers. To enhance guest satisfaction, Zisuku actively seeks feedback and continuously strives to improve its services based on guest preferences. The resort also fosters strong relationships with the local community by sourcing products and services from local businesses, creating employment opportunities, and supporting local initiatives. This commitment to community engagement not only enriches the guest experience but also contributes to the sustainable development of the region. By creating a welcoming and inclusive environment, Zisuku aims to foster long-term relationships with its guests and become a trusted brand synonymous with exceptional hospitality.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Zisuku Villa & Resort envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, building upon its reputation as a premier hospitality destination in Guwahati. Future plans include expanding the resort\'s accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand for luxury travel in the region. The resort also intends to introduce new and innovative services, such as adventure tourism packages, eco-tourism initiatives, and wellness retreats, catering to a wider range of traveler interests. Furthermore, Zisuku aims to strengthen its commitment to sustainable practices by implementing eco-friendly technologies and promoting responsible tourism. By investing in its infrastructure, expanding its service offerings, and embracing sustainable practices, Zisuku Villa & Resort is poised to become a leading force in the Assam hospitality industry, contributing to the economic growth and cultural preservation of the region. The long-term goal is to establish Zisuku as a benchmark for excellence in hospitality, recognized for its commitment to customer satisfaction, community engagement, and environmental sustainability.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:45:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
