(1074, 'The Blue Orchid Resort', 'Resorts', '', 'The Blue Orchid Resort: A Serene Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nThe Blue Orchid Resort offers a tranquil escape from the bustling city life of Guwahati, presenting a harmonious blend of modern comfort and Assamese hospitality. Situated amidst lush greenery, the resort is strategically located to provide easy access to key attractions while maintaining a serene and secluded ambiance. Unlike generic hotels, The Blue Orchid Resort aims to provide a holistic experience, celebrating the culture, cuisine, and natural beauty of Assam. The resort has quickly become a preferred destination for both leisure and business travelers, distinguishing itself as a unique establishment within Guwahati\'s hospitality sector by focusing on personalized service and authentic local experiences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings revolve around providing exceptional accommodation, diverse dining experiences, and versatile event spaces. Our well-appointed rooms and suites cater to a variety of needs, from solo travelers seeking a quiet retreat to families desiring a comfortable and spacious stay. Each room is designed with a focus on comfort and aesthetics, featuring modern amenities and tasteful décor reflecting the region\'s artistic heritage.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe resort\'s dining options are a significant draw, showcasing the rich culinary tapestry of Assam and beyond. Our multi-cuisine restaurant offers a curated menu featuring traditional Assamese dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients, alongside popular Indian and international fare. We also provide customized dining experiences, including private dinners and themed buffets, catering to specific dietary requirements and preferences. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to promoting Assamese cuisine and supporting local farmers and producers. This approach not only provides a distinctive culinary experience but also contributes to the sustainable development of the local community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, The Blue Orchid Resort boasts state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, making it an ideal venue for corporate events, weddings, and social gatherings. Our event spaces are designed to be flexible and adaptable, accommodating both small meetings and large-scale celebrations. The resort provides comprehensive event planning services, ensuring that every detail is meticulously managed to create a seamless and memorable experience. By offering a comprehensive range of services and focusing on quality and customization, The Blue Orchid Resort directly addresses the growing demand for sophisticated and personalized hospitality in Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt The Blue Orchid Resort, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our staff is carefully trained to provide warm, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and comfortable. We strive to anticipate the needs of our guests and go the extra mile to exceed their expectations. This proactive approach to customer service has earned us a loyal clientele and positive word-of-mouth referrals.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are committed to connecting with the local community through various initiatives. We actively support local artisans and craftsmen by showcasing their work in our gift shop and incorporating their designs into our décor. We also partner with local organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and contribute to community development projects. Furthermore, we organize cultural events and performances that showcase the rich heritage of Assam, providing our guests with a unique opportunity to immerse themselves in the local culture. This strong community engagement fosters goodwill and reinforces our position as a responsible and valued member of the Guwahati business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, The Blue Orchid Resort envisions becoming a leading destination for eco-tourism and cultural immersion in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options, developing new and innovative dining concepts, and enhancing our event facilities. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local tour operators to offer curated excursions that showcase the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are committed to adopting sustainable business practices and minimizing our environmental impact. This includes implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and promoting responsible water usage. We believe that by operating in a sustainable and ethical manner, we can contribute to the long-term prosperity of the local community and protect the environment for future generations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to establish The Blue Orchid Resort as a landmark destination in Guwahati, synonymous with exceptional hospitality, authentic local experiences, and sustainable tourism. We are confident that our commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement will enable us to achieve this vision and solidify our position as a leader in the region\'s hospitality industry.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:45:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1075, 'Madhumita\'s Homestay', 'Resorts', '', 'Madhumita\'s Homestay: A Sanctuary of Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nMadhumita\'s Homestay offers an authentic and immersive experience of Assam, nestled in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a place to stay, it\'s a portal to the rich culture, traditions, and warm hospitality that define this vibrant region of India. In a city increasingly dominated by generic hotel chains, Madhumita\'s Homestay provides a refreshing alternative, catering to discerning travelers seeking genuine connection and personalized service. We aim to be a significant contributor to Assam\'s burgeoning tourism sector by showcasing the unique charm and beauty of the state to a global audience, providing an income source for local communities through employment and collaborations. Our commitment extends to promoting sustainable tourism practices that respect the environment and preserve Assam\'s cultural heritage.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Madhumita\'s Homestay provides comfortable and welcoming accommodation designed to reflect the traditional Assamese aesthetic. Our rooms are thoughtfully furnished with local materials and handcrafted details, creating a cozy and inviting atmosphere. Beyond the rooms themselves, we offer a range of services designed to enhance our guests\' experience. This includes home-cooked meals featuring authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Guests can savor the flavors of the region, from the tangy Masor Tenga (fish sour curry) to the comforting Khar (alkaline dish).\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly distinguishes Madhumita\'s Homestay is the emphasis on personalized experiences. We offer guided tours of Guwahati and its surrounding areas, including visits to the Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Island, and the Assam State Museum. We can also arrange excursions to Kaziranga National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site renowned for its population of one-horned rhinoceroses. Furthermore, we facilitate cultural interactions, such as opportunities to learn traditional Assamese weaving, participate in Bihu dance workshops, or attend local festivals. This hands-on approach allows guests to deeply engage with the local culture and create lasting memories. Our unique selling point lies in offering these curated experiences, going beyond basic accommodation to provide a holistic and enriching journey. This resonates with a market increasingly seeking authentic travel experiences and a desire to connect with the local culture.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer service at Madhumita\'s Homestay is rooted in genuine care and attention to detail. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where guests feel like part of the family. From the moment they arrive, they are greeted with genuine smiles and personalized assistance. We take the time to understand their individual needs and preferences, tailoring our services to ensure a comfortable and memorable stay. We believe in building lasting relationships with our guests, fostering a sense of community and belonging. We actively engage with the local community by sourcing products and services from local artisans and businesses. We also participate in community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to social responsibility. By fostering these connections, we not only enhance the guest experience but also contribute to the well-being of the local community. Positive word-of-mouth referrals are a testament to the effectiveness of this approach, forming a vital part of our marketing strategy.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Madhumita\'s Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and cultural preservation. We plan to expand our services to include more curated experiences, such as culinary tours, tea garden visits, and opportunities to learn about Assamese medicinal plants. We also aim to develop partnerships with local organizations to promote responsible tourism practices and support community development initiatives. This may include offering training programs for local youth in hospitality and tourism, empowering them to participate in the growing tourism sector.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, we are exploring the possibility of expanding our physical presence, adding more rooms and facilities to accommodate the growing demand for our unique brand of hospitality. This expansion will be carefully planned to ensure that it remains true to our core values and does not compromise the intimate and personalized atmosphere that defines Madhumita\'s Homestay. We intend to utilize technology to enhance the guest experience, such as online booking platforms, virtual tours, and digital information resources. However, we will always prioritize human interaction and maintain a personal touch in our service delivery. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional hospitality but also contributes to the economic and social well-being of Assam. By staying true to our roots and embracing innovation, we believe that Madhumita\'s Homestay will continue to flourish and serve as a beacon of Assamese hospitality for years to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:45:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1076, 'Saanvi Royal Club', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Saanvi Royal Club stands as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of luxury, recreation, and community engagement. Nestled in the heart of the city, the Club provides an exclusive environment for members to connect, unwind, and pursue their passions. More than just a social hub, Saanvi Royal Club is committed to enriching the lives of its members by providing exceptional facilities, personalized services, and a vibrant social calendar. In a region known for its strong community bonds and appreciation for refined experiences, Saanvi Royal Club fills a distinct niche, offering a sophisticated space for business and leisure.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>The core of Saanvi Royal Club’s offerings lies in its comprehensive suite of services and meticulously maintained facilities. Central to the Club is its state-of-the-art fitness center, equipped with the latest cardiovascular and strength-training equipment, alongside dedicated spaces for yoga, Pilates, and other group fitness classes. Expert trainers are available to provide personalized fitness plans tailored to individual needs and goals. Complementing the fitness facilities is a luxurious spa offering a range of rejuvenating treatments, including massages, facials, and body wraps, providing a sanctuary for relaxation and well-being.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>Beyond fitness and wellness, Saanvi Royal Club boasts exceptional dining experiences. Multiple restaurants and bars cater to diverse palates, ranging from authentic Assamese cuisine highlighting local flavors to international dishes prepared with the finest ingredients. The Club also offers private dining rooms, ideal for business meetings, family gatherings, or special celebrations. Moreover, Saanvi Royal Club provides extensive recreational amenities, including a swimming pool, tennis courts, and badminton courts, encouraging members to engage in healthy and enjoyable activities. A dedicated children’s play area and activity center ensure that families can enjoy quality time together within the Club\'s secure and engaging environment.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>What truly distinguishes Saanvi Royal Club is its commitment to fostering a strong sense of community among its members. The Club regularly organizes a variety of social events, including themed parties, live music performances, cultural celebrations, and networking opportunities. These events provide members with ample opportunities to connect with like-minded individuals, build relationships, and expand their social and professional circles. The Club also hosts workshops, seminars, and guest speaker events on topics ranging from business and finance to arts and culture, enriching the intellectual and cultural lives of its members. The unique selling point of Saanvi Royal Club lies in its ability to seamlessly blend luxury, recreation, and community, offering a holistic experience that caters to the diverse needs and interests of its discerning clientele. By providing a welcoming and inclusive environment, the Club addresses the local market\'s desire for a sophisticated social hub that promotes personal growth, well-being, and meaningful connections.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Saanvi Royal Club. From the moment a member enters the Club, they are greeted with warm hospitality and personalized attention. A dedicated concierge service is available to assist members with their needs, whether it\'s making reservations, arranging transportation, or providing information about local attractions. The Club\'s staff is meticulously trained to anticipate and exceed member expectations, ensuring that every visit is a memorable and enjoyable experience. Saanvi Royal Club actively seeks feedback from its members to continuously improve its services and offerings. Regular surveys and focus groups are conducted to gather insights into member preferences and identify areas for enhancement. The Club also encourages open communication through various channels, including a dedicated member portal and a responsive customer service team.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>To further connect with the local community, Saanvi Royal Club actively supports local charities and initiatives. The Club regularly hosts fundraising events and partners with local organizations to address community needs. By engaging in social responsibility initiatives, Saanvi Royal Club demonstrates its commitment to making a positive impact on the lives of people in Guwahati. This active community involvement strengthens the Club\'s reputation and fosters a sense of pride among its members.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Saanvi Royal Club envisions significant growth and expansion. The Club plans to introduce new facilities and services to further enhance the member experience. This includes potentially expanding the fitness center, adding new recreational amenities, and introducing innovative dining concepts. The Club also aims to expand its membership base by attracting new members from diverse backgrounds and interests. Strategic marketing initiatives and targeted outreach programs will be implemented to raise awareness of the Club\'s offerings and attract prospective members.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>In the long term, Saanvi Royal Club aspires to become the premier social and recreational destination in Guwahati and the surrounding region. The Club is committed to maintaining its high standards of quality and service, while continuously innovating and adapting to meet the evolving needs of its members. By fostering a strong sense of community, providing exceptional facilities, and engaging in social responsibility initiatives, Saanvi Royal Club aims to create a lasting legacy as a vital contributor to the social and economic fabric of Guwahati. The Club\'s ultimate goal is to provide an unparalleled experience for its members, enriching their lives and fostering a sense of belonging that extends beyond the Club\'s walls.\n</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:45:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1077, 'Capital O Spring Valley Resort', 'Resorts', '', 'Capital O Spring Valley Resort stands as a tranquil oasis on the outskirts of Guwahati, offering a blend of modern comfort and Assamese hospitality. More than just a resort, it\'s a destination designed to cater to both leisure travelers seeking respite from the bustling city and corporate clients requiring a productive and serene environment for conferences and retreats. Situated amidst lush greenery, the resort provides a refreshing escape, setting it apart from the more conventional hotels within the city limits. Its significance lies in its ability to cater to the growing demand for premium accommodation options that provide an immersive experience, connecting visitors with the natural beauty of Assam, without compromising on accessibility to the city.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Capital O Spring Valley Resort\'s offerings are its meticulously designed rooms and suites, each promising a comfortable and rejuvenating stay. The resort boasts a range of accommodation options, from standard rooms tailored for budget-conscious travelers to spacious suites perfect for families or extended stays. Beyond accommodation, the resort excels in providing comprehensive event hosting services. It features multiple well-equipped conference halls and outdoor spaces suitable for weddings, corporate events, and social gatherings. Culinary experiences are a key highlight, with an on-site restaurant serving a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and international cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The swimming pool, fitness center, and recreational activities such as nature walks and birdwatching enhance the guest experience, creating a truly memorable stay. Its unique selling point is the combination of modern amenities with the tranquility of its natural surroundings, offering a unique escape that is hard to replicate in downtown Guwahati. These services directly address the needs of a market that values both comfort and convenience, while also seeking authentic experiences rooted in the local environment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Capital O Spring Valley Resort. The resort prides itself on its personalized service, with a dedicated team committed to ensuring every guest\'s needs are met promptly and efficiently. From the warm welcome at check-in to the attentive service in the restaurant and the efficient handling of event logistics, the focus is always on exceeding expectations. What truly makes the business stand out is its genuine commitment to showcasing Assamese culture and hospitality. Staff members are encouraged to share their knowledge of local traditions, customs, and attractions, fostering a deeper connection between guests and the region. The resort actively engages with the local community by sourcing products and services from local suppliers, supporting local artisans, and participating in community events. This not only strengthens the resort\'s ties to the community but also contributes to the economic well-being of the region. The team is trained to be sensitive to the needs of both domestic and international travelers, ensuring a culturally aware and respectful environment for all guests.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Capital O Spring Valley Resort envisions becoming the premier destination for leisure and business travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience in Guwahati. Future plans include expanding the resort\'s capacity with additional rooms and suites, adding new recreational facilities such as a spa and wellness center, and further enhancing its event hosting capabilities. The resort aims to strengthen its position as a sustainable and environmentally responsible business by implementing green initiatives such as reducing energy consumption, minimizing waste, and promoting eco-friendly practices. A key long-term goal is to develop partnerships with local tour operators and tourism agencies to offer curated experiences that showcase the diverse attractions of Assam, including tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, and cultural heritage sites. By continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Capital O Spring Valley Resort is committed to providing exceptional hospitality and contributing to the growth of the tourism sector in Assam. The ultimate ambition is to establish the resort as a landmark destination, synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:50:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1078, 'Ethnic Village Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Ethnic Village Resort: A Gateway to Assam\'s Rich Cultural Heritage</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Ethnic Village Resort offers an immersive experience into the vibrant tapestry of Assam\'s diverse ethnic communities. More than just a resort, it\'s a cultural sanctuary designed to preserve, promote, and celebrate the rich heritage of the region. In a rapidly modernizing world, Ethnic Village Resort stands as a unique testament to the enduring traditions, art, and lifestyles of Assam\'s indigenous tribes, providing both a tranquil escape for visitors and a vital platform for local artisans and performers. It addresses a growing demand for authentic cultural tourism, providing an alternative to conventional hospitality options and solidifying its position as a significant contributor to the local economy and cultural preservation efforts.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The resort\'s core offerings are meticulously crafted to provide a holistic and engaging cultural journey. Accommodation consists of traditionally styled cottages, each reflecting the unique architectural designs of different Assamese ethnic groups. Guests can choose to stay in a Bodo-inspired dwelling, a Mishing chang ghar (stilt house), or a Karbi-style hut, among others. These aren\'t simply themed rooms; they are constructed using traditional materials and techniques, offering an authentic glimpse into the daily lives of these communities.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond accommodation, Ethnic Village Resort provides a range of immersive experiences. These include traditional Assamese cooking classes, where guests learn to prepare local delicacies using indigenous ingredients and methods. Weaving demonstrations showcase the intricate artistry of Assamese textiles, renowned for their silk and vibrant patterns. Folk dance and music performances, often featuring local tribes, offer a captivating window into the region\'s rich artistic traditions. Furthermore, the resort curates guided tours to nearby villages, allowing guests to interact directly with local communities, learn about their customs, and purchase handcrafted souvenirs directly from the artisans, fostering economic empowerment and cultural exchange. A dedicated museum within the resort grounds showcases artifacts, costumes, and historical information about the different ethnic groups of Assam. What distinguishes Ethnic Village Resort is its commitment to authenticity and sustainability. Unlike some cultural resorts that offer a superficial experience, Ethnic Village Resort actively collaborates with local communities, ensuring that the cultural representations are accurate and respectful. A significant portion of the resort’s revenue is reinvested into supporting local artisans, cultural preservation projects, and community development initiatives.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Ethnic Village Resort, customer service is deeply rooted in Assamese hospitality, known for its warmth and genuine care. Every staff member is trained to be a cultural ambassador, capable of sharing insights into the region\'s history, traditions, and customs. The resort strives to create a personalized and enriching experience for each guest, anticipating their needs and going the extra mile to ensure their comfort and satisfaction. This dedication to exceptional service, combined with the unique cultural offerings, has earned the resort a loyal following among both domestic and international travelers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, Ethnic Village Resort actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. It partners with local schools and organizations to offer educational programs on Assamese culture and heritage. The resort also hosts cultural events and festivals that are open to the public, providing a platform for local artists and performers to showcase their talents. By fostering a strong sense of community and cultural pride, Ethnic Village Resort strengthens its bond with the local population and reinforces its commitment to preserving Assam\'s rich heritage for future generations. Guest feedback is actively solicited and incorporated into the resort\'s operations, ensuring continuous improvement and responsiveness to the evolving needs of its clientele.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Ethnic Village Resort envisions expanding its reach and impact. Future plans include developing additional cottages that represent even more of Assam\'s diverse ethnic communities. The resort also aims to create a dedicated cultural center that will serve as a hub for research, education, and artistic expression. A key objective is to enhance the sustainability of the resort\'s operations, incorporating eco-friendly practices and reducing its environmental footprint. This includes exploring renewable energy sources, implementing waste management programs, and sourcing local and organic products whenever possible. The long-term goal is to establish Ethnic Village Resort as a leading destination for sustainable cultural tourism in Northeast India, attracting visitors from around the world who are eager to experience the authentic beauty and richness of Assam\'s heritage. Further expansion may include offering specialized wellness programs incorporating traditional Assamese healing practices and collaborating with other tourism operators to promote integrated cultural tourism circuits in the region. Ethnic Village Resort seeks to be more than just a resort; it aspires to be a catalyst for positive social, economic, and cultural change in Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:50:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1079, 'Segun Bagan Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Segun Bagan Resort: A Serene Escape in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Segun Bagan Resort is a premier hospitality destination nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a resort, it\'s an oasis of tranquility, offering guests an unparalleled experience steeped in local culture and natural beauty. Recognizing the growing demand for both leisure and business travel in the region, Segun Bagan Resort fills a vital need for high-quality accommodation and exceptional service, contributing significantly to the burgeoning Assam tourism and hospitality sector. We are committed to providing an authentic and memorable experience that reflects the unique charm and warmth of Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Comfort and Convenience</p>\n\n<p>At Segun Bagan Resort, we offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our guests. Our primary offerings include exquisitely appointed rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to provide the utmost comfort and relaxation. These accommodations range from elegantly furnished standard rooms ideal for solo travelers and couples to spacious suites perfect for families and extended stays. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and climate control, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. <br> <br> Beyond accommodation, Segun Bagan Resort boasts a range of facilities designed to enhance the guest experience. Our in-house restaurant serves a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies and international cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This emphasis on regional flavors distinguishes us from other resorts, offering guests an authentic culinary journey. We also provide banquet and conference facilities, making Segun Bagan Resort an ideal venue for business meetings, corporate retreats, and social gatherings. Our event spaces are equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and can be customized to meet the specific requirements of each event. <br> <br> What truly sets Segun Bagan Resort apart is our commitment to personalized service and attention to detail. We offer a range of concierge services, including airport transfers, tour bookings, and car rentals, ensuring that our guests can explore the region with ease and convenience. Our experienced and dedicated staff are always on hand to assist with any request, ensuring a truly seamless and unforgettable experience. Moreover, we incorporate elements of Assamese culture, such as traditional decor and cultural performances, to provide a unique and immersive experience that resonates with both domestic and international travelers.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Where Hospitality Meets Heart</p>\n\n<p>At Segun Bagan Resort, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our approach is rooted in the principles of empathy, responsiveness, and personalized attention. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warmth and genuine hospitality, setting the tone for a memorable stay. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and facilities. <br> <br> We strive to create a strong connection with the local community by supporting local businesses and initiatives. We partner with local artisans and vendors to source unique products and experiences, allowing our guests to immerse themselves in the authentic culture of Assam. Furthermore, we actively participate in community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to the well-being of the local community. We also prioritize employing local residents, providing them with valuable employment opportunities and contributing to the economic growth of the region. <br> <br> Segun Bagan Resort fosters a welcoming and inclusive environment for all guests. Our staff are trained to be sensitive to the diverse needs and preferences of our guests, ensuring that everyone feels comfortable and valued. We go above and beyond to anticipate and fulfill the needs of our guests, creating a personalized and memorable experience that exceeds their expectations.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Enriching Experiences</p>\n\n<p>Segun Bagan Resort is committed to sustainable growth and continuous improvement. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, including the addition of eco-friendly cottages and luxury villas. We also plan to develop additional recreational facilities, such as a swimming pool, spa, and fitness center, further enhancing the guest experience. <br> <br> We envision Segun Bagan Resort as a leading eco-tourism destination in Assam, promoting sustainable practices and responsible travel. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact by implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. We aim to educate our guests about the importance of environmental conservation and encourage them to participate in sustainable tourism practices. <br> <br> Our long-term goals include establishing Segun Bagan Resort as a nationally recognized brand, synonymous with exceptional service, authentic experiences, and sustainable practices. We plan to expand our presence to other key tourist destinations in Assam and the Northeast, creating a network of resorts that offer a seamless and unforgettable travel experience. Ultimately, our vision is to be a catalyst for positive change in the Assam tourism industry, promoting sustainable growth, empowering local communities, and showcasing the unique beauty and culture of the region to the world.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:50:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1080, 'Kumars Green Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Kumars Green Resort: An Oasis of Tranquility in Guwahati\'s Embrace</p>\n\n<p>Kumars Green Resort offers a rejuvenating escape from the hustle and bustle of city life, providing a serene sanctuary nestled amidst the lush landscapes surrounding Guwahati. More than just a getaway, the resort is meticulously crafted to blend seamlessly with the natural environment, offering guests an immersive experience that celebrates Assam\'s rich cultural heritage and breathtaking biodiversity. Positioned strategically to offer both accessibility and seclusion, Kumars Green Resort is rapidly emerging as a significant player in the Guwahati hospitality sector, catering to both leisure travelers seeking respite and corporate clients in search of a conducive environment for retreats and conferences. The resort\'s commitment to sustainable practices and community engagement further distinguishes it, aligning with the growing demand for eco-conscious tourism within the region and contributing positively to the local economy.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Comfort and Nature</p>\n\n<p>At the heart of Kumars Green Resort lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality through a diverse range of services tailored to meet the needs of discerning travelers. The resort boasts elegantly appointed accommodations, ranging from cozy cottages to spacious suites, all designed to offer maximum comfort while maintaining a rustic charm that reflects the local aesthetic. A key offering is the immersive nature experiences, including guided treks through nearby tea gardens, birdwatching tours led by local experts, and opportunities to explore the vibrant flora and fauna of the region. The resort\'s in-house restaurant showcases the diverse flavors of Assamese cuisine, utilizing locally sourced ingredients to create authentic culinary experiences. For corporate clients, Kumars Green Resort provides state-of-the-art conference facilities equipped with modern amenities, ideal for hosting meetings, seminars, and team-building events. The unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of nature, culture, and hospitality, offering a truly holistic experience unavailable elsewhere in Guwahati. The resort addresses a growing market need for sustainable and authentic tourism, providing an alternative to generic hotel experiences and promoting responsible travel within the region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Crafting Memorable Moments with Assamese Hospitality</p>\n\n<p>Kumars Green Resort prioritizes customer satisfaction above all else, fostering a culture of genuine hospitality and personalized service. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm smiles and attentive assistance, ensuring a seamless and memorable experience. The resort prides itself on its well-trained staff, who are knowledgeable about the local area and eager to share their insights with visitors. Recognizing the importance of cultural immersion, Kumars Green Resort actively involves the local community in its operations, providing employment opportunities and showcasing local art, crafts, and traditions. Regular cultural performances and workshops are organized to provide guests with a deeper understanding of Assam\'s rich heritage. Feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered to continuously improve the guest experience. What truly sets Kumars Green Resort apart is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its guests, creating a sense of belonging and encouraging repeat visits. The resort also actively participates in local initiatives, supporting community development projects and promoting environmental awareness, further solidifying its connection with the local community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Growing Roots and Expanding Horizons</p>\n\n<p>Kumars Green Resort envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued contribution to the Guwahati tourism landscape. The long-term goal is to establish the resort as a leading eco-tourism destination in Assam, renowned for its commitment to environmental conservation, cultural preservation, and exceptional hospitality. Future plans include expanding the resort\'s accommodations, adding new amenities such as a wellness center offering traditional Ayurvedic treatments, and developing innovative tour packages that showcase the diverse attractions of the region. Furthermore, the resort aims to strengthen its ties with the local community through increased collaboration with artisans, farmers, and cultural organizations. Embracing technology is also a key aspect of the future vision, with plans to implement online booking platforms, enhance digital marketing efforts, and leverage data analytics to personalize the guest experience. By focusing on sustainable practices, community engagement, and continuous innovation, Kumars Green Resort is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and become a beacon of responsible tourism in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:50:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1081, 'ANIYAA EDITION A LUXURY BOUTIQUE HOTEL AND BANQUETS', 'Resorts', '', 'ANIYAA EDITION: A LUXURY BOUTIQUE HOTEL AND BANQUETS\n\nNestled in the heart of Guwahati, ANIYAA EDITION is a premier luxury boutique hotel and banquets, redefining hospitality in Assam. More than just a place to stay or host an event, ANIYAA EDITION is an experience, meticulously crafted to blend modern elegance with the rich cultural heritage of the region. We stand as a beacon of refined comfort and personalized service, catering to discerning travelers and those seeking an exceptional venue for memorable celebrations. In a city rapidly embracing global trends, ANIYAA EDITION distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of international standards and authentic Assamese hospitality, filling a crucial gap in the market for sophisticated and intimate experiences. We contribute to the local business landscape by attracting high-value tourism and providing a platform for showcasing local artistry and culinary excellence.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings revolve around providing unparalleled luxury and bespoke service in both accommodation and event hosting. As a boutique hotel, we offer a limited number of exquisitely designed rooms and suites, each reflecting a commitment to impeccable detail and guest comfort. Each room is appointed with premium amenities, from plush bedding and state-of-the-art entertainment systems to meticulously curated local artwork, providing a sense of place and cultural immersion. Our banqueting facilities are equally impressive, boasting versatile spaces that can be tailored to accommodate a wide range of events, from intimate gatherings to grand celebrations. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to personalization. We understand that every guest and every event is unique. Our dedicated team of event planners and hospitality professionals work closely with each client to curate bespoke experiences that exceed expectations, paying meticulous attention to every detail from décor and catering to entertainment and logistics. This personalized approach, combined with our luxurious amenities and prime location, directly addresses the local market\'s growing demand for high-end event venues and sophisticated accommodation options. We source local ingredients and partner with local artisans, supporting the regional economy and offering guests an authentic taste of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt ANIYAA EDITION, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in creating not just satisfied customers, but loyal advocates. Our approach to customer service is rooted in anticipating needs, exceeding expectations, and fostering genuine connections. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our well-trained staff is dedicated to providing seamless and intuitive service, ensuring that every aspect of their stay or event is flawless. We proactively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. But our commitment extends beyond just the confines of the hotel. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, support for cultural initiatives, and participation in community events. We aim to be more than just a business; we want to be a contributing member of the Guwahati community, fostering a sense of belonging and shared prosperity. We regularly host events showcasing local talent and promoting Assamese culture, further cementing our connection with the community and offering guests a unique opportunity to immerse themselves in the local way of life. Our commitment to sustainability and ethical practices further resonates with the community, fostering trust and loyalty.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for ANIYAA EDITION is to establish ourselves as the undisputed leader in luxury boutique hospitality and event hosting in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our services and offerings, while remaining true to our core values of personalized service, luxurious comfort, and authentic cultural immersion. This includes exploring opportunities to add specialized wellness services, enhance our culinary offerings with innovative regional cuisine, and develop unique experiential packages that showcase the best of Assam. We are also exploring strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector to create synergistic offerings that enhance the overall visitor experience in Guwahati. Our long-term goals include expanding our brand presence to other key locations in Northeast India, bringing our unique blend of luxury and local flavor to a wider audience. We envision ANIYAA EDITION becoming a symbol of excellence in hospitality, a catalyst for economic growth in the region, and a proud ambassador of Assamese culture to the world. We are committed to continuous innovation, staying ahead of industry trends, and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers, ensuring that ANIYAA EDITION remains a destination of choice for discerning travelers and event organizers for years to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:50:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1082, 'Vivanta Guwahati', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Vivanta Guwahati: A Gateway to Elevated Experiences in Assam</p>\n\n<p>Vivanta Guwahati stands as a beacon of refined hospitality and exceptional service within the vibrant and burgeoning business landscape of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to stay, Vivanta Guwahati is a destination – a meticulously crafted environment designed to cater to the discerning needs of business travelers, leisure seekers, and the local community alike. Nestled strategically within Guwahati, the hotel offers unparalleled accessibility to key commercial hubs, cultural landmarks, and transportation networks, making it an ideal base for exploring the region. Vivanta Guwahati strives to seamlessly blend global standards of excellence with the warmth and authenticity of Assamese hospitality, creating a truly unique and memorable experience for every guest. It contributes significantly to the local economy, providing employment opportunities and supporting local businesses, thereby playing an integral role in the region\'s growth story. The hotel is known for its commitment to sustainable practices, minimizing its environmental footprint and actively engaging with the local community through various initiatives.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Elevated Hospitality: Core Services and Products</p>\n\n<p>Vivanta Guwahati offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. At its heart are exquisitely appointed guest rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to provide a haven of comfort and tranquility. From stylishly furnished interiors to state-of-the-art amenities, every detail is carefully considered to ensure a relaxing and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, Vivanta Guwahati excels in its culinary offerings. Multiple dining venues tantalize the palate with a diverse range of flavors, from authentic Assamese cuisine that showcases local ingredients and culinary traditions to international delicacies prepared by seasoned chefs. The hotel\'s banquet and conferencing facilities are equipped with the latest technology and supported by a dedicated events team, making it an ideal venue for corporate meetings, conferences, and social gatherings. The hotel also offers a fully equipped fitness center and spa, providing guests with opportunities to rejuvenate and unwind. What sets Vivanta Guwahati apart is its unwavering commitment to personalized service. From customized catering options to bespoke travel arrangements, the hotel\'s team goes the extra mile to anticipate and exceed guest expectations. These services directly address the needs of the local market by providing a premium venue for business events, offering a sophisticated dining experience for local residents, and contributing to the overall tourism infrastructure of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Crafting Unforgettable Experiences: The Customer-Centric Approach</p>\n\n<p>At Vivanta Guwahati, the guest experience is paramount. The hotel cultivates a culture of genuine care and attentiveness, empowering its staff to create meaningful connections with every guest. This commitment to exceptional service is reflected in consistently positive guest feedback and a strong reputation for hospitality excellence. The hotel distinguishes itself through its proactive approach to anticipating guest needs, offering personalized recommendations, and promptly addressing any concerns. Furthermore, Vivanta Guwahati actively engages with the local community, organizing cultural events and supporting local artisans and businesses. This commitment to community involvement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the hotel\'s position as a valued member of the Guwahati community. The hotel regularly partners with local organizations to promote Assamese art, culture, and traditions, showcasing the region\'s rich heritage to its guests and contributing to its preservation. Vivanta Guwahati’s focus extends beyond simply providing accommodation and dining; it aims to create lasting memories and foster a sense of connection with the local culture and community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking Ahead: A Vision for Growth and Excellence</p>\n\n<p>Vivanta Guwahati envisions a future marked by continued growth, innovation, and a steadfast commitment to delivering exceptional experiences. The hotel aims to further enhance its services and facilities to meet the evolving needs of its guests and the local market. Expansion plans may include the addition of new guest rooms and suites, the introduction of innovative dining concepts, and the enhancement of its conferencing and event facilities. Vivanta Guwahati is also exploring opportunities to integrate sustainable practices further into its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the local community. The hotel is committed to investing in the training and development of its staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge to deliver world-class service. By continually striving for excellence and embracing innovation, Vivanta Guwahati aims to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a valuable contributor to the region\'s economic and cultural development. It aims to be synonymous with quality, innovation, and a genuine commitment to providing unforgettable experiences.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:55:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
