(1083, 'Eagle Nest Home Stay', 'Resorts', '', 'Eagle Nest Home Stay: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Culture in Guwahati\n\nNestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Eagle Nest Home Stay offers a unique blend of comfortable accommodation and immersive cultural experiences. More than just a place to rest your head, we provide a gateway to exploring the rich tapestry of Assamese traditions, cuisine, and natural beauty. In a region increasingly catering to discerning travelers seeking authentic and personalized experiences, Eagle Nest Home Stay distinguishes itself by providing a haven that combines modern amenities with a genuine connection to the local community. We contribute to the vibrant tourism sector of Assam by promoting responsible tourism practices and showcasing the unique charm of Guwahati and its surrounding areas.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core service revolves around providing well-appointed and thoughtfully designed accommodation to both domestic and international travelers. We offer a range of room options, from cozy standard rooms perfect for solo adventurers or couples, to larger family suites equipped with all the necessary comforts. Each room is designed with meticulous attention to detail, blending modern aesthetics with elements of traditional Assamese design, creating a welcoming and relaxing atmosphere. Beyond accommodation, we offer a curated selection of experiences designed to immerse guests in the local culture. This includes Assamese cooking classes where guests can learn to prepare traditional dishes, guided tours of local temples and historical sites, and opportunities to participate in traditional Assamese crafts like silk weaving. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to seamlessly integrate comfort with cultural immersion, creating memorable experiences that go beyond the typical tourist itinerary. We cater to the growing demand for experiential travel, offering a more enriching and authentic alternative to conventional hotels.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Eagle Nest Home Stay, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is built on genuine warmth, personalized attention, and a deep understanding of our guests\' needs. We go above and beyond to ensure that every guest feels welcomed and cared for, from providing personalized recommendations for local attractions to arranging transportation and assisting with any special requests. We actively engage with the local community by sourcing local produce for our kitchen, supporting local artisans by showcasing their crafts, and promoting local businesses through our concierge services. This not only ensures that our guests experience the authentic flavors of Assam but also contributes to the sustainable development of the local economy. We foster a strong sense of community by organizing cultural events and activities that bring together guests and locals, creating opportunities for meaningful interactions and cultural exchange. We are committed to building lasting relationships with our guests, turning them into ambassadors for Assam and for Eagle Nest Home Stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Eagle Nest Home Stay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, developing new and innovative cultural experiences, and further strengthening our ties with the local community. We plan to incorporate eco-friendly practices into our operations, such as using renewable energy sources and reducing waste, to minimize our environmental impact. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local NGOs and community organizations to support social and environmental initiatives in the region. Our vision is to create a positive impact on the local community while providing our guests with unforgettable experiences that celebrate the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam. We aim to be more than just a place to stay; we aspire to be a catalyst for cultural exchange and sustainable tourism in the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:55:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1084, 'Mawing resort', 'Resorts', '', 'Mawing Resort: A Sanctuary of Tranquility in the Heart of Assam\n\nNestled amidst the lush green landscapes surrounding Guwahati, Mawing Resort offers a unique blend of serenity and modern hospitality, making it a premier destination for both leisure and business travelers in the region. Unlike typical hotels concentrated in the city center, Mawing Resort capitalizes on its strategic location to provide an escape from the urban bustle while remaining easily accessible. Its distinctive architectural design, inspired by traditional Assamese aesthetics, coupled with contemporary amenities, distinguishes it within the local hospitality sector. Mawing Resort strives to contribute to the growing tourism industry in Assam by showcasing the region\'s natural beauty and rich cultural heritage.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Mawing Resort\'s offerings lies a commitment to providing a holistic and enriching experience. The resort boasts a range of meticulously designed accommodation options, from well-appointed rooms offering panoramic views to luxurious suites catering to discerning guests. These spaces are designed to evoke a sense of calm and relaxation, featuring comfortable furnishings and modern conveniences. Beyond accommodation, Mawing Resort presents a diverse array of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of its clientele. A key highlight is the on-site restaurant, which showcases authentic Assamese cuisine alongside popular Indian and international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This focus on local produce supports regional farmers and provides guests with a genuine taste of Assam. Additionally, the resort offers comprehensive event facilities, including spacious banquet halls and meeting rooms equipped with state-of-the-art technology, making it an ideal venue for corporate events, weddings, and social gatherings. The resort also features recreational facilities such as a swimming pool, a well-equipped fitness center, and curated nature walks, allowing guests to rejuvenate and connect with the surrounding environment. The unique selling proposition lies in the combination of world-class amenities with an authentic Assamese experience, something often missing in standard hotel chains. Mawing Resort addresses the growing demand for experiential travel, providing a sanctuary where guests can immerse themselves in the region\'s culture and natural beauty.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer satisfaction is paramount at Mawing Resort, and this is reflected in every aspect of the guest experience. The resort emphasizes personalized service, with a dedicated team of well-trained staff committed to anticipating and exceeding guest expectations. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service, ensuring a seamless and memorable stay. The resort actively seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and offerings. This commitment to customer-centricity extends beyond individual interactions to encompass a genuine connection with the local community. Mawing Resort actively supports local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and services within the resort. The resort also participates in community initiatives aimed at promoting sustainable tourism and preserving the region\'s cultural heritage. By fostering strong relationships with local communities, Mawing Resort creates a more enriching experience for guests while contributing to the economic and social well-being of the region. Regular cultural programs are organized to showcase the rich traditions of Assam, further immersing guests in the local culture.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nMawing Resort envisions becoming a leading destination for sustainable and culturally immersive tourism in Northeast India. Future plans include expanding its accommodation capacity to cater to the growing influx of tourists to the region, while maintaining its commitment to environmental sustainability. The resort also intends to further develop its wellness offerings, incorporating traditional Assamese healing practices and Ayurvedic therapies to provide guests with a truly rejuvenating experience. Investment in eco-friendly technologies and practices is a key priority, aiming to minimize the resort\'s environmental footprint and promote responsible tourism. Long-term goals include establishing Mawing Resort as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, sustainability, and authentic Assamese hospitality. The resort aims to play a vital role in promoting tourism to Assam, contributing to the region\'s economic growth and showcasing its unique cultural heritage to the world. Future expansions may include partnering with local tour operators to offer curated excursions to nearby attractions, such as Kaziranga National Park and Majuli Island, further enriching the guest experience and promoting regional tourism.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:55:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1085, 'Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi', 'Resorts', '', 'Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi, nestled in the heart of Assam\'s silk village, Sualkuchi, just a short distance from Guwahati, offers a unique and authentic experience that distinguishes it within the regional tourism sector. More than just a place to stay, it\'s a gateway to understanding and experiencing the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam. The resort provides a serene escape from the bustling city life, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the tranquility of rural Assam while enjoying comfortable and modern amenities. Its location in Sualkuchi, renowned for its silk weaving industry, gives it a distinct advantage, offering guests immediate access to witness the intricate artistry and craftsmanship that has been passed down through generations. This makes Binodini Village Resort a cultural tourism destination of significant importance, promoting local artistry and providing a sustainable income source for the community. <br> <br>\n\nThe resort\'s primary offerings center around providing comfortable accommodation, authentic Assamese cuisine, and immersive cultural experiences. Accommodation options range from well-appointed rooms with modern amenities to traditional Assamese-style cottages that blend seamlessly with the natural surroundings. Each room is designed to offer a relaxing and comfortable stay, featuring locally sourced materials and reflecting the region\'s aesthetic. The dining experience is a highlight, with a restaurant serving a delectable array of traditional Assamese dishes prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Guests can savor the unique flavors of Assam, often enjoying meals prepared using traditional cooking methods. Beyond accommodation and dining, Binodini Village Resort differentiates itself by offering guided tours of Sualkuchi\'s silk weaving workshops, allowing guests to witness the entire silk-making process, from cocoon to finished product. We also arrange for traditional Assamese dance and music performances, showcasing the vibrant cultural heritage of the region. Furthermore, the resort offers nature walks and bird-watching excursions, allowing guests to explore the surrounding natural beauty. These services directly address the growing demand for authentic and immersive travel experiences, catering to both domestic and international tourists seeking to connect with the local culture and environment. <br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi. The resort\'s approach is rooted in personalized service and genuine Assamese hospitality. The staff is dedicated to creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. From assisting with travel arrangements to providing insightful information about local customs and traditions, the team goes the extra mile to exceed expectations. What truly sets the resort apart is its deep connection with the local community. The resort actively supports local artisans and businesses, sourcing products and services from the village. This not only contributes to the local economy but also provides guests with an authentic glimpse into the lives of the people of Sualkuchi. Furthermore, the resort regularly organizes cultural events and workshops, inviting local residents to participate and share their skills and knowledge with guests. This fosters a sense of community and creates opportunities for meaningful interaction between visitors and locals. The resort also emphasizes sustainable tourism practices, minimizing its environmental impact and promoting responsible travel. This commitment to sustainability and community engagement resonates with travelers seeking ethical and authentic experiences. <br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi is to become a leading cultural and eco-tourism destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to sustainability, community engagement, and authentic experiences. Expansion plans include adding more accommodation options, such as eco-friendly cottages and family suites, to cater to a wider range of travelers. The resort also aims to develop new and innovative cultural experiences, such as immersive workshops on Assamese cuisine, silk weaving, and traditional crafts. These initiatives will further enhance the resort\'s appeal as a center for cultural learning and exchange. Long-term goals include establishing partnerships with local educational institutions to offer internship programs and training opportunities for young people in the community. This will help to develop a skilled workforce and promote sustainable tourism practices. The resort also plans to expand its outreach efforts, promoting Sualkuchi as a must-visit destination for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching cultural experience. By continuing to invest in its people, its community, and its environment, Binodini Village Resort Sualkuchi aims to create a lasting positive impact on the region and contribute to the sustainable development of tourism in Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:55:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1086, 'Xhyiteez - The Eco Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Xhyiteez - The Eco Resort, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offers a sustainable and immersive retreat that harmonizes seamlessly with the natural beauty of Assam. We are more than just a resort; we are a conscious haven dedicated to providing guests with an unforgettable experience while preserving the region\'s rich ecological heritage. Our commitment to responsible tourism sets us apart in the Guwahati hospitality sector, offering a unique blend of luxury, adventure, and environmental stewardship. We aim to be a leading example of sustainable tourism in Northeast India, contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural resources and supporting local communities. Xhyiteez represents a growing trend towards eco-conscious travel, providing an alternative to conventional tourism that resonates with both local and international visitors seeking authentic and responsible experiences.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Our core services revolve around providing comfortable and eco-friendly accommodations, curated experiences that showcase the region\'s natural and cultural assets, and delicious, locally sourced cuisine. We offer a range of accommodation options, from elegantly designed eco-cottages built using sustainable materials to thoughtfully appointed rooms that minimize environmental impact. Each space is designed to provide comfort without compromising our commitment to sustainability. Our unique selling point lies in our immersive experiences. We offer guided nature walks through nearby forests, birdwatching tours led by local experts, and opportunities to engage with Assamese culture through traditional music and dance performances. These experiences are designed to educate guests about the region\'s biodiversity and promote cultural understanding. Furthermore, our restaurant focuses on utilizing fresh, seasonal ingredients sourced from local farmers and producers. This not only supports the local economy but also ensures that our guests enjoy authentic Assamese cuisine while minimizing our carbon footprint. The emphasis on locally sourced products allows us to contribute directly to the sustainability of the region, creating a positive economic impact for local communities.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>At Xhyiteez, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where guests feel connected to both the resort and the surrounding environment. Our staff is trained to provide personalized attention and cater to individual needs, ensuring that every guest has a memorable and enriching experience. We prioritize building strong relationships with the local community through various initiatives. We actively partner with local artisans and craftspeople, providing them with a platform to showcase their products and skills. We also support local schools and community organizations through donations and volunteer programs. Our commitment to community engagement extends to our hiring practices, where we prioritize employing local residents and providing them with opportunities for professional development. This focus on community integration not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the overall well-being of the region. We encourage open communication and feedback from our guests and the community to continuously improve our services and strengthen our commitment to responsible tourism.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Xhyiteez envisions becoming a regional leader in sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options while maintaining our commitment to eco-friendly design and construction. We aim to develop new and innovative experiences that further showcase the natural and cultural heritage of Assam, such as establishing a dedicated organic farm to supply our restaurant and offering educational workshops on sustainable living practices. We also plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and organizations, empowering them to participate in and benefit from our tourism initiatives. Our long-term goals include obtaining relevant certifications for sustainable practices and sharing our knowledge and experience with other businesses in the region to promote responsible tourism across Northeast India. We believe that by continuing to prioritize sustainability, community engagement, and exceptional customer service, Xhyiteez can play a significant role in preserving Assam\'s natural beauty and fostering economic growth for local communities. We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the tourism industry while remaining true to our core values of environmental stewardship and social responsibility. We see our future as being deeply intertwined with the prosperity of the local community and the preservation of the environment.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 10:55:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1087, 'River bank guest house (Restaurant & self cooking)', 'Resorts', '', 'River Bank Guest House (Restaurant & Self Cooking) presents a unique hospitality experience nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil retreat with the flexibility of self-catering options. Situated strategically, it caters to both tourists seeking an authentic Assamese experience and business travelers desiring a comfortable and convenient stay. River Bank distinguishes itself from conventional hotels by combining the personalized service of a guest house with the culinary delights of a restaurant and the independence of self-cooking facilities, filling a specific niche within Guwahati\'s diverse hospitality sector. Its significance lies in providing affordable, comfortable, and customizable accommodation catering to varied traveler preferences, adding a distinct flavor to the city\'s accommodation choices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nRiver Bank Guest House offers a three-pronged approach to hospitality. Firstly, it provides well-appointed guest rooms, each designed to offer a comfortable and relaxing stay. These range from standard rooms to family suites, all equipped with essential amenities to ensure a pleasant experience. Secondly, the on-site restaurant serves a delectable array of Assamese and Indian cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Guests can savor authentic regional flavors without venturing far from their accommodation. Thirdly, and perhaps most uniquely, River Bank offers self-cooking facilities in select rooms and a communal kitchen area. This empowers guests to prepare their own meals, catering to specific dietary requirements, personal preferences, or simply the desire for a home-cooked meal while traveling. This self-catering option is a significant differentiator, appealing to budget-conscious travelers, families with young children, and those with specific dietary needs, a segment often underserved in the Guwahati market. The unique selling point lies in this combination of convenience, comfort, and culinary flexibility, making it an attractive alternative to traditional hotels and guesthouses.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt River Bank, customer service is paramount. The staff is trained to provide personalized attention, anticipating guests\' needs and offering assistance with local information, transportation arrangements, and other requests. The guest house prides itself on creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, fostering a sense of community among guests. What sets River Bank apart is its commitment to showcasing Assamese culture and hospitality. The decor incorporates local crafts and artwork, the restaurant menu features traditional dishes, and the staff are knowledgeable about the region\'s history and attractions. This dedication to authentic Assamese experiences resonates with travelers seeking more than just a place to stay; they seek a cultural immersion. River Bank actively engages with the local community by sourcing ingredients from local farmers and artisans, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of its offerings. Regular cultural events, such as Bihu celebrations or Assamese music performances, are organized to further connect guests with the local community and provide a memorable experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, River Bank Guest House envisions significant growth potential. Plans are underway to expand the accommodation capacity, adding more rooms and diversifying the room types to cater to an even wider range of travelers. This includes exploring options for eco-friendly and sustainable practices, aligning with the growing demand for responsible tourism. The restaurant aims to further enhance its menu, incorporating more innovative Assamese dishes and catering to evolving culinary trends. The self-cooking facilities will be upgraded with modern equipment and expanded to accommodate larger groups. Long-term goals include establishing River Bank as a leading provider of hospitality services in Guwahati, recognized for its unique blend of comfort, culinary excellence, and cultural immersion. The business also aims to develop partnerships with local tour operators and businesses to offer comprehensive travel packages, further enhancing the guest experience and promoting tourism in the region. River Bank’s vision is to not only provide a comfortable stay but to be a gateway for visitors to experience the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam, contributing to the sustainable growth of the local economy.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:00:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1088, 'Hotel Park Riviera', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Hotel Park Riviera: Guwahati\'s Premier Destination for Comfort and Connectivity</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Hotel Park Riviera stands as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati, offering a unique blend of modern hospitality and Assamese warmth. Strategically located in the heart of the city, it serves as a vital hub for both business and leisure travelers seeking a seamless and enriching experience. Unlike many hotels in the region, Park Riviera distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, contemporary amenities, and a deep understanding of the local cultural landscape. Recognizing the growing demand for sophisticated accommodation within Assam, Park Riviera fills a critical gap by providing international standards of comfort coupled with the authentic flavor of the Northeast. The hotel plays a crucial role in supporting Guwahati\'s burgeoning tourism and business sectors, contributing to the city\'s reputation as a gateway to Northeast India.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Hotel Park Riviera provides comprehensive lodging solutions, ranging from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, each designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. Beyond accommodation, the hotel boasts a range of essential services including:\n   <ul>\n     <li><b>Dining:</b> On-site restaurants offer a diverse culinary journey, featuring both international cuisine and authentic Assamese dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients. A focus is placed on showcasing the region\'s unique flavors and culinary traditions.</li>\n     <li><b>Event Spaces:</b> Versatile banquet halls and conference rooms provide ideal venues for corporate meetings, conferences, weddings, and social gatherings. Equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual technology and customizable layouts, these spaces cater to events of all sizes.</li>\n     <li><b>Recreational Facilities:</b> Guests can unwind and rejuvenate at the hotel\'s fitness center and swimming pool. These facilities are designed to provide relaxation and well-being during their stay.</li>\n     <li><b>Business Center:</b> A fully equipped business center offers essential services such as printing, photocopying, and secretarial support, catering to the needs of business travelers.</li>\n     <li><b>Concierge Services:</b> Dedicated concierge staff provide personalized assistance with travel arrangements, local sightseeing tours, and other bespoke requests, ensuring a seamless and memorable experience for every guest.</li>\n   </ul>\n\n    A significant unique selling point of Hotel Park Riviera lies in its dedication to providing authentic cultural experiences. This includes showcasing local art and crafts within the hotel\'s interiors, organizing cultural performances, and offering guided tours of nearby historical and cultural sites. The hotel directly addresses the increasing demand for quality accommodation that provides a genuine connection to the local environment, making it a preferred choice for both domestic and international visitors.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Hotel Park Riviera prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience centered around personalized service, attentiveness, and genuine hospitality. Staff members are trained to anticipate guest needs and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a comfortable and stress-free stay. What sets Hotel Park Riviera apart is its commitment to building lasting relationships with its guests, fostering a sense of community and belonging. The hotel actively engages with the local community by participating in local festivals, supporting local artisans, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. Initiatives include sourcing produce from local farms, employing local talent, and supporting local environmental conservation efforts. This commitment to social responsibility enhances the hotel\'s reputation and strengthens its connection with the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Park Riviera envisions itself as a leading hospitality provider in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to excellence and sustainable practices. Future plans include expanding its accommodation options, enhancing its wellness and recreational facilities, and further developing its culinary offerings to showcase the diverse flavors of the region. The hotel aims to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, implementing smart room features, online check-in/check-out processes, and personalized communication channels. Furthermore, Hotel Park Riviera intends to strengthen its partnerships with local tourism operators and businesses to promote Guwahati as a premier destination for both leisure and business travel. Long-term goals include achieving industry-leading sustainability certifications and contributing to the economic and social development of the region. By consistently exceeding guest expectations and embracing innovation, Hotel Park Riviera aims to solidify its position as a premier destination in Guwahati, contributing significantly to the region\'s growth and prosperity. The hotel is also exploring opportunities to expand its brand presence in other key locations within Northeast India, further establishing itself as a leader in the hospitality industry.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:00:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1089, 'OYO 12808 Victoria Villa', 'Resorts', '', '<p>OYO 12808 Victoria Villa: A Comfortable Haven in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, OYO 12808 Victoria Villa offers a welcoming and comfortable accommodation option for travelers seeking convenience, affordability, and a touch of local charm. More than just a place to stay, Victoria Villa strives to provide a memorable experience, bridging the gap between budget-friendly travel and genuine hospitality. Positioned strategically within Guwahati, the Villa acts as a perfect launchpad for exploring the city\'s historical sites, bustling markets, and serene natural landscapes. It aims to distinguish itself within the competitive Guwahati hospitality scene by focusing on consistent quality, cleanliness, and a guest-centric approach, offering a reliable and pleasant stay for both leisure and business travelers.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, OYO 12808 Victoria Villa provides well-maintained and thoughtfully furnished rooms catering to a diverse range of needs. Guests can choose from various room types, including standard, deluxe, and family rooms, each equipped with essential amenities such as air conditioning, comfortable bedding, private bathrooms with hot and cold water, and televisions. A key differentiator lies in the Villa\'s commitment to cleanliness and hygiene, ensuring a comfortable and worry-free experience for every guest. Furthermore, complimentary Wi-Fi access is provided throughout the premises, enabling guests to stay connected for work or leisure. Recognizing the needs of modern travelers, the Villa also offers services such as laundry facilities, travel assistance, and 24-hour front desk support. These services directly address the needs of tourists visiting Guwahati to explore its cultural heritage and natural beauty, as well as business travelers seeking a convenient and reliable place to stay. The competitive pricing structure, coupled with the provision of essential amenities, positions OYO 12808 Victoria Villa as an attractive option for budget-conscious travelers seeking value for their money.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at OYO 12808 Victoria Villa. The staff is trained to provide warm, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that guests feel welcomed and valued from the moment they arrive. A dedicated front desk team is available around the clock to assist with check-in/check-out procedures, address inquiries, and provide recommendations for local attractions and dining options. Beyond the standard hospitality offerings, the Villa aims to foster a sense of connection with the local community. The staff are encouraged to share their knowledge of Guwahati, providing guests with insights into local customs, traditions, and hidden gems. Furthermore, the Villa actively supports local businesses by sourcing products and services from nearby vendors, contributing to the local economy and providing guests with an authentic taste of Guwahati. Feedback is actively sought from guests to continuously improve service delivery and tailor the experience to meet evolving needs. This proactive approach to customer service ensures that OYO 12808 Victoria Villa not only meets but exceeds guest expectations, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, OYO 12808 Victoria Villa envisions becoming a leading accommodation provider in Guwahati, recognized for its commitment to quality, affordability, and exceptional customer service. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, such as introducing breakfast options featuring local Assamese cuisine, partnering with local tour operators to provide curated sightseeing packages, and enhancing the overall guest experience through personalized amenities and services. The business also plans to leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and increase brand awareness. A key focus will be on sustainable practices, such as implementing energy-efficient lighting and water conservation measures, demonstrating a commitment to environmental responsibility. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish OYO 12808 Victoria Villa as a preferred choice for travelers visiting Guwahati, contributing to the growth of the local tourism industry and creating a positive impact on the community. By consistently delivering value, fostering strong relationships with guests, and adapting to evolving market trends, OYO 12808 Victoria Villa is poised for continued success and sustainable growth in the dynamic Guwahati hospitality landscape.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:00:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1090, 'Maibong Eco Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Maibong Eco Resort: A Sustainable Sanctuary in the Heart of Assam</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled amidst the verdant landscapes surrounding Guwahati, Maibong Eco Resort offers a distinctive blend of serene retreat and sustainable tourism, catering to discerning travelers seeking an authentic and environmentally conscious experience. More than just a place to stay, Maibong Eco Resort is envisioned as a catalyst for responsible tourism in Assam, showcasing the region’s rich biodiversity and cultural heritage while minimizing its environmental footprint. It aims to provide an escape from the bustling city life, offering a tranquil environment for relaxation, rejuvenation, and reconnection with nature. Positioned strategically near Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, Maibong Eco Resort offers easy accessibility while maintaining a secluded ambiance, making it a compelling destination for both domestic and international visitors.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, Maibong Eco Resort provides comfortable and eco-friendly accommodations designed to harmonize with the surrounding environment. These include thoughtfully designed cottages constructed using locally sourced, sustainable materials, minimizing their impact on the ecosystem. Each cottage provides modern amenities while retaining a rustic charm that reflects the local aesthetic. Beyond accommodations, the resort offers a range of curated experiences designed to immerse guests in the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam. These experiences include guided nature walks through surrounding forests, birdwatching expeditions led by knowledgeable local guides, and opportunities to participate in traditional Assamese cooking classes and cultural performances. A key differentiator is the resort\'s commitment to sustainable practices. This is evident in its initiatives such as rainwater harvesting, solar energy utilization, waste management programs, and the promotion of organic farming practices within the resort premises. The resort also actively partners with local communities, sourcing produce and employing local artisans, thereby contributing to the economic empowerment of the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Maibong Eco Resort prioritizes creating a memorable and personalized customer experience. The staff is meticulously trained to provide warm and attentive service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and cared for. From the moment of arrival to departure, guests are treated with genuine hospitality, creating a sense of belonging and fostering lasting memories. The resort distinguishes itself through its emphasis on creating meaningful connections with the local community. Guests are encouraged to interact with local villagers, learn about their traditions, and participate in activities that promote cultural exchange. The resort also actively supports local initiatives, such as promoting local handicrafts and providing educational opportunities for children in the surrounding villages. This commitment to community engagement enhances the guest experience, providing a deeper understanding and appreciation of the local culture and environment. Regular feedback is solicited from guests to continuously improve services and offerings, ensuring that the resort remains responsive to evolving customer needs and preferences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Maibong Eco Resort is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth. Expansion plans include the addition of new eco-friendly accommodations, incorporating innovative designs and technologies to further minimize the environmental impact. There are also plans to develop more comprehensive nature trails and adventure activities, such as zip-lining and rock climbing, catering to a wider range of interests and preferences. A significant focus will be placed on strengthening partnerships with local communities and organizations, further enhancing the resort\'s contribution to the region\'s economic and social development. This includes initiatives to promote sustainable agriculture, support local artisans, and provide educational and training opportunities for local youth. The resort also aims to become a recognized leader in sustainable tourism, serving as a model for other businesses in the region. This will involve actively sharing best practices, participating in industry forums, and advocating for policies that promote responsible tourism development. The long-term goal is to establish Maibong Eco Resort as a premier destination for eco-conscious travelers, attracting visitors from around the world and showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam while preserving its natural heritage for future generations.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:00:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1091, 'Anurag Residency - #1 Hotel in Lokhra', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Anurag Residency: Redefining Hospitality in Lokhra, Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Anurag Residency, proudly recognized as the #1 Hotel in Lokhra, Guwahati, stands as a beacon of exceptional hospitality in Assam. More than just a place to stay, Anurag Residency represents a commitment to providing a comfortable, memorable, and genuinely Assamese experience. Situated strategically in Lokhra, a vibrant and increasingly important commercial and residential hub of Guwahati, the residency caters to a diverse clientele, ranging from business travelers seeking seamless efficiency to tourists eager to explore the rich cultural tapestry of the region. Anurag Residency distinguishes itself through its personalized service, meticulous attention to detail, and a deep understanding of the unique needs and preferences of its guests. This dedication elevates it beyond a standard hotel, establishing it as a crucial element of the local business landscape, contributing to the region\'s economic vitality and reinforcing its reputation as a welcoming destination.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Anurag Residency\'s offerings lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to every guest\'s need. The residency boasts a range of well-appointed rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to offer a blend of comfort and functionality. Whether a guest requires a standard room for a short business trip or a spacious suite for a family vacation, Anurag Residency provides accommodations to suit diverse requirements. Key features include complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi throughout the property, ensuring seamless connectivity for business and leisure purposes. The in-house restaurant serves a delectable array of culinary delights, encompassing both authentic Assamese cuisine and popular international dishes, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, providing a true taste of Assam. Furthermore, Anurag Residency offers a range of supplementary services, including laundry and dry cleaning, airport transfers, and travel assistance, ensuring a hassle-free and convenient stay for every guest. What truly sets Anurag Residency apart is its commitment to providing personalized service. The staff are trained to anticipate guest needs and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a memorable and comfortable experience. The residency also offers customized packages tailored to specific needs, such as corporate retreats, family celebrations, and cultural tours, further enhancing its appeal to a broad range of travelers. By focusing on these distinctive selling points, Anurag Residency effectively meets the needs of the local market, offering a compelling alternative to larger, impersonal hotel chains.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Anurag Residency. The business philosophy is deeply rooted in the principle of \"Atithi Devo Bhava\" (the guest is equivalent to God), a traditional Indian value that emphasizes the importance of hospitality and respect towards guests. This philosophy permeates every aspect of the business, from the warm welcome at reception to the attentive service in the restaurant. The staff are not only professionally trained but also deeply connected to the local community, providing guests with valuable insights and recommendations on local attractions, cultural events, and hidden gems. Anurag Residency actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local artisans and businesses, participating in community events, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. This commitment to social responsibility strengthens its bond with the local community and reinforces its position as a responsible and ethical business. Regular feedback is actively solicited from guests to continuously improve services and ensure that the residency remains responsive to evolving needs and preferences. This dedication to customer satisfaction has resulted in consistently positive reviews and a strong reputation for excellence in hospitality. The team strives to create a personal connection with each guest, fostering a sense of belonging and ensuring that every stay is a truly memorable experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Anurag Residency envisions significant growth and expansion. The long-term goals include increasing its market share within the Guwahati hospitality sector, becoming the undisputed leader in Lokhra, and expanding its offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers. Future plans include the addition of new amenities, such as a fitness center and a rooftop terrace, to further enhance the guest experience. The residency also plans to invest in technology to streamline operations, improve efficiency, and enhance customer service. A key strategic objective is to develop and promote sustainable tourism practices, minimizing the environmental impact of the business and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty. This includes implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. Another area of focus is staff development. Anurag Residency is committed to investing in training and development programs to equip its staff with the skills and knowledge necessary to excel in their roles and provide exceptional service. This commitment to employee empowerment will not only enhance the quality of service but also create a positive and supportive work environment. By pursuing these ambitious goals, Anurag Residency aims to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and contribute to the region\'s economic and social development.</p>\n</body>\n</html>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:00:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
