(1092, 'Prashaanti Tourist Lodge, ATDC', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Prashaanti Tourist Lodge, an Assam Tourism Development Corporation (ATDC) initiative located in the heart of Guwahati, offers a tranquil and culturally immersive experience for travelers seeking an authentic taste of Assam. Beyond simply providing accommodation, Prashaanti Tourist Lodge acts as a gateway to exploring the rich heritage, natural beauty, and vibrant traditions of the region. It stands as a testament to ATDC\'s commitment to promoting sustainable tourism and fostering a deep appreciation for Assam\'s unique identity. In a city teeming with various lodging options, Prashaanti distinguishes itself through its strategic location, emphasis on Assamese hospitality, and direct connection to the state\'s tourism infrastructure.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, Prashaanti Tourist Lodge provides comfortable and well-maintained accommodation catering to diverse traveler needs. This includes a range of room options, from standard rooms to suites, all designed with a blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese aesthetics. Each room is equipped to ensure a relaxing and convenient stay, including features like air conditioning, private bathrooms, and reliable internet access. Beyond accommodation, Prashaanti offers a range of services designed to enhance the overall travel experience. These include a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both local Assamese delicacies and popular international dishes, a travel desk providing expert guidance on local attractions and tour packages, and conference facilities for business travelers. A unique selling point is the Lodge’s inherent connection to ATDC\'s extensive network, allowing guests seamless access to information, transportation, and curated experiences throughout Assam. This direct link mitigates the challenges often faced by independent travelers navigating a new region. Prashaanti directly addresses the market need for reliable, culturally sensitive, and centrally located accommodation options in Guwahati, serving as an ideal base for exploring the city and surrounding areas.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer service at Prashaanti Tourist Lodge is rooted in the Assamese tradition of \'Atithi Devo Bhava\' – treating guests as God. The staff are trained to provide personalized attention, anticipate needs, and offer genuine hospitality that goes beyond standard hotel service. What truly sets Prashaanti apart is its commitment to showcasing Assamese culture. This is achieved through various initiatives, such as showcasing local handicrafts and artwork within the lodge, organizing cultural performances for guests, and promoting local cuisine in the restaurant. The Lodge actively engages with the local community by sourcing produce from nearby farms and employing local artisans and craftsmen. This not only supports the local economy but also provides guests with an authentic and immersive experience. By fostering a sense of connection to Assam\'s culture and community, Prashaanti strives to create lasting memories and encourage responsible tourism.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Prashaanti Tourist Lodge is to further solidify its position as a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality and a key player in promoting sustainable tourism in the region. Growth plans include expanding the Lodge’s capacity to accommodate a growing influx of tourists, upgrading existing facilities to meet evolving customer expectations, and developing new and innovative tourism packages that showcase the diverse attractions of Assam. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to enhance the guest experience, such as implementing online booking platforms, providing virtual tours of local attractions, and offering personalized recommendations based on guest preferences. Furthermore, Prashaanti aims to strengthen its partnerships with local communities and businesses to create a more inclusive and sustainable tourism ecosystem. Long-term goals include establishing Prashaanti as a model for responsible tourism development in Assam, inspiring other businesses to prioritize cultural preservation, environmental sustainability, and community engagement. By consistently delivering exceptional service, promoting Assamese culture, and embracing innovation, Prashaanti Tourist Lodge aspires to be the preferred choice for travelers seeking an unforgettable and enriching experience in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:05:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1093, 'Hotel ROYALE de CASA', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Hotel ROYALE de CASA: A Luxurious Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Hotel ROYALE de CASA stands as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, offering a distinctive blend of luxury, comfort, and personalized service. Nestled amidst the vibrant cityscape, our hotel provides a tranquil escape for both business and leisure travelers. We distinguish ourselves in the regional hospitality landscape by meticulously crafting an experience that resonates with the rich cultural heritage of Assam while adhering to the highest international standards of excellence. Our commitment to providing an unmatched guest experience makes us a preferred choice for discerning travelers seeking sophistication and unparalleled service in Northeast India.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Hotel ROYALE de CASA, we provide a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clientele. Our core offerings include luxuriously appointed guest rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to provide optimal comfort and relaxation. Each room features modern amenities, plush furnishings, and stunning views, creating a serene haven for our guests. Beyond accommodation, we boast an array of exceptional dining options, from fine-dining restaurants serving authentic Assamese cuisine alongside international delicacies to casual cafes perfect for a quick bite or a leisurely afternoon. Our state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities are equipped to host a wide range of events, from corporate meetings and conferences to weddings and social gatherings, supported by a dedicated event planning team. Furthermore, guests can rejuvenate and unwind at our wellness center, featuring a fully equipped fitness center, a revitalizing spa offering traditional and contemporary treatments, and a refreshing swimming pool. Our unique selling point lies in our personalized approach to hospitality, ensuring that every guest\'s needs are anticipated and exceeded. By incorporating elements of Assamese art, culture, and culinary traditions into our offerings, we provide a truly immersive and authentic experience that sets us apart from generic hotel chains. These services directly address the local market\'s desire for high-quality accommodation, diverse dining options, and comprehensive event facilities, meeting the increasing demands of both domestic and international visitors to Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Hotel ROYALE de CASA. We believe in creating lasting memories for our guests by providing exceptional service with a personal touch. Our dedicated team of hospitality professionals is meticulously trained to anticipate and fulfill every guest\'s needs, ensuring a seamless and unforgettable stay. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively support local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and crafts within the hotel. We also partner with local tour operators to offer authentic cultural experiences, allowing our guests to immerse themselves in the rich heritage of Assam. Furthermore, we participate in community initiatives and charitable events, demonstrating our commitment to social responsibility and contributing to the well-being of the local community. By fostering strong relationships with local businesses and organizations, we aim to create a welcoming and inclusive environment for our guests and contribute to the overall vibrancy of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Hotel ROYALE de CASA is to solidify our position as the premier luxury hotel in Guwahati and a leading hospitality provider in Northeast India. We envision expanding our facilities and services to meet the growing demand for high-quality accommodation and event spaces in the region. Future plans include adding more guest rooms and suites, enhancing our dining options with innovative culinary concepts, and expanding our wellness center to offer a wider range of treatments and services. We are also exploring opportunities to develop new tourism products and experiences that showcase the unique cultural and natural attractions of Assam. Furthermore, we are committed to adopting sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the long-term well-being of the region. This includes investing in energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. Our long-term goal is to become a recognized leader in sustainable tourism, setting an example for other hospitality providers in the region. By continuously innovating, expanding our offerings, and embracing sustainable practices, we are confident that Hotel ROYALE de CASA will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth and prosperity of Guwahati and Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:05:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1094, 'dichang hotel', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Dichang Hotel, nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a haven of comfort and authentic Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, Dichang Hotel embodies a commitment to showcasing the rich culture and traditions of the region, providing guests with an immersive and unforgettable experience. Situated strategically in Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, Dichang Hotel caters to both business and leisure travelers seeking a blend of modern amenities and genuine local charm. In a region experiencing rapid growth in tourism and commerce, Dichang Hotel distinguishes itself by offering personalized service, a focus on sustainability, and a dedication to supporting the local community, making it a significant contributor to the Assam business landscape. <br> <br>\n\nDichang Hotel\'s core offerings revolve around providing exceptional accommodation and dining experiences. Our well-appointed rooms, ranging from standard suites to luxurious executive spaces, are designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clientele. Each room features modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable furnishings, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, Dichang Hotel boasts a meticulously crafted culinary experience centered around authentic Assamese cuisine. Our in-house restaurant, \'Jonaki,\' serves traditional dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients, allowing guests to savor the unique flavors of Assam. We also offer a selection of continental and Indian favorites to cater to broader palates. A unique selling point is our curated experiences, including guided tours of local tea gardens, cultural performances showcasing Assamese music and dance, and opportunities to interact with local artisans. These experiences directly address the growing demand for authentic cultural immersion among travelers visiting Assam, making Dichang Hotel a preferred choice for those seeking more than just a hotel stay. <br> <br>\n\nAt Dichang Hotel, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in fostering genuine connections with our guests, ensuring every interaction is marked by warmth, attentiveness, and personalized service. Our well-trained staff is dedicated to anticipating and fulfilling the needs of our guests, from arranging transportation to providing insightful recommendations on local attractions. We go beyond standard customer service by actively engaging with the local community. We partner with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and services within the hotel, contributing to their economic empowerment and providing guests with a unique shopping experience. Dichang Hotel also participates in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of community and promoting Assamese culture to a wider audience. Our commitment to sustainable practices, such as waste reduction and energy conservation, further enhances the guest experience by demonstrating our dedication to responsible tourism. Online feedback mechanisms, including surveys and social media engagement, are actively utilized to continuously improve our services and ensure guest satisfaction remains at the forefront of our operations. <br> <br>\n\nDichang Hotel envisions becoming a leading hospitality brand in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and cultural preservation. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand for quality lodging in Guwahati. We are also exploring the development of additional amenities, such as a spa and wellness center, to enhance the guest experience further. A key focus is on strengthening our ties with the local community by providing training and employment opportunities for local youth. We aim to establish partnerships with educational institutions to offer hospitality internships and mentorship programs, contributing to the development of a skilled workforce in the region. Furthermore, we plan to implement innovative technologies to streamline operations, enhance guest services, and reduce our environmental footprint. Long-term, Dichang Hotel aims to expand its presence beyond Guwahati, establishing a network of eco-friendly and culturally sensitive hotels across Northeast India, contributing to the sustainable growth of the region\'s tourism sector and showcasing the unique beauty and culture of Assam to the world.\n</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:05:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1095, 'Kaaamini village resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Kaaamini Village Resort, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers an authentic and immersive experience that distinguishes it as a unique player in the region\'s burgeoning hospitality sector. More than just a place to stay, Kaaamini Village Resort is a sanctuary that celebrates the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam, offering guests a chance to reconnect with tradition and tranquility. In a market increasingly dominated by standardized hotel chains, Kaaamini stands out by providing a genuine taste of local life, contributing significantly to the promotion of Assam\'s tourism and supporting local artisans and communities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of Kaaamini Village Resort lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality intertwined with authentic cultural experiences. The resort offers a range of meticulously designed accommodations, from traditionally styled cottages that reflect Assamese architecture to modern rooms that offer comfort and convenience, all surrounded by lush greenery. Beyond accommodation, Kaaamini provides curated experiences designed to immerse guests in Assamese culture. These include traditional Assamese cooking classes where guests learn to prepare local delicacies, cultural performances showcasing Bihu dance and music, and guided tours of nearby villages and tea gardens, offering insights into the region\'s rich history and traditions. The resort also boasts a restaurant that serves authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients, offering a gastronomic journey through the flavors of the region. A unique selling point is the resort\'s dedication to sustainable tourism practices, emphasizing environmental conservation and community empowerment, which appeals to the growing number of environmentally conscious travelers. This approach directly addresses the increasing demand for authentic and responsible travel experiences within the local market and beyond.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Kaaamini Village Resort prioritizes creating a memorable and personalized customer experience. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality and attentive service. The staff is trained to anticipate guests\' needs and provide personalized recommendations, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. What truly sets Kaaamini apart is its ability to foster a deep connection with the local community. The resort actively involves local artisans and craftsmen in its operations, showcasing their work and providing them with opportunities to generate income. Guests have the chance to interact with local villagers, learn about their traditions, and purchase handcrafted souvenirs, contributing directly to the economic well-being of the community. The resort also organizes community events and initiatives, further strengthening its ties with the local population. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also helps to preserve and promote Assam\'s cultural heritage.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Kaaamini Village Resort envisions becoming a leading destination for cultural and eco-tourism in Assam. The resort aims to expand its range of services and experiences, offering even more opportunities for guests to immerse themselves in Assamese culture and explore the region\'s natural beauty. Future plans include developing new eco-friendly accommodations, expanding the restaurant\'s menu to showcase a wider range of Assamese cuisine, and organizing more community-based tourism initiatives. Kaaamini also plans to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, such as offering online booking and personalized concierge services. Furthermore, the resort aims to establish partnerships with local tourism organizations and tour operators to promote Assam as a premier tourist destination. The long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional hospitality but also contributes to the preservation of Assam\'s cultural heritage and the economic empowerment of local communities. Kaaamini Village Resort aspires to be more than just a resort; it aims to be a gateway to discovering the soul of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:05:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1096, 'Nirvana Guest House', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Nirvana Guest House: A Tranquil Haven in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Nirvana Guest House offers a peaceful and welcoming retreat for travelers seeking comfort and convenience in Guwahati, Assam. Nestled amidst the vibrant energy of the city, our guest house provides a serene escape, balancing modern amenities with the warmth of Assamese hospitality. We stand out in the local hospitality sector by offering a personalized experience that caters to both business and leisure travelers, establishing ourselves as a preferred choice for those seeking a home away from home. Unlike larger hotels, Nirvana Guest House provides a more intimate and attentive atmosphere, allowing us to focus on individual guest needs and create memorable stays. Our commitment to cleanliness, comfort, and genuine care sets us apart, contributing to our positive reputation within the Guwahati community and beyond.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: Your Gateway to Comfort and Convenience</p>\n\n<p>At Nirvana Guest House, we provide a range of services designed to ensure a relaxing and productive stay. Our primary offering is comfortable and well-appointed guest rooms, each thoughtfully designed with modern amenities. Rooms feature air conditioning, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen televisions with cable channels, and private bathrooms with hot and cold water. We offer a variety of room types, including single, double, and family rooms, catering to the diverse needs of our guests. <br> <br> Beyond accommodation, we offer a complimentary breakfast service featuring a selection of continental and Indian dishes, providing a nourishing start to the day. We also provide laundry services, ensuring guests can travel light and maintain a fresh wardrobe. Our concierge service assists with travel arrangements, airport transfers, and local sightseeing recommendations, helping guests make the most of their time in Guwahati. What truly differentiates Nirvana Guest House is our dedication to providing a personalized experience. We go the extra mile to understand our guests\' preferences and needs, tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. This could include arranging specific dietary requests, organizing guided tours of local attractions, or providing assistance with business-related tasks. This personalized touch, combined with our competitive pricing, positions us as a valuable and accessible option for travelers seeking quality accommodation in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Cultivating a Community Connection Through Exceptional Customer Experience</p>\n\n<p>Customer service lies at the heart of Nirvana Guest House\'s philosophy. We believe in creating a welcoming and supportive environment for every guest, ensuring they feel comfortable and valued from the moment they arrive. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service. We emphasize proactive communication, anticipating guest needs and addressing any concerns promptly and effectively. <br> <br> What truly makes our customer experience exceptional is our connection to the local community. We actively promote local culture and tourism, recommending authentic Assamese restaurants, cultural events, and local attractions. We also partner with local businesses, supporting the growth of the community and providing guests with unique and enriching experiences. We believe in building relationships with our guests beyond their stay. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and maintain open communication channels for future bookings and inquiries. Many of our guests are repeat visitors, a testament to our commitment to providing a consistently positive and memorable experience. This focus on community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also strengthens our reputation as a responsible and caring business within Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking Ahead: Growth and Innovation at Nirvana Guest House</p>\n\n<p>Nirvana Guest House envisions a future of sustained growth and continued excellence in the Guwahati hospitality market. Our long-term goals include expanding our capacity to accommodate a greater number of guests while maintaining our commitment to personalized service. We are exploring opportunities to add new amenities, such as a small business center, to cater to the needs of business travelers. We also aim to enhance our sustainability practices, implementing eco-friendly initiatives to reduce our environmental impact. <br> <br> Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our online presence through targeted marketing campaigns and partnerships with online travel agencies. We will also continue to leverage social media to engage with potential guests and promote Guwahati as a desirable tourist destination. We are committed to investing in our staff through ongoing training and development programs, ensuring they remain at the forefront of hospitality best practices. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Nirvana Guest House aims to solidify its position as a leading guest house in Guwahati, known for its exceptional service, comfortable accommodations, and genuine connection to the local community. We believe in fostering a culture of continuous improvement and are dedicated to providing our guests with an unforgettable experience that reflects the unique charm and hospitality of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:05:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1097, 'Hotel Orchid', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Hotel Orchid stands as a distinguished hospitality landmark in Guwahati, Assam, providing exceptional accommodation and comprehensive services designed to cater to the discerning traveler. Located strategically in the heart of the city, Hotel Orchid distinguishes itself through a commitment to blending contemporary comfort with the rich cultural tapestry of Assam, offering guests an immersive and unforgettable experience. The hotel plays a significant role in the local business landscape by providing premium lodging and event spaces, supporting tourism, and contributing to the economic vitality of the region. It is a place where business blends seamlessly with leisure, providing a tranquil retreat amidst the bustling city.\n<br> <br>\nAt Hotel Orchid, our core offering revolves around providing superior accommodation. Our rooms and suites are meticulously designed, featuring modern amenities and elegant décor, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay for both leisure and business travelers. Beyond lodging, we offer a range of services including multiple on-site dining options featuring both local Assamese cuisine and international flavors, a well-equipped business center for corporate needs, and comprehensive event and conference facilities capable of hosting a wide array of gatherings, from intimate meetings to large-scale conferences and weddings.\n<br> <br>\nOur unique selling points are multifaceted. We pride ourselves on our commitment to showcasing the authentic Assam experience. From incorporating local art and handicrafts into our décor to offering culinary experiences that highlight regional specialties, we provide guests with a genuine taste of Assam. This commitment to cultural immersion, coupled with our dedication to modern amenities and exceptional service, sets us apart from competitors. Our focus on providing personalized service, anticipating guest needs, and exceeding expectations makes us a preferred choice for both domestic and international travelers. The ability to cater to diverse needs – from corporate events to family vacations – positions us as a versatile and valuable resource within Guwahati\'s hospitality sector. We address local market needs by providing a high-quality alternative to other establishments, delivering consistent service, and actively contributing to the positive image of Guwahati as a destination.\n<br> <br>\nCustomer experience is paramount at Hotel Orchid. Our approach to customer service is rooted in a philosophy of genuine care and attention to detail. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized experience for every guest, ensuring their needs are not only met but exceeded. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality, and our dedicated staff is always available to assist with any requests. We differentiate ourselves through proactive service, anticipating needs and going the extra mile to ensure guest satisfaction. This includes offering personalized concierge services, tailored dining experiences, and assistance with travel arrangements and local excursions.\n<br> <br>\nHotel Orchid actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. We collaborate with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and services, contributing to the local economy. We participate in community events and support local charities, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen. Furthermore, we prioritize employing local residents, providing job opportunities and contributing to the overall well-being of the community. This engagement fosters goodwill and strengthens our relationship with the people of Guwahati, establishing Hotel Orchid as not just a business, but a valued member of the community. We believe in building lasting relationships with our guests and the community alike.\n<br> <br>\nThe future vision for Hotel Orchid is one of sustainable growth and continued excellence. We aim to expand our reach within the Assam market and beyond, exploring opportunities to establish new properties in other strategic locations. We are committed to continuously improving our services and facilities, incorporating the latest technologies and trends to enhance the guest experience. A key aspect of our future plans involves developing our event and conference facilities further, positioning Hotel Orchid as a premier destination for business and social gatherings in the region.\n<br> <br>\nFurthermore, we plan to strengthen our commitment to sustainability, implementing eco-friendly practices throughout our operations. This includes reducing our environmental footprint, conserving resources, and supporting local conservation efforts. Our long-term goals involve establishing Hotel Orchid as a recognized leader in the hospitality industry in Northeast India, renowned for its exceptional service, commitment to quality, and dedication to the local community. We aspire to be more than just a hotel; we aim to be a destination that embodies the spirit of Assam and provides guests with an unforgettable experience that they will cherish for years to come. Our vision is to be synonymous with luxury, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality.\n</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:10:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1098, 'Vaanya Retreat', 'Resorts', '', 'Vaanya Retreat: A Sanctuary of Wellness in Guwahati\n\nVaanya Retreat emerges as a haven of tranquility in the bustling heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a wellness center, it is a dedicated space designed to foster holistic well-being, drawing inspiration from the region\'s rich cultural heritage and natural abundance. In a market increasingly seeking mindful escapes and authentic experiences, Vaanya Retreat stands apart by offering a curated blend of traditional Assamese hospitality and modern wellness practices, creating a truly unique and rejuvenating experience. It addresses the growing need for accessible and comprehensive wellness solutions within the local community and beyond.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Vaanya Retreat offers a diverse portfolio of services designed to cater to various aspects of well-being. The offerings include revitalizing spa treatments incorporating locally sourced ingredients and traditional Assamese massage techniques, personalized yoga and meditation sessions led by certified instructors, and curated wellness programs focused on stress management, detoxification, and overall health improvement. Unique to Vaanya Retreat is its emphasis on incorporating Assam\'s natural resources, such as locally grown herbs and teas, into its treatments and programs. This not only enhances the therapeutic benefits but also promotes local sustainability. A signature offering is the \"Kamrup Revival,\" a multi-day wellness package that combines yoga, meditation, Ayurvedic-inspired treatments, and healthy Assamese cuisine, offering a deep immersion into the region\'s healing traditions. This distinctive approach differentiates Vaanya Retreat from generic spa and wellness centers, directly appealing to the discerning customer seeking an authentic and enriching experience. We also offer curated tea tasting experiences showcasing the diverse flavors of Assam tea, a crucial aspect of the region\'s identity.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nVaanya Retreat prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience at every touchpoint. From the moment guests enter the serene and thoughtfully designed space, they are greeted with warmth and genuine care. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide personalized attention, understanding individual needs and preferences to tailor treatments and programs accordingly. We strive to build lasting relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of community and belonging. What truly sets Vaanya Retreat apart is its commitment to engaging with the local community. We actively collaborate with local artisans and suppliers, showcasing their crafts and products within the retreat. Regular wellness workshops and events are organized, inviting community members to learn about healthy living, stress management, and traditional Assamese healing practices. By actively participating in local initiatives and promoting sustainable practices, Vaanya Retreat aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a valuable member of the Guwahati community. We also partner with local tourism operators to offer wellness packages that integrate cultural experiences, such as visits to tea gardens and temples, further enhancing the guest experience and promoting regional tourism.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Vaanya Retreat envisions becoming a leading wellness destination in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the range of services to include specialized wellness programs for specific health conditions, such as diabetes management and post-COVID recovery. We also aim to establish a training academy to nurture local talent in the wellness industry, providing opportunities for employment and professional development. A key focus is on enhancing the online presence and reach, attracting both domestic and international guests seeking a unique and rejuvenating wellness experience. We plan to introduce online consultations and virtual wellness programs, making our services accessible to a wider audience. Ultimately, Vaanya Retreat aspires to be a catalyst for positive change in the health and well-being of the community, promoting a holistic approach to life and celebrating the rich cultural heritage of Assam. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities for establishing eco-friendly accommodations within the retreat premises, creating a self-contained wellness sanctuary. This will allow guests to fully immerse themselves in the tranquil environment and deepen their connection with nature.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:10:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1099, 'Kordoi Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Kordoi Resort: An Oasis of Tranquility in Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Kordoi Resort emerges as a premier destination within Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of modern luxury and traditional Assamese hospitality. Nestled amidst the lush landscapes characteristic of the region, Kordoi isn\'t merely a place to stay; it\'s an immersive experience designed to connect guests with the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam. In a region increasingly seeking sophisticated yet authentic travel experiences, Kordoi Resort distinguishes itself by prioritizing sustainable practices, supporting local artisans, and delivering unparalleled personalized service. It aims to be a leading establishment not just within Guwahati but as a beacon of responsible and high-quality tourism in Northeast India.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Kordoi Resort lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality through a diverse range of services and facilities. The resort boasts luxuriously appointed accommodations, ranging from elegantly designed rooms with panoramic views to private villas offering secluded retreats. Each room reflects a careful balance of contemporary design and local craftsmanship, featuring handcrafted textiles and locally sourced materials. Beyond accommodation, Kordoi offers a comprehensive suite of amenities, including:\n<br> <br>\n\n*   <b>Gourmet Dining:</b> Multiple restaurants and cafes showcase the diverse culinary landscape of Assam and the broader Indian subcontinent, with a focus on fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Special dietary needs and preferences are meticulously catered to.\n<br> <br>\n*   <b>Wellness & Recreation:</b> A state-of-the-art spa provides a range of rejuvenating treatments inspired by traditional Assamese wellness practices. A fully equipped fitness center, swimming pool, and various recreational activities, such as nature walks and birdwatching tours, cater to diverse interests.\n<br> <br>\n*   <b>Event & Conference Facilities:</b> Kordoi Resort offers versatile event spaces, ideal for weddings, corporate retreats, and social gatherings. These spaces are equipped with modern technology and supported by a dedicated events team to ensure seamless execution.\n<br> <br>\n*   <b>Cultural Experiences:</b> Unique to Kordoi is its focus on showcasing Assamese culture. Guests can participate in traditional dance performances, cooking classes featuring local cuisine, and guided tours of nearby historical and cultural sites.\n<br> <br>\nKordoi\'s unique selling proposition lies in its ability to seamlessly blend luxury with authenticity. Unlike generic hotel chains, Kordoi actively promotes and celebrates the rich heritage of Assam, creating a deeply immersive and memorable experience for every guest. This approach effectively addresses the growing demand for authentic travel experiences and positions Kordoi as a cultural gateway to the region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Kordoi Resort. Every interaction, from initial booking to departure, is meticulously designed to exceed expectations. A dedicated concierge service provides personalized assistance, curating bespoke itineraries and catering to individual needs. The resort prides itself on its highly trained and attentive staff, who are deeply knowledgeable about the local culture and committed to providing warm and genuine hospitality.\n<br> <br>\n\nKordoi actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. The resort sources local produce and handicrafts, supporting local farmers and artisans and contributing to the economic well-being of the region. It also collaborates with local organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and environmental conservation. The resort regularly hosts community events, showcasing local talent and fostering a sense of connection between guests and the local population. By prioritizing ethical and sustainable practices, Kordoi aims to be a responsible corporate citizen and a positive force within the Guwahati community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Kordoi Resort is one of sustainable growth and regional leadership. The resort aims to expand its offerings, potentially including the development of eco-lodges in other parts of Assam, furthering its commitment to responsible tourism. Plans are also in place to enhance the cultural immersion programs, creating even more authentic and engaging experiences for guests. Furthermore, Kordoi aspires to become a center for promoting Assamese art and culture, hosting exhibitions, workshops, and festivals that showcase the region\'s unique heritage.\n<br> <br>\n\nLong-term, Kordoi Resort aims to be recognized as a premier destination for discerning travelers seeking authentic cultural experiences and unparalleled hospitality in Northeast India. The focus remains on continuous improvement, innovation, and a steadfast commitment to sustainability, ensuring that Kordoi Resort remains a treasured asset to the Guwahati community and a beacon of responsible tourism in the region for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:10:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1100, 'Hotel Green Valley', 'Resorts', '', 'Hotel Green Valley: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nNestled amidst the verdant landscapes surrounding Guwahati, Hotel Green Valley offers a distinctive hospitality experience that seamlessly blends modern comfort with the rich cultural heritage of Assam. More than just a place to stay, Hotel Green Valley serves as a gateway to exploring the region’s natural beauty, vibrant traditions, and warm hospitality. We are committed to providing exceptional service and creating memorable experiences for every guest, contributing to the thriving tourism sector and the overall economic landscape of Assam. Our commitment to sustainable practices further distinguishes us, making us a responsible and forward-thinking member of the Guwahati business community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Hotel Green Valley lies our dedication to providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodations. We offer a range of rooms and suites, each designed to cater to the diverse needs of our guests, from business travelers seeking a productive workspace to families desiring a relaxing retreat. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, comfortable bedding, and en-suite bathrooms, ensuring a pleasant and convenient stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodation, we provide a comprehensive suite of services designed to enhance our guests\' experience. Our in-house restaurant showcases the authentic flavors of Assamese cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, alongside a selection of international dishes to cater to diverse palates. We also offer banqueting and conference facilities, making Hotel Green Valley an ideal venue for corporate events, weddings, and other special occasions. These facilities are equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and supported by a dedicated events team, ensuring seamless execution and memorable experiences. Our travel desk assists guests in planning excursions to nearby attractions, including the Kamakhya Temple, Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary, and the scenic Brahmaputra River, allowing them to fully immerse themselves in the beauty and culture of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly sets Hotel Green Valley apart is our unwavering commitment to providing exceptional customer service. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs and provide personalized attention, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. We actively engage with the local community by supporting local artisans and promoting Assamese culture through our events and activities. We showcase local artwork within the hotel and collaborate with local businesses to offer authentic Assamese experiences to our guests, fostering a sense of connection and contributing to the local economy. We regularly participate in local festivals and events, further solidifying our connection with the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer feedback is paramount to our continuous improvement. We actively solicit and analyze guest feedback to identify areas for enhancement and ensure that we are consistently exceeding expectations. We utilize various channels, including online surveys, comment cards, and direct interaction with guests, to gather valuable insights and refine our services. We empower our staff to address guest concerns promptly and effectively, ensuring that any issues are resolved to the guest\'s satisfaction. This proactive approach to customer service has earned us a reputation for excellence and fostered strong relationships with our guests.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Hotel Green Valley envisions expanding its operations and solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and the surrounding region. We plan to introduce new services and amenities to cater to the evolving needs of our guests, including a wellness center offering spa treatments and fitness facilities. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-friendly initiatives and promote sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goals include establishing a training program for local youth to provide them with valuable skills and employment opportunities in the hospitality industry. We believe in investing in the local community and fostering a culture of excellence that will benefit both our employees and our guests. We are also committed to expanding our marketing efforts to reach a wider audience and attract more tourists to Guwahati and Assam, contributing to the growth of the local economy and promoting the region\'s rich cultural heritage. Hotel Green Valley aims to be more than just a hotel; we aspire to be a cornerstone of the Guwahati community, a champion of Assamese culture, and a leader in sustainable tourism.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:10:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
