(1101, 'Capital O Wedding Resort', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Capital O Wedding Resort stands as a premier destination in Guwahati, Assam, revolutionizing the landscape of wedding venues and event hosting. More than just a location, it offers a comprehensive and unforgettable experience, catering to the growing demand for sophisticated and personalized celebrations within the region. Strategically positioned to embrace the natural beauty of Assam while remaining accessible to the city, Capital O Wedding Resort fills a crucial gap in the market for a high-quality, full-service wedding and event venue. It represents a significant investment in the local hospitality sector, fostering economic growth and providing employment opportunities, while simultaneously setting a new benchmark for excellence in the event management industry within Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering centers around providing a seamless and stress-free wedding experience. We offer a range of customizable packages designed to cater to diverse budgets and preferences. These packages encompass everything from venue rental and decoration to catering services, photography, videography, and entertainment. Our in-house team of experienced wedding planners works closely with each couple to understand their vision and bring it to life, ensuring every detail is meticulously executed. Beyond weddings, Capital O Wedding Resort is also equipped to host a variety of other events, including corporate conferences, social gatherings, and private parties. We boast multiple indoor and outdoor spaces, including beautifully landscaped gardens, spacious banquet halls, and comfortable accommodation for guests. What truly distinguishes Capital O Wedding Resort is our commitment to incorporating local Assamese traditions and aesthetics into our offerings. We collaborate with local artisans and vendors to provide authentic cultural experiences, allowing couples to celebrate their heritage in a meaningful way. For example, we can arrange traditional Bihu dance performances, offer Assamese cuisine options, and incorporate local silk fabrics into the décor. This focus on cultural relevance sets us apart from generic event venues and resonates deeply with the local market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Capital O Wedding Resort, we prioritize creating an exceptional customer experience from the initial inquiry to the final farewell. Our dedicated team is committed to providing personalized attention and responsive support throughout the planning process. We understand that planning a wedding or any major event can be overwhelming, so we strive to alleviate the stress and make the experience enjoyable. We believe in building strong relationships with our clients, understanding their unique needs, and exceeding their expectations. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing a service; we aim to create cherished memories that last a lifetime. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events and supporting local businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that has welcomed us and fostering a positive relationship with our neighbors. We also strive to be environmentally conscious, implementing sustainable practices in our operations, such as waste reduction and energy conservation. Our reputation within the local community is paramount, and we actively seek feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure customer satisfaction.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Capital O Wedding Resort envisions becoming the leading wedding and event destination in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our facilities to accommodate larger events and offer even more diverse services. We aim to incorporate the latest technology into our offerings, such as virtual reality tours of the venue and interactive event planning tools. We also plan to partner with more local businesses and artisans to further enhance the cultural experience we offer. One of our long-term goals is to establish a training program for aspiring event planners and hospitality professionals in Assam. We believe in investing in the local talent and contributing to the growth of the hospitality industry in the region. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional branches in other cities in Northeast India, bringing our unique blend of quality service and cultural relevance to a wider audience. Ultimately, our vision is to create a legacy of excellence in event management and contribute to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam and the entire Northeast region. We strive to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a vital part of the community, a catalyst for celebration, and a symbol of lasting memories.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:10:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1102, 'Kiranshree Grand', 'Resorts', '', 'Kiranshree Grand, a distinguished establishment located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of quality and innovation within the region\'s evolving business environment. More than just a business, Kiranshree Grand represents a commitment to excellence, deeply rooted in the local culture and driven by a desire to meet the specific needs of the community. Its unique blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese hospitality sets it apart, contributing significantly to the vibrancy and economic growth of Guwahati. Kiranshree Grand aspires to be a landmark destination, synonymous with exceptional service and unwavering dedication to its patrons.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nKiranshree Grand\'s core offerings revolve around providing premium hospitality and event management solutions. Its services encompass elegantly appointed accommodations designed for both business and leisure travelers, offering a seamless blend of comfort and functionality. The hotel boasts state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, ideally suited for hosting a diverse range of events, from corporate meetings and seminars to weddings and social gatherings. The in-house culinary team excels in creating exquisite menus that showcase both local Assamese delicacies and international cuisine, catering to diverse palates. What distinguishes Kiranshree Grand is its personalized approach to event planning, ensuring that every occasion is meticulously orchestrated to exceed expectations. Furthermore, it emphasizes incorporating sustainable practices, appealing to an increasingly environmentally conscious clientele. Kiranshree Grand specifically caters to the increasing demand for high-quality event spaces and accommodations within Guwahati, effectively addressing the needs of both local residents and visitors.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Kiranshree Grand. The establishment prides itself on delivering personalized and attentive service, fostering a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere for all guests. Staff members are carefully selected and trained to anticipate and cater to individual needs, ensuring a memorable and seamless stay. The hotel actively seeks feedback from its clientele to continuously improve its services and offerings. Kiranshree Grand participates actively in local community initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses, thus contributing to the socio-economic well-being of Guwahati. Moreover, it frequently hosts community events and workshops, fostering a sense of belonging and connection. This dedication to customer satisfaction and community engagement differentiates Kiranshree Grand, establishing it as a trusted and respected member of the Guwahati business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Kiranshree Grand envisions significant growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in the region. Future plans include expanding its accommodation capacity, introducing new and innovative services, and further enhancing its event management capabilities. There are also plans for strategic partnerships with local tourism operators to promote Guwahati and Assam as premier destinations. The long-term goals involve establishing Kiranshree Grand as a benchmark for excellence in the hospitality industry, recognized not only for its luxurious amenities but also for its commitment to sustainability, community engagement, and ethical business practices. This vision involves continuously adapting to evolving market trends and customer preferences, ensuring that Kiranshree Grand remains a relevant and thriving enterprise for years to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:15:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1103, 'Airport Guest House Guwahati', 'Resorts', '', 'Airport Guest House Guwahati: Your Gateway to Assam\n\nAirport Guest House Guwahati is a comfortable and conveniently located accommodation option designed to cater to the diverse needs of travelers visiting Assam. Situated in Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, the guest house offers a welcoming respite for tourists, business travelers, and those in transit, seeking a blend of accessibility, affordability, and genuine Assamese hospitality. The strategic location provides unparalleled ease of access to Lokpriya Gopinath Bordoloi International Airport, minimizing travel time and maximizing convenience for guests arriving or departing from Guwahati. The business aims to distinguish itself not merely as a place to stay, but as an integral part of the visitor\'s experience, offering a seamless transition into the vibrant culture and captivating landscapes of Assam. <br> <br>\n\nAt a time when Guwahati is experiencing a surge in tourism and business activity, Airport Guest House Guwahati plays a vital role in supporting the region\'s infrastructure. It provides accessible accommodation for those who might find hotel costs prohibitive, as well as an alternative to the larger, sometimes impersonal, hotel chains. This accessibility fosters broader participation in the regional economy, enabling more people to visit and contribute to local businesses. The guest house adds value to the overall Guwahati travel experience by delivering a blend of practical comfort and authentic local engagement. <br> <br>\n\nOur core service is providing comfortable and well-maintained accommodation that caters to a variety of budgetary needs. We offer a range of rooms, from standard to deluxe, all equipped with essential amenities, including air conditioning, comfortable beds, and clean, private bathrooms. Understanding the importance of connectivity, we also provide complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi access throughout the property, enabling guests to stay connected for business or leisure. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to providing a home-like atmosphere, coupled with personalized service. We strive to anticipate the needs of our guests, offering assistance with everything from airport transfers and local transportation to itinerary planning and cultural insights. <br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodation, we provide essential services like laundry, luggage storage, and a 24-hour front desk to address guest needs promptly. We partner with local tour operators to offer curated excursions, enabling guests to experience the region\'s rich cultural heritage, explore the mesmerizing Brahmaputra River, and discover the unique flora and fauna of Assam. We also offer a simple, yet satisfying, breakfast service that incorporates local flavors. This focus on locally-sourced elements enriches the experience and supports the local economy. Our dedication to providing efficient and effective services is further amplified by our deep understanding of the transient nature of our clientele, who often seek quick, reliable solutions when they are travelling through Guwahati. This acute awareness informs how we tailor our services and the way we address the needs of each individual. <br> <br>\n\nWe understand that positive customer experiences are the bedrock of a successful hospitality business. Our approach to customer service is rooted in genuine warmth and a sincere desire to make each guest feel welcome and valued. Our staff is trained to be attentive, approachable, and proactive in addressing guest concerns. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continually improve our services and ensure that we are exceeding their expectations. We also understand the importance of fostering a connection with the local community. We actively promote local artisans and businesses by featuring their products in our guest house and providing information about local attractions and events. This not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the economic well-being of the community. <br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, we encourage interaction between our guests and local residents, fostering a sense of cultural exchange and mutual understanding. We achieve this through promoting local festivals and arranging opportunities for guests to participate in community events. We also prioritize hiring local staff, providing employment opportunities within the community and ensuring that our guests are greeted by individuals who are passionate about sharing their knowledge of the region. We proactively use online platforms to manage guest relationships and address any concerns promptly and efficiently. Our engagement extends beyond our premises as we participate in local initiatives promoting sustainability and responsible tourism practices. We firmly believe that contributing to the wellbeing of the community is an integral element of our business success. <br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Airport Guest House Guwahati has ambitious plans for growth and development. We envision expanding our accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand for affordable and accessible lodging options in Guwahati. We intend to incorporate sustainable practices into our operations, reducing our environmental footprint and contributing to the preservation of the region\'s natural beauty. This includes initiatives like solar energy adoption and rainwater harvesting. We plan to establish partnerships with local educational institutions to offer internship opportunities, contributing to the development of skilled workforce in the hospitality sector. We also aim to create a unique and immersive experience by developing culturally themed rooms that showcase Assam’s rich heritage. <br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to establish Airport Guest House Guwahati as the leading choice for travelers seeking a comfortable, convenient, and culturally enriching experience in Guwahati. We aim to become synonymous with authentic Assamese hospitality, creating lasting memories for our guests and contributing to the growth and prosperity of the local community. This will involve consistently improving our services, investing in our staff, and embracing innovative technologies to enhance the guest experience. We also plan to strategically expand our reach through online marketing initiatives, solidifying our brand presence and attracting a wider customer base. Ultimately, we seek to not only provide a place to stay, but to be a vital part of the traveler\'s journey through Assam, offering a welcoming introduction to the region and fostering a deep appreciation for its unique culture and landscapes.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:15:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1104, 'RJB Grand', 'Resorts', '', '<p>RJB Grand stands as a prominent name in Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of hospitality and service excellence that distinguishes it within the regional business landscape. Located strategically in the heart of the city, RJB Grand has quickly established itself as a preferred choice for both business and leisure travelers, as well as local residents seeking a refined experience. The business is committed to providing exceptional value, combining modern amenities with a touch of Assamese warmth and hospitality, reflecting the rich cultural heritage of the region. RJB Grand strives to be more than just a business; it aims to be an integral part of the Guwahati community, contributing to its economic growth and social well-being. <br> <br>\nThe importance of RJB Grand within the local Assam business landscape lies in its commitment to quality and its understanding of local needs. By providing a superior level of service and a focus on customer satisfaction, the business contributes to the overall positive perception of Guwahati as a destination for both commerce and tourism.</p>\n\n<p>RJB Grand’s core offerings revolve around providing comprehensive hospitality solutions. This includes well-appointed and tastefully decorated rooms catering to varying budgets and preferences. Each room is designed with comfort and functionality in mind, equipped with modern amenities like high-speed internet access, television, and comfortable workspaces. Beyond accommodation, RJB Grand boasts a range of services designed to enhance the guest experience. <br> <br>\nOne key element is the on-site dining experience. The restaurant features a diverse menu, encompassing both local Assamese delicacies and popular international cuisine, prepared by experienced chefs using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. In addition, RJB Grand offers conference and banqueting facilities ideal for business meetings, seminars, weddings, and other special events. These spaces are equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and supported by a dedicated events team. A unique selling point is its commitment to personalizing each event, tailoring services to meet the specific needs and preferences of each client. This focus on customization, combined with the quality of the facilities, makes RJB Grand a sought-after venue in Guwahati. The presence of a well-equipped fitness center and a relaxing spa further adds to the comprehensive suite of services. <br> <br>\nThese services directly meet local market needs by providing a high-quality accommodation and event venue option that was previously underserved. The demand for reliable, modern facilities for both business and leisure has been on the rise in Guwahati, and RJB Grand addresses this directly.</p>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of RJB Grand\'s operations. The business is committed to providing personalized service and building lasting relationships with its guests. Staff members are trained to anticipate guest needs and go the extra mile to ensure their comfort and satisfaction. This includes offering personalized recommendations for local attractions and activities, providing efficient and prompt assistance with any requests, and maintaining a welcoming and friendly atmosphere throughout the establishment. <br> <br>\nWhat truly sets RJB Grand apart is its strong connection to the local community. The business actively participates in local events and initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses, and promoting the rich cultural heritage of Assam. This commitment to social responsibility resonates with both guests and the local community, fostering a sense of pride and loyalty. RJB Grand actively seeks feedback from its customers through surveys and online reviews, using this information to continuously improve its services and offerings. This dedication to continuous improvement demonstrates a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction and a desire to exceed expectations. The business also utilizes social media platforms to engage with its audience, share updates, and promote local events, further strengthening its ties to the community.</p>\n\n<p>The future vision for RJB Grand involves significant growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. Plans are underway to expand the accommodation capacity, adding more rooms and suites to cater to the growing demand. The business also intends to further enhance its facilities by adding new amenities, such as a swimming pool and a rooftop lounge, providing even more options for relaxation and recreation. <br> <br>\nLong-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand to other cities in Assam and the Northeast region, bringing the RJB Grand brand of hospitality to a wider audience. The business is also committed to investing in its staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure they continue to deliver exceptional service. Furthermore, RJB Grand aims to become a leader in sustainable tourism practices, implementing eco-friendly initiatives to minimize its environmental impact and contribute to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty. This focus on sustainability will not only benefit the environment but also enhance the brand\'s reputation and appeal to environmentally conscious travelers. By focusing on innovation, continuous improvement, and community engagement, RJB Grand is poised for continued success and long-term growth in the dynamic hospitality industry.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:15:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1105, 'Vishwaratna Hotel', 'Resorts', '', 'Vishwaratna Hotel: A Gateway to Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nVishwaratna Hotel stands as a beacon of comfort and sophistication in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a distinguished hospitality experience that blends modern amenities with the rich cultural heritage of the region. More than just a place to stay, Vishwaratna is a destination where travelers can immerse themselves in the spirit of Assam, savor authentic flavors, and create lasting memories. Situated strategically within Guwahati, the hotel serves as a convenient hub for both business and leisure travelers seeking to explore the vibrant city and its surrounding landscapes. Its significance lies in its commitment to providing exceptional service while promoting the local culture and contributing to the economic growth of Assam.\n\nCore Services and Products: Tailored to Meet Every Need\n\nAt Vishwaratna Hotel, guests can choose from a range of meticulously designed accommodations, including well-appointed rooms and suites that cater to diverse preferences and budgets. Each space is thoughtfully crafted to provide a relaxing and productive environment, featuring modern conveniences such as high-speed internet access, comfortable bedding, and spacious work areas. Beyond accommodations, the hotel offers a diverse culinary journey at its in-house restaurant, which showcases the authentic flavors of Assamese cuisine alongside popular international dishes. Using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, the chefs create delectable meals that tantalize the taste buds and offer a true sense of place. <br> <br>\n\nFor business travelers, Vishwaratna Hotel provides state-of-the-art conference and event facilities, equipped with the latest audio-visual technology and supported by a dedicated team of event professionals. These spaces are ideal for hosting meetings, seminars, conferences, and social gatherings of all sizes. Unique selling points include the hotel\'s unwavering commitment to personalized service, its prime location providing easy access to key attractions and business districts, and its dedication to showcasing Assamese culture through its décor, cuisine, and hospitality. These services meet the local market\'s need for high-quality accommodations, exceptional dining experiences, and professional event venues, all delivered with a touch of regional authenticity. <br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience: Where Hospitality Meets Heart\n\nVishwaratna Hotel places paramount importance on creating a memorable and positive experience for every guest. The staff is trained to anticipate needs, offer personalized assistance, and go the extra mile to ensure satisfaction. From the warm welcome at check-in to the attentive service throughout the stay, guests are treated with genuine care and respect. The hotel actively seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and tailor its offerings to meet evolving preferences. <br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Vishwaratna Hotel apart is its strong connection to the local community. The hotel partners with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and talents, contributing to the economic empowerment of the region. Guests have the opportunity to learn about Assamese culture through curated experiences, such as traditional dance performances, cooking demonstrations, and visits to nearby cultural sites. By fostering a sense of community and promoting local heritage, Vishwaratna Hotel creates a truly enriching and authentic experience for its guests. The hotel also supports local charities and initiatives, further solidifying its commitment to the well-being of the community it serves. <br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: A Legacy of Excellence and Growth\n\nVishwaratna Hotel envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, driven by its commitment to excellence and its dedication to meeting the evolving needs of its guests and the community. The hotel plans to further enhance its facilities and services, including the addition of new rooms and suites, the expansion of its dining options, and the development of innovative event spaces. The hotel intends to leverage technology to improve the guest experience, streamline operations, and enhance its marketing efforts. <br> <br>\n\nLong-term goals include establishing Vishwaratna Hotel as a leading hospitality brand in Assam, known for its exceptional service, its commitment to sustainability, and its contributions to the local community. The hotel aims to expand its presence beyond Guwahati, with plans to develop new properties in other key locations in the region. By staying true to its core values and embracing innovation, Vishwaratna Hotel is poised to create a lasting legacy of excellence and contribute to the growth and prosperity of Assam\'s tourism industry. The hotel will continue to prioritize employee development and training, ensuring that its staff remains at the forefront of hospitality best practices. Furthermore, Vishwaratna Hotel is committed to sustainable tourism practices, minimizing its environmental impact and promoting responsible travel within the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:15:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1106, 'SOMA- THE NATURE', 'Resorts', '', '<p>SOMA – THE NATURE, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a unique enterprise dedicated to bringing the serenity and vitality of nature into everyday life. More than just a business, SOMA – THE NATURE is a conduit, connecting the rich biodiversity of Assam with the growing demand for authentic, natural products and experiences. In a region celebrated for its lush landscapes and traditional practices, SOMA – THE NATURE distinguishes itself by offering curated selections of indigenous products and eco-conscious services that promote well-being and sustainable living. This commitment positions SOMA – THE NATURE as a significant player in the burgeoning eco-tourism and wellness sectors of Assam, catering to both local residents seeking natural alternatives and tourists eager to experience the region\'s authentic offerings. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of SOMA – THE NATURE lies a dedication to providing high-quality, nature-inspired products and services. The business offers a diverse range of carefully selected items, including locally sourced herbal teas, handcrafted natural soaps and skincare products made with indigenous ingredients, and ethically harvested honey from the surrounding forests. Each product is chosen for its quality, sustainability, and connection to Assam\'s natural heritage. The unique selling point of SOMA – THE NATURE lies in its commitment to transparency and traceability. Customers can be assured that the products they purchase are sourced responsibly, often directly from local farmers and artisans, supporting their livelihoods and preserving traditional skills. Beyond products, SOMA – THE NATURE offers nature-based wellness experiences, such as guided nature walks through nearby forests, workshops on traditional Assamese herbal remedies, and curated retreats focused on mindful living and connection with nature. These experiences address the growing need for stress relief and holistic well-being, appealing to individuals seeking respite from the demands of modern life. By combining tangible products with immersive experiences, SOMA – THE NATURE caters to a wide spectrum of needs within the local market, promoting a lifestyle centered around nature and wellness.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at SOMA – THE NATURE. The business strives to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel valued and understood. Staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the products and services offered, providing personalized recommendations and answering questions with patience and enthusiasm. SOMA – THE NATURE fosters a sense of community by hosting regular events, such as herbal tea tasting sessions and educational talks on sustainable living. These events provide opportunities for customers to connect with each other, learn about the benefits of natural products, and share their experiences. The business actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local schools and organizations, promoting environmental awareness and supporting local initiatives. SOMA – THE NATURE also leverages digital platforms to reach a wider audience, sharing informative content about Assam\'s natural heritage, promoting sustainable practices, and showcasing the stories behind the products and the people who create them. This multi-faceted approach to customer engagement strengthens the brand\'s connection with the local community and reinforces its commitment to providing exceptional service and building lasting relationships.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, SOMA – THE NATURE envisions significant growth potential within the expanding market for natural products and wellness experiences. Future plans include expanding the product line to incorporate more indigenous ingredients and traditional remedies, developing new and innovative wellness programs that cater to diverse needs, and establishing strategic partnerships with local businesses and tourism operators. SOMA – THE NATURE aims to become a recognized leader in the eco-tourism sector of Assam, offering authentic and sustainable travel experiences that showcase the region\'s natural beauty and cultural heritage. Long-term goals include establishing a dedicated research and development center focused on exploring the potential of Assam\'s indigenous plants and herbs, promoting sustainable agricultural practices, and contributing to the conservation of the region\'s biodiversity. SOMA – THE NATURE is committed to operating as a responsible and ethical business, prioritizing environmental sustainability, supporting local communities, and promoting the well-being of its customers. The vision is to create a positive impact on the local economy and the environment, while providing customers with access to high-quality, nature-inspired products and experiences that enrich their lives. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating, SOMA – THE NATURE is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a leading force in the natural products and wellness sectors of Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:15:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1107, 'Global Citizens Home Away Home', 'Resorts', '', '```html\n<h1>Global Citizens Home Away Home: A Guwahati Oasis</h1>\n\n<p>Global Citizens Home Away Home stands as a unique hospitality venture nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a guesthouse or hotel, it offers a curated experience blending comfort, cultural immersion, and a deep connection to the local community. Recognizing a gap in the market for accommodation that caters to both domestic and international travelers seeking an authentic Assamese experience, Global Citizens Home Away Home provides a warm and inviting space for exploration and relaxation. Its distinct approach sets it apart from standard lodging options, positioning it as a key player in Guwahati’s burgeoning tourism sector.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Bridging Comfort and Culture</h2>\n\n<p>At the core of Global Citizens Home Away Home are its thoughtfully designed accommodation options. Ranging from cozy single rooms to spacious family suites, each space is furnished with modern amenities and infused with traditional Assamese design elements. Locally sourced textiles, handcrafted furniture, and artwork reflecting the region\'s rich heritage contribute to an atmosphere of authenticity and comfort. Beyond accommodation, the business offers a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include:</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><b>Authentic Assamese Cuisine:</b> Guests can savor the flavors of Assam with home-cooked meals prepared using locally sourced ingredients. The menu features traditional dishes, offering a genuine taste of the region\'s culinary heritage.</li>\n    <li><b>Curated Cultural Experiences:</b> Global Citizens Home Away Home organizes guided tours and excursions to nearby cultural sites, tea gardens, and wildlife sanctuaries. These experiences provide guests with a deeper understanding of Assam\'s history, traditions, and natural beauty. Arrangements can be made for traditional dance performances and interactions with local artisans.</li>\n    <li><b>Personalized Travel Assistance:</b> The dedicated staff offers personalized travel assistance, including airport transfers, transportation arrangements, and itinerary planning. They provide insider tips and recommendations to help guests make the most of their time in Guwahati and the surrounding areas.</li>\n    <li><b>Language Support:</b> Recognizing the diverse backgrounds of its guests, Global Citizens Home Away Home offers language support to facilitate communication and ensure a comfortable stay. Staff members are proficient in English, Hindi, and Assamese, and can assist with translation services as needed.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly distinguishes Global Citizens Home Away Home is its commitment to creating a personalized and immersive experience. The focus is not simply on providing a place to stay, but on fostering meaningful connections between guests and the local culture. This emphasis on authenticity and cultural exchange is a unique selling point that resonates with travelers seeking more than just a typical tourist experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: A Home Away From Home</h2>\n\n<p>Customer service at Global Citizens Home Away Home is paramount. The staff is trained to be attentive, responsive, and genuinely welcoming, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. The business emphasizes building relationships with guests, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. This personalized approach fosters a sense of community and belonging, making guests feel like valued members of the Global Citizens family.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Global Citizens Home Away Home actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. They source products and services from local businesses, supporting the local economy and promoting sustainable tourism. They also participate in community events and initiatives, further solidifying their ties to Guwahati. This commitment to social responsibility enhances the business\'s reputation and strengthens its connection with the local population. Furthermore, Global Citizens Home Away Home actively seeks feedback from its guests to continuously improve its services and offerings. This commitment to continuous improvement ensures that the business remains responsive to the evolving needs of its clientele.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Deepening Roots</h2>\n\n<p>The future vision for Global Citizens Home Away Home involves expanding its reach and deepening its roots in the Guwahati community. Plans are underway to enhance its existing services and introduce new offerings that cater to a wider range of travelers. These may include incorporating sustainable practices, expanding the range of cultural experiences, and partnering with local artisans to showcase their work.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The long-term goal is to establish Global Citizens Home Away Home as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati, known for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and social responsibility. The business envisions becoming a hub for cultural exchange and a catalyst for sustainable tourism in the region. By consistently delivering exceptional experiences and fostering meaningful connections, Global Citizens Home Away Home aims to contribute to the growth and prosperity of Guwahati while remaining true to its core values of hospitality, cultural preservation, and community engagement. Further expansion plans include potentially opening sister locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Global Citizens experience to a wider audience.\n</p>\n```', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:20:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1108, 'Hotel O SPRINGVILLA', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Hotel O SPRINGVILLA: A Gateway to Tranquility and Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, Hotel O SPRINGVILLA offers a unique blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality, making it a preferred choice for both business and leisure travelers. Strategically located, it provides easy access to key commercial hubs, tourist attractions, and transportation links, positioning itself as an ideal base for exploring the wonders of Assam and the Northeast. Going beyond the typical hotel experience, O SPRINGVILLA aims to be more than just a place to stay; it aspires to be a cultural touchstone, reflecting the rich heritage and warm spirit of the region. The hotel\'s architecture incorporates local design elements, creating an ambiance that is both contemporary and authentically Assamese. In a city rapidly evolving, O SPRINGVILLA stands out by offering a personalized and immersive experience, catering to the discerning traveler seeking comfort, convenience, and a genuine connection with the local culture.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Hotel O SPRINGVILLA are its meticulously designed rooms and suites, offering a range of options to suit diverse needs and preferences. Each room is thoughtfully furnished with modern amenities, ensuring a comfortable and relaxing stay. Beyond accommodation, the hotel boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant serving delectable dishes that showcase the region\'s culinary diversity, alongside popular international fare. A key differentiator is the hotel\'s focus on sourcing local ingredients, supporting local farmers and providing guests with an authentic taste of Assam. Complementing the dining experience is a well-stocked bar, offering a selection of local and international beverages in a relaxed setting. Recognizing the growing demand for event spaces, O SPRINGVILLA features versatile banquet halls and meeting rooms, equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment, making it an ideal venue for corporate gatherings, conferences, and social events. Furthermore, the hotel offers services such as travel assistance, laundry and dry cleaning, and complimentary Wi-Fi, ensuring a seamless and hassle-free experience for all guests. The commitment to quality and attention to detail sets O SPRINGVILLA apart, providing a compelling alternative to larger, impersonal hotel chains.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer service is paramount at Hotel O SPRINGVILLA, with a dedicated team committed to providing personalized attention and exceeding guest expectations. The staff is carefully selected and trained to embody the warm and welcoming spirit of Assamese hospitality, ensuring that every guest feels valued and cared for. The hotel actively seeks feedback from guests and uses it to continuously improve its services and facilities. O SPRINGVILLA understands the importance of connecting with the local community and actively participates in local events and initiatives. The hotel partners with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and services, contributing to the local economy and providing guests with a unique cultural experience. Furthermore, O SPRINGVILLA promotes sustainable tourism practices, minimizing its environmental impact and supporting responsible tourism in the region. By fostering strong relationships with the local community and prioritizing customer satisfaction, O SPRINGVILLA has cultivated a loyal customer base and established a reputation as a trusted and reliable hospitality provider in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Hotel O SPRINGVILLA envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in the Northeast, renowned for its exceptional service, commitment to sustainability, and deep connection to the local community. Future plans include expanding its accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, including families and long-stay guests. The hotel is also exploring opportunities to develop specialized wellness programs and recreational facilities, further enhancing the guest experience. Recognizing the growing importance of digital technology, O SPRINGVILLA plans to invest in innovative solutions to streamline operations, improve customer service, and enhance online presence. This includes implementing a sophisticated online booking system, enhancing its social media engagement, and leveraging data analytics to personalize the guest experience. Long-term goals include establishing a presence in other key locations across the Northeast, replicating the O SPRINGVILLA model of combining modern comfort with authentic regional hospitality. By staying true to its core values and embracing innovation, Hotel O SPRINGVILLA is poised to achieve significant growth and solidify its position as a premier hospitality destination in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:20:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1109, 'Capital O 16 Hillside', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Capital O 16 Hillside: Redefining Hospitality in Guwahati\'s Scenic Embrace</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Capital O 16 Hillside stands as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati\'s vibrant hospitality sector, offering a unique blend of comfort, convenience, and local charm. Nestled strategically within the city, Capital O 16 Hillside provides both leisure and business travelers with an accessible and welcoming haven. More than just a place to stay, it’s a carefully curated experience designed to resonate with the spirit of Assam, offering a seamless blend of modern amenities and the region’s inherent hospitality.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Guwahati, as the gateway to Northeast India, is experiencing significant growth in tourism and business travel. Capital O 16 Hillside addresses the increasing demand for quality accommodation by providing a reliable and affordable option without compromising on comfort or essential services. The business understands the unique needs of its clientele, whether they are exploring the rich cultural heritage of Assam, attending to business matters in the city, or simply seeking a comfortable stopover before venturing further into the Northeast.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Core Services and Products: Your Gateway to a Comfortable Stay</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Capital O 16 Hillside\'s offerings is comfortable and well-appointed accommodation. Rooms are designed with a focus on functionality and relaxation, featuring modern amenities like air conditioning, high-speed Wi-Fi, comfortable bedding, and clean, en-suite bathrooms. The attention to detail in room design reflects an understanding of the needs of today\'s traveler, ensuring a restful and productive stay.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond accommodation, Capital O 16 Hillside provides essential services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include 24/7 front desk support, ensuring assistance is always readily available. Complimentary breakfast is offered, providing a convenient and satisfying start to the day. Laundry services are also available, catering to the needs of longer-staying guests. Moreover, the establishment offers assistance with local transportation arrangements, helping guests navigate Guwahati with ease.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What truly sets Capital O 16 Hillside apart is its commitment to providing value without sacrificing quality. It offers a cost-effective alternative to luxury hotels, while still maintaining high standards of cleanliness, service, and comfort. This approach resonates particularly well with budget-conscious travelers and those seeking a practical and reliable base from which to explore Guwahati and the surrounding region. The establishment understands the importance of a hassle-free experience and strives to deliver exactly that, ensuring that guests can focus on their travel or business objectives without worrying about their accommodation.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Creating Memories</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Capital O 16 Hillside prioritizes creating a positive and memorable customer experience. The staff is trained to be attentive, helpful, and knowledgeable about the local area, providing guests with valuable insights and recommendations. A personalized approach to customer service is emphasized, with staff members going the extra mile to address individual needs and preferences. The business strives to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, making guests feel like they are more than just customers – they are valued members of the Capital O 16 Hillside community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Recognizing the importance of connecting with the local community, Capital O 16 Hillside actively promotes local culture and experiences. The establishment collaborates with local artisans and businesses to showcase Assamese products and handicrafts, providing guests with an opportunity to discover and support the region\'s rich cultural heritage. Information about local attractions, events, and festivals is readily available, encouraging guests to explore Guwahati beyond the typical tourist trail. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the overall development of the local economy.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Enhancing Value</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Capital O 16 Hillside is centered on sustainable growth and continuous improvement. Plans are underway to expand the business\'s reach and impact within Guwahati and potentially beyond, exploring opportunities to establish additional locations that embody the same core values of comfort, convenience, and local connection. The business is also committed to investing in technology and infrastructure to further enhance the guest experience, streamlining processes and providing even greater value.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>A key aspect of the future vision is a focus on sustainability and responsible tourism. Capital O 16 Hillside aims to implement eco-friendly practices throughout its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and promoting responsible travel. This includes initiatives such as reducing energy consumption, conserving water, and supporting local conservation efforts. By embracing sustainable practices, the business aims to contribute to the long-term well-being of the community and the environment.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ultimately, Capital O 16 Hillside aspires to be more than just a hotel – it aims to be a trusted partner for travelers visiting Guwahati, providing a reliable and enriching experience that reflects the true spirit of Assam. By focusing on customer satisfaction, community engagement, and sustainable practices, the business is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:20:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
