(1110, 'Hotel River King', 'Resorts', '', 'Hotel River King is an established hospitality landmark in Guwahati, Assam, offering a blend of modern comfort and authentic Assamese hospitality. Strategically situated to provide convenient access to the city\'s key business and tourist destinations, the hotel distinguishes itself by offering panoramic views of the majestic Brahmaputra River, creating a unique and memorable experience for its guests. In a region known for its rich culture and growing commercial importance, Hotel River King plays a vital role in accommodating business travelers, tourists exploring the wonders of Assam, and local residents seeking a refined and relaxing getaway. Its commitment to providing exceptional service and showcasing the local culture positions it as a significant contributor to the region\'s tourism and hospitality sector.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe hotel\'s core offerings encompass a range of meticulously designed accommodations, from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, all equipped with modern amenities to ensure a comfortable and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, Hotel River King boasts a diverse culinary experience. Its in-house restaurant specializes in authentic Assamese cuisine, alongside a selection of Indian and international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. This commitment to showcasing regional flavors sets it apart and allows guests to immerse themselves in the local culture. Furthermore, the hotel offers comprehensive event hosting services, including well-equipped conference halls and banquet facilities suitable for business meetings, corporate events, weddings, and social gatherings. These facilities are supported by a dedicated events team that provides seamless planning and execution, catering to the specific needs of each client. The unique selling point of Hotel River King lies in its combination of premium amenities, strategic location, and commitment to showcasing the best of Assam\'s culinary and cultural heritage. This multifaceted approach caters to the needs of both business and leisure travelers, making it a preferred choice in the competitive Guwahati hospitality market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHotel River King prioritizes delivering exceptional customer service by fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The staff is extensively trained to anticipate guest needs and provide personalized attention, ensuring a memorable and satisfying experience. The hotel actively seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and maintain high standards of quality. Beyond its commitment to individual guests, Hotel River King is deeply engaged with the local community. It actively participates in local events and initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and services. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the hotel\'s reputation but also contributes to the overall development of the region. The hotel also strives to incorporate sustainable practices into its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty. This dedication to both customer satisfaction and community well-being distinguishes Hotel River King as a socially responsible and highly valued member of the Guwahati business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Hotel River King envisions expanding its reach and enhancing its offerings to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include upgrading existing facilities with state-of-the-art technology, expanding the range of accommodation options to cater to a wider clientele, and introducing new and innovative services to enhance the guest experience. The hotel also aims to further strengthen its ties with the local community through increased participation in local initiatives and collaborations with local businesses. A key strategic goal is to promote sustainable tourism practices and minimize the environmental impact of its operations. Hotel River King also intends to explore opportunities for strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism and hospitality sector to broaden its market reach and create synergies that benefit both the hotel and the region as a whole. By continuing to prioritize customer satisfaction, community engagement, and sustainable practices, Hotel River King is poised for continued growth and success in the dynamic and evolving hospitality landscape of Assam. Ultimately, the long-term vision is to create a legacy of excellence in hospitality, showcasing the best of Assamese culture and contributing to the economic and social development of the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:20:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1111, 'The Greenwood, Guwahati : A Luxury Boutique Hotel', 'Resorts', '', '<p>The Greenwood, Guwahati: A Luxury Boutique Hotel represents a distinctive offering in Guwahati\'s burgeoning hospitality sector, providing an intimate and personalized alternative to larger, more impersonal hotel chains. Nestled in a prime location within Guwahati, this boutique hotel is more than just a place to stay; it\'s a carefully curated experience designed to immerse guests in the rich culture and tranquil ambiance of Assam. The Greenwood addresses a growing demand for refined accommodation coupled with authentic local experiences, setting a new benchmark for luxury and personalized service within the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, The Greenwood provides luxury accommodation through exquisitely designed rooms and suites. Each space is meticulously crafted to balance modern comfort with subtle nods to Assamese artistry, featuring locally sourced textiles, handcrafted furniture, and artwork that reflects the region\'s heritage. Beyond accommodation, The Greenwood offers a range of bespoke services including personalized concierge assistance, in-room dining with an emphasis on local flavors, and curated excursions designed to showcase the best of Guwahati and its surrounding areas. The hotel boasts a fine-dining restaurant specializing in authentic Assamese cuisine prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, providing a culinary journey that introduces guests to the unique tastes of the region. A tranquil spa offers traditional Ayurvedic treatments and modern wellness therapies, ensuring a rejuvenating experience. What truly sets The Greenwood apart is its dedication to creating personalized experiences. From arranging private tea garden tours to organizing traditional Bihu dance performances, the hotel goes above and beyond to connect guests with the essence of Assam. This commitment fulfills a specific need in the local market – a desire for authentic and immersive travel experiences that go beyond standard tourist offerings.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Greenwood. Every interaction is approached with a genuine desire to anticipate and exceed guest expectations. The staff is meticulously trained not only in hospitality best practices but also in the art of anticipating individual needs and preferences. This personalized attention extends from pre-arrival arrangements to post-departure follow-up, ensuring a seamless and memorable stay. The Greenwood actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the region\'s cultural preservation. This might include partnering with local artisans, showcasing regional crafts within the hotel, or supporting community-based tourism projects. By weaving itself into the fabric of Guwahati, The Greenwood distinguishes itself as more than just a hotel; it becomes a valued member of the community, fostering goodwill and enriching the overall guest experience. This deep connection resonates positively with both local residents and visiting guests, establishing a reputation for authenticity and responsible tourism.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The Greenwood envisions a future of sustainable growth, becoming the leading luxury boutique hotel in Guwahati and a recognized champion of Assam\'s cultural heritage. Future plans include expanding its offerings to include curated wellness retreats focused on traditional Assamese healing practices, as well as developing partnerships with local businesses to create unique and immersive cultural experiences. The hotel aims to become a hub for cultural exchange, hosting events that showcase local artists, musicians, and culinary talents. Moreover, The Greenwood is committed to sustainable practices, aiming to minimize its environmental impact through responsible sourcing, waste reduction programs, and energy-efficient technologies. Long-term goals include expanding its footprint to other strategically important locations within Assam, creating a network of luxury boutique hotels that celebrate the region\'s unique charm and hospitality. By consistently exceeding guest expectations, fostering community engagement, and embracing sustainable practices, The Greenwood aspires to not only achieve commercial success but also contribute to the cultural and economic well-being of Guwahati and Assam as a whole.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:20:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1112, 'D.D Lodge', 'Resorts', '', '<p>D.D Lodge: A Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, D.D Lodge offers a welcoming and comfortable haven for travelers seeking an authentic experience of Northeast India. More than just a place to stay, D.D Lodge aims to be a cultural bridge, connecting guests to the vibrant traditions and warm hospitality that define this unique region. Recognizing the growing demand for quality accommodation that blends modern amenities with a touch of local flavor, D.D Lodge has established itself as a significant player in Guwahati\'s hospitality sector. The lodge caters to a diverse clientele, from business travelers and tourists exploring Assam\'s rich heritage to families seeking a relaxing getaway. Its strategic location provides convenient access to key transportation hubs, business districts, and cultural landmarks, making it an ideal base for exploring the city and beyond. D.D Lodge distinguishes itself by prioritizing personalized service, creating a memorable and enriching experience for every guest. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: Your Home Away From Home</p>\n\n<p>D.D Lodge provides a range of meticulously designed services and products tailored to meet the diverse needs of its guests. The core offering comprises well-appointed rooms, each thoughtfully decorated to provide a comfortable and relaxing atmosphere. Guests can choose from various room types, including standard rooms, deluxe rooms, and suites, ensuring options to suit different budgets and preferences. Each room is equipped with modern amenities such as air conditioning, complimentary Wi-Fi, flat-screen televisions, and private bathrooms with essential toiletries. Beyond accommodation, D.D Lodge offers a multi-cuisine restaurant serving a delectable array of dishes, from authentic Assamese cuisine to popular Indian and international favorites. This allows guests to savor the local flavors without having to venture far. A unique selling point is the emphasis on using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshest and most flavorful meals. Furthermore, D.D Lodge provides essential services such as laundry, travel assistance, and car rental, making it a one-stop solution for travelers. The lodge also boasts conference and banquet facilities, catering to business meetings, seminars, and social events. By providing these comprehensive services, D.D Lodge addresses the needs of both leisure and business travelers, making it a preferred choice in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Connecting with the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<p>At D.D Lodge, customer service is more than just a department; it\'s a philosophy. The lodge is committed to providing exceptional personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and cared for. The staff is trained to be attentive to individual needs, offering assistance with a warm and friendly demeanor. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with genuine hospitality, creating a welcoming and comfortable environment. What truly sets D.D Lodge apart is its dedication to connecting guests with the local community. The lodge actively promotes local artisans and cultural experiences. Guests can participate in guided tours to explore nearby tea gardens, visit local villages, or attend traditional dance performances. D.D Lodge also partners with local businesses to offer unique experiences, such as cooking classes focused on Assamese cuisine. By fostering these connections, the lodge not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the economic well-being of the community. D.D Lodge regularly seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and ensure that it is meeting their evolving needs. This commitment to excellence has earned the lodge a reputation for outstanding customer service and a loyal customer base. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Building a Legacy of Hospitality</p>\n\n<p>D.D Lodge envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued excellence in the hospitality sector. The long-term goal is to establish D.D Lodge as a leading brand synonymous with quality, comfort, and cultural immersion in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding the accommodation options by adding new rooms and suites, catering to a wider range of guests. The lodge also intends to enhance its facilities by incorporating a wellness center, featuring a spa and fitness center, providing guests with opportunities for relaxation and rejuvenation. Recognizing the growing importance of sustainable practices, D.D Lodge is committed to implementing eco-friendly initiatives, such as reducing waste, conserving energy, and supporting local conservation efforts. Another key focus is on strengthening partnerships with local businesses and organizations, further contributing to the economic and cultural development of the community. By embracing innovation, prioritizing customer satisfaction, and remaining true to its core values, D.D Lodge is poised for continued success and will continue to offer unparalleled hospitality, embodying the true spirit of Assam.\n</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:25:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1113, 'The Guwahati Address', 'Resorts', '', '<p><strong>The Guwahati Address: Your Gateway to Assam\'s Business Potential</strong></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, Guwahati is a dynamic city serving as a crucial commercial and logistical hub for Northeast India. Recognizing the potential and the challenges of navigating this vibrant market, The Guwahati Address was established to serve as a comprehensive solution provider for businesses looking to establish, grow, and thrive in the region. More than just a service provider, The Guwahati Address acts as a strategic partner, deeply rooted in the local ecosystem, understanding its nuances, and possessing the network to unlock its full potential.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike generic consultancy firms, The Guwahati Address focuses specifically on the Assam and Northeast Indian market. This specialization allows us to offer highly contextualized solutions, taking into account local regulations, cultural sensitivities, and unique market dynamics. We bridge the gap between national and international businesses and the local landscape, providing the knowledge and connections necessary for successful market entry and sustained growth.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Core Services and Products: Building Success from the Ground Up</strong></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Guwahati Address offers a diverse suite of services designed to cater to the varied needs of businesses operating in or entering the Assamese market. Our core offerings include:</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Market Entry Strategy & Consulting:</strong> We provide comprehensive market research, competitive analysis, and tailored strategies for businesses looking to enter or expand their presence in Assam. This includes identifying potential market opportunities, understanding local regulations, and developing effective go-to-market plans.</li>\n<li><strong>Business Setup & Registration:</strong> Navigating the regulatory landscape can be complex. We streamline the process of business registration, licensing, and compliance, ensuring a smooth and efficient setup process. Our team handles the paperwork, liaises with relevant authorities, and ensures adherence to all local laws and regulations.</li>\n<li><strong>Office Space & Virtual Office Solutions:</strong> Whether you need a physical office space, a virtual office address, or meeting rooms, we offer flexible solutions to suit your needs. Our spaces are strategically located in prime areas of Guwahati, providing a professional and convenient business environment.</li>\n<li><strong>Recruitment & Talent Acquisition:</strong> Finding the right talent is crucial for success. We offer recruitment services tailored to the local market, connecting businesses with skilled professionals who understand the region\'s specific needs and culture. We leverage our extensive network and local knowledge to identify and attract top talent.</li>\n<li><strong>Government Liaison & Public Relations:</strong> Building relationships with government authorities and stakeholders is essential for long-term success. We provide government liaison services, facilitating communication and ensuring compliance with local regulations. We also offer public relations support to help businesses build a positive image and reputation in the community.</li>\n<li><strong>Logistics & Supply Chain Support:</strong> We provide solutions and support for all logistical concerns specific to doing business in the region and further into Northeast India.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets The Guwahati Address apart is our commitment to providing personalized and culturally sensitive services. We understand that every business is unique, and we tailor our solutions to meet their specific needs and objectives. Our deep understanding of the local market, combined with our extensive network of contacts, gives our clients a significant competitive advantage. We also pride ourselves on transparency and ethical business practices, building trust and long-term relationships with our clients.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Customer Experience: A Partner in Your Success</strong></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Guwahati Address, we believe that customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a seamless and positive experience for every client, from initial consultation to ongoing support. Our team is dedicated to providing prompt, professional, and personalized service. We listen carefully to our clients\' needs, understand their challenges, and work collaboratively to develop solutions that meet their specific requirements.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our business operations. We actively participate in local events, support local initiatives, and promote sustainable business practices. We believe in giving back to the community and contributing to the overall economic development of Assam. We aim to foster long-term relationships with our clients, becoming a trusted advisor and a valuable partner in their success.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Future Vision: Growing with Assam</strong></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Guwahati Address envisions itself as the leading business solutions provider in Assam and the Northeast region. We are committed to continuously expanding our service offerings, investing in technology, and building a team of highly skilled professionals. We plan to expand our physical presence to other key locations in the Northeast, further strengthening our network and reach.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to play a significant role in driving economic growth and development in Assam. We believe that by providing businesses with the right support and resources, we can help them thrive and create opportunities for the local community. The Guwahati Address is more than just a business; it\'s a commitment to the future of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:25:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1114, 'OYO 46384 Hotel VIP Regency', 'Resorts', '', 'OYO 46384 Hotel VIP Regency, strategically situated in Guwahati, Assam, offers a comfortable and convenient stay for both business and leisure travelers. It stands as a prominent establishment within the local hospitality sector, contributing to the region\'s growing tourism infrastructure and providing a crucial link between visitors and the vibrant culture of Assam. The hotel strives to be more than just a place to stay; it aims to be a welcoming gateway to exploring the wonders of Guwahati and its surrounding areas. Its commitment to quality service and a comfortable environment positions it as a significant player in the city\'s hospitality offerings.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOYO 46384 Hotel VIP Regency\'s core service revolves around providing well-appointed and affordable accommodation. The hotel offers a range of room types to cater to diverse needs, from standard rooms ideal for budget-conscious travelers to more spacious options for families or those seeking extra comfort. Each room is designed to provide a relaxing atmosphere, equipped with essential amenities such as comfortable bedding, air conditioning, televisions, and private bathrooms. Beyond accommodation, the hotel also provides supplementary services to enhance the guest experience, including complimentary Wi-Fi access throughout the premises, round-the-clock front desk assistance, and room service. A key differentiator is the hotel’s commitment to maintaining consistently high standards of cleanliness and hygiene, addressing a critical need in today\'s travel environment. The hotel\'s pricing strategy is designed to offer value for money, making it an attractive option for travelers seeking affordable comfort without compromising on quality. This focus aligns directly with the demands of the Guwahati market, which caters to a wide spectrum of travelers, including budget tourists, business professionals, and pilgrims visiting nearby religious sites.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt OYO 46384 Hotel VIP Regency, the customer experience is paramount. The hotel emphasizes personalized service, with staff trained to anticipate and respond to guest needs promptly and efficiently. The aim is to create a welcoming and friendly atmosphere where guests feel valued and cared for. This includes providing helpful information about local attractions, assisting with travel arrangements, and addressing any concerns or requests with a positive and proactive attitude. The hotel understands the importance of connecting with the local community and promoting Assamese culture. This is reflected in the decor, which incorporates elements of local art and craftsmanship, and the hotel’s commitment to sourcing local products whenever possible. Furthermore, the hotel actively engages with local businesses and organizations to support community initiatives and contribute to the region\'s economic development. The commitment to providing a seamless and enjoyable experience, coupled with a genuine connection to the local culture, distinguishes OYO 46384 Hotel VIP Regency from its competitors.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, OYO 46384 Hotel VIP Regency envisions significant growth and expansion within the Guwahati hospitality market. Future plans include enhancing existing facilities with potential upgrades to common areas, introducing new amenities such as a dedicated dining space or a small business center, and further refining service standards through ongoing staff training and development programs. The hotel recognizes the increasing demand for sustainable and eco-friendly practices and is committed to implementing environmentally responsible initiatives to minimize its impact on the local ecosystem. This includes exploring options for energy efficiency, waste reduction, and responsible sourcing of materials. The long-term goal is to establish OYO 46384 Hotel VIP Regency as a leading hotel in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional service, commitment to sustainability, and contribution to the local community. This vision involves not only expanding its physical presence but also strengthening its brand reputation and building lasting relationships with guests and partners. By continuously adapting to evolving market trends and prioritizing customer satisfaction, OYO 46384 Hotel VIP Regency aims to solidify its position as a vital and respected part of the Guwahati hospitality landscape.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:25:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1115, 'Brahmaputra Guest House', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Brahmaputra Guest House stands as a welcoming beacon of comfort and Assamese hospitality in the heart of Guwahati, a vibrant city serving as the gateway to Northeast India. More than just a place to stay, Brahmaputra Guest House offers an authentic experience, blending modern amenities with the rich cultural heritage of Assam. Situated strategically within Guwahati, the guest house provides easy access to key landmarks, business districts, and transportation hubs, making it an ideal choice for both leisure and business travelers seeking a genuine connection to the region. Our significance in the local business landscape stems from our commitment to providing personalized service and a comfortable, culturally immersive environment that distinguishes us from larger, more impersonal hotel chains. We aim to be a home away from home for our guests, fostering lasting relationships and contributing positively to the local tourism and hospitality sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service revolves around providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodation. We offer a variety of room types to suit different needs and budgets, ranging from standard rooms ideal for solo travelers to larger suites designed for families or extended stays. Each room is meticulously maintained, ensuring cleanliness and functionality, and equipped with modern amenities such as air conditioning, complimentary Wi-Fi, and private bathrooms. Beyond accommodation, we provide a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include a 24-hour front desk, laundry service, airport transfers upon request, and assistance with arranging local tours and excursions. Our unique selling point is the emphasis on authentic Assamese hospitality. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, and our staff are always on hand to offer personalized recommendations and assistance. We also showcase local art and crafts throughout the guest house, providing guests with a glimpse into the region\'s rich cultural heritage. Furthermore, we serve a selection of traditional Assamese dishes in our in-house dining area, allowing guests to experience the unique flavors of the region. These services directly address the needs of travelers seeking a comfortable, convenient, and culturally enriching experience in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Brahmaputra Guest House, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered on building genuine connections with our guests, treating each individual with warmth, respect, and understanding. We empower our staff to go the extra mile to ensure guest satisfaction, whether it\'s arranging a customized tour, providing insider tips on local attractions, or simply offering a friendly conversation. What sets us apart is our commitment to creating a personalized experience. We take the time to learn about our guests\' preferences and needs, and we tailor our services accordingly. We also actively engage with the local community, sourcing fresh produce from local farmers and supporting local artisans. We believe that by supporting the local economy, we can contribute to the sustainable development of the region and provide our guests with an even more authentic and meaningful experience. Our connection with the local community extends to cultural celebrations and events. We often host traditional Assamese performances and festivals at the guest house, providing guests with a unique opportunity to immerse themselves in the local culture and connect with the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Brahmaputra Guest House envisions a future of sustainable growth and enhanced service offerings. Our primary goal is to solidify our position as the leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality in Guwahati. We plan to achieve this through strategic investments in infrastructure, technology, and employee training. We are exploring opportunities to expand our accommodation options by adding new rooms and suites, catering to a wider range of travelers. We also intend to enhance our technological capabilities by implementing a modern online booking system and streamlining our internal operations. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in our employees, providing them with ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they continue to deliver exceptional customer service. A key aspect of our future vision is to strengthen our connection with the local community. We plan to expand our partnerships with local farmers, artisans, and businesses, further contributing to the sustainable development of the region. We also aim to become a recognized center for promoting Assamese culture and heritage, hosting regular cultural events and workshops at the guest house. Our long-term goal is to establish Brahmaputra Guest House as a symbol of Assamese hospitality, attracting travelers from around the world and contributing to the growth of the local tourism industry.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:25:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1116, 'Hotel Barak Residency', 'Resorts', '', 'Hotel Barak Residency stands as a distinguished hospitality landmark in Guwahati, Assam, offering a blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. Nestled in a strategically convenient location within the city, the hotel provides a welcoming haven for both business and leisure travelers seeking a comfortable and enriching experience. Beyond simply providing accommodation, Hotel Barak Residency aims to contribute positively to the local tourism ecosystem and the economic vibrancy of Guwahati. We strive to be more than just a place to stay; we aim to be a gateway to experiencing the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHotel Barak Residency’s core offerings center around providing high-quality accommodation coupled with personalized service. Our range of rooms, from standard options to suites, are designed to cater to diverse needs and budgets. Each room is meticulously maintained and equipped with modern amenities including high-speed Wi-Fi, climate control, and comfortable furnishings. Beyond accommodation, we offer a range of services including in-house dining at our restaurant which specializes in both regional Assamese cuisine and popular international dishes, providing guests with a diverse culinary experience. We also offer comprehensive event management services, capable of hosting business conferences, meetings, and social gatherings, complete with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and dedicated support staff. A key differentiator lies in our commitment to showcasing local Assamese culture. This is reflected not only in the culinary offerings but also in the hotel\'s décor, which incorporates traditional motifs and artwork. This dedication to local heritage, coupled with our focus on personalized service, provides a unique and compelling value proposition in the Guwahati hospitality market. The ability to cater to both corporate needs and leisure travelers interested in exploring Assam\'s culture makes Hotel Barak Residency a versatile and attractive choice.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Hotel Barak Residency, exceptional customer service is paramount. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and cared for. Our staff is rigorously trained to anticipate guest needs and provide prompt, efficient, and courteous service. From personalized check-in experiences to readily available concierge services, we strive to exceed expectations at every touchpoint. What truly distinguishes us is our genuine connection to the local community. We actively engage with local artisans, sourcing materials and artwork that reflect the region\'s cultural heritage. Furthermore, we prioritize hiring from the local community, contributing to economic empowerment and fostering a strong sense of local pride within our team. We also actively participate in local events and initiatives, further strengthening our ties to Guwahati. We see our guests not just as customers, but as valued members of the Hotel Barak Residency family, and we are committed to providing them with an unforgettable and enriching experience that goes beyond just a comfortable stay. Feedback is actively solicited and carefully analyzed to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to better meet the evolving needs of our guests.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Hotel Barak Residency envisions itself as a leading hospitality provider in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, customer satisfaction, and sustainable practices. Our future plans include expanding our room capacity and adding new amenities such as a wellness center and a rooftop lounge, further enhancing the guest experience. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism packages that showcase the natural beauty of Assam and promote responsible travel practices. Furthermore, we intend to leverage technology to streamline our operations and enhance the guest experience through online booking platforms, mobile check-in/check-out options, and personalized digital concierge services. A key focus will be on strengthening our brand presence through targeted marketing initiatives and strategic partnerships with travel agencies and corporate clients. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and profitable business that contributes to the economic development of Guwahati and showcases the best of Assamese hospitality to the world. We are committed to innovation, continuous improvement, and a steadfast focus on exceeding the expectations of our valued guests, ensuring that Hotel Barak Residency remains a preferred choice for travelers visiting Guwahati for years to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:25:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1117, 'OYO 62278 New City Resort', 'Resorts', '', 'OYO 62278 New City Resort: A Tranquil Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nOYO 62278 New City Resort offers a refreshing hospitality experience in Guwahati, Assam, blending modern comfort with the region\'s natural beauty. Nestled in a convenient location, the resort provides a welcoming sanctuary for both leisure and business travelers seeking a peaceful retreat. Recognizing the growing demand for quality accommodations in Guwahati, especially for those exploring the gateway to Northeast India, New City Resort distinguishes itself by prioritizing comfort, affordability, and a seamless guest experience. It\'s a valuable addition to Guwahati\'s hospitality sector, catering to a diverse clientele and contributing to the region\'s burgeoning tourism industry.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around providing comfortable and well-equipped accommodations to our guests. We offer a range of room types to suit different needs and budgets, from standard rooms for solo travelers to more spacious options for families and groups. Each room is designed to be a relaxing haven, featuring amenities such as air conditioning, clean and comfortable bedding, private bathrooms with essential toiletries, and television sets for entertainment. Beyond the room itself, we strive to provide a hassle-free experience through services such as complimentary Wi-Fi access throughout the property, ensuring guests can stay connected and productive during their stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly sets OYO 62278 New City Resort apart is its dedication to creating a relaxing and convenient atmosphere. We offer on-site dining options, allowing guests to savor delicious meals without having to venture far from the resort. Our menu features a selection of local Assamese cuisine, alongside popular Indian and international dishes, catering to varied palates. Furthermore, we provide parking facilities for guests arriving with their own vehicles, and our 24-hour front desk ensures assistance is always available, regardless of the time of day. Our commitment to cleanliness and hygiene is paramount, and we adhere to strict standards to maintain a safe and healthy environment for our guests. This multifaceted approach to guest comfort, combining comfortable accommodations with convenient amenities, makes New City Resort a compelling choice for visitors to Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt OYO 62278 New City Resort, we understand that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful hospitality business. Our team is trained to be attentive, responsive, and genuinely helpful, ensuring that every guest feels valued and well-cared for. We strive to personalize the guest experience by anticipating needs and proactively addressing any concerns that may arise. We place a strong emphasis on building relationships with our guests, fostering a welcoming and friendly atmosphere that encourages repeat visits. This commitment extends to our interaction with the local community. We actively seek opportunities to collaborate with local businesses and artisans, promoting the region\'s culture and supporting the local economy. By fostering positive relationships with both our guests and the community, we aim to create a truly memorable and enriching experience for everyone who comes through our doors.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, OYO 62278 New City Resort envisions itself as a leading accommodation provider in Guwahati, recognized for its commitment to quality, comfort, and exceptional service. We plan to continuously improve our facilities and services, adapting to the evolving needs and preferences of our guests. This includes exploring opportunities to enhance our dining offerings, introduce new amenities, and leverage technology to streamline the guest experience. We also aim to expand our marketing efforts to reach a wider audience, highlighting the unique benefits of staying at New City Resort.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, we recognize the growing importance of sustainable practices and are committed to incorporating environmentally friendly initiatives into our operations. This may include measures to reduce our carbon footprint, conserve water and energy, and minimize waste. By embracing sustainability, we aim to contribute to the well-being of the local environment and create a more responsible and ethical business. Our long-term goal is to establish OYO 62278 New City Resort as a trusted and respected brand, known for its unwavering commitment to guest satisfaction, community engagement, and environmental responsibility, contributing positively to Guwahati\'s tourism landscape and beyond.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:30:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1118, 'The Lily Hotel', 'Resorts', '', '<p>The Lily Hotel, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a refreshing blend of modern comfort and Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, The Lily Hotel aims to be a gateway for visitors to experience the rich culture, vibrant traditions, and breathtaking natural beauty of the region. In a market increasingly dominated by large chains, The Lily Hotel distinguishes itself by providing personalized service and a locally infused experience, contributing significantly to the burgeoning tourism and hospitality sector of Assam. It serves as a pivotal point for both leisure and business travelers seeking an authentic connection to the Northeast.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, The Lily Hotel provides comprehensive accommodation services, ranging from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, each designed with comfort and functionality in mind. Beyond lodging, the hotel boasts a range of amenities including a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both international fare and authentic Assamese delicacies, a fully equipped business center for corporate travelers, and event spaces suitable for conferences, weddings, and social gatherings. Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to showcasing Assamese culture. This is reflected not only in the cuisine but also in the hotel\'s décor, which features local handicrafts and artwork, and in the curated experiences we offer, such as guided tours of nearby tea gardens, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and cultural performances showcasing Bihu dance and music. These services directly address the needs of a diverse clientele, from international tourists seeking authentic cultural experiences to domestic travelers requiring comfortable and convenient accommodation, and local businesses seeking professional event spaces.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Lily Hotel prioritizes an exceptional customer experience. We believe in fostering a warm and welcoming environment where every guest feels valued and cared for. Our staff is meticulously trained not only in hospitality standards but also in understanding and catering to the specific needs of our diverse clientele. We strive to go beyond simply meeting expectations, aiming to create memorable moments that leave a lasting impression. This is achieved through personalized recommendations for local attractions, proactive assistance with travel arrangements, and genuine engagement with guests to understand their preferences and needs. Furthermore, The Lily Hotel is deeply committed to connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local events, support local artisans and businesses, and strive to be a responsible corporate citizen, contributing to the sustainable development of the region. We believe that our success is inextricably linked to the well-being of the community we serve, and we are committed to fostering strong and mutually beneficial relationships.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Lily Hotel envisions a future of sustainable growth and expanded offerings. We plan to enhance our existing facilities with the addition of a spa and wellness center, further catering to the needs of wellness-focused travelers. Expansion into eco-tourism is also a key aspect of our future strategy. We aim to develop partnerships with local communities to offer authentic eco-tourism experiences that showcase the natural beauty of Assam while promoting sustainable practices. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to expand our footprint by opening additional boutique hotels in other key locations across the Northeast, each reflecting the unique character and culture of its respective locale. Our long-term goal is to establish The Lily Hotel as a leading hospitality brand in the Northeast, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement. We strive to be more than just a hotel; we aspire to be a cultural ambassador, a champion of sustainable tourism, and a catalyst for economic growth in the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:30:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
