(1119, 'Prabhakar Homestay', 'Resorts', '', 'Prabhakar Homestay: A Gateway to Authentic Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nPrabhakar Homestay offers a unique and immersive experience for travelers seeking more than just a place to stay in Guwahati. Situated in a peaceful locality within the city, Prabhakar Homestay provides a comfortable and authentic introduction to Assamese culture, cuisine, and hospitality. In a region known for its rich traditions and natural beauty, Prabhakar Homestay stands out by blending modern amenities with the warmth and personal touch of a family-run establishment. It serves as a welcoming haven for both domestic and international tourists, contributing to the burgeoning tourism sector in Assam by offering a genuine alternative to conventional hotels. Prabhakar Homestay aims to be a memorable part of every guest\'s journey through Northeast India, fostering a deeper appreciation for the local heritage and lifestyle.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Prabhakar Homestay provides comfortable and well-maintained accommodation designed to cater to a variety of traveler needs. We offer a range of room options, from standard double rooms ideal for couples to family suites capable of accommodating larger groups. Each room is thoughtfully furnished with essential amenities such as comfortable beds, clean linens, private bathrooms with hot and cold water, and air conditioning to ensure a pleasant stay, regardless of the season. Beyond accommodation, Prabhakar Homestay distinguishes itself through its curated experiences. We offer traditional Assamese meals cooked with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, allowing guests to savor the authentic flavors of the region. This includes popular dishes like *masor tenga* (sour fish curry), *aloo pitika* (mashed potatoes), and various types of *pitha* (rice cakes). Furthermore, we arrange guided tours to popular attractions in and around Guwahati, such as the Kamakhya Temple, the Assam State Museum, and the Umananda Island, providing insights into the history, culture, and spirituality of Assam. We also offer customized itineraries tailored to individual preferences, ensuring that each guest has a personalized and enriching experience. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to showcasing the genuine Assamese way of life. Guests can participate in activities like tea tasting sessions, learn about traditional Assamese crafts, and even try their hand at cooking local dishes under the guidance of our experienced staff. By offering these immersive experiences, Prabhakar Homestay directly addresses the growing demand for authentic and culturally enriching travel experiences in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Prabhakar Homestay. We believe in providing personalized and attentive service that goes above and beyond to meet the needs of each guest. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with warmth and genuine hospitality. Our staff is fluent in multiple languages, including Assamese, Hindi, and English, ensuring seamless communication. We are committed to providing prompt and efficient service, addressing any queries or concerns with utmost care. What truly sets Prabhakar Homestay apart is its dedication to fostering a sense of community. We actively engage with local artisans and businesses, sourcing products and services locally whenever possible. This not only supports the local economy but also provides guests with authentic, locally made souvenirs and experiences. We also host cultural events and performances showcasing local talent, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the vibrant cultural scene of Guwahati. Furthermore, we encourage interaction between guests and local residents, facilitating cultural exchange and fostering a deeper understanding of the Assamese way of life. This commitment to community engagement has earned Prabhakar Homestay a reputation as a responsible and ethical business that contributes positively to the local community. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continually improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Prabhakar Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality in Guwahati and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options to cater to a wider range of travelers, including budget-conscious backpackers and luxury travelers seeking a more exclusive experience. We also plan to enhance our curated experiences by adding new and exciting activities, such as bird watching tours in nearby wildlife sanctuaries, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and workshops on traditional Assamese music and dance. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with other local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and support community development initiatives. A key aspect of our long-term vision is to establish Prabhakar Homestay as a model for responsible and sustainable tourism in the region. This includes implementing eco-friendly practices such as waste reduction, water conservation, and energy efficiency. We are also committed to promoting ethical tourism practices that respect local cultures and traditions. Ultimately, our goal is to create a positive impact on the local community and contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam. We aim to expand the Prabhakar Homestay brand by establishing similar homestays in other parts of Northeast India, showcasing the diverse cultures and natural beauty of the region to a wider audience. We are confident that by staying true to our core values of authenticity, hospitality, and community engagement, Prabhakar Homestay will continue to thrive and make a significant contribution to the tourism landscape of Assam and Northeast India.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:30:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1120, 'The Ecotel Guwahati', 'Resorts', '', '<p>The Ecotel Guwahati, nestled in the heart of Assam’s vibrant capital, Guwahati, is more than just a hotel; it’s an experience steeped in sustainable practices and authentic Assamese hospitality. Recognizing the growing demand for eco-conscious travel and a deeper connection to the local culture, The Ecotel Guwahati has positioned itself as a leader in responsible tourism within the region. Unlike conventional hotels, it strives to minimize its environmental footprint while simultaneously showcasing the rich traditions and natural beauty of Assam. This commitment resonates particularly well in a state increasingly aware of the importance of preserving its unique ecosystems and cultural heritage.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of The Ecotel Guwahati’s offerings lies a commitment to providing comfortable and enriching stays. Its primary services encompass well-appointed accommodations designed with sustainable materials and energy-efficient appliances. These rooms offer a haven of tranquility, allowing guests to relax and rejuvenate after exploring the wonders of Assam. Beyond accommodation, the hotel provides a curated selection of experiences that delve into the local culture. These include guided tours of nearby tea gardens, offering insights into the region\'s famous beverage, and excursions to Kaziranga National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage site renowned for its rhino population. The hotel also organizes cultural performances featuring traditional Assamese music and dance, providing guests with an immersive understanding of the state\'s artistic heritage. A key unique selling point is the hotel’s farm-to-table dining experience. The on-site restaurant sources its ingredients from local farmers and its own organic garden, ensuring freshness and supporting the local agricultural community. This dedication to sustainability and authenticity directly addresses the needs of environmentally conscious travelers and those seeking genuine cultural immersion, a rapidly growing segment of the market in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The customer experience at The Ecotel Guwahati is built upon the principles of personalized service and genuine connection. The staff is trained to anticipate guest needs and provide attentive assistance, creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. What truly distinguishes the Ecotel Guwahati is its dedication to engaging with the local community. The hotel actively supports local artisans and businesses, showcasing their products in its gift shop and incorporating their expertise into guest experiences. For example, guests might participate in a traditional Assamese cooking class led by a local chef or learn weaving techniques from skilled artisans. The Ecotel Guwahati also partners with local organizations to promote environmental conservation and community development initiatives. This active involvement fosters a sense of pride among the staff and strengthens the hotel\'s connection to the community, creating a more meaningful experience for guests who seek to contribute positively to the region during their stay. The hotel also meticulously gathers feedback and uses it to iteratively improve the guest experience, ensuring that the offerings remain relevant and exceed expectations.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, The Ecotel Guwahati envisions expanding its role as a leading advocate for sustainable tourism in Assam. Future plans include increasing the hotel\'s reliance on renewable energy sources, such as solar power, and implementing water conservation measures to further minimize its environmental impact. There is also a plan to broaden the range of eco-tourism experiences offered, potentially including birdwatching tours, nature walks, and visits to local villages to learn about traditional lifestyles. Another key goal is to establish a training program for local youth in hospitality and sustainable tourism practices, equipping them with the skills and knowledge to contribute to the growing tourism industry in a responsible manner. The long-term vision is to establish The Ecotel Guwahati as a model for sustainable tourism development in the region, inspiring other businesses to adopt environmentally friendly practices and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage. By consistently delivering exceptional experiences, fostering community engagement, and remaining steadfast in its commitment to sustainability, The Ecotel Guwahati aims to become synonymous with responsible and authentic travel in Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:30:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1121, 'LIVE as GHY926', 'Resorts', '', '<p>LIVE as GHY926: Cultivating Experiences, Connecting Communities in Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>LIVE as GHY926 isn\'t just a business; it\'s a vibrant thread in the rich tapestry of Guwahati\'s cultural and commercial landscape. Situated in the heart of the city, we strive to offer unique experiences and solutions that resonate deeply with the local community. Unlike generic businesses, LIVE as GHY926 is acutely attuned to the specific needs and aspirations of the Assamese people, offering a carefully curated selection of services designed to enhance their lives and foster a stronger sense of community. We aim to be more than just a service provider; we aim to be a trusted partner in the growth and prosperity of Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our commitment to understanding local nuances sets us apart. We recognize that Guwahati, and Assam as a whole, possess a distinct cultural identity and unique socio-economic dynamics. Our business model is built around respecting and celebrating this identity, providing services that are both relevant and enriching for the people of this region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core offerings center around [Here, you would describe the business\'s primary services or products. For example, this could be: event management and experiential marketing focused on Assamese culture; a boutique showcasing locally sourced and ethically produced crafts; a co-working space designed to foster collaboration among Guwahati\'s entrepreneurs; a digital marketing agency specializing in reaching the Assamese diaspora].</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>A key aspect of our [services/products] is [describe a unique selling point - e.g., the incorporation of traditional Assamese motifs into modern designs; the use of sustainable and locally sourced materials; the provision of bilingual (Assamese and English) support; the creation of events that highlight Assamese artists and performers]. This commitment to [unique selling point] is what distinguishes us from competitors who may offer similar services without the same level of cultural sensitivity and local understanding.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>For example, if we are an event management company, we might specialize in organizing Bihu celebrations that authentically represent Assamese traditions, sourcing local artisans for decorations, and employing local performers. If we operate a co-working space, we might host workshops on Assamese entrepreneurship and provide resources specifically tailored to the needs of local businesses. The goal is always to provide a service that is not only functional but also culturally meaningful.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At LIVE as GHY926, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers by providing personalized service and creating a welcoming and inclusive environment. Our team is composed of individuals who are passionate about the local community and deeply committed to providing exceptional customer support. We strive to understand each customer\'s unique needs and tailor our services to meet those needs effectively.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through [mention specific initiatives – e.g., sponsoring local events; partnering with local NGOs; offering discounts to local residents; hosting community workshops]. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and fostering a sense of shared responsibility for the well-being of Guwahati. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers and the community to ensure that our services remain relevant and responsive to their evolving needs. This commitment to continuous improvement is a core value of our business.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, LIVE as GHY926 envisions becoming a leading force in the Guwahati business landscape, recognized for its commitment to innovation, community engagement, and cultural preservation. Our long-term goals include [mention specific future plans – e.g., expanding our services to other cities in Assam; developing new products that cater to the evolving needs of the local market; establishing a foundation to support local artists and entrepreneurs; becoming a certified sustainable business].</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We are committed to sustainable growth and believe that business should be a force for good in the world. We will continue to invest in our team, our community, and our planet, ensuring that LIVE as GHY926 remains a positive and impactful presence in Guwahati for years to come. Our ambition is to not only grow our business but also contribute to the overall prosperity and well-being of the Assamese community, fostering a vibrant and sustainable future for generations to come.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ultimately, LIVE as GHY926 seeks to be synonymous with quality, innovation, and community spirit in Guwahati. We are more than just a business; we are a part of the city\'s story, committed to shaping a brighter future for all.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:30:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1122, 'OYO Ashirwad Heritage', 'Resorts', '', 'OYO Ashirwad Heritage, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offers a unique blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just accommodation, we strive to provide an immersive cultural experience, positioning ourselves as a significant contributor to the growing tourism sector of Assam. We recognize the increasing demand for authentic travel experiences, particularly for visitors seeking to explore the rich cultural heritage of the region. Our establishment stands as a testament to Assam’s architectural beauty while adhering to contemporary standards of comfort and service, making us a distinctive presence in Guwahati\'s hospitality landscape.\n<br> <br>\nOur core service revolves around providing comfortable and affordable accommodation through the OYO platform, benefiting from their widespread reach and technological infrastructure. We offer a variety of room types to cater to diverse needs, from standard rooms for budget-conscious travelers to premium rooms for those seeking a more luxurious experience. However, what truly distinguishes OYO Ashirwad Heritage is our commitment to showcasing Assamese culture. This is reflected in the architectural design of the property, incorporating traditional elements and motifs. We also offer curated experiences like traditional Assamese cooking classes, folk music performances, and guided tours of local historical sites. These unique offerings set us apart from generic hotels and cater specifically to the growing demand for culturally immersive travel experiences in Guwahati. By seamlessly integrating local heritage with modern amenities, we create a memorable and enriching stay for our guests, directly addressing the market need for authentic cultural tourism options.\n<br> <br>\nAt OYO Ashirwad Heritage, customer satisfaction is paramount. We are deeply committed to providing personalized service and creating a warm, welcoming atmosphere. Our staff is trained not only in hospitality best practices but also in sharing their knowledge of local culture and traditions. We go beyond simply providing a room; we aim to act as a concierge, offering recommendations for local eateries, assisting with travel arrangements, and ensuring guests have a truly enriching experience in Guwahati. Our connection with the local community is strengthened through partnerships with local artisans and cultural organizations. We showcase and sell locally made handicrafts in our lobby, providing a platform for local artisans and giving our guests the opportunity to take home authentic souvenirs. Furthermore, we actively participate in local festivals and events, further integrating ourselves into the community fabric and demonstrating our commitment to promoting Assamese culture. We regularly solicit feedback from our guests and actively use this information to improve our services and offerings, ensuring we are constantly evolving to meet their needs and expectations.\n<br> <br>\nOYO Ashirwad Heritage envisions becoming a leading destination for culturally immersive travel in Guwahati and the wider Assam region. We plan to expand our offerings by adding more curated cultural experiences, such as tea garden tours and visits to local weaving villages. We also aim to incorporate sustainable tourism practices into our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty. This includes sourcing local and organic produce for our restaurant, implementing energy-efficient technologies, and supporting local conservation initiatives. We are exploring the possibility of developing partnerships with other heritage properties in Assam to create a network of culturally significant destinations, allowing visitors to experience the full diversity of the region\'s heritage. Long-term, we aspire to be recognized not only as a comfortable and convenient place to stay but also as a cultural ambassador for Assam, playing a vital role in promoting tourism and preserving the region\'s rich heritage for future generations. Our focus remains on delivering authentic experiences, strengthening our community ties, and championing sustainable practices to ensure a bright future for OYO Ashirwad Heritage and the tourism sector of Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:35:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1123, 'Moon Hill Homestay', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Moon Hill Homestay: A Sanctuary of Tranquility in Guwahati</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled amidst the verdant hills surrounding Guwahati, Moon Hill Homestay offers a unique and authentic Assamese hospitality experience. Beyond simply providing accommodation, Moon Hill Homestay strives to be a gateway to the region\'s rich culture, breathtaking landscapes, and warm community. In a region increasingly embracing tourism, Moon Hill distinguishes itself through its commitment to sustainable practices, personalized service, and deep connection to the local environment. We aim to be more than just a place to stay; we aim to be a memorable and enriching part of our guests\' Assam journey, contributing positively to the local economy and showcasing the true spirit of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service revolves around providing comfortable and culturally immersive accommodation. We offer a range of rooms, each thoughtfully designed to blend modern comfort with traditional Assamese aesthetics. Guests can choose from standard rooms offering essential amenities to more spacious family suites with private balconies overlooking the surrounding hills. What truly sets us apart is the curated experience we provide. This includes offering guests homemade Assamese meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients, providing insightful guided tours of nearby attractions, and facilitating interactions with local artisans and craftspeople. Our \"Assam Discovery Package,\" for example, combines comfortable lodging with a customized itinerary featuring visits to tea gardens, Kaziranga National Park, and local craft villages, offering a holistic exploration of the region. We cater to both leisure travelers seeking relaxation and adventure, as well as business travelers looking for a peaceful and convenient base from which to operate. We also provide specialized services such as airport transfers, laundry facilities, and reliable Wi-Fi access to ensure a seamless and hassle-free stay.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Moon Hill Homestay, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our team is dedicated to creating a welcoming and personalized experience for every guest. From the moment they arrive, guests are greeted with genuine warmth and attentiveness. We take pride in anticipating their needs and going the extra mile to ensure their comfort and satisfaction. Our staff are not just employees; they are local residents who possess a deep understanding of the region and are passionate about sharing its stories and traditions with our guests. We actively encourage feedback and use it to continually improve our services and offerings. We foster a strong connection with the local community by sourcing our produce and employing local talent, ensuring that our business directly benefits the surrounding villages. We also participate in local initiatives, such as supporting local schools and promoting sustainable tourism practices, demonstrating our commitment to responsible business operations. This engagement fosters a sense of trust and goodwill within the community, enhancing the overall experience for our guests and strengthening our roots in the region. Furthermore, we actively promote local culture through traditional music and dance performances held on the premises, providing our guests with a vibrant and authentic cultural immersion.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Moon Hill Homestay envisions becoming a leading eco-tourism destination in Guwahati. We aim to expand our accommodation options to include eco-friendly cottages and glamping sites, further minimizing our environmental footprint. We are actively exploring opportunities to integrate renewable energy sources, such as solar power, into our operations. A key aspect of our future plans involves developing specialized wellness programs centered around traditional Assamese healing practices and yoga retreats, catering to the growing demand for holistic travel experiences. We also intend to establish partnerships with local conservation organizations to support their efforts in protecting the region\'s biodiversity and promoting sustainable tourism. We plan to launch a comprehensive online platform that showcases our offerings, highlights local attractions, and facilitates seamless booking processes. Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional hospitality but also contributes significantly to the economic and social well-being of the local community and promotes the preservation of Assam\'s unique cultural heritage. Ultimately, we aspire for Moon Hill Homestay to be recognized as a model for responsible and sustainable tourism in the region, inspiring others to adopt similar practices and contribute to a brighter future for Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:35:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1124, 'Debojani Ashralaya Travellers Hostel by OK! North East', 'Resorts', '', 'Debojani Ashralaya Travellers Hostel by OK! North East, located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique blend of comfort, affordability, and cultural immersion for travellers exploring the vibrant North East region of India. More than just a place to stay, it functions as a gateway, connecting visitors with the rich tapestry of Assamese culture, adventure opportunities, and the warmth of the local community. In a landscape where tourism is rapidly evolving, Debojani Ashralaya aims to fill a crucial niche by providing budget-friendly accommodation without compromising on quality, safety, and authentic local experiences. It stands apart by fostering a sense of community among travellers and acting as a responsible promoter of sustainable tourism practices within the Assam context.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe hostel\'s core service is providing clean, comfortable, and secure accommodation suitable for solo travellers, backpackers, groups, and budget-conscious explorers. A variety of room options are available, including dormitories with secure lockers and private rooms catering to different needs and preferences. Beyond accommodation, Debojani Ashralaya distinguishes itself by offering curated travel experiences and support services. These include guided city tours of Guwahati, excursions to nearby attractions like the Kamakhya Temple and Umananda Island, and assistance with planning longer trips into the North East, encompassing destinations like Kaziranga National Park, Shillong, and Tawang. A significant unique selling point is the strong partnership with OK! North East, a well-established and respected local tour operator. This collaboration allows the hostel to offer reliable, vetted, and culturally sensitive tours, ensuring travellers have authentic and enriching experiences. Further enhancing the offering, the hostel provides practical amenities like laundry facilities, free Wi-Fi, a communal kitchen for self-catering, and a comfortable common area for socialising and exchanging travel stories. These services address a critical need in the market for affordable, reliable, and informative travel support, especially for independent travellers venturing into a region that may be less familiar.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Debojani Ashralaya. The hostel strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, fostering a sense of belonging for every guest. The staff, primarily comprised of locals, are trained to be more than just service providers; they act as cultural ambassadors, offering insights into Assamese customs, traditions, and cuisine. They are readily available to provide personalised recommendations for local eateries, cultural events, and off-the-beaten-path destinations, ensuring that guests have a truly immersive experience. What sets Debojani Ashralaya apart is its active engagement with the local community. The hostel supports local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and services, creating opportunities for cultural exchange and economic empowerment. The hostel also hosts cultural events, such as traditional Assamese music performances, cooking classes, and language workshops, offering guests a unique opportunity to connect with the local culture on a deeper level. This commitment to responsible tourism and community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the sustainable development of the region. The business actively seeks feedback from guests to continually improve its services and ensure that it meets their evolving needs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Debojani Ashralaya has ambitious plans for growth and development. The immediate focus is on strengthening its online presence and expanding its network of partners within the local tourism industry. Future plans include developing thematic tours focusing on specific interests such as wildlife, tea tourism, and cultural heritage. The business also aims to establish a network of similar hostels in other key locations across the North East, creating a seamless and affordable travel circuit for backpackers and independent travellers. A long-term goal is to become a leading advocate for sustainable tourism practices in the region, promoting responsible travel that benefits both visitors and local communities. This includes initiatives to reduce the hostel\'s environmental footprint, support local conservation efforts, and raise awareness among travellers about the importance of respecting local cultures and traditions. By consistently providing exceptional service, fostering a strong sense of community, and actively promoting responsible tourism, Debojani Ashralaya aims to establish itself as a cornerstone of the North East\'s tourism landscape and a trusted gateway for travellers seeking authentic and enriching experiences. The business envisions becoming synonymous with responsible and culturally immersive travel within the region, contributing to its economic growth while preserving its unique cultural heritage.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:35:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1125, 'Baruah Abax', 'Resorts', '', 'Baruah Abax: Bridging Innovation and Tradition in Guwahati\'s Business Ecosystem\n\nBaruah Abax stands as a dynamic and forward-thinking enterprise nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a business, Baruah Abax embodies a commitment to fostering economic growth and innovation while honoring the rich cultural heritage of the region. Operating within a vibrant, yet often underserved, market, the company distinguishes itself by offering tailored solutions that address the specific needs and challenges faced by local businesses and individuals. Baruah Abax strives to be a catalyst for positive change, driving progress through a blend of cutting-edge technologies and time-honored business principles.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products: Empowering Growth in Assam\n\nBaruah Abax specializes in providing comprehensive business solutions across a spectrum of areas, primarily focusing on two key pillars: technology integration and strategic consulting. On the technology front, the company offers tailored software development, digital marketing strategies, and IT infrastructure support to empower local businesses to thrive in the digital age. Recognizing the growing need for businesses to establish a robust online presence, Baruah Abax provides website design and development services, search engine optimization (SEO), social media marketing, and content creation, all specifically designed to resonate with the local audience and capture their attention.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, Baruah Abax provides strategic consulting services encompassing market research, business plan development, financial planning, and operational efficiency improvements. Understanding that each business is unique, the company adopts a personalized approach, working closely with clients to identify their specific goals and challenges, and then developing customized strategies to achieve sustainable growth. A key unique selling point lies in their deep understanding of the local market dynamics, cultural nuances, and regulatory landscape, allowing them to provide insights and guidance that larger, nationally focused firms often overlook. By providing culturally relevant and practical business advice, Baruah Abax helps local enterprises navigate the complexities of the market and unlock their full potential. This blend of technological prowess and strategic acumen positions Baruah Abax as a valuable partner for businesses seeking to scale and compete effectively in the modern marketplace.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience: Building Lasting Relationships Through Local Connection\n\nBaruah Abax prioritizes building strong, lasting relationships with its clients and fostering a sense of community. The company believes in going beyond the transactional, focusing on understanding the unique needs and aspirations of each client. The customer service approach is rooted in transparency, integrity, and responsiveness, ensuring that clients feel valued and supported throughout their journey. Baruah Abax fosters open communication channels, providing personalized support and guidance to address any concerns or challenges that may arise.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nRecognizing the importance of community engagement, Baruah Abax actively participates in local initiatives and events, supporting organizations that contribute to the well-being and development of Guwahati. This involvement not only strengthens its ties with the community but also provides valuable insights into the evolving needs of the market. By actively listening to the community and incorporating their feedback, Baruah Abax ensures that its services remain relevant and aligned with the needs of the local population. Through its commitment to exceptional customer service and active community engagement, Baruah Abax strives to be more than just a business; it aims to be a trusted partner and a positive force for change in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: Expanding Horizons and Driving Sustainable Growth\n\nLooking ahead, Baruah Abax envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam business landscape and beyond. The company is committed to staying at the forefront of technological advancements and adapting its services to meet the evolving needs of the market. This includes exploring opportunities in emerging areas such as artificial intelligence, data analytics, and sustainable business practices. A key long-term goal is to establish Baruah Abax as a leading provider of business solutions in Northeast India, empowering businesses across the region to achieve their full potential.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, Baruah Abax plans to expand its team of talented professionals, attracting and nurturing local talent to drive innovation and growth. Investing in training and development programs will ensure that its team remains equipped with the latest skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional service to its clients. By fostering a culture of innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning, Baruah Abax aims to create a dynamic and rewarding work environment that attracts and retains top talent. In essence, Baruah Abax is dedicated to becoming a catalyst for economic empowerment in Assam, fostering a thriving business ecosystem that creates opportunities for individuals and communities to prosper.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:35:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1126, 'FabHotel Red Rose', 'Resorts', '', 'FabHotel Red Rose: Your Gateway to Comfort and Convenience in Guwahati\n\nFabHotel Red Rose is a strategically located hotel in Guwahati, offering a comfortable and convenient stay for business and leisure travelers alike. Recognizing the growing demand for quality accommodations in Assam\'s bustling hub, FabHotel Red Rose provides a modern and affordable option without compromising on essential amenities and service excellence. Its presence fills a crucial niche, catering to discerning travelers seeking a reliable and pleasant experience in a city brimming with commercial activity and cultural richness. FabHotel Red Rose distinguishes itself by offering consistent, standardized quality backed by the trusted FabHotels brand, ensuring a predictable and satisfactory stay for every guest, differentiating it from many unbranded establishments in the area.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of FabHotel Red Rose\'s offerings are well-appointed rooms designed to provide a restful and productive environment. Each room is equipped with comfortable beds, air conditioning, high-speed Wi-Fi, television, and a private bathroom with essential toiletries. This focus on essential amenities is crucial for meeting the needs of both business travelers requiring reliable internet access and leisure travelers seeking a relaxing retreat after exploring Guwahati\'s attractions. Beyond the rooms, the hotel offers a range of services including complimentary breakfast, ensuring a convenient start to the day, laundry service, and 24/7 front desk assistance to cater to guests’ needs around the clock. The hotel\'s unique selling point lies in its commitment to providing a consistently high standard of service, a hallmark of the FabHotels brand, combined with a localized understanding of the needs of travelers in Guwahati. This blend ensures that guests receive the quality assurance they expect while experiencing the warmth and hospitality unique to the region. The strategic location provides easy access to key business districts, transportation hubs like the airport and railway station, and popular tourist destinations, meeting the diverse needs of its clientele.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at FabHotel Red Rose. The hotel emphasizes personalized service, with staff trained to anticipate and cater to individual guest needs. This includes providing local insights and recommendations for exploring Guwahati, arranging transportation, and ensuring a smooth and hassle-free check-in and check-out process. The hotel fosters a welcoming atmosphere, creating a sense of belonging for guests, especially those who may be unfamiliar with the city. FabHotel Red Rose actively seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and maintain high standards of customer satisfaction. The hotel also seeks to connect with the local community by sourcing local products for its breakfast offerings and engaging with local businesses for services like transportation, thereby contributing to the local economy and fostering positive relationships within Guwahati. This approach creates a symbiotic relationship, where the hotel benefits from local resources and the community benefits from the hotel\'s presence.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, FabHotel Red Rose envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati hospitality market. The hotel aims to expand its services by potentially adding amenities such as a small conference room for business meetings or a rooftop terrace for relaxation and social gatherings. Future plans also include strengthening partnerships with local businesses and tour operators to offer curated experiences for guests, showcasing the rich culture and natural beauty of Assam. A long-term goal is to establish FabHotel Red Rose as a leading choice for travelers seeking reliable, affordable, and comfortable accommodations in Guwahati. This includes continually investing in staff training, adopting sustainable practices, and adapting to the evolving needs of the market. By focusing on customer satisfaction, operational excellence, and community engagement, FabHotel Red Rose is poised to solidify its position as a valuable asset to the Guwahati business landscape and a welcoming home away from home for travelers visiting the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:35:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1127, 'Hotel Bhargav Grand', 'Resorts', '', 'Hotel Bhargav Grand stands as a beacon of refined hospitality in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to stay, it’s a carefully crafted experience designed to cater to both the discerning traveler and the local community seeking sophisticated comfort and exceptional service. Located strategically within the city, Hotel Bhargav Grand offers a tranquil retreat while maintaining convenient access to key business hubs, cultural attractions, and transportation arteries. We strive to be a key player in enhancing Guwahati\'s reputation as a premier destination for business and leisure travel, contributing to the region\'s economic growth by providing world-class facilities and generating local employment. Our commitment extends beyond providing accommodation; we aim to be a landmark institution synonymous with quality, integrity, and unwavering dedication to guest satisfaction in the heart of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHotel Bhargav Grand’s core offerings center around providing a seamless and enriching guest experience. Our well-appointed rooms and suites, designed with a blend of contemporary elegance and traditional Assamese aesthetics, offer a sanctuary of comfort. Each room is equipped with modern amenities including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and luxurious bedding, ensuring a restful and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, we offer a range of exceptional services tailored to meet diverse needs. Our on-site multi-cuisine restaurant tantalizes taste buds with a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and international favorites, prepared by experienced chefs using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. For business travelers, we provide state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, equipped with audio-visual technology and supported by a dedicated events team, ideal for hosting meetings, conferences, and social gatherings. Our wellness center, complete with a fully equipped gym and spa, allows guests to rejuvenate and unwind. What truly sets Hotel Bhargav Grand apart is our personalized approach to hospitality. We anticipate guest needs before they arise, offering bespoke services such as personalized concierge assistance, airport transfers, and curated local tours to showcase the best of Guwahati and its surrounding areas. This dedication to exceeding expectations makes us a preferred choice for discerning travelers seeking an authentic and memorable experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Hotel Bhargav Grand, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our team is comprised of highly trained and dedicated professionals who are passionate about providing personalized attention and anticipating guest needs. We foster a culture of empathy and responsiveness, empowering our staff to go the extra mile to ensure every guest feels valued and cared for. We understand the importance of building strong relationships with our local community. We actively participate in local initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. Our restaurant prioritizes sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers, contributing to the local economy and ensuring the freshness of our offerings. We also regularly host community events and cultural celebrations, fostering a sense of belonging and connection. Furthermore, we actively seek feedback from our guests and the local community, using their insights to continuously improve our services and offerings. This commitment to continuous improvement and community engagement ensures that Hotel Bhargav Grand remains a vital and valued part of the Guwahati landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Hotel Bhargav Grand envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued excellence. We plan to expand our facilities and services, adding more rooms and suites to accommodate growing demand while maintaining our commitment to personalized service. We are also exploring opportunities to develop new amenities, such as a rooftop infinity pool and bar, to further enhance the guest experience. A key focus of our future strategy is embracing sustainable practices. We are committed to reducing our environmental footprint through initiatives such as energy conservation, water management, and waste reduction. We plan to implement green technologies and adopt eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, aligning with global sustainability standards. Furthermore, we aim to become a recognized leader in hospitality training and development in the region. We plan to establish a hospitality training program to nurture local talent, providing young individuals with the skills and knowledge necessary to succeed in the industry. By investing in our people and our community, we are confident that Hotel Bhargav Grand will continue to thrive and contribute to the prosperity of Guwahati for years to come. Our long-term goal is to establish Hotel Bhargav Grand as a leading hospitality brand in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and unwavering dedication to guest satisfaction.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:40:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
