(1128, 'Green View Guest House', 'Resorts', '', 'Green View Guest House is an established hospitality provider nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil retreat from the city\'s bustling energy. More than just a place to stay, Green View Guest House is a sanctuary designed to connect visitors with the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam. Its unique blend of comfortable accommodations, personalized service, and commitment to showcasing the region\'s authentic charm positions it as a significant player in Guwahati\'s growing tourism sector. In a market dominated by larger hotel chains, Green View Guest House distinguishes itself through its intimate atmosphere, personalized attention, and focus on sustainable practices. This emphasis caters to the increasing demand for authentic and responsible travel experiences, setting it apart within the local business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Green View Guest House’s offerings are meticulously maintained and thoughtfully decorated guest rooms, each designed to provide a comfortable and relaxing experience. Rooms range from cozy standard options to more spacious suites, all equipped with modern amenities such as air conditioning, complimentary Wi-Fi, and private bathrooms. Beyond accommodation, Green View Guest House provides a curated selection of experiences aimed at immersing guests in Assamese culture. This includes guided tours of local tea gardens, visits to nearby historical sites like the Kamakhya Temple, and opportunities to experience traditional Assamese cuisine. A key differentiator is the guest house’s in-house restaurant, which serves authentic Assamese dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only offers a taste of the region but also supports local farmers and producers, contributing to the community\'s economic well-being. The guest house also arranges for guests to attend local festivals and cultural performances, providing unparalleled access to the region\'s vibrant traditions. These services directly address the market\'s growing desire for experiential travel, offering a more profound and meaningful connection with Assam than standard tourist offerings.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nGreen View Guest House places paramount importance on delivering exceptional customer service, fostering a welcoming and personalized atmosphere that resonates with both domestic and international travelers. The staff is meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs, providing attentive and responsive service from the moment of arrival. A dedicated concierge service is available to assist with travel arrangements, activity bookings, and personalized recommendations, ensuring a seamless and memorable stay. What truly sets Green View Guest House apart is its commitment to building genuine connections with guests, treating them not just as customers but as valued members of the community. This is reflected in the positive reviews and testimonials that consistently highlight the warmth and hospitality of the staff. Furthermore, Green View Guest House actively participates in local community initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses. By showcasing and promoting local products and experiences, the guest house not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the sustainable development of the community. This active engagement builds goodwill and strengthens the guest house\'s reputation as a responsible and community-minded business.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Green View Guest House envisions significant opportunities for growth and expansion within the burgeoning Guwahati tourism market. Future plans include expanding the property to include additional rooms and amenities, such as a small spa and wellness center offering traditional Assamese treatments. There are also plans to develop eco-tourism packages that further emphasize sustainable practices and responsible travel, capitalizing on the growing demand for environmentally conscious tourism options. A key focus will be on strengthening partnerships with local tour operators and businesses to create more comprehensive and immersive travel experiences. Furthermore, the guest house aims to leverage digital marketing and social media to reach a wider audience and enhance its online presence. This includes developing a user-friendly website with online booking capabilities and engaging with potential guests through targeted social media campaigns. The long-term goal is to establish Green View Guest House as a leading provider of authentic and sustainable travel experiences in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional service, commitment to community, and dedication to showcasing the beauty and culture of Assam. By continuously innovating and adapting to evolving market trends, Green View Guest House is poised to solidify its position as a significant and respected player in the regional hospitality industry.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:40:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1129, 'Hotel Island Park', 'Resorts', '', 'Hotel Island Park, nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a premier hospitality destination, offering a unique blend of modern comfort and Assamese warmth. Strategically located to provide easy access to key business districts and tourist attractions, the hotel caters to both discerning business travelers and leisure seekers exploring the rich cultural tapestry of the region. In a city experiencing rapid economic growth and a surge in tourism, Hotel Island Park distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, exceptional amenities, and a genuine connection to the local community. It plays a significant role in the local business landscape by providing a reliable and sophisticated venue for corporate events, meetings, and accommodation, thereby contributing to the growth of Guwahati as a regional business hub.\n\nHotel Island Park’s core offering revolves around providing exceptional accommodation experiences. This includes a range of meticulously designed rooms and suites, each equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable workspaces, ensuring a productive and relaxing stay. Beyond accommodation, the hotel boasts a diverse culinary experience with its in-house restaurants. These restaurants serve a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies and international cuisine, prepared by experienced chefs using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This dedication to local flavors not only enhances the guest experience but also supports local farmers and producers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA key differentiator for Hotel Island Park is its comprehensive event and meeting facilities. The hotel features multiple well-equipped conference halls and banquet spaces suitable for hosting a wide range of events, from corporate seminars and product launches to weddings and social gatherings. These spaces are supported by dedicated event planning teams who provide seamless coordination and personalized service, ensuring the success of every event. Furthermore, the hotel offers a range of recreational facilities, including a fitness center, swimming pool, and spa, allowing guests to unwind and rejuvenate during their stay. The strategic location of the hotel, combined with its diverse range of services, positions it as a one-stop solution for travelers seeking both convenience and comfort in Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of Hotel Island Park\'s operations. The hotel prides itself on its commitment to providing personalized and attentive service to every guest. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with genuine warmth and hospitality. The staff is highly trained to anticipate and cater to the individual needs of each guest, ensuring a memorable and comfortable stay. Beyond providing exceptional service within the hotel, Hotel Island Park actively engages with the local community. The hotel partners with local artisans and businesses to showcase Assamese culture and craftsmanship, providing guests with an authentic and immersive experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe hotel also participates in local community initiatives, supporting local charities and promoting sustainable tourism practices. This commitment to social responsibility not only enhances the hotel\'s reputation but also strengthens its connection with the local community. Guest feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve services and amenities, demonstrating a commitment to exceeding customer expectations. By fostering a culture of empathy and responsiveness, Hotel Island Park creates a welcoming and inclusive environment for all guests.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Hotel Island Park envisions itself as the leading hospitality destination in Guwahati and the surrounding region. The hotel plans to expand its offerings to include more specialized services, such as curated cultural tours and experiences. There are also plans to enhance its sustainability efforts by implementing eco-friendly practices and reducing its environmental footprint. The hotel aims to leverage technology to further enhance the guest experience, exploring opportunities to integrate mobile check-in, personalized recommendations, and other digital solutions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, Hotel Island Park plans to explore strategic partnerships with other businesses in the region to offer bundled travel packages and experiences, attracting a wider range of travelers. The long-term goal is to establish Hotel Island Park as a symbol of Assamese hospitality, known for its exceptional service, cultural immersion, and commitment to sustainability. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Hotel Island Park is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a key player in the Guwahati hospitality industry.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:40:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1130, 'MARTIAL ARTS ACADEMY (MAA)', 'Resorts', '', '<p>MARTIAL ARTS ACADEMY (MAA): Empowering Guwahati Through Discipline and Skill</p>\n\n<p>MARTIAL ARTS ACADEMY (MAA), located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a premier institution dedicated to the practice and propagation of various martial arts disciplines. More than just a training facility, MAA is a community hub fostering physical fitness, mental discipline, and personal growth. Recognizing the increasing need for self-defense skills, physical well-being, and character development in today\'s fast-paced environment, MAA provides comprehensive martial arts training tailored to individuals of all ages and skill levels. In a region rich in cultural heritage and facing its unique set of challenges, MAA plays a vital role in empowering the local community with confidence, resilience, and a strong sense of self.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing high-quality instruction in a range of martial arts styles. These typically include disciplines like Karate, Taekwondo, Kung Fu, and self-defense programs tailored specifically for women and children. Each program is meticulously designed to cater to the specific needs and skill levels of the participants, from beginners taking their first steps to seasoned practitioners looking to refine their techniques. We emphasize not only the physical aspects of martial arts – strength, speed, and agility – but also the mental and philosophical dimensions, fostering discipline, respect, and perseverance. A unique selling point of MAA is its focus on blending traditional martial arts principles with modern training methodologies. We incorporate contemporary fitness techniques and safety protocols to ensure a safe, effective, and engaging learning experience. Furthermore, recognizing the increasing importance of self-defense in the local context, our self-defense programs are designed to equip individuals with practical skills and strategies to protect themselves and their loved ones in real-world situations. These programs address common threats faced in the region and provide tailored solutions for personal safety.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At MARTIAL ARTS ACADEMY, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building a supportive and inclusive environment where every student feels valued and motivated to achieve their full potential. Our instructors are not just highly skilled martial artists but also dedicated mentors who provide personalized guidance and support to each student. We prioritize open communication and actively solicit feedback from students to continuously improve our programs and services. To enhance the learning experience, MAA organizes regular workshops, seminars, and social events that bring together students, instructors, and the wider community. These events provide opportunities for students to learn from experienced martial artists, share their knowledge and experiences, and build lasting friendships. We also actively participate in local community events, such as martial arts demonstrations and self-defense workshops, to promote the benefits of martial arts and contribute to the overall well-being of the community. Through these initiatives, MAA aims to foster a strong sense of belonging and create a positive impact on the lives of individuals and families in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, MARTIAL ARTS ACADEMY envisions becoming the leading martial arts institution in Assam, renowned for its excellence in training, commitment to community engagement, and dedication to empowering individuals. Our growth strategy involves expanding our range of programs and services to cater to a wider audience. This includes introducing new martial arts disciplines, offering specialized fitness programs, and developing corporate wellness programs tailored to the needs of local businesses. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the learning experience, such as developing online training modules and interactive learning tools. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in the professional development of our instructors to ensure that they remain at the forefront of martial arts training methodologies. We also aspire to establish partnerships with other organizations in the community, such as schools, colleges, and NGOs, to promote the benefits of martial arts and reach a broader audience. By pursuing these strategic initiatives, MAA aims to solidify its position as a vital community asset and contribute to the overall health, well-being, and empowerment of the people of Guwahati and beyond. Our long-term goal is to instill in our students not only the skills of self-defense and physical prowess but also the virtues of discipline, respect, and integrity, shaping them into responsible and contributing members of society.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:40:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1131, 'Hotel Parashuram', 'Resorts', '', 'Hotel Parashuram: A Gateway to Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nHotel Parashuram stands as a welcoming beacon in Guwahati, offering a blend of comfortable accommodations, authentic Assamese experiences, and modern amenities. More than just a place to stay, it\'s a reflection of the region\'s rich cultural heritage and a commitment to providing exceptional service, making it a noteworthy establishment within Guwahati\'s dynamic business and tourism sector. Positioned strategically within the city, Hotel Parashuram serves as an ideal base for both business travelers seeking efficient access to commercial hubs and leisure tourists eager to explore Assam\'s captivating landscapes and cultural gems. Its unique appeal lies in its ability to cater to a diverse clientele while maintaining a distinct local identity, setting it apart from larger, more generic hotel chains.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe hotel\'s significance stems from its dedication to showcasing Assamese hospitality. In a market increasingly dominated by standardized global brands, Hotel Parashuram offers a genuine taste of the region, fostering a connection with local traditions and supporting the community. This commitment translates into a more immersive and memorable experience for guests, contributing to the overall growth and promotion of Assam\'s tourism sector. By prioritizing local sourcing, cultural immersion, and personalized service, Hotel Parashuram strengthens the region\'s appeal as a destination that values authenticity and genuine connection.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHotel Parashuram offers a comprehensive range of services designed to meet the diverse needs of its guests. At its core, the hotel provides comfortable and well-appointed accommodations, ranging from standard rooms to suites, each thoughtfully designed to ensure a relaxing and productive stay. These rooms are equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable workspaces, catering to the needs of both business and leisure travelers. The hotel also features a multi-cuisine restaurant that serves a delectable array of local Assamese delicacies alongside popular Indian and international dishes, providing a culinary journey that tantalizes the taste buds.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodations and dining, Hotel Parashuram provides essential business services, including conference and meeting facilities equipped with audio-visual equipment, catering services, and dedicated support staff. This makes it an ideal venue for corporate events, seminars, and workshops. The hotel also offers travel assistance, concierge services, and airport transfers, ensuring a seamless and hassle-free experience for guests arriving in or departing from Guwahati. The unique selling points of Hotel Parashuram lie in its personalized service, authentic cultural experiences, and strategic location. Unlike larger hotels, the hotel fosters a more intimate and welcoming atmosphere, where guests are treated as individuals rather than just room numbers. The hotel also distinguishes itself by actively promoting Assamese culture through curated experiences, such as cultural performances, traditional cooking classes, and guided tours of local attractions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHotel Parashuram recognizes the growing need for comfortable and convenient accommodations in Guwahati, particularly for travelers seeking a blend of local culture and modern amenities. The hotel addresses this need by providing a haven of tranquility amidst the bustling city, where guests can relax, recharge, and experience the authentic flavors of Assam. By offering a range of services tailored to both business and leisure travelers, Hotel Parashuram contributes to the growth of the local economy and promotes the region as a desirable destination for tourism and commerce.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer service at Hotel Parashuram is rooted in the principles of personalized attention, genuine hospitality, and proactive problem-solving. The staff is meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs and provide prompt and efficient service with a warm and friendly demeanor. From the moment guests arrive until their departure, every effort is made to ensure their comfort and satisfaction. The hotel emphasizes building strong relationships with its guests, creating a welcoming atmosphere where they feel valued and appreciated. This commitment to exceptional customer service is reflected in the positive feedback received from guests, which consistently praises the staff\'s professionalism, attentiveness, and willingness to go the extra mile.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Hotel Parashuram apart is its deep connection to the local community. The hotel actively supports local artisans, suppliers, and businesses, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. It also participates in community events and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility and its desire to be a positive force in Guwahati. This connection to the local community not only enhances the hotel\'s reputation but also provides guests with a more authentic and enriching experience. By showcasing local talent, promoting regional products, and supporting community initiatives, Hotel Parashuram fosters a sense of pride and belonging among its guests and employees.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHotel Parashuram envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued commitment to providing exceptional hospitality while playing a key role in promoting Assam\'s tourism and cultural heritage. The hotel plans to expand its services and facilities to meet the evolving needs of its guests, including the addition of new room categories, enhanced dining options, and state-of-the-art conference facilities. It also intends to further strengthen its ties with the local community by supporting local businesses, promoting sustainable tourism practices, and participating in community development initiatives. The long-term goal is to establish Hotel Parashuram as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati, known for its exceptional service, authentic cultural experiences, and commitment to social responsibility. The hotel envisions itself as a catalyst for growth in the region, attracting more tourists, supporting local businesses, and contributing to the overall economic prosperity of Assam. By continuously improving its services, investing in its employees, and remaining true to its core values, Hotel Parashuram is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a premier destination in Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:40:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1132, 'OYO Near Beltola', 'Resorts', '', 'OYO Near Beltola: Your Comfortable and Convenient Stay in Guwahati\n\nOYO Near Beltola presents a welcoming haven for travelers seeking comfortable and affordable accommodation in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Situated in close proximity to the bustling Beltola area, the establishment offers a strategic location, providing easy access to key commercial hubs, transportation networks, and local attractions. Recognizing the growing demand for quality lodging options that cater to both business and leisure travelers in this dynamic region, OYO Near Beltola stands out by providing value-driven accommodation coupled with genuine Assamese hospitality. The business plays a vital role in supporting tourism and commerce within Guwahati, providing a reliable base for visitors exploring the city and its surrounding areas. Its location addresses a need for conveniently located and reasonably priced stays, contributing to the overall accessibility and appeal of Guwahati as a destination.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering is centered around providing comfortable and well-maintained rooms designed to meet the diverse needs of our guests. We offer a variety of room types, ranging from standard rooms perfect for solo travelers to family-friendly options suitable for larger groups. Each room is equipped with essential amenities, including air conditioning, comfortable bedding, television, and attached bathrooms with hot water facilities. Complimentary Wi-Fi is available throughout the property, enabling guests to stay connected.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets OYO Near Beltola apart is its commitment to cleanliness, affordability, and the consistently reliable service provided by OYO. We understand the importance of a clean and hygienic environment, particularly for travelers. Our rooms are regularly sanitized, and we adhere to strict hygiene protocols to ensure the well-being of our guests. The affordability factor makes us an attractive option for budget-conscious travelers who do not want to compromise on comfort and convenience. Furthermore, leveraging the OYO brand ensures a standardized level of quality and service, creating a sense of trust and familiarity for guests. Our services directly meet the needs of travelers visiting Guwahati for various purposes, including business meetings, tourism, medical treatments, and educational pursuits, providing a readily available and trustworthy accommodation option.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt OYO Near Beltola, we prioritize creating a positive and memorable customer experience. Our dedicated staff is committed to providing warm and attentive service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We strive to create a personalized experience, offering assistance with travel arrangements, local recommendations, and any other requests to enhance the guest\'s stay. We understand that many of our guests are visiting Guwahati for the first time, and we aim to be a reliable source of information and support.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur connection to the local community extends beyond simply providing accommodation. We actively promote local businesses and attractions to our guests, encouraging them to explore and experience the rich culture and heritage of Assam. We source local produce and ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and suppliers. Furthermore, we are committed to responsible tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the sustainable development of the region. We actively seek feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs and expectations. Our staff consists of locals who understand the culture and are trained to provide helpful information to guests, thus improving their stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, OYO Near Beltola envisions expanding its services and enhancing its facilities to cater to a wider range of travelers. Future plans may include the addition of new room types, such as suites and apartments, to accommodate families and long-stay guests. We also plan to explore opportunities to offer value-added services, such as airport transfers, tour packages, and laundry services, to enhance the convenience and overall experience for our guests. We see potential in collaborating with local businesses to offer curated experiences, such as tea plantation tours and cultural performances.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to establish OYO Near Beltola as a leading accommodation provider in Guwahati, recognized for its commitment to quality, affordability, and customer satisfaction. We aim to contribute to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam by providing a reliable and welcoming base for travelers exploring the region. We are committed to investing in our staff, continuously improving our facilities, and adapting to the evolving needs of the market. By embracing innovation and staying true to our core values, we are confident that OYO Near Beltola will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the local community and the broader hospitality landscape of Guwahati. We will continue to monitor the market and adjust our offerings to meet the needs of our guests.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:45:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1133, 'Collection O 12447 Uzan Bazar', 'Resorts', '', 'Collection O 12447 Uzan Bazar, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique blend of comfortable accommodation and convenient access to the city\'s vibrant cultural and commercial hub. Situated in the bustling Uzan Bazar area, this establishment caters primarily to business travelers, tourists seeking to explore Assam\'s rich heritage, and individuals requiring short-term stays in the city. Collection O 12447 distinguishes itself by providing a standardized, high-quality experience at a competitive price point, a valuable proposition in Guwahati\'s diverse hospitality sector. Its strategic location allows guests to easily navigate to key attractions, business districts, and transportation hubs, making it a strategically advantageous choice for visitors.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Collection O 12447 Uzan Bazar provides well-appointed and comfortable rooms designed to meet the needs of the modern traveler. Each room is equipped with essential amenities such as air conditioning, clean and comfortable bedding, private bathrooms, and Wi-Fi connectivity. Beyond basic accommodation, the establishment distinguishes itself through its commitment to hygiene and standardized service. This includes regular housekeeping, prompt room service, and a responsive front desk available to address guest inquiries and requests. A key selling point is the focus on providing a consistent and reliable experience, eliminating the uncertainties often associated with smaller, unbranded hotels. The establishment also offers complimentary breakfast, a significant value addition that caters to the needs of busy travelers who appreciate a hassle-free start to their day. By focusing on essential comforts and reliable service, Collection O 12447 fulfills the local market need for affordable, dependable accommodation, particularly appealing to budget-conscious business travelers and tourists looking for a comfortable base from which to explore Guwahati and the surrounding region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Collection O 12447 Uzan Bazar. The staff is trained to provide courteous and efficient service, ensuring that guests feel welcomed and well-cared for. Understanding the importance of local connection, the team is knowledgeable about nearby attractions, restaurants, and transportation options, enabling them to provide valuable recommendations to guests. The establishment actively seeks feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and address any concerns promptly. Furthermore, Collection O 12447 understands the importance of building relationships within the local community. They achieve this by sourcing local products and services whenever possible, contributing to the local economy and showcasing the region\'s unique offerings. The business also actively participates in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and demonstrating its commitment to the well-being of the community. This blend of efficient service, local knowledge, and community engagement sets Collection O 12447 apart and creates a positive and memorable experience for its guests.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Collection O 12447 Uzan Bazar envisions significant potential for growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and potentially beyond. Future plans include exploring opportunities to enhance its service offerings, such as adding a small business center to cater specifically to the needs of business travelers, or partnering with local tour operators to offer curated travel packages. The establishment also recognizes the increasing importance of online presence and plans to strengthen its digital marketing efforts to reach a wider audience. Long-term goals involve establishing Collection O 12447 as a recognized and trusted brand within the budget accommodation sector in Assam. This could involve expanding to other strategic locations within the state, capitalizing on the growing tourism and business travel sectors. By focusing on continuous improvement, strategic partnerships, and a strong commitment to customer satisfaction, Collection O 12447 Uzan Bazar aims to solidify its position as a leading provider of affordable and reliable accommodation in Guwahati, contributing to the growth of the local hospitality industry and showcasing the region\'s unique charm to visitors from around the world.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:45:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1134, 'OYO 4794 Home Stay Beltola', 'Resorts', '', 'OYO 4794 Home Stay Beltola is a welcoming and strategically located accommodation option in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, designed to cater to both leisure and business travelers seeking a comfortable and convenient stay. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning tourism, OYO 4794 Home Stay Beltola distinguishes itself by offering a personalized, home-like experience coupled with the reliability and assurance associated with the OYO brand. Its significance lies in providing affordable yet quality lodging in a prime area of Guwahati, contributing to the city\'s growing hospitality sector and catering to the increasing demand for diverse accommodation choices. The business aims to enhance the visitor experience in Guwahati by offering a seamless blend of local charm and modern amenities.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOYO 4794 Home Stay Beltola\'s primary offering is comfortable and well-maintained accommodation. This encompasses a range of room types, each designed to cater to different needs and budgets, from solo travelers to families. Each room is equipped with essential amenities, including air conditioning, comfortable bedding, private bathrooms, and often, complimentary Wi-Fi access, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay. The unique selling point lies in the combination of affordability, cleanliness, and strategic location. Situated in Beltola, the home stay provides easy access to key attractions, business hubs, and transportation links within Guwahati. This accessibility, coupled with the reassurance of the OYO network, positions OYO 4794 Home Stay Beltola as a preferred choice for travelers who value convenience and value for money. The services meet the local market needs by providing a reliable and budget-friendly alternative to traditional hotels, appealing to a wide demographic of visitors to Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the core of OYO 4794 Home Stay Beltola\'s operational philosophy. The staff is trained to provide warm, attentive service, ensuring that guests feel welcomed and valued throughout their stay. A key element of the approach is responsiveness to guest inquiries and needs, addressing concerns promptly and efficiently. The business aims to create a welcoming atmosphere that reflects the hospitality Assam is known for. While a smaller establishment, the home stay fosters a personal connection with guests, offering local insights and recommendations to enhance their exploration of Guwahati and the surrounding region. This connection with the local community extends to supporting local businesses and promoting regional tourism, contributing to the overall growth of the area. The business actively seeks feedback from guests to continually improve its services and maintain a high standard of customer satisfaction.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for OYO 4794 Home Stay Beltola involves expanding its reach within Guwahati and potentially beyond. This could involve increasing the number of rooms, enhancing amenities, or even exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other strategic areas of Assam. Long-term goals include establishing OYO 4794 Home Stay Beltola as a recognized and trusted name in the local hospitality market, known for its commitment to quality, affordability, and exceptional customer service. The business aims to leverage its positive reputation and strong connection with the OYO network to attract a wider range of travelers and solidify its position as a leading accommodation provider in Guwahati. Further plans include incorporating sustainable practices into its operations, such as energy-efficient measures and waste reduction initiatives, contributing to responsible tourism and minimizing its environmental impact. The ultimate aim is to not only provide comfortable lodging but also to contribute positively to the economic and social fabric of the local community.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:45:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1135, 'Flagship Hemlata Lodge', 'Resorts', '', 'Flagship Hemlata Lodge stands as a distinguished hospitality landmark in Guwahati, Assam, offering a blend of comfortable accommodations and personalized service that caters to both business and leisure travelers. Strategically located for easy access to key commercial centers, tourist attractions, and transportation hubs, the lodge provides a convenient and tranquil retreat within the bustling city. Hemlata Lodge strives to be more than just a place to stay; it aims to be a welcoming gateway to experiencing the rich culture and vibrant spirit of Assam. Its significance lies in providing reliable, high-quality lodging options that support the growing tourism and business sectors of Guwahati and the surrounding region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe core offerings of Flagship Hemlata Lodge revolve around providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodations. These range from standard rooms designed for budget-conscious travelers to deluxe suites offering enhanced space and amenities. All rooms are equipped with essential conveniences such as air conditioning, complimentary Wi-Fi, television, and private bathrooms. Beyond accommodations, the lodge also offers a curated selection of services to enhance the guest experience. These include laundry service, 24-hour front desk assistance, and travel assistance for arranging local tours and transportation. The unique selling point lies in the lodge\'s commitment to providing exceptional value for money. It aims to deliver a superior experience compared to budget hotels, while remaining significantly more affordable than larger, international hotel chains. By focusing on providing essential comforts and attentive service, Flagship Hemlata Lodge directly addresses the needs of price-conscious travelers seeking comfortable and reliable lodging in Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Flagship Hemlata Lodge. The team is dedicated to providing warm, personalized service that anticipates and fulfills the needs of each guest. Staff members are carefully selected and trained to embody the values of hospitality and respect, ensuring a welcoming and attentive atmosphere. The lodge differentiates itself by cultivating a strong connection with the local community. It actively promotes local businesses and attractions to its guests, encouraging them to explore the unique cultural offerings of Guwahati. Furthermore, the lodge strives to source locally produced goods and services whenever possible, contributing to the sustainable development of the region. Feedback is actively solicited from guests, and the lodge continuously strives to improve its services based on this input. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and fostering a sense of community, Flagship Hemlata Lodge aims to create loyal guests who return repeatedly and recommend the lodge to others.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Flagship Hemlata Lodge envisions significant growth potential within the dynamic Guwahati market. The long-term goal is to establish the lodge as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality and value in the hospitality sector. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, such as adding a small in-house restaurant to provide convenient dining options for guests. The lodge also plans to explore opportunities for strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to enhance the guest experience and promote tourism in the region. Furthermore, there are aspirations to expand the lodge\'s capacity by adding more rooms to accommodate the growing demand for quality accommodations in Guwahati. In the longer term, expansion to other locations within Assam is also being considered. Ultimately, Flagship Hemlata Lodge aims to contribute to the economic development of Guwahati and Assam by providing exceptional hospitality services and promoting sustainable tourism practices.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:45:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1136, 'OYO Indiraj', 'Resorts', '', '<p>OYO Indiraj stands as a prominent hospitality provider in Guwahati, Assam, offering comfortable and affordable accommodation solutions tailored to the needs of both business and leisure travelers. Situated strategically within the city, OYO Indiraj contributes significantly to the local tourism sector by providing accessible lodging options that cater to a diverse clientele. The business model focuses on leveraging the established OYO Rooms brand to ensure quality and consistency while maintaining a local touch that resonates with the unique cultural landscape of Assam. It is a valued part of Guwahati’s expanding service industry, playing a role in facilitating smoother tourism and business travel within the region. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The core service provided by OYO Indiraj is the offering of well-maintained and budget-friendly rooms. These rooms typically include essential amenities such as air conditioning, comfortable bedding, attached bathrooms, and Wi-Fi access. A significant advantage lies in the standardization that comes with being part of the OYO network, ensuring a consistent quality standard across all rooms. This consistency is particularly appealing to travelers who value predictability and reliability in their accommodation. Furthermore, OYO Indiraj addresses a critical need in the Guwahati market by offering accessible price points. This allows a broader range of travelers, including students, budget-conscious families, and independent explorers, to experience the city without exceeding their budgetary constraints. The availability of online booking through the OYO platform and other online travel agencies provides convenience and ease of access, which is increasingly important for modern travelers.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>OYO Indiraj prioritizes delivering a positive customer experience through attentive service and a focus on addressing the specific needs of its guests. While operating within a standardized framework, the local management strives to instill a sense of Assamese hospitality. This might involve offering local insights and recommendations for exploring Guwahati, assisting with transportation arrangements, or providing a welcoming atmosphere that reflects the regional culture. The emphasis on cleanliness and prompt resolution of guest concerns further contributes to customer satisfaction. The integration with the OYO app allows for seamless check-in and check-out processes and provides a platform for guests to voice feedback. This feedback is actively used to improve service delivery and ensure that OYO Indiraj remains responsive to the evolving preferences of its clientele. OYO Indiraj connects with the local community by potentially sourcing supplies locally and providing employment opportunities, thereby contributing to the economic well-being of the Guwahati region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for OYO Indiraj includes expanding its reach within Guwahati and potentially branching out to other locations in Assam. This expansion could involve increasing the number of rooms available or introducing new service offerings such as extended-stay options or bundled packages that include local tours and experiences. A key focus area is likely to be strengthening its online presence and leveraging digital marketing strategies to attract a wider audience. Furthermore, OYO Indiraj could explore partnerships with local businesses and organizations to offer exclusive deals and promotions to its guests. This collaborative approach would not only enhance the guest experience but also contribute to the growth of the local economy. Long-term goals may encompass incorporating sustainable practices, such as energy-efficient technologies and waste reduction programs, to minimize its environmental impact and align with the growing emphasis on responsible tourism. By continuously adapting to market trends and prioritizing customer satisfaction, OYO Indiraj aims to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a valuable contributor to the region\'s tourism industry.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:45:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
