(1137, 'OYO 44696 Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse', 'Resorts', '', 'OYO 44696 Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse: A Welcoming Haven in Guwahati\n\nOYO 44696 Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse offers comfortable and affordable lodging in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Strategically located, the guesthouse serves as a convenient base for both leisure and business travelers exploring the vibrant city and its surrounding regions. In a market often characterized by extremes – from budget accommodations lacking basic amenities to high-end hotels catering to a different clientele – Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse strives to fill a crucial gap by providing quality accommodation at a competitive price point, catering to a diverse range of travelers seeking value and comfort. Its significance in the local business landscape stems from its ability to attract tourists and business visitors to the region, thereby contributing to the local economy and supporting other businesses in the hospitality and tourism sectors.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products: A Focus on Comfort and Convenience\n\nDhireswaraloy Guesthouse offers well-maintained and thoughtfully furnished rooms equipped with essential amenities to ensure a comfortable and pleasant stay. Each room is designed to provide a relaxing environment, featuring comfortable bedding, clean linens, and private bathrooms. Beyond the basics, the guesthouse provides complimentary Wi-Fi access, allowing guests to stay connected and productive throughout their visit. A dedicated front desk service is available to assist guests with check-in, check-out, and any queries they may have during their stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOne of the guesthouse\'s unique selling points is its commitment to cleanliness and hygiene. Stringent cleaning protocols are followed to maintain a high standard of hygiene throughout the property, ensuring a safe and healthy environment for all guests. Furthermore, the guesthouse prides itself on its personalized service, striving to create a welcoming and homely atmosphere. Recognizing the diverse needs of travelers, Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse also offers additional services such as laundry and travel assistance (where available), making it a convenient and hassle-free choice.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThese services directly address the needs of the local market by providing affordable and reliable accommodation options. Guwahati, as a major gateway to Northeast India, experiences a constant influx of travelers. Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse caters to this demand by offering a value-for-money proposition, appealing to budget-conscious travelers, families, and business visitors alike. By focusing on providing a comfortable and convenient stay, the guesthouse helps to promote tourism and commerce in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience: Building Relationships and Community Engagement\n\nDhireswaraloy Guesthouse prioritizes customer satisfaction by fostering a warm and welcoming environment. The staff is trained to be attentive, responsive, and dedicated to meeting the needs of each guest. The focus is on creating a personalized experience, where guests feel valued and appreciated. Clear and prompt communication is key, ensuring that all queries are addressed efficiently and effectively. The guesthouse also values guest feedback and uses it to continuously improve its services and facilities.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse apart is its commitment to connecting with the local community. The guesthouse actively promotes local businesses and attractions, encouraging guests to explore and experience the rich culture and heritage of Guwahati and Assam. Information on local events, restaurants, and tourist destinations is readily available, empowering guests to make the most of their visit. Furthermore, the guesthouse strives to source local products and services whenever possible, supporting the local economy and promoting sustainable tourism practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBy fostering strong relationships with the local community and providing exceptional customer service, Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse aims to create a loyal customer base and build a positive reputation within the region. This commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement is crucial for the long-term success and sustainability of the business.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: Growth, Expansion, and Enhanced Services\n\nThe future vision for Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse involves a strategic expansion of its services and facilities, aiming to solidify its position as a leading provider of affordable and comfortable accommodation in Guwahati. This includes exploring opportunities to increase the number of rooms, upgrade existing facilities, and introduce new services such as in-house dining or a dedicated travel desk (subject to feasibility and market demand).\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe guesthouse also plans to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience. This may involve implementing online booking platforms, streamlining communication processes, and utilizing data analytics to better understand customer preferences and needs. Furthermore, Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse is committed to sustainable tourism practices, exploring opportunities to reduce its environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of the local community. The long-term goal is to establish Dhireswaraloy Guesthouse as a trusted and respected brand, known for its commitment to quality, affordability, and exceptional customer service. The guesthouse aspires to not only provide a comfortable place to stay, but also to contribute positively to the tourism and economic development of Guwahati and the wider Assam region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:50:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1138, 'Super Hotel O Bimal Residency', 'Resorts', '', '<p>Super Hotel O Bimal Residency: A Guwahati Landmark in Hospitality</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Super Hotel O Bimal Residency stands as a beacon of comfort and quality service. More than just a place to stay, it’s a reflection of Assam’s warm hospitality and a commitment to providing an exceptional experience for every guest. Situated strategically within Guwahati, the hotel offers convenient access to key business districts, tourist attractions, and transportation hubs, making it an ideal choice for both business and leisure travelers. Super Hotel O Bimal Residency plays a vital role in the local economy, providing employment opportunities and contributing to the growth of the tourism sector in Assam. It differentiates itself through a blend of modern amenities and a dedication to showcasing Assamese culture, offering guests a truly immersive and authentic experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Accommodation and Unparalleled Service: Our Core Offerings</p>\n\n<p>Super Hotel O Bimal Residency offers a range of well-appointed rooms and suites designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. From comfortable and efficient standard rooms for budget-conscious travelers to luxurious suites with panoramic city views, we provide accommodation options to suit every taste and budget. Each room is meticulously maintained and equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable bedding, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, we offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both local Assamese delicacies and international favorites, a well-equipped business center for corporate travelers, and concierge services to assist with travel arrangements, sightseeing tours, and other requests. A key differentiator is our commitment to personalized service, tailoring our offerings to meet the specific needs of each guest. Our in-house travel desk arranges visits to nearby attractions like Kamakhya Temple and Kaziranga National Park. Super Hotel O Bimal Residency fills a critical need in the Guwahati market by providing high-quality accommodation and services at competitive prices, catering to the growing influx of tourists and business travelers to the region. Our dedication to showcasing local culture through our cuisine and décor also sets us apart, providing visitors with a truly authentic Assamese experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Creating Memorable Experiences: Our Customer-Centric Approach</p>\n\n<p>At Super Hotel O Bimal Residency, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our team is dedicated to anticipating and exceeding the expectations of every guest, creating a welcoming and memorable experience. We understand that each guest is unique, and we strive to provide personalized attention to ensure their individual needs are met. From the moment a guest arrives until their departure, our staff is readily available to assist with any request, whether it\'s arranging transportation, providing recommendations for local attractions, or simply offering a friendly greeting. We actively seek feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. Furthermore, Super Hotel O Bimal Residency is deeply connected to the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses whenever possible. We also strive to promote sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the local community. This connection to the community fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens our reputation as a responsible and trusted member of the Guwahati business landscape. We also source local produce and ingredients for our restaurant, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable agriculture.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking Ahead: A Vision for Growth and Innovation</p>\n\n<p>Super Hotel O Bimal Residency is committed to continued growth and innovation, with a vision to become the leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and the surrounding region. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options to cater to a wider range of travelers, including families and larger groups. We also plan to enhance our facilities with the addition of a swimming pool, a fitness center, and a spa, providing guests with even more opportunities for relaxation and recreation. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to offer unique and immersive experiences for our guests, such as cooking classes featuring Assamese cuisine and guided tours of local villages. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to enhance the guest experience, including the implementation of online check-in and check-out services, mobile room keys, and personalized recommendations based on guest preferences. We are also committed to investing in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to establish Super Hotel O Bimal Residency as a symbol of quality, hospitality, and community engagement in Guwahati, contributing to the growth and prosperity of the region while providing guests with an unforgettable experience.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-11-30 11:50:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1140, 'Ginger Guwahati', 'Hotels', '', 'Ginger Guwahati: A Symphony of Flavors and Hospitality in the Heart of Assam\n\nGuwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, is a city brimming with culture, tradition, and burgeoning business opportunities. Nestled within this vibrant landscape is Ginger Guwahati, a business dedicated to providing a unique and enriching experience for both locals and visitors alike. Ginger Guwahati isn\'t just another establishment; it\'s a reflection of the spirit of Assam, infused with a modern sensibility and a commitment to exceptional service. We strive to be a cornerstone of the local economy, fostering connections and contributing to the growth of Guwahati as a thriving business hub. We understand the importance of representing the region\'s values and aspirations, and we endeavor to embody these qualities in every aspect of our operation. Our commitment extends beyond mere commerce; we aim to create a lasting positive impact on the community we serve.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Ginger Guwahati lies a diverse range of services and products carefully curated to meet the specific needs and preferences of our clientele. Our core offering revolves around providing high-quality culinary experiences and exceptional hospitality. We feature a restaurant that showcases the rich and diverse flavors of Assamese cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Our chefs are dedicated to preserving the authenticity of traditional dishes while also incorporating innovative techniques to create modern interpretations that appeal to a broad palate. We also offer catering services for events of all sizes, bringing our signature flavors and impeccable service to your doorstep. Complementing our culinary offerings is a selection of handcrafted Assamese products, ranging from exquisite textiles and handicrafts to aromatic teas and spices. These products are sourced directly from local artisans and producers, supporting their livelihoods and promoting the region\'s unique cultural heritage. What sets Ginger Guwahati apart is our commitment to providing a truly immersive experience that captures the essence of Assam. From the warm and welcoming ambiance to the carefully selected décor and the attentive service, every detail is designed to create a memorable and authentic encounter. We strive to be more than just a place to eat or shop; we aim to be a destination where people can connect with the culture, traditions, and flavors of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Ginger Guwahati. We believe that every interaction is an opportunity to build lasting relationships and create brand loyalty. Our approach to customer service is rooted in genuine warmth, empathy, and a proactive commitment to exceeding expectations. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our products and services, as well as the local area, enabling them to provide personalized recommendations and assist customers with their needs. We actively seek feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and enhance their experience. We understand that connecting with the local community is essential to our success. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting charitable causes and promoting cultural awareness. We also collaborate with local businesses and organizations to create mutually beneficial partnerships. Our goal is to be an integral part of the Guwahati community, contributing to its economic growth and social well-being. We aim to be recognized not only as a provider of quality products and services but also as a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. We regularly host events that celebrate Assamese culture, providing a platform for local artists and performers to showcase their talents.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Ginger Guwahati envisions a future of sustained growth and continued contribution to the Assam business landscape. Our long-term goals include expanding our presence within Guwahati and potentially extending our reach to other parts of Northeast India. We are committed to continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs and preferences of our customers. We plan to introduce new products and services that complement our existing offerings and further enhance the overall experience. This includes exploring opportunities to develop sustainable tourism initiatives that promote the region\'s natural beauty and cultural heritage. We also aim to strengthen our relationships with local artisans and producers, providing them with increased access to markets and resources. We envision Ginger Guwahati becoming a leading advocate for sustainable business practices and responsible tourism in Assam. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and supporting initiatives that promote social and economic equity. Our ultimate goal is to create a business that not only generates profits but also creates positive social and environmental value. We believe that by staying true to our core values and embracing innovation, Ginger Guwahati can achieve its full potential and become a source of pride for the entire community. We are dedicated to building a legacy of excellence and contributing to the long-term prosperity of Guwahati and the state of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:05:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '0'),
(1141, 'Vivanta Guwahati', 'Hotels', '', 'Vivanta Guwahati: A Beacon of Business and Hospitality in Assam\n\nVivanta Guwahati stands as a prominent business establishment nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, representing a significant contribution to the region\'s vibrant economic landscape. More than just a hospitality provider, Vivanta Guwahati embodies a commitment to delivering exceptional experiences, fostering local talent, and supporting the growth of Assam\'s business community. Its strategic location and commitment to excellence make it a vital hub for both domestic and international travelers, as well as a preferred venue for corporate events and social gatherings, solidifying its position as a key player in the region\'s development.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products: Elevating the Standard of Hospitality\n\nAt its core, Vivanta Guwahati offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. The primary focus is on providing luxurious accommodations, with a range of elegantly appointed rooms and suites that seamlessly blend modern amenities with traditional Assamese aesthetics. These spaces are designed to provide comfort and functionality, catering to both leisure and business travelers. Beyond accommodations, Vivanta Guwahati offers a sophisticated dining experience through its diverse culinary outlets. These restaurants showcase a range of cuisines, from authentic Assamese delicacies to international flavors, prepared by experienced chefs using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This emphasis on local sourcing not only enhances the dining experience but also supports the local agricultural economy. The hotel also boasts extensive meeting and event facilities, equipped with state-of-the-art technology and supported by a dedicated team of event professionals. These spaces are ideal for hosting corporate conferences, seminars, weddings, and other large-scale events. These are crucial offerings that fill a specific need in the local market, providing businesses and individuals with a premium venue for conducting important meetings and celebrating significant milestones. A key differentiating factor is Vivanta Guwahati’s commitment to incorporating elements of Assamese culture and heritage into its services, creating a unique and memorable experience for guests. This includes showcasing local art, providing opportunities to experience Assamese traditions, and offering personalized service that reflects the warmth and hospitality of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience: Connecting with the Heart of Assam\n\nVivanta Guwahati prides itself on delivering an exceptional customer experience that extends beyond the typical transactional relationship. A dedicated team of highly trained professionals is committed to providing personalized service, anticipating the needs of each guest and ensuring their stay is seamless and memorable. The focus is on creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel valued and respected. Beyond providing exceptional service within its walls, Vivanta Guwahati actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. This includes partnering with local artisans and businesses, supporting local charities, and participating in community events. These efforts demonstrate a genuine commitment to giving back to the community and fostering a sense of belonging. What truly sets Vivanta Guwahati apart is its ability to connect with the local community on a deeper level. By showcasing local culture, supporting local businesses, and actively engaging in community initiatives, the hotel has become more than just a place to stay; it is a valued member of the Guwahati community. This strong connection with the local community not only enhances the guest experience but also strengthens the hotel\'s reputation and fosters long-term loyalty.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: A Catalyst for Growth and Innovation\n\nLooking ahead, Vivanta Guwahati is poised for continued growth and expansion, with ambitious plans to further enhance its offerings and solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in the region. The business is exploring opportunities to expand its facilities, adding new rooms, suites, and event spaces to accommodate the growing demand. There are also plans to introduce new services and amenities, such as a spa and wellness center, to cater to the evolving needs of its clientele. Furthermore, Vivanta Guwahati is committed to investing in technology and innovation to enhance the guest experience and improve operational efficiency. This includes implementing new digital solutions for online booking, guest communication, and service delivery. The long-term vision is to establish Vivanta Guwahati as a catalyst for growth and innovation in the local hospitality industry. By providing exceptional service, fostering local talent, and supporting the development of the region\'s tourism sector, the business aims to contribute to the overall prosperity of Assam. It aims to be not only a place to stay, but a destination in itself, a place that embodies the spirit and culture of Assam, offering guests an unforgettable experience that they will cherish for years to come. By embracing innovation, expanding its offerings, and continuing to prioritize customer satisfaction, Vivanta Guwahati is well-positioned to achieve its goals and remain a leading player in the Assam business landscape for years to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:05:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1142, 'Cherry City Cottage', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Cherry City Cottage emerges as a distinctive presence in Guwahati\'s burgeoning hospitality and artisanal food sector, offering a unique blend of comfortable accommodation and delectable, locally-sourced culinary experiences. Situated in a serene corner of the city, Cherry City Cottage is more than just a place to stay; it\'s a haven that celebrates the rich cultural tapestry of Assam and its vibrant culinary heritage. The business distinguishes itself by providing a personalized and immersive experience, catering to both tourists seeking an authentic taste of the region and locals looking for a relaxing escape and high-quality, home-style meals.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Cherry City Cottage lies a commitment to providing exceptional hospitality and culinary offerings. The core services revolve around two key areas: boutique accommodation and a curated food menu. The accommodation features thoughtfully designed cottages, each reflecting traditional Assamese architectural elements blended with modern amenities. These cottages provide a comfortable and private retreat, allowing guests to unwind and rejuvenate in a tranquil setting. Each cottage is equipped with essential amenities to ensure a seamless and enjoyable stay. The limited number of cottages ensures an intimate and personalized experience for every guest. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Beyond accommodation, Cherry City Cottage boasts a unique culinary experience centered around authentic Assamese cuisine and freshly baked goods. The menu features traditional dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients, offering guests a genuine taste of the region. The emphasis is on showcasing the unique flavors and culinary traditions of Assam, from the tangy \"Tenga\" dishes to the aromatic \"Khar\" preparations. Alongside traditional dishes, Cherry City Cottage also offers a selection of freshly baked goods, including breads, cakes, and pastries, prepared using time-honored recipes and the finest ingredients. The culinary offerings cater to a wide range of palates, with options for both vegetarian and non-vegetarian guests. The unique selling point is the dedication to providing an authentic and home-style dining experience, setting it apart from standard restaurants in the area. The combination of accommodation and artisanal food caters to the increasing demand for immersive travel experiences and locally sourced, high-quality food options in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Cherry City Cottage. The business prides itself on providing personalized and attentive service to every guest. From the moment of arrival, guests are greeted with warmth and hospitality, making them feel welcomed and at home. The staff is well-trained to cater to individual needs and preferences, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. Cherry City Cottage fosters a strong connection with the local community by sourcing ingredients from local farmers and artisans, supporting the local economy and promoting sustainable practices. Furthermore, the business actively participates in local events and initiatives, contributing to the vibrancy of the community. Special attention is given to creating a peaceful and relaxing atmosphere, allowing guests to escape the hustle and bustle of city life. Regular guest feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve services and offerings, ensuring that Cherry City Cottage consistently exceeds customer expectations.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Cherry City Cottage envisions significant growth potential. Future plans include expanding the accommodation capacity while maintaining the intimate and personalized atmosphere. There are also plans to introduce new culinary offerings, such as cooking classes and food tours, further enhancing the immersive experience for guests. The business also aims to strengthen its online presence and expand its marketing efforts to reach a wider audience. Long-term goals include establishing Cherry City Cottage as a leading destination for authentic Assamese hospitality and culinary experiences in Guwahati. The vision includes collaborating with local tourism agencies and promoting sustainable tourism practices. By continuing to prioritize customer satisfaction, fostering strong community relationships, and innovating its services, Cherry City Cottage aims to solidify its position as a unique and valued asset to the Guwahati business landscape.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:05:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1143, 'Radisson Blu Hotel, Guwahati', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Radisson Blu Hotel, Guwahati, stands as a beacon of international hospitality in the heart of Assam, offering a blend of world-class amenities and a touch of local warmth. Located strategically in Guwahati, the gateway to Northeast India, the hotel caters to discerning business travelers, leisure tourists, and local residents seeking an elevated experience. Its presence significantly contributes to the growing tourism and business infrastructure of the region, serving as a preferred venue for corporate events, social gatherings, and comfortable stays. The hotel is more than just a place to stay; it’s a destination that embodies sophistication and efficiency, providing a seamless experience that resonates with the dynamic spirit of Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, Radisson Blu Hotel, Guwahati, provides comprehensive hospitality services centered around accommodation, dining, and events. The hotel boasts a range of elegantly appointed rooms and suites, each designed with contemporary comfort and modern conveniences in mind. Guests can choose from various room categories, catering to different needs and preferences, from spacious standard rooms to luxurious suites with panoramic city views. The dining experiences are equally diverse, with multiple restaurants and bars offering a wide array of culinary delights. These include specialty restaurants showcasing regional Assamese cuisine alongside international favorites, ensuring a global palate is catered to. Furthermore, the hotel offers extensive conferencing and banqueting facilities, making it a prime venue for corporate meetings, conferences, weddings, and other social events. The well-equipped meeting rooms, supported by dedicated event planning services and state-of-the-art technology, ensure seamless and successful events.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What sets Radisson Blu Hotel, Guwahati, apart is its commitment to personalized service and creating memorable experiences. The hotel prides itself on its attentive and well-trained staff, who are dedicated to exceeding guest expectations at every touchpoint. The focus is on anticipating needs and providing tailored solutions, ensuring each guest feels valued and cared for. This dedication to exceptional service extends beyond the hotel walls, with a strong emphasis on connecting with the local community. The hotel actively engages in initiatives that support local businesses, promote Assamese culture, and contribute to the overall well-being of the community. By incorporating local elements into the guest experience, such as showcasing local artwork, sourcing regional produce, and promoting local tours, the hotel creates a unique and authentic connection with its surroundings.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The customer experience is paramount at Radisson Blu Hotel, Guwahati. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with a warm welcome and efficient service. The check-in process is streamlined, and the staff are always on hand to assist with any queries or requests. Throughout their stay, guests can enjoy a range of amenities and services designed to enhance their comfort and convenience. These include a well-equipped fitness center, a refreshing swimming pool, a rejuvenating spa, and complimentary high-speed internet access. The hotel also offers a concierge service to assist with travel arrangements, local recommendations, and any other needs guests may have. The goal is to create a seamless and stress-free experience, allowing guests to focus on enjoying their stay and achieving their objectives, whether they are traveling for business or leisure.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Radisson Blu Hotel, Guwahati, envisions continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in the region. Future plans include exploring opportunities to further enhance its facilities and services, such as introducing new dining concepts, expanding its event spaces, and implementing sustainable practices. The hotel is also committed to investing in its staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure they continue to deliver exceptional service. The long-term goal is to not only be a preferred hotel for travelers but also a valued member of the Guwahati community, contributing to its economic growth and cultural vibrancy. By staying true to its core values of excellence, innovation, and community engagement, Radisson Blu Hotel, Guwahati, aims to shape the future of hospitality in Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:05:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1144, 'Novotel Guwahati GS Road', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Novotel Guwahati GS Road stands as a prominent landmark in the vibrant cityscape of Guwahati, Assam, offering a sophisticated blend of international hospitality and local charm. Situated strategically on the bustling GS Road, the hotel provides unparalleled access to the city\'s commercial hubs, tourist attractions, and cultural experiences, making it a preferred choice for both business and leisure travelers. Novotel Guwahati GS Road contributes significantly to the Assam business landscape by providing a world-class venue for conferences, meetings, and corporate events, further bolstering Guwahati’s position as a key economic center in Northeast India. The hotel\'s presence elevates the standard of hospitality in the region, attracting discerning travelers who seek comfort, convenience, and impeccable service.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The hotel\'s core offerings revolve around providing exceptional accommodation, dining experiences, and event hosting capabilities. Accommodation options range from elegantly appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, all designed with contemporary aesthetics and equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed internet, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable work spaces. A key unique selling point is the commitment to providing personalized service, ensuring each guest\'s individual needs are met with attentiveness and efficiency. The hotel boasts multiple dining options, including a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both international delicacies and authentic Assamese dishes, allowing guests to savor the local flavors. A stylish bar provides a relaxing ambiance for evening cocktails and socializing. Furthermore, Novotel Guwahati GS Road features state-of-the-art meeting and conference facilities, equipped with advanced audio-visual technology, making it an ideal venue for business meetings, seminars, and corporate events. These services directly address the needs of the local market by providing a reliable and sophisticated venue for businesses to conduct operations and entertain clients, while also offering a comfortable and convenient base for tourists exploring Assam\'s rich cultural heritage and natural beauty.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Novotel Guwahati GS Road, customer experience is paramount. The hotel operates under a philosophy of anticipating and exceeding guest expectations at every touchpoint. A dedicated team of highly trained professionals is committed to providing personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and comfortable. The hotel strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, reflecting the warmth and hospitality of Assamese culture. Beyond exceptional service, Novotel Guwahati GS Road actively seeks to connect with the local community. The hotel often collaborates with local artisans and businesses to showcase Assamese crafts and products, providing a platform for them to reach a wider audience. The hotel also participates in local events and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility and contributing to the well-being of the community. Furthermore, the culinary team emphasizes the use of locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices. The goal is to create a memorable and authentic experience for guests, allowing them to connect with the culture and people of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Novotel Guwahati GS Road envisions itself as a continued leader in the hospitality sector in Guwahati and the wider Northeast region. Future plans include expanding the hotel\'s facilities and services to cater to the evolving needs of its guests. This may involve adding more rooms and suites, introducing new dining concepts, and enhancing the meeting and event spaces. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to improve the guest experience, such as implementing mobile check-in and check-out options, personalized concierge services, and interactive digital platforms. Furthermore, the hotel aims to strengthen its commitment to sustainability and environmental responsibility by implementing eco-friendly practices throughout its operations. This includes reducing waste, conserving energy, and promoting responsible water management. Long-term goals include expanding the hotel\'s brand presence in other key locations in Northeast India, further solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in the region. By continuously innovating and adapting to the changing needs of the market, Novotel Guwahati GS Road is poised for sustained growth and success, contributing to the economic development and tourism potential of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:05:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1145, 'Ginger Guwahati', 'Hotels', '', 'Ginger Guwahati: A Taste of Tradition, A Vision for the Future\n\nGinger Guwahati stands as a vibrant and emerging enterprise nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to offering a curated selection of products and services that celebrate the region\'s rich cultural heritage while embracing modern business practices. Unlike generic retail outlets, Ginger Guwahati strives to be a destination where customers can discover authentic Assamese craftsmanship, experience the warmth of local hospitality, and support the sustainable growth of the local economy. Our business model is built on principles of fair trade, ethical sourcing, and a deep commitment to preserving the traditions that make Assam unique. We aim to be more than just a business; we envision ourselves as a community hub that fosters creativity, celebrates artistry, and empowers local artisans and entrepreneurs. Ginger Guwahati recognizes the growing demand for genuine, locally-sourced goods and experiences, and we are uniquely positioned to cater to both residents and tourists seeking an authentic taste of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Ginger Guwahati’s offerings are two primary pillars: a curated retail experience and bespoke event planning services. Our retail space showcases a diverse range of products, including handloom textiles, handcrafted jewelry, traditional Assamese silk garments (mekhela chadors), organic tea and spices sourced directly from local farms, and unique art pieces created by regional artists. What distinguishes our retail selection is the story behind each product. We meticulously vet our suppliers, ensuring that artisans are fairly compensated and that traditional techniques are preserved. Our focus is not simply on selling items, but on sharing the cultural significance and the human touch that goes into each creation. We offer products that are difficult to find elsewhere, providing a platform for local artisans to reach a wider audience and ensuring customers acquire truly unique and authentic pieces.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nComplementing our retail offerings is our bespoke event planning service. Ginger Guwahati specializes in creating unforgettable experiences that showcase the vibrant culture of Assam. We cater to a range of events, from intimate gatherings celebrating personal milestones to larger-scale corporate functions seeking an authentic regional flavor. Our services include sourcing local musicians and dancers, curating menus featuring traditional Assamese cuisine, designing event spaces that reflect the region\'s artistic heritage, and providing expert guidance on cultural etiquette. We pride ourselves on our ability to create seamless, memorable events that leave a lasting impression on guests. Understanding that the local market seeks events that are both culturally relevant and professionally executed, we fill a gap in the market by offering a specialized service that blends tradition with contemporary event management practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Ginger Guwahati. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers, going above and beyond to provide personalized service and create a welcoming atmosphere. Our staff is knowledgeable about the products we sell and the traditions they represent, and they are passionate about sharing this knowledge with our customers. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. We strive to create a community feel within our store, hosting regular workshops, demonstrations, and cultural events to engage with the local community and promote appreciation for Assamese art and culture. Furthermore, we actively participate in local festivals and events, supporting community initiatives and building brand awareness through engagement. We understand that being a successful business in Guwahati means being an active and responsible member of the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Ginger Guwahati envisions significant growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include establishing an online presence to reach a wider national and international audience, expanding our retail space to accommodate a greater selection of products and services, and developing strategic partnerships with local businesses and tourism organizations. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for local artisans, providing them with the skills and resources they need to grow their businesses and preserve their craft. We see the potential to become a leading destination for authentic Assamese products and experiences, not only in Guwahati but throughout the region. We are committed to sustainable growth, ensuring that our business practices are environmentally responsible and that we continue to support the local community. Ultimately, Ginger Guwahati aspires to be a beacon of cultural preservation, economic empowerment, and exceptional customer service, contributing to the vibrant and thriving future of Guwahati and Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:10:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1146, 'Om Shree Residency', 'Hotels', '', 'Om Shree Residency: A Haven of Comfort and Connectivity in Guwahati\n\nOm Shree Residency stands as a distinguished name in Guwahati\'s hospitality sector, offering a blend of comfortable accommodation and personalized service tailored to the needs of both business and leisure travelers. Situated in a prime location within Guwahati, Om Shree Residency provides convenient access to key commercial hubs, tourist attractions, and transportation links, making it an ideal choice for visitors seeking a seamless and enriching experience in Assam\'s vibrant capital. The residency is more than just a place to stay; it’s a gateway to experiencing the cultural richness and dynamic energy of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nDistinguished by its commitment to providing a home-away-from-home atmosphere, Om Shree Residency has carved a niche for itself through attentive service and a deep understanding of the specific requirements of its diverse clientele. Unlike larger, impersonal hotel chains, the residency emphasizes a personalized approach, ensuring that each guest feels valued and catered to throughout their stay. This dedication to individual attention, coupled with its strategic location, sets Om Shree Residency apart in the competitive Guwahati hospitality market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products\n\nAt the heart of Om Shree Residency\'s offerings are its well-appointed and thoughtfully designed rooms. Ranging from standard accommodations to more spacious suites, each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, comfortable bedding, and en-suite bathrooms with premium toiletries. The rooms are designed to provide a relaxing and productive environment, catering to the needs of both those seeking rest and those requiring a space to work.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodation, Om Shree Residency provides a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include a multi-cuisine restaurant serving a delectable array of local and international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This focus on regional cuisine offers guests an authentic taste of Assam, adding a cultural dimension to their stay. Furthermore, the residency offers laundry services, travel assistance, and airport transfers, ensuring a hassle-free experience from arrival to departure.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA significant unique selling point is Om Shree Residency\'s ability to cater to the specific needs of business travelers. The residency offers meeting and conference facilities equipped with audio-visual equipment, providing a professional setting for business meetings and presentations. This, coupled with the convenient location near key commercial areas, makes Om Shree Residency a preferred choice for corporate travelers visiting Guwahati. In a market often dominated by larger hotels, Om Shree Residency provides a more intimate and personalized option, catering to those seeking a balance between comfort and efficiency.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience\n\nCustomer satisfaction is paramount at Om Shree Residency. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating the needs of guests and ensuring that their stay is as comfortable and enjoyable as possible. From the warm welcome at check-in to the prompt and efficient handling of requests, every interaction is designed to create a positive and memorable experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOm Shree Residency actively engages with the local community, fostering relationships with local businesses and organizations. This commitment extends to promoting local culture and tourism, providing guests with information about nearby attractions, cultural events, and opportunities to experience the authentic Assam. This connection to the community not only enhances the guest experience but also strengthens Om Shree Residency\'s reputation as a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati business landscape. The residency also strives to incorporate elements of Assamese culture into its décor and ambiance, creating a welcoming and authentic environment for visitors.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFeedback is actively sought from guests to continuously improve services and facilities. This commitment to continuous improvement ensures that Om Shree Residency remains responsive to the evolving needs of its clientele and maintains its position as a leading provider of accommodation in Guwahati. The residency also utilizes online platforms and social media to engage with guests, respond to inquiries, and promote its services, further enhancing its accessibility and responsiveness.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision\n\nLooking ahead, Om Shree Residency envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati. Future plans include potential expansion of facilities to accommodate a growing clientele, as well as the introduction of new services and amenities designed to further enhance the guest experience. This may include adding a fitness center, spa services, or expanding the dining options.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA key focus of the future vision is to further develop Om Shree Residency\'s brand identity, emphasizing its commitment to personalized service, local engagement, and sustainable business practices. The residency also aims to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, potentially through the implementation of online check-in systems, mobile concierge services, and smart room technology. By staying abreast of industry trends and continuously innovating, Om Shree Residency is poised to maintain its competitive edge and achieve its long-term goals of becoming a premier destination for travelers visiting Guwahati. The commitment to providing exceptional value and fostering lasting relationships with guests will remain at the core of Om Shree Residency\'s future success.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:10:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
