(1156, 'Hotel Jaysha', 'Hotels', '', 'Hotel Jaysha: A Guwahati Hospitality Landmark\n\nHotel Jaysha stands as a prominent landmark in Guwahati\'s vibrant hospitality sector, offering a blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. Situated in a strategic location within Guwahati, Hotel Jaysha caters to a diverse clientele, including business travelers, tourists exploring the Northeast, and local residents seeking refined dining and event spaces. The hotel distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, authentic culinary experiences, and a deep understanding of the unique needs of the Assam market. Hotel Jaysha aims not just to provide accommodation, but to create memorable experiences that showcase the rich culture and warmth of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products: A Holistic Hospitality Experience\n\nAt its core, Hotel Jaysha offers a comprehensive range of hospitality services tailored to meet the demands of modern travelers. Our accommodation options include a variety of well-appointed rooms and suites, designed with comfort and functionality in mind. Each room features modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, comfortable bedding, and en-suite bathrooms. Beyond accommodation, Hotel Jaysha boasts a renowned in-house restaurant specializing in authentic Assamese cuisine, as well as offering a curated selection of Indian and international dishes. The restaurant utilizes fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring a genuine culinary experience that reflects the region\'s diverse flavors. Furthermore, Hotel Jaysha provides extensive banquet and conference facilities suitable for hosting a range of events, from corporate meetings and seminars to weddings and social gatherings. These facilities are equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and supported by a dedicated events team, ensuring seamless execution and a memorable occasion. What truly sets Hotel Jaysha apart is its commitment to showcasing the best of Assam. We offer curated experiences such as guided tours of local tea gardens, cultural performances, and opportunities to engage with local artisans, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the region\'s rich heritage. This focus on cultural immersion differentiates Hotel Jaysha from more generic hotel offerings, appealing to travelers seeking authentic experiences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nExceptional Customer Experience: The Heart of Hotel Jaysha\n\nCustomer satisfaction is at the heart of Hotel Jaysha’s philosophy. We strive to provide a personalized and attentive service that anticipates the needs of each guest. From the moment of arrival, guests are greeted with warmth and efficiency, ensuring a seamless check-in process. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the local area and provide helpful recommendations for sightseeing, dining, and cultural activities. We understand that every guest is unique, and we tailor our service to meet individual preferences. This includes offering personalized concierge services, customized dining options, and proactive attention to any special requests or requirements. Hotel Jaysha actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as sponsoring local events, supporting local artisans, and partnering with local businesses. This demonstrates our commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen and contributes to the overall vibrancy of Guwahati. Furthermore, we prioritize gathering feedback from our guests through surveys, online reviews, and direct communication. This feedback is used to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are consistently exceeding expectations. Our commitment to exceptional customer service is reflected in our consistently high ratings and positive reviews, solidifying Hotel Jaysha\'s reputation as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: Expansion and Continued Excellence\n\nHotel Jaysha envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodation capacity to meet the growing demand for quality hotel rooms in the region. We are also exploring opportunities to introduce new and innovative services, such as a wellness center and spa, to cater to the evolving needs of our guests. In addition to physical expansion, Hotel Jaysha is committed to investing in technology and infrastructure to enhance the guest experience. This includes implementing advanced reservation systems, improving internet connectivity, and adopting sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact. We are also focused on developing our staff through ongoing training and development programs, ensuring that they are equipped with the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service. Hotel Jaysha recognizes the importance of adapting to changing market trends and evolving customer preferences. We are continuously monitoring the competitive landscape and identifying opportunities to differentiate ourselves through unique offerings and innovative services. By remaining committed to our core values of personalized service, authentic experiences, and community engagement, Hotel Jaysha is confident in its ability to achieve its long-term goals and continue to contribute to the growth and prosperity of Guwahati\'s hospitality sector.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:20:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1157, 'GHAR 365 Residency', 'Hotels', '', '<p>GHAR 365 Residency: Redefining Modern Living in Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>GHAR 365 Residency stands as a modern residential solution in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, catering to the growing demand for comfortable, convenient, and community-focused living. In a region experiencing rapid urbanization and a surge in professionals, students, and young families, GHAR 365 Residency offers a compelling alternative to traditional housing models. We distinguish ourselves by providing fully furnished, well-maintained living spaces with a strong emphasis on shared amenities and a vibrant community atmosphere. Our presence in Guwahati is significant as we aim to alleviate the housing challenges faced by transient populations and individuals seeking hassle-free living options, contributing to the city\'s evolving urban landscape. We are not merely providing rooms; we are building a lifestyle.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing fully furnished and serviced apartments/rooms designed for both short-term and long-term stays. These units are meticulously designed with modern aesthetics and functional layouts, ensuring a comfortable and productive living environment. We take care of furnishing details, from comfortable beds and seating to essential appliances, eliminating the burden of setting up a new home. Beyond the individual living spaces, GHAR 365 Residency distinguishes itself through its array of shared amenities. These may include co-working spaces conducive to productivity, communal kitchens fostering social interaction, well-equipped fitness centers promoting healthy lifestyles, and recreational areas designed for relaxation and entertainment. Our unique selling point lies in offering a comprehensive living solution where residents can immediately settle in and focus on their personal and professional pursuits without the worries of traditional home management. The need for such services in Guwahati is evident in the increasing number of professionals relocating for work, students pursuing higher education, and individuals seeking a convenient and comfortable living arrangement without the commitment of long-term leases or the hassle of furnishing an apartment from scratch. We address these needs by providing a move-in-ready solution that integrates comfort, convenience, and community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At GHAR 365 Residency, we prioritize creating an exceptional customer experience built on attentiveness, responsiveness, and a genuine commitment to resident satisfaction. Our dedicated management team is available to address inquiries, resolve issues, and ensure the smooth operation of the residency. We understand the importance of building strong relationships with our residents and fostering a sense of community within the residency. Regular social events, community gatherings, and opportunities for interaction are organized to encourage residents to connect with one another, share experiences, and build lasting friendships. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where residents feel at home and supported. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events. This involvement not only benefits our residents by providing access to local resources and opportunities but also contributes to the overall vibrancy and well-being of the Guwahati community. We are committed to being a responsible and engaged member of the local ecosystem.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, GHAR 365 Residency envisions significant growth and expansion within Guwahati and potentially beyond, aiming to become a recognized leader in providing modern residential solutions in Assam and the Northeast. Our future plans include expanding our portfolio of properties to cater to a wider range of needs and preferences, potentially including larger apartments or specialized living spaces for specific demographics. We also aim to enhance our service offerings by incorporating additional amenities and services that cater to the evolving needs of our residents. This could involve incorporating smart home technology, expanding our co-working facilities, or offering specialized wellness programs. Our long-term goals include establishing GHAR 365 Residency as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, convenience, and community. We aim to set a new standard for modern living in the region, contributing to the growth and development of Guwahati and providing a valuable service to its residents. We are continuously exploring opportunities to innovate and improve our offerings to ensure that GHAR 365 Residency remains at the forefront of the residential solutions market.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:20:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1158, 'Townhouse Medicity Formerly Hotel Grand Majesty', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Townhouse Medicity, formerly known as Hotel Grand Majesty, stands as a revitalized and reimagined hospitality landmark in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. While retaining the elegance and prime location that defined its predecessor, Townhouse Medicity has strategically pivoted to cater to the evolving needs of a modern clientele, particularly those seeking convenient access to medical facilities and a comfortable, supportive environment during healthcare-related stays. Positioned strategically, it occupies a significant niche within Guwahati’s growing healthcare tourism sector and serves as a welcoming haven for both medical travelers and discerning leisure guests alike. This evolution underscores our commitment to adapting to market demands and providing exceptional value to our patrons.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Townhouse Medicity offers a curated blend of accommodation and support services designed to enhance the guest experience. Our well-appointed rooms and suites provide a comfortable and restful environment, equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and dedicated workspaces. Beyond accommodation, we offer a suite of supplementary services specifically tailored to the needs of medical tourists and their families. These include pre- and post-operative care assistance, dietary meal plans catering to specific medical requirements, transportation arrangements to and from local hospitals and clinics, and dedicated concierge services to navigate the local medical landscape. For leisure guests, we provide a relaxing atmosphere, exceptional dining options showcasing regional Assamese cuisine, and assistance with arranging local sightseeing tours and cultural experiences. The unique selling point lies in our seamless integration of hospitality and healthcare support, creating a worry-free environment for our guests. This focus directly addresses the growing demand for comfortable and convenient accommodations near Guwahati\'s burgeoning medical centers, filling a crucial gap in the market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer service is paramount at Townhouse Medicity. We pride ourselves on creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where every guest feels valued and supported. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide personalized attention, anticipating needs and exceeding expectations. Understanding the unique stresses and anxieties often associated with medical travel, we prioritize empathy, patience, and clear communication. We strive to build genuine connections with our guests, fostering a sense of trust and security. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local Guwahati community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations. We support local artisans and craftspeople, showcasing their work within our establishment and promoting Assamese culture to our guests. This commitment to local integration reinforces our position as not just a business, but a valued member of the community, contributing to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Townhouse Medicity envisions significant growth and expansion within the hospitality and healthcare support sectors. Our long-term goals include enhancing our medical support services to offer a more comprehensive range of assistance, potentially incorporating telehealth consultations and on-site nursing care. We plan to further develop our partnerships with local hospitals and clinics, solidifying our position as the preferred accommodation provider for medical tourists. Additionally, we aim to expand our reach through targeted marketing campaigns, both domestically and internationally, highlighting the unique advantages of choosing Townhouse Medicity. We also plan to invest in upgrading our facilities, incorporating sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to a greener Guwahati. The vision is to establish Townhouse Medicity as a leading example of integrated hospitality, setting a new standard for customer care and community engagement within the region. This growth will be carefully managed to ensure that the core values of comfort, convenience, and compassionate service remain at the heart of our operation.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:20:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1159, 'Blue Moon Guest House', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Blue Moon Guest House offers a tranquil and welcoming retreat in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam. Situated strategically, we provide comfortable and convenient accommodation for both leisure and business travelers seeking an authentic experience within the heart of Northeast India. In a region rapidly developing its tourism infrastructure, Blue Moon Guest House distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, local cultural immersion, and a serene atmosphere, making it a significant contributor to Guwahati’s growing hospitality sector. We strive to be more than just a place to stay; we aim to be a gateway for our guests to discover the rich heritage and natural beauty of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering is comfortable and well-appointed guest rooms, catering to a range of needs and budgets. We provide single rooms, double rooms, and family suites, all designed with a focus on cleanliness, comfort, and functionality. Each room is equipped with essential amenities such as air conditioning, private bathrooms with hot and cold water, complimentary Wi-Fi access, and comfortable bedding. Beyond accommodation, we offer a range of supplementary services designed to enhance our guests’ experience. These include a delicious breakfast service featuring both continental and traditional Assamese cuisine, a laundry service, and airport pick-up and drop-off services. A key differentiator is our personalized tour arrangement service. Understanding that many of our guests are eager to explore the surrounding region, we partner with local guides and tour operators to offer curated excursions to nearby attractions such as the Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Island, and the Kaziranga National Park. This concierge-style service, focused on showcasing the local culture and natural wonders, significantly sets us apart from larger, more impersonal hotels.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Blue Moon Guest House, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in genuine hospitality and a commitment to anticipating our guests’ needs. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with a warm welcome and personalized attention. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the local area and readily available to provide recommendations for restaurants, shops, and activities. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continually improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their expectations. What truly makes us stand out is our connection to the local community. We actively support local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products within our guest house and recommending their services to our guests. We also participate in local community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community. This commitment fosters a sense of authenticity and allows our guests to experience the true spirit of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Blue Moon Guest House envisions significant growth potential. Our long-term goals include expanding our capacity by adding more rooms and facilities to accommodate the increasing demand for quality accommodation in Guwahati. We plan to enhance our services by incorporating more sustainable practices, such as implementing energy-efficient technologies and reducing our environmental footprint. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local organizations to promote eco-tourism and responsible travel within the region. Another key aspect of our future vision is to develop a stronger online presence and expand our marketing efforts to reach a wider audience, both domestically and internationally. We aim to become a recognized and trusted brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and exceptional customer service in the Northeast Indian hospitality sector. Ultimately, we aspire to be a leading guesthouse in Guwahati, contributing to the growth of the local economy and promoting the rich cultural heritage of Assam to the world.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:20:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1160, 'HOTEL SILVER STAY', 'Hotels', '', '<p>HOTEL SILVER STAY: Your Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, HOTEL SILVER STAY offers a refreshing blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, we strive to provide an immersive experience that connects our guests to the vibrant culture and stunning natural beauty of the region. We aim to be a preferred choice for both business and leisure travelers seeking quality accommodation and personalized service, contributing positively to the tourism and hospitality sector of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At HOTEL SILVER STAY, we understand that every traveler has unique needs. Our core services are designed to cater to a diverse range of preferences and requirements. We offer a variety of well-appointed rooms and suites, ranging from comfortable standard rooms ideal for budget-conscious travelers to luxurious suites perfect for families or those seeking a more indulgent stay. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, air conditioning, and comfortable bedding to ensure a restful and productive stay. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond accommodation, we provide a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the overall guest experience. Our on-site restaurant serves a delectable array of local Assamese cuisine, alongside popular Indian and international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We also offer a well-stocked bar, providing a relaxed setting for guests to unwind after a long day of work or exploration. For business travelers, we provide well-equipped meeting and conference facilities, complete with audio-visual equipment and support services, making HOTEL SILVER STAY an ideal venue for corporate events and gatherings.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What sets HOTEL SILVER STAY apart is our unwavering commitment to personalized service and a genuine connection with the local community. Our dedicated staff is trained to anticipate guest needs and provide attentive, friendly service, ensuring that every stay is memorable. We believe in fostering a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel valued and appreciated. We strive to provide information and recommendations about local attractions, cultural events, and hidden gems, helping our guests to experience the authentic Assam beyond the typical tourist trail.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, supporting local artisans, sourcing products from local suppliers, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We believe in contributing to the economic and social well-being of the region, ensuring that our business benefits the community as a whole. We participate in local festivals and events, offering our guests opportunities to experience the rich cultural heritage of Assam firsthand.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of our business philosophy. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continually improve our services and facilities. We believe in building long-term relationships with our guests, fostering loyalty through exceptional service and personalized attention. Our online presence is actively managed, allowing us to respond promptly to inquiries and address any concerns that may arise. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, HOTEL SILVER STAY envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our services to include a wider range of amenities, such as a fitness center, a spa, and a swimming pool, further enhancing the guest experience. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism initiatives, showcasing the natural beauty of Assam while promoting sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goal is to establish HOTEL SILVER STAY as a brand synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We are committed to investing in our staff, providing them with ongoing training and development opportunities to enhance their skills and knowledge. We believe that a motivated and well-trained team is essential to delivering exceptional customer service. We also plan to leverage technology to streamline our operations and enhance the guest experience, implementing online booking systems, mobile check-in options, and other innovative solutions. We aim to stay ahead of the curve, adapting to the evolving needs of our customers and the changing landscape of the hospitality industry. We are confident that HOTEL SILVER STAY will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth and prosperity of Guwahati and Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:25:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1161, 'ALOHI INN', 'Hotels', '', '<p>ALOHI INN: A Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, ALOHI INN stands as a beacon of warm hospitality, offering a unique blend of modern comfort and Assamese cultural immersion. More than just a place to stay, ALOHI INN is a destination designed to provide travelers with an authentic and enriching experience of Northeast India. In a region known for its breathtaking landscapes and vibrant traditions, ALOHI INN distinguishes itself by meticulously curating experiences that resonate with both leisure and business travelers, offering a seamless integration of comfort, convenience, and cultural exploration.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>ALOHI INN\'s significance in the Guwahati business landscape extends beyond accommodation. We aim to be a catalyst for local tourism, promoting the region\'s rich heritage and supporting local artisans and businesses. By providing a platform for cultural exchange and offering a superior guest experience, we contribute to the overall growth and prosperity of Guwahati and Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our Core Offerings: Comfort, Convenience, and Cultural Immersion</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>ALOHI INN offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our guests. Our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and well-appointed accommodation. We offer a variety of room types, from standard rooms ideal for budget-conscious travelers to deluxe suites offering enhanced space and amenities for those seeking a more luxurious experience. Each room is designed with modern aesthetics and equipped with essential amenities like high-speed internet access, climate control, and comfortable bedding to ensure a relaxing stay.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond accommodation, we provide a range of supplementary services to enhance the guest experience. Our in-house restaurant serves a delightful array of culinary options, from authentic Assamese delicacies to popular Indian and international dishes. We prioritize using locally sourced ingredients to support regional farmers and offer our guests a taste of Assam\'s rich culinary heritage. We also offer a range of other services including laundry, travel assistance, and airport transfers, ensuring a hassle-free experience for our guests.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>One of ALOHI INN\'s unique selling points is our commitment to providing authentic cultural experiences. We organize guided tours to local attractions, including the Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Island, and the Assam State Museum. We also host cultural events and performances, showcasing traditional Assamese music, dance, and art forms. Furthermore, we partner with local artisans to offer guests the opportunity to purchase handcrafted souvenirs and support the region\'s artistic traditions. These cultural immersion initiatives are designed to provide guests with a deeper understanding and appreciation of Assam\'s rich heritage.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our services directly address the needs of the Guwahati market by providing a high-quality accommodation option that caters to both domestic and international travelers. The increasing demand for tourism in Northeast India, coupled with the growing business activity in Guwahati, necessitates the availability of reliable and comfortable lodging. ALOHI INN fills this gap by offering a superior guest experience at a competitive price, making it an attractive option for both leisure and business travelers. Our cultural immersion programs further enhance our appeal, attracting travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Exceptional Customer Experience: Connecting with the Community</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At ALOHI INN, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount to our success. We are committed to providing each guest with a personalized and memorable experience. Our staff is trained to be attentive, responsive, and proactive in addressing guest needs. We strive to anticipate guest requests and exceed their expectations, creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. We believe in fostering genuine connections with our guests, making them feel valued and appreciated.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What sets us apart is our dedication to creating a culturally immersive and authentic experience. We go beyond simply providing accommodation and strive to connect our guests with the local community. We partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism and support the region\'s economic development. We actively engage with the community through various initiatives, such as sponsoring local events and participating in charitable activities. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we create a positive impact and contribute to the overall well-being of Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We actively solicit guest feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We encourage guests to share their experiences through online reviews and in-person surveys. We carefully analyze this feedback and use it to identify areas for improvement and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our guests.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Vision for the Future: Growth, Innovation, and Sustainability</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>ALOHI INN envisions a future where it stands as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a recognized champion of sustainable tourism in Northeast India. Our long-term goal is to expand our operations and establish ALOHI INN as a benchmark for quality and service in the region. We plan to explore opportunities for expansion, including adding more rooms and facilities, and potentially opening new locations in other parts of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We are committed to innovation and continuously seeking ways to enhance our guest experience. We plan to invest in new technologies and amenities to provide our guests with the latest in comfort and convenience. We are also exploring new ways to incorporate Assamese culture into our offerings, such as offering cooking classes and cultural workshops. Sustainability is a core value at ALOHI INN. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and promoting responsible tourism practices. We are exploring ways to reduce our energy consumption, conserve water, and minimize waste. We also plan to support local environmental initiatives and promote eco-friendly tourism options.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>By focusing on growth, innovation, and sustainability, ALOHI INN aims to solidify its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and contribute to the long-term prosperity of the region. We are confident that our commitment to exceptional customer service, cultural immersion, and sustainable practices will enable us to achieve our vision and continue to delight our guests for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:25:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1162, 'Erica Residency', 'Hotels', '', 'Erica Residency: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nErica Residency stands as a beacon of refined hospitality in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil haven for both business and leisure travelers. Situated in a prime location within the city, Erica Residency distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, modern amenities, and a genuine connection to the rich cultural heritage of Assam. In a region experiencing burgeoning tourism and increased business activity, Erica Residency addresses a critical need for high-quality accommodation that combines comfort, convenience, and authentic local experiences. It\'s more than just a place to stay; it\'s a gateway to exploring the beauty and vibrancy of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Erica Residency\'s offerings are elegantly appointed rooms and suites, each designed to provide guests with a restful and rejuvenating experience. These accommodations are equipped with contemporary amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and climate control systems, ensuring a comfortable and productive stay. Beyond the rooms themselves, Erica Residency boasts a range of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of its clientele. These include:\n\n* **Restaurant & Cafe:** Offering a diverse menu of local Assamese delicacies alongside popular international dishes, catering to a range of palates. The emphasis is on fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers.\n* **Conference & Event Facilities:** Providing flexible spaces suitable for business meetings, conferences, and social gatherings. Equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and supported by a dedicated events team, Erica Residency is an ideal venue for professional events in Guwahati.\n* **Travel Assistance:** A dedicated concierge service is available to assist guests with travel arrangements, sightseeing tours, and local recommendations, ensuring they can seamlessly explore the region\'s attractions and cultural landmarks.\n* **Laundry & Valet Services:** Offering convenience and efficiency for guests during their stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly sets Erica Residency apart is its unwavering dedication to providing an exceptional customer experience. The staff is meticulously trained to anticipate and cater to the individual needs of each guest, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere from arrival to departure. The goal is not simply to provide accommodation, but to create memorable moments and foster lasting relationships.\n\nErica Residency actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. The restaurant sources ingredients from local farmers, contributing to the economic empowerment of the region. Furthermore, the residency partners with local artisans and cultural organizations to showcase the art, crafts, and traditions of Assam, providing guests with a deeper understanding of the region\'s unique heritage. By actively engaging with the community, Erica Residency aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a valued member of the Guwahati community. Customer feedback is actively solicited and analyzed to continuously improve services and exceed guest expectations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Erica Residency envisions becoming the premier destination for discerning travelers in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding the range of services offered, such as incorporating a wellness center and spa, to provide guests with a more holistic experience. There are also plans to enhance the cultural immersion aspect of the residency by hosting regular cultural events and workshops, showcasing the diverse traditions of Assam.\n\nLong-term goals include exploring opportunities for expansion within the region, potentially establishing additional residency locations in other key cities of Assam. Erica Residency is committed to sustainable business practices and seeks to minimize its environmental impact by adopting eco-friendly technologies and promoting responsible tourism. Ultimately, Erica Residency aims to be synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality, contributing to the growth and prosperity of the region while providing guests with an unforgettable experience.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:25:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1163, 'Hotel Cosy Home', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Hotel Cosy Home: Your Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Hotel Cosy Home offers a unique blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, we provide a welcoming haven for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience. Our commitment to personalized service, coupled with our strategic location and thoughtfully designed accommodations, positions Hotel Cosy Home as a significant player in the Guwahati hospitality sector, catering to both leisure and business travelers who value comfort, convenience, and cultural immersion.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Home Away From Home</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Hotel Cosy Home, we pride ourselves on offering a comprehensive range of services designed to meet the diverse needs of our guests. Our core offering revolves around comfortable and well-appointed accommodations. We provide a variety of room types, from cozy standard rooms perfect for solo travelers to spacious family suites designed to accommodate larger groups. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed Wi-Fi, air conditioning, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and private bathrooms with hot and cold water facilities. We maintain impeccable cleanliness standards throughout the hotel to ensure a pleasant and hygienic stay for all our guests.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond accommodation, Hotel Cosy Home features an in-house restaurant serving a delightful array of cuisines, with a special emphasis on authentic Assamese dishes. This culinary experience allows guests to savor the rich flavors of the region without leaving the comfort of the hotel. We also offer complimentary breakfast to all our guests, providing a convenient and delicious start to their day. For guests seeking relaxation and rejuvenation, we offer massage services.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>One of our key differentiators is our personalized approach to service. We go the extra mile to cater to the specific needs and preferences of each guest. Whether it\'s arranging airport transfers, providing information about local attractions, or assisting with travel arrangements, our dedicated team is always on hand to ensure a seamless and enjoyable stay. Furthermore, we understand the importance of connectivity for today\'s travelers, which is why we offer complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi access throughout the hotel premises. Our strategic location in Guwahati places us in close proximity to key attractions, business centers, and transportation hubs, making us an ideal choice for both leisure and business travelers.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, Fostering Loyalty</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Hotel Cosy Home, customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We believe in building lasting relationships with our guests by providing exceptional service and creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to be courteous, attentive, and knowledgeable about the local area. We encourage open communication with our guests, actively soliciting feedback to continuously improve our services and offerings. We understand the importance of creating a sense of community, which is why we regularly organize cultural events and activities that showcase the rich heritage of Assam. These events provide guests with an opportunity to interact with locals, learn about the local culture, and create memorable experiences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our commitment to the local community extends beyond cultural events. We actively support local businesses and initiatives, sourcing our ingredients and products from local suppliers whenever possible. We also participate in community outreach programs, contributing to the well-being of the local community. We believe that by fostering strong relationships with our guests and the local community, we can create a positive and sustainable business model.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Sustainability</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Cosy Home is committed to continued growth and innovation. We envision expanding our operations to include additional rooms and facilities, further enhancing the guest experience. We plan to introduce new services, such as a travel desk to assist guests with planning their itineraries and exploring the region. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local tour operators to offer curated experiences that showcase the best of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Furthermore, we are committed to sustainable business practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty. We are exploring ways to reduce our energy consumption, conserve water, and minimize waste. We also plan to implement initiatives to support local artisans and promote responsible tourism. Hotel Cosy Home\'s long-term goal is to become a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional service, commitment to sustainability, and dedication to the local community. We aim to be the preferred choice for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience in Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:25:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1164, 'Hotel Spectrum Residency', 'Hotels', '', 'Hotel Spectrum Residency, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a beacon of hospitality, offering a distinctive blend of comfort, convenience, and cultural immersion. More than just a place to stay, Hotel Spectrum Residency aims to be a gateway to experiencing the rich tapestry of Assamese culture and the vibrant spirit of the Northeast. In a region known for its tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, and spiritual significance, Hotel Spectrum Residency distinguishes itself by providing a personalized and memorable experience tailored to the needs of both leisure and business travelers. Its strategic location provides easy access to key landmarks, commercial hubs, and transportation arteries, making it an ideal base for exploring Guwahati and its surrounding areas.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHotel Spectrum Residency\'s core offering revolves around providing exceptional accommodation and comprehensive hospitality services. This includes well-appointed rooms, each designed to offer a sanctuary of tranquility amidst the bustling city. Room categories cater to a diverse range of preferences, from comfortable standard rooms ideal for short stays to spacious suites suitable for extended visits. A key differentiator lies in the hotel\'s commitment to incorporating local artistry and craftsmanship into the room décor, creating an authentic sense of place. Beyond accommodation, the hotel boasts a range of amenities designed to enhance the guest experience, including an on-site restaurant serving both regional and international cuisine, a well-equipped fitness center for maintaining wellness routines, and conference facilities designed to accommodate business meetings and small-scale events. What truly sets Hotel Spectrum Residency apart is its dedication to providing personalized service. The staff is trained to anticipate guest needs and to go the extra mile in ensuring a comfortable and hassle-free stay. Understanding the growing demand for authentic experiences, the hotel also curates local tours and activities, allowing guests to delve deeper into Assam\'s cultural heritage and natural beauty.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Hotel Spectrum Residency. The hotel strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. This begins with attentive and efficient service from the moment of arrival and extends throughout the entire stay. The staff are not just employees, but rather ambassadors of Assamese hospitality, eager to share their knowledge of the region and provide recommendations tailored to individual interests. The hotel actively solicits feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and ensure that it meets the evolving needs of its clientele. Hotel Spectrum Residency also recognizes the importance of connecting with the local community. It actively supports local artisans and businesses by sourcing products and services locally, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. Furthermore, the hotel participates in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the vibrant cultural landscape of Guwahati. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the hotel\'s reputation but also fosters a deeper connection with its guests, many of whom are keen to support businesses that are socially responsible.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Hotel Spectrum Residency envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a recognized name throughout the Northeast. The hotel plans to expand its services and amenities to cater to a wider range of travelers. This includes exploring opportunities to develop specialized tourism packages focused on niche interests such as tea tourism, wildlife expeditions, and cultural immersion programs. Further, there are plans to expand the existing conference facilities to accommodate larger events and cater to the growing demand for business travel in the region. A key element of the future vision is a continued commitment to sustainability. Hotel Spectrum Residency aims to implement eco-friendly practices throughout its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty. This includes initiatives such as reducing water consumption, promoting energy efficiency, and supporting local conservation efforts. By embracing innovation, sustainability, and a continued focus on customer satisfaction, Hotel Spectrum Residency is poised to solidify its position as a premier hospitality destination in Guwahati and contribute to the growth of the tourism sector in Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:25:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
