(1182, 'Hotel Gangotri', 'Hotels', '', 'Hotel Gangotri: A Guwahati Landmark in Hospitality\n\nHotel Gangotri stands as a prominent and well-regarded establishment in Guwahati, offering a blend of comfortable accommodations and warm hospitality that caters to both business and leisure travelers. Situated strategically within the city, Hotel Gangotri has become a familiar name synonymous with quality service and a convenient location. More than just a place to stay, it strives to be a welcoming home away from home for its guests, contributing positively to the vibrant hospitality sector of Assam. Its reputation is built on a foundation of consistent service, attention to detail, and a commitment to exceeding guest expectations, solidifying its position as a preferred choice for visitors to Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Hotel Gangotri provides a comprehensive range of services designed to ensure a comfortable and memorable stay. The hotel boasts well-appointed rooms, ranging from standard accommodations to more luxurious suites, each meticulously maintained and equipped with modern amenities to meet the diverse needs of its clientele. Beyond accommodation, Hotel Gangotri offers a multi-cuisine restaurant serving a variety of delectable dishes, from traditional Assamese fare to international favorites, providing a culinary journey for its guests. Complementing this is banqueting and conference facilities equipped to host a range of events, from corporate meetings and seminars to weddings and social gatherings. The unique selling point lies in the hotel\'s ability to seamlessly blend modern amenities with a touch of local Assamese charm, offering an authentic and enriching experience that sets it apart from larger, more impersonal hotel chains. The strategic location provides easy access to key business districts, tourist attractions, and transportation hubs, making it an ideal choice for both business travelers and tourists exploring the region. The services cater specifically to the local market by offering packages that include guided tours of nearby cultural sites and customized menus featuring regional specialties, ensuring a truly immersive experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Hotel Gangotri. The hotel prides itself on providing personalized service, where every guest is treated with warmth, respect, and genuine care. Staff are trained to anticipate guest needs and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free stay. What truly makes Hotel Gangotri stand out is its commitment to creating a welcoming atmosphere that extends beyond the provision of mere accommodation. The hotel actively participates in local community initiatives, supporting local artisans and promoting Assamese culture through various events and collaborations. This engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and creates a unique connection with guests who appreciate the hotel\'s commitment to social responsibility. Hotel Gangotri strives to build lasting relationships with its guests, ensuring they return not just for the comfortable accommodations, but also for the genuine hospitality and connection to the local community that it provides. Regular feedback is actively sought and carefully considered to continuously improve services and enhance the overall guest experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Hotel Gangotri envisions significant growth and expansion while maintaining its core values of quality, service, and community engagement. The hotel plans to explore opportunities to enhance its offerings, potentially including the addition of a spa and wellness center, further enriching the guest experience. A key focus is on leveraging technology to improve operational efficiency and provide a more seamless and personalized experience for guests, from online check-in to customized service recommendations. Sustainability is also a growing priority, with plans to implement eco-friendly practices throughout the hotel\'s operations, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to a more sustainable future for Guwahati. The long-term goal is to solidify Hotel Gangotri\'s position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and the wider Assam region, recognized not only for its comfortable accommodations and exceptional service, but also for its commitment to the community and its contribution to the growth and prosperity of the local economy. Ultimately, Hotel Gangotri aims to be more than just a hotel; it aspires to be a symbol of Assamese hospitality, welcoming visitors from around the world and showcasing the rich culture and beauty of the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:45:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1183, 'Greeny Villa Home Stay', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Greeny Villa Home Stay offers a tranquil escape in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, providing guests with an authentic and immersive experience of Assamese culture and hospitality. Situated amidst lush greenery, our home stay distinguishes itself from conventional hotels by offering a personalized, family-oriented atmosphere, making it a unique addition to the growing hospitality sector in the region. We cater to both domestic and international travelers seeking a peaceful retreat with convenient access to the city\'s attractions, while simultaneously promoting sustainable tourism practices.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service revolves around providing comfortable and culturally enriching accommodation. We offer well-appointed rooms, each designed with a blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese aesthetics. Guests can choose from a range of room options to suit their needs, from standard rooms for budget-conscious travelers to deluxe suites offering enhanced comfort and space. Beyond accommodation, we provide curated experiences that showcase the rich cultural tapestry of Assam. This includes guided tours of local tea gardens, visits to historical sites like the Kamakhya Temple, and opportunities to participate in traditional Assamese cooking classes. A key differentiator is our emphasis on authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared using locally sourced ingredients. We offer guests the opportunity to savor traditional dishes, providing a culinary journey that reflects the region\'s unique flavors. This focus on local culture and experiences not only sets us apart from generic hotels but also directly addresses the growing demand for experiential travel among discerning tourists.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Greeny Villa Home Stay, we are committed to providing exceptional customer service that embodies the warmth and hospitality synonymous with Assamese culture. Our approach is deeply personalized; we strive to understand each guest\'s individual needs and preferences to ensure a memorable and comfortable stay. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with genuine warmth and attentiveness. We pride ourselves on building strong relationships with our guests, often going the extra mile to assist with travel arrangements, provide local insights, and cater to special requests. Beyond individual guest interactions, we actively engage with the local community. We source our produce and ingredients from local farmers and artisans, supporting the local economy and minimizing our environmental impact. We also collaborate with local tour operators to offer authentic and responsible tourism experiences. Furthermore, we participate in community events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of the local community. Our commitment to community engagement not only strengthens our brand reputation but also aligns with our values of sustainability and social responsibility.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Greeny Villa Home Stay envisions becoming a leading eco-friendly home stay in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism and exceptional guest experiences. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation capacity while maintaining our intimate and personalized service. We aim to incorporate more sustainable practices into our operations, such as implementing solar power, rainwater harvesting, and waste management systems. We also plan to develop new and innovative cultural experiences, such as workshops on Assamese weaving and pottery, further enhancing our offering and promoting local art and crafts. Exploring partnerships with local NGOs to support community development projects and promote responsible tourism is also on the horizon. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to create a model for sustainable and culturally enriching tourism in Assam, contributing to the region\'s economic development while preserving its unique heritage and environment. This includes exploring opportunities to expand our brand to other locations within Assam, offering a network of eco-friendly home stays that showcase the diversity and beauty of the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:45:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1184, 'OYO 46047 Orchard Hotel', 'Hotels', '', '<p>OYO 46047 Orchard Hotel: A Haven of Comfort and Convenience in Guwahati</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, OYO 46047 Orchard Hotel offers a compelling blend of comfort, convenience, and affordability for both business and leisure travelers. Situated strategically within the city, the hotel provides easy access to key commercial hubs, tourist attractions, and transportation links, making it an ideal base for exploring the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of the region. Beyond a simple accommodation, OYO 46047 Orchard Hotel strives to be a welcoming gateway to Assam, offering a personalized experience that resonates with the warmth and hospitality that the region is known for. Its presence contributes positively to the local tourism ecosystem by providing accessible and reliable lodging options that cater to a diverse range of travelers, bolstering Guwahati\'s position as a significant destination in Northeast India.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and well-maintained accommodations. Each room is thoughtfully designed to ensure a relaxing stay, equipped with essential amenities such as comfortable bedding, climate control, en-suite bathrooms with modern fixtures, and complimentary Wi-Fi. Beyond the rooms themselves, we offer a range of services to enhance the guest experience. These typically include 24-hour front desk assistance to address any queries or needs, laundry services to ensure guests can travel light, and on-site parking facilities for those arriving by car. A key differentiator lies in our commitment to providing a seamless and hassle-free stay. We understand the importance of value, and strive to offer competitive rates without compromising on quality. Our value proposition is particularly attractive to budget-conscious travelers, families, and those seeking a comfortable and reliable base from which to explore Guwahati. Furthermore, our convenient location significantly reduces travel time to key destinations within the city, catering to the needs of both business travelers with tight schedules and tourists eager to maximize their sightseeing opportunities.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At OYO 46047 Orchard Hotel, we prioritize creating a positive and memorable experience for every guest. Our dedicated team is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that individual needs and preferences are met with genuine care and efficiency. We understand that exceptional customer service goes beyond simply addressing requests; it\'s about anticipating needs and creating a welcoming atmosphere. We actively encourage feedback from our guests to continually improve our services and offerings. While part of a larger chain, OYO 46047 Orchard Hotel aims to connect with the local Guwahati community by engaging with local businesses and promoting regional tourism. This might involve collaborating with local tour operators to offer curated experiences, sourcing local produce for our breakfast offerings (where applicable), or participating in community events. By fostering strong relationships with local stakeholders, we aim to contribute to the economic prosperity of Guwahati and showcase the unique cultural richness of Assam to our guests.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, OYO 46047 Orchard Hotel is committed to sustainable growth and continuous improvement. We envision expanding our services and amenities to better cater to the evolving needs of our guests. This could include introducing enhanced dining options, adding business facilities, or offering specialized packages tailored to specific traveler segments. We are also exploring opportunities to integrate sustainable practices into our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty. This might involve implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation initiatives. Our long-term goal is to establish OYO 46047 Orchard Hotel as a leading accommodation provider in Guwahati, recognized not only for its comfortable and convenient lodging but also for its commitment to exceptional customer service, community engagement, and sustainable practices. We believe that by consistently delivering on these core values, we can contribute to the continued growth of tourism in Guwahati and create lasting value for our guests, our employees, and the local community.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:45:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1185, 'LOKTAK RESIDENCY', 'Hotels', '', '<p>LOKTAK RESIDENCY: A Gateway to Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, Loktak Residency stands as a distinguished establishment offering a blend of comfortable accommodation and authentic Assamese hospitality. Named after the mesmerizing Loktak Lake, the largest freshwater lake in Northeast India, the residency aims to capture the region\'s natural beauty and cultural richness within its walls. Loktak Residency distinguishes itself not merely as a place to stay, but as an immersive experience, connecting guests with the soul of Assam. In a landscape increasingly dominated by standardized global hotel chains, Loktak Residency provides a personalized and culturally sensitive alternative, catering to both discerning travelers and local residents seeking a refined and memorable stay. The residency\'s commitment to showcasing Assamese art, cuisine, and traditions positions it as a significant contributor to the local tourism and hospitality sector, fostering a sense of regional pride and providing a platform for local artisans and businesses.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Loktak Residency’s offerings are its well-appointed rooms, designed for comfort and functionality. Beyond simply providing a place to rest, each room is thoughtfully curated to reflect the aesthetic sensibilities of Assam, incorporating local textiles, handicrafts, and artwork. Guests can choose from a range of room categories, from cozy standard rooms to spacious suites, each equipped with modern amenities to ensure a seamless and enjoyable stay. However, Loktak Residency extends beyond accommodation. A signature aspect of the residency is its dedication to showcasing Assamese cuisine. The in-house restaurant offers a diverse menu featuring both traditional Assamese dishes and popular Indian and international fare, all prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Guests can savor the unique flavors of Assam, experiencing dishes like <i>masor tenga</i> (sour fish curry) and <i>pitha</i> (traditional rice cakes) in an elegant and inviting setting. Furthermore, Loktak Residency provides event and conference facilities suitable for business meetings, social gatherings, and cultural events. These spaces are equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual equipment and are supported by a dedicated event management team, ensuring the success of every occasion. The unique selling point lies in the commitment to providing personalized service, catering to individual needs and preferences, and creating an atmosphere of warmth and genuine hospitality. The services directly address the market need for culturally relevant and comfortable accommodation and event spaces, particularly for those seeking an authentic Assamese experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Loktak Residency. The staff is meticulously trained to anticipate guests\' needs and provide personalized attention. From the warm welcome at check-in to the attentive service throughout their stay, guests are made to feel valued and cared for. Loktak Residency differentiates itself by proactively seeking feedback and continuously striving to improve its services. The residency actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. It partners with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their work within the property, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. It also participates in local festivals and events, contributing to the vibrant cultural landscape of Guwahati. Furthermore, Loktak Residency is committed to sustainable practices, minimizing its environmental impact and supporting local environmental initiatives. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, Loktak Residency creates a sense of belonging for its guests and contributes to the overall well-being of the region. The aim is to build lasting relationships with guests, turning them into loyal patrons and ambassadors for Loktak Residency and Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Loktak Residency envisions itself as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and a significant contributor to the growth of the Assamese tourism industry. Future plans include expanding its accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, including budget-conscious visitors and luxury seekers. The residency also plans to enhance its culinary offerings by introducing cooking classes and food tours, allowing guests to delve deeper into the rich culinary traditions of Assam. Furthermore, Loktak Residency aims to develop strategic partnerships with tour operators and travel agencies to promote Assam as a premier tourist destination. This includes showcasing the diverse natural beauty of the region, from the lush tea gardens to the mighty Brahmaputra River. Long-term goals include establishing Loktak Residency as a brand synonymous with authentic Assamese hospitality, expanding its presence to other key locations in Assam, and contributing to the sustainable development of the region. The ultimate vision is to create a legacy of excellence in hospitality, while preserving and promoting the rich cultural heritage of Assam for generations to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:50:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1186, 'DASSERA LODGE', 'Hotels', '', 'DASSERA LODGE: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Culture in Guwahati\n\nDASSERA LODGE stands as a distinguished hospitality establishment nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of modern comfort and authentic Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, DASSERA LODGE is an experience, a gateway to understanding and appreciating the rich cultural tapestry of the region. In a city rapidly evolving as a commercial and tourist hub for Northeast India, DASSERA LODGE distinguishes itself by providing personalized service, comfortable accommodations, and a commitment to showcasing the best of Assam to its guests. Its strategic location provides convenient access to key business districts, tourist attractions, and transportation hubs, making it an ideal choice for both business and leisure travelers seeking a memorable stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, DASSERA LODGE offers elegantly appointed rooms designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. From cozy standard rooms perfect for solo travelers to spacious suites ideal for families or extended stays, each room is meticulously maintained and equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and climate control. Beyond accommodations, DASSERA LODGE distinguishes itself through its curated experiences. These include guided tours of local tea gardens, Kaziranga National Park excursions (organized through reputable tour operators), and cultural performances showcasing traditional Assamese music and dance. The on-site restaurant serves a delectable array of local and international cuisine, with a particular emphasis on authentic Assamese dishes prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. This commitment to showcasing the region\'s culinary heritage is a significant differentiator, appealing to travelers eager to immerse themselves in the local culture. Further enhancing the guest experience are personalized concierge services, laundry facilities, and airport shuttle services. The lodge\'s unique selling proposition lies in its ability to provide a seamless blend of comfort, convenience, and cultural immersion, catering specifically to the growing demand for authentic travel experiences in the Northeast.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nDASSERA LODGE prioritizes creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, fostering genuine connections with its guests. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating needs and exceeding expectations. The lodge\'s commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in consistently positive guest reviews and a high rate of repeat business. DASSERA LODGE actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, promoting their crafts and providing them with a platform to showcase their talent. The lodge also participates in local festivals and events, further strengthening its ties to the community and demonstrating its commitment to preserving and promoting Assamese culture. By sourcing local produce and employing local staff, DASSERA LODGE contributes to the economic well-being of the community, further solidifying its position as a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. Its dedication to providing authentic Assamese experiences extends beyond its walls, with staff members readily offering recommendations for local restaurants, shops, and cultural attractions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, DASSERA LODGE envisions expanding its services and facilities to further enhance the guest experience. Plans are underway to develop a dedicated event space for hosting conferences, weddings, and other special occasions, catering to the growing demand for event venues in Guwahati. The lodge also aims to expand its culinary offerings, introducing cooking classes that allow guests to learn the art of Assamese cuisine. Furthermore, DASSERA LODGE is committed to embracing sustainable practices, reducing its environmental footprint through energy-efficient technologies and responsible waste management. The long-term goal is to establish DASSERA LODGE as a leading hospitality destination in Guwahati, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of its guests, DASSERA LODGE is poised to play a significant role in the growth of tourism and business in Assam, contributing to the region\'s economic prosperity and cultural preservation. The ambition is to become synonymous with exceptional hospitality and a true reflection of the spirit of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:50:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1187, 'Hotel D\' Sapphire', 'Hotels', '', 'Hotel D\' Sapphire: A Jewel in Guwahati\'s Hospitality Crown\n\nHotel D\' Sapphire stands as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati\'s vibrant hospitality sector, offering a sophisticated blend of comfort, elegance, and personalized service. Situated in a prime location within Guwahati, it provides convenient access to key business districts, tourist attractions, and transportation hubs, making it an ideal choice for both business and leisure travelers. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning economic activity, Hotel D\' Sapphire distinguishes itself by embracing local traditions while upholding international standards of excellence. We are committed to delivering an unparalleled guest experience, contributing positively to the local community, and playing a significant role in the continued growth of Guwahati\'s tourism and business sectors. <br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Assam, a region experiencing increasing tourism and economic growth, Hotel D\' Sapphire fills a crucial need for high-quality accommodation and event spaces. It serves as a vital link, connecting visitors with the unique charm and opportunities of Guwahati, all while promising a reliably superior experience. The hotel is more than just a place to stay; it’s a gateway to exploring the best that Assam has to offer. <br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products\n\nHotel D\' Sapphire offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. At the core of our offerings are our well-appointed guest rooms and suites. These accommodations are designed to provide a relaxing and productive environment, featuring modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and comfortable work spaces. Each room is meticulously maintained and designed to reflect a contemporary aesthetic that blends seamlessly with local artistic influences. <br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodations, the hotel boasts multiple dining options, catering to a variety of palates. Our signature restaurant serves authentic Assamese cuisine alongside international favorites, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. A relaxed cafe setting provides a perfect spot for casual meetings or a quick bite, while our bar offers an extensive selection of beverages in a sophisticated atmosphere. <br> <br>\n\nRecognizing the importance of business travel, Hotel D\' Sapphire features state-of-the-art conference and event facilities. These spaces are equipped with the latest technology and supported by a dedicated team of event professionals, ensuring seamless execution of meetings, conferences, weddings, and other special occasions. Our versatile spaces can be configured to accommodate events of varying sizes, from small board meetings to large-scale receptions. <br> <br>\n\nA key differentiator for Hotel D\' Sapphire is our commitment to providing personalized service that anticipates and exceeds guest expectations. We offer concierge services, travel assistance, and laundry and dry-cleaning services to ensure a comfortable and hassle-free stay. Our well-trained and attentive staff is dedicated to creating a memorable experience for each guest, paying meticulous attention to detail and responding promptly to individual needs. Furthermore, the hotel provides wellness facilities including a fitness center, allowing guests to maintain their health and wellbeing even while travelling. <br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience\n\nThe customer experience at Hotel D\' Sapphire is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and memorable atmosphere that fosters lasting relationships with our guests. Our approach to customer service is rooted in genuine hospitality, anticipating needs before they are voiced and delivering service with a smile. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. <br> <br>\n\nWhat sets us apart is our commitment to connecting with the local community. We actively support local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products in our hotel and incorporating them into our services. This commitment not only enhances the guest experience by providing authentic local experiences but also contributes to the economic vitality of the region. We also partner with local charities and organizations to support community initiatives and contribute to the well-being of the residents of Guwahati. The Hotel strives to participate in initiatives that promote sustainable tourism, aiming to minimize its environmental impact and contribute to the preservation of the local culture and environment. <br> <br>\n\nOur team is carefully selected and trained to provide exceptional service that reflects the warmth and hospitality of Assamese culture. We prioritize creating a work environment that empowers our employees to excel, fostering a culture of teamwork, respect, and continuous improvement. By investing in our employees, we ensure that they are well-equipped to deliver the highest standards of service to our guests. <br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision\n\nHotel D\' Sapphire is poised for continued growth and expansion in the years to come. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand from both business and leisure travelers. We are also exploring opportunities to develop new dining concepts and event spaces that cater to evolving customer preferences. In addition, we plan to enhance our technology infrastructure to provide guests with seamless and convenient access to information and services. <br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to establish Hotel D\' Sapphire as the premier hotel in Guwahati and a leading hospitality brand in the Northeast region of India. We envision becoming a symbol of excellence, innovation, and community engagement, contributing to the growth and prosperity of the region. We are committed to maintaining our high standards of service, adapting to changing market dynamics, and staying true to our core values of integrity, respect, and customer satisfaction. Ultimately, Hotel D\' Sapphire seeks to be more than just a hotel; we aspire to be an integral part of the Guwahati community and a cherished destination for travelers from around the world.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:50:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1188, 'Vivanta Guwahati', 'Hotels', '', 'Vivanta Guwahati stands as a beacon of professional service and comprehensive business solutions in the heart of Assam. Nestled in Guwahati, a vital commercial hub of Northeast India, Vivanta Guwahati distinguishes itself by providing tailored services designed to empower local businesses and facilitate growth within the region. More than just a service provider, Vivanta Guwahati acts as a strategic partner, understanding the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the local economic landscape. Its commitment to fostering sustainable growth, coupled with a client-centric approach, sets it apart as a key player in the Assam business community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nVivanta Guwahati offers a diverse portfolio of services catering to a wide spectrum of business needs. These include specialized consulting services covering market entry strategies, financial planning, and operational efficiency improvements. Recognizing the importance of a strong brand presence, Vivanta Guwahati also provides marketing and branding solutions, crafting compelling narratives that resonate with the local consumer base. Furthermore, the company offers essential business support services such as administrative assistance, virtual office solutions, and event management, enabling businesses to focus on their core competencies. A key differentiator is Vivanta Guwahati\'s deep understanding of the regulatory environment specific to Assam, ensuring compliance and smooth business operations for its clients. This understanding is particularly vital given the unique legal and economic considerations within the region. These services directly address the demand for accessible, high-quality business support that is often lacking in developing commercial centers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience lies at the very heart of Vivanta Guwahati’s operational philosophy. The business is built on the principle of creating lasting partnerships, achieved through proactive communication, personalized solutions, and a genuine commitment to client success. Vivanta Guwahati fosters a culture of responsiveness, ensuring that every client interaction is efficient, informative, and solution-oriented. Beyond simply fulfilling service requests, the company actively seeks to understand its clients\' broader business objectives, allowing it to anticipate needs and offer proactive guidance. Furthermore, Vivanta Guwahati actively participates in local business events and initiatives, strengthening its connection with the community and fostering a sense of collaboration. This commitment to community engagement is integral to its brand identity and reinforces its position as a trusted partner for local businesses. By prioritizing relationship building and community involvement, Vivanta Guwahati cultivates a loyal customer base that values its expertise and dedication.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Vivanta Guwahati envisions significant growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading business service provider in Assam. The company is committed to continuously enhancing its service offerings, incorporating cutting-edge technologies and best practices to meet the evolving needs of the market. Future plans include expanding its consulting capabilities to encompass specialized sectors such as tourism and sustainable development, aligning with the region\'s economic priorities. Additionally, Vivanta Guwahati aims to establish strategic partnerships with other regional businesses and organizations, creating a collaborative ecosystem that promotes mutual growth and innovation. A long-term goal is to establish a training and development center, equipping local entrepreneurs and professionals with the skills and knowledge necessary to thrive in the competitive business landscape. Through strategic investments in technology, partnerships, and talent development, Vivanta Guwahati is poised to play a pivotal role in driving economic prosperity and empowering the Assam business community for years to come.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:50:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1189, 'Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur Formerly Shree Vinayak Guest House', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur, formerly Shree Vinayak Guest House, represents a unique convergence of hospitality and healthcare in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Strategically located in Dispur, a vital administrative and commercial hub, the establishment offers a distinct proposition: comfortable accommodation with seamless access to comprehensive medical services provided by the renowned GNRC Hospitals. This innovative approach addresses a critical need for patients and their families seeking accessible and affordable lodging near quality medical facilities, setting Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur apart in the local business environment. This hybrid model contributes significantly to the local economy by facilitating medical tourism and supporting the healthcare ecosystem in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The primary service offered is comfortable and well-maintained accommodation, catering primarily to out-of-town patients, their families, and individuals visiting GNRC Hospital Dispur for medical consultations, treatments, or post-operative care. Rooms are designed to provide a relaxing and stress-free environment, equipped with essential amenities such as air conditioning, private bathrooms, television, and Wi-Fi access. Beyond basic lodging, the establishment provides value-added services including assistance with hospital appointments, transportation arrangements to and from the hospital, and information on local amenities and attractions. What truly distinguishes Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur is its direct affiliation with GNRC Hospitals. This allows for streamlined communication with medical staff, facilitating prompt updates and support for guests. The establishment\'s proximity to the hospital eliminates the logistical challenges associated with traveling long distances for medical appointments, providing significant convenience and peace of mind to patients and their families. This integration specifically addresses the needs of the local market, where access to quality healthcare is paramount and logistical support can significantly impact the patient experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is at the forefront of Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur\'s operational philosophy. The staff is trained to be empathetic, attentive, and responsive to the unique needs of guests, many of whom are navigating stressful healthcare situations. This commitment to compassionate service sets the establishment apart. Beyond the standard hotel courtesies, the team goes the extra mile to provide emotional support and practical assistance. This might include arranging special dietary requirements, assisting with communication with medical professionals, or simply offering a listening ear. The business fosters a strong connection with the local community through its partnerships with GNRC Hospitals and other local businesses. It actively participates in community events and initiatives, contributing to the overall well-being of the area. By creating a welcoming and supportive environment, Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur not only serves its guests but also strengthens its ties with the local community, building trust and goodwill.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur is one of sustainable growth and enhanced service offerings. The business plans to expand its accommodation capacity to meet the increasing demand for its services. Future development includes the potential addition of specialized facilities tailored to the needs of specific patient groups, such as those undergoing rehabilitation or requiring long-term care support. The organization also envisions strengthening its integration with GNRC Hospitals, potentially offering bundled packages that combine accommodation, medical services, and transportation. The long-term goal is to establish Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur as the premier accommodation provider for patients and their families seeking quality medical care in Guwahati and to become a model for integrated healthcare and hospitality services in the region. By continuously improving its services and expanding its reach, Collection O GNRC Hospital Dispur aims to contribute significantly to the growth of the healthcare industry in Assam and to enhance the overall well-being of the community.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:50:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1190, 'Hotel Sunview', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Hotel Sunview stands as a beacon of hospitality in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, offering a blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese warmth. Strategically located for easy access to key transportation hubs and local attractions, Hotel Sunview caters to a diverse clientele, from business travelers seeking seamless connectivity to tourists eager to explore the rich cultural tapestry of the region. In a market characterized by a mix of budget accommodations and luxury resorts, Hotel Sunview distinguishes itself by providing high-quality service and amenities at a competitive price point, filling a crucial niche in Guwahati\'s hospitality sector. Its commitment to sustainable practices and community engagement further solidifies its position as a responsible and integral part of the local business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Hotel Sunview\'s offerings are its meticulously designed and well-appointed guest rooms. Ranging from comfortable standard rooms to spacious suites, each accommodation is equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen televisions, and climate control systems. Beyond accommodation, Hotel Sunview provides a comprehensive range of services to enhance the guest experience. These include a multi-cuisine restaurant serving delectable regional and international dishes, a well-stocked bar offering a relaxing ambiance, and a fully equipped conference hall ideal for corporate events and meetings. A travel desk assists guests in planning excursions to nearby attractions such as the Kamakhya Temple and the Brahmaputra River cruise, ensuring a memorable Assam experience. What truly sets Hotel Sunview apart is its personalized service and attention to detail. The hotel meticulously crafts special packages tailored to specific needs, whether it\'s a romantic getaway, a family vacation, or a corporate retreat. This proactive approach ensures that every guest receives a bespoke experience, exceeding expectations and fostering loyalty. The hotel addresses local market needs by providing transportation assistance, local language support and information on nearby cultural events, making it easier for tourists to immerse themselves in the Assamese culture.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Hotel Sunview prioritizes creating a memorable and positive customer experience, understanding that hospitality extends beyond just providing a room. The hotel\'s staff is meticulously trained not only in operational efficiency but also in empathy and cultural sensitivity. They are empowered to go the extra mile to anticipate guest needs and address any concerns promptly and efficiently. The hotel actively solicits feedback through online surveys and direct interactions, using this input to continuously improve its services and offerings. Hotel Sunview is deeply connected with the local community. The hotel actively participates in local festivals and events, showcasing Assamese culture and traditions. The hotel sources locally produced ingredients for its restaurant, supporting local farmers and businesses. Furthermore, Hotel Sunview engages in various social responsibility initiatives, such as partnering with local NGOs to support education and environmental conservation. This commitment to community well-being not only enhances the hotel\'s reputation but also fosters a sense of pride and belonging among its staff and guests. By embracing the spirit of \'Atithi Devo Bhava\' (the guest is God), Hotel Sunview aims to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and respected.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Hotel Sunview envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in the Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. The hotel plans to expand its accommodation capacity to meet the growing demand from both domestic and international tourists. The hotel is also exploring the possibility of adding new amenities such as a spa and wellness center to cater to the increasing demand for wellness tourism. Another key area of focus is strengthening its online presence and leveraging digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience. Hotel Sunview is actively investing in staff training and development programs to enhance service standards and build a highly skilled workforce. In the long term, Hotel Sunview aspires to be a model for sustainable tourism in the region, adopting eco-friendly practices and promoting responsible travel. The hotel intends to collaborate with local communities to develop eco-tourism initiatives that benefit both the environment and the local economy. By staying true to its core values of integrity, excellence, and community, Hotel Sunview is confident in its ability to achieve its ambitious goals and contribute to the growth and prosperity of Guwahati and the surrounding region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 06:55:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
