(1225, 'Hotel Royal Palace', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Hotel Royal Palace stands as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati, offering a blend of traditional Assamese hospitality and modern amenities. Situated in a prime location within the city, the hotel caters to a diverse clientele, ranging from business travelers and tourists exploring the Northeast to locals seeking a refined dining or event venue. More than just a place to stay, Hotel Royal Palace aims to be a cultural touchstone, reflecting the spirit and heritage of Assam while providing world-class service.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The hotel differentiates itself by integrating elements of Assamese art and architecture into its design. This isn\'t simply a superficial aesthetic choice; it\'s a deliberate effort to provide guests with an immersive experience of the region\'s rich cultural tapestry. From locally sourced artwork adorning the walls to the use of traditional materials in the construction, Hotel Royal Palace strives to be a reflection of its surroundings, contributing to Guwahati\'s unique identity.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Hotel Royal Palace\'s core services center around providing comfortable and convenient accommodation. We offer a variety of rooms and suites, each designed with meticulous attention to detail. Beyond standard amenities, guests can expect premium bedding, high-speed internet access, and personalized concierge services. What truly sets our rooms apart is the incorporation of subtle Assamese motifs and textiles, creating a distinctive ambiance that resonates with the local culture. We provide a genuine taste of the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our dining options are equally diverse, ranging from casual cafes to a fine-dining restaurant specializing in both international cuisine and authentic Assamese dishes. The restaurant prides itself on using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring the freshest, most flavorful meals. A key selling point is our commitment to showcasing the unique flavors of Assam, offering guests a culinary journey through the region\'s diverse gastronomic landscape.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Furthermore, Hotel Royal Palace features state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, making it an ideal venue for business meetings, conferences, weddings, and other special events. These spaces are equipped with the latest technology and supported by a dedicated events team, ensuring seamless and successful gatherings. The ability to host large-scale events while simultaneously offering personalized service positions Hotel Royal Palace as a preferred choice for both corporate and private clients in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Hotel Royal Palace, customer experience is paramount. Our approach is rooted in a deep understanding of Assamese hospitality, characterized by warmth, respect, and a genuine desire to cater to each guest\'s individual needs. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel valued and appreciated. From the moment they arrive until their departure, we aim to exceed their expectations with personalized service and attention to detail.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. This includes partnering with local artisans and businesses to showcase their products and services within the hotel, supporting local cultural events, and participating in community outreach programs. By fostering strong relationships with our neighbors, we aim to contribute to the well-being and prosperity of Guwahati, embedding ourselves as an integral part of the city\'s social fabric. Our team is largely recruited from the local population, ensuring that we not only contribute to local employment, but that we also understand and meet the expectations of the surrounding community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Royal Palace envisions becoming the premier hospitality destination in Guwahati and the wider Northeast region. Our future plans include expanding our services to cater to a wider range of travelers, enhancing our sustainability efforts, and further integrating technology to improve the guest experience. This involves exploring opportunities for eco-friendly practices throughout the hotel\'s operations, minimizing our environmental impact and promoting responsible tourism.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing Hotel Royal Palace as a brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and exceptional service. We aspire to be more than just a hotel; we want to be a cultural hub, a place where guests can experience the true essence of Assam. We also aim to be a leader in promoting sustainable tourism practices in the region, inspiring other businesses to adopt environmentally responsible approaches. Through continuous innovation and a steadfast commitment to excellence, Hotel Royal Palace is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of Guwahati\'s hospitality landscape.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Hotel Royal Palace is dedicated to continual improvement and adaptation to the evolving needs of the market. This involves regularly seeking feedback from our guests and employees, conducting market research to identify emerging trends, and investing in training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of the hospitality industry. By staying agile and responsive, we are confident in our ability to maintain our position as a leading hotel in Guwahati and to achieve our ambitious growth objectives.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:30:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1226, 'Hotel Kamrupa Private Limited', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Hotel Kamrupa Private Limited: A Gateway to Assam\'s Hospitality</p>\n\n<p>Hotel Kamrupa Private Limited stands as a prominent player in Guwahati\'s burgeoning hospitality sector, offering a refined blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese warmth. Situated in a strategically convenient location within Guwahati, it serves as an ideal base for both business travelers seeking efficient connectivity and leisure tourists eager to explore the rich cultural tapestry and natural beauty of Assam. More than just a place to stay, Hotel Kamrupa strives to be an integral part of the Assam experience, reflecting the region\'s values of hospitality and cultural heritage. The hotel\'s commitment to providing personalized service and a genuine Assamese ambience distinguishes it within the competitive landscape. Its presence contributes significantly to the local economy by providing employment opportunities and supporting local businesses through procurement and collaborations.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Hotel Kamrupa\'s offerings lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its clientele. The hotel provides a range of accommodation options, from well-appointed standard rooms to spacious suites, each designed with a focus on comfort, functionality, and aesthetic appeal. Key amenities include complimentary high-speed internet access, in-room entertainment systems, and comfortable workstations, ensuring a productive and relaxing stay for all guests. The culinary experience at Hotel Kamrupa is equally impressive, featuring an in-house restaurant that showcases authentic Assamese cuisine alongside popular Indian and international dishes. The use of locally sourced ingredients ensures freshness and supports local farmers and suppliers. Beyond accommodation and dining, the hotel offers state-of-the-art conferencing and banqueting facilities, making it a preferred venue for corporate events, seminars, and social gatherings. These facilities are equipped with modern audio-visual technology and supported by a dedicated events team, ensuring seamless and successful events. What truly sets Hotel Kamrupa apart is its commitment to providing personalized experiences. This includes offering customized tour packages to explore Assam\'s attractions, arranging cultural performances for guests, and providing insights into local traditions and customs. This personalized approach caters specifically to the growing demand for experiential travel and a deeper connection with the local culture.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Hotel Kamrupa prioritizes delivering an exceptional customer experience that goes beyond mere transactional interactions. The hotel fosters a culture of genuine care and attentiveness among its staff, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. Regular training programs are conducted to equip staff with the skills and knowledge to anticipate guest needs and provide proactive assistance. This emphasis on service excellence is reflected in consistently positive guest reviews and a high rate of repeat business. To further enhance the guest experience, Hotel Kamrupa actively engages with the local community. The hotel partners with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their products in the hotel lobby, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. The hotel also supports local charities and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility. Moreover, Hotel Kamrupa organizes cultural events and festivals that celebrate Assam\'s rich heritage, inviting both guests and local residents to participate. This approach fosters a sense of community and strengthens the hotel\'s connection with the local culture. By creating a welcoming and inclusive environment, Hotel Kamrupa aims to be more than just a hotel; it strives to be a hub for cultural exchange and a contributor to the local community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Kamrupa Private Limited envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. The immediate focus is on enhancing existing facilities and services to meet evolving customer expectations. This includes upgrading rooms with smart technology, expanding the restaurant\'s menu to include more regional specialties, and investing in more sustainable practices to minimize the hotel\'s environmental footprint. Longer-term plans involve exploring opportunities for expansion into other strategic locations within Assam and the Northeast region. This expansion will be guided by a commitment to maintaining the same high standards of quality and service that have defined Hotel Kamrupa\'s success. Furthermore, Hotel Kamrupa aims to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience and streamline operations. This includes implementing a mobile app for check-in, room service, and concierge services, as well as utilizing data analytics to personalize guest interactions and improve operational efficiency. Ultimately, Hotel Kamrupa strives to be recognized not only as a leading hotel but also as a responsible corporate citizen, contributing to the economic and social development of Assam. The long-term vision is to create a legacy of excellence in hospitality while preserving and promoting the unique cultural heritage of the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:30:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1227, 'Hotel The Imperia', 'Hotels', '', 'Hotel The Imperia stands as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati, Assam, offering a premium hospitality experience tailored to both discerning business travelers and leisure seekers exploring the vibrant culture and natural beauty of Northeast India. More than just a place to stay, The Imperia aims to be a destination in itself, embodying the region\'s warm hospitality while providing modern amenities and unparalleled service. Situated strategically within Guwahati, the hotel provides easy access to key business hubs, transportation links, and popular tourist attractions, making it a pivotal player in supporting the region\'s growing tourism and business sectors. The Imperia distinguishes itself through its commitment to blending global standards of luxury with the unique cultural essence of Assam, creating a memorable and authentic experience for every guest.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe Imperia\'s core offerings center around providing exceptional accommodation, dining, and event spaces. Guests can choose from a variety of elegantly appointed rooms and suites, each meticulously designed to provide comfort, convenience, and a sense of sophisticated relaxation. Every room features modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and well-equipped workspaces, catering to the needs of both business and leisure travelers. Beyond accommodation, The Imperia boasts diverse dining options to tantalize every palate. The hotel\'s signature restaurant showcases authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients and presented with contemporary flair. An additional restaurant offers a curated selection of international dishes. Furthermore, a cozy café and a vibrant bar provide ideal settings for casual meetings or relaxed evenings. The Imperia also features state-of-the-art event facilities, including spacious banquet halls and well-equipped meeting rooms, making it a premier venue for conferences, weddings, and other special occasions. These spaces are complemented by professional event planning services, ensuring seamless and successful events. What truly sets The Imperia apart is its dedication to providing personalized service and creating unique experiences, such as curated tours of local attractions, cultural performances, and culinary workshops.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Hotel The Imperia, the guest experience is paramount. The hotel\'s philosophy revolves around anticipating and exceeding guest expectations, creating a welcoming and memorable stay for every individual. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with genuine warmth and attentive service. The Imperia\'s staff is meticulously trained to provide personalized attention, catering to individual needs and preferences. Beyond its exceptional service, The Imperia actively engages with the local community. The hotel sources its ingredients and products locally whenever possible, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable practices. It also partners with local artisans and cultural organizations to showcase the rich heritage of Assam through curated events and exhibitions. The Imperia further fosters a sense of community by actively participating in local initiatives and charitable programs, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility. Customer feedback is highly valued and used to continually improve services and offerings. The hotel actively solicits guest reviews and uses this feedback to refine its operations and enhance the overall guest experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Hotel The Imperia envisions becoming the leading luxury hotel in Guwahati and a symbol of hospitality excellence in Northeast India. Future plans include expanding its accommodation offerings, adding new amenities such as a spa and wellness center, and further diversifying its dining options. The hotel also aims to enhance its event facilities and services to cater to a wider range of events and conferences. Recognizing the growing importance of sustainable tourism, The Imperia is committed to implementing eco-friendly practices throughout its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and promoting responsible tourism. This includes initiatives such as reducing energy consumption, conserving water, and minimizing waste. Furthermore, The Imperia plans to strengthen its ties with the local community by expanding its support for local businesses and cultural organizations. The hotel envisions itself as a catalyst for economic growth and cultural preservation in the region. Ultimately, Hotel The Imperia strives to be more than just a hotel; it aspires to be a destination that embodies the spirit of Assam, offering guests an unforgettable experience that combines luxury, culture, and genuine hospitality.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:30:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1228, 'Alpine inn', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Alpine Inn, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a tranquil retreat amidst the bustling city. We provide a unique blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality, catering to both leisure and business travelers seeking a distinctive and memorable experience. Alpine Inn stands out as a locally owned and operated establishment committed to showcasing the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam. We distinguish ourselves through personalized service, meticulously designed accommodations, and a dedication to sustainable practices, contributing positively to the local economy and environment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a range of accommodation options, from elegantly appointed standard rooms to spacious suites designed for extended stays. Each room is thoughtfully furnished with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable bedding, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay. Beyond accommodation, Alpine Inn features a curated dining experience at our in-house restaurant, \"The Brahmaputra Grill,\" which specializes in authentic Assamese cuisine alongside popular international dishes. We source fresh, local ingredients whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers. Furthermore, we offer comprehensive event planning and catering services, ideal for hosting conferences, weddings, and other special occasions. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to providing an immersive cultural experience. We organize guided tours to nearby tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, and historical sites, allowing guests to explore the wonders of Assam firsthand. This approach directly addresses the growing demand for experiential travel, offering visitors a deeper connection with the region and its people.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Alpine Inn, we prioritize creating a welcoming and personalized customer experience. Our highly trained staff is dedicated to anticipating and exceeding guest expectations, providing attentive and efficient service at every touchpoint. We believe in building genuine relationships with our guests, fostering a sense of belonging and making them feel like valued members of the Alpine Inn family. To enhance the guest experience, we offer complimentary airport transfers, a 24-hour concierge service, and a well-equipped fitness center. What truly sets us apart is our active engagement with the local community. We collaborate with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their work in our hotel, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. We also actively participate in local initiatives and charitable events, demonstrating our commitment to giving back to the community that supports us. We regularly host cultural performances and workshops, providing guests with opportunities to learn about Assamese music, dance, and art forms. By fostering these connections, we aim to create a positive impact on the local community while enriching the overall guest experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Alpine Inn envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and cultural preservation. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, including families and larger groups. We are exploring the possibility of adding a spa and wellness center to enhance our guests\' relaxation and rejuvenation experience. Furthermore, we plan to invest in renewable energy sources and implement eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental footprint. We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations, creating a more sustainable and inclusive tourism ecosystem. Specifically, we are exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism packages that promote responsible travel and conservation efforts in the region. We believe that by focusing on sustainable growth, cultural preservation, and exceptional customer service, Alpine Inn can achieve its full potential and contribute to the economic and social development of Guwahati and the surrounding region. We are committed to adapting to evolving market trends and embracing innovation to remain competitive and relevant in the ever-changing hospitality landscape.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:30:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1229, 'OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels', 'Hotels', '', 'OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels, strategically located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a distinctive hospitality experience that caters to the needs of the modern traveler. More than just a hotel, OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels represents a smart, stylish, and efficient accommodation solution designed to enhance the travel experience for both business and leisure guests. In Guwahati, a city experiencing rapid commercial growth and increasing tourist traffic, OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels fills a crucial niche by providing premium amenities and personalized service at an accessible price point. It aims to redefine the standard for comfortable and convenient stays within the city.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe core service offering of OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels revolves around providing meticulously designed rooms that are equipped with modern amenities. These include high-speed Wi-Fi, comfortable bedding, air conditioning, flat-screen televisions, and spotless bathrooms. Going beyond the basics, the hotel offers value-added services such as complimentary breakfast, 24/7 customer support, and efficient laundry services. A key unique selling point is the focus on consistency and quality, ensuring that guests receive a reliably high standard of service regardless of the specific room or floor they occupy. This consistency, coupled with the convenience of online booking and flexible check-in/check-out options, significantly enhances the guest experience. Recognizing the local market needs, the hotel also provides curated travel assistance, helping guests navigate Guwahati\'s attractions, restaurants, and transportation options. Understanding the importance of connectivity for business travelers, the hotel offers dedicated workspaces within rooms and common areas, ensuring a productive stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the forefront of OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels\' operations. The hotel prioritizes personalized service, with staff trained to anticipate and respond to individual guest needs. A welcoming atmosphere is cultivated through attentive and proactive service, creating a sense of warmth and hospitality. To foster a stronger connection with the local community, the hotel sources local produce and incorporates regional elements into the dining experience, allowing guests to immerse themselves in the Assamese culture. Furthermore, the hotel actively participates in local initiatives and supports community events, demonstrating a commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen. Feedback mechanisms are in place to continuously monitor and improve the guest experience, ensuring that the hotel remains responsive to evolving customer preferences. The hotel regularly collects guest reviews and actively uses them to inform staff training and adjust service protocols.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels in Guwahati is centered on sustainable growth and enhanced service offerings. Plans include expanding the hotel\'s capacity to accommodate increasing demand while maintaining the high standards of quality that define the brand. Further, the hotel aims to introduce new services that cater to the evolving needs of travelers, such as curated local experiences and partnerships with local businesses to promote tourism. A long-term goal is to establish OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels as a leading accommodation provider in Guwahati, recognized for its commitment to customer satisfaction, community engagement, and sustainable business practices. Exploring opportunities to integrate technology further into the guest experience is also a priority, including the potential for mobile check-in, personalized room controls, and enhanced communication channels. By consistently delivering exceptional value and adapting to market trends, OYO Townhouse 384 N.K Hotels is poised for continued success and significant contributions to the Guwahati hospitality landscape.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:30:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1230, 'The Residency Tourist Resort', 'Hotels', '', '<p><b>The Residency Tourist Resort: A Gateway to Assam\'s Hospitality</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Residency Tourist Resort stands as a beacon of refined hospitality in Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese charm. Situated strategically in the heart of the city, The Residency is more than just a place to stay; it\'s an experience designed to immerse guests in the rich culture and natural beauty of the region. In a local business landscape increasingly focused on experiential tourism, The Residency distinguishes itself by prioritizing personalized service, authentic regional experiences, and a commitment to sustainable practices, making it a significant contributor to Assam\'s thriving tourism sector.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Comfort and Culture</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of The Residency\'s offerings are its elegantly appointed rooms and suites. Each space is thoughtfully designed to provide maximum comfort and convenience, featuring modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and luxurious bedding. Beyond accommodation, The Residency offers a range of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of its guests.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our signature restaurant, \"Kaziranga Kitchen,\" is a culinary journey through the flavors of Assam. We emphasize locally sourced ingredients, showcasing traditional dishes like *Masor Tenga* and *Pitha* alongside international favorites. We are mindful of dietary needs and offer vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options to cater to a wide array of palates.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Residency also provides comprehensive event management services, catering to corporate conferences, weddings, and private celebrations. Our versatile event spaces can be customized to suit any occasion, and our experienced team ensures seamless execution from planning to completion. We also offer curated tours of Guwahati and surrounding areas, allowing guests to explore Assam\'s rich cultural heritage, visit tea gardens, and experience the breathtaking beauty of the Brahmaputra River.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>One of The Residency\'s unique selling points is its dedication to sustainable tourism. We actively promote eco-friendly practices, such as water conservation, waste reduction, and energy efficiency. We partner with local artisans and businesses to showcase Assamese handicrafts and promote economic empowerment within the community. This commitment resonates strongly with environmentally conscious travelers and adds value to the overall guest experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our services effectively meet the local market needs by addressing the growing demand for high-quality accommodation, authentic cultural experiences, and sustainable tourism options. We cater to both domestic and international travelers seeking a comfortable and immersive stay in Assam. By prioritizing local sourcing and promoting regional culture, The Residency contributes to the economic growth and cultural preservation of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Customer Experience: A Personal Touch of Assamese Hospitality</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Residency Tourist Resort, exceptional customer service is paramount. Our highly trained staff are dedicated to providing personalized attention to each guest, ensuring a comfortable and memorable stay. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality and attentive service. We go the extra mile to anticipate their needs and exceed their expectations. We encourage feedback and actively use it to improve our services and enhance the guest experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets The Residency apart is its authentic connection to the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of the community. We collaborate with local schools and organizations to promote education and cultural awareness. By engaging with the community, The Residency creates a welcoming and inclusive environment for both guests and residents.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We aim to create a \"home away from home\" atmosphere, where guests feel valued, respected, and connected to the local culture. Our commitment to personalized service and community engagement distinguishes The Residency from other hotels in the region and creates a loyal customer base.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Deepening Roots</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Residency Tourist Resort envisions becoming a leading destination for sustainable and culturally immersive tourism in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation capacity, adding new amenities such as a spa and wellness center, and developing new tour packages that showcase the diverse attractions of Assam and neighboring states. We aim to strengthen our commitment to sustainable practices by implementing more eco-friendly initiatives and supporting local communities.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience. We will invest in mobile apps and online platforms to streamline booking processes, provide personalized recommendations, and facilitate communication with guests. Our long-term goals include establishing The Residency as a model for responsible tourism in the region and creating a positive impact on the environment, economy, and culture of Assam. We will continue to innovate and adapt to meet the evolving needs of our guests and the changing dynamics of the tourism industry.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:35:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1231, 'Mayur Hotel', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Mayur Hotel: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Tradition in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Mayur Hotel stands as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati, offering a harmonious blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. Strategically located, it serves as an ideal base for both business travelers and leisure seekers exploring the vibrant city and its surrounding natural beauty. More than just a place to stay, Mayur Hotel is an experience, deeply rooted in the local culture and dedicated to providing exceptional service that resonates with the spirit of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Recognizing the increasing demand for quality accommodation and personalized experiences, Mayur Hotel aims to be a premier hospitality provider in the region. It differentiates itself by focusing on authentic cultural integration, showcasing local artistry and cuisine, and offering a level of personalized attention often absent in larger, more impersonal establishments. This commitment to local authenticity not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the preservation and promotion of Assamese heritage.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Core Services and Products</p>\n\n<p>At its core, Mayur Hotel offers a range of meticulously designed services tailored to meet the diverse needs of its clientele. These include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Luxurious Accommodation:</b> A selection of well-appointed rooms and suites, each designed with comfort and functionality in mind. Rooms feature modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and comfortable work spaces, ensuring a productive and relaxing stay.</li>\n<li><b>Exquisite Dining Experiences:</b> The hotel boasts an in-house restaurant that celebrates the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Guests can savor authentic Assamese dishes prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, alongside a selection of Indian and international cuisine. Special dietary requirements and preferences are readily accommodated.</li>\n<li><b>Event and Conference Facilities:</b> Mayur Hotel provides versatile event spaces suitable for hosting conferences, seminars, weddings, and social gatherings. Equipped with state-of-the-art audio-visual technology and supported by a dedicated events team, the hotel ensures seamless and successful events of any scale.</li>\n<li><b>Personalized Concierge Services:</b> The hotel\'s concierge team is dedicated to providing exceptional assistance to guests, offering services such as travel arrangements, tour bookings, and local recommendations. Their in-depth knowledge of Guwahati and the surrounding region allows them to curate personalized itineraries and experiences that cater to individual interests.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What truly sets Mayur Hotel apart is its unwavering commitment to providing a personalized and culturally immersive experience. The hotel actively promotes local artisans and craftsmen, showcasing their work within the hotel premises and offering guests opportunities to purchase unique, handcrafted souvenirs. The restaurant also hosts occasional culinary events that highlight regional specialties and traditional cooking methods.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Understanding the local market needs, Mayur Hotel also caters to the specific requirements of business travelers, providing efficient and reliable services that facilitate productivity. This includes business center access, high-speed internet throughout the property, and flexible meeting spaces. Simultaneously, the hotel offers leisure travelers a comfortable and convenient base from which to explore the cultural and natural attractions of Guwahati and the surrounding region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer Experience</p>\n\n<p>At Mayur Hotel, the customer is at the heart of everything. The hotel\'s approach to customer service is rooted in the traditional Assamese concept of \"Atithi Devo Bhava\" – treating the guest as God. This philosophy is reflected in the warm and welcoming atmosphere, the attentive service provided by the staff, and the genuine desire to exceed guest expectations.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The hotel stands out by creating a personalized and memorable experience for each guest. From the moment they arrive, guests are greeted with a warm smile and a genuine interest in their needs and preferences. The staff are trained to anticipate guest requirements and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable stay. Special requests are handled with utmost care and attention to detail, reflecting the hotel\'s commitment to providing exceptional service.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Mayur Hotel actively connects with the local community through various initiatives, including supporting local businesses, participating in community events, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. The hotel also employs local residents, providing employment opportunities and contributing to the economic development of the region. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, Mayur Hotel enhances its reputation as a responsible and socially conscious business.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Future Vision</p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Mayur Hotel envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. The hotel plans to further enhance its offerings by incorporating innovative technologies and sustainable practices, ensuring a seamless and environmentally responsible guest experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Future plans include exploring opportunities to expand the hotel\'s capacity and amenities, potentially adding new room categories, recreational facilities, and dining options. The hotel also aims to strengthen its partnerships with local businesses and tourism operators, creating unique and immersive experiences for guests. Furthermore, Mayur Hotel is committed to investing in the training and development of its staff, ensuring that they continue to provide exceptional service and maintain the highest standards of hospitality.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ultimately, Mayur Hotel\'s long-term goal is to become synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality. By continuously striving to exceed guest expectations, embracing sustainable practices, and contributing to the local community, Mayur Hotel aims to create a lasting positive impact on the region and establish itself as a true landmark in Guwahati\'s hospitality landscape.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:35:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1232, 'Hotel Empire Regency', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Hotel Empire Regency: A Guwahati Landmark in Hospitality</p>\n\n<p>Hotel Empire Regency stands as a beacon of sophisticated hospitality in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a blend of modern luxury and traditional Assamese warmth. Strategically located to provide easy access to key commercial and tourist destinations, the hotel caters to both business and leisure travelers seeking a comfortable and memorable stay. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning business sector, Hotel Empire Regency distinguishes itself through its commitment to exceptional service, locally inspired experiences, and a dedication to fostering strong ties with the community. We aim to be more than just a hotel; we aspire to be an integral part of the Guwahati experience, a place where guests feel welcomed, valued, and connected to the spirit of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Exquisite Accommodation and Comprehensive Services</p>\n\n<p>At Hotel Empire Regency, our core offering revolves around providing meticulously crafted accommodation experiences. Our diverse range of rooms, from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, are designed to meet the varying needs of our guests. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed internet access, comfortable bedding, and spacious work areas, ensuring both relaxation and productivity. Beyond accommodation, we offer a comprehensive suite of services to enhance our guests’ stay. Our in-house restaurant, \"The Brahmaputra Grill,\" features a diverse menu showcasing both international cuisine and authentic Assamese delicacies, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. For business travelers, we provide state-of-the-art conference and meeting facilities, complete with audio-visual equipment and dedicated support staff. We also offer laundry services, airport transfers, and a concierge service dedicated to assisting guests with travel arrangements, local sightseeing recommendations, and other personalized requests. What sets us apart is our unwavering focus on personalization. We strive to anticipate our guests’ needs and exceed their expectations, creating a truly memorable experience. The strategic location, coupled with superior amenities and dedicated service, uniquely positions us to serve both the tourist and corporate markets in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Unwavering Commitment to Customer Experience and Community Engagement</p>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do at Hotel Empire Regency. Our approach to customer service is built on principles of attentiveness, empathy, and proactive problem-solving. We invest in comprehensive training programs for our staff to ensure they are equipped to handle any guest request with professionalism and grace. What truly distinguishes us is our commitment to creating a personalized and welcoming atmosphere. We encourage our staff to engage with guests on a personal level, learning their preferences and anticipating their needs. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services. Furthermore, we believe in actively engaging with the local community. We partner with local artisans and businesses to showcase Assamese culture and products within the hotel. We also participate in community initiatives and support local charities, demonstrating our commitment to giving back to the region that has welcomed us. By fostering genuine connections with our guests and actively supporting the local community, we strive to create a hospitality experience that is both enriching and sustainable.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A Vision for Growth and Enduring Excellence</p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Hotel Empire Regency is poised for continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati hospitality market. Our long-term vision is to solidify our position as the premier destination for discerning travelers seeking exceptional service and authentic local experiences. We plan to expand our offerings by adding a wellness center and spa, providing guests with even more opportunities to relax and rejuvenate. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism packages that showcase the natural beauty and biodiversity of Assam. Furthermore, we are committed to leveraging technology to enhance the guest experience, including implementing online check-in and check-out systems and personalized mobile apps. We are also actively exploring sustainable business practices to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the long-term well-being of the community. Our ultimate goal is to create a legacy of excellence in hospitality, one that is defined by unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, community engagement, and sustainable business practices. We aim to be a source of pride for Guwahati, a symbol of Assamese hospitality, and a destination that guests will cherish for years to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:35:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1233, 'The Upper Homes', 'Hotels', '', '<p>The Upper Homes stands as a distinguished name in Guwahati\'s burgeoning real estate sector, offering a comprehensive suite of property solutions tailored to the unique demands and aspirations of Assam\'s residents. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, we are more than just a real estate company; we are partners in helping individuals and families find their ideal living spaces and astute investors discover promising opportunities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Guwahati, as the gateway to Northeast India, presents a dynamic and evolving property market. The Upper Homes is strategically positioned to navigate this landscape, leveraging local expertise and a deep understanding of regional preferences to deliver unparalleled value. We recognize that purchasing or investing in property is a significant decision, and we are committed to providing transparent, reliable, and personalized service throughout the entire process.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core services revolve around facilitating seamless property transactions, encompassing both residential and commercial properties. We specialize in property sales, rentals, and property management, catering to a diverse clientele ranging from first-time homebuyers to seasoned investors. For those looking to purchase, we offer an extensive portfolio of properties, ranging from contemporary apartments in the city center to sprawling villas in tranquil suburban settings. Our team of experienced real estate professionals meticulously vets each property to ensure quality, legality, and long-term value. Renters benefit from our curated selection of well-maintained properties and our commitment to responsive property management. Investors appreciate our insights into market trends and potential growth areas, enabling them to make informed decisions and maximize returns.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>A key differentiator for The Upper Homes is our unwavering focus on ethical practices and transparent dealings. We adhere to the highest standards of integrity, ensuring that all transactions are conducted with fairness and honesty. We also provide comprehensive support throughout the entire process, from initial property search to final closing, guiding our clients through every step with expert advice and assistance. Furthermore, we understand the importance of showcasing properties effectively. We employ cutting-edge marketing techniques, including professional photography, virtual tours, and targeted advertising campaigns, to ensure that our listings reach the widest possible audience. For property management clients, we offer a hassle-free solution, handling all aspects of property maintenance, tenant relations, and financial reporting, allowing them to focus on other priorities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At The Upper Homes, customer experience is paramount. We believe that building strong relationships with our clients is essential for long-term success. We go beyond simply facilitating transactions; we strive to understand our clients\' individual needs and aspirations, offering personalized advice and tailored solutions. Our team is composed of friendly, knowledgeable professionals who are passionate about real estate and committed to providing exceptional service. We actively seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure their complete satisfaction. Beyond our direct client interactions, we actively engage with the local community through participation in local events and initiatives. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and fostering a sense of connection and belonging. We sponsor local sports teams, participate in community clean-up drives, and support local charities, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future for The Upper Homes is bright. We envision expanding our services to encompass property development, creating innovative and sustainable living spaces that meet the evolving needs of the Guwahati community. We are also exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance our services, such as developing a user-friendly mobile app that allows clients to easily search for properties, schedule viewings, and manage their accounts. A long-term goal is to become the leading real estate company in Northeast India, recognized for our integrity, innovation, and commitment to customer satisfaction. We plan to achieve this through strategic partnerships, continuous investment in our team, and a relentless focus on exceeding expectations. We believe that by staying true to our core values and embracing innovation, we can continue to make a positive impact on the lives of our clients and the community we serve.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ultimately, The Upper Homes is dedicated to helping people realize their property dreams in Guwahati and beyond. We are committed to providing exceptional service, building strong relationships, and contributing to the growth and prosperity of the region. We invite you to experience the Upper Homes difference and discover why we are the trusted partner for all your real estate needs.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:35:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
