(1234, 'CLASSIC INN', 'Hotels', '', 'CLASSIC INN, a cornerstone of Guwahati\'s hospitality sector, offers a welcoming haven for travelers and locals alike. Nestled in the heart of Assam’s vibrant capital, our inn stands as a testament to comfortable accommodation and personalized service, blending traditional Assamese hospitality with modern amenities. CLASSIC INN distinguishes itself not just as a place to stay, but as an integral part of the Guwahati experience, providing a relaxing retreat and a convenient base for exploring the region\'s rich cultural heritage and natural beauty. We are more than just a business; we are a friendly face, a reliable service, and a contributing member of the local community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCLASSIC INN specializes in providing comfortable and affordable accommodation options, catering to a diverse clientele ranging from business travelers to tourists seeking an authentic Assamese experience. Our core offering revolves around well-appointed rooms, each designed with guest comfort in mind. Rooms feature essential amenities such as comfortable bedding, private bathrooms with hot and cold water, air conditioning, and complimentary Wi-Fi access. We offer a range of room types, including standard rooms, deluxe rooms, and family suites, ensuring we can accommodate various needs and budgets.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodation, CLASSIC INN offers a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include a 24-hour front desk, laundry service, and travel assistance. Our in-house dining options provide guests with the opportunity to savor both local Assamese cuisine and popular Indian dishes. We take pride in using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and suppliers. A key differentiator for CLASSIC INN is our personalized service, exemplified by our attentive staff who are always ready to assist guests with their needs, from arranging transportation to providing recommendations for local attractions. This focus on personalized service, coupled with our commitment to comfort and affordability, sets us apart from larger, more impersonal hotel chains and addresses the growing demand for value-driven hospitality in Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt CLASSIC INN, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable environment where guests feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide personalized attention and anticipate guest needs. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services. We understand that many of our guests are first-time visitors to Guwahati and Assam, and we go the extra mile to provide them with information and assistance to help them make the most of their trip. This includes offering travel advice, arranging tours, and providing insights into local culture and customs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe also actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We partner with local businesses and organizations to promote tourism and support local artisans and producers. We participate in community events and sponsor local charities. By being an active and engaged member of the Guwahati community, we build goodwill and foster strong relationships with our neighbors. We recognize that our success is intertwined with the success of the community we serve. Our dedication to customer satisfaction, combined with our commitment to the local community, creates a unique and positive experience for our guests, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals. We believe that this is what truly sets CLASSIC INN apart.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, CLASSIC INN is committed to continued growth and expansion, while remaining true to our core values of providing comfortable accommodation, personalized service, and contributing to the local community. Our future plans include expanding our room capacity to meet the increasing demand for accommodation in Guwahati. We are also exploring opportunities to enhance our services, such as adding a fitness center and expanding our in-house dining options.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are committed to embracing sustainable practices in our operations, such as reducing our energy consumption and minimizing waste. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local organizations to promote sustainable tourism. Our long-term goal is to become the leading independent inn in Guwahati, recognized for our commitment to quality, service, and community engagement. We envision CLASSIC INN as a beacon of hospitality, welcoming guests from around the world and showcasing the best of Assam. We are confident that with our dedicated team, our commitment to excellence, and our strong ties to the local community, we can achieve our ambitious goals and contribute to the continued growth and prosperity of Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:35:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1235, 'ADITYA RESIDENCY', 'Hotels', '', '<p>ADITYA RESIDENCY: A Haven of Comfort and Convenience in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, ADITYA RESIDENCY stands as a distinguished establishment offering comfortable accommodation and impeccable service. More than just a place to stay, ADITYA RESIDENCY strives to be a home away from home, providing a seamless blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese hospitality. In the evolving hospitality landscape of Guwahati, ADITYA RESIDENCY distinguishes itself by prioritizing personalized experiences and fostering a genuine connection with its guests, contributing significantly to the region\'s growing reputation as a welcoming destination.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing thoughtfully designed and meticulously maintained rooms and suites. Each space is crafted to ensure optimal comfort and functionality, featuring contemporary décor, comfortable furnishings, and modern conveniences such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and well-appointed bathrooms. We understand the diverse needs of our clientele, ranging from business travelers seeking a productive workspace to leisure tourists exploring the wonders of Assam. Beyond accommodation, ADITYA RESIDENCY provides essential services including laundry, dry cleaning, and reliable room service. A key differentiator is our unwavering commitment to cleanliness and hygiene, ensuring a safe and pleasant environment for every guest. We also offer a curated selection of local experiences, partnering with local artisans and tour operators to provide authentic insights into Assamese culture and heritage, setting us apart from standard hotel offerings.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At ADITYA RESIDENCY, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a memorable stay. Our highly trained and dedicated staff is committed to anticipating and exceeding guest expectations. From the warm welcome at check-in to prompt and efficient assistance throughout their stay, we strive to create a positive and personalized experience for every individual. We proactively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and offerings. Furthermore, ADITYA RESIDENCY actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. We source local produce and ingredients for our restaurant, supporting local farmers and businesses. We also participate in community events and support local charities, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and contributing member of the Guwahati community. Our dedication extends to promoting Assamese culture through showcasing local art and handicrafts within the residency, offering guests a unique glimpse into the region\'s rich heritage.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, ADITYA RESIDENCY envisions becoming a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and the surrounding region. Our strategic growth plans include expanding our accommodation capacity to cater to the increasing demand from both domestic and international travelers. We are also exploring opportunities to introduce new services and amenities, such as a state-of-the-art fitness center, a rooftop lounge with panoramic views of the city, and expanded conference and event facilities. A significant focus will be placed on sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and promoting responsible travel within the region. We intend to partner with eco-tourism organizations and implement energy-efficient technologies to reduce our carbon footprint. Ultimately, ADITYA RESIDENCY aspires to be synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality, contributing to the growth and development of Guwahati as a premier tourist destination.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We are dedicated to continuous improvement and innovation, always seeking new ways to enhance the guest experience and strengthen our position in the market. By staying true to our values of integrity, excellence, and community engagement, ADITYA RESIDENCY is poised for sustained success and continued contribution to the vibrant tapestry of Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:40:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1236, 'Pratistha Lodge', 'Hotels', '', 'Pratistha Lodge: A Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati\n\nPratistha Lodge stands as a welcoming beacon of hospitality in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to stay, it is a carefully curated experience designed to immerse guests in the warmth of Assamese culture while providing modern comfort and convenience. Nestled in a strategic location within Guwahati, Pratistha Lodge offers a serene escape from the bustling city center, making it an ideal choice for both leisure and business travelers seeking an authentic Assamese experience. Its significance lies in its commitment to providing personalized service, promoting local artistry, and contributing to the sustainable growth of the tourism sector in the region. The lodge distinguishes itself through its dedication to preserving and showcasing Assamese heritage, making it a unique and valuable asset to the local business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Pratistha Lodge are its well-appointed accommodations, ranging from cozy standard rooms to spacious suites designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. Each room is thoughtfully decorated with elements of traditional Assamese design, creating an ambiance that is both inviting and culturally enriching. Beyond comfortable lodging, Pratistha Lodge offers a range of services to enhance the guest experience. This includes a multi-cuisine restaurant serving authentic Assamese delicacies alongside popular Indian and continental dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We offer curated experiences, such as guided tours of Guwahati\'s historical sites and cultural landmarks, as well as opportunities to engage with local artisans and learn about traditional crafts. The lodge also provides essential amenities such as complimentary Wi-Fi, laundry services, and airport transfers, ensuring a seamless and hassle-free stay. What sets Pratistha Lodge apart is its focus on creating personalized experiences that cater to the individual needs of each guest. This includes arranging customized itineraries, organizing cultural performances, and providing recommendations for exploring the best of Guwahati and its surrounding areas. By providing such diverse services, Pratistha Lodge caters to a wide range of travelers, from those seeking a relaxing getaway to those on business trips or cultural explorations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Pratistha Lodge. Our approach is rooted in genuine Assamese hospitality, characterized by warmth, respect, and personalized attention. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with a smile and a sincere desire to make their stay memorable. The staff is carefully trained to anticipate guest needs and provide prompt, efficient, and friendly service. We prioritize building relationships with our guests, taking the time to understand their preferences and providing tailored recommendations to enhance their experience. What truly sets Pratistha Lodge apart is its deep connection to the local community. We actively support local artisans and businesses, showcasing their products and services to our guests. We also participate in community initiatives, such as sponsoring local events and supporting environmental conservation efforts. This commitment to social responsibility not only strengthens our ties with the community but also enhances the overall guest experience, allowing them to connect with the heart and soul of Assam. The lodge also actively solicits feedback from guests and uses it to continuously improve its services and offerings. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and fostering strong relationships with the local community, Pratistha Lodge creates a welcoming and enriching environment for all.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nPratistha Lodge envisions a future where it continues to be a leading force in promoting sustainable tourism and preserving Assamese culture. Our long-term goals include expanding our operations to offer even more diverse experiences, such as eco-tourism adventures and wellness retreats that showcase the natural beauty and therapeutic traditions of Assam. We plan to invest in upgrading our facilities and amenities to further enhance the guest experience, while remaining committed to sustainable practices and environmental responsibility. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with other local businesses and organizations to create a network of experiences that showcase the best of Guwahati and its surrounding region. Ultimately, our vision is to establish Pratistha Lodge as a premier destination for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching Assamese experience, while contributing to the economic and social well-being of the local community. We believe that by staying true to our values of hospitality, cultural preservation, and sustainable tourism, we can achieve our goals and create a lasting legacy in the vibrant city of Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:40:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1237, 'Dubori Homestay', 'Hotels', '', 'Dubori Homestay: A Gateway to Authentic Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nDubori Homestay is a welcoming and authentic accommodation nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offering travelers a unique opportunity to experience the rich culture and warm hospitality of Assam. Unlike conventional hotels, Dubori Homestay provides a personalized and immersive experience, allowing guests to connect with the local community and discover the true essence of this vibrant region. Situated conveniently within Guwahati, Dubori Homestay serves as an ideal base for exploring the city\'s attractions and venturing further into the breathtaking landscapes of Assam. We differentiate ourselves through our commitment to providing not just a place to stay, but a genuine cultural immersion, making us a significant contributor to the tourism sector in Guwahati and a champion of sustainable, community-based tourism. <br> <br>\n\nAt Dubori Homestay, we believe in providing a home away from home, where guests can relax, rejuvenate, and create lasting memories.\n\nOur core services revolve around offering comfortable and culturally enriching accommodation. We provide well-appointed rooms, designed with a blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese aesthetics, ensuring a comfortable and authentic stay. Beyond the basics, we offer a range of bespoke experiences designed to immerse guests in the local culture. These include:\n\n*   **Traditional Assamese Cuisine:** Guests can savor authentic Assamese meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. We offer cooking classes, allowing visitors to learn the secrets of Assamese cuisine and recreate these flavors at home.\n*   **Cultural Immersion Activities:** We organize visits to local villages, tea gardens, and craft workshops, providing opportunities to interact with artisans and witness the traditional way of life. We also host cultural performances, showcasing Assamese music, dance, and theater.\n*   **Guided Tours:** Our knowledgeable guides offer personalized tours of Guwahati and its surrounding areas, highlighting historical landmarks, religious sites, and natural wonders. We can arrange treks in the hills and wildlife spotting excursions, allowing guests to explore the diverse landscapes of Assam.\n*   **Personalized Experiences:** Recognizing that every traveler is unique, we tailor our services to meet individual needs and preferences. Whether it\'s arranging transportation, organizing special events, or providing local insights, we go the extra mile to ensure a memorable stay.\n\nOur unique selling point lies in our commitment to providing an authentic and immersive cultural experience. We are not just a place to sleep; we are a gateway to the heart of Assam. We cater to the growing demand for experiential travel, offering visitors a chance to connect with the local community, learn about Assamese culture, and contribute to sustainable tourism. By supporting local artisans and businesses, we contribute to the economic well-being of the community, while simultaneously offering our guests a truly enriching and meaningful travel experience. <br> <br>\n\nCustomer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do at Dubori Homestay. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized experience for each guest, ensuring they feel valued and cared for. Our approach to customer service is built on the principles of warmth, respect, and genuine hospitality. Our staff are trained to be attentive, helpful, and knowledgeable, providing guests with all the information and assistance they need to make the most of their stay.\n\nWe believe in building strong relationships with our guests, treating them as part of our extended family. We encourage interaction and conversation, sharing stories and insights about Assamese culture and traditions. We also actively solicit feedback from our guests, using their suggestions to improve our services and offerings.\n\nBeyond individual guest interactions, we are committed to connecting with the local community. We partner with local artisans, businesses, and organizations to promote Assamese culture and support sustainable tourism. We host events and workshops that bring together guests and locals, fostering cultural exchange and mutual understanding. We also actively participate in community initiatives, contributing to the social and economic well-being of the region. We aim to be more than just a business; we strive to be a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community. <br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Dubori Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Assam. We plan to expand our services and offerings, while staying true to our core values of cultural immersion, community engagement, and exceptional customer service.\n\nOur future plans include:\n\n*   **Expanding Accommodation Options:** We aim to increase the number of rooms available, while maintaining the same level of comfort and authenticity. We are also exploring the possibility of adding eco-friendly accommodation options, such as cottages and tents, allowing guests to experience the natural beauty of Assam in a sustainable way.\n*   **Developing New Cultural Experiences:** We are constantly researching and developing new cultural experiences, showcasing the diverse traditions and heritage of Assam. This includes organizing workshops on traditional crafts, arranging visits to lesser-known cultural sites, and hosting festivals and events that celebrate Assamese culture.\n*   **Strengthening Community Partnerships:** We are committed to strengthening our partnerships with local artisans, businesses, and organizations. We plan to increase our support for local producers, promote sustainable tourism practices, and contribute to the economic well-being of the community.\n*   **Leveraging Technology:** We will leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, providing online booking, virtual tours, and digital guides. We will also use social media to promote our services and engage with our audience, sharing stories and insights about Assamese culture.\n\nOur long-term goal is to establish Dubori Homestay as a model for sustainable and responsible tourism in Assam, demonstrating how tourism can benefit both visitors and the local community. We believe that by providing authentic cultural experiences, fostering community engagement, and prioritizing customer satisfaction, we can create a truly unique and memorable travel experience, while contributing to the preservation and promotion of Assamese culture. We aspire to be recognized not just as a place to stay, but as a gateway to understanding and appreciating the rich heritage and vibrant spirit of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:40:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1238, 'Hotel Rajendra Residency', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Hotel Rajendra Residency stands as a distinguished landmark in Guwahati, Assam, offering a seamless blend of modern comfort and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, it\'s a gateway to experiencing the vibrant culture and natural beauty of the region. Situated strategically in Guwahati, the hotel caters to a diverse clientele, including business travelers, leisure tourists, and local residents seeking a refined hospitality experience. Hotel Rajendra Residency distinguishes itself by providing personalized service, elegantly appointed accommodations, and a commitment to showcasing the rich cultural heritage of Assam, thereby enriching the overall guest experience and contributing positively to the local business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Hotel Rajendra Residency’s core offerings are meticulously designed to meet the diverse needs of its clientele. At the heart of its services are its well-appointed rooms and suites, each designed to provide a relaxing and comfortable environment. These accommodations range from standard rooms ideal for short stays to luxurious suites offering enhanced amenities and spacious layouts. Beyond lodging, the hotel boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant that serves a delectable array of Indian, Continental, and authentic Assamese dishes. This culinary offering aims to provide a taste of the region’s diverse gastronomy, catering to both local and international palates. Conference and banquet facilities are also integral to the hotel’s services, equipped with modern technology and versatile spaces suitable for business meetings, corporate events, weddings, and social gatherings. What sets Hotel Rajendra Residency apart is its dedication to providing customized services, whether it\'s arranging local sightseeing tours, facilitating transportation, or tailoring menus for special events. This personalized approach addresses the specific needs of travelers seeking an authentic and hassle-free experience in Guwahati, while the conference facilities meet the growing demand for professional event spaces in the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Hotel Rajendra Residency, customer experience is paramount, driving every aspect of the business. The hotel\'s approach to customer service is characterized by attentiveness, responsiveness, and a genuine desire to exceed guest expectations. A dedicated team of hospitality professionals is committed to providing personalized attention, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for throughout their stay. From the warm welcome at check-in to the efficient handling of requests and inquiries, the hotel strives to create a seamless and memorable experience. What truly distinguishes Hotel Rajendra Residency is its active engagement with the local community. The hotel sources local products and ingredients whenever possible, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable practices. Furthermore, the hotel actively participates in local festivals and cultural events, showcasing the rich heritage of Assam to its guests. This commitment to community involvement fosters a sense of belonging and demonstrates the hotel’s dedication to being a responsible and valued member of the Guwahati business landscape. The staff is trained to act as informal ambassadors for the region, providing guests with valuable insights into local customs, attractions, and hidden gems, further enhancing their connection with the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Hotel Rajendra Residency envisions a future where it remains a premier destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional hospitality and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. The hotel’s growth potential lies in expanding its offerings and enhancing its facilities to cater to the evolving needs of travelers. Future plans include the addition of a wellness center, featuring a spa and fitness facilities, to provide guests with opportunities for relaxation and rejuvenation. Renovations and upgrades to the existing rooms and suites are also planned to ensure that the hotel maintains its high standards of comfort and elegance. In the long term, Hotel Rajendra Residency aims to become a leading hospitality provider in the Northeast region, exploring opportunities for expansion into other key locations in Assam and neighboring states. This expansion will be guided by the hotel\'s core values of personalized service, community engagement, and a commitment to showcasing the unique culture and heritage of the region. The goal is to not only increase market share but also to contribute to the growth of tourism and the overall economic development of the region, solidifying Hotel Rajendra Residency’s position as a cornerstone of the Guwahati business community and a beacon of Assamese hospitality.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:40:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1239, 'Metro Guest House', 'Hotels', '', 'Metro Guest House, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a tranquil and convenient haven for travelers seeking a comfortable and authentic experience. Unlike larger, more impersonal hotels, Metro Guest House provides a personalized service and a genuine connection to the local culture, making it a notable presence in Guwahati\'s hospitality sector. We understand the diverse needs of our guests, from business travelers requiring seamless connectivity to tourists eager to explore the rich heritage of Assam. Our focus is on providing a seamless blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese hospitality, setting us apart from conventional accommodations in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core service is providing well-appointed and comfortable guest rooms designed to meet the varied needs of our clientele. We offer a range of room types, from standard single rooms for solo travelers to spacious family suites, all meticulously maintained and equipped with modern conveniences such as air conditioning, high-speed internet access, and en-suite bathrooms. Beyond comfortable lodging, we also offer a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include a complimentary breakfast featuring local Assamese delicacies, laundry services, and airport transfer arrangements. What truly distinguishes Metro Guest House is our commitment to providing a personalized concierge service. Our knowledgeable staff are readily available to assist guests with everything from arranging local tours and excursions to providing recommendations on the best restaurants and cultural attractions in Guwahati. We cater to the needs of the market by offering rates that are competitive yet reflect the quality of service and the comfortable environment we provide. Understanding the growing need for seamless business travel, we also offer services tailored for corporate clients, including quiet working spaces and reliable internet connectivity.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Metro Guest House, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in a genuine desire to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere for every guest. From the moment they arrive until their departure, our staff are dedicated to anticipating and exceeding their expectations. We strive to create a personal connection with each guest, remembering their preferences and tailoring our service accordingly. What truly sets us apart is our active involvement in the local community. We source our produce and ingredients from local farmers and artisans, supporting the local economy and ensuring that our guests experience the authentic flavors of Assam. We also partner with local tour operators to offer unique and immersive cultural experiences, allowing our guests to connect with the heritage of the region. Furthermore, we actively participate in local community events and initiatives, fostering a strong sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of Guwahati. We proactively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings, ensuring that we remain responsive to their evolving needs and preferences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Metro Guest House envisions becoming a leading provider of boutique accommodation in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional service, its commitment to local culture, and its sustainable business practices. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation options to cater to a wider range of travelers, potentially adding additional rooms or suites. We also plan to enhance our service offerings by introducing new amenities such as a small fitness center or a rooftop terrace with panoramic views of the city. A key component of our long-term strategy is to further strengthen our ties with the local community. We aim to expand our partnerships with local artisans and businesses, offering guests unique and authentic experiences that showcase the best of Assam. We are also committed to implementing sustainable business practices, reducing our environmental footprint and contributing to the preservation of Guwahati\'s natural beauty. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, such as implementing a mobile app for check-in, concierge services, and local information. Ultimately, our goal is to create a memorable and enriching experience for every guest, solidifying Metro Guest House\'s position as a premier destination in Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:40:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1240, 'V & Q Homestay', 'Hotels', '', '<p>V & Q Homestay offers a comfortable and authentic Assam experience, nestled in the heart of Guwahati. More than just accommodation, V & Q Homestay provides a gateway to understanding the vibrant culture, warm hospitality, and breathtaking landscapes that define this corner of Northeast India. In a region where tourism is steadily growing and visitors seek immersive experiences beyond standard hotels, V & Q Homestay distinguishes itself by offering a personalized and culturally enriching stay that reflects the true spirit of Assam. Our commitment to showcasing local traditions and supporting the community makes us a significant contributor to the evolving tourism landscape of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At V & Q Homestay, our core offering is providing comfortable and thoughtfully designed accommodation that feels like a home away from home. Guests can choose from a range of rooms, each carefully furnished to reflect the local aesthetic while ensuring modern comfort and convenience. This includes comfortable beds, private bathrooms with hot water, air conditioning, and complimentary Wi-Fi. Beyond just providing a place to sleep, we offer curated experiences designed to immerse guests in the local culture. This includes authentic Assamese meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, offering a true taste of the region. We also organize guided tours to nearby attractions, such as the Kamakhya Temple, Umananda Island, and the Assam State Museum, ensuring guests can explore the rich history and natural beauty of Guwahati with knowledgeable local guides.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to creating a personalized and immersive experience. We go beyond the standard tourist offerings, connecting our guests with local artisans, musicians, and chefs, allowing them to engage directly with the community and gain a deeper understanding of Assamese traditions. For example, guests can participate in cooking classes to learn how to prepare traditional Assamese dishes, attend a Bihu dance performance, or visit local markets to discover unique handicrafts. This focus on authentic experiences caters directly to the growing demand from travelers who seek more than just sightseeing; they crave meaningful connections and cultural immersion. By offering a blend of comfort, convenience, and cultural engagement, V & Q Homestay fills a crucial gap in the Guwahati accommodation market, providing an alternative to impersonal hotels and generic tourist experiences.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer service at V & Q Homestay is built on the principles of warmth, attentiveness, and genuine care. We understand that our guests are not just customers but individuals seeking a unique and memorable experience. From the moment they arrive, guests are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality, ensuring they feel welcomed and valued. Our staff is trained to be attentive to their needs, providing personalized recommendations and assistance throughout their stay. We strive to create a relaxed and friendly atmosphere where guests feel comfortable interacting with us and learning about the local culture. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their expectations. Our commitment extends beyond just providing excellent service; we actively participate in local community initiatives, supporting local artisans, promoting sustainable tourism practices, and contributing to the overall well-being of the community. This commitment resonates with guests who value ethical and responsible travel, fostering a sense of connection and loyalty.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our approach to connecting with the local community is multifaceted. We actively partner with local businesses and artisans to promote their products and services to our guests. We also work with local organizations to support community development projects, ensuring that tourism benefits the entire community, not just our business. By integrating ourselves into the local fabric, we create a more authentic and enriching experience for our guests, while also contributing to the sustainable development of Guwahati. For example, we source our produce from local farmers, employ local staff, and promote locally made handicrafts in our gift shop. These initiatives not only support the local economy but also provide our guests with a deeper understanding of Assamese culture and traditions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, V & Q Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation offerings, adding new cultural experiences, and strengthening our ties with the local community. We aim to develop themed rooms that showcase the diverse cultures and traditions of Assam, offering guests a deeper understanding of the region\'s rich heritage. We also plan to introduce new activities such as tea plantation tours, river cruises, and wildlife safaris, showcasing the natural beauty of Assam. Furthermore, we are committed to enhancing our sustainability practices, reducing our environmental footprint, and promoting responsible tourism practices within the community. Our long-term goal is to create a business that not only provides exceptional experiences for our guests but also contributes to the sustainable development of Guwahati and the preservation of its unique culture and environment. We believe that by focusing on quality, authenticity, and sustainability, V & Q Homestay can become a model for responsible tourism in Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:45:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1241, 'Spring Villa Hotel', 'Hotels', '', 'Spring Villa Hotel, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a distinguished hospitality provider offering a blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese charm. More than just a place to stay, Spring Villa Hotel is designed to be an immersive experience, connecting guests with the rich culture and natural beauty of the region. In a city rapidly becoming a hub for trade, tourism, and education in Northeast India, Spring Villa Hotel distinguishes itself by providing personalized service, a commitment to sustainable practices, and a genuine connection to the local community. We are poised to be a leading player in Guwahati’s hospitality sector, catering to both domestic and international travelers seeking an authentic and comfortable stay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core services revolve around providing a premium hospitality experience. This includes a range of well-appointed rooms and suites, each designed with comfort and convenience in mind. From standard rooms ideal for solo travelers or business professionals, to luxurious suites perfect for families or those seeking a more indulgent experience, we cater to diverse needs and budgets. Each room features modern amenities such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and comfortable workspaces. Beyond accommodation, Spring Villa Hotel offers a comprehensive suite of services: a multi-cuisine restaurant serving both local Assamese delicacies and international fare, a well-equipped fitness center, and banquet and conference facilities capable of hosting a variety of events, from corporate meetings to private celebrations. A unique selling point is our focus on showcasing Assamese culture through our restaurant\'s menu, the locally sourced artwork adorning our walls, and the traditional Assamese textiles incorporated into our interior design. This immersion distinguishes us from generic hotel chains and resonates strongly with travelers seeking authentic experiences. Our location in Guwahati provides easy access to key attractions, business districts, and transportation hubs, making us an ideal base for exploring the city and the wider region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Spring Villa Hotel, customer experience is paramount. We believe that exceptional service is not just about efficiency, but also about creating genuine connections with our guests. Our staff are carefully selected and trained to anticipate needs, offer personalized recommendations, and provide a warm and welcoming atmosphere. We actively solicit feedback to continually improve our services and ensure that every guest has a memorable stay. Our commitment to the local community is integral to our business philosophy. We actively support local artisans and businesses by sourcing products and services locally, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. We participate in community initiatives, such as supporting local schools and environmental conservation efforts. This active engagement fosters goodwill and reinforces our position as a responsible and valued member of the Guwahati community. We aim to be more than just a hotel; we aspire to be a gateway for our guests to experience the authentic spirit of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Spring Villa Hotel envisions significant growth and expansion. We plan to further enhance our facilities and services to meet the evolving needs of our guests. This includes exploring opportunities to add more rooms, expand our restaurant offerings, and develop new recreational facilities. A key strategic goal is to enhance our sustainability efforts. We are committed to reducing our environmental footprint by implementing eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, from energy conservation to waste reduction. We aim to become a leader in sustainable tourism in the region. We are also exploring partnerships with local tour operators to offer curated experiences that showcase the natural beauty and cultural richness of Assam. Long-term, we aspire to establish Spring Villa Hotel as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and responsible tourism. We believe that by consistently delivering exceptional experiences and contributing to the well-being of the local community, we can achieve sustainable growth and solidify our position as a premier hospitality destination in Guwahati and beyond.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:45:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1242, 'Hotel Divine View', 'Hotels', '', '<p>Hotel Divine View: Where Comfort Meets the Majesty of Guwahati</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Hotel Divine View offers a sanctuary of comfort and unparalleled hospitality. More than just a place to stay, it’s an experience designed to immerse guests in the vibrant culture and scenic beauty of the region. Strategically located to provide easy access to key business and leisure destinations, Hotel Divine View distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, breathtaking views, and a dedication to showcasing the best of Assamese hospitality. In a city brimming with accommodation options, Hotel Divine View stands as a beacon of refined elegance and genuine care, contributing significantly to the burgeoning tourism and business travel sectors of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing a seamless and memorable stay for every guest. This encompasses a range of meticulously curated services and amenities, designed to cater to the diverse needs of both leisure and business travelers. The hotel boasts exquisitely appointed rooms and suites, each offering panoramic views of the surrounding landscape. Guests can choose from a variety of room configurations, all equipped with modern conveniences such as high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and luxurious bedding. Beyond accommodation, Hotel Divine View provides a comprehensive suite of services including:</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Gourmet Dining:</b> Our in-house restaurant features a diverse menu encompassing both international cuisine and authentic Assamese delicacies, prepared with locally sourced ingredients. This allows guests to savor the unique flavors of Assam without leaving the comfort of the hotel. Special dietary requirements and private dining requests are readily accommodated.</li>\n<li><b>Event Facilities:</b> Hotel Divine View offers state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, perfect for hosting corporate events, weddings, and social gatherings. Our dedicated event planning team ensures that every detail is flawlessly executed, from audiovisual equipment to catering services.</li>\n<li><b>Wellness and Recreation:</b> Guests can unwind and rejuvenate at our well-equipped fitness center or indulge in a relaxing treatment at our spa. We also offer concierge services to assist with travel arrangements, sightseeing tours, and local recommendations.</li>\n<li><b>Travel Assistance:</b> Understanding the needs of travelers, we offer comprehensive travel assistance. This includes airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours to explore the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets Hotel Divine View apart is its unwavering commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience. We believe that hospitality is more than just providing a service; it\'s about creating a personal connection with our guests. Our staff is meticulously trained to anticipate needs, exceed expectations, and create a welcoming atmosphere that makes every guest feel valued and cared for. We strive to foster a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events and supporting local businesses. We showcase Assamese art and crafts throughout the hotel, providing a platform for local artisans to display their talent and connect with a wider audience. We are committed to sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the community. Guest feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our customers. The goal is to make every stay memorable, not just comfortable.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, Hotel Divine View envisions becoming a leading destination for discerning travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience in Guwahati. Our strategic growth plans include expanding our accommodation capacity, adding new amenities, and further enhancing our service offerings. We are actively exploring opportunities to collaborate with local tourism partners to promote Assam as a premier travel destination. We plan to invest in technology to streamline operations, enhance the guest experience, and improve our environmental sustainability. The long-term vision is to establish Hotel Divine View as a brand synonymous with excellence, innovation, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, not just in Guwahati but across the region. We aim to be recognized as a responsible corporate citizen, contributing to the economic and social well-being of the local community. Ultimately, Hotel Divine View strives to be more than just a hotel; we aspire to be a landmark destination that showcases the beauty and hospitality of Assam to the world.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:45:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
