(1243, 'Super Hotel O Saurabh Nagar Beltola', 'Hotels', '', 'Super Hotel O Saurabh Nagar Beltola, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a distinctive hospitality experience tailored to the discerning traveler seeking comfort and convenience. More than just a place to stay, it\'s a haven that reflects the vibrant culture and warm hospitality of Assam, while providing modern amenities and impeccable service. In a region experiencing increasing tourism and business travel, Super Hotel O aims to be a leading choice, providing a reliable and welcoming environment that caters to both domestic and international guests. Its strategic location in Saurabh Nagar Beltola provides easy access to key commercial areas, tourist attractions, and transportation hubs, making it a highly desirable destination within Guwahati. The hotel’s commitment to quality, combined with its understanding of local preferences, positions it as a significant player in the growing Assam hospitality sector.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Super Hotel O provides a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to a variety of needs. These include well-appointed rooms, ranging from standard accommodations to luxurious suites, each designed to provide a comfortable and restful experience. The hotel also boasts an in-house restaurant offering a diverse menu of local Assamese delicacies and popular international dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Beyond accommodation and dining, Super Hotel O offers essential services such as complimentary Wi-Fi access throughout the property, laundry and dry-cleaning services, and 24-hour front desk support. What truly sets Super Hotel O apart is its personalized service and attention to detail. The team is trained to anticipate guest needs and provide proactive assistance, ensuring a seamless and memorable stay. In a market where standardized experiences are common, the hotel focuses on delivering a unique, culturally-sensitive hospitality experience that resonates with the local market and appeals to visitors seeking an authentic taste of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Super Hotel O. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm smiles and efficient service. The staff is trained to be attentive, responsive, and knowledgeable about the local area, providing valuable recommendations for sightseeing, dining, and cultural experiences. Super Hotel O differentiates itself through its commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment. The design incorporates elements of Assamese art and culture, creating a sense of place and identity. Moreover, the hotel actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. This includes sourcing products and services from local businesses, participating in local festivals and events, and supporting community development programs. By fostering strong relationships with its neighbors, Super Hotel O strengthens its connection to the community and enhances the overall guest experience, providing an authentic glimpse into the heart of Assam. The hotel regularly solicits feedback from guests and utilizes this information to continuously improve its services and offerings.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Super Hotel O Saurabh Nagar Beltola envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam hospitality market. The hotel plans to enhance its service offerings by potentially adding facilities such as a fitness center, a spa, or a conference hall to cater to business travelers. Another area of focus is on enhancing the hotel\'s online presence and digital marketing efforts to reach a wider audience. Strategic partnerships with local tour operators and travel agencies are also being explored to increase occupancy rates and promote tourism in the region. A long-term goal is to establish Super Hotel O as a recognized brand synonymous with quality and exceptional service in Guwahati and beyond. This involves maintaining a consistent standard of excellence, investing in employee training and development, and continuously adapting to the evolving needs of the market. Ultimately, Super Hotel O aims to contribute to the growth of the local economy and become a valued member of the Guwahati community, fostering a positive image of Assam as a welcoming and vibrant tourist destination.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:45:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1244, 'STARGAZE BACKPACKERS GUWAHATI', 'Hotels', '', '<p><b>STARGAZE BACKPACKERS GUWAHATI: Your Gateway to Authentic Assam</b></p>\n\n<p>Stargaze Backpackers Guwahati is a vibrant and welcoming hostel nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering budget-friendly accommodation and curated experiences for travelers seeking to immerse themselves in the rich culture and natural beauty of Northeast India. More than just a place to stay, Stargaze Backpackers aims to be a community hub for explorers, fostering connections and providing invaluable local insights. In a region experiencing a surge in independent travel, Stargaze Backpackers fills a crucial gap by providing affordable, safe, and engaging accommodation options that cater specifically to the needs of budget-conscious travelers, solo adventurers, and those seeking authentic cultural immersion. Our establishment contributes to the local economy by supporting local businesses, promoting sustainable tourism practices, and offering employment opportunities within the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Core Services and Products: More Than Just a Bed</b></p>\n\n<p>At Stargaze Backpackers Guwahati, we offer a range of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our guests. Our primary offering is comfortable and clean dormitory-style accommodation, with options for mixed and female-only dorms. We also provide private rooms for those seeking more privacy. All accommodations feature essential amenities such as secure lockers, individual reading lights, and readily accessible power outlets. <br> <br> However, what truly sets us apart is our focus on curated experiences and local connections. We organize regular social events, including traditional Assamese cooking classes, language exchange sessions, and live music performances featuring local artists. We also arrange guided tours to popular attractions like the Kamakhya Temple, the Umananda Island, and the Assam State Museum, as well as off-the-beaten-path excursions to nearby villages and tea gardens. Our in-house travel desk provides personalized itinerary planning assistance, offering expert advice on exploring Assam and the wider Northeast region. We facilitate transportation bookings, connecting travelers with reliable and reputable local transport providers. <br> <br> Beyond accommodation and tours, Stargaze Backpackers provides a communal kitchen where guests can prepare their own meals, a cozy common area for socializing and relaxing, and a book exchange corner. We also offer laundry facilities, luggage storage, and free Wi-Fi throughout the property. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to blend affordable accommodation with enriching cultural experiences and personalized travel support, creating a memorable and authentic Assam adventure for our guests. We directly address the need for reliable information and logistical support that is often lacking for independent travelers navigating the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Customer Experience: Building a Community, One Traveler at a Time</b></p>\n\n<p>Customer service is at the heart of everything we do at Stargaze Backpackers Guwahati. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where guests feel comfortable, safe, and connected. Our multilingual staff are knowledgeable about the local area and passionate about sharing their insights and recommendations. We prioritize building genuine relationships with our guests, taking the time to understand their individual needs and interests. <br> <br> We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and offerings. We respond promptly to inquiries and address any concerns with utmost care and attention. We encourage interaction between guests, fostering a sense of community through organized events and informal gatherings. Our commitment to creating a positive and memorable experience has earned us consistently high ratings and positive reviews. <br> <br> We are deeply committed to connecting with the local community. We partner with local businesses to source our supplies and services, supporting local entrepreneurs and contributing to the economic well-being of the region. We actively promote responsible tourism practices, encouraging our guests to respect the local culture and environment. We participate in community initiatives and support local charities. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we ensure that our guests have the opportunity to experience the authentic Assam and contribute positively to the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><b>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Deepening Roots</b></p>\n\n<p>Stargaze Backpackers Guwahati envisions a future where we are recognized as the premier accommodation and experience provider for budget travelers in Northeast India. We plan to expand our services to include additional accommodation options, such as eco-friendly glamping sites in rural areas and partnerships with local homestays. We aim to develop a wider range of curated experiences, focusing on sustainable tourism initiatives and responsible travel practices. <br> <br> We are exploring opportunities to expand our operations to other locations within Assam and the Northeast region, bringing our unique brand of hospitality and community-building to new destinations. We are also investing in technology to enhance the guest experience, including online booking platforms, mobile apps, and virtual tour guides. <br> <br> Our long-term goal is to become a leading advocate for sustainable tourism in Northeast India, promoting responsible travel practices and supporting local communities. We believe that by providing affordable, authentic, and engaging experiences, we can contribute to the economic growth and cultural preservation of this beautiful and diverse region. We aspire to be more than just a hostel; we aim to be a catalyst for positive change and a bridge between travelers and the local communities of Assam and the wider Northeast.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:45:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1245, 'Hotel Dream Star', 'Hotels', '', 'Hotel Dream Star: A Gateway to Comfort and Culture in Guwahati\n\nHotel Dream Star offers a haven of comfort and convenience in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, providing exceptional hospitality and a memorable experience for every guest. Recognizing the increasing demand for quality accommodation and personalized service in this vibrant gateway to Northeast India, Hotel Dream Star stands as a distinguished landmark, catering to both leisure and business travelers. Situated strategically in Guwahati, it is perfectly positioned to serve as a base for exploring the region\'s rich cultural heritage and breathtaking natural beauty. Our commitment to exceeding expectations sets us apart within the local hospitality industry.\n\nCore Services and Products\n\nAt Hotel Dream Star, we provide a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of our clientele. Our core offering revolves around providing beautifully appointed and meticulously maintained rooms. Guests can choose from a range of room categories, each designed to provide the utmost in comfort and convenience, from standard rooms offering a comfortable stay to luxurious suites featuring enhanced amenities and spacious layouts. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including high-speed Wi-Fi, flat-screen televisions, air conditioning, and comfortable bedding, ensuring a relaxing and productive stay. <br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodation, we boast a range of facilities and services designed to enhance the guest experience. Our in-house restaurant offers a delectable array of local Assamese cuisine alongside popular international dishes, prepared by experienced chefs using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. A well-stocked bar provides a relaxing space to unwind with a selection of beverages. For business travelers, we offer well-equipped conference and meeting rooms, perfect for hosting seminars, workshops, and corporate events. We also provide essential services such as laundry and dry cleaning, concierge assistance, and airport transfers. <br> <br>\n\nHotel Dream Star differentiates itself through a commitment to personalized service and an authentic experience of Assam. We actively promote local culture and traditions through curated experiences, such as traditional Assamese dance performances and opportunities to sample local delicacies. Our unique selling point is our ability to blend modern comfort with the charm and warmth of Assamese hospitality. We understand the needs of the local market, including the growing influx of tourists seeking to explore the region’s natural beauty and cultural heritage, and we are dedicated to providing a seamless and enriching experience for every guest.\n\nCustomer Experience\n\nCustomer satisfaction is at the heart of Hotel Dream Star\'s ethos. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and cared for. Our team of dedicated and well-trained staff are committed to providing attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every need is met with efficiency and a genuine smile. <br> <br>\n\nWe actively solicit feedback from our guests through surveys and online platforms, and we use this feedback to continuously improve our services and facilities. We strive to create a memorable experience for each guest by paying attention to the small details and going the extra mile to exceed expectations. We also actively participate in local community initiatives, supporting local artisans and businesses and contributing to the preservation of Assamese culture and heritage. We aim to be more than just a hotel; we aim to be a valuable member of the Guwahati community. By fostering strong relationships with local businesses and organizations, we create a mutually beneficial ecosystem that enhances the overall experience for our guests and contributes to the economic vitality of the region. <br> <br>\n\nWe recognize the importance of connecting with the local community and promoting Assam\'s rich cultural heritage. We often host events showcasing local art, music, and cuisine, providing our guests with a unique opportunity to immerse themselves in the local culture. Our staff are also knowledgeable about local attractions and can provide guests with insider tips and recommendations, ensuring that they have an authentic and enriching experience of Guwahati.\n\nFuture Vision\n\nLooking ahead, Hotel Dream Star envisions expanding its footprint and solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in Guwahati and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our room inventory, adding new amenities such as a fitness center and swimming pool, and further enhancing our conference and event facilities. <br> <br>\n\nWe are also exploring opportunities to partner with local tour operators to offer curated experiences that showcase the best of Assam, including tea garden tours, wildlife safaris, and cultural excursions. We aim to become a one-stop shop for travelers seeking to explore the region, providing them with seamless access to the many wonders that Assam has to offer. <br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to establish Hotel Dream Star as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, comfort, and authentic Assamese hospitality. We are committed to sustainable practices and responsible tourism, ensuring that we minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of the local community. We believe that by focusing on customer satisfaction, continuous improvement, and a commitment to our values, we can achieve our vision and create a lasting legacy in the Guwahati hospitality landscape. We are dedicated to creating an environment where our guests feel welcome, valued, and inspired, and where our employees are empowered to provide exceptional service. We aim to be more than just a hotel; we aim to be a destination in itself, a place where memories are made and dreams are realized.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:50:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1246, 'Hotel Nakshatra', 'Hotels', '', 'Hotel Nakshatra, a beacon of hospitality nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique blend of contemporary comfort and traditional Assamese warmth. More than just a place to stay, Hotel Nakshatra is a destination designed to immerse guests in the rich cultural tapestry of the region, while providing an exceptional standard of service. Strategically located, it serves as an ideal base for both business and leisure travelers seeking to explore the vibrant city and the surrounding natural beauty of Assam. In a city experiencing rapid growth and increasing tourist footfall, Hotel Nakshatra differentiates itself through its commitment to personalized experiences and authentic local engagement, contributing significantly to the region\'s burgeoning hospitality sector.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Hotel Nakshatra provides a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to a diverse range of guest needs. Accommodation options range from well-appointed standard rooms to luxurious suites, each meticulously designed with modern amenities and a touch of local artistry, ensuring a comfortable and memorable stay. Beyond accommodation, the hotel boasts a multi-cuisine restaurant, \'Brahmaputra Bites\', serving a delectable array of regional Assamese delicacies alongside popular Indian and international dishes. This culinary offering provides guests with an authentic taste of Assam without having to venture outside the hotel\'s premises. Furthermore, Hotel Nakshatra offers state-of-the-art conference and banquet facilities, making it a preferred venue for corporate events, workshops, and social gatherings. The unique selling point lies in the hotel\'s dedication to curating bespoke experiences, such as guided tours of local attractions, traditional Assamese dance performances, and culinary workshops focused on regional cuisine. This focus on experiential travel directly addresses the growing demand for authentic cultural immersion, attracting tourists seeking a deeper connection with Assam\'s heritage.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Hotel Nakshatra. Every member of the staff is trained to anticipate and fulfill guest needs with genuine warmth and efficiency. The hotel fosters a culture of personalized service, where guests are treated as individuals, not just room numbers. This commitment extends beyond the provision of comfortable accommodation and efficient service; it encompasses a genuine effort to connect with the local community. Hotel Nakshatra actively promotes local artisans and businesses, showcasing their products within the hotel and providing opportunities for guests to engage with them directly. This includes featuring locally woven textiles and handicrafts in the hotel decor and offering guests the chance to purchase these items as souvenirs. Moreover, the hotel regularly hosts community events, such as traditional Assamese festivals and cultural performances, creating a vibrant atmosphere and fostering a sense of belonging for both guests and local residents. The emphasis on creating a welcoming and inclusive environment sets Hotel Nakshatra apart, building strong relationships with its guests and solidifying its position as a valued member of the Guwahati community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Hotel Nakshatra envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam hospitality market and beyond. The immediate plans include expanding its accommodation capacity to meet the growing demand, introducing new spa and wellness facilities to cater to health-conscious travelers, and further enhancing its conference and banquet offerings to attract larger corporate events. A key long-term goal is to establish Hotel Nakshatra as a leading eco-friendly and sustainable tourism provider in the region. This involves implementing environmentally conscious practices throughout its operations, such as reducing waste, conserving energy, and supporting local conservation efforts. Furthermore, the hotel aims to develop partnerships with local tourism organizations to promote responsible and sustainable tourism practices throughout Assam. Ultimately, Hotel Nakshatra strives to become synonymous with quality hospitality, cultural immersion, and sustainable tourism, playing a vital role in shaping the future of tourism in Guwahati and contributing to the economic and social well-being of the local community. The long term vision is to expand the Nakshatra brand to other culturally significant locations in Northeast India, becoming a recognizable symbol of authentic and responsible tourism.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:50:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1247, 'Tulip Guest house (Rooftop)', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Tulip Guest House (Rooftop) offers a tranquil and elevated lodging experience in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Distinct from typical hotels and guesthouses, Tulip Guest House (Rooftop) distinguishes itself with its focus on providing personalized service, stunning rooftop views, and a commitment to showcasing the rich cultural heritage of Assam. In a city brimming with accommodation options, our guesthouse provides a refreshing alternative for travelers seeking comfort, convenience, and a genuine connection to the local environment. Situated in a conveniently accessible location within Guwahati, Tulip Guest House (Rooftop) caters to both leisure and business travelers looking for a memorable and authentic Assam experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service is providing comfortable and well-appointed guest rooms, each designed to offer a relaxing and productive stay. We offer a range of room types to suit various needs, from cozy single rooms ideal for solo travelers to spacious family suites. Each room is equipped with modern amenities, including air conditioning, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and private bathrooms with hot and cold water. Our unique selling point lies in our stunning rooftop terrace, which offers panoramic views of the Guwahati skyline and the surrounding hills. This space serves as a relaxing area for guests to unwind, socialize, and enjoy the cool evening breeze. Furthermore, we offer a delectable breakfast service featuring both continental and traditional Assamese options, providing guests with a taste of the local cuisine. Our services directly address the needs of travelers seeking comfortable, convenient, and culturally immersive accommodations in Guwahati. We aim to provide a home away from home, where guests can relax and recharge while experiencing the best of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Tulip Guest House (Rooftop), customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in providing personalized service that goes above and beyond to meet the individual needs of each guest. Our friendly and attentive staff is always available to assist with inquiries, provide local recommendations, and ensure a seamless and enjoyable stay. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to connecting with the local community. We actively support local artisans and businesses by featuring their products in our guesthouse and recommending their services to our guests. We also organize cultural events and workshops on our rooftop terrace, providing guests with the opportunity to learn about and appreciate the rich cultural heritage of Assam. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, we create a welcoming and authentic atmosphere for our guests, making their stay truly memorable. We strive to create an atmosphere of warmth and hospitality, ensuring every guest feels valued and cared for.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We envision Tulip Guest House (Rooftop) becoming a leading provider of boutique accommodation in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional service, commitment to sustainability, and promotion of Assamese culture. Our future plans include expanding our services to include guided tours of local attractions, allowing guests to explore the hidden gems of Guwahati and its surrounding areas. We also plan to introduce a range of wellness activities, such as yoga and meditation sessions, on our rooftop terrace, promoting a healthy and holistic lifestyle. Furthermore, we are committed to implementing sustainable practices throughout our operations, reducing our environmental footprint and supporting local conservation efforts. We aim to create a positive impact on the local community and contribute to the sustainable development of Guwahati. Our long-term goal is to establish Tulip Guest House (Rooftop) as a model for responsible and sustainable tourism in Assam, showcasing the region\'s natural beauty and cultural heritage to the world.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:50:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1248, '*URBAN HOME*- A Terrace Garden Studio Unit', 'Homestays', '', '<p><b>URBAN HOME - A Terrace Garden Studio Unit: Bringing Nature to City Living in Guwahati</b></p>\n\n<p>URBAN HOME offers a unique hospitality experience in Guwahati, Assam, specializing in short-term rental accommodations that seamlessly blend urban convenience with the tranquility of nature. Positioned as a terrace garden studio unit, URBAN HOME provides a refreshing alternative to conventional hotel rooms and apartments, catering to both leisure travelers and business professionals seeking a rejuvenating stay. In a rapidly developing urban landscape like Guwahati, where green spaces are increasingly valued, URBAN HOME distinguishes itself by offering a private outdoor sanctuary within a modern, well-appointed studio apartment. This concept addresses the growing demand for sustainable and wellness-focused travel options in the region, contributing to the diversification of the local hospitality sector and promoting a more eco-conscious approach to urban tourism.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>URBAN HOME\'s core offering is a fully furnished studio apartment featuring a meticulously designed terrace garden. The studio itself is equipped with modern amenities, including a comfortable queen-sized bed, a functional kitchenette with essential appliances, a dedicated workspace suitable for remote work, high-speed internet access, and a private bathroom with hot and cold water. However, the true differentiator lies in the attached terrace garden. This outdoor space is thoughtfully landscaped with a variety of indigenous plants, creating a serene atmosphere for relaxation, meditation, or simply enjoying the Guwahati climate. Guests can unwind amidst lush greenery, enjoying their morning coffee or an evening beverage in their own private oasis. We provide complimentary gardening tools, and basic information on maintaining the garden, for guests interested in engaging more deeply with the space. The emphasis on incorporating nature into the living space allows URBAN HOME to stand out from typical accommodations, appealing to travelers seeking a more holistic and enriching experience. This unique offering directly addresses the local market\'s desire for a peaceful escape from the bustling city, without sacrificing accessibility or modern comforts.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At URBAN HOME, exceptional customer service is paramount. We are committed to providing a personalized and attentive experience for every guest, starting from the initial booking inquiry to the final check-out. We prioritize clear and prompt communication, ensuring that all guest queries are addressed efficiently and effectively. Our approach is to anticipate the needs of our guests and provide them with the information and resources they require to make their stay comfortable and memorable. We offer a flexible check-in and check-out process, and are readily available to assist with any requests or concerns that may arise during their stay. Beyond providing comfortable accommodations, we strive to connect with the local community by promoting local businesses and attractions to our guests. We offer curated recommendations for restaurants, cultural sites, and outdoor activities, encouraging guests to explore the authentic flavors and experiences of Guwahati. We also prioritize sourcing local products and services whenever possible, supporting the local economy and showcasing the richness of Assamese culture. This focus on community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and contributes to the positive reputation of URBAN HOME within the local ecosystem.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for URBAN HOME is to expand its concept of integrating nature and urban living to other locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in the Northeast region of India. This expansion would involve creating additional studio units with similar terrace garden features, or developing larger apartment complexes that incorporate communal green spaces and sustainable design principles. We also envision incorporating smart home technology to enhance the guest experience, such as automated lighting, temperature control, and security systems. Furthermore, we plan to develop partnerships with local artisans and craftsmen to showcase their products within the studio units, providing guests with an opportunity to purchase unique souvenirs and support local talent. A long-term goal is to establish URBAN HOME as a recognized brand synonymous with sustainable and wellness-focused hospitality in the region. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of travelers, we aim to create a lasting positive impact on the local economy and promote a more environmentally conscious approach to urban living.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ultimately, URBAN HOME is more than just a place to stay; it is an experience that connects guests with nature, supports the local community, and promotes a sustainable lifestyle. We believe that by providing a unique and enriching travel experience, we can contribute to the growth and vibrancy of Guwahati\'s tourism sector while fostering a deeper appreciation for the natural beauty of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:50:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1249, 'Tosh Villa  -A 2Bhk Duplex Penthouse with Rooftop', 'Homestays', '', '<h1>Tosh Villa - A 2Bhk Duplex Penthouse with Rooftop: Your Guwahati Sanctuary</h1>\n\nTosh Villa is a distinctive accommodation offering nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. It presents a unique proposition in the local hospitality landscape: a fully furnished, meticulously designed 2BHK duplex penthouse, complete with a private rooftop terrace. Far from a standard hotel room or guesthouse, Tosh Villa provides a premium, residential experience, blending the comforts of home with the exclusivity of a luxury retreat. Its significance lies in catering to discerning travelers seeking more than just a place to stay; it offers an immersive, comfortable, and private environment ideal for extended stays, family vacations, or executive accommodations. Tosh Villa aims to redefine the concept of temporary living in Guwahati, establishing itself as a haven for those who appreciate space, privacy, and unparalleled comfort.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nTosh Villa\'s core offering is the exclusive rental of its fully furnished 2BHK duplex penthouse. This includes access to all amenities within the unit, such as a fully equipped kitchen, modern bathrooms, a spacious living area, and comfortable bedrooms. What truly sets Tosh Villa apart is its private rooftop terrace, offering panoramic views of Guwahati and providing a unique space for relaxation, entertainment, or simply enjoying the cityscape. Furthermore, the penthouse is equipped with high-speed internet, ensuring seamless connectivity for business or leisure. Addressing a clear need in the Guwahati market, Tosh Villa provides an alternative to cramped hotel rooms or impersonal serviced apartments. It caters to travelers who value privacy, space, and the ability to live comfortably and independently while away from home. This offering resonates particularly well with families, corporate travelers on extended assignments, and individuals seeking a tranquil and luxurious escape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Tosh Villa. While offering a self-contained accommodation, the team is dedicated to providing attentive and personalized service. This begins with a seamless booking process and extends to a warm welcome upon arrival. Guests are provided with detailed information about the penthouse, its amenities, and the surrounding area. The team is readily available to address any questions or concerns, ensuring a comfortable and hassle-free stay. Beyond basic assistance, Tosh Villa aims to foster a connection with the local community. Guests are provided with recommendations for local restaurants, attractions, and cultural experiences. The goal is to not only provide a comfortable place to stay but also to encourage guests to explore and appreciate the vibrant culture of Guwahati. This personalized approach differentiates Tosh Villa from larger, more impersonal accommodation options.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Tosh Villa envisions becoming a recognized and respected brand synonymous with premium residential-style accommodations in Guwahati. Future plans include expanding the portfolio to include additional unique properties, catering to a wider range of traveler needs. This may involve offering smaller apartment options or developing partnerships with local businesses to provide curated experiences for guests. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to enhance the guest experience, such as implementing a digital concierge service or streamlining the booking process. The long-term goal is to establish Tosh Villa as the preferred choice for discerning travelers seeking a comfortable, private, and authentic Guwahati experience. Furthermore, Tosh Villa is committed to sustainable practices and aims to minimize its environmental impact through responsible resource management and eco-friendly initiatives. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Tosh Villa is poised for sustained growth and success in the dynamic Guwahati hospitality sector.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:50:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1250, 'The Green Hills', 'Homestays', '', '<p>The Green Hills, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a dynamic enterprise dedicated to providing sustainable and high-quality solutions tailored to the specific needs of the region. More than just a business, The Green Hills aims to be a responsible corporate citizen, contributing to the economic growth and environmental well-being of the community it serves. Our unique approach combines local expertise with innovative practices, making us a distinct and valuable asset to the burgeoning business landscape of Assam. We strive to set new standards for quality and service, fostering lasting relationships with our clients and partners. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>At its core, The Green Hills offers a comprehensive suite of services and products centered around sustainable agriculture and eco-tourism. Our agricultural division focuses on providing locally sourced, organic produce to Guwahati\'s markets and restaurants. We work directly with local farmers, empowering them with training and resources to adopt sustainable farming methods that preserve the region\'s rich biodiversity. This not only ensures a consistent supply of high-quality ingredients but also supports the livelihoods of the farming community. Our product line includes a variety of fresh fruits, vegetables, and spices, grown without the use of harmful pesticides or chemicals, guaranteeing both exceptional taste and environmental responsibility. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Furthermore, The Green Hills recognizes the untapped potential of eco-tourism in Assam. We curate immersive and authentic experiences that showcase the natural beauty and cultural heritage of the region. Our guided tours, trekking expeditions, and homestay programs are designed to promote responsible tourism, minimizing environmental impact while maximizing benefits for local communities. We collaborate with indigenous communities to offer unique cultural experiences, ensuring that tourism revenue directly supports their economic development. This dual focus on sustainable agriculture and eco-tourism creates a synergistic business model that addresses the growing demand for environmentally conscious products and experiences. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>What truly sets The Green Hills apart is our unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement. We believe in building strong, lasting relationships with our clients, based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect. Our customer service philosophy is rooted in personalized attention and proactive communication. We go the extra mile to understand the specific needs of each customer, providing tailored solutions and exceptional support. Whether it\'s supplying a local restaurant with the freshest ingredients or crafting a bespoke eco-tourism itinerary, we strive to exceed expectations at every touchpoint. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Beyond providing excellent products and services, The Green Hills actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. We organize workshops and training programs for farmers, equipping them with the knowledge and skills to adopt sustainable farming practices. We also partner with local schools and organizations to promote environmental awareness and education among young people. By investing in the community, we aim to create a positive ripple effect, fostering a culture of sustainability and responsible citizenship. We participate in local festivals and events, showcasing our products and engaging with the community in a meaningful way. Our commitment to fair trade practices ensures that our suppliers receive equitable compensation for their goods and services, further strengthening our ties with the local community. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Green Hills envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading force in the sustainable business sector in Assam. We plan to expand our agricultural operations, increasing our production capacity and diversifying our product line. This includes exploring opportunities to process and package our produce, adding value and extending its shelf life. We also intend to develop new eco-tourism offerings, catering to a wider range of interests and budgets. This may involve partnering with other tourism operators to create comprehensive travel packages that showcase the best of Assam. <br> <br> </p>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a research and development center dedicated to sustainable agriculture and eco-tourism. This center will serve as a hub for innovation, fostering the development of new technologies and practices that can benefit the entire region. We are committed to investing in the latest technologies and training our employees to stay ahead of the curve. We also aim to expand our reach beyond Guwahati, bringing our sustainable products and experiences to other parts of Assam and beyond. The Green Hills aspires to be a model for sustainable business practices, demonstrating that economic success and environmental responsibility can go hand in hand. Our ultimate vision is to create a thriving ecosystem that benefits the community, the environment, and our stakeholders, leaving a lasting legacy for generations to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:55:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1251, 'Tales of Guwahati Independent 1BHK - iii', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Tales of Guwahati Independent 1BHK - iii offers a unique and comfortable accommodation experience nestled within the vibrant city of Guwahati. As an independent provider, we distinguish ourselves in the local hospitality landscape by focusing on personalized service, immaculately maintained properties, and a commitment to showcasing the authentic charm of Assam. Recognizing the growing demand for short-term and mid-term rentals that offer both privacy and convenience, particularly among business travelers, tourists seeking an immersive cultural experience, and individuals relocating to the city, we provide a meticulously curated alternative to traditional hotels and impersonal corporate housing.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core service is providing fully furnished, independent 1BHK (one-bedroom, hall, kitchen) apartments for short-term and mid-term stays in Guwahati. Each apartment is thoughtfully designed and equipped with modern amenities to ensure a comfortable and convenient stay. These include a well-equipped kitchenette allowing guests to prepare their own meals, a comfortable living area for relaxation, high-speed internet access essential for both business and leisure, and a private bathroom with hot water facilities. What sets Tales of Guwahati Independent 1BHK - iii apart is our attention to detail; we provide not just a place to sleep, but a home away from home. We proactively address the specific needs of our guests, offering services such as airport transfers (upon request), local area information, and assistance with arranging tours and activities within Guwahati and the surrounding region. This bespoke approach allows guests to experience the best of Assam, hassle-free.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Tales of Guwahati Independent 1BHK - iii, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere from the moment a guest makes an inquiry until their departure. Our dedicated team is readily available to assist with any questions or concerns, providing prompt and efficient support. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that each guest\'s experience exceeds expectations. Beyond providing accommodation, we aim to connect our guests with the local community. We offer insights into local customs, traditions, and hidden gems, encouraging guests to explore the authentic flavors and cultural richness of Guwahati. We actively support local businesses by recommending restaurants, shops, and cultural attractions, contributing to the growth of the local economy and fostering a sense of community among our guests.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Tales of Guwahati Independent 1BHK - iii is one of sustainable growth and continued commitment to providing exceptional accommodation experiences. We plan to expand our portfolio of properties, carefully selecting locations that offer both convenience and a unique perspective on the city. This expansion will be strategically aligned with the increasing demand for quality short-term rentals in Guwahati, driven by the city\'s growing economic activity and increasing tourism. We are also exploring opportunities to incorporate sustainable practices into our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the local community. This includes sourcing locally made products and amenities, implementing energy-efficient measures, and promoting responsible tourism. Ultimately, we aspire to become a leading provider of independent 1BHK accommodations in Guwahati, recognized for our unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, our dedication to showcasing the beauty of Assam, and our positive contribution to the local economy.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 07:55:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
