(1270, 'Bright/Bohemian Studio Unit', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Bright/Bohemian Studio Unit offers a unique and vibrant accommodation experience in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, catering to a growing demand for stylish and comfortable short-term rentals. In a city increasingly recognized as a gateway to Northeast India, our studio unit stands out by blending modern amenities with a distinct bohemian aesthetic, providing a refreshing alternative to conventional hotel rooms and impersonal apartments. We contribute to the local tourism ecosystem by offering a distinctive lodging option that attracts discerning travelers and supports local businesses through curated recommendations and partnerships.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offering is a fully furnished studio apartment meticulously designed to provide a comfortable and aesthetically pleasing stay. The \"bright\" aspect refers to the abundant natural light and use of cheerful color palettes, creating an uplifting ambiance. The \"bohemian\" influence is evident in the eclectic decor, featuring handcrafted textiles, unique artwork sourced from local artisans, and globally inspired furnishings. This creates a relaxed and inspiring atmosphere, ideal for both leisure travelers and business professionals seeking a more personalized and enriching experience. Key amenities include high-speed internet access, a fully equipped kitchenette for self-catering, a comfortable workspace, and a private bathroom with modern fixtures. What truly sets us apart is the curated experience we offer – a space that is not just a place to sleep, but a haven that reflects the vibrant culture and artistic spirit of Guwahati and the broader region. We address the local market\'s need for quality short-term rentals that offer a sense of individuality and connection to the community, especially appealing to younger travelers and those seeking an authentic Assamese experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Bright/Bohemian Studio Unit. We strive to provide personalized and attentive service from the moment a guest makes a booking until their departure. Communication is prompt, clear, and friendly, ensuring a seamless and stress-free experience. Upon arrival, guests receive a welcome package containing locally sourced snacks and beverages, along with a detailed guide to the city, including recommendations for restaurants, cultural attractions, and hidden gems. We actively encourage guests to explore the local community, partnering with nearby businesses to offer exclusive discounts and experiences. This not only enhances the guest\'s stay but also supports the local economy. We are highly responsive to guest feedback, constantly seeking ways to improve our services and offerings. Our commitment to fostering a warm and welcoming environment has resulted in positive reviews and a strong reputation within the community, leading to repeat bookings and word-of-mouth referrals. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by participating in local events and promoting sustainable tourism practices, ensuring that our business contributes positively to the cultural fabric of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Bright/Bohemian Studio Unit envisions expanding its presence in Guwahati and beyond, potentially adding more studio units with unique themes that celebrate the diverse cultures of Northeast India. We plan to further enhance our customer experience by offering personalized concierge services, arranging guided tours, and facilitating interactions with local artisans and craftspeople. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses to create curated experiences that showcase the best of Assam\'s cuisine, art, and culture. Our long-term goals include establishing Bright/Bohemian Studio Unit as a leading provider of unique and authentic accommodation experiences in the region, while remaining committed to sustainable tourism practices and supporting the local community. We believe that by providing exceptional service and a distinctive product, we can contribute to the growth of tourism in Guwahati and foster a deeper appreciation for the rich cultural heritage of Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:15:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1271, 'GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY', 'Homestays', '', '<p>GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY: Your Gateway to Authentic Assam Hospitality</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY offers a tranquil escape for travelers seeking an authentic and immersive experience in North East India. More than just accommodation, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY is a sanctuary where guests can connect with the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam. In a region known for its vibrant traditions, lush landscapes, and burgeoning tourism sector, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY stands out by providing a personalized and sustainable approach to hospitality, differentiating itself from conventional hotels and resorts prevalent in the area. By emphasizing eco-conscious practices and fostering a genuine connection with the local community, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY contributes positively to the sustainable development of the Assamese tourism industry. The homestay serves as a warm and inviting base for exploring the region\'s wonders, from the majestic Brahmaputra River to the sprawling tea gardens and ancient temples that dot the landscape. It offers a more intimate and enriching alternative to impersonal hotel stays, promoting cultural exchange and supporting local livelihoods.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Blend of Comfort and Culture</p>\n\n<p>GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY offers a range of services designed to cater to the diverse needs of its guests. At its core, the homestay provides comfortable and well-appointed rooms, each reflecting the traditional Assamese aesthetic with modern amenities for a relaxing stay. Beyond accommodation, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY excels in curating immersive experiences that allow guests to delve into the local culture. This includes guided tours to nearby attractions, such as the Kamakhya Temple and the Assam State Zoo, arranged in collaboration with local guides, ensuring ethical and informed exploration. A key offering is the opportunity to savor authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared using locally sourced ingredients. Guests can participate in cooking classes to learn the secrets of traditional dishes, fostering a deeper appreciation for the region\'s culinary heritage. Recognizing the growing demand for sustainable travel, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY prioritizes eco-friendly practices, such as waste reduction, energy conservation, and the use of organic products. This commitment to sustainability resonates with environmentally conscious travelers seeking responsible tourism options. The unique selling point lies in the personalized attention and warmth provided by the host family, creating a genuine \"home away from home\" experience that is often missing in larger commercial establishments. By focusing on authentic cultural immersion, sustainable practices, and personalized service, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY directly addresses the needs of travelers seeking meaningful and responsible travel experiences in Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, Fostering Community</p>\n\n<p>At GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY, the customer experience is paramount. The approach to customer service is built on genuine hospitality, attentiveness, and a desire to exceed guest expectations. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warmth and personalized attention, making them feel like part of the family. The team at GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY goes the extra mile to cater to individual needs and preferences, offering customized itineraries, arranging transportation, and providing local insights to enhance the overall travel experience. What truly sets GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY apart is its commitment to fostering a strong connection with the local community. The homestay actively supports local artisans and businesses by showcasing their products and services to guests, creating opportunities for economic empowerment. Furthermore, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY organizes cultural events and workshops that bring together guests and local residents, promoting intercultural understanding and exchange. These initiatives not only enrich the guest experience but also contribute to the preservation and promotion of Assamese culture. Positive reviews and testimonials from satisfied guests highlight the exceptional level of service, the authentic cultural experiences, and the warm and welcoming atmosphere that defines GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY. The emphasis on building genuine relationships with guests and the community creates a loyal customer base and fosters a sense of belonging, transforming visitors into ambassadors for the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Growth, Sustainability, and Cultural Preservation</p>\n\n<p>The future vision for GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY is one of sustainable growth, cultural preservation, and community empowerment. The business aims to expand its reach by attracting a wider range of travelers interested in authentic and responsible tourism experiences. This will involve strengthening its online presence through targeted marketing campaigns and partnerships with travel agencies specializing in sustainable travel. Future plans include developing new and innovative offerings, such as curated wellness retreats focused on traditional Assamese healing practices and eco-tourism adventures exploring the region\'s diverse ecosystems. A key priority is to further enhance the homestay\'s sustainability initiatives by implementing more eco-friendly practices, such as rainwater harvesting, solar energy generation, and organic farming. GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY also plans to expand its support for local artisans and businesses by creating a dedicated retail space showcasing their products and providing training opportunities to enhance their skills. Long-term goals include establishing a foundation dedicated to preserving and promoting Assamese culture and heritage. This foundation would support local artists, fund cultural preservation projects, and provide educational programs for the community. By focusing on sustainable growth, cultural preservation, and community empowerment, GREEN VISTA HOMESTAY aspires to become a leading example of responsible tourism in Assam, contributing positively to the region\'s economic, social, and environmental well-being.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:15:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1272, 'Dula HomeStay - Standard Queen Room', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Dula HomeStay - Standard Queen Room: A Sanctuary of Comfort in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, Dula HomeStay - Standard Queen Room offers a refined and comfortable accommodation experience, perfectly blending modern amenities with the warmth of Assamese hospitality. More than just a place to stay, it\'s a curated haven designed for both leisure and business travelers seeking a restful and convenient base to explore the rich cultural tapestry and natural beauty of the region. In the burgeoning Guwahati hospitality sector, Dula HomeStay distinguishes itself by offering a focused, high-quality stay experience centered around the Standard Queen Room, ensuring a consistent level of comfort and personalized attention often missing in larger establishments. Its strategic location provides easy access to key attractions, business districts, and transportation hubs, making it a significant and valuable addition to the local travel ecosystem.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The core offering of Dula HomeStay revolves around the Standard Queen Room, meticulously designed to provide a comfortable and restorative environment. Each room features a high-quality queen-size bed with premium linens, ensuring a restful night\'s sleep. Modern amenities include a private en-suite bathroom with hot and cold water, air conditioning, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and a flat-screen television with access to a variety of channels. The rooms are tastefully decorated with touches of local artistry, creating a serene and inviting atmosphere. While Dula HomeStay primarily focuses on the Standard Queen Room experience, additional services are provided to enhance the overall stay, such as airport transfers (available upon request and at an additional cost), laundry services, and assistance with local tour arrangements. What sets Dula HomeStay apart is its commitment to maintaining an exceptional standard of cleanliness and comfort, coupled with a personalized approach to guest service. This targeted focus on a specific room type allows for streamlined operations, ensuring that every guest receives a consistently high-quality experience. This directly addresses the needs of budget-conscious travelers who prioritize comfort, convenience, and a hassle-free stay without sacrificing quality.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Dula HomeStay. The approach to customer service is deeply rooted in the Assamese tradition of \"Atithi Devo Bhava\" – treating the guest as God. From the initial booking inquiry to the final check-out, every interaction is handled with genuine care and attentiveness. Upon arrival, guests are greeted with a warm welcome and provided with all the necessary information to make their stay as comfortable as possible. The on-site staff are readily available to assist with any queries or requests, offering local insights and recommendations to enhance the guest\'s exploration of Guwahati and its surroundings. Dula HomeStay fosters a sense of community by actively engaging with local businesses and promoting local attractions. Guests are encouraged to explore nearby restaurants, shops, and cultural sites, contributing to the local economy and experiencing the authentic flavors of Assam. Regular guest feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered to continuously improve the services and offerings. This dedication to personalized service, combined with a commitment to promoting local culture, creates a unique and memorable experience that sets Dula HomeStay apart from its competitors. Repeat bookings and positive word-of-mouth referrals are a testament to the success of this customer-centric approach.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Dula HomeStay envisions becoming a leading provider of quality, affordable accommodation in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include exploring opportunities to expand the business by adding a few more rooms that maintain the existing standard of excellence, potentially introducing variations of the Standard Queen Room with value-added amenities. Furthermore, there are plans to enhance the online presence through strategic partnerships with online travel agencies and targeted digital marketing campaigns to reach a wider audience. Dula HomeStay also aims to strengthen its ties with the local community by collaborating with local artisans and businesses to offer unique experiences and products to its guests. Long-term goals include establishing Dula HomeStay as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with comfort, convenience, and exceptional hospitality in the Assam region. By consistently delivering on its promise of providing a high-quality stay experience at an affordable price, Dula HomeStay is well-positioned for sustainable growth and continued success in the dynamic Guwahati hospitality market.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:15:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1273, 'Solace Stay', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Solace Stay offers a unique blend of modern comfort and authentic Assamese hospitality in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Recognizing a growing need for premium, yet accessible, accommodations in the city, Solace Stay distinguishes itself by providing personalized service, a serene atmosphere, and a commitment to showcasing the rich culture of the region. More than just a place to stay, Solace Stay aims to be a gateway for travelers to experience the true essence of Assam, catering to both business travelers and tourists seeking an immersive cultural experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Solace Stay provides well-appointed accommodations ranging from comfortable standard rooms to spacious suites, each designed with a focus on functionality and aesthetic appeal. All rooms feature modern amenities such as high-speed internet, flat-screen televisions with satellite channels, and climate control. However, what truly sets Solace Stay apart is its commitment to incorporating local elements into the guest experience. We offer curated cultural experiences, including traditional Assamese cooking classes, guided tours of local tea gardens and historical sites, and opportunities to interact with local artisans. Our in-house restaurant, \"Ahaar,\" features a menu showcasing authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with locally sourced ingredients. Recognizing the demands of the modern traveler, Solace Stay also offers business services such as meeting rooms, printing facilities, and airport transfers, ensuring a seamless experience for corporate clients. The unique selling proposition lies in the fusion of contemporary comforts with immersive cultural experiences, making Solace Stay a distinctive choice in the Guwahati hospitality market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Solace Stay. We believe in creating a welcoming and personalized atmosphere for every guest. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality and attentive service. Our staff is trained to anticipate the needs of our guests and provide tailored recommendations for exploring the city and its surrounding areas. We actively seek feedback from our guests through online surveys and in-person interactions to continually improve our services and offerings. Solace Stay is committed to engaging with the local community through partnerships with local artisans and businesses. We source locally made products for our gift shop and support local initiatives that promote sustainable tourism. We also actively participate in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of community and connection. By prioritizing personalized service, cultural immersion, and community engagement, Solace Stay creates a memorable and enriching experience for every guest.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Solace Stay envisions becoming a leading destination for travelers seeking authentic and immersive experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our range of cultural experiences, developing partnerships with more local artisans and businesses, and exploring opportunities to offer eco-tourism packages that showcase the natural beauty of Assam. We also aim to enhance our technological infrastructure to provide a more seamless and convenient guest experience. This includes implementing online booking platforms, mobile check-in/check-out options, and personalized concierge services. Furthermore, we plan to expand our physical presence, potentially adding more rooms or developing new properties in other key locations within Assam. Long-term, Solace Stay aspires to be recognized as a brand synonymous with authentic Assamese hospitality and sustainable tourism, contributing to the economic and cultural development of the region. We aim to become not just a place to stay, but a vital part of the travel experience, fostering deeper connections between visitors and the vibrant culture of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:15:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1274, 'SAIKIANEST', 'Homestays', '', 'SAIKIANEST: Nurturing Growth in Guwahati and Beyond\n\nSAIKIANEST is a dynamic business solutions provider headquartered in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a service provider, SAIKIANEST aims to be a strategic partner for businesses, fostering sustainable growth and contributing to the burgeoning entrepreneurial ecosystem of the Northeast. Recognizing the unique challenges and opportunities present in the region, SAIKIANEST offers tailored solutions designed to empower local enterprises and enable them to compete effectively in a global marketplace. SAIKIANEST is distinguished by its deep understanding of local culture and business practices, combined with a commitment to leveraging cutting-edge technology and innovative strategies. It strives to bridge the gap between traditional business models and modern, efficient practices, making it a vital asset for businesses in Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nSAIKIANEST\'s core offerings encompass a comprehensive suite of business development and management solutions, primarily focusing on marketing and technology consultation. Their marketing services include creating and implementing digital marketing strategies, brand development, content creation, and social media management specifically tailored to resonate with the local consumer base. Understanding the diverse linguistic and cultural landscape of Assam, SAIKIANEST ensures marketing campaigns are culturally sensitive and strategically localized for maximum impact.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOn the technology front, SAIKIANEST provides consultation services focusing on streamlining operations and boosting efficiency. This includes evaluating existing IT infrastructure, recommending and implementing appropriate software solutions (such as CRM or ERP systems), and providing cybersecurity consultation for data protection. A key differentiator is SAIKIANEST\'s commitment to open-source technologies and cost-effective solutions, enabling businesses to adopt advanced technology without incurring prohibitive expenses. The business also offers website design and development services, ensuring businesses have a strong online presence that is both visually appealing and user-friendly. A vital component is the ongoing support and training provided to clients, empowering them to effectively utilize implemented solutions and maintain long-term success.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nSAIKIANEST prioritizes customer satisfaction above all else. The approach is centered around building long-term relationships based on trust and mutual respect. This begins with a thorough understanding of each client\'s unique needs, challenges, and goals through personalized consultations and in-depth business analysis. The team at SAIKIANEST believes in transparent communication, providing regular updates and seeking client feedback throughout the project lifecycle. They are readily available to address concerns and provide ongoing support, ensuring clients feel valued and empowered.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, SAIKIANEST is deeply rooted in the Guwahati community. They actively participate in local business events, workshops, and seminars, fostering connections and sharing expertise. They also offer internship opportunities to local students, providing valuable hands-on experience and contributing to the development of future business leaders. SAIKIANEST also works with local artisans and producers to help them market their products and services, contributing to the economic empowerment of the region\'s traditional crafts. This commitment to social responsibility and community engagement reinforces SAIKIANEST’s position as a trusted and respected member of the Guwahati business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, SAIKIANEST envisions expanding its service offerings and geographical reach. The company aims to become a leading provider of business solutions in the entire Northeast region, empowering businesses across diverse sectors. Plans include developing specialized services for emerging industries such as tourism and sustainable agriculture, aligning with the region\'s growing economic priorities. SAIKIANEST also plans to invest in research and development, exploring innovative technologies and strategies to further enhance its service offerings and provide clients with a competitive edge.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, SAIKIANEST is committed to fostering a culture of innovation and continuous improvement. This involves investing in employee training and development, attracting top talent, and creating a dynamic and collaborative work environment. By staying at the forefront of industry trends and embracing emerging technologies, SAIKIANEST aims to remain a valuable partner for businesses in Guwahati and beyond, driving sustainable growth and contributing to the region\'s economic prosperity. The ultimate long-term goal is to establish SAIKIANEST as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and commitment to client success.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:15:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1275, 'Mimo\'s', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Mimo\'s: A Taste of Innovation in Guwahati\'s Culinary Scene</p>\n\n<p>Mimo\'s is a dynamic and evolving food and beverage establishment nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a restaurant, Mimo\'s aspires to be a vibrant community hub, offering a unique blend of contemporary culinary experiences and a genuine connection to the local culture. In a city known for its rich culinary heritage, Mimo\'s distinguishes itself by embracing innovation while remaining deeply rooted in the flavors and traditions of Assam. We aim to offer an unparalleled dining experience, becoming a preferred destination for residents and visitors alike seeking quality, consistency, and a memorable taste of Assam\'s modern culinary landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors</p>\n\n<p>At its core, Mimo\'s offers a carefully curated menu that caters to a wide range of palates. Our primary offerings can be broadly categorized into:</p>\n\n<p><b>1. Modern Assamese Cuisine:</b> We take pride in re-imagining traditional Assamese dishes with contemporary techniques and presentations. This includes using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, showcasing the region\'s rich agricultural bounty and supporting local farmers. Expect to find familiar flavors presented in innovative ways, creating a delightful surprise for both seasoned connoisseurs of Assamese cuisine and newcomers eager to explore the region\'s culinary heritage.</p>\n\n<p><b>2. Globally Inspired Dishes:</b> Beyond our Assamese offerings, we also feature a selection of internationally inspired dishes, prepared with the same commitment to quality and attention to detail. These offerings provide variety and cater to diverse tastes, ensuring there is something for everyone at Mimo\'s.</p>\n\n<p><b>3. Specialty Beverages:</b> Our beverage program complements our food menu perfectly, featuring a range of handcrafted cocktails, mocktails, and specialty teas and coffees. We utilize local ingredients and traditional Assamese techniques to create unique and refreshing drinks that perfectly complement the dining experience.</p>\n\n<p><b>4. Catering Services:</b> Mimo\'s also provides catering services for events of all sizes. We bring our signature flavors and impeccable service to your special occasions, ensuring a memorable culinary experience for your guests. We customize our catering menus to meet the specific needs and preferences of our clients.</p>\n\n<p>Our unique selling points lie in our commitment to sourcing local ingredients, our innovative approach to traditional Assamese cuisine, and our unwavering dedication to providing exceptional quality and service. We understand the local market\'s desire for authentic flavors and experiences, and we strive to deliver that in every dish and every interaction.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Community Through Culinary Excellence</p>\n\n<p>At Mimo\'s, we believe that a positive customer experience is paramount to our success. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and inclusive atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our approach to customer service is built on the following principles:</p>\n\n<p><b>1. Personalized Attention:</b> Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating customer needs and going the extra mile to ensure their satisfaction.</p>\n\n<p><b>2. Local Connection:</b> We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local farmers, artisans, and organizations. We showcase local art and culture within our establishment, creating a space that reflects the spirit of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<p><b>3. Community Engagement:</b> We regularly host events and workshops that celebrate Assamese culture and cuisine. These events provide opportunities for our customers to learn, connect, and experience the richness of the region.</p>\n\n<p><b>4. Feedback and Improvement:</b> We actively solicit customer feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. We believe that customer feedback is essential to our growth and success.</p>\n\n<p>Mimo\'s stands out due to its commitment to creating a sense of community and belonging. We are more than just a restaurant; we are a place where people can come together to share good food, good company, and a genuine connection to the local culture.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons, Preserving Heritage</p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Mimo\'s envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, while remaining true to our core values of quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our long-term goals include:</p>\n\n<p><b>1. Expanding Our Menu:</b> We plan to continuously evolve our menu, introducing new and exciting dishes that showcase the diversity of Assamese cuisine and global flavors.</p>\n\n<p><b>2. Opening New Locations:</b> We aspire to expand our presence in Guwahati and beyond, bringing the Mimo\'s experience to new communities and audiences.</p>\n\n<p><b>3. Strengthening Local Partnerships:</b> We are committed to strengthening our partnerships with local farmers, artisans, and organizations, supporting the local economy and promoting sustainable practices.</p>\n\n<p><b>4. Enhancing Community Engagement:</b> We plan to expand our community engagement initiatives, hosting more events and workshops that celebrate Assamese culture and cuisine.</p>\n\n<p><b>5. Embracing Sustainability:</b> We are dedicated to implementing sustainable practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to a healthier planet.</p>\n\n<p>Mimo\'s aims to be a leading culinary destination in Guwahati and a recognized brand across Assam, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We are confident that with our passion, dedication, and commitment to excellence, we can achieve our goals and create a lasting positive impact on the local community.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:20:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1276, 'Citynest HomeStay', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Citynest HomeStay offers a uniquely immersive and comfortable accommodation experience in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to stay, Citynest provides guests with a genuine connection to the city\'s culture and lifestyle. Recognizing a growing demand for personalized and authentic travel experiences in Assam, Citynest stands out by blending modern amenities with the warmth of Assamese hospitality. In a region increasingly focused on tourism and business travel, Citynest HomeStay contributes to the local economy by promoting local artisans, food vendors, and cultural experiences, establishing itself as a key player in Guwahati\'s burgeoning hospitality sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The core of Citynest HomeStay lies in offering a range of meticulously designed rooms and suites that cater to diverse needs. Whether a solo traveler seeking a cozy retreat or a family requiring spacious accommodation, Citynest provides options for everyone. Each room is thoughtfully furnished, reflecting the local aesthetic with comfortable beds, modern bathrooms, and essential amenities such as high-speed Wi-Fi, air conditioning, and work desks. Beyond accommodation, Citynest distinguishes itself by offering curated experiences. These include guided tours of Guwahati\'s historical sites, cooking classes showcasing Assamese cuisine, and opportunities to engage with local artisans through workshops and demonstrations. A signature offering is the \'Assam Tea Experience,\' where guests can learn about the region\'s renowned tea production and enjoy curated tea tasting sessions. By providing these unique experiences, Citynest caters to the growing market of travelers who desire authentic cultural immersion beyond typical sightseeing.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Citynest HomeStay, the guest experience is paramount. The team is dedicated to providing personalized and attentive service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. From pre-arrival inquiries to post-departure feedback, Citynest strives to exceed expectations at every touchpoint. The staff is locally sourced and well-versed in the region\'s attractions, culture, and customs, enabling them to provide informed recommendations and address any guest needs efficiently. What truly sets Citynest apart is its commitment to connecting with the local community. The HomeStay actively supports local businesses by sourcing ingredients for its meals and collaborating with artisans for decor and guest amenities. By fostering these relationships, Citynest not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the sustainable growth of the local economy. Guests are often encouraged to participate in community events and interact with residents, providing them with a richer and more meaningful travel experience. Regular cultural events are also hosted on-site, further integrating guests with the local community and showcasing the vibrant Assamese heritage.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Citynest HomeStay envisions itself as a leading provider of authentic and sustainable hospitality experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding its accommodation offerings to include eco-friendly cottages in nearby rural areas, further tapping into the growing interest in eco-tourism. The business aims to develop strategic partnerships with local tour operators and travel agencies to promote Guwahati as a premier destination for cultural and adventure tourism. Another key focus is on leveraging technology to enhance the guest experience, including the implementation of a mobile app for easy booking, personalized recommendations, and seamless communication with staff. Long-term, Citynest HomeStay aims to establish a strong brand reputation synonymous with quality, authenticity, and social responsibility, expanding its footprint to other locations in Assam and the Northeast, bringing its unique blend of comfort and cultural immersion to a wider audience. The ultimate goal is to contribute significantly to the sustainable development of the region\'s tourism sector while providing exceptional experiences for every guest.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:20:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1277, 'Tranquility Homestay', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Tranquility Homestay: A Sanctuary of Comfort and Culture in Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, Tranquility Homestay offers a unique blend of comfortable accommodation and authentic cultural immersion. More than just a place to stay, it’s a gateway to experiencing the rich heritage and natural beauty of Northeast India. In a region rapidly developing its tourism infrastructure, Tranquility Homestay stands out by prioritizing personalized service, sustainable practices, and genuine connection with the local community. It fills a critical niche in Guwahati’s hospitality sector, catering to discerning travelers seeking an alternative to conventional hotels – individuals and families who value cultural enrichment and personalized attention.</p>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products</p>\n\n<p>At its core, Tranquility Homestay provides comfortable and well-appointed accommodation. We offer a range of room options, from cozy single rooms perfect for solo travelers to spacious family suites designed for larger groups. Each room is thoughtfully designed to create a relaxing and welcoming atmosphere, incorporating elements of Assamese design while ensuring modern comforts such as air conditioning, en-suite bathrooms with hot and cold water, and complimentary Wi-Fi. Beyond accommodation, Tranquility Homestay distinguishes itself through its experiential offerings. We organize guided tours of Guwahati\'s historical sites, including the Kamakhya Temple and the Assam State Museum, providing insights into the region\'s rich history and culture. We also arrange excursions to nearby attractions such as the Pobitora Wildlife Sanctuary, home to the Indian one-horned rhinoceros, allowing guests to experience Assam’s stunning natural beauty. Furthermore, guests can participate in cooking classes where they learn to prepare traditional Assamese dishes, fostering a deeper appreciation for the local cuisine. A key differentiator is our emphasis on showcasing Assamese artistry; we collaborate with local artisans to display and sell their handcrafted products within the homestay, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience while offering guests unique souvenirs. We source locally produced and organic ingredients for our meals, contributing to the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of our offerings. In addition to these, airport pick-up and drop facilities, laundry services, and travel assistance are offered for the convenience of our guests.</p>\n\n<p>Customer Experience</p>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of Tranquility Homestay\'s philosophy. Our approach to customer service is built on the principles of warmth, attentiveness, and genuine hospitality. We strive to create a home-away-from-home atmosphere where guests feel welcomed, valued, and cared for. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide personalized service, attending to each guest\'s individual needs and preferences. From arranging transportation and booking tours to providing recommendations for local restaurants and attractions, we go the extra mile to ensure a seamless and memorable experience. What truly sets us apart is our dedication to fostering meaningful connections with our guests. We encourage interaction and cultural exchange, organizing informal gatherings where guests can interact with our staff and local residents, sharing stories and experiences. We actively participate in local community events and initiatives, supporting local businesses and organizations. This commitment to community engagement not only enriches the guest experience but also strengthens our ties to the local community, establishing Tranquility Homestay as a responsible and valued member of Guwahati. Our commitment to personalized service is reflected in consistently positive guest reviews highlighting the friendly and helpful staff, the comfortable accommodations, and the immersive cultural experiences. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall experience. Through online platforms and in-person interactions, we ensure that our guests feel heard and valued.</p>\n\n<p>Future Vision</p>\n\n<p>The future of Tranquility Homestay is bright, with ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our immediate plans include expanding our accommodation capacity by adding additional rooms and facilities, catering to the growing demand for our unique offering. We also plan to further develop our experiential offerings, introducing new tours, activities, and workshops that showcase the diverse culture and natural beauty of Assam and Northeast India. A key focus for the future is enhancing our sustainability efforts. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact through responsible resource management, waste reduction, and energy efficiency. We also plan to increase our support for local communities through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, promoting sustainable tourism practices and empowering local artisans and entrepreneurs. Looking ahead, we aspire to replicate the Tranquility Homestay model in other locations across Northeast India, creating a network of sustainable and culturally rich accommodations that provide travelers with authentic and meaningful experiences. We also aim to establish a training program for local youth, providing them with the skills and knowledge necessary to pursue careers in the tourism industry. By investing in the future of our community and our environment, we believe that Tranquility Homestay can play a significant role in promoting sustainable tourism and economic development in Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:20:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1278, 'Riverside Palm Homestay 2BHK', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Riverside Palm Homestay 2BHK offers a unique and tranquil retreat in the heart of Guwahati, providing guests with a comfortable and authentic Assamese experience. Situated away from the bustling city center yet conveniently accessible, our homestay stands out as an ideal choice for both leisure and business travelers seeking a serene and personalized alternative to conventional hotels. We contribute to the growing homestay sector in Assam, catering to a demand for authentic, localized experiences that showcase the region\'s rich culture and natural beauty. Our commitment to quality and personalized service sets us apart, offering a refreshing and memorable stay for every guest.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Riverside Palm Homestay 2BHK, our core offering is a fully furnished, two-bedroom apartment designed for comfort and convenience. Each bedroom is equipped with comfortable bedding, ample storage, and air conditioning, ensuring a restful night\'s sleep. The living area provides a relaxing space for guests to unwind, complete with comfortable seating and entertainment options. A fully equipped kitchen allows guests to prepare their own meals, catering to those who prefer self-catering options or have specific dietary needs. We also provide essential amenities such as complimentary Wi-Fi, ensuring guests stay connected, and on-site parking for those travelling with their own vehicles. What truly distinguishes us is the attention to detail and personalized service. We offer optional services like traditional Assamese meals upon request, prepared with fresh, local ingredients, giving guests a genuine taste of the region. We cater to a need for spacious, comfortable, and private accommodation, especially attractive to families, small groups, and extended-stay travelers seeking a home away from home. The quiet riverside location provides a sanctuary from the city\'s hustle, a rare find within Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Riverside Palm Homestay 2BHK. We strive to provide a warm and welcoming atmosphere, treating each guest as a member of our extended family. From the moment a booking is made, we prioritize clear and prompt communication, ensuring all questions and concerns are addressed efficiently. Upon arrival, guests are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality, including a welcome drink and a personalized orientation to the homestay and the surrounding area. We are readily available to provide local insights, recommendations for sightseeing, and assistance with travel arrangements. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to going the extra mile to cater to individual needs. We understand that every guest is unique, and we strive to create a personalized experience that exceeds expectations. We believe in building relationships with our guests, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty. We also actively engage with the local community, sourcing local produce and supporting local artisans. By showcasing the best of Assam, we aim to create a positive impact and contribute to the sustainable development of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Riverside Palm Homestay 2BHK is centered around sustainable growth and enhancing the overall guest experience. We plan to expand our services by incorporating curated tours of Guwahati and surrounding areas, providing guests with unique opportunities to explore the region\'s cultural and natural attractions. We also aim to partner with local businesses to offer exclusive discounts and promotions, further enriching the guest experience and supporting the local economy. A key focus will be on embracing eco-friendly practices to minimize our environmental impact. This includes implementing water conservation measures, reducing waste, and using sustainable products whenever possible. We are exploring the possibility of adding more rooms to accommodate growing demand while maintaining the intimate and personalized atmosphere that defines our homestay. We also plan to invest in technology to streamline operations and enhance the booking process. Long-term, we envision Riverside Palm Homestay 2BHK as a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality, recognized for its commitment to quality, personalized service, and sustainable practices. We aim to be a positive force in the local community, promoting tourism responsibly and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage. We aspire to expand to other strategic locations within Assam in the future, always with a view of promoting tourism responsibly and sustainably. </p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 08:20:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
