(1326, 'Citynest Homestay', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Citynest Homestay, nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and authentic accommodation experience, bridging the gap between impersonal hotels and conventional guest houses. We provide a welcoming haven for travelers seeking a comfortable, culturally rich, and personalized stay, making us a significant contributor to the region\'s burgeoning tourism sector and a compelling alternative within the local hospitality market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Citynest Homestay differentiates itself by offering more than just a place to sleep. We provide a curated experience deeply rooted in Assamese hospitality and culture. Our core service revolves around providing well-appointed, comfortable rooms that blend modern amenities with traditional Assamese aesthetics. Beyond accommodation, we offer curated local experiences, including guided tours of Guwahati\'s historical sites and temples, opportunities to participate in local festivals (subject to season), and cooking classes featuring authentic Assamese cuisine. We also provide assistance with travel arrangements within Assam and the Northeast, offering insider knowledge and personalized itineraries to enhance our guests\' exploration of the region. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to showcasing Assam\'s rich cultural heritage and offering personalized service, making each guest\'s stay memorable and enriching. This focus on cultural immersion directly addresses the growing demand from travelers seeking authentic and meaningful travel experiences, moving beyond superficial tourism and fostering a deeper appreciation for the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Citynest Homestay. We believe in treating every guest as part of our extended family, ensuring their comfort and satisfaction are paramount. From the moment a guest makes a reservation to their departure, we strive to exceed expectations with attentive and personalized service. We offer a seamless booking process, readily available communication channels for pre-arrival inquiries, and a warm welcome upon arrival. Our staff are carefully selected and trained to be knowledgeable about the local area, providing valuable insights and recommendations to guests. We actively seek guest feedback through surveys and personal interactions, continuously improving our services to meet evolving needs. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by sourcing local produce and handicrafts, supporting local artisans and businesses, and promoting responsible tourism practices. This community-centric approach not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the economic well-being of the surrounding area, fostering a sense of shared prosperity and cultural preservation.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Citynest Homestay is to become a leading provider of culturally immersive and sustainable accommodation experiences in Guwahati and the wider Northeast region. We plan to expand our offerings by adding more rooms and incorporating eco-friendly practices to minimize our environmental impact. This includes implementing water conservation measures, utilizing solar energy, and promoting responsible waste management. We also aim to further enhance our cultural experiences by partnering with local artisans, musicians, and dancers to offer more diverse and engaging activities. We are exploring the possibility of establishing a sustainable farm-to-table dining experience, sourcing fresh produce from local farmers and showcasing the region\'s diverse culinary heritage. Our long-term goal is to create a network of Citynest Homestays across the Northeast, each offering a unique and authentic experience that celebrates the region\'s diverse cultures and landscapes. We envision Citynest Homestay as not just a place to stay, but as a gateway to experiencing the true essence of Assam and the Northeast, contributing to the growth of sustainable tourism and the preservation of local traditions.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:10:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1327, 'Upaja Ghar Homestay', 'Homestays', '', 'Upaja Ghar Homestay is a warm and inviting haven nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering an authentic and immersive experience of Assamese hospitality and culture. Unlike conventional hotels, Upaja Ghar provides a home-like atmosphere, allowing guests to connect with the local environment and traditions on a deeper level. In the bustling Guwahati landscape, where modern development intersects with rich cultural heritage, Upaja Ghar stands as a bridge, offering travelers a chance to experience the true essence of Assam. It fills a crucial gap by providing personalized service and culturally relevant experiences often missing in larger, more impersonal accommodations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Upaja Ghar Homestay provides comfortable and well-appointed accommodations catering to both leisure and business travelers. The rooms are designed to reflect traditional Assamese aesthetics, incorporating local materials and craftsmanship. Beyond lodging, Upaja Ghar curates experiences designed to immerse guests in Assamese culture. This includes traditional Assamese cooking classes, where guests learn to prepare authentic dishes using locally sourced ingredients; guided tours of nearby tea gardens and historical sites, offering insights into Assam\'s rich history and economic significance; and opportunities to participate in local festivals and celebrations, providing firsthand exposure to the vibrant Assamese traditions. A unique selling point of Upaja Ghar is its emphasis on sustainable tourism. The homestay actively promotes responsible travel by sourcing food locally, minimizing waste, and supporting local artisans and businesses. This commitment not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the preservation of Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage. The services directly address the growing demand for authentic and culturally immersive travel experiences, especially among tourists seeking to go beyond superficial encounters and connect with the local community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer service at Upaja Ghar is built on the principles of genuine hospitality and personalized attention. Guests are treated as extended family, ensuring their comfort and well-being throughout their stay. The staff, primarily locals, are knowledgeable about the region and passionate about sharing their culture. They go the extra mile to cater to individual needs and preferences, offering personalized recommendations for activities, dining, and exploration. What truly distinguishes Upaja Ghar is its active engagement with the local community. The homestay partners with local artisans, farmers, and community organizations to provide guests with authentic experiences and support local livelihoods. This includes showcasing locally made handicrafts, sourcing ingredients from nearby farms, and organizing cultural performances by local artists. Upaja Ghar also actively participates in community initiatives, such as environmental conservation projects and educational programs, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility. This deep connection with the community fosters a sense of belonging for guests and creates a positive impact on the local economy and environment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Upaja Ghar Homestay envisions becoming a leading advocate for sustainable and culturally immersive tourism in Assam. Future plans include expanding the range of cultural experiences offered, such as workshops on traditional Assamese crafts, language classes, and opportunities to learn about local farming practices. The business intends to strengthen its partnerships with local artisans and businesses, further promoting sustainable tourism and supporting the local economy. Exploring options for expanding the homestay\'s capacity while maintaining its commitment to personalized service and environmental sustainability is also a key area of focus. Upaja Ghar also aims to play a more active role in promoting Assam as a premier tourist destination, collaborating with tourism boards and other stakeholders to attract visitors from around the world. The long-term goal is to establish Upaja Ghar as a model for responsible tourism, demonstrating how businesses can contribute to the preservation of cultural heritage, the protection of the environment, and the economic empowerment of local communities. Ultimately, Upaja Ghar Homestay strives to be more than just a place to stay; it aspires to be a gateway to the heart and soul of Assam, leaving a lasting positive impact on both its guests and the community it serves.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:10:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1328, 'Kaveri home stays', 'Homestays', '', 'Kaveri Home Stays: Your Authentic Gateway to Assamese Hospitality\n\nKaveri Home Stays is a locally owned and operated hospitality business nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offering a unique and immersive experience for travelers seeking an authentic connection with Assam. Beyond providing comfortable accommodation, we strive to curate a culturally rich stay, showcasing the region\'s vibrant traditions, delectable cuisine, and warm hospitality. In a market increasingly dominated by standardized hotel chains, Kaveri Home Stays stands out by offering personalized service, a homelike atmosphere, and an opportunity to live like a local, making us a significant player in the growing Assam tourism sector, particularly for those seeking off-the-beaten-path experiences.\n<br> <br>\nOur primary offering revolves around providing comfortable and culturally relevant accommodation in thoughtfully designed homes. These aren\'t merely rooms; they are spaces imbued with the spirit of Assam, featuring local textiles, handicrafts, and artwork. Beyond accommodation, we offer a range of bespoke services designed to enhance the visitor\'s experience. These include:\n\n*   **Authentic Assamese Cuisine:** Guests can savor traditional dishes prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, offering a true taste of Assam. Cooking classes are also available for those who wish to learn the secrets of Assamese culinary arts.\n\n*   **Curated Experiences:** We provide guided tours and excursions to local attractions, including tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, and historical sites, led by knowledgeable locals who share their passion for the region.\n\n*   **Cultural Immersion Activities:** Guests can participate in traditional dance and music performances, learn local crafts, and interact with community members, fostering a deeper understanding of Assamese culture.\n\nOur unique selling point lies in the personalized attention and genuine hospitality we offer. We strive to understand each guest\'s interests and tailor their experience accordingly. Unlike impersonal hotel chains, we offer a warm, welcoming environment where guests feel like part of the family. This focus on authenticity and personalized service directly addresses the growing demand for experiential travel, where visitors seek meaningful connections with the local culture and community. We contribute to the local economy by sourcing products and services from local artisans, farmers, and tour operators.\n<br> <br>\nAt Kaveri Home Stays, customer experience is paramount. We believe in going the extra mile to ensure that every guest feels welcomed, comfortable, and cared for. Our approach is rooted in genuine Assamese hospitality, characterized by warmth, respect, and a genuine desire to share our culture with others. We proactively solicit feedback from our guests and continuously strive to improve our services based on their suggestions.\n\nWe foster a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events, supporting local artisans, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We believe that tourism should benefit the local community and contribute to the preservation of Assam\'s cultural heritage. We achieve this by employing local staff, sourcing local products, and educating our guests about responsible tourism. Kaveri Home Stays actively engages with local non-profits for initiatives that are focused on sustainable tourism for Assam. This deep integration with the local community sets us apart and allows us to offer guests an even more authentic and enriching experience.\n<br> <br>\nLooking ahead, Kaveri Home Stays envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our network of home stays to other parts of Assam, allowing us to offer guests a wider range of experiences. We also plan to develop new and innovative tourism products that showcase the region\'s unique cultural heritage and natural beauty.\n\nWe are committed to continuously improving our services and enhancing the guest experience. This includes investing in training for our staff, upgrading our facilities, and adopting new technologies to improve efficiency and communication. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the Assam tourism sector, creating economic opportunities for local communities and preserving the region\'s rich cultural heritage for future generations. We aim to be more than just a place to stay; we want to be a gateway to a deeper understanding and appreciation of Assam, fostering meaningful connections between visitors and the local community. We foresee strategic partnerships with local artisans and travel agencies to expand outreach of Kaveri Home Stays services.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:10:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1329, 'Amazing Homestay - Three-Bedroom Apartment with Balcony', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Amazing Homestay - Three-Bedroom Apartment with Balcony offers a premium accommodation experience in the heart of Guwahati, catering to travelers seeking comfort, convenience, and a touch of local flavor. Nestled within a vibrant community, our apartment provides a home-away-from-home atmosphere, differentiating us from traditional hotel stays and budget-focused guesthouses. We understand the growing demand for spacious, self-catered accommodations in Guwahati, particularly among families, groups of friends, and business travelers who appreciate privacy and the flexibility to manage their own schedules. Our commitment to exceptional hospitality and meticulously maintained facilities positions us as a leading choice for discerning visitors to Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our primary offering is a fully furnished three-bedroom apartment featuring a private balcony with views of the surrounding cityscape. The apartment is equipped with modern amenities including air conditioning in all rooms, high-speed Wi-Fi, a fully equipped kitchen with a refrigerator, microwave, oven, and stovetop, as well as laundry facilities. Guests have access to comfortable living and dining areas, ensuring ample space for relaxation and social interaction. What truly sets us apart is our dedication to providing a \"turnkey\" solution for our guests; the apartment is supplied with fresh linens, towels, and essential toiletries upon arrival. Furthermore, we offer optional concierge services such as airport transfers, car rentals, and assistance with booking local tours and activities. This commitment to convenience addresses a critical need for travelers who may be unfamiliar with the local transportation and tourism landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Amazing Homestay. We believe in personalized service that goes beyond simply providing a place to stay. Our team is committed to ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience for every guest, from the initial booking inquiry to their departure. We maintain open and responsive communication channels, readily available to address any questions or concerns. Upon arrival, guests receive a warm welcome and a comprehensive orientation to the apartment and the surrounding neighborhood. We also provide a curated guide featuring recommendations for local restaurants, attractions, and shopping areas, allowing guests to experience the authentic flavors of Guwahati. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continually improve our services and ensure we are exceeding their expectations. Our connection with the local community is fostered through partnerships with local businesses and vendors, allowing us to support the local economy and offer unique experiences to our guests, such as cooking classes featuring Assamese cuisine or guided tours led by local experts.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Amazing Homestay envisions becoming the preferred accommodation provider for travelers seeking a comfortable and authentic experience in Guwahati. Our future plans include expanding our portfolio to include additional apartments in strategic locations throughout the city, catering to a wider range of budgets and preferences. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and businesses to offer curated experiences and products to our guests, further enhancing their connection with Assam\'s culture and heritage. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to streamline the booking process, enhance communication, and provide guests with access to a wider range of services and information. We aim to establish ourselves as a leader in sustainable tourism practices, implementing eco-friendly initiatives to minimize our environmental impact and support the local community. Long-term, we aspire to expand beyond Guwahati and establish Amazing Homestay as a recognized brand synonymous with quality and hospitality throughout Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:10:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1330, 'Cityscape_Retreat', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Cityscape_Retreat: Your Urban Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Cityscape_Retreat offers a unique blend of modern hospitality and authentic Assamese charm, establishing itself as a premier destination for business and leisure travelers alike in Guwahati, Assam. Recognizing the growing demand for sophisticated accommodations coupled with personalized experiences, Cityscape_Retreat distinguishes itself by providing a sanctuary amidst the bustling city. More than just a place to stay, we are a gateway to experiencing the rich culture, delectable cuisine, and breathtaking landscapes of Assam. Our commitment to exceptional service and unwavering attention to detail positions us as a significant contributor to the local tourism ecosystem, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable practices.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Core to our offerings are meticulously designed rooms and suites, each reflecting a contemporary aesthetic while incorporating subtle nods to Assamese artistry. We provide a range of accommodation options, from standard rooms perfect for short stays to luxurious suites ideal for extended visits and special occasions. Each room is equipped with modern amenities including high-speed internet access, smart TVs, and premium bedding to ensure a comfortable and productive stay. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond accommodation, Cityscape_Retreat features a state-of-the-art conference and event space, catering to corporate gatherings, workshops, and social events. This versatile space is equipped with cutting-edge audio-visual technology and is supported by a dedicated events team, ensuring seamless execution and a memorable experience for all attendees. Our culinary offerings further enhance the guest experience. Our in-house restaurant showcases the diverse flavors of Assam, using locally sourced ingredients to create authentic and innovative dishes. Guests can savor traditional Assamese thalis, explore regional specialties, and enjoy international favorites, all prepared with the utmost care and attention to detail. We also offer bespoke catering services for events hosted at our venue or at external locations. A rooftop lounge provides a relaxing space to unwind with handcrafted cocktails and panoramic city views. What truly sets Cityscape_Retreat apart is our personalized concierge service. We go beyond the typical hotel offerings by providing curated experiences that allow guests to delve into the local culture. This includes arranging guided tours of historical sites, organizing tea estate visits, facilitating interactions with local artisans, and providing insider recommendations on the best places to eat, shop, and explore in Guwahati and the surrounding areas.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Cityscape_Retreat, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our team is comprised of highly trained professionals who are passionate about hospitality and dedicated to exceeding expectations. We actively solicit feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet their evolving needs. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our commitment to the local community extends beyond providing employment opportunities. We actively partner with local businesses to source products and services, supporting the local economy and promoting sustainable practices. We also participate in community initiatives and events, demonstrating our commitment to social responsibility. Cityscape_Retreat aims to be a cultural hub, showcasing local art, music, and traditions. We regularly host exhibitions and performances featuring local artists and performers, providing a platform to share their talents and enrich the cultural landscape of Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking towards the future, Cityscape_Retreat envisions becoming the leading hospitality destination in Guwahati and a recognized brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional service. We plan to expand our facilities to include additional rooms and suites, as well as enhance our event space to accommodate larger gatherings. We are also exploring opportunities to introduce new services and amenities, such as a wellness center and a dedicated co-working space, to cater to the evolving needs of our guests. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>A key aspect of our future growth strategy involves leveraging technology to enhance the guest experience. We plan to implement smart room technology, personalized mobile apps, and online booking platforms to streamline the booking process and provide seamless access to our services. We are also committed to adopting sustainable practices throughout our operations, reducing our environmental footprint and promoting responsible tourism. This includes implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. Ultimately, Cityscape_Retreat aims to be more than just a hotel; it aspires to be a catalyst for positive change in the community, contributing to the economic prosperity and cultural enrichment of Guwahati and the entire Assam region.\n</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:15:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1331, 'Mi casa homestay', 'Homestays', '', 'Mi Casa Homestay is a burgeoning hospitality business nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering a unique and immersive lodging experience that blends the comforts of home with the richness of Assamese culture. In a market often dominated by impersonal hotels and standardized accommodations, Mi Casa Homestay distinguishes itself by providing guests with a genuine taste of local life, fostering meaningful connections, and contributing positively to the local economy. The business taps into a growing demand for authentic travel experiences, particularly among discerning tourists seeking to explore the cultural tapestry of Assam beyond the typical tourist trails. Situated in Guwahati, a gateway to Northeast India, Mi Casa Homestay serves as an ideal base for exploring the region\'s diverse landscapes and traditions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core service revolves around providing comfortable and culturally immersive homestay accommodations. Unlike conventional hotels, we offer a limited number of carefully curated rooms within a family setting or a designated space designed to mimic the warmth and character of a traditional Assamese home. Each room is thoughtfully furnished, reflecting local aesthetics with handcrafted textiles, bamboo accents, and artwork that celebrates the region\'s artistic heritage. Beyond comfortable lodging, Mi Casa Homestay offers a range of complementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include home-cooked Assamese meals, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, offering a culinary journey through the region\'s distinctive flavors. We also arrange personalized tours and excursions, guided by local experts, showcasing the best of Guwahati and its surrounding areas, including tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries, and historical sites. What sets us apart is our commitment to providing personalized attention and creating a sense of belonging. We go the extra mile to cater to individual needs, offering personalized recommendations, facilitating cultural exchange, and ensuring that every guest feels like a welcomed member of our extended family. This personalized approach, combined with the authenticity of our accommodation and experiences, represents a unique selling point in the Guwahati hospitality market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Mi Casa Homestay, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and authentic environment where guests feel valued, respected, and connected to the local community. Our approach to customer service is built on empathy, attentiveness, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. We actively solicit feedback and continuously refine our services to better meet the evolving needs of our guests. Our commitment to community engagement extends beyond providing exceptional service. We actively support local artisans and businesses, showcasing their products and services to our guests, contributing to the economic empowerment of the community. We also participate in local cultural events and festivals, fostering a sense of pride and belonging within the neighborhood. Mi Casa Homestay stands out by fostering a sense of community amongst its guests, creating opportunities for them to interact with each other and with local residents, enriching their travel experiences and fostering cultural understanding. We believe that travel is about more than just seeing sights; it\'s about forging connections, creating memories, and contributing to the well-being of the communities we visit.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Mi Casa Homestay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Guwahati and the broader Northeast India region. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation capacity while maintaining our commitment to quality and personalized service. We also plan to diversify our offerings by introducing new cultural experiences, such as cooking classes, traditional craft workshops, and immersive language programs. We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with other local businesses and organizations to create synergistic partnerships that benefit the entire community. Sustainability is a core principle of our business model. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact by adopting eco-friendly practices, such as waste reduction, energy conservation, and responsible sourcing. We also aim to contribute to the preservation of Assam\'s cultural heritage by supporting local artisans, promoting traditional crafts, and showcasing the region\'s rich history and traditions. Our long-term goal is to establish Mi Casa Homestay as a model for sustainable and responsible tourism, demonstrating that it is possible to create a successful business while also contributing to the well-being of the environment and the local community. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we can achieve our vision and create a positive impact on the lives of our guests, our community, and the region as a whole.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:15:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1332, 'Kuhipaat Homestay', 'Homestays', '', 'Kuhipaat Homestay: A Sanctuary of Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nKuhipaat Homestay, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offers an authentic and immersive experience of Assamese culture and hospitality. More than just accommodation, Kuhipaat strives to be a gateway for travelers seeking genuine connection with the local community and a deeper understanding of Assam\'s rich heritage. In a city increasingly populated by generic hotels, Kuhipaat distinguishes itself by providing a personalized, culturally sensitive, and environmentally conscious haven for both domestic and international visitors. Its significance lies in its commitment to sustainable tourism, showcasing Assamese traditions, and contributing to the local economy through community engagement. Kuhipaat fills a crucial gap in the Guwahati hospitality sector by offering a unique alternative to standard lodging, appealing to discerning travelers who value authenticity and responsible travel.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Kuhipaat Homestay provides comfortable and traditionally furnished rooms, designed to reflect the aesthetic sensibilities of Assamese homes. Beyond basic lodging, Kuhipaat offers a curated range of services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include:\n\n*   **Authentic Assamese Cuisine:** Home-cooked meals prepared using locally sourced ingredients, offering guests a genuine taste of Assam. This goes beyond typical restaurant fare, featuring traditional dishes often unavailable elsewhere. Cooking classes are also offered, allowing guests to learn the secrets of Assamese cuisine.\n*   **Cultural Immersion Activities:** Arranging guided tours of local temples, tea gardens, and craft villages, providing insights into the region\'s history and culture. We organize traditional Bihu dance performances on request and introduce guests to local artisans.\n*   **Personalized Itinerary Planning:** Tailoring travel itineraries to suit individual preferences, ensuring guests can explore Guwahati and its surrounding areas at their own pace and according to their interests. This might include recommending off-the-beaten-path destinations or arranging transportation.\n*   **Sustainable Tourism Practices:** Kuhipaat is committed to minimizing its environmental impact through the use of eco-friendly products, waste reduction initiatives, and supporting local conservation efforts. We partner with local suppliers who share our commitment to sustainability.\n\nWhat sets Kuhipaat apart is its dedication to providing a truly immersive and authentic experience, rather than simply offering a place to sleep. The focus on local cuisine, cultural activities, and personalized service creates a unique selling proposition that appeals to travelers seeking a deeper connection with Assam. This approach also directly addresses the market need for culturally sensitive and responsible tourism options in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at Kuhipaat Homestay is built on warmth, personalized attention, and a genuine desire to share the beauty of Assamese culture. From the moment guests arrive, they are welcomed with traditional Assamese hospitality, including a *gamusa* (traditional Assamese scarf) and a refreshing welcome drink. Staff members are not just employees but passionate ambassadors of Assam, eager to share their knowledge and stories with guests.\n\nKuhipaat fosters a strong connection with the local community by employing local staff, sourcing products from local artisans and farmers, and supporting community-based tourism initiatives. Guests are encouraged to interact with the local community, participate in cultural events, and learn about the daily lives of the people of Assam. Regular feedback is actively sought and implemented to continually improve the guest experience. This commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement has resulted in high levels of repeat business and positive word-of-mouth referrals, solidifying Kuhipaat\'s reputation as a premier homestay in Guwahati. We strive to create lasting memories and build genuine connections between our guests and the local community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nKuhipaat Homestay envisions becoming a leading advocate for sustainable and culturally responsible tourism in Assam. Future plans include:\n\n*   **Expanding Accommodation Capacity:** Increasing the number of rooms while maintaining the intimate and personalized atmosphere. This will allow us to accommodate more guests while preserving the unique character of Kuhipaat.\n*   **Developing New Cultural Immersion Programs:** Offering a wider range of activities, such as workshops on Assamese silk weaving, traditional pottery, and local music. This will deepen the guest experience and provide additional opportunities to learn about Assamese culture.\n*   **Establishing Partnerships with Local Communities:** Collaborating with villages and communities outside Guwahati to offer authentic rural tourism experiences. This will help to diversify tourism offerings and support economic development in rural areas.\n*   **Implementing Green Initiatives:** Further reducing the homestay\'s environmental footprint through initiatives such as rainwater harvesting, solar energy, and composting. We aim to become a model for sustainable tourism practices in the region.\n*   **Creating a Culinary School:** Offering in-depth courses on Assamese cuisine, attracting both domestic and international culinary enthusiasts. This will further promote Assamese culinary heritage and provide training opportunities for local residents.\n\nThe long-term goal is to establish Kuhipaat Homestay as a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Assamese hospitality, sustainable tourism, and community engagement. We aim to be more than just a place to stay; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change in the local community and a champion of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:15:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1333, 'Vamoose Madhumita Homestay', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Vamoose Madhumita Homestay is a haven of tranquility and Assamese hospitality, nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati. More than just a place to stay, Vamoose Madhumita offers an immersive cultural experience, connecting travelers with the authentic heart of Assam. Situated away from the bustling city center yet conveniently accessible to key attractions, the homestay provides a serene escape, a comfortable base from which to explore the region\'s rich heritage, stunning landscapes, and diverse culinary scene. Vamoose Madhumita differentiates itself by weaving traditional Assamese elements into every aspect of the guest experience, creating a truly memorable stay that goes beyond the standard hotel offering. Its presence in the Guwahati hospitality sector signifies a shift towards personalized, culturally sensitive tourism, contributing to a more sustainable and enriching experience for visitors and the local community alike.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core service provided by Vamoose Madhumita Homestay is comfortable and culturally enriching accommodation. Guests can choose from well-appointed rooms, each reflecting traditional Assamese aesthetics with locally sourced materials and handicrafts. Beyond lodging, Vamoose Madhumita offers a range of experiences designed to immerse guests in the local culture. These include authentic Assamese meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients, providing a genuine taste of the region. Cooking classes are also available, allowing guests to learn the secrets of Assamese cuisine. Furthermore, the homestay organizes guided tours to nearby attractions, showcasing the historical sites, natural beauty, and vibrant local markets of Guwahati and the surrounding areas. A unique selling point of Vamoose Madhumita is its commitment to sustainable tourism practices. The homestay actively supports local artisans and businesses, promoting economic empowerment within the community. By offering authentic cultural experiences and prioritizing responsible tourism, Vamoose Madhumita caters to the growing demand for meaningful and immersive travel, aligning perfectly with the preferences of discerning travelers seeking genuine connections with the local culture.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Vamoose Madhumita Homestay, exceptional customer service is paramount. The approach is deeply rooted in the Assamese tradition of warmth and hospitality, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and cared for. Personalized attention is a key element, with staff members dedicated to understanding each guest\'s individual needs and preferences. From arranging airport transfers to providing tailored recommendations for sightseeing and dining, the team goes above and beyond to create a seamless and memorable experience. What sets Vamoose Madhumita apart is its genuine connection with the local community. The homestay actively promotes local culture through events and workshops, inviting guests to participate in traditional festivals, learn local crafts, and interact with community members. This fosters a sense of cultural exchange and creates opportunities for meaningful connections. Furthermore, Vamoose Madhumita is committed to giving back to the community through various initiatives, such as supporting local schools and promoting environmental awareness. By prioritizing genuine hospitality, cultural immersion, and community engagement, Vamoose Madhumita creates a truly authentic and enriching experience for its guests, fostering lasting memories and positive impacts on the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Vamoose Madhumita Homestay envisions itself as a leading advocate for sustainable and culturally sensitive tourism in Assam. The long-term goal is to expand its reach and impact while maintaining its core values of authenticity, hospitality, and community engagement. Future plans include developing new and innovative cultural experiences, such as curated tours focusing on specific aspects of Assamese heritage, wellness retreats incorporating traditional healing practices, and partnerships with local artists and artisans to showcase their work. The business also aims to enhance its sustainability efforts by implementing eco-friendly practices throughout its operations, reducing its environmental footprint and promoting responsible resource management. Exploring opportunities for strategic partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, such as tour operators, travel agencies, and local businesses, is also a key focus. These collaborations will help to broaden the reach of Vamoose Madhumita, attracting a wider audience and promoting Assam as a premier destination for cultural tourism. Ultimately, Vamoose Madhumita Homestay strives to be a catalyst for positive change in the Assam tourism landscape, inspiring other businesses to adopt sustainable practices and promote authentic cultural experiences, contributing to a more vibrant and prosperous future for the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:15:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1334, 'AC, balcony & complimentary breakfast at Shivam Guest House by OK North East', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Shivam Guest House by OK North East, located in the vibrant city of Guwahati, offers a comfortable and convenient accommodation experience catering specifically to the needs of both leisure and business travelers exploring Assam and the Northeast region. We distinguish ourselves by providing well-appointed rooms featuring air conditioning, private balconies, and complimentary breakfast, a combination highly valued by our guests and a significant advantage in the Guwahati hospitality sector.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Guwahati, as the gateway to Northeast India, experiences a steady influx of tourists and business professionals. Shivam Guest House fills a crucial niche by providing quality accommodation that balances affordability with essential amenities. Our commitment is to offer a refreshing and reliable stay, enabling guests to explore the region with ease and return to a comfortable and restful environment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Shivam Guest House, our core offering revolves around providing comfortable and convenient lodging. Each room is equipped with air conditioning to combat the humid climate of Guwahati, ensuring a pleasant stay regardless of the season. A private balcony offers a space for relaxation and allows guests to enjoy the city\'s ambiance. The complimentary breakfast provides a convenient and energizing start to the day, saving our guests valuable time and resources. These fundamental amenities, packaged with a commitment to cleanliness and attentive service, constitute our primary value proposition.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond the standard offerings, we understand the importance of connectivity in today\'s world. Therefore, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi is available throughout the guest house, allowing guests to stay connected with work, family, or social media. We also offer travel assistance and information, guiding guests to local attractions, transportation options, and essential services. This focus on holistic service makes us more than just a place to sleep; we strive to be a valuable resource for our guests during their time in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling points stem from the synergy of essential amenities, attentive service, and a convenient location. The inclusion of air conditioning and a private balcony is not always standard in similarly priced accommodations in Guwahati, providing a competitive edge. The complimentary breakfast further enhances the value proposition, catering to budget-conscious travelers seeking a comfortable and convenient experience. The \"OK North East\" affiliation signifies a commitment to quality and reliable service, building trust with our guests.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We understand that travelers coming to Guwahati often need assistance navigating the region. Our knowledgeable staff is trained to provide information about local attractions, transportation, and cultural experiences. We can assist with booking tours, arranging transportation, and providing recommendations for dining and shopping. This personalized assistance ensures that our guests can make the most of their time in Guwahati and the surrounding areas.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Shivam Guest House, we believe in providing a warm and welcoming atmosphere for our guests. Our staff is dedicated to delivering friendly and efficient service, ensuring that every guest feels comfortable and well-cared for. We strive to create a personalized experience, taking the time to understand each guest\'s individual needs and preferences. This personalized approach fosters a sense of community and encourages repeat business.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We are actively involved in supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We source our breakfast ingredients from local farmers and suppliers whenever possible, contributing to the local economy. We also encourage our guests to explore the local culture and support local artisans and businesses. By promoting responsible tourism, we aim to contribute to the long-term well-being of the Guwahati community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Shivam Guest House by OK North East envisions expanding its services and enhancing its facilities to better serve the evolving needs of travelers to Guwahati. We plan to explore opportunities to incorporate sustainable practices into our operations, minimizing our environmental impact. We are also committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development to ensure that they continue to deliver exceptional service.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing Shivam Guest House as a leading accommodation provider in Guwahati, known for its quality, value, and commitment to customer satisfaction. We aim to become a preferred choice for both leisure and business travelers seeking a comfortable and convenient base for exploring the Northeast region. By continuously improving our services and facilities, we are confident that we can achieve our vision and contribute to the growth of the tourism sector in Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:15:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
