(1335, 'Tokari Home Stay', 'Homestays', '', 'Tokari Home Stay: A Gateway to Authentic Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nTokari Home Stay offers a unique and immersive hospitality experience in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Rooted in the rich cultural heritage of the region, we provide more than just accommodation; we offer a genuine connection to the local way of life, making us a distinctive player in Guwahati’s burgeoning tourism sector. We stand apart by blending modern comforts with traditional Assamese aesthetics, creating a warm and welcoming environment for both domestic and international travelers seeking an authentic cultural immersion. <br> <br>\n\nOur commitment goes beyond providing lodging. We strive to showcase the true essence of Assam to our guests, contributing to the responsible and sustainable growth of tourism in the region. We see ourselves as ambassadors of Assamese culture, promoting its beauty and traditions to a global audience while simultaneously empowering the local community. <br> <br>\n\nOur Core Services and Products\n\nAt Tokari Home Stay, our core offering is comfortable and thoughtfully designed accommodation that reflects the spirit of Assam. Our rooms, decorated with local crafts and textiles, provide a tranquil and inviting retreat for our guests. We offer a range of room options to cater to diverse needs, from solo travelers to families, all equipped with modern amenities such as Wi-Fi, air conditioning, and private bathrooms. <br> <br>\n\nBeyond accommodation, we curate immersive experiences designed to introduce our guests to the authentic culture of Assam. This includes traditional Assamese cooking classes, where guests can learn to prepare local delicacies using fresh, locally sourced ingredients. We also organize guided tours to nearby tea gardens, historical sites, and wildlife sanctuaries, offering insights into the region\'s rich history, natural beauty, and biodiversity. Furthermore, we showcase traditional Assamese music and dance performances, providing a captivating glimpse into the region\'s vibrant cultural heritage. <br> <br>\n\nWhat sets us apart is our commitment to personalized service and authentic cultural immersion. Unlike conventional hotels, we foster a warm and familial atmosphere, ensuring that each guest feels welcomed and valued. Our focus on using locally sourced products and supporting local artisans further enhances the authenticity of the Tokari Home Stay experience. This commitment not only benefits the local economy but also ensures that our guests receive a truly unique and memorable stay. We directly address the growing market need for experiential travel, providing travelers with opportunities to connect with the local culture and create lasting memories. <br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience: Connecting with Culture and Community\n\nAt Tokari Home Stay, customer service is more than just a department; it is an integral part of our philosophy. We believe in building genuine connections with our guests, understanding their needs, and exceeding their expectations. Our staff is carefully selected for their warmth, hospitality, and knowledge of Assamese culture. They are trained to provide personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. <br> <br>\n\nWe actively encourage interaction between our guests and the local community. We facilitate opportunities for guests to meet local artisans, farmers, and musicians, allowing them to learn firsthand about their lives and traditions. We also support local businesses by sourcing our products and services locally, ensuring that our operations contribute to the economic well-being of the community. <br> <br>\n\nOur commitment to sustainable tourism further strengthens our connection with the local community. We actively promote responsible travel practices, encouraging our guests to respect the local environment and culture. We also support local conservation efforts, contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural heritage. We actively seek and respond to customer feedback, using it to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall guest experience. This dedication has resulted in high levels of customer satisfaction and a strong reputation within the local community. <br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: Growth and Sustainability\n\nTokari Home Stay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality, recognized for its commitment to cultural preservation and sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, while maintaining our focus on providing personalized service and a unique cultural experience. We plan to add more rooms, potentially developing cottage-style accommodations within a larger property that still retains the intimate feel of a home stay. <br> <br>\n\nWe also aim to further develop our range of cultural immersion activities, offering new and innovative experiences that showcase the diverse traditions of Assam. This includes organizing specialized tours focused on specific aspects of Assamese culture, such as tea cultivation, silk weaving, and traditional music. Furthermore, we plan to enhance our sustainability initiatives, reducing our environmental impact and supporting local conservation efforts. We intend to implement eco-friendly practices such as solar energy utilization and waste reduction programs. <br> <br>\n\nLong-term, we aspire to establish Tokari Home Stay as a model for responsible and sustainable tourism in Assam, inspiring other businesses to prioritize cultural preservation and community engagement. We believe that by combining modern comforts with traditional Assamese hospitality, we can create a unique and memorable experience for our guests while contributing to the sustainable development of the region. We are confident that Tokari Home Stay will continue to thrive as a gateway to authentic Assamese culture, welcoming travelers from around the world to experience the beauty and hospitality of our beloved Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:20:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1336, 'Tour Inn', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Tour Inn, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a comprehensive travel and tourism company dedicated to providing authentic and immersive experiences within the Northeast region of India. Recognizing the untapped potential of Assam’s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and diverse wildlife, Tour Inn strives to be the premier gateway for travelers seeking unique and unforgettable adventures. The company\'s significance lies in its commitment to responsible tourism, empowering local communities, and showcasing the hidden gems of the region, contributing to the sustainable growth of Assam\'s tourism sector. Unlike conventional tour operators, Tour Inn emphasizes personalized itineraries, cultural sensitivity, and eco-friendly practices, setting a new standard for travel experiences in Northeast India.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Tour Inn’s core services encompass a wide range of travel solutions, catering to both domestic and international tourists. These include meticulously crafted tour packages focusing on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, cultural explorations of Assam\'s vibrant traditions and historical sites like the Kamakhya Temple, and adventurous trekking expeditions in the scenic hills of Meghalaya and Arunachal Pradesh. We also provide customized itineraries based on individual preferences and interests, ensuring each traveler has a truly bespoke experience. Beyond tour packages, Tour Inn offers comprehensive travel support services, including flight and train ticketing, hotel bookings at a range of establishments from boutique guesthouses to luxury resorts, transportation arrangements with a modern fleet of vehicles, and expert guidance on visa and travel documentation. Our unique selling point is the emphasis on experiential travel, incorporating elements like tea garden visits, interactions with local artisans, and traditional Assamese cooking classes. These activities allow travelers to connect with the local culture on a deeper level. By focusing on sustainable tourism practices and partnering with local communities, Tour Inn directly addresses the needs of the local market by promoting economic empowerment and preserving cultural heritage.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Tour Inn, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is built on a foundation of personalized attention, responsiveness, and genuine care. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the journey, we strive to create a seamless and enjoyable experience for every traveler. A dedicated team of multilingual travel experts is available 24/7 to assist with any queries or concerns. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure we exceed their expectations. Tour Inn distinguishes itself by fostering a strong connection with the local community. We actively collaborate with local artisans, guides, and homestay providers, creating mutually beneficial partnerships. This collaborative approach not only enhances the traveler\'s experience but also contributes to the economic well-being of the local communities. Furthermore, Tour Inn actively participates in local festivals and events, promoting Assam\'s cultural heritage and fostering a sense of community pride. We believe that responsible tourism involves actively engaging with and supporting the communities we operate in.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Tour Inn envisions itself as the leading travel and tourism company in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and authentic travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our tour offerings to include more niche experiences, such as birdwatching tours, tea tourism circuits, and adventure sports activities. We also plan to invest in developing eco-friendly accommodations and transportation options to further minimize our environmental impact. A key focus will be on leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly mobile app with real-time travel updates, interactive maps, and personalized recommendations. We intend to strengthen our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to play a more active role in the tourism industry. Long-term goals include expanding our operations to other parts of India and internationally, promoting Northeast India as a premier tourist destination on the global stage. Tour Inn aims to be a catalyst for sustainable economic growth in the region, preserving its unique cultural heritage and protecting its natural environment for generations to come. Our ultimate ambition is to create unforgettable travel experiences that inspire a deeper appreciation for the beauty and diversity of Northeast India.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:20:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1337, 'Konwer\'s Home Stay\\n\\n', 'Homestays', '', 'Konwer\'s Home Stay: A Gateway to Authentic Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati\n\nKonwer\'s Home Stay offers a tranquil and authentic Assamese experience for travelers seeking a genuine connection with the culture and charm of Guwahati. Nestled in a serene corner of the city, Konwer\'s provides a welcoming alternative to conventional hotels, focusing on personalized service, cultural immersion, and a comfortable \"home away from home\" atmosphere. In the bustling Guwahati landscape, Konwer’s distinguishes itself by offering a curated experience that highlights local traditions, cuisine, and the inherent warmth of Assamese hospitality. It serves as an ideal base for exploring the region\'s rich heritage, from the ancient temples to the lush tea gardens, providing not just accommodation, but an enriching cultural journey.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Konwer\'s Home Stay provides thoughtfully designed accommodation options ranging from comfortable standard rooms to spacious family suites. Each room is meticulously maintained, reflecting a blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese decor. Beyond accommodation, Konwer\'s distinguishes itself through its culinary offerings. Guests are treated to authentic Assamese meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. The home stay goes beyond simply providing food; it offers cooking classes, allowing guests to learn the secrets of Assamese cuisine and experience the joy of preparing traditional dishes. A significant unique selling point is the curated tour packages offered by Konwer\'s. These packages are designed to provide an immersive experience of Guwahati and its surrounding areas, including visits to prominent temples like Kamakhya, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and excursions to nearby tea estates. By offering these curated experiences, Konwer\'s caters to the growing demand for experiential travel, providing guests with opportunities to connect with the local culture in a meaningful way. The home stay effectively addresses the local market need for comfortable, culturally-sensitive accommodation and personalized travel experiences, particularly for visitors seeking to explore Assam beyond the typical tourist trails.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Konwer\'s Home Stay. The approach is rooted in personalized service, where every guest is treated as an individual with unique needs and preferences. The staff is dedicated to creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere, ensuring that guests feel comfortable and cared for throughout their stay. What truly sets Konwer\'s apart is its commitment to connecting guests with the local community. The home stay facilitates interactions between guests and local artisans, offering opportunities to learn about traditional crafts like weaving and pottery. It also promotes responsible tourism by supporting local businesses and initiatives. This commitment to community engagement extends beyond the home stay\'s walls. Konwer\'s actively participates in local festivals and events, further solidifying its role as an integral part of the Guwahati community. By fostering genuine connections and promoting cultural exchange, Konwer\'s creates a memorable and enriching experience for its guests, turning them into ambassadors for the Assam region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Konwer\'s Home Stay envisions becoming a leading provider of authentic Assamese hospitality in Guwahati and beyond. The long-term goal is to expand the business, potentially adding more rooms or establishing additional home stay locations in other parts of Assam. Future plans include enhancing the range of services offered, such as incorporating wellness programs, yoga retreats, and immersive cultural workshops focused on Assamese music, dance, and art. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Konwer\'s is committed to minimizing its environmental impact and promoting responsible tourism practices. This includes implementing energy-efficient technologies, reducing waste, and supporting local conservation efforts. The business also aims to strengthen its online presence and expand its marketing efforts to reach a wider audience. By leveraging digital platforms and collaborating with travel agencies, Konwer\'s seeks to attract more visitors to Guwahati and showcase the beauty and culture of Assam to the world. Ultimately, Konwer\'s Home Stay aspires to be more than just a place to stay; it aims to be a cultural hub, a catalyst for responsible tourism, and a gateway to the rich and vibrant heritage of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:20:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1338, 'Lily Homes', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Lily Homes: Crafting Spaces, Building Dreams in Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Lily Homes is a Guwahati-based business dedicated to providing high-quality residential solutions, focusing on construction and real estate development. Recognizing the growing demand for modern, comfortable, and accessible housing in Assam, Lily Homes strives to create spaces that blend contemporary design with the region\'s rich cultural heritage. We are committed to building not just houses, but homes where families can thrive and create lasting memories. Our core philosophy centers around integrity, innovation, and a deep understanding of the needs and aspirations of the local community. In a market often dominated by larger national players, Lily Homes distinguishes itself through personalized service, localized design aesthetics, and a unwavering commitment to ethical business practices. We aim to be a trusted partner in helping individuals and families achieve their dream of homeownership in Guwahati and beyond.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our primary services encompass both residential construction and real estate development. We offer a range of housing options, from thoughtfully designed apartments catering to young professionals and small families, to spacious independent homes suitable for larger households. Each project is meticulously planned and executed, ensuring adherence to the highest standards of quality and safety. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to incorporating eco-friendly practices and sustainable materials whenever possible, reflecting a dedication to environmental responsibility and long-term value for our customers. Furthermore, we understand the specific architectural preferences and climatic conditions of the region. Our designs are tailored to maximize natural light and ventilation, minimizing the need for artificial cooling and promoting energy efficiency. We also offer customized design services, allowing clients to personalize their homes to reflect their individual tastes and lifestyles. This level of personalization is a key differentiator in the Guwahati market, where standardized housing options often fail to meet the diverse needs of the community. By offering flexible and adaptable housing solutions, Lily Homes addresses the local market need for homes that are both aesthetically pleasing and functionally efficient.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Lily Homes, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a seamless and stress-free experience for our clients, from the initial consultation to the final handover of their new home. Our dedicated team of professionals provides personalized attention, guiding customers through every step of the process, answering their questions, and addressing their concerns promptly and effectively. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and processes. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively participate in community events, support local businesses, and prioritize hiring local talent. This commitment to community engagement fosters trust and builds lasting relationships with our customers. We also understand the importance of transparency and integrity in our business dealings. We are committed to providing clear and accurate information to our clients, ensuring that they are fully informed and empowered to make the best decisions for their families. This ethical approach has earned us a reputation for trustworthiness and reliability, making Lily Homes a preferred choice for homebuyers in Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Lily Homes envisions a future where sustainable and affordable housing is accessible to all in Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our operations to other key cities in the region, while maintaining our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction. We plan to introduce innovative building technologies and design concepts to further enhance the value and appeal of our homes. We are also exploring opportunities to develop integrated residential communities that offer a range of amenities and services, such as parks, schools, and shopping centers, creating vibrant and self-sufficient neighborhoods. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in the training and development of our employees, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to meet the evolving needs of the market. We also plan to strengthen our partnerships with local suppliers and contractors, supporting the growth of the local economy. Ultimately, Lily Homes aims to be a leading real estate developer in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community development. We aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, creating spaces where individuals and families can thrive, and contributing to the overall well-being of the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:20:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1339, 'MAA Homestay Dormitory', 'Homestays', '', '<p>MAA Homestay Dormitory is a locally owned and operated accommodation provider in Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to offering budget-friendly, comfortable, and secure lodging options for travelers, students, and professionals. In the vibrant and bustling city of Guwahati, where tourism and education are significant drivers of the economy, MAA Homestay Dormitory fills a crucial gap by providing affordable alternatives to traditional hotels, catering specifically to individuals seeking community-oriented and cost-effective stays. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing a bed; we aim to create a welcoming and supportive environment that reflects the warmth and hospitality of Assamese culture.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service is providing dormitory-style accommodation with a focus on cleanliness, safety, and comfort. We offer a range of dormitory rooms, varying in size from smaller, more private rooms to larger, more communal spaces, allowing guests to choose an option that best suits their needs and budget. Each bed is equipped with personal storage lockers, reading lights, and power outlets, ensuring individual convenience and privacy within a shared space. Beyond the basic amenities, MAA Homestay Dormitory distinguishes itself by offering a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the guest experience. These include complimentary Wi-Fi throughout the premises, a communal kitchen equipped with essential appliances for self-catering, and a common area designed for relaxation, socializing, and collaborative work. We also provide laundry facilities, luggage storage, and 24/7 security to ensure the safety and convenience of our guests. Our location in Guwahati provides easy access to key transportation hubs, educational institutions, and tourist attractions, making us an ideal base for exploring the city and surrounding areas. What truly sets us apart is our dedication to creating a community atmosphere. We regularly organize social events and activities, such as guided tours of local attractions, cultural performances, and informal gatherings, providing opportunities for guests to connect with each other and experience the rich culture of Assam. This community focus resonates particularly well with students and solo travelers seeking a sense of belonging and connection.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At MAA Homestay Dormitory, we prioritize providing exceptional customer service that embodies the spirit of Assamese hospitality. Our staff are carefully selected for their friendly demeanor, helpfulness, and knowledge of the local area. We are committed to going the extra mile to assist our guests, whether it\'s providing travel advice, arranging transportation, or addressing any concerns they may have. We believe in fostering open communication and encourage feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services. Our approach to customer service extends beyond the immediate needs of our guests. We are actively involved in the local community, partnering with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism and support community initiatives. This commitment to social responsibility resonates with travelers who are seeking meaningful and authentic experiences. We also utilize online platforms and social media to engage with our guests, share information about local events and attractions, and build a strong online community. We believe that by creating a welcoming and supportive environment, both online and offline, we can foster lasting relationships with our guests and contribute to the positive image of Guwahati as a welcoming destination.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for MAA Homestay Dormitory is to become the leading provider of budget-friendly, community-oriented accommodation in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our operations by opening additional locations in other key cities and towns in Assam, replicating our successful model of providing comfortable, affordable, and socially responsible lodging options. We also aim to diversify our services by offering customized tour packages, language classes, and cultural workshops, further enhancing the guest experience and promoting the unique culture of Assam. Our long-term goals include establishing partnerships with educational institutions and corporate organizations to provide accommodation for students and professionals attending conferences and training programs. We also plan to invest in sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of the local community. We believe that by staying true to our core values of providing exceptional customer service, fostering a strong community atmosphere, and promoting sustainable tourism, MAA Homestay Dormitory can achieve significant growth and become a valuable asset to the local business landscape in Assam. Our commitment to continuous improvement and innovation will ensure that we remain at the forefront of the budget accommodation sector, providing travelers with unforgettable experiences and contributing to the economic and social development of the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:20:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1340, 'Quiet yet located in the heart of the city....!', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Quiet yet located in the heart of the city...! is a unique establishment nestled in Guwahati, Assam, offering a tranquil escape amidst the urban bustle. More than just a business, it’s a sanctuary designed to cater to the needs of the modern individual seeking respite, productivity, and connection within a vibrant community. Situated strategically in a central location, it provides unparalleled accessibility while maintaining an atmosphere of serenity, a rare and valuable combination in a rapidly developing city like Guwahati. This dual nature positions \"Quiet yet located in the heart of the city...!\" as a distinctive and highly sought-after destination, filling a crucial gap in the local market for individuals and professionals seeking a balanced and fulfilling experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, \"Quiet yet located in the heart of the city...!\" offers a multi-faceted approach, combining a high-end co-working space with a specialty tea and coffee bar, and complemented by curated workshops and events focused on personal and professional development. The co-working space provides a flexible and productive environment for freelancers, remote workers, and small teams. It boasts state-of-the-art amenities, including high-speed internet, ergonomic furniture, private meeting rooms equipped with video conferencing facilities, and printing services. What sets it apart from typical co-working spaces is its emphasis on creating a peaceful and focused atmosphere, achieved through thoughtful design, soundproofing, and designated quiet zones. The tea and coffee bar offers a selection of premium Assam teas, ethically sourced coffee, and light refreshments, providing a stimulating and comforting experience for both co-workers and casual visitors alike. The regularly scheduled workshops and events, ranging from skill-building sessions to networking opportunities, foster a sense of community and contribute to the personal and professional growth of its members. This holistic approach, combining productivity, relaxation, and community engagement, is a key differentiator, appealing to a diverse clientele seeking more than just a place to work or grab a coffee. It caters specifically to the emerging needs of Guwahati\'s growing professional class and the increasingly sophisticated demands of its urban population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at \"Quiet yet located in the heart of the city...!\". From the moment someone walks through the door, they are greeted with genuine warmth and attentive service. Staff members are trained to anticipate needs and create a welcoming and supportive environment. The business distinguishes itself through personalized interactions, actively seeking feedback and adapting its services to meet the evolving preferences of its customers. A loyalty program rewards frequent visitors, fostering a sense of belonging and appreciation. \"Quiet yet located in the heart of the city...!\" actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artists, artisans, and organizations. It showcases local talent, supports community initiatives, and creates opportunities for cultural exchange. By hosting events that celebrate Assam\'s rich heritage and culture, the business strengthens its connection to the local community and positions itself as a hub for cultural and intellectual activity. Furthermore, it prioritizes sourcing ingredients and materials locally, contributing to the sustainability of the local economy and reducing its environmental footprint. This commitment to community engagement and responsible business practices enhances its reputation and fosters a strong sense of goodwill.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for \"Quiet yet located in the heart of the city...!\" is ambitious and forward-looking. The business plans to expand its co-working space to accommodate the growing demand, adding more private offices and collaborative workspaces. It also aims to introduce new services, such as on-site childcare and wellness programs, catering to the needs of working parents and individuals seeking a holistic lifestyle. The business envisions establishing a network of similar establishments in other key cities across Assam and Northeast India, replicating its successful model of combining productivity, relaxation, and community engagement. In the long term, \"Quiet yet located in the heart of the city...!\" aspires to become a leading provider of flexible workspace solutions and a prominent advocate for sustainable and community-focused business practices in the region. By continuously innovating, adapting to market trends, and staying true to its core values, \"Quiet yet located in the heart of the city...!\" is poised to achieve significant growth and make a lasting positive impact on the local business landscape and the wider community.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:25:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1341, 'Urbanica Homestay', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Urbanica Homestay is a uniquely positioned hospitality venture nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offering travelers an authentic and immersive experience of Assamese culture and lifestyle. Beyond providing comfortable accommodation, Urbanica distinguishes itself by fostering a genuine connection between guests and the local community, contributing to the burgeoning tourism sector in Assam while preserving its rich heritage. Unlike conventional hotels, Urbanica offers a personalized and intimate environment that resonates with both domestic and international travelers seeking an enriching and memorable stay.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Urbanica\'s offerings are thoughtfully designed and well-maintained rooms that blend modern amenities with traditional Assamese aesthetics. Guests can choose from a range of accommodation options, each reflecting the unique character of the region. Beyond comfortable lodging, Urbanica provides a curated selection of experiences, including traditional Assamese cooking classes, guided tours of local markets and historical sites, and opportunities to engage with local artisans. A significant unique selling point lies in the emphasis on sustainable tourism practices, promoting responsible travel and supporting local businesses. Urbanica addresses the growing demand for experiential travel, catering to individuals and families who seek to understand and appreciate the cultural fabric of Assam. This approach differentiates Urbanica from standard hotels and resorts, appealing to a more discerning and culturally curious clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Urbanica Homestay. The team is dedicated to providing warm, personalized service that anticipates and exceeds guest expectations. From pre-arrival assistance with travel arrangements to on-site support and curated activity recommendations, every effort is made to ensure a seamless and unforgettable stay. Urbanica actively fosters a sense of community by organizing cultural events and providing opportunities for guests to interact with local residents. This connection extends beyond the homestay itself, with Urbanica actively collaborating with local artisans, businesses, and community organizations to promote Assamese culture and heritage. This dedication to customer satisfaction and community engagement has resulted in high levels of guest loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals, establishing Urbanica as a trusted and respected name in Guwahati\'s hospitality sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Urbanica Homestay envisions becoming a leading example of sustainable and culturally immersive tourism in Assam. Future plans include expanding the range of accommodation options while maintaining the intimate and personalized service that defines the brand. There is a strong commitment to further developing and promoting unique cultural experiences, such as tea garden tours, traditional weaving workshops, and opportunities to participate in local festivals. Moreover, Urbanica aims to strengthen its partnerships with local businesses and community organizations to create a positive social and economic impact. Long-term goals include replicating the Urbanica model in other regions of Assam, showcasing the diverse cultural landscape of the state while upholding the principles of responsible and sustainable tourism. Urbanica Homestay is dedicated to fostering cultural exchange, supporting local communities, and providing travelers with an authentic and unforgettable Assam experience. Through continuous innovation and a unwavering commitment to its core values, Urbanica aims to solidify its position as a premier destination for culturally immersive travel in the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:25:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1342, 'Tusti Homestay', 'Homestays', '', 'Tusti Homestay, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique blend of traditional Assamese hospitality and modern comforts, making it a haven for travelers seeking an authentic and enriching experience. In a region increasingly sought after for its natural beauty, vibrant culture, and growing business opportunities, Tusti Homestay distinguishes itself by providing personalized service, a deep connection to the local community, and an immersive cultural environment that goes beyond the typical hotel stay. We are more than just accommodation; we are a gateway to experiencing the true essence of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Tusti Homestay, our core offering is comfortable and culturally-rich accommodation. We provide well-appointed rooms designed to reflect the aesthetic sensibilities of Assam, incorporating local textiles, art, and craftsmanship. Beyond the rooms themselves, we offer a range of services designed to enhance the guest experience. This includes authentic Assamese meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients, providing a true taste of the region. We also organize cultural experiences, such as guided tours of Guwahati\'s historical sites, visits to local craft villages, and opportunities to participate in traditional Assamese festivals and celebrations (subject to availability). What sets us apart is our commitment to responsible tourism. We actively support local artisans and businesses, ensuring that our operations contribute positively to the community and environment. This focus on sustainability resonates deeply with travelers seeking meaningful and ethical travel experiences. Our services directly address the growing demand for experiential travel, catering to tourists, business travelers, and researchers who want to engage with the local culture on a deeper level than offered by conventional hotels.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer service at Tusti Homestay is built upon the principles of warmth, respect, and genuine care. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where guests feel like part of the family. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide personalized attention to each guest, anticipating their needs and going the extra mile to ensure their comfort and satisfaction. We encourage open communication and actively seek feedback to continuously improve our services. What truly makes us stand out is our connection to the local community. We actively participate in community events, support local initiatives, and promote Assamese culture through our homestay. We also collaborate with local artisans and businesses, providing them with opportunities to showcase their talents and products. This strong connection to the community not only enriches the guest experience but also fosters a sense of belonging and contributes to the sustainable development of the region. Guests often comment on the genuine hospitality and the feeling of being immersed in the local culture, which are key differentiators for Tusti Homestay.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Tusti Homestay envisions itself as a leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our accommodation offerings while maintaining our commitment to quality and personalized service. We are exploring opportunities to develop eco-tourism initiatives, such as guided treks in the surrounding hills and birdwatching tours. We also plan to enhance our cultural experiences by offering workshops in traditional Assamese crafts, cooking classes, and language lessons. A key aspect of our long-term strategy is to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations. We believe that collaboration is essential for promoting sustainable tourism and supporting the local economy. We are committed to investing in training and development opportunities for our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional service. Our ultimate goal is to create a homestay that is not only a comfortable and welcoming place to stay but also a valuable asset to the local community and a promoter of Assamese culture on a global stage. We aspire to be recognized as a model for responsible and sustainable tourism in the region, inspiring other businesses to follow suit and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s unique heritage.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:25:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1343, 'Cosy & Spacious in Guwahati City', 'Homestays', '', 'Cosy & Spacious in Guwahati City is more than just a name; it\'s a commitment to providing residents and visitors alike with comfortable, well-appointed accommodations and exceptional service within the vibrant heart of Guwahati. Located strategically in Guwahati, this establishment aims to redefine the standard for short-term and extended stays, offering a unique blend of homely warmth and modern convenience often missing in traditional hotel settings. In a city experiencing rapid growth and increasingly attracting both business travelers and tourists exploring the gateway to Northeast India, Cosy & Spacious fills a crucial gap by providing a reliable, comfortable, and competitively priced alternative to generic hotels. Its significance lies in its commitment to delivering value and creating a memorable Assam experience for every guest.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Cosy & Spacious in Guwahati City offers a range of thoughtfully designed and meticulously maintained apartments and rooms available for short-term and extended stays. These accommodations are more than just places to sleep; they are fully equipped havens designed to cater to diverse needs. From studios ideal for solo travelers and business professionals to spacious multi-bedroom apartments perfect for families or groups, each unit is furnished with comfortable furniture, fully equipped kitchens or kitchenettes (depending on the unit), modern appliances, high-speed internet access, and other amenities designed to ensure a seamless and enjoyable stay. The unique selling point is the deliberate emphasis on creating a \"home away from home\" atmosphere. This is achieved through the use of inviting décor, ample space for relaxation and work, and a focus on providing guests with the tools they need to live comfortably during their stay, rather than just existing in a sterile hotel environment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nUnderstanding the local market, Cosy & Spacious recognizes the need for flexible accommodation options that cater to the varying durations and budgets of travelers coming to Guwahati. The business addresses this need by offering a tiered pricing structure based on length of stay and apartment size, making it an attractive alternative to hotels for extended business trips, family vacations, or even individuals relocating to the city. Furthermore, all units are maintained to the highest standards of cleanliness and safety, ensuring a worry-free experience for all guests.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe commitment to exceptional customer service is paramount at Cosy & Spacious. From the initial inquiry to the final check-out, every interaction is designed to be friendly, efficient, and personalized. A dedicated team of local staff is available to assist guests with everything from booking inquiries and check-in procedures to providing local recommendations for restaurants, attractions, and transportation. What truly sets Cosy & Spacious apart is its dedication to building relationships with its guests. The staff is actively encouraged to engage with guests, learn about their needs, and provide tailored recommendations that enhance their experience in Guwahati. Small touches, such as complimentary welcome baskets with local snacks and drinks, are designed to create a lasting impression and foster a sense of belonging.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, Cosy & Spacious actively seeks to connect with the local community. The business partners with local businesses, such as restaurants and tour operators, to offer guests exclusive deals and packages that support the local economy. The business also participates in local events and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community. This focus on community engagement not only benefits the local economy but also enhances the guest experience by providing opportunities to connect with the authentic culture and spirit of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Cosy & Spacious envisions significant growth potential. Future plans include expanding the portfolio of properties to include additional apartments and rooms in strategic locations throughout Guwahati. The business also plans to invest in technology to streamline the booking process and enhance the guest experience, such as implementing a user-friendly online booking platform and a mobile app that allows guests to easily access information and services.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLong-term goals include establishing Cosy & Spacious as a leading provider of short-term and extended-stay accommodations in Guwahati and potentially expanding to other key cities in Northeast India. The business aims to achieve this by consistently delivering exceptional value, building strong relationships with its guests and the local community, and remaining committed to providing a comfortable and memorable Assam experience for everyone who chooses to stay at Cosy & Spacious in Guwahati City. The vision is to become synonymous with quality, comfort, and genuine hospitality in the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:25:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
