(1352, 'Cozy Home - Quadruple Room with Bath', 'Homestays', '', 'Cozy Home - Quadruple Room with Bath, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, offers a unique accommodation experience tailored to families and small groups visiting Assam\'s vibrant capital. More than just a place to stay, Cozy Home provides a comfortable and convenient base for exploring the region\'s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking natural beauty, and burgeoning business opportunities. In a city where accommodation options range from budget guesthouses to luxury hotels, Cozy Home carves its niche by providing spacious, affordable, and well-appointed quadruple rooms, catering specifically to the needs of those traveling with companions. This focus distinguishes it from establishments primarily targeting solo travelers or couples, filling a significant gap in the local market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Cozy Home\'s offerings is the quadruple room with attached bath. This room configuration is designed to comfortably accommodate up to four individuals, making it ideal for families, groups of friends, or colleagues traveling together. Each room is thoughtfully furnished with comfortable beds, clean linens, ample storage space, and essential amenities such as air conditioning and Wi-Fi. The attached bathroom ensures privacy and convenience for all guests. A key differentiating factor is the emphasis on cleanliness and hygiene, which are paramount to ensuring a pleasant and healthy stay. Regular deep cleaning and stringent hygiene protocols are implemented throughout the property. This commitment addresses a significant concern for travelers, particularly those seeking affordable accommodation. Further enhancing the appeal is the provision of complimentary breakfast, allowing guests to start their day energized and ready to explore Guwahati. This combination of spacious accommodation, essential amenities, and affordable pricing makes Cozy Home a compelling choice for budget-conscious travelers who refuse to compromise on comfort and convenience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of the Cozy Home philosophy. The business strives to provide personalized and attentive service, fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere for all guests. Staff are trained to be helpful and responsive, assisting with everything from travel arrangements and local recommendations to addressing any concerns or requests promptly and efficiently. Recognizing the importance of connecting with the local community, Cozy Home actively promotes local businesses and attractions. Guests are provided with information on nearby restaurants serving authentic Assamese cuisine, local markets offering unique handicrafts, and cultural sites showcasing the region\'s rich history. This not only enhances the guest experience but also supports the local economy. Furthermore, Cozy Home actively solicits feedback from guests to continuously improve its services and offerings. This commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in consistently positive reviews and a high rate of repeat bookings, solidifying Cozy Home\'s reputation as a trusted and reliable accommodation provider in Guwahati. The business also provides assistance in local languages, Hindi and Assamese, further facilitating communication and fostering a sense of belonging for guests from diverse backgrounds.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Cozy Home envisions becoming the premier provider of affordable and comfortable group accommodation in Guwahati. The business plans to expand its services to cater to a wider range of travelers, potentially including the addition of family suites or interconnected rooms. Investment in technology is also a priority, with plans to implement online booking systems and enhance communication channels with guests. Furthermore, Cozy Home aims to strengthen its ties with the local community by partnering with local tour operators to offer curated experiences showcasing the best of Assam\'s culture and natural beauty. Sustainable practices are also being explored, such as implementing energy-efficient lighting and water conservation measures, to minimize the environmental impact of the business. Ultimately, Cozy Home aims to not only provide comfortable and affordable accommodation but also to contribute to the growth and prosperity of the local community. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand to other locations within Assam, offering a consistent and reliable accommodation option for travelers throughout the region.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:35:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1353, 'Dreams Abode', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Dreams Abode: Crafting Homes and Building Futures in Guwahati</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Dreams Abode emerges as a leading real estate solutions provider in Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to transforming the aspirations of individuals and families into tangible realities. Situated in the heart of Northeast India, our firm uniquely understands the region\'s distinct cultural nuances, aesthetic preferences, and economic realities. We are not just about selling properties; we are about crafting homes and building lasting relationships with our clients, contributing meaningfully to the evolving urban landscape of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Unlike larger, nationally focused real estate corporations, Dreams Abode is deeply rooted in the local community. This allows us to provide personalized attention and tailored solutions that cater to the specific needs and aspirations of our clients, whether they are first-time homebuyers, seasoned investors, or businesses seeking commercial spaces. We recognize the significance of property ownership in Assamese culture and strive to make the process transparent, seamless, and ultimately, fulfilling. Our commitment to ethical practices and client satisfaction distinguishes us as a trusted partner in the Guwahati real estate market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive range of real estate solutions, tailored to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. We specialize in:</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><b>Residential Property Sales:</b> Offering a diverse portfolio of apartments, independent houses, and villas across Guwahati. We meticulously select properties based on location, quality of construction, amenities, and potential for appreciation. Our team of experienced agents provides expert guidance throughout the buying process, from initial consultation to final closing.</li>\n    <li><b>Commercial Property Sales and Leasing:</b> Catering to businesses of all sizes, we offer a range of commercial properties, including office spaces, retail outlets, and industrial facilities. We assist clients in identifying properties that align with their specific business requirements, considering factors such as location, accessibility, and infrastructure. Our leasing services provide flexible options for businesses seeking short-term or long-term solutions.</li>\n    <li><b>Property Management Services:</b> Providing comprehensive property management solutions for residential and commercial properties. Our services include tenant screening, rent collection, property maintenance, and legal compliance, ensuring that our clients’ investments are well-maintained and profitable. We understand the challenges of property ownership and aim to alleviate the burden by providing professional and reliable management services.</li>\n    <li><b>Real Estate Investment Advisory:</b> Offering expert advice on real estate investment opportunities in Guwahati and the surrounding areas. We conduct thorough market research and analysis to identify properties with high potential for appreciation and rental income. Our advisory services are tailored to the individual investment goals and risk tolerance of our clients.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Dreams Abode apart is our unwavering commitment to providing exceptional customer service. We understand that buying or selling property is a significant decision, and we strive to make the process as stress-free and rewarding as possible. Our team of dedicated professionals is readily available to answer questions, provide guidance, and offer support at every stage of the transaction. We prioritize building long-term relationships with our clients, based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through sponsorships of local events, participation in community initiatives, and support for charitable organizations. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us and are committed to making a positive impact on the lives of those around us. We also conduct regular seminars and workshops on real estate investment, providing valuable information and insights to aspiring homebuyers and investors.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Dreams Abode envisions becoming the premier real estate solutions provider in Northeast India, renowned for our integrity, professionalism, and commitment to client satisfaction. We plan to expand our portfolio of properties to include a wider range of residential and commercial options, catering to diverse market segments. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own real estate projects, focusing on sustainable and environmentally friendly designs.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of Guwahati by providing high-quality housing and commercial spaces that enhance the city\'s livability and economic vitality. We are committed to staying at the forefront of industry trends and adopting innovative technologies to improve our services and enhance the customer experience. By continuously striving for excellence, we aim to solidify our position as the trusted partner for all real estate needs in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:35:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1354, 'Vintage Dwelling homestay', 'Homestays', '', 'Vintage Dwelling homestay offers a unique and immersive experience in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, catering to travelers seeking an authentic connection with the region\'s culture, heritage, and warm hospitality. Unlike conventional hotels, Vintage Dwelling provides a personalized and intimate setting reminiscent of a traditional Assamese home, blended with modern comforts and conveniences. Situated strategically within Guwahati, it serves as a convenient base for exploring the city\'s vibrant markets, historical sites, and the surrounding natural beauty of Assam. Vintage Dwelling aims to contribute positively to the local tourism ecosystem by promoting sustainable practices and supporting local artisans and communities.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering is curated homestay experiences. We provide beautifully appointed rooms that reflect the aesthetic of Assamese design, incorporating local materials and craftsmanship. Beyond accommodation, we offer immersive cultural experiences such as traditional Assamese cooking classes, guided tours of local tea gardens and silk weaving centers, and opportunities to participate in regional festivals and events. A significant differentiator is our emphasis on personalized service. Guests aren\'t just booking a room; they\'re entering a home, where they are welcomed with genuine warmth and care. Our team is dedicated to providing tailored recommendations for local experiences, arranging transportation, and addressing any specific needs or requests to ensure a memorable stay. This personalised approach directly addresses a growing demand in the travel market for authentic and meaningful experiences, rather than standardized hotel offerings.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience lies at the heart of Vintage Dwelling. From the moment a guest makes an inquiry, they are treated with respect and personalized attention. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where guests feel comfortable interacting with our team and other visitors. We provide locally sourced, home-cooked meals that showcase the diverse flavors of Assamese cuisine, often accommodating dietary restrictions and preferences. We also actively connect guests with the local community by recommending ethical and sustainable businesses, promoting local artisans through in-house displays and sales, and encouraging respectful interactions with local customs and traditions. Our commitment extends beyond providing accommodation; we aim to foster cultural exchange and create lasting positive impacts on both our guests and the community we serve. We believe that this deeply rooted connection with the local culture is what truly sets us apart and creates a unique and memorable homestay experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Vintage Dwelling envisions becoming a leading homestay destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authentic cultural experiences and sustainable tourism practices. Future plans include expanding our range of cultural immersion activities, such as organizing village homestays in collaboration with local communities, providing educational workshops on Assamese art and culture, and developing partnerships with local tour operators to offer responsible and eco-friendly travel options. We also plan to enhance our online presence to reach a wider audience of conscious travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences. We aim to incorporate sustainable practices throughout our operations, such as reducing waste, conserving energy and water, and supporting local suppliers and artisans. Our long-term goal is not just to provide accommodation, but to create a platform for cultural exchange, community empowerment, and responsible tourism, contributing to the preservation and promotion of Assam\'s rich heritage. We see Vintage Dwelling as a catalyst for positive change, inspiring others to embrace sustainable tourism practices and celebrate the unique beauty and culture of Assam.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:35:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1355, 'M B Holiday Home', 'Homestays', '', '<p>M B Holiday Home, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a tranquil escape and a unique lodging experience that blends modern comfort with the rich cultural tapestry of the region. More than just a place to stay, M B Holiday Home strives to be a gateway for visitors to discover the authentic Assam, offering a warm and inviting atmosphere that resonates with both local traditions and international standards. In a city known for its vibrant tea gardens, ancient temples, and bustling marketplaces, M B Holiday Home distinguishes itself by providing personalized service, meticulously maintained accommodations, and a commitment to showcasing the best of Assamese hospitality. Its strategic location offers easy access to key landmarks, business centers, and transportation hubs, making it an ideal choice for both leisure travelers and corporate guests seeking a comfortable and convenient base in Guwahati. As a locally owned and operated establishment, M B Holiday Home is deeply invested in the community, contributing to the local economy and fostering sustainable tourism practices.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, M B Holiday Home provides well-appointed and comfortable accommodation options catering to a diverse range of needs and preferences. Our offerings include a variety of rooms, ranging from cozy standard rooms perfect for solo travelers or short stays, to spacious family suites designed for extended vacations. Each room is thoughtfully designed with modern amenities, including air conditioning, high-speed internet access, flat-screen televisions, and en-suite bathrooms with hot and cold water. Beyond accommodation, M B Holiday Home offers a range of services designed to enhance the guest experience. We provide complimentary breakfast featuring both continental and traditional Assamese dishes, allowing guests to sample the unique flavors of the region. Our in-house travel desk assists guests with arranging local tours, transportation, and other travel-related needs. We also offer laundry services, airport transfers, and 24-hour reception to ensure a seamless and stress-free stay. What truly sets M B Holiday Home apart is its dedication to providing a personalized and authentic Assamese experience. We work closely with local artisans and suppliers to showcase the region\'s rich cultural heritage through handcrafted décor, local cuisine, and curated experiences. This commitment allows us to offer guests a unique opportunity to immerse themselves in the local culture and create lasting memories. Our services address the specific needs of the local market by offering a blend of comfort, convenience, and cultural immersion that appeals to both domestic and international travelers seeking an authentic Assam experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at M B Holiday Home. We believe that genuine hospitality is the key to creating lasting impressions and fostering loyalty. Our approach to customer service is rooted in anticipating guest needs, exceeding expectations, and creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with personalized attention and genuine care. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide exceptional service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and respected. We actively solicit feedback from our guests and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We are committed to fostering a strong connection with the local community. We partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism and support local initiatives. We also actively participate in community events and activities, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community. This approach to customer service, coupled with our commitment to the local community, sets M B Holiday Home apart from other lodging options in Guwahati. We strive to create a sense of belonging and connection for our guests, making them feel like they are part of the M B Holiday Home family.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, M B Holiday Home envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued excellence in hospitality. Our long-term goals include expanding our accommodation offerings to cater to a wider range of travelers, while maintaining the personalized service and authentic Assamese experience that defines our brand. We plan to incorporate eco-friendly practices into our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural beauty. This includes exploring renewable energy options, implementing water conservation measures, and reducing waste through recycling and composting programs. Furthermore, we intend to strengthen our ties with the local community by supporting local artisans, promoting cultural tourism, and investing in community development projects. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the guest experience, such as implementing online booking systems, mobile check-in/check-out options, and personalized recommendations based on guest preferences. The potential for growth in Guwahati\'s tourism sector is significant, and M B Holiday Home is well-positioned to capitalize on this opportunity by providing exceptional service, authentic experiences, and a commitment to sustainable tourism practices. Our vision is to become the leading choice for travelers seeking a comfortable, convenient, and culturally immersive experience in Guwahati, while contributing to the economic and social well-being of the local community. We aim to be more than just a place to stay; we aspire to be a gateway to the heart and soul of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:40:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1356, 'Classic Homes Airport', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Classic Homes Airport stands as a prominent real estate firm in Guwahati, Assam, specializing in providing comprehensive property solutions to individuals and families seeking to buy, sell, or rent homes in the region. With a focus on integrity, transparency, and personalized service, Classic Homes Airport distinguishes itself by offering a curated portfolio of properties and a client-centric approach that prioritizes understanding and meeting the unique needs of each customer. In a dynamic market like Guwahati, where understanding local nuances is paramount, Classic Homes Airport leverages its deep regional expertise to guide clients through every step of the real estate journey, ensuring a smooth and successful transaction. The firm recognizes the significance of homeownership in Assamese culture and strives to make the dream of owning a home a tangible reality for its clients.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Classic Homes Airport\'s services lies a commitment to providing a one-stop solution for all real estate needs. The firm\'s core offerings include property sales, rental management, and real estate advisory services. The property sales division showcases a diverse range of residential options, from apartments in the heart of Guwahati to independent houses in the serene outskirts. Each property is carefully vetted to ensure it meets the highest standards of quality and value. The rental management service caters to both property owners and tenants, offering comprehensive management solutions, including tenant screening, rent collection, and property maintenance. This service is particularly valuable in Guwahati, where many homeowners seek reliable management for their investment properties. Furthermore, Classic Homes Airport provides expert real estate advisory services, offering insightful market analysis and guidance to clients looking to make informed investment decisions. The firm\'s unique selling point lies in its intimate knowledge of the Guwahati real estate landscape, which allows it to provide tailored solutions that perfectly align with the needs and preferences of local residents.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Classic Homes Airport places customer experience at the forefront of its operations, recognizing that buying or selling a home is often one of the most significant financial and emotional decisions in a person\'s life. The firm fosters a culture of empathy, attentiveness, and proactive communication, ensuring that every client feels valued and supported throughout the entire process. The team at Classic Homes Airport goes beyond simply showing properties; they take the time to understand each client\'s individual needs, preferences, and budget, providing personalized guidance and support at every stage. This commitment to exceptional service has earned Classic Homes Airport a strong reputation for trustworthiness and reliability within the Guwahati community. Moreover, the firm actively participates in local events and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to giving back to the community and fostering strong relationships with local residents. This community engagement helps to build trust and solidify Classic Homes Airport\'s position as a respected and valued member of the Guwahati business ecosystem.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Classic Homes Airport envisions becoming the leading real estate firm in Guwahati, renowned for its integrity, innovation, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. The firm plans to expand its service offerings to include property valuation and legal assistance, further streamlining the real estate process for its clients. Furthermore, Classic Homes Airport aims to leverage technology to enhance its services, implementing a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily browse properties, schedule viewings, and track their transactions. This technological advancement will improve efficiency and accessibility, making Classic Homes Airport even more responsive to the needs of its clients. The firm also plans to invest in training and development programs for its employees, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of industry knowledge and best practices. By continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Classic Homes Airport is well-positioned to achieve its long-term goals and solidify its position as a trusted partner for all real estate needs in Guwahati and beyond.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:40:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1357, 'Sajupriya homestay', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Sajupriya Homestay: Your Gateway to Authentic Assamese Hospitality in Guwahati</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam, Sajupriya Homestay offers a tranquil and immersive experience for travelers seeking an authentic taste of Assamese culture and hospitality. Unlike conventional hotels, Sajupriya provides a home-away-from-home atmosphere, allowing guests to connect with the local way of life and create lasting memories. In the burgeoning tourism sector of Assam, Sajupriya stands out by prioritizing personalized experiences, cultural immersion, and sustainable practices, contributing to the region\'s economic growth while preserving its unique heritage. It caters to a diverse clientele, ranging from domestic tourists seeking cultural experiences to international travelers exploring the Northeast of India, and business travelers looking for a comfortable and convenient alternative to impersonal hotels.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Sajupriya Homestay\'s core offering revolves around providing comfortable and culturally rich accommodation. This includes well-appointed rooms reflecting local aesthetics, equipped with modern amenities to ensure a seamless stay. Beyond accommodation, Sajupriya curates authentic experiences, such as traditional Assamese cooking classes where guests learn to prepare local delicacies using fresh, regional ingredients. Another unique offering is guided tours of Guwahati and its surrounding areas, led by knowledgeable locals who share insights into the region\'s history, culture, and natural beauty. Furthermore, Sajupriya facilitates interactions with local artisans, showcasing the region\'s rich crafts and providing opportunities for guests to purchase unique souvenirs directly from the creators. These curated experiences directly address the growing demand for experiential travel, particularly among tourists seeking authentic cultural immersion beyond superficial sightseeing.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Sajupriya Homestay\'s ethos. The emphasis is on creating a warm and welcoming environment where guests feel like part of the family. This is achieved through personalized attention, anticipatory service, and genuine interactions. Staff are trained not only to handle guest requests efficiently but also to engage in meaningful conversations, share local knowledge, and provide recommendations tailored to individual interests. Sajupriya actively fosters a sense of community by organizing cultural evenings featuring traditional Assamese music and dance performances, creating opportunities for guests to interact with local artists and fellow travelers. Furthermore, the homestay actively participates in local initiatives, supporting local businesses and contributing to community development projects. This commitment to social responsibility resonates deeply with guests, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals. Sajupriya leverages online platforms to actively solicit feedback, respond to inquiries promptly, and continuously improve its services based on guest suggestions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Sajupriya Homestay envisions itself as a leading advocate for sustainable and responsible tourism in Assam. The long-term goal is to expand its operations while maintaining its commitment to personalized service and cultural immersion. This includes potentially adding more rooms or even establishing satellite homestays in other parts of Assam, showcasing the diverse landscapes and cultures of the region. Future plans involve developing more specialized tour packages catering to specific interests, such as wildlife tourism, tea plantation visits, and spiritual retreats. Sajupriya also aims to strengthen its partnerships with local artisans and businesses, creating more economic opportunities within the community. A key focus will be on integrating technology to enhance the guest experience, such as online booking platforms, virtual tours, and personalized travel itineraries. Ultimately, Sajupriya Homestay aspires to be recognized as a model for sustainable tourism in Assam, contributing to the region\'s economic prosperity while preserving its unique cultural heritage for generations to come.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:40:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1358, 'Anne’s Laces Homestay', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Anne’s Laces Homestay offers a unique and authentic Assam experience for travellers seeking comfortable accommodation with a personal touch in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a place to stay, Anne’s Laces provides an immersive cultural encounter, showcasing Assamese hospitality and tradition. Situated amidst the bustling city, yet nestled in a tranquil neighbourhood, the homestay offers a serene escape from the everyday, making it a noteworthy addition to Guwahati\'s growing tourism sector. In a market dominated by conventional hotels, Anne’s Laces distinguishes itself by providing a genuine home-away-from-home experience, fostering connections between guests and the local culture. It\'s a small but significant contributor to the regional economy, promoting sustainable tourism and supporting local artisans and businesses.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Anne\'s Laces Homestay provides comfortable and well-appointed rooms catering to both leisure and business travellers. Each room is designed with a blend of modern amenities and traditional Assamese decor, reflecting the rich heritage of the region. Beyond accommodation, the homestay offers a range of curated experiences designed to immerse guests in the local culture. These include Assamese cooking classes, where guests learn to prepare authentic dishes like <i>Masor Tenga</i> and <i>Pitha</i>; guided tours of local markets and historical sites; and opportunities to interact with local artisans, learning about traditional crafts like silk weaving and bamboo work. A significant unique selling point is the personalized service. Guests are treated as family, receiving individual attention and assistance in planning their itinerary and navigating Guwahati. The homestay also offers home-cooked meals using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, providing a taste of authentic Assamese cuisine. This combination of comfortable accommodation, personalized service, and cultural immersion caters to the growing demand for experiential travel, particularly among tourists seeking an alternative to generic hotel stays and desiring a deeper connection with the local community and culture.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Anne’s Laces Homestay prioritizes creating a memorable and personalized customer experience. The emphasis is on genuine hospitality and building lasting relationships with guests. From the moment a guest arrives, they are greeted with warmth and treated as part of the family. The staff are knowledgeable about the local area and are always willing to offer recommendations for places to visit, things to do, and restaurants to try. What sets Anne’s Laces apart is its commitment to fostering a sense of community. Guests are encouraged to interact with each other and share their experiences. The homestay also actively engages with the local community, supporting local businesses and artisans. For example, the homestay sources its ingredients from local farmers and showcases the work of local artisans in its decor. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the guest experience but also contributes to the sustainable development of the local economy. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the services and facilities offered, ensuring that the homestay remains responsive to the needs and preferences of its guests.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Anne’s Laces Homestay is to become a leading provider of authentic Assamese cultural experiences, recognized for its exceptional hospitality and commitment to sustainable tourism. Expansion plans include adding more rooms and facilities to cater to a growing demand, while maintaining the intimate and personalized atmosphere that defines the homestay. Future plans also involve developing new and innovative cultural experiences, such as workshops on traditional Assamese music and dance, and partnerships with local organizations to promote responsible tourism practices. Long-term goals include establishing a training program for local youth, providing them with the skills and knowledge necessary to work in the hospitality industry and contribute to the economic development of the region. Another key objective is to strengthen ties with the local community by supporting local initiatives and promoting cultural exchange. By staying true to its core values of authenticity, hospitality, and sustainability, Anne’s Laces Homestay aims to not only grow as a business but also contribute to the preservation and promotion of Assamese culture and heritage. The aspiration is to create a model for sustainable tourism that benefits both the local community and the visitors who come to experience the beauty and richness of Assam.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:40:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1359, 'Shamaayim - A Luxury Stay', 'Homestays', '', 'Shamaayim - A Luxury Stay: An Oasis of Sophistication in Guwahati\n\nShamaayim - A Luxury Stay is redefining hospitality in Guwahati, Assam, by offering an unparalleled experience that blends sophisticated comfort with the region\'s rich cultural heritage. More than just a place to stay, Shamaayim is a destination in itself, meticulously crafted to cater to discerning travelers seeking tranquility, exclusivity, and personalized service. In a region known for its burgeoning tourism sector and increasing demand for high-end accommodations, Shamaayim fills a crucial niche, providing a haven of luxury that resonates with both local and international guests. Situated strategically in Guwahati, it offers easy access to the city\'s key attractions while maintaining an atmosphere of secluded serenity, making it a significant addition to the premium hospitality offerings in Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around providing elegantly appointed accommodations coupled with bespoke services designed to exceed expectations. Shamaayim features a limited number of suites and rooms, each thoughtfully designed with contemporary aesthetics and infused with subtle Assamese design elements, creating a unique sense of place. These are not just rooms; they are sanctuaries offering panoramic views, luxurious bedding, state-of-the-art amenities, and dedicated concierge service.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond the accommodations, Shamaayim boasts a range of exclusive amenities, including a fine-dining restaurant showcasing regional and international cuisine crafted with locally sourced ingredients, a rejuvenating spa offering traditional Ayurvedic treatments, and a meticulously landscaped outdoor pool area perfect for relaxation. One of our unique selling points is our commitment to personalized experiences. We understand that each guest is unique, and we strive to tailor every aspect of their stay to their individual preferences, from curated excursions to private dining experiences. The emphasis on local sourcing extends beyond the restaurant, with Shamaayim actively supporting local artisans and businesses, offering guests an authentic taste of Assam. This commitment resonates deeply with the local market, which increasingly values sustainable and culturally sensitive tourism. By providing luxury that is both refined and respectful of its surroundings, Shamaayim addresses the growing demand for sophisticated and responsible travel experiences in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Shamaayim, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our team is meticulously trained to anticipate guest needs, provide personalized attention, and create memorable experiences. We foster a culture of warmth and genuine hospitality, treating each guest as an individual and ensuring that their stay is seamless and stress-free.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Shamaayim apart is our dedication to connecting with the local community. We actively collaborate with local tour operators to offer unique cultural experiences, such as tea garden tours, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and visits to local craft villages. We also host events showcasing Assamese art, music, and cuisine, providing a platform for local talent and enriching the guest experience. We strive to be more than just a hotel; we aim to be an active and responsible member of the Guwahati community, contributing to its economic and cultural vitality. This deep connection resonates with both local and international guests, who appreciate the opportunity to immerse themselves in the authentic culture of Assam. We believe in building long-term relationships with our guests, fostering loyalty through consistent delivery of exceptional service and a genuine commitment to their satisfaction.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Shamaayim envisions becoming the premier luxury destination in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include curated wellness programs, personalized adventure tours, and exclusive events. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our footprint, potentially opening new properties in other key tourist destinations in Assam and the surrounding region, always maintaining the same commitment to quality, luxury, and cultural sensitivity that defines the Shamaayim brand.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are committed to continuous improvement and innovation, constantly seeking new ways to enhance the guest experience and stay ahead of evolving market trends. Our long-term goal is to establish Shamaayim as a symbol of refined hospitality, a destination that not only provides luxurious accommodations but also creates lasting memories and contributes to the sustainable development of the region. We aim to be recognized as a leader in responsible tourism, showcasing the beauty and culture of Assam while minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local communities. Shamaayim – A Luxury Stay is not just a business; it\'s a passion project, driven by a desire to create something truly special and meaningful in the heart of Guwahati.', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:40:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1360, 'Ecstacy 2BHK', 'Homestays', '', '<p>Ecstacy 2BHK stands as a unique player in Guwahati\'s real estate market, specializing in providing fully furnished, ready-to-move-in 2BHK apartments for short-term and long-term stays. Addressing the growing demand for flexible living solutions, particularly among professionals, students, and families relocating to Assam, Ecstacy 2BHK offers a convenient and comfortable alternative to traditional rental options and hotels. Located strategically in Guwahati, a city experiencing rapid urbanization and economic growth, the business aims to redefine urban living by providing thoughtfully designed and meticulously maintained living spaces that cater to a diverse range of needs. The business taps into the evolving lifestyle preferences of a generation that values convenience, mobility, and community, positioning itself as a preferred choice for those seeking a hassle-free living experience in the heart of Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the core of Ecstacy 2BHK lies its commitment to providing fully furnished 2BHK apartments equipped with all essential amenities. This includes comfortable bedrooms, a functional kitchen complete with cooking utensils and appliances, a cozy living area, and modern bathroom facilities. Beyond the basic necessities, each apartment is designed with a focus on aesthetics and functionality, creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere for residents. A key differentiator for Ecstacy 2BHK is its flexible rental options. Whether it\'s a short-term stay for a project assignment or a long-term residence while settling into a new job, the business offers tailored lease agreements to suit individual needs. Furthermore, Ecstacy 2BHK distinguishes itself through its comprehensive service package, which includes regular cleaning, maintenance, and dedicated customer support. This all-inclusive approach eliminates the typical burdens associated with renting and managing a property, offering residents a truly worry-free living experience. The service meets a significant local market need, particularly for those new to Guwahati or seeking temporary accommodation without the commitment of setting up a household from scratch.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Ecstacy 2BHK prioritizes creating a positive and seamless customer experience from initial inquiry to move-out. The team understands that choosing a place to live is a significant decision, and they strive to provide personalized attention and guidance throughout the entire process. The business emphasizes clear communication, transparency in its pricing and policies, and prompt responsiveness to resident inquiries and requests. To foster a sense of community, Ecstacy 2BHK actively engages with its residents through social events and initiatives, creating opportunities for connection and interaction. The business also recognizes the importance of being a responsible corporate citizen within the local community. This includes supporting local businesses and initiatives, promoting sustainable practices, and contributing to the overall well-being of the neighborhood. By fostering strong relationships with its residents and actively engaging with the local community, Ecstacy 2BHK aims to build a reputation as a trusted and valued member of Guwahati\'s business landscape.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Ecstacy 2BHK involves strategic expansion within Guwahati and potentially into other key cities in Assam. This growth will be driven by a commitment to maintaining the highest standards of quality and customer service. Plans include increasing the number of available apartments, incorporating smart home technology to enhance the living experience, and introducing additional services such as laundry and concierge. Ecstacy 2BHK also envisions developing partnerships with local businesses and organizations to offer residents exclusive discounts and benefits, further enhancing the value proposition. Long-term, the business aims to become a leading provider of flexible living solutions in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to innovation, customer satisfaction, and community engagement. By staying attuned to evolving market trends and consistently exceeding customer expectations, Ecstacy 2BHK is poised for continued growth and success in the dynamic real estate landscape of Guwahati and beyond. The business aims to be synonymous with comfortable, convenient, and community-focused living in the region.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:45:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1361, 'ALPANEST - Near GMCH and B Barooah Cancer - Superior King Room', 'Homestays', '', '<p>ALPANEST – Near GMCH and B Barooah Cancer Institute – Superior King Room offers premium accommodation in Guwahati, strategically located for those seeking convenience and comfort during medical visits or business trips. Situated in close proximity to the Gauhati Medical College and Hospital (GMCH) and the Dr. B. Borooah Cancer Institute, ALPANEST addresses a critical need in the local Assam landscape: providing a comfortable, secure, and easily accessible stay for patients, their families, and visiting medical professionals. We understand the unique challenges faced by individuals and families navigating healthcare journeys, and our accommodations are designed to provide a haven of tranquility amidst potentially stressful circumstances. Beyond its proximity to medical facilities, ALPANEST serves as a well-appointed retreat for business travelers seeking a respite from the hustle of the city, offering a superior alternative to traditional hotels with a focus on personalized service and a home-away-from-home atmosphere. Our commitment extends beyond simply providing lodging; we strive to be a supportive resource for our guests, connecting them with essential local amenities and fostering a sense of community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering is the meticulously designed Superior King Room, a haven of comfort and functionality tailored to the needs of our diverse clientele. Each room boasts a king-size bed with premium bedding, ensuring a restful night\'s sleep. A private, well-appointed bathroom with modern fixtures and complimentary toiletries provides a refreshing start to the day. Beyond the essentials, we provide amenities designed for both relaxation and productivity, including high-speed Wi-Fi access, a flat-screen television with cable channels, and a dedicated workspace suitable for remote work or personal use. What truly sets ALPANEST apart is its commitment to creating a peaceful and supportive environment. We offer flexible check-in and check-out times to accommodate unpredictable medical schedules, and our staff is trained to provide discreet and empathetic service. Understanding the unique needs of individuals undergoing medical treatment, we offer options for tailored meal arrangements and can facilitate connections to local transportation services for hospital visits or errands. These services directly address the anxieties and logistical challenges faced by patients and their families, providing peace of mind during a difficult time.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt ALPANEST, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our approach is rooted in empathy, attentiveness, and a genuine desire to make our guests\' stay as comfortable and stress-free as possible. We prioritize personalized attention, taking the time to understand each guest\'s individual needs and preferences. From assisting with transportation arrangements to providing recommendations for local restaurants and services, we strive to be a helpful and reliable resource. We maintain open lines of communication, encouraging feedback and continuously seeking ways to improve our services. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our immediate guests. We actively support local businesses and initiatives, contributing to the economic well-being of the surrounding area. We also strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment for all, fostering a sense of belonging and connection. We partner with local charities and organizations to provide assistance to patients and families in need, further demonstrating our commitment to serving the community beyond our immediate business interests.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, ALPANEST envisions becoming the premier accommodation choice for individuals and families visiting GMCH and the Dr. B. Borooah Cancer Institute, as well as a preferred destination for business travelers seeking a comfortable and convenient stay in Guwahati. We plan to expand our service offerings to include additional amenities, such as a dedicated concierge service, on-site laundry facilities, and partnerships with local healthcare providers to offer discounted services to our guests. We are exploring opportunities to expand our accommodation options to include family suites and accessible rooms, catering to a wider range of needs. Our long-term goals include establishing ALPANEST as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, comfort, and compassionate service. We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of our guests and the local community, ensuring that ALPANEST remains a valuable resource for years to come. Ultimately, our vision is to create a space where individuals can find respite, support, and a sense of belonging, regardless of the circumstances that bring them to Guwahati.</p>', 'Guwahati', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 09:45:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
