(1437, 'Asian Holidays & Expeditions', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>Asian Holidays & Expeditions, located at House No 10, Amrabati Path, GS Rd, Guwahati, stands as a premier travel and tour operator deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, we are architects of unforgettable experiences, specializing in curating personalized journeys that showcase the diverse beauty and rich cultural heritage of Northeast India and select destinations across Asia. In a region renowned for its breathtaking landscapes and vibrant traditions, Asian Holidays & Expeditions distinguishes itself through its commitment to authentic travel, sustainable tourism practices, and unparalleled customer service. We strive to be a gateway, connecting travelers with the soul of Asia, while contributing positively to the local communities we interact with.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service lies in crafting bespoke travel itineraries that cater to a wide range of interests and preferences. From adventurous expeditions into the Himalayas and exploring the lush tea gardens of Assam to immersive cultural tours of ancient temples and vibrant festivals, we offer a diverse portfolio of travel options. We specialize in personalized itineraries, ensuring each journey is tailored to the individual needs and desires of our clients. This includes arranging comfortable accommodations, reliable transportation, knowledgeable local guides fluent in multiple languages, and access to unique experiences often unavailable to the average traveler. Our trekking tours are particularly popular, taking adventurers through stunning landscapes like the Dzukou Valley and the Kaziranga National Park periphery, offering a chance to spot rare wildlife and immerse in the region\'s natural beauty. Beyond Northeast India, we also offer meticulously planned tours to Southeast Asian destinations such as Thailand, Vietnam, and Cambodia, focusing on cultural immersion and responsible travel. What sets us apart is our deep understanding of the local ecosystem, our established relationships with local communities, and our unwavering commitment to responsible tourism. We prioritize supporting local businesses, minimizing our environmental impact, and respecting the cultural sensitivities of the regions we operate in.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Asian Holidays & Expeditions, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in building relationships, not just processing transactions. From the initial inquiry to the final departure, our dedicated team provides personalized attention and unwavering support. Our travel consultants are not just booking agents; they are passionate travel enthusiasts with in-depth knowledge of the destinations we offer. They take the time to understand each client\'s unique interests, budget, and travel style, creating itineraries that perfectly match their expectations. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, attention to detail, and proactive problem-solving. Before, during, and after the trip, our team is readily available to address any concerns or provide assistance. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that every journey is a truly memorable one. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our business operations. We actively participate in local tourism initiatives, supporting cultural preservation efforts and promoting sustainable development. By partnering with local artisans, guides, and guesthouse owners, we contribute to the economic well-being of the communities we serve, creating a mutually beneficial relationship that enriches the travel experience for our clients and strengthens the fabric of the local culture.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Asian Holidays & Expeditions envisions itself as a leading force in shaping the future of tourism in Northeast India and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to include more niche travel experiences, such as eco-tourism, wellness retreats, and specialized photography tours. We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, creating a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily browse itineraries, customize their trips, and access real-time travel information. We are also committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities, developing new initiatives that empower local businesses and promote sustainable tourism practices. A key focus will be on promoting responsible travel, educating travelers about the importance of respecting local cultures and minimizing their environmental impact. We aim to become a recognized advocate for sustainable tourism, inspiring others to adopt responsible practices and contribute to the preservation of the region\'s natural and cultural heritage. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the travel market, Asian Holidays & Expeditions is poised to achieve sustainable growth, creating a positive impact on the local economy and the communities we serve, while providing unforgettable travel experiences for our valued clients.</p>', 'House No 10, Amrabati Path, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:00:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1438, 'Tribal Planet Tours and Travels', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>Tribal Planet Tours and Travels is a Guwahati-based travel agency dedicated to providing authentic and immersive travel experiences throughout Assam and Northeast India. We specialize in crafting personalized itineraries that connect travelers with the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant traditions of the region, promoting sustainable tourism practices and empowering local communities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Operating in a region with immense tourism potential yet often overlooked by mainstream travel circuits, Tribal Planet Tours and Travels distinguishes itself by offering unique and culturally sensitive tours. We aim to be more than just a travel agency; we strive to be a bridge connecting visitors with the heart and soul of Northeast India, fostering understanding and appreciation for its diverse tribal cultures and pristine natural environments. Our commitment to responsible tourism and community engagement sets us apart in the local business landscape.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of travel options, catering to diverse interests and budgets. These include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><b>Cultural Immersion Tours:</b> Offering in-depth exploration of tribal villages, participation in local festivals, and interaction with artisans and craftspeople. These tours emphasize respectful cultural exchange and contribute directly to the economic well-being of the communities we visit.</li>\n<li><b>Adventure and Eco-Tourism Packages:</b> Featuring trekking in the Eastern Himalayas, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, river rafting expeditions, and exploration of tea gardens. We prioritize eco-friendly practices and ensure minimal environmental impact.</li>\n<li><b>Customized Itineraries:</b> Designing personalized travel plans based on individual preferences, interests, and time constraints. Our experienced travel consultants work closely with clients to create bespoke experiences that exceed expectations.</li>\n<li><b>Homestay and Community-Based Tourism:</b> Promoting authentic cultural experiences by facilitating stays in local homes and providing opportunities to interact with community members. This fosters cultural exchange and provides sustainable income for local families.</li>\n<li><b>Transportation and Accommodation Arrangements:</b> Ensuring seamless travel logistics by providing reliable transportation services and booking comfortable and culturally appropriate accommodations.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>A key differentiator for Tribal Planet Tours and Travels is our commitment to providing authentic and responsible tourism experiences. We work closely with local communities to develop sustainable tourism initiatives that benefit both the visitors and the residents. This includes employing local guides, sourcing local products and services, and ensuring that tourism activities are conducted in a culturally sensitive and environmentally responsible manner. Our understanding of the unique challenges and opportunities of the Northeast Indian tourism market allows us to offer services that are both enriching and impactful.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We strive to provide unparalleled customer service, ensuring that every traveler feels welcomed, supported, and valued. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the tour, our team is dedicated to providing prompt, efficient, and personalized assistance. Our approach is built on building genuine relationships with our clients, understanding their needs and expectations, and exceeding them whenever possible. We believe in going the extra mile to ensure that every tour is a memorable and transformative experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our deep connection with the local community is a cornerstone of our business. We actively participate in community development initiatives, support local artisans and entrepreneurs, and promote cultural preservation efforts. We believe that tourism can be a powerful force for positive change, and we are committed to using our business as a platform to empower local communities and promote sustainable development. We also maintain close relationships with local authorities and tourism stakeholders to ensure that our operations align with regional development priorities.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, Tribal Planet Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading sustainable tourism operator in Northeast India. We plan to expand our service offerings to include more specialized tours, such as birdwatching expeditions, culinary tours, and wellness retreats. We also intend to invest in developing eco-friendly accommodations and transportation options to further reduce our environmental footprint.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our long-term goals include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Expanding our reach:</b> Targeting new markets and attracting a wider range of travelers to Northeast India.</li>\n<li><b>Strengthening our partnerships:</b> Collaborating with more local communities and organizations to develop sustainable tourism initiatives.</li>\n<li><b>Promoting responsible tourism practices:</b> Educating travelers and stakeholders about the importance of sustainable tourism and cultural preservation.</li>\n<li><b>Investing in technology:</b> Developing a user-friendly online platform to enhance the customer experience and streamline our operations.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Tribal Planet Tours and Travels is dedicated to showcasing the beauty and diversity of Northeast India while contributing to the sustainable development of the region. We are confident that our commitment to quality, authenticity, and responsible tourism will enable us to achieve our goals and make a positive impact on the lives of the communities we serve.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:00:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1439, 'Jyoti Travels - Taxi Service in Guwahati | Car Rental Service in Guwahati | Best Cab Service in Guwahati', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>Jyoti Travels: Your Trusted Partner for Taxi and Car Rental Services in Guwahati</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, Guwahati serves as a vibrant gateway to the Northeast. Jyoti Travels is proud to be a leading provider of reliable and efficient taxi and car rental services within this bustling city. We understand that navigating Guwahati, whether for business or leisure, requires seamless transportation solutions. Our commitment to safety, punctuality, and customer satisfaction has established us as a preferred choice for both local residents and visitors alike. We strive to redefine the standards of transportation services in Guwahati, contributing to the region’s growing connectivity and economic prosperity.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service lies in providing a comprehensive suite of transportation options tailored to meet diverse needs. We offer a range of well-maintained vehicles, from compact cars ideal for city commutes to spacious SUVs perfect for family trips and group excursions to destinations surrounding Guwahati. Whether you require a quick taxi ride across town, a full-day car rental for exploring Assam\'s scenic beauty, or airport transfer services, Jyoti Travels has you covered. We offer both chauffeur-driven and self-drive options, ensuring flexibility and convenience for our clientele. Our fleet undergoes regular maintenance and safety checks to guarantee a comfortable and secure travel experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets Jyoti Travels apart is our unwavering focus on customer satisfaction. We understand that travel can be stressful, and we are dedicated to alleviating that stress by providing a seamless and hassle-free booking process. Our online booking platform is user-friendly and efficient, allowing customers to reserve vehicles quickly and easily. We also offer dedicated customer support via phone and email, ensuring that assistance is always readily available. Our drivers are professionally trained, courteous, and knowledgeable about local routes, committed to providing a safe and pleasant journey. We also emphasize transparency in our pricing, ensuring that our customers are fully aware of all costs involved upfront, with no hidden fees or surprises. This commitment to ethical and transparent business practices has earned us the trust and loyalty of our customers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond simply providing transportation, Jyoti Travels actively engages with the local community. We prioritize hiring local drivers, contributing to employment opportunities within Guwahati. We also support local tourism by providing information and recommendations on attractions and activities in the region, helping visitors discover the hidden gems of Assam. We believe in sustainable business practices, actively exploring ways to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to a greener Guwahati. We are committed to being a responsible corporate citizen, participating in community initiatives and supporting local causes.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Jyoti Travels is poised for continued growth and expansion. Our vision is to become the undisputed leader in taxi and car rental services in Guwahati and the surrounding region. We plan to achieve this by continuously investing in our fleet, technology, and people. We are exploring opportunities to expand our service offerings to include specialized transportation solutions, such as corporate travel packages and event transportation. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance our customer experience, including implementing real-time tracking and mobile app booking capabilities. We are committed to staying ahead of the curve and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers. Our long-term goal is to not only provide transportation but also to facilitate meaningful connections and contribute to the vibrant tapestry of Guwahati\'s community and economy. We aim to be synonymous with reliability, convenience, and exceptional service, solidifying our position as the best cab service in Guwahati for years to come.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:00:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1440, 'Albatross Journey', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>Albatross Journey: Navigating Your Path to Success in Assam\'s Dynamic Landscape</p>\n\n<p>Nestled at Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute, Albatross Journey is a comprehensive business solutions provider dedicated to empowering individuals and organizations to achieve their full potential within the vibrant and evolving Assam business environment. More than just a service provider, we are a dedicated partner committed to understanding the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the region, offering tailored solutions designed to drive sustainable growth and lasting success. Albatross Journey stands apart by combining global best practices with a deep understanding of local nuances, creating a truly unique value proposition for our clients.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our comprehensive suite of services is designed to address a wide range of business needs, from personal and professional development to strategic organizational growth. At the heart of our offerings are our bespoke training programs, meticulously crafted to enhance essential skills across various disciplines. These programs encompass areas such as leadership development, communication mastery, sales excellence, and customer service proficiency. We recognize that the strength of any organization lies in its people, and our training initiatives are designed to unlock their potential and drive tangible improvements in performance.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond individual development, Albatross Journey provides specialized consulting services aimed at streamlining business operations and optimizing overall efficiency. We work closely with businesses to identify areas for improvement, offering tailored solutions to address specific challenges and unlock new opportunities. This may involve process optimization, technology implementation, or strategic planning, all geared towards enhancing productivity and profitability. Our consulting services extend to supporting start-ups and small businesses in developing robust business plans, securing funding, and navigating the complexities of the local market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Albatross Journey is our unwavering commitment to providing practical, results-oriented solutions. We understand that theoretical knowledge alone is insufficient, and our programs emphasize hands-on learning and real-world application. Our training sessions incorporate interactive exercises, case studies, and simulations to ensure that participants gain a deep understanding of the concepts and can effectively apply them in their day-to-day roles. This practical approach ensures that our clients see a measurable return on their investment and achieve tangible results.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Albatross Journey prides itself on fostering a supportive and collaborative environment where clients feel valued and empowered. We believe that exceptional customer service is paramount, and our team is dedicated to providing personalized attention to each and every client. From the initial consultation to ongoing support, we are committed to building strong, lasting relationships based on trust and mutual respect. We actively seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our connection to the local community is deeply ingrained in our business philosophy. We actively participate in local initiatives and collaborate with community organizations to promote economic development and social well-being. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and are committed to making a positive impact on the lives of the people in Assam. We regularly host workshops and seminars on topics relevant to the local business community, providing valuable knowledge and resources to help individuals and organizations thrive.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Albatross Journey is committed to expanding its reach and impact within the region. We envision becoming the leading provider of business solutions in Assam, recognized for our commitment to excellence, innovation, and customer satisfaction. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized training in emerging technologies and digital marketing, equipping our clients with the skills they need to succeed in the rapidly evolving digital landscape. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with educational institutions to offer customized training programs for students and recent graduates, preparing them for successful careers in the business world.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable economic growth of Assam by empowering individuals and organizations to reach their full potential. We believe that by providing access to high-quality training, consulting, and support services, we can help create a more vibrant and prosperous business environment for all. Albatross Journey is dedicated to remaining at the forefront of innovation and continuously adapting our services to meet the changing needs of the local market. We are confident that with our unwavering commitment to excellence and our deep understanding of the local landscape, we can help our clients navigate their own Albatross Journey to achieve lasting success.</p>', 'Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:05:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1441, 'APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS', 'Tour Operators', '', 'APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS, situated at 13/C, W.W COLONY in the heart of Assam, stands as a premier provider of bespoke travel experiences, catering to both domestic and international adventurers. Unlike generic travel agencies, Apex Tours and Travels focuses on delivering personalized journeys that showcase the rich cultural heritage, stunning natural landscapes, and unique adventures that Assam and Northeast India have to offer. We strive to be more than just a travel provider; we aim to be a gateway to unforgettable experiences, contributing positively to the local tourism ecosystem.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, including meticulously crafted tour packages, efficient flight and train ticketing services, comfortable accommodation bookings, and reliable transportation arrangements. We specialize in curating unique experiences such as eco-tourism adventures in Kaziranga National Park, cultural immersion tours exploring the tea gardens and tribal villages, and spiritual journeys to ancient temples and monasteries. What sets Apex Tours and Travels apart is our deep understanding of the local terrain and our commitment to sustainable tourism practices. We collaborate with local guides and businesses, ensuring that our tours not only provide enriching experiences for our clients but also contribute to the economic well-being of the communities we visit. We differentiate ourselves through personalized itinerary creation, addressing individual preferences and budgets, while maintaining consistent quality and reliability in every aspect of our service. Our offerings directly address the growing demand in the local market for specialized and authentic travel experiences, moving beyond mass tourism towards meaningful and responsible exploration.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Apex Tours and Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our approach is centered on building lasting relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations at every turn. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, our dedicated team of experienced travel professionals is committed to providing seamless and personalized support. We prioritize clear and open communication, ensuring that our clients are well-informed and confident throughout their journey. We actively seek feedback and continuously strive to improve our services based on customer input. Furthermore, we are deeply rooted in the local community, participating in initiatives that promote sustainable tourism and cultural preservation. We collaborate with local artisans, promote local businesses, and support environmental conservation efforts. This commitment to the community not only enhances the travel experience for our clients but also fosters a sense of shared responsibility for preserving the natural and cultural treasures of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Apex Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include adventure tourism activities such as trekking and river rafting, as well as developing specialized tours focused on wellness and yoga retreats. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily browse our offerings, customize their itineraries, and manage their travel arrangements. Furthermore, we plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and businesses, ensuring that our growth benefits the region as a whole. Our long-term goals include establishing Apex Tours and Travels as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, reliability, and responsible tourism, contributing to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam and Northeast India. We strive to continually innovate and adapt to the evolving needs of the travel market, while remaining true to our core values of customer satisfaction, community engagement, and environmental responsibility.', '13/C, W.W COLONY', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:05:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1442, 'AAGAMAN Northeast India Tour Operator', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>AAGAMAN Northeast India Tour Operator is a dedicated travel company passionately committed to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Northeast India. Nestled in the heart of Assam, AAGAMAN is more than just a tour operator; we are cultural ambassadors, dedicated to providing immersive and authentic travel experiences that connect visitors with the soul of this enchanting region. Northeast India, often called the \"Land of Seven Sisters\" (plus one brother state, Sikkim), boasts diverse landscapes from lush valleys and towering mountains to cascading waterfalls and vibrant rainforests. AAGAMAN understands the unique allure of this region and strives to deliver bespoke itineraries that cater to the discerning traveller seeking adventure, cultural immersion, and responsible tourism.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We operate in a region brimming with untapped potential yet faced with challenges of accessibility and sustainable tourism practices. AAGAMAN aims to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting responsible travel that benefits local communities while preserving the natural environment. Our presence strengthens the local business landscape by providing employment opportunities, supporting local artisans and businesses, and attracting tourists who contribute to the region\'s economic growth. By focusing on sustainable tourism practices, we contribute to the long-term well-being of the environment and local communities.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of meticulously crafted tour packages designed to cater to diverse interests and preferences. We offer customized itineraries focusing on wildlife adventures in Kaziranga National Park (home to the one-horned rhinoceros), cultural explorations of the tribes of Arunachal Pradesh, serene retreats to the tea gardens of Assam, and trekking expeditions in the picturesque hills of Meghalaya. We also provide specialized tours focusing on specific interests, such as birdwatching, photography, spiritual journeys, and culinary experiences. Our services extend beyond mere sightseeing; we facilitate meaningful interactions with local communities, offering opportunities to learn about their traditions, customs, and way of life.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>AAGAMAN differentiates itself through its unwavering commitment to authenticity and responsible tourism. We work closely with local guides and communities to ensure that our tours are not only informative and engaging but also respectful of local cultures and traditions. We prioritize eco-friendly practices, such as minimizing waste, supporting local conservation efforts, and promoting sustainable transportation options. Our deep understanding of the Northeast Indian terrain and culture allows us to curate unique experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We provide insider access to hidden gems and off-the-beaten-path destinations, allowing travellers to truly connect with the essence of the region. Our commitment to personalized service ensures that each traveller receives individualized attention and support throughout their journey.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We address a critical need in the local market by providing organized and reliable tour services that are often lacking in the fragmented tourism industry of Northeast India. We bridge the gap between travellers seeking authentic experiences and the local communities eager to share their rich heritage. By promoting sustainable tourism, we contribute to the economic empowerment of local communities while preserving the region\'s natural beauty and cultural heritage.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At AAGAMAN, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, providing them with exceptional service from the initial inquiry to the final departure. Our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to understanding each client\'s individual needs and preferences, crafting bespoke itineraries that exceed their expectations. We provide 24/7 support throughout the tour, ensuring that our clients have a seamless and worry-free travel experience. Our local guides are not just knowledgeable about the region\'s history and culture; they are passionate storytellers who bring the Northeast to life with their personal anecdotes and insights.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community by supporting local artisans, sourcing our supplies from local businesses, and partnering with community-based tourism initiatives. We believe in giving back to the region that we call home, contributing to its sustainable development and preserving its cultural heritage. We regularly participate in local festivals and events, promoting the region\'s rich cultural diversity to a wider audience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>AAGAMAN envisions itself as the leading sustainable tour operator in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to authenticity, responsible tourism, and exceptional customer service. We aim to expand our reach by developing new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, wellness tourism, and culinary tourism. We plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our operations, making it easier for travellers to discover and book our tours. We also aspire to establish partnerships with international travel agencies and organizations, promoting Northeast India as a world-class travel destination.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing a sustainable tourism training center to empower local communities with the skills and knowledge they need to participate in the tourism industry. We aim to create a network of eco-friendly accommodations and transportation providers, further reducing our environmental impact and promoting sustainable tourism practices. By continuously innovating and adapting to the changing needs of the market, AAGAMAN is committed to remaining at the forefront of the Northeast Indian tourism industry, contributing to its sustainable growth and promoting the region\'s unique beauty and cultural heritage to the world.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:05:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1443, 'Ezzy Tours & Travels', 'Tour Operators', '', 'Ezzy Tours & Travels, located at House No.- 02, RN Choudhury Path, stands as a premier provider of comprehensive travel solutions within the burgeoning Assam tourism sector. We distinguish ourselves through a deep understanding of both local nuances and global travel trends, enabling us to craft bespoke experiences that cater to a diverse clientele, from adventurous solo travelers to large corporate groups. Our commitment to exceptional service, ethical business practices, and sustainable tourism sets us apart, contributing to the region\'s economic growth while preserving its rich cultural and natural heritage.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Ezzy Tours & Travels lies a suite of core services designed to streamline and enhance every aspect of the travel experience. We offer meticulously planned tour packages encompassing popular destinations throughout Assam, including Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and the tea gardens of Upper Assam. These packages are not merely itineraries; they are curated journeys designed to immerse travelers in the authentic Assamese culture, showcasing local cuisine, traditions, and artistic expressions. Beyond packaged tours, we provide customized travel planning services, tailoring itineraries to individual preferences, budgets, and time constraints. Our expertise extends to booking flights, accommodations (ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts), and transportation, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience. Furthermore, we facilitate visa assistance and travel insurance, offering comprehensive support throughout the entire travel process. Our unique selling proposition lies in our personalized approach, our in-depth knowledge of the region, and our commitment to sourcing sustainable and ethical tourism options, contributing positively to the local communities we serve. These services directly address the increasing demand for well-organized, culturally sensitive, and environmentally responsible travel experiences within Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Ezzy Tours & Travels. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, grounded in trust and mutual respect. Our team of dedicated travel professionals is committed to providing personalized attention and responsive support at every stage of the journey. From the initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up, we strive to exceed expectations by anticipating needs and proactively addressing concerns. We actively solicit feedback to continually improve our services and tailor our offerings to evolving customer preferences. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We collaborate with local artisans, homestays, and transportation providers, ensuring that our tours contribute directly to the livelihoods of the people of Assam. We actively participate in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of community and promoting cultural exchange. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the authenticity of our tours but also strengthens our brand reputation and fosters customer loyalty.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Ezzy Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its innovative approach, exceptional customer service, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on niche interests such as birdwatching, photography, and adventure sports. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours, managing itineraries, and accessing travel information. We also plan to forge strategic partnerships with hotels, airlines, and other travel providers to offer competitive pricing and exclusive deals. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in training and development for our staff, ensuring that they possess the knowledge and skills necessary to deliver exceptional service. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of Assam\'s tourism sector, promoting responsible travel practices, preserving the region\'s natural beauty, and empowering local communities through tourism-related opportunities. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Ezzy Tours & Travels will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the lives of our customers and the communities we serve.', 'House No.- 02, RN Choudhury Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:05:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1444, 'Voyage Tours and Travels', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>Voyage Tours and Travels: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, at Daljan Path, near N R Housing Complex, Voyage Tours and Travels stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional and personalized travel experiences. We are more than just a booking service; we are architects of unforgettable journeys, committed to showcasing the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and unparalleled hospitality that Assam and Northeast India have to offer. In a region teeming with natural beauty and historical significance, Voyage Tours and Travels distinguishes itself through a commitment to responsible tourism, customized itineraries, and a deep understanding of the local landscape, playing a vital role in promoting sustainable travel and contributing to the local economy. Our presence helps bridge the gap between global travelers and the unique treasures of Assam, offering a convenient and reliable platform for exploring this enchanting corner of India.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Voyage Tours and Travels, we offer a comprehensive suite of travel services tailored to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. Our core services include: expertly curated tour packages showcasing Assam\'s iconic landmarks like Kaziranga National Park, the Kamakhya Temple, and the tea gardens of upper Assam; bespoke travel planning for individuals, families, and groups, designed to create unique and personalized itineraries; reliable and efficient transportation services, including airport transfers, car rentals with experienced local drivers, and comfortable bus and train ticketing; and seamless hotel booking services, offering a wide range of accommodation options from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious resorts, ensuring a comfortable and memorable stay. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to providing authentic and immersive travel experiences. We go beyond the typical tourist trail, venturing into lesser-known villages, engaging with local communities, and promoting eco-friendly practices. Our team of experienced travel experts possesses in-depth knowledge of the region, allowing us to craft itineraries that cater to specific interests, whether it\'s wildlife photography, cultural immersion, or adventure tourism. We also prioritize responsible tourism by partnering with local businesses and supporting community-based initiatives, ensuring that our tours benefit the local economy and minimize environmental impact. This dedication to authenticity and sustainability is a key differentiator, appealing to discerning travelers seeking meaningful and impactful travel experiences. Our ability to provide multi-lingual support is also key, helping to break down barriers and ensure clear communication with all travelers.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do at Voyage Tours and Travels. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional customer service from the initial inquiry to the completion of their trip. Our approach is centered on personalized attention, prompt communication, and proactive problem-solving. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we take the time to listen to their individual needs and preferences. Our dedicated team is available to answer questions, provide assistance, and resolve any issues that may arise, ensuring a smooth and stress-free travel experience. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services. We also actively participate in local tourism events and collaborate with community organizations, fostering a strong sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of the community. This strong community connection helps us stay abreast of local developments and offer unique, authentic experiences to our clients.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Voyage Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its commitment to responsible tourism, personalized service, and authentic travel experiences. We plan to expand our range of tour packages to include more off-the-beaten-path destinations, showcasing the diverse beauty and cultural richness of the entire Northeast India region. We are exploring opportunities to develop eco-friendly accommodations and promote sustainable tourism practices throughout our operations. Further, we aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, by developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours, accessing travel information, and interacting with our team. Long-term, our goal is to play a significant role in promoting Assam as a premier tourist destination, creating economic opportunities for local communities and preserving the region\'s natural and cultural heritage for generations to come. We see ourselves as not just a travel agency, but as a catalyst for positive change, contributing to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam and beyond. We plan to increase our digital marketing presence to reach a wider audience, targeting specific demographics interested in adventure, cultural, or eco-tourism.</p>', 'Daljan Path, near N R Housing Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:05:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1445, 'KAZIRANGA TOURS & TRAVELS.', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>KAZIRANGA TOURS & TRAVELS, strategically located at 4RH5+89R, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional tourism experiences focused primarily on Kaziranga National Park and the diverse cultural landscape of Assam. We differentiate ourselves through our deep-rooted understanding of the region, our commitment to sustainable tourism practices, and our personalized approach to crafting unforgettable journeys for every traveler. In a market often dominated by larger, impersonal operators, KAZIRANGA TOURS & TRAVELS offers an intimate and authentic connection to the heart of Assam, contributing significantly to the local economy by supporting local businesses and promoting responsible travel.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service lies in curating customized tour packages centered around Kaziranga National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site famed for its population of one-horned rhinoceroses. These packages range from short wildlife safaris to extended explorations incorporating elements of adventure, cultural immersion, and relaxation. We offer jeep safaris led by experienced and knowledgeable guides, elephant-back safaris for a unique perspective of the park, and birdwatching tours showcasing the region\'s rich avian biodiversity. Beyond Kaziranga, we design bespoke itineraries encompassing other captivating destinations within Assam, including Majuli, the world\'s largest river island, the ancient Kamakhya Temple in Guwahati, and tea garden experiences in the lush landscapes of Upper Assam. What truly sets us apart is our dedication to tailoring each itinerary to the specific interests and preferences of our clients. We prioritize small group sizes to ensure a more personalized and impactful experience. Our unique selling proposition extends beyond wildlife viewing; we actively promote responsible tourism by partnering with local communities, employing local guides and drivers, and supporting eco-friendly accommodations. This commitment ensures that our tours benefit the local economy and minimize our environmental footprint. We understand the market needs of both domestic and international tourists seeking authentic and immersive experiences, offering a blend of adventure, relaxation, and cultural discovery that is unparalleled in the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At KAZIRANGA TOURS & TRAVELS, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is built on building genuine relationships with our clients, providing attentive support from the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey. We prioritize clear and prompt communication, ensuring that our clients are well-informed and comfortable throughout the booking process. Our team comprises knowledgeable and passionate travel experts who possess a deep understanding of Assam and its tourism offerings. We go the extra mile to personalize each experience, considering individual preferences and needs to create truly unforgettable memories. We foster a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events and initiatives. We also partner with local artisans and businesses to showcase the region\'s rich cultural heritage and support economic development. This commitment to community involvement not only enhances the travel experience for our clients but also contributes to the sustainable growth of the region\'s tourism sector. Our business stands out by offering a distinctly Assamese experience, infused with warmth, hospitality, and a genuine passion for sharing the beauty and culture of our region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for KAZIRANGA TOURS & TRAVELS is to solidify our position as the leading provider of authentic and sustainable tourism experiences in Assam. We plan to expand our service offerings to include more specialized tours catering to niche interests such as photography, birdwatching, and cultural immersion. We aim to forge stronger partnerships with local communities to further enhance the authenticity and sustainability of our tours. Technology plays a crucial role in our future growth strategy. We envision developing a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse our tour packages, customize their itineraries, and make secure bookings. We also plan to leverage social media and digital marketing to reach a wider audience and promote Assam as a premier tourism destination. Long-term, our goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam, ensuring that the benefits of tourism are shared by all stakeholders. We aspire to become a model for responsible tourism practices, demonstrating that tourism can be a force for good, promoting environmental conservation, cultural preservation, and economic empowerment. We are committed to continuous improvement, constantly seeking innovative ways to enhance the travel experience for our clients and contribute to the growth and prosperity of our local community. Our vision is to be synonymous with authentic, responsible, and unforgettable travel experiences in Kaziranga and throughout Assam.</p>', '4RH5+89R', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:10:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
