(1481, 'Capital Tours (India) Pvt. Ltd.', 'Tour Operators', '', 'Capital Tours (India) Pvt. Ltd., strategically located at 403, Assam Trunk Rd, stands as a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences throughout India, with a particular emphasis on showcasing the diverse and captivating beauty of Assam and the Northeast. More than just a travel agency, Capital Tours acts as a gateway, connecting travelers with the rich culture, breathtaking landscapes, and unique adventures that this region has to offer. In a market often dominated by standardized tour packages, Capital Tours distinguishes itself through personalized itineraries, expert local knowledge, and a commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism.\n\n<br><br>\n\nAt the heart of Capital Tours\' operations lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a wide range of needs and preferences. These services include meticulously crafted tour packages focusing on Assam\'s tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries (such as Kaziranga National Park), historical sites, and vibrant cultural festivals. Beyond pre-packaged tours, the company excels in creating bespoke itineraries tailored to individual interests, group dynamics, and budget considerations. This personalized approach allows travelers to experience India, and particularly Assam, in a way that resonates deeply with them. Capital Tours also provides essential travel logistics services, including flight and train bookings, hotel reservations, transportation arrangements (car rentals, private chauffeur services), and visa assistance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience from start to finish. One of Capital Tours’ unique selling points is its deep understanding of the local ecosystem. They partner with local communities and businesses to provide authentic cultural experiences and support sustainable tourism practices. This commitment ensures that tourism benefits the local economy and minimizes its environmental impact. These services meet the local market need for curated and responsible travel options, attracting both domestic and international tourists seeking authentic and enriching experiences beyond the typical tourist traps.\n\n<br><br>\n\nCapital Tours understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to success in the travel industry. The company prides itself on its team of knowledgeable and passionate travel consultants who are dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert advice to each client. From the initial consultation to the completion of the trip, customers can expect prompt, courteous, and efficient service. Capital Tours fosters a strong connection with the local community through its partnerships with local guides, artisans, and businesses. They prioritize employing local talent and showcasing local products and traditions, contributing to the economic empowerment of the community and providing travelers with authentic cultural immersion. This approach not only enhances the customer experience but also reinforces Capital Tours\' commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism. Regular engagement with the community through participation in local events and initiatives further solidifies the company\'s position as a trusted and valued member of the local ecosystem.\n\n<br><br>\n\nCapital Tours (India) Pvt. Ltd. envisions a future where it becomes the leading travel company in Northeast India, known for its commitment to sustainable tourism, personalized service, and authentic cultural experiences. The company plans to expand its range of tour packages to include more niche offerings, such as eco-tourism adventures, culinary tours, and wellness retreats. Leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience is a key priority. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and managing travel itineraries, as well as utilizing data analytics to personalize marketing efforts and optimize service delivery. Furthermore, Capital Tours aims to strengthen its partnerships with local communities and businesses, ensuring that tourism benefits the local economy and preserves the region\'s rich cultural heritage. Long-term goals include expanding operations to other parts of India and Southeast Asia, while maintaining its core values of sustainability, personalized service, and cultural sensitivity. By focusing on these strategic priorities, Capital Tours is poised for continued growth and success, solidifying its position as a key player in the Indian travel and tourism industry.', '403, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:45:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1482, 'AirGennie - \"Wander More, Worry Less\"', 'Tour Operators', '', 'AirGennie - \"Wander More, Worry Less\", situated at No 88, Aghona Bhavan, Mandir Path, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier travel concierge and experience curator uniquely tailored to the demands and desires of both local residents and visiting tourists in Assam and the wider Northeast India region. Understanding the inherent challenges and unique opportunities present in navigating this culturally rich and geographically diverse landscape, AirGennie offers a comprehensive suite of travel-related services designed to eliminate stress and maximize the enjoyment of every journey. We strive to be more than just a travel agency; we are your personal travel architects, crafting bespoke itineraries and providing unparalleled on-the-ground support to ensure seamless and unforgettable experiences. <br> <br>\n\nOur core service lies in meticulously planning and executing personalized travel itineraries that cater to diverse interests and budgets. Whether it\'s a spiritual retreat to Kamakhya Temple, an adventurous trek through the verdant hills of Meghalaya, a wildlife safari in Kaziranga National Park, or a cultural immersion in the tea gardens of Assam, AirGennie transforms travel aspirations into tangible realities. We leverage our extensive network of local partners – including hotels, transportation providers, guides, and activity operators – to secure the best possible rates and ensure exceptional quality. Unlike generic online travel platforms, we specialize in crafting experiences that are deeply rooted in the local culture and environment, promoting sustainable tourism and supporting local communities. <br> <br>\n\nBeyond itinerary planning, AirGennie offers a range of supplementary services designed to enhance the travel experience. These include airport transfers, visa assistance, travel insurance procurement, currency exchange guidance, and 24/7 on-call support. A unique selling point is our \'Assam Immersion\' package, which includes curated cultural experiences such as traditional Assamese cooking classes, Bihu dance performances, and visits to local artisan workshops. We also offer specialized packages for adventure tourism, focusing on activities like river rafting, rock climbing, and paragliding, always prioritizing safety and environmental responsibility. Our services directly address the common challenges faced by travelers in the region, such as language barriers, limited transportation options, and a lack of reliable information, providing peace of mind and allowing them to fully embrace their adventures. <br> <br>\n\nAt AirGennie, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building genuine relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. Our team of dedicated travel consultants are not just booking agents; they are experienced travelers themselves, possessing in-depth knowledge of the region and a passion for sharing its hidden gems. We go the extra mile to ensure that every client feels valued and supported, providing personalized recommendations, addressing concerns promptly, and proactively anticipating potential issues. Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends beyond the booking process. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor them to meet evolving needs. We also strive to engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in community events, fostering a sense of shared responsibility for promoting sustainable tourism and preserving the cultural heritage of Assam. <br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, AirGennie envisions becoming the leading travel concierge service in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized travel packages for niche markets, such as eco-tourism, wellness retreats, and culinary tours. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly mobile app that provides real-time travel updates, interactive maps, and personalized recommendations. A key long-term goal is to establish a network of AirGennie-branded guesthouses and boutique hotels in strategic locations throughout the region, providing travelers with a consistent standard of quality and hospitality. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, AirGennie is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of tourism in Northeast India, promoting sustainable growth, and creating memorable experiences for travelers from all walks of life. We are committed to fostering a positive impact on the local economy and preserving the unique cultural identity of the region, ensuring that future generations can continue to \"Wander More, Worry Less.\"', 'No 88, Aghona Bhavan, Mandir Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:45:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1483, 'Moudeep travel agency', 'Tour Operators', '', 'Moudeep Travel Agency, strategically located on Beltola Bazaar Road, August Kranti Path, stands as a cornerstone of travel solutions within Guwahati and the broader Assam region. More than just a travel agency, Moudeep Travel Agency is a dedicated partner in crafting seamless and enriching travel experiences, catering to both leisure and business travelers alike. Recognizing the unique needs of the local populace and the burgeoning tourism sector in Assam, Moudeep distinguishes itself through personalized service, in-depth regional expertise, and a commitment to ethical and sustainable travel practices. We aim to be the trusted gateway for individuals and organizations seeking to explore the beauty and opportunities of Assam and beyond, while simultaneously contributing to the region\'s economic growth and responsible tourism.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nMoudeep Travel Agency offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse clientele. Our core offerings include expertly curated tour packages encompassing Assam\'s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and unique wildlife experiences. We specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries that cater to individual preferences, group sizes, and budgetary considerations. These packages often include visits to Kaziranga National Park, tea gardens of Upper Assam, and culturally significant sites in Guwahati and Majuli. In addition to package tours, we provide a full spectrum of travel services including domestic and international flight bookings, hotel reservations across various price points, car rental services with experienced local drivers, and visa assistance for international travel. A key differentiator lies in our deep understanding of the region\'s specific logistical challenges, allowing us to navigate potential issues proactively and ensure smooth and hassle-free journeys for our clients. We also offer specialized travel solutions for corporate clients, including conference and event planning, group travel arrangements, and customized incentive programs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Moudeep Travel Agency, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention and going the extra mile to exceed expectations. Our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to understanding each customer\'s unique needs and preferences, offering expert advice and tailored solutions. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness and accessibility, ensuring that customers can easily reach us with any queries or concerns. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to fostering a sense of community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, partnering with local artisans, guides, and businesses to promote authentic Assam experiences. Furthermore, we are committed to responsible tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local communities through sustainable travel initiatives. This commitment resonates deeply with the local population and creates a strong sense of trust and loyalty.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Moudeep Travel Agency envisions becoming the leading travel solutions provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainable practices. We plan to expand our service offerings to include adventure tourism activities such as trekking, river rafting, and wildlife safaris, catering to the growing demand for experiential travel. We are also investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and travel services. Another key area of focus is strategic partnerships with hotels, airlines, and other travel providers to offer competitive pricing and exclusive deals to our customers. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to expand our reach beyond Assam, offering customized travel packages to other parts of Northeast India and Southeast Asia. Our long-term goal is to establish Moudeep Travel Agency as a respected brand synonymous with reliable, enriching, and responsible travel experiences, both locally and internationally, while continuing to contribute positively to the economic and social well-being of the Assam region.', 'beltola bazaar road, August Kranti Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:45:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1484, 'Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency is a dedicated and passionate travel provider nestled in the heart of Assam, catering specifically to the adventurous spirit and cultural curiosity of both local residents and visitors eager to explore the region. Understanding the nuanced beauty and rich heritage of Assam and Northeast India, Tour Lover\'s aims to move beyond generic tourism, offering curated and authentic experiences that resonate deeply with each traveler.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Agency distinguishes itself within the Assam tourism landscape by focusing on personalized itineraries and sustainable travel practices. In a region increasingly attracting tourists, Tour Lover\'s prioritizes responsible tourism, ensuring minimal environmental impact and maximum benefit to local communities. This commitment to ethical travel positions the agency as a conscious and community-focused business within the growing Assamese tourism sector.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency offers a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to diverse travel preferences. These core offerings include: <b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> Tailored itineraries for individuals, families, and groups, focusing on specific interests such as wildlife, tea gardens, cultural immersion, river cruises on the Brahmaputra, and trekking in the Eastern Himalayas. Packages range from short weekend getaways to extensive multi-day explorations of Northeast India. <b>Guided Tours:</b> Expert-led tours by knowledgeable local guides, providing in-depth insights into Assam\'s history, culture, and natural wonders. These tours are available in multiple languages, accommodating a wider range of travelers. <b>Accommodation Bookings:</b> Strategic partnerships with a range of accommodations, from comfortable budget hotels to luxurious resorts and heritage bungalows, ensuring suitable options for all price points and preferences. Special emphasis is placed on supporting locally owned guesthouses and homestays to promote community-based tourism. <b>Transportation Services:</b> Reliable and comfortable transportation solutions, including private car rentals, bus charters, and airport transfers, facilitating seamless travel throughout the region. The agency utilizes local drivers with extensive knowledge of the terrain. <b>Adventure Activities:</b> Arrangements for thrilling activities like river rafting, paragliding, and wildlife safaris in national parks like Kaziranga and Manas. All activities are conducted with certified operators adhering to strict safety standards.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Tour Lover\'s unique selling point lies in its deep understanding of Assam and the Northeast\'s unique cultural and geographical landscape. Unlike larger, national travel agencies, Tour Lover\'s possesses intimate knowledge of hidden gems, local traditions, and the best times to visit specific locations. This hyperlocal expertise allows them to craft truly unforgettable and authentic travel experiences. Moreover, the agency actively promotes lesser-known destinations within Assam and the Northeast, contributing to a more equitable distribution of tourism revenue and preventing overcrowding in popular spots. This focus helps to preserve the natural beauty and cultural integrity of these unique areas.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency prides itself on providing exceptional customer service that extends beyond simply booking travel arrangements. The agency strives to create a personal connection with each client, understanding their individual needs and preferences to craft truly bespoke experiences. The customer service approach is built on responsiveness, transparency, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. Pre-trip consultations are thorough, ensuring that clients are fully informed about their itinerary and prepared for their journey. During the trip, the agency maintains open communication channels, providing ongoing support and assistance to address any unforeseen issues. Post-trip feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve services and tailor future offerings.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Tour Lover\'s deeply values its connection with the local community. The agency actively collaborates with local artisans, cultural groups, and community-based tourism initiatives to support sustainable development and promote cultural preservation. They prioritize hiring local staff and sourcing services from local businesses, contributing to the economic empowerment of the community. Additionally, Tour Lover\'s participates in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of belonging and strengthening relationships with residents.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency envisions a future where tourism in Assam and Northeast India is both sustainable and enriching, benefiting both travelers and local communities. The agency\'s long-term goals include: Expanding its range of eco-tourism offerings, promoting responsible travel practices, and minimizing environmental impact. Establishing strategic partnerships with more community-based tourism initiatives to support local economic development. Developing innovative technology solutions to enhance the customer experience and streamline operations. Becoming a leading voice in the sustainable tourism movement within Assam, advocating for responsible travel policies and promoting ethical business practices. Ultimately, Tour Lover\'s aspires to be recognized as a trusted and respected travel partner, known for its commitment to providing exceptional experiences, supporting local communities, and preserving the natural and cultural heritage of Assam and Northeast India.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:45:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1485, 'Green Pics Tours', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>Green Pics Tours offers immersive and sustainable tourism experiences throughout Assam, showcasing the region\'s rich biodiversity, vibrant culture, and breathtaking landscapes. In a rapidly evolving tourism sector, Green Pics Tours distinguishes itself by prioritizing responsible travel practices, enriching the local economy, and educating visitors on the importance of environmental conservation. We are more than just a tour operator; we are curators of authentic Assamese experiences, committed to leaving a positive impact on the communities we visit and the environment we explore. Assam\'s tourism industry is experiencing growth, and Green Pics Tours is uniquely positioned to capitalize on the increasing demand for eco-conscious and culturally sensitive travel options.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around offering carefully curated tour packages that highlight Assam\'s diverse offerings. These include wildlife safaris in renowned national parks like Kaziranga and Manas, known for their rhino and tiger populations, respectively. We also provide cultural immersion tours that allow travelers to interact with local tribes, experience traditional Assamese festivals, and learn about the region\'s unique crafts and culinary traditions. For those seeking adventure, we offer trekking and river rafting expeditions through the lush hills and pristine waterways of Assam. Each tour is designed with sustainability in mind, minimizing environmental impact and maximizing benefits for local communities through the use of locally owned accommodations, transportation, and guide services. A key differentiator is our commitment to small group sizes, ensuring personalized attention and minimizing disturbance to the natural environment. Furthermore, we offer customized itinerary planning, catering to individual preferences and ensuring a bespoke travel experience for each guest. We meet the growing local market need for sustainable and authentic tourism by offering alternatives to mass tourism, fostering responsible travel behavior, and directly supporting local economies.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Green Pics Tours, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is rooted in building genuine relationships with our guests, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations. From the moment a traveler expresses interest in our tours to the completion of their journey, we provide personalized attention and support. Our tour guides are not only knowledgeable about the region\'s flora, fauna, and culture but are also passionate about sharing their expertise and fostering a deeper appreciation for Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage. We prioritize clear and transparent communication, ensuring that our guests are well-informed and prepared for their adventures. What sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively involve local residents in our tours, providing them with economic opportunities and ensuring that tourism benefits are shared equitably. We regularly collect feedback from our guests to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their needs. Green Pics Tours actively participates in local events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to the community and fostering a sense of shared responsibility for the region\'s well-being.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Green Pics Tours envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and culturally immersive tourism experiences in Assam, recognized for our commitment to responsible travel practices, community empowerment, and environmental conservation. Our future plans include expanding our tour offerings to new regions within Assam, further diversifying our services to cater to a wider range of interests, and strengthening our partnerships with local communities and conservation organizations. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, improve operational efficiency, and promote sustainable tourism practices. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that provides detailed information about our tours, allows for online booking, and facilitates communication with our guests. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff and local guides, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and promote responsible tourism practices. Long-term, we aspire to contribute to the sustainable development of Assam\'s tourism sector, promoting responsible travel behavior, conserving the region\'s natural and cultural heritage, and improving the livelihoods of local communities. We aim to establish a Green Pics Tours Foundation to support local conservation initiatives and community development projects, further solidifying our commitment to making a positive impact on the region.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:50:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1486, 'TRAVELLERS 365', 'Tour Operators', '', 'TRAVELLERS 365: Your Gateway to Seamless Travel Experiences in Assam\n\nTRAVELLERS 365, strategically located in Pakiza Samsun Plaza on Maniram Dewan Rd, is a comprehensive travel solutions provider dedicated to curating exceptional travel experiences for both domestic and international travelers. Situated in the heart of Assam, we understand the unique needs and aspirations of our clientele, offering personalized services that go beyond the typical travel agency experience. We are more than just a booking platform; we are travel partners, committed to ensuring every journey is memorable, hassle-free, and tailored to individual preferences. Our significance lies in bridging the gap between travelers\' dreams and logistical realities, particularly within the vibrant and diverse tourism landscape of Assam and Northeast India. <br> <br>\n\nWe distinguish ourselves through a deep understanding of the local context, enabling us to offer bespoke itineraries that showcase the region\'s hidden gems, cultural richness, and breathtaking natural beauty. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism practices ensures that we contribute positively to the communities and environments we operate in, fostering a responsible and enriching travel experience for all. We strive to be the go-to resource for travelers seeking authentic and immersive journeys, contributing to the growth of Assam\'s tourism sector while upholding the highest standards of professionalism and integrity. <br> <br>\n\nOur core services and products encompass a wide spectrum of travel-related offerings designed to cater to diverse needs and budgets. These include:\n\n*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in crafting personalized itineraries that cater to individual interests, whether it\'s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, discovering the wildlife sanctuaries of Kaziranga and Manas, experiencing the vibrant culture of the indigenous tribes, or embarking on adventurous treks in the Himalayan foothills. Our packages are meticulously designed to ensure a seamless and enriching travel experience, incorporating comfortable accommodations, reliable transportation, and knowledgeable local guides.\n*   **Flight and Accommodation Bookings:** We provide access to a comprehensive database of flight options from various airlines, ensuring competitive pricing and convenient connections. Our accommodation booking service offers a wide range of options, from luxury hotels and resorts to comfortable guesthouses and homestays, catering to different budgets and preferences.\n*   **Visa and Documentation Assistance:** Navigating visa requirements and travel documentation can be daunting. Our team provides expert guidance and assistance throughout the process, ensuring that travelers have all the necessary documents to travel smoothly and legally.\n*   **Transportation Services:** We offer reliable and comfortable transportation solutions, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours, ensuring that travelers can explore the region with ease and convenience.\n*   **Travel Insurance:** Protecting our clients is paramount. We offer a range of travel insurance options to safeguard against unforeseen circumstances, providing peace of mind and financial security throughout their journey.\n\nOur unique selling point lies in our personalized approach and our deep knowledge of the local area. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we take the time to understand our clients\' individual needs and preferences, crafting itineraries that are truly tailored to their interests and aspirations. This personalized service, coupled with our commitment to quality and reliability, sets us apart from other travel agencies. Our services directly address the local market\'s need for trustworthy and knowledgeable travel partners who can navigate the complexities of travel planning and provide access to unique and authentic experiences. <br> <br>\n\nAt TRAVELLERS 365, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. We are committed to providing a warm, welcoming, and personalized experience for every client. Our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to providing expert advice, answering questions promptly, and resolving any issues that may arise with efficiency and empathy. We prioritize building long-term relationships with our clients, becoming their trusted travel advisors for all their future journeys. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, promoting sustainable tourism practices and supporting local initiatives. We also participate in community events and festivals, fostering a sense of connection and belonging. We believe in creating a positive impact on the community we serve, contributing to its economic growth and cultural preservation. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. We value their opinions and use them to refine our processes and enhance the overall travel experience. <br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, TRAVELLERS 365 envisions becoming the leading travel solutions provider in Assam and Northeast India. Our growth strategy includes expanding our service offerings to include specialized tours focused on niche interests such as wildlife photography, birdwatching, and adventure sports. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance our online presence and streamline the booking process, making it even easier for travelers to plan their trips. We aim to forge strategic partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, including hotels, airlines, and local tour operators, to offer even more competitive pricing and comprehensive travel solutions. Our long-term goals include establishing a reputation for excellence in customer service, sustainability, and ethical tourism practices. We are committed to contributing to the growth of Assam\'s tourism sector while preserving its cultural heritage and natural beauty for future generations. We see ourselves as not just a travel agency, but as a catalyst for positive change in the tourism industry, promoting responsible and enriching travel experiences that benefit both travelers and the local community.', 'Pakiza Samsun Plaza, Maniram Dewan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:50:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1487, 'Travellers Club', 'Tour Operators', '', '<article>\n<h1>Travellers Club: Your Gateway to Exploration on Rajgarh Rd</h1>\n\n<p>Travellers Club, strategically situated on Rajgarh Rd, is more than just a travel agency; it\'s a purveyor of experiences, a facilitator of dreams, and a trusted partner for exploring the diverse landscapes and rich cultures that Assam and beyond have to offer. In a region brimming with natural beauty and a burgeoning tourism sector, Travellers Club distinguishes itself through personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a commitment to crafting unforgettable journeys. Recognizing the unique needs of the Assam traveller, from the adventurous trekker to the leisure-seeking family, Travellers Club has established itself as a key player in the local business ecosystem, fostering sustainable tourism and contributing to the economic vitality of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Tailored Journeys for Every Explorer</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of Travellers Club lies a comprehensive suite of travel services meticulously designed to cater to a wide spectrum of travel preferences. Our primary offerings include expertly curated tour packages encompassing destinations throughout Assam, Northeast India, and select international locations. These packages are not simply pre-packaged itineraries; they are dynamic frameworks that can be customized to align with individual interests, budgets, and time constraints. Whether it\'s exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam, trekking through the biodiversity hotspot of Kaziranga National Park, or embarking on a spiritual journey to the revered Kamakhya Temple, Travellers Club provides the expertise and logistical support to ensure a seamless and enriching experience. We also specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries for special interest groups, such as birdwatching enthusiasts, photography clubs, and cultural immersion seekers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond tour packages, Travellers Club offers a full range of individual travel services, including flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations, car rentals, and visa assistance. Our unique selling point lies in our dedication to providing personalized attention and leveraging our deep understanding of the local travel landscape. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we offer insightful recommendations on the best places to stay, eat, and explore, ensuring that our clients experience the authentic essence of their chosen destination. In a market often dominated by impersonal online travel agencies, Travellers Club provides a human touch, offering expert advice and unwavering support throughout the entire travel process. Recognizing the growing demand for sustainable and responsible tourism, we actively partner with local communities and eco-friendly accommodations, promoting ethical travel practices and contributing to the preservation of Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, One Journey at a Time</h2>\n\n<p>Customer service is not just a department at Travellers Club; it\'s a philosophy that permeates every aspect of our operations. We understand that travel is an investment, not just of money, but also of time and dreams. That\'s why we prioritize building genuine relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, our team of experienced travel consultants provides unwavering support and personalized attention. We believe in proactive communication, keeping our clients informed every step of the way and addressing any concerns promptly and effectively. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to going the extra mile, anticipating potential challenges and providing creative solutions to ensure a smooth and enjoyable travel experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Travellers Club actively connects with the local community through various initiatives, including sponsoring local events, partnering with community-based tourism organizations, and promoting local artisans and businesses. We believe in fostering a spirit of collaboration and contributing to the economic well-being of the region. Furthermore, we leverage social media and other digital platforms to share travel tips, promote local attractions, and engage with our customers on a personal level. By fostering a strong sense of community and providing exceptional customer service, Travellers Club has cultivated a loyal customer base and established a reputation as a trusted and reliable travel partner in the Rajgarh Rd area and beyond.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons, Embracing Innovation</h2>\n\n<p>Travellers Club envisions a future of continued growth and innovation, solidifying its position as a leading travel provider in Assam and Northeast India. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to encompass adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and educational travel programs. We are actively exploring partnerships with airlines and hotels to secure competitive rates and enhance our value proposition. Furthermore, we are investing in technology to streamline our operations, improve the customer experience, and expand our reach through online channels. This includes developing a user-friendly mobile app and enhancing our online presence to cater to the growing demand for digital travel solutions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Travellers Club is committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices and contributing to the economic development of the communities we serve. We plan to increase our partnerships with local organizations, promote eco-friendly accommodations, and support initiatives that preserve Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage. By embracing innovation, fostering collaboration, and remaining committed to our core values of personalized service and customer satisfaction, Travellers Club is poised to embark on a journey of continued success, empowering individuals to explore the world and create memories that will last a lifetime, all starting from our base on Rajgarh Rd.</p>\n</article>', 'Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:50:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1488, 'Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels', 'Tour Operators', '', 'Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels, strategically located near the SIPRD hill, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences within Assam and beyond. Nestled in a region rich with natural beauty and cultural heritage, Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels distinguishes itself through its deep understanding of the local landscape and a commitment to crafting personalized journeys that cater to the diverse needs of both domestic and international travelers. The agency aims to be more than just a travel provider; it aspires to be a trusted partner in exploration, offering seamless, memorable, and enriching adventures.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to every aspect of travel. These services include expertly curated tour packages encompassing Assam\'s famed tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga National Park, and spiritual destinations. Tailored itineraries are crafted based on client preferences, ensuring each journey reflects individual interests and expectations. Beyond pre-packaged tours, the agency offers flight and train ticketing services, facilitating convenient and cost-effective transportation arrangements. Hotel booking services are also integral, providing access to a wide range of accommodation options, from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious resorts, all carefully selected for comfort, convenience, and quality. A significant differentiator for Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels is its focus on specialized tours such as eco-tourism, adventure tourism (including trekking and river rafting), and cultural immersion experiences. These cater to a growing demand for authentic and responsible travel that benefits local communities and preserves the region\'s natural heritage. By prioritizing local guides and partnering with eco-friendly accommodations, the agency contributes to sustainable tourism practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nMahalaxmi Tour N Travels places paramount importance on customer satisfaction, striving to create a seamless and delightful travel experience from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. The agency\'s team comprises experienced travel consultants with in-depth knowledge of Assam and its surrounding regions. These consultants are adept at understanding client needs, offering informed recommendations, and handling all logistical aspects with meticulous attention to detail. What truly sets Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels apart is its commitment to building genuine relationships with its clients. The agency fosters a welcoming and personalized atmosphere, treating each traveler as an individual rather than just a booking. This personalized approach extends to on-the-ground support, with dedicated representatives available to assist travelers throughout their journey, ensuring prompt resolution of any issues or concerns. Furthermore, Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, cultural organizations, and community-based tourism initiatives. This commitment to community involvement not only enhances the travel experience but also contributes to the economic empowerment of local residents.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the region, recognized for its exceptional customer service, innovative tour offerings, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Future growth plans include expanding the range of specialized tours to encompass emerging interests such as culinary tourism and wellness retreats. The agency also aims to enhance its online presence through a user-friendly website and mobile app, enabling travelers to easily access information, book services, and manage their travel itineraries. Strategic partnerships with airlines, hotels, and other travel providers are also being pursued to enhance competitiveness and offer even greater value to customers. Long-term goals include establishing a network of regional offices to better serve travelers across Assam and beyond, fostering a culture of continuous improvement and innovation within the organization, and actively contributing to the sustainable development of the region\'s tourism industry. Mahalaxmi Tour N Travels is dedicated to showcasing the beauty and richness of Assam to the world, while simultaneously preserving its natural and cultural heritage for future generations.', 'near SIPRD hill', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:50:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1489, 'Thomas Cook - Christian Basti| Holiday & Forex', 'Tour Operators', '', '<p>Thomas Cook - Christian Basti| Holiday & Forex stands as a prominent and trusted name in the Guwahati travel and financial services sector, offering a comprehensive suite of holiday packages and foreign exchange solutions tailored to the diverse needs of the region. Located in the bustling Christian Basti area, this branch of the globally recognized Thomas Cook brand combines international expertise with a deep understanding of local preferences, creating a unique and valuable proposition for its customers.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Unlike standalone travel agencies or forex bureaus, Thomas Cook - Christian Basti| Holiday & Forex offers a one-stop-shop for all travel-related needs, providing a seamless and stress-free experience. Their core services encompass meticulously curated holiday packages, catering to a wide range of interests and budgets. These packages range from domestic explorations of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage and breathtaking landscapes to international adventures in popular destinations across Asia, Europe, and beyond. Beyond pre-packaged tours, the business excels in creating bespoke itineraries, meticulously crafted to fulfill the specific requirements and desires of individual travelers and groups. This personalized approach, coupled with their global network of partners, allows them to offer exclusive experiences and competitive pricing. Complementing the holiday offerings is a comprehensive range of foreign exchange services. They provide competitive exchange rates for a variety of currencies, facilitate international money transfers, and offer travel insurance, ensuring that customers are financially secure and protected throughout their journeys. Their unique selling point lies in the synergy between these services – customers can plan their entire trip, secure their currency needs, and arrange for travel insurance all under one roof, saving valuable time and effort.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Thomas Cook - Christian Basti| Holiday & Forex’s operating philosophy. The team understands that planning a trip, whether for leisure or business, can be a complex and sometimes daunting task. Therefore, they prioritize providing personalized attention and expert guidance to each customer. Their trained travel consultants possess in-depth knowledge of various destinations and are adept at understanding individual travel styles and preferences. They patiently listen to customer needs, offering insightful recommendations and helping them create their dream holiday. Beyond the initial booking process, the business maintains open lines of communication, providing ongoing support and assistance throughout the customer\'s journey. This commitment to exceptional customer service extends to their foreign exchange services, where trained professionals offer transparent and reliable currency exchange solutions. What truly distinguishes this branch is its connection to the local community. They actively participate in local events, sponsor community initiatives, and build relationships with local businesses, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty. They also understand the cultural nuances of the region, tailoring their services to cater to the specific needs and preferences of the Assamese community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Thomas Cook - Christian Basti| Holiday & Forex envisions a future of sustained growth and enhanced service offerings. Their long-term goals include expanding their range of holiday packages to cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. They also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, introducing online booking platforms and mobile applications that provide greater convenience and accessibility. A significant focus will be on strengthening their presence in the corporate travel sector, offering customized travel solutions to businesses in Guwahati and the surrounding region. This includes streamlining travel arrangements, negotiating preferential rates with hotels and airlines, and providing dedicated account management services. Furthermore, the business aims to expand its foreign exchange services to cater to the growing demand for international transactions, offering new and innovative financial solutions to individuals and businesses alike. By consistently investing in its people, technology, and service offerings, Thomas Cook - Christian Basti| Holiday & Forex is poised to solidify its position as the leading travel and financial services provider in the region, contributing to the economic growth and development of Assam.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 11:50:38', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
