(1507, 'Rocks \'n\' Shells- A Travel Hub LLP- One Stop Travel Solutions | Guwahati, Assam', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<h1>Rocks \'n\' Shells - A Travel Hub LLP: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond</h1>\n\n<p>Rocks \'n\' Shells - A Travel Hub LLP, located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, at Santi Nivas, Tripura Rd, near NERIM Institute, is a comprehensive travel solutions provider dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences for both domestic and international travelers. Recognizing the growing demand for personalized and authentic travel within the Northeast and beyond, Rocks \'n\' Shells bridges the gap between standardized tourism and the unique desires of individual explorers. As an LLP, the company combines the flexibility of a partnership with the security of limited liability, positioning it for sustainable growth and expansion within the dynamic Assam business environment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>In a region celebrated for its rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and unparalleled biodiversity, Rocks \'n\' Shells stands out by offering bespoke travel solutions that cater to a wide spectrum of needs and preferences. From adventurous treks through the Himalayan foothills to immersive cultural tours exploring ancient temples and tribal villages, the company curates itineraries that resonate with the spirit of exploration and discovery. By focusing on sustainable tourism practices and empowering local communities, Rocks \'n\' Shells contributes to the preservation of Assam\'s natural and cultural assets while providing enriching and responsible travel experiences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Crafting Exceptional Journeys</h2>\n\n<p>Rocks \'n\' Shells offers a diverse portfolio of travel services designed to cater to the diverse needs of modern travelers:\n<ul>\n<li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> Tailored itineraries that reflect individual interests, budget considerations, and travel styles. These range from short weekend getaways to extensive multi-day explorations, showcasing the best of Assam and neighboring regions.</li>\n<li><b>Adventure Tourism:</b> Organized trekking expeditions, river rafting adventures, and wildlife safaris, led by experienced guides and adhering to stringent safety standards. These experiences are designed to immerse travelers in the natural beauty of the Northeast.</li>\n<li><b>Cultural Immersion Experiences:</b> Guided tours of historical sites, interactions with local artisans and tribal communities, and participation in traditional festivals and celebrations. These programs promote cultural exchange and understanding.</li>\n<li><b>Corporate Travel Management:</b> Efficient and cost-effective travel solutions for businesses, including flight bookings, hotel reservations, transportation arrangements, and conference planning.</li>\n<li><b>Ticketing and Accommodation:</b> Comprehensive booking services for flights, trains, buses, and hotels, ensuring seamless travel arrangements for both leisure and business travelers.</li>\n</ul></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Rocks \'n\' Shells distinguishes itself through several key differentiators. Firstly, its profound understanding of the local terrain, culture, and logistics allows for the creation of truly unique and authentic travel experiences. Secondly, the company is committed to sustainable tourism practices, working closely with local communities to minimize environmental impact and maximize socio-economic benefits. Finally, its dedication to personalized service ensures that each traveler receives the attention and support needed to create a memorable and stress-free journey.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>These services directly address the evolving needs of the local market. As Guwahati emerges as a major economic and tourism hub in the Northeast, there is a growing demand for reliable and professional travel solutions. Rocks \'n\' Shells caters to this demand by providing convenient, personalized, and sustainable travel options that cater to both domestic and international visitors, as well as local residents seeking to explore their own region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, One Journey at a Time</h2>\n\n<p>At Rocks \'n\' Shells, customer satisfaction is paramount. The company\'s approach to customer service is built on a foundation of responsiveness, transparency, and personalized attention. A dedicated team of travel experts is available to assist customers at every stage of their journey, from initial planning to post-trip follow-up. The company actively solicits feedback from customers and uses it to continuously improve its services and offerings.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Rocks \'n\' Shells strives to create a welcoming and inclusive environment for all travelers. The company\'s commitment to ethical and responsible tourism practices extends to its interactions with local communities. By supporting local businesses, respecting cultural traditions, and promoting environmental conservation, Rocks \'n\' Shells fosters positive relationships with the communities it serves.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Rocks \'n\' Shells actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, tour guides, and service providers. The company also participates in local events and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to the cultural and economic well-being of Assam. By building strong relationships with local stakeholders, Rocks \'n\' Shells ensures that its travel experiences are authentic, enriching, and beneficial to the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Enriching Lives</h2>\n\n<p>Rocks \'n\' Shells envisions becoming the leading travel solutions provider in the Northeast, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. The company plans to expand its service offerings to include niche travel segments, such as wellness tourism, eco-tourism, and experiential travel. Further, Rocks \'n\' Shells intends to leverage digital technologies to enhance its online presence, streamline its operations, and provide customers with seamless access to its services.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Long-term goals include establishing strategic partnerships with international travel agencies, expanding its geographical reach beyond the Northeast, and developing innovative travel products that cater to the evolving needs of the global traveler. Rocks \'n\' Shells is committed to investing in its team, fostering a culture of innovation and excellence, and contributing to the sustainable growth of the tourism industry in Assam and beyond. The vision is to not just facilitate travel, but to curate transformative experiences that broaden horizons and enrich lives, fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation for the world we inhabit.</p>', 'Santi Nivas, Tripura Rd, near NERIM Insitute', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:10:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1508, 'C.N. Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>C.N. Travels is a premier travel agency deeply rooted in the heart of Assam, dedicated to providing exceptional and personalized travel experiences within the region and beyond. More than just a travel provider, C.N. Travels acts as a cultural ambassador, curating journeys that not only showcase the beauty of Assam but also support local communities and promote sustainable tourism practices. In a landscape often dominated by larger, impersonal travel conglomerates, C.N. Travels distinguishes itself through its intimate knowledge of the region, its commitment to personalized service, and its dedication to crafting truly unforgettable adventures. The agency\'s significance lies in its ability to connect travelers with the authentic Assam, fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation for its rich cultural heritage and stunning natural landscapes.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>C.N. Travels offers a diverse portfolio of services designed to cater to a wide range of travel needs. Its core services include meticulously planned tour packages that explore the diverse landscapes of Assam, from the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam to the wildlife havens of Kaziranga and Manas National Parks. These packages are customizable, allowing travelers to tailor their itineraries to their specific interests and preferences, whether it\'s birdwatching, river cruises, cultural immersion experiences, or adventurous trekking expeditions. Beyond pre-packaged tours, C.N. Travels provides comprehensive travel planning assistance, including flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations, car rentals, and visa assistance. A key differentiator is the agency\'s focus on showcasing lesser-known gems of Assam, venturing beyond the typical tourist trails to offer unique experiences such as visits to tribal villages, participation in local festivals, and homestays that provide an intimate glimpse into Assamese life. C.N. Travels also specializes in crafting bespoke itineraries for corporate groups, educational institutions, and special interest groups, ensuring that every detail is meticulously planned and executed to meet the specific needs of each client. The agency’s expertise directly addresses the local market\'s desire for reliable, trustworthy, and culturally sensitive travel solutions that are tailored to the unique nuances of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer service is the cornerstone of C.N. Travels\' philosophy. The agency strives to create a welcoming and supportive environment for every traveler, fostering genuine connections and building lasting relationships. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, the C.N. Travels team is dedicated to providing prompt, efficient, and personalized assistance. The staff are not just travel agents; they are passionate advocates for Assam, eager to share their knowledge and insights with visitors. What truly sets C.N. Travels apart is its commitment to going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. This includes providing 24/7 support during travel, proactively addressing any potential issues, and offering flexible solutions to accommodate unexpected changes in plans. C.N. Travels actively engages with the local community by partnering with local artisans, guides, and homestay providers, thereby contributing to the economic well-being of the region and promoting responsible tourism. The agency regularly participates in local festivals and events, further strengthening its ties with the community and demonstrating its commitment to preserving Assamese culture and traditions. C.N. Travels also actively solicits feedback from customers to continuously improve its services and ensure that it is meeting the evolving needs of the local market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>C.N. Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, its commitment to sustainable tourism, and its unwavering dedication to showcasing the beauty and diversity of the region. Future plans include expanding its network of local partners, developing new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. The agency intends to invest in digital marketing and online booking platforms to reach a wider audience and make its services more accessible. C.N. Travels also aims to establish strategic partnerships with international tour operators to attract more foreign tourists to Assam and promote the region as a world-class travel destination. A long-term goal is to establish a training academy for local tour guides and hospitality professionals, ensuring that the region has a skilled and knowledgeable workforce to support the growing tourism industry. Ultimately, C.N. Travels aspires to be a catalyst for positive change in the region, promoting sustainable economic development, preserving cultural heritage, and fostering a deeper appreciation for the natural wonders of Assam.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:10:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1509, 'Jernav Tour and Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Jernav Tour and Travels: Exploring Assam and Beyond from Ganeshguri\n\nJernav Tour and Travels, strategically located in the bustling Ganeshguri area of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a premier provider of comprehensive travel solutions. In a region renowned for its rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and burgeoning tourism sector, Jernav Tour and Travels distinguishes itself through a commitment to personalized service, deep local expertise, and a dedication to showcasing the authentic beauty of Northeast India and beyond. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of experiences, crafting journeys that leave lasting memories.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products: Unveiling Assam\'s Treasures and Global Adventures\n\nAt the heart of Jernav Tour and Travels lies a diverse portfolio of services designed to cater to a wide spectrum of travel needs. Our core offerings include:\n\n*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries that reflect individual preferences, interests, and budgets. Whether it’s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, trekking through the hills of Meghalaya, or discovering the wildlife sanctuaries of Arunachal Pradesh, our packages are meticulously planned to ensure a seamless and enriching experience. These packages often include accommodation, transportation, guided tours, and cultural immersion activities.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **Hotel and Accommodation Booking:** Leveraging strong relationships with a network of hotels, resorts, and guesthouses across Northeast India and pan India, we secure competitive rates and ensure comfortable and convenient stays for our clients. We cater to all budgets, from budget-friendly options to luxurious retreats.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **Transportation Services:** We offer a comprehensive range of transportation solutions, including car rentals with experienced drivers, bus bookings for larger groups, and assistance with flight and train ticketing. We prioritize safety and reliability, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free travel experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **Adventure Tourism:** Recognizing the growing demand for experiential travel, we organize adventure activities such as river rafting, trekking, camping, and wildlife safaris, catering to thrill-seekers and nature enthusiasts alike. Our adventure tours are conducted by experienced guides and adhere to the highest safety standards.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **International Travel Assistance:** Beyond Northeast India, we assist clients with international travel arrangements, including visa assistance, flight bookings, and tour packages to various destinations across the globe.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local terrain, culture, and nuances of travel in Northeast India. This allows us to offer authentic and immersive experiences that are often missed by larger, more generic travel agencies. We also differentiate ourselves through our commitment to responsible tourism, promoting sustainable practices and supporting local communities. We actively work with local artisans, guides, and businesses to ensure that our tours contribute to the economic well-being of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience: Personalized Service and Community Connection\n\nAt Jernav Tour and Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, providing personalized attention and going the extra mile to exceed their expectations. Our approach is characterized by:\n\n*   **Dedicated Travel Consultants:** Our team of experienced travel consultants are knowledgeable, responsive, and passionate about creating unforgettable travel experiences. They take the time to understand each client\'s individual needs and preferences, offering expert advice and guidance.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **24/7 Support:** We provide round-the-clock support to our clients, ensuring that they have assistance whenever they need it, whether it\'s a simple query or an unexpected travel emergency.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **Focus on Feedback:** We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We value transparency and are committed to addressing any concerns promptly and effectively.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond providing exceptional travel services, Jernav Tour and Travels actively participates in local community initiatives. We partner with local organizations to promote tourism awareness, support cultural preservation efforts, and contribute to the overall development of the Ganeshguri area. We believe that by engaging with the community, we can create a more sustainable and enriching tourism ecosystem for everyone.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: Expanding Horizons and Enhancing Experiences\n\nJernav Tour and Travels envisions a future where it becomes the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainable tourism practices. Our future plans include:\n\n*   **Expanding our service offerings:** We plan to introduce new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, such as wellness tourism, eco-tourism, and adventure tourism.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **Leveraging technology:** We will continue to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, streamline our operations, and improve our online presence. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that allows clients to easily book tours, manage their itineraries, and access travel information.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **Strengthening partnerships:** We will continue to build strong relationships with hotels, airlines, and other travel providers to secure competitive rates and offer our clients the best possible value.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n*   **Promoting responsible tourism:** We remain committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices and supporting local communities. We will actively seek out opportunities to partner with organizations that share our values and contribute to the preservation of Northeast India\'s rich cultural and natural heritage.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to not only provide exceptional travel services but also to contribute to the economic and social development of the region. By showcasing the beauty and diversity of Northeast India, we aim to attract more tourists, create more jobs, and improve the quality of life for local communities. Jernav Tour and Travels is dedicated to being a responsible and sustainable business, committed to preserving the environment and supporting the communities in which we operate, while providing unparalleled travel experiences to our valued customers.', 'Ganeshguri', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:10:40', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1510, 'Solitude Travel Solutions Pvt LTD', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Solitude Travel Solutions Pvt LTD, strategically located on Pir Ajan Fakir Rd, near Bimala Bibah Bhawan, is emerging as a premier travel solutions provider in the heart of Assam. We distinguish ourselves by offering personalized and comprehensive travel arrangements that cater to the unique needs and preferences of both local and inbound travelers. Our commitment goes beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we aim to craft memorable and enriching travel experiences that resonate with the rich cultural heritage and stunning natural beauty of Assam and beyond. As a Pvt LTD company, we operate with a structure focused on stability, sustainable growth, and a dedication to providing the highest standards of service within the Assam business landscape. Solitude Travel Solutions recognizes the specific needs of the local market, appreciating the blend of leisure, pilgrimage, and business travel that defines the region\'s travel patterns. We aim to be the preferred partner for individuals, families, and organizations seeking seamless and stress-free travel solutions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Solitude Travel Solutions\' offerings are a range of meticulously designed services and products to facilitate all aspects of travel. These include:\n*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries that highlight Assam\'s diverse attractions, from the majestic Brahmaputra River and lush tea gardens to the sacred Kamakhya Temple and the wildlife sanctuaries of Kaziranga and Manas. These packages are designed to cater to various interests, timeframes, and budgets.\n*   **Domestic and International Flight Bookings:** We provide efficient and reliable flight booking services, leveraging our partnerships with leading airlines to offer competitive fares and optimal travel routes.\n*   **Hotel and Accommodation Reservations:** We maintain a strong network of hotels, guesthouses, and resorts across Assam and beyond, ensuring our clients have access to a wide range of accommodation options to suit their preferences and budget.\n*   **Transportation Arrangements:** We offer seamless transportation solutions, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours with experienced local drivers, ensuring comfortable and convenient travel throughout the region.\n*   **Pilgrimage Tours:** Recognizing the spiritual significance of Assam, we design specialized pilgrimage tours to prominent religious sites, providing comfortable and hassle-free experiences for devotees.\n*   **Corporate Travel Management:** We offer comprehensive travel management services for businesses, streamlining travel arrangements and optimizing travel budgets for corporate clients.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur unique selling point lies in our personalized approach to travel planning. We take the time to understand each client\'s individual needs and preferences, tailoring our services to create unique and unforgettable experiences. Unlike generic online travel platforms, we provide expert advice, local insights, and dedicated support throughout the entire travel process. This personalized touch is particularly valuable in Assam, where local knowledge and cultural sensitivity are crucial for a smooth and enriching travel experience. We also emphasize sustainable and responsible tourism practices, supporting local communities and minimizing our environmental impact.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nSolitude Travel Solutions is committed to delivering an exceptional customer experience that exceeds expectations. We believe that building strong relationships with our clients is essential for long-term success. Our customer service philosophy is built on the following pillars:\n*   **Personalized Attention:** We provide dedicated travel consultants who are readily available to answer questions, address concerns, and offer expert advice.\n*   **Prompt and Efficient Service:** We strive to respond to inquiries quickly and efficiently, ensuring that all travel arrangements are handled with professionalism and care.\n*   **Local Expertise:** Our team possesses in-depth knowledge of Assam and the surrounding region, allowing us to provide valuable insights and recommendations.\n*   **Community Engagement:** We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, supporting sustainable tourism initiatives and promoting the region\'s cultural heritage.\n*   **Continuous Improvement:** We are constantly seeking feedback from our clients to improve our services and enhance the overall travel experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Solitude Travel Solutions envisions itself as the leading travel solutions provider in Assam, renowned for its personalized service, local expertise, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our long-term goals include:\n*   **Expanding our network:** We plan to expand our network of partners, including hotels, tour operators, and transportation providers, to offer an even wider range of services and options to our clients.\n*   **Developing innovative travel packages:** We will continue to develop innovative and unique travel packages that showcase the best of Assam\'s cultural and natural attractions.\n*   **Investing in technology:** We will invest in technology to streamline our operations, enhance our customer service capabilities, and provide a seamless online booking experience.\n*   **Promoting sustainable tourism:** We are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities and protect the environment.\n*   **Establishing a strong brand reputation:** We will continue to build a strong brand reputation based on trust, reliability, and exceptional customer service.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBy focusing on these strategic goals, Solitude Travel Solutions aims to contribute to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam while providing unparalleled travel experiences for our clients. Our location near Bimala Bibah Bhawan acts as an accessible touchpoint for many local families and individuals planning their next adventure, solidifying our place in the community as a trusted partner for all their travel needs. We are confident that Solitude Travel Solutions will continue to thrive and make a significant contribution to the Assam business landscape for years to come.', 'Pir Ajan Fakir Rd, near Bimala Bibah Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:15:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1511, 'Mahabaahu travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Mahabaahu Travels: Connecting Assam, One Journey at a Time\n\nMahabaahu Travels, strategically located at LP School, near the BJP Office, is a premier travel service provider dedicated to facilitating seamless and enriching travel experiences within Assam and beyond. Rooted in a deep understanding of the region\'s diverse landscapes, vibrant culture, and the evolving needs of its travelers, Mahabaahu Travels distinguishes itself through a commitment to personalized service, reliability, and a genuine passion for showcasing the beauty and hospitality of Assam. Unlike generic travel agencies, we specialize in crafting itineraries that resonate with the authentic Assamese spirit, catering to both leisure and business travelers seeking memorable and hassle-free journeys. Our proximity to a central landmark allows for easy accessibility and fosters a sense of community trust and familiarity.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core services revolve around providing comprehensive travel solutions tailored to the unique demands of the Assamese market. These include:\n\n*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We design bespoke tour packages that explore the hidden gems and popular attractions of Assam, catering to individual preferences, group sizes, and budget considerations. From wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to cultural immersion experiences in Majuli, the world\'s largest river island, and spiritual retreats in the Kamakhya Temple, we curate itineraries that leave a lasting impression.\n\n*   **Reliable Transportation Services:** Mahabaahu Travels offers a fleet of well-maintained vehicles and experienced drivers to ensure safe and comfortable transportation throughout Assam. Our services range from airport transfers and city tours to long-distance travel within the state and neighboring regions. We prioritize punctuality and passenger safety, providing a stress-free travel experience.\n\n*   **Hotel and Accommodation Bookings:** We have established strong relationships with a network of hotels, guesthouses, and resorts across Assam, allowing us to offer competitive rates and a wide range of accommodation options to suit various budgets and preferences. We carefully select accommodations based on their quality, location, and service standards.\n\n*   **Ticketing Services:** Mahabaahu Travels provides ticketing services for flights, trains, and buses, simplifying the booking process and ensuring access to the best available fares. We offer expert advice on travel routes and schedules, helping customers make informed decisions.\n\nOur unique selling points lie in our deep local knowledge, personalized approach, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices. We strive to support local communities and promote responsible travel that minimizes environmental impact. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and building lasting relationships, we aim to become the preferred travel partner for individuals and businesses in Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Mahabaahu Travels, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building genuine connections with our customers, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations. Our team of dedicated travel professionals is committed to providing personalized attention and expert guidance at every step of the journey. From the initial inquiry to the final departure, we strive to create a seamless and enjoyable experience.\n\nWe foster a welcoming and inclusive environment, where customers feel valued and respected. Our customer service representatives are fluent in local languages, ensuring effective communication and addressing any concerns promptly. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our services.\n\nBeyond providing exceptional travel services, Mahabaahu Travels is deeply involved in the local community. We participate in local events, support charitable organizations, and promote initiatives that benefit the residents of Assam. By contributing to the well-being of the community, we aim to build trust and foster a sense of shared responsibility. Our location near LP School allows us to directly engage with the local community, building relationships and understanding their needs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Mahabaahu Travels envisions becoming the leading travel service provider in Assam, renowned for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include:\n\n*   **Expanding our service offerings:** We plan to introduce new services such as adventure tourism packages, eco-tourism experiences, and specialized tours for specific interests, such as tea tourism and wildlife photography.\n\n*   **Leveraging technology:** We will invest in advanced technology platforms to streamline our operations, enhance customer communication, and provide online booking capabilities.\n\n*   **Strengthening our partnerships:** We will continue to build strong relationships with our partners, including hotels, transportation providers, and local businesses, to offer our customers the best possible value and service.\n\n*   **Promoting sustainable tourism:** We will actively promote sustainable tourism practices and encourage responsible travel that benefits local communities and minimizes environmental impact.\n\nOur long-term goal is to contribute to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam, creating economic opportunities for local communities and showcasing the beauty and culture of the region to the world. We are committed to providing exceptional travel experiences that leave a lasting positive impact on our customers and the communities we serve. Mahabaahu Travels is more than just a travel agency; we are your trusted partner in exploring the wonders of Assam.', 'Lp school, near BJP Office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:15:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1512, 'KHAREL TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>KHAREL TRAVELS, strategically located at Shop No 340, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, near Downtown Hospital Kamrup, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences tailored to the diverse needs of the Assam community and beyond. As a vital part of the local business ecosystem, KHAREL TRAVELS distinguishes itself through a commitment to personalized service, in-depth regional expertise, and a genuine passion for connecting people with enriching travel opportunities. We are more than just a booking agency; we are travel partners committed to crafting seamless and memorable journeys.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of KHAREL TRAVELS\' offerings lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to both leisure and business travelers. Our primary services include meticulously planned tour packages encompassing Assam\'s breathtaking landscapes, vibrant cultural heritage, and unique wildlife experiences. These packages range from short weekend getaways exploring tea gardens and historical sites to immersive multi-day expeditions into national parks like Kaziranga and Manas. Furthermore, we offer expertly curated itineraries for destinations across India and select international locations, ensuring a diverse range of travel options for our clients.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond tour packages, KHAREL TRAVELS provides essential travel arrangements, including flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations, and vehicle rentals. Our strategic partnerships with leading airlines, hotel chains, and transportation providers allow us to secure competitive rates and offer our clients the best value for their money. We also specialize in visa assistance services, guiding travelers through the often-complex application process with expert advice and support, significantly reducing stress and increasing the likelihood of successful applications. A key differentiator is our focus on eco-tourism, promoting sustainable travel practices and supporting local communities through responsible tourism initiatives. This commitment resonates strongly with the growing awareness of environmental conservation within the region. Our deep understanding of the specific travel needs of the local market – including preferences for pilgrimage tours, family vacations, and corporate travel arrangements – further sets us apart from larger, less localized agencies.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at KHAREL TRAVELS. We believe that exceptional service begins with understanding each client\'s unique needs and aspirations. Our team of experienced travel consultants takes the time to listen carefully, offering personalized recommendations and crafting bespoke itineraries that exceed expectations. We foster a welcoming and approachable atmosphere, ensuring that every interaction is positive and informative. This dedication extends beyond the initial booking process. We provide ongoing support throughout the journey, offering assistance with travel logistics, addressing any unforeseen challenges, and ensuring a smooth and enjoyable experience from start to finish.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our commitment to the local community is deeply ingrained in our business ethos. We actively participate in local events, support community initiatives, and prioritize partnerships with local businesses. This engagement fosters strong relationships with our clients and reinforces our position as a trusted and valued member of the community. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings. This commitment to responsiveness and adaptability allows us to stay ahead of evolving travel trends and meet the changing needs of our clientele. We also leverage digital platforms to enhance communication, providing online booking options, virtual consultations, and real-time travel updates, ensuring convenience and accessibility for our customers.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking towards the future, KHAREL TRAVELS envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as the leading travel agency in the region. Our future plans include developing specialized tour packages focused on niche interests such as adventure tourism, wildlife photography, and cultural immersion experiences. We also aim to strengthen our online presence and enhance our digital marketing efforts to reach a wider audience. Investing in staff training and development is a key priority, ensuring that our team remains at the forefront of industry knowledge and best practices. Furthermore, we plan to explore strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector, such as local hotels, restaurants, and transportation providers, to create synergistic relationships and enhance the overall travel experience for our clients.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing KHAREL TRAVELS as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, reliability, and exceptional customer service. We are committed to contributing to the sustainable development of the tourism industry in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices and supporting local communities. By staying true to our core values and continuously innovating to meet the evolving needs of our customers, KHAREL TRAVELS is poised for continued growth and success in the years to come. We aspire to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be a catalyst for positive change, connecting people with enriching experiences and fostering a deeper appreciation for the beauty and diversity of our world.</p>', 'Shop No 340, Dr Zakir Hussain Rd, near Downtown Hospital Kamrup', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:15:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1513, 'Dhrubojyoti Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Dhrubojyoti Travels, situated at 23 Beltola College Road, Guwahati, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences throughout Assam, Northeast India, and beyond. With a deep understanding of the region\'s unique cultural tapestry and stunning natural beauty, Dhrubojyoti Travels acts as a gateway for both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and memorable journeys. In a landscape often dominated by larger, less personalized agencies, Dhrubojyoti Travels distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a genuine passion for showcasing the wonders of Assam and the Northeast.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Dhrubojyoti Travels lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to a diverse range of travel needs. These include meticulously crafted tour packages highlighting Assam\'s iconic destinations, such as Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and the tea gardens of Upper Assam. Furthermore, the agency offers customized itineraries designed to meet the specific interests and preferences of individual travelers or groups, whether it\'s exploring ancient temples, trekking through lush forests, or immersing oneself in the vibrant culture of local tribes. Beyond Assam, Dhrubojyoti Travels extends its expertise to cover the entire Northeast, including Arunachal Pradesh, Meghalaya, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura, offering seamless travel arrangements that factor in permits, transportation, and accommodation. Rounding out its core services are flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations, and car rental services, ensuring a hassle-free travel experience from start to finish. What truly sets Dhrubojyoti Travels apart is its specialization in off-the-beaten-path destinations and experiential travel. They curate unique opportunities for travelers to engage with local communities, participate in cultural events, and support sustainable tourism initiatives. This commitment to responsible tourism allows visitors to not only experience the beauty of the region but also contribute to its preservation.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Dhrubojyoti Travels places paramount importance on delivering exceptional customer service. The agency\'s approach is built on the principles of personalized attention, proactive communication, and a genuine desire to exceed customer expectations. Every interaction, from the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up, is handled with professionalism and care. The team at Dhrubojyoti Travels understands that travel is more than just logistics; it\'s about creating memories. They strive to build strong relationships with their clients, understanding their individual needs and preferences to craft truly tailored experiences. Furthermore, Dhrubojyoti Travels actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, artisans, and cultural organizations. By supporting local initiatives, the agency contributes to the economic and social well-being of the region while providing travelers with authentic cultural encounters. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of trust and goodwill, making Dhrubojyoti Travels a respected and valued member of the Beltola College Road neighborhood and the wider Assam travel industry. The agency also prides itself on its responsiveness and accessibility, providing 24/7 support to travelers in case of emergencies or unexpected situations, ensuring peace of mind throughout their journey.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Dhrubojyoti Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, sustainable practices, and unwavering commitment to showcasing the beauty and culture of the region. The agency plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on specific interests, such as wildlife photography, birdwatching, and tea tourism. Furthermore, Dhrubojyoti Travels aims to strengthen its online presence and leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience, both domestically and internationally. A key focus will be on developing sustainable tourism initiatives that minimize environmental impact and maximize benefits for local communities. This includes promoting eco-friendly accommodations, supporting local artisans and businesses, and educating travelers about responsible travel practices. Long-term, Dhrubojyoti Travels aspires to play a pivotal role in promoting Assam as a premier tourism destination, attracting visitors from around the world and contributing to the economic growth and cultural preservation of the region. The agency also intends to invest in training and development programs for its staff, ensuring that they possess the knowledge, skills, and passion necessary to deliver exceptional service and maintain Dhrubojyoti Travels\' position as a leader in the Assam travel industry. The commitment to innovation and continuous improvement will be central to the agency\'s future success, ensuring that Dhrubojyoti Travels remains at the forefront of the evolving travel landscape.</p>', '23 Beltola College Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:15:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1514, 'Encamp Adventures - Customized Tour & Trek Packages', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Encamp Adventures - Customized Tour & Trek Packages: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam and Beyond\n\nEncamp Adventures, located in the vibrant Beltola Survey area of Guwahati, Assam, is a premier tour and trekking company specializing in crafting bespoke travel experiences that cater to the diverse interests and needs of adventure seekers, nature enthusiasts, and cultural explorers. We distinguish ourselves in the Assam business landscape by prioritizing personalized service, sustainable tourism practices, and an in-depth understanding of the region’s hidden gems, offering a curated alternative to mass-market tourism. We aim to showcase the breathtaking beauty and rich cultural heritage of Assam and Northeast India while contributing positively to the local communities we engage with.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core service lies in the meticulous creation of customized tour and trek packages. We move beyond pre-packaged itineraries, working closely with each client to understand their individual preferences, fitness levels, budget constraints, and desired level of adventure. This personalized approach allows us to design truly unique experiences, whether it\'s a challenging multi-day trek through the Himalayas, a tranquil exploration of Assam\'s tea gardens, or a culturally immersive journey through tribal villages.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur offerings encompass a wide range of travel styles, including:\n\n*   **Adventure Treks:** Exploring challenging terrains in Assam and neighboring states, guided by experienced and certified mountaineers, focusing on safety and environmental responsibility.\n*   **Wildlife Safaris:** Providing access to renowned national parks and wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga and Manas, with expert naturalists and guides, emphasizing conservation and ethical wildlife viewing.\n*   **Cultural Tours:** Delving into the vibrant traditions, art forms, and culinary delights of Assam, connecting travelers with local artisans, musicians, and communities.\n*   **Tea Tourism:** Experiencing the allure of Assam\'s tea estates, from guided tours of tea gardens to tea-tasting sessions and luxurious stays in heritage bungalows.\n*   **River Cruises:** Discovering the Brahmaputra River\'s beauty, with options ranging from short scenic cruises to multi-day expeditions, combined with visits to riverside villages and historical sites.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Encamp Adventures apart is our commitment to providing immersive and responsible travel experiences. We partner with local guides, homestays, and businesses, ensuring that tourism benefits the communities we visit and minimizes our environmental impact. We are dedicated to promoting sustainable tourism practices that protect the region\'s natural and cultural heritage for future generations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Encamp Adventures, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the initial consultation to the completion of the trip, we strive to exceed expectations and create lasting memories. Our team is passionate about travel, knowledgeable about the region, and dedicated to providing personalized support throughout the entire journey. We prioritize clear communication, prompt responsiveness, and attention to detail, ensuring that every client feels valued and cared for.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe cultivate strong relationships with the local community by actively participating in local initiatives, supporting local businesses, and promoting cultural exchange. We believe that tourism should be a force for good, empowering local communities and preserving their unique traditions. We strive to create opportunities for meaningful interactions between travelers and local people, fostering mutual understanding and respect. Our Beltola Survey location allows us to be accessible and responsive to our local clientele, fostering a sense of trust and community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Encamp Adventures envisions becoming a leading tour and trekking operator in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to personalized service, sustainable tourism practices, and authentic travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our range of offerings to include more niche travel experiences, such as birdwatching tours, photography expeditions, and wellness retreats. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with international travel agencies to attract a wider audience of adventure travelers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily customize their trips, access travel information, and connect with our team. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff and local guides, ensuring that they are equipped with the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service and promote responsible tourism practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nUltimately, Encamp Adventures aspires to be more than just a tour company; we want to be a catalyst for positive change in the region, contributing to the sustainable development of local communities and the preservation of Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage. We invite you to join us on an unforgettable journey of discovery, exploration, and adventure.', 'Beltola Survey', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:15:39', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
