(1532, 'Indian Travel Agency', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Indian Travel Agency, strategically located on Rupali Path, stands as a cornerstone of the travel and tourism sector in Assam. More than just a travel agency, we are curators of experiences, dedicated to providing seamless and enriching journeys both within India and abroad. Rooted in the heart of Guwahati, we possess an intimate understanding of the local culture, travel preferences, and logistical nuances, enabling us to offer unparalleled service and personalized itineraries tailored to the specific needs of our diverse clientele. Our commitment to ethical practices, transparency, and unwavering customer satisfaction has established us as a trusted name in the industry, contributing significantly to the region\'s economic growth by facilitating tourism and supporting local businesses connected to the travel sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive suite of travel solutions, catering to both leisure and business travelers. We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages that showcase the breathtaking beauty and rich cultural heritage of Assam, Northeast India, and the wider Indian subcontinent. These packages range from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and cultural immersion tours in Majuli, the world\'s largest river island, to spiritual journeys to ancient temples and monasteries. Beyond domestic travel, we offer expertly curated international tours, providing access to global destinations with seamless flight bookings, visa assistance, and comfortable accommodations. A key differentiator is our ability to customize every aspect of the travel experience. Unlike generic tour operators, we prioritize understanding individual preferences and creating personalized itineraries that align perfectly with specific interests, budgets, and time constraints. We also provide specialized services such as corporate travel management, handling all aspects of business travel arrangements, including flights, hotels, transportation, and event planning. Our in-depth knowledge of local regulations and established relationships with airlines, hotels, and transport providers enable us to negotiate the best possible deals for our clients, ensuring cost-effectiveness without compromising on quality or comfort.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Indian Travel Agency, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe that travel is more than just reaching a destination; it\'s about the entire journey, from initial consultation to safe return. Our highly trained and dedicated team is committed to providing exceptional customer service at every touchpoint. We take pride in offering personalized attention, ensuring that each client feels valued and supported throughout their travel experience. What sets us apart is our deep understanding of the local community. We actively engage with local artisans, guides, and accommodation providers, ensuring that our tours benefit the local economy and provide authentic cultural experiences for our clients. We foster a culture of open communication and readily respond to inquiries and concerns, offering 24/7 support to address any unexpected situations that may arise during travel. Our commitment to building long-term relationships with our clients is evident in our high rate of repeat business and positive word-of-mouth referrals. We also actively participate in community events and initiatives, further solidifying our position as a responsible and engaged corporate citizen.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Indian Travel Agency is poised for continued growth and expansion. We envision becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for our commitment to innovation, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. We are actively exploring partnerships with new hotels, airlines, and tour operators to broaden our network and provide our clients with even more diverse and exciting travel options. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting responsible tourism practices that minimize our environmental impact and support local communities. We believe that by embracing innovation, prioritizing sustainability, and consistently exceeding customer expectations, we can achieve our long-term goals and contribute to the growth of the travel and tourism sector in Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Rupali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:35:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1533, 'S SQUARE TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'S SQUARE TRAVELS: Exploring Assam and Beyond from Number 18\n\nS SQUARE TRAVELS, strategically located at Number 18, is more than just a travel agency; it\'s a gateway to experiencing the rich tapestry of Assam and the world beyond. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, S SQUARE TRAVELS distinguishes itself through a commitment to personalized travel experiences, deep local knowledge, and a dedication to sustainable tourism practices. We aim to be the premier travel partner for both residents of Assam seeking adventures abroad and visitors eager to discover the hidden gems of Northeast India.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core service is crafting bespoke travel itineraries tailored to individual preferences and budgets. We specialize in arranging domestic tours within Assam and Northeast India, showcasing the region\'s breathtaking natural beauty, including Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and the rolling hills of Meghalaya. These tours encompass everything from wildlife safaris and river cruises to cultural immersion experiences and trekking adventures. Beyond the Northeast, we offer comprehensive international travel packages, catering to diverse interests such as leisure travel, adventure tourism, and business trips.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets S SQUARE TRAVELS apart is our unwavering commitment to creating unique and memorable experiences. We don\'t just book flights and hotels; we curate journeys. We pride ourselves on our in-depth knowledge of the region, allowing us to suggest off-the-beaten-path destinations and authentic cultural encounters that are often overlooked by larger, less specialized travel agencies. Our expertise extends to handling all aspects of travel, including visa assistance, travel insurance, and foreign exchange services, providing our clients with a seamless and stress-free travel planning process. Our carefully selected network of local guides, hotels, and transport providers ensures quality and reliability at every step of the journey. We also offer customized packages for corporate clients, including incentive trips and team-building activities.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of everything we do at S SQUARE TRAVELS. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we strive to provide personalized attention to each client. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, our team is dedicated to ensuring complete satisfaction. We foster a welcoming and supportive environment, where clients feel comfortable sharing their travel aspirations and receiving expert guidance. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and adapt to the evolving needs of our clientele.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur connection to the local community is paramount. We actively promote sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities and minimize environmental impact. We prioritize partnerships with local businesses, supporting their growth and contributing to the economic well-being of the region. We also participate in community initiatives, such as promoting responsible waste management and raising awareness about the importance of preserving Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage. This commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism not only enhances the travel experience for our clients but also helps to protect the environment and support the local communities we serve.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, S SQUARE TRAVELS envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our range of services to include specialized tours focusing on niche interests such as birdwatching, tea tourism, and tribal culture. We are also exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information. We aim to establish strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector, both locally and internationally, to broaden our reach and offer our clients an even wider range of travel options.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism industry in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices and empowering local communities. We believe that tourism can be a powerful force for positive change, and we are committed to playing our part in ensuring that it benefits both travelers and the destinations they visit. By focusing on quality, innovation, and sustainability, S SQUARE TRAVELS is poised to achieve continued growth and success, providing exceptional travel experiences for years to come.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nS SQUARE TRAVELS, located at Number 18, isn’t just a starting point; it is the beginning of your next great adventure.', '18', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:35:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1534, 'TRAVELORR', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>TRAVELORR, located at 7A1, 7th floor, Mainaak Towers, Beside Aayakar Bhawan, GS Rd, Guwahati, stands as a prominent travel solutions provider in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, TRAVELORR acts as a trusted partner, crafting seamless and enriching travel experiences for individuals, families, and businesses alike. Situated strategically in a bustling commercial area, TRAVELORR leverages its prime location and deep understanding of the local ecosystem to cater to the unique travel needs of the region. The company’s significance lies in its commitment to providing personalized service, coupled with a comprehensive suite of travel-related offerings, making it a go-to resource for both leisure and corporate travel within and beyond Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>TRAVELORR\'s core offerings encompass a broad spectrum of travel services designed to cater to diverse requirements. These include: meticulously planned holiday packages covering both domestic and international destinations, expert assistance with flight and accommodation bookings ensuring competitive pricing and optimal travel routes, customized corporate travel solutions tailored to streamline business travel logistics and manage budgets effectively, and comprehensive visa assistance services navigating the complexities of international travel regulations. A key differentiator for TRAVELORR is its focus on creating bespoke travel itineraries. Rather than offering generic, off-the-shelf packages, the company’s travel specialists work closely with clients to understand their specific preferences, interests, and budgetary constraints, crafting personalized journeys that exceed expectations. This personalized approach, combined with strong relationships with airlines, hotels, and local tour operators, allows TRAVELORR to offer unparalleled value and unique travel experiences. Furthermore, recognizing the burgeoning tourism sector in Assam and the Northeast, TRAVELORR actively promotes and facilitates travel within the region, showcasing its rich cultural heritage and natural beauty to both domestic and international tourists.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>TRAVELORR prioritizes a customer-centric approach, striving to deliver exceptional service at every touchpoint. The company distinguishes itself through its team of highly trained and knowledgeable travel consultants who possess a deep understanding of travel destinations, airline routes, and accommodation options. These consultants are dedicated to providing personalized guidance, offering expert advice, and proactively addressing any concerns or queries that customers may have. Moreover, TRAVELORR actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, sponsorships, and collaborations with other businesses. This commitment to community involvement strengthens its connection with local residents and reinforces its position as a trusted and reliable travel partner. The business cultivates trust by fostering open communication, ensuring transparency in pricing, and providing responsive support throughout the entire travel process, from initial consultation to post-trip follow-up.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, TRAVELORR envisions becoming the undisputed leader in the travel solutions market in Assam and the wider Northeast region. The company\'s growth strategy involves expanding its range of services to include specialized offerings such as adventure tourism packages, eco-tourism initiatives, and cultural immersion experiences. Furthermore, TRAVELORR plans to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including the development of a user-friendly online platform for booking flights, accommodations, and travel packages. The company is also committed to investing in the training and development of its employees to ensure that they remain at the forefront of industry knowledge and best practices. Long-term goals include establishing strategic partnerships with tourism boards and industry associations to promote sustainable tourism practices and contribute to the overall growth of the travel sector in the region. Ultimately, TRAVELORR aims to build a strong and sustainable business that not only provides exceptional travel services but also plays a positive role in the economic and social development of the local community. By focusing on innovation, customer satisfaction, and community engagement, TRAVELORR is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a leading travel solutions provider in the region.</p>', '7A1, 7th floor, Mainaak Towers, Beside Aayakar Bhawan, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:35:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1535, 'RR Travels Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'RR Travels Guwahati stands as a reliable and customer-focused travel agency situated near Jatiya faguna rabha high school path, dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences within Assam and beyond. Recognizing the unique needs and desires of the local community, RR Travels Guwahati strives to be more than just a booking service; it aims to be a trusted partner in crafting memorable journeys, both personal and professional. In a region rich with natural beauty and cultural heritage, RR Travels Guwahati plays a crucial role in connecting people to these experiences, while also facilitating travel for business and leisure to destinations across India. We differentiate ourselves through personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of RR Travels Guwahati\'s operations lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to diverse requirements. Our core offerings encompass:\n*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in creating tailor-made itineraries that showcase the best of Assam and Northeast India, including Kaziranga National Park, Shillong, Tawang, and more. These packages are designed to cater to individual preferences, budgets, and time constraints, incorporating authentic experiences and unique cultural immersions. We handle all aspects of the tour, from accommodation and transportation to sightseeing and activity arrangements.\n*   **Flight and Train Ticketing:** RR Travels Guwahati offers a seamless and efficient booking service for both domestic and international flights and train journeys. Our team is proficient in navigating complex ticketing systems and securing the best possible fares for our clients, ensuring a hassle-free booking experience. We also provide assistance with seat selection, baggage allowances, and other travel-related inquiries.\n*   **Hotel Bookings:** We maintain strong relationships with a wide network of hotels, resorts, and guesthouses throughout Assam and India. This allows us to offer a diverse range of accommodation options to suit varying budgets and preferences. Our expertise extends to securing competitive rates and ensuring that our clients enjoy comfortable and well-appointed stays.\n*   **Car Rental Services:** To facilitate independent exploration, RR Travels Guwahati offers a reliable car rental service with a fleet of well-maintained vehicles and experienced drivers. Whether it\'s for airport transfers, city tours, or multi-day excursions, we provide convenient and affordable transportation solutions. We prioritize safety and reliability, ensuring that our clients can travel with peace of mind.\n*   **Corporate Travel Solutions:** RR Travels Guwahati provides comprehensive travel management services for businesses of all sizes. We understand the unique needs of corporate travelers and offer efficient booking solutions, expense management tools, and personalized support to ensure smooth and cost-effective travel arrangements.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nRR Travels Guwahati places paramount importance on delivering exceptional customer experiences. We believe that travel is a personal journey, and we strive to create a supportive and attentive environment for our clients. Our team of dedicated travel consultants is readily available to assist with inquiries, provide expert advice, and tailor travel plans to individual needs. What sets us apart is our deep understanding of the local culture and travel landscape, allowing us to offer insightful recommendations and unique perspectives. We are committed to building lasting relationships with our customers, based on trust, transparency, and genuine care. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events, supporting local businesses, and promoting responsible tourism practices. We believe that travel should be a force for good, and we are committed to contributing to the sustainable development of the region. Feedback is actively sought and valued, allowing us to constantly improve our services and ensure that we are consistently exceeding customer expectations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, RR Travels Guwahati envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Guwahati and a trusted partner for travelers throughout Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include specialized travel packages, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. We are also exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, through the development of a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app. We plan to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and tourism stakeholders to create a more vibrant and sustainable tourism ecosystem. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to contribute to the economic growth and cultural preservation of Assam, while providing exceptional travel experiences that enrich the lives of our customers. We aim to become synonymous with quality, reliability, and personalized service in the travel industry, solidifying our position as the preferred choice for travelers seeking unforgettable journeys. We are committed to continuous improvement, innovation, and a unwavering focus on customer satisfaction.', 'Jatiya faguna rabha high school path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:40:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1536, 'Pushpak Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '```html\n<h1>Pushpak Travels: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond</h1>\n\nPushpak Travels stands as a trusted name in the Assam travel industry, offering a comprehensive suite of travel solutions designed to cater to both domestic and international travelers. More than just a travel agency, we are dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences, immersing our clients in the rich culture, breathtaking landscapes, and warm hospitality that Assam and the surrounding regions have to offer. We differentiate ourselves through our deep-rooted understanding of the local terrain, our commitment to personalized service, and our unwavering focus on ethical and sustainable tourism practices, making us a valuable contributor to the local business ecosystem.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core services encompass a wide range of travel needs, including meticulously planned tour packages, efficient flight and train ticketing, comfortable and reliable car rentals, and bespoke travel itineraries tailored to individual preferences. Our tour packages are designed to showcase the best of Assam, from the serene tea gardens of upper Assam to the majestic Brahmaputra River and the wildlife sanctuaries teeming with biodiversity. We offer both pre-designed and customizable tour options, catering to diverse interests such as cultural immersion, wildlife adventures, spiritual journeys, and adventurous treks. Furthermore, our strong relationships with local hotels and guesthouses ensure that our clients enjoy comfortable and authentic accommodation experiences. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to seamlessly blend modern convenience with authentic local experiences, allowing travelers to delve deep into the heart of Assam while enjoying the comfort and security they expect. Recognizing the growing demand for seamless travel solutions, we offer online booking facilities and 24/7 customer support, ensuring that our clients can access our services anytime, anywhere.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Pushpak Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful travel business. Our team of dedicated travel consultants possesses an in-depth knowledge of the region and a genuine passion for showcasing its beauty. We prioritize building lasting relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs and preferences, and going the extra mile to ensure their travel experiences are seamless and memorable. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the booking process; we provide ongoing support throughout the journey, ensuring that our clients feel safe, informed, and well-cared for. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by promoting locally owned businesses, supporting sustainable tourism initiatives, and participating in community events. This commitment to social responsibility not only strengthens our connection with the local community but also enhances the overall travel experience for our clients. We regularly gather feedback from our customers through surveys and online reviews, using their insights to continuously improve our services and exceed their expectations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Pushpak Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its unwavering commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to incorporate emerging destinations in Northeast India, diversifying our service offerings to include eco-tourism and adventure travel options, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are committed to investing in our team, providing them with ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure they remain at the forefront of the travel industry. We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations, fostering a collaborative ecosystem that benefits both our clients and the community. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to position Assam as a premier travel destination, attracting visitors from around the globe and contributing to the economic prosperity of the region while preserving its unique cultural heritage and natural beauty. We are actively exploring opportunities to integrate virtual reality tours into our services, allowing potential travelers to experience Assam firsthand before even booking their trip. This innovative approach will further enhance the customer experience and showcase the region\'s unique offerings to a global audience.\n```', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:40:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1537, 'LUIT TOURS & TRAVELS - Travel Agency, Tour Operator & Taxi Service', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'LUIT TOURS & TRAVELS - Travel Agency, Tour Operator & Taxi Service, strategically located at G1, ASTHA ENCLAVE, GS Rd, stands as a comprehensive travel solution provider in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, we are a dedicated partner committed to crafting seamless and memorable travel experiences for both domestic and international travelers. Our integrated approach, combining travel agency services, tour operations, and a reliable taxi service, positions us uniquely within the local business landscape, offering a one-stop shop for all travel-related needs. We understand the unique charm and diversity of Assam and the surrounding region, and we leverage this knowledge to curate exceptional travel itineraries that showcase the best of what this area has to offer.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs. As a full-fledged travel agency, we handle flight bookings (domestic and international), hotel reservations, visa assistance, and travel insurance. This simplifies the often-complex process of travel planning for our clients, allowing them to focus on enjoying their journey. Our unique selling point lies in our personalized approach; we don’t just book flights and hotels. We take the time to understand our clients\' preferences, budgets, and travel goals, tailoring our recommendations accordingly. This ensures that each trip is perfectly suited to the individual traveler. Furthermore, our experience navigating the intricacies of international travel regulations provides our clients with invaluable peace of mind.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond traditional travel agency services, we excel as tour operators, specializing in customized tour packages within Assam and the Northeast India region. From the serene beauty of Kaziranga National Park to the spiritual haven of Kamakhya Temple and the picturesque landscapes of Meghalaya, we offer a diverse range of tour options to cater to varying interests. These packages can be tailored to include specific activities, accommodations, and transportation needs, ensuring a hassle-free and enriching travel experience. We prioritize responsible tourism, working closely with local communities to promote sustainable practices and preserve the cultural heritage of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCompleting our integrated offering is our reliable taxi service. We maintain a fleet of well-maintained vehicles and employ experienced drivers who are familiar with the local routes. This service provides our clients with convenient and safe transportation options for airport transfers, city tours, and intercity travel. The combination of our travel agency, tour operation, and taxi service allows us to provide a complete travel solution, eliminating the need for our clients to coordinate with multiple providers. This streamlined approach saves time, reduces stress, and ensures a cohesive and enjoyable travel experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt LUIT TOURS & TRAVELS, exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment for all our clients. Our team is composed of knowledgeable and passionate travel professionals who are dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert guidance. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, and we go the extra mile to ensure their satisfaction. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services. Our commitment to customer satisfaction is evident in the positive testimonials we receive and the high rate of repeat business we enjoy.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, we are deeply rooted in the local community. We actively participate in local events and support initiatives that promote tourism and economic development in Assam. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us, and we are committed to being a responsible corporate citizen. Our understanding of local customs and traditions allows us to provide our clients with authentic and immersive cultural experiences. We work closely with local artisans, guides, and accommodations to ensure that our tours contribute to the economic well-being of the communities we visit.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, LUIT TOURS & TRAVELS envisions significant growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include expanding our tour offerings to encompass a wider range of destinations within India and Southeast Asia. We plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking process. We also aim to develop strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism industry to expand our reach and offer a wider range of services. We are committed to continuously improving our services and adapting to the evolving needs of the travel market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe see a significant opportunity to tap into the growing demand for sustainable and responsible tourism. We plan to develop new tour packages that focus on ecotourism, cultural immersion, and community-based tourism. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local communities. We believe that sustainable tourism is not only good for the environment and the local economy, but also provides a more enriching and authentic travel experience for our clients. LUIT TOURS & TRAVELS is dedicated to becoming the leading travel solution provider in Assam, known for our exceptional service, comprehensive offerings, and commitment to responsible tourism. We are confident that our unique approach, combined with our deep understanding of the local market, will enable us to achieve our ambitious goals.', 'G1, ASTHA ENCLAVE, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:40:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1538, 'Holidays91 - Travel Agency in Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Holidays91: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Journeys from Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at the 2nd Floor, Chakraborty Complex, GNB Rd, beside Fashion City, Holidays91 stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to curating exceptional travel experiences for both local residents and visitors exploring the enchanting landscapes of Assam and beyond. In a region rich with natural beauty and cultural heritage, Holidays91 fills a vital role by providing personalized travel solutions that cater to diverse interests and budgets. More than just a travel agency, we are journey architects, committed to turning travel dreams into tangible realities. We understand the nuances of travel in Northeast India and leverage this expertise to craft seamless and memorable adventures.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of Holidays91\'s offerings are a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to the multifaceted needs of modern travelers. These include:</p>\n<br> <br>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> Moving beyond generic itineraries, we specialize in creating tailor-made tour packages that reflect individual preferences, whether it’s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, trekking in Arunachal Pradesh, experiencing the wildlife of Kaziranga National Park, or immersing oneself in the vibrant culture of Meghalaya. Our expertise allows us to design journeys that are both enriching and logistically sound.</li>\n<li><b>Flight and Accommodation Booking:</b> We streamline the often-complex process of booking flights and accommodations, offering access to a wide range of options to suit different budgets and preferences. We work with reputable airlines and hotels to ensure comfort, safety, and value for money.</li>\n<li><b>Car Rentals and Transportation Services:</b> Navigating the diverse terrain of Northeast India requires reliable transportation. Holidays91 offers a range of car rental and transportation services, ensuring seamless travel between destinations. We prioritize safety and comfort, offering well-maintained vehicles and experienced drivers.</li>\n<li><b>Visa Assistance and Travel Insurance:</b> We understand that international travel can be daunting. Holidays91 provides comprehensive visa assistance and travel insurance services, simplifying the process and providing peace of mind.</li>\n<li><b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> We cater to the needs of businesses with specialized corporate travel solutions, including booking flights, accommodations, and transportation for employees, as well as organizing corporate events and conferences.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What truly sets Holidays91 apart is our deep understanding of the local market and our commitment to providing personalized service. We are not just selling travel; we are creating experiences. We understand that each traveler is unique, with distinct needs and aspirations. Our travel consultants take the time to listen to our clients, understand their preferences, and create itineraries that exceed their expectations. We pride ourselves on our attention to detail, ensuring that every aspect of the journey, from transportation to accommodation to activities, is meticulously planned and executed. Furthermore, our location in Guwahati allows us to leverage local knowledge and connections, providing access to unique experiences and insider tips that are not readily available to other travel agencies.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Holidays91. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients, and we strive to provide exceptional customer service at every touchpoint. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, we are dedicated to ensuring that our clients have a seamless and enjoyable travel experience. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services. Beyond providing excellent service, we are actively involved in the local community, participating in local events and supporting local businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Holidays91 envisions itself as the leading travel agency in Guwahati and a trusted partner for travelers across Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our range of services, developing new and innovative tour packages, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are committed to staying ahead of the curve in the ever-evolving travel industry. We plan to strengthen our online presence, making it easier for customers to research and book travel online. We are also exploring partnerships with local artisans and businesses to offer unique and authentic experiences to our clients. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to be synonymous with quality, reliability, and exceptional service in the travel industry, creating unforgettable journeys for generations to come. We aim to further establish ourselves as a vital contributor to the growth of tourism in Assam and the wider Northeast region.</p>', '2nd Floor, Chakraborty Complex, GNB Rd, beside Fashion City', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:40:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1539, 'Ezzy Tours & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Ezzy Tours & Travels, located at House No.- 02, RN Choudhury Path, is a premier travel and tourism company deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. We are dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences, showcasing the region\'s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and unparalleled hospitality. In a landscape often dominated by larger, national players, Ezzy Tours & Travels distinguishes itself through a localized approach, personalized service, and a genuine passion for promoting Assam as a leading tourist destination. Our commitment extends beyond simply booking trips; we aim to create unforgettable journeys that connect travelers with the soul of Assam, contributing to the sustainable growth of the local tourism sector. We operate with integrity, transparency, and a profound respect for the environment and the communities we engage with.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of travel-related offerings designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. We specialize in meticulously crafted tour packages that explore the diverse facets of Assam, from the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam to the wildlife sanctuaries teeming with rare and endangered species, including the iconic one-horned rhinoceros at Kaziranga National Park. We also offer customized tour itineraries, allowing clients to tailor their travel experiences to their specific interests and timelines. Our services extend to hotel bookings, flight and transportation arrangements (including car rentals with experienced local drivers), and assistance with permits and documentation. What sets Ezzy Tours & Travels apart is our deep understanding of the region and our ability to provide authentic, off-the-beaten-path experiences. We collaborate closely with local communities, promoting eco-tourism initiatives and ensuring that our tours benefit the local economy. We also provide specialized packages focusing on adventure tourism (river rafting, trekking), cultural immersion (visits to tribal villages, participation in local festivals), and spiritual journeys (exploring ancient temples and monasteries). By focusing on these specific areas, we directly address the growing demand for experiential and sustainable travel in Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Ezzy Tours & Travels, customer satisfaction is at the core of our business philosophy. We strive to provide exceptional customer service at every touchpoint, from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. Our dedicated team of travel consultants is comprised of knowledgeable and passionate individuals who possess a deep understanding of Assam\'s tourism landscape. We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients, taking the time to understand their individual needs and preferences. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, attention to detail, and ability to anticipate and address potential challenges proactively. Beyond providing excellent service, we actively engage with the local community. We participate in local tourism events, sponsor community initiatives, and collaborate with local artisans and businesses. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism practices further strengthens our connection with the community and enhances our reputation as a responsible and trustworthy travel partner. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. This dedication to customer-centricity has allowed us to build a loyal customer base and establish a strong reputation within the local community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Ezzy Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of services to cater to a wider audience, developing new and innovative tour packages that showcase the region\'s unique attractions, and strengthening our partnerships with local communities. We plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking processes, making it easier for customers to access our services. Furthermore, we aim to expand our team of travel consultants and provide them with ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they remain at the forefront of the industry. A key focus will be on promoting sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact, and supporting local communities through responsible tourism initiatives. We believe that by focusing on these strategic goals, Ezzy Tours & Travels can contribute to the sustainable growth of the tourism sector in Assam, while providing exceptional travel experiences that exceed our customers\' expectations.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>In addition to our core tour packages, we plan to develop niche travel experiences targeting specific interests, such as birdwatching tours, photography tours, and culinary tours. We also aim to leverage digital marketing channels to reach a wider audience, both domestically and internationally. By actively promoting Assam as a unique and attractive tourist destination, we hope to attract more visitors to the region and contribute to the economic development of local communities. Ultimately, Ezzy Tours & Travels strives to be more than just a travel company; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable tourism practices, preserving Assam\'s cultural heritage, and creating unforgettable experiences for our customers.</p>', 'House No.- 02, RN Choudhury Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:40:38', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1540, 'TRAVENTURE BUDDY', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>TRAVENTURE BUDDY is emerging as a key player in Assam\'s burgeoning tourism sector, offering meticulously curated travel experiences designed to connect visitors with the authentic beauty and rich cultural heritage of the region. Located in the heart of [Assume Guwahati], TRAVENTURE BUDDY isn\'t just another travel agency; it\'s a personalized gateway to exploring the hidden gems and iconic landmarks of Assam and the Northeast. The company distinguishes itself by focusing on sustainable tourism practices and fostering meaningful interactions between travelers and local communities, contributing to the economic empowerment of the region while minimizing environmental impact.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>TRAVENTURE BUDDY\'s core offerings center around customizable tour packages that cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. These include meticulously planned itineraries covering wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, spiritual journeys to the Kamakhya Temple, cultural immersion experiences in Majuli – the world\'s largest river island, and adventurous treks through the scenic hills of Meghalaya (often integrated due to proximity). Beyond the standard packages, TRAVENTURE BUDDY excels in creating bespoke travel plans, meticulously tailoring each journey to the specific preferences and desires of individual clients. This personalized approach extends to accommodation choices, transportation logistics, and activity selections, ensuring a truly unique and unforgettable experience. A significant differentiator lies in TRAVENTURE BUDDY\'s commitment to showcasing the local culture beyond typical tourist traps. This includes arranging homestays with local families, organizing interactions with artisans and craftspeople, and offering opportunities to participate in traditional festivals and celebrations. This not only provides travelers with an authentic glimpse into Assamese life but also directly benefits the local communities by generating income and preserving their cultural heritage.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At TRAVENTURE BUDDY, customer satisfaction is paramount. The company prides itself on providing exceptional service from the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up. Their team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants possesses in-depth knowledge of the region and are passionate about sharing its wonders with visitors. They go above and beyond to ensure that every aspect of the trip is meticulously planned and executed, addressing any concerns or queries promptly and efficiently. This dedication to customer care is reflected in the consistently positive feedback and repeat business TRAVENTURE BUDDY receives. The business actively connects with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, homestay providers, and transportation services. By prioritizing local resources, TRAVENTURE BUDDY contributes to the economic growth of the region and fosters a sense of community ownership in the tourism industry. They also participate in local events and initiatives, further strengthening their ties with the community and demonstrating their commitment to responsible and sustainable tourism. Regular workshops and training sessions are conducted for local guides and service providers, ensuring they are equipped with the necessary skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional experiences to travelers. This investment in local talent not only enhances the quality of service but also empowers individuals to participate in the tourism economy and preserve their cultural heritage.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, TRAVENTURE BUDDY envisions becoming the leading provider of authentic and sustainable travel experiences in Assam and the Northeast. Their future plans include expanding their range of tour packages to include more off-the-beaten-path destinations and niche interests, such as birdwatching tours, tea garden visits, and culinary experiences. A key focus is on leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly mobile app that provides travelers with real-time information, personalized recommendations, and seamless booking capabilities. TRAVENTURE BUDDY also aims to strengthen its partnerships with local communities and organizations to further promote sustainable tourism practices and empower local economies. This includes investing in community-based tourism initiatives, supporting local artisans and craftspeople, and promoting environmentally responsible travel practices. Long-term goals encompass establishing a strong brand presence, both regionally and nationally, and attracting a wider range of international visitors to Assam and the Northeast. By continuing to prioritize customer satisfaction, sustainable tourism, and community engagement, TRAVENTURE BUDDY is well-positioned to achieve its vision of becoming a catalyst for positive change in the region\'s tourism industry, showcasing the beauty and cultural richness of Assam while contributing to its sustainable development.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 12:45:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
