(1559, 'Luxvac Tours And Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Luxvac Tours And Travels, strategically located at House No 109, 2nd Floor, 2nd Building, Dr BK Kakati Rd, Guwahati, is a premier travel agency dedicated to curating exceptional travel experiences tailored to the discerning needs of local residents and visitors alike. Situated in a vibrant hub of Assam, Luxvac distinguishes itself by providing a comprehensive suite of travel solutions, underpinned by a commitment to personalized service and in-depth knowledge of the region\'s unique attractions and cultural nuances. Luxvac Tours And Travels strives to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be trusted travel partners, crafting unforgettable journeys that resonate with individual aspirations and leave lasting impressions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings encompass a diverse range of travel services designed to cater to a broad spectrum of travel preferences and budgets. These include meticulously planned domestic and international tour packages, focusing particularly on showcasing the natural beauty and cultural heritage of Assam and Northeast India. We offer customized itineraries that cater to diverse interests, from wildlife enthusiasts seeking to explore Kaziranga National Park to spiritual travelers wishing to visit the revered Kamakhya Temple. Furthermore, Luxvac provides comprehensive flight booking services, facilitating seamless travel arrangements for both leisure and business travelers. Hotel reservations are also a cornerstone of our services, with access to a wide network of accommodations ranging from budget-friendly options to luxurious resorts. Car rental services, complete with experienced drivers, are offered to ensure convenient and comfortable transportation throughout the region. Beyond these standard offerings, Luxvac specializes in niche tourism experiences such as tea tourism, heritage tours exploring the Ahom kingdom\'s historical sites, and adventure tourism encompassing trekking and river rafting in the Brahmaputra valley. What truly sets Luxvac apart is our intimate understanding of the local landscape, allowing us to curate authentic experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We pride ourselves on offering value-added services such as visa assistance and travel insurance, simplifying the entire travel planning process for our clients.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Luxvac Tours And Travels, customer experience is paramount. We believe in fostering long-term relationships with our clients based on trust, reliability, and a genuine dedication to exceeding expectations. Our team of experienced travel consultants is committed to providing personalized attention, taking the time to understand each client\'s unique needs and preferences. We proactively offer expert advice and guidance, ensuring that every aspect of the trip is meticulously planned and executed. What truly differentiates us is our emphasis on building a personal connection with the local community. We actively partner with local businesses and artisans, promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit the region and provide our clients with authentic cultural immersion. Feedback is actively solicited and diligently acted upon to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall customer journey. Furthermore, we maintain a strong online presence and utilize social media platforms to engage with our customers, share travel inspiration, and provide timely updates on travel advisories and exclusive deals. Our dedication to providing exceptional customer service has earned us a reputation as a trusted and reliable travel partner within the local community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Luxvac Tours And Travels envisions expanding its reach and becoming the leading travel agency in the region, recognized for its commitment to innovation, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include developing specialized tour packages catering to specific niche markets, such as eco-tourism and wellness travel. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, implementing online booking platforms and mobile applications to streamline the travel planning process. Further expansion into neighboring states of Northeast India is also planned, with the goal of offering a more comprehensive range of travel destinations and experiences. A key focus will be on promoting responsible tourism practices that minimize environmental impact and support local communities. We are committed to investing in our staff\'s professional development, ensuring that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry. Ultimately, Luxvac Tours And Travels aspires to be a catalyst for positive change in the tourism sector, promoting sustainable and ethical travel practices while contributing to the economic growth and cultural preservation of Assam and Northeast India.', 'House No 109, 2nd Floor, 2nd Building, Dr BK Kakati Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:00:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1560, 'Sudarshan Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Sudarshan Travels, located at House No. 1, Sugam Path, is a premier travel agency deeply rooted in the heart of Assam, dedicated to providing exceptional and personalized travel experiences. More than just a travel agency, Sudarshan Travels acts as a gateway to exploring the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Assam and beyond. We understand the unique needs and preferences of the local community, making us a trusted partner for both leisure and business travel.</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<p>At Sudarshan Travels, we distinguish ourselves by combining traditional Assamese hospitality with modern efficiency. We are committed to crafting unforgettable journeys that reflect the individual desires of our clients, fostering a sense of discovery and connection with the destinations they explore. Our local knowledge and established relationships within the travel industry allow us to offer competitive pricing and exclusive access to hidden gems often overlooked by larger, less personalized travel agencies. We pride ourselves on being a local business with a global perspective.</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive suite of travel solutions tailored to meet diverse needs. These include: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries that showcase the best of Assam, from the majestic Brahmaputra River cruises and wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to immersive cultural experiences in historic towns and tea gardens. We also offer customized packages for destinations across India and international locales.</li>\n<li><b>Flight and Accommodation Bookings:</b> Leveraging our extensive network of airline and hotel partners, we provide seamless and efficient flight and accommodation booking services, ensuring competitive rates and convenient travel arrangements.</li>\n<li><b>Car Rentals:</b> We offer a wide selection of vehicles to suit individual needs, from compact cars for city exploration to robust SUVs for navigating the rugged terrain of Assam’s countryside. Our car rental service comes with the option of experienced local drivers.</li>\n<li><b>Visa Assistance:</b> We provide expert guidance and support throughout the visa application process, simplifying complex requirements and ensuring a smooth and stress-free experience for our clients.</li>\n<li><b>Corporate Travel Management:</b> We offer tailored travel solutions for businesses, including flight and hotel bookings, ground transportation, and event planning, all managed with efficiency and cost-effectiveness.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<p>What sets Sudarshan Travels apart is our dedication to creating truly personalized experiences. We take the time to understand each client\'s interests, budget, and travel style, crafting itineraries that exceed expectations. Our experienced travel consultants are passionate about travel and possess in-depth knowledge of Assam and beyond. They provide expert advice, insightful recommendations, and unwavering support throughout the entire travel process, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience.</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Our commitment to responsible and sustainable tourism is also a key differentiator. We actively promote eco-friendly practices and support local communities, ensuring that our tours have a positive impact on the environment and the people who call Assam home. We partner with local businesses and artisans, providing our clients with authentic cultural experiences while contributing to the economic well-being of the region.</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We strive to build long-lasting relationships with our clients, providing exceptional service and personalized attention at every stage of their journey. From the initial consultation to the final return home, we are dedicated to ensuring a smooth, enjoyable, and memorable travel experience. We actively solicit feedback and continuously strive to improve our services to meet the evolving needs of our customers. Our location on Sugam Path allows for convenient access and personalized consultations.</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<p>We actively participate in local community events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to giving back to the region that has supported our growth. We believe in fostering strong relationships with local businesses and organizations, contributing to the vibrant and interconnected fabric of the Assam community. This commitment to community involvement strengthens our reputation as a trusted and responsible business.</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Sudarshan Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its exceptional service, personalized experiences, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours focusing on specific interests, such as wildlife photography, birdwatching, and yoga retreats. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours, flights, and accommodations. Furthermore, we intend to strengthen our partnerships with local communities, promoting responsible tourism practices and supporting the economic development of the region.</p>\n\n<br><br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Sudarshan Travels as a symbol of quality, reliability, and authentic travel experiences, not only in Assam but also across India and beyond. We are committed to continuous improvement, innovation, and a unwavering dedication to exceeding the expectations of our clients. By staying true to our core values of integrity, customer focus, and community involvement, we are confident in our ability to achieve our vision and contribute to the growth and prosperity of Assam\'s tourism industry.</p>', 'House no 1, Sugam Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:05:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1561, 'Meenakshi Tour N Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Meenakshi Tour N Travels stands as a dedicated and reliable travel agency committed to providing exceptional travel experiences, with a particular focus on showcasing the rich cultural heritage and natural beauty of Assam and Northeast India. Situated at the heart of [Insert Specific Locality in Assam, e.g., Guwahati, Dispur, Jorhat - Be as Specific as Possible Here. If you don\'t know, omit this entire first sentence and start with the second one], Meenakshi Tour N Travels offers a comprehensive suite of travel services tailored to both domestic and international travelers. In a region abundant with untapped tourism potential, Meenakshi Tour N Travels plays a vital role in connecting travelers with the authentic Assam experience, contributing to the growth of sustainable tourism and empowering local communities.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around creating personalized and memorable travel itineraries. We provide a wide array of services designed to cater to diverse travel needs, including: meticulously planned tour packages covering Assam\'s renowned tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries (such as Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park), sacred pilgrimage sites, and vibrant cultural hubs; seamless hotel booking services through established partnerships with a range of accommodations, from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts; reliable transportation services, including car rentals and airport transfers, ensuring comfortable and safe journeys; expertly guided tours led by knowledgeable local guides fluent in multiple languages, providing insightful commentary and enriching the travel experience; and specialized travel arrangements for specific interests such as adventure tourism (river rafting, trekking), eco-tourism (bird watching, nature walks), and cultural immersion programs (traditional Assamese cooking classes, visits to local craft villages). What truly distinguishes Meenakshi Tour N Travels is our commitment to crafting bespoke itineraries that perfectly match individual preferences, budgets, and time constraints. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we strive to deliver personalized solutions that exceed expectations. Moreover, we prioritize ethical and responsible tourism practices, ensuring that our tours benefit local communities and minimize environmental impact.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Meenakshi Tour N Travels, we firmly believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered around building lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and genuine care. We go the extra mile to ensure that every aspect of the travel experience is seamless and stress-free, from the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up. Our team of dedicated travel consultants are readily available to provide expert advice, address concerns promptly, and offer personalized recommendations. We actively seek customer feedback to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet evolving needs. We are also deeply rooted in the local community, actively participating in local events and collaborating with local businesses to promote the region\'s unique offerings. This strong community connection enables us to provide our customers with authentic and immersive experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We source local guides, support local artisans, and promote locally owned businesses, ensuring that our tours contribute to the economic well-being of the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Meenakshi Tour N Travels envisions becoming a leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its exceptional customer service, sustainable tourism practices, and innovative travel solutions. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to encompass emerging travel trends such as wellness tourism and experiential travel. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing user-friendly online platforms and mobile applications that provide seamless booking and travel management capabilities. We also plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate in the tourism value chain and share their unique cultural heritage with the world. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver world-class travel experiences. We will also focus on promoting Assam and Northeast India as a premier travel destination through targeted marketing campaigns and collaborations with tourism boards and industry partners. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable growth of the tourism sector in the region, creating economic opportunities for local communities while preserving the environment and cultural heritage for future generations.', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:05:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1562, 'Horizon Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Horizon Travels: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam and Beyond\n\nNestled in the heart of Guwahati, at 1ST FLOOR, NO. 234-A, Bye Lane Number 8, near RAJGARH, Horizon Travels is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences tailored to the unique needs and desires of the local community and visitors alike. More than just a travel agency, Horizon Travels serves as a bridge, connecting individuals and families to the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Assam and the wider world. Our commitment to personalized service, deep understanding of the local landscape, and dedication to creating unforgettable journeys distinguishes us as a vital part of the Assam business ecosystem. We aim to not only facilitate travel but to inspire exploration, foster cultural exchange, and create lasting memories for our clients.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Horizon Travels\' offerings lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to diverse travel needs. We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages throughout Assam and Northeast India, showcasing the region\'s stunning biodiversity, ancient temples, vibrant festivals, and unique tribal cultures. These packages range from serene tea garden retreats and wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to adventurous treks in the hills of Meghalaya and immersive cultural experiences in the tribal villages of Nagaland. Understanding the needs of the local market, we also offer pilgrimage tours to revered sites across India, meticulously planned and executed for a seamless and spiritually enriching experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond regional tourism, Horizon Travels provides a full range of domestic and international travel services. We offer flight bookings with competitive fares, hotel reservations at a variety of properties ranging from budget-friendly accommodations to luxury resorts, visa assistance, and travel insurance. Recognizing the growing demand for hassle-free travel, we also facilitate corporate travel arrangements, including conference bookings, group travel logistics, and customized itineraries designed to meet specific business objectives. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to combine global travel expertise with an intimate understanding of the local context, ensuring that every trip is meticulously planned, flawlessly executed, and personally enriching.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of the Horizon Travels philosophy. We believe that travel planning should be a collaborative process, and our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to providing personalized attention to each client. We take the time to understand individual preferences, budget constraints, and travel aspirations, tailoring our services to create the perfect itinerary. Our commitment extends beyond the booking process. We provide ongoing support throughout the journey, offering assistance with travel arrangements, visa applications, and any unexpected challenges that may arise.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nHorizon Travels actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, partnerships with local businesses, and promotion of sustainable tourism practices. We believe in supporting the local economy and preserving the natural and cultural heritage of Assam. By sourcing local guides, utilizing locally owned accommodations, and promoting responsible tourism, we contribute to the sustainable development of the region. This commitment to the community extends to our corporate social responsibility initiatives, which focus on supporting local education and environmental conservation efforts.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Horizon Travels envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a leading travel provider in Assam and Northeast India. Our future plans include developing specialized tour packages catering to niche interests such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness tourism. We are also investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including online booking platforms and mobile applications that provide real-time travel updates and personalized recommendations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe aim to establish strategic partnerships with international tour operators to attract a wider range of international visitors to Assam, showcasing the region\'s unique attractions to a global audience. Furthermore, we are committed to continuously training and developing our team of travel consultants, ensuring that they possess the knowledge, skills, and dedication to provide exceptional service. Our long-term goal is to become synonymous with exceptional travel experiences, contributing to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam while upholding our commitment to sustainability, community engagement, and customer satisfaction. Horizon Travels strives to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a trusted partner, guiding our clients on unforgettable journeys and helping them discover the wonders of Assam and the world.', '1ST FLOOR, NO. 234-A, Bye Lane Number 8, near RAJGARH', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:05:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1563, 'Asian Holidays & Expeditions', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Asian Holidays & Expeditions, located at House No 10, Amrabati Path, GS Rd, is a dedicated travel company specializing in crafting authentic and enriching travel experiences across Assam and wider Northeast India, with a particular focus on showcasing the diverse cultures and breathtaking landscapes of Asia. More than just a travel agency, Asian Holidays & Expeditions acts as a bridge, connecting travelers with the heart and soul of the region, offering carefully curated itineraries and bespoke travel solutions for both domestic and international visitors. In a region known for its rich biodiversity and unexplored beauty, Asian Holidays & Expeditions stands out by prioritizing sustainable tourism practices and fostering meaningful connections between travelers and local communities. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings encompass a wide range of travel services designed to cater to diverse interests and preferences. We specialize in customized tour packages that showcase the unique aspects of Assam, from its lush tea gardens and majestic Brahmaputra River to its vibrant festivals and ancient temples. These packages can be tailored to individual needs, accommodating varying budgets, durations, and activity levels. Birdwatching tours, adventure treks in the Himalayas, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, and cultural immersion experiences with local tribes are just a few examples of the experiences we facilitate. Beyond Assam, we extend our expertise to crafting memorable journeys across Northeast India, including Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura. We also offer meticulously planned expeditions to other Asian destinations, focusing on culturally rich locations and hidden gems. Hotel bookings, transportation arrangements (including car rentals and local transport), visa assistance, and travel insurance are all integral parts of our service, ensuring a seamless and hassle-free travel experience. Our unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to responsible tourism, which ensures that our operations benefit the local communities we work with and minimize our environmental impact. We actively promote eco-friendly accommodations, support local artisans, and encourage travelers to respect the cultural sensitivities of the region. By focusing on sustainable practices and authentic experiences, Asian Holidays & Expeditions meets the growing demand for ethical and immersive travel options in the local market and beyond.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Asian Holidays & Expeditions, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. Our team of experienced travel consultants is passionate about creating personalized travel experiences that exceed expectations. We take the time to understand each client\'s individual needs and preferences, providing expert advice and guidance every step of the way. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, we are dedicated to ensuring a smooth, enjoyable, and memorable journey. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the booking process. We maintain regular communication with our clients throughout their trip, providing support and assistance as needed. We also actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our customers. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, community organizations, and tourism initiatives. By supporting local entrepreneurs and promoting sustainable tourism practices, we contribute to the economic development and cultural preservation of the region. We also participate in local events and festivals, showcasing the beauty and diversity of Assam and fostering a sense of community pride.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Asian Holidays & Expeditions envisions itself as a leading travel company in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism and its ability to create authentic and transformative travel experiences. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to include more specialized themes, such as culinary tours, wellness retreats, and photography expeditions. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking process, making it easier for customers to plan and book their trips. A key long-term goal is to establish a training program for local youth, providing them with the skills and knowledge necessary to pursue careers in the tourism industry. This initiative will not only contribute to the economic empowerment of local communities but also ensure that the future of tourism in the region is sustainable and responsible. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and community engagement, Asian Holidays & Expeditions is poised to play a significant role in shaping the future of tourism in Northeast India and beyond.</p>', 'House No 10, Amrabati Path, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:05:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1564, 'Krishnaguru Tours & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Krishnaguru Tours & Travels, situated on Rodali Path, is a premier travel and tourism company deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, we are curators of experiences, connecting travelers with the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and spiritual essence that Assam and Northeast India offer. In a region brimming with untapped potential for tourism, Krishnaguru Tours & Travels stands out as a reliable and passionate partner for both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and immersive journeys. We pride ourselves on our local expertise, personalized service, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices, contributing to the growth of the local economy and preservation of our natural and cultural heritage.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, including meticulously planned tour packages, efficient transportation solutions, and comfortable accommodation arrangements. We offer a diverse range of tour packages, catering to varied interests and budgets. These range from spiritual journeys to the Krishnaguru Sewashram, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, cultural explorations of Majuli Island, and adventure treks in the Himalayan foothills. Beyond pre-designed packages, we excel in creating bespoke travel itineraries, tailoring each trip to the individual preferences and requirements of our clients. Our transportation services ensure seamless travel across the region, with a fleet of well-maintained vehicles and experienced drivers familiar with the local terrain. Furthermore, we partner with a network of reputable hotels, guesthouses, and homestays to provide comfortable and authentic accommodation options, ranging from budget-friendly to luxury experiences. A key differentiator for Krishnaguru Tours & Travels is our focus on responsible and sustainable tourism. We strive to minimize our environmental impact and maximize the benefits to local communities by supporting local businesses and promoting eco-friendly practices.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Krishnaguru Tours & Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service from the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey. Our team of dedicated travel consultants are passionate about Assam and possess in-depth knowledge of the region. They are adept at understanding individual travel needs and crafting personalized itineraries that exceed expectations. We are committed to providing prompt and efficient communication, addressing any queries or concerns with utmost attention. Our on-the-ground support ensures a smooth and hassle-free travel experience. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings. Beyond customer service, we are deeply connected with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local artisans and promoting cultural preservation. We believe that tourism should be a force for good, contributing to the economic empowerment of local communities and the preservation of Assam\'s unique cultural identity.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Krishnaguru Tours & Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours focused on niche interests, such as birdwatching, tea tourism, and tribal culture immersion. We are also exploring opportunities to develop eco-friendly accommodations in remote areas, promoting sustainable tourism and creating employment opportunities for local communities. Technological innovation is also a key focus, with plans to develop a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse and book tours, customize itineraries, and access travel information. We are committed to investing in the training and development of our staff, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam, showcasing the region\'s unique beauty and cultural heritage to the world while preserving it for future generations.</p>', 'Rodali Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:05:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1565, 'Voyage Tours and Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Voyage Tours and Travels, strategically located on Daljan Path, near N R Housing Complex in Assam, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing unparalleled travel experiences tailored to the diverse needs and desires of its clientele. Recognizing the rich tapestry of Assam\'s landscapes, cultures, and traditions, Voyage Tours and Travels aims to be more than just a travel provider; it strives to be a gateway to unforgettable journeys, fostering deeper connections with the region\'s unique offerings. In a local business landscape increasingly focused on personalized experiences, Voyage Tours and Travels stands out by combining local expertise with a global perspective, catering to both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and enriching adventures. <br> <br>\n\nOur core business revolves around crafting bespoke travel itineraries, handling comprehensive travel logistics, and providing exceptional customer service from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up.  We offer a broad spectrum of services, including: personalized tour packages focusing on Assam\'s tea gardens, wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, cultural heritage sites, and adventure tourism activities like river rafting and trekking; efficient flight and railway ticketing services for domestic and international travel; comfortable and reliable car rental services tailored to various group sizes and travel requirements; hotel and resort booking services, ensuring access to the best accommodations at competitive rates; and expert visa assistance and travel insurance services, providing peace of mind throughout the journey. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to creating highly customized travel experiences. We delve deep into understanding our clients\' individual preferences, interests, and budgets to design itineraries that perfectly match their needs. This personalized approach extends beyond simply booking flights and hotels; it involves curating unique experiences, recommending hidden gems, and providing insider tips to ensure each journey is truly unforgettable. Our services directly address the needs of the local market by offering accessible and affordable travel options for residents looking to explore their own region, as well as providing expertly guided tours for international visitors seeking an authentic glimpse into Assam\'s captivating beauty and culture. <br> <br>\n\nAt Voyage Tours and Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is centered on building genuine relationships with our clients, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations at every touchpoint. Our team of dedicated and knowledgeable travel consultants are passionate about Assam and are committed to providing personalized attention and expert advice.  We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, our attention to detail, and our ability to handle any unexpected situations that may arise during travel. We go above and beyond to ensure that our clients feel supported and cared for throughout their entire journey. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond providing travel services. We actively participate in local events, support local businesses, and promote sustainable tourism practices that benefit the environment and local communities. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us and are committed to being a responsible and ethical business partner. Our strategic location on Daljan Path allows for easy accessibility for local residents, and we actively engage with the N R Housing Complex community through special offers and partnerships. <br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Voyage Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to include niche travel experiences such as culinary tours, wellness retreats, and community-based tourism initiatives; developing strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote Assam as a premier tourist destination; leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience and streamline operations, including a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app; and investing in employee training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry. We plan to grow our market reach beyond Assam, targeting travelers from across India and around the world who are seeking authentic and enriching travel experiences. By continually adapting to the evolving needs of the market and remaining true to our core values, we are confident that Voyage Tours and Travels will continue to thrive and make a significant contribution to the tourism industry in Assam and beyond.\n</p>', 'Daljan Path, near N R Housing Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:10:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1566, 'Assam Tours and travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Assam Tours and Travels, strategically located in Goshala, near Water Tank, stands as a premier travel and tourism company dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the Northeast. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of authentic experiences, committed to providing seamless and memorable journeys for every traveler, whether they are seeking adventure in the Brahmaputra valley, tranquility in the tea gardens, or cultural immersion in the vibrant local communities.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Assam Tours and Travels distinguishes itself in the local business landscape through its deep understanding of the region and its commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism. We work closely with local communities, promoting their traditions and supporting their economic growth. This commitment not only enriches the traveler\'s experience but also contributes to the preservation of Assam\'s unique cultural heritage and natural environment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around crafting personalized travel itineraries that cater to a wide range of interests and budgets. These include:</p>\n\n*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in designing bespoke tour packages tailored to individual preferences, focusing on various themes such as wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, tea tourism in the lush estates of Upper Assam, cultural tours exploring the Ahom kingdom and tribal traditions, and adventure tours encompassing trekking, river rafting, and paragliding.<br>\n*   **Hotel Bookings:** Leveraging our extensive network of partner hotels and guesthouses across Assam and the Northeast, we offer a diverse range of accommodation options, from budget-friendly stays to luxurious resorts, ensuring comfort and convenience for our clients.<br>\n*   **Transportation Services:** We provide reliable and comfortable transportation services, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours in well-maintained vehicles, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free travel experience.<br>\n*   **Guided Tours:** Our knowledgeable and experienced local guides provide insightful commentary and personalized attention, enriching the traveler\'s understanding of Assam\'s history, culture, and natural environment.<br>\n*   **Specialized Experiences:** We curate unique and immersive experiences, such as tea tasting sessions, traditional Assamese cooking classes, visits to local artisan villages, and cultural performances, offering travelers a deeper connection with the region.<br>\n*   **Pilgrimage Tours:** We organize well managed pilgrimage tours to sacred sites in Assam like Kamakhya Temple and Hajo, catering to spiritual tourists.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Assam Tours and Travels apart is our unwavering commitment to authenticity and personalized service. We go beyond the typical tourist experience, striving to connect travelers with the heart and soul of Assam. Our itineraries are carefully designed to showcase the region\'s hidden gems and cultural nuances, offering a truly immersive and unforgettable travel experience. Furthermore, our dedication to responsible tourism ensures that our operations benefit local communities and minimize our environmental impact.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Assam Tours and Travels, we believe that customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is built on responsiveness, attentiveness, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. From the initial inquiry to the final departure, our dedicated team is available to provide support and guidance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We also foster strong relationships with local businesses and communities, creating a network of support that enhances the overall travel experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We connect with the local community through various initiatives, including supporting local artisans by promoting their products in our tour packages, employing local guides and drivers, and partnering with community-based tourism projects. We also actively participate in local events and festivals, showcasing Assam\'s rich cultural heritage to a wider audience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Assam Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism company in Assam and the Northeast, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include:</p>\n\n*   **Expanding our reach:** We aim to broaden our network of partner hotels and service providers across the region, offering a wider range of options for our clients.<br>\n*   **Developing new tour packages:** We are continuously exploring new destinations and experiences, developing innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends and interests.<br>\n*   **Investing in technology:** We plan to leverage technology to enhance our online presence, streamline our operations, and improve the customer experience.<br>\n*   **Strengthening our commitment to sustainability:** We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact and supporting responsible tourism practices across the region.<br>\n*   **Promoting Assam Tourism Globally:** Intend to bring more global clients, therefore promoting Assam at a global level.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of Assam\'s tourism industry, creating economic opportunities for local communities and preserving the region\'s unique cultural heritage and natural environment for future generations. Assam Tours and Travels is dedicated to being a catalyst for positive change, promoting responsible tourism that benefits both travelers and the communities they visit. We are confident that our passion for Assam, combined with our commitment to excellence, will enable us to achieve our vision and solidify our position as a leader in the region\'s tourism sector.</p>', 'Goshala, near Water Tank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:10:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1567, 'BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS, strategically located on the 2nd Floor, Nazib Complex, GS Rd, near Prag News, and opposite Woodland Restaurant, stands as a prominent and reliable provider of travel and tourism solutions within the vibrant Assam business landscape. More than just a travel agency, BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS acts as a facilitator of experiences, connecting individuals and groups with the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty that Assam and the wider Northeast India region offer. The company distinguishes itself by its deep-rooted understanding of the local terrain, culture, and logistical challenges, ensuring seamless and memorable travel experiences for its clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS offers a comprehensive suite of services tailored to meet the diverse needs of modern travelers. At its core, the business provides meticulously planned tour packages covering popular destinations within Assam and neighboring states like Meghalaya, Arunachal Pradesh, and Nagaland. These packages range from short weekend getaways focusing on wildlife sanctuaries like Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park, to extended cultural immersions exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam and the tribal villages of the hills. Beyond pre-packaged tours, BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS excels in creating bespoke itineraries designed to individual preferences, budgets, and time constraints. This personalized approach sets it apart, appealing to discerning travelers seeking unique and authentic experiences. <br> <br> Furthermore, the company offers essential travel services including flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations across a wide spectrum of accommodations (from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts), and car rentals with experienced drivers familiar with the region\'s roads. The unique selling proposition lies in the combination of local expertise, personalized service, and a commitment to sustainable tourism practices. By partnering with local communities and promoting eco-friendly initiatives, BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS contributes to the preservation of Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage. The services directly address the growing demand for organized and reliable travel solutions in a region where logistical complexities can often deter independent travelers.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS. The business fosters a welcoming and supportive environment, prioritizing clear communication, prompt responses to inquiries, and proactive problem-solving. Trained travel consultants are available to guide customers through every stage of the journey, from initial planning to on-the-ground support. The company’s approach to customer service is built on building long-term relationships rather than transactional interactions. This is achieved through attentive listening, personalized recommendations, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. <br> <br> BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with artisans and cultural organizations, and promotion of local businesses within its tour packages. This community engagement not only enhances the authenticity of the travel experiences offered but also contributes to the economic empowerment of local communities. Word-of-mouth referrals are a significant source of business, testament to the positive experiences shared by satisfied customers and the company\'s reputation for integrity and reliability.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision of BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS is to become the leading travel and tourism provider in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Expansion plans include diversifying its tour offerings to cater to niche markets such as adventure tourism (trekking, river rafting), wellness tourism (yoga retreats, Ayurvedic treatments), and educational tourism (study tours focused on local culture and history). The company also aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience through online booking platforms, mobile applications, and virtual reality tours that showcase the region\'s attractions. <br> <br> Long-term goals involve establishing strategic partnerships with international tour operators to attract a wider range of tourists from around the globe, further contributing to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam and the Northeast. BHARGAB TOUR & TRAVELS recognizes the importance of responsible tourism and is committed to implementing sustainable practices throughout its operations, ensuring that its business activities benefit both the environment and the local communities it serves. The strategic location near Prag News and opposite Woodland Restaurant provides excellent visibility and accessibility, laying a strong foundation for continued growth and success.</p>', '2nd Floor, Nazib Complex, GS Rd, near Prag News, opposite Woodland Restaurant', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:10:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
