(1577, 'TRIP NORTHEAST', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>TRIP NORTHEAST, located at 12, Samannay Path, is a premier travel and tour operator deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. We specialize in curating authentic and immersive experiences across the Northeast Indian states, showcasing the region\'s unparalleled natural beauty, rich cultural heritage, and vibrant traditions. Unlike generic travel agencies, TRIP NORTHEAST is built on a foundation of local expertise and a passion for responsible tourism, making us a trusted partner for both domestic and international travelers seeking an unforgettable adventure. Our commitment extends beyond simply organizing trips; we aim to connect visitors with the soul of the Northeast, fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation for its unique identity and contributing positively to the local communities we serve.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of our offerings are meticulously crafted tour packages designed to cater to a diverse range of interests and preferences. From exploring the lush tea gardens of Assam and witnessing the majestic Brahmaputra River to trekking through the breathtaking hills of Meghalaya and discovering the ancient tribal cultures of Nagaland, Arunachal Pradesh, Manipur, and Mizoram, we offer an unparalleled variety of itineraries. Our services include customized tour planning, transportation arrangements (including private car rentals and helicopter charters where feasible), comfortable accommodation bookings (ranging from luxury hotels to eco-friendly homestays), expert local guides fluent in multiple languages, and permits/documentation assistance. Beyond pre-packaged tours, we excel in creating bespoke travel experiences tailored to individual needs, whether it\'s a birdwatching expedition, a cultural immersion program, or an adventure-filled exploration of remote landscapes. What sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to showcasing the authentic Northeast, moving beyond typical tourist traps to provide genuine interactions with local communities, supporting sustainable tourism practices, and ensuring the preservation of the region\'s cultural and environmental heritage. We understand the specific needs of the local market, particularly the growing demand for intra-Northeast travel and tailored family vacations, and our services are designed to address these specific requirements.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at TRIP NORTHEAST. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, providing personalized attention from the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey. Our dedicated team of travel consultants is available around the clock to answer questions, provide expert advice, and address any concerns that may arise. We prioritize clear and transparent communication, ensuring that our customers are fully informed about their itinerary, costs, and any potential challenges. Furthermore, we actively solicit feedback from our clients after each trip, using their insights to continuously improve our services and refine our offerings. What truly distinguishes TRIP NORTHEAST is our deep connection to the local community. We actively partner with local artisans, homestay owners, and community-based organizations to ensure that our tours benefit the local economy and promote sustainable tourism practices. We believe in empowering local communities and showcasing their unique skills and traditions to the world. We participate in local tourism fairs and events, sponsor community initiatives, and actively promote the Northeast region as a premier travel destination, fostering a sense of pride and belonging within the local community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, TRIP NORTHEAST envisions becoming the leading travel and tour operator in the Northeast, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We plan to expand our network of partners, forge strategic alliances with other tourism stakeholders, and invest in cutting-edge technology to enhance our service delivery. Our future plans include developing new and innovative tour packages that showcase the lesser-known destinations of the Northeast, promoting eco-tourism initiatives, and empowering local communities to participate in the tourism industry. We aim to create a comprehensive online platform that provides travelers with easy access to information, booking services, and personalized travel advice. We also plan to establish a training academy to develop the skills and knowledge of local tourism professionals, ensuring that the Northeast tourism industry is equipped to meet the challenges and opportunities of the future. Our long-term goal is to position the Northeast as a globally recognized travel destination, attracting visitors from all corners of the world and contributing to the sustainable economic development of the region while preserving its unique cultural and environmental heritage.</p>\n</body>\n</html>', '12, Samannay Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:20:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1578, 'APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Assamese Experiences\n\nLocated at 13/C, W.W COLONY, APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS stands as a premier travel agency committed to providing exceptional travel experiences within Assam and beyond. We pride ourselves on offering personalized, reliable, and cost-effective travel solutions catering to a diverse clientele, from individual explorers to large corporate groups. Understanding the unique cultural and geographical landscape of Assam, we aim to connect travelers with the heart of Northeast India, showcasing its hidden gems and unparalleled beauty. APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS isn\'t just a travel agency; it\'s a facilitator of memories, a bridge between cultures, and a champion of sustainable tourism in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core services encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions designed to meet the evolving needs of the modern traveler. We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages tailored to individual interests, whether it\'s exploring the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam, embarking on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, or immersing oneself in the vibrant cultural tapestry of Guwahati. Our offerings include:\n\n*   **Customized Tour Packages:** Tailored itineraries designed around individual preferences, budget, and time constraints. We offer a range of thematic tours, including adventure tourism, cultural immersion, wildlife exploration, and pilgrimage circuits.\n*   **Hotel and Accommodation Bookings:** Access to a wide network of hotels, guesthouses, and homestays across Assam, ensuring comfortable and convenient lodging options for all travelers. We meticulously select accommodations based on quality, location, and guest reviews.\n*   **Flight and Transportation Arrangements:** Seamless booking of domestic and international flights, as well as reliable transportation services within Assam. We offer a variety of options, including private car rentals, bus charters, and river cruises.\n*   **Corporate Travel Solutions:** Comprehensive travel management services for businesses, including group bookings, conference arrangements, and incentive travel programs. We understand the unique needs of corporate clients and strive to provide efficient and cost-effective solutions.\n*   **Visa Assistance:** Guidance and support with visa applications for international travel, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free process for our clients.\n\nWhat truly sets APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS apart is our in-depth knowledge of the Assamese landscape and our commitment to sustainable tourism practices. We actively promote eco-friendly travel options and partner with local communities to support responsible tourism initiatives. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to curate authentic experiences that go beyond typical tourist traps, allowing travelers to connect with the local culture and environment on a deeper level. We understand the needs of the local market, offering packages that cater to regional festivals, cultural events, and specific interest groups.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS, customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and exceptional service. Our dedicated team of travel experts is available 24/7 to assist with any queries or concerns, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience. We proactively seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and tailor our offerings to meet their evolving needs. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events and sponsorship of cultural initiatives. We strive to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be a trusted partner and a valuable resource for anyone exploring the wonders of Assam. Our connection with the local community allows us to provide authentic insights and insider tips that enhance the travel experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, APEX TOURS AND TRAVELS envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional service, innovative tour packages, and commitment to sustainable tourism. Our future plans include expanding our reach to new markets, developing niche tourism products, and leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We aim to establish strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote tourism development in the region. We are actively exploring opportunities to incorporate augmented reality (AR) and virtual reality (VR) technologies to provide immersive previews of our destinations. We also plan to invest in employee training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable growth of the Assamese tourism sector while creating unforgettable travel experiences for our clients. We are committed to preserving the natural beauty and cultural heritage of Assam for future generations.', '13/C, W.W COLONY', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:20:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1579, 'North East Seven Sisters - North East Travel Agency | Tour operator in North East | Best Travel Agency in Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>North East Seven Sisters: Your Gateway to Unforgettable North East India Experiences</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, North East Seven Sisters – North East Travel Agency | Tour Operator in North East | Best Travel Agency in Guwahati, is a premier travel agency and tour operator dedicated to curating exceptional and authentic travel experiences throughout the captivating landscapes of Northeast India. We are more than just a travel agency; we are passionate storytellers, weaving together the rich tapestry of culture, nature, and adventure that defines this unique region. Recognizing the growing interest in sustainable and immersive travel, we strive to provide personalized itineraries that showcase the unparalleled beauty and diverse heritage of Assam and its sister states. Our commitment to responsible tourism contributes to the local economy and preserves the delicate ecosystems of the region, making us a significant player in the Assam business landscape, promoting not only tourism but also sustainable development.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At North East Seven Sisters, we offer a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a wide range of preferences and budgets. Our core offerings include expertly crafted tour packages, ranging from wildlife expeditions in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park to cultural immersions in the tea gardens of Assam and the monasteries of Arunachal Pradesh. We specialize in tailor-made itineraries, meticulously designed to meet the specific needs and interests of each client, whether it’s a solo traveler seeking adventure, a couple looking for a romantic getaway, or a family planning a memorable vacation. In addition to tour packages, we provide reliable transportation services, including airport transfers and comfortable vehicle rentals. We also offer hotel booking assistance, ensuring our clients have access to the best accommodations available, from luxurious resorts to charming homestays that offer an authentic taste of local life. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the region and our unwavering commitment to providing unparalleled customer service. We leverage our extensive network of local partners and guides to offer exclusive experiences that are not readily available to independent travelers. This includes arranging private tours of tea estates, organizing traditional Assamese cooking classes, and facilitating encounters with local artisans and craftspeople. By focusing on authentic and sustainable experiences, we meet the growing demand for responsible tourism that benefits both travelers and the local communities we serve.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Exceptional customer service is at the heart of everything we do at North East Seven Sisters. We believe that travel should be a seamless and stress-free experience, and we go above and beyond to ensure that our clients feel supported and taken care of every step of the way. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our dedicated team of travel experts is available to provide personalized assistance and expert advice. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, attention to detail, and ability to anticipate and address our clients\' needs. What truly sets us apart is our genuine passion for sharing the beauty and culture of Northeast India with the world. We are not just selling tours; we are building relationships and creating memories that will last a lifetime. We actively participate in local tourism events and initiatives, supporting local businesses and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We also strive to connect with the local community by employing local guides and drivers, thereby contributing to the economic empowerment of the region. By fostering strong relationships with local stakeholders, we ensure that our tours are not only enriching for our clients but also beneficial for the communities we visit.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, North East Seven Sisters envisions becoming the leading tour operator in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to sustainable tourism, exceptional customer service, and authentic travel experiences. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of tour packages to encompass new and emerging destinations within the region, such as Meghalaya\'s living root bridges and Nagaland\'s vibrant tribal cultures. We plan to invest in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking processes, making it easier for travelers from around the world to discover and book their dream trip to Northeast India. We are also committed to further developing our relationships with local communities, supporting initiatives that promote economic development and cultural preservation. By fostering a culture of innovation and continuous improvement, we aim to remain at the forefront of the tourism industry in Northeast India, offering unique and unforgettable experiences that showcase the unparalleled beauty and diversity of this captivating region. Our vision is to not just grow as a business, but to contribute meaningfully to the sustainable development and cultural preservation of the North East, ensuring that its beauty and traditions are enjoyed by generations to come.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:20:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1580, 'Happy Journey tours and travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Happy Journey Tours and Travels: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Experiences in Assam and Beyond\n\nNestled in the heart of Guwahati, at 3rd FLOOR, MEERA TOWER, KRC Rd, above MOMOWALA, near PAY FAIR, Happy Journey Tours and Travels is more than just a travel agency; it\'s a curator of unforgettable experiences. We are a dedicated team of travel enthusiasts passionate about showcasing the beauty and diversity of Assam and extending our reach to popular destinations across India and beyond. In a region brimming with natural wonders and cultural richness, Happy Journey stands out by offering personalized and meticulously planned travel solutions, catering to the diverse needs of our clientele. We strive to be a leading player in the Assam tourism sector, known for our commitment to quality, customer satisfaction, and sustainable tourism practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings revolve around providing comprehensive travel solutions, designed to make every journey a happy one. These include expertly crafted tour packages for Assam, focusing on wildlife tourism in Kaziranga National Park, cultural immersions in Majuli Island, and serene explorations of the tea gardens of Upper Assam. Beyond Assam, we offer customized itineraries for popular Indian destinations like Rajasthan, Kerala, and Himachal Pradesh, as well as international destinations tailored to individual preferences. We handle all aspects of travel, from flight and train bookings to hotel reservations, transportation arrangements, and guided tours.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Happy Journey apart is our dedication to personalization. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we take the time to understand their specific interests, budget, and travel style. Unlike generic tour operators, we offer flexible itineraries that can be tailored to meet individual needs. Moreover, we prioritize utilizing local resources and expertise, ensuring that our tours benefit the local communities and promote sustainable tourism practices. Our close relationships with local hotels, transportation providers, and guides allow us to offer competitive pricing without compromising on quality. We are committed to providing authentic and immersive experiences that go beyond the typical tourist traps, allowing travelers to connect with the local culture and environment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer satisfaction is at the heart of our business philosophy. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, we strive to provide exceptional service at every touchpoint. Our knowledgeable and friendly travel consultants are always available to answer questions, provide advice, and assist with any travel-related needs. We believe in building long-term relationships with our customers, and we go the extra mile to ensure their travel experiences exceed expectations. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services. Furthermore, being located near PAY FAIR, MOMOWALA, makes us easily accessible for local residents, fostering a sense of community and trust. We actively participate in local events and initiatives to promote tourism and support the local economy. We aim to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a trusted partner in creating memorable journeys.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Happy Journey Tours and Travels envisions becoming a leading travel provider in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. We plan to expand our range of services to include specialized tours focusing on adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and educational travel. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and entrepreneurs to showcase the unique products and crafts of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nTechnological advancement is also a key part of our future strategy. We are investing in a user-friendly online platform that will allow customers to easily browse our tour packages, customize their itineraries, and book their travel arrangements online. We also intend to leverage social media to reach a wider audience and promote the beauty of Assam to the world. We are committed to responsible and sustainable tourism practices, and we will continue to work with local communities to minimize our environmental impact and maximize the benefits of tourism for local residents. Our long-term goal is to create a thriving tourism industry that benefits both travelers and the local community, while preserving the natural and cultural heritage of Assam for generations to come. Happy Journey Tours and Travels is not just planning trips; we are building bridges to unforgettable experiences and contributing to a brighter future for tourism in Assam and beyond.', '3rd FLOOR, MEERA TOWER, KRC Rd, above MOMOWALA, near PAY FAIR', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:25:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1581, 'Green Horn Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Green Horn Travels, located at Barman Enclave, 2, Hengrabari Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a burgeoning travel agency dedicated to providing unique and enriching travel experiences, with a particular focus on showcasing the natural beauty and cultural heritage of Assam and Northeast India. In a region rapidly embracing tourism, Green Horn Travels distinguishes itself by offering personalized service, sustainable travel practices, and a deep commitment to promoting local communities. The agency fills a crucial gap in the market by catering to travelers seeking authentic and responsible tourism experiences, moving beyond conventional sightseeing to offer immersive and meaningful journeys.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Green Horn Travels offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to diverse needs and interests. These services include: meticulously crafted tour packages throughout Assam and Northeast India, focusing on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga and Manas National Parks, cultural tours exploring the traditions of various indigenous communities, adventure tourism including trekking and river rafting, and pilgrimage tours to significant religious sites. Additionally, the agency provides personalized itinerary planning to meet individual customer preferences, ensuring a bespoke travel experience. A key differentiator lies in the agency\'s commitment to eco-tourism. Green Horn Travels actively promotes sustainable practices by partnering with eco-friendly accommodations, supporting local artisans, and minimizing environmental impact. The agency also prioritizes employing local guides and drivers, thereby directly contributing to the economic empowerment of communities in the region. This focus on sustainability resonates strongly with the growing segment of travelers seeking responsible and ethical travel options. Moreover, Green Horn Travels distinguishes itself by offering specialized tours focusing on Assam\'s rich tea heritage, allowing visitors to experience the journey from tea leaf to cup firsthand. These tours contribute significantly to highlighting a key aspect of the region’s identity and economy.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is at the heart of Green Horn Travels\' operations. The agency strives to build lasting relationships with its clients by providing exceptional service at every stage of the travel process. From the initial consultation to the final departure, customers receive personalized attention and dedicated support. Green Horn Travels prides itself on its responsiveness, flexibility, and ability to address individual needs and concerns promptly. To further enhance the customer experience, the agency has implemented a robust feedback mechanism, allowing them to continuously improve their services and offerings. Green Horn Travels actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. They partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and support community development projects. They regularly participate in local festivals and events, fostering a sense of connection and belonging. The agency also supports local artisans by showcasing their products in their office and promoting them to tourists, contributing to the preservation of traditional crafts. By embedding itself within the local community, Green Horn Travels gains invaluable insights into the needs and preferences of both residents and visitors, allowing them to tailor their services and create truly authentic and memorable travel experiences.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Green Horn Travels envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Northeast India. The agency plans to expand its service offerings to include more niche tourism products, such as birdwatching tours, photography expeditions, and culinary experiences showcasing Assamese cuisine. They also aim to strengthen their partnerships with local communities and businesses, creating a more integrated and sustainable tourism ecosystem. A key focus for the future is leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. Green Horn Travels intends to develop a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse and book tours, access travel information, and connect with the agency\'s team. They also plan to utilize social media and digital marketing to reach a wider audience and promote their unique offerings. Green Horn Travels also intends to invest in training and development programs for its staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and promote sustainable tourism practices. The agency believes that by continuously innovating and adapting to the changing needs of the market, they can achieve their long-term goals and contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism industry in Northeast India. Their ultimate aim is to not only provide unforgettable travel experiences but also to empower local communities, protect the environment, and showcase the rich cultural heritage of the region to the world.</p>', 'Barman Enclave, 2, Hengrabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:25:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1582, 'DD TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>DD TRAVELS: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam and Beyond, Located on Lokhra Rd</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>DD TRAVELS, strategically situated on Lokhra Rd, stands as a trusted and comprehensive travel solution provider, deeply rooted in the heart of Assam. More than just a travel agency, DD TRAVELS serves as a bridge, connecting individuals and businesses to unforgettable experiences, seamless travel arrangements, and dependable transportation solutions. Recognizing the unique tapestry of the Assamese landscape – from its lush tea gardens and the majestic Brahmaputra River to its vibrant culture and spiritual sanctuaries – DD TRAVELS caters specifically to the needs of both local residents seeking outbound adventures and travelers eager to explore the wonders of the Northeast. In a region characterized by its rich biodiversity and burgeoning tourism sector, DD TRAVELS has carved a niche by offering personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a commitment to sustainable and responsible travel practices.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of DD TRAVELS’ service offerings are meticulously designed tour packages, encompassing both domestic and international destinations. For those seeking adventure within India, packages range from exploring the Himalayas to discovering the historical sites of Rajasthan. For international travelers, options extend to popular destinations in Southeast Asia, Europe, and beyond. Beyond pre-packaged tours, DD TRAVELS excels in crafting bespoke travel itineraries, meticulously tailored to individual preferences, budget constraints, and time considerations. This personalized approach distinguishes DD TRAVELS from its competitors, ensuring that each client receives a travel experience that aligns perfectly with their specific desires. Furthermore, DD TRAVELS provides a full suite of travel-related services, including flight booking (domestic and international), hotel reservations (ranging from budget-friendly options to luxury accommodations), visa assistance, travel insurance, and transportation services (car rentals, airport transfers, and bus ticketing). The commitment to providing a complete travel solution under one roof makes DD TRAVELS a convenient and reliable choice for its clientele. A key differentiator lies in DD TRAVELS’ specialization in tours showcasing the unique cultural and ecological heritage of Assam and the Northeast. These tours are designed to promote responsible tourism, support local communities, and educate travelers about the region\'s rich traditions and environmental significance. By emphasizing authenticity and sustainability, DD TRAVELS contributes to the long-term well-being of the region and provides travelers with enriching and meaningful experiences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>DD TRAVELS places paramount importance on delivering exceptional customer service, recognizing that positive word-of-mouth referrals are crucial for success in the local market. The team at DD TRAVELS is composed of experienced and knowledgeable travel professionals who possess a deep understanding of the travel industry and a genuine passion for helping clients realize their travel dreams. From the initial consultation to the completion of the trip, clients receive personalized attention and dedicated support. DD TRAVELS understands the importance of clear and transparent communication, ensuring that clients are fully informed about their travel arrangements and any potential issues that may arise. A proactive approach to problem-solving and a commitment to resolving client concerns promptly and efficiently are hallmarks of DD TRAVELS’ customer service philosophy. The company actively seeks feedback from its clients to continuously improve its services and refine its offerings. Furthermore, DD TRAVELS actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, sponsorship of community initiatives, and collaborations with local businesses. This commitment to community involvement fosters goodwill and strengthens DD TRAVELS’ reputation as a responsible and trusted member of the Lokhra Rd business landscape. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and actively engaging with the community, DD TRAVELS has cultivated a loyal customer base and established itself as a reliable travel partner.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, DD TRAVELS envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, driven by a commitment to innovation, customer satisfaction, and responsible tourism practices. The company plans to enhance its online presence through the development of a user-friendly website and the strategic use of social media marketing to reach a wider audience. Further investments in technology will enable DD TRAVELS to streamline its operations, improve efficiency, and provide clients with a more seamless booking experience. DD TRAVELS intends to expand its network of partnerships with hotels, airlines, and tour operators to offer an even wider range of travel options and competitive pricing. A key area of focus will be on developing new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, ecotourism, and wellness travel. In line with its commitment to responsible tourism, DD TRAVELS plans to strengthen its partnerships with local communities to promote sustainable tourism practices and empower local businesses. This includes offering tours that support local artisans, promote traditional crafts, and provide employment opportunities for local residents. Ultimately, DD TRAVELS aims to become the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to responsible tourism practices. By staying true to its core values and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, DD TRAVELS is well-positioned to achieve its long-term goals and contribute to the growth and prosperity of the local tourism sector.</p>', 'Lokhra Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:25:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1583, 'Northeast Gateway Tour & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Northeast Gateway Tour & Travels, situated on Lachit Barphukan Path in the heart of Assam, is a premier travel agency dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Northeast India. More than just a travel provider, Northeast Gateway acts as a cultural ambassador, connecting travelers with authentic experiences and fostering sustainable tourism practices within the region. The agency recognizes the unique appeal of Northeast India, often overlooked by mainstream tourism, and strives to make it accessible and enjoyable for visitors from all walks of life. Our local expertise and dedication to responsible tourism differentiate us, making us a vital contributor to the burgeoning Assam business landscape and a trusted partner for travelers seeking authentic Northeast Indian adventures. Northeast Gateway understands that travel is not just about seeing places, but about experiencing cultures, connecting with people, and creating lasting memories. This philosophy is at the core of everything we do.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>Our core service revolves around crafting bespoke travel itineraries throughout the eight states of Northeast India: Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Manipur, Meghalaya, Mizoram, Nagaland, Sikkim, and Tripura. We offer a diverse portfolio of travel experiences, ranging from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park to cultural immersion tours exploring the ancient temples of Assam and the vibrant tribal cultures of Nagaland and Manipur. Treks through the stunning landscapes of Meghalaya, including the famed living root bridges, are also a popular offering. For those seeking spiritual journeys, we organize visits to significant pilgrimage sites and monasteries across the region. Northeast Gateway goes beyond standard package tours. We specialize in customizing itineraries to perfectly match the interests, preferences, and budgets of our clients. This personalized approach, coupled with our in-depth knowledge of the region, is a key differentiator. We also provide essential travel services like flight and train ticketing, hotel booking, transportation arrangements, and permit assistance, ensuring a seamless and hassle-free travel experience. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to responsible and sustainable tourism. We partner with local communities and businesses to ensure that tourism benefits the local economy and minimizes its environmental impact. We promote eco-friendly accommodations, support local artisans, and encourage cultural exchange that respects and preserves the traditions of the Northeast. We recognize that our success is intrinsically linked to the well-being of the communities we serve. Our services address the specific needs of the local market by providing accessible and reliable travel solutions for both domestic and international tourists. We offer specialized packages for schools and colleges, corporate groups, and families, making Northeast India a viable and attractive travel destination for all.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Northeast Gateway Tour & Travels. We believe that exceptional service begins with genuine care and attention to detail. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our team is dedicated to providing personalized assistance and ensuring complete customer satisfaction. We strive to build lasting relationships with our clients, treating them not just as customers but as valued guests. Our multilingual team is well-versed in the local languages and customs, enabling us to effectively communicate with and cater to the diverse needs of our clientele. We proactively address any concerns or issues that may arise during the travel process, ensuring a smooth and stress-free experience. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively participate in local events, support local initiatives, and promote cultural awareness. We regularly organize workshops and training programs for local guides and hospitality professionals, enhancing their skills and knowledge. We also collaborate with local artisans and craftspeople, showcasing their products and promoting their livelihoods. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we are able to provide our clients with authentic and enriching experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We gather regular feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We are committed to providing a consistently high level of service and exceeding customer expectations.\n</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n<p>Northeast Gateway Tour & Travels envisions a future where Northeast India is recognized as a premier travel destination, renowned for its natural beauty, cultural diversity, and sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goal is to become the leading travel agency in the region, setting the standard for quality, innovation, and responsible tourism. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized tours focused on specific themes, such as birdwatching, adventure sports, and wellness retreats. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own eco-friendly accommodations and resorts, providing our clients with unique and sustainable lodging options. We intend to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly mobile app and online platform that provides access to real-time travel information, booking services, and interactive maps. We will also invest in digital marketing and social media to reach a wider audience and promote Northeast India as a must-visit destination. Furthermore, we are committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities and businesses, providing them with greater opportunities to participate in the tourism sector. We will continue to support local initiatives that promote sustainable development, cultural preservation, and environmental protection. We believe that by working together, we can create a thriving tourism industry that benefits both visitors and residents alike. Ultimately, Northeast Gateway aims to be more than just a travel agency. We aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, empowering local communities, preserving cultural heritage, and promoting sustainable tourism practices that will ensure a bright future for Northeast India.\n</p>', 'Lachit Barphukan Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:25:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1584, 'Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Northeast Magical Escapes Adventures and Tours offers curated travel experiences designed to unveil the hidden beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the wider Northeast India. Situated at the heart of [Omitted Specific Location for privacy], we are more than just a tour operator; we are storytellers, weaving unforgettable journeys that connect travelers with the soul of this enchanting region. We distinguish ourselves through a deep commitment to sustainable tourism, fostering genuine connections with local communities and preserving the natural environment for future generations. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, Northeast Magical Escapes stands out as a beacon of responsible and authentic travel, offering a unique alternative to mass tourism.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core services center around meticulously crafted itineraries that cater to a diverse range of interests and preferences. From thrilling wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, home to the majestic one-horned rhinoceros, to serene tea garden tours showcasing Assam\'s rich tea heritage, we offer experiences that are both captivating and educational. For adventure seekers, we organize treks through the lush hills of Meghalaya, exploring living root bridges and cascading waterfalls. Culture enthusiasts can immerse themselves in the vibrant traditions of the Bodo, Mising, and other indigenous communities through homestay experiences and cultural performances. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to personalize each journey, tailoring itineraries to individual needs and ensuring an intimate and immersive experience. We also offer specialized tours focusing on specific themes, such as birdwatching, photography, or spiritual retreats. These services directly address the growing demand for authentic and responsible travel experiences in the region, providing travelers with a meaningful alternative to conventional tourist packages.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Northeast Magical Escapes, we understand that exceptional customer service is paramount. We go beyond simply arranging transportation and accommodation; we strive to create genuine connections with our guests, anticipating their needs and exceeding their expectations. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our dedicated team of travel experts is committed to providing personalized attention and unwavering support. We employ local guides who possess in-depth knowledge of the region\'s history, culture, and ecology, enriching the travel experience with insightful commentary and authentic perspectives. To foster a strong connection with the local community, we actively partner with local businesses and organizations, ensuring that tourism benefits the region\'s economy and supports sustainable development. We also prioritize responsible waste management and promote ethical interactions with wildlife, minimizing our environmental impact and preserving the natural beauty of Assam for generations to come. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism practices differentiates us from other tour operators and resonates deeply with environmentally conscious travelers.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Northeast Magical Escapes envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour offerings to encompass more remote and unexplored regions of the Northeast, further diversifying our cultural immersion programs, and strengthening our partnerships with local communities. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, providing online booking platforms, virtual reality tours, and interactive travel guides. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in training and development programs for our staff and local guides, ensuring that they possess the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and promote responsible tourism practices. We recognize the immense potential for growth in the tourism sector in Northeast India, and we are confident that Northeast Magical Escapes is well-positioned to capitalize on this opportunity while contributing to the sustainable development of the region.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:25:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1585, 'MaarinTravels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'MaarinTravels, nestled in the heart of Assam, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing bespoke travel experiences that capture the essence of Northeast India and beyond. Situated in [Address in Assam, be specific - e.g., G.S. Road, Guwahati, Assam], MaarinTravels stands out in the local business landscape by focusing on personalized itineraries, sustainable tourism practices, and deep connections with local communities. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys, committed to showcasing the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant traditions that make Assam and the Northeast a truly unique destination.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur commitment to responsible travel sets us apart. We believe in minimizing our environmental impact and maximizing the positive contributions to the communities we visit. This is reflected in our partnerships with local artisans, homestays, and eco-lodges, ensuring that tourism benefits the region directly. Furthermore, our intimate knowledge of the local terrain and culture allows us to offer experiences that are authentic, immersive, and deeply enriching. We strive to connect travelers with the soul of Assam, leaving them with lasting memories and a profound appreciation for the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nMaarinTravels offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse clientele, from solo adventurers to large families and corporate groups. Our core services include:\n\n<br> <br>\n\n* **Customized Itinerary Planning:** We specialize in crafting personalized itineraries that cater to individual preferences, interests, and budgets. Whether it\'s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, trekking through the rainforests of Arunachal Pradesh, or experiencing the vibrant festivals of Nagaland, we tailor each journey to ensure a unique and unforgettable experience. Our expert travel consultants work closely with clients to understand their needs and create itineraries that exceed their expectations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n* **Guided Tours:** Our experienced and knowledgeable guides are passionate about sharing the wonders of Northeast India. They provide insightful commentary, facilitate meaningful interactions with local communities, and ensure a safe and enjoyable travel experience. We offer a variety of guided tours, ranging from cultural immersion experiences to wildlife safaris and adventure treks.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n* **Accommodation Booking:** We partner with a wide range of accommodations, from luxurious hotels to charming homestays and eco-lodges, to provide our clients with comfortable and authentic lodging options. We carefully select our partner properties based on their quality, service, and commitment to sustainability.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n* **Transportation Arrangements:** We handle all transportation logistics, including airport transfers, car rentals, and train and flight bookings, to ensure a seamless and stress-free travel experience. We prioritize safety and reliability, working with reputable transportation providers to guarantee comfortable and efficient travel.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n* **Permit Assistance:** Navigating the permit requirements for travel in Northeast India can be complex. We provide expert assistance with obtaining the necessary permits, ensuring that our clients can travel legally and without hassle.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur unique selling points lie in our dedication to personalized service, our in-depth knowledge of the region, and our commitment to responsible tourism. We understand the nuances of the local market and strive to exceed the expectations of our clients by providing exceptional value and unparalleled experiences. We cater to the growing demand for authentic and sustainable travel options, appealing to travelers who seek meaningful connections with the destinations they visit.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt MaarinTravels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional customer service at every stage of the travel journey. Our dedicated team is available to answer questions, provide support, and address any concerns that may arise. We go above and beyond to ensure that our clients feel valued and cared for.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, businesses, and organizations. We participate in local events, support community initiatives, and promote sustainable tourism practices. We believe in giving back to the community and contributing to the economic development of the region. We strive to be a responsible corporate citizen and a positive force in the local business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, MaarinTravels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to personalized service, sustainable tourism practices, and deep connections with local communities. We plan to expand our service offerings, develop new and innovative tour packages, and further strengthen our partnerships with local stakeholders. We are exploring opportunities to incorporate technology into our operations to enhance the customer experience and streamline our processes. Our long-term goal is to promote Northeast India as a premier tourist destination while preserving its natural beauty and cultural heritage for future generations. We aim to foster a sustainable tourism ecosystem that benefits both travelers and the local communities. We are committed to continuous improvement and innovation, ensuring that we remain at the forefront of the travel industry in Northeast India.', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:30:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
