(1586, 'WTF Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>WTF Travels: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam and Beyond</p>\n\n<p>Nestled conveniently on Beltola-Basistha Road, near KFC, WTF Travels is rapidly establishing itself as a premier travel agency within the dynamic Assam business ecosystem. More than just a booking service, WTF Travels strives to be a trusted partner for both local residents seeking getaways and visitors eager to experience the rich cultural heritage and breathtaking landscapes of Northeast India. Understanding the nuances of the local travel market, WTF Travels differentiates itself through personalized service, expertly curated tour packages, and a deep commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism. We aim to be the first thought when considering travel, whether it’s a weekend escape within Assam or an international adventure.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of WTF Travels lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse range of needs and preferences. Our core offerings include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries that delve into the hidden gems of Assam and the wider Northeast, moving beyond standard tourist trails. These packages are meticulously designed to suit individual interests, budgets, and time constraints. Whether it\'s exploring the tea gardens of Upper Assam, trekking through the verdant hills of Meghalaya, or experiencing the vibrant culture of Arunachal Pradesh, we ensure an unforgettable journey.</li>\n    <li><b>Domestic and International Flight Bookings:</b> Leveraging our strong relationships with airlines, we provide seamless flight booking services, securing competitive fares for both domestic and international destinations. Our experienced agents are adept at navigating complex booking procedures, ensuring a hassle-free experience for our clients.</li>\n    <li><b>Hotel and Accommodation Reservations:</b> We have established partnerships with a wide network of hotels, resorts, and guesthouses, ranging from budget-friendly options to luxurious retreats. This allows us to offer diverse accommodation choices that meet the specific needs and preferences of our customers. We personally vet many establishments to ensure quality and comfort.</li>\n    <li><b>Car Rentals and Transportation:</b> Understanding the importance of comfortable and reliable transportation, we offer a comprehensive car rental service, providing access to a diverse fleet of vehicles. Our drivers are experienced, knowledgeable about local routes, and committed to providing safe and efficient transportation.</li>\n    <li><b>Visa Assistance and Travel Insurance:</b> To ensure a seamless travel experience, we provide expert assistance with visa applications and offer a range of travel insurance options, protecting our clients against unforeseen circumstances.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>What truly sets WTF Travels apart is our unwavering focus on personalized service. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we take the time to listen to their needs and preferences. Our team of experienced travel consultants is passionate about creating tailor-made itineraries that exceed expectations. Moreover, we are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices, ensuring that our tours benefit local communities and minimize environmental impact. Our unique selling point is the personalized attention and local expertise that larger, online travel agencies simply cannot replicate. We speak the local language, understand the local culture, and know the best hidden spots to make your trip truly special.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at WTF Travels. We strive to create a welcoming and friendly environment where customers feel valued and appreciated. Our customer service approach is built on the principles of empathy, responsiveness, and proactivity. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our services. We also understand the importance of building strong relationships with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting local businesses and organizations. We believe that by giving back to the community, we can contribute to its growth and prosperity. Furthermore, we use social media platforms to engage with our customers, share travel tips and inspiration, and promote local tourism. Our physical location, near the busy KFC on Beltola-Basistha Road, provides easy accessibility and visibility, making it convenient for customers to visit us in person. We also foster customer loyalty through repeat business incentives and personalized travel planning for returning clients.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, WTF Travels envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. Our long-term goal is to become the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for our commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainability. We plan to expand our service offerings to include specialized adventure tours, wellness retreats, and cultural immersion experiences. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance our online presence and provide a seamless booking experience for our customers. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that allows customers to easily browse our tour packages, book flights and hotels, and access travel information. We also plan to forge strategic partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector, such as hotels, restaurants, and transportation providers, to create a comprehensive and integrated travel ecosystem. Moreover, we are committed to investing in the training and development of our employees, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service. Ultimately, WTF Travels aspires to not just facilitate travel, but to curate transformative experiences that enrich lives and foster a deeper appreciation for the world around us.</p>', 'Beltola - Basistha Rd, near KFC', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:30:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1587, 'Guwahati Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Guwahati Travels: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond</p>\n\n<p>Guwahati Travels, strategically located on Lokhra Rd, opposite Subham Garden, is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences throughout Assam, Northeast India, and beyond. More than just a booking service, we are passionate travel architects, crafting personalized journeys that resonate with the unique spirit and diverse landscapes of the region. As a locally rooted business, we possess an unparalleled understanding of Assam\'s hidden gems and logistical nuances, setting us apart within the dynamic Assam business environment. We strive to be the trusted partner for both leisure and business travelers seeking seamless and enriching travel solutions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core service offering encompasses a comprehensive range of travel solutions designed to cater to a diverse clientele. These include:</p>\n\n<p><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages tailored to individual preferences and budgets. Whether it\'s exploring the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam, embarking on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, discovering the spiritual heartland of Majuli Island, or trekking through the scenic hills of Meghalaya, we meticulously design itineraries that capture the essence of each destination. Our packages encompass accommodation, transportation, guided tours, and authentic cultural experiences.</p>\n\n<p><b>Hotel Bookings:</b> We maintain strong relationships with a wide network of hotels, resorts, and guesthouses, ranging from budget-friendly options to luxurious accommodations. This allows us to secure the best possible rates and ensure a comfortable and convenient stay for our clients.</p>\n\n<p><b>Flight and Train Ticketing:</b> We provide efficient and reliable flight and train ticketing services, assisting customers with booking domestic and international flights, as well as train journeys across India. Our experienced team navigates complex schedules and fares to find the most suitable travel arrangements.</p>\n\n<p><b>Car Rentals and Transportation:</b> We offer a diverse fleet of well-maintained vehicles for rent, ranging from compact cars to spacious SUVs and tempo travelers. Our experienced and courteous drivers ensure safe and comfortable transportation for individuals and groups.</p>\n\n<p><b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> We provide comprehensive travel management services for businesses, including corporate event planning, group travel arrangements, and customized itineraries for business trips. Our dedicated corporate travel team is committed to delivering cost-effective and efficient travel solutions that meet the specific needs of our corporate clients.</p>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition lies in our deep local expertise, personalized service, and commitment to sustainable tourism. We prioritize ethical and responsible travel practices, supporting local communities and preserving the natural environment. Unlike large, impersonal online travel agencies, we offer a human touch, providing personalized recommendations and attentive support throughout the entire travel journey.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Guwahati Travels, customer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do. We are committed to providing exceptional customer service that exceeds expectations. Our approach is characterized by:</p>\n\n<p><b>Personalized Attention:</b> We take the time to understand each customer\'s individual needs and preferences, crafting travel itineraries that are tailored to their specific requirements.</p>\n\n<p><b>Responsive Communication:</b> We are readily available to answer questions, provide assistance, and address any concerns that may arise. Our dedicated customer support team is available via phone, email, and in-person at our Lokhra Rd office.</p>\n\n<p><b>Seamless Booking Process:</b> We strive to make the booking process as simple and convenient as possible, offering online booking options and personalized assistance from our experienced travel consultants.</p>\n\n<p><b>Building Relationships:</b> We believe in building long-term relationships with our customers, fostering loyalty and trust. We actively engage with the local community, participating in local events and supporting community initiatives.</p>\n\n<p>Our commitment to customer service extends beyond the booking process. We provide ongoing support throughout the travel journey, ensuring that our customers have a seamless and enjoyable experience. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall travel experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Guwahati Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its exceptional service, sustainable practices, and commitment to customer satisfaction. Our future plans include:</p>\n\n<p><b>Expanding our Destination Portfolio:</b> We plan to expand our destination portfolio to include more destinations within Northeast India and beyond, offering a wider range of travel options for our customers.</p>\n\n<p><b>Developing Innovative Tour Packages:</b> We are committed to developing innovative and experiential tour packages that showcase the unique cultural and natural attractions of the region.</p>\n\n<p><b>Leveraging Technology:</b> We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that provides seamless booking options and personalized travel recommendations.</p>\n\n<p><b>Strengthening Partnerships:</b> We will continue to strengthen our partnerships with hotels, airlines, and other travel providers to secure the best possible rates and ensure a high-quality travel experience for our customers.</p>\n\n<p><b>Promoting Sustainable Tourism:</b> We are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities and preserve the natural environment. We will continue to support local businesses and initiatives that promote responsible tourism.</p>\n\n<p>Guwahati Travels is dedicated to playing a vital role in the growth and development of the tourism industry in Assam and Northeast India. We are confident that our commitment to excellence, personalized service, and sustainable practices will enable us to achieve our long-term goals and solidify our position as the premier travel agency in the region. Our location on Lokhra Rd, opposite Subham Garden, serves as a welcoming hub for travelers seeking to explore the wonders of Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Lokhra Rd, opposite Subham Garden', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:30:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1588, 'Brothers Travel & tourism, Car rental service in Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Brothers Travel & Tourism: Your Gateway to Exploring Assam & Beyond, with Premier Car Rental Services in Guwahati\n\nBrothers Travel & Tourism is a Guwahati-based car rental and tourism company dedicated to providing reliable, comfortable, and personalized travel experiences across Assam and Northeast India. Located at Bylane 2, SK Boruah Path, we are strategically positioned to serve both local residents and visiting tourists seeking seamless transportation solutions and expertly curated travel itineraries. More than just a car rental agency, we strive to be a trusted partner in exploration, offering tailored services that cater to diverse travel needs, from short city commutes to extensive regional tours. Our commitment to customer satisfaction, combined with our in-depth local knowledge, sets us apart in the dynamic Assam tourism sector. We understand that travel is not just about reaching a destination; it\'s about the journey and the memories created along the way.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Brothers Travel & Tourism lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to make travel effortless and enjoyable. Our core offering is our diverse fleet of well-maintained vehicles, ranging from compact cars ideal for navigating Guwahati\'s bustling streets to spacious SUVs perfect for exploring the rugged terrains of Meghalaya and Arunachal Pradesh. We provide self-drive options for experienced drivers seeking independence and chauffeured services for those who prefer to relax and leave the driving to our professional and courteous drivers. Beyond car rental, we specialize in crafting personalized tour packages that showcase the best of Assam\'s rich culture, breathtaking landscapes, and diverse wildlife. These packages encompass accommodation arrangements, sightseeing tours, and cultural experiences, all meticulously planned to suit individual preferences and budgets. What distinguishes us is our unwavering focus on providing value for money without compromising on quality or safety. We ensure that our vehicles undergo regular maintenance checks and that our drivers are well-trained and knowledgeable about the region\'s roads and attractions. We also provide transparent pricing with no hidden charges, building trust with our customers from the outset. Moreover, we cater specifically to the nuances of the local market, understanding the challenges and opportunities presented by Assam\'s unique geography and travel conditions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Brothers Travel & Tourism. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service at every touchpoint. From the moment a customer makes an inquiry to the completion of their journey, we strive to exceed expectations. Our friendly and responsive customer support team is available to assist with booking inquiries, itinerary planning, and any on-trip assistance required. We understand that unforeseen circumstances can arise during travel, and we are committed to providing prompt and effective solutions to ensure minimal disruption. Our drivers are not just drivers; they are also informal guides who can offer valuable insights into the local culture, customs, and attractions. We actively seek customer feedback to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. Furthermore, we recognize the importance of connecting with the local community. We actively support local businesses and initiatives, promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit both our customers and the region as a whole. Our involvement in community events and initiatives helps us build goodwill and reinforces our commitment to being a responsible and ethical business.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Brothers Travel & Tourism envisions becoming the leading car rental and tourism provider in Guwahati and Northeast India. We plan to expand our fleet of vehicles to cater to a wider range of customer needs and preferences, including adding electric vehicles to promote environmentally friendly transportation options. We are also investing in technology to enhance our online booking platform and improve the overall customer experience. This includes implementing real-time vehicle tracking, online payment options, and personalized travel recommendations. A key element of our future growth strategy is to further develop our tour package offerings, focusing on niche tourism segments such as eco-tourism, adventure tourism, and cultural tourism. We aim to collaborate with local artisans, communities, and homestay providers to create authentic and immersive travel experiences that showcase the unique character of Assam and Northeast India. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to not only grow our business but also contribute to the sustainable development of the region\'s tourism industry, promoting responsible travel practices that benefit both the environment and the local communities. We believe that by focusing on customer satisfaction, innovation, and community engagement, we can achieve our vision and become a trusted partner for travelers seeking to explore the wonders of Assam and beyond.', 'Bylane 2, SK boruah path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:30:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1589, 'ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY: Your Gateway to Unforgettable Assamese Experiences</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at Ground Floor, Renault Service Center, Avtar Complex, Naharani Path, opposite Rajdhani Regency, ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY stands as a premier travel agency dedicated to crafting bespoke and immersive travel experiences throughout Assam and the Northeast. In a region celebrated for its breathtaking landscapes, diverse cultures, and rich biodiversity, ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY distinguishes itself by offering personalized itineraries that go beyond the typical tourist trail, connecting travelers with the authentic soul of Assam. Recognizing the increasing demand for sustainable and culturally sensitive tourism, we are committed to showcasing the region\'s beauty while supporting local communities and preserving its natural heritage. We strive to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be storytellers, guides, and facilitators, enabling our clients to forge meaningful connections with the land and its people.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel needs, tailored to individual preferences and interests. We specialize in crafting customized tour packages that explore Assam\'s diverse offerings, from the serene tea gardens of Upper Assam to the majestic Brahmaputra River and the wildlife sanctuaries teeming with endangered species like the one-horned rhinoceros. For adventure seekers, we offer trekking expeditions in the Himalayan foothills, river rafting adventures, and birdwatching tours led by experienced local guides. Cultural immersion is at the heart of our philosophy, and we organize village homestays, visits to tribal communities, and participation in local festivals, providing travelers with authentic glimpses into the region’s unique traditions and customs. Furthermore, we provide comprehensive travel solutions, including flight and train ticketing, hotel bookings, car rentals, and visa assistance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free travel experience. Our unique selling point lies in our in-depth knowledge of Assam and the Northeast, our commitment to responsible tourism, and our ability to create personalized itineraries that cater to the specific needs and interests of each client. We understand the local market\'s desire for accessible, authentic, and sustainable travel options, and we strive to exceed expectations by delivering exceptional value and unparalleled service.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our approach to customer service is rooted in building genuine relationships and understanding individual needs. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, we strive to provide personalized attention and support, ensuring that every detail of the trip is meticulously planned and executed. We believe in proactive communication, keeping our clients informed and updated throughout their journey. Our team consists of experienced travel professionals who are passionate about Assam and dedicated to providing exceptional service. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Furthermore, we are committed to supporting the local community by partnering with local businesses, employing local guides, and promoting responsible tourism practices. We regularly participate in local events and initiatives, fostering a strong sense of community engagement and demonstrating our commitment to the sustainable development of Assam\'s tourism sector. We believe that by investing in the local community, we can create a more enriching and rewarding experience for our clients while contributing to the long-term well-being of the region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, ADVENTOUR HOLIDAY envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include niche travel experiences such as wellness retreats, yoga tours, and photography workshops. We also plan to develop stronger partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate more actively in the tourism sector. We are exploring opportunities to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as developing a user-friendly mobile app that provides real-time travel information and personalized recommendations. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting Assam as a premier travel destination on both the national and international stage, showcasing its unique beauty and cultural heritage to a wider audience. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of Assam\'s tourism sector, ensuring that it benefits both the local community and the environment. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we can achieve our vision and create a lasting positive impact on the region.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Renault Service Center, Avtar Complex, Naharani Path, opposite Rajdhani Regency', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:30:40', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1590, 'High Hills Tours and Travels (Registered Under Assam Tourism)', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>High Hills Tours and Travels, registered under Assam Tourism, is a premier tour operator dedicated to showcasing the breathtaking beauty and rich cultural heritage of Assam and the greater Northeast India region. Based strategically to offer seamless access to the region’s diverse landscapes, we specialize in crafting bespoke travel experiences that cater to a wide range of interests, from adventure tourism and wildlife safaris to cultural immersion and spiritual journeys. We are committed to promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities and preserve the region\'s natural environment for generations to come.\n<br> <br>\nIn a region renowned for its tea gardens, national parks, and vibrant traditions, High Hills Tours and Travels distinguishes itself by offering personalized service, expert local knowledge, and a deep commitment to responsible travel. Our registration with Assam Tourism underscores our adherence to the highest standards of quality, safety, and ethical business practices, providing our clients with peace of mind knowing they are traveling with a reputable and trusted operator.\n</p>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions designed to meet the diverse needs of our clientele. These include:\n<br> <br>\n<b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in creating tailor-made itineraries that cater to individual preferences, interests, and budgets. Whether it\'s a family vacation exploring the Kaziranga National Park, a backpacking adventure through the Himalayan foothills, or a cultural tour delving into the traditions of Assam\'s various ethnic communities, we can design the perfect trip.\n<br> <br>\n<b>Wildlife Safaris:</b> Assam is home to a remarkable array of wildlife, including the endangered one-horned rhinoceros. We offer expertly guided safaris in Kaziranga, Manas, and other national parks, providing unforgettable opportunities to witness these magnificent creatures in their natural habitat. Our experienced naturalists ensure both a thrilling and educational experience.\n<br> <br>\n<b>Cultural Tours:</b> Immerse yourself in the rich cultural tapestry of Assam through our curated cultural tours. We offer opportunities to visit ancient temples, interact with local artisans, participate in traditional festivals, and learn about the region\'s diverse heritage.\n<br> <br>\n<b>Adventure Tourism:</b> For adventure seekers, we offer a range of exciting activities such as trekking, river rafting, and camping in some of the region\'s most stunning landscapes. Our experienced guides prioritize safety while providing an exhilarating experience.\n<br> <br>\n<b>Transportation Services:</b> We provide reliable and comfortable transportation services throughout the region, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours in well-maintained vehicles.\n<br> <br>\nWhat truly sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to providing authentic and immersive travel experiences. We work closely with local communities to ensure that our tours benefit them directly, and we are dedicated to minimizing our environmental impact. Our unique selling proposition lies in our ability to combine expert local knowledge with personalized service, creating unforgettable travel memories for our clients. Our services address the growing demand for responsible and authentic tourism in Assam, connecting travelers with the region\'s natural beauty, cultural richness, and warm hospitality.\n</p>\n\n<p>At High Hills Tours and Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment for all our clients, ensuring that their needs are met with promptness and professionalism. Our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to providing personalized attention and expert guidance, from the initial planning stages to the completion of the tour.\n<br> <br>\nWe foster strong relationships with local communities, businesses, and organizations to ensure that our tours are not only enjoyable but also contribute to the sustainable development of the region. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting cultural preservation and environmental conservation efforts. Our commitment to responsible tourism has earned us the trust and respect of the local community, which in turn enhances the quality of our tours and the overall experience for our clients. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are exceeding their expectations. Our commitment to building lasting relationships with our clients extends beyond the tour itself; we strive to be a trusted resource for all their future travel needs in the region.\n</p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, High Hills Tours and Travels envisions becoming the leading sustainable tour operator in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to responsible tourism, exceptional customer service, and innovative travel experiences. Our future plans include:\n<br> <br>\n<b>Expanding our Service Offerings:</b> We plan to introduce new and exciting tour packages that cater to emerging trends in tourism, such as eco-tourism, wellness retreats, and community-based tourism.\n<br> <br>\n<b>Strengthening our Online Presence:</b> We will invest in enhancing our online presence through a user-friendly website and active engagement on social media, making it easier for customers to discover and book our tours.\n<br> <br>\n<b>Developing Strategic Partnerships:</b> We will continue to forge strategic partnerships with hotels, airlines, and other tourism stakeholders to offer our clients competitive pricing and seamless travel arrangements.\n<br> <br>\n<b>Investing in Training and Development:</b> We will provide ongoing training and development opportunities for our staff to ensure that they are equipped with the latest knowledge and skills to deliver exceptional service.\n<br> <br>\n<b>Promoting Sustainable Tourism Practices:</b> We will continue to champion sustainable tourism practices by working with local communities to develop eco-friendly tourism initiatives and promoting responsible travel behavior among our clients.\n<br> <br>\nOur long-term goal is to create a positive impact on the local economy, environment, and culture of Northeast India while providing our clients with unforgettable travel experiences that they will cherish for a lifetime. We are confident that with our dedicated team, commitment to quality, and passion for showcasing the beauty of the region, High Hills Tours and Travels will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam and beyond.\n</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:35:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1591, 'North East Tour Planner --by Travel Zone', 'Travel Agencies', '', '```html\n<p>North East Tour Planner – by Travel Zone, located at Kamala Enclave, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd, stands as a premier travel facilitator dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of North East India. More than just a travel agency, we are curators of immersive experiences, connecting discerning travellers with the heart and soul of Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Meghalaya, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, we distinguish ourselves through a deep-rooted commitment to responsible tourism, personalized service, and an unwavering passion for promoting the region’s unique heritage and ecological treasures.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core service revolves around crafting bespoke travel itineraries that cater to a diverse range of interests, from adventurous treks through the Himalayas and wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to cultural explorations of ancient temples and tribal villages. We offer a comprehensive suite of services including: customized tour packages encompassing accommodation, transportation, and guided excursions; specialized adventure tours focusing on trekking, river rafting, and wildlife observation; cultural immersion programs offering authentic experiences with local communities; comfortable and reliable transportation solutions ranging from private car rentals to group bus services; and meticulous accommodation booking services encompassing a variety of options from heritage hotels to eco-friendly homestays. What sets us apart is our intimate knowledge of the region, allowing us to provide insider access to hidden gems and off-the-beaten-path experiences that are often overlooked by mainstream travel agencies. We work directly with local communities, ensuring that tourism benefits the region’s economy and promotes sustainable practices. Our itineraries are designed not only to showcase the natural wonders of the North East but also to foster meaningful interactions between travellers and the local people, creating enriching and transformative journeys.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At North East Tour Planner, we understand that exceptional customer service is paramount to creating unforgettable travel experiences. We pride ourselves on a personalized approach, taking the time to understand each client’s individual needs and preferences. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, our dedicated team of travel experts provides unwavering support and attention to detail, ensuring a seamless and stress-free journey. We foster a strong connection with the local community by partnering with local guides, drivers, and homestay owners, creating opportunities for them to share their knowledge and culture with our clients. We are actively involved in community initiatives aimed at promoting sustainable tourism and preserving the region’s natural and cultural heritage. Our commitment to ethical and responsible tourism practices has earned us the trust and loyalty of our clients, many of whom return year after year to explore new facets of the North East with us. We believe in fostering long-term relationships, not just transactions, and strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment for every traveller.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, North East Tour Planner envisions becoming the leading and most trusted travel brand in the region, renowned for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and authentic experiences. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour offerings to cater to niche markets such as birdwatching, photography, and yoga retreats. We are investing in technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online booking platform and mobile app. We plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate in the tourism industry and benefit from its economic opportunities. We are also committed to promoting responsible tourism practices, educating travellers about the importance of respecting the environment and local cultures. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the North East region by promoting tourism that is both economically viable and environmentally responsible. By showcasing the unique beauty and cultural richness of the North East to the world, we aim to create a positive impact on the lives of local communities and preserve the region’s natural heritage for future generations.</p>\n```', 'Kamala Enclave, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:35:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1592, 'Leisure Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Leisure Travels, strategically located at 93 Sundarpur, RGB Road, opposite Modern Living and near Vinyl Cafe, is a premier travel agency dedicated to crafting unforgettable travel experiences for residents of Assam and beyond. More than just booking flights and hotels, Leisure Travels distinguishes itself by providing personalized, curated itineraries that cater to the diverse interests and budgets of its clientele, playing a vital role in facilitating both inbound and outbound tourism within the region. Recognizing the growing desire for seamless and enriching travel, Leisure Travels fills a critical need in the local market by offering expert guidance, transparent pricing, and unwavering customer support.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe core of Leisure Travels\' offerings lies in its comprehensive suite of travel services. These include flight booking across all major airlines, accommodation reservations ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts, and meticulously planned tour packages. A significant differentiator is the agency\'s focus on customized itinerary creation. Travel consultants work closely with each client to understand their preferences, interests (such as historical sites, nature exploration, cultural immersion, or adventure activities), and budgetary constraints. Based on this in-depth consultation, Leisure Travels crafts bespoke travel plans that maximize enjoyment and minimize stress. Another key offering is specialized packages catering to niche markets, such as honeymoon trips, family vacations, adventure tours in the Northeast, and pilgrimage tours to sacred sites within India. These specialized packages leverage the expertise of Leisure Travels\' team, ensuring a unique and enriching experience. By providing clear and transparent pricing, and by guaranteeing comprehensive support throughout the entire journey, Leisure Travels ensures a smooth and rewarding experience for all its customers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLeisure Travels prides itself on delivering exceptional customer service that extends far beyond mere transactions. The agency understands that travel planning can be complex and often daunting. Therefore, they emphasize personalized attention and readily available support. Each customer is assigned a dedicated travel consultant who acts as their single point of contact from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. This consultant provides expert advice, answers questions promptly, and resolves any issues that may arise. Furthermore, Leisure Travels actively fosters connections with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring community initiatives, and collaborating with local businesses. This active engagement builds trust and strengthens the agency\'s reputation as a reliable and community-focused travel partner. Leisure Travels also leverages digital channels, including a user-friendly website and social media platforms, to provide convenient access to information, facilitate online bookings, and engage with customers. This multi-channel approach ensures that customers can interact with Leisure Travels in a way that best suits their needs and preferences. By consistently exceeding customer expectations and nurturing strong community ties, Leisure Travels has cultivated a loyal customer base and established a strong reputation for excellence.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Leisure Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the region, renowned for its exceptional service, innovative offerings, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices. Key growth initiatives include expanding its range of specialized travel packages to cater to emerging market trends, such as eco-tourism and wellness travel. The agency plans to forge strategic partnerships with local hotels, tour operators, and transportation providers to enhance its service offerings and provide customers with even greater value. Furthermore, Leisure Travels is committed to investing in its team, providing ongoing training and development to ensure that its travel consultants remain at the forefront of industry knowledge and best practices. The agency also recognizes the growing importance of digital technology and plans to further enhance its online presence, develop mobile applications, and leverage data analytics to personalize customer experiences. By embracing innovation, fostering strategic partnerships, and prioritizing customer satisfaction, Leisure Travels is confident in its ability to achieve its long-term goals and continue to play a vital role in promoting tourism and economic growth within the region. In essence, Leisure Travels aims to not just be a travel agency, but a facilitator of dreams, helping individuals and families explore the world and create memories that last a lifetime.', '93 sundarpur , RGB ROad Opp - Modern Living, near Vinyle Cafe', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:35:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1593, 'Natural Holidays', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Natural Holidays, situated on the 2nd floor of Assam Tourism at AK Azad Road, is a premier travel agency dedicated to showcasing the unparalleled beauty and cultural richness of Assam and Northeast India. We distinguish ourselves by crafting immersive and responsible travel experiences that resonate with both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic encounters. In a region brimming with natural wonders, from the majestic Brahmaputra River to the sprawling tea gardens and biodiverse national parks, Natural Holidays acts as a key facilitator, connecting discerning travelers with the hidden gems of Assam and its neighboring states.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around providing customized travel itineraries that cater to a wide spectrum of interests and preferences. We specialize in organizing wildlife safaris to Kaziranga National Park, renowned for its population of one-horned rhinoceros, and Manas National Park, a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Beyond wildlife, we offer meticulously planned cultural tours that delve into the traditions of Assam\'s diverse ethnic communities, including Bodo, Mising, and Karbi. For those seeking tranquility, we curate serene retreats amidst tea estates, offering a glimpse into the world of tea cultivation and processing. Adventure enthusiasts can choose from trekking expeditions in the Himalayan foothills, river cruises along the Brahmaputra, and paragliding opportunities in selected locations. What sets us apart is our commitment to sustainable tourism practices. We actively partner with local communities and businesses to ensure that our tours benefit the local economy and minimize our environmental impact. Our itineraries prioritize eco-friendly accommodations, support local artisans, and promote responsible wildlife viewing practices. This dedication to sustainability is a significant differentiator, appealing to an increasingly conscious traveler base. These offerings directly address the growing demand in the local market for curated experiences that go beyond conventional sightseeing, providing deeper cultural immersion and a connection to nature.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Natural Holidays, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the tour, our dedicated team of travel specialists is committed to providing personalized attention and expert guidance. We understand that every traveler has unique needs and expectations, and we strive to create bespoke itineraries that exceed those expectations. Our knowledgeable and experienced tour guides are fluent in multiple languages and possess an intimate understanding of the region\'s history, culture, and ecology. They are passionate about sharing their knowledge and ensuring that every traveler has an enriching and memorable experience. Beyond personalized service, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We organize cultural events and workshops that showcase the region\'s art, music, and cuisine, fostering a sense of connection and understanding between travelers and local residents. We also support local schools and community organizations through donations and volunteer programs, contributing to the overall well-being of the community. This dedication to community engagement strengthens our relationships with local stakeholders and enhances our credibility as a responsible and ethical travel agency. We foster lasting relationships with our customers, many of whom return to explore more of the region with us.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Natural Holidays envisions becoming the leading sustainable tourism operator in Northeast India. We plan to expand our range of services to include more specialized and niche tourism products, such as birdwatching tours, angling expeditions, and wellness retreats. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own eco-friendly accommodations, providing travelers with even more sustainable and immersive travel experiences. A key focus of our future growth strategy is leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are developing a user-friendly online platform that will allow travelers to easily browse our tours, book accommodations, and access travel information. We also plan to utilize social media and digital marketing to reach a wider audience and promote the region\'s unique attractions. Furthermore, we aim to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and businesses, ensuring that our growth benefits the region as a whole. We are committed to investing in training and development for our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service and promote sustainable tourism practices. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the economic development of Assam and Northeast India while preserving its natural and cultural heritage for future generations. We see immense potential for growth in the region\'s tourism sector and are confident that Natural Holidays is well-positioned to capitalize on this opportunity.</p>', '2nd floor, Assam Tourism, AK Azad Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:35:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
