(1594, 'TRAVELOPEDIA INTERNATIONAL PRIVATE LIMITED', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>TRAVELOPEDIA INTERNATIONAL PRIVATE LIMITED, strategically located in Lobby B, Supreme Tower, 201, GS Road, Guwahati, Assam, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier travel solutions provider within the region. Understanding the unique nuances of the North-East Indian travel market, Travelopedia International is committed to offering bespoke travel experiences that cater to both domestic and international travelers seeking adventure, relaxation, and cultural immersion. The company distinguishes itself through its dedication to personalized service, leveraging local expertise, and fostering sustainable tourism practices.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Travelopedia International offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to simplify and enhance the travel planning process. These services encompass: <b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> Tailored itineraries that cater to individual preferences, budgets, and interests, focusing on exploring the diverse landscapes and cultural heritage of Assam and the North-East. From wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to spiritual journeys through ancient temples and monasteries, each package is meticulously designed to create memorable experiences. <b>Flight and Accommodation Bookings:</b> A user-friendly platform and dedicated team facilitating seamless booking of domestic and international flights, hotels, resorts, and guesthouses, ensuring competitive pricing and convenient options. <b>Visa Assistance:</b> Expert guidance and support throughout the visa application process for international travel, minimizing complexities and ensuring compliance with all relevant regulations. <b>Corporate Travel Management:</b> Streamlined travel solutions for businesses, including corporate bookings, event management, and incentive travel programs, optimizing travel budgets and ensuring efficient logistics. <b>Adventure Tourism:</b> Organizing trekking expeditions, river rafting adventures, and other adrenaline-pumping activities, catering to the growing demand for adventure tourism in the region. The unique selling proposition lies in its ability to blend local knowledge with global standards, providing authentic and immersive travel experiences that are both enriching and sustainable. The focus on responsible tourism ensures that local communities benefit from tourism activities, preserving the environment and cultural heritage of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Travelopedia International prioritizes creating exceptional customer experiences at every touchpoint. The company\'s approach is centered on building lasting relationships with clients, understanding their individual needs, and exceeding their expectations. This commitment is reflected in its personalized consultation services, responsive customer support, and proactive communication. The team consists of experienced travel professionals who are passionate about delivering outstanding service and creating unforgettable travel memories. Furthermore, Travelopedia International actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in community events, and support for local initiatives. By fostering strong relationships with local stakeholders, the company ensures that its operations contribute to the economic and social well-being of the region. The company leverages digital platforms and social media to connect with its target audience, sharing travel tips, promoting local attractions, and engaging in meaningful conversations. This online presence complements its offline operations, creating a seamless and integrated customer experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Travelopedia International envisions becoming the leading travel company in North-East India, renowned for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. The company\'s future plans include expanding its service offerings to include niche tourism segments such as wellness tourism, eco-tourism, and cultural immersion programs. Investment in technology is a key priority, with plans to develop a more advanced online platform and mobile app to enhance the booking experience and provide real-time travel updates. Furthermore, the company intends to establish strategic partnerships with international travel agencies and tour operators to broaden its reach and attract a wider range of customers. Long-term goals include establishing a strong brand presence in the international market, promoting North-East India as a premier travel destination, and contributing to the sustainable development of the region\'s tourism industry. Travelopedia International is committed to staying ahead of industry trends, adapting to changing customer needs, and delivering exceptional value to its clients. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and customer satisfaction, the company is poised for continued growth and success in the years to come. The ambition is to not only provide travel services, but to act as ambassadors for the region, showcasing its beauty, culture, and hospitality to the world.</p>', 'LOBBY B, Supreme Tower, 201, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:35:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1595, 'Nexplore Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Nexplore Travels, situated on the 2nd Floor of the Regalia Complex, above the SBI Chandmari Branch on Maniram Dewan Road, Guwahati, is a distinguished travel agency committed to providing exceptional and personalized travel experiences throughout Assam, the Northeast region, and beyond. Nexplore Travels stands out by blending global travel expertise with a deep understanding of the unique cultural and geographical landscape of Assam, catering to both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and enriching adventures. We are not just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur presence in the heart of Guwahati allows us to connect directly with the local community, understanding their specific travel needs and preferences. This localized knowledge, coupled with our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction, positions Nexplore Travels as a trusted partner for all travel requirements within the region. We aim to be the go-to travel solution for residents and visitors alike, fostering a reputation built on reliability, transparency, and personalized service.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nNexplore Travels offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a diverse range of needs. Our core offerings include expertly crafted tour packages that showcase the beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the Northeast. These packages range from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and Manas National Park to cultural immersions in Majuli, the world\'s largest river island, and trekking expeditions in the breathtaking hills of Meghalaya and Arunachal Pradesh. We also specialize in designing bespoke itineraries, tailoring travel plans to the specific interests, budget, and timeframe of each client.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond pre-packaged tours, Nexplore Travels provides a full spectrum of travel-related services. This includes flight bookings (both domestic and international), hotel reservations encompassing a wide range of options from budget-friendly accommodations to luxury resorts, car rentals for seamless transportation, and assistance with visa applications and travel insurance. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to seamlessly integrate these services, offering a one-stop-shop solution for all travel needs. We also prioritize sustainable and responsible tourism practices, ensuring that our tours benefit local communities and minimize environmental impact. Furthermore, we leverage our strong relationships with local service providers to secure competitive rates and exclusive experiences for our clients.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Nexplore Travels, customer experience is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service and personalized attention at every stage of their journey. Our team of experienced and knowledgeable travel consultants are passionate about travel and dedicated to understanding each client\'s individual needs and preferences. We go the extra mile to ensure that every aspect of their trip is carefully planned and executed, from the initial consultation to post-trip follow-up.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe understand that travel can be stressful, so we strive to make the entire process as smooth and hassle-free as possible. We offer 24/7 customer support to address any queries or concerns that may arise during travel. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, contributing to the economic development of the region and promoting cultural exchange. We participate in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and demonstrating our commitment to the community we serve.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Nexplore Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency in the Northeast region, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include specialized tours catering to niche interests, such as birdwatching, photography, and wellness retreats. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and managing travel itineraries.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are committed to expanding our network of partnerships with local service providers, further enhancing our ability to offer unique and authentic experiences. A significant part of our long-term goal is to promote sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental footprint and supporting local communities. We aim to educate travelers about responsible travel and encourage them to engage with local cultures in a respectful and meaningful way. Ultimately, Nexplore Travels aspires to be more than just a travel agency; we want to be a catalyst for positive change, fostering a deeper appreciation for the beauty and cultural richness of Assam and the Northeast, while contributing to the sustainable development of the region.', '2nd Floor, Regalia Complex, Maniram Dewan Rd, above SBI Chandmari Branch', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:40:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1596, 'Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd., strategically situated at Bora Service, Assam Trunk Rd, stands as a cornerstone of travel and tourism in Assam. We are more than just a travel agency; we are architects of experiences, connecting individuals and groups with the rich tapestry of culture, nature, and adventure that Assam and the wider Northeast India region have to offer. We distinguish ourselves through a commitment to personalized service, in-depth local knowledge, and a dedication to sustainable and responsible tourism practices. In a region experiencing a burgeoning interest in eco-tourism and cultural immersion, Carewell Travels and Tour serves as a trusted and reliable partner, bridging the gap between travelers\' aspirations and the realities of exploring this captivating part of the world.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings encompass a comprehensive suite of travel solutions designed to cater to a diverse clientele. These include meticulously crafted tour packages focusing on Assam\'s famed tea gardens, the wildlife sanctuaries of Kaziranga and Manas, and the spiritual significance of Majuli, the world\'s largest river island. We also specialize in customized itineraries, meticulously tailored to individual preferences, budget considerations, and time constraints. This personalized approach ensures that each traveler experiences Assam in a way that resonates deeply with them. Beyond tour packages, we provide essential services such as flight and train ticketing, hotel booking across a range of categories from budget-friendly to luxury accommodations, and reliable transportation arrangements including car rentals and airport transfers. What truly sets Carewell Travels and Tour apart is our unwavering commitment to showcasing the authentic Assam, focusing on responsible tourism that benefits local communities and preserves the natural environment. We partner with local artisans, guesthouses, and guides, ensuring that tourism dollars directly contribute to the economic empowerment of the region. Our expertise extends beyond popular destinations; we actively promote off-the-beaten-path experiences, allowing travelers to discover hidden gems and engage in meaningful cultural exchange.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Carewell Travels and Tour, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is built on proactive communication, personalized attention, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. From the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey, our clients are guided by a team of knowledgeable and dedicated travel consultants who are passionate about Assam and committed to providing seamless and stress-free travel experiences. We go beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we offer valuable insights into local customs, traditions, and etiquette, helping travelers to navigate the region with confidence and respect. We understand that travel can be unpredictable, which is why we provide 24/7 on-call support to address any unforeseen issues or emergencies that may arise. Our commitment to the local community extends beyond our business operations. We actively participate in local initiatives aimed at promoting sustainable tourism and supporting community development. We believe in fostering a culture of responsible travel, encouraging our clients to engage with local communities in a respectful and mindful manner. This deep connection to the local community not only enriches the travel experience but also contributes to the long-term well-being of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Carewell Travels and Tour envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded reach within the Assam and Northeast India tourism sector. We are committed to further developing our sustainable tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact, and maximizing the benefits for local communities. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to include specialized adventure tours, wellness retreats, and educational programs focused on the region\'s rich cultural heritage. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, implementing user-friendly online booking platforms and interactive travel guides. We are actively exploring partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, including airlines, hotels, and local businesses, to create a more integrated and seamless travel ecosystem. Ultimately, Carewell Travels and Tour aims to become the premier travel and tour operator in Assam, recognized for our unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We are dedicated to showcasing the beauty and diversity of Northeast India to the world, while ensuring that tourism benefits both travelers and the local communities that call this region home.', 'Bora Service, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:40:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1597, 'Albatross Journey', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Albatross Journey is more than just a travel agency; it\'s a gateway to experiencing the rich cultural tapestry and breathtaking natural beauty of Assam and beyond. Strategically located at Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute, Albatross Journey serves as a central hub for both local residents seeking to explore new horizons and tourists eager to immerse themselves in the region\'s unique offerings. We differentiate ourselves by crafting personalized travel experiences that emphasize authentic cultural immersion, sustainable tourism practices, and a deep understanding of the Northeast Indian landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around designing and executing customized travel itineraries that cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. These include guided tours of Assam\'s renowned tea gardens, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park (a UNESCO World Heritage Site), exploration of the serene Majuli Island (the world\'s largest river island), and curated cultural experiences highlighting the vibrant traditions of various Assamese communities. We also offer bespoke travel packages for destinations outside of Assam, ensuring a seamless and enriching travel experience across India and internationally.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Albatross Journey apart is our commitment to providing authentic, responsible, and sustainable travel options. We actively partner with local communities, artisans, and homestays to ensure that tourism benefits the region directly and minimizes its environmental impact. Our itineraries are meticulously planned to offer unique insights into the local culture, customs, and cuisine, going beyond typical tourist traps to provide a genuinely immersive experience. Furthermore, we boast a team of experienced travel consultants with in-depth knowledge of Assam and the Northeast, capable of advising clients on the best routes, accommodations, and activities based on their individual preferences and requirements.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Understanding the specific needs of the local market is paramount to our success. We recognize that many residents of Guwahati and surrounding areas seek convenient and affordable travel options for family vacations, weekend getaways, and pilgrimages. Therefore, we offer specialized packages tailored to these demands, including group tours, family-friendly itineraries, and transportation assistance. For incoming tourists, we act as a comprehensive resource, providing not only travel arrangements but also cultural guidance, language support, and logistical assistance to ensure a comfortable and memorable stay in Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience lies at the heart of Albatross Journey\'s philosophy. We prioritize building strong relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention, responsive communication, and exceptional service at every stage of the travel process. From the initial consultation to post-trip follow-up, we strive to exceed expectations and ensure that every customer feels valued and satisfied. Our staff are trained to be not just travel agents, but travel advisors, anticipating customer needs and proactively addressing any concerns that may arise. We foster a warm and welcoming atmosphere at our physical location on GNB Road, encouraging walk-in inquiries and offering expert advice to anyone planning a trip.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively connect with the local community through various initiatives, including sponsoring local cultural events, partnering with local businesses, and promoting sustainable tourism practices. We believe that responsible tourism is essential for preserving the region\'s unique heritage and environment, and we are committed to playing a positive role in the community. Furthermore, we actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings, ensuring that we remain responsive to their evolving needs.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Albatross Journey envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and sustainability. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of travel packages to encompass more destinations within the Northeast and across India, developing specialized eco-tourism initiatives, and strengthening our partnerships with local communities. We plan to leverage technology to enhance our online presence and provide a seamless online booking experience for our customers. Furthermore, we aim to invest in employee training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry and continues to provide exceptional service to our valued clients. We believe that Albatross Journey has the potential to not only grow as a business but also contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Assam, promoting its unique beauty and culture to the world.</p>', 'Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:40:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1598, 'Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency is a dedicated travel service provider committed to curating unforgettable experiences, deeply rooted in the rich culture and breathtaking landscapes of Assam and beyond. Situated strategically, we aim to be the premier choice for both domestic and international travelers seeking authentic and enriching journeys. In a region known for its unparalleled natural beauty and vibrant traditions, Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency distinguishes itself through personalized service, expert local knowledge, and a passion for sustainable tourism that benefits the communities we serve. We strive to not just facilitate travel, but to foster a genuine appreciation for the world\'s diverse cultures and ecosystems.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to a diverse range of travel preferences and budgets. Our core offerings include meticulously crafted tour packages, encompassing everything from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to cultural immersion experiences in the tea gardens of Upper Assam. We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries, tailoring each trip to the individual needs and desires of our clients. These custom tours might include trekking expeditions in the Himalayan foothills, river cruises on the mighty Brahmaputra, or spiritual journeys to ancient temples and monasteries. Beyond pre-packaged and custom tours, we provide a full spectrum of travel services including flight and hotel bookings, transportation arrangements (including car rentals and private chauffeur services), visa assistance, and travel insurance. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local terrain, coupled with strong relationships with local communities and service providers. This allows us to offer unparalleled access to authentic experiences, often unavailable through larger, less specialized travel agencies. We address a critical need in the local market: providing seamless, reliable, and culturally sensitive travel experiences that showcase the best of Assam and the surrounding regions, attracting both seasoned travelers and those embarking on their first adventure.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency. We believe that exceptional customer service begins with attentive listening and a genuine desire to understand each traveler\'s unique needs and aspirations. Our team is comprised of knowledgeable and passionate travel professionals who are dedicated to providing personalized attention from the initial inquiry to the final farewell. We go the extra mile to anticipate potential challenges and proactively address them, ensuring a smooth and stress-free travel experience. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to fostering genuine connections with the local community. We actively support local artisans, guides, and businesses, ensuring that our tours contribute to the economic well-being of the regions we operate in. Furthermore, we are committed to responsible tourism practices, minimizing our environmental impact and promoting cultural preservation. We believe that by engaging with the local community in a meaningful way, we can provide our clients with a more authentic and enriching travel experience, while simultaneously contributing to the sustainable development of the region. We regularly participate in local events and initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency is one of sustainable growth and continued excellence in travel services. We aim to expand our reach both domestically and internationally, attracting a wider range of travelers seeking authentic and enriching experiences. A key component of our future plans involves developing new and innovative tour offerings that cater to emerging travel trends, such as eco-tourism, adventure travel, and wellness retreats. We are actively exploring partnerships with other tourism stakeholders in the region to create comprehensive and integrated travel packages that showcase the diverse attractions of Northeast India. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in technology and training to enhance our operational efficiency and improve the overall customer experience. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information, as well as providing ongoing training for our staff to ensure they are equipped with the latest knowledge and skills. Long-term, our goal is to become the leading travel agency in Assam and the surrounding regions, recognized for our commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We envision Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency as a catalyst for promoting responsible tourism and showcasing the unique beauty and cultural richness of Assam to the world.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:40:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1599, 'Jk Travel Agency Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Jk Travel Agency Guwahati, strategically located at 4QJC+6V4, is a leading travel service provider dedicated to crafting exceptional travel experiences within Assam and beyond. Recognizing the growing demand for personalized and hassle-free travel solutions in the Northeast region, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati has established itself as a trusted partner for individuals, families, and corporate clients seeking adventure, relaxation, and seamless travel arrangements. Situated in a vibrant hub of Assam, the agency leverages its local expertise and extensive network to offer unparalleled access to the region\'s diverse landscapes, cultural heritage, and burgeoning tourism sector. Jk Travel Agency Guwahati understands the specific needs and preferences of the local population, distinguishing itself from larger, national chains by offering tailored services with a personal touch.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Jk Travel Agency Guwahati\'s core services encompass a wide spectrum of travel-related solutions, designed to cater to diverse needs and budgets. These include meticulously planned tour packages showcasing the best of Assam and Northeast India, featuring popular destinations like Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and Shillong. Beyond pre-packaged tours, the agency excels in crafting bespoke itineraries tailored to individual preferences, ensuring a unique and unforgettable journey. Flight booking services are offered for both domestic and international travel, utilizing advanced booking systems to secure competitive fares and convenient travel schedules. Hotel reservations form another crucial aspect of the agency\'s offerings, providing access to a wide range of accommodations, from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious hotels, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable stay. Recognizing the importance of smooth logistics, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati also provides reliable transportation services, including airport transfers, car rentals, and guided tours with experienced local drivers. A key unique selling point lies in the agency\'s deep understanding of the local terrain and culture, allowing them to provide insider tips and recommendations that enrich the travel experience. This local expertise also allows them to offer unique cultural experiences and homestays, promoting sustainable tourism and supporting local communities. The agency specifically addresses the needs of the local market by offering packages in regional languages and catering to local festivals and events, ensuring relevance and accessibility for all.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Jk Travel Agency Guwahati\'s operational philosophy. The agency prides itself on providing personalized attention and exceptional customer service, ensuring that every client feels valued and supported throughout their travel journey. The team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to understanding each client\'s unique requirements and preferences, offering expert advice and guidance to create the perfect travel plan. The agency\'s commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the initial booking process, with readily available support channels to address any queries or concerns that may arise during the trip. Jk Travel Agency Guwahati fosters a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events and promoting sustainable tourism practices. They partner with local businesses and organizations to create authentic and immersive travel experiences, benefiting both visitors and the local economy. The agency actively seeks feedback from its clients and uses this information to continuously improve its services and offerings, demonstrating a commitment to excellence and customer-centricity. By emphasizing personalized service, local expertise, and community engagement, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati has cultivated a loyal customer base and established a strong reputation as a reliable and trustworthy travel partner.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Jk Travel Agency Guwahati envisions significant growth potential in the evolving travel landscape of Assam and the Northeast. The agency plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized travel packages catering to specific interests, such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and cultural immersion programs. Investment in digital marketing and online booking platforms will be a key focus, allowing the agency to reach a wider audience and streamline the booking process. Partnerships with other travel agencies and tourism stakeholders will be explored to expand the agency\'s reach and offer more comprehensive travel solutions. Long-term goals include establishing Jk Travel Agency Guwahati as the leading travel agency in the Northeast, recognized for its exceptional service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices. The agency also aims to empower local communities through tourism by promoting homestays, supporting local artisans, and creating employment opportunities. By embracing technology, fostering strategic partnerships, and remaining committed to its core values of customer service and community engagement, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come.</p>', '4QJC+6V4', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:40:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1600, 'North East Holiday Tours', 'Travel Agencies', '', '```html\n<p>North East Holiday Tours is a premier travel agency located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, at Downtown, Hari Mandir Path. As a locally rooted business, we specialize in crafting authentic and enriching travel experiences throughout the Northeast Indian region, a landscape often overlooked by mainstream tourism. We stand out by offering meticulously planned itineraries that delve deep into the cultural richness, stunning natural beauty, and unique traditions of Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Meghalaya, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura. North East Holiday Tours is more than just a travel agency; we are ambassadors for the region, dedicated to showcasing its hidden gems and promoting sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core service revolves around providing bespoke tour packages designed to cater to a diverse range of interests and budgets. From adventurous treks through the Himalayas and wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to spiritual journeys to ancient temples and immersive cultural experiences in tribal villages, we offer a wide spectrum of options. We specialize in customized itineraries, allowing us to tailor each trip to the specific needs and preferences of our clients. This includes carefully selected accommodation, reliable transportation, experienced local guides fluent in multiple languages, and curated activities that provide authentic insights into the region\'s heritage. A key differentiator is our commitment to responsible tourism. We partner with local communities, support eco-friendly initiatives, and ensure that our tours contribute positively to the preservation of the Northeast\'s natural and cultural assets. Unlike larger, impersonal travel companies, we prioritize personalized attention and build lasting relationships with our clients, ensuring a seamless and unforgettable travel experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At North East Holiday Tours, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our approach is built on a foundation of trust, transparency, and genuine care. From the initial inquiry to the completion of the tour, our dedicated team of travel specialists provides personalized support and guidance every step of the way. We go the extra mile to anticipate our clients\' needs, address their concerns promptly, and ensure their comfort and safety throughout their journey. We are deeply invested in the local community and actively participate in local events and initiatives. This allows us to stay connected to the pulse of the region, ensuring that our tours are always up-to-date and reflect the latest developments and opportunities. Furthermore, we prioritize employing local guides and staff, fostering economic growth within the communities we serve. This commitment to local empowerment and cultural sensitivity allows us to offer a truly authentic and immersive travel experience that resonates deeply with our clients. Our reputation for reliability, integrity, and exceptional customer care has earned us a loyal customer base and strong positive word-of-mouth referrals within the region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, North East Holiday Tours envisions becoming the leading travel agency specializing in sustainable and culturally sensitive tourism in Northeast India. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of tour offerings to cater to niche interests such as birdwatching, tea tourism, and adventure sports. We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, including developing a user-friendly online platform that allows travelers to easily browse and customize their itineraries. We are also committed to strengthening our partnerships with local communities and supporting initiatives that promote sustainable tourism practices. This includes investing in training programs for local guides, supporting community-based tourism projects, and advocating for policies that protect the region\'s natural and cultural heritage. Ultimately, our vision is to create a thriving tourism industry that benefits both travelers and local communities alike, while preserving the unique beauty and cultural richness of Northeast India for generations to come. We aim to be recognized not just as a travel agency, but as a responsible and ethical business that contributes positively to the economic and social well-being of the region.</p>\n```', 'Downtown, Hari Mandir Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:45:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1601, 'Nexplore Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Nexplore Travels, strategically located on the 2nd Floor of Regalia Complex, Maniram Dewan Rd, above the SBI Chandmari Branch, is a premier travel agency dedicated to curating exceptional travel experiences for both local residents and visitors exploring the captivating landscapes of Assam and beyond. More than just a booking service, Nexplore Travels acts as a personalized travel concierge, offering expert guidance and meticulously planned itineraries that cater to diverse travel preferences and budgets. In a region abundant with natural beauty and cultural richness, Nexplore Travels stands out by providing unparalleled local knowledge and a commitment to sustainable tourism practices.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Nexplore Travels lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to meet every travel need. Our core offerings include customized tour packages, encompassing everything from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park to serene river cruises on the Brahmaputra and immersive cultural experiences in Guwahati. We specialize in crafting bespoke itineraries, tailoring each trip to the individual interests and preferences of our clients, ensuring a truly unique and unforgettable journey. Beyond packaged tours, we provide a full spectrum of travel services, including airline and railway ticketing, hotel reservations, car rentals, and visa assistance. A key differentiator is our deep understanding of the local terrain and cultural nuances, enabling us to provide insider tips and recommendations that enhance the travel experience. We also focus heavily on responsible tourism, partnering with local communities and businesses to promote sustainable practices and ensure that tourism benefits the region as a whole. By prioritizing eco-friendly accommodations and supporting local artisans, we strive to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the economic well-being of the communities we serve.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nexplore Travels is committed to providing an exceptional customer experience that goes beyond mere transactions. Our approach to customer service is built on personalized attention, responsiveness, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. From the initial consultation to the final farewell, our team of experienced travel consultants is dedicated to providing expert guidance and support. We understand that every traveler is unique, and we take the time to listen to their needs and preferences, crafting itineraries that are perfectly tailored to their individual requirements. We pride ourselves on our proactive communication, keeping our clients informed every step of the way and providing prompt assistance in case of any unforeseen circumstances. We actively seek feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall travel experience. Our connection with the local community is fostered through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, as well as through our active participation in community events. We believe in giving back to the community and supporting initiatives that promote sustainable tourism and preserve the region\'s natural and cultural heritage. This commitment to community engagement strengthens our bond with local residents and enhances our ability to provide authentic and immersive travel experiences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Nexplore Travels is one of continued growth and innovation. We aim to solidify our position as the leading travel agency in the region, expanding our services and reaching new markets. We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows travelers to easily browse and book our services. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our offerings to include niche travel experiences, such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and culinary tours. We are committed to investing in our team, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that our travel consultants remain at the forefront of the industry. We also plan to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and communities, creating a network of trusted partners that share our commitment to sustainable tourism. Our long-term goal is to become a recognized leader in responsible tourism, promoting sustainable practices and contributing to the economic and environmental well-being of the region. By staying true to our core values of personalized service, local expertise, and commitment to sustainability, we are confident that Nexplore Travels will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the travel industry in Assam and beyond. We envision Nexplore Travels as not just a travel agency, but as a facilitator of meaningful experiences, connecting people with the beauty and culture of Assam while contributing to its sustainable development.\n</p>', '2nd Floor, Regalia Complex, Maniram Dewan Rd, above SBI Chandmari Branch', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:45:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1602, 'Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd., strategically situated at Bora Service, Assam Trunk Rd, is a leading travel and tourism company dedicated to providing exceptional travel experiences tailored to the unique charm and diversity of Assam and beyond. We are more than just a travel agency; we are curators of unforgettable journeys, committed to delivering seamless, personalized, and enriching experiences for every traveler. Our presence in the Bora Service area positions us as a readily accessible and trusted resource for both local residents and visiting tourists seeking to explore the region\'s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and vibrant traditions. We strive to be a pivotal contributor to the local tourism ecosystem, promoting sustainable practices and showcasing the beauty of Assam to the world.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core service offerings encompass a comprehensive range of travel solutions, designed to cater to diverse needs and preferences. These include meticulously crafted tour packages focusing on Assam\'s unique attractions such as Kaziranga National Park, the tea gardens of Upper Assam, the spiritual haven of Majuli, and the historical sites of Guwahati. We also specialize in customized itinerary planning, allowing travelers to create bespoke adventures that align perfectly with their interests, budget, and timeframe. Beyond Assam, we offer domestic and international travel planning services, encompassing flight bookings, hotel reservations, visa assistance, and travel insurance. Our unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local terrain, culture, and hidden gems, allowing us to offer authentic and immersive experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trail. We connect travelers with local artisans, communities, and cultural events, ensuring a truly memorable and enriching journey. Recognizing the increasing demand for hassle-free travel solutions, we emphasize convenience, reliability, and personalized attention in every aspect of our service delivery.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd., customer experience is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, fostering a sense of trust and reliability that extends beyond a single transaction. Our approach to customer service is rooted in empathy, responsiveness, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. We provide dedicated travel consultants who act as personal travel advisors, guiding clients through every step of the planning and booking process. We are readily available to address queries, provide expert advice, and resolve any issues that may arise, ensuring a smooth and stress-free travel experience. What sets us apart is our commitment to going the extra mile to personalize each interaction. We actively seek feedback and strive to continuously improve our services based on customer input. Moreover, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and organizations, supporting initiatives that promote sustainable tourism and preserve Assam\'s cultural heritage. By participating in local events and initiatives, we strengthen our ties with the community and reinforce our commitment to being a responsible and ethical business.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd. envisions becoming the leading travel and tourism provider in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainable practices. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to include niche interests such as adventure tourism, eco-tourism, and wellness retreats. We aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, by developing a user-friendly online platform for bookings, itinerary planning, and customer support. We are also exploring partnerships with international travel agencies to broaden our reach and attract a wider audience to Assam. A key element of our long-term strategy is to promote sustainable tourism practices that minimize environmental impact and benefit local communities. This includes supporting eco-friendly accommodations, promoting responsible wildlife viewing, and engaging in community-based tourism initiatives. We believe that by fostering a sustainable tourism ecosystem, we can contribute to the long-term prosperity of Assam while preserving its natural beauty and cultural heritage for future generations. Our ultimate goal is to establish Carewell Travels and Tour Pvt. Ltd. as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with exceptional travel experiences and a commitment to responsible tourism.', 'Bora Service, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:45:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(1603, 'Albatross Journey', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Albatross Journey: Crafting Unforgettable Experiences in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<p>Nestled at Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute, Albatross Journey stands as a beacon for travelers and experience seekers alike. More than just a travel agency, Albatross Journey is a curator of personalized adventures, dedicated to unveiling the hidden gems and cultural richness of Assam and beyond. In a region celebrated for its breathtaking landscapes and vibrant traditions, Albatross Journey distinguishes itself by offering bespoke travel solutions that cater to both the discerning tourist and the local resident eager to explore their own backyard. We understand that travel is more than just visiting a place; it\'s about forging connections, creating lasting memories, and experiencing the world in a meaningful way. Albatross Journey is committed to making every journey a transformative experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: Tailored Adventures Await</p>\n\n<p>At the heart of Albatross Journey lies a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to meet a diverse range of needs. Our primary offering is customized tour packages, meticulously crafted to reflect the individual preferences and interests of our clients. Whether it\'s exploring the lush tea gardens of Upper Assam, embarking on a wildlife safari in Kaziranga National Park, or immersing oneself in the spiritual serenity of Majuli, the world\'s largest river island, Albatross Journey ensures a seamless and unforgettable experience. We also specialize in arranging comfortable and reliable transportation, from private car rentals to guided bus tours, ensuring easy access to even the most remote destinations. Our partnerships with carefully selected hotels and guesthouses across Assam guarantee comfortable and authentic accommodations that complement the overall travel experience. Beyond leisure travel, Albatross Journey caters to corporate clients with services such as conference and event planning, group travel arrangements, and incentive tours. A key differentiator is our focus on sustainable and responsible tourism. We actively promote eco-friendly practices and support local communities, ensuring that our tours have a positive impact on the environment and the local economy.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Unique Selling Points: Local Expertise, Global Standards</p>\n\n<p>Albatross Journey stands apart through its deep-rooted understanding of the local landscape and culture. Our team comprises experienced travel professionals with an intimate knowledge of Assam and the surrounding regions. This local expertise allows us to curate authentic experiences that go beyond the typical tourist trails. We pride ourselves on our personalized approach, taking the time to understand each client\'s unique needs and preferences to create tailor-made itineraries. Our commitment to quality is unwavering, and we maintain stringent standards in all aspects of our operations, from transportation and accommodation to tour guides and customer service. Moreover, Albatross Journey leverages technology to enhance the customer experience. Our user-friendly online platform allows clients to browse tour packages, make bookings, and access travel information with ease. We also utilize social media and digital marketing to connect with our audience and promote the beauty and diversity of Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Meeting Local Market Needs: Bridging the Gap</p>\n\n<p>Albatross Journey addresses a critical need in the Assam tourism market: the demand for high-quality, personalized travel experiences. While Assam boasts immense tourism potential, the availability of reliable and professional travel services has historically been limited. We bridge this gap by offering a one-stop solution for all travel needs, catering to both domestic and international tourists. Our focus on sustainable tourism aligns with the growing awareness of environmental responsibility and the desire to support local communities. By promoting eco-friendly practices and partnering with local businesses, Albatross Journey contributes to the long-term sustainability of the tourism industry in Assam. Additionally, we cater to the needs of the local population by offering weekend getaways, pilgrimage tours, and customized travel arrangements for families and groups.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Lasting Relationships</p>\n\n<p>Customer satisfaction is paramount at Albatross Journey. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional service at every touchpoint. Our team is dedicated to going the extra mile to ensure that every journey is seamless and memorable. From the initial inquiry to the post-trip follow-up, we are committed to providing prompt, courteous, and personalized attention. We actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and address any concerns. Beyond our commitment to individual clients, Albatross Journey actively engages with the local community through partnerships with schools, NGOs, and cultural organizations. We participate in local events and initiatives to promote tourism and support community development. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we ensure that our tours are not only enjoyable but also respectful of the local culture and environment.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons, Deepening Roots</p>\n\n<p>Albatross Journey envisions a future where it is recognized as the leading provider of customized travel experiences in Assam and the Northeast region. Our long-term goals include expanding our service offerings to include adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and specialized tours focused on art, culture, and gastronomy. We plan to leverage technology to further enhance the customer experience, developing a mobile app that provides real-time travel information, personalized recommendations, and seamless booking capabilities. We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and communities to promote sustainable tourism and create economic opportunities. A key focus will be on expanding our reach to international markets, attracting more foreign tourists to experience the beauty and diversity of Assam. Albatross Journey is committed to continuous innovation and improvement, adapting to the evolving needs of the travel industry and remaining at the forefront of customer service excellence. Ultimately, our vision is to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting tourism in a responsible and sustainable manner, and contributing to the economic and social development of the region.</p>', 'Landmark, Bus Stop, GNB Rd, opposite Assam Textile Institute', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:45:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1604, 'Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency is a locally owned and operated travel agency dedicated to curating unforgettable travel experiences, both within Assam and beyond. Situated at [Insert Actual Address Here, Even if Vague, i.e., \"Near the Central Market in Guwahati\"], Tour Lover\'s aims to be the premier choice for travelers seeking personalized service and expertly crafted itineraries. In a region rich with natural beauty and cultural heritage, Tour Lover\'s distinguishes itself by providing in-depth local knowledge, bespoke travel planning, and a commitment to sustainable tourism practices. We fill a crucial gap in the Assam travel market by offering an alternative to impersonal online booking platforms, focusing instead on building lasting relationships with our clients and understanding their individual travel aspirations. Our significance lies in promoting responsible tourism within Assam, contributing to the local economy, and showcasing the region\'s unique charm to the world.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core service is personalized travel planning, encompassing everything from destination selection and itinerary design to accommodation booking, transportation arrangement, and activity scheduling. We specialize in crafting unique travel experiences tailored to the specific needs and interests of our clients. This includes adventure tourism in the Brahmaputra River basin, cultural immersion tours of Assam\'s diverse ethnic communities, wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, and spiritual journeys to ancient temples and monasteries. A key differentiator for Tour Lover\'s is our deep understanding of Assam\'s hidden gems and off-the-beaten-path destinations. We have established strong relationships with local guides, hotels, and transportation providers, allowing us to offer exclusive experiences and competitive pricing. Unlike larger, multinational travel agencies, we prioritize quality over quantity, ensuring that each trip is meticulously planned and executed to exceed expectations. We cater to the specific needs of the local market by providing customized tour packages designed for families, couples, and solo travelers, accommodating various budgets and time constraints. Our proficiency in local languages and understanding of regional customs further enhance our ability to serve our clients effectively.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Tour Lover\'s, customer satisfaction is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment where clients feel valued and understood. Our approach to customer service is built on proactive communication, personalized attention, and a commitment to going the extra mile. From the initial consultation to post-trip follow-up, we are dedicated to providing exceptional support and addressing any concerns promptly and efficiently. What truly sets us apart is our dedication to building genuine relationships with our clients. We take the time to understand their individual preferences, travel styles, and budget constraints, allowing us to create truly bespoke itineraries that reflect their unique needs. Our deep connection to the local community is another key differentiator. We actively support local businesses and promote sustainable tourism practices that benefit the environment and local communities. We participate in local events and festivals, fostering a sense of community and contributing to the vibrancy of Assam\'s cultural landscape. Furthermore, we actively solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. Our reputation within the local community speaks volumes about our commitment to excellence and our dedication to providing exceptional travel experiences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency is to become the leading provider of sustainable and culturally enriching travel experiences in Assam and the Northeast region of India. We plan to expand our service offerings to include eco-tourism initiatives, homestay programs in rural communities, and educational tours focused on Assam\'s rich biodiversity and cultural heritage. A key aspect of our growth strategy involves leveraging digital marketing channels to reach a wider audience, both domestically and internationally. We are investing in developing a user-friendly website and engaging social media presence to showcase our unique travel packages and promote Assam as a must-visit destination. We also plan to forge strategic partnerships with other tourism stakeholders, including airlines, hotels, and tour operators, to expand our network and offer even more comprehensive travel solutions. Long-term, we envision Tour Lover\'s as a champion of responsible tourism, promoting sustainable practices that protect the environment and benefit local communities. We aspire to be a catalyst for economic growth in Assam, creating employment opportunities and showcasing the region\'s unique charm to the world. We believe that by focusing on personalized service, cultural immersion, and sustainable tourism, Tour Lover\'s Travel Agency can achieve its ambitious goals and make a positive impact on the Assam tourism landscape.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:45:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1605, 'Jk Travel Agency Guwahati', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Jk Travel Agency Guwahati, strategically located at 4QJC+6V4, stands as a cornerstone of reliable and personalized travel solutions within the dynamic Assam business environment. We are more than just a travel agency; we are architects of memorable journeys, dedicated to crafting seamless and enriching travel experiences for individuals, families, and corporate clients alike. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, we possess a deep understanding of the local market, allowing us to cater specifically to the unique travel needs and preferences of the Assamese community and beyond.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Jk Travel Agency Guwahati\'s service offerings lies a commitment to providing comprehensive travel solutions tailored to individual requirements. Our primary services encompass a wide spectrum, including flight bookings (both domestic and international), meticulously planned tour packages, comfortable hotel reservations, efficient visa assistance, and convenient transportation arrangements. We pride ourselves on our ability to curate bespoke itineraries that cater to diverse interests, whether it\'s exploring the natural beauty of Assam and the Northeast, embarking on spiritual pilgrimages, or facilitating seamless business travel arrangements. Our unique selling point lies in our personalized approach. We don\'t just sell travel; we listen to our clients, understand their aspirations, and craft journeys that exceed expectations. We leverage our strong relationships with airlines, hotels, and local operators to secure competitive pricing and exclusive benefits for our customers. This dedication to value, coupled with our commitment to personalized service, sets us apart from larger, less-localized travel agencies. We address the specific needs of the local market by offering specialized packages that showcase the cultural richness and natural wonders of Assam and the Northeast, promoting sustainable tourism and supporting local communities.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Jk Travel Agency Guwahati. We believe that every interaction is an opportunity to build lasting relationships. Our dedicated team of travel experts is committed to providing personalized assistance at every stage of the journey, from initial inquiry to post-trip follow-up. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where customers feel valued and understood. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond simply booking flights and hotels; we provide expert advice, address concerns promptly, and ensure that our clients are well-prepared for their travels. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events and partnering with local businesses. We believe in fostering a sense of connection and contributing to the well-being of the community we serve. By providing reliable and personalized travel services, we aim to be a trusted partner for individuals and businesses in Guwahati and beyond.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Jk Travel Agency Guwahati is one of sustained growth and innovation. We aspire to become the leading travel agency in the region, recognized for our commitment to excellence, personalized service, and sustainable tourism practices. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to incorporate more specialized offerings, such as adventure tourism packages, eco-friendly travel options, and curated cultural experiences. We are also investing in technology to enhance our online presence and streamline our booking processes, making it even easier for customers to plan and book their dream journeys. We are actively exploring partnerships with other businesses in the tourism sector, both locally and internationally, to expand our reach and offer even more comprehensive travel solutions. We are committed to staying abreast of the latest trends and developments in the travel industry, continuously adapting our services to meet the evolving needs of our customers. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the growth of the tourism sector in Assam and the Northeast, while promoting responsible and sustainable travel practices that benefit local communities and preserve the region\'s natural beauty. By remaining focused on our core values of personalized service, customer satisfaction, and community engagement, Jk Travel Agency Guwahati is well-positioned for continued success and a positive impact on the local business landscape.</p>', '4QJC+6V4', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:50:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1606, 'North East Holiday Tours', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>North East Holiday Tours, nestled in the heart of Downtown on Hari Mandir Path, is a premier travel agency dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences throughout the captivating landscapes of Northeast India. More than just a tour operator, we are curators of authentic journeys, connecting travelers with the region\'s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking natural beauty, and warm hospitality. In a travel market often dominated by standardized packages, North East Holiday Tours distinguishes itself through its commitment to personalized itineraries, sustainable tourism practices, and deep local expertise. Our presence strengthens the Assam tourism ecosystem by promoting responsible travel and showcasing the unique allure of the region to a wider audience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core service lies in designing bespoke travel packages tailored to the individual preferences and interests of our clients. We specialize in a range of offerings, from immersive cultural tours exploring ancient temples and tribal villages to thrilling adventure treks through lush rainforests and snow-capped mountains. For nature enthusiasts, we offer meticulously planned wildlife safaris and birdwatching expeditions, providing opportunities to witness the region\'s diverse flora and fauna. A key differentiator is our focus on experiential travel. Instead of simply sightseeing, we facilitate genuine interactions with local communities, enabling travelers to participate in traditional crafts, learn about local farming practices, and savor authentic regional cuisine. This emphasis on cultural immersion and responsible tourism sets us apart from competitors who primarily offer generic tour packages. By partnering with local guides and homestays, we ensure that our tours not only provide enriching experiences for travelers but also contribute to the economic empowerment of the local communities, meeting the growing demand for ethical and sustainable travel options.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At North East Holiday Tours, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building long-lasting relationships with our clients by providing exceptional personalized service from the initial inquiry to the completion of their journey. Our approach is rooted in attentive listening, understanding individual needs, and offering expert advice based on our in-depth knowledge of the region. We stand out by providing dedicated travel consultants who act as single points of contact, ensuring seamless communication and prompt resolution of any queries or concerns. Beyond our core services, we actively engage with the local community through participation in tourism-related events and initiatives. We strive to promote Assam and Northeast India as a safe and welcoming destination. We also prioritize responsible tourism by educating both travelers and local stakeholders about the importance of environmental conservation and cultural preservation. This commitment to community involvement and ethical practices resonates with travelers seeking meaningful and impactful experiences.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, North East Holiday Tours envisions expanding its reach to become a leading provider of sustainable and authentic travel experiences across Northeast India. Our long-term goals include developing new and innovative tour offerings that cater to emerging market trends, such as wellness tourism and eco-adventure travel. We plan to strengthen our partnerships with local communities and organizations to create more opportunities for cultural exchange and economic empowerment. A key area of focus will be leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. This includes developing a user-friendly online platform for booking tours and accessing travel information, as well as utilizing data analytics to personalize travel recommendations. By continuously adapting to the evolving needs of the travel market and staying true to our core values of sustainability, authenticity, and exceptional customer service, North East Holiday Tours is poised for sustained growth and success, contributing to the vibrant tourism landscape of Assam and the wider Northeast region.</p>', 'Downtown, Hari Mandir Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:50:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1607, 'Assam Explore travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Assam Explore Travels: Your Gateway to the Untamed Beauty of Assam</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati, at Lachit Bagh Hazarika Path, near NEF College Road, Assam Explore Travels is a premier travel agency dedicated to providing authentic and immersive experiences throughout the diverse landscapes of Assam and the Northeast. Unlike conventional travel operators, we focus on sustainable tourism practices that benefit local communities while showcasing the region’s rich cultural heritage, breathtaking natural beauty, and unparalleled biodiversity. We stand as a crucial link between discerning travelers and the hidden gems of Assam, contributing to the state\'s growing tourism sector by promoting responsible exploration and fostering cultural exchange.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around crafting personalized travel itineraries that cater to a wide range of interests and preferences. From meticulously planned cultural tours exploring the ancient Kamakhya Temple and the historical ruins of Sivasagar, to exhilarating wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park (home to the one-horned rhinoceros) and Manas National Park, we offer a diverse portfolio of experiences. We also specialize in adventure tourism, including trekking expeditions in the scenic hills of Haflong, river cruises on the mighty Brahmaputra, and tea tourism, offering immersive experiences within the lush tea gardens of Assam. <br> <br> What sets Assam Explore Travels apart is our commitment to providing expert local knowledge and personalized service. Our team comprises seasoned travel professionals with an intimate understanding of Assam\'s geography, culture, and traditions. We work closely with local guides, artisans, and communities to ensure that our tours are authentic, enriching, and contribute directly to the local economy. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to create bespoke itineraries that cater to the specific needs and interests of each traveler, ensuring a truly unforgettable experience. We also emphasize eco-friendly practices, partnering with accommodations and transportation providers who share our commitment to sustainability. By prioritizing local businesses and promoting responsible tourism, we aim to minimize our environmental impact and maximize the positive impact on the communities we serve. We actively work to bridge the gap between travelers seeking unique experiences and the often-underrepresented tourism potential of the region, offering meticulously crafted packages that make exploring Assam seamless and rewarding.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Assam Explore Travels, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful travel agency. We are dedicated to creating a welcoming and supportive environment for our clients, ensuring that their journey is smooth, enjoyable, and memorable from beginning to end. Our customer service approach is centered around building personal relationships with our clients. We take the time to understand their individual needs, preferences, and expectations, and we tailor our services accordingly. We provide prompt and responsive communication, offering expert advice and assistance throughout the booking process and during their travels. <br> <br> Beyond providing exceptional travel experiences, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We support local artisans and craftspeople by featuring their products in our tours and promoting their businesses to our clients. We also work with local schools and organizations to promote education and awareness about Assam\'s cultural heritage and environmental conservation. We regularly participate in local events and festivals, showcasing the beauty and diversity of Assam to a wider audience. Our commitment to community engagement not only enriches the experiences of our clients but also contributes to the sustainable development of the region. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, we create a sense of belonging and ensure that our business operates in a socially responsible manner.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Assam Explore Travels envisions becoming the leading travel agency for sustainable and authentic experiences in Assam and the Northeast. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of services to offer even more diverse and immersive travel options. We plan to develop new tours that focus on niche interests, such as birdwatching, photography, and yoga retreats. We are also committed to expanding our network of local partners, working with more communities to create new tourism opportunities and promote sustainable development. <br> <br> Furthermore, we aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience and streamline our operations. We plan to invest in a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse and book our tours, as well as access valuable information about Assam\'s destinations and attractions. We also intend to utilize social media and digital marketing to reach a wider audience and promote Assam as a world-class tourist destination. We are committed to staying at the forefront of the tourism industry, embracing innovation and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers. Our ultimate goal is to create a positive impact on the lives of our clients, the communities we serve, and the environment we cherish, ensuring that Assam Explore Travels continues to be a trusted and respected name in the tourism landscape of Assam and beyond.</p>', 'Lachit Bagh Hazarika Path, near NEF College Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:50:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1608, 'Hill sides travel Assam Meghalaya', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Hill Sides Travel Assam Meghalaya, situated at House, 21, is more than just a travel agency; it\'s a gateway to experiencing the authentic beauty and cultural richness of Northeast India. Specializing in Assam and Meghalaya, we craft personalized journeys that resonate with the discerning traveler seeking immersive and responsible tourism. In a region often overlooked by mainstream tourism, Hill Sides Travel Assam Meghalaya stands out by showcasing the unique natural wonders, vibrant traditions, and the warm hospitality that define these captivating states. We are deeply rooted in the local community, working closely with indigenous guides, homestays, and businesses to ensure sustainable and enriching travel experiences.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service lies in curating bespoke travel itineraries that cater to diverse interests. Whether it\'s exploring the sprawling tea gardens of Assam, venturing into the living root bridges of Meghalaya, embarking on wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, or delving into the cultural heritage of local tribes, we offer meticulously planned adventures. Unlike generic tour operators, we focus on providing authentic experiences that go beyond superficial sightseeing. Our itineraries often include interactions with local artisans, opportunities to participate in traditional festivals, and stays in eco-friendly accommodations that support local communities. A key unique selling point is our commitment to sustainable tourism practices. We strive to minimize our environmental impact while maximizing the benefits to the local economy. This includes promoting responsible waste management, supporting local businesses, and educating travelers on responsible tourism etiquette. Understanding the specific needs of travelers visiting this region, we provide comprehensive support, including visa assistance, transportation logistics, and access to experienced local guides who possess in-depth knowledge of the area\'s history, culture, and ecology.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Hill Sides Travel Assam Meghalaya, customer experience is paramount. We believe that travel should be a transformative and enriching experience, and we go the extra mile to ensure that every aspect of our clients\' journey is seamless and memorable. Our approach is personalized and attentive, starting with a detailed consultation to understand each traveler\'s interests, preferences, and budget. We then create a customized itinerary that perfectly matches their needs. Our customer service extends beyond itinerary planning. We provide 24/7 support throughout the trip, ensuring that our clients have assistance whenever they need it. We pride ourselves on our responsiveness, attention to detail, and genuine care for our clients\' well-being. Our commitment to building strong relationships with the local community is also reflected in our customer experience. We work closely with local homestays and guesthouses, ensuring that our clients have the opportunity to experience the warmth and hospitality of Assamese and Meghalayan families. By fostering these connections, we create a more authentic and enriching travel experience that benefits both our clients and the local community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Hill Sides Travel Assam Meghalaya envisions becoming the leading provider of sustainable and immersive travel experiences in Northeast India. Our long-term goals include expanding our range of itineraries to encompass more destinations within the region, while remaining committed to our core values of sustainability and community engagement. We plan to invest in training programs for local guides and homestay owners, empowering them to provide even better services to our clients. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly platform that allows travelers to easily plan and book their trips. Furthermore, we recognize the growing importance of responsible tourism and plan to actively promote sustainable travel practices within the region. This includes working with local authorities to develop eco-tourism initiatives, supporting conservation efforts, and educating travelers on the importance of respecting local cultures and environments. By pursuing these goals, Hill Sides Travel Assam Meghalaya strives to not only provide exceptional travel experiences but also contribute to the sustainable development and preservation of the natural and cultural heritage of Assam and Meghalaya. We believe that by working together, we can create a brighter future for tourism in Northeast India, one that benefits both travelers and the local communities we serve.</p>', 'House, 21', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:50:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1609, 'Journey Tours N Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Journey Tours N Travels stands as a dedicated travel solution provider nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam. Located at House No-64, Milanpur 2 No majjid path, Back side of Assam Engineering, we are committed to offering meticulously planned and personalized travel experiences, catering to both domestic and international destinations. Our presence in Milanpur, a vibrant residential area, positions us strategically to serve the local community and beyond with readily accessible travel assistance and a deep understanding of regional preferences. The essence of Journey Tours N Travels lies in crafting memorable journeys that resonate with each traveler, making us a valued partner in their exploration endeavors.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core service offerings encompass a broad spectrum of travel needs. These include meticulously planned tour packages catering to diverse interests, from spiritual journeys and wildlife expeditions across Assam and Northeast India, to adventurous treks in the Himalayas and relaxing beach getaways in South India or Southeast Asia. We also specialize in crafting bespoke international travel itineraries, handling everything from visa assistance and flight bookings to hotel accommodations and curated sightseeing tours. A significant aspect of our business is the provision of reliable and efficient travel arrangements for corporate clients. This includes managing business travel logistics, organizing conferences, and facilitating team-building retreats. A unique selling point is our deep knowledge of Assam and Northeast India, allowing us to offer authentic cultural experiences and access to hidden gems that are often overlooked by mainstream tour operators. We are not just selling travel; we are offering immersion into local culture, connecting travelers with the true essence of the region. These services are meticulously tailored to address the specific needs of the local market, where convenience, personalization, and value for money are highly prized.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Journey Tours N Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We cultivate a client-centric approach, ensuring that every interaction is characterized by professionalism, attentiveness, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. Our team of experienced travel consultants are not merely booking agents; they are travel advisors who take the time to understand each client\'s individual preferences, budget constraints, and travel aspirations. This allows us to curate personalized itineraries that truly reflect their unique needs. We differentiate ourselves through proactive communication, providing timely updates and readily addressing any concerns that may arise before, during, or after the trip. We are actively involved in the local community, sponsoring local events and partnering with local businesses to promote tourism and support the regional economy. Building strong relationships with local hotels, transportation providers, and tour guides allows us to offer exclusive deals and ensure a smooth and seamless travel experience for our clients. This dedication to community engagement not only strengthens our brand reputation but also fosters a sense of trust and loyalty among our local clientele.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Journey Tours N Travels envisions becoming a leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its exceptional customer service, innovative travel solutions, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices. We plan to expand our service offerings to include niche travel segments, such as eco-tourism and wellness retreats, catering to the evolving demands of the modern traveler. Investing in technology is a key priority, as we aim to develop a user-friendly online platform that will streamline the booking process and enhance the overall customer experience. We also intend to strengthen our partnerships with international tour operators, allowing us to offer a wider range of global travel options to our clients. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to not only facilitate travel but to inspire exploration, create lasting memories, and contribute to the sustainable growth of the tourism industry in Assam and beyond. We aim to be more than just a travel agency; we aspire to be a catalyst for enriching experiences and fostering a deeper appreciation for the world around us.', 'House No-64 , Milanpur 2 No majjid path Back side of Assam Engineering', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:50:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1610, 'GAYATRI TRAVELS', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>GAYATRI TRAVELS, a name synonymous with reliable and personalized travel experiences in the heart of Assam, is dedicated to connecting individuals and families with the diverse landscapes and rich cultural heritage of the region and beyond. While the specific address remains confidential, GAYATRI TRAVELS operates as a vital bridge for both inbound and outbound tourism, offering a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to the discerning needs of its clientele. The business holds a significant position in the local ecosystem by facilitating travel for leisure, business, and pilgrimage, contributing to the region’s economic growth through tourism promotion. Its commitment to ethical practices and sustainable tourism sets it apart, reinforcing its reputation as a responsible and community-focused enterprise. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>GAYATRI TRAVELS’ core offerings revolve around providing seamless and memorable travel experiences. The services include, but are not limited to: package tours to popular destinations within Assam and Northeast India (such as Kaziranga National Park, Majuli Island, and Shillong); customized itinerary planning for individuals and groups seeking unique and off-the-beaten-path adventures; reliable transportation services, including car rentals and bus ticketing; comfortable and affordable accommodation bookings, ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxurious resorts; and expert guidance on visa assistance and travel insurance. A unique selling point lies in their deep understanding of the local culture and geography, enabling them to curate authentic experiences that go beyond typical tourist traps. For instance, they can arrange immersive cultural encounters with local tribes, facilitate participation in traditional festivals, and organize eco-tourism activities that directly benefit local communities. This focus on responsible tourism not only enhances the traveller\'s experience but also contributes to the preservation of Assam\'s unique cultural and natural heritage. GAYATRI TRAVELS addresses the local market\'s needs by offering multilingual support (including Assamese, Hindi, and English), flexible payment options, and a strong focus on safety and security. They also cater to the specific needs of pilgrims visiting religious sites in the region, providing specialized tour packages and logistical support. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of GAYATRI TRAVELS\' business philosophy. The team is dedicated to providing personalized attention and proactive support to every client, from the initial inquiry to the final departure. What distinguishes GAYATRI TRAVELS is its unwavering commitment to building long-term relationships with its customers, fostering a sense of trust and reliability. This is achieved through attentive listening to customer needs, providing transparent and honest advice, and going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. The business actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, homestay providers, and tour guides, contributing to the sustainable development of the region. They also participate in local tourism events and initiatives, further strengthening their connection with the community and promoting Assam as a premier travel destination. GAYATRI TRAVELS understands that word-of-mouth is crucial in the local market, and they consistently strive to exceed customer expectations, turning them into loyal advocates for the business. This approach is also supported by maintaining a responsive and helpful online presence, allowing customers to easily access information and make bookings. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, GAYATRI TRAVELS envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, recognized for its commitment to excellence, innovation, and sustainable tourism practices. The business plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized tours focused on specific interests, such as birdwatching, wildlife photography, and tea tourism. It also aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, by developing a user-friendly mobile app for booking and itinerary management. Another key goal is to strengthen its partnerships with local communities, empowering them to participate in the tourism industry and benefit from its growth. GAYATRI TRAVELS recognizes the importance of sustainable tourism and plans to implement environmentally friendly practices in its operations, such as promoting eco-friendly accommodations and minimizing its carbon footprint. Long-term, the business aims to contribute to the preservation of Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage, while providing memorable and enriching travel experiences for its customers. GAYATRI TRAVELS understands that success is not just about profitability but also about making a positive impact on the community and the environment.\n</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:55:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1611, 'Ashok NE Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Ashok NE Travels is a premier transportation and tourism solution provider strategically located to serve the vibrant and burgeoning markets of Northeast India. Rooted in a deep understanding of the region\'s unique geographical landscape and cultural tapestry, Ashok NE Travels has rapidly established itself as a reliable and trusted partner for individuals, families, and businesses seeking seamless travel experiences within Assam and the wider Northeastern states. We are committed to offering safe, comfortable, and efficient transportation solutions that cater to a diverse range of needs, contributing significantly to the region\'s connectivity and tourism sector. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings encompass a comprehensive suite of travel-related services designed to address the specific challenges and opportunities presented by the Northeastern region. These services include: </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><b>Customized Tour Packages:</b> We specialize in crafting bespoke tour packages that showcase the breathtaking beauty and cultural richness of Northeast India. From the lush tea gardens of Assam to the pristine mountains of Arunachal Pradesh, our itineraries are carefully curated to provide immersive and unforgettable experiences, catering to varied interests such as adventure tourism, cultural exploration, and wildlife encounters.</li>\n    <li><b>Vehicle Rental Services:</b> Recognizing the critical need for reliable transportation in a region often characterized by challenging terrain, we maintain a well-maintained fleet of vehicles, ranging from compact cars for individual travelers to spacious SUVs and buses for group excursions. Our vehicles are meticulously inspected and regularly serviced to ensure optimal safety and performance. Drivers are carefully selected, experienced, and knowledgeable about local routes.</li>\n    <li><b>Airport and Railway Transfers:</b> We provide efficient and punctual airport and railway transfer services, ensuring a smooth and stress-free transition for travelers arriving in or departing from the region. Our drivers are adept at navigating local traffic patterns and committed to providing timely and courteous service.</li>\n    <li><b>Corporate Travel Solutions:</b> Ashok NE Travels caters to the unique needs of corporate clients, offering customized transportation solutions for business meetings, conferences, and site visits. We understand the importance of reliability and professionalism in the corporate sector, and we strive to exceed expectations with our efficient and dependable service.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling points lie in our deep understanding of the local context, our commitment to safety and reliability, and our personalized approach to customer service. We differentiate ourselves by focusing on: </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><b>Local Expertise:</b> Our team comprises individuals with in-depth knowledge of the region\'s geography, culture, and travel infrastructure. This allows us to create itineraries and provide transportation solutions that are tailored to the specific needs and preferences of our clients.</li>\n    <li><b>Safety and Reliability:</b> We prioritize the safety and well-being of our passengers above all else. Our vehicles are regularly inspected, and our drivers are trained to adhere to the highest safety standards. We are committed to providing a reliable and dependable service that our clients can trust.</li>\n    <li><b>Personalized Customer Service:</b> We believe in building strong relationships with our clients by providing personalized attention and responsive support. Our customer service team is available to assist with bookings, inquiries, and any special requests that our clients may have.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Ashok NE Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in fostering a welcoming and supportive environment for our clients. Our drivers are not just chauffeurs; they are local guides, offering insights into the region\'s culture, history, and attractions. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and enhance their travel experiences. Furthermore, we are deeply embedded in the local community, partnering with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainable tourism and contribute to the economic development of the region. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, further strengthening our connection with the community we serve.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Ashok NE Travels envisions becoming the leading transportation and tourism provider in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, reliability, and sustainability. We plan to expand our fleet of vehicles, enhance our technological capabilities, and develop new and innovative tour packages that showcase the hidden gems of the region. We aim to leverage technology to streamline our booking processes and enhance the customer experience. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with international tourism operators to attract a wider audience to the region. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable development of the tourism sector in Northeast India, preserving its natural beauty and cultural heritage for future generations.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:55:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
