(1612, 'Kamakshi Tours', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Kamakshi Tours, deeply rooted in the heart of Assam, offers immersive and authentic travel experiences that showcase the region\'s unparalleled natural beauty, vibrant culture, and rich history. More than just a tour operator, Kamakshi Tours acts as a bridge, connecting travellers with the soul of Assam and fostering sustainable tourism that benefits local communities. In a region often overlooked by mainstream tourism, Kamakshi Tours has established itself as a key player, providing curated journeys that reveal the hidden gems and untold stories of this enchanting land.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core service is crafting bespoke and group tours throughout Assam and neighbouring northeastern states. We specialize in experiences ranging from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park, home to the one-horned rhinoceros, to cultural immersions in Majuli, the world’s largest river island and a vibrant hub of Neo-Vaishnavite culture. Birdwatching tours, tea estate visits, and trekking expeditions in the lush hills of Assam are also integral parts of our offering. What sets Kamakshi Tours apart is our commitment to authentic and responsible travel. We partner with local guides and homestays, ensuring that our tours directly benefit the communities we visit and minimize our environmental impact. Furthermore, we meticulously design itineraries that cater to diverse interests and fitness levels, offering both leisurely explorations and adventurous escapades. By focusing on niche markets and personalized service, we effectively meet the growing demand for sustainable and experiential tourism within Assam, providing an alternative to mass-market tourism that often overlooks the unique cultural and environmental sensitivities of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Kamakshi Tours, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in creating a personal connection with each traveller, understanding their individual needs and preferences to craft truly unforgettable experiences. Our dedicated team of travel experts provides personalized pre-trip consultations, ensuring that every aspect of the journey is meticulously planned and tailored to the customer\'s expectations. During the tour, our knowledgeable and passionate local guides act as cultural ambassadors, sharing their insights and stories, fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation for Assam\'s heritage. We maintain open communication throughout the journey, addressing any concerns promptly and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience. Our commitment extends beyond the tour itself. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, supporting local artisans, promoting responsible waste management, and raising awareness about the importance of preserving Assam\'s natural and cultural heritage. This deep connection with the community not only enriches the travel experience for our customers but also strengthens our position as a responsible and ethical business.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Kamakshi Tours envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as the leading provider of sustainable and authentic tourism experiences in Assam. Our future plans include developing new and innovative tour packages that cater to emerging trends such as wellness tourism, agri-tourism, and community-based tourism. We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local communities, empowering them to play a greater role in the tourism industry and ensuring that they benefit directly from its growth. Investing in technology to enhance the booking process, improve communication, and provide real-time information to our customers is another key priority. We are exploring opportunities to develop a user-friendly mobile app that will allow travellers to easily access tour information, make bookings, and connect with our team. Long-term, Kamakshi Tours aspires to become a model for sustainable tourism development in Northeast India, inspiring other businesses to adopt responsible practices and contribute to the preservation of the region\'s unique natural and cultural heritage. We envision a future where tourism in Assam not only generates economic benefits but also empowers local communities, protects the environment, and promotes cultural understanding.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:55:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1613, 'Huge Commercial Tours & Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Huge Commercial Tours & Travels, strategically located at House No, Markandaw Bhavan, 2, Nayanpur Rd, stands as a leading provider of comprehensive travel solutions tailored for businesses and organizations throughout Assam and beyond. We are more than just a travel agency; we are a dedicated partner committed to streamlining corporate travel, enhancing efficiency, and delivering exceptional experiences. Recognizing the unique demands of the commercial sector in Assam, we\'ve built our services around a deep understanding of local business culture, logistical challenges, and the burgeoning opportunities that define the region. Our presence at the heart of Nayanpur Rd allows us to be readily accessible to businesses seeking reliable and efficient travel solutions, making us a vital component of the local business ecosystem.\n<br> <br>\nOur core offerings encompass a wide spectrum of travel-related services meticulously designed to cater to the diverse needs of commercial clients. These services include: Corporate Travel Management – We handle all aspects of business trips, from flight and accommodation bookings to ground transportation and visa assistance, ensuring a seamless and stress-free experience for traveling employees. Group Tours and Incentive Travel – We specialize in organizing group tours for conferences, team-building activities, and corporate retreats, crafting bespoke itineraries that align with specific business objectives and budgets. Customized Vacation Packages – Recognizing the importance of employee well-being, we offer tailored vacation packages designed to reward hard work and foster a healthy work-life balance. Event Management – We provide comprehensive event planning services, including venue selection, logistics coordination, and on-site support, for corporate meetings, seminars, and exhibitions. Our unique selling proposition lies in our ability to combine global travel expertise with a deep understanding of the local Assamese market. We leverage our extensive network of partners and suppliers to secure competitive rates and exclusive deals, ensuring maximum value for our clients. We also differentiate ourselves through our personalized approach, taking the time to understand each client\'s unique requirements and crafting solutions that perfectly match their needs. Our services directly address the market need for reliable, efficient, and cost-effective travel solutions that empower businesses to focus on their core operations.\n<br> <br>\nAt Huge Commercial Tours & Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We are committed to providing exceptional service at every touchpoint, from the initial inquiry to the completion of the trip. Our dedicated team of travel professionals is readily available to provide expert advice, personalized assistance, and prompt support, ensuring a seamless and stress-free experience for our clients. We understand that travel plans can change unexpectedly, which is why we offer flexible booking options and responsive customer service to accommodate unforeseen circumstances. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to building long-term relationships with our clients, becoming a trusted partner in their success. We actively engage with the local community through sponsorships, partnerships, and participation in local events, demonstrating our commitment to the region\'s growth and development. We believe in going above and beyond to exceed expectations and create lasting memories for our clients. Our local presence enables us to understand the specific nuances of the region, allowing us to provide informed recommendations and personalized experiences that truly resonate with our customers.\n<br> <br>\nLooking ahead, Huge Commercial Tours & Travels envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying our position as the leading provider of commercial travel solutions in Assam. We plan to continuously invest in technology and innovation to enhance our service offerings and streamline our operations, further improving the customer experience. We aim to expand our network of partners and suppliers, both locally and internationally, to provide our clients with even more competitive rates and exclusive deals. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to diversify our services, catering to emerging trends in the travel industry and addressing unmet needs in the market. We recognize the growing importance of sustainable and responsible tourism and are committed to incorporating environmentally friendly practices into our business operations. Our long-term goal is to become a nationally recognized brand, synonymous with excellence in commercial travel management, while remaining deeply rooted in the local community and contributing to the economic prosperity of Assam. We strive to empower businesses to thrive by providing them with the travel solutions they need to succeed in today\'s competitive global marketplace.\n</p>', 'House No, Markandaw Bhavan, 2, Nayanpur Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:55:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1614, 'ABG Travels', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'ABG Travels, strategically located in SB Complex on RG Baruah Rd, opposite Dispur Dhaba, serves as a premier travel solutions provider deeply rooted within the Assam business landscape. More than just a travel agency, ABG Travels is committed to crafting personalized and seamless travel experiences that cater to the diverse needs of individuals, families, and corporate clients across the region. We distinguish ourselves through a combination of local expertise, a dedication to exceptional customer service, and a comprehensive understanding of the unique travel requirements within Assam and beyond. ABG Travels aspires to be the trusted partner for all travel needs, facilitating exploration, business connections, and unforgettable journeys.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings encompass a wide spectrum of travel services, designed to address every facet of the journey. We specialize in meticulously planned tour packages showcasing the breathtaking beauty of Assam and Northeast India. These packages include carefully selected accommodations, transportation logistics, guided tours to historical sites and natural wonders, and immersive cultural experiences. Beyond regional tourism, ABG Travels provides international travel planning assistance, including flight bookings, visa application support, hotel reservations, and itinerary development. For corporate clients, we offer comprehensive travel management solutions that optimize travel budgets, streamline booking processes, and ensure efficient and comfortable business travel. A unique selling point lies in our specialized services for organizing pilgrimage tours to various religious sites across India, catering to the spiritual travel needs of the local community. Our commitment to providing customized solutions that prioritize comfort, safety, and cultural sensitivity sets us apart in a competitive market. Our services directly address the local market needs by providing accessible, reliable, and culturally relevant travel solutions that empower individuals and businesses to explore the world with confidence.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt ABG Travels, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by consistently exceeding their expectations. Our approach to customer service is rooted in personalized attention, responsiveness, and a proactive approach to problem-solving. We strive to understand each client\'s unique travel goals and preferences, tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. We go the extra mile to ensure a smooth and hassle-free travel experience, providing 24/7 support and assistance throughout the journey. What makes us stand out is our deep connection with the local community. We actively participate in local events, support regional initiatives, and prioritize partnerships with local businesses. This commitment to community involvement allows us to gain valuable insights into the needs of our customers and build trust within the region. We actively solicit feedback from our clients and use their suggestions to continuously improve our services and enhance the overall customer experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, ABG Travels envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam travel market and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our range of specialized tour packages to cater to emerging travel trends, such as eco-tourism and adventure travel. We aim to leverage technology to enhance our online presence and offer a more seamless booking experience for our clients. This includes developing a user-friendly website and mobile app that allows customers to easily browse our offerings, book travel arrangements, and access real-time travel information. We also plan to forge strategic partnerships with airlines, hotels, and other travel providers to offer competitive pricing and exclusive deals to our customers. Our long-term goals include establishing ABG Travels as a leading travel solutions provider in Northeast India, recognized for our commitment to excellence, innovation, and community engagement. We are dedicated to contributing to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam by promoting sustainable travel practices and showcasing the region\'s rich cultural heritage to the world. We aim to expand our team with skilled travel professionals and invest in training programs to ensure that we continue to provide the highest level of service to our clients.', 'SB Complex, RG Baruah Rd, opposite Dispur Dhaba', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 13:55:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1615, 'Ganesha Tours and Travels Agency', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<h1>Ganesha Tours and Travels Agency: Your Gateway to Assam and Beyond</h1>\n\nGanesha Tours and Travels Agency, strategically located on Nayanpur Rd, stands as a premier provider of comprehensive travel solutions, deeply rooted in the rich cultural tapestry of Assam. More than just a travel agency, we are curators of experiences, crafting journeys that resonate with the diverse landscapes, vibrant traditions, and warm hospitality that define this corner of India. In a region known for its burgeoning tourism sector and the increasing demand for personalized travel experiences, Ganesha Tours and Travels Agency offers a unique blend of local expertise, global standards, and a commitment to sustainable tourism practices, solidifying our position as a trusted partner for both domestic and international travelers. <br> <br>\n\nOur commitment to ethical and responsible tourism sets us apart. We actively collaborate with local communities, ensuring that our tours contribute positively to their economic well-being and cultural preservation. This dedication not only enhances the authenticity of our offerings but also fosters a sense of respect and understanding between visitors and the local population. We are dedicated to showcasing the beauty of Assam while minimizing our environmental footprint, promoting eco-friendly practices and supporting conservation efforts.\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Tailored Journeys for Every Traveler</h2>\n\nGanesha Tours and Travels Agency offers a comprehensive suite of travel services designed to cater to a wide range of needs and preferences. Our core offerings include:\n\n*   **Customized Tour Packages:** We specialize in creating bespoke itineraries that reflect the individual interests and budgets of our clients. Whether it\'s exploring the tea gardens of Assam, embarking on a wildlife safari in Kaziranga National Park, discovering the ancient temples of Hajo, or experiencing the vibrant Bihu festival, we design journeys that are both immersive and unforgettable.\n\n*   **Transportation Services:** We provide a range of transportation options, from comfortable car rentals to reliable bus services, ensuring seamless travel throughout Assam and beyond. Our vehicles are well-maintained, and our drivers are experienced and knowledgeable about the region.\n\n*   **Accommodation Booking:** We have established strong partnerships with a diverse network of hotels, guesthouses, and homestays, allowing us to offer a wide range of accommodation options to suit every taste and budget. We carefully select our partner establishments based on their quality, service, and commitment to sustainable practices.\n\n*   **Flight and Train Ticketing:** We offer convenient and efficient flight and train ticketing services, simplifying the travel planning process for our clients. Our team stays up-to-date on the latest travel regulations and airline promotions, ensuring that our clients receive the best possible fares and travel arrangements.\n\n*   **Adventure Tourism:** For the adventurous souls, we curate trekking expeditions through the breathtaking Himalayan foothills, river rafting experiences on the Brahmaputra, and wildlife encounters in the region\'s national parks. Our adventure tours are led by experienced guides who prioritize safety and environmental responsibility.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur unique selling point lies in our deep understanding of the local landscape and culture. We don\'t just offer tours; we offer authentic experiences that connect travelers with the heart and soul of Assam. Our local guides are passionate about sharing their knowledge and insights, providing a unique perspective that cannot be found in guidebooks or online resources. We also emphasize responsible and sustainable tourism practices, ensuring that our tours benefit the local communities and minimize our environmental impact. We are committed to showcasing the beauty of Assam while preserving its natural and cultural heritage for future generations.\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Personalized Service and Community Connection</h2>\n\nAt Ganesha Tours and Travels Agency, customer satisfaction is our top priority. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients by providing personalized service, attention to detail, and a genuine commitment to exceeding their expectations. From the initial consultation to the final departure, we strive to make every step of the travel planning process seamless and enjoyable. <br> <br>\n\nOur approach to customer service is built on empathy, understanding, and responsiveness. We take the time to listen to our clients\' needs and preferences, tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. Our team is available 24/7 to answer questions, provide assistance, and address any concerns that may arise during their travels. We are committed to going the extra mile to ensure that our clients have a safe, comfortable, and memorable experience. <br> <br>\n\nWe actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local artisans, promoting traditional crafts, and participating in community events. We also partner with local organizations to promote sustainable tourism practices and environmental conservation. We believe that by giving back to the community, we can contribute to its long-term well-being and create a more positive and enriching experience for our clients.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Sustainable Growth</h2>\n\nGanesha Tours and Travels Agency envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Assam, renowned for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include specialized tours focused on specific interests, such as bird watching, tea tourism, and cultural immersion. We also plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows clients to easily book tours, access travel information, and connect with our team. <br> <br>\n\nWe are committed to fostering sustainable growth by investing in our employees, expanding our network of local partners, and promoting responsible tourism practices. We believe that by focusing on quality, innovation, and sustainability, we can create long-term value for our clients, our employees, and the community. Our long-term goal is to become a model for responsible tourism in Assam, demonstrating that it is possible to operate a successful business while also protecting the environment and supporting local communities. We aspire to leave a positive legacy by showcasing the beauty of Assam to the world while preserving its natural and cultural heritage for future generations.\n<br> <br>\nOur focus will remain on providing exceptional travel experiences, contributing to the economic growth of the region, and promoting responsible tourism practices that benefit both travelers and the local community.', 'Nayanpur Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:00:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1616, 'Amar Jyoti Tours and Travel - Expert Travel Agency for Railway, Flight, and Bus Ticket Booking', 'Travel Agencies', '', 'Amar Jyoti Tours and Travel: Your Gateway to Seamless Travel in Assam\n\nAmar Jyoti Tours and Travel stands as a reliable and expert travel agency located on M. E. Road, conveniently near Maa Kali Hotel, a landmark familiar to many in the region. We specialize in providing comprehensive booking services for railway, flight, and bus tickets, catering to the diverse travel needs of the local community and beyond. In a region where efficient and accessible transportation is crucial, Amar Jyoti Tours and Travel fills a significant gap by simplifying the often complex process of travel planning and ticketing. We are more than just a booking agency; we are a trusted partner in facilitating journeys, connecting people, and enabling exploration. Our commitment to exceptional service and deep understanding of the local travel landscape sets us apart, making us a vital resource for both leisure and business travelers in Assam.\n<br> <br>\nOur Core Services: Simplifying Your Travel Experience\n\nAt Amar Jyoti Tours and Travel, we offer a comprehensive suite of services designed to streamline your travel arrangements. Our primary focus is on providing hassle-free booking for all major modes of transportation:\n\n*   **Railway Ticket Booking:** We handle all aspects of train travel, from initial inquiry and seat availability checks to final ticket confirmation and printing. Our expertise extends to navigating complex railway schedules, understanding fare structures, and securing tatkal tickets when necessary. We aim to make train travel, a widely popular mode of transport in India, as convenient and stress-free as possible.\n\n*   **Flight Ticket Booking:** Whether it\'s domestic or international travel, we provide access to a wide range of airlines and flight options. We assist customers in finding the most cost-effective and convenient flights based on their preferences, handling everything from fare comparisons to baggage allowance information. We stay updated on the latest flight deals and promotions to offer our customers the best possible value.\n\n*   **Bus Ticket Booking:** Recognizing the importance of bus travel, especially for intra-state and regional journeys, we offer booking services for various bus operators. We ensure access to reliable bus schedules, seat availability, and convenient departure points, making bus travel a viable and comfortable option for our customers.\n\nOur unique selling point lies in our personalized service and deep understanding of the local context. We go beyond simply booking tickets; we provide valuable travel advice, assist with itinerary planning, and offer solutions to unexpected travel challenges. We understand the specific needs of our local clientele, including language preferences, cultural nuances, and common travel routes within Assam and the Northeast region. This localized expertise allows us to provide a level of service that larger, impersonal online booking platforms cannot match. By offering a blend of traditional agency service with modern booking capabilities, we cater to a wide range of customers, from those comfortable with technology to those who prefer a more personal touch.\n<br> <br>\nUnwavering Commitment to Customer Satisfaction\n\nCustomer satisfaction is at the heart of everything we do at Amar Jyoti Tours and Travel. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers by providing exceptional service and personalized attention. Our team of experienced travel professionals is dedicated to understanding each customer\'s unique needs and preferences, offering tailored solutions and expert guidance. We prioritize clear communication, transparency, and responsiveness, ensuring that our customers are always informed and supported throughout their travel journey.\n\nWhat truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We understand the importance of building trust and fostering goodwill within our locality. We actively engage with local organizations and participate in community events, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and supportive member of the community. We believe in providing a welcoming and accessible service for everyone, regardless of their travel experience or background. Our location near Maa Kali Hotel, a well-known landmark, makes us easily accessible to locals and visitors alike. We strive to create a friendly and supportive environment where customers feel comfortable seeking assistance and advice, making Amar Jyoti Tours and Travel more than just a business; it\'s a trusted neighbor.\n<br> <br>\nLooking Ahead: A Vision for Growth and Expansion\n\nAmar Jyoti Tours and Travel envisions a future where we continue to be the preferred travel partner for individuals and businesses in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to include customized tour packages, hotel bookings, and travel insurance, further simplifying the travel planning process for our customers. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance our booking platform and online presence, making our services even more accessible and convenient.\n\nWe are committed to staying abreast of the latest trends and developments in the travel industry, ensuring that we can continue to provide our customers with the best possible service. We recognize the growing demand for sustainable and responsible tourism and plan to incorporate eco-friendly travel options into our offerings. Our long-term goal is to establish Amar Jyoti Tours and Travel as a leading travel agency in the region, known for its expertise, reliability, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, we can achieve our ambitious goals and continue to serve the travel needs of our community for years to come. We envision expanding to other locations within Assam to spread our reach and support local travel across the state.', 'M. E. Road, near Maa Kali Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:00:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1617, 'DREAM DESTINATIONS', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Dream Destinations, situated at NO-5, Sankar Madhab Path, House NO-1, Byelane, Nayanpur Rd, is an emerging travel and tourism company dedicated to crafting unforgettable experiences tailored to the discerning traveler, particularly within and beyond the Assam region. Understanding the evolving needs and aspirations of modern explorers, Dream Destinations stands apart by offering a blend of personalized service, deep local knowledge, and a commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism. We aspire to be more than just a travel agency; we aim to be trusted partners in realizing our clients\' travel dreams, curating journeys that resonate with their individual preferences and create lasting memories.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Dream Destinations lies a comprehensive suite of services designed to cater to diverse travel needs. Our core offerings include: meticulously planned domestic and international tour packages, customized itinerary design, hotel and resort bookings, flight and transportation arrangements, visa assistance, and comprehensive travel insurance solutions. We specialize in crafting unique experiences that showcase the rich cultural heritage, breathtaking landscapes, and diverse wildlife of Assam and Northeast India. This includes curated tea garden tours, wildlife safaris in renowned national parks, immersive cultural experiences with local communities, and adventure treks through the region\'s stunning hills and valleys. What truly sets us apart is our unwavering commitment to personalization. We believe that every traveler is unique, and their journey should reflect their individual interests and preferences. Our experienced travel consultants work closely with each client to understand their desires, budget, and travel style, crafting bespoke itineraries that exceed their expectations. We also place a strong emphasis on responsible tourism practices, partnering with local communities and promoting eco-friendly initiatives to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to the sustainable development of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Dream Destinations recognizes that exceptional customer service is paramount to building lasting relationships and fostering customer loyalty. Our approach is centered on providing personalized attention, proactive communication, and unwavering support throughout the entire travel journey. From the initial consultation to the post-trip follow-up, we strive to exceed expectations at every touchpoint. Our knowledgeable and friendly staff are passionate about travel and dedicated to providing expert advice and guidance. We are committed to understanding our customers\' needs and providing tailored solutions that meet their specific requirements. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community by supporting local artisans, promoting cultural events, and contributing to conservation efforts. We believe that by fostering strong relationships with the local community, we can provide our clients with a more authentic and enriching travel experience. Our commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism also resonates deeply with the local community, fostering trust and mutual respect.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Dream Destinations envisions itself as a leading travel and tourism company in the Assam region, known for its innovative approach, exceptional customer service, and commitment to sustainable tourism practices. Our future plans include expanding our range of services to include specialized tours focusing on niche interests such as bird watching, photography, and culinary tourism. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, developing a user-friendly online platform that allows customers to easily browse our tour packages, customize their itineraries, and book their travel arrangements. Strategic partnerships with local businesses, including hotels, restaurants, and transportation providers, are also a key focus, enabling us to offer our clients competitive prices and access to exclusive experiences. Ultimately, Dream Destinations is committed to contributing to the growth of the tourism industry in Assam, creating opportunities for local communities and showcasing the region\'s unique beauty and culture to the world. Our long-term goal is to be synonymous with responsible and enriching travel experiences in and beyond the Northeast, setting a benchmark for quality and sustainability in the industry.</p>', 'NO-5, SANKAR MADHAB PATH, HOUSE NO-1, BYELANE, Nayanpur Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:00:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1618, 'Jumbo Safari Best Car Hire,Tempo Traveller Hire, Innova Crysta hire, Ertiga Hire', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Jumbo Safari: Your Trusted Partner for Car Rental Solutions in Assam</p>\n\n<p>Jumbo Safari stands as a premier car rental service provider in Assam, offering a comprehensive fleet designed to cater to a diverse range of transportation needs. We specialize in providing reliable, comfortable, and affordable car hire options, including popular models such as Tempo Travellers, Innova Crystas, and Ertigas. Our commitment to exceptional service and well-maintained vehicles has established us as a preferred choice for both local residents and visitors exploring the beauty and vibrancy of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Jumbo Safari, we understand the unique demands of travel in Assam, from navigating bustling city streets to embarking on adventurous journeys through the region\'s scenic landscapes. Our fleet is carefully selected to provide optimal performance, safety, and comfort, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable travel experience. We distinguish ourselves through our dedication to customer satisfaction, transparent pricing, and a genuine passion for showcasing the wonders of Assam to our clients.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core services revolve around providing versatile and reliable vehicle rental options. We offer:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><b>Tempo Traveller Hire:</b> Ideal for group travel, family outings, and corporate events, our Tempo Travellers provide ample space and comfortable seating, ensuring a relaxed journey for all passengers.</li>\n  <li><b>Innova Crysta Hire:</b> Renowned for its luxurious interiors, smooth ride, and spaciousness, the Innova Crysta is a perfect choice for comfortable long-distance travel and executive transportation.</li>\n  <li><b>Ertiga Hire:</b> A versatile and fuel-efficient option, the Ertiga offers a practical solution for smaller groups or families seeking a comfortable and economical ride for city commutes or weekend getaways.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling points include our commitment to maintaining a meticulously maintained fleet, providing competitive and transparent pricing with no hidden charges, and offering flexible rental packages tailored to individual needs. Unlike some rental services, we prioritize clear communication, ensuring our clients are fully informed about all aspects of their rental agreement. We also offer options for chauffeur-driven services, providing added convenience and peace of mind for those unfamiliar with local routes.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our services directly address the growing demand for reliable and affordable transportation solutions in Assam. We cater to tourists seeking to explore the region\'s diverse attractions, including national parks, tea gardens, and historical sites. We also serve the needs of local businesses and residents requiring transportation for corporate events, family gatherings, or daily commutes. By offering a range of vehicle options and flexible rental terms, we ensure our services are accessible to a wide spectrum of clients.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of our business philosophy. We strive to create a positive and memorable experience for every client, from the initial inquiry to the return of the vehicle. Our customer service team is dedicated to providing prompt, courteous, and helpful assistance, addressing any questions or concerns with efficiency and professionalism. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, reliability, and a genuine commitment to exceeding their expectations.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We stand out through our personalized approach to customer service. We take the time to understand each client\'s specific needs and preferences, recommending the most suitable vehicle and rental package to ensure a seamless and enjoyable experience. We also actively seek feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and address any areas for improvement. We understand that happy customers are our best advocates, and we are committed to earning their loyalty through exceptional service.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We are actively involved in the local community, supporting local businesses and organizations whenever possible. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we are committed to contributing to the economic and social well-being of Assam. We also strive to promote responsible tourism, encouraging our clients to explore the region in a sustainable and environmentally conscious manner.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Jumbo Safari envisions becoming the leading car rental service provider in Assam, recognized for its unwavering commitment to quality, reliability, and customer satisfaction. We plan to expand our fleet to include a wider range of vehicle options, catering to even more diverse transportation needs. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance our services, offering online booking platforms, GPS tracking, and other innovative solutions to improve the overall customer experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include establishing strategic partnerships with local hotels, travel agencies, and businesses to further expand our reach and enhance our service offerings. We also plan to invest in employee training and development, ensuring our team remains knowledgeable, skilled, and committed to providing exceptional service. We are confident that by staying true to our core values and embracing innovation, Jumbo Safari will continue to thrive and contribute to the growth of the tourism and transportation sectors in Assam.</p>', '·', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:00:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1619, 'Rocky North East travel agency', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Rocky North East Travel Agency, strategically located on Idgah Rd in the heart of Assam, is a premier travel provider dedicated to crafting authentic and enriching experiences throughout the North East region of India. More than just a booking service, we are passionate storytellers, connecting travelers with the vibrant culture, breathtaking landscapes, and hidden gems that define this unique corner of the world. We distinguish ourselves by fostering deep relationships with local communities, ensuring sustainable tourism practices, and providing personalized itineraries that cater to diverse interests and budgets. In a market increasingly saturated with generic travel options, Rocky North East Travel Agency offers a truly immersive and responsible approach to exploring the North East.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a wide range of travel solutions designed to meet the specific needs of both domestic and international visitors. We specialize in curated tour packages, highlighting the diverse offerings of Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Meghalaya, Manipur, Mizoram, Nagaland, and Tripura. These packages range from wildlife safaris in Kaziranga National Park and cultural immersions in tribal villages to adventurous treks in the Himalayas and spiritual journeys to ancient monasteries. Beyond pre-designed packages, we excel at creating bespoke itineraries, meticulously tailored to individual preferences, time constraints, and budgetary considerations. This personalized approach allows us to cater to everyone, from solo backpackers seeking adventure to families desiring a comfortable and enriching vacation. In addition, we offer essential travel services such as flight and train ticketing, hotel reservations (ranging from budget-friendly guesthouses to luxury resorts), car rentals with experienced local drivers, and permit assistance for restricted areas. Our unique selling point lies in our intimate knowledge of the region, coupled with our commitment to ethical and sustainable tourism. We actively promote local businesses and initiatives, ensuring that tourism benefits the communities we visit, preserving their cultural heritage and protecting the environment. This commitment is reflected in our partnerships with local guides, homestays, and artisans, allowing our clients to experience the North East in a truly authentic and meaningful way. We also provide comprehensive travel insurance options for a worry-free travel experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Rocky North East Travel Agency, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe that travel is a deeply personal experience, and we strive to build lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and genuine care. Our approach to customer service is proactive and personalized, beginning with the initial inquiry and continuing throughout the entire journey. We have a team of dedicated travel experts who possess in-depth knowledge of the North East and are passionate about sharing their expertise with our clients. They are readily available to answer questions, provide recommendations, and address any concerns that may arise. We emphasize clear and open communication, ensuring that our clients are fully informed and confident in their travel arrangements. We actively solicit feedback from our clients after their trips, using their insights to continuously improve our services and offerings. Beyond individual customer service, we actively engage with the local community. We regularly participate in local events and festivals, showcasing the rich culture and traditions of the North East. We also support local charities and initiatives that promote sustainable tourism and community development. Our commitment to the community extends beyond our business operations, reflecting our deep connection to the region and our desire to contribute to its well-being. We also organize travel awareness programs for the local communities to educate them about sustainable tourism practices.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Rocky North East Travel Agency envisions a future where sustainable and responsible tourism thrives throughout the North East, benefiting both travelers and local communities. Our long-term goals include expanding our reach within the region, developing new and innovative tour packages, and further strengthening our partnerships with local stakeholders. We plan to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, streamlining the booking process and providing real-time information and support. We aim to create a user-friendly mobile app that allows travelers to access their itineraries, communicate with our team, and discover hidden gems along their journey. We are also committed to promoting eco-friendly travel practices, encouraging our clients to minimize their environmental impact and support conservation efforts. This includes offering carbon offsetting options and promoting responsible wildlife tourism. Furthermore, we plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they remain at the forefront of travel trends and best practices. We aspire to become the leading travel agency in the North East, recognized for our commitment to quality, sustainability, and customer satisfaction. We believe that by providing exceptional travel experiences and fostering a deep connection between travelers and the region, we can contribute to the economic growth and cultural preservation of the North East for generations to come. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our services to include adventure tourism activities like paragliding and white-water rafting, further enriching the travel experience for our clients.</p>', 'Idgah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:00:41', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1620, 'Fufunia', 'Travel Agencies', '', '<p>Fufunia, located at House no 18, Shakuntala Path, is rapidly establishing itself as a dynamic and community-focused enterprise within the vibrant business ecosystem of Assam. More than just a business, Fufunia represents a commitment to delivering quality and fostering genuine connections within the local community. Understanding the nuances of the Assam market is at the heart of Fufunia’s operations, allowing it to offer tailored solutions that resonate with the specific needs and preferences of its clientele. The business\'s core values revolve around integrity, customer satisfaction, and a deep respect for the rich cultural heritage of the region. It aims to be more than just a service provider; Fufunia aspires to be a trusted partner in the growth and prosperity of the community it serves.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Fufunia\'s primary focus lies in providing high-quality, locally-sourced handicraft products. This includes a diverse range of handwoven textiles, traditional Assamese jewelry, intricately carved wooden artifacts, and other unique artisanal creations. Each product is carefully selected and curated, reflecting the skill and artistry of local artisans. A key differentiator for Fufunia is its commitment to fair trade practices, ensuring that the artisans receive a just price for their work, thereby supporting sustainable livelihoods within the community. Furthermore, Fufunia offers a platform for these artisans to showcase their talents to a wider audience, both locally and potentially nationally. In addition to its product offerings, Fufunia also provides bespoke gifting services, allowing customers to create personalized packages that capture the essence of Assam\'s cultural richness. This service caters to both individual customers seeking unique gifts and corporate clients looking for distinctive promotional items or employee appreciation gifts.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Fufunia, customer experience is paramount. The business strives to create a warm, welcoming, and personalized experience for every customer. The staff are not only knowledgeable about the products and their origins but are also passionate about sharing the stories behind them. This approach transforms a simple transaction into a meaningful interaction. Fufunia actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as participating in local festivals and markets, hosting workshops on traditional crafts, and collaborating with local schools and community organizations. These efforts are aimed at fostering a sense of belonging and strengthening ties within the community. Fufunia understands that its success is intertwined with the well-being of the community it serves, and it is committed to giving back and contributing to the social and economic development of the region. They also offer convenient online ordering and local delivery, ensuring accessibility for a broader customer base.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Fufunia envisions expanding its reach while remaining deeply rooted in its core values. The business plans to explore opportunities for online sales and distribution, enabling it to reach customers beyond the immediate locality. This includes developing a user-friendly e-commerce platform that showcases the products and tells the stories of the artisans. Fufunia also aims to diversify its product offerings while staying true to its focus on locally-sourced, handcrafted items. This could involve partnering with new artisans and exploring new product categories that reflect the evolving tastes and preferences of the market. Furthermore, Fufunia is committed to investing in training and development programs for local artisans, helping them to enhance their skills and improve their livelihoods. Long-term, Fufunia aspires to become a recognized and respected brand that is synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement within the Assam business landscape. The ultimate goal is to create a sustainable business that not only generates profit but also makes a positive impact on the lives of the people it serves.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Fufunia is dedicated to providing excellent customer service. This is achieved through a well-trained and dedicated team that is passionate about helping customers find the perfect product or service. They focus on building lasting relationships with customers, creating a loyal customer base that returns time and time again. By continuing to adapt to the changing needs of the market, and by remaining committed to its core values, Fufunia is well-positioned to achieve its long-term goals and contribute to the growth and prosperity of the Assam community.</p>', 'House no 18, Shakuntala Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, '10 AM - 6 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:05:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
