(1631, 'Bhartiya Jalpan', 'Restaurants', '', 'Bhartiya Jalpan, a vibrant culinary destination nestled at STORE NO 2 22, URBAN CITY COMPLEX in the heart of Assam, offers an authentic taste of India with a special emphasis on traditional Assamese flavors. More than just a restaurant, Bhartiya Jalpan is a cultural experience, providing a welcoming space for the community to gather and enjoy meticulously prepared dishes inspired by generations of culinary heritage. We are committed to showcasing the rich diversity of Indian cuisine while highlighting the unique and often overlooked culinary treasures of Assam, contributing to the local economy and preserving cultural traditions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around providing a diverse menu of high-quality, freshly prepared Indian and Assamese cuisine. From classic favorites like flavorful biryanis and creamy butter chicken to regional specialties like Masor Tenga (sour fish curry) and Khar (an alkaline dish), we cater to a wide range of palates. We carefully source our ingredients, prioritizing locally grown produce and spices to ensure freshness and support local farmers. Beyond our main menu, we also offer a variety of traditional Assamese \"jolpan\" (snacks) throughout the day, including pitha (rice cakes), laru (sweet balls), and other delectable treats perfect for a quick bite or a leisurely afternoon tea.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Bhartiya Jalpan apart is our unwavering commitment to authenticity and quality. We use traditional cooking methods and recipes passed down through generations to create dishes that are bursting with flavor. Our unique selling point is our focus on showcasing the diverse culinary landscape of Assam, offering a taste of the region that is often difficult to find elsewhere. We believe that food is more than just sustenance; it\'s a connection to our culture and heritage. Therefore, we strive to create a dining experience that is both delicious and educational, introducing our customers to the rich and diverse flavors of Assam. Our menu is designed to meet the needs of the local market, offering affordable options for everyday meals as well as more elaborate dishes for special occasions. We also provide catering services for events of all sizes, bringing the taste of Bhartiya Jalpan to your doorstep.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Bhartiya Jalpan, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our friendly and attentive staff is dedicated to providing a warm and welcoming atmosphere for every guest. We strive to create a personal connection with each customer, taking the time to understand their preferences and provide recommendations. We value feedback and are constantly looking for ways to improve our service and offerings. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events and festivals, sponsoring local initiatives, and promoting Assamese culture through our food and atmosphere. Our restaurant is designed to be a comfortable and inviting space where people can relax, connect with friends and family, and enjoy a delicious meal. We believe that Bhartiya Jalpan is more than just a restaurant; it\'s a gathering place for the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Bhartiya Jalpan envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in the region, recognized for its commitment to authenticity, quality, and customer service. We plan to expand our menu to include even more regional specialties from Assam and other parts of India, further showcasing the diversity of Indian cuisine. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local farmers and artisans to promote sustainable practices and support the local economy. Long-term, we aspire to open additional locations throughout Assam and beyond, bringing the taste of Bhartiya Jalpan to a wider audience. We are committed to preserving and promoting Assamese culinary traditions for generations to come, ensuring that the unique flavors of the region are celebrated and enjoyed by all. Our vision is to be more than just a restaurant; we want to be a cultural ambassador, sharing the rich heritage of Assam with the world.', 'STORE NO 2 22, URBAN CITY COMPLEX', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:15:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1632, 'Terra Mayaa', 'Restaurants', '', 'Terra Mayaa, nestled at 6th, Anil Plaza - II, 2, GS Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a dynamic business enterprise committed to providing innovative and tailored solutions within the evolving landscape of Assam’s commercial sector. More than just a business address, Terra Mayaa represents a forward-thinking approach to meeting the specific needs and aspirations of its community. The name itself, evoking a sense of grounding (“Terra”) and possibility (“Mayaa”), reflects the company\'s core values: stability, creativity, and a commitment to fostering lasting relationships. Located in a bustling commercial hub, Terra Mayaa stands out by offering a unique blend of specialized services designed to empower local businesses and individuals alike.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Terra Mayaa\'s offerings lie a suite of integrated services primarily focused on marketing solutions and business consulting. Specifically, the company specializes in crafting targeted digital marketing campaigns designed to enhance brand visibility and drive customer engagement for businesses throughout Assam. This includes social media management, search engine optimization (SEO), content creation, and email marketing, all tailored to the specific cultural nuances and market dynamics of the region. Recognizing the increasing importance of online presence in today’s economy, Terra Mayaa equips local businesses with the tools and strategies needed to thrive in the digital realm. Beyond marketing, Terra Mayaa also offers strategic business consulting services, providing guidance on everything from business plan development to operational efficiency improvements. This holistic approach ensures clients receive comprehensive support to navigate the complexities of the modern business world. The unique selling point lies in the company\'s localized expertise, understanding the specific challenges and opportunities presented by the Assamese market, allowing them to create solutions that truly resonate with the target audience and drive tangible results.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nTerra Mayaa prioritizes building strong, lasting relationships with its clients. Customer service is not just a department; it\'s a company-wide philosophy. The team is dedicated to providing personalized attention and responsive support, ensuring every client feels valued and understood. This commitment extends beyond professional interactions, as Terra Mayaa actively seeks to connect with the local community through various initiatives. This involves participating in local events, supporting local charities, and fostering partnerships with other businesses in the area. By actively engaging with the community, Terra Mayaa fosters a sense of trust and belonging, solidifying its reputation as a responsible and engaged corporate citizen. They operate under the principle that a thriving community benefits everyone, and they are committed to playing a positive role in the growth and prosperity of Assam. The team at Terra Mayaa prides itself on its accessibility and responsiveness, understanding that clear communication and proactive problem-solving are essential for building strong client relationships.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Terra Mayaa envisions itself as a leading catalyst for business growth and innovation in Assam. The company plans to expand its service offerings to include specialized training programs designed to equip local talent with the skills needed to succeed in the digital economy. There are also explorations into offering e-commerce solutions to empower traditional businesses to transition into online retail. Furthermore, Terra Mayaa aims to become a hub for networking and collaboration, fostering connections between businesses and entrepreneurs across the region. By constantly adapting and evolving to meet the changing needs of the market, Terra Mayaa is committed to driving economic growth and creating opportunities for the people of Assam. The long-term goal is to establish Terra Mayaa as a trusted and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement, contributing significantly to the overall prosperity and development of the region.', '6th, Anil Plaza - II, 2, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:15:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1633, 'Michinga Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', 'Michinga Restaurant: A Taste of Assam on Jayanagar Road\n\nMichinga Restaurant, nestled at 4RH4+MFR, 175, Jayanagar Rd, is more than just a dining establishment; it\'s an immersive experience into the heart of Assam\'s rich culinary heritage. Situated in a vibrant local area, Michinga aims to be a cornerstone of the community, offering authentic Assamese cuisine with a modern touch. We strive to provide a welcoming atmosphere where both locals and visitors can savor the unique flavors of the region, while enjoying exceptional service and a memorable dining experience. In the diverse Assam business landscape, Michinga stands out by staying true to its roots, celebrating regional ingredients and traditional cooking methods.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Michinga Restaurant lies a commitment to delivering an unparalleled culinary journey through Assam. Our core offerings center around a curated menu showcasing the region\'s signature dishes. From the comforting warmth of Khar, a traditional alkaline dish, to the flavorful spice of Masor Tenga (sour fish curry) and the aromatic delicacy of Duck Roast, each dish is crafted with meticulous attention to detail and the freshest locally sourced ingredients. We offer a diverse range of options, including vegetarian and non-vegetarian dishes, ensuring there’s something to delight every palate.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly sets Michinga apart is our unwavering dedication to authenticity and quality. We collaborate directly with local farmers and producers to obtain the finest ingredients, ensuring that every dish reflects the true flavors of Assam. Our chefs, deeply knowledgeable in regional culinary traditions, skillfully blend traditional recipes with modern techniques to create dishes that are both familiar and innovative. Furthermore, we offer unique Assamese beverages, including rice beer (locally sourced and prepared) and traditional teas, complementing the dining experience. Our competitive advantage lies in our commitment to providing an authentic taste of Assam that cannot be easily replicated elsewhere in the area.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Michinga Restaurant. We believe in creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, guiding diners through the menu and offering insights into the history and cultural significance of each dish. We are committed to exceeding expectations, ensuring that every visit to Michinga is a memorable one. This dedication to exceptional customer service, coupled with our authentic cuisine, has helped us forge strong connections with the local community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nMichinga actively participates in local events and festivals, showcasing Assamese cuisine and culture to a wider audience. We host cooking demonstrations, workshops, and themed dinners, further engaging with the community and fostering a deeper appreciation for the region\'s culinary heritage. We are also committed to sustainable practices, supporting local farmers and minimizing our environmental impact. By actively engaging with the community and prioritizing sustainability, Michinga aims to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a positive force in the local ecosystem.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Michinga Restaurant envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, while remaining steadfast in our commitment to authentic Assamese cuisine and exceptional customer service. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to showcase even more of the region\'s diverse culinary offerings and introducing new and innovative dishes that celebrate the flavors of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe also plan to explore opportunities to expand our reach, potentially through opening additional locations or offering catering services for local events. Our vision is to become a leading destination for Assamese cuisine, both locally and beyond. Furthermore, we aim to establish a training program for aspiring chefs, fostering a new generation of culinary talent dedicated to preserving and promoting the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Through continued innovation, dedication to quality, and a strong commitment to the community, Michinga Restaurant is poised to achieve its long-term goals and become a lasting legacy in the Assam business landscape.', '4RH4+MFR, 175, Jayanagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:15:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1634, 'Lama by Yeti | Awarded Best Ethnic and Oriental Cuisine', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Lama by Yeti, proudly awarded \'Best Ethnic and Oriental Cuisine,\' stands as a culinary beacon in Assam, offering an authentic and immersive dining experience that transcends the ordinary. More than just a restaurant, Lama by Yeti is a celebration of the rich and diverse flavors of the Himalayas and East Asia, meticulously crafted and presented with unparalleled dedication to quality and service. Located in the heart of [Insert general location in Assam - e.g., Guwahati’s bustling commercial district] , it provides a welcome escape, a sanctuary where the vibrant culture of the East is brought to life through exceptional cuisine and genuine hospitality.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Lama by Yeti distinguishes itself by providing a curated selection of dishes representing the best of Tibetan, Nepali, Bhutanese, and broader Oriental culinary traditions. Our core offering revolves around delivering an authentic taste of these regions, utilizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible to ensure the highest quality and support local farmers. From steaming momos and thukpas, hand-pulled noodles, and flavorful curries to expertly prepared stir-fries and delicate dim sums, our menu is a testament to the artistry and skill of our chefs. Unique selling points include our commitment to traditional recipes passed down through generations, our innovative interpretations of classic dishes, and our unwavering focus on using the finest ingredients available. We cater to the growing demand for diverse and authentic culinary experiences in Assam, filling a niche for diners seeking something beyond the typical Indian fare. Our menu also includes thoughtfully curated vegetarian and vegan options, ensuring that everyone can find something to savor and enjoy.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Lama by Yeti, customer experience is paramount. We believe that dining should be an enjoyable and memorable occasion, and we strive to create an atmosphere that is both welcoming and refined. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and cared for. From the moment you step through our doors, you are greeted with warmth and genuine hospitality. We go beyond simply taking orders; we engage with our guests, offering recommendations, explaining the intricacies of our dishes, and ensuring that every need is met. The ambiance of Lama by Yeti is carefully designed to complement the cuisine. [Describe the restaurant\'s ambiance - e.g., Warm lighting, traditional decor, calming music]. We actively connect with the local community by participating in local events, supporting local charities, and sourcing ingredients from regional producers. We aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a valued member of the Assam community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Lama by Yeti is ambitious and exciting. Building upon our current success and the recognition as \'Best Ethnic and Oriental Cuisine,\' we plan to expand our reach within Assam and potentially beyond. This may involve opening additional locations, developing a catering service for events and gatherings, or creating a line of signature sauces and spices for retail sale. We are committed to continually innovating and refining our menu, introducing new and exciting dishes that showcase the diversity of Himalayan and East Asian cuisine. We also plan to further enhance our customer experience through initiatives such as cooking classes, themed dining events, and collaborations with local artists and musicians. Our long-term goal is to establish Lama by Yeti as a leading culinary destination in Northeast India, renowned for its authentic cuisine, exceptional service, and unwavering commitment to quality. We envision Lama by Yeti as a place where people can come together to celebrate culture, share a delicious meal, and create lasting memories.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:15:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1635, 'Café Hendrix', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Café Hendrix, nestled on GS Road, opposite Pantaloons Down Town, is more than just a café; it\'s a vibrant hub where exceptional coffee meets a contemporary Assamese experience. Stepping into Café Hendrix is an invitation to escape the hustle and bustle of Guwahati, offering a relaxing and inspiring atmosphere that caters to a diverse clientele, from students and professionals to families and tourists. In a region renowned for its tea, Café Hendrix is establishing itself as a premier destination for coffee connoisseurs and those seeking a unique culinary experience, adding a fresh and modern dimension to the local café culture. We\'re committed to sourcing locally wherever possible, supporting the Assam economy and offering our customers the freshest ingredients.<br> <br></p>\n\n<p>At the heart of Café Hendrix lies a dedication to providing high-quality coffee and a diverse menu that caters to a range of palates. Our core offerings include a wide selection of expertly crafted coffee beverages, from classic espresso-based drinks like lattes and cappuccinos to specialty brews featuring single-origin beans sourced both locally and internationally. Beyond coffee, our menu boasts a delightful array of teas, including premium Assam varieties, refreshing iced beverages, and handcrafted smoothies. <br> <br> Complementing our beverage selection is a carefully curated food menu featuring both continental and regional delicacies. Customers can savor freshly baked pastries and cakes, enjoy light and flavorful sandwiches and wraps, or indulge in heartier options inspired by Assamese cuisine. Our signature dishes often incorporate locally sourced ingredients, providing a unique culinary experience that celebrates the flavors of the region. What sets Café Hendrix apart is our commitment to quality, consistency, and innovation. We continually strive to refine our menu, explore new brewing techniques, and source the finest ingredients to ensure that every visit is a memorable one. Our spacious and comfortable seating arrangement, coupled with reliable Wi-Fi, makes us an ideal location for both casual meetups and productive work sessions, making us a versatile space for various customer needs.<br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Café Hendrix. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating customer needs and going the extra mile to ensure satisfaction. From greeting customers with a warm smile to offering recommendations based on individual preferences, we strive to build meaningful connections with our clientele. <br> <br> Understanding the importance of community, Café Hendrix actively engages with local initiatives and organizations. We host regular events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, and workshops focused on coffee appreciation and other culinary skills. These events not only enhance the Café Hendrix experience but also contribute to the cultural vibrancy of the GS Road area. We also believe in giving back, and regularly partner with local charities and NGOs to support community development projects. By fostering a sense of community and providing exceptional service, Café Hendrix aims to be more than just a café; it aspires to be a cherished gathering place that enriches the lives of our customers and contributes to the well-being of the local community. We actively solicit customer feedback through online platforms and in-person interactions, continuously striving to improve our offerings and tailor our services to meet the evolving needs of our patrons.<br> <br></p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Café Hendrix envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam market and beyond. Our long-term goals include establishing multiple locations throughout Guwahati and other key cities in the region, bringing our unique blend of exceptional coffee and cultural experiences to a wider audience. We plan to enhance our menu by introducing seasonal offerings, expanding our range of locally sourced products, and collaborating with regional artisans to create exclusive merchandise. <br> <br> A key aspect of our future vision involves leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience. We are exploring options such as online ordering, mobile payments, and loyalty programs to provide greater convenience and personalization. Furthermore, we are committed to sustainable practices and plan to implement eco-friendly initiatives such as reducing waste, using renewable energy sources, and partnering with local farmers who prioritize environmentally responsible agriculture. Ultimately, Café Hendrix aims to become a leading brand in the Assam café industry, renowned for its commitment to quality, community engagement, and sustainable growth. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, we can create a lasting legacy that benefits both our customers and the region as a whole. Our ambition is to not just serve coffee, but to cultivate a culture – a culture of connection, creativity, and community, all centered around the comforting aroma of expertly brewed coffee.<br> <br></p>', 'GS Rd, opp. Pantaloons Down Town', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:20:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1636, 'Khao Gully - The Food Court', 'Restaurants', '', '<p><b>Khao Gully - The Food Court: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</b></p>\n\n<p>Khao Gully - The Food Court, strategically situated in Bhajanka Building on GS Road, next to Central Mall, has rapidly established itself as a premier dining destination in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a collection of food stalls, Khao Gully is a curated culinary experience, designed to cater to the diverse tastes and preferences of the local community and visiting patrons. It offers a vibrant and welcoming atmosphere where families, friends, and colleagues can gather to enjoy a wide array of delicious food options in a comfortable and convenient setting. In a city known for its rich culinary heritage, Khao Gully stands out by offering a modern, diverse, and accessible food court experience, addressing the growing demand for quality, variety, and convenience in the Guwahati dining scene. Its prime location ensures high visibility and accessibility, making it a popular choice for a quick lunch, a casual dinner, or a weekend family outing.</p>\n\n<p>Khao Gully\'s core offering lies in its carefully selected vendors, each specializing in a distinct culinary style. From authentic Assamese cuisine to popular North Indian dishes, flavorful Chinese fare, and tantalizing continental options, the food court provides a diverse menu that caters to a broad spectrum of palates. A key unique selling point is the emphasis on quality ingredients and hygienic food preparation practices. Each vendor is carefully vetted to ensure adherence to stringent quality standards, guaranteeing a safe and enjoyable dining experience for all customers. The food court also prioritizes affordability, offering a range of options to suit different budgets, making it an accessible choice for students, families, and working professionals alike. Furthermore, Khao Gully addresses a crucial need in the local market by providing a centralized location where individuals with varying dietary preferences can dine together harmoniously. Rather than compromising on cuisine choice, groups can easily find something to satisfy everyone\'s cravings within the food court\'s diverse offerings.</p>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Khao Gully. From the moment patrons enter, they are greeted with a clean, well-maintained, and aesthetically pleasing environment. Ample seating arrangements cater to both small and large groups, ensuring a comfortable dining experience for everyone. Attentive and friendly staff are readily available to assist customers, providing information about the various food options and ensuring a smooth and efficient ordering process. Beyond the physical space, Khao Gully actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting food festivals showcasing regional specialties, partnering with local organizations for fundraising events, and offering special promotions to students and senior citizens. The business strives to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels valued and appreciated. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the quality of service and the overall dining experience. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, Khao Gully has become more than just a food court; it has become a vibrant social hub.</p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Khao Gully envisions expanding its presence and solidifying its position as the leading food court destination in Guwahati. Future plans include introducing new and innovative food concepts, incorporating more technology to enhance the customer experience, and expanding the seating capacity to accommodate growing demand. The business is also exploring opportunities to partner with local farmers and suppliers to source fresh, locally grown ingredients, further supporting the local economy and enhancing the quality of its offerings. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Khao Gully is committed to reducing its environmental footprint by implementing eco-friendly practices such as waste reduction, recycling, and the use of biodegradable packaging. Long-term, the goal is to establish Khao Gully as a benchmark for quality, service, and sustainability in the food court industry, not just in Guwahati, but across the region. The business aims to create a sustainable and thriving enterprise that benefits both its customers and the local community, contributing to the overall growth and prosperity of Assam.</p>', 'Bhajanka Building, GS Rd, next to Central Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:20:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1637, 'Rang De Basanti Dhaba', 'Restaurants', '', 'Rang De Basanti Dhaba, located at 1st, Basudev Complex, offers a vibrant and authentic taste of North Indian cuisine with a strong Assam flavour. More than just a restaurant, it is a cultural hub, a community gathering place, and a testament to the rich culinary heritage of India. Positioned within the dynamic local business environment of Assam, Rang De Basanti Dhaba stands out by delivering a unique dining experience that combines traditional recipes with local ingredients, appealing to both residents and tourists alike. The dhaba seeks to capture the essence of rustic Indian dining, offering a taste of home in a lively and welcoming atmosphere.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Rang De Basanti Dhaba provides a comprehensive menu of North Indian and tandoori dishes, meticulously prepared to preserve authentic flavours while incorporating locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The restaurant\'s signature dishes, such as Butter Chicken, Dal Makhani, and a variety of freshly baked naans and rotis, are consistently praised for their quality and taste. However, what truly distinguishes Rang De Basanti Dhaba is its commitment to incorporating local Assam flavours. Examples include the inclusion of Assam black pepper in specific marinades, the use of local vegetables in certain curries, and offering a unique Assam-style chai. The dhaba also caters to diverse dietary needs, providing vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options to ensure a satisfying experience for all patrons. By prioritizing quality ingredients, authentic cooking techniques, and a diverse menu, Rang De Basanti Dhaba effectively meets the local market needs for both traditional North Indian cuisine and innovative fusion dishes.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at Rang De Basanti Dhaba is built on a foundation of genuine hospitality and personalized service. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. The dhaba’s ambiance plays a crucial role in enhancing the overall dining experience. The decor reflects the spirit of the movie \"Rang De Basanti\", using vibrant colours, rustic furniture, and evocative imagery to create a lively and immersive atmosphere. The restaurant regularly hosts live music performances showcasing local artists, creating a lively and engaging environment that celebrates Assam\'s vibrant culture. Furthermore, Rang De Basanti Dhaba actively participates in local community events, supporting local businesses and organizations through sponsorships and partnerships. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and reinforces the dhaba’s position as a beloved local institution. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve service and offerings, demonstrating a commitment to customer satisfaction.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Rang De Basanti Dhaba envisions significant growth and expansion while maintaining its core values of quality, authenticity, and community engagement. Expansion plans include potentially opening additional locations within Assam and possibly expanding to other regions, allowing a wider audience to experience the unique culinary offerings. The dhaba is also exploring opportunities to enhance its online presence through online ordering and delivery services, catering services for local events, and the development of a branded line of spices and sauces, allowing customers to enjoy the Rang De Basanti Dhaba experience at home. Moreover, the business plans to strengthen its relationships with local farmers and suppliers, ensuring a sustainable and ethical supply chain. Long-term goals involve establishing Rang De Basanti Dhaba as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with authentic North Indian cuisine, community support, and exceptional customer service within the Assam region and beyond. The focus will be on creating a legacy of culinary excellence and positive social impact.', '1st, Basudev Complex', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:20:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1638, 'Gam\'s Delicacy Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Gam\'s Delicacy Restaurant: A Taste of Assam\'s Culinary Heart in Krishna Market</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Krishna Market, GS Road, Gam\'s Delicacy Restaurant stands as a culinary beacon, offering an authentic taste of Assam\'s rich and diverse gastronomic landscape. More than just a restaurant, Gam\'s Delicacy is a celebration of local flavors, time-honored recipes, and the warm hospitality that defines the Assamese spirit. In a region known for its unique culinary traditions, Gam\'s Delicacy distinguishes itself by prioritizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients and presenting them in both traditional and innovative ways, catering to a diverse clientele that includes local residents, tourists, and business professionals.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Gam\'s Delicacy offers a comprehensive menu that showcases the breadth and depth of Assamese cuisine. From the tangy and aromatic <i>Maa Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry) to the hearty and comforting <i>Dal with Khar</i> (lentils cooked with alkaline extract), each dish is prepared with meticulous attention to detail and a deep respect for tradition. The restaurant\'s signature dishes include a flavorful rendition of <i>Duck Roast</i> prepared with local herbs and spices, and a tantalizing <i>Pitha</i> platter, showcasing the diverse range of rice cakes that are central to Assamese festivities. Beyond traditional fare, Gam\'s Delicacy also features innovative dishes that blend Assamese flavors with modern culinary techniques, appealing to a younger and more adventurous palate. Vegetarian options are plentiful, featuring dishes prepared with seasonal vegetables and lentils, offering a delightful experience for non-meat eaters. What sets Gam\'s Delicacy apart is its commitment to sourcing ingredients directly from local farmers and producers, ensuring freshness and supporting the local agricultural economy. This farm-to-table approach not only enhances the flavor of the dishes but also guarantees a sustainable and ethical dining experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Gam\'s Delicacy. The restaurant strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel welcomed and valued. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service, offering recommendations and catering to individual dietary needs and preferences. The ambiance is carefully curated to reflect the essence of Assamese culture, with traditional decor and soothing background music creating a relaxing and immersive dining experience. Furthermore, Gam\'s Delicacy actively engages with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring local initiatives, and hosting cultural programs that showcase Assamese arts and traditions. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and reinforces Gam\'s Delicacy\'s position as a vital part of the local fabric. Feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered, ensuring that the restaurant continuously improves its service and offerings to meet the evolving needs of its clientele. Regular customer loyalty programs and special promotions further enhance the customer experience and encourage repeat visits.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Gam\'s Delicacy envisions expanding its reach and influence within the regional culinary landscape. Future plans include introducing online ordering and delivery services to cater to the growing demand for convenient dining options. The restaurant also aims to establish a catering service to provide authentic Assamese cuisine for private events and corporate functions. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with local artisans and producers to create a curated retail section within the restaurant, showcasing and selling local products, is also on the horizon. A long-term goal is to establish a culinary school or training program to nurture aspiring chefs and promote the preservation and evolution of Assamese cuisine. Gam\'s Delicacy believes that by investing in education and innovation, it can contribute to the continued growth and recognition of Assam\'s culinary heritage on a national and international scale. The restaurant is committed to maintaining its focus on quality, authenticity, and customer satisfaction as it embarks on this journey of growth and expansion, ensuring that Gam\'s Delicacy remains a cherished destination for those seeking a truly authentic and unforgettable taste of Assam.</p>', 'Krishna Market, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:20:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1639, 'Nuts and Brew', 'Restaurants', '', 'Nuts and Brew: A Guwahati Gathering Place\n\nNuts and Brew, strategically located on the 3rd Floor, GS Rd, above Forever 21 and directly in front of the Novotel Hotel, offers a distinctive experience in Guwahati\'s vibrant commercial district. More than just a cafe, Nuts and Brew is envisioned as a dynamic social hub, a place where the energy of the city converges over premium beverages and carefully curated snacks. Nestled amidst the bustling GS Road, it provides a welcome respite, offering a blend of modern sophistication and warm, inviting hospitality. Its location lends itself to both planned meetings and spontaneous get-togethers, contributing uniquely to the local business and social landscape by providing a conveniently located and aesthetically pleasing meeting point.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nNuts and Brew\'s core offerings center around a sophisticated selection of freshly brewed coffee, artisanal teas, and a range of handcrafted beverages, catering to diverse palates and preferences. Complementing the beverage menu is a curated selection of nuts, snacks, and light bites designed to perfectly pair with the drink offerings. From locally sourced Assam tea blends to globally inspired coffee roasts, the focus is on quality and freshness. What sets Nuts and Brew apart is its commitment to providing more than just refreshments; it aims to create a complete sensory experience. The atmosphere is designed to be conducive to both focused work and relaxed conversation, making it a versatile destination for students, professionals, and casual visitors alike. Recognizing the growing demand for healthy and convenient food options, the menu also includes healthier snack alternatives, catering to a health-conscious clientele prevalent in the area. This blend of quality beverages, carefully chosen snacks, and a conducive atmosphere positions Nuts and Brew as a distinctive player in the local cafe scene.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Nuts and Brew. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring each customer feels valued and welcomed. This extends beyond simply taking orders; it involves actively listening to customer preferences, offering informed recommendations, and creating a genuine connection. The interior design incorporates comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and subtle ambient music, creating a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. Furthermore, Nuts and Brew actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artists and suppliers, showcasing regional products and talent. Wi-Fi connectivity is readily available and reliable, catering to the needs of working professionals and students. Customer feedback is actively solicited and incorporated to continually improve the service and offerings. This commitment to outstanding service and community engagement differentiates Nuts and Brew, transforming it from a mere cafe into a beloved local institution.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Nuts and Brew envisions significant growth potential. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more locally sourced ingredients and exploring partnerships with regional food producers. Introducing loyalty programs and targeted marketing campaigns are also on the horizon, aimed at building a stronger customer base and increasing brand awareness. The business aims to further solidify its position as a premier destination for quality beverages and snacks, while also fostering a vibrant social hub within the community. There are also plans for potential expansion to other strategic locations within Guwahati, building on the success of the initial establishment. Longer-term goals include establishing Nuts and Brew as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, community, and a unique Guwahati experience. By continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Nuts and Brew is poised to become a long-term success story in the Assam business landscape.', '3rd Floor, GS Rd, above Forever 21, in front of Novotel Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:20:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1640, 'Yaara - Multi Cuisine Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', 'Yaara - Multi Cuisine Restaurant: A Culinary Oasis in Assam\n\nYaara - Multi Cuisine Restaurant offers a vibrant and diverse dining experience, enriching the culinary landscape of Assam with its eclectic menu and dedication to exceptional service. More than just a restaurant, Yaara aims to be a community hub, a place where friends, families, and colleagues can gather to celebrate life’s moments over delicious food, carefully crafted beverages, and engaging conversation. Located in [Insert Specific Location in Assam], Yaara fills a crucial need for a restaurant that provides both familiar favorites and exciting new flavors, appealing to a broad range of palates and dietary preferences. Our commitment to fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible sets us apart, contributing to the sustainability of local agriculture and ensuring the highest quality dishes for our patrons.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Yaara\'s offerings is a carefully curated multi-cuisine menu designed to transport diners on a global culinary journey. Our menu features a delightful array of dishes from Indian, Continental, and Asian cuisines. From expertly prepared Indian curries bursting with authentic spices to perfectly seared steaks and flavorful stir-fries, each dish is prepared with precision and passion by our skilled chefs. A highlight of our menu includes [Insert a signature dish or unique menu item specific to the region or restaurant], which has already garnered significant popularity among our customers. We also offer a selection of vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options, ensuring that everyone can find something to enjoy. Beyond the food, Yaara boasts a well-stocked bar offering a selection of classic cocktails, local beers, and fine wines, complementing the dining experience. The ambiance of Yaara is equally important. We have created a warm and inviting space that is both elegant and comfortable, suitable for a romantic dinner, a family celebration, or a casual lunch with friends.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Yaara. We believe that dining out should be more than just a meal; it should be a memorable occasion. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating the needs of our guests and ensuring their comfort. From the moment customers walk through the door, they are greeted with a warm welcome and made to feel at home. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and service standards. To foster a stronger connection with the local community, Yaara actively participates in local events and supports local initiatives. [Give specific example, e.g., \"We partner with local farmers to source our produce\" or \"We sponsor local cultural events\"]. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and are committed to being a responsible corporate citizen.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Yaara envisions becoming a landmark destination in Assam, synonymous with quality food, exceptional service, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate even more regional specialties, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We are also exploring the possibility of offering cooking classes and culinary workshops, allowing our customers to learn the secrets behind our delicious dishes. Furthermore, we plan to enhance our online presence through online ordering and delivery services, making our food more accessible to a wider audience. We are also considering expanding our physical space to accommodate growing demand and provide a more comfortable dining experience. Our long-term goal is to establish Yaara as a brand that represents culinary excellence and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, not just in Assam, but potentially beyond. We strive to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a place where memories are made and connections are forged, one delicious meal at a time.', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:25:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
