(1650, 'The Barbeque Company Guwahati | Buffet Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>The Barbeque Company Guwahati represents a vibrant and flavourful addition to the city’s culinary scene. Situated in a yet to be specified location within Guwahati, this buffet restaurant offers an expansive and exciting dining experience centered around the art of barbeque. More than just a restaurant, The Barbeque Company aims to be a social hub where friends and family can gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories over delicious food. In a region known for its rich culinary traditions and emerging appetite for global flavors, The Barbeque Company seeks to bridge the gap, offering a familiar yet novel dining option.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of The Barbeque Company lies its comprehensive buffet spread, meticulously curated to cater to a wide range of palates. The core offering revolves around live barbeque stations where diners can customize their experience, selecting from an array of marinated meats, seafood, and vegetables. These ingredients are then expertly grilled to perfection right before their eyes, ensuring freshness and optimal flavor. Beyond the barbeque, the buffet boasts a diverse selection of Indian, Chinese, and Continental dishes, complete with appetizers, salads, main courses, and decadent desserts. This expansive selection caters to the diverse tastes of the Guwahati populace, ensuring that there is something for everyone to enjoy. A unique selling point is the restaurant\'s commitment to sourcing locally whenever possible. This allows the business to support local farmers and producers, contribute to the community\'s economic well-being, and guarantees the use of the freshest, seasonal ingredients. This focus on local sourcing not only enhances the dining experience but also resonates with the values of the local community, increasing customer loyalty. By providing a high-quality buffet experience at a competitive price, The Barbeque Company addresses the market\'s need for affordable yet indulgent dining options. Furthermore, the restaurant offers customized party packages and catering services, meeting the growing demand for venues to host celebrations and corporate events.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Barbeque Company understands that exceptional food is only one part of the equation. Customer experience is paramount. The restaurant cultivates a warm and inviting atmosphere, creating a space where guests feel comfortable and valued. The staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, ensuring that every customer interaction is positive and memorable. From greeting guests at the door to providing attentive service at the table, every detail is carefully considered to exceed expectations. The restaurant aims to be more than just a place to eat; it strives to be a place where people connect and celebrate life\'s moments. To foster a stronger connection with the local community, The Barbeque Company actively participates in local events and initiatives. This could include sponsoring local sports teams, partnering with local charities, or hosting community events at the restaurant. By actively engaging with the community, The Barbeque Company aims to build brand awareness, foster customer loyalty, and contribute to the overall well-being of Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Barbeque Company envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion within the Assam region and potentially beyond. Future plans include introducing seasonal menu items that highlight the unique flavors of Assam, further strengthening the restaurant\'s connection to the local community. Expanding the catering services to reach a wider audience is also a priority. This may involve investing in additional catering equipment and staffing, as well as developing specialized catering menus to meet diverse needs. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other cities throughout Assam, replicating the successful formula of The Barbeque Company Guwahati. Furthermore, the company aspires to establish itself as a leading brand in the barbeque restaurant sector in Northeast India, recognized for its quality food, exceptional service, and commitment to the local community. This vision involves continuous innovation, a relentless focus on customer satisfaction, and a dedication to creating a positive impact on the communities it serves. By staying true to its core values and embracing opportunities for growth, The Barbeque Company Guwahati is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and establish itself as a beloved dining destination for years to come. To ensure consistency and growth, the implementation of robust training programs for staff is essential. This would maintain a high level of service and food preparation, regardless of future expansion plans.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:35:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1651, 'Typically Indian Bar & Grill', 'Restaurants', '', 'Typically Indian Bar & Grill offers an authentic and contemporary Indian dining experience nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, at [Insert Actual Address Here]. This establishment transcends the typical Indian restaurant by seamlessly blending traditional flavors with a modern ambiance and exceptional service, creating a unique destination for both local residents and visitors seeking a true taste of India. Situated in a vibrant part of the city, Typically Indian Bar & Grill contributes to the rich tapestry of Assam\'s culinary scene, providing a sophisticated yet approachable dining option that complements the region\'s diverse gastronomic offerings. It stands out as a space where the warmth of Indian hospitality meets culinary artistry.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of Typically Indian Bar & Grill lies a dedication to providing a diverse menu that caters to a wide range of palates. The primary offerings include a curated selection of Indian dishes from across the country, with a particular emphasis on regional Assamese specialties. Guests can savor flavorful curries, tandoori delicacies, biryanis, and a variety of vegetarian and non-vegetarian options prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The bar complements the food menu with a selection of Indian and international spirits, wines, and beers, alongside handcrafted cocktails inspired by Indian flavors and spices. A key differentiator is the restaurant\'s commitment to showcasing authentic recipes while incorporating modern culinary techniques for a refined dining experience. This commitment is further enhanced by the restaurant\'s skilled chefs, who are passionate about preserving the integrity of Indian cuisine while pushing the boundaries of flavor and presentation. The offerings cater to the needs of the local market by providing a space for families, friends, and colleagues to gather and enjoy a memorable meal.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Typically Indian Bar & Grill. The restaurant strives to create a welcoming and attentive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. This is achieved through attentive service, personalized recommendations, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and to provide insights into the dishes, allowing customers to make informed choices and discover new flavors. The ambiance of the restaurant further enhances the dining experience, with a thoughtfully designed interior that blends modern aesthetics with traditional Indian elements. The warm lighting, comfortable seating, and subtle décor create an inviting atmosphere that encourages relaxation and conversation. Furthermore, Typically Indian Bar & Grill actively engages with the local community by hosting events, supporting local initiatives, and sourcing ingredients from regional suppliers whenever possible. This commitment to community involvement strengthens the restaurant\'s ties to the area and reinforces its position as a valued member of the local business landscape. Special attention is also paid to accommodating dietary restrictions and preferences, ensuring that all guests can enjoy a satisfying and worry-free dining experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for Typically Indian Bar & Grill encompasses sustainable growth and continued innovation. The restaurant aims to expand its reach within Guwahati and beyond, potentially opening additional locations in other cities in Assam or across the Northeast region. Future plans include developing new menu items that showcase the diversity of Indian cuisine, incorporating seasonal ingredients, and creating unique culinary experiences. The restaurant also plans to enhance its online presence through online ordering and delivery services, as well as by engaging with customers on social media platforms. A long-term goal is to establish Typically Indian Bar & Grill as a recognized brand that embodies the spirit of Indian hospitality and culinary excellence. This will involve investing in staff training and development, maintaining high standards of quality and service, and continuously seeking ways to improve the customer experience. Another important aspect of the future vision is to embrace sustainable practices, such as reducing food waste, using eco-friendly packaging, and supporting local farmers and suppliers. By focusing on these areas, Typically Indian Bar & Grill aims to create a lasting positive impact on the community and the environment, while simultaneously achieving its business objectives.', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:35:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1652, 'Dine Way Platz', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Dine Way Platz, strategically located on Guwahati Shillong Rd, is rapidly becoming a culinary landmark and a preferred dining destination for both locals and travelers in Assam. More than just a restaurant, Dine Way Platz aims to be a vibrant social hub, fostering community connections through memorable dining experiences. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and diverse flavors, Dine Way Platz distinguishes itself by offering a carefully curated menu that blends global culinary trends with locally sourced ingredients, creating a unique and contemporary dining experience. The restaurant\'s commitment to quality, combined with its welcoming ambiance and attentive service, positions it as a significant player in the burgeoning Guwahati hospitality sector.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Dine Way Platz\'s offerings is a diverse menu designed to cater to a wide range of palates. The restaurant specializes in contemporary cuisine with a strong emphasis on fresh, seasonal ingredients. Signature dishes showcase innovative interpretations of classic recipes, reflecting a commitment to both culinary artistry and nutritional balance. Beyond the food, Dine Way Platz also boasts an impressive beverage selection, including handcrafted cocktails, a curated wine list, and locally sourced artisanal teas and coffees. A key differentiator is the restaurant\'s dedication to utilizing locally sourced produce and supporting local farmers, ensuring the freshness and quality of ingredients while also contributing to the regional economy. This commitment to sustainability and local partnerships is a unique selling point that resonates with a growing segment of socially conscious consumers in the region. Recognizing the increasing demand for healthy and dietary-conscious options, Dine Way Platz also offers a selection of vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free dishes, ensuring that every guest can find something to enjoy. The restaurant also provides bespoke catering services for private events and gatherings, bringing the Dine Way Platz experience directly to customers\' homes or venues.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Dine Way Platz places paramount importance on delivering an exceptional customer experience. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The restaurant\'s staff is trained to anticipate customer needs and provide personalized recommendations, ensuring that every dining experience is tailored to individual preferences. The ambiance is carefully designed to create a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, with comfortable seating, tasteful decor, and soft lighting. The restaurant regularly hosts live music performances and themed events, adding to the vibrant and engaging atmosphere. Dine Way Platz actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in community events. By supporting local initiatives and fostering meaningful connections, Dine Way Platz aims to be more than just a restaurant; it strives to be a valuable contributor to the social and cultural fabric of the Guwahati area. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the dining experience, ensuring that Dine Way Platz remains responsive to the evolving needs and preferences of its clientele. The restaurant also leverages social media platforms to engage with customers, share updates, and promote special offers, further strengthening its connection with the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Dine Way Platz envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. The restaurant plans to expand its menu offerings to include more regional specialties, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Plans are also underway to develop a loyalty program to reward frequent customers and foster long-term relationships. Recognizing the growing demand for online ordering and delivery services, Dine Way Platz intends to expand its digital presence and offer convenient options for customers to enjoy its cuisine from the comfort of their homes. Furthermore, the business plans to explore opportunities for expansion, potentially opening additional locations in other key areas of Guwahati and beyond. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Dine Way Platz is well-positioned for sustained growth and success in the dynamic hospitality sector. The long-term goal is to establish Dine Way Platz as a renowned brand synonymous with exceptional dining experiences, unwavering quality, and a deep commitment to the local community.</p>', 'Guwahati Shillong Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:35:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1653, 'JB\'s', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>JB\'s: A Taste of Assam, Rooted in Tradition and Innovation</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of [City/Town, Assam], JB\'s has rapidly established itself as a significant player in the local food and beverage sector, offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and modern culinary techniques. More than just a restaurant, JB\'s is a community hub, a celebration of Assam\'s rich culinary heritage, and a testament to the entrepreneurial spirit thriving in the region. We pride ourselves on sourcing local ingredients, supporting regional farmers, and providing an authentic Assamese dining experience that resonates with both locals and visitors alike. JB\'s contributes to the vibrant tapestry of Assam\'s business landscape by fostering economic growth within the community and promoting the unique flavors of the region to a wider audience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of JB\'s lies a commitment to delivering exceptional food and beverage experiences. Our primary offering is a curated menu featuring both classic Assamese dishes and innovative creations that reimagine traditional flavors. From the comforting aroma of *Masor Tenga* (Sour Fish Curry) cooked with locally sourced *ou tenga* (elephant apple) to the fiery kick of *Bhoot Jolokia* infused delicacies, our menu offers a culinary journey through Assam. We also offer a range of vegetarian options showcasing the abundance of fresh vegetables and herbs grown in the region, such as * Khar* a unique alkaline dish prepared with raw papaya. Beyond the traditional fare, JB\'s is known for its inventive appetizers and desserts that subtly incorporate Assamese ingredients, adding a modern twist to familiar tastes. We offer a carefully selected beverage menu including local teas, freshly squeezed juices made from seasonal fruits and signature cocktails that complement the flavors of the cuisine. What sets JB\'s apart is our dedication to using locally sourced, organic ingredients whenever possible. This commitment ensures the freshness and quality of our dishes while simultaneously supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable agricultural practices. We strive to meet the needs of the local market by providing a diverse menu that caters to various tastes and dietary preferences, offering everything from quick and affordable lunch options to elaborate multi-course meals for special occasions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>JB\'s understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to success. Our approach is rooted in creating a welcoming and hospitable atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, attentive to customer needs, and passionate about sharing the stories behind the dishes. We strive to personalize the dining experience, taking the time to understand individual preferences and offering tailored recommendations. Beyond the in-house dining experience, JB\'s actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. We regularly host events featuring local musicians, artists, and artisans, providing a platform for showcasing the region\'s talent. We participate in local festivals and markets, offering a taste of JB\'s to a wider audience and strengthening our connection with the community. Moreover, we are committed to sustainability and reducing our environmental impact. We prioritize eco-friendly packaging, minimize food waste, and actively participate in local environmental initiatives. Through these efforts, JB\'s aims to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a responsible and contributing member of the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, JB\'s envisions continued growth and expansion while remaining true to its core values of authenticity, quality, and community engagement. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to incorporate even more regional specialties and seasonal ingredients, further deepening our commitment to supporting local farmers. We are also exploring opportunities to open additional locations, both within Assam and potentially in other parts of India, to share the unique flavors of Assamese cuisine with a wider audience. Another key focus area is enhancing our online presence and developing a robust delivery service to cater to the growing demand for convenient food options. We plan to invest in staff training and development to ensure that our team continues to provide exceptional customer service and maintain the highest standards of quality. Furthermore, JB\'s is committed to exploring innovative ways to promote sustainable practices and reduce our environmental footprint. We aim to become a recognized leader in the region\'s food and beverage industry, not only for our delicious food but also for our commitment to ethical and sustainable business practices. Ultimately, JB\'s aspires to be a symbol of Assam\'s culinary pride, a place where people can come together to celebrate the region\'s rich heritage and experience the true taste of Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:35:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1654, 'Levitate Rooftop Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', 'Levitate Rooftop Restaurant, strategically located on GS Rd, opposite the prestigious Vivanta by Taj in Guwahati, Assam, offers a distinctive dining experience, elevating the city’s culinary scene. Levitate is more than just a restaurant; it\'s a destination, providing a sophisticated ambiance, unparalleled city views, and a menu that celebrates both local flavors and international cuisine. The restaurant caters to a diverse clientele, ranging from discerning locals seeking a refined dining experience to tourists looking for a memorable taste of Assam. Its prominent location, combined with its unique rooftop setting, positions Levitate as a premier dining and entertainment venue in the heart of Guwahati.\n<br> <br>\nLevitate Rooftop Restaurant’s core offerings center around providing exceptional dining and beverage services. The restaurant boasts a carefully curated menu featuring a blend of contemporary dishes and reimagined Assamese classics. Expect to find dishes that incorporate locally sourced ingredients, showcasing the region\'s rich culinary heritage with a modern twist. Beyond the food, Levitate offers an extensive beverage program, including signature cocktails, fine wines, and a selection of premium spirits, all expertly crafted by experienced mixologists. A unique selling point is undoubtedly the unparalleled rooftop setting, providing panoramic views of Guwahati\'s skyline, creating a memorable backdrop for any occasion. This combination of exquisite food, innovative drinks, and breathtaking views fills a significant gap in the local market, offering a sophisticated alternative to more traditional dining options. Levitate also caters to private events, offering customized menus and dedicated service for celebrations and corporate gatherings.\n<br> <br>\nAt Levitate Rooftop Restaurant, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with attentive and personalized service, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable dining experience. The staff are trained to anticipate needs, provide insightful recommendations, and create a welcoming atmosphere. The restaurant design itself is intentional, creating a sophisticated yet comfortable environment that encourages relaxation and conversation. Regular live music performances featuring local artists are a key feature, adding to the vibrant atmosphere and creating a sense of community. Levitate actively engages with the local community through collaborations with local suppliers, showcasing regional produce and supporting local businesses. Special events and promotions are often themed around Assamese festivals and cultural celebrations, further cementing Levitate\'s connection with its surroundings and establishing it as a place where both locals and visitors can come together to appreciate the best of Assam. The management places a strong emphasis on gathering customer feedback, utilizing it to continually refine its offerings and enhance the overall experience.\n<br> <br>\nLevitate Rooftop Restaurant envisions becoming the premier dining and entertainment destination in Guwahati and a recognized name throughout the region. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more diverse culinary influences, while still retaining a focus on local ingredients and Assamese flavors. The restaurant intends to further enhance its beverage program, introducing new signature cocktails and expanding its wine list to cater to a wider range of palates. Exploring the possibility of opening additional locations, either within Guwahati or in other key cities in the Northeast, is also under consideration. Technology will play a crucial role in Levitate\'s future growth, with plans to implement online ordering systems, reservation platforms, and customer loyalty programs to further enhance convenience and engagement. Ultimately, Levitate aims to be more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural hub, a place where people can connect, celebrate, and experience the best of Guwahati in a sophisticated and memorable setting. The long-term goal is to establish Levitate as a symbol of culinary excellence and a vital part of the Assam business landscape.', 'GS Rd, opposite Vivanta by Taj', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:35:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1655, 'Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna: A Culinary Destination Immersed in Assam\'s Spirit</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Located at 4QQX+QC7 Udeshna building, Hari Mandir Path, Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna stands as a vibrant and highly regarded dining establishment, offering a unique and immersive culinary experience that resonates deeply with the spirit of Assam. Far more than just a restaurant, it represents a celebration of food, culture, and community, quickly establishing itself as a cornerstone of Guwahati\'s thriving culinary scene. This location is a particularly prominent spot for gatherings, celebrations, and memorable dining experiences, drawing a diverse clientele from across the region. It distinguishes itself by providing an interactive, engaging, and ultimately satisfying dining adventure that goes beyond the conventional restaurant experience. The popularity of the Guwahati Udeshna location is a testament to its commitment to quality, service, and authentic flavors, consistently drawing crowds seeking a memorable culinary journey.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna lies its core offering: the \"Unlimited Barbeque\" experience. Guests are treated to a delightful array of pre-seasoned vegetarian and non-vegetarian appetizers, grilled live on their tables using embedded grills. This interactive element allows diners to customize their grilling experience, ensuring that each morsel is cooked to their exact preference. Beyond the barbeque, a comprehensive buffet spread awaits, featuring a diverse selection of main courses encompassing Indian, Continental, and Chinese cuisines. The dessert section is equally lavish, presenting an irresistible assortment of sweet treats, from traditional Indian sweets to international pastries. A significant unique selling point is the restaurant\'s constant innovation in its menu offerings. Regularly updated with seasonal delicacies and themed food festivals, the restaurant ensures that the dining experience remains fresh, exciting, and aligned with local tastes and preferences. Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna successfully addresses a growing demand in the local market for high-quality, interactive dining experiences that cater to diverse palates and dietary preferences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The customer experience at Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna is paramount, setting it apart from competitors. The staff is known for their warm hospitality, attentiveness, and genuine dedication to ensuring guest satisfaction. From the moment a customer enters the restaurant until they leave, every effort is made to create a memorable and enjoyable dining experience. The restaurant fosters a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, making it an ideal destination for families, friends, and corporate gatherings alike. Recognizing the importance of community engagement, Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna actively participates in local events and initiatives, further solidifying its connection with the people of Assam. Special promotions and discounts are frequently offered to celebrate local festivals and occasions, demonstrating a commitment to giving back to the community and fostering a sense of belonging. Feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered, demonstrating a continuous effort to improve services and meet the evolving needs of its customers. This unwavering focus on customer satisfaction is a key driver of the restaurant\'s sustained success and popularity.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. Building upon its existing reputation and customer base, the restaurant plans to further enhance its offerings through menu innovation, service improvements, and targeted marketing campaigns. Exploring opportunities to cater to a wider demographic, including the incorporation of more localized Assamese cuisine options, represents a key area of focus. Strengthening its online presence and expanding its delivery services are also strategic priorities, aimed at reaching a broader audience and accommodating evolving consumer preferences. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to solidify Barbeque Nation - Guwahati Udeshna\'s position as the leading barbeque restaurant in the region, synonymous with exceptional food, unparalleled service, and a vibrant community spirit. This vision involves sustained investment in employee training and development, ensuring that the restaurant continues to deliver a consistently high-quality dining experience. Furthermore, the business aims to explore opportunities for expansion within Guwahati and potentially other key locations in Assam, bringing its unique culinary offering to an even wider audience. The commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement will remain central to the restaurant\'s growth strategy, ensuring its continued success and relevance in the dynamic culinary landscape of Assam.</p>', '4QQX+QC7 Udeshna building, Hari Mandir Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:40:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1656, 'Banbati the flavours of Northeast', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Banbati: The Flavours of Northeast is a culinary haven nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, dedicated to bringing the vibrant and diverse gastronomic traditions of Northeast India to the forefront. More than just a restaurant, Banbati is an immersive experience, a cultural ambassador showcasing the unique ingredients, time-honored recipes, and distinct culinary styles of the eight sister states: Assam, Arunachal Pradesh, Manipur, Meghalaya, Mizoram, Nagaland, Sikkim, and Tripura. In a region experiencing a growing appreciation for its own cultural heritage and a burgeoning interest in authentic regional cuisine, Banbati fills a crucial gap, offering both locals and tourists a genuine taste of Northeast India without compromising on quality or authenticity.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core offering centers around a carefully curated menu that features iconic dishes from each of the eight states, prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From the smoky pork dishes of Nagaland and Mizoram to the fermented fish preparations of Tripura and Manipur, and the delicate vegetarian curries of Meghalaya and Sikkim, Banbati provides a culinary journey that explores the breadth and depth of Northeast Indian cuisine. We also offer a selection of traditional rice beers and other indigenous beverages, providing a complete and authentic dining experience. Beyond the individual dishes, we offer curated thalis representing different states, allowing patrons to sample a variety of flavors and textures in a single meal. Unique selling points include our commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, our adherence to traditional cooking methods, and our emphasis on showcasing the authentic flavors of each region. We actively seek out small farmers and producers across the Northeast, supporting local communities and ensuring the highest quality ingredients. This dedication to authenticity and quality sets us apart from other restaurants in the region and ensures that our customers experience the true essence of Northeast Indian cuisine. Our dishes also cater to various dietary preferences and needs, with vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options readily available.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Banbati, we believe that exceptional food is only one part of a memorable dining experience. We are committed to providing warm, attentive, and personalized customer service. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the region\'s cuisine and culture, enabling them to guide guests through the menu and offer recommendations based on their preferences. The restaurant\'s ambiance reflects the rich cultural heritage of Northeast India, with traditional decor, handcrafted textiles, and subtle regional music creating a welcoming and immersive atmosphere. We host occasional cultural events, such as traditional music performances and cooking demonstrations, to further enhance the dining experience and celebrate the region\'s vibrant culture. We also actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans and community organizations. We participate in local food festivals and markets, raising awareness about Northeast Indian cuisine and supporting local businesses. Feedback is actively solicited and highly valued; we use online platforms and comment cards to gauge customer satisfaction and continually improve our services. We strive to create a space where people can not only enjoy delicious food but also learn about and appreciate the diverse cultures of Northeast India.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, Banbati envisions itself as a leading culinary destination for Northeast Indian cuisine, both within Assam and beyond. Our immediate plans include expanding our menu to incorporate even more regional specialties and seasonal ingredients. We are also exploring opportunities to collaborate with local chefs and food producers to create innovative dishes that showcase the versatility of Northeast Indian ingredients. We aim to establish a strong online presence, offering online ordering, delivery services, and virtual cooking classes. Longer-term goals include opening additional branches in other major cities in India and potentially internationally, thereby expanding the reach of Northeast Indian cuisine to a wider audience. We also plan to develop a line of packaged food products featuring traditional Northeast Indian flavors, such as pickles, chutneys, and spice blends, making it easier for people to enjoy these flavors at home. We are committed to sustainable business practices, working to minimize our environmental impact and support local communities. We also envision establishing a culinary school to train aspiring chefs in the art of Northeast Indian cooking, ensuring that these culinary traditions are preserved and passed on to future generations. Ultimately, Banbati strives to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a cultural ambassador, a culinary innovator, and a champion of Northeast India\'s rich and diverse gastronomic heritage.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:40:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1657, 'FoodExx | ফুড্‌এক্স', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>FoodExx | ফুড্‌এক্স, located on Shillong Road, opposite Anil Plaza, is a vibrant culinary establishment dedicated to providing the Assam region with a diverse and delightful dining experience. More than just a restaurant, FoodExx aims to be a community hub where authentic flavors meet modern culinary innovation, offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese cuisine and contemporary global dishes. In a region rich with culinary heritage, FoodExx stands out by curating a menu that honors local ingredients and techniques while embracing international influences, catering to a wide spectrum of tastes and preferences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>FoodExx’s core offerings center around a carefully crafted menu that boasts both classic Assamese dishes and globally-inspired favorites. Patrons can savor traditional delicacies like *Masor Tenga* (sour fish curry), *Pitha* (rice cake), and other regional specialties prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. Simultaneously, the menu features international dishes, offering options like flavorful Asian stir-fries, classic continental fare, and innovative fusion creations designed to tantalize the palate. The unique selling point lies in the commitment to using only the freshest ingredients, sourced directly from local farmers and producers whenever possible. This not only ensures superior quality but also supports the local agricultural community. Beyond the restaurant itself, FoodExx provides catering services for events of all sizes, bringing its signature flavors and commitment to quality to private parties, corporate gatherings, and community celebrations. This dual approach allows FoodExx to cater to the everyday dining needs of the local populace and the specialized requirements of event organizers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At FoodExx, customer experience is paramount. The restaurant strives to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere where guests feel valued and appreciated. From the moment they step through the door, customers are greeted with friendly and attentive service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and to provide personalized recommendations based on individual preferences and dietary needs. The ambiance is carefully designed to be both modern and inviting, featuring comfortable seating, aesthetically pleasing décor, and a warm color palette. FoodExx actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, sponsorships, and partnerships with local organizations. The restaurant also leverages social media to engage with customers, share updates on new menu items, and solicit feedback. Furthermore, FoodExx prioritizes sustainability by minimizing waste, using eco-friendly packaging whenever possible, and supporting local environmental initiatives. By focusing on personalized service, community engagement, and sustainability, FoodExx aims to create a truly memorable and positive dining experience for every guest.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for FoodExx is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and community impact. The immediate plans involve expanding the menu to include more seasonal dishes, showcasing the diverse agricultural products of the Assam region. Further down the line, FoodExx envisions opening additional locations, both within Shillong and in other key areas of Assam, to broaden its reach and impact. A key long-term goal is to establish a culinary training program for local youth, providing them with the skills and knowledge necessary to pursue careers in the food service industry. This initiative would not only address the growing demand for skilled culinary professionals but also empower young people and contribute to the economic development of the region. Ultimately, FoodExx aspires to become a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, community engagement, and sustainability. The vision is to create a lasting legacy that extends beyond the restaurant walls, enriching the lives of the local community and contributing to the vibrancy of the regional culinary scene.</p>', 'Shillong Road, opp. Anil Plaza', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:40:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1658, 'Botanee', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Botanee: Cultivating Growth and Innovation from the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<p>Located on the 3rd floor of Sureka Square, Botanee stands as a vibrant and innovative business dedicated to fostering growth, learning, and connection within the Assam business community. We\'re not just another service provider; we are a catalyst, committed to understanding and meeting the unique needs of the region through targeted solutions and a deep-rooted commitment to local values. Botanee recognizes the untapped potential within Assam\'s entrepreneurial spirit and seeks to empower individuals and organizations alike with the tools and resources necessary to thrive in an ever-evolving market. Our presence in Sureka Square, a known hub for business activity, positions us perfectly to interact, collaborate, and contribute to the ongoing development of Assam\'s economic landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Botanee\'s offerings are three primary services: specialized business consulting, personalized skill development workshops, and community-focused networking events. Our business consulting arm provides tailored strategies for local businesses seeking to optimize operations, expand market reach, or navigate the challenges of the regional economy. We delve into the specifics of each client\'s situation, providing actionable insights and practical solutions that consider the unique socio-economic context of Assam. Unlike generic consulting firms, we prioritize local knowledge and sustainable growth, focusing on building resilient businesses that contribute positively to the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our skill development workshops are designed to bridge the gap between theoretical knowledge and practical application. Covering a range of topics from digital marketing and financial literacy to leadership and team building, these workshops are facilitated by experienced professionals with a deep understanding of the local business environment. A unique selling point is our emphasis on indigenous knowledge and practices, integrating them with modern techniques to create a learning experience that is both relevant and empowering. We ensure accessibility by offering workshops in multiple local languages and at various price points, making professional development attainable for a wider audience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Finally, Botanee fosters a strong sense of community through carefully curated networking events. These events provide a platform for entrepreneurs, business leaders, and aspiring professionals to connect, collaborate, and share ideas. By creating a supportive and inclusive environment, we encourage the exchange of knowledge and the formation of valuable partnerships that can drive collective growth. These aren\'t just run-of-the-mill networking mixers; we incorporate cultural elements and local traditions to create a truly unique and engaging experience, fostering deeper connections and a stronger sense of belonging.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Botanee. We believe in building lasting relationships based on trust, transparency, and genuine care. Our approach is deeply personalized, taking the time to understand each client\'s specific needs and challenges. We go beyond simply providing services; we act as partners, offering ongoing support and guidance to help our clients achieve their goals. We distinguish ourselves through active listening, responsive communication, and a proactive approach to problem-solving. We are committed to exceeding expectations and creating a positive and memorable experience for every individual who interacts with Botanee.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, Botanee actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, including sponsoring local events, partnering with non-profit organizations, and providing pro bono services to small businesses in underserved areas. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and are committed to making a positive impact on the lives of those around us. This commitment to social responsibility is not just a marketing strategy; it is a core value that drives everything we do.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Botanee envisions itself as a leading force for positive change in the Assam business landscape. Our future plans include expanding our range of services, developing new training programs tailored to emerging industries, and establishing strategic partnerships with national and international organizations. We are committed to staying at the forefront of innovation and adapting our offerings to meet the evolving needs of the market. We aim to become a recognized center of excellence for business development and skill enhancement in the region, attracting talent and investment to Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable economic growth of Assam by empowering individuals and organizations to reach their full potential. We believe that by fostering a culture of innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning, we can create a brighter future for the region. Botanee is not just a business; it is a commitment to the future of Assam, a promise to cultivate growth and innovation from the very heart of the community.</p>', '3rd floor, Sureka Square', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:40:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(1659, 'Olio', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Olio: Weaving Assam\'s Rich Heritage into Contemporary Experiences</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, Olio is more than just a business; it’s a conduit connecting the region\'s vibrant traditions with the demands of the modern world. Rooted in the rich cultural tapestry of the Northeast, Olio strives to deliver exceptional experiences and high-quality products that showcase the unique artistry and natural bounty of Assam. Situated at \'\', Olio serves as a focal point for both locals and visitors seeking authentic and ethically sourced goods and services. Recognizing a gap in the market for businesses that genuinely prioritize local artisans and sustainable practices, Olio was established to fill this void, contributing to the economic empowerment of the community while promoting Assam’s distinctive identity.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Olio offers a carefully curated range of handcrafted products and immersive cultural experiences. Our primary product line features textiles woven by local artisans, using traditional techniques passed down through generations. These aren\'t mere fabrics; they are stories woven into intricate patterns, reflecting the diverse cultures and landscapes of Assam. We offer a variety of styles, from Eri silk shawls known for their warmth and durability to Muga silk sarees renowned for their golden sheen, each piece representing a unique piece of Assam\'s heritage. Beyond textiles, Olio also features handcrafted jewellery, intricately carved wooden artifacts, and locally sourced tea and spices, providing a comprehensive offering of Assam\'s finest products. <br> <br> A key differentiator for Olio lies in its commitment to fair trade practices. We work directly with artisan communities, ensuring they receive fair wages and recognition for their skills. This not only empowers these communities but also guarantees the authenticity and quality of our products. In addition to product sales, Olio offers cultural immersion experiences, including guided tours of local villages, workshops on traditional weaving techniques, and culinary classes showcasing Assamese cuisine. These experiences are designed to provide visitors with a deeper understanding and appreciation of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage, promoting responsible tourism and fostering cross-cultural exchange. These cultural experiences are particularly appealing to tourists seeking authentic encounters, and to locals interested in preserving and celebrating their heritage.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Olio. We strive to create a welcoming and engaging environment for every visitor. Our staff is meticulously trained to be knowledgeable about our products and the artisans who create them, providing insightful information and personalized recommendations. We believe in building relationships with our customers, understanding their needs, and exceeding their expectations. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. <br> <br> Olio also actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. We regularly host events showcasing local artists and artisans, providing them with a platform to share their work and connect with a wider audience. We partner with local schools and organizations to offer educational programs on Assam\'s cultural heritage, fostering a sense of pride and responsibility among the younger generation. We are committed to sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental impact by sourcing materials locally and using eco-friendly packaging. Our dedication to ethical sourcing and community engagement has earned us a reputation as a trusted and responsible business within the local community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, Olio envisions becoming a leading platform for promoting Assam\'s cultural heritage and sustainable products on a national and international scale. We plan to expand our product line to include more diverse offerings from across the Northeast, showcasing the region\'s rich tapestry of cultures and traditions. We aim to enhance our online presence, creating a user-friendly e-commerce platform that allows customers from around the world to access our unique products and experiences. <br> <br> A key strategic focus is to develop stronger partnerships with tourism agencies and tour operators, integrating our cultural experiences into established tourism circuits. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for local artisans, empowering them to enhance their skills and create innovative products that meet the evolving demands of the market. We aspire to become a certified fair trade organization, further solidifying our commitment to ethical and sustainable practices. Ultimately, Olio\'s long-term goal is to create a positive social and economic impact on the communities we serve, while preserving and promoting Assam\'s unique cultural heritage for generations to come. We believe that by combining a passion for our region\'s traditions with a commitment to sustainable business practices, Olio can play a significant role in shaping a brighter future for Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:40:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1660, 'Annapurnam', 'Restaurants', '', 'Annapurnam, strategically located in Krishna Tower, GS Rd, opposite the DY365 Office in Guwahati, Assam, stands as a premier establishment offering a unique blend of [Specify Annapurnam’s core offering - e.g., authentic Assamese cuisine, premium tea and snacks, artisanal handicrafts, or a combination]. More than just a business, Annapurnam strives to be a cultural touchstone, reflecting the rich heritage and traditions of Assam while catering to the evolving tastes of a modern clientele. Its prime location within a bustling commercial hub allows Annapurnam to serve both local residents and visiting tourists, making it a significant player in the local economy and a contributor to the region\'s vibrant identity. Annapurnam seeks to redefine the [Industry/Sector] experience in Guwahati, offering something truly distinct and memorable.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAnnapurnam specializes in [Expand on the core offering, providing specific examples. E.g., \"offering a meticulously curated menu of traditional Assamese dishes, prepared using locally sourced ingredients and time-honored recipes.\" Or \"providing a wide selection of high-quality Assam tea, ranging from classic black tea to rare and exotic varieties, along with a range of complementary snacks and pastries.\"] The primary services include [List key services, e.g., dine-in service, takeaway options, catering for local events, online ordering, or retail sales of packaged goods]. A key differentiator for Annapurnam is its commitment to [Highlight a unique selling proposition. E.g., \"using only organic and sustainably sourced ingredients.\" Or \"preserving traditional Assamese cooking techniques.\" Or \"offering a personalized tea tasting experience guided by expert tea sommeliers\"]. These services are designed to meet the specific needs of the local market by [Explain how the services address local demands. E.g., \"providing a healthy and flavorful alternative to fast food.\" Or \"offering a convenient and accessible source for authentic Assamese products.\" Or \"catering to the growing demand for unique and memorable experiences.\"]. Annapurnam aims to satisfy a gap in the market for authentic, high-quality [Type of Offering] that both locals and visitors can appreciate.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Annapurnam, the customer experience is paramount. The business is dedicated to providing warm, friendly, and efficient service to every guest. Staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the [Specific Offering] and to offer personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. Annapurnam distinguishes itself through [Describe specific aspects of customer service. E.g., \"its inviting and aesthetically pleasing ambiance that reflects Assamese culture.\" Or \"its commitment to addressing customer feedback and continuously improving its offerings.\" Or \"its personalized service, where staff remember regular customers and their preferences.\"] Beyond providing exceptional service, Annapurnam actively connects with the local community by [Explain how the business engages with the local community. E.g., \"sponsoring local cultural events.\" Or \"partnering with local artisans and producers.\" Or \"offering workshops and demonstrations on Assamese [Related Skill, e.g., cooking or crafts]\".] Annapurnam believes in fostering strong relationships with its customers and contributing to the well-being of the community it serves. Building long-term relationships and creating a welcoming atmosphere are key to Annapurnam’s continued success.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Annapurnam envisions significant growth potential. Future plans include [Describe specific plans for expansion or new initiatives. E.g., \"expanding its menu to include more regional specialties.\" Or \"opening additional locations in other parts of Assam.\" Or \"developing an online platform for e-commerce and delivery.\" Or \"partnering with local hotels and tour operators to promote Assamese culture.\"]. The long-term goal is to establish Annapurnam as a leading [Type of Business] in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and community engagement. Annapurnam is committed to embracing innovation and adapting to the changing needs of the market while staying true to its core values. The business aims to become synonymous with [Key Desired Association, e.g., authentic Assamese flavors, premium tea experience, or unique cultural offerings] in the minds of customers, both local and international. Annapurnam sees itself as a vital part of the Assam business landscape, contributing to the region\'s economic growth and cultural preservation for years to come.', 'Krishna Tower, GS Rd, opposite DY365 Office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:45:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1661, 'Naga flavour - Authentic Naga Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p><b>Naga Flavour - Authentic Naga Restaurant: A Culinary Journey to the Heart of Nagaland in Guwahati</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Naga Flavour, located on the 1st floor of Avtar Complex, Basistha Rd, Guwahati, isn\'t just a restaurant; it\'s an immersive cultural experience. It offers a genuine taste of Nagaland, bringing the distinct and vibrant flavors of the Naga hills to the heart of Assam. In a region rich with culinary diversity, Naga Flavour distinguishes itself by specializing solely in authentic Naga cuisine, filling a previously unmet demand for this unique culinary tradition. It stands as a beacon of Naga culture, offering both locals and tourists a chance to explore and appreciate the unique gastronomic heritage of the Naga people. Its presence enriches the local business landscape by introducing a distinctive dining option, contributing to the area\'s culinary tapestry and attracting customers seeking adventurous and authentic food experiences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering is a comprehensive menu featuring traditional Naga dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring the freshest and most authentic flavors. Signature dishes include pork with akhuni (fermented soybean), bamboo shoot curry with fish, and various preparations of Naga dal, each reflecting the unique cooking styles and ingredients of different Naga tribes. Naga Flavour also offers a selection of traditional rice beers, complementing the spicy and flavorful dishes. What sets Naga Flavour apart is not just the food itself, but the entire dining experience. We prioritize the use of traditional cooking methods, often employing open fire and bamboo steaming to impart distinct smoky and earthy notes to the dishes. This commitment to authenticity, coupled with the use of unique ingredients sourced from or inspired by Nagaland, offers a dining experience unmatched by other restaurants in the area. We also offer catering services for small events, allowing customers to share the unique taste of Nagaland with their friends and family. This caters to the local market\'s desire for unique and authentic experiences, providing a welcome alternative to standard restaurant fare.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Naga Flavour, customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where guests feel comfortable exploring the unfamiliar tastes of Naga cuisine. Our staff is trained not only to provide efficient and friendly service but also to educate customers about the dishes, their origins, and cultural significance. We actively engage with the local community through participation in food festivals and cultural events, showcasing Naga cuisine and promoting cross-cultural understanding. We also prioritize building relationships with local suppliers, supporting small businesses and ensuring the freshest ingredients. Regular feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve the dining experience and menu offerings, ensuring that Naga Flavour remains a vibrant and responsive member of the Guwahati community. We believe that the best way to connect with the local community is through genuine interaction and a shared appreciation for culture and cuisine.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Naga Flavour envisions itself as the premier destination for authentic Naga cuisine in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to showcase an even wider variety of dishes from different Naga tribes, offering cooking classes to share the art of Naga cooking, and potentially opening additional locations within Assam and other major cities. A key focus will be on sustainable practices, including sourcing ingredients responsibly and minimizing environmental impact. The business also aims to become a platform for promoting Naga culture, showcasing traditional music, art, and handicrafts within the restaurant. Long-term goals include establishing partnerships with Naga farmers and producers, ensuring a stable supply of authentic ingredients and supporting the economic development of Nagaland. Naga Flavour strives to be more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural ambassador, fostering appreciation for the rich heritage of Nagaland and creating a lasting positive impact on both the local community and the broader culinary landscape.</p>', '1st floor Avtar Complex, Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:45:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1662, 'Gogoi Pork', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Gogoi Pork, situated prominently within the supermarket at Swapta Swahid Path, GS Rd, is a purveyor of high-quality pork products, deeply rooted in the culinary traditions of Assam. More than just a meat provider, Gogoi Pork strives to be a cornerstone of the local food culture, offering a range of products that cater to both everyday meals and festive celebrations. The business is committed to sourcing the finest local pork, ensuring freshness and contributing to the sustainability of regional agriculture. Located within a bustling supermarket, Gogoi Pork offers unparalleled accessibility for residents and visitors alike, making it a convenient stop for those seeking premium pork products. Our commitment to quality, coupled with our strategic location, positions Gogoi Pork as a significant player in the local food market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Gogoi Pork\'s offerings is a diverse selection of fresh pork cuts, catering to a wide array of culinary needs. From succulent pork belly, perfect for traditional Assamese preparations like Khar, to lean cuts ideal for grilling or stir-frying, we provide options for every taste and recipe. Beyond fresh cuts, Gogoi Pork also offers processed pork products, including smoked sausages, bacon, and cured meats. These products are made using time-honored recipes and techniques, resulting in distinctive flavors that are both authentic and satisfying. A key differentiator for Gogoi Pork is its emphasis on locally sourced pork. We partner with regional farmers who adhere to ethical and sustainable farming practices, ensuring that our products are not only of the highest quality but also contribute to the well-being of the local economy. By prioritizing local sourcing, we minimize transportation distances, preserving freshness and reducing our environmental footprint. Gogoi Pork\'s commitment to quality and local sourcing makes it the preferred choice for discerning customers seeking authentic and flavorful pork products.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Gogoi Pork understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to building lasting relationships with the community. Our staff is knowledgeable about our products, readily offering cooking suggestions and recipe ideas to customers. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers feel valued and supported. Beyond providing excellent service within our supermarket location, Gogoi Pork actively engages with the local community. We participate in local food festivals and events, showcasing our products and connecting with potential customers. We also collaborate with local chefs and restaurants, supplying them with our premium pork and supporting the regional culinary scene. By building strong relationships with both our customers and the broader community, Gogoi Pork aims to become a trusted and respected member of the local business landscape. We believe that our commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement sets us apart and fosters a sense of loyalty among our clientele.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Gogoi Pork envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded impact within the local market. Our immediate plans include expanding our product line to include more specialized pork cuts and value-added products, catering to evolving consumer preferences. We also aim to strengthen our relationships with local farmers, ensuring a consistent supply of high-quality pork and supporting sustainable agricultural practices. A key element of our future vision is to enhance our brand presence and customer reach. We plan to leverage digital marketing strategies to connect with a wider audience, promoting our products and highlighting our commitment to quality and local sourcing. Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of establishing a direct-to-consumer online platform, offering convenient access to our products for customers throughout the region. Ultimately, Gogoi Pork aspires to be recognized as the leading provider of premium pork products in Assam, known for its unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. Our long-term goal is to not only grow our business but also contribute to the prosperity of the local economy and the preservation of Assam\'s rich culinary heritage.</p>', 'supermarket, Swapta Swahid Path, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:45:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1663, 'Leaf Deck Café', 'Restaurants', '', 'Leaf Deck Café: A Refreshing Oasis on GS Road, Guwahati\n\nLeaf Deck Café stands as a vibrant addition to Guwahati\'s burgeoning café culture, offering a unique blend of culinary delights and a tranquil ambiance right on GS Road, opposite GTAC. More than just a place to grab a quick bite, Leaf Deck is designed to be a community hub, a place where friends can connect, professionals can unwind, and everyone can enjoy a moment of respite from the city\'s hustle. Nestled in a prime location, the café aims to distinguish itself not only through its quality offerings but also through a commitment to creating a welcoming and memorable experience for every guest. Recognizing the increasing demand for quality leisure spaces in Guwahati, Leaf Deck strives to fill the gap by providing a comfortable and stylish setting for social interaction and relaxation.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Leaf Deck Café offers a comprehensive menu designed to cater to diverse palates. Our primary offerings encompass a curated selection of artisanal coffees, expertly brewed using locally sourced beans whenever possible, supporting Assam\'s rich coffee heritage. Beyond coffee, we present a variety of refreshing beverages, including handcrafted teas, smoothies, and mocktails, perfect for the Guwahati climate. The food menu complements our drinks selection with a range of savory and sweet options. From light bites like sandwiches, wraps, and salads, perfect for a quick lunch, to more substantial dishes like pasta and continental options, we aim to satisfy a wide spectrum of culinary preferences. Our pastries and desserts are made fresh daily, offering a tempting indulgence for those with a sweet tooth.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Leaf Deck Café apart is its commitment to providing a unique and locally relevant experience. We prioritize using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers. Our menu also incorporates Assamese flavors and ingredients, subtly weaving in regional culinary traditions to create a distinctive identity. The café’s ambiance is carefully curated to provide a relaxing and inviting atmosphere. The interior design incorporates natural elements, creating a sense of calm and tranquility. Comfortable seating arrangements, coupled with soft lighting and soothing music, further enhance the overall experience. We also offer free Wi-Fi, making Leaf Deck an ideal spot for students, remote workers, and anyone looking to stay connected.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of Leaf Deck Café\'s philosophy. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. We strive to create a genuine connection with our customers, remembering their preferences and anticipating their needs. Building relationships within the local community is also a priority. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, partnering with nearby organizations to support community causes. We also host regular events at the café, such as live music performances, art exhibitions, and workshops, creating a vibrant and engaging space for the local community to come together. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the café itself. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. We are also responsive to online reviews and comments, addressing any concerns promptly and professionally.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Leaf Deck Café envisions becoming a cornerstone of the GS Road community, known for its quality offerings, exceptional service, and commitment to local values. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more innovative and seasonal dishes, showcasing the diversity of Assamese cuisine. We also aim to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and craftsmen to showcase their work at the café, providing a platform for them to reach a wider audience. Long-term, we aspire to expand our presence beyond the current location, opening new branches in other parts of Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam, while maintaining the same commitment to quality, community, and exceptional customer service that defines Leaf Deck Café. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, Leaf Deck can become a leading café brand in Assam, contributing to the region\'s vibrant culinary landscape.', 'GS Rd, opp. GTAC', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:45:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1664, 'Kori\'s', 'Restaurants', '', 'Kori\'s: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nKori\'s, located at Kori\'s Cafe & Restro, 2nd Floor, R.G.B Road, Zoo Rd, Jonali Path, opp. S.B.I Bank, is more than just a cafe and restaurant; it\'s a destination. Nestled in the vibrant Jonali Path area of Guwahati, Assam, Kori\'s offers a unique blend of delectable cuisine, a welcoming ambiance, and exceptional service, establishing itself as a key player in the local food and beverage sector. In a region known for its rich culinary heritage and burgeoning cafe culture, Kori\'s stands out by providing a modern, elevated dining experience while remaining deeply connected to the community it serves. The establishment aims to be a place where locals and visitors alike can gather, connect, and savor memorable moments over delightful food and drinks.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Kori\'s provides a diverse menu encompassing cafe classics and restaurant-style meals. The cafe element focuses on freshly brewed coffees, artisanal teas, and a selection of pastries, cakes, and light snacks, perfect for a quick bite or a leisurely afternoon. The restaurant aspect expands into a curated menu of dishes designed to tantalize taste buds, likely featuring a fusion of international flavors and locally sourced ingredients, reflecting Assam\'s abundant produce. A unique selling point could be its specialty coffee blends, roasted in-house, or a signature dish showcasing traditional Assamese flavors with a contemporary twist. Furthermore, Kori’s likely caters to diverse dietary needs, potentially offering vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options, thereby meeting the evolving preferences of the local market. By combining quality ingredients, innovative recipes, and appealing presentation, Kori\'s aims to differentiate itself from competitors and become a go-to spot for discerning diners.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Kori\'s. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. Kori\'s aims to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, possibly through thoughtful interior design, comfortable seating, and soft lighting, promoting relaxation and conversation. Furthermore, Kori’s likely engages with the local community through special events, promotions, and partnerships with local businesses. Perhaps Kori\'s hosts live music nights featuring local artists, or collaborates with nearby schools for fundraising initiatives. Such initiatives foster a sense of belonging and loyalty among customers, solidifying Kori\'s position as a neighborhood hub. Feedback is actively encouraged and used to constantly improve the dining experience, demonstrating a commitment to exceeding customer expectations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Kori\'s has significant potential for growth and expansion. Plans may include expanding the menu to include seasonal specials, introducing a loyalty program to reward regular customers, or offering catering services for local events. Another potential avenue for growth could be establishing an online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, thereby reaching a wider audience and increasing accessibility. Long-term goals may involve opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati or even expanding to other cities in Assam. Kori\'s could also consider partnering with local farmers and producers to source ingredients sustainably and support the local economy. By staying true to its core values of quality, customer service, and community engagement, Kori\'s aims to solidify its position as a leading cafe and restaurant in the region and continue to delight customers for years to come.', 'kori\'s cafe & restro, 2nd Floor, R.G.B Road, Zoo Rd, Jonali Path, opp. S.B.I Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:45:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1665, 'Kerala Bhavan', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Kerala Bhavan, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, stands as a vibrant testament to the rich culinary and cultural heritage of Kerala. More than just a restaurant, Kerala Bhavan is a cultural bridge, bringing authentic Kerala flavors and traditions to the diverse palate of Assam. In a region renowned for its own distinct culinary identity, Kerala Bhavan has carved a niche for itself by offering a genuine and immersive Kerala experience, contributing significantly to the expanding culinary diversity of the city.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Kerala Bhavan\'s core offering revolves around authentic Kerala cuisine. The menu boasts a wide array of dishes, from the ever-popular appam and stew to the flavorful fish curries cooked in traditional clay pots, using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Seafood, a cornerstone of Kerala cuisine, features prominently, with preparations ranging from spicy prawn masala to delicate fish moilee. Vegetarian options are equally abundant, showcasing the diverse range of vegetables and spices used in Kerala cooking. The restaurant also offers traditional Kerala snacks and sweets, providing a complete culinary journey. A key differentiator is the restaurant\'s commitment to using authentic Kerala recipes and cooking techniques, ensuring a genuine taste of the region. This authenticity is further enhanced by sourcing spices and other key ingredients directly from Kerala, preserving the integrity of the flavors. This attention to detail and commitment to authenticity are major selling points, appealing to both Keralites residing in Assam and locals eager to explore new culinary horizons. Kerala Bhavan effectively addresses the market need for authentic regional cuisine and provides a refreshing alternative to the more common restaurant offerings in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Kerala Bhavan, customer experience is paramount. The restaurant strives to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, reminiscent of a traditional Kerala home. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and to provide attentive and personalized service. The ambiance is carefully curated to evoke the spirit of Kerala, with subtle décor elements reflecting the state\'s rich culture. What truly sets Kerala Bhavan apart is its dedication to fostering a sense of community. The restaurant regularly hosts cultural events, showcasing Kerala dance, music, and art, providing a platform for cultural exchange and celebrating the shared heritage of Kerala and Assam. Furthermore, Kerala Bhavan actively participates in local festivals and community initiatives, strengthening its ties to the community and solidifying its position as a valuable cultural asset in Guwahati. The restaurant also caters to specific dietary needs and preferences, ensuring that every guest feels comfortable and catered to. Feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve the dining experience and maintain the highest standards of customer satisfaction.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Kerala Bhavan envisions expanding its reach and impact within the local business landscape. Plans include introducing a wider range of Kerala dishes, including regional specialties and seasonal offerings, to further diversify the menu and cater to evolving customer preferences. There is also potential for expanding the restaurant\'s catering services, bringing authentic Kerala cuisine to events and gatherings throughout Guwahati. Another key area of focus is strengthening partnerships with local suppliers and farmers, promoting sustainable practices and supporting the local economy. The long-term goal is to establish Kerala Bhavan as the premier destination for authentic Kerala cuisine and cultural experiences in Assam. Further, there are considerations to expand into related areas such as offering Kerala cooking classes to share the culinary traditions with a wider audience and potentially establishing a small retail outlet selling Kerala spices, snacks, and handicrafts. By consistently delivering exceptional food, impeccable service, and a genuine cultural experience, Kerala Bhavan aims to solidify its position as a beloved and respected business in the Guwahati community, contributing to the city\'s vibrant culinary scene and fostering a deeper appreciation for the diverse cultural heritage of India.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:50:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1666, 'Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road, situated on the 4th Floor of Adityam Building on GS Road, offers an authentic Rajasthani dining experience, reimagined for the vibrant palate of Guwahati. More than just a restaurant, Ghoomar is a culinary journey, transporting guests to the heart of Rajasthan with its meticulously crafted thalis, warm hospitality, and commitment to preserving the rich traditions of Rajasthani cuisine. In a city known for its diverse culinary influences, Ghoomar stands out as a beacon of authentic regional Indian flavors, providing a unique and memorable dining experience that resonates with locals and visitors alike. It distinguishes itself not only through the quality of its food but also through its commitment to cultural representation and elevated service, making it a significant and cherished part of the GS Road business landscape.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of Ghoomar’s offering is the traditional Rajasthani Thali. This isn\'t merely a plate of food; it\'s a carefully curated ensemble of dishes, each representing a different facet of Rajasthani culinary artistry. From the savory Dal Baati Churma to the spicy Gatte ki Sabzi and the sweet notes of Moong Dal Halwa, every element is prepared with authentic recipes and high-quality ingredients. The restaurant emphasizes using locally sourced produce whenever possible to ensure freshness and support local farmers, while adhering to traditional cooking methods to maintain the authenticity of the flavors. What truly sets Ghoomar apart is its unwavering commitment to providing an all-you-can-eat thali experience, allowing guests to savor a wide variety of dishes and explore the diverse flavors of Rajasthan without limitations. This abundance, coupled with the dedication to authentic taste, fills a significant need in the local market, catering to customers who appreciate both value and quality in their dining experiences. Additionally, Ghoomar offers a selection of Rajasthani beverages and snacks to complement the thali, further enriching the overall dining experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road believes that exceptional food should be accompanied by exceptional service. The restaurant cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where guests are treated with genuine Rajasthani hospitality. Staff members are trained to be attentive, knowledgeable about the menu, and eager to cater to individual preferences and dietary requirements. The restaurant understands that many diners might be unfamiliar with Rajasthani cuisine, and therefore, the staff are adept at explaining the dishes and offering recommendations. Beyond impeccable service, Ghoomar strives to connect with the local community by participating in local events and festivals, showcasing Rajasthani culture through food. Special thalis are occasionally introduced to celebrate specific occasions or seasons, adding an element of novelty and excitement for regular patrons. By fostering a sense of community and cultural exchange, Ghoomar establishes itself as more than just a restaurant; it becomes a cultural ambassador, promoting the rich heritage of Rajasthan within the heart of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. While maintaining its core commitment to authentic Rajasthani cuisine and exceptional service, the restaurant plans to explore opportunities to broaden its reach and impact. This could involve expanding to new locations within Guwahati or even exploring other cities in the region. Future plans may also include introducing new dishes and variations on the traditional thali to cater to evolving tastes and preferences. Furthermore, Ghoomar aims to enhance its online presence through online ordering and delivery services, making it even more accessible to a wider audience. The long-term goal is to establish Ghoomar as the premier destination for authentic Rajasthani cuisine in the region, renowned for its quality, service, and commitment to cultural preservation. By continuously innovating and adapting while staying true to its core values, Ghoomar Traditional Thali Restaurants - GS Road is poised for continued success and a lasting legacy in the Assam culinary landscape.</p>', '4th Floor, Adityam Building, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:50:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1667, 'Black bird (the local kitchen)', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Black bird (the local kitchen) is a culinary gem nestled in the heart of Assam, dedicated to showcasing the rich and diverse flavors of Assamese cuisine with a modern twist. More than just a restaurant, Black bird is a celebration of local ingredients, traditional recipes passed down through generations, and the vibrant culture of the region. We strive to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, providing a unique dining experience that delights both residents and visitors alike. Black bird stands out by offering authentic Assamese dishes prepared with a contemporary approach, elevating traditional fare to new heights while remaining true to its roots.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing an authentic and unforgettable Assamese culinary journey. We specialize in dishes crafted from locally sourced produce, meats, and spices, ensuring freshness and supporting the region\'s farmers and producers. Our menu features a range of traditional Assamese delicacies, from the tangy and flavorful <i>Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry) to the savory and aromatic <i>Khar</i> (alkaline dish), each prepared with meticulous attention to detail and using time-honored techniques. A signature element of Black bird is our commitment to innovative presentations. We take pride in presenting traditional dishes in modern, visually appealing ways, enhancing the overall dining experience. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to bridge the gap between authentic Assamese flavors and contemporary culinary aesthetics, appealing to both traditionalists and adventurous palates. We also offer a selection of refreshing local beverages, including Assamese tea and homemade fruit juices, complementing the food and further immersing our guests in the region\'s culinary heritage. Black bird addresses a growing demand for authentic Assamese cuisine in a market often dominated by other regional and international options. We cater to individuals seeking a genuine taste of Assam, as well as tourists eager to explore the region\'s rich culinary traditions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Black bird, we prioritize creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels like family. Our approach to customer service is rooted in genuine hospitality and personalized attention. Our staff is not only knowledgeable about our menu and ingredients but also passionate about sharing the stories behind each dish, providing diners with insights into Assamese culture and culinary traditions. We believe in building relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and loyalty. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local food festivals and events, showcasing our culinary expertise and promoting Assamese cuisine to a wider audience. We also collaborate with local artists and artisans to decorate our space, creating an ambiance that reflects the region\'s artistic heritage. Black bird is more than just a place to eat; it\'s a gathering place where people can connect, celebrate, and experience the true essence of Assam. We achieve this by ensuring that the setting of the physical restaurant supports the overall food and service excellence, creating an atmosphere that is both modern and welcoming.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Black bird envisions becoming a leading advocate for Assamese cuisine on a regional and potentially national scale. Our future plans involve expanding our menu to include even more diverse and lesser-known Assamese dishes, further enriching the culinary experience we offer. We aim to establish partnerships with local farmers and producers to source an even greater percentage of our ingredients locally, strengthening our commitment to sustainability and supporting the local economy. We are also exploring opportunities to offer cooking classes and workshops, sharing our knowledge and passion for Assamese cuisine with aspiring cooks and food enthusiasts. Furthermore, we envision expanding our reach through catering services and online ordering, making our authentic Assamese fare accessible to a wider audience. Our long-term goal is to establish Black bird as a cultural ambassador for Assam, promoting its unique culinary heritage and contributing to the region\'s economic growth. We plan to explore the potential for opening additional locations, carefully selecting sites that align with our brand values and commitment to quality. By continuously innovating, embracing sustainability, and fostering strong community ties, Black bird aims to remain a vibrant and integral part of the Assam business landscape for years to come.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:50:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1668, 'Kimchi Eonni', 'Restaurants', '', 'Kimchi Eonni: Bringing Authentic Korean Flavors to Shanti Path\n\nKimchi Eonni, located at NO:18, Shanti Path, next to PRAPTI MART, is a culinary gem bringing the vibrant and authentic tastes of Korean cuisine to the heart of Assam. More than just a restaurant, Kimchi Eonni is a cultural bridge, offering a unique dining experience that resonates with the local palate while introducing the richness and diversity of Korean culinary traditions. In a region known for its diverse culinary landscape, Kimchi Eonni distinguishes itself by specializing in authentic Korean dishes prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients, filling a niche for those seeking genuine international flavors. We strive to be a beloved community hub, a place where people can gather, enjoy delicious food, and experience a taste of Korea.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around providing an extensive menu of traditional Korean dishes, with a particular emphasis on the namesake, Kimchi. We offer a variety of Kimchi preparations, from the classic Napa cabbage Kimchi to other regional and seasonal variations. Beyond Kimchi, our menu features popular Korean staples such as Bibimbap (mixed rice with vegetables and meat), Bulgogi (marinated grilled beef), Japchae (glass noodles with vegetables), Tteokbokki (spicy rice cakes), and a selection of comforting Korean soups and stews like Kimchi Jjigae (Kimchi stew) and Sundubu Jjigae (soft tofu stew). We also cater to vegetarian and vegan preferences with thoughtfully crafted plant-based options.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat sets Kimchi Eonni apart is our unwavering commitment to authenticity. We source many of our ingredients directly, ensuring that the flavors are true to their Korean origins. We also take pride in our preparation methods, using traditional techniques passed down through generations. Our unique selling point lies in offering a truly immersive culinary experience, allowing customers to explore the depth and complexity of Korean cuisine beyond the familiar. By using locally sourced vegetables, where possible, we contribute to the local economy and ensure the freshness of our dishes. We also address the local market needs by offering customizable spice levels, ensuring our dishes are enjoyable for every palate. We are aware of the Assamese preference for specific flavors and ingredients, and we carefully balance authenticity with regional preferences to cater to our diverse clientele.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Kimchi Eonni, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a guest walks through our door, they are greeted with warmth and hospitality, embodying the spirit of \"Eonni,\" which translates to \"older sister\" in Korean – a term of endearment and respect. Our staff is knowledgeable and passionate about Korean cuisine, ready to guide customers through the menu, explain the dishes, and offer recommendations based on their preferences. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere where customers feel like they are dining in a Korean home.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe actively engage with the local community by participating in local events, organizing culinary workshops, and collaborating with other local businesses. We believe in fostering a sense of community and cultural exchange through food. We also encourage feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our menu and service. Our commitment to providing a personalized and attentive experience has helped us build a loyal customer base and establish ourselves as a trusted and respected member of the Shanti Path community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Kimchi Eonni envisions expanding its reach and becoming a leading destination for Korean cuisine in Assam. Our plans include introducing new and exciting dishes to our menu, expanding our seating capacity, and exploring the possibility of offering online ordering and delivery services to cater to a wider audience. We also aim to develop a line of signature Kimchi and Korean sauces for retail sale, allowing customers to enjoy the flavors of Kimchi Eonni in their own homes.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goals include establishing Kimchi Eonni as a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Korean food and exceptional customer service. We also hope to contribute to the cultural landscape of Assam by promoting cross-cultural understanding and appreciation through culinary experiences. By staying true to our values of authenticity, quality, and community engagement, Kimchi Eonni is committed to achieving sustainable growth and solidifying its position as a beloved and cherished establishment in the local business landscape, a place where the warmth of Korean hospitality meets the vibrant spirit of Assam.', 'NO:18, Shanti Path, next to PRAPTI MART', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:50:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
