(1669, 'Sura Vie', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Sura Vie, situated on the 4th floor of The Hub Mall, GS Rd, presents a sophisticated and contemporary experience in Guwahati\'s evolving hospitality sector. More than just a destination, Sura Vie aims to be a landmark, offering a unique blend of culinary artistry, premium beverages, and an ambiance that resonates with both local sensibilities and international standards. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and growing cosmopolitan outlook, Sura Vie distinguishes itself by creating a space where tradition meets modernity, providing an elevated dining and social experience unlike any other in the immediate vicinity.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Sura Vie offers a diverse range of services centered around providing a high-quality dining and beverage experience. The culinary offerings feature a curated menu designed to appeal to a wide range of palates. It encompasses both regional specialties prepared with locally sourced ingredients and internationally inspired dishes, all crafted with meticulous attention to detail. Complementing the food menu is an extensive beverage program that includes a carefully selected array of wines, spirits, and craft cocktails. The bar program focuses on both classic concoctions and innovative, signature drinks designed to be memorable and flavorful. What sets Sura Vie apart is its commitment to quality and presentation. Each dish and drink is thoughtfully prepared and presented, demonstrating a passion for culinary excellence. This commitment directly addresses the local market\'s growing desire for sophisticated and high-quality dining options that go beyond the ordinary. The intent is to deliver not merely sustenance, but a full sensory experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Sura Vie. From the moment a guest enters, the focus is on creating a welcoming and attentive environment. The staff are trained to provide personalized service, anticipating needs and ensuring that every visit is memorable. The ambiance of the space itself contributes significantly to the customer experience. The interior design reflects a modern aesthetic, incorporating comfortable seating, stylish decor, and carefully curated lighting to create a sophisticated and inviting atmosphere. The attention to detail extends to the background music and the overall energy of the space, fostering a sense of relaxed elegance. But what truly connects Sura Vie with the local community is a commitment to fostering relationships. The establishment aims to be a gathering place for friends, colleagues, and families. This is achieved through hosting special events, showcasing local artists, and actively participating in community initiatives. The goal is to be more than just a business; it\'s about being a contributing member of the local fabric, fostering a sense of belonging and shared experiences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Sura Vie envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities. The initial goal is to solidify its position as the premier dining and social destination in the Hub Mall area and the broader Guwahati region. This involves continuously refining the menu, enhancing the customer experience, and expanding the beverage program. Future plans may include introducing themed nights, live music performances, and collaborative events with local businesses and organizations. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand to other strategic locations within Assam and potentially beyond. This expansion would be carefully planned and executed to maintain the quality and consistency that define the Sura Vie brand. The ultimate vision is to establish Sura Vie as a recognized and respected name synonymous with exceptional dining, impeccable service, and a commitment to enriching the local community.</p>', '4th floor, The Hub Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:50:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1670, 'Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant is a newly established culinary destination, poised to become a cornerstone of the dining scene in the heart of Assam. Located in a strategically chosen area known for its vibrant community and increasing foot traffic, Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of authentic Assamese cuisine alongside popular regional and international dishes, served within a welcoming and family-friendly atmosphere. In a region rich with culinary tradition, our restaurant aims to elevate the dining experience by prioritizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients, innovative menu options, and exceptional customer service. We are committed to not just providing meals, but creating memorable experiences that cater to the diverse palates and social needs of the local community. The restaurant recognizes the importance of adapting to the evolving preferences of its customers, ensuring a consistently relevant and appealing offering in the competitive hospitality sector.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant, our core offering revolves around providing a comprehensive dining experience that caters to a wide range of tastes and preferences. Our menu is carefully curated to feature a harmonious blend of traditional Assamese delicacies, prepared using time-honored recipes and the freshest local ingredients, alongside a selection of familiar Indian favorites and carefully chosen continental dishes. This ensures that both local patrons seeking authentic flavors and visitors exploring the region\'s cuisine can find something to delight their palate. Beyond the diverse menu, a key unique selling point lies in our commitment to showcasing the culinary heritage of Assam. We actively seek out and incorporate seasonal ingredients sourced directly from local farmers and producers, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the highest quality and freshness in our dishes. The bar area offers a selection of locally brewed beers and carefully selected wines, complementing the food menu and providing a relaxed social setting. For families, we provide a dedicated children\'s menu with healthy and appealing options, along with a safe and comfortable environment that allows parents to relax and enjoy their meals. Furthermore, the restaurant offers catering services for local events and gatherings, bringing our culinary expertise directly to the community. This multifaceted approach ensures that Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant meets the diverse dining needs of the local market, catering to individuals, families, and corporate clients alike.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant\'s operational philosophy. We believe that exceptional service is just as important as the quality of our food. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where customers can relax, connect with friends and family, and enjoy a memorable dining experience. To further enhance customer satisfaction, we actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. We are deeply committed to connecting with the local community through various initiatives, such as supporting local cultural events, partnering with local businesses, and participating in charitable activities. We understand the importance of building strong relationships with our neighbors and contributing to the well-being of the community. Regular themed evenings and special promotions are planned to create a lively and engaging atmosphere, further fostering a sense of community and encouraging repeat visits. We are dedicated to creating a space where people feel a sense of belonging and can come together to celebrate the vibrant culture and culinary traditions of Assam. This community-centric approach, combined with exceptional service and high-quality food, sets Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant apart as a truly special dining destination.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant envisions itself as a leading culinary institution in Assam, renowned for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to showcase even more of the region\'s diverse culinary heritage, while also incorporating modern culinary techniques and trends. We plan to establish strategic partnerships with local farmers and suppliers to ensure a consistent supply of fresh, high-quality ingredients and support sustainable agricultural practices. Expansion is also a key element of our future vision. We aim to open additional branches in other strategic locations within Assam, bringing our unique dining experience to a wider audience. We also plan to invest in technology to streamline our operations, enhance customer service, and improve efficiency. This includes implementing online ordering and reservation systems, as well as utilizing data analytics to better understand customer preferences and tailor our offerings accordingly. Furthermore, we are committed to developing our staff through ongoing training and development programs, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge necessary to provide exceptional service and contribute to the success of the business. Ultimately, our goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional dining experiences but also makes a positive contribution to the local community and the culinary landscape of Assam. We strive to become a destination that locals are proud of and that visitors seek out to experience the authentic flavors and warm hospitality of the region.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:55:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1671, 'John Chang\'s Kitchen', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>John Chang\'s Kitchen, nestled at 5Q5F+RMH, GS Rd, stands as a vibrant testament to the fusion of authentic Assamese culinary traditions and modern dining experiences. More than just a restaurant, it is a destination that celebrates the rich flavors of Assam, offering a carefully curated menu that showcases the region\'s diverse culinary heritage. Located in a bustling area, John Chang\'s Kitchen offers a welcome respite, inviting patrons to savor both familiar comforts and exciting new tastes, contributing uniquely to the Assam business landscape by promoting local ingredients and culinary practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of John Chang\'s Kitchen lies its dedication to serving exceptional Assamese cuisine. The core offering revolves around providing authentic and innovative dishes that reflect the diverse regional flavors. From the classic Khar, a signature alkaline dish known for its unique taste and digestive properties, to the flavorful Masor Tenga, a sour fish curry, the menu is a journey through Assam\'s culinary landscape. Alongside traditional favorites, the kitchen also offers creative interpretations of local ingredients, introducing dishes that blend familiar tastes with modern culinary techniques. A significant unique selling point is the emphasis on sourcing fresh, locally grown produce whenever possible, ensuring quality and supporting local farmers. This commitment to local sourcing not only enhances the flavor profiles of the dishes but also directly addresses the growing demand for sustainable and ethically produced food within the community. The menu caters to a wide range of palates, including vegetarian and non-vegetarian options, ensuring there is something for everyone to enjoy. By highlighting the unique and often underrepresented flavors of Assam, John Chang\'s Kitchen fills a crucial gap in the local market, providing a platform for the region\'s culinary heritage to be appreciated and celebrated.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at John Chang\'s Kitchen. The approach is centered on creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Attentive and knowledgeable staff are trained to provide personalized recommendations and insights into the menu, enriching the dining experience with stories and context about the dishes. Beyond the exceptional food, the ambiance plays a crucial role in setting John Chang\'s Kitchen apart. The décor reflects the cultural richness of Assam, with subtle nods to local art and craftsmanship. This dedication to creating a culturally immersive experience fosters a strong connection with the local community. John Chang\'s Kitchen actively engages with local events and initiatives, participating in food festivals and collaborating with local artisans. This commitment to community involvement demonstrates a genuine desire to be more than just a restaurant; it strives to be a gathering place, a cultural hub, and a contributing member of the local ecosystem.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for John Chang\'s Kitchen is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and continued contribution to the Assam culinary scene. Expansion plans may include introducing new menu items that further explore the region\'s diverse ingredients and cooking styles, perhaps incorporating lesser-known delicacies and traditional cooking methods. Exploring opportunities for catering services and partnerships with local businesses could broaden the reach and impact of the brand. A long-term goal is to establish John Chang\'s Kitchen as a leading advocate for sustainable food practices in Assam, inspiring other businesses to prioritize local sourcing and ethical food production. Educational initiatives, such as cooking workshops and culinary tours, could further promote awareness of Assamese cuisine and its cultural significance. Ultimately, the vision is to solidify John Chang\'s Kitchen\'s position as a culinary landmark, recognized for its commitment to quality, authenticity, and its contribution to the vibrancy of the local community and the broader Assam region.</p>', '5Q5F+RMH, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:55:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1672, 'Souka Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Souka Restaurant, a vibrant culinary establishment located at the heart of Guwahati\'s bustling Paltan Bazaar, offers an authentic taste of Assam blended with contemporary flavors. More than just a restaurant, Souka is a celebration of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage, expressed through its cuisine, ambiance, and commitment to community engagement. Situated amidst the commercial hub, Souka provides a welcome respite for locals and tourists alike, offering a refined dining experience that captures the essence of Assam’s culinary traditions. Souka seeks to be a landmark destination, a place where stories are shared, traditions are savored, and culinary memories are created.\n<br> <br>\nSouka Restaurant\'s core offering revolves around providing an elevated dining experience centered on authentic Assamese cuisine with creative twists. The menu features a diverse array of traditional dishes, carefully prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Signature dishes include *Masor Tenga*, a tangy fish curry known for its distinctive sour flavor, *Khar*, a unique dish made with alkaline extract and various vegetables or meat, and *Pitha*, a range of traditional rice cakes and sweets. Souka differentiates itself through its commitment to quality ingredients, innovative presentation, and a modern interpretation of classic Assamese recipes. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to bridge the gap between traditional flavors and contemporary palates, appealing to both seasoned connoisseurs of Assamese cuisine and those new to the region\'s culinary delights. The menu also features carefully curated options for vegetarian and vegan diners, ensuring inclusivity and catering to diverse dietary preferences. By partnering with local farmers and suppliers, Souka supports the local economy and ensures the freshness and quality of its ingredients, contributing to a sustainable food ecosystem.\n<br> <br>\nAt Souka Restaurant, customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The ambiance is carefully curated to reflect Assam’s cultural heritage, featuring traditional Assamese decor, soothing music, and comfortable seating arrangements. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and passionate about sharing the stories behind each dish. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where guests feel valued and appreciated. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and incorporated to continuously improve the dining experience. Beyond the restaurant walls, Souka actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, sponsoring community initiatives, and offering cooking workshops that showcase Assamese cuisine. Souka believes in building strong relationships with its neighbors and contributing to the vibrant cultural tapestry of Guwahati. Special events and themed nights celebrating Assamese festivals are regularly organized, further solidifying Souka\'s commitment to preserving and promoting local traditions.\n<br> <br>\nSouka Restaurant envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to authentic Assamese cuisine, exceptional customer service, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties from across Assam, introducing a line of packaged Assamese spices and ingredients for customers to take home, and potentially opening additional locations in other major cities in the region. The long-term goal is to establish Souka as a national brand that represents the best of Assamese cuisine and culture, bringing the flavors and traditions of Assam to a wider audience. We plan to leverage digital marketing and social media to reach new customers and build brand awareness. Investment in staff training and development will remain a priority to ensure consistent quality and exceptional service across all aspects of the business. Souka is committed to sustainable practices and will continue to explore ways to minimize its environmental impact and support local communities. We also plan to explore collaborations with local artisans and craftsmen to showcase their work within the restaurant, further enhancing the cultural experience for our guests.\n</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:55:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1673, 'TransCurry Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>TransCurry Restaurant: A Taste of Assam, Globally Inspired</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>TransCurry Restaurant is a vibrant culinary destination situated at the heart of [Insert specific, even if general, location in Assam, e.g., “Guwahati\'s bustling Ganeshguri area” or “a prime location on GS Road”]. More than just a restaurant, TransCurry is a celebration of Assam\'s rich culinary heritage, infused with global influences to create a unique and unforgettable dining experience. In a region renowned for its distinctive flavors and warm hospitality, TransCurry stands out by skillfully blending traditional Assamese ingredients and cooking techniques with innovative international approaches. We aim to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, contributing to the region\'s cultural vibrancy and economic growth by providing exceptional food and service, while creating a welcoming space for locals and visitors alike.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing authentic Assamese cuisine with a contemporary twist. Our menu features classic dishes like <i>Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry), <i>Khar</i> (an alkaline dish made with dried banana peels), and a variety of bamboo shoot preparations, all prepared with the freshest, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. What sets TransCurry apart is our commitment to innovation. We don\'t simply replicate traditional recipes; we reimagine them. Our chefs experiment with global culinary techniques and flavor profiles to create innovative dishes that complement and enhance the inherent qualities of Assamese cuisine. For example, we might offer a <i>Masor Tenga</i> inspired broth with seared scallops or a <i>Khar</i> risotto with Parmesan cheese and truffle oil. We also offer a selection of international dishes, carefully curated to complement our Assamese offerings and cater to diverse palates. Vegetarian and vegan options are thoughtfully developed and prominently featured, reflecting our commitment to catering to all dietary preferences. Our carefully curated beverage menu features local teas, artisanal cocktails inspired by Assamese fruits and spices, and a selection of wines and beers from around the world. This diverse and innovative approach directly addresses the needs of the local market, which seeks both authentic regional flavors and globally inspired dining experiences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At TransCurry, we believe that exceptional food is only part of the dining experience. Our approach to customer service is centered around creating a warm, welcoming, and personalized atmosphere. From the moment guests enter our doors, they are greeted with genuine Assamese hospitality. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and passionate about the food and culture they represent. We strive to anticipate our guests\' needs and exceed their expectations, whether it\'s offering a recommendation based on their preferences or accommodating specific dietary requests. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local events, sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers, and partnering with local artists and artisans to showcase their work in our restaurant. We regularly host cultural events, such as traditional Assamese music performances and cooking demonstrations, to further connect with the community and promote the region\'s rich heritage. We actively solicit feedback from our customers through online reviews, in-house surveys, and direct interactions, using this feedback to continuously improve our service and offerings. Our commitment to providing a memorable and authentic Assamese experience has earned us a loyal following and a reputation as a beloved local establishment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, TransCurry envisions becoming a recognized and respected culinary ambassador for Assam on a national and even international stage. Our growth strategy focuses on several key areas. We plan to expand our restaurant\'s footprint, potentially opening additional locations in other major cities in Assam and beyond. We also intend to develop a line of packaged Assamese food products, such as spice blends, sauces, and ready-to-eat meals, to make the flavors of Assam more accessible to a wider audience. We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with other businesses in the tourism and hospitality sectors to create immersive Assamese cultural experiences. Furthermore, we plan to invest in culinary training programs to nurture and develop local talent, ensuring that the next generation of chefs is equipped to preserve and innovate Assamese cuisine. Our long-term goal is to establish TransCurry as a leading brand synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine, exceptional quality, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction. We believe that by staying true to our roots, embracing innovation, and prioritizing our customers and community, we can achieve this vision and contribute to the continued growth and prosperity of Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:55:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1674, 'The Root Barrel', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Located on the 7th Floor of Exotica Greens, The Root Barrel is a dynamic and innovative venture poised to reshape the business landscape of Assam. More than just a business, The Root Barrel represents a commitment to fostering local talent, promoting sustainable practices, and providing exceptional services to a rapidly growing community. Nestled within a modern, accessible location, it seeks to be a central hub for connection, innovation, and growth within the region.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The Root Barrel operates as a multifaceted establishment, offering a carefully curated blend of co-working spaces, artisanal coffee, and locally sourced produce. At its core, the business provides premium, flexible co-working solutions designed to meet the evolving needs of freelancers, startups, and established businesses. These spaces are thoughtfully designed to inspire creativity, foster collaboration, and enhance productivity, featuring high-speed internet, ergonomic furniture, private meeting rooms, and state-of-the-art technology. Supplementing the co-working environment is a sophisticated café offering specialty coffee crafted from locally sourced beans. By partnering directly with Assam\'s coffee growers, The Root Barrel provides not only a unique and flavorful experience but also supports local agriculture and sustainable farming practices. Further enriching the offering is a selection of seasonal, locally sourced produce. This conscious effort to connect consumers with the region’s rich agricultural heritage underscores the commitment to sustainability and community well-being. The unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of these three elements – co-working, coffee, and local produce – creating a vibrant ecosystem that supports local businesses, fosters innovation, and promotes a healthy lifestyle.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount to The Root Barrel\'s success. The business prides itself on providing exceptional, personalized service to every individual who walks through its doors. The focus is on building genuine relationships with clients and fostering a strong sense of community. This is achieved through proactive engagement, attentive staff, and a welcoming atmosphere. Regular networking events, workshops, and community gatherings are organized to connect members, encourage collaboration, and celebrate local talent. The Root Barrel distinguishes itself through its dedication to supporting the local community. This is demonstrated not only through the sourcing of local produce and coffee but also through active participation in local initiatives and partnerships with community organizations. The Root Barrel actively solicits feedback from customers to continually refine its services and ensure that they are meeting the evolving needs of the local community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Root Barrel envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam region. The long-term goal is to establish itself as the premier destination for co-working, artisanal coffee, and local produce, becoming a symbol of innovation and community support. Future plans include expanding the co-working space to accommodate a growing membership base, developing partnerships with additional local farmers and artisans, and launching new initiatives that further promote sustainability and community engagement. Expansion may include opening new locations in other key areas of Assam, bringing The Root Barrel\'s unique blend of services and community focus to a wider audience. Further, exploring opportunities to incorporate technology to streamline operations and enhance the customer experience is a crucial aspect of the vision. This involves implementing online booking systems, interactive community platforms, and data analytics to better understand customer needs and preferences. Ultimately, The Root Barrel aims to be more than just a business; it strives to be a catalyst for positive change, driving economic growth, promoting sustainable practices, and building a stronger, more vibrant community in Assam.</p>', '7th Floor, Exotica Greens', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 14:55:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1675, 'Red Hot Chilli Pepper', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Red Hot Chilli Pepper, situated at the vibrant location of 9, RG Baruah Rd, near Chariali, Guwahati, Assam, is rapidly establishing itself as a culinary hotspot, offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and innovative culinary techniques. More than just a restaurant, Red Hot Chilli Pepper is a destination, a place where the rich heritage of Assam meets the modern palate. In the competitive landscape of Guwahati\'s food scene, Red Hot Chilli Pepper stands out by offering an authentic, locally sourced, and artistically presented dining experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Red Hot Chilli Pepper\'s offerings is a commitment to showcasing the diverse and flavorful cuisine of Assam. The restaurant\'s core menu features a carefully curated selection of both traditional and contemporary dishes. Key offerings include signature Assamese thalis, showcasing regional specialties like *Masor Tenga* (sour fish curry), *Khar* (alkaline dish), and a variety of locally sourced vegetable preparations. Beyond the traditional, the restaurant also features innovative dishes that blend local ingredients with international culinary techniques, catering to a more adventurous palate. Unique selling points include a focus on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients directly from Assam\'s farms, ensuring the highest quality and supporting local agriculture. The restaurant also boasts a signature line of homemade pickles and chutneys, adding an extra layer of authentic Assamese flavor to the dining experience. These services directly address the local market\'s growing demand for authentic, high-quality Assamese cuisine, presented in a modern and appealing way, and appeal to both local residents and tourists seeking an immersive culinary experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Red Hot Chilli Pepper. The restaurant strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel welcomed and valued. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every diner\'s needs are met with efficiency and genuine hospitality. What sets Red Hot Chilli Pepper apart is its deep connection to the local community. The restaurant actively partners with local farmers and artisans, sourcing ingredients and products that showcase the region\'s rich cultural heritage. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists and culinary workshops focusing on Assamese cuisine, are organized to further engage with the community and promote local talent. The restaurant also actively participates in local festivals and events, offering special menus and catering services to support community initiatives. This commitment to community engagement not only enhances the customer experience but also strengthens Red Hot Chilli Pepper\'s position as a valued member of the local business ecosystem.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Red Hot Chilli Pepper is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth. The restaurant aims to expand its reach by opening additional locations within Assam and potentially beyond, bringing the flavors of Assam to a wider audience. Future plans include developing a line of packaged food products, such as pickles, chutneys, and spice blends, allowing customers to enjoy the flavors of Red Hot Chilli Pepper at home. The restaurant also intends to invest in culinary training programs for local youth, providing opportunities for them to develop valuable skills and contribute to the region\'s culinary landscape. Long-term goals include establishing Red Hot Chilli Pepper as a leading advocate for sustainable tourism in Assam, promoting responsible travel practices and supporting local communities. By focusing on innovation, community engagement, and sustainable practices, Red Hot Chilli Pepper is poised to become a culinary institution in Assam, celebrated for its authentic flavors, exceptional service, and commitment to the local community.</p>', '9, RG Baruah Rd, near Chariali', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:00:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1676, 'YOKO Sizzlers - A Fine Dine Restaurant, City Center Guwahati', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>YOKO Sizzlers – A Fine Dine Restaurant, strategically situated on the 4th Floor of City Center Mall, Christian Basti, GS Rd, near International Hospital in Guwahati, represents a sophisticated addition to the city\'s culinary scene. As a fine-dining establishment specializing in sizzlers, YOKO Sizzlers offers a distinctive and engaging dining experience that caters to the evolving tastes of Guwahati’s discerning clientele. Our restaurant distinguishes itself not only through the quality and diversity of its sizzler offerings but also through its commitment to exceptional service and a vibrant ambiance, contributing meaningfully to the local Assam business landscape by elevating the standard for casual and fine-dining options within the city center.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of YOKO Sizzlers’ appeal lies its diverse and meticulously crafted menu, centered around the sizzler concept. We offer a wide array of sizzlers, ranging from classic continental options featuring succulent grilled meats and seafood, to innovative vegetarian and regional Indian variations tailored to local palates. Each sizzler is prepared with the freshest, highest-quality ingredients, sourced both locally and internationally, and presented on a sizzling hot plate to deliver an unforgettable sensory experience. Beyond sizzlers, our menu also features a selection of appetizers, soups, salads, and desserts designed to complement the main courses and provide a complete and satisfying meal. A curated beverage list, including mocktails, juices, and a selection of wines and beers, further enhances the dining experience. The unique selling point of YOKO Sizzlers is the theatrical presentation of our dishes, the consistent high quality of ingredients, and the ability to customize sizzlers to individual preferences. This addresses the local market need for elevated dining experiences that offer both familiar flavors and exciting culinary innovations within a comfortable and accessible setting.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at YOKO Sizzlers. We are committed to providing impeccable service, delivered by a highly trained and attentive staff. From the moment guests enter the restaurant, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism, ensuring a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. Our staff is knowledgeable about the menu and prepared to offer recommendations and accommodate dietary restrictions or preferences. We strive to create a personalized and memorable dining experience for each guest. Beyond the food and service, YOKO Sizzlers fosters a strong connection with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, and we strive to source ingredients from local suppliers whenever possible, supporting the local economy and reducing our environmental footprint. The restaurant also provides a venue for celebrating special occasions, offering customized menus and decorations for birthdays, anniversaries, and corporate events. We aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a gathering place that contributes positively to the social and cultural fabric of Guwahati.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for YOKO Sizzlers involves continued growth and expansion while maintaining our commitment to quality and customer satisfaction. We plan to introduce seasonal menus featuring locally sourced ingredients, further enhancing the dining experience and supporting local farmers and producers. Exploring opportunities to expand our menu with more regional Assamese cuisine-inspired sizzlers will also be on the cards. We also envision expanding our presence within Guwahati and potentially to other cities in the Northeast region, bringing the YOKO Sizzlers experience to a wider audience. This expansion will be carefully managed to ensure that we maintain the high standards of quality and service that have become synonymous with our brand. Long-term, we aim to establish YOKO Sizzlers as a leading fine-dining destination in Guwahati and a recognizable name in the broader culinary landscape of Northeast India, renowned for its innovative cuisine, exceptional service, and commitment to the local community. We aim to become the preferred choice for those seeking a sophisticated and memorable dining experience.</p>', '4th Floor, City Center Mall Christian Basti, GS Rd, near International Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:00:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1677, 'Paaro Jodi Khaa', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Paaro Jodi Khaa, a name synonymous with quality and authenticity, stands proudly at 168, Jayanagar Rd, opposite to BPCL, serving the heart of Assam with its distinctive offerings. More than just a business, Paaro Jodi Khaa is a celebration of local flavors and traditions, thoughtfully curated to cater to the discerning palates of the community. Situated in a prime location, we are easily accessible and deeply ingrained in the fabric of Jayanagar, making us a familiar and trusted establishment in the local business ecosystem.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Paaro Jodi Khaa, our core offerings revolve around providing an unparalleled culinary experience rooted in Assamese cuisine. We specialize in two primary areas: traditional Assamese thalis and homemade Assamese delicacies. Our thalis are a carefully composed symphony of flavors, showcasing the diversity of Assamese culinary heritage. Each dish is prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, reflecting the region\'s rich agricultural bounty. From the delicate *khar* to the spicy *masor tenga*, every element of the thali is meticulously crafted to deliver an authentic taste of Assam. Complementing our thalis are a range of homemade Assamese delicacies, including *pithas* (rice cakes), *larus* (sweet balls), and traditional sweets, all prepared with time-honored recipes passed down through generations. What sets Paaro Jodi Khaa apart is our unwavering commitment to quality, authenticity, and hygiene. We take immense pride in preserving the traditional methods of Assamese cooking, ensuring that every dish is a true reflection of its cultural origins. Furthermore, our dedication to using locally sourced ingredients not only guarantees freshness but also supports local farmers and producers, fostering a sustainable and mutually beneficial relationship within the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Paaro Jodi Khaa. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and hospitable environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is carefully trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each visit is a memorable one. From the moment a customer walks through our doors, they are greeted with a genuine smile and a willingness to cater to their specific needs and preferences. We understand that food is not just about sustenance; it\'s about connection, culture, and shared experiences. Therefore, we go the extra mile to create an atmosphere that fosters a sense of community and belonging. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events, sponsorships, and partnerships with other businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us, and we are committed to playing an active role in its growth and development. Word-of-mouth referrals are our strongest testament to the positive experiences our customers have consistently enjoyed.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Paaro Jodi Khaa envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading provider of authentic Assamese cuisine. Our long-term goals include expanding our product offerings to cater to a wider range of tastes and preferences while remaining true to our core values of quality and authenticity. We are exploring opportunities to introduce new and innovative dishes that showcase the versatility of Assamese ingredients and culinary techniques. We also plan to enhance our online presence and explore opportunities for online ordering and delivery, making our products more accessible to customers beyond the immediate Jayanagar area. Another key aspect of our future vision is to strengthen our partnerships with local farmers and producers, creating a more sustainable and resilient supply chain. We are committed to supporting local agriculture and ensuring that our business practices are environmentally responsible. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the authentic taste of Paaro Jodi Khaa to a wider audience. We believe that by staying true to our roots, embracing innovation, and remaining deeply committed to our customers and community, Paaro Jodi Khaa can achieve its ambitious goals and make a lasting contribution to the culinary landscape of Assam. We aspire to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a cultural ambassador, showcasing the richness and diversity of Assamese cuisine to the world.</p>', '168, Jayanagar Rd, opposite to BPCL', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:00:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1678, 'Aroma : Modern Dining', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Aroma : Modern Dining is a culinary haven situated in the heart of Assam, offering a refined and contemporary dining experience that blends global culinary trends with the rich flavors of the region. More than just a restaurant, Aroma aspires to be a social hub, a place where people connect over exquisite food, impeccable service, and a welcoming atmosphere. Aroma’s strategic location allows it to cater to both locals seeking a sophisticated dining option and tourists eager to explore Assam\'s gastronomic landscape. Aroma distinguishes itself by providing an elevated experience without sacrificing the warmth and hospitality for which Assam is known. The establishment aims to contribute to the vibrant and evolving culinary scene of the region, fostering a greater appreciation for both local and international cuisine.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Aroma : Modern Dining offers a comprehensive menu curated to tantalize the taste buds with a fusion of global and regional flavors. The primary offering revolves around a carefully crafted a la carte menu featuring modern interpretations of classic dishes alongside innovative creations using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The restaurant prides itself on its commitment to freshness, quality, and artistic presentation. Beyond the a la carte experience, Aroma offers set course menus designed for special occasions and corporate events, providing a seamless and memorable dining experience. A well-stocked bar complements the food menu, featuring a wide selection of wines, spirits, and handcrafted cocktails, including Assam tea-infused concoctions. One of Aroma’s unique selling points is its regular introduction of seasonal menus that highlight the best of Assam’s produce throughout the year. This commitment to seasonality ensures that the dishes are always fresh, flavorful, and reflective of the region\'s agricultural heritage. Aroma also caters to dietary needs with vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options clearly marked on the menu, ensuring that all guests can enjoy a delightful dining experience. This focus on inclusivity addresses the evolving dietary preferences within the local market, making Aroma a welcoming choice for a diverse clientele.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Aroma : Modern Dining, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with genuine warmth and attentiveness. The staff is meticulously trained to provide impeccable service, anticipating needs and exceeding expectations. The ambiance is carefully curated to create a relaxed yet sophisticated atmosphere, with thoughtfully designed interiors, comfortable seating, and soft lighting. Aroma strives to create a memorable dining experience that extends beyond the food itself. Regular live music performances by local artists add to the ambiance, creating a vibrant and engaging social scene. Aroma actively engages with the local community by hosting culinary workshops, partnering with local farmers and producers, and supporting local charities. By fostering these connections, Aroma positions itself as more than just a restaurant; it becomes an integral part of the community, contributing to its cultural and economic vibrancy. Aroma’s commitment to customer satisfaction is further reinforced through actively seeking feedback and using it to continuously improve its services and offerings. This dedication to continuous improvement ensures that Aroma remains a preferred dining destination for both locals and visitors alike.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Aroma : Modern Dining is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and community engagement. The immediate plan involves expanding the restaurant\'s catering services to serve a wider range of events and functions within the region. This expansion will leverage Aroma\'s existing culinary expertise and reputation for excellence to capture a larger share of the catering market. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in other key cities within Assam, replicating the successful formula of modern dining with a local twist. Aroma envisions becoming a recognized brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community involvement. Another key focus is on developing partnerships with local agricultural initiatives to source more ingredients directly from farmers, supporting sustainable agriculture and reducing the restaurant\'s carbon footprint. Furthermore, Aroma plans to establish a culinary training program to nurture local talent and provide opportunities for aspiring chefs and hospitality professionals. By investing in training and development, Aroma aims to contribute to the growth of the hospitality industry in Assam and create a pipeline of skilled workers for its expanding operations. Ultimately, Aroma : Modern Dining aims to be more than just a successful business; it aspires to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting sustainable practices, supporting local communities, and elevating the culinary landscape of Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:00:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
