(1679, 'Gandharb Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Gandharb Restaurant, nestled at 4QQQ+X2G, Dr RP Rd, behind MLA Hostel in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, offers a refined dining experience that seamlessly blends authentic Assamese flavors with contemporary culinary techniques. More than just a restaurant, Gandharb is a celebration of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage, expressed through its meticulously crafted menu and warm, inviting atmosphere. In a region known for its diverse culinary traditions, Gandharb distinguishes itself by offering a carefully curated selection of both traditional and innovative dishes, appealing to a broad spectrum of palates, from seasoned locals to adventurous tourists. The restaurant strives to be a cornerstone of the local food scene, providing a sophisticated yet accessible gateway to the culinary wonders of Assam. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Gandharb Restaurant lies a commitment to showcasing the vibrant and diverse flavors of Assam. Our primary offering is a comprehensive menu featuring authentic Assamese cuisine, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Diners can indulge in classic dishes such as <em>Masor Tenga</em> (sour fish curry), <em>Khar</em> (an alkaline dish made with banana peel), and <em>Pitha</em> (rice cakes) alongside innovative creations that reimagine traditional flavors in modern presentations. Beyond the Assamese specialties, the menu also features a selection of pan-Indian and continental dishes, ensuring a diverse range of options to cater to varying preferences. A carefully curated beverage list complements the food offerings, featuring local teas, refreshing juices, and a selection of wines and spirits. What truly sets Gandharb apart is its dedication to quality ingredients, expert preparation, and artistic presentation. In a market where culinary offerings often prioritize speed and affordability, Gandharb focuses on providing a premium dining experience that emphasizes authenticity, flavor, and visual appeal. This commitment addresses the growing demand for high-quality, locally inspired dining options within the city. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Gandharb Restaurant. From the moment guests step through the door, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality and attentive service. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, providing informed recommendations and catering to individual dietary needs and preferences. The ambiance is designed to be both elegant and inviting, creating a comfortable and memorable dining experience. The restaurant’s location, while slightly tucked away behind MLA Hostel, offers a sense of tranquility away from the bustling city streets. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as sourcing ingredients from local farmers and artisans, participating in local food festivals, and hosting culinary workshops to promote Assamese cuisine. We aim to build strong relationships with our customers and become a trusted and beloved part of the community. This dedication to personalized service and community engagement fosters customer loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals, further solidifying Gandharb’s position as a leading dining destination in Guwahati. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Gandharb Restaurant envisions a future where it is recognized as the leading ambassador of Assamese cuisine, both locally and nationally. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to showcase even more diverse regional specialties and developing a signature line of packaged Assamese delicacies for retail sale. We plan to enhance our online presence through targeted marketing campaigns and online ordering platforms, reaching a wider customer base. Furthermore, we aspire to establish strategic partnerships with local tourism agencies and hotels to promote Gandharb as a must-visit dining destination for tourists visiting Assam. In the coming years, we aim to explore opportunities for expanding to additional locations within Assam and potentially to other major cities in India, bringing the authentic flavors of Assamese cuisine to a broader audience. We are also committed to sustainable practices, minimizing our environmental impact by reducing waste and sourcing ingredients responsibly. By continuously innovating, adapting to market trends, and staying true to our core values, Gandharb Restaurant is poised for sustained growth and long-term success in the dynamic culinary landscape of Assam and beyond. </p>', '4QQQ+X2G, Dr RP Rd, behind MLA Hostel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:00:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1680, 'Confucius', 'Restaurants', '', 'Confucius, located on the First Floor of Protech Dawn, GS Rd, opposite Shoolin Grand, in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is a business solutions provider dedicated to empowering local enterprises with innovative and effective strategies for sustainable growth. We understand the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the Assam business landscape and tailor our services to meet the specific needs of this dynamic market. Confucius is more than just a consultancy; we are partners in progress, committed to building a thriving business ecosystem within the region. Our approach is rooted in practical application, drawing on global best practices while remaining firmly grounded in local realities. We believe in fostering long-term relationships built on trust, transparency, and a shared vision for success.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings revolve around providing comprehensive business solutions designed to optimize performance and drive profitability for our clients. We specialize in three key areas: Business Strategy & Consulting, Digital Marketing Solutions, and Operational Efficiency Improvement. Our Business Strategy & Consulting services focus on developing and implementing strategic roadmaps that align with our clients\' long-term objectives. This includes market analysis, competitive intelligence, business plan development, and assistance with securing funding opportunities. We help businesses identify their competitive advantages, define their target markets, and create sustainable growth strategies.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur Digital Marketing Solutions are designed to enhance online presence, generate leads, and drive customer engagement. We offer a full suite of digital marketing services, including search engine optimization (SEO), social media marketing, content creation, email marketing, and pay-per-click (PPC) advertising. We understand the importance of leveraging digital channels to reach a wider audience and build brand awareness in today’s interconnected world. We focus on creating data-driven strategies that deliver measurable results and maximize return on investment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOperational Efficiency Improvement is at the heart of our commitment to helping businesses thrive. We work closely with our clients to identify areas where operational processes can be streamlined and optimized. This includes process analysis, workflow optimization, supply chain management, and technology implementation. We aim to reduce costs, improve productivity, and enhance overall operational performance. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to combine strategic thinking with practical implementation. We don\'t just provide recommendations; we work alongside our clients to implement changes and ensure that they achieve their desired outcomes. We are also deeply committed to understanding the local market dynamics in Assam. We possess a strong understanding of the cultural nuances, economic realities, and regulatory environment that shape the business landscape in this region. This allows us to tailor our solutions to the specific needs of our clients and ensure that they are aligned with local customs and practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Confucius, we prioritize providing an exceptional customer experience. We believe in building strong, lasting relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect. We take the time to understand our clients\' unique needs and challenges, and we tailor our services accordingly. Our team is responsive, proactive, and dedicated to providing personalized attention to each and every client. We also understand the importance of connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local business events and initiatives, and we are committed to supporting the growth and development of the Assam business ecosystem. We believe that by working together, we can create a more prosperous and vibrant community for all. We strive to be accessible and approachable, fostering an open communication environment where clients feel comfortable sharing their thoughts and concerns. Regular feedback sessions and progress updates are integrated into our service delivery model, ensuring transparency and collaborative decision-making. We consider our clients to be partners, and their success is our success.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Confucius envisions becoming the leading business solutions provider in Assam, recognized for our expertise, innovation, and commitment to client success. We plan to expand our service offerings to meet the evolving needs of the market, including incorporating new technologies and methodologies. We are committed to investing in our team and providing them with the training and development opportunities they need to stay ahead of the curve. We also aim to build strategic partnerships with other organizations and institutions to expand our reach and enhance our capabilities. Our long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable economic growth of Assam by empowering local businesses to thrive and compete in the global marketplace. We see potential in expanding into areas such as sustainability consulting and entrepreneurship training, further contributing to a holistic business ecosystem. We aim to establish Confucius as a thought leader in the regional business community, actively participating in industry discussions and contributing to the development of best practices. Our commitment to innovation and client satisfaction will continue to drive our growth and solidify our position as a trusted partner for businesses in Assam.', 'First Floor, Protech Dawn, GS Rd, opposite Shoolin Grand', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:05:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1681, 'Mocha Cafe & Bar', 'Restaurants', '', 'Mocha Cafe & Bar, situated at 2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd, Guwahati, Assam, is a vibrant and contemporary establishment that seamlessly blends the inviting atmosphere of a traditional cafe with the sophisticated ambiance of a modern bar. It stands as a distinctive addition to the Guwahati culinary scene, offering a unique experience that caters to a diverse clientele seeking quality coffee, delicious food, and expertly crafted cocktails in a comfortable and stylish setting. Mocha Cafe & Bar aims to be more than just a place to grab a quick bite or a drink; it aspires to be a community hub, a place where connections are forged, ideas are exchanged, and lasting memories are created.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Mocha Cafe & Bar\'s offerings lies a carefully curated menu that caters to both coffee aficionados and those seeking more substantial fare. The coffee program features meticulously sourced beans, expertly roasted to bring out their distinct flavor profiles. Patrons can enjoy a range of classic espresso drinks, from rich and creamy lattes to bold and intense cappuccinos, all prepared by skilled baristas dedicated to the art of coffee making. Beyond coffee, the menu boasts a selection of gourmet sandwiches, fresh salads, and delectable pastries, all made with high-quality ingredients and prepared with a focus on flavor and presentation. As the day transitions into evening, Mocha Cafe & Bar transforms into a sophisticated bar, offering a wide array of handcrafted cocktails, premium spirits, and a curated selection of wines and beers. The bar menu is designed to complement the food offerings, providing the perfect pairing for any occasion. A key differentiator for Mocha Cafe & Bar is its commitment to sourcing local ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers and showcasing the unique flavors of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience is paramount at Mocha Cafe & Bar. From the moment guests step through the door, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. The interior design is carefully considered to create a space that is both stylish and comfortable, with plush seating, warm lighting, and tasteful decor. The goal is to create an environment where customers can relax, unwind, and enjoy their time. Mocha Cafe & Bar actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting live music performances, art exhibitions, and community events. The cafe also partners with local organizations to support charitable causes and promote social responsibility. By fostering strong relationships with the community, Mocha Cafe & Bar aims to become an integral part of the neighborhood fabric.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Mocha Cafe & Bar envisions significant growth potential. The business plans to expand its menu offerings, introduce new and innovative cocktails, and enhance its customer loyalty program. There are also plans to explore opportunities for expansion, potentially opening additional locations in Guwahati and other parts of Assam. The long-term goal is to establish Mocha Cafe & Bar as a leading brand in the region, known for its commitment to quality, customer service, and community engagement. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating to meet the evolving needs of its customers, Mocha Cafe & Bar is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and become a cherished destination for locals and visitors alike. Continuous improvement and adaptation to the local market are key to sustaining success and solidifying Mocha Cafe & Bar\'s position as a premier establishment in the Assam hospitality landscape.', '2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:05:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1682, 'Maihang', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Maihang is a burgeoning enterprise deeply rooted in the heart of Assam, committed to delivering authentic Assamese experiences and products while fostering sustainable growth within the local community. Situated strategically to serve both local residents and tourists seeking a genuine taste of Assam, Maihang operates as a multifaceted business, bridging the gap between traditional craftsmanship, local produce, and modern consumer demands.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Maihang functions as a curator and purveyor of high-quality Assamese goods and services. The business\'s primary offerings encompass three key areas: handcrafted textiles, locally sourced agricultural products, and curated cultural experiences. The textile division showcases the rich weaving traditions of Assam, featuring handloom products such as Mekhela Chadors, Eri silk shawls, and cotton fabrics directly sourced from local weavers. This not only provides customers with authentic, ethically produced garments but also supports the livelihoods of artisans preserving age-old techniques. The agricultural arm focuses on showcasing the diverse bounty of Assam, offering a range of products including premium Assam tea, organic spices, and indigenous fruits and vegetables sourced directly from local farmers. Maihang emphasizes sustainable farming practices and fair prices to empower the agricultural community. Finally, the cultural experiences component offers immersive opportunities for visitors to connect with Assam\'s heritage, including guided tours of tea gardens, traditional cooking workshops, and demonstrations of local crafts. These experiences are designed to be authentic, informative, and engaging, offering a deeper understanding of the region\'s rich cultural tapestry.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Maihang\'s unique selling proposition lies in its commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and community empowerment. Unlike mass-produced goods, Maihang’s products are carefully selected and often handcrafted, reflecting the unique artistry and cultural heritage of Assam. The business prioritizes ethical sourcing practices, ensuring that artisans and farmers receive fair compensation for their work. This commitment to sustainability extends to environmental considerations, with a focus on promoting organic farming practices and minimizing waste throughout the supply chain. Furthermore, Maihang actively invests in the local community through initiatives such as skills training programs for artisans and farmers, fostering economic development and preserving traditional crafts for future generations. These initiatives not only contribute to the economic well-being of the community but also strengthen Maihang\'s brand image and customer loyalty.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Maihang. The business strives to create a welcoming and informative environment for all visitors, whether they are local residents or international tourists. The staff is trained to provide personalized service, offering detailed information about the products, their origins, and the artisans or farmers who produced them. Maihang actively engages with the local community through participation in local festivals and events, showcasing its products and promoting Assamese culture. The business also utilizes social media platforms to connect with customers, share stories about its artisans and farmers, and provide updates on new products and events. Furthermore, Maihang actively solicits customer feedback to continuously improve its products and services. The business believes that building strong relationships with its customers is essential for long-term success.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Maihang envisions itself as a leading advocate for Assamese culture and a catalyst for sustainable economic development in the region. The business plans to expand its product offerings to include a wider range of handcrafted goods, agricultural products, and cultural experiences. This expansion will be guided by a commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and community empowerment. Maihang also aims to establish a stronger online presence to reach a wider audience and facilitate the sale of its products to customers worldwide. The business plans to partner with other local businesses and organizations to promote Assam as a destination for cultural tourism and sustainable agriculture. Long-term, Maihang aspires to become a model for responsible business practices in the region, demonstrating how businesses can contribute to the economic and social well-being of the community while preserving cultural heritage.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:05:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1683, 'O2...The Open Banquet', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>O2...The Open Banquet stands as a vibrant and versatile event space, strategically located in the bustling Bipanan Khetra area on Panjabari Road, near Juripara Junction. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, O2...The Open Banquet provides a much-needed premium venue option for a diverse range of events, catering to the growing demand for sophisticated and adaptable event spaces in the region. More than just a banquet hall, it\'s a space designed to transform ordinary gatherings into extraordinary experiences, contributing significantly to the local business landscape by providing a platform for celebrations, corporate events, and community gatherings alike. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>O2...The Open Banquet specializes in providing a comprehensive event hosting service, offering a meticulously designed space and support services to ensure seamless execution. Our core offering is the flexible banquet hall itself, capable of being configured to accommodate various event sizes and styles, from intimate gatherings of 50 guests to larger celebrations hosting upwards of 500. Beyond the physical space, we offer a curated selection of add-on services including: <br>\n*<b>Catering Services:</b> Partnering with local culinary experts to provide diverse menu options ranging from traditional Assamese cuisine to continental and international flavors.<br>\n*<b>Decor and Styling:</b> Offering customizable decoration packages to create the desired ambiance for each event, from elegant and sophisticated to vibrant and festive. <br>\n*<b>Audio-Visual Equipment:</b> Providing state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems, along with projection capabilities, to enhance presentations and entertainment.<br>\n*<b>Event Planning Assistance:</b> A dedicated team of event coordinators to assist clients with planning and execution, ensuring a stress-free experience. <br> <br>\nThe unique selling point of O2...The Open Banquet lies in its blend of modern amenities, flexible space, and personalized service. We understand the importance of creating memorable experiences, and our commitment to quality and attention to detail sets us apart. Furthermore, the strategic location near Juripara Junction ensures easy accessibility for guests from across Guwahati and beyond, addressing a key need in a city where travel can be challenging. This accessibility, combined with our comprehensive service offerings, makes O2...The Open Banquet a premier choice for event hosting in the region.\n</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of O2...The Open Banquet. We believe in fostering a warm and welcoming atmosphere from the moment a client inquires about our services. Our approach is centered on understanding each client\'s unique needs and vision, working collaboratively to bring their event to life. We prioritize clear and consistent communication, providing prompt and helpful responses to all inquiries. On the day of the event, our dedicated team is present to ensure everything runs smoothly, addressing any unexpected issues with professionalism and efficiency. <br> <br>\nWe actively engage with the local community by hosting and supporting local events, showcasing the talents of local artists and businesses. Building strong relationships with local vendors and suppliers allows us to offer competitive pricing and unique service options, further enhancing the value we provide to our clients. This commitment to community integration not only strengthens our business but also contributes to the vibrant cultural tapestry of Guwahati. We strive to be more than just a venue; we aim to be a trusted partner in creating lasting memories for our clients and a valuable asset to the local community.\n</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for O2...The Open Banquet is one of continued growth and expansion, establishing ourselves as the leading event destination in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to enhance our service offerings by incorporating sustainable practices, such as partnering with local farmers for catering and implementing energy-efficient technologies. Exploring opportunities to create themed event packages that cater to specific cultural events and festivals relevant to Assam is also a key consideration. <br> <br>\nFurthermore, we intend to invest in staff training and development to ensure our team remains at the forefront of event management expertise. This includes staying updated on the latest trends in event technology, catering, and decor. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within Assam and offering franchise opportunities to entrepreneurs who share our passion for creating exceptional event experiences. O2...The Open Banquet aspires to not only be a successful business but also a positive force in the community, fostering economic growth and contributing to the cultural vibrancy of the region, offering a space where memories are made and celebrations come to life.\n</p>', 'Bipanan Khetra Panjabari Road, near Juripara Junction', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:05:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1684, '11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet', 'Restaurants', '', '<p><strong>11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet: A Culinary Landmark in FA Road, Assam</strong></p>\n\n<p>Nestled on the ground floor of Shivani Arcade, opposite Kumudinee Apartment on FA Road, 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet stands as a premier destination for discerning diners and event planners in Assam. More than just a restaurant, 11 July is a vibrant hub where culinary artistry meets exceptional hospitality, creating memorable experiences for every guest. We have quickly established ourselves as a significant player in the local culinary scene, offering a diverse range of dining and event solutions tailored to the unique tastes and traditions of the region while maintaining an internationally inspired outlook.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet, we pride ourselves on our commitment to quality, creativity, and unparalleled service. Our establishment is designed to cater to a broad spectrum of needs, from intimate dinners and casual gatherings to grand celebrations and corporate events. We are not simply providing food and drinks; we are crafting experiences that linger long after the last course is served.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors and Experiences</strong></p>\n\n<p>Our core offerings revolve around three primary pillars: the Kitchen, the Bar, and the Banquet. Each element is meticulously designed and managed to provide a seamless and satisfying experience for our clientele.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>The Kitchen:</strong> Our restaurant showcases a meticulously curated menu that blends authentic Assamese flavors with contemporary culinary techniques. We source fresh, locally available ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the highest quality in every dish. From traditional Assamese thalis bursting with regional specialties to globally inspired entrees, our menu offers something to delight every palate. Vegetarian and vegan options are thoughtfully included, reflecting our commitment to inclusivity and dietary preferences. What sets us apart is our dedication to innovation; we regularly introduce seasonal specials and chef\'s recommendations, ensuring that our menu remains exciting and engaging for our regular patrons. Our open kitchen concept allows guests to witness the culinary magic firsthand, adding an element of theatre to the dining experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>The Bar:</strong> Our well-stocked bar is a sophisticated haven for cocktail enthusiasts and those seeking a relaxed ambiance. We offer a comprehensive selection of premium spirits, wines, and beers, both domestic and international. Our experienced mixologists are adept at crafting classic cocktails and creating innovative concoctions using fresh ingredients and unique flavor combinations. The bar also features a curated selection of non-alcoholic beverages, ensuring that everyone can find something to enjoy. We frequently host themed cocktail nights and tasting events, adding an extra layer of excitement and entertainment for our guests.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>The Banquet:</strong> Our spacious and elegantly appointed banquet hall provides the perfect setting for a wide range of events, from weddings and receptions to corporate conferences and private parties. We offer flexible seating arrangements and customizable décor options to suit the specific needs of each event. Our dedicated event planning team works closely with clients to ensure that every detail is meticulously executed, from menu selection and table settings to audio-visual equipment and entertainment. We pride ourselves on our ability to seamlessly manage events of all sizes, providing a stress-free and memorable experience for our clients and their guests. Our commitment to personalized service and attention to detail sets us apart from other banquet facilities in the area. We also offer customized catering services, allowing clients to bring the 11 July culinary experience to off-site events.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>These services meet the specific needs of the local market by providing a high-quality dining and event experience that is both accessible and affordable. We understand the importance of value for money, and we strive to offer exceptional quality at competitive prices.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Relationships, Fostering Community</strong></p>\n\n<p>At 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, friendly, and professional service at all times. We prioritize building genuine relationships with our customers, remembering their preferences and anticipating their needs. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. What makes us stand out is our commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels valued and appreciated.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We are deeply connected to the local community and actively participate in local events and initiatives. We partner with local businesses and organizations to support the local economy and promote community engagement. We also host regular community events at our establishment, such as live music performances and cultural celebrations, further strengthening our ties to the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Enduring Excellence</strong></p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet envisions a future of continued growth and innovation. We plan to expand our menu and services to further cater to the evolving tastes and needs of our clientele. We are exploring opportunities to introduce new dining concepts and event packages, further diversifying our offerings. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering and reservation systems. Our long-term goal is to establish 11 July Kitchen Bar & Banquet as a culinary landmark in Assam, synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional hospitality. We aim to become the premier destination for dining and events in the region, while remaining deeply rooted in the local community. We believe that our commitment to excellence, combined with our passion for innovation and our unwavering focus on customer satisfaction, will enable us to achieve our ambitious goals.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Shivani Arcade, FA Rd, opp. Kumudinee Apartment', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:05:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1685, 'Khorikaa', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Khorikaa, located on the 1st Floor of Kamal C Plaza, 2, GS Rd, represents a vibrant addition to the Assam business landscape. More than just a commercial establishment, Khorikaa embodies the spirit of local craftsmanship and innovation, offering a curated selection of products and services designed to cater to the evolving needs and aspirations of the community. The business is built upon a foundation of authenticity and a commitment to delivering exceptional quality, setting it apart as a reliable and respected name in the region. Khorikaa strives to be a hub where tradition meets modernity, a place where customers can discover unique items, experience outstanding service, and connect with the rich cultural heritage of Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Khorikaa’s core offering revolves around providing high-quality, handcrafted goods that reflect the artistry and skill of local artisans. Central to its product line are traditionally woven Assamese textiles, including mekhela chadors, gamosas, and other handloom products. These aren\'t merely articles of clothing; they are pieces of art that tell stories of the region\'s history and heritage. Beyond textiles, Khorikaa also features a range of handcrafted products, such as artisanal jewelry, decorative items, and locally sourced food products, emphasizing the unique flavors and ingredients of Assam. A significant unique selling point lies in Khorikaa\'s dedication to fair trade practices, ensuring that artisans receive equitable compensation for their work, fostering sustainable economic growth within the community. Furthermore, Khorikaa actively promotes the use of eco-friendly materials and sustainable production methods, aligning with the growing demand for environmentally conscious products. By offering a blend of traditional craftsmanship and contemporary design, Khorikaa caters to a diverse customer base, from those seeking authentic cultural souvenirs to individuals looking for unique and ethically sourced products for everyday use.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Khorikaa. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide knowledgeable and personalized service, assisting customers in understanding the stories behind the products and the artisans who create them. Khorikaa strives to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where customers feel valued and respected. This is achieved through attentive listening, proactive problem-solving, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. The business actively engages with the local community through participation in local festivals, cultural events, and collaborations with other small businesses. This involvement strengthens Khorikaa\'s connection to the community, fostering a sense of trust and loyalty among its customers. Khorikaa also leverages digital platforms to connect with a wider audience, showcasing its products, sharing artisan stories, and providing convenient online shopping options. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience and ensure that Khorikaa remains responsive to the evolving needs of its clientele. Moreover, special attention is paid to packaging and presentation, ensuring that every purchase from Khorikaa is a delightful and memorable experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Khorikaa envisions a future where it becomes a leading platform for promoting Assamese art and culture on a national and even international scale. A key strategic goal is to expand its product line to include a broader range of handcrafted items, partnering with more artisans and craftspeople across the region. This expansion will not only enhance the diversity of offerings but also provide economic opportunities for more individuals within the community. Another important aspect of Khorikaa\'s future vision is to strengthen its online presence, developing a robust e-commerce platform that allows customers from anywhere in the world to access its products. The business is also exploring opportunities to collaborate with tourism agencies and hotels to promote its products to visitors, further enhancing its visibility and reach. In the long term, Khorikaa aims to establish itself as a brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and ethical sourcing, representing the best of Assam\'s craftsmanship and culture to a global audience. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating to meet the evolving needs of its customers and artisans, Khorikaa is poised for sustainable growth and continued success in the years to come.</p>', '1st Floor, Kamal C Plaza, 2, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:10:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1686, 'Confucius: Chinese And Thai Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', 'Confucius: Chinese And Thai Restaurant, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Shankar Complex, GS Rd, opposite Reliance Trends, offers a unique and vibrant dining experience that seamlessly blends the rich culinary traditions of China and Thailand. More than just a restaurant, Confucius represents a fusion of authentic flavors and contemporary dining, aiming to introduce a diverse and sophisticated palette to the discerning residents of Assam. The restaurant fills a significant gap in the local market by providing a high-quality, accessible, and culturally rich dining option that caters to a wide range of preferences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Confucius, guests can embark on a gastronomic journey through the diverse landscapes of Chinese and Thai cuisine. Our menu features an extensive selection of dishes, ranging from classic Cantonese Dim Sum and spicy Sichuan delicacies to fragrant Thai curries and aromatic noodle dishes. Each dish is meticulously prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, combined with authentic imported spices to ensure an unparalleled flavor profile. Key highlights of our menu include our signature Peking Duck, a crispy and flavorful masterpiece prepared according to traditional methods; our Green Thai Curry, brimming with fresh herbs and creamy coconut milk; and our variety of flavorful stir-fried noodles, customized to individual spice preferences. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to authenticity while adapting certain flavors to resonate with the local Assamese palate. This careful balance ensures that both seasoned connoisseurs and newcomers to Asian cuisine can find something to delight in. By offering both Chinese and Thai cuisine under one roof, Confucius eliminates the need for diners to choose, catering to varied tastes within a group and providing a truly comprehensive Asian dining experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Confucius. From the moment guests step inside, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. Our well-trained staff are knowledgeable about the menu and happy to offer recommendations, ensuring a personalized and memorable dining experience. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable ambiance, with a tastefully decorated interior that reflects the cultural heritage of both China and Thailand. In addition to providing exceptional in-house dining, we also offer convenient takeaway and delivery services, allowing customers to enjoy our delicious food from the comfort of their own homes. We actively engage with the local community through participation in local events and collaborations with community organizations. This dedication to community involvement fosters a sense of belonging and establishes Confucius as more than just a restaurant, but as a valued member of the Guwahati community. We gather feedback regularly and adapt our offerings to meet the evolving needs of our clientele.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Confucius: Chinese And Thai Restaurant envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam business landscape. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as the premier destination for Asian cuisine in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to expand our menu, introducing seasonal specials and innovative dishes that showcase the culinary artistry of our chefs. We are also exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing our unique dining experience to a wider audience. Furthermore, we are investing in sustainable practices, such as reducing food waste and sourcing ingredients from local farmers whenever possible, to minimize our environmental impact. We aim to continually enhance our service standards and maintain our commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience. By focusing on quality, innovation, and community engagement, Confucius: Chinese And Thai Restaurant is confident in its ability to achieve its ambitious goals and make a lasting contribution to the vibrant culinary scene of Assam.', 'Shankar Complex, GS Rd, opp. Reliance Trends', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:10:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1687, 'Pirates of Grill', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Pirates of Grill, a vibrant and engaging dining destination located on the 4th floor of City Center, GS Rd, near Apollo Hospitals in Guwahati, Assam, offers a unique and interactive culinary experience that sets it apart within the local restaurant scene. More than just a restaurant, Pirates of Grill is a celebration of flavor, community, and immersive dining, providing a refreshing alternative to traditional restaurant formats. Its strategic location within City Center ensures high visibility and accessibility, attracting a diverse clientele from across the city.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, Pirates of Grill specializes in a \"do-it-yourself\" grilling concept, where diners are presented with a diverse array of marinated meats, seafood, and vegetables, and can grill them directly at their table using provided skewers and tabletop grills. This interactive element fosters a sense of participation and customization, allowing each guest to tailor their meal to their individual preferences. Alongside the grilling options, Pirates of Grill also offers a comprehensive buffet spread featuring a variety of Indian and international dishes, ensuring there\'s something to satisfy every palate. The unlimited nature of both the grilling and buffet experiences provides exceptional value for money, making it a popular choice for families, groups, and corporate gatherings. The restaurant prides itself on sourcing fresh, high-quality ingredients, and the marinades are carefully crafted to deliver bold and authentic flavors. Unique selling points include the live grilling experience, the expansive buffet selection, and the festive, pirate-themed ambiance, which creates a memorable and engaging dining experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Pirates of Grill is committed to providing exceptional customer service that extends beyond simply taking orders and serving food. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu and grilling process, providing guidance and assistance to ensure a seamless and enjoyable experience for every guest. The restaurant cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, fostering a sense of community and camaraderie. Recognizing the importance of local connection, Pirates of Grill actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with local businesses, and special promotions tailored to regional festivals and celebrations. The restaurant also prioritizes gathering customer feedback through surveys and online reviews, using this information to continuously improve its offerings and enhance the overall dining experience. The goal is to create not just customers, but loyal advocates who return time and again, recommending Pirates of Grill to their friends and family.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, Pirates of Grill envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam region and potentially beyond. Plans are underway to further enhance the dining experience through the introduction of new menu items, innovative grilling techniques, and expanded beverage options. There\'s an ambition to incorporate more local Assamese cuisine into the buffet spread, showcasing the region\'s unique culinary heritage to a wider audience. The business is also exploring opportunities to expand its presence through the opening of additional locations in other key cities within Assam or even venturing into neighboring states. A strong emphasis will remain on maintaining the quality of food and service that has become synonymous with the Pirates of Grill brand. Long-term goals include establishing Pirates of Grill as a leading dining destination in the region, recognized for its unique interactive grilling experience, its commitment to customer satisfaction, and its dedication to supporting the local community. The business is committed to sustainable practices, exploring ways to minimize its environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of the region.</p>', '4th floor, City Center, GS Rd, near Apollo Hospitals', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:10:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(1688, 'The Socialite', 'Restaurants', '', '<p><b>The Socialite: Connecting Assam Through Events and Experiences</b></p>\n\n<p>Located at the bustling heart of Guwahati, on 3rd Floor, Tirupati Tower, Purvadoy, GS Rd, The Socialite is more than just an event management company; it\'s a curator of unforgettable experiences. We specialize in crafting bespoke events that resonate with the vibrant spirit of Assam, offering a unique blend of modern sophistication and local cultural nuances. In a region often underserved by high-quality, innovative event solutions, The Socialite aims to bridge the gap by delivering seamless and impactful events that leave a lasting impression. We understand the importance of fostering community connections and strive to be a vital contributor to the local business landscape by facilitating networking opportunities and promoting local talent. We aim to be a name synonymous with professionalism, creativity, and flawless execution in the Assam event industry.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core services encompass a comprehensive suite of event management solutions, designed to cater to a diverse range of needs. This includes corporate events such as conferences, seminars, product launches, and team-building activities, all tailored to align with specific business objectives. We also excel in organizing social events, including weddings, birthday parties, anniversaries, and cultural celebrations, incorporating traditional Assamese elements with contemporary designs. Beyond event planning, we offer a range of supplementary services, including venue sourcing, catering coordination, entertainment booking (featuring local artists whenever possible), décor and styling, audio-visual setup, and complete on-site management. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to personalization. We believe every event should be a reflection of our client’s vision and brand identity. We invest time in understanding their unique needs and preferences, ensuring that every detail, from the initial concept to the final execution, is meticulously planned and flawlessly implemented. Furthermore, our deep understanding of the local market allows us to leverage regional resources, talent, and cultural traditions, resulting in authentic and memorable experiences for all attendees. By understanding the logistical challenges specific to Guwahati and Assam, we offer solutions that others might overlook, ensuring seamless execution and minimizing potential disruptions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At The Socialite, customer experience is at the heart of everything we do. We are committed to providing exceptional service, characterized by responsiveness, transparency, and a proactive approach. We believe in building long-term relationships with our clients, becoming trusted partners who understand their evolving needs. Our dedicated team of experienced event professionals is passionate about delivering flawless execution and exceeding expectations. We pride ourselves on our ability to anticipate potential challenges and proactively address them, ensuring a stress-free experience for our clients. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, artists, and suppliers. By supporting local talent and promoting regional culture, we aim to foster a sense of community and contribute to the economic growth of Assam. We also regularly solicit feedback from our clients to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their evolving needs. We are not just an event management company; we are an active member of the Guwahati community, committed to making a positive impact.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Socialite envisions becoming the leading event management company in Assam and the Northeast region. We plan to expand our service offerings to include virtual and hybrid event solutions, catering to the growing demand for online and blended experiences. We also aim to develop specialized packages for niche markets, such as destination weddings and adventure tourism events, leveraging the region\'s natural beauty and cultural heritage. Strategic partnerships with key stakeholders in the tourism and hospitality sectors are a priority to further expand our reach and influence. Our long-term goals include establishing a strong brand reputation, building a loyal client base, and fostering a culture of innovation and excellence within our team. We are committed to investing in the professional development of our employees, ensuring they have the skills and knowledge to deliver world-class event experiences. Ultimately, The Socialite aspires to be a catalyst for positive change in the Assam business landscape, by promoting tourism, supporting local businesses, and creating memorable experiences that showcase the region\'s unique charm and potential.</p>', '3rd, Tirupati Tower, Purvadoy, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:10:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1689, 'The Yellow Chilli', 'Restaurants', '', 'The Yellow Chilli, situated within the vibrant hub of Mridul Properties Pvt Ltd, The Hub Mall, GS Rd, stands as a culinary beacon, offering a distinctive and modern interpretation of Indian cuisine. More than just a restaurant, The Yellow Chilli is a destination where authentic flavors meet contemporary presentation, creating an unforgettable dining experience that resonates with the dynamic spirit of Assam. In a region celebrated for its rich culinary heritage, The Yellow Chilli distinguishes itself by elevating traditional dishes with innovative techniques and a commitment to using the freshest, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, positioning itself as a significant player in Guwahati\'s evolving food scene.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of The Yellow Chilli\'s offering is a carefully curated menu showcasing the diverse tapestry of Indian gastronomy. While traditional favorites hold a prominent place, the restaurant also prides itself on signature dishes that are exclusive to The Yellow Chilli experience. These aren\'t simply rehashes of existing recipes; they represent a commitment to culinary artistry, blending familiar tastes with unexpected textures and aromas. The menu features a wide array of vegetarian and non-vegetarian options, catering to diverse palates and dietary preferences. From flavorful kebabs and aromatic biryanis to rich curries and delectable desserts, each dish is prepared with meticulous attention to detail, ensuring a consistent and high-quality culinary journey. A key differentiator lies in the restaurant\'s ability to strike a perfect balance between authenticity and innovation. Dishes are rooted in traditional recipes but are presented with a modern flair, appealing to both seasoned connoisseurs of Indian food and adventurous diners seeking new culinary experiences. By sourcing ingredients locally, The Yellow Chilli not only supports the local economy but also ensures the freshness and quality of its offerings, aligning with the growing demand for sustainable and responsible dining practices in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe Yellow Chilli understands that dining is more than just about food; it’s about creating a memorable experience. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm hospitality and an inviting ambiance. The restaurant\'s design blends contemporary aesthetics with subtle Indian influences, creating a space that is both stylish and comfortable. The attentive and knowledgeable staff are dedicated to providing personalized service, guiding guests through the menu and ensuring that every need is met. Special attention is given to creating a family-friendly environment, making The Yellow Chilli an ideal destination for celebrations, casual meals, and everything in between. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and used to continuously improve the dining experience, reflecting a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction. Furthermore, The Yellow Chilli actively engages with the local community through participation in local events and initiatives. This fosters a strong sense of belonging and demonstrates a dedication to contributing to the cultural fabric of Assam. By prioritizing customer service, creating a welcoming atmosphere, and actively engaging with the local community, The Yellow Chilli strives to build lasting relationships with its patrons.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, The Yellow Chilli envisions itself as a leading culinary destination in Assam and beyond. The business aims to expand its reach through strategic partnerships and potential franchising opportunities, while maintaining its commitment to quality and innovation. A key focus will be on continuously evolving the menu to incorporate new culinary trends and seasonal ingredients, ensuring that the dining experience remains fresh and exciting. Plans are also in place to enhance the restaurant\'s online presence and explore new avenues for customer engagement through social media and online ordering platforms. The ultimate goal is to establish The Yellow Chilli as a brand synonymous with exceptional Indian cuisine, outstanding customer service, and a strong commitment to the local community. By staying true to its core values and embracing innovation, The Yellow Chilli is poised for continued growth and success in the years to come. The business plans to explore catering opportunities for local events and businesses to further integrate into the community and diversify its revenue streams. Furthermore, there is an aspiration to develop a line of signature spice blends and sauces, allowing customers to recreate the Yellow Chilli experience in their own homes, further expanding the brand\'s reach and creating new avenues for engagement.', 'Mridul Properties Pvt Ltd, The Hub Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:10:38', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1690, 'The Alchemy Grill and Lounge', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>The Alchemy Grill and Lounge stands as a vibrant addition to the culinary and social scene of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a restaurant and bar, it’s a destination designed to ignite the senses and foster connection. Nestled in a strategic location [ *Please Insert Specific Address Here* ], The Alchemy Grill and Lounge offers a sophisticated yet welcoming atmosphere, making it a prime location for both casual gatherings and special occasions. We aim to be a catalyst for enriching the local community through elevated dining and entertainment experiences.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of The Alchemy Grill and Lounge lies a commitment to transforming quality ingredients into memorable culinary creations. Our primary offering centers around a meticulously crafted menu that blends international grilling techniques with the rich tapestry of Assamese flavors. We feature premium cuts of meat, sustainably sourced seafood, and fresh, locally sourced produce whenever possible. Our signature dishes are inspired by both global trends and regional traditions, offering a unique and exciting gastronomic journey. Complementing the grill is an extensive lounge menu, featuring handcrafted cocktails, a curated selection of wines, and a diverse range of spirits and beers. The lounge provides a sophisticated space for socializing and enjoying expertly mixed drinks.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>What sets The Alchemy Grill and Lounge apart is our dedication to creating an unparalleled experience. From the carefully designed interior to the expertly prepared food and drinks, every detail is considered. Our open-flame grill is a focal point, allowing patrons to witness the artistry of our chefs. We also offer a unique selection of shareable plates, encouraging a convivial dining experience. Recognizing the growing demand for innovative food and beverage options in Guwahati, The Alchemy Grill and Lounge provides a sophisticated alternative to the existing dining landscape. We cater to a diverse clientele, including young professionals, families, and tourists looking for a memorable experience. Our commitment to quality ingredients, exceptional service, and a vibrant atmosphere positions us as a leader in the regional hospitality industry.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Alchemy Grill and Lounge. We strive to provide a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service. From the moment a guest walks through the door, they are greeted with genuine hospitality. We actively seek feedback from our customers and continuously improve our offerings based on their suggestions. To connect with the local community, we actively participate in local events and partner with regional suppliers. We also host regular live music performances and themed nights, creating a vibrant and engaging social atmosphere. Building relationships and fostering a sense of community are integral to our success. We are dedicated to creating a space where people can come together to enjoy great food, drinks, and company.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for The Alchemy Grill and Lounge is to become a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement within the Assam region and beyond. We plan to expand our menu to incorporate more seasonal and locally sourced ingredients, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of the region. We also envision introducing cooking classes and workshops to share our culinary expertise with the community. Potential expansion plans include opening additional locations in other key cities within Northeast India. We are committed to investing in our staff through ongoing training and development, ensuring that we maintain the highest standards of service. Furthermore, we will explore opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to promote sustainability and support community initiatives. The Alchemy Grill and Lounge strives to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a valuable asset to the community, contributing to the vibrant cultural and economic landscape of Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:15:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1691, 'Lam Naga Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Lam Naga Restaurant: A Culinary Journey Through Authentic Naga Cuisine</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam, near the popular Naga Delicacy at 4RF4+9XM, Mandir Path, lies Lam Naga Restaurant, a culinary haven dedicated to showcasing the rich and diverse flavors of Nagaland. More than just a restaurant, Lam Naga serves as a cultural ambassador, offering an immersive experience that transports diners to the hills of Nagaland through authentic Naga cuisine and warm hospitality. Positioned in a vibrant area known for its diverse culinary offerings, Lam Naga distinguishes itself by focusing exclusively on the unique and often unexplored flavors of Naga cuisine, filling a significant gap in the local culinary scene and providing a much-needed platform for this distinctive regional fare. The restaurant prides itself on sourcing the freshest, most authentic ingredients possible, ensuring that each dish reflects the true essence of Naga culinary traditions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Taste of Nagaland</p>\n\n<p>Lam Naga Restaurant specializes in a wide array of traditional Naga dishes, each prepared with meticulous attention to detail and adherence to authentic recipes. The menu features signature Naga delicacies such as Smoked Pork with Akhuni (fermented soybean), Anishi (fermented yam leaves) based dishes, Bamboo Shoot Curry, and a variety of flavorful meat and vegetable stews cooked with traditional Naga spices and herbs. The restaurant also offers a selection of Naga-style rice preparations, including sticky rice, a staple in Naga cuisine. What sets Lam Naga apart is not only the authenticity of its dishes but also the careful presentation and the use of unique Naga ingredients often sourced directly from the region. This commitment to authenticity and quality provides a dining experience that is both educational and incredibly satisfying, catering to adventurous food enthusiasts and those seeking to experience the true taste of Nagaland. Beyond the core menu, Lam Naga often introduces seasonal specials featuring rare and unique Naga ingredients, further enriching the dining experience and showcasing the breadth and depth of Naga culinary traditions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: A Warm Welcome and Authentic Connection</p>\n\n<p>At Lam Naga Restaurant, customer service is paramount. The staff is not only well-trained in providing attentive and efficient service but also knowledgeable about Naga cuisine and culture. They are happy to explain the origins of the dishes, the ingredients used, and the culinary traditions behind them, creating a more engaging and informative dining experience for guests. The restaurant strives to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere that reflects the hospitality for which Nagaland is known. The ambiance is designed to be comfortable and inviting, with subtle nods to Naga culture and aesthetics. Lam Naga actively engages with the local community through participation in food festivals, cultural events, and partnerships with local organizations. They are committed to sourcing ingredients locally whenever possible, supporting local farmers and businesses. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of loyalty among customers and reinforces Lam Naga\'s position as a valued member of the local business landscape. Furthermore, the restaurant regularly solicits feedback from customers to continually improve its offerings and ensure that it is meeting the evolving needs and preferences of the community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Growth and Expansion with Authentic Naga Flavor</p>\n\n<p>Lam Naga Restaurant envisions a future where it becomes the premier destination for authentic Naga cuisine in Assam and beyond. The restaurant plans to expand its menu, introducing even more regional specialties and incorporating innovative culinary techniques while staying true to its commitment to authenticity. Future plans may include expanding the restaurant\'s physical space to accommodate a larger dining audience and potentially opening additional locations in other cities. Furthermore, Lam Naga is exploring opportunities to offer catering services for events and functions, bringing the unique flavors of Naga cuisine to a wider audience. Long-term goals include establishing a strong online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, enhancing accessibility and reach. Lam Naga is also committed to sustainable practices, exploring ways to minimize its environmental impact and support responsible sourcing of ingredients. By focusing on innovation, quality, and community engagement, Lam Naga Restaurant is poised to achieve significant growth and solidify its position as a leading culinary destination, celebrating and preserving the rich culinary heritage of Nagaland.</p>', '4RF4+9XM, Mandir Path, Near Naga Delicacy', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:15:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1692, 'Urban Mantra six mile', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Urban Mantra Six Mile, nestled on Namghar Path, represents a fresh perspective on modern living in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a retail and service provider, Urban Mantra strives to be a community hub, a place where convenience meets connection and quality intersects with local sensibilities. Recognizing the dynamic pace of life in Six Mile, and the desire for accessible, high-quality services, Urban Mantra aims to streamline daily routines while fostering a sense of belonging within the neighborhood. We are dedicated to understanding the evolving needs of our customers and providing solutions that enhance their urban experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Urban Mantra Six Mile lies a curated selection of essential services and products. Our offerings are designed to cater to the diverse needs of the local community, ranging from everyday necessities to specialized services that simplify modern living. We provide a meticulously stocked convenience store, offering a variety of groceries, personal care items, and household essentials, ensuring that residents have easy access to the products they need without having to travel far. In addition to the convenience store, Urban Mantra houses a state-of-the-art laundry and dry-cleaning service. This service utilizes eco-friendly practices and modern technology to provide efficient and reliable cleaning solutions for clothing and household textiles. Furthermore, a modern and efficient tailoring service caters to alteration and custom clothing needs. What sets Urban Mantra apart is its commitment to quality and convenience. We source high-quality products, employ skilled professionals, and leverage technology to optimize our processes, ensuring a seamless and satisfying experience for our customers. We aim to offer a one-stop shop where residents can efficiently manage their daily chores and access the services they need without compromising on quality or convenience.\n</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Urban Mantra Six Mile. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers by providing exceptional service and fostering a welcoming atmosphere. Our team is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized assistance. We prioritize understanding each customer\'s unique needs and tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. Beyond transactional interactions, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. This includes sponsoring local events, partnering with local businesses, and organizing workshops and seminars on topics relevant to the community. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, Urban Mantra aims to be more than just a business; we strive to be a trusted neighbor and a valuable resource for residents of Six Mile. We continuously solicit feedback from our customers to improve our services and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. Our commitment to exceptional customer service and community engagement is what truly sets Urban Mantra apart and makes us a preferred destination for residents of Six Mile.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Urban Mantra Six Mile envisions becoming a cornerstone of the Six Mile community, a place where residents can rely on us for quality services, convenience, and a strong sense of belonging. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to cater to the evolving needs of the community. We are exploring the possibility of adding a package receiving and forwarding service, responding to the increasing demand for reliable delivery solutions in the area. Furthermore, we are investigating opportunities to offer specialized services such as mobile phone repair and IT support. To achieve our long-term goals, we plan to invest in technology to further streamline our operations and enhance the customer experience. We will also continue to focus on building strong relationships with local businesses and community organizations. Our ultimate vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the economic and social well-being of the Six Mile community. We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the changing needs of our customers, ensuring that Urban Mantra remains a valuable and relevant resource for years to come.</p>', 'Namghar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:15:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1693, 'Nandadulal Pure Veg', 'Restaurants', '', 'Nandadulal Pure Veg stands as a culinary beacon for vegetarian cuisine in the heart of Assam, offering a delectable array of dishes crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. More than just a restaurant, Nandadulal Pure Veg is committed to providing an authentic and satisfying dining experience that resonates with the values and traditions of the community. In a region where vegetarian options are often limited, Nandadulal Pure Veg fills a crucial gap, providing a dedicated space for individuals and families seeking flavorful and ethically prepared meals. The establishment strives to be a welcoming haven, fostering a sense of community and celebrating the rich culinary heritage of vegetarianism. Its significance lies not only in the quality of its food but also in its dedication to promoting a healthier and more sustainable lifestyle within the local business landscape. <br> <br>\n\nNandadulal Pure Veg\'s core offerings center around a diverse menu of vegetarian dishes, ranging from traditional Assamese delicacies to popular North Indian and South Indian specialties. The restaurant\'s signature dishes often feature locally grown vegetables and lentils, prepared using time-honored recipes passed down through generations. These could include a fragrant Assamese Thali with khar, tenga, and pitika, or a flavorful North Indian Dal Makhani with freshly baked naan. A South Indian selection featuring crispy dosas, fluffy idlis, and savory sambar might also be available. What sets Nandadulal Pure Veg apart is its unwavering commitment to using only the freshest, highest-quality ingredients. Emphasis is placed on sourcing produce from local farmers, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the dishes are bursting with flavor. Furthermore, the restaurant may offer a selection of freshly squeezed juices, traditional Assamese drinks, and desserts to complete the dining experience. By focusing on pure vegetarian cuisine and emphasizing fresh, local ingredients, Nandadulal Pure Veg caters directly to the needs of the local market, offering a unique and compelling alternative to the predominantly non-vegetarian dining options in the area. <br> <br>\n\nAt Nandadulal Pure Veg, customer experience is paramount. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The restaurant aims to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, whether it\'s through comfortable seating, tasteful décor, or the soothing sounds of traditional Assamese music. A key element of their customer service approach is personalization. Staff may take the time to understand dietary preferences and offer recommendations based on individual needs. Perhaps they offer customized spice levels or suggest dishes that cater to specific allergies. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and incorporated into service improvements and menu updates. Beyond providing exceptional food and service, Nandadulal Pure Veg actively seeks to connect with the local community. This may involve sponsoring local events, participating in community festivals, or partnering with local organizations to promote healthy eating habits. By fostering strong relationships with its customers and the broader community, Nandadulal Pure Veg aims to become more than just a restaurant, but a trusted and valued member of the local neighborhood. The establishment strives to create a sense of belonging, where customers feel like family and are always greeted with a warm smile. <br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for Nandadulal Pure Veg is one of sustainable growth and community enrichment. Expansion within the local area and potentially into neighboring districts is a possibility, allowing more people to experience the restaurant\'s unique brand of vegetarian cuisine. Menu innovation will be a continuous process, with plans to introduce new dishes that showcase the diversity of Assamese and Indian vegetarian cooking, while also catering to evolving customer preferences. There may be considerations to incorporate technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering, table reservations, or a loyalty program. Furthermore, Nandadulal Pure Veg envisions becoming a leading advocate for vegetarianism and healthy eating within the region. This could involve hosting cooking classes, workshops on nutrition, or collaborating with local schools and healthcare providers to promote awareness about the benefits of a plant-based diet. A long-term goal is to establish Nandadulal Pure Veg as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement. By staying true to its core values and continuously striving for excellence, Nandadulal Pure Veg is poised to make a lasting contribution to the local culinary landscape and inspire a healthier, more sustainable future for the community it serves.', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:15:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1694, 'AB\'s - Absolute Barbecues | GS Road, Guwahati', 'Restaurants', '', 'AB\'s - Absolute Barbecues | GS Road, Guwahati, located on the 2nd Floor of Mayur Heights at ABC Point, GS Road, is a vibrant and established restaurant that has quickly become a cornerstone of the Guwahati culinary scene. More than just a dining establishment, AB\'s offers an immersive and interactive barbecue experience, setting it apart from traditional restaurants and catering specifically to the discerning palates of Assam. Positioned strategically on GS Road, a major commercial artery of Guwahati, AB\'s benefits from high visibility and accessibility, making it a popular choice for families, friends, and corporate gatherings. The restaurant’s commitment to quality, variety, and exceptional customer service contributes significantly to its positive reputation within the local business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of AB\'s offering is its distinctive \"Wish Grill,\" where diners can customize their own barbecue experience by selecting from a wide array of exotic meats, seafood, and vegetables. This personalized approach allows guests to experiment with flavors and create their own unique dishes. Complementing the Wish Grill is a comprehensive buffet spread featuring both Indian and international cuisines. From traditional Indian curries and biryanis to continental favorites, the buffet provides a diverse selection to cater to varying tastes and preferences. Unique selling points include the interactive grilling experience, the sheer variety of dishes offered, and the restaurant\'s commitment to using fresh, high-quality ingredients. This resonates particularly well in Guwahati, where food is an integral part of the culture and residents appreciate authentic flavors and generous portions. AB\'s effectively addresses the local market\'s desire for a unique dining experience that combines entertainment with culinary excellence.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAB\'s - Absolute Barbecues places a strong emphasis on providing an exceptional customer experience. The restaurant\'s staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and well-cared for. Beyond the core food offerings, AB\'s frequently hosts special events and promotions to further enhance the dining experience. This includes live music performances, festive celebrations, and themed food festivals. The restaurant actively engages with the local community through social media and partnerships with local organizations. By participating in community events and offering special deals to local residents, AB\'s fosters a sense of belonging and loyalty. This commitment to building strong relationships with the local community is a key differentiator and contributes to the restaurant\'s continued success. Regular feedback is actively solicited from patrons through comment cards and online platforms. This feedback is carefully analyzed and used to continuously improve the dining experience and address any customer concerns.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, AB\'s - Absolute Barbecues | GS Road, Guwahati, envisions sustained growth and expansion within the region. The restaurant aims to further solidify its position as the premier barbecue destination in Guwahati by continuously innovating its menu, enhancing the customer experience, and strengthening its ties with the local community. Potential future plans include expanding the restaurant\'s seating capacity to accommodate growing demand, introducing new menu items that reflect local culinary traditions, and exploring opportunities to offer catering services for events and gatherings. The long-term goal is to establish AB\'s as a trusted and respected brand that is synonymous with quality, value, and exceptional dining experiences. The management team is also exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the AB\'s experience to a wider audience. With its strong foundation, dedicated team, and unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, AB\'s - Absolute Barbecues | GS Road, Guwahati is well-positioned for continued success and growth in the years to come.', '2nd Floor, Mayur Heights ABC Point, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:15:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1695, 'Chaska - Fine Dining', 'Restaurants', '', 'Chaska - Fine Dining: A Culinary Oasis on GS Road\n\nChaska - Fine Dining represents a sophisticated addition to the culinary landscape of Guwahati, Assam, offering a distinctive fine dining experience on the bustling GS Road. More than just a restaurant, Chaska aims to be a destination where authentic flavors meet contemporary presentation, creating memorable moments for its patrons. Situated in a prime location, Chaska distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality ingredients, innovative menu design, and impeccable service, filling a crucial niche in the market for discerning diners seeking refined culinary experiences. We strive to be a beacon of culinary excellence, enriching the local business environment by attracting both local clientele and visitors alike.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around providing an exceptional multi-cuisine fine dining experience. The menu is thoughtfully curated, featuring a blend of global culinary techniques applied to locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. While we offer an array of international dishes prepared with meticulous attention to detail, we also celebrate the rich culinary heritage of Assam, presenting traditional Assamese flavors with a modern twist. This fusion approach is a key differentiator, appealing to both those seeking familiar comforts and those eager to explore new gastronomic horizons. Our focus on fresh, high-quality ingredients sets us apart from casual dining establishments, and our commitment to consistent execution ensures a delightful experience every time. We address the local market\'s need for a premium dining option, offering a sophisticated alternative to the prevalent casual dining scene. Specifically, we feature seasonally inspired menus to highlight the freshest available local produce.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Chaska, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. Our staff is trained to anticipate needs, provide informed recommendations, and ensure a seamless and enjoyable dining journey. We cultivate a welcoming and elegant ambiance, creating a space where guests can relax and savor their meals. Beyond providing exceptional food and service, Chaska actively engages with the local community through participation in local events and collaborations with regional artisans and suppliers. We believe in fostering a strong connection with the community by supporting local businesses and promoting the region\'s unique cultural identity. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to ensure we continually improve our offerings and maintain the highest standards of service. Regular customer loyalty programs are also in place to reward our most valued patrons.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Chaska envisions becoming the premier fine dining destination in Guwahati and a recognized name throughout Assam. Our future plans include expanding our menu offerings, hosting exclusive culinary events, and potentially opening additional locations to reach a wider audience. We are committed to staying ahead of culinary trends and continuously innovating to provide our guests with new and exciting dining experiences. We plan to establish strategic partnerships with local farms and producers to further enhance our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients. Our long-term goal is to elevate the culinary landscape of the region, contributing to the growth of the local economy and establishing Assam as a destination for discerning food lovers. We are also exploring options for online ordering and delivery to cater to the evolving needs of our customers while maintaining the high quality associated with the Chaska brand.', 'GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:20:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1696, 'Eats & Beats Restro', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Eats & Beats Restro is a vibrant and dynamic dining establishment located at Tripura Rd Jayanagar Road, conveniently situated near Agile Hospital and opposite SBI in the heart of [Assam City/Town]. We offer a unique blend of delicious cuisine and live musical performances, creating a memorable and immersive experience for our patrons. Our restaurant is more than just a place to eat; it\'s a community hub where friends and family can gather, enjoy good food, and appreciate local talent.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>In the burgeoning Assam business landscape, Eats & Beats Restro distinguishes itself through its dual focus on culinary excellence and artistic expression. We recognized a need for a venue that catered to both the appetite for quality food and the desire for enriching entertainment. By combining these two elements, we\'ve carved a niche for ourselves as a go-to destination for a complete and satisfying evening. We are committed to supporting the local arts scene by providing a platform for musicians and performers, while simultaneously offering a diverse menu crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Eats & Beats Restro, our core offering revolves around providing a diverse and satisfying dining experience. Our menu features a curated selection of dishes ranging from regional Assamese specialties to popular Indian and Continental favorites. We take pride in using fresh, high-quality ingredients to create flavorful and authentic meals. Beyond the food, our live musical performances are a significant draw. We feature a rotating roster of local bands and musicians, showcasing a variety of genres, including traditional Assamese music, contemporary pop, and soulful melodies. This unique combination provides a truly immersive and entertaining experience that differentiates us from standard restaurants.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A key unique selling point for Eats & Beats Restro is our commitment to creating a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We carefully curate our music program to ensure it complements the dining experience, creating a lively yet comfortable ambiance. Furthermore, our menu is designed to cater to a wide range of tastes and dietary preferences, ensuring that there\'s something for everyone to enjoy. Our location, easily accessible and well-known due to its proximity to Agile Hospital and SBI, also provides a significant advantage.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our services effectively meet the local market needs by providing a versatile venue for various occasions. Whether it\'s a casual lunch with colleagues, a family dinner, or a celebratory event with friends, Eats & Beats Restro offers the perfect setting. We also cater to the growing demand for live entertainment, particularly among younger audiences, providing a space where they can discover new local artists and enjoy a night out. By offering a combination of quality food, engaging entertainment, and a welcoming atmosphere, we provide a comprehensive and fulfilling dining experience that resonates with the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Eats & Beats Restro. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each dining experience is memorable. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our food, service, and overall atmosphere. We also engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting fundraising events for local charities and sponsoring community events. These efforts help us build strong relationships with our neighbors and foster a sense of community within our restaurant.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets Eats & Beats Restro apart is our genuine commitment to creating a connection with the local community. We actively support local artists by providing them with a platform to showcase their talent. We also source ingredients from local farmers and producers whenever possible, contributing to the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of our food. By prioritizing community engagement, we aim to be more than just a restaurant; we aspire to be a valuable asset to the local area.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Eats & Beats Restro envisions becoming a landmark destination known for its exceptional food, vibrant entertainment, and unwavering commitment to the local community. We plan to expand our menu to include more regional specialties and introduce innovative dishes that reflect the evolving tastes of our customers. We also aim to enhance our entertainment offerings by featuring a wider range of musical genres and performance styles. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to further strengthen our ties to the community. Our long-term goal is to establish Eats & Beats Restro as a beloved institution that enriches the cultural fabric of [Assam City/Town] for years to come.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We also intend to introduce loyalty programs and special event nights to further engage our customer base and enhance their experience. Exploring options such as themed nights dedicated to specific genres of music or showcasing local artisans during weekend markets are under consideration. Ultimately, Eats & Beats Restro aims to be a catalyst for positive community engagement while offering a unique and enjoyable dining and entertainment experience. Our continued success will be driven by our dedication to quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction.</p>', 'Tripura Rd Jayanagar Road near Agile Hospital, opp. SBI', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:20:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1697, '11th Avenue Cafe Bistro', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>11th Avenue Cafe Bistro: A Culinary Gem on Tayabulla Road</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled at 19, Tayabulla Road, 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro offers a unique dining experience that blends the warmth of a traditional Assamese cafe with the sophistication of a European-style bistro. More than just a place to eat, it\'s a community hub, a meeting place, and a destination for those seeking quality food, exceptional coffee, and a welcoming atmosphere. In the bustling local landscape of Assam, 11th Avenue stands out as a carefully curated space where both locals and visitors can find respite and enjoy a memorable culinary journey.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro lies a commitment to providing diverse and high-quality offerings. The core of our business revolves around two main pillars: expertly crafted food and specialty coffee. Our menu features a curated selection of dishes, from classic continental breakfast options and light lunch fare to heartier evening meals. We take pride in using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring that each dish is bursting with flavor and reflects the regional bounty. Our chefs expertly blend traditional techniques with modern culinary trends, resulting in innovative and satisfying meals. Vegetarians and those with dietary restrictions will find ample choices, reflecting our commitment to catering to a diverse clientele.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond our food, we are equally passionate about our coffee. We carefully select premium beans from reputable suppliers, roasting them in-house to achieve the perfect aroma and flavor profile. Our baristas are highly trained and dedicated to crafting exceptional espresso-based drinks, from classic cappuccinos to more adventurous latte art creations. Our unique selling point lies in the fusion of these two elements: a high-quality food menu complemented by a truly exceptional coffee experience, all within a comfortable and inviting setting. This combination caters to the local market\'s growing demand for sophisticated dining options that retain a sense of authenticity and regional flavor.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro. From the moment a guest walks through the door, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our staff is dedicated to providing personalized service, anticipating needs, and ensuring that every visit is enjoyable. We believe in building relationships with our customers, fostering a sense of community and belonging. Our welcoming atmosphere, comfortable seating, and thoughtful décor contribute to an environment where guests can relax, socialize, and savor their meals. We regularly host events and special promotions, further engaging with the local community and creating a vibrant social hub. We also actively solicit customer feedback, using it to continuously improve our offerings and enhance the overall dining experience. Furthermore, we actively engage with our local community through collaborations with local artists, supporting local charities, and participating in community events. We strive to be more than just a cafe; we aim to be a valued member of the Tayabulla Road neighborhood.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro is poised for growth and expansion. We envision becoming a recognized culinary destination in Assam, known for our commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our coffee roasting operations, potentially supplying our beans to other cafes and restaurants in the region. We hope to establish ourselves as a trusted brand synonymous with excellent food, exceptional coffee, and a genuine sense of hospitality. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations, bringing the 11th Avenue Cafe Bistro experience to new communities while always maintaining the core values of quality, community, and exceptional service that define us.</p>', '19, Tayabulla Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:20:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
