(1698, 'The Whiskey Bar & Grill', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>The Whiskey Bar & Grill aims to redefine the dining and social scene in Guwahati, Assam, by offering a sophisticated yet approachable establishment where quality food, premium beverages, and exceptional service converge. More than just a restaurant and bar, it\'s envisioned as a vibrant hub for professionals, residents, and tourists seeking a memorable experience rooted in local hospitality and international standards. Positioned to capitalize on Guwahati’s growing demand for upscale dining and curated beverage experiences, The Whiskey Bar & Grill seeks to become a landmark destination in the city\'s culinary landscape.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The establishment distinguishes itself by meticulously curating its whiskey selection, showcasing a diverse range from renowned Scotch distilleries to emerging Indian brands, offering both connoisseurs and novices an opportunity to explore the world of whiskey. Beyond whiskey, the bar features an extensive selection of other spirits, craft beers, and expertly crafted cocktails, catering to a broad spectrum of preferences. Complementing the beverage program is a carefully designed menu focusing on grilled specialties and elevated comfort food. Utilizing locally sourced ingredients where possible, the kitchen crafts dishes that pair perfectly with the bar\'s offerings, from hearty steaks and burgers to lighter fare like salads and appetizers. The menu is designed to be both approachable and refined, ensuring there\'s something to satisfy every palate. This careful balance of quality and accessibility is a core differentiator in the local market. Furthermore, The Whiskey Bar & Grill will cater to the increasing demand for private dining and event spaces by offering customizable options for gatherings, corporate events, and celebrations.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At The Whiskey Bar & Grill, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm Assam hospitality and attentive service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and beverage offerings, providing personalized recommendations and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable dining experience. The ambiance is carefully crafted to create a welcoming and sophisticated atmosphere, with comfortable seating, thoughtfully chosen decor, and ambient lighting that enhances the overall mood. Regular live music performances featuring local artists will further contribute to the vibrant atmosphere, making The Whiskey Bar & Grill a destination for entertainment as well as dining. By actively engaging with the local community through partnerships with local businesses, participation in local events, and support for charitable initiatives, The Whiskey Bar & Grill aims to foster a sense of belonging and become an integral part of Guwahati’s social fabric. Feedback is actively solicited and valued, ensuring continuous improvement and adaptation to meet the evolving needs and preferences of the local clientele.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, The Whiskey Bar & Grill envisions significant growth potential. The immediate focus is on establishing a strong reputation within Guwahati as the premier destination for whiskey enthusiasts and discerning diners. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more seasonal and regional specialties, further highlighting the culinary heritage of Assam. Exploring partnerships with local distilleries and breweries is another key objective, strengthening ties with the local economy and offering unique, locally sourced products. Geographically, potential expansion to other key cities in Northeast India is being considered, leveraging the brand\'s success and replicating the unique concept in new markets. This expansion would be carefully planned and executed to maintain the quality and standards that define The Whiskey Bar & Grill. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish The Whiskey Bar & Grill as a recognized and respected brand throughout the region, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and unwavering dedication to customer satisfaction.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The Whiskey Bar & Grill seeks to become more than just a business; it strives to become a cornerstone of the Guwahati community, a place where people can gather to celebrate, connect, and create lasting memories. By staying true to its core values of quality, service, and community engagement, The Whiskey Bar & Grill is confident in its ability to achieve its ambitious goals and contribute to the vibrant growth of the local business landscape.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:20:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1699, 'Shanghai Salsa', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Shanghai Salsa, located at 1st House, Leelamoni Medicos, 37, Ambikagiri Nagar Path, Guwahati, Assam, brings a vibrant and exciting fusion of flavors to the culinary landscape of the region. Unlike typical dining establishments, Shanghai Salsa offers a unique experience that blends the exotic tastes of Chinese cuisine with the zesty spice of authentic Mexican salsa, creating a memorable dining destination that caters to the adventurous palates of the local community and beyond. The business aims to be more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural hub where diverse flavors and communities converge.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Shanghai Salsa lies its commitment to delivering an innovative and unparalleled dining experience. The core offering revolves around a curated menu that creatively marries the best of Chinese and Mexican culinary traditions. Patrons can expect a tantalizing array of dishes featuring familiar Chinese staples reimagined with the bold and vibrant flavors of Mexican salsa. Think of dishes like Szechuan Chicken Tacos with a fiery mango salsa, or perhaps Kung Pao Shrimp burritos with a refreshing cucumber-cilantro salsa. Vegetarian options are also prominent, featuring dishes like tofu stir-fry fajitas or vegetable spring rolls with a spicy black bean salsa dip. The unique selling point of Shanghai Salsa is undoubtedly its ability to bridge two seemingly disparate culinary worlds, resulting in a flavor profile that is both familiar and surprisingly innovative. This novelty provides a refreshing alternative to the traditional dining choices available in Guwahati and caters to a growing demand for more experimental and globally inspired cuisine. Furthermore, the business focuses on using locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and quality of its dishes. This commitment to local sourcing resonates well with the community and reinforces Shanghai Salsa\'s dedication to supporting the regional economy.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Shanghai Salsa understands that exceptional food is only one component of a successful dining experience. The business places a high premium on providing attentive and personalized customer service. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warmth and enthusiasm, creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. Staff members are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, able to offer recommendations, and accommodate dietary restrictions or preferences. The ambience of the restaurant is designed to be both inviting and vibrant, reflecting the fusion of cultures that define its culinary offerings. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered to continuously improve the dining experience and ensure that it meets the evolving needs and expectations of its clientele. Shanghai Salsa also actively engages with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with other businesses, and the hosting of special themed nights that celebrate both Chinese and Mexican cultures. This active community involvement helps build brand loyalty and solidifies Shanghai Salsa\'s position as a valued member of the Ambikagiri Nagar Path neighborhood.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Shanghai Salsa envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati and broader Assam market. The business plans to expand its menu offerings, introducing new and exciting fusion dishes that continue to push the boundaries of culinary innovation. One of the primary future goals is to establish a strong online presence through a user-friendly website and active social media engagement, allowing for online ordering and delivery services, expanding its reach to customers beyond the immediate vicinity. Further plans include the exploration of catering services for local events and corporate gatherings, offering a unique and memorable culinary experience for a wider audience. Longer-term goals include the potential expansion to additional locations within Assam and potentially other northeastern states, bringing the unique Shanghai Salsa experience to a broader regional market. The business is also committed to continuous staff training and development, ensuring that its employees remain knowledgeable, passionate, and dedicated to providing exceptional service. By staying true to its core values of culinary innovation, customer satisfaction, and community engagement, Shanghai Salsa is confident in its ability to achieve its ambitious growth objectives and become a leading culinary destination in the region.</p>\n</body>\n</html>', '1st House, Leelamoni Medicos, 37, Ambikagiri Nagar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:20:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1700, 'Bamboo Heights Ethnic Family Restaurant', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Bamboo Heights Ethnic Family Restaurant: A Taste of Assam\'s Heritage</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati, at Panjabari Rd, opposite Purabi Diary and near Sankardev Kalakhetra, Bamboo Heights Ethnic Family Restaurant offers a unique and authentic Assamese dining experience. More than just a restaurant, Bamboo Heights is a celebration of Assam\'s rich culinary heritage, providing a welcoming space for families and individuals to connect over delicious, traditionally prepared food. In a local business landscape increasingly influenced by global cuisines, Bamboo Heights stands out by championing the distinctive flavors and ingredients of Assam, contributing to the preservation and promotion of its cultural identity. It’s a culinary landmark aiming to provide a genuine taste of Assam to both residents and visitors alike, fostering a deeper appreciation for the region\'s gastronomic treasures.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Bamboo Heights’ offerings lies a diverse menu showcasing the best of Assamese cuisine. Our signature dishes include traditional thalis featuring a variety of curries, vegetables, and rice preparations, all prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We pride ourselves on our slow-cooked meats, infused with unique Assamese spices and herbs, offering a depth of flavor rarely found elsewhere. Vegetarian options are equally prominent, with a focus on fresh, seasonal vegetables and traditional lentil preparations. Our unique selling point lies in the authenticity of our recipes, passed down through generations, ensuring that each dish embodies the true essence of Assamese home cooking. Furthermore, we offer a curated selection of traditional Assamese beverages, complementing the food and enhancing the overall dining experience. By prioritizing local sourcing and traditional cooking methods, Bamboo Heights directly addresses the growing demand for authentic regional cuisine, appealing to both local residents seeking a taste of home and tourists eager to explore the unique flavors of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Bamboo Heights. From the moment guests step through our doors, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality. Our attentive and knowledgeable staff are dedicated to providing personalized service, guiding diners through the menu and explaining the nuances of each dish. The restaurant\'s ambiance is carefully designed to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, reflecting the rustic charm of rural Assam. Regular cultural events, such as traditional music performances and art exhibitions, further enhance the dining experience and foster a strong connection with the local community. We believe in building relationships with our customers, not just serving them food. Feedback is actively encouraged and used to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that we are consistently meeting the needs of our diverse clientele. By actively engaging with the local community through partnerships with local artisans and participation in community events, Bamboo Heights aims to be more than just a restaurant – it strives to be a gathering place where people can connect, celebrate, and experience the true spirit of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Bamboo Heights envisions becoming a leading ambassador for Assamese cuisine, both within the region and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to incorporate lesser-known regional specialties, further showcasing the diversity of Assam\'s culinary landscape. We also plan to establish partnerships with local farmers and producers, strengthening our commitment to sustainable sourcing and supporting the local economy. Exploring opportunities for catering services and packaged food products is also under consideration, allowing us to reach a wider audience and share the flavors of Assam with those who may not be able to visit our restaurant. Ultimately, Bamboo Heights aims to be recognized as a cultural institution, a place where people can not only enjoy delicious food but also learn about and appreciate the rich heritage of Assam. We are committed to preserving and promoting Assamese culture through our food, our service, and our engagement with the local community, ensuring that the traditions of Assam continue to thrive for generations to come.</p>', 'Panjabari Rd, opp. Purabi Diary, near Sankardev Kalakhetra', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:25:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1701, 'Upsouth', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Upsouth, a vibrant and innovative eatery, brings the authentic flavors of South India to the heart of Assam, offering a refreshing culinary experience that resonates with the local palate. Located at \'\', Upsouth stands out as more than just a restaurant; it’s a cultural bridge, showcasing the diversity of Indian cuisine while catering to the specific preferences of the Assamese community. In a region known for its rich culinary traditions, Upsouth introduces a contemporary twist on classic South Indian dishes, providing a novel and exciting dining option for residents and visitors alike.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Upsouth\'s offerings are its meticulously crafted South Indian delicacies. The menu features a wide array of dosas, idlis, vadas, uttapams, and rice preparations, each prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. These dishes are not simply replicated; they are adapted to incorporate local tastes, subtly blending the sharp spices of South India with the more mellow flavors favored in Assam. For instance, a unique twist on the traditional masala dosa might feature locally grown potatoes and spices, creating a dish that is both familiar and uniquely Upsouth. Furthermore, Upsouth emphasizes healthy cooking methods, using minimal oil and prioritizing fresh, natural ingredients. One of Upsouth\'s unique selling points is its commitment to hygiene and food safety, assuring customers of a consistently high-quality dining experience. The restaurant also caters to various dietary needs, offering gluten-free and vegan options, ensuring inclusivity and appealing to a broad spectrum of customers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Upsouth is dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience, starting with a warm and inviting ambiance. The restaurant\'s interior is designed to be both modern and comfortable, creating a welcoming atmosphere for families, friends, and individuals alike. Customer service is paramount; Upsouth\'s staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, providing helpful recommendations and addressing any concerns promptly. To further enhance the customer experience, Upsouth incorporates technology, offering online ordering and table reservations. The restaurant also actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting cultural events and supporting local farmers and suppliers. By participating in local festivals and collaborating with community organizations, Upsouth has established itself as a valuable member of the Assamese community, fostering a sense of belonging and connection with its customers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Upsouth envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded influence within the Assamese culinary landscape. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties, further showcasing the diversity of South Indian cuisine while continuing to cater to local tastes. Another key aspect of the future vision is expansion, with plans to open additional locations in other key areas of Assam. This strategic expansion will enable Upsouth to reach a wider audience and further solidify its position as a leading South Indian restaurant in the region. Long-term goals also include developing a line of packaged South Indian snacks and ingredients, making the unique flavors of Upsouth accessible to customers beyond the restaurant\'s physical locations. By focusing on innovation, quality, and community engagement, Upsouth is poised to continue its success and become a beloved culinary institution in Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:25:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1702, 'GUWAHATI AKHOL', 'Restaurants', '', '<article>\n<h1>GUWAHATI AKHOL: Nurturing Assam\'s Agricultural Future</h1>\n<p>GUWAHATI AKHOL is a dedicated agricultural solutions provider based in the heart of Assam, committed to empowering local farmers and fostering sustainable agricultural practices. Recognizing the pivotal role agriculture plays in the state\'s economy and the livelihoods of countless families, GUWAHATI AKHOL operates as more than just a business; it functions as a partner, offering tailored support and resources to enhance productivity, improve crop quality, and promote environmentally responsible farming.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We understand the unique challenges faced by Assam\'s agricultural community, from unpredictable weather patterns and pest infestations to limited access to advanced technologies and market information. GUWAHATI AKHOL addresses these challenges by providing a comprehensive suite of services and products designed to optimize every stage of the agricultural process, from pre-planting preparation to post-harvest management. Our commitment to innovation, coupled with a deep understanding of local agricultural conditions, positions us as a trusted resource for farmers seeking to thrive in a rapidly evolving agricultural landscape.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Core Services and Products</h2>\n<p>GUWAHATI AKHOL\'s core offerings encompass a diverse range of solutions tailored to meet the specific needs of Assam\'s diverse agricultural sectors. These include:</p>\n<br> <br>\n<ul>\n<li><b>High-Quality Seeds and Saplings:</b> We source and supply a wide variety of certified, high-yielding seeds and saplings, carefully selected for their suitability to Assam\'s climate and soil conditions. This includes rice varieties, vegetables, fruits, and other commercially viable crops. Our focus is on providing seeds that are disease-resistant and adapted to the local environment, ensuring optimal yields and minimizing crop losses.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Agricultural Inputs:</b> GUWAHATI AKHOL offers a range of essential agricultural inputs, including fertilizers, pesticides, and micronutrients. We prioritize the supply of eco-friendly and sustainable options, encouraging farmers to adopt responsible farming practices that minimize environmental impact while maximizing crop health and productivity. We provide guidance on the appropriate application of these inputs to ensure optimal results.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Farm Equipment and Tools:</b> To enhance efficiency and reduce manual labor, we provide access to a range of modern farm equipment and tools, from small-scale hand tools to larger machinery. We also offer guidance and training on the proper use and maintenance of these tools, ensuring that farmers can maximize their investment and improve their operational efficiency.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Expert Agricultural Advisory Services:</b> Our team of experienced agricultural experts provides personalized advisory services to farmers, offering guidance on crop selection, soil management, pest control, irrigation techniques, and post-harvest handling. We conduct on-site farm visits, provide practical recommendations, and offer ongoing support to help farmers overcome challenges and achieve their production goals.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Market Linkage Support:</b> Recognizing the importance of access to markets, GUWAHATI AKHOL facilitates market linkages for farmers, connecting them with potential buyers and helping them to negotiate fair prices for their produce. We provide information on market trends, demand patterns, and quality standards, empowering farmers to make informed decisions and maximize their profitability.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our unique selling point lies in our holistic approach to agricultural development. We don\'t just sell products; we provide comprehensive solutions that address the entire agricultural value chain. This, combined with our deep understanding of the local context and our commitment to sustainability, sets us apart from other agricultural suppliers in the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Customer Experience</h2>\n<p>At GUWAHATI AKHOL, we believe that building strong relationships with our customers is essential to our success. We are committed to providing exceptional customer service, characterized by:</p>\n<br> <br>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Personalized Attention:</b> We take the time to understand the unique needs and challenges of each farmer, offering tailored solutions that are specifically designed to address their individual circumstances.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Prompt and Reliable Support:</b> We are always available to answer questions, provide guidance, and resolve any issues that may arise. Our dedicated customer support team is committed to providing prompt and reliable service.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Community Engagement:</b> GUWAHATI AKHOL is actively involved in the local community, participating in agricultural events, sponsoring farmer training programs, and supporting initiatives that promote sustainable agriculture. We believe in giving back to the community and contributing to the overall development of the agricultural sector in Assam.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Building Trust and Transparency:</b> We operate with the highest levels of integrity and transparency, ensuring that our customers have complete confidence in our products and services. We are committed to building long-term relationships based on trust and mutual respect.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our approach to customer service goes beyond simple transactions. We strive to create a supportive and collaborative environment where farmers feel empowered to learn, grow, and succeed. We regularly conduct farmer training programs and workshops to share knowledge and best practices, fostering a sense of community and promoting continuous improvement.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<h2>Future Vision</h2>\n<p>GUWAHATI AKHOL envisions a future where Assam\'s agricultural sector is thriving, sustainable, and economically viable. Our long-term goals include:</p>\n<br> <br>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Expanding our Product and Service Offerings:</b> We plan to continually expand our range of products and services to meet the evolving needs of Assam\'s agricultural community, incorporating innovative technologies and sustainable practices.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Strengthening our Market Linkages:</b> We are committed to strengthening our market linkages to ensure that farmers have access to fair and remunerative prices for their produce. This includes exploring new market opportunities and developing value-added products.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Promoting Sustainable Agriculture:</b> We will continue to promote sustainable agricultural practices, encouraging farmers to adopt environmentally responsible farming methods that protect natural resources and enhance long-term productivity.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Empowering Farmers:</b> We aim to empower farmers with the knowledge, skills, and resources they need to succeed in a rapidly changing agricultural landscape. This includes providing access to education, training, and financial support.</li>\n<br>\n<li><b>Establishing GUWAHATI AKHOL as a Leader:</b> We aspire to establish GUWAHATI AKHOL as a leader in the agricultural solutions sector in Assam, recognized for our commitment to innovation, sustainability, and customer service.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We believe that by working in partnership with farmers, government agencies, and other stakeholders, we can contribute to a brighter future for Assam\'s agricultural sector. GUWAHATI AKHOL is committed to being a catalyst for positive change, driving innovation, promoting sustainability, and empowering farmers to achieve their full potential.</p>\n</article>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:25:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1703, 'Roots', 'Restaurants', '', 'Roots: Nurturing Growth and Connection in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nRoots, strategically located on G.S. Road, opposite the Indian Oil Petrol Pump in Rukmini Gaon, Guwahati (781022), is more than just a business; it\'s a vital thread in the fabric of the local Assamese community. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning entrepreneurial spirit, Roots stands out by offering a unique blend of services designed to foster growth, connection, and well-being. Our commitment to quality, combined with a deep understanding of the local market, positions us as a trusted partner for individuals and businesses alike.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe recognize the diverse needs of the residents of Guwahati and the surrounding areas. Roots was conceived to address these needs by providing a curated selection of resources and services that empower individuals and strengthen the community. We are particularly sensitive to the unique cultural context of Assam, and strive to incorporate this understanding into every aspect of our operations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings center around [Here, be specific about the business\'s core offerings. Some examples:] holistic wellness services and a community co-working space. The wellness services encompass everything from yoga and meditation classes led by experienced local instructors to therapeutic massage and nutritional consultations. We believe in a holistic approach to well-being, addressing not only physical health but also mental and emotional balance. Our unique selling point within this domain is our emphasis on incorporating traditional Assamese healing practices alongside modern wellness techniques. For example, we offer specialized Ayurvedic consultations tailored to the local climate and dietary habits. This resonates deeply with the community, which values its cultural heritage. We actively source local, organic ingredients for our wellness offerings, further supporting local farmers and businesses.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur co-working space provides a vibrant and collaborative environment for freelancers, entrepreneurs, and small businesses. It offers a range of flexible workspace options, from hot desks to private offices, equipped with high-speed internet, printing facilities, and meeting rooms. What distinguishes our co-working space is its strong emphasis on community building. We host regular networking events, workshops, and skill-sharing sessions to foster collaboration and support the growth of our members\' businesses. This goes beyond simply renting out space; it\'s about creating a supportive ecosystem where individuals can connect, learn, and thrive. The co-working aspect directly addresses the needs of the growing startup scene and the increasing number of remote workers in Guwahati, providing them with a professional and supportive environment to work and connect.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Roots, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in building genuine relationships with our clients and treating everyone who walks through our doors with warmth, respect, and understanding. Our team is carefully selected not only for their professional skills but also for their genuine empathy and commitment to customer service. We prioritize listening to our customers\' needs and tailoring our services to meet their specific requirements. We actively solicit feedback and continuously strive to improve our offerings based on customer input. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through participation in local events, sponsoring local initiatives, and partnering with other local businesses. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and this commitment is reflected in everything we do. We regularly organize free workshops and community events focused on topics relevant to the local population, such as financial literacy, digital marketing, and sustainable living. These initiatives help us build strong relationships with the community and demonstrate our commitment to their well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Roots envisions becoming a leading hub for wellness, entrepreneurship, and community connection in Guwahati. We plan to expand our range of wellness services to include more specialized therapies and workshops. We are also exploring the possibility of offering childcare services to better support working parents in the community. With respect to the co-working space, we aim to create more specialized spaces catering to specific industries, such as a design studio or a makerspace. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance the member experience and streamline operations. We also intend to strengthen our partnerships with local businesses and organizations to further expand our reach and impact.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur long-term goal is to establish Roots as a model for sustainable and community-focused businesses. We are committed to operating in an environmentally responsible manner, reducing our carbon footprint, and supporting local initiatives that promote sustainability. Ultimately, Roots aspires to be a place where individuals can come together to learn, grow, connect, and contribute to the betterment of the community. We see a future where Roots serves as a catalyst for positive change in Guwahati and beyond. We believe that by fostering growth, connection, and well-being, we can help build a stronger and more vibrant community for all.', 'G.S. Road, Opp Indian Oil Petrol Pump, Rukmini Gaon, 781022', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:25:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1704, 'PIAZZA', 'Restaurants', '', 'PIAZZA, strategically located on Dr B Borooah Rd, opposite Nehru Stadium in Guwahati, is a vibrant and dynamic establishment that aims to redefine the local experience of [mention specific industry, e.g., dining, retail, co-working]. Rooted in the heart of Assam, PIAZZA strives to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect, engage, and enjoy a unique blend of contemporary offerings and traditional Assamese hospitality. Its prime location ensures easy accessibility and visibility, making it a landmark destination within the bustling city. PIAZZA recognizes the growing demand for [mention specific need the business addresses, e.g., a modern dining experience, curated retail products, a flexible workspace] in Guwahati, and is committed to providing high-quality services that cater to the evolving needs of its diverse clientele.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, PIAZZA offers [mention specific core service or product, e.g., a curated selection of Assamese and Continental cuisine, a unique collection of handcrafted artisanal products, state-of-the-art co-working facilities]. For instance, if PIAZZA is a restaurant, its menu features dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam while incorporating modern culinary techniques. Unique selling points might include a focus on sustainable practices, a commitment to supporting local farmers and producers, or a distinctive ambiance that blends traditional Assamese aesthetics with contemporary design elements. If PIAZZA is a retail store, it specializes in offering high-quality, locally made products that are not readily available elsewhere, promoting local artisans and craftsmanship. This approach directly addresses the growing consumer demand for authentic, ethically sourced products. Should PIAZZA be a co-working space, it provides flexible work solutions catering to freelancers, startups, and small businesses, equipped with high-speed internet, meeting rooms, and networking opportunities. This tackles the increasing need for collaborative workspaces and entrepreneurial support within the region. PIAZZA prides itself on offering something that goes beyond the ordinary, providing customers with an enriching and memorable experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of PIAZZA\'s ethos. PIAZZA is committed to delivering exceptional service, prioritizing customer satisfaction above all else. This is achieved through a dedicated team of friendly and knowledgeable staff who are passionate about providing personalized attention and exceeding expectations. PIAZZA actively seeks customer feedback and uses it to continuously improve its services and offerings. This could be through online surveys, in-person interactions, or social media engagement. What truly distinguishes PIAZZA is its strong connection to the local community. PIAZZA actively participates in local events, sponsors community initiatives, and collaborates with local organizations. For example, PIAZZA might host cultural performances, workshops featuring local artisans, or fundraising events for local charities. By fostering these connections, PIAZZA aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be an integral part of the community, contributing to its growth and prosperity. The business strives to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels valued and appreciated.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, PIAZZA envisions significant growth potential. Plans are underway to expand its offerings and reach a wider audience. This could involve introducing new products or services, expanding its physical space, or opening new locations. In the long term, PIAZZA aims to become a leading [mention industry, e.g., dining destination, retail outlet, co-working space] in Guwahati and beyond. The business plans to leverage technology to enhance customer experience, streamline operations, and increase efficiency. This might include implementing online ordering systems, loyalty programs, or data analytics tools. PIAZZA is also committed to sustainability and environmental responsibility, and plans to implement eco-friendly practices throughout its operations. This includes reducing waste, conserving energy, and supporting sustainable sourcing. Ultimately, PIAZZA\'s long-term goal is to create a thriving business that contributes to the economic and social well-being of the local community, while providing exceptional services and unforgettable experiences for its customers. The business is dedicated to adapting and innovating to meet the evolving needs of the market, ensuring its continued success and relevance in the years to come.\n\n<br> <br>\nPIAZZA strives to be synonymous with quality, community, and authentic local experience.', 'Dr B Borooah Rd, opp. Nehru Stadium', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:25:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1705, 'Rabha Kitchen', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Rabha Kitchen: A Culinary Gem Celebrating Assam\'s Rich Heritage</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of [Location, Assam - if unavailable, omit specific location], Rabha Kitchen isn\'t just a restaurant; it\'s a vibrant celebration of Assam\'s diverse culinary heritage, particularly focusing on the unique flavors and traditions of the Rabha community. We are committed to providing an authentic and immersive dining experience, showcasing both traditional recipes passed down through generations and innovative interpretations that cater to modern palates. Rabha Kitchen stands out in the local business landscape as more than just a food establishment; it\'s a cultural ambassador, actively promoting and preserving the rich gastronomic tapestry of Assam. We aim to be a cornerstone of the community, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect with the region\'s cultural identity through the universal language of food.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offering centers around authentic Rabha and broader Assamese cuisine. The menu features signature dishes such as *Chuk\'a Bhat* (sticky rice cooked in a unique bamboo method), *Pitha* (traditional rice cakes in various sweet and savory forms), and flavorful meat and vegetable curries prepared with locally sourced ingredients and traditional Rabha spices. What distinguishes Rabha Kitchen is our unwavering commitment to using fresh, seasonal produce sourced directly from local farmers, ensuring not only superior quality but also supporting the local agricultural economy. Beyond the food itself, we offer unique cultural experiences, occasionally featuring live Rabha folk music performances and showcasing traditional Rabha handicrafts. This multi-faceted approach sets us apart from typical restaurants, providing a richer, more immersive cultural experience. We address a critical need in the local market: a craving for authentic, locally-sourced food and a desire to connect with the region\'s unique cultural identity. We provide a venue for experiencing this heritage firsthand.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Rabha Kitchen, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and personalized dining atmosphere. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the dishes and the cultural significance behind them, allowing them to guide guests through the menu and answer any questions. We believe in building genuine relationships with our customers, treating them as honored guests rather than just patrons. The ambiance reflects the warmth and hospitality inherent in Rabha culture, featuring traditional décor and comfortable seating arrangements. We actively engage with the local community by participating in local festivals and events, offering catering services for community gatherings, and partnering with local artisans to showcase their work. Our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients also strengthens our connection with the community, fostering a sense of shared purpose and mutual support. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs and expectations.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Rabha Kitchen envisions becoming a nationally recognized culinary destination, renowned for its authentic Rabha and Assamese cuisine and its commitment to cultural preservation. We plan to expand our menu to include even more diverse regional dishes, further showcasing the richness and complexity of Assam\'s culinary landscape. Future plans include establishing a cooking school where visitors can learn to prepare traditional Rabha dishes, creating a hands-on cultural experience. We also aim to develop a line of packaged Rabha spices and culinary products, allowing customers to recreate the flavors of Rabha Kitchen in their own homes and share them with others. Long-term, we aspire to establish partnerships with other cultural organizations and tourism agencies to promote Assam as a unique and compelling travel destination. We believe that Rabha Kitchen has the potential to be a catalyst for economic growth in the local community, supporting local farmers, artisans, and other businesses. Our ultimate goal is to not just serve delicious food but to preserve and promote the vibrant cultural heritage of the Rabha community and Assam as a whole, ensuring that it is enjoyed and appreciated for generations to come.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:30:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1706, 'Nagameez', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Nagameez: Your Partner for Growth in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Located at 4RC4+J9C, Tripura Rd, near Agile Hospital, Nagameez stands as a dynamic and forward-thinking business dedicated to serving the evolving needs of the local community and beyond. While specific sector specialisation remains a core asset, Nagameez is defined by its adaptability and commitment to providing tailored solutions. Our strategic location allows us to be readily accessible to clients throughout the region, fostering strong relationships and enabling responsive service.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Nagameez, we believe in the power of partnership. Whether you\'re a budding entrepreneur or an established enterprise, we strive to provide the support and resources necessary for you to thrive. Our team possesses a deep understanding of the Assam business landscape, enabling us to offer insightful guidance and practical solutions that resonate with the local context.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our Core Offerings: Solutions Tailored to Your Needs</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nagameez offers a versatile suite of services designed to address a wide range of business requirements. While the specific nature of these services is dependent on client needs and current market trends, our offerings typically fall into several key areas. These may include, but are not limited to, business consultancy, marketing support, technological solutions, and logistical assistance. We approach each project with a fresh perspective, ensuring that the solutions we deliver are precisely aligned with the client\'s objectives and the realities of their operating environment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Nagameez lies in our ability to combine global best practices with a deep understanding of the local Assam market. This allows us to offer solutions that are both innovative and practical, leveraging the latest technologies and methodologies while remaining sensitive to the unique cultural and economic dynamics of the region. We take pride in our ability to bridge the gap between global trends and local realities, empowering our clients to compete effectively in an increasingly interconnected world.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Meeting Local Market Needs: A Commitment to Community</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We understand that businesses in Assam face unique challenges and opportunities. From navigating complex regulatory landscapes to accessing skilled labor and capital, the path to success can be daunting. At Nagameez, we are committed to providing the support and guidance needed to overcome these obstacles. We actively seek to understand the specific needs of our clients and tailor our services accordingly. This personalized approach ensures that our clients receive the most relevant and effective solutions for their particular situation.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Lasting Relationships</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Nagameez, we believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of a successful business. We are dedicated to providing a seamless and positive experience for every client, from the initial consultation to the completion of the project. Our team is comprised of experienced professionals who are passionate about helping businesses succeed. We are committed to building long-term relationships with our clients based on trust, transparency, and mutual respect. We prioritize open communication, responsiveness, and a proactive approach to problem-solving.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We also understand the importance of connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting the growth and development of the region. We believe that by investing in the community, we are investing in our own future. This commitment to community engagement is an integral part of our business philosophy.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Community Impact</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Nagameez is committed to continued growth and innovation. We plan to expand our service offerings to meet the evolving needs of the market and to leverage emerging technologies to provide even more effective solutions for our clients. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our reach beyond Assam, bringing our expertise and dedication to other regions in India. Our ultimate goal is to become a leading business partner for companies of all sizes, empowering them to achieve their full potential.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>We envision Nagameez as more than just a business; we aspire to be a catalyst for positive change in the community. We are committed to creating jobs, supporting local entrepreneurs, and contributing to the overall economic development of the region. We believe that by working together, we can build a brighter future for Assam and for India as a whole.</p>', '4RC4+J9C, Tripura Rd, near Agile Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:30:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
