(1727, 'Guwahati Kitchen', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Guwahati Kitchen stands as a culinary beacon in the heart of Assam, dedicated to showcasing the rich and diverse flavors of the region to both locals and visitors alike. More than just a restaurant, Guwahati Kitchen is a celebration of Assamese culture, a place where traditional recipes meet modern culinary techniques to create a truly unforgettable dining experience. Located in [Please insert specific address here. If not available, provide a general location description, e.g., \"a vibrant neighborhood in the heart of Guwahati\"], we pride ourselves on using locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers, and contributing to the sustainable development of the Assamese food industry.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Guwahati Kitchen distinguishes itself in the bustling Guwahati food scene through its commitment to authenticity, quality, and community. We offer a comprehensive menu that encompasses the breadth of Assamese cuisine, from classic dishes prepared with time-honored techniques to innovative creations that reinterpret traditional flavors for the modern palate. Our signature dishes include the hearty *Masor Tenga*, a tangy fish curry, and the flavorful *Pitha*, a rice cake available in a variety of sweet and savory preparations. A particular emphasis is placed on showcasing the unique ingredients that define Assamese cooking, such as *khorisa* (fermented bamboo shoot), *jolokia* (bhut jolokia pepper), and a variety of indigenous herbs and spices. We also offer a selection of *thalis*, allowing customers to sample a range of dishes and experience the full spectrum of Assamese flavors. Vegetarian options are plentiful and thoughtfully crafted, ensuring that all dietary preferences are catered to with equal care. In addition to our dine-in service, we also offer takeaway and catering options, bringing the taste of Guwahati Kitchen to homes and events throughout the city. Our commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients is a key differentiator, ensuring not only exceptional flavor but also supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable agricultural practices. We believe that this focus on quality and sustainability resonates deeply with our customers and reinforces our position as a leader in the Assam culinary landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Guwahati Kitchen, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and memorable atmosphere for every guest. Our staff is knowledgeable about Assamese cuisine and passionate about sharing their knowledge with customers, providing recommendations and insights into the dishes. We are committed to providing attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. The restaurant\'s ambiance is designed to reflect the beauty and culture of Assam, with traditional decor and soothing music creating a relaxing and authentic dining environment. Beyond simply serving food, we aim to foster a sense of community. We actively participate in local events, support local charities, and collaborate with other businesses to promote Assam\'s cultural heritage. We also host cooking workshops and demonstrations, providing opportunities for customers to learn about Assamese cuisine and develop their own culinary skills. We believe that this commitment to community engagement not only enhances the customer experience but also strengthens our connection to the local culture and reinforces our role as a valuable member of the Guwahati community. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use their suggestions to continuously improve our services and offerings.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Guwahati Kitchen is one of sustained growth, innovation, and continued commitment to showcasing the best of Assamese cuisine. We plan to expand our operations to reach a wider audience, both within Guwahati and beyond. This may include opening additional locations, developing a line of packaged food products featuring our signature recipes, or expanding our catering services to serve larger events. We are also committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they continue to deliver exceptional service. Furthermore, we plan to deepen our commitment to sustainability by working with local farmers to promote organic and environmentally friendly farming practices. We also aim to explore new and innovative ways to incorporate traditional Assamese ingredients into modern dishes, further pushing the boundaries of Assamese cuisine while staying true to its roots. We envision Guwahati Kitchen becoming a nationally recognized brand, synonymous with quality, authenticity, and the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Ultimately, our goal is to not only serve delicious food but also to promote Assam\'s culture and contribute to the economic development of the region.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:50:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1728, 'Mast Biryani', 'Restaurants', '', 'Mast Biryani, nestled at 4QPR+QHH, Beltola Rd, near Rajdhani Regency in the heart of Guwahati, is quickly establishing itself as a premier destination for authentic and flavorful Biryani in Assam. More than just a restaurant, Mast Biryani is a culinary experience, meticulously crafted to deliver the richness of traditional Biryani while catering to the discerning palates of the local community. We strive to be a cornerstone of Assam\'s vibrant food scene, offering not only exceptional food but also a welcoming and memorable dining experience. Our dedication to quality ingredients, authentic recipes, and superior customer service sets us apart and positions us for sustained success in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Mast Biryani specializes in a diverse range of Biryani preparations, each reflecting the culinary heritage of different regions known for their unique Biryani styles. From the delicately spiced Lucknowi Biryani to the robust and aromatic Hyderabadi Biryani, and the flavorful Kolkata Biryani, our menu offers a comprehensive exploration of this beloved dish. Beyond Biryani, we also offer complementary dishes such as flavorful kebabs, rich curries, and refreshing raitas, creating a complete and satisfying meal. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to using only the freshest, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, combined with traditional cooking techniques that have been perfected over generations. This approach ensures that every dish is bursting with authentic flavor and represents the true essence of Biryani. We understand the local market\'s appreciation for quality and value, and we strive to provide generous portions at competitive prices, making our Biryani accessible to a wide range of customers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Mast Biryani. We believe that every interaction, from the moment a customer steps through our doors to their last bite, should be positive and memorable. Our staff is carefully trained to provide attentive and friendly service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We are committed to creating a warm and inviting atmosphere, where families and friends can gather to enjoy a delicious meal in a comfortable setting. We actively seek feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. Beyond the dine-in experience, we also offer convenient takeaway and delivery options, ensuring that customers can enjoy Mast Biryani wherever they are. We are also committed to connecting with the local community through participation in local events and collaborations with other businesses. We believe in building strong relationships with our neighbors and contributing to the growth and prosperity of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Mast Biryani envisions becoming a household name in Assam, synonymous with quality Biryani and exceptional dining experiences. Our growth strategy includes expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and catering to evolving customer preferences. We plan to explore opportunities to open additional locations in key areas of Guwahati and beyond, making our Biryani more accessible to a wider audience. We are also committed to investing in technology to streamline our operations and enhance the customer experience. This includes implementing online ordering systems, loyalty programs, and mobile applications. Furthermore, we are dedicated to sustainable business practices and minimizing our environmental impact. We aim to source more ingredients locally, reduce waste, and implement energy-efficient technologies. Our long-term goal is to establish Mast Biryani as a leading culinary destination in Assam, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We aspire to create a legacy of culinary excellence that will be enjoyed by generations to come.', '4QPR+QHH, Beltola Rd, near Rajdhani Regency', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:50:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1729, 'CMS Food Court', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>CMS Food Court: A Culinary Hub on Shillong Road</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>CMS Food Court is a vibrant and dynamic culinary destination strategically located on Shillong Road, serving as a key player in the burgeoning Assam food and beverage industry. More than just a collection of eateries, CMS Food Court offers a curated selection of diverse cuisines and dining experiences, catering to the varied tastes and preferences of the local community and travelers alike. Its appeal lies not only in its convenient location but also in its commitment to quality, hygiene, and providing a welcoming atmosphere for families, friends, and individuals seeking a satisfying and enjoyable meal. CMS Food Court distinguishes itself by fostering a collaborative environment amongst its vendors, ensuring a consistent standard of excellence and a diverse menu that keeps patrons returning for more.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of CMS Food Court\'s offerings is a collection of carefully selected food stalls, each specializing in a distinct culinary niche. Patrons can find everything from authentic Assamese thalis showcasing the region\'s rich culinary heritage to popular North Indian dishes, quick-bite Chinese staples, and even continental favorites. What sets CMS Food Court apart is the emphasis on utilizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers and producers but also ensures the highest quality and flavor in every dish. Each vendor is chosen for their expertise, commitment to hygiene standards, and ability to deliver exceptional food consistently. Further differentiating itself is the focus on providing options for diverse dietary needs, including vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free choices, ensuring that every customer can find something to enjoy. This thoughtful approach caters to the evolving preferences of the modern consumer and demonstrates CMS Food Court\'s commitment to inclusivity.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at CMS Food Court, shaping every aspect of the business from the welcoming ambiance to the efficient service. The food court boasts a clean and well-maintained dining area, creating a comfortable and relaxed setting for guests to enjoy their meals. A dedicated team of customer service personnel is on hand to assist with inquiries, manage seating arrangements, and ensure a seamless dining experience. Beyond the immediate service, CMS Food Court actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting local events, supporting community organizations, and participating in regional food festivals. By fostering a strong connection with the community, CMS Food Court establishes itself as more than just a place to eat; it becomes a social hub where people can connect, celebrate, and enjoy the vibrant culture of Assam. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and incorporated to continuously improve the quality of food and service, demonstrating a commitment to exceeding customer expectations. The food court also implements innovative ordering and payment systems to further enhance the customer experience, reducing wait times and making the entire process more convenient.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, CMS Food Court envisions itself as the leading food destination on Shillong Road and a recognized culinary landmark within the region. Strategic growth plans include expanding the vendor selection to further diversify the culinary offerings, potentially introducing international cuisines and specialty food concepts. There are also plans to enhance the physical space with improved seating arrangements, landscaping, and potentially even a dedicated children\'s play area to further cater to families. Furthermore, CMS Food Court recognizes the importance of leveraging technology to enhance its operations and customer engagement. This includes developing a mobile app for online ordering and loyalty programs, as well as utilizing social media platforms to promote vendors, announce special events, and engage with customers. The long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional food and service but also contributes to the economic and social well-being of the local community. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of its customers, CMS Food Court is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come.</p>', 'Shillong Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:50:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1730, 'ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN, situated on the 1st Floor of Hotel Palacio, above Poddar Car World on GS Road, represents a novel and exciting addition to the Assam\'s culinary and leisure scene. This establishment uniquely combines the craft brewery experience with a full-service kitchen, offering a multifaceted venue for locals and visitors alike. Positioned in a prominent location, ABACUS aims to become a preferred destination for those seeking quality handcrafted beverages, delectable cuisine, and a vibrant social atmosphere. The establishment is poised to contribute to the evolving landscape of Guwahati\'s hospitality sector by introducing a differentiated offering that appeals to a diverse clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of ABACUS lies its commitment to crafting distinctive and flavorful beers. The brewery component focuses on producing a range of handcrafted brews, from refreshing lagers and crisp pilsners to robust IPAs and rich stouts. Seasonal specialties and experimental batches are also anticipated to be part of the rotating tap list, ensuring a constantly evolving selection for beer enthusiasts. Alongside its brewery offerings, ABACUS boasts a full-service kitchen delivering a complementary menu that extends beyond typical pub fare. The kitchen focuses on creating a menu that uses locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, offering familiar flavors with a modern twist and dishes designed to pair expertly with the in-house brewed beers. This fusion of brewery and kitchen is designed to provide a holistic experience that caters to diverse preferences, setting ABACUS apart from standard standalone breweries or restaurants. It directly addresses the local market’s growing appetite for craft beverages and unique dining experiences, offering a convenient and engaging alternative within the city.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN is dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience that fosters loyalty and positive word-of-mouth. The service philosophy centers on creating a welcoming and attentive environment where guests feel valued and appreciated. Knowledgeable and friendly staff are trained to guide customers through the beer selection, offer food pairing suggestions, and cater to individual dietary needs and preferences. The ambiance of ABACUS is designed to be both modern and inviting, creating a space where people can relax, socialize, and enjoy the company of friends and family. Regular events such as live music performances, trivia nights, and brewery tours are planned to engage the local community and cultivate a sense of belonging. By actively participating in local initiatives and supporting community organizations, ABACUS aims to establish itself as a responsible and integral part of the greater Guwahati community. The establishment envisions itself as a social hub where individuals can gather, connect, and celebrate the vibrant culture of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, ABACUS BREWING CO. & KITCHEN has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on establishing a strong presence in the local market and building a loyal customer base. Plans include expanding the brewing capacity to meet increasing demand, introducing new and innovative beer styles, and continuously refining the food menu based on customer feedback and seasonal availability. Potential future avenues include exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations, expanding the retail offerings to include merchandise and packaged beers, and potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam or the Northeast region. The long-term vision for ABACUS is to become a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality handcrafted beverages, exceptional cuisine, and a commitment to community engagement. It aspires to play a significant role in shaping the evolving hospitality landscape of Assam and beyond, solidifying its position as a premier destination for locals and tourists alike. The business intends to adapt to the changes in the market, constantly innovating to provide superior products and customer service and aiming to be a trendsetter in the local brewing and food scene.\n</p>', '1st Floor, Hotel Palacio, GS Rd, above Poddar Car World', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:55:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1731, '188 Downtown', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>188 Downtown is a vibrant and innovative establishment poised to become a cornerstone of the business landscape in its Assam locale. More than just a business, 188 Downtown aims to be a central hub, fostering connections, providing exceptional services, and contributing meaningfully to the community\'s economic and social fabric. It distinguishes itself through a commitment to quality, a deep understanding of local needs, and a forward-thinking approach to business practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, 188 Downtown provides a range of services tailored to cater to the evolving demands of the local market. A key offering is its curated selection of artisanal goods sourced from regional producers. This showcases the rich talent and craftsmanship of Assam, providing a platform for local artisans to reach a wider audience. The business also features a contemporary cafe serving locally sourced teas, coffees, and light meals. This cafe provides a welcoming space for business meetings, casual gatherings, and individuals seeking a relaxed environment to work or socialize. Furthermore, 188 Downtown offers co-working spaces equipped with modern amenities, catering to freelancers, entrepreneurs, and small businesses seeking a collaborative and productive work environment. These spaces are designed to foster creativity and innovation, with flexible membership options to suit diverse needs.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The unique selling proposition of 188 Downtown lies in its seamless integration of retail, hospitality, and workspace solutions, all under one roof. This multifaceted approach creates a dynamic ecosystem that benefits both its customers and the local community. The focus on sourcing local products not only supports regional artisans but also ensures that customers have access to authentic and high-quality goods. The emphasis on creating a welcoming and productive atmosphere in the cafe and co-working spaces fosters a sense of community and collaboration. This holistic approach differentiates 188 Downtown from traditional retail outlets, cafes, or co-working spaces, positioning it as a unique and valuable asset to the local economy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at 188 Downtown. The business is committed to providing exceptional service characterized by warmth, attentiveness, and a genuine desire to meet customer needs. Staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the products and services offered, providing insightful recommendations and personalized assistance. 188 Downtown actively seeks feedback from customers to continuously improve its offerings and ensure that it remains responsive to their evolving needs. Regular community events, such as workshops, exhibitions, and networking sessions, are organized to foster connections and create a vibrant and inclusive atmosphere. By actively engaging with the local community, 188 Downtown aims to build strong relationships and become a trusted and valued member of the neighborhood.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, 188 Downtown envisions significant growth and expansion. Future plans include expanding its retail offerings to include a wider range of locally sourced products, potentially incorporating online sales channels to reach a broader customer base. The co-working spaces may be expanded to accommodate growing demand, with the addition of private offices and meeting rooms. There are also plans to partner with local educational institutions to offer workshops and training programs that support entrepreneurship and skill development within the community. Long-term goals include establishing 188 Downtown as a regional leader in providing innovative and sustainable business solutions, while remaining deeply committed to supporting the economic and social well-being of the local community. The business aspires to become a model for responsible and community-focused enterprise in Assam, inspiring other businesses to prioritize local partnerships and sustainable practices.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:55:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1732, 'Hari Mirch', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Hari Mirch stands as a vibrant and authentic culinary beacon in the heart of Assam, dedicated to bringing the bold and diverse flavors of the region to a wider audience. More than just a restaurant, Hari Mirch is a celebration of Assamese culture and cuisine, a place where tradition meets innovation, and every dish tells a story. Located at [Insert Location - if not available, omit this sentence and start with \"Hari Mirch is...\"], we strive to provide an unparalleled dining experience that honors local ingredients and culinary heritage. Hari Mirch understands the discerning palate of its local community and the increasing desire for genuine Assamese flavors amongst visitors, making it a unique and significant player in the local business landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Hari Mirch’s offerings lies a diverse menu showcasing the best of Assamese cuisine. Our signature dishes include fragrant rice plates served with flavorful curries made from locally sourced ingredients, such as the intensely flavored *masor tenga* (sour fish curry) and the comforting *aloo pitika* (mashed potatoes with mustard oil and onions). We also offer a selection of *khar* dishes, known for their unique alkaline taste, a staple of Assamese households. For those seeking a lighter option, our selection of Assamese snacks and *pitha* (traditional rice cakes) provides a glimpse into the region\'s rich culinary heritage. What sets Hari Mirch apart is its unwavering commitment to authenticity. We meticulously source our ingredients from local farmers and producers, ensuring the freshest and highest quality. Our chefs are masters of their craft, using traditional recipes passed down through generations while incorporating modern techniques to elevate the dining experience. Hari Mirch caters to the local market by offering familiar favorites prepared with utmost care and also introduces exciting new dishes that showcase the versatility of Assamese ingredients. The use of organic and sustainable practices further reinforces our commitment to the well-being of our community and the environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Hari Mirch believes that exceptional food is only part of the equation; outstanding customer service is equally paramount. We aim to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels like a part of the Hari Mirch family. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and passionate about Assamese cuisine, guiding customers through the diverse flavors and offering personalized recommendations. We actively seek feedback from our customers, continuously striving to improve our offerings and enhance the dining experience. Beyond providing excellent service within the restaurant, Hari Mirch is committed to connecting with the local community. We participate in local events, support local farmers and artisans, and host cultural programs that celebrate Assamese heritage. We also offer catering services for local gatherings and celebrations, bringing the flavors of Hari Mirch to homes and events throughout the region. By actively engaging with the community, Hari Mirch aims to be more than just a restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural hub and a source of local pride.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, Hari Mirch envisions becoming the leading ambassador of Assamese cuisine, both locally and beyond. We plan to expand our menu to include even more diverse and innovative dishes, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of the region. A key area of growth involves expanding our online presence and delivery services, allowing us to reach a wider audience and cater to the growing demand for convenient and authentic Assamese food. We also aim to establish partnerships with other local businesses and tourism operators to promote Assam as a culinary destination. Furthermore, Hari Mirch is committed to sustainable practices and plans to implement initiatives to reduce our environmental impact and support local farming communities. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to create a lasting legacy by preserving and promoting Assamese cuisine, ensuring that it continues to thrive for generations to come. Hari Mirch strives to be a model of success, demonstrating that businesses can be both profitable and socially responsible, contributing to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:55:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1733, 'PEPA - The Ethnic Kitchen', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>PEPA - The Ethnic Kitchen is more than just a restaurant; it\'s an immersive culinary journey into the heart of Assam\'s diverse ethnic communities. Located in [Insert Actual Location - if not known, write: a vibrant and accessible location in the city], PEPA offers a unique dining experience that celebrates the region\'s rich gastronomic heritage. In a local business landscape often dominated by generic culinary offerings, PEPA stands out by providing authentic, home-style meals prepared with traditional recipes and locally sourced ingredients. We are committed to preserving and promoting the unique flavours and culinary traditions of Assam’s various tribes and communities, offering a truly distinctive alternative to mainstream dining.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing an authentic taste of Assam. We specialize in dishes representing a variety of ethnic groups, going beyond the standard Assamese fare to showcase the lesser-known culinary gems of communities like the Bodo, Mising, Karbi, and Dimasa people. Our menu features dishes rarely found in commercial establishments, prepared with traditional techniques and ingredients. This includes smoked meats, fermented delicacies, an array of locally sourced vegetables, and unique preparations of fish and poultry. We offer a range of services, including dine-in, takeaway, and catering for small to medium-sized events. A key unique selling point is our commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers and ensuring the authenticity of our dishes. We also cater to dietary needs and preferences, offering vegetarian and vegan options rooted in the region\'s diverse culinary landscape. Our offerings directly address the need for authentic ethnic cuisine in the local market, satisfying the growing demand for unique and culturally significant dining experiences. We aim to provide a platform for experiencing the diverse food of Assam, catering both to locals seeking a taste of home and tourists eager to explore the region\'s culinary heritage.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At PEPA, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere, reminiscent of a traditional Assamese home. Our staff are trained not just to serve, but to engage with customers, sharing stories and insights about the dishes and the communities they represent. We encourage interaction and are always happy to explain the origins and preparation methods of our food. What sets us apart is our genuine commitment to hospitality and cultural exchange. We believe in creating a space where people can not only enjoy delicious food but also learn about and appreciate the cultural diversity of Assam. We actively connect with the local community through collaborations with local farmers, artisans, and cultural organizations. We host occasional cultural events and workshops to further promote the region\'s heritage. By providing personalized service, creating a welcoming atmosphere, and fostering community engagement, PEPA aims to build lasting relationships with its customers and become a cherished part of the local community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for PEPA - The Ethnic Kitchen is ambitious and rooted in sustainable growth. We aim to expand our menu to represent even more of Assam\'s diverse ethnic communities, becoming the go-to destination for experiencing the region\'s complete culinary landscape. We plan to introduce educational initiatives, such as cooking classes and cultural workshops, to further promote the understanding and appreciation of Assam\'s culinary heritage. We are also exploring the possibility of establishing partnerships with local tourism operators to offer culinary tours and experiences. In the long term, we envision expanding our operations to other locations, both within Assam and potentially beyond, to share the unique flavors of the region with a wider audience. We are committed to maintaining our focus on sustainability, ethical sourcing, and community engagement as we grow. Our ultimate goal is to become a recognized and respected ambassador for Assam\'s culinary heritage, contributing to the preservation and promotion of the region\'s rich cultural diversity and fostering a deeper understanding and appreciation of its unique identity through the universal language of food.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:55:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1734, 'Vatika - The Kitchen Garden', 'Restaurants', '', '<p><b>Vatika - The Kitchen Garden: Cultivating Flavors, Nurturing Community</b></p>\n\n<p>Vatika - The Kitchen Garden is a unique culinary venture nestled in the heart of [Insert locality within Assam]. More than just a restaurant, Vatika is a celebration of Assam\'s rich agricultural heritage, offering a farm-to-table dining experience that connects diners directly with the source of their food. In a region known for its vibrant culinary traditions and abundance of fresh produce, Vatika stands out by prioritizing sustainability, local sourcing, and innovative interpretations of traditional Assamese cuisine. The business seeks to contribute to the local economy by partnering with regional farmers and artisans, fostering a vibrant food ecosystem within Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Vatika offers a range of services centered around providing a fresh, authentic, and sustainable dining experience. At its core, Vatika operates as a restaurant, serving breakfast, lunch, and dinner. The menu is carefully curated to showcase the best of Assamese ingredients, with a strong emphasis on seasonal availability. From aromatic curries infused with local herbs and spices to innovative salads featuring freshly harvested vegetables, each dish tells a story of the region\'s culinary landscape. A key distinguishing feature is the on-site kitchen garden, where many of the restaurant\'s herbs, vegetables, and fruits are grown. This not only ensures freshness but also allows guests to witness the journey of their food from garden to plate. Beyond the restaurant, Vatika also offers catering services for private events and gatherings. These services extend the restaurant\'s commitment to quality and sustainability, bringing the flavors of the kitchen garden to a wider audience. Furthermore, Vatika hosts cooking classes and workshops, providing opportunities for locals and tourists alike to learn about Assamese cuisine and sustainable cooking practices.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Vatika addresses critical needs in the local market. There\'s an increasing demand for healthy, locally sourced food. Vatika directly responds to this by offering a transparent and traceable food supply chain. The focus on traditional Assamese cuisine also caters to a growing desire among locals to reconnect with their culinary heritage. For tourists, Vatika provides an authentic and immersive cultural experience, allowing them to savor the true flavors of Assam while supporting local farmers and businesses. The workshops and cooking classes further enhance the customer experience, providing valuable skills and knowledge while promoting culinary tourism in the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Vatika, customer experience is paramount. The staff is dedicated to providing warm, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The restaurant\'s ambiance is designed to be relaxing and inviting, with a rustic charm that reflects the region\'s natural beauty. Regular feedback is actively solicited from customers to continuously improve the dining experience. What truly sets Vatika apart is its strong connection to the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events, supports community initiatives, and partners with local schools to educate children about sustainable agriculture and healthy eating habits. This deep engagement fosters a sense of community ownership and strengthens Vatika\'s reputation as a responsible and ethical business.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Vatika envisions significant growth potential. A key focus will be expanding the on-site kitchen garden to increase self-sufficiency and further reduce its environmental footprint. There are plans to introduce a line of locally produced food products, such as pickles, jams, and spices, allowing customers to take a taste of Vatika home with them. Strategic partnerships with hotels and tour operators will be explored to attract a wider range of tourists and showcase Assamese cuisine on a larger scale. Long-term goals include establishing a training program for aspiring chefs and farmers, contributing to the development of a skilled workforce in the region. The ultimate vision is for Vatika to become a leading example of sustainable and community-focused business, inspiring others to embrace local sourcing and promote the rich culinary heritage of Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 15:55:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1735, 'Kasturi Restaurant (Dhakai Bengali Cuisine)', 'Restaurants', '', 'Kasturi Restaurant (Dhakai Bengali Cuisine) is a vibrant culinary destination nestled in a bright, modern space, offering a genuine taste of Dhaka\'s rich and diverse Bengali culinary heritage. Situated in the heart of Assam, Kasturi distinguishes itself by presenting authentic Dhakai cuisine, a culinary tradition relatively unexplored in the region. More than just a restaurant, Kasturi is a cultural ambassador, introducing Assam to the nuanced flavors and intricate spice blends that define the culinary landscape of Dhaka. The restaurant fills a significant gap in the local dining scene, catering to a growing demand for diverse and authentic international cuisines while providing a comforting and familiar taste for those already acquainted with Bengali food. This makes it a unique and valuable addition to Assam\'s business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nKasturi Restaurant specializes in providing an exceptional Dhakai Bengali dining experience. Our core offerings revolve around a meticulously curated menu showcasing iconic dishes such as Morog Polao, a fragrant and flavorful chicken biryani; Kachchi Biryani, a layered meat and rice dish slow-cooked to perfection; and various Bhortas (mashed vegetables) prepared with traditional Dhakai recipes. We also offer a wide selection of freshly caught fish preparations, reflecting Dhaka\'s proximity to major river systems and their influence on local cuisine. What truly sets Kasturi apart is our commitment to using authentic ingredients and traditional cooking techniques passed down through generations. This ensures that each dish delivers an unparalleled taste of Dhaka, creating a truly memorable culinary journey. By offering these specialties, Kasturi effectively caters to the local market\'s desire for novel and authentic dining experiences, distinguishing itself from other restaurants in the area. Our selection of desserts such as Rosogolla and Mishti Doi complement the meal and create an experience that is truly Bangladeshi.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Kasturi, we believe that exceptional food deserves exceptional service. Our approach to customer service is rooted in creating a warm, welcoming, and attentive environment for every guest. Our staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, providing detailed explanations of each dish and offering personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. Beyond providing attentive service, Kasturi actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting cultural events showcasing Dhakai music and art, partnering with local organizations to support community initiatives, and sourcing ingredients from local farmers and suppliers whenever possible. These efforts help us build strong relationships with our neighbors and foster a sense of community around the restaurant, making Kasturi a beloved gathering place for food enthusiasts and those seeking a taste of home. We also strive to make the experience accessible to everyone by offering a variety of pricing options and catering to dietary restrictions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Kasturi Restaurant envisions becoming the premier destination for Dhakai Bengali cuisine in Assam and beyond. Our future plans include expanding our menu to showcase a wider range of regional specialties, offering cooking classes to share the secrets of Dhakai cuisine with the community, and potentially opening additional locations to reach a broader audience. We also aim to enhance our online presence through online ordering and delivery services, making it even easier for customers to enjoy our food from the comfort of their own homes. Long-term, Kasturi aims to become a recognized and respected culinary institution, contributing to the cultural richness of Assam while providing a sustainable and rewarding business for its employees and investors. We are committed to maintaining the highest standards of quality and authenticity, ensuring that Kasturi remains a beacon of Dhakai Bengali cuisine for generations to come. We believe that our focus on authentic flavors, exceptional service, and community engagement will be the key to our continued success and growth.', 'Bright, modern space for classic meals', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:00:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1736, 'Brewbakes', 'Restaurants', '', '<p>Brewbakes, a vibrant café and bakery nestled in the heart of Digen, Bora Complex, GS Rd, offers a unique blend of artisanal baked goods and expertly crafted beverages, quickly becoming a cherished community hub in Guwahati’s bustling landscape. More than just a place to grab a quick bite or a caffeine fix, Brewbakes represents a commitment to quality ingredients, skilled craftsmanship, and a welcoming atmosphere that resonates with the local Assamese culture and its diverse palates. In a market often dominated by national chains, Brewbakes distinguishes itself by prioritizing local sourcing, supporting regional farmers and producers, and infusing traditional flavors into contemporary offerings.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Brewbakes lies its dedication to delivering exceptional baked goods and beverages. The café\'s signature offerings include a diverse selection of handcrafted cakes, pastries, and breads, each made fresh daily using premium ingredients. Customers can indulge in classic favorites like chocolate cake and croissants, as well as discover unique creations incorporating local ingredients like *pitha*, *laru*, and indigenous fruits. Alongside the baked goods, Brewbakes boasts a carefully curated beverage menu featuring specialty coffee sourced from regional estates, a variety of teas, refreshing fruit juices, and innovative blended drinks. A major selling point is the emphasis on customization; customers can tailor their orders to their preferences, whether it’s adjusting the sweetness level of a pastry or requesting a specific coffee roast. This adaptability directly addresses the preferences of the local market, which values both quality and personalized service. The menu also features lighter fare such as sandwiches and salads, perfect for a quick lunch or a light snack, catering to the on-the-go lifestyle of many in the area.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Brewbakes is built upon a foundation of exceptional customer service and community engagement. The staff is trained not only to prepare and serve high-quality products but also to create a warm and welcoming environment for every guest. Attentive service, personalized recommendations, and a genuine interest in customer satisfaction are key to the Brewbakes experience. The café regularly hosts events and promotions that celebrate local culture and foster community spirit. This might include live music performances by local artists, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, or themed baking workshops that teach participants how to create traditional Assamese sweets. By actively participating in the local community, Brewbakes aims to become more than just a business; it strives to be a gathering place where people can connect, celebrate, and share experiences. Furthermore, Brewbakes actively engages with its customer base through social media, responding to feedback, sharing updates, and promoting upcoming events, fostering a strong sense of loyalty and connection.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, Brewbakes envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati region and beyond. The long-term goals include establishing additional locations, each maintaining the same commitment to quality, community, and customer service that defines the original café. There are plans to expand the product line to include a wider range of artisanal goods, such as homemade jams, chutneys, and packaged snacks, showcasing the diverse flavors of Assam. Brewbakes is also exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to promote regional products and tourism. This collaborative approach aims to contribute to the overall economic development of the area. In addition, Brewbakes recognizes the importance of sustainability and is committed to implementing eco-friendly practices throughout its operations, from sourcing ethically produced ingredients to reducing waste and promoting responsible consumption. Ultimately, the vision for Brewbakes is to become a leading brand in the region, known not only for its exceptional products but also for its positive impact on the community and the environment.</p>', 'Digen, Bora Complex, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:00:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
