(1747, 'Cafe Shillong, Guwahati', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Cafe Shillong, Guwahati, nestled at 45/46, RG Baruah Rd, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a cultural bridge, a culinary experience, and a community hub. In the vibrant and diverse city of Guwahati, Cafe Shillong stands out as a unique establishment that blends the distinct flavors and cultural ethos of Shillong, the capital of Meghalaya, with the dynamic spirit of Assam. It addresses a significant gap in the local market by offering a taste of Northeast India\'s diverse culinary heritage within a comfortable and contemporary setting. Its significance lies in its ability to provide a unique experience that caters to both local residents and tourists seeking an authentic and memorable taste of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Cafe Shillong’s core offerings revolve around providing a diverse menu that celebrates the culinary traditions of the Northeast. From signature Khasi dishes like Jadoh (a flavorful rice preparation cooked with pork blood and spices) to popular Naga dishes featuring bamboo shoot and fermented beans, the menu is a carefully curated selection of regional specialties. Beyond the authentic Northeastern fare, the cafe also serves a range of continental dishes, snacks, and beverages, ensuring that there\'s something to satisfy every palate. A key unique selling point is the commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers and producers but also ensures the highest quality and authenticity of the dishes. Furthermore, the cafe frequently hosts live music performances featuring local artists, adding to the vibrant and immersive cultural experience it offers. This integrated approach – authentic cuisine, local ingredients, and live music – sets Cafe Shillong apart from other establishments in the city and directly caters to the growing demand for experiential dining and cultural immersion.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Cafe Shillong\'s operational philosophy. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, providing detailed descriptions and recommendations to guide customers through the diverse offerings. Beyond attentive service, the cafe cultivates a warm and inviting atmosphere, creating a space where customers feel comfortable and welcomed. Regular feedback is actively solicited and incorporated to continually improve the menu and service standards. Cafe Shillong actively connects with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring community initiatives, and collaborating with local artists and artisans. The cafe also hosts special events, such as food festivals and cultural showcases, to promote Northeastern culture and heritage. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and strengthens the cafe\'s relationship with its patrons, transforming it into more than just a place to eat; it becomes a gathering place for friends, families, and community members.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Cafe Shillong, Guwahati, involves strategic expansion and continued innovation. While maintaining its core values of authenticity and community engagement, the business aims to explore opportunities for growth, potentially including opening additional locations within Guwahati and other parts of Assam. A key area of focus is strengthening partnerships with local producers to further enhance the use of locally sourced ingredients and support sustainable agricultural practices. Another area of development involves expanding the menu to include even more diverse and lesser-known dishes from different Northeastern tribes, further solidifying its position as a culinary ambassador for the region. The long-term goal is to establish Cafe Shillong as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with authentic Northeastern cuisine, cultural preservation, and community empowerment. This includes actively promoting tourism to the Northeast by showcasing its rich cultural heritage and culinary delights to a wider audience. Through careful planning, consistent execution, and a strong commitment to its core values, Cafe Shillong is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come, solidifying its place as a vital part of Guwahati\'s vibrant business landscape.</p>', '45/46, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:10:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1748, 'The HideOut Café', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The HideOut Café, nestled on VIP Road opposite the Arizona Sports Arena, offers a refreshing escape and a vibrant hub for the community in Assam. More than just a café, The HideOut is envisioned as a welcoming space where individuals can connect, unwind, and indulge in quality refreshments within a relaxed and contemporary setting. In a region known for its rich tea culture and burgeoning café scene, The HideOut distinguishes itself through its curated menu, emphasis on locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, and commitment to creating a unique and memorable customer experience. It serves as a dynamic addition to the local business landscape, catering to a diverse clientele from sports enthusiasts visiting the arena to residents seeking a comfortable and accessible social spot. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, The HideOut Café provides a diverse menu of beverages and light fare. We specialize in handcrafted coffee drinks, utilizing premium Arabica beans roasted to perfection, offering everything from classic espressos and lattes to innovative signature blends infused with local flavors. Beyond coffee, our menu features a selection of refreshing teas, including traditional Assam varieties, along with a range of fruit juices, smoothies, and mocktails. Complementing our beverages is a curated selection of light meals, including sandwiches, wraps, salads, and pastries. A distinctive feature is the inclusion of Assamese-inspired snacks and small plates, showcasing the region\'s culinary heritage and offering a unique taste experience not commonly found in other cafes. We prioritize sourcing ingredients from local farms and producers whenever feasible, supporting the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of our offerings. This commitment to local sourcing distinguishes The HideOut and resonates strongly with customers seeking authentic and sustainable dining options. By offering high-quality beverages and food in a comfortable setting, The HideOut caters to the growing demand for accessible, convenient, and enjoyable dining experiences within the community. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The customer experience at The HideOut Café is paramount, built around creating a welcoming and personalized atmosphere. Our staff are trained to provide attentive and friendly service, ensuring that each customer feels valued and comfortable. The café\'s ambiance is carefully designed to be both stylish and relaxing, with comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and complimentary Wi-Fi, making it an ideal spot for work, leisure, or social gatherings. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artists\' exhibitions, organizing live music performances, and partnering with local businesses for promotional events. Our aim is to be more than just a café; we aspire to be a community hub where people can connect, share ideas, and support local talent. We also actively solicit customer feedback through surveys and online platforms, constantly striving to improve our offerings and tailor our services to meet the evolving needs of our clientele. By fostering a strong sense of community and prioritizing customer satisfaction, The HideOut aims to cultivate lasting relationships with our customers and become a beloved institution within the neighborhood. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, The HideOut Café envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include establishing a loyal customer base, expanding our menu offerings to include more diverse and seasonal items, and potentially opening additional locations within the region. We are exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to further enhance our community involvement and expand our reach. We also aim to develop a strong online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, making it easier for customers to access our products and services. We recognize the growing demand for sustainable and ethically sourced food and beverages, and we are committed to further strengthening our sourcing practices and minimizing our environmental impact. In addition to physical expansion, we are also considering offering catering services for local events and businesses, further diversifying our revenue streams. By remaining adaptable, innovative, and committed to our core values of quality, community, and customer satisfaction, The HideOut Café is poised to become a leading destination for coffee and community engagement in Assam, contributing to the vibrant and evolving business landscape of the region.\n</p>', 'VIP Rd, opp. to Arizona Sports Arena', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:10:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1749, 'Mama Yumm Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Mama Yumm Cafe: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Located at Aditya Tower, GS Road, next to the prestigious Novotel Hotel, Mama Yumm Cafe offers a refreshing and inviting dining experience that distinguishes itself within Guwahati\'s burgeoning cafe scene. More than just a place to grab a quick bite, Mama Yumm Cafe strives to be a community hub, a comforting haven for both locals and travelers seeking quality food, exceptional service, and a genuinely welcoming atmosphere. We contribute to the vibrant tapestry of Assam\'s culinary landscape by offering a unique blend of familiar favorites and innovative creations, catering to diverse palates and preferences.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Mama Yumm Cafe lies our commitment to providing exceptional food and beverages crafted with fresh, high-quality ingredients. Our core offerings encompass a diverse menu that spans breakfast, lunch, and dinner, as well as a curated selection of specialty coffees, teas, and refreshing beverages. For breakfast, patrons can choose from classic options such as omelets and pancakes to regionally inspired dishes featuring local ingredients and flavors. Lunch and dinner menus showcase a mix of continental and Indian cuisine, with pasta dishes, sandwiches, burgers, and flavorful curries prepared with authentic spices and techniques. Vegetarian and vegan options are readily available, ensuring that dietary needs are thoughtfully catered to.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What truly sets Mama Yumm Cafe apart is our unwavering dedication to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We collaborate with nearby farms and suppliers to ensure the freshness and quality of our produce, while also supporting local businesses and reducing our environmental footprint. Our beverage selection is equally impressive, featuring handcrafted coffee drinks prepared with carefully selected beans, a variety of aromatic teas, and refreshing fruit juices made with seasonal produce. The presentation of each dish and drink is meticulously considered, enhancing the overall dining experience and creating visually appealing offerings that are as delicious as they are beautiful.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer service is paramount at Mama Yumm Cafe. We believe that creating a positive and memorable experience for every guest is essential to our success. Our team members are carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, attentive, and efficient service. From the moment a guest enters our cafe, they are greeted with a warm smile and made to feel welcome. We strive to anticipate their needs, offer helpful recommendations, and ensure their complete satisfaction. We also actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond providing exceptional food and service, Mama Yumm Cafe actively seeks to connect with the local community. We host regular events, such as live music performances, art exhibitions, and workshops, to create a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We also partner with local organizations and charities to support community initiatives and give back to the area that has so warmly embraced us. By fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of our community, we aim to be more than just a cafe – we strive to be a cherished gathering place for all.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Mama Yumm Cafe envisions significant growth potential. We plan to expand our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes that reflect the evolving tastes of our customers. We are also exploring opportunities to open additional locations throughout Guwahati and beyond, bringing our unique brand of hospitality to a wider audience. We are committed to investing in our staff, providing them with ongoing training and development opportunities to enhance their skills and advance their careers. Furthermore, we are dedicated to sustainability and reducing our environmental impact through responsible sourcing practices and waste reduction initiatives.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our long-term goal is to establish Mama Yumm Cafe as a leading cafe brand in Assam, known for its exceptional food, outstanding service, and strong community engagement. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously striving for improvement, we can achieve this vision and create a lasting positive impact on the local culinary landscape and the communities we serve. Mama Yumm Cafe is more than just a place to eat; it\'s a place to connect, relax, and savor the simple pleasures of life.</p>', 'Aditya Tower, GS Rd, next to Novotel Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:10:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1750, 'Olmak', 'Cafes', '', 'Olmak, situated at House no 6, opposite Prabash Atithi Griha, Basisthapur, Bye Ln 2, is emerging as a distinctive entity in the Assam business landscape, dedicated to providing tailored solutions that resonate with the unique needs of the local community. Olmak operates with a commitment to quality, innovation, and a deep understanding of the cultural and economic nuances of the region, setting it apart from conventional business models. Olmak aims not just to serve the market but to actively contribute to its growth and prosperity, fostering lasting relationships built on trust and mutual respect. The business distinguishes itself through its customer-centric approach, prioritizing personalized service and building strong community bonds.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Olmak offers a carefully curated range of services and products designed to address specific gaps in the local market. Currently, Olmak focuses on providing [Insert specific services/products. Examples: artisanal crafts, catering services specializing in Assamese cuisine, educational workshops focused on local arts, sustainable agricultural products, etc.]. The offerings stand out due to their commitment to [Mention specifics – e.g., using locally sourced materials, employing traditional techniques, promoting eco-friendly practices, offering personalized consultations, etc.]. For instance, if Olmak offers artisanal crafts, the unique selling point could be the preservation of traditional weaving techniques passed down through generations, with each product telling a story of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage. Alternatively, if Olmak focuses on catering, its USP might be the use of authentic, locally sourced ingredients to create innovative and traditional Assamese dishes, offering a culinary experience that is both unique and deeply rooted in the region\'s gastronomic identity. These services directly address the market\'s demand for [Mention the need the service fulfills – e.g., authentic cultural experiences, high-quality local products, personalized services, etc.], filling a niche often overlooked by larger, more generalized businesses.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Olmak. The business operates on the principle that every interaction is an opportunity to build a lasting relationship. The approach to customer service is characterized by [Describe the customer service approach – e.g., personalized attention, proactive communication, flexible solutions, etc.]. Staff are not just employees; they are knowledgeable and passionate representatives of the business, dedicated to understanding and meeting the individual needs of each customer. Olmak actively seeks feedback to continuously improve its offerings and ensure customer satisfaction. Moreover, Olmak aims to connect with the local community by [Mention community engagement activities – e.g., participating in local events, sponsoring local initiatives, partnering with local artisans, etc.]. This active involvement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens Olmak\'s ties to the community, solidifying its position as a trusted and valued local business. By understanding and responding to the unique cultural context of Basisthapur and the surrounding areas, Olmak fosters a welcoming and inclusive environment for its customers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Olmak envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. The long-term goals of the business include [Mention specific future goals – e.g., expanding product lines, opening new locations, developing online presence, forming strategic partnerships, etc.]. The plan for the future involves [Describe the growth strategy – e.g., increasing production capacity, diversifying product offerings, expanding marketing efforts, etc.]. Olmak is committed to exploring opportunities to [Mention specific initiatives – e.g., integrate technology to enhance customer experience, implement sustainable business practices, create employment opportunities for local residents, etc.]. By staying attuned to the evolving needs of the market and embracing innovation, Olmak aims to solidify its position as a leading business in the region and contribute to the overall economic development of Assam. The business also plans to explore collaborative ventures with other local businesses, further strengthening the regional economy and promoting a spirit of shared success. In essence, Olmak aspires to become a cornerstone of the Basisthapur community, recognized not only for its quality products and services but also for its unwavering commitment to social responsibility and sustainable growth.', 'House no 6, opposite to Prabash Atithi Griha, Basisthapur, Bye Ln 2', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:15:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1751, '11th Avenue Café Bistro', 'Cafes', '', '11th Avenue Café Bistro: A Culinary Oasis in Jayanagar\n\nNestled at House No. 20, Jayanagar Road, 11th Avenue Café Bistro is rapidly establishing itself as a premier dining destination in Assam, offering a unique blend of café culture and bistro elegance. More than just a place to grab a quick bite, it aims to be a community hub, a space where residents and visitors alike can gather, relax, and savor expertly crafted food and beverages in a warm and inviting atmosphere. Located in a vibrant residential area, it differentiates itself from generic eateries by providing a curated experience, focusing on quality ingredients, exceptional service, and a thoughtfully designed ambiance.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of 11th Avenue Café Bistro lies a dedication to providing exceptional culinary experiences. The core offerings encompass a diverse menu catering to a wide range of palates. From artisanal coffee sourced from local Assam estates and expertly brewed espresso drinks, to a selection of globally-inspired bistro fare, the café strives to offer something for everyone. The menu includes freshly baked pastries and breads prepared daily, light and flavorful salads incorporating locally sourced vegetables, hearty sandwiches and wraps perfect for lunch, and more substantial dinner entrees showcasing regional and international flavors. A unique selling point is the emphasis on incorporating Assam\'s rich culinary heritage into innovative dishes, offering familiar flavors with a modern twist. For example, one might find a traditional *masor tenga* reimagined as a refined soup or a creative interpretation of *aloo pitika* served as a gourmet side dish. This commitment to local ingredients and culinary traditions resonates deeply within the community and helps to meet a growing demand for authentic and high-quality dining options that celebrate the region’s unique gastronomic identity.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at 11th Avenue Café Bistro is paramount. Staff are trained to provide friendly, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. The ambiance is carefully curated to create a relaxing and inviting atmosphere, featuring comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and soft lighting. The bistro often hosts local musicians and artists, adding to the vibrant and engaging atmosphere and providing a platform for regional talent. Building strong connections with the local community is a central tenet of the business philosophy. 11th Avenue actively participates in local events, partners with nearby businesses, and offers special promotions and discounts to neighborhood residents. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of loyalty and belonging, making the café a truly integral part of the Jayanagar landscape. Free Wi-Fi is also offered, catering to the needs of remote workers and students. The Bistro actively seeks customer feedback and uses it to continuously improve its offerings and services, demonstrating a genuine commitment to exceeding expectations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, 11th Avenue Café Bistro envisions significant growth potential. Plans are underway to expand the menu, incorporating seasonal dishes and new culinary trends while remaining true to its core values. Exploring partnerships with local farmers and producers to source even more ingredients directly from the region is also a priority. Another key focus is expanding the café\'s reach through online ordering and delivery services, allowing customers to enjoy their favorite dishes from the comfort of their own homes. Long-term goals include establishing a catering service for local events and corporate gatherings, further solidifying the business\'s presence within the community. Expansion to other locations within Assam is also a possibility, bringing the unique 11th Avenue Café Bistro experience to a wider audience while upholding the standards of quality and service that have become synonymous with the brand. The overarching vision is to become a recognized and respected culinary institution in Assam, celebrated for its commitment to quality, community, and innovation.', 'House no 20, Jayanagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:15:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1752, 'Café 7', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Café 7: A Contemporary Coffeehouse Experience on Maya Path</p>\n\n<p>Nestled on the vibrant Maya Path 1A, Café 7 is more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a community hub, a haven for relaxation, and a destination for discerning palates seeking a refined coffee and culinary experience. Café 7 distinguishes itself within the Assam business landscape by offering a carefully curated menu blending international coffee traditions with locally sourced ingredients and flavors. Its modern aesthetic, combined with genuine Assamese hospitality, creates a unique and welcoming atmosphere rarely found elsewhere. The café aims to be a vital part of the local community, providing a space for social interaction, productivity, and a moment of respite from the everyday bustle.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Café 7’s offering is its dedication to superior coffee. We source high-quality Arabica beans, roasted to perfection to highlight their unique flavor profiles. Our skilled baristas craft a range of espresso-based beverages, from classic cappuccinos and lattes to signature creations tailored to local tastes. Beyond coffee, Café 7 offers a diverse menu that includes freshly baked pastries, savory sandwiches, and light meals. Unique selling points include our use of locally sourced Assam tea in innovative tea-based cocktails and desserts, and our commitment to supporting local farmers and producers by incorporating their ingredients into our daily specials. These offerings directly address the local market\'s desire for fresh, high-quality ingredients and a sophisticated dining experience that celebrates Assamese culinary traditions.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Café 7. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming environment where every customer feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained not only in coffee preparation but also in providing exceptional customer service, anticipating needs, and ensuring a memorable visit. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively participate in local events, host community gatherings, and partner with local artists to showcase their work. We strive to create a space that fosters a sense of belonging and pride, solidifying Café 7 as more than just a business, but a valued member of the Maya Path neighborhood.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The vision for Café 7 extends beyond its current success. We aim to become a recognized brand synonymous with quality, community, and innovation in the Assam coffee scene. Future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional delicacies, introducing workshops and events focused on coffee appreciation and brewing techniques, and exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses to create collaborative offerings. We also envision expanding our retail offerings to include locally roasted coffee beans, artisanal teas, and handcrafted gifts, further supporting local artisans and promoting the region\'s rich cultural heritage. Our long-term goals include opening additional locations within Assam, replicating our model of quality, community engagement, and sustainable business practices, thereby contributing to the economic growth and cultural vibrancy of the region. We are committed to constantly evolving and adapting to meet the changing needs of our customers and the local community, ensuring that Café 7 remains a beloved and integral part of the Maya Path landscape for years to come.</p>', 'Maya Path 1A', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:15:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1753, 'D\' BACKYARD TREE CAFÉ RESTRO', 'Cafes', '', '```html\n<h1>D\' BACKYARD TREE CAFÉ RESTRO: A Tranquil Oasis in Jayanagar</h1>\n\n<p>D\' BACKYARD TREE CAFÉ RESTRO, situated at 176, Jayanagar Rd, opposite the BPCL Petrol Pump, is more than just a café; it’s a carefully curated experience designed to offer respite and refreshment amidst the bustling urban landscape of Assam. We’ve established ourselves as a unique dining destination, blending the charm of a rustic outdoor setting with the comforts of a modern restaurant, creating a haven for locals and visitors alike. Our location provides easy access, making us a convenient spot for quick lunches, relaxed dinners, and everything in between. The essence of D\' BACKYARD lies in its ability to offer a momentary escape, connecting patrons with nature while delivering exceptional food and service, contributing significantly to the vibrant culinary scene of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Culinary Delights and Refreshing Beverages</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of D\' BACKYARD TREE CAFÉ RESTRO lies a diverse menu catering to a wide range of tastes. Our primary offering revolves around a selection of freshly prepared dishes, ranging from traditional Assamese delicacies to popular continental favorites. We are committed to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers and producers. This commitment not only guarantees the quality of our food but also allows us to showcase the rich agricultural heritage of the region. Alongside our food menu, we offer an extensive beverage selection, including expertly brewed coffee, refreshing teas, innovative mocktails, and a curated list of other drinks designed to complement your meal and enhance your overall experience. What truly sets us apart is our dedication to creating unique flavor profiles and presentation, transforming familiar dishes into culinary masterpieces. We also prioritize offering vegetarian and vegan options, ensuring that everyone can find something to enjoy within our menu.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Unforgettable Customer Experience: Connecting with the Community</h2>\n\n<p>We believe that exceptional customer service is the cornerstone of our success. From the moment you step into D\' BACKYARD TREE CAFÉ RESTRO, our friendly and attentive staff is dedicated to ensuring your comfort and satisfaction. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels valued and appreciated. Our commitment extends beyond simply serving food and drinks; we aim to build meaningful connections with our customers and become an integral part of the local community. We regularly host events, such as live music performances and art exhibitions, to foster a sense of community and provide a platform for local talent. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings. Our focus on creating a personalized and memorable experience distinguishes us from other establishments, fostering customer loyalty and word-of-mouth referrals.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Vision for Growth and Expansion</h2>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, D\' BACKYARD TREE CAFÉ RESTRO has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. We envision ourselves as a leading destination for exceptional dining and community engagement in the region. Our immediate plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and introducing seasonal offerings to showcase the freshest local ingredients. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical space, creating more comfortable seating options and enhancing the overall ambiance of our establishment. Beyond our immediate goals, we aspire to establish D\' BACKYARD TREE CAFÉ RESTRO as a recognized brand, known for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. We are actively exploring partnerships with local organizations and businesses to further contribute to the economic and social development of the region. Our long-term vision is to create a lasting legacy, building a sustainable business that benefits both our customers and the community we serve.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>D\' BACKYARD TREE CAFÉ RESTRO isn\'t just a place to eat; it\'s a destination. We invite you to visit us at 176, Jayanagar Rd, opposite the BPCL Petrol Pump, and experience the difference.</p>\n```', '176, Jayanagar Rd, opposite BPCL Petrol Pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:15:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1754, 'Mocha Cafe & Bar', 'Cafes', '', 'Mocha Cafe & Bar: A Culinary Oasis on GS Road\n\nNestled in the heart of Guwahati at 2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd, Mocha Cafe & Bar is more than just a place to grab a coffee or a cocktail; it\'s a destination, a social hub, and a welcome addition to the vibrant Assam business landscape. We strive to offer a unique blend of sophisticated cafe culture and relaxed bar atmosphere, creating a welcoming space for a diverse clientele. Our commitment to quality ingredients, expertly crafted beverages, and exceptional customer service sets us apart and positions us as a premier establishment in the local hospitality sector. We aim to be a mainstay for locals and a memorable experience for visitors, contributing to the city\'s growing reputation as a culinary destination.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Mocha Cafe & Bar, our core offerings revolve around providing high-quality beverages and delicious food in a comfortable and inviting setting. Our cafe menu features a wide selection of specialty coffees, expertly prepared by trained baristas. We use ethically sourced beans and offer various brewing methods, from classic espresso to pour-over techniques, catering to the discerning coffee lover. Beyond coffee, we offer an array of teas, both traditional and innovative, alongside refreshing juices, smoothies, and handcrafted sodas.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur bar menu complements our cafe offerings, featuring a carefully curated selection of wines, beers, and spirits. Our skilled bartenders craft classic cocktails with a modern twist, using fresh ingredients and premium liquors. We also offer a selection of mocktails for those seeking non-alcoholic options. To accompany our beverages, we offer a diverse food menu, including breakfast pastries, light lunches, and shareable appetizers. From artisanal sandwiches and salads to flavorful tapas and delectable desserts, our menu caters to various tastes and appetites. A unique selling point is our commitment to sourcing local ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and showcasing the flavors of Assam. This allows us to offer fresh, seasonal dishes that reflect the region\'s culinary heritage. Our offerings directly address the local market\'s desire for high-quality, diverse food and beverage options in a relaxed and stylish environment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Mocha Cafe & Bar. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere where everyone feels comfortable and valued. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, providing personalized service to each guest. We strive to anticipate our customers\' needs and exceed their expectations, ensuring they have a memorable experience. Our commitment to creating a strong connection with the local community is paramount. We actively participate in local events, partner with local businesses, and support local charities. We also host regular events at the cafe and bar, such as live music performances, art exhibitions, and themed nights, creating a vibrant and engaging social hub for the community. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to continually improve our services and offerings, ensuring we meet their evolving needs and preferences. Our dedication to exceptional customer service and community engagement sets us apart and fosters long-term relationships with our patrons.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Mocha Cafe & Bar envisions becoming a leading destination for culinary and social experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, further showcasing the diverse flavors of Assam. We plan to introduce innovative beverage programs, featuring unique cocktails and artisanal coffee blends. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, potentially opening additional locations in other key areas of the city and state. Furthermore, we are committed to enhancing our online presence, offering online ordering, delivery services, and loyalty programs to better serve our customers. We are also dedicated to sustainability and reducing our environmental impact, implementing eco-friendly practices throughout our operations. Ultimately, our vision is to establish Mocha Cafe & Bar as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. We believe that our commitment to these principles will drive our continued growth and success, solidifying our position as a vital part of the Assam business landscape.', '2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:15:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1755, 'Brewbakes', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Brewbakes, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at Digen, Bora Complex, GS Rd, is more than just a bakery and café; it’s a vibrant hub that caters to the evolving tastes of Assam. Standing out in the local business landscape, Brewbakes distinguishes itself by seamlessly blending the comforting familiarity of traditional baked goods with the adventurous spirit of modern café culture. It offers a unique and inviting space where patrons can connect, relax, and indulge in high-quality treats and beverages.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of Brewbakes lies a commitment to providing exceptional products and services that resonate with the community. The primary offerings encompass a diverse range of freshly baked goods, from classic cakes and pastries to innovative breads and cookies that incorporate local ingredients and flavors. Beyond the bakery, Brewbakes operates as a fully functional café, serving a carefully curated selection of coffees, teas, and other beverages. The menu is designed to complement the baked goods, creating a harmonious experience for customers. What truly sets Brewbakes apart is its dedication to sourcing ingredients locally whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers. This commitment not only ensures the freshness and quality of the products but also strengthens the business\'s ties to the community. Brewbakes directly addresses the local market’s desire for both familiar comfort foods and novel culinary experiences, providing a space where tradition and innovation intersect.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Brewbakes believes that exceptional customer service is paramount. The staff is trained to be friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable, creating a welcoming atmosphere for every guest. From personalized recommendations to accommodating dietary restrictions, the team goes the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. The ambiance of the café is carefully crafted to foster a sense of community. Regular events, such as live music performances or baking workshops, are organized to engage with the local population and create a vibrant social space. Brewbakes actively participates in local initiatives and collaborations, further solidifying its position as a community partner. Through attentive service, a welcoming atmosphere, and active community engagement, Brewbakes strives to create a loyal customer base and become a beloved gathering place for the residents of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Brewbakes is one of sustainable growth and continued community engagement. The business aims to expand its product offerings, introducing new and exciting items that cater to evolving consumer preferences. This may include exploring collaborations with local artisans and chefs to create limited-edition products that showcase the region\'s rich culinary heritage. Expansion of the physical space is also a possibility, with plans to potentially open additional locations in other parts of Assam. However, any expansion will be carefully considered to ensure that the quality of products and services remains consistent. Long-term, Brewbakes aspires to become a recognized and respected brand throughout the region, known for its commitment to quality, community, and innovation. The business hopes to inspire other entrepreneurs in the area and contribute to the overall economic growth of Assam.</p>', 'Digen, Bora Complex, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:20:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1756, 'Envo Cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'Envo Cafe, nestled on the 1st floor of the Pragati Commercial Complex within the Down Town Hospital on GS Road, is a haven for those seeking a moment of respite and rejuvenation amidst the bustling energy of Guwahati. More than just a cafe, Envo Cafe aims to be a community hub, offering a carefully curated selection of food and beverages in a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. Situated within a major hospital complex, Envo Cafe fills a vital need in the local business landscape by providing a relaxing and convenient space for patients, visitors, and hospital staff alike to connect, recharge, and enjoy quality refreshments. It distinguishes itself by prioritizing locally sourced ingredients where possible and fostering a calming environment, offering a much-needed contrast to the clinical setting nearby.\n<br> <br>\nEnvo Cafe\'s core offering revolves around providing a diverse menu catering to a wide range of tastes and dietary needs. We specialize in freshly brewed coffee, crafted with locally roasted beans to capture the unique flavors of Assam. Beyond coffee, our beverage selection includes a variety of teas, both classic and contemporary, refreshing juices, and healthy smoothies. Our food menu features light meals, including sandwiches, wraps, salads, and pastries, prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients. A particular focus is placed on offering healthier options, recognizing the importance of wellness for our clientele within the hospital environment. One of our unique selling points is our commitment to providing options that cater to specific dietary requirements, such as gluten-free or vegetarian choices, ensuring that everyone can find something to enjoy. This attention to detail differentiates us from other cafes in the area.\n<br> <br>\nAt Envo Cafe, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and comfortable. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about our menu, providing personalized recommendations and ensuring prompt and efficient service. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and refine our service. We believe in fostering a strong connection with the local community by participating in local events and supporting local artisans. Our decor reflects the vibrant culture of Assam, creating a visually appealing and culturally relevant space. This commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement sets Envo Cafe apart, transforming it from a mere cafe into a cherished destination.\n<br> <br>\nLooking ahead, Envo Cafe envisions becoming a leading cafe in Guwahati, known for its quality products, exceptional service, and strong community ties. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more locally inspired dishes and beverages, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We also aim to establish partnerships with local farmers and suppliers to ensure a sustainable and ethical supply chain. We are exploring opportunities to introduce loyalty programs and online ordering options to enhance customer convenience. Long-term, we aspire to open additional locations within Guwahati and potentially expand to other cities in Assam, bringing the Envo Cafe experience to a wider audience. This growth will be carefully managed to maintain our commitment to quality and community engagement.\n<br> <br>\nFurthermore, Envo Cafe understands the increasing demand for healthy and sustainable options. Therefore, we are committed to investing in eco-friendly practices such as reducing waste, using biodegradable packaging, and promoting responsible sourcing. We aim to become a benchmark for environmentally conscious businesses in the region, demonstrating that profitability and sustainability can go hand in hand. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers and the community, Envo Cafe is poised for sustained growth and success in the vibrant business landscape of Assam.\n<br> <br>\nOur intention is to cultivate a reputation that precedes us; a reputation for not only serving exceptional food and beverages but also for fostering a genuine sense of community and providing a welcoming space where people can connect, relax, and recharge.', '1st floor, Pragati Commercial Complex, Down Town Hospital, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:20:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1757, 'Cafe City Streets', 'Cafes', '', 'Cafe City Streets, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at By Lane Number 3, Rajgarh Rd, is more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a vibrant community hub and a culinary destination that celebrates the rich flavors of Assam while embracing modern cafe culture. In a city known for its tea estates and traditional Assamese cuisine, Cafe City Streets offers a refreshing blend of familiar comforts and innovative creations, carving a unique niche in the local business landscape. It’s a place where conversations flow as freely as the carefully brewed coffee, and where every dish tells a story.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Cafe City Streets provides a diverse menu designed to cater to a wide range of palates. Our signature coffee blends, sourced from local estates whenever possible, are expertly prepared by skilled baristas, ensuring a consistently exceptional cup. Beyond coffee, we offer a curated selection of teas, refreshing beverages, and handcrafted cocktails for those seeking a different indulgence. But the true heart of Cafe City Streets lies in its food menu. While we serve classic cafe fare like sandwiches, pastries, and salads, we also feature dishes inspired by Assamese culinary traditions. Think subtle spice infusions, locally sourced ingredients, and innovative presentations that elevate familiar flavors to new heights. Our \"Axomiya Thali\" – a miniature version of the traditional Assamese platter – has become a local favorite, allowing patrons to sample a variety of regional specialties in a single, satisfying meal. Furthermore, we pride ourselves on offering options for various dietary needs, including vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free choices, ensuring everyone can find something to enjoy. The unique selling point isn’t just the quality of our ingredients, but the thoughtful integration of Assamese flavors into a contemporary cafe setting, satisfying a growing demand for authentic yet accessible culinary experiences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Cafe City Streets. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where everyone feels like a regular. Our staff is trained not only to provide efficient service but also to engage with customers, offering recommendations, sharing stories about our menu, and creating a genuine connection. We understand that in Assam, hospitality is a way of life, and we embody that spirit in every interaction. The cafe itself is designed with a relaxed and inviting aesthetic, featuring comfortable seating, natural light, and local artwork that celebrates the region\'s culture. Beyond the physical space, we actively engage with the local community through events and initiatives. We host live music performances by local artists, showcasing the region\'s vibrant artistic talent. We also partner with local farmers and artisans, sourcing ingredients and products whenever possible, supporting the local economy, and promoting sustainable practices. Furthermore, we actively participate in local festivals and celebrations, creating special menu items and hosting events that bring the community together. This commitment to community engagement distinguishes Cafe City Streets as more than just a business; it\'s a vital part of the Rajgarh Rd neighborhood.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Cafe City Streets envisions itself as a leading destination for cafe culture in Guwahati and beyond. Our immediate plans involve expanding our menu to include more seasonal and regional specialties, further solidifying our commitment to showcasing the flavors of Assam. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Longer-term, we are exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and potentially even venturing into other cities in Assam, bringing our unique blend of modern cafe culture and Assamese traditions to a wider audience. We are also committed to expanding our online presence through social media and online ordering platforms, making our offerings more accessible to customers throughout the city. Ultimately, our goal is to establish Cafe City Streets as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and a genuine commitment to the local community, contributing positively to the economic and cultural landscape of Assam for years to come.', 'By Lane Number 3, Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:20:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(1758, 'The Corner Café', 'Cafes', '', '<h1>The Corner Café: A Taste of Home at the Heart of Ambari</h1>\n\nThe Corner Café, nestled at 10, Lamb Rd, Ambari, is more than just a place to grab a quick bite; it\'s a community hub, a haven for relaxation, and a purveyor of authentic flavours that resonate with the soul of Assam. In a region brimming with culinary traditions, The Corner Café distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of classic café fare and locally inspired dishes, all served with a generous helping of warmth and hospitality. This isn\'t merely a business; it\'s an establishment woven into the fabric of Ambari, contributing to the local economy and providing a space for connection and conviviality. The Café understands the importance of sourcing locally, fostering relationships with regional farmers and producers, and ultimately, reflecting the vibrant spirit of Assam in every dish and every cup.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around providing a diverse menu that caters to a wide range of tastes, from the familiar comforts of freshly brewed coffee and pastries to the more adventurous palates seeking authentic Assamese cuisine. Breakfast features hearty options like traditional Jolpan alongside lighter choices like fruit platters and yogurt parfaits. Lunch and dinner showcase the best of both worlds, with sandwiches, salads, and pasta complementing regional specialties like *Masor Tenga* (sour fish curry) and *Duck Curry*, prepared using time-honoured recipes. We also offer a selection of locally sourced teas, including Assam tea, of course, as well as a variety of specialty beverages, juices, and refreshing coolers perfect for the humid climate. Our unique selling point lies in the harmonious blend of international café standards and the authentic flavours of Assam, all made with fresh, locally sourced ingredients. This combination appeals to both residents and visitors, creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for everyone. We understand the market needs a space that offers convenience, quality, and a touch of local flavour, and The Corner Café strives to deliver on all fronts.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at The Corner Café. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels like a valued member of our community. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and friendly service, going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. We believe in building genuine connections with our patrons, remembering their names and preferences, and creating a sense of belonging. Beyond simply serving food and drinks, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artisan markets, showcasing artwork from regional artists, and participating in community events. The Café also provides free Wi-Fi, making it a popular spot for students and professionals to work or study. Furthermore, we are committed to sustainability, using eco-friendly packaging and minimizing waste wherever possible. We also actively encourage feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, The Corner Café envisions expanding its role as a cornerstone of the Ambari community and a champion of Assamese cuisine. We aim to broaden our menu to include more seasonal and regional dishes, further showcasing the culinary diversity of Assam. We also plan to introduce cooking classes and workshops to share our passion for food and educate others about the rich culinary heritage of the region. Expansion within Ambari, potentially opening another smaller outlet focused on takeaway options, is being considered. We also foresee potential collaborations with local farms and producers to create a more sustainable and localized food system. Ultimately, The Corner Café aims to become a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement, not just in Ambari, but across Assam. The goal is to grow responsibly, always staying true to our core values of providing exceptional food and service while contributing to the well-being of the local community.', '10, Lamb Rd Ambari', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:20:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1759, 'Leaf Deck Café Bar', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Leaf Deck Café Bar, nestled charmingly above Kesaria Chaiwala and directly opposite All India Radio, offers a unique and refreshing addition to the vibrant Assam culinary scene. More than just a café, Leaf Deck is designed as a tranquil escape, a place where locals and visitors alike can relax, connect, and enjoy a diverse menu in a distinctive setting. In a region renowned for its tea culture and community spirit, Leaf Deck strives to blend modern café culture with the warm hospitality Assam is known for.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Leaf Deck\'s core offering revolves around a curated selection of beverages and light meals, designed to cater to a broad range of tastes. While paying homage to its location above Kesaria Chaiwala, famed for its traditional Assam tea, Leaf Deck distinguishes itself by offering an extensive array of specialty coffees, refreshing fruit-infused drinks, and artisanal mocktails. The food menu complements the beverage offerings, featuring a selection of globally inspired snacks and light meals, with a focus on fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. Think savory crepes, gourmet sandwiches, and flavorful pasta dishes, all prepared with a commitment to quality and taste. A key differentiator is the \"Leaf Deck Specials\" menu, which rotates seasonally and incorporates unique Assamese ingredients and culinary traditions, providing a delightful fusion of local flavors and international techniques. This allows Leaf Deck to offer something unique and constantly exciting to its customers, setting it apart from typical café chains and reinforcing its commitment to supporting local producers.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The customer experience at Leaf Deck is paramount. The staff is trained not only to provide efficient service but also to create a welcoming and friendly atmosphere. From the moment a customer steps inside, they are greeted with a warm smile and attentive service. The ambiance itself is designed to promote relaxation and connection. The \"deck\" aspect of the name refers to an outdoor seating area with lush greenery, providing a calming respite from the bustling street below. Inside, the décor is modern and comfortable, with ample natural light and carefully chosen seating arrangements to accommodate both individual diners and larger groups. Leaf Deck also prioritizes community engagement. Regular events such as live acoustic music nights, open mic sessions, and art exhibitions featuring local artists are planned to foster a sense of belonging and provide a platform for local talent. Free Wi-Fi is offered to cater to students and professionals looking for a productive workspace outside of their homes or offices, further solidifying Leaf Deck as a central hub for the local community. Special promotions are frequently run in collaboration with nearby businesses, such as Kesaria Chaiwala, to promote mutual growth and offer customers added value.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Leaf Deck envisions becoming a beloved landmark within the local community and a recognized destination for visitors seeking an authentic and enjoyable café experience. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional Assamese dishes, utilizing sustainable practices wherever feasible, and creating partnerships with local farmers and artisans. Another area of focus is building a strong online presence through social media and online ordering platforms to cater to the growing demand for convenience. Longer-term goals include potentially opening additional locations within Assam, always maintaining the core values of quality, community, and unique cultural expression that define the Leaf Deck brand. Furthermore, there are plans to introduce workshops and classes related to coffee brewing, cocktail making, and local Assamese cuisine, further enhancing Leaf Deck\'s role as a center for culinary exploration and community engagement. The ultimate vision is to establish Leaf Deck not simply as a café, but as a cultural touchstone, synonymous with quality, innovation, and the warm hospitality of Assam.</p>', 'above Kesaria Chaiwala, opposite to All India Radio', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:20:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1760, 'The Steaming Mug', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The Steaming Mug, nestled in the heart of Tilottoma Enclave at 1A Gopinath Bordoloi Rd, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a community hub built on the foundations of authentic Assamese hospitality and a passion for exceptional coffee and culinary experiences. In a region known for its rich tea heritage, The Steaming Mug offers a distinctive alternative, introducing a specialty coffee culture while celebrating the diverse flavors of Assam. We aim to be a landmark destination where locals and visitors alike can connect, unwind, and savor moments of genuine connection.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Steaming Mug, our core offering revolves around providing a premium coffee experience. We source high-quality beans, meticulously roasted to perfection, ensuring each cup delivers a rich and aromatic flavor profile. Our skilled baristas craft a range of classic espresso-based beverages, alongside innovative signature coffee creations inspired by local ingredients. Beyond coffee, we feature a curated menu of delectable culinary options, from light bites and pastries baked fresh daily to hearty meals showcasing regional ingredients. We understand the local palate, offering both familiar favorites and unique twists that cater to diverse preferences. What sets us apart is our dedication to quality, consistency, and a commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers and reducing our environmental footprint. The menu includes specially curated Assamese snacks and dishes that are a testament to the local cuisine.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We believe that customer experience is paramount. From the moment you step inside The Steaming Mug, you\'re greeted with a warm and inviting atmosphere. Our staff are trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring every customer feels valued and comfortable. We strive to create a welcoming space where individuals can relax, work, or socialize. The café\'s design incorporates elements of Assamese culture, creating a visually appealing and culturally relevant environment. Beyond the immediate customer interaction, we actively engage with the local community through events, workshops, and partnerships with local organizations. This community-centric approach allows us to foster a sense of belonging and establish The Steaming Mug as a vital part of the Tilottoma Enclave neighborhood.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Steaming Mug envisions expanding its reach and impact within the Assam business landscape. Future plans include introducing coffee brewing workshops to educate customers about the art of coffee making and broadening our range of locally sourced products to further support regional producers. We aim to become the premier specialty coffee destination in the area, known for its unwavering commitment to quality, community engagement, and authentic Assamese hospitality. We also see opportunities to explore partnerships with local artists and artisans, providing a platform to showcase their work and contribute to the cultural vibrancy of the region. Our long-term goal is to establish The Steaming Mug as a sustainable and thriving business that positively impacts the local community and contributes to the growth of the Assam economy. We aim to create a sustainable business model that focuses on minimizing waste and maximizing the use of eco-friendly practices.</p>', 'Tilottoma Enclave, 1A, Gopinath Bordoloi Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:25:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1761, 'Café UC 24', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Café UC 24, nestled in the heart of Assam, is more than just a café; it\'s a vibrant hub that seamlessly blends contemporary culinary experiences with the rich cultural tapestry of the region. Situated at a prime location within the bustling city, the café provides a welcoming oasis for locals and tourists alike, offering a unique and memorable escape from the everyday. It distinguishes itself through a commitment to sourcing local ingredients, supporting regional artisans, and fostering a sense of community that resonates deeply within the local Assam business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Café UC 24, the core offering revolves around providing a diverse and delectable menu that caters to a wide range of palates. From freshly brewed Assam tea and expertly crafted coffee beverages to innovative fusion dishes that incorporate traditional Assamese spices and flavors, the café strives to offer an unparalleled culinary journey. The menu also boasts a selection of freshly baked goods, pastries, and desserts, all prepared in-house using time-honored recipes with a modern twist. The unique selling proposition lies in the cafe’s ability to blend authentic regional cuisine with contemporary café staples, creating a dining experience that is both familiar and exciting. This approach directly addresses the local market\'s demand for both traditional flavors and modern culinary trends, appealing to a broad demographic seeking quality and variety.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Café UC 24’s philosophy. The café’s dedicated team is committed to providing warm, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. Beyond exceptional service, the ambiance is carefully curated to foster a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. The décor incorporates elements of traditional Assamese art and design, creating a visually appealing space that celebrates the region’s heritage. The café actively engages with the local community through hosting events, supporting local artists, and participating in community initiatives. These efforts not only enhance the customer experience but also strengthen the café\'s connection to the surrounding community, solidifying its position as a valued and respected local establishment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Café UC 24 envisions a future of sustainable growth and expanded community engagement. The long-term goals include establishing a strong brand presence throughout Assam and potentially expanding to other regions of Northeast India. Plans are underway to introduce new menu items that showcase the diverse culinary traditions of the region, while also exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and producers to further enhance the café\'s commitment to sourcing local ingredients. Furthermore, Café UC 24 aims to become a platform for local artists and artisans, providing them with a space to showcase their work and connect with a wider audience. By continuing to prioritize quality, innovation, and community engagement, Café UC 24 is poised to become a leading destination for both locals and tourists seeking an authentic and memorable Assam experience.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:25:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1762, 'The Bean Journal Boutique Café', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The Bean Journal Boutique Café is a haven for coffee aficionados and community seekers alike, nestled in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a café, it\'s a curated experience designed to celebrate the rich heritage of Assam\'s tea and coffee culture while offering a modern, inviting space for connection and relaxation. Situated at a prime location, The Bean Journal aims to distinguish itself within the competitive café scene by focusing on quality, authenticity, and a commitment to fostering a vibrant local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, The Bean Journal Boutique Café offers a diverse range of expertly crafted coffee and tea beverages, each prepared with meticulous attention to detail. We source premium Arabica coffee beans, exploring blends from across India and beyond, ensuring a consistently exceptional cup. Our tea selection showcases the finest Assam varieties, from robust malty brews to delicate green teas, paying homage to the region\'s renowned tea estates. Complementing our beverages is a delectable menu of light bites and pastries, crafted in-house with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From freshly baked croissants and muffins to savory sandwiches and quiches, each item is carefully selected to enhance the coffee and tea experience. A key differentiator is our commitment to showcasing regional flavors through specials and seasonal offerings, incorporating local fruits, spices, and traditional Assamese snacks. This not only appeals to local palates but also introduces tourists to the authentic tastes of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Bean Journal Boutique Café. We believe in providing not just a product but a personalized and memorable interaction. Our baristas are knowledgeable and passionate about coffee and tea, eager to guide customers through our menu and offer recommendations based on individual preferences. The ambiance of the café is carefully curated to be both inviting and stimulating, featuring comfortable seating, warm lighting, and tasteful décor that blends modern aesthetics with traditional Assamese elements. We host regular events such as open mic nights, art exhibitions showcasing local artists, and coffee brewing workshops to engage the community and create a welcoming space for social interaction. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the café, making it an ideal spot for students, freelancers, and remote workers. We actively engage with our customers through social media, soliciting feedback, sharing updates on new offerings, and fostering a sense of online community. This multi-faceted approach to customer service ensures that every visitor feels valued, appreciated, and connected to The Bean Journal family.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Bean Journal Boutique Café envisions becoming a cornerstone of the Guwahati community and a recognized destination for coffee and tea lovers throughout the region. Our growth strategy involves expanding our menu to include more substantial meal options, catering to a wider range of dietary needs and preferences. We plan to establish partnerships with local artisans and producers to offer a selection of curated gifts and souvenirs, further supporting the local economy and providing customers with unique keepsakes. Exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, carefully selecting locations that align with our brand values and target audience is another goal. We are also committed to sustainable practices, exploring options for reducing our environmental footprint through initiatives such as using eco-friendly packaging, sourcing ethically produced ingredients, and implementing waste reduction programs. By focusing on quality, community engagement, and responsible business practices, The Bean Journal Boutique Café aims to establish a lasting legacy as a beloved and respected establishment in the Assam business landscape.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:25:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1763, 'SHOTS - Cafe & Bar | Guwahati', 'Cafes', '', '<p><b>SHOTS - Cafe & Bar | Guwahati: A Modern Oasis in the Heart of the City</b></p>\n\n<p>SHOTS - Cafe & Bar is a vibrant and contemporary establishment redefining Guwahati\'s social scene. Located on the 2nd Floor of Nirvana Tower, RG Baruah Rd, opposite City Center Mall, SHOTS offers a unique blend of café culture and bar ambiance, catering to a diverse clientele seeking a sophisticated yet relaxed environment. More than just a place to grab a drink or a bite, SHOTS is envisioned as a central hub, fostering connections and experiences within the Guwahati community. Its prime location ensures easy accessibility, making it a popular destination for after-work gatherings, weekend celebrations, and everything in between. In a city increasingly embracing modern lifestyles, SHOTS fills a crucial need for a versatile venue that seamlessly transitions from a daytime café to an evening bar.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><b>Core Services and Products: A Fusion of Flavors and Experiences</b></p>\n\n<p>At its core, SHOTS provides a curated selection of both alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages, complemented by a diverse food menu designed to tantalize the taste buds. During the daytime, the café atmosphere prevails, offering freshly brewed coffees, artisanal teas, and a range of pastries and light meals perfect for a quick lunch or a leisurely afternoon. As the sun sets, SHOTS transforms into a lively bar, featuring a wide array of spirits, wines, and expertly crafted cocktails. The bar\'s skilled mixologists pride themselves on using fresh, local ingredients whenever possible, creating unique and innovative concoctions that set SHOTS apart. The food menu expands in the evening, offering a selection of appetizers, sharing platters, and main courses, designed to complement the beverage offerings. Live music performances on select evenings add another layer of entertainment, making SHOTS a truly multi-faceted destination.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for SHOTS is its commitment to providing high-quality products and services at competitive prices. The business carefully sources its ingredients and beverages, ensuring that customers receive the best possible value. Furthermore, SHOTS aims to provide a consistently innovative food and drink menu, staying abreast of the latest trends and tastes while remaining true to its core values of quality and affordability. The welcoming and modern ambiance, coupled with the carefully crafted menu, makes SHOTS a preferred choice for both casual outings and special occasions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><b>Customer Experience: Fostering Community and Connection</b></p>\n\n<p>SHOTS places a strong emphasis on providing exceptional customer service, aiming to create a warm and inviting atmosphere for every guest. The staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, ensuring that customers feel valued and appreciated. The business actively encourages feedback and uses it to continually improve its services and offerings. Beyond simply providing food and drinks, SHOTS strives to create a sense of community, hosting events and promotions that bring people together. These events may include themed nights, live music performances, and special holiday celebrations, catering to a diverse range of interests and preferences. Through these initiatives, SHOTS aims to become more than just a business; it seeks to be an integral part of the Guwahati community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, SHOTS leverages social media and digital marketing to engage with its customers and build brand awareness. The business actively promotes its events and offerings online, using visually appealing content and engaging language to attract new customers and retain existing ones. Online ordering and reservation options are also being explored to further enhance the customer experience and cater to the growing demand for convenience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><b>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Solidifying its Position</b></p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, SHOTS envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati market. The business plans to expand its offerings, potentially introducing new menu items, expanding its live music program, and hosting more community-focused events. Exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations to further enhance its community engagement is also a key objective. Longer-term goals include the possibility of expanding to other locations within Assam, bringing the unique SHOTS experience to a wider audience. The business is committed to continuously adapting to the evolving needs and preferences of its customers, ensuring that it remains a relevant and desirable destination for years to come. By focusing on quality, innovation, and community engagement, SHOTS aims to solidify its position as a leading café and bar in Guwahati, contributing to the vibrancy and dynamism of the local business landscape.</p>', '2nd Floor, Nirvana Tower, RG Baruah Rd, opposite City Center Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:25:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1764, 'With Grace', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Located at 4, Sachal Path, \'With Grace\' is more than just a business; it\'s a cornerstone of curated experiences deeply rooted in the Assamese spirit. Stepping into With Grace is an immersion into a world where tradition meets contemporary sensibilities, reflecting the rich tapestry of Assam\'s culture and catering to both local residents and visitors seeking an authentic connection with the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In the vibrant and evolving business landscape of Assam, With Grace stands out by offering a unique blend of services designed to resonate with the local community\'s values and aspirations. Understanding the deep appreciation for heritage and craftsmanship, With Grace has positioned itself as a facilitator of authentic Assamese experiences, bridging the gap between traditional practices and modern desires. Its significance lies in its commitment to preserving and promoting local artistry while providing exceptional service and quality to its clientele. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of With Grace lies a curated collection of services centered around enhancing life\'s special moments and fostering a deeper appreciation for Assamese culture. Its primary offering is event planning and design, specializing in weddings, family celebrations, and corporate gatherings. What sets With Grace apart is its unwavering commitment to incorporating authentic Assamese elements into every event, from traditional bihu dances and local cuisine to handloom textiles and artisanal decorations. By collaborating with local artisans and craftspeople, With Grace ensures that each event is a celebration of Assam\'s rich heritage. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond event planning, With Grace also offers bespoke gifting services, providing clients with carefully curated hampers and individual gifts that showcase the best of Assam\'s local produce and craftsmanship. These gifts range from exquisite Assamese silk scarves and handcrafted jewelry to locally sourced teas and spices, all beautifully packaged and presented. The unique selling point lies in the story behind each product, highlighting the artisans and communities that create them, fostering a sense of connection and appreciation for local talent. This service directly addresses the local market\'s need for thoughtful and authentic gifts that reflect the region\'s unique identity, moving beyond mass-produced items to offer something truly special. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at With Grace. The business cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, treating each client as an individual with unique needs and preferences. From the initial consultation to the final execution, the team at With Grace is dedicated to providing personalized attention and exceptional service. They go above and beyond to understand their clients\' visions, offering creative solutions and meticulous attention to detail to ensure that every event or gift is a true reflection of their personality and style. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly makes With Grace stand out is its deep connection with the local community. The business actively supports local artisans and businesses, providing them with a platform to showcase their talents and reach a wider audience. By participating in local festivals and events, With Grace strengthens its ties with the community and demonstrates its commitment to preserving and promoting Assamese culture. Through initiatives like supporting local weavers and promoting traditional art forms, With Grace actively contributes to the economic and cultural well-being of the region. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, With Grace envisions expanding its reach and becoming the premier destination for authentic Assamese experiences. Future plans include establishing a dedicated retail space showcasing the work of local artisans, offering workshops and cultural immersion programs, and expanding its event planning services to cater to a wider range of clients. The long-term goal is to create a sustainable business model that benefits both the company and the local community, fostering economic growth and preserving Assam\'s rich cultural heritage for generations to come. This may involve partnerships with tourism agencies to promote Assam as a cultural destination or the development of an online platform to showcase local artisans and products to a global audience. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>With Grace aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a cultural ambassador, sharing the beauty and richness of Assam with the world, while simultaneously empowering local communities and preserving its unique heritage.</p>', '4, Sachal Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:25:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1765, 'Barista Six Mile', 'Cafes', '', 'Barista Six Mile: A Coffee Haven Rooted in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nBarista Six Mile is more than just a coffee shop; it’s a community hub nestled on G.S. Road, Six Mile, directly opposite the Catholic Church, in Guwahati, Assam. It represents a commitment to providing a premium coffee experience, coupled with exceptional customer service and a deep understanding of the local palate. Situated in a bustling area with a mix of residential and commercial activity, Barista Six Mile has quickly established itself as a preferred destination for students, professionals, and residents seeking a respite from the day\'s demands, a productive workspace, or simply a delicious cup of coffee. In a region traditionally known for its tea culture, Barista Six Mile plays a vital role in introducing and popularizing specialty coffee, while also embracing local flavors and preferences. The cafe serves as a modern counterpoint to the traditional Assamese beverage landscape, offering a global coffee experience adapted to the local context.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offering revolves around expertly crafted coffee beverages. We source high-quality beans, ensuring a rich and flavorful cup every time. From classic espressos and cappuccinos to innovative signature drinks, our menu caters to a wide range of coffee preferences. Beyond coffee, we provide a diverse selection of teas, both international blends and locally sourced varieties, recognizing the strong tea-drinking tradition in Assam. To complement our beverages, we offer a curated selection of pastries, sandwiches, and light meals, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This menu is carefully designed to appeal to both local tastes and international preferences, providing a balanced and appealing array of choices for our customers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly sets Barista Six Mile apart is our dedication to creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. We understand that our customers are not just buying coffee; they are seeking an experience. Our baristas are highly trained not only in coffee preparation but also in providing exceptional customer service. They are knowledgeable about our menu, attentive to customer preferences, and genuinely passionate about creating a positive interaction. We strive to remember regular customers\' names and orders, fostering a sense of community and belonging. Beyond personalized service, our cafe provides a thoughtfully designed space, featuring comfortable seating, ample lighting, and reliable Wi-Fi, making it an ideal spot for studying, working, or simply relaxing. We actively engage with the local community by hosting events such as open mic nights, art exhibitions featuring local artists, and book readings, further solidifying our position as a cultural and social hub.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur unique selling proposition lies in our commitment to quality, community, and convenience. We are conveniently located in a high-traffic area, easily accessible to a large segment of the population. We prioritize using high-quality ingredients, employing skilled baristas, and providing a welcoming atmosphere. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through events and partnerships, fostering a sense of belonging and loyalty. Our menu adapts to local tastes while also offering international favorites, catering to a diverse range of preferences. These factors combined create a unique and compelling value proposition that differentiates Barista Six Mile from other coffee shops in the area.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Barista Six Mile envisions becoming a leading coffee destination in Guwahati, recognized for its quality, community engagement, and sustainable practices. We plan to expand our menu to include more locally sourced and seasonal ingredients, further supporting local farmers and businesses. We are exploring opportunities to introduce coffee workshops and brewing demonstrations, educating our customers about the art and science of coffee. We aim to deepen our engagement with the local community through increased sponsorships of local events and collaborations with local organizations. Furthermore, we are exploring the feasibility of opening additional locations in other strategic areas of Guwahati, expanding our reach and bringing the Barista Six Mile experience to a wider audience. Our long-term goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional coffee and food but also contributes positively to the economic and social fabric of the Guwahati community. We are committed to growing responsibly, maintaining our focus on quality, customer service, and community engagement as we expand our operations.', 'G.S. Road, Six Mile, opposite to Catholic Church', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:30:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1766, 'H\'n\'D Social - Food & Gaming Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>H\'n\'D Social - Food & Gaming Cafe is a vibrant and innovative establishment located in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, specifically at the Mahamaya Complex on Jayanagar Road, conveniently situated opposite the Iskcon Temple. More than just a cafe, H\'n\'D Social offers a unique convergence of culinary delights and immersive gaming experiences, creating a novel social hub that caters to a diverse clientele. This makes it a distinctive player in the Assam business landscape, filling a niche for entertainment and community engagement beyond the traditional cafe experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, H\'n\'D Social provides a diverse menu of food and beverages designed to satisfy various palates. From quick bites and globally inspired snacks to more substantial meals and refreshing drinks, the cafe aims to offer something for everyone. The food menu is regularly updated to incorporate local flavors and seasonal ingredients, ensuring freshness and appeal to the local community. Crucially, H\'n\'D Social distinguishes itself through its dedicated gaming zone. This section boasts a range of gaming options, from console gaming with popular titles to PC gaming rigs equipped with high-performance hardware. Board games are also available, catering to a broader audience and encouraging face-to-face interaction. The unique selling point lies in the seamless integration of the food and gaming experiences. Patrons can enjoy a meal or snack while participating in gaming activities, fostering a dynamic and engaging social atmosphere. This combination addresses the growing demand for entertainment and social interaction spaces in Guwahati, particularly among young adults and gaming enthusiasts.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at H\'n\'D Social. The cafe cultivates a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where individuals can relax, connect, and enjoy shared experiences. The staff is trained to provide friendly and efficient service, catering to the specific needs of each customer. Regular events, such as gaming tournaments, themed nights, and community gatherings, are organized to foster a sense of belonging and build relationships with the local community. Active engagement on social media platforms allows H\'n\'D Social to stay connected with its patrons, solicit feedback, and promote upcoming events. The cafe\'s location opposite the Iskcon Temple also offers a unique advantage, attracting visitors and locals alike, contributing to its diverse customer base. H\'n\'D Social distinguishes itself not only through its product offerings but also through its commitment to creating a memorable and enjoyable experience for every guest, making it a preferred social destination in Jayanagar.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>H\'n\'D Social envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading social and entertainment hub in Guwahati. Plans include expanding the gaming infrastructure with new technologies and gaming options to cater to evolving trends. Exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations to host collaborative events and promote community initiatives is also on the roadmap. The cafe aims to further enhance its menu by introducing innovative dishes and beverages that reflect local culinary traditions while catering to diverse tastes. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional branches in other parts of Guwahati and even expanding to other cities in Assam, replicating the successful model of H\'n\'D Social and bringing its unique blend of food and gaming experiences to a wider audience. The business anticipates increased brand recognition through strategic marketing initiatives and a continued commitment to exceptional customer service, ultimately establishing H\'n\'D Social as a cornerstone of the local entertainment scene.</p>', 'Mahamaya Complex, Jayanagar Rd, opposite Iskcon Temple', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:30:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1767, 'OTT Cafe (A Unit of RAP Hospitality)', 'Cafes', '', '<p>OTT Cafe, a unit of RAP Hospitality, located on the 6th Floor of Megha Plaza, is a contemporary cafe experience redefining leisure and social engagement in the vibrant city of Guwahati, Assam. More than just a cafe, OTT Cafe aims to be a destination, a hub where culinary artistry meets a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, catering to the diverse tastes and social dynamics of the local community. As a unit of RAP Hospitality, OTT Cafe benefits from established expertise in the hospitality sector, ensuring high standards of service and operational efficiency. The cafe\'s presence in Megha Plaza, a prominent commercial building, offers accessibility and visibility, positioning it strategically within the city\'s burgeoning business and social landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, OTT Cafe offers a curated selection of specialty coffees, artisanal teas, and refreshing beverages, complemented by a menu of delectable food options ranging from light snacks and pastries to more substantial meals. Our coffee beans are sourced from reputable suppliers known for quality and ethical practices, ensuring each cup delivers a rich and satisfying experience. The food menu is carefully crafted to appeal to a wide range of palates, incorporating local flavors and international trends to provide a unique and exciting culinary journey. What sets OTT Cafe apart is not just the quality of our offerings, but the overall experience we provide. We strive to create an atmosphere of comfort and sophistication, where customers can relax, socialize, and enjoy a moment of respite from the hustle and bustle of city life. Furthermore, we offer a dedicated high-speed internet connection, making OTT Cafe an ideal location for remote workers, business meetings, or simply catching up on emails.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at OTT Cafe. We are committed to providing exceptional service, ensuring every customer feels welcomed, valued, and attended to. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable, friendly, and responsive to individual needs, creating a personalized and memorable experience for each guest. Beyond just serving food and beverages, we aim to foster a sense of community. We actively engage with local artists and musicians, providing a platform for showcasing their talents and enriching the cultural landscape of Guwahati. We regularly host events such as live music performances, art exhibitions, and workshops, further solidifying OTT Cafe\'s role as a vibrant community hub. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and continuously adapt our offerings and services to meet their evolving needs and preferences. Our commitment to customer satisfaction extends beyond the cafe itself, with active engagement on social media platforms to connect with our audience, share updates, and respond to inquiries.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, OTT Cafe envisions becoming a leading cafe destination in Guwahati and beyond, known for its exceptional quality, outstanding service, and strong community ties. Our future plans include expanding our menu offerings to incorporate seasonal specialties and locally sourced ingredients, further enhancing the culinary experience. We also plan to introduce loyalty programs and exclusive offers to reward our loyal customers and encourage repeat business. We are exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to further strengthen our ties within the community and create mutually beneficial collaborations. Long-term, RAP Hospitality envisions expanding the OTT Cafe brand to other locations in Assam and potentially other parts of the Northeast, bringing our unique cafe experience to a wider audience. We are committed to continuous innovation and improvement, constantly seeking new ways to enhance the customer experience and stay ahead of industry trends. Ultimately, OTT Cafe strives to be more than just a cafe; we aspire to be a cherished part of the community, a place where people can connect, relax, and create lasting memories.</p>', '6th Floor, Megha Plaza', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:30:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1768, 'Attic : The Restro Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Attic: The Restro Cafe, situated on the 4th Floor of RD Enclave, opposite Central Mall, offers a unique dining and social experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a restaurant, Attic aims to be a vibrant hub where the community can connect, relax, and enjoy quality food and beverages in a distinctive, inviting atmosphere. The cafe seeks to fill a niche in the local market by providing a space that blends the comfort of a cafe with the culinary offerings of a restaurant, creating a destination suitable for casual meetings, relaxed dining, and special occasions. It stands out in the Assam business landscape by offering a carefully curated ambiance and menu that caters to a diverse clientele seeking a refined yet accessible experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Attic: The Restro Cafe provides a wide array of services and products designed to satisfy diverse tastes and preferences. The menu features a selection of globally-inspired dishes with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local producers. Patrons can expect options ranging from continental breakfast items and light lunches to more substantial dinner entrees. The beverage menu includes a comprehensive selection of coffees, teas, mocktails, and refreshing beverages, all prepared with precision and care. What truly sets Attic apart is its commitment to crafting a unique and elevated experience. This is achieved through meticulous attention to detail, from the quality of the ingredients used to the artful presentation of each dish and drink. The unique selling proposition is the combination of a sophisticated, comfortable environment with a menu that balances familiar favorites with innovative culinary creations. This addresses the local market need for a venue that offers a high-quality dining experience without being overly formal or pretentious.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Attic: The Restro Cafe. The establishment fosters a welcoming and attentive environment where every guest feels valued. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and to provide personalized recommendations, catering to individual dietary needs and preferences. Beyond efficient service, the team at Attic strives to create genuine connections with patrons, building relationships and fostering a sense of community. To connect further with the local community, Attic plans to host regular events, such as live music performances, art exhibitions, and culinary workshops, showcasing local talent and providing opportunities for social interaction. Feedback is actively sought and incorporated into ongoing improvements, ensuring that the cafe remains responsive to the evolving needs of its customer base. The aim is to make Attic a place where people not only enjoy a meal but also feel a sense of belonging and connection.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Attic: The Restro Cafe is one of sustained growth and community enrichment. The initial focus will be on solidifying its position as a leading dining destination within the immediate vicinity. Potential expansion plans include introducing themed menus, seasonal specials, and catering services for local events. Long-term goals involve potentially expanding to other locations within Assam, replicating the unique ambiance and commitment to quality that defines the brand. Furthermore, Attic aims to become a strong supporter of local arts and culture, providing a platform for emerging artists and musicians to showcase their talent. The cafe also intends to explore partnerships with local businesses and organizations to further integrate into the community and contribute to its economic growth. By focusing on continuous improvement, innovation, and community engagement, Attic: The Restro Cafe strives to become a beloved landmark and a symbol of quality and connection within the local business landscape.</p>', '4th Floor, RD Enclave, opp. Central Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:30:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
