(1769, 'Cafe Wings', 'Cafes', '', 'Cafe Wings, strategically located at 167, Jayanagar Rd, near the NRL petrol pump, represents a fresh and vibrant addition to the Assam food and beverage scene. More than just a cafe, Cafe Wings aims to be a community hub, a place where locals can gather, connect, and enjoy high-quality food and beverages in a comfortable and inviting atmosphere. Situated in a prime location along Jayanagar Road, Cafe Wings benefits from high visibility and accessibility, drawing both regular patrons and passing traffic. The cafe\'s focus on creating a distinctive experience sets it apart from other establishments in the area, emphasizing locally sourced ingredients where possible and crafting a menu that caters to diverse palates.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Cafe Wings offers a carefully curated selection of specialty coffee drinks, a diverse range of teas, and a delectable menu of food items. The coffee program prioritizes ethically sourced beans, expertly brewed by trained baristas to deliver a consistent and flavorful experience. Beyond the standard espresso-based drinks, Cafe Wings also features signature coffee creations unique to the cafe. The tea selection includes both classic varieties and regionally inspired blends, reflecting the rich tea heritage of Assam. The food menu is designed to complement the beverage offerings, featuring freshly baked pastries, savory snacks, light meals, and desserts. A key differentiator is the commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever feasible, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring the freshest possible flavors. This commitment to quality and local sourcing helps Cafe Wings meet the growing demand for authentic and sustainable dining experiences within the community. The menu caters to different dietary needs and preferences, ensuring there is something for everyone.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCafe Wings is dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience from the moment a guest walks through the door. The staff is trained to be friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable, ensuring that every customer feels welcome and valued. Beyond efficient service, the cafe strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, a place where customers feel comfortable lingering and connecting with friends and neighbors. The cafe\'s design incorporates elements of Assamese culture and design, creating a unique and visually appealing space that reflects the local identity. Events, such as live music performances, art displays by local artists, or themed food and beverage nights, are occasionally hosted to further engage the community and foster a sense of belonging. Feedback is actively solicited through various channels, allowing Cafe Wings to continuously improve its offerings and cater to the evolving needs of its customer base. Building lasting relationships with the community is paramount, and Cafe Wings actively seeks opportunities to support local initiatives and organizations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for Cafe Wings is to establish itself as a leading cafe and community gathering place within Jayanagar and beyond. Expansion opportunities, such as opening additional locations in strategic areas, are being explored. The cafe plans to continuously innovate its menu, introducing new and exciting food and beverage options that reflect seasonal availability and customer preferences. Exploring partnerships with local businesses and organizations to offer unique products and services is also part of the long-term strategy. Furthermore, Cafe Wings aims to enhance its online presence and leverage digital marketing channels to reach a wider audience. The ultimate goal is to build a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the economic and social well-being of the local community, while consistently delivering exceptional quality and service. The cafe envisions becoming synonymous with quality, community, and a welcoming atmosphere, a place where people can connect, relax, and enjoy the best that Assam has to offer. The long-term success of Cafe Wings hinges on maintaining a strong commitment to its core values and continually adapting to meet the changing needs of the market.', '167, Jayanagar Rd, near NRL petrol pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:30:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1770, 'The Greenhouse Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The Greenhouse Cafe, nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a place to grab a quick bite; it\'s a vibrant hub where community, culture, and culinary innovation converge. Located at a strategically chosen spot known for its accessibility and bustling atmosphere, The Greenhouse Cafe offers a unique and refreshing experience in Assam\'s evolving food and beverage scene. We distinguish ourselves by prioritizing locally sourced ingredients, sustainable practices, and a commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere for everyone.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Greenhouse Cafe, our core offering revolves around providing a diverse menu that caters to a wide range of palates, blending international favorites with authentic Assamese flavors. From freshly brewed organic Assam tea and locally sourced coffee beans prepared by skilled baristas, to a selection of delicious pastries and wholesome meals crafted with seasonal ingredients, we ensure a memorable culinary journey. Our menu includes popular items like artisanal sandwiches made with homemade bread, vibrant salads featuring local greens, and traditional Assamese snacks prepared with a modern twist. What sets us apart is our dedication to sourcing ingredients directly from local farmers and producers, ensuring freshness, supporting the regional economy, and minimizing our environmental footprint. This commitment not only guarantees high-quality meals but also allows us to offer unique seasonal dishes that reflect the rich agricultural heritage of Assam. We also cater to dietary needs with vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options, making The Greenhouse Cafe a place where everyone can find something to enjoy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of The Greenhouse Cafe\'s philosophy. We strive to create a warm, inviting, and personalized experience for every guest. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about our menu, ready to provide recommendations and accommodate special requests. We believe in fostering a strong connection with the local community by hosting regular events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, and workshops focused on sustainable living and healthy eating. The cafe\'s ambiance is carefully curated to provide a relaxing and inspiring environment. The interior design incorporates natural elements, creating a sense of tranquility and connection with nature. Comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and thoughtfully chosen décor contribute to a space where customers can unwind, connect with friends and family, or simply enjoy a moment of peace. Furthermore, we actively engage with our customers through social media and online platforms, encouraging feedback and building a loyal following. We believe in transparency and are committed to addressing any concerns promptly and effectively, ensuring that every customer leaves feeling valued and satisfied. Our commitment to accessibility extends to offering free Wi-Fi and a welcoming atmosphere for students, entrepreneurs, and anyone seeking a comfortable and productive workspace.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Greenhouse Cafe envisions becoming a leading force in Assam\'s sustainable food and beverage industry, recognized for our commitment to quality, community, and environmental responsibility. Our future plans include expanding our partnerships with local farmers to further enhance our sourcing practices and offer even more diverse seasonal menus. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our operations, potentially opening new locations in other parts of Assam while maintaining our core values. We plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in our staff through ongoing training and development, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service and contribute to the cafe\'s success. We are also exploring the possibility of offering catering services for local events and corporate gatherings, providing our customers with the opportunity to enjoy our delicious food and beverages at a variety of occasions. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to establish The Greenhouse Cafe as a beloved institution in Assam, a place where people can come together to enjoy great food, connect with their community, and support sustainable practices. We aspire to be more than just a cafe; we aim to be a catalyst for positive change, promoting local agriculture, supporting regional artists, and fostering a culture of sustainability throughout Assam.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:35:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1771, '11th Avenue Café Bistro', 'Cafes', '', '```html\n<p>11th Avenue Café Bistro, nestled at 26, Rajgarh, is more than just a place to grab a bite; it\'s a destination for those seeking a unique culinary experience in the heart of Assam. This establishment aims to be a cornerstone of the local community, offering a blend of international flavors and local ingredients, fostering a warm and inviting atmosphere for residents and visitors alike. Understanding the burgeoning café culture in the region, 11th Avenue aims to elevate the dining experience beyond simple sustenance, transforming it into a social and sensory experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, 11th Avenue Café Bistro offers a diverse menu spanning breakfast, lunch, and dinner, complemented by a carefully curated selection of beverages. From freshly brewed Assamese tea and expertly crafted coffee to innovative cocktails and refreshing mocktails, the beverage selection caters to a wide range of tastes. The food menu showcases a harmonious blend of continental bistro fare with a subtle incorporation of local Assamese ingredients. Think perfectly grilled paninis with locally sourced cheeses, pasta dishes featuring indigenous herbs, and delectable desserts crafted with regional fruits. A key unique selling point is the bistro\'s commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the highest quality in every dish. Special attention is given to offering vegetarian and vegan options, acknowledging the growing demand for plant-based meals within the community. Furthermore, 11th Avenue caters to the local market needs by providing a comfortable and accessible space for meetings, gatherings, and casual social interactions. The provision of free Wi-Fi and ample charging points makes it an ideal spot for remote workers and students alike.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at 11th Avenue Café Bistro. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. Beyond the basic courtesies, the café strives to create a personalized experience, remembering regular customers\' preferences and offering recommendations based on individual tastes. What truly sets 11th Avenue apart is its dedication to fostering a sense of community. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, open mic nights, and themed culinary evenings, are organized to create a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. The bistro also actively participates in local community initiatives, supporting local charities and sponsoring events that benefit the neighborhood. By actively engaging with the community, 11th Avenue aims to be more than just a business; it seeks to be a contributing member of the Rajgarh community, a place where people can connect, relax, and enjoy good food and company.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for 11th Avenue Café Bistro is ambitious and multifaceted. The immediate goal is to solidify its position as a leading café and bistro in the Rajgarh area, known for its quality, service, and community engagement. This will be achieved through continuous improvement of the menu, ongoing staff training, and proactive marketing efforts. Long-term, the business aims to expand its reach and impact within the wider Assam region. This could involve opening additional locations in other key areas, each tailored to the specific needs and preferences of the local community. Another avenue for growth involves developing a range of branded products, such as its own blend of Assamese tea or a line of artisanal jams and chutneys made with locally sourced ingredients. The ambition is to create a brand that is synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community spirit. Furthermore, 11th Avenue envisions becoming a training ground for aspiring culinary professionals in the region, offering internships and mentorship programs to nurture local talent and contribute to the growth of the Assam hospitality industry. By investing in the local community and continuously striving for excellence, 11th Avenue Café Bistro is poised for sustainable growth and long-term success.</p>\n```', '26, Rajgarh', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:35:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1772, 'Shambhala Kitchen - Tibetan and Himalayan Cafe (A unit of Little Donnie)', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Shambhala Kitchen - Tibetan and Himalayan Cafe, a unit of Little Donnie, brings the authentic flavors of Tibet and the Himalayas to the vibrant culinary scene of Assam. More than just a restaurant, it is an immersive experience that transports patrons to the serene and culturally rich regions it represents. Situated in a currently undisclosed location, Shambhala Kitchen fills a unique niche, offering a distinct alternative to the existing dining options and catering to both adventurous palates and those seeking comfort in familiar flavors.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Shambhala Kitchen specializes in providing a wide array of traditional Tibetan and Himalayan dishes. Our core offerings include momos (steamed or fried dumplings), thukpa (noodle soup), various curries featuring yak or locally sourced meats and vegetables, and a selection of authentic teas and beverages. Our unique selling point lies in the genuine recipes, carefully preserved and prepared using traditional methods. We prioritize fresh, high-quality ingredients, sourcing locally whenever possible to support local farmers and ensure the authenticity of our dishes. Furthermore, we offer vegetarian and vegan options, catering to the diverse dietary preferences of our customers. Our menu is thoughtfully curated to showcase the best of Himalayan cuisine while adapting to local tastes, offering a balanced blend of the familiar and the exotic. Shambhala Kitchen addresses a growing demand for diverse culinary experiences within Assam, providing a refreshing departure from standard restaurant fare and catering to a clientele eager to explore new flavors and cultures.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Shambhala Kitchen, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere that reflects the tranquility and hospitality of the Himalayan region. Our staff is trained not only in culinary expertise but also in providing exceptional customer service, ensuring every guest feels welcomed and valued. We aim to create a personal connection with our customers, sharing stories and insights about the dishes and the culture they represent. Our commitment extends beyond providing excellent food; we host occasional cultural events, such as traditional music performances and art exhibitions, to further enrich the dining experience and connect with the local community. Shambhala Kitchen actively engages with local organizations and participates in community events, solidifying its role as a positive and contributing member of the Assam business landscape. We regularly seek feedback from our customers and utilize it to improve our offerings and services, ensuring we consistently meet and exceed their expectations.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Shambhala Kitchen envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its authentic Tibetan and Himalayan cuisine, exceptional customer service, and commitment to the community. Future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate seasonal dishes and regional specialties, introducing cooking classes and workshops to share our culinary expertise with the public, and potentially opening additional locations within Assam and beyond. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their products in our cafe, further promoting the region\'s rich cultural heritage. Our long-term goal is to establish Shambhala Kitchen as a sustainable and socially responsible business, contributing to the economic growth of Assam while preserving and celebrating the unique culinary traditions of the Himalayas. We are committed to innovation and continuous improvement, constantly seeking new ways to enhance the dining experience and exceed customer expectations, ensuring Shambhala Kitchen remains a cherished culinary gem in the heart of Assam.\n</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:35:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1773, 'Guwahati Coffee House', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Guwahati Coffee House aims to be more than just a place to grab a cup of coffee; it aspires to be a cornerstone of the community, a haven for conversation, and a celebration of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage, all served with the finest locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. Situated in the heart of Guwahati, it carves a unique niche within the city\'s burgeoning cafe scene by blending traditional Assamese hospitality with contemporary coffee culture.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Guwahati Coffee House offers a curated selection of coffee beverages, ranging from expertly pulled espresso-based drinks to traditional Assamese black tea preparations. The coffee beans, where feasible, are sourced from nearby estates, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. Beyond coffee, the menu boasts a range of handcrafted teas, refreshing iced beverages, and a selection of locally inspired snacks and light meals. Our unique selling point lies not only in the quality of our ingredients but also in our commitment to showcasing Assam\'s culinary traditions. The \"Jolpan Platter,\" for instance, features traditional Assamese breakfast items, offering a taste of local flavors to both residents and tourists alike. This dedication to authenticity sets us apart from generic coffee chains and positions us as a destination that celebrates the region\'s distinct identity. The menu is designed to cater to a wide spectrum of palates, from those seeking a familiar caffeine fix to adventurous foodies eager to explore local tastes. We also offer vegan and gluten-free options, ensuring inclusivity for all customers.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Guwahati Coffee House. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere where patrons feel comfortable lingering, working, or connecting with friends. Our staff is trained not only in coffee preparation but also in providing genuine and attentive service, anticipating customer needs and fostering a sense of community. The interior design incorporates elements of Assamese art and craftsmanship, creating a visually appealing and culturally relevant space. We regularly host local artists, musicians, and storytellers, providing a platform for creative expression and enriching the cultural landscape of Guwahati. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the cafe, catering to students and professionals seeking a productive workspace. We also actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools and charitable organizations, participating in local events and contributing to the well-being of the city. Our commitment extends to ethical sourcing and sustainable practices. We are working to minimize our environmental footprint through waste reduction programs and the use of eco-friendly materials.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Guwahati Coffee House envisions becoming a premier destination for coffee lovers and cultural enthusiasts alike. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and collaborating with local artisans to showcase their crafts. We aim to establish a roasting facility to further enhance the quality and freshness of our coffee beans, while also providing employment opportunities for the local community. Branching out to other strategic locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam is also a consideration for long-term growth. Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of offering coffee brewing workshops and cultural immersion experiences to educate and engage our customers. Our ultimate goal is to create a sustainable and impactful business that contributes to the economic and cultural vitality of Assam, solidifying Guwahati Coffee House as a cherished landmark in the city.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:35:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1774, 'Lush - The Café', 'Cafes', '', 'Lush - The Café, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at House No. 12 Jorpukhuri, Gautam Krishna Kunj, Lamb Rd, is more than just a café; it\'s a culinary haven designed to offer a refreshing and enriching experience within the local Assam business landscape. We strive to be a cornerstone of the community, a place where friends gather, ideas are exchanged, and memories are made, all while indulging in high-quality food and beverages in a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. We understand the unique character of Assam and aim to reflect it in our ambiance, menu, and overall customer experience, setting us apart from typical coffee shops and eateries.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLush - The Café\'s core offerings revolve around providing a diverse and satisfying culinary experience. Our menu boasts a carefully curated selection of dishes, ranging from traditional Assamese snacks and light meals, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, to continental favorites with a modern twist. We offer a variety of artisanal coffees and teas, refreshing beverages, and delectable desserts, catering to a wide range of palates and preferences. A unique selling point is our focus on incorporating local Assamese flavors and ingredients into our menu, creating dishes that are both familiar and innovative. We also pride ourselves on our commitment to providing vegetarian and vegan options, ensuring that there\'s something for everyone to enjoy. The café also plans to offer a small selection of locally produced artisanal goods for sale, further supporting the Assam business community. This multifaceted approach allows us to meet the local market needs for quality food, diverse options, and a celebration of local culture.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Lush - The Café, customer experience is paramount. We believe in providing exceptional service that goes beyond simply taking orders and delivering food. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The ambiance of the café is designed to be warm and inviting, with comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and a relaxing atmosphere. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and services. We also strive to connect with the local community by hosting events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing the work of regional talent, and workshops that celebrate Assamese culture and traditions. This focus on community engagement helps us foster a strong sense of belonging and build lasting relationships with our customers, making Lush - The Café a true community hub.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Lush - The Café envisions significant growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as a recognized and respected brand within the Guwahati food and beverage industry. We plan to expand our menu to include more innovative dishes and beverages, continuously adapting to evolving customer preferences. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and potentially expanding to other cities in Assam. To achieve this, we are committed to investing in our staff, improving our operational efficiency, and strengthening our marketing efforts. We also recognize the importance of sustainability and plan to implement eco-friendly practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to a more sustainable future for Assam. Our vision is to not only be a successful business but also a positive force within the community, promoting local culture, supporting local businesses, and providing a valuable service to the people of Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLush - The Café is dedicated to creating a vibrant and welcoming space that celebrates the rich culture and culinary heritage of Assam, while offering a contemporary café experience that meets the needs of a modern audience. Through a combination of exceptional food and beverages, outstanding customer service, and a commitment to community engagement, Lush - The Café aims to be a beloved destination for locals and visitors alike.', 'House No. 12 Jorpukhuri, Gautam Krishna Kunj, Lamb Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:35:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1775, 'Verandah - A Book Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Verandah – A Book Cafe offers a unique haven in the heart of Geetanagar, Assam, situated conveniently next to the police station on Mother Teresa Road. More than just a cafe, Verandah provides a curated space where the community can connect over literature, freshly brewed coffee, and a menu designed to complement both. In Assam\'s vibrant cultural landscape, Verandah fills a specific niche by providing a tranquil retreat amidst the bustling city life, fostering a love for reading and creating a platform for local artists and writers. It contributes to the region’s growing appreciation for literary arts and provides a much-needed space for intellectual exchange. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, Verandah offers a dual experience: a carefully selected bookstore and a cozy cafe. The bookstore component focuses on a diverse range of genres, from contemporary fiction and classic literature to regional Assamese writings and non-fiction works that cater to a broad spectrum of interests. We specifically highlight local authors, providing them with a platform to showcase their talents and connect with readers. The cafe aspect complements the reading experience by offering a selection of expertly prepared coffee, teas, and other beverages, alongside a menu of light meals and snacks designed to be enjoyed while reading or engaging in conversation. Our unique selling point lies in the synergy between these two elements; customers can browse books while enjoying a cup of coffee, participate in book clubs, attend author events, and simply relax in a literary atmosphere. The menu features locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, appealing to customers who value fresh, regional products. The carefully chosen selection aims to cater to the evolving tastes of the local community, offering a welcoming space for students, professionals, and book lovers of all ages. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Verandah places immense emphasis on creating a memorable and welcoming customer experience. Staff are trained not only to provide efficient service but also to offer knowledgeable recommendations on books and beverages. The atmosphere is carefully cultivated to be both comfortable and inspiring, with comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and a quiet ambiance conducive to reading and conversation. We strive to create a sense of community by hosting regular events such as book launches, poetry readings, and open mic nights, fostering a vibrant literary scene and connecting local artists with their audience. Beyond these events, Verandah actively engages with the local community through partnerships with schools and libraries, promoting literacy and a love of reading among younger generations. We also actively solicit feedback from our customers and adapt our offerings to meet their needs and preferences, ensuring that Verandah remains a cherished hub within the Geetanagar community. The cafe regularly updates its social media platforms to engage the community with events, new book arrivals and community initiatives. </p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Verandah envisions significant growth potential. We plan to expand our book selection to include a wider range of international titles and specialized genres, further catering to the diverse interests of our customers. We aim to enhance the cafe menu with innovative dishes and beverage options, focusing on seasonal ingredients and locally inspired flavors. Future plans include establishing an online presence with an e-commerce platform to reach a broader audience beyond the Geetanagar area, allowing customers to browse and purchase books online. We also intend to increase collaborations with local artists and writers, offering workshops, residencies, and other opportunities to support their creative endeavors. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Verandah experience to a wider community. By continuing to focus on exceptional customer service, a curated selection of books, and a commitment to the local community, Verandah aims to become a leading cultural hub in the region, fostering a love for reading and supporting the growth of the literary arts. </p>', 'Police station, Mother Teresa Rd, next to Geetanagar', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:40:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1776, 'QALAA', 'Cafes', '', '<p>QALAA, nestled in the heart of Assam, is more than just a business; it\'s a testament to the region\'s rich heritage and entrepreneurial spirit. Standing as a unique entity within the local business landscape, QALAA is committed to providing exceptional services tailored to the specific needs of the Assamese community. We strive to blend modern business practices with a deep understanding of local culture and traditions, fostering sustainable growth and contributing to the overall prosperity of the region. QALAA aims to be a cornerstone of innovation and reliability, earning the trust of our customers and partners alike.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, QALAA specializes in [State the specific industry, e.g., sustainable handicrafts, eco-tourism, authentic Assamese cuisine, digital marketing solutions for local businesses]. Our primary offerings include [Specifically list 3-5 key services or products, e.g., handcrafted Eri silk shawls, guided tours of tea gardens, traditional Assamese thalis, social media management for small businesses, website design services in Assamese]. What distinguishes QALAA from its competitors is our unwavering commitment to [Mention key differentiators, e.g., ethical sourcing of materials, personalized customer experiences, use of authentic recipes passed down through generations, deep understanding of the Assamese language and culture, focus on environmentally responsible practices]. These unique selling points ensure that QALAA not only meets the functional needs of the market but also resonates with the cultural values and preferences of our target audience. For example, our [Specific service/product] is designed to address the local need for [Specific need] by [How the service/product addresses the need], thereby creating significant value for our customers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at QALAA. We believe in fostering genuine connections with our customers, treating each interaction as an opportunity to build lasting relationships. Our customer service approach is characterized by [Describe specific customer service qualities, e.g., personalized attention, prompt responsiveness, proactive communication, cultural sensitivity]. What truly sets QALAA apart is our dedication to understanding the unique needs and preferences of our local community. We actively engage with our customers through [Specific examples of engagement, e.g., community events, online forums, feedback surveys, collaborations with local artisans]. This allows us to continuously improve our services and tailor them to better serve the evolving needs of the Assamese market. We also strive to contribute positively to the community through [Specific initiatives, e.g., supporting local charities, sponsoring cultural events, providing employment opportunities to underprivileged individuals, promoting sustainable practices]. By actively participating in the local ecosystem, QALAA aims to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a valued and respected member of the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, QALAA envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. Our potential lies in [Identify specific areas for growth, e.g., expanding our product line, reaching new markets, establishing strategic partnerships, leveraging technology]. We plan to achieve this by [Outline key strategies for growth, e.g., investing in research and development, strengthening our online presence, expanding our distribution network, developing innovative marketing campaigns]. Our long-term goals include [Mention long-term aspirations, e.g., becoming a leading provider of [Service/Product] in Assam, establishing a national presence, contributing to the economic development of the region, promoting Assamese culture on a global scale]. QALAA is committed to building a sustainable and ethical business that not only delivers exceptional value to our customers but also makes a positive impact on the environment and the community. We believe that by staying true to our values and embracing innovation, QALAA can achieve its ambitious goals and become a true success story in the Assam business landscape.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:40:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1777, 'Kalita Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Kalita Cafe, a vibrant and welcoming establishment located in the heart of Guwahati, is more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a cultural hub celebrating the rich heritage of Assam while offering a modern cafe experience. We stand out in the burgeoning Assam business landscape by blending traditional Assamese flavors and hospitality with contemporary cafe culture, creating a unique space where locals and tourists alike can connect, relax, and savor the essence of Assam. Kalita Cafe is committed to sourcing local ingredients and supporting regional artisans, further solidifying our position as a socially responsible and culturally aware business.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Kalita Cafe, our core offering revolves around providing a diverse and satisfying culinary experience. We specialize in handcrafted coffee beverages, using locally sourced coffee beans whenever possible, ensuring a rich and aromatic experience. Alongside our coffee selection, we offer a tempting array of traditional Assamese snacks and dishes, such as pitha, laru, and a variety of savory preparations that showcase the region\'s unique culinary traditions. Our menu also includes familiar cafe favorites, catering to a wider range of tastes and preferences. <br> <br> A key differentiator for Kalita Cafe is our commitment to authenticity and quality. We prioritize using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, supporting local farmers and producers. Our chefs and baristas are trained to expertly prepare traditional Assamese recipes while maintaining the highest standards of hygiene and presentation. We also feature unique, Assam-inspired beverage creations that cannot be found anywhere else. By harmonizing authentic Assamese cuisine with contemporary cafe staples, we cater to both the nostalgia of local residents and the curiosity of tourists eager to explore the region\'s culinary heritage. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Kalita Cafe\'s philosophy. We strive to create a warm, inviting, and personalized atmosphere for every visitor. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about our menu and the local area. We encourage interaction and are always happy to share stories about Assamese culture and traditions. Our goal is to make every customer feel like a valued guest. <br> <br> We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We host cultural events, such as Assamese music performances and traditional craft workshops, providing a platform for local artists and artisans. We also partner with local NGOs and organizations to support social causes and promote community development. By fostering a strong connection with the community, we aim to be more than just a cafe; we aspire to be a gathering place where people can come together, celebrate their culture, and contribute to the vibrancy of Assam. We regularly seek feedback from our customers to ensure we are continually improving our service and meeting their needs.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Kalita Cafe envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. Our long-term goal is to establish Kalita Cafe as a leading brand representing Assam\'s rich culinary and cultural heritage across India and beyond. We plan to expand our menu to include more regional delicacies and introduce innovative, Assam-inspired culinary creations. We also aim to open additional locations, strategically positioned to cater to a broader audience while maintaining the unique charm and character of our original cafe. <br> <br> Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to develop a line of packaged Assamese food products, such as tea, coffee, and traditional snacks, which can be sold both online and in retail stores. This will allow us to extend our brand reach and share the flavors of Assam with a wider audience. We are also committed to investing in training and development for our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to provide exceptional service and contribute to the continued success of Kalita Cafe. Our vision is to build a sustainable and socially responsible business that celebrates Assam\'s culture, supports the local economy, and provides a memorable experience for every customer. We plan to integrate sustainable practices into all aspects of our operations, from sourcing ingredients to waste management, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to a greener future.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:40:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1778, 'Bagan: Poolside Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Bagan: Poolside Cafe, nestled within the serene embrace of The Greenwood Resort in Assam, offers a unique and refreshing dining experience that seamlessly blends relaxation with culinary delight. More than just a cafe, Bagan is an oasis, a place where guests can unwind by the shimmering pool while savouring meticulously crafted dishes and beverages. In the vibrant Assam business landscape, Bagan distinguishes itself by offering a sophisticated yet approachable atmosphere, catering to both resort guests and local residents seeking a refined escape from the everyday.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Bagan\'s offerings are its carefully curated menu and attentive service. The cafe boasts a diverse selection of dishes, ranging from light and refreshing salads and sandwiches perfect for poolside snacking to more substantial meals featuring both local Assamese flavors and international cuisine. Fresh, locally sourced ingredients are prioritized, ensuring vibrant flavors and supporting regional farmers. A highlight of the menu is the dedicated section showcasing traditional Assamese snacks and dishes, providing a taste of the region\'s culinary heritage to both domestic and international guests. The beverage selection complements the food perfectly, with freshly brewed coffees, artisanal teas, refreshing mocktails, and a selection of wines and beers. What truly sets Bagan apart is its commitment to providing personalized service. The staff is trained to anticipate guests\' needs and create a welcoming and attentive atmosphere, ensuring every visit is a memorable one. This focus on quality and personalized service addresses a growing demand in the local market for elevated dining experiences within a relaxed and picturesque setting.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Bagan prioritizes creating a memorable and enriching customer experience. The ambiance is carefully cultivated to promote relaxation and enjoyment, with comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and the soothing presence of the surrounding greenery and pool. The staff is dedicated to providing attentive and friendly service, ensuring each guest feels welcomed and valued. Beyond exceptional service, Bagan actively connects with the local community. The cafe regularly hosts events and promotions, such as live music performances showcasing local artists and themed dining nights that celebrate Assamese culture and cuisine. By partnering with local artisans and suppliers, Bagan contributes to the economic growth of the region and fosters a sense of community pride. Furthermore, Bagan actively engages with its customers on social media, sharing updates on new menu items, special events, and highlighting the stories of local suppliers. This creates a transparent and engaging dialogue, further strengthening its connection with the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, Bagan: Poolside Cafe envisions expanding its offerings and solidifying its position as a leading destination for relaxed and refined dining in the region. Future plans include introducing seasonal menu variations that showcase the best of Assam\'s local produce throughout the year. There are also plans to expand the cafe\'s event hosting capabilities, offering tailored packages for private parties and corporate gatherings. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Bagan aims to further reduce its environmental footprint by implementing eco-friendly practices, such as minimizing waste and sourcing more ingredients from sustainable local farms. Long-term goals include establishing Bagan as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, relaxation, and authentic Assamese hospitality. By continuously innovating and adapting to evolving customer preferences, Bagan: Poolside Cafe is poised for continued growth and success, contributing positively to the vibrant business landscape of Assam and providing a unique and memorable experience for its valued guests.</p>', 'The Greenwood Resort', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:40:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1779, 'Tea Villa Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<article>\n<h1>Tea Villa Cafe: A Contemporary Tea Experience in the Heart of Guwahati</h1>\n\n<p>Tea Villa Cafe, strategically located on the 5th Floor of Supreme Tower, GS Rd, near the foot over bridge in Guwahati, Assam, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a destination designed to elevate the tea-drinking experience. In a region renowned for its tea heritage, Tea Villa Cafe distinguishes itself by blending traditional appreciation with a modern, globally-inspired approach. We cater to a discerning clientele seeking both familiar comforts and exciting new flavors, contributing a unique vibrancy to the evolving Assam business landscape. The cafe is positioned as a sophisticated, yet approachable, space for business meetings, casual gatherings, and moments of personal indulgence.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of Tea Villa Cafe lies an extensive menu focused on high-quality teas sourced from both local Assam gardens and renowned tea regions worldwide. We offer a diverse selection ranging from classic Assam black teas and delicate green teas to herbal infusions and specialty blends. Each tea is meticulously prepared, ensuring optimal flavor extraction and a truly satisfying cup. Beyond tea, our cafe boasts a delectable array of complementary offerings. Patrons can indulge in freshly baked pastries, savory snacks, and light meals, all carefully crafted to complement the tea selection. Our skilled chefs prepare everything with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, adding to the overall quality and supporting the regional economy. Unique selling points include our curated tea flights, allowing guests to sample a variety of teas in a single sitting, and our expertly paired food and tea combinations, designed to tantalize the taste buds. Furthermore, Tea Villa Cafe features a selection of specialty coffees and other beverages to cater to diverse preferences. This blend of traditional tea culture with modern cafe offerings addresses a growing local demand for sophisticated, high-quality food and beverage experiences, providing an alternative to standard coffee shops and traditional tea houses.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>The Tea Villa Cafe Customer Experience: Connecting with the Community</h2>\n\n<p>Customer service at Tea Villa Cafe is paramount. We believe in fostering a warm, welcoming atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our tea selection, providing personalized recommendations and guidance to enhance the customer experience. We actively solicit feedback and continuously strive to improve our offerings and service standards. What truly sets Tea Villa Cafe apart is our commitment to connecting with the local community. We regularly host events, such as tea tasting sessions, live music performances, and art exhibitions, creating a vibrant hub for cultural exchange and social interaction. We also partner with local businesses and organizations to promote regional products and initiatives. We aim to become an integral part of the community, not just a place to enjoy a cup of tea, but a space for connection, creativity, and shared experiences. The accessibility provided by the location near the foot over bridge also contributes to higher customer traffic.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Brewing Success and Expansion</h2>\n\n<p>Tea Villa Cafe envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading tea destination in Guwahati and beyond. Our immediate plans include introducing seasonal tea menus, showcasing the unique flavors of Assam\'s diverse tea harvests throughout the year. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our online presence, offering tea subscriptions and curated gift boxes to reach a wider audience. Long-term goals involve opening additional Tea Villa Cafe locations in other key cities in Assam and potentially other regions, bringing our unique tea experience to a broader market. Furthermore, we are committed to sustainability and ethical sourcing, ensuring that our teas are produced in a responsible manner, supporting local tea farmers and protecting the environment. We aim to become a model for sustainable business practices in the Assam region, demonstrating that business success can go hand in hand with social and environmental responsibility. Our ultimate ambition is to elevate the appreciation of tea culture, fostering a deeper understanding of its rich history and diverse flavors, and becoming a global ambassador for Assam tea.</p>\n\n</article>', '5th Floor, Supreme Tower, GS Rd, near foot over bridge', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:40:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
