(1790, 'Smuk lounge and cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'Smuk Lounge & Cafe: A Tranquil Oasis Near Vrindawan Garden\n\nNestled near the vibrant Pinaki Path, adjacent to the serene Vrindawan Garden, Smuk Lounge & Cafe offers a refreshing escape from the hustle and bustle of daily life. More than just a cafe, Smuk is envisioned as a community hub, a place where friends gather, ideas flourish, and moments of tranquility are savored. Situated in a rapidly developing area of Assam, Smuk addresses the growing demand for sophisticated yet comfortable spaces that cater to both social gatherings and individual relaxation. It aims to distinguish itself in the local business landscape by offering a unique blend of high-quality food and beverages, a soothing ambiance, and a strong commitment to fostering community engagement.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Smuk Lounge & Cafe provides a curated selection of beverages and light fare. Our offerings range from expertly crafted coffee and specialty teas to refreshing mocktails and artisanal fruit blends. The food menu features delectable pastries, light sandwiches, and locally inspired snacks, all prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients. A significant differentiator is our commitment to sourcing locally whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers and ensuring the freshness and authenticity of our offerings. We also cater to various dietary needs, offering vegetarian and gluten-free options to ensure that everyone can find something to enjoy. Beyond the menu, Smuk provides a comfortable and inviting space, designed with a modern minimalist aesthetic that promotes relaxation and productivity. Free Wi-Fi is available throughout the cafe, making it an ideal spot for remote work, study sessions, or casual browsing. The cafe also hosts occasional events, such as live music performances and art exhibitions, further enriching the customer experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nSmuk\'s approach to customer service is rooted in creating a welcoming and personalized experience. Our staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about our menu offerings, providing recommendations and catering to individual preferences. We prioritize building genuine relationships with our customers, remembering their names and preferred orders, and creating a sense of belonging. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our services and offerings. Beyond individual interactions, Smuk aims to connect with the local community by participating in local events and initiatives. We partner with local artists and artisans to showcase their work, creating opportunities for them to reach a wider audience. We also support local charities and organizations through fundraising events and donations. This commitment to community engagement helps us to build strong relationships with our neighbors and establish Smuk as a valuable asset to the area.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Smuk Lounge & Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion within the local market. Our immediate plans involve expanding our menu to include more substantial meal options, catering to lunch and dinner crowds. We are also exploring the possibility of introducing a loyalty program to reward our frequent customers and encourage repeat business. Longer-term goals include opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, replicating the Smuk experience while adapting to the specific needs and preferences of each local community. We also aspire to become a recognized brand, synonymous with quality, comfort, and community engagement. We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers and the changing dynamics of the local market. Ultimately, our vision is to establish Smuk Lounge & Cafe as a cornerstone of the local community, a place where people can connect, relax, and create lasting memories. We aim to not just offer food and beverages but to provide an experience that enriches the lives of those we serve.', 'near, Pinaki Path, near vrindawan garden', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:55:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1791, 'Cafe Riverrun', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Cafe Riverrun, nestled at 47 Moheshwar Cottage on MG Rd, offers a unique and refreshing haven in the heart of Assam. More than just a cafe, Riverrun strives to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect, relax, and enjoy high-quality food and beverages in a welcoming and aesthetically pleasing environment. Positioned strategically on MG Road, a vital artery of commercial and social activity, Riverrun aims to become a recognizable and cherished landmark within the local business landscape, contributing to its vibrancy and character. We differentiate ourselves by combining a contemporary cafe experience with a deep appreciation for Assamese culture and locally sourced ingredients, appealing to a broad demographic seeking quality and authenticity.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, Cafe Riverrun provides a comprehensive cafe experience. This includes a diverse menu featuring freshly brewed coffee sourced from local Assam estates, a selection of teas highlighting regional specialties, and a range of cold beverages catering to varied preferences. Beyond beverages, Riverrun offers a carefully curated menu of food items, encompassing breakfast options like traditional Assamese jolpan with a modern twist, light lunches, and delectable pastries. A significant selling point is our commitment to using locally sourced, seasonal ingredients whenever possible. This supports local farmers and producers, ensures freshness, and allows us to showcase the unique flavors of Assam. To meet the needs of the local market, we also offer vegetarian and vegan options, recognizing the growing demand for plant-based meals. Furthermore, recognizing the importance of connectivity, Riverrun provides complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, making it an ideal spot for students, professionals, and travelers seeking a productive and comfortable workspace.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Cafe Riverrun. We are committed to providing attentive and personalized service that exceeds expectations. Our staff is trained not only to efficiently fulfill orders but also to engage with customers, offer recommendations, and create a genuinely welcoming atmosphere. We believe in fostering a sense of community within our cafe. To achieve this, we host occasional events such as open mic nights featuring local musicians, art exhibitions showcasing the work of regional artists, and workshops on coffee brewing and tea tasting. This commitment to community engagement allows us to connect with our customers on a deeper level and establish Riverrun as a space where people can come together, share ideas, and celebrate local talent. The ambiance of Cafe Riverrun is carefully curated to provide a relaxing and inspiring environment, reflecting Assam’s natural beauty. From the decor to the music, every detail is designed to enhance the overall customer experience and create a memorable visit.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Cafe Riverrun is ambitious and forward-thinking. While consolidating its position as a leading cafe on MG Road is the immediate priority, the long-term goal is to expand its reach and impact within the region. We envision opening additional locations in other key areas of Assam, each retaining the unique character and community focus that defines Riverrun. We also plan to further develop our partnerships with local farmers and producers, increasing our reliance on sustainably sourced ingredients. Exploring opportunities to offer online ordering and delivery services to cater to a wider customer base is also under consideration. In addition, we aim to become a recognized advocate for Assamese culture and cuisine, actively promoting the region\'s rich heritage through our menu, events, and community initiatives. Ultimately, Cafe Riverrun aspires to be more than just a successful business; it aims to be a positive force in the local community, contributing to its economic growth, cultural vibrancy, and overall well-being.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Furthermore, we are investigating the possibility of developing a signature line of packaged coffee and tea blends, allowing customers to enjoy the Riverrun experience at home. These products would be carefully crafted using the finest locally sourced ingredients and packaged in an aesthetically pleasing manner, reflecting the brand\'s commitment to quality and authenticity. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster a stronger sense of connection with the Cafe Riverrun brand. This program will offer exclusive discounts, special offers, and early access to events, further enhancing the customer experience and encouraging repeat business. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the local market, Cafe Riverrun is confident in its ability to achieve its long-term goals and solidify its position as a leading destination for coffee, community, and culture in Assam.</p>', '47 Moheshwar Cottage, MG Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:55:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1792, 'Cafe Craft', 'Cafes', '', 'Cafe Craft: A Culinary and Creative Hub in the Heart of Pension Para\n\nCafe Craft, nestled at Goswami Service, 54, Pension Para Rd, is more than just a café; it\'s a vibrant community hub that blends artisanal coffee, delectable food, and creative expression in the heart of Assam. Recognizing a need for a space where locals could connect, create, and enjoy high-quality, locally-sourced refreshments, Cafe Craft was envisioned as a unique addition to the Pension Para landscape, offering a distinct experience that caters to a diverse clientele. From students seeking a quiet study spot to families looking for a relaxing weekend brunch, and artists searching for inspiration, Cafe Craft aims to be a welcoming haven for all. The cafe distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, community engagement, and a celebration of local talent.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Cafe Craft provides a carefully curated menu featuring specialty coffee, prepared with locally roasted beans that emphasize the unique flavor profiles of Assam\'s rich coffee-growing region. Beyond coffee, the cafe offers a diverse selection of teas, refreshing beverages, and a food menu designed to satisfy a range of tastes. Customers can indulge in freshly baked pastries, sandwiches made with locally sourced bread, and regional Assamese delicacies prepared with traditional recipes and modern culinary techniques. The cafe takes pride in its ability to cater to various dietary needs, offering vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options. What truly sets Cafe Craft apart is its unique integration of creative arts. The cafe regularly hosts art exhibitions, open mic nights, and creative workshops, providing a platform for local artists and performers to showcase their talents. This dedication to supporting the local arts community reinforces Cafe Craft’s position as a cultural center, not just a place to grab a coffee.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Cafe Craft. The cafe is designed to be welcoming and inclusive, with comfortable seating arrangements, a warm and inviting atmosphere, and attentive service. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and the local area, providing recommendations and assisting customers with their needs. Cafe Craft understands the importance of building strong relationships with the local community. It actively participates in local events, sponsors community initiatives, and collaborates with nearby businesses. By fostering a sense of belonging and contributing to the well-being of the community, Cafe Craft aims to be more than just a business; it strives to be a valuable asset to Pension Para. The cafe also utilizes social media platforms to engage with customers, share updates, and promote local events, fostering a strong online community in addition to its physical presence. The focus is always on creating a personalized and memorable experience for each visitor, ensuring they leave feeling valued and eager to return.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Cafe Craft envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a leading culinary and creative destination in the region. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties, sourcing more ingredients directly from local farmers and producers, and increasing the frequency and variety of creative events. There\'s also potential to introduce a loyalty program to reward regular customers and foster stronger relationships. A key goal is to establish partnerships with local schools and organizations to offer educational workshops and mentorship programs focused on culinary arts and creative expression. By continually innovating and adapting to the needs of the community, Cafe Craft aims to achieve sustainable growth while maintaining its commitment to quality, community engagement, and a celebration of local talent. The long-term vision is to replicate the Cafe Craft model in other locations across Assam, creating a network of community hubs that promote local culture and foster a thriving creative ecosystem.', 'Goswami Service, 54, Pension Para Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:55:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1793, '37 Street Affair - Food. Comfort. Flavour - Since 2017', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Established in 2017, 37 Street Affair – Food. Comfort. Flavour – has become a beloved culinary destination on Panjabari Rd, specifically located at 92, Panjabari Rd, in the heart of Assam. More than just a restaurant, 37 Street Affair is an experience, a place where modern culinary techniques meet the warmth of Assamese hospitality. It represents a unique blend in the local business landscape, offering a contemporary dining experience while remaining deeply rooted in the region’s cultural identity and culinary traditions. Its sustained success demonstrates a deep understanding of local preferences, combined with a commitment to quality and innovation that sets it apart from traditional eateries and fast-food chains prevalent in the area.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, 37 Street Affair offers a diverse menu designed to tantalize taste buds and cater to a wide range of palates. The primary offerings include a curated selection of globally-inspired dishes prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, guaranteeing freshness and supporting regional farmers. The menu features expertly crafted pizzas with unique flavour combinations, hearty burgers made with premium quality meats, and a variety of continental dishes, from pasta to flavorful rice bowls. A signature selection of Assamese-inspired dishes are also available, incorporating traditional flavors and techniques to create a modern interpretation of classic regional cuisine. Unique selling points include the commitment to using fresh, high-quality ingredients, the innovative menu that combines global trends with local tastes, and the meticulous attention to detail in both food presentation and service. These offerings specifically address a growing need in the local market for a dining establishment that provides a refined yet approachable culinary experience, bridging the gap between casual dining and fine dining establishments. The restaurant also boasts a dedicated beverage menu featuring signature mocktails, refreshing beverages and a curated selection of wines and spirits that complement the food offerings.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at 37 Street Affair. The approach to customer service is built on principles of attentiveness, efficiency, and genuine hospitality. Staff members are trained to anticipate needs, provide informed recommendations, and ensure that every guest feels valued and comfortable. What truly makes the business stand out is its ability to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, making it a preferred spot for families, friends, and colleagues alike. The interior design, carefully curated to provide a modern yet cozy ambiance, further enhances the dining experience. Beyond the immediate customer interactions, 37 Street Affair actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, partnerships with local businesses, and support for local initiatives. This active community engagement has fostered a strong sense of loyalty among its customers, solidifying its position as a neighborhood favourite and a valued contributor to the local economy.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for 37 Street Affair involves strategic growth and expansion while maintaining its commitment to quality and community engagement. Plans are in place to explore opportunities for expanding its footprint, possibly through the establishment of additional locations within Assam or even venturing into other Northeast Indian states. This expansion will be carefully managed to ensure that the brand\'s core values and commitment to quality are not compromised. There are also plans to enhance the menu offerings, introducing new and exciting dishes that continue to reflect the latest culinary trends while celebrating the unique flavours of Assam. Investment in technology is also a key focus, with plans to implement online ordering platforms, streamline operational processes, and enhance customer engagement through digital channels. The long-term goal is to establish 37 Street Affair as a leading culinary brand in Northeast India, recognized for its innovative menu, exceptional customer service, and unwavering commitment to the local community. By focusing on sustainable growth, continuous improvement, and a strong brand identity, 37 Street Affair is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and continue to delight customers for years to come.</p>', '92, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:55:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1794, 'Café LICA', 'Cafes', '', 'Café LICA, situated on the 1st Floor of Aruna Tower, strategically located below the CEC Centre on Lakhimi Path, Main Road, is a vibrant and welcoming café that aims to be more than just a place to grab a coffee. It\'s envisioned as a community hub, a space for connection, and a provider of quality food and beverages in the heart of Assam. Nestled within a bustling commercial area, Café LICA provides a relaxing escape from the everyday hustle, offering a unique blend of contemporary café culture and traditional Assamese hospitality. Its significance lies in catering to a diverse clientele, from students and professionals seeking a productive workspace to families and friends looking for a comfortable place to socialize. Café LICA aims to be an integral part of the local business landscape by fostering a welcoming atmosphere and contributing positively to the community.\n<br> <br>\nCafé LICA\'s core offerings revolve around providing a diverse menu of high-quality food and beverages. Coffee, sourced from carefully selected beans, forms the cornerstone of the beverage selection, with a range of espresso-based drinks, from classic cappuccinos and lattes to innovative signature blends. A wide array of teas, including locally sourced Assamese tea, cater to diverse preferences. Beyond beverages, the café offers a curated selection of snacks, light meals, and desserts. This includes pastries, sandwiches, and salads, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. A key unique selling point is the café\'s commitment to incorporating Assamese culinary influences into its menu. Expect to find traditional Assamese snacks and dishes alongside familiar café staples, offering a unique culinary experience. This blending of familiar and local flavors caters directly to the local market’s desire for both convenience and cultural authenticity. Furthermore, the availability of high-speed Wi-Fi provides a conducive environment for students and professionals, solidifying the café\'s position as a preferred working and meeting space.\n<br> <br>\nAt Café LICA, customer experience is paramount. The approach to customer service is centered on creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and welcomed. Staff are trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, offering personalized recommendations and addressing individual needs. The café’s ambiance is carefully designed to be both aesthetically pleasing and functional, with comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and tasteful décor that reflects a contemporary yet locally inspired aesthetic. What sets Café LICA apart is its commitment to fostering a strong connection with the local community. This is achieved through various initiatives, such as hosting local artist exhibitions, organizing community events, and supporting local businesses. Furthermore, the café actively seeks feedback from its customers to continually improve its offerings and ensure it remains responsive to the needs of the community. The aim is to create a space where people feel a sense of belonging and where Café LICA becomes an integral part of their daily lives.\n<br> <br>\nCafé LICA envisions itself as a growing and evolving business with significant potential for expansion and long-term success. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate a wider range of Assamese culinary delights, further solidifying its position as a unique dining destination. Exploring partnerships with local farmers and producers to source ingredients directly would further enhance the café\'s commitment to supporting the local economy and ensuring the freshness and quality of its offerings. The business also aims to expand its catering services to cater to local businesses and events, providing a convenient and high-quality food and beverage solution for various occasions. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other strategic areas of Assam, replicating the successful model of Café LICA while adapting to the specific needs and preferences of each local market. Ultimately, Café LICA aspires to become a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, community, and authentic Assamese hospitality. The goal is to create a lasting legacy as a business that not only provides excellent food and beverages but also contributes positively to the cultural and economic fabric of Assam.', '1st Floor, Aruna Tower Below CEC Centre, Lakhimi Path, main, road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 16:55:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1795, 'K Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>K Cafe, nestled atop Ratnagiri Tower at Public Health Tinali on Hengrabari Rd, presents a distinctive and refreshing addition to the burgeoning café culture of Assam. More than just a place to grab a coffee, K Cafe aims to be a vibrant social hub, offering a unique blend of modern café experiences with a touch of local warmth and hospitality. Situated in a prime location with panoramic rooftop views, K Cafe stands out as an oasis amidst the bustling city, promising a relaxed atmosphere and a carefully curated menu designed to cater to diverse tastes.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its heart, K Cafe is a purveyor of exceptional coffee. We meticulously source high-quality beans, roasted to perfection, and expertly brewed by our skilled baristas. Our coffee menu features a range of classic espresso-based drinks, innovative specialty brews, and refreshing iced coffees. Beyond coffee, we offer a diverse selection of beverages, including artisanal teas, handcrafted lemonades, and invigorating smoothies. Complementing our drinks menu is a delectable array of food offerings. From freshly baked pastries and wholesome sandwiches to light meals and shareable platters, our menu is designed to provide satisfying options throughout the day. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, infusing our offerings with the authentic flavors of Assam and supporting local farmers and producers. The rooftop location is also key, providing a unique selling point of al fresco dining with exceptional views. This meets the growing demand for sophisticated yet accessible dining experiences that resonate with the local community and attract tourists alike. K Cafe offers a premium experience without the premium price tag.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at K Cafe. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that each visit is memorable. From the moment a customer walks through the door, they are greeted with a warm smile and a genuine desire to cater to their needs. We pay meticulous attention to detail, from the carefully chosen music to the comfortable seating arrangements, all designed to create a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. Beyond the standard café experience, K Cafe actively seeks to connect with the local community. We host regular events such as live music performances, open mic nights, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local artists and performers to showcase their talent. We also partner with local organizations to support community initiatives and promote social causes. We aim to be more than just a business; we strive to be a positive force in the community, fostering connections and creating a sense of belonging.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, K Cafe envisions itself as a leading destination for coffee lovers and social butterflies alike. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, further highlighting the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We are also exploring opportunities to introduce new coffee brewing techniques and specialty coffee beans, providing our customers with even more unique and exciting experiences. In the long term, K Cafe aspires to become a recognizable brand synonymous with quality, community, and innovation. We envision expanding our presence to other locations in the region, bringing the K Cafe experience to a wider audience. We are committed to sustainable practices, striving to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to a more sustainable future for our community. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, K Cafe has the potential to become a beloved institution in the local business landscape, fostering connections, creating opportunities, and enriching the lives of our customers and the community we serve.</p>', 'Rooftop, Ratnagiri Tower, Public Health Tinali, Hengrabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:00:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1796, 'The Flavours Cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'The Flavours Cafe, nestled at House No. 60, GMC Hostel Road, Udayachal Rd, is more than just a place to grab a quick bite; it\'s a culinary haven designed to offer a taste of both familiar comfort and exciting innovation. Situated in a bustling area, the cafe aims to be a pivotal part of the local Assam food scene, providing a welcoming atmosphere for students, professionals, and families alike. We strive to be a place where conversations flow as freely as the tea, and where every dish tells a story. Our commitment to quality ingredients, coupled with a passion for culinary artistry, sets us apart in a market increasingly saturated with generic food outlets.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe core of The Flavours Cafe lies in its diverse menu, carefully curated to cater to a broad spectrum of tastes. We specialize in both traditional Assamese delicacies and contemporary cafe staples, ensuring something for everyone. Our signature dish, the *Masor Tenga* (a tangy fish curry), is prepared using locally sourced fish and authentic spices, offering a true taste of Assam. Alongside this, we offer a range of globally inspired dishes, including gourmet sandwiches, pasta, and freshly baked pastries. Our coffee selection is equally impressive, featuring expertly brewed espresso drinks and aromatic local tea blends. What truly distinguishes us is our commitment to using fresh, seasonal ingredients. We partner with local farmers whenever possible, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the highest quality produce. This focus on freshness and local sourcing is a significant selling point, appealing to increasingly health-conscious and ethically-minded consumers. The menu is designed to evolve with the seasons, introducing new and exciting dishes that highlight the best of what Assam has to offer. We also provide vegetarian and vegan options, recognizing the growing demand for plant-based alternatives in the market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt The Flavours Cafe, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm and genuine welcome. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. We actively solicit feedback from our patrons, using their insights to continually improve our offerings and service. Beyond simply serving food, we aim to create a community hub. We regularly host live music performances featuring local artists, creating a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We also organize cooking workshops and food tasting events, fostering a sense of connection among our customers and promoting culinary exploration. Understanding the importance of accessibility, we offer free Wi-Fi and comfortable seating arrangements, making The Flavours Cafe an ideal place for students to study, professionals to conduct meetings, or friends to simply relax and connect. Our commitment to community extends beyond our immediate vicinity; we actively participate in local initiatives and support charitable organizations, further solidifying our role as a responsible and engaged member of the Assam community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, The Flavours Cafe envisions significant growth potential within the Assam market. Our immediate plan involves expanding our menu to include more regional specialties and introducing a catering service for local events and businesses. We also aim to establish an online ordering system, allowing customers to easily order their favorite dishes for takeaway or delivery. In the long term, we aspire to open additional locations throughout Assam, bringing our unique blend of culinary artistry and community spirit to a wider audience. We are exploring partnerships with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their work in our cafes, further promoting the region\'s rich cultural heritage. Sustainable practices are also a key focus for the future. We are committed to reducing our environmental footprint by implementing eco-friendly packaging, minimizing waste, and sourcing from sustainable suppliers. Our ultimate goal is to establish The Flavours Cafe as a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, community, and innovation. We aim to not only serve delicious food but also to create a lasting positive impact on the local economy and the lives of our customers.', 'House No. 60, GMC Hostel Road, Udayachal Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:00:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1797, 'TL7 Café', 'Cafes', '', 'TL7 Café: A Riverside Retreat in Belle View\n\nTL7 Café, nestled at the heart of Upper Stand Rd (Riverside), Belle View, Road Rd, offers a unique and refreshing experience within the burgeoning café culture of Assam. More than just a coffee shop, TL7 is designed as a community hub, a place where the rich traditions of Assamese hospitality meet modern culinary trends. It aims to be a welcoming destination for residents and visitors alike, offering a haven for relaxation, connection, and the enjoyment of quality food and beverages. The café strives to be a cornerstone of the Belle View area, contributing to its vibrant character and appeal.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, TL7 Café provides a diverse menu centered on exceptional coffee, locally sourced teas, and freshly prepared food. The coffee selection showcases ethically sourced beans, expertly brewed by trained baristas who are passionate about their craft. From classic espresso drinks to innovative coffee concoctions infused with local flavors, there\'s something to satisfy every palate. The tea menu features a curated selection of Assam teas, highlighting the region\'s renowned tea heritage, along with herbal infusions and iced teas perfect for the warm climate. Beyond beverages, TL7 offers a menu of light meals, snacks, and delectable desserts. Patrons can enjoy freshly baked pastries, sandwiches made with locally sourced ingredients, and traditional Assamese snacks prepared with a modern twist. The unique selling point lies in the fusion of global café culture with the authentic flavors of Assam, creating a culinary experience that is both familiar and uniquely local. This responds directly to the growing demand for quality coffee and artisanal food in the region, while also celebrating the local culinary identity.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at TL7 Café. From the moment a guest steps inside, they are greeted with warm smiles and attentive service. The café is designed to foster a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, with comfortable seating arrangements, aesthetically pleasing décor, and ambient lighting that creates a cozy and welcoming environment. The staff is not only trained to provide efficient service but also to engage with customers, offering personalized recommendations and creating a genuine connection. TL7 actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting live music performances featuring local artists, showcasing artwork from regional talent, and organizing community events that bring people together. By supporting local producers and artisans, TL7 reinforces its commitment to the community and contributes to the economic well-being of the area. Furthermore, TL7 emphasizes sustainability practices, striving to minimize its environmental impact through responsible sourcing, waste reduction, and energy efficiency.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, TL7 Café envisions significant growth potential within the Belle View area and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate seasonal dishes and catering to dietary preferences, such as vegan and gluten-free options. TL7 aspires to become a destination for special events, offering catering services and private event bookings. Exploration of partnerships with local businesses and organizations is also a key component of the growth strategy, aiming to create synergistic relationships that benefit the entire community. The long-term goal is to establish TL7 Café as a beloved and respected brand, synonymous with quality, community, and exceptional customer service. This vision extends to the potential for opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the TL7 experience to a wider audience while staying true to its core values and commitment to the local community. Ultimately, TL7 strives to be more than just a café; it aspires to be a cultural landmark, a gathering place that enriches the lives of its patrons and contributes to the vibrant tapestry of Assam\'s business landscape.', 'Upper stand rd(riverside), belle view, road rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:00:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1798, 'Cafe Detox', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Cafe Detox, a vibrant and health-conscious establishment located on Beltola Jayanagar Rd, opposite the Administrative Staff College, is redefining the cafe experience in Guwahati. More than just a place to grab a quick bite, Cafe Detox is committed to providing a rejuvenating and nourishing escape from the everyday hustle, offering a menu centered around fresh, locally sourced ingredients and a welcoming atmosphere that promotes well-being. In a city increasingly aware of the importance of healthy living, Cafe Detox fills a crucial niche by providing delicious and accessible options for those seeking a balanced and mindful lifestyle.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Cafe Detox offers a diverse range of services and products focused on detoxification and healthy eating. The menu features freshly pressed juices and smoothies packed with vitamins and antioxidants, carefully crafted to invigorate the body and cleanse the system. Salads are a staple, utilizing seasonal vegetables and incorporating lean proteins and healthy fats to create satisfying and nutritious meals. Beyond these staples, the cafe also offers a selection of healthy wraps, sandwiches made with whole-grain bread, and thoughtfully prepared breakfast bowls designed to provide sustained energy throughout the day. A unique selling point is the cafe\'s commitment to sourcing ingredients from local farms and producers, ensuring freshness and supporting the local economy. Furthermore, Cafe Detox features a range of herbal teas and infusions, expertly blended to offer specific health benefits, such as boosting immunity, aiding digestion, and promoting relaxation. Understanding the increasing demand for plant-based options, the menu prominently features vegetarian and vegan choices, ensuring that everyone can find something to enjoy. By offering a comprehensive selection of healthy and delicious food and beverages, Cafe Detox caters to the growing need for convenient and accessible options for health-conscious individuals in Guwahati.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Cafe Detox prioritizes creating a positive and welcoming customer experience. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and able to provide recommendations based on individual dietary needs and preferences. The cafe\'s ambiance is designed to be relaxing and inviting, featuring comfortable seating, natural light, and soothing decor. The overall atmosphere aims to promote a sense of calm and well-being, encouraging customers to unwind and recharge. Recognizing the importance of community engagement, Cafe Detox actively participates in local events and initiatives focused on health and wellness. The cafe also hosts workshops and seminars on topics related to nutrition, mindfulness, and healthy living, further solidifying its role as a community hub for those seeking to improve their well-being. By fostering a strong connection with the local community and providing exceptional customer service, Cafe Detox has established itself as a beloved destination for those seeking a healthy and uplifting experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Cafe Detox is ambitious and centered around expanding its impact on the local community. The cafe plans to introduce new menu items that cater to specific dietary needs and preferences, such as gluten-free options and keto-friendly meals. There are also plans to expand the retail section of the cafe, offering a wider selection of healthy snacks, supplements, and locally sourced products. Exploring partnerships with local fitness studios and wellness centers is also a key component of the long-term strategy, allowing Cafe Detox to reach a wider audience and promote a holistic approach to health and wellness. One potential avenue for growth is the development of a line of pre-packaged juices and snacks that can be sold at local grocery stores and markets, increasing accessibility and expanding the brand\'s reach. Ultimately, Cafe Detox aspires to become a leading advocate for healthy living in Guwahati, inspiring individuals to make mindful choices and prioritize their well-being. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the community, Cafe Detox is well-positioned for continued growth and success in the years to come.</p>', 'Beltola Jayanagar Rd, opposite to administrative staff College', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:00:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1799, 'Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery isn\'t just another establishment on Beltola-Basistha Road; it\'s a vibrant culinary destination designed to capture the spirit of Assam while offering a modern and engaging dining experience. Located conveniently at A G, Bus Stop, directly opposite Brahmaputra Apartment, the cafe serves as a welcoming haven for locals and visitors alike, offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and contemporary cafe fare. In a region known for its rich tea heritage and burgeoning food scene, Cafe Xtreme aims to stand out by providing high-quality ingredients, innovative menu options, and an unparalleled atmosphere of comfort and community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Cafe Xtreme\'s offerings lies a dual focus: exceptional teas and delectable food. The teahouse aspect boasts an extensive selection of locally sourced Assamese teas, ranging from robust black teas to delicate green and white varieties. These teas are meticulously prepared and served, allowing patrons to fully appreciate the nuanced flavors and aromas that characterize Assam’s world-renowned tea industry. Beyond the traditional, Cafe Xtreme also offers innovative tea-based beverages, including iced teas, flavored blends, and tea cocktails, catering to a diverse range of palates. The \"Eatery\" component complements the tea selection with a diverse menu of food options. This ranges from traditional Assamese snacks and light meals like *pitha*, *jolpan*, and *thukpa*, prepared with authentic recipes and locally sourced ingredients, to continental favorites such as sandwiches, pasta, and pizzas. Special emphasis is placed on fresh, seasonal ingredients, ensuring that every dish is bursting with flavor and reflects the culinary richness of the region. A unique selling point is the cafe\'s commitment to using organic ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and promoting sustainable practices. By offering both classic Assamese dishes and familiar international fare, Cafe Xtreme successfully bridges the gap between tradition and modernity, appealing to a broad customer base. This caters to the local market\'s desire for both authentic flavors and familiar comfort foods.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery. The cafe prides itself on providing warm, attentive, and personalized service. Staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and passionate about the teas and dishes they serve, able to provide recommendations and answer questions with enthusiasm. The atmosphere is carefully curated to be inviting and comfortable, with a blend of modern design elements and traditional Assamese touches. Comfortable seating arrangements, ample lighting, and thoughtfully chosen decor create a relaxing and enjoyable environment for individuals, couples, and groups. Beyond just providing excellent service and a pleasant atmosphere, Cafe Xtreme actively seeks to connect with the local community. The cafe regularly hosts events such as live music performances featuring local artists, tea tasting workshops, and cooking demonstrations showcasing Assamese cuisine. These events provide opportunities for customers to engage with the cafe on a deeper level and foster a sense of community. Furthermore, Cafe Xtreme actively supports local initiatives and charities, demonstrating its commitment to giving back to the community it serves. By prioritizing customer service, cultivating a welcoming atmosphere, and actively engaging with the local community, Cafe Xtreme strives to be more than just a place to eat and drink; it aims to be a gathering place where people can connect, relax, and experience the best of Assamese culture.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery is ambitious yet grounded in a deep understanding of the local market and a commitment to quality. The immediate plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties and seasonal dishes, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese cuisine. There are also plans to introduce a loyalty program to reward regular customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Longer-term goals involve establishing Cafe Xtreme as a recognizable brand within the region, potentially through opening additional locations in other key areas. This expansion would be carefully managed to maintain the same high standards of quality and customer service that define the original location. Another area of focus is developing a line of branded tea products and Assamese delicacies that can be sold both in the cafe and online, allowing customers to enjoy Cafe Xtreme\'s offerings from the comfort of their own homes. Furthermore, the business is exploring opportunities to partner with local tea gardens and producers to create exclusive tea blends and support sustainable farming practices. By consistently innovating, expanding its reach, and staying true to its core values of quality, community, and authenticity, Cafe Xtreme Teahouse & Eatery aims to become a leading culinary destination in Assam, enriching the local food scene and providing a memorable experience for every customer.</p>', 'A G, Bus Stop, Beltola - Basistha Rd, opp. Brahmaputra Apartment', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:00:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
