(1809, 'THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE', 'Cafes', '', '<p>THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE is a refined and inviting destination nestled in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, poised to redefine the tea-drinking experience. More than just a tea room, it\'s a celebration of Assam\'s rich tea heritage, meticulously curated to offer both traditional reverence and contemporary innovation. In a region synonymous with tea production, THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE distinguishes itself by providing a sophisticated and educational journey through the world of tea, from estate to cup. We strive to be a pivotal addition to Guwahati\'s business landscape, attracting both local enthusiasts and international visitors seeking an authentic and elevated Assam tea experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE are its core services and products, each designed to showcase the versatility and depth of Assam tea. Our primary offering is a meticulously selected menu of single-origin Assam teas, sourced directly from reputable local estates committed to sustainable and ethical practices. We offer a variety of preparations, from traditional brewing methods using handcrafted teaware to innovative tea-infused beverages. Beyond classic black teas, we feature lesser-known Assam varietals, including green, white, and oolong teas, broadening the understanding of Assam\'s tea-making capabilities.<br> <br> Complementing our tea selection is a range of carefully chosen food pairings, designed to enhance the flavor profiles of each tea. These include locally sourced pastries, light meals featuring regional ingredients, and traditional Assamese snacks. We also offer tea-related merchandise, such as loose-leaf teas, teaware sets, and tea-infused beauty products, providing customers with an opportunity to extend their tea experience beyond the lounge. <br> <br> What truly sets THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE apart is our commitment to education and engagement. We host regular tea tasting sessions, workshops on tea brewing techniques, and talks by local tea experts. This focus on knowledge sharing positions us as more than just a tea room; we are a center for tea culture and appreciation, fulfilling a growing demand for authentic and informative experiences within the local market. Our curated selection of teas unavailable elsewhere in the city also provides a unique selling point.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The customer experience at THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE is paramount. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our staff are highly trained not only in tea preparation and service but also in the history and nuances of Assam tea. They are knowledgeable guides, ready to assist customers in selecting the perfect tea based on their preferences and to answer any questions they may have. <br> <br> The lounge\'s ambiance is carefully crafted to foster relaxation and connection. The interior design blends traditional Assamese elements with modern aesthetics, creating a space that is both elegant and comfortable. Comfortable seating, soft lighting, and curated music contribute to a tranquil atmosphere. <br> <br> We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, farmers, and cultural organizations. We showcase local art, host community events, and source ingredients from local suppliers whenever possible. This commitment to supporting the local economy and celebrating Assamese culture fosters a strong sense of connection and loyalty among our customers. Furthermore, we actively solicit and incorporate customer feedback to continually improve our offerings and ensure that we are meeting the evolving needs of our community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE is one of sustainable growth and continued commitment to excellence. Our immediate plans include expanding our tea menu to include rare and limited-edition Assam teas, further solidifying our position as a destination for tea connoisseurs. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster long-term relationships. <br> <br> Looking further ahead, we envision expanding our online presence to reach a wider audience, offering online tea sales and virtual tea tasting experiences. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other key cities in India and internationally, bringing the authentic Assam tea experience to a global audience. <br> <br> Our long-term goals include establishing THE GTAC TEA LOUNGE as a recognized leader in the Assam tea industry, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We aspire to be a catalyst for promoting Assam tea culture and supporting the livelihoods of local tea farmers. By consistently delivering exceptional experiences and fostering a deep appreciation for Assam tea, we are confident in our ability to achieve our ambitious goals and contribute to the region\'s economic and cultural vibrancy.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:10:38', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1810, 'Addicted', 'Cafes', '', '<p><b>Addicted: Fueling Assam\'s Drive with Premium Automotive Solutions</b></p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Located in the heart of Assam\'s industrial sector at the In & Out Building, Industrial Development Corporation, Zoo Rd, \"Addicted\" is emerging as a prominent provider of specialized automotive services and products. Addicted isn\'t just another auto business; it aims to be a vital resource contributing to the efficiency and performance of vehicles across the region. Recognizing the unique needs of the Assamese market, from navigating challenging terrain to enduring the region\'s distinctive climate, Addicted is positioned to become a trusted partner for individual vehicle owners, fleet operators, and businesses relying on reliable transportation.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Addicted focuses on delivering a comprehensive suite of services and products designed to enhance vehicle performance and longevity. Core offerings include a carefully curated selection of high-quality automotive parts, ranging from essential maintenance items like filters, belts, and lubricants to performance upgrades such as specialized suspension systems and enhanced braking components. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing products that are specifically suited to the demands of Assam\'s environment, ensuring they can withstand the humidity, varying road conditions, and unique driving styles prevalent in the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond parts, Addicted boasts a team of skilled technicians capable of providing expert diagnostics, repair, and maintenance services. Specialization lies in areas often overlooked by general auto shops, such as performance tuning, advanced diagnostics of modern vehicle electronics, and customized solutions for improving fuel efficiency. The service department is equipped with state-of-the-art diagnostic equipment and specialized tools, allowing the team to tackle complex automotive challenges with precision and expertise. The workshop strives to provide services for all types of vehicles.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets Addicted apart is its dedication to providing a superior customer experience deeply rooted in the local community. The business operates on the principle of building long-term relationships with customers based on trust and transparency. Every interaction is approached with a commitment to understanding the individual needs of each customer, offering tailored solutions, and providing clear and honest communication throughout the service process. Addicted understands that vehicle maintenance can be stressful, and strives to make the process as smooth and convenient as possible.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Furthermore, Addicted aims to actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. This includes sponsoring local automotive events, providing educational workshops on vehicle maintenance, and participating in community outreach programs. By fostering a strong connection with the community, Addicted aims to become more than just a business; it seeks to be a valued contributor to the region\'s economic and social well-being. This community engagement helps to build brand loyalty and trust among local customers, creating a sustainable business model.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Addicted envisions expanding its range of services and products to meet the evolving needs of the Assamese automotive market. This includes exploring partnerships with leading automotive manufacturers, expanding the service department to accommodate a wider range of vehicles, and investing in advanced training for its technicians. A key focus will be on incorporating sustainable practices into the business operations, such as promoting eco-friendly automotive products and implementing energy-efficient technologies.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Addicted\'s long-term goal is to become the leading provider of premium automotive solutions in Assam, recognized for its expertise, customer service, and commitment to the community. By continuously innovating and adapting to the changing landscape of the automotive industry, Addicted is poised to achieve sustained growth and make a significant contribution to the region\'s transportation infrastructure. The business aims to set a new standard for automotive services in Assam, offering a blend of technical expertise, customer focus, and community engagement that resonates with local values.</p>', 'In &, In And Out Building, Industrial Develoment Corporation, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:15:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1811, 'Public domain cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'Public Domain Café: A Haven for Creativity and Community in Panjabari\n\nLocated at H.No. 93, Panjabari Rd, Public Domain Café is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it\'s a vibrant hub where creativity blossoms and community thrives. Nestled in the heart of Panjabari, Guwahati, the café distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of quality food and beverage alongside a strong commitment to supporting local artists and fostering intellectual exchange. In Assam\'s dynamic business landscape, Public Domain Café fills a niche by providing a welcoming and inspiring space for students, professionals, and artists alike. We aim to be a cornerstone of the Panjabari community, contributing to its cultural richness and providing a platform for local talent to shine.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Public Domain Café, our core offering revolves around delivering a superior café experience. We meticulously source high-quality coffee beans, ensuring a rich and flavorful brew that caters to discerning palates. Our menu extends beyond coffee to include a diverse selection of teas, refreshing beverages, and delectable pastries and light meals, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We recognize the growing demand for healthier options and strive to incorporate nutritious choices into our menu, catering to various dietary preferences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly sets Public Domain Café apart is its dedication to the “public domain” concept. We actively curate a space that showcases and celebrates works in the public domain – literature, art, music, and film – creating an atmosphere that encourages intellectual curiosity and appreciation for shared cultural heritage. This is reflected in our decor, our curated selection of books and magazines, and our regular events which include open mic nights, art exhibitions featuring local artists, and screenings of classic films. We also offer free Wi-Fi, making it an ideal workspace for freelancers and students. Our unique selling point lies in this combination of a comfortable café environment with a strong emphasis on fostering creativity and intellectual engagement. This resonates deeply with the local market, particularly the student population and the burgeoning artistic community in and around Panjabari.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Public Domain Café. We believe in providing friendly, attentive service that makes every visitor feel welcome and valued. Our staff is trained not just to serve coffee, but to engage with customers, understand their needs, and create a positive and memorable experience. We actively seek feedback and continuously strive to improve our offerings based on customer preferences. To further enhance community engagement, we regularly host workshops and events designed to connect local residents and foster a sense of belonging. We collaborate with local artists, musicians, and writers to provide them with a platform to showcase their talents and connect with their audience. This dedication to community building extends to actively participating in local initiatives and supporting charitable causes within the Panjabari area. We strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be a positive force in the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Public Domain Café envisions significant growth potential. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu offerings to cater to a wider range of culinary tastes and preferences. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and further cultivate a sense of community. A key aspect of our future vision is to enhance our online presence through social media and a user-friendly website, allowing us to connect with a broader audience and promote our events and initiatives.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to create mutually beneficial relationships and further contribute to the local economy. One potential avenue is collaborating with local educational institutions to offer student discounts and host academic events at the café. We are also considering expanding our retail offerings to include merchandise featuring local artists and craftspeople. Ultimately, Public Domain Café aspires to become a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, creativity, and community engagement in the Guwahati area and beyond. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, we can achieve our long-term goals and make a lasting positive impact on the Panjabari community and the wider Assam business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are also committed to sustainability and are actively exploring ways to reduce our environmental footprint. This includes sourcing eco-friendly packaging, minimizing waste, and promoting responsible consumption among our customers. We believe that by operating in a sustainable and ethical manner, we can contribute to a better future for our community and the planet.', 'h no, 93, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:15:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1812, 'Ethnic Taste - A Fusion Café', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Ethnic Taste - A Fusion Café: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n\n<p>Nestled near the vibrant atmosphere of the Cricket Stadium, at Gate no-3, Cricket Stadium, Rgbs Road, Bye Lane-4, House No-15, 4, RGBS Rd, near Barsapara, Guwahati, Ethnic Taste - A Fusion Café offers a unique dining experience that blends the rich tapestry of Assamese culinary traditions with innovative flavors from around the world. More than just a restaurant, Ethnic Taste aims to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can gather to savor delicious food, enjoy warm hospitality, and celebrate the diverse cultural heritage of Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>In the dynamic Guwahati business landscape, Ethnic Taste distinguishes itself by offering a distinct alternative to standard dining options. We recognize the growing desire for innovative culinary experiences while respecting the importance of local flavors and traditions. Our café serves as a bridge, connecting the familiar comfort of Assamese cuisine with the exciting allure of global gastronomy. We are committed to sourcing fresh, local ingredients whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers, and contributing to the sustainable growth of the local economy. By offering a unique and thoughtfully curated menu, Ethnic Taste aims to elevate the dining scene in Guwahati and become a destination for food enthusiasts seeking an unforgettable experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings revolve around providing a diverse and flavorful menu that caters to a wide range of palates. The menu features a selection of authentic Assamese dishes prepared with traditional methods and locally sourced ingredients. Alongside these regional staples, we present a carefully crafted array of fusion dishes that blend Assamese flavors with international culinary techniques. Imagine tasting a delicately spiced Masor Tenga infused with subtle hints of Thai lemongrass, or enjoying a traditional Pitha reinvented as a savory crepe with a filling inspired by global street food. We also offer a variety of specialty coffees, teas, and refreshing beverages, carefully selected to complement the flavors of our food. Vegetarian and vegan options are thoughtfully included to cater to diverse dietary needs and preferences.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>A key differentiator for Ethnic Taste is our commitment to quality and innovation. We continuously experiment with new flavor combinations, explore different cooking techniques, and refine our menu based on customer feedback and seasonal availability of ingredients. This dedication to culinary creativity ensures that our offerings remain fresh, exciting, and consistently satisfying. Furthermore, we prioritize using organic and sustainably sourced ingredients whenever possible, minimizing our environmental impact and supporting local farmers who share our commitment to quality. Our goal is to provide not just a meal, but a culinary adventure that stimulates the senses and leaves a lasting impression.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Ethnic Taste, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a warm, welcoming, and inclusive atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and passionate about sharing their love for food and the local culture. We actively seek customer feedback and use it to continuously improve our service and menu offerings. We host regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, cooking demonstrations showcasing Assamese cuisine, and cultural celebrations that highlight the region\'s rich heritage. These events are designed to foster a sense of community and provide opportunities for people to connect and share their experiences.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>What truly sets us apart is our commitment to building meaningful relationships with the local community. We actively participate in local events, support local charities, and partner with local businesses to promote the region\'s cultural and economic growth. We believe that by giving back to the community, we can create a positive impact and foster a sense of belonging. We regularly engage with our customers through social media, sharing updates about our menu, events, and community initiatives. We encourage open communication and actively respond to customer inquiries and feedback, ensuring that our customers feel heard and valued.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Ethnic Taste envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Guwahati, recognized for its innovative fusion cuisine, exceptional customer service, and commitment to the local community. We plan to expand our menu offerings, introduce new and exciting dishes, and further refine our culinary techniques. We are exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and beyond, bringing our unique blend of flavors and hospitality to a wider audience. We also aim to establish partnerships with local culinary schools and training programs, providing opportunities for aspiring chefs and hospitality professionals to develop their skills and contribute to the growth of the industry.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goal is to become a symbol of Assamese culinary innovation and a driving force in the region\'s tourism and cultural development. We believe that by staying true to our values, continuously innovating, and fostering strong relationships with our customers and the community, we can achieve our vision and leave a lasting positive impact on the Guwahati business landscape and beyond. We are confident that Ethnic Taste will continue to evolve and thrive, serving as a testament to the power of food, culture, and community.</p>', 'Gate no-3, Cricket Stadium, Rgbs Road, Bye Lane-4, House No-15, 4, RGBS Rd, near Barsapara', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:15:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1813, 'Yummy Belly', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Yummy Belly, strategically located in the bustling Sixmile area on GS Road, near Dominos, has quickly become a beloved culinary destination in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a restaurant, Yummy Belly offers a vibrant and welcoming space where the rich flavors of the region blend seamlessly with contemporary culinary techniques. Recognizing the growing demand for both authentic Assamese cuisine and convenient dining options, Yummy Belly fills a crucial gap in the local market by providing a diverse menu, a comfortable atmosphere, and unwavering commitment to quality and customer satisfaction.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Yummy Belly specializes in delivering an exceptional dining experience anchored by a diverse menu catering to a wide range of palates. The primary offerings include: a curated selection of authentic Assamese dishes, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, to showcase the unique and vibrant flavors of the region; a variety of North Indian favorites, cooked with traditional recipes and aromatic spices; and a range of popular Chinese dishes, prepared with a focus on fresh ingredients and authentic techniques. What truly sets Yummy Belly apart is its commitment to freshness and quality. Each dish is carefully prepared using high-quality ingredients, ensuring a memorable culinary journey for every customer. Furthermore, Yummy Belly offers convenient takeaway and delivery services, catering to the needs of busy professionals and families in the Sixmile area. This adaptability to modern lifestyles makes Yummy Belly a go-to choice for both casual dining and quick, delicious meals. The restaurant consistently adapts its menu based on seasonal availability of ingredients and customer preferences, showcasing a dedication to innovation and catering to local tastes.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Yummy Belly. The restaurant fosters a warm and inviting atmosphere, encouraging customers to relax and savor their meals. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, readily assisting customers with their choices and addressing any concerns promptly and efficiently. Yummy Belly strives to build lasting relationships with its clientele by prioritizing personalized service and creating a welcoming environment. The restaurant actively engages with the local community by participating in local events and sponsoring community initiatives. By fostering a strong connection with the community, Yummy Belly has cultivated a loyal customer base that appreciates its commitment to quality, service, and local engagement. Positive word-of-mouth referrals and glowing online reviews stand as testament to the restaurant\'s success in delivering an outstanding customer experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Yummy Belly envisions a future marked by continued growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on further enhancing the menu by introducing innovative dishes that blend traditional flavors with modern culinary trends. Exploring opportunities to expand the seating capacity to accommodate the growing customer base is also a priority. Long-term goals include establishing Yummy Belly as a recognizable and respected brand throughout Guwahati and potentially beyond. This could involve opening additional locations in strategic areas of the city or even exploring franchise opportunities. Furthermore, Yummy Belly aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering platforms and loyalty programs. By staying adaptable to evolving market trends and consistently delivering high-quality food and exceptional service, Yummy Belly is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious growth objectives and solidify its position as a leading culinary destination in Assam.</p>', 'Sixmile, GS Rd, near Dominos', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:15:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1814, 'Desi Swag Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Desi Swag Cafe, located at 8A, Nilomani Phukan Path, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a vibrant cultural hub bringing a modern, stylish twist to traditional Assamese flavors and hospitality. In a region rich with culinary heritage and a growing demand for contemporary dining experiences, Desi Swag Cafe distinguishes itself by seamlessly blending authentic Assamese cuisine with a trendy, inviting atmosphere. We aim to be a cornerstone of the local community, offering a unique space where tradition meets innovation.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Desi Swag Cafe lies our commitment to providing a distinctive and memorable culinary journey. Our core offering revolves around authentic Assamese dishes, meticulously prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. While staying true to traditional recipes, we also introduce innovative twists, catering to a diverse palate. Our menu features signature items like the classic \'Masor Tenga\' (sour fish curry) prepared with a modern twist, flavorful \'Pitha\' platters showcasing the region\'s diverse rice cakes, and a range of revitalizing Assamese teas, sourced directly from local tea gardens. A unique selling point is our focus on presentation, elevating traditional fare to an aesthetically pleasing dining experience suitable for social media sharing and creating lasting impressions. Recognizing the evolving preferences of the local market, we also offer continental options and vegetarian choices, ensuring that there\'s something for everyone. The menu is carefully curated to cater to breakfast, lunch, and dinner, providing a comprehensive dining solution throughout the day.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Desi Swag Cafe prides itself on delivering exceptional customer service that goes beyond merely serving food. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality, making them feel instantly welcomed and valued. Our staff is meticulously trained not only in food service but also in understanding and responding to individual customer needs and preferences. What sets us apart is our commitment to creating a sense of community. We organize regular events like live music performances featuring local artists, cooking workshops showcasing Assamese culinary techniques, and cultural exhibitions that celebrate the rich heritage of the region. We actively engage with our customers on social media, fostering a digital community where they can share their experiences, provide feedback, and stay updated on our latest offerings and events. By prioritizing genuine human interaction and creating a vibrant social space, we aim to foster strong connections with the local community and become a beloved gathering place.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Desi Swag Cafe envisions becoming a prominent brand synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine and contemporary dining in the region. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and seasonal ingredients, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese flavors. We also aim to establish partnerships with local farmers and artisans, promoting sustainable practices and supporting the local economy. Expansion is a key element of our long-term strategy, with plans to open additional locations in other parts of Assam and eventually across India, bringing the taste of authentic Assamese cuisine to a wider audience. We are also exploring the possibility of launching a line of packaged Assamese snacks and ingredients, allowing customers to enjoy our flavors at home. Ultimately, our goal is to be recognized as a leading culinary destination that not only provides exceptional food and service but also actively contributes to the preservation and promotion of Assamese culture and heritage. We aspire to become a national brand that represents the true essence of Assam, one delicious bite at a time.</p>', '8A, Nilomani Phukan Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:15:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1815, 'Café Coffee Day', 'Cafes', '', 'Café Coffee Day, nestled in the heart of Basistha Road at Rajat Bhawan, near the My Jio Store, is more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a vibrant community hub offering a welcoming space for locals and visitors alike. In Assam\'s dynamic business environment, where tea has historically reigned supreme, Café Coffee Day introduces a contemporary coffee culture, blending global coffee trends with local tastes and preferences. It provides a modern, relaxed environment distinct from traditional establishments, catering to a growing demand for specialized coffee and a comfortable gathering place.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Café Coffee Day provides a wide array of coffee-based beverages, from classic espressos and cappuccinos to signature frappes and innovative seasonal creations. Beyond coffee, the menu extends to include a selection of teas, both hot and iced, catering to the region’s deep-rooted tea affinity. Complementing the beverage offerings are a variety of food items, including sandwiches, wraps, pastries, cakes, and quick bites. The unique selling point lies in the carefully curated coffee blends, sourced from some of the finest coffee plantations, ensuring a rich and aromatic experience. Furthermore, the café prides itself on adapting its menu to incorporate locally sourced ingredients and flavors, offering items that resonate with the Assam palate. This focus on local integration allows Café Coffee Day to meet the specific needs of the market, providing familiar tastes alongside internationally inspired options. For instance, seasonal variations on lattes using local spices or pastries inspired by traditional Assamese sweets might be offered.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Café Coffee Day. The staff is trained to provide friendly, efficient service, creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere. The café’s ambiance is designed to be comfortable and conducive to both work and relaxation, with comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and often, Wi-Fi connectivity. This makes it an ideal spot for students studying, professionals holding informal meetings, or friends catching up. What truly sets Café Coffee Day apart is its commitment to engaging with the local community. This is achieved through hosting local events, showcasing regional artwork, and partnering with local businesses for promotions. The café also strives to be a responsible corporate citizen, participating in local initiatives and supporting community projects. This deep connection to the community fosters a sense of belonging and makes Café Coffee Day more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a valued member of the neighborhood.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Café Coffee Day envisions itself as an even more integral part of the Basistha Road community. The business plans to expand its offerings, potentially including live music performances, book readings, and other cultural events, transforming the café into a vibrant cultural center. There is also potential to introduce a loyalty program to reward regular customers and enhance customer retention. Furthermore, the business aims to strengthen its commitment to sustainability, exploring ways to reduce its environmental impact and support local farmers and producers. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within Guwahati, bringing the unique Café Coffee Day experience to a wider audience while maintaining the core values of quality, community engagement, and customer satisfaction. By continuing to innovate and adapt to the evolving needs of the local market, Café Coffee Day aims to solidify its position as the premier destination for coffee and community in the Basistha Road area and beyond.', 'Rajat Bhawan, Basistha Rd, near My Jio Store', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:20:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1816, 'Adora cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'Adora Cafe, nestled in the heart of Assam, is more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a haven crafted to celebrate the region\'s rich culinary heritage and vibrant social spirit. We aim to provide an unparalleled experience, blending the warmth of Assamese hospitality with expertly crafted beverages and delectable food, establishing ourselves as a cornerstone of the local community and a premier destination for both residents and visitors.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAdora Cafe differentiates itself through a commitment to sourcing local ingredients, showcasing the authentic flavors of Assam. Our menu features a carefully curated selection of artisanal coffees, each roasted to perfection and prepared with meticulous attention to detail by our skilled baristas. Alongside classic espresso drinks, we offer unique Assamese tea blends, paying homage to the region\'s tea-growing legacy. Our food menu complements our beverage offerings, featuring traditional Assamese snacks and meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced produce whenever possible. We also offer a variety of pastries and light meals, catering to diverse palates while maintaining a commitment to quality and flavor. Unlike many generic coffee chains, Adora Cafe provides a distinctive regional experience, immersing customers in the unique culture and tastes of Assam. We are committed to ethical sourcing and sustainability, supporting local farmers and producers, and minimizing our environmental impact. Our cafe provides a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, perfect for catching up with friends, working remotely, or simply enjoying a moment of tranquility.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Adora Cafe, customer satisfaction is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service, ensuring that each customer\'s experience is exceptional. We actively engage with the local community by hosting events, supporting local artists, and participating in community initiatives. Our cafe provides a gathering space for residents to connect, celebrate, and build relationships. We believe in building genuine connections with our customers, understanding their preferences, and anticipating their needs. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. Adora Cafe fosters a sense of community by promoting local talent through showcasing their artwork and products within the cafe, and by supporting local charities and organizations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Adora Cafe envisions expanding its reach while maintaining its commitment to quality and community engagement. We plan to introduce new menu items that further showcase the region\'s culinary diversity, and we are exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and businesses to offer unique products and experiences. We also aim to enhance our online presence, making it easier for customers to order online, stay informed about our events, and connect with us on social media. Furthermore, we are exploring the potential of opening additional locations within Assam, bringing the Adora Cafe experience to a wider audience. Long-term, we aspire to become a recognized symbol of Assamese hospitality and culinary excellence, contributing to the economic and social well-being of the communities we serve. We envision Adora Cafe as a lasting legacy, celebrating the rich culture and traditions of Assam for generations to come. We plan to implement sustainability initiatives to further reduce our carbon footprint and promote environmental responsibility. This includes sourcing more renewable energy and reducing waste through composting and recycling programs.', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:20:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1817, 'Starbucks', 'Cafes', '', 'Starbucks, located on the Ground Floor of the iconic Tata Tea Building on GS Rd, opposite Aayakar Bhawan in Guwahati, Assam, represents a unique blend of global coffee culture and local sensibilities. More than just a coffee shop, it\'s a destination that provides a familiar yet distinct experience, bridging the gap between international standards and the burgeoning café culture of Assam. Situated in a prime location, this Starbucks outlet caters to a diverse clientele, from students and professionals to tourists and local residents, offering a premium coffee experience within a comfortable and welcoming atmosphere. It aims to be a gathering place, a workspace, and a respite from the bustling city life, fostering a sense of community and connection within the heart of Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThis Starbucks location offers the full range of signature Starbucks beverages, including espresso-based drinks like lattes, cappuccinos, and macchiatos, as well as brewed coffee, iced coffee, and Frappuccinos. Beyond coffee, the menu features a variety of teas, refreshers, and other specialty drinks. The food offerings include a selection of pastries, cakes, sandwiches, and salads, catering to diverse tastes and dietary preferences. Unique to this location, and in line with Starbucks’ global strategy, the menu often incorporates locally inspired flavors and ingredients. This might include pastries with regional spices or beverages featuring local fruits, providing a distinct Assamese touch to the familiar Starbucks experience. The key selling points are the consistent quality of beverages and food, the comfortable and aesthetically pleasing ambiance, and the reliable Wi-Fi, which makes it a popular choice for working professionals and students alike. By offering a consistently high-quality experience and a localized touch, Starbucks meets the growing demand for premium coffee and a comfortable social space within the Guwahati market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at Starbucks on GS Road is paramount. Baristas are trained to provide friendly and efficient service, ensuring that each customer feels welcome and valued. The focus is on creating personalized experiences, remembering regular customers\' preferences, and offering recommendations based on individual tastes. The atmosphere is designed to be conducive to both relaxation and productivity, with comfortable seating, ample lighting, and a consistent background music selection. Beyond the in-store experience, Starbucks actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in community events. This might include sponsoring local arts initiatives, collaborating with nearby educational institutions, or supporting local charities. By actively participating in the local ecosystem, Starbucks aims to be more than just a coffee shop, but a responsible and engaged member of the Guwahati community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Starbucks at the Tata Tea Building envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam market. Future plans may include introducing new menu items that further incorporate local flavors and ingredients, hosting regular community events to foster stronger connections with local residents, and potentially expanding to new locations within Guwahati and other key cities in the region. The long-term goal is to solidify its position as the leading premium coffee destination in Assam, known for its exceptional coffee, welcoming atmosphere, and commitment to the local community. This involves continuously adapting to the evolving needs and preferences of the local market, embracing sustainable practices, and investing in the training and development of its employees. The vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional coffee but also contributes positively to the social and economic well-being of the Assam region.', 'Ground Floor, Tata Tea Building, GS Rd, opposite Aayakar Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:20:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1818, 'Yellow 29', 'Cafes', '', 'Yellow 29: Illuminating Opportunities on Rajgarh Road\n\nLocated at h/no, 25, Rajgarh Rd, opposite Icon Academy, Yellow 29 is emerging as a dynamic and innovative business hub in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a service provider, Yellow 29 aims to be a catalyst for growth, offering tailored solutions that address the specific needs and nuances of the local business environment. In a region characterized by its entrepreneurial spirit and rich cultural heritage, Yellow 29 is committed to fostering collaboration, driving innovation, and contributing to the overall economic prosperity of Assam. It stands out through its commitment to understanding the local market intimately and delivering services designed for maximum impact within that context.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Yellow 29 provides a suite of services focused on business development and digital empowerment. These core offerings encompass several key areas:\n\n*   **Digital Marketing Solutions:** Recognizing the increasing importance of online presence, Yellow 29 crafts customized digital marketing strategies for local businesses. This includes search engine optimization (SEO), social media marketing, content creation, and targeted advertising campaigns designed to reach local consumers and expand brand awareness. The emphasis is on leveraging digital platforms to connect businesses with their target audience in a meaningful and measurable way.\n\n*   **Business Consulting & Strategy:** Yellow 29 offers expert consulting services to guide businesses through the challenges of startup, growth, and sustainability. This includes market research, competitive analysis, business plan development, and strategic planning sessions. The goal is to equip businesses with the knowledge and tools they need to make informed decisions and achieve their objectives. This service is particularly vital in Assam\'s evolving market, where local knowledge and adaptability are crucial.\n\n*   **Training and Skill Development:** Recognizing the skills gap within the region, Yellow 29 provides specialized training programs focused on digital literacy, entrepreneurship, and professional development. These programs are designed to empower individuals with the skills they need to succeed in the modern business world and contribute to the growth of the local economy. This aspect directly caters to the local need for skilled professionals.\n\nThe unique selling proposition of Yellow 29 lies in its hyper-local focus and its commitment to providing personalized services. The team understands the specific challenges and opportunities facing businesses in Assam and tailors its solutions accordingly. Unlike larger, more generic consulting firms, Yellow 29 offers a hands-on, collaborative approach, working closely with clients to achieve tangible results.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nYellow 29 places immense value on building strong relationships with its clients and the local community. Customer service is not just a department; it\'s a philosophy that permeates every aspect of the business. The team is dedicated to providing prompt, responsive, and personalized support to each client. They prioritize clear communication, transparency, and a genuine commitment to client success.\n\nBeyond client interactions, Yellow 29 actively engages with the local community through sponsorships, workshops, and participation in local events. This commitment to social responsibility reflects the business\'s belief in giving back to the community and contributing to its overall well-being. They understand the importance of building trust and fostering a sense of community, which is particularly crucial in the tightly knit society of Assam. Moreover, being situated opposite Icon Academy positions Yellow 29 as a potential resource for students and young entrepreneurs, further solidifying its community connection.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Yellow 29 envisions becoming the leading business solutions provider in Assam, recognized for its innovation, expertise, and commitment to local development. The business plans to expand its service offerings to include areas such as financial planning, legal consulting, and technology solutions. Future goals include establishing a strong online presence, developing strategic partnerships with other local businesses, and expanding its reach to other cities and towns in the region.\n\nThe long-term vision for Yellow 29 is to create a thriving ecosystem that supports entrepreneurship, fosters innovation, and drives economic growth in Assam. The business aims to be a catalyst for change, empowering local businesses to achieve their full potential and contribute to a brighter future for the region. The strategic location on Rajgarh Road, a developing commercial area, positions Yellow 29 for significant future growth. The team is dedicated to continually adapting and evolving to meet the changing needs of the local market and to remain at the forefront of business innovation.', 'h/no, 25, Rajgarh Rd, opposite Icon Academy', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:20:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
