(1819, 'Yummy Belly', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Yummy Belly, a vibrant culinary destination nestled in the heart of Assam, offers a unique and authentic taste of the region alongside beloved international flavors. More than just a restaurant, Yummy Belly strives to be a community hub, a place where friends and families gather to celebrate life\'s simple joys over delicious food and warm hospitality. Recognizing the growing demand for both traditional Assamese cuisine and globally-inspired dishes, Yummy Belly bridges the gap, offering a diverse menu that caters to a wide range of palates and preferences. The business seeks to elevate the local dining scene by providing high-quality ingredients, expertly prepared meals, and a welcoming atmosphere that reflects the rich cultural heritage of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of Yummy Belly\'s offerings is a diverse menu meticulously crafted to showcase the best of both worlds: authentic Assamese delicacies and popular international dishes. Our Assamese selection features signature dishes like <i>Masor Tenga</i> (sour fish curry), <i>Khar</i> (an alkaline dish made with vegetables), and <i>Pitha</i> (traditional rice cakes), prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. We take pride in presenting these dishes with an authentic touch, preserving traditional recipes and cooking methods passed down through generations. Complementing the regional cuisine is a selection of international favorites, ranging from flavorful Chinese stir-fries and comforting Italian pasta dishes to zesty Mexican tacos and satisfying American burgers. This fusion approach allows Yummy Belly to cater to a broad customer base, offering something for everyone, from those seeking a taste of home to adventurous eaters eager to explore new flavors. Our unique selling point lies not only in the variety of our menu but also in our commitment to quality. We carefully select our ingredients, prioritize hygiene in our kitchen, and employ experienced chefs who are passionate about creating memorable dining experiences. This dedication to excellence is what sets Yummy Belly apart and helps us meet the growing demand for quality dining options in the local market.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Yummy Belly. We believe that every interaction with our customers is an opportunity to build a lasting relationship. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment a customer walks through the door, they are greeted with a warm smile and guided through the menu, offered recommendations, and catered to with genuine care. We understand that dining out is more than just about the food; it\'s about creating a memorable experience. That\'s why we strive to create a comfortable and inviting atmosphere, with cozy seating arrangements, pleasant decor, and soothing music. Beyond providing exceptional service within the restaurant, Yummy Belly actively connects with the local community through participation in local events, collaborations with local artisans and suppliers, and initiatives to support local charities. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us and are committed to being a responsible and engaged member of the local business landscape. We regularly host special events and promotions to attract new customers and reward loyal patrons, fostering a sense of community and belonging within our restaurant. Our goal is to make Yummy Belly more than just a place to eat; it\'s a place to connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Yummy Belly envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in Assam, renowned for its authentic cuisine, exceptional service, and commitment to the community. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, exploring opportunities for catering and delivery services, and potentially opening additional locations to reach a wider audience. We also plan to invest in employee training and development to ensure that our staff continues to provide the highest level of service. A key component of our long-term vision is to establish Yummy Belly as a sustainable business that contributes positively to the local economy and environment. We are exploring ways to reduce our environmental footprint, such as sourcing more ingredients from local farmers, implementing waste reduction strategies, and promoting sustainable practices within our operations. Furthermore, we aim to develop strategic partnerships with other local businesses and organizations to promote tourism and cultural exchange in the region. By focusing on innovation, sustainability, and community engagement, Yummy Belly is confident in its ability to achieve its long-term goals and solidify its position as a cherished culinary institution in Assam. We are committed to continuous improvement, listening to customer feedback, and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, ensuring that Yummy Belly remains a vibrant and relevant part of the local community for years to come.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:20:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1820, 'FILO cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>FILO cafe: A Culinary Haven in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant and culturally rich landscape of Assam, FILO cafe stands as a testament to the fusion of modern culinary artistry and traditional Assamese hospitality. More than just a cafe, FILO is a community hub, a space where the aroma of freshly brewed coffee blends seamlessly with the comforting scent of local spices, creating an inviting atmosphere for both residents and visitors alike. FILO cafe distinguishes itself through its commitment to sourcing local ingredients, promoting sustainable practices, and offering a unique gastronomic experience that celebrates the diverse flavors of the region. It aims to contribute meaningfully to the local economy while providing a contemporary and comfortable space for individuals to connect and unwind. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, FILO cafe offers a curated selection of beverages and food items designed to cater to a wide range of palates. Our coffee program is meticulously crafted, featuring ethically sourced beans roasted to perfection, ensuring a rich and flavorful cup every time. Beyond coffee, we offer a variety of teas, including locally sourced Assam tea, refreshing iced beverages, and artisanal smoothies. Our food menu is where FILO cafe truly shines. We specialize in modern interpretations of classic Assamese dishes, using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Imagine indulging in a flavorful <i>masor tenga</i> with a contemporary twist, or savoring a plate of <i>aloo pitika</i> prepared with farm-fresh potatoes and aromatic herbs. We also offer a range of continental dishes, from sandwiches and salads to pasta and pastries, ensuring there\'s something for everyone. One of our unique selling points is our focus on creating vegetarian and vegan options that are not just an afterthought, but thoughtfully designed to be delicious and satisfying. Furthermore, FILO cafe regularly introduces seasonal specials that showcase the best of what local farmers have to offer, promoting sustainability and supporting the local agricultural community. By seamlessly blending traditional Assamese flavors with modern culinary techniques, FILO cafe addresses a growing demand for innovative and authentic dining experiences in the region. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The FILO cafe experience is built on a foundation of exceptional customer service and genuine connection. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and passionate about our menu, providing personalized recommendations and catering to individual preferences. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere, with comfortable seating arrangements, aesthetically pleasing décor that reflects the region\'s artistic heritage, and soothing background music. FILO cafe also actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. We host regular events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing the works of regional talent, and workshops on topics ranging from coffee brewing to sustainable living. We also partner with local charities and organizations to support community development projects. By actively participating in the local cultural landscape, FILO cafe aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a vibrant and integral part of the community it serves. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, FILO cafe envisions itself as a leading culinary destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. We plan to expand our menu offerings to include more regional specialties and innovative dishes, while continuing to prioritize locally sourced ingredients. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the FILO cafe experience to a wider audience. Furthermore, we are committed to strengthening our partnerships with local farmers and artisans, creating a more sustainable and equitable supply chain. We also aim to enhance our online presence, offering online ordering and delivery services to cater to the growing demand for convenience. Long-term, FILO cafe aspires to be a model for sustainable business practices in the region, demonstrating that it is possible to be both profitable and socially responsible. Our ultimate goal is to create a positive impact on the local economy and community, while providing a unique and unforgettable culinary experience for our customers. </p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:25:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1821, 'Deja Brew Cafe And Bistro', 'Cafes', '', 'Deja Brew Cafe And Bistro: A Culinary Oasis on Zoo Road, Guwahati\n\nDeja Brew Cafe And Bistro is a vibrant and welcoming establishment situated in a prime location on Zoo Road, LKRB Path, near Doordarshan Kendra in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a cafe, Deja Brew is a community hub, offering a sophisticated yet comfortable space where locals and visitors alike can enjoy expertly crafted beverages, delectable cuisine, and genuine hospitality. In the burgeoning culinary landscape of Guwahati, Deja Brew distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, its dedication to creating a unique dining experience, and its strong connection to the surrounding community. The cafe aims to be a preferred destination for those seeking a relaxing atmosphere, delicious food, and exceptional service in the heart of the city.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Deja Brew’s offering is a carefully curated menu of both classic and innovative beverages. From expertly pulled espresso drinks crafted with locally sourced coffee beans (where feasible) to refreshing iced teas and blended fruit smoothies, there’s something to satisfy every palate. The bistro aspect of Deja Brew elevates the dining experience beyond typical cafe fare. The menu features a selection of appetizers, salads, sandwiches, and entrees, crafted with fresh, high-quality ingredients. Dishes reflect both local flavors and international influences, appealing to a diverse clientele. The cafe also offers a range of delectable desserts and pastries, perfect for an afternoon treat or a sweet ending to a satisfying meal. A key differentiator is the emphasis on using locally sourced produce and ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and businesses while ensuring the freshest possible flavors. The menu is thoughtfully designed to cater to various dietary preferences, including vegetarian and vegan options. The focus on quality ingredients, skilled preparation, and diverse menu offerings positions Deja Brew as a culinary destination rather than just a place to grab a quick coffee.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nDeja Brew understands that customer experience is paramount. The cafe strives to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel valued and comfortable. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, providing personalized service that exceeds expectations. From greeting customers with a smile to offering recommendations from the menu, the emphasis is on creating a positive and memorable experience. The cafe also actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artists\' exhibitions, organizing live music performances, and partnering with community organizations for fundraising events. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens Deja Brew’s position as a local gathering place. Furthermore, the cafe thoughtfully designs its space to create a relaxing and aesthetically pleasing environment, considering factors such as comfortable seating, ambient lighting, and tasteful decor. The goal is to create a space that is both functional and inviting, encouraging customers to linger and enjoy their time at Deja Brew.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nDeja Brew Cafe And Bistro envisions becoming a cornerstone of the Zoo Road community and a recognized culinary destination in Guwahati. Future plans include expanding the menu with seasonal specials that showcase local ingredients and culinary traditions. The cafe also aims to enhance its online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, reaching a wider audience and providing convenient access to its offerings. There are also plans to potentially introduce catering services for local events and businesses, further expanding the cafe\'s reach and revenue streams. Longer-term goals include exploring opportunities to open additional locations in strategic areas of Guwahati, replicating the successful model of Deja Brew while maintaining the same commitment to quality, community engagement, and exceptional customer service. The overarching vision is to establish Deja Brew as a trusted and beloved brand, synonymous with quality, community, and culinary excellence within the vibrant landscape of Guwahati\'s hospitality sector.', 'Zoo Road, LKRB Path, Zoo Rd, near Doordarshan kendra', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:25:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1822, 'Suto cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Suto Cafe: A Taste of Assam, A Hub for Community</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of \'\', Suto Cafe offers a refreshing blend of traditional Assamese flavors and modern cafe culture. More than just a place to grab a quick bite or a cup of coffee, Suto Cafe aims to be a vibrant community hub, fostering connections and celebrating the rich cultural heritage of Assam through its unique culinary offerings and welcoming atmosphere. In a region where traditional tea stalls and restaurants dominate, Suto Cafe distinguishes itself by offering a refined cafe experience while staying true to its Assamese roots.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Suto Cafe\'s offerings lies a curated selection of authentic Assamese dishes and beverages alongside familiar cafe staples. Our menu is carefully crafted to showcase the diverse culinary landscape of Assam, featuring dishes like *Pitha*, *Kharsoli*, and various rice-based preparations made with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We take pride in using traditional recipes passed down through generations, ensuring an authentic and flavorful experience for our patrons. Complementing these traditional dishes are innovative fusion creations that blend Assamese ingredients with contemporary culinary techniques, appealing to a wider range of palates. In addition to our food offerings, we boast an extensive beverage menu that includes specialty Assamese teas sourced directly from local tea gardens. From the robust *CTC* tea to the delicate *orthodox* varieties, our teas are brewed with precision and care, offering a truly immersive tea-drinking experience. Beyond tea, we offer a selection of freshly brewed coffee, refreshing juices, and traditional Assamese beverages like *Jalpan* (a light meal) and *Labra* (a mixed vegetable dish), catering to diverse tastes and preferences. A unique selling point is our commitment to ethical sourcing, working directly with local farmers and artisans to ensure the freshness and quality of our ingredients while supporting the local economy. We address a critical need in the local market by providing a comfortable and modern space where people can enjoy authentic Assamese cuisine in a relaxed and social setting, bridging the gap between traditional flavors and contemporary cafe culture.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Suto Cafe. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and welcomed. Our staff is trained not only in food preparation and service but also in providing friendly and personalized attention to each customer. We believe in building genuine connections with our patrons, taking the time to understand their preferences and ensuring their satisfaction. We regularly host community events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing the talents of regional artisans, and workshops on Assamese culture and cuisine. These events serve to foster a sense of community and provide a platform for local talent to shine. Furthermore, we actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local schools, organizations, and charities, contributing to social causes and promoting community development. We actively solicit customer feedback through surveys and online platforms, using this input to continuously improve our services and offerings. Our commitment to providing exceptional customer service and fostering a strong connection with the local community sets us apart and positions us as more than just a cafe – we are a gathering place, a cultural hub, and a community partner.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Suto Cafe envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a leading purveyor of Assamese cuisine and cafe culture. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional delicacies and seasonal ingredients, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese culinary traditions. We plan to establish partnerships with more local farmers and artisans, strengthening our commitment to ethical sourcing and supporting the local economy. We aim to open additional locations in other parts of Assam and potentially beyond, bringing the unique flavors and experiences of Suto Cafe to a wider audience. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own line of packaged Assamese teas and food products, allowing customers to enjoy the taste of Suto Cafe at home. Long-term, our goal is to become a recognized brand synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine, exceptional customer service, and a commitment to community engagement. We aspire to play a significant role in promoting Assamese culture and tourism, contributing to the economic and social development of the region. By staying true to our core values and continuously innovating to meet the evolving needs of our customers, we are confident that Suto Cafe will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the community for years to come.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:25:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1823, 'The Backyard Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The Backyard Cafe, nestled in the heart of [Replace with specific locality, e.g., Chandmari, Guwahati], Assam, is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it\'s a community hub, a culinary sanctuary, and a celebration of Assam\'s rich cultural heritage. In a region often characterized by traditional tea stalls and quick-service restaurants, The Backyard Cafe offers a unique and inviting alternative: a space where modern culinary techniques meet local flavors, served with a genuine warmth that reflects the hospitality of the Assamese people. We aim to be a destination that both locals and tourists seek out for a memorable experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, The Backyard Cafe is a full-service cafe and restaurant offering a diverse menu designed to appeal to a broad palate. Our signature offerings include specialty coffee beverages crafted from locally sourced beans, prepared with precision and passion by our trained baristas. Beyond coffee, our menu boasts a selection of freshly baked pastries, cakes, and desserts, all made in-house using high-quality ingredients. For those seeking heartier fare, we offer a range of savory dishes, blending continental cuisine with regional Assamese influences. Think wood-fired pizzas with locally sourced toppings, pasta dishes incorporating indigenous herbs and spices, and innovative interpretations of classic Assamese recipes. One of our unique selling points is our commitment to sustainability, prioritizing locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and artisans, and minimizing our environmental footprint. We also offer a curated selection of Assamese teas and traditional snacks, providing visitors with an authentic taste of the region. This focus on local sourcing and culinary innovation allows us to cater to the growing demand for authentic, locally relevant experiences, distinguishing us from generic food service establishments.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The Backyard Cafe prioritizes creating a welcoming and memorable experience for every guest. Our customer service philosophy is rooted in the Assamese tradition of hospitality, emphasizing warmth, respect, and attentiveness. We strive to create a relaxed and inviting atmosphere where customers feel comfortable lingering over a cup of coffee, enjoying a meal with friends, or simply unwinding after a long day. Our staff are trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and passionate about providing exceptional service. We actively engage with the local community through events and partnerships. We host live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing the work of regional talent, and workshops on topics ranging from coffee brewing to traditional Assamese crafts. We also collaborate with local charities and organizations to support community initiatives, further strengthening our ties to the area. By actively engaging with and supporting the local community, we aim to build a loyal customer base and foster a sense of belonging.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Backyard Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam business landscape. Our immediate plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more innovative and locally inspired dishes, and enhancing our outdoor seating area to create an even more inviting and comfortable space for our customers. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and producers to offer a curated selection of Assamese handicrafts and souvenirs, further promoting the region\'s rich cultural heritage. In the long term, we aspire to establish The Backyard Cafe as a recognizable and respected brand throughout Assam, with multiple locations offering the same high-quality food, exceptional service, and unwavering commitment to community engagement. We are also considering expanding our services to include catering for local events and offering online ordering and delivery options to reach a wider audience. Our ultimate goal is to be a leading culinary destination in Assam, known for its innovative cuisine, sustainable practices, and unwavering commitment to providing a memorable and authentic experience for every guest, all while contributing to the economic and cultural vibrancy of the local community.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:25:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1824, 'The 11:11 cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The 11:11 Café: A Sanctuary of Flavors and Connection in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant landscape of Assam, The 11:11 Café is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it’s a destination, a meeting point, and a celebration of local culture infused with a touch of contemporary flair. We strive to be a cornerstone of the community, offering a warm and inviting atmosphere where friends gather, ideas spark, and memories are made. While many cafes populate the urban landscape, The 11:11 Café differentiates itself by prioritizing locally sourced ingredients, supporting regional artisans, and cultivating a genuine connection with its patrons. Our commitment extends beyond simply serving excellent food and beverages; it encompasses a dedication to enriching the lives of those we serve and contributing positively to the local economy. We aim to offer a tranquil escape from the hustle and bustle, a space where individuals can recharge, connect, and appreciate the simple pleasures of life. The 11:11 Café seeks to redefine the café experience in Assam, creating a lasting impression that extends far beyond the last sip or bite.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>A Menu Crafted with Passion and Purpose: Core Services and Products</p>\n\n<p>At the heart of The 11:11 Café lies a commitment to quality and authenticity. Our primary offering revolves around a carefully curated menu featuring specialty coffee, artisanal teas, delectable pastries, and a selection of light meals prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Our coffee beans are sourced from regional plantations known for their exceptional quality, ensuring a rich and aromatic experience for coffee aficionados. We collaborate with local tea estates to offer a variety of Assam teas, showcasing the unique flavors and traditions of the region. Beyond the beverages, our pastries are freshly baked daily, using traditional recipes with a modern twist. Our light meals, ranging from sandwiches and salads to traditional Assamese snacks with a contemporary presentation, are designed to cater to diverse palates while remaining true to the flavors of the region. A key differentiator is our dedication to incorporating seasonal, locally sourced produce into our menu, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers. This commitment to sustainability and regional sourcing sets us apart, allowing us to offer a unique and authentic culinary experience that resonates with the local community. We also offer options for dietary restrictions such as vegan, vegetarian, and gluten-free choices, broadening our appeal and catering to a diverse customer base. Our unique selling point is the ability to provide high-quality, locally-sourced food and beverages in a comfortable and aesthetically pleasing environment, creating a holistic experience that celebrates the essence of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Creating a Welcoming Embrace: Customer Experience and Community Engagement</p>\n\n<p>The 11:11 Café is dedicated to providing an exceptional customer experience characterized by warmth, attentiveness, and genuine connection. Our staff are trained to be knowledgeable about our menu offerings and provide personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. We prioritize creating a welcoming atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. We believe in going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction, whether it\'s remembering a regular customer\'s favorite order or offering assistance with local information. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to community engagement. We actively participate in local events, partner with local artisans to showcase their products, and host workshops and gatherings that promote cultural exchange and community building. The café\'s décor incorporates elements of Assamese art and culture, creating a visually appealing and culturally relevant space. We host open mic nights featuring local musicians, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, and workshops on traditional Assamese crafts. This proactive approach to community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens our connection with the local population. We also utilize social media platforms to share local stories, promote community events, and solicit feedback from our customers, ensuring that we remain responsive to their needs and preferences. By actively engaging with the community and providing personalized service, we aim to create a loyal customer base and establish The 11:11 Café as a beloved community hub.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking Towards the Horizon: Future Vision and Growth Potential</p>\n\n<p>The future of The 11:11 Café is bright, driven by a clear vision for sustainable growth and continued community engagement. Our long-term goal is to expand our presence within Assam, potentially opening additional locations while maintaining the core values and principles that have made us successful. We envision expanding our menu offerings to include more traditional Assamese dishes and beverages, further celebrating the culinary heritage of the region. We plan to establish stronger partnerships with local farmers and artisans, ensuring a consistent supply of high-quality, locally sourced ingredients and products. We aim to implement sustainable practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and promoting responsible business practices. This includes reducing waste, conserving energy, and supporting local environmental initiatives. We also plan to explore opportunities to offer catering services for local events and corporate gatherings, further expanding our reach within the community. In addition, we are investigating the feasibility of offering online ordering and delivery services, catering to the growing demand for convenience. We recognize the importance of adapting to evolving consumer preferences and technological advancements. We envision The 11:11 Café becoming a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement. By staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we are confident that The 11:11 Café will continue to thrive and make a positive impact on the local community for years to come.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:25:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1825, 'Kalita Spectrum', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Kalita Spectrum, situated conveniently at Bus Stop, GS Rd, stands as a dynamic and forward-thinking business dedicated to serving the unique needs of the Assam community. More than just a commercial entity, Kalita Spectrum aims to be a vital hub, fostering growth and connection through its specialized offerings. The business recognizes the particular demands and opportunities presented by the local landscape and tailors its services to address them directly, striving to be a valuable asset to both individual customers and the broader business ecosystem of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Kalita Spectrum provides a multifaceted suite of services designed to empower its clientele. The primary offerings revolve around two key areas: technology solutions and business consulting. The technology solutions arm focuses on providing customized software development, IT support, and digital marketing strategies tailored for local businesses. Recognizing that many businesses in the region may lack the resources or expertise to navigate the digital world effectively, Kalita Spectrum bridges that gap with accessible and impactful solutions. From creating user-friendly websites and e-commerce platforms to implementing robust cybersecurity measures, the technology solutions team ensures businesses can operate efficiently and securely in today\'s digital age. The unique selling point here lies in the hyper-localization of these solutions, accounting for language preferences, local market trends, and specific regulatory requirements within Assam. <br> <br>\n\nOn the consulting side, Kalita Spectrum offers strategic business planning, financial advisory services, and market research aimed at fostering growth and sustainability for local enterprises. This includes assisting startups with developing viable business models, helping established companies optimize their operations, and guiding organizations through the complexities of obtaining funding and managing finances. Again, the focus is on providing bespoke advice that considers the unique economic and cultural context of Assam, differentiating it from generic consulting services. By combining technological prowess with sound business acumen, Kalita Spectrum equips businesses with the tools and knowledge they need to thrive in a competitive environment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Kalita Spectrum. The approach is built on fostering genuine relationships and understanding the individual needs of each client. Beyond simply delivering services, the team strives to create a supportive and collaborative environment where clients feel valued and empowered. This is achieved through proactive communication, personalized attention, and a commitment to exceeding expectations. Kalita Spectrum actively engages with the local community by participating in local events, sponsoring initiatives, and offering educational workshops. This fosters a sense of trust and mutual respect, solidifying its position as a reliable partner within the community. Furthermore, the staff is recruited locally, enriching the connection to the culture, and ensuring greater empathy when addressing customer needs and requests. By understanding the unique challenges and opportunities facing the local population, Kalita Spectrum can offer solutions that are not only effective but also culturally sensitive.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Kalita Spectrum envisions itself as a catalyst for growth and innovation within the Assam business landscape. The business plans to expand its service offerings to include training programs focused on digital literacy and entrepreneurship, further empowering individuals and businesses to succeed in the modern economy. Furthermore, Kalita Spectrum aims to establish strategic partnerships with other organizations and institutions to create a collaborative ecosystem that fosters innovation and economic development. This might include collaborations with local universities to provide internship opportunities for students or partnerships with government agencies to support small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs). Long-term goals include establishing Kalita Spectrum as a recognized center of excellence for technology solutions and business consulting within the region, contributing to the creation of jobs, and driving sustainable economic growth for the benefit of the entire community. By remaining responsive to the evolving needs of the market and continuously investing in its people and capabilities, Kalita Spectrum is poised to achieve its vision of becoming a transformative force within the Assam business community.</p>', 'Bus Stop, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:30:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1826, 'The Throttle Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The Throttle Cafe, strategically located near Hatigaon at Police Station, Hatigaon Bhetapara Rd, represents a vibrant and novel addition to the Assam culinary scene. More than just a place to grab a bite, it’s envisioned as a community hub where the love of good food meets a passion for all things automotive. The cafe distinguishes itself by creating a unique thematic dining experience, catering to a diverse clientele while seamlessly integrating into the local culture and economy of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, The Throttle Cafe offers a curated menu that blends familiar comfort food with innovative culinary creations, appealing to both adventurous palates and those seeking classic flavors. The cafe\'s signature offerings include gourmet burgers, artisanal pizzas with locally sourced ingredients, and a selection of globally-inspired dishes with a distinct Assamese twist. A diverse range of beverages, from freshly brewed coffee and exotic teas to refreshing mocktails and locally crafted juices, complement the food menu. Beyond the culinary offerings, The Throttle Cafe boasts a unique selling point: its automotive theme. The decor features carefully selected memorabilia, custom-built furniture incorporating automotive elements, and a generally immersive atmosphere for car and bike enthusiasts. This distinctive theme sets it apart from standard cafes in the area, attracting a niche market while remaining accessible and welcoming to a broader audience. Furthermore, the cafe recognizes the growing demand for healthier options, offering a selection of salads, vegetarian dishes, and gluten-free alternatives, addressing diverse dietary needs within the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Throttle Cafe prioritizes delivering an exceptional customer experience, placing a strong emphasis on personalized service and genuine hospitality. Staff members are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, attentive to customer needs, and proactive in creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere. The cafe aims to foster a sense of community by hosting regular events, such as live music performances by local artists, themed nights celebrating different cuisines, and gatherings for automotive enthusiasts. Feedback is actively solicited and incorporated to continuously improve the customer experience. To further connect with the local community, The Throttle Cafe actively participates in local initiatives and collaborates with nearby businesses. This includes sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers, supporting local artisans by showcasing their work within the cafe, and sponsoring community events. By integrating itself into the fabric of the Hatigaon neighborhood, The Throttle Cafe strives to become a beloved and integral part of the community\'s social life.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Throttle Cafe envisions a significant potential for growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and beyond. Future plans include introducing seasonal menu changes that capitalize on locally available produce, expanding the beverage offerings to include regional specialties, and developing a line of branded merchandise that captures the cafe\'s unique automotive theme. Furthermore, the cafe is exploring opportunities to offer catering services for local events and corporate functions, leveraging its culinary expertise and distinctive branding. Long-term goals include establishing The Throttle Cafe as a recognized brand synonymous with quality food, exceptional service, and a unique thematic experience. This vision may involve opening additional locations in strategic areas within Assam and potentially expanding into other Northeast Indian states. The focus remains on maintaining the core values of community engagement, customer satisfaction, and culinary innovation, ensuring that The Throttle Cafe continues to be a vibrant and relevant player in the region\'s growing hospitality sector.</p>', 'Police Station, Hatigaon Bhetapara Rd, near Hatigaon', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:30:16', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1827, 'Piquant', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Piquant, situated at House 189/2, Behind Tisa Medicos, Saikia Enclave, is rapidly establishing itself as a distinctive culinary and retail destination in the heart of Assam. More than just a shop or eatery, Piquant aims to be a vibrant hub where local flavors meet curated goods, offering a unique and memorable experience for residents and visitors alike. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning entrepreneurial spirit, Piquant seeks to contribute to the local economy by supporting local artisans and providing a platform for authentic Assamese products and culinary creations. Our focus on quality, authenticity, and community engagement sets us apart, making Piquant a welcome addition to the Saikia Enclave neighborhood and the broader Assam business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Piquant lies a dual offering: a carefully curated selection of artisanal products and a delectable range of locally inspired culinary treats. Our retail section showcases the talent and craftsmanship of local artisans, featuring handcrafted textiles, traditional Assamese crafts, organic teas, locally sourced spices, and unique gift items. We prioritize products that embody the region\'s cultural heritage and are produced sustainably and ethically. The culinary arm of Piquant offers a modern twist on traditional Assamese cuisine. Our menu features reimagined classics using fresh, locally sourced ingredients, catering to both traditional palates and those seeking innovative flavors. Think flavorful jolpan with a contemporary presentation, aromatic masor tenga crafted with seasonal fish, and a variety of homemade sweets that celebrate the region\'s rich culinary history. What truly sets Piquant apart is our commitment to providing a holistic experience. We don’t just sell products or serve food; we offer a story, a connection to the land, and a taste of Assam\'s soul. This approach effectively addresses the local market\'s desire for authentic experiences and high-quality, locally sourced goods and food.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Piquant. From the moment a customer steps through our doors, they are greeted with warm hospitality and personalized attention. Our staff is knowledgeable about our products and passionate about sharing the stories behind them. We strive to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting workshops featuring local artisans, organizing food festivals showcasing regional cuisine, and participating in local events. We believe in building strong relationships with our customers, treating them as neighbors and friends. This personalized approach extends to our online presence, where we actively engage with our followers on social media, responding promptly to inquiries and providing helpful information about our products and services. We regularly seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that we are meeting their needs. Our dedication to exceptional customer service and community engagement has helped us build a loyal customer base and establish Piquant as a trusted and respected member of the Saikia Enclave community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Piquant envisions a future where it becomes a leading ambassador for Assamese culture and craftsmanship. Our long-term goal is to expand our reach, both within Assam and beyond, while remaining true to our core values of quality, authenticity, and community engagement. We plan to achieve this by expanding our retail offerings to include a wider range of artisanal products from across the region, further refining our culinary menu to showcase the diversity of Assamese cuisine, and developing strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations. We are also exploring opportunities to establish an online presence to reach a wider audience and facilitate the sale of our products to customers both nationally and internationally. Another key aspect of our future vision is to empower local artisans and entrepreneurs by providing them with training and resources to help them grow their businesses. We believe that by supporting the local economy and fostering a culture of innovation, we can contribute to the sustainable development of the region. Piquant aspires to become more than just a business; we strive to be a cultural institution, a community gathering place, and a catalyst for positive change in Assam.</p>', 'House 189/2, Behind Tisa Medicos, Saikia Enclave', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:30:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1828, 'The Rush', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Located in the vibrant heart of Guwahati at RG Baruah Road, Zoo Rd, \'The Rush\' is quickly establishing itself as a dynamic and innovative hub catering to the evolving needs of the city\'s increasingly discerning clientele. More than just a business, The Rush aims to be a destination, a space where convenience, quality, and community converge to create a unique and enriching experience. Situated in a prime location known for its bustling activity and accessibility, The Rush is poised to become a landmark establishment within the local Assam business landscape. We strive to differentiate ourselves by understanding the specific nuances of the regional market and tailoring our offerings to reflect the local culture and preferences. Our core philosophy revolves around providing exceptional value while fostering a welcoming and inclusive environment for all.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>At its core, The Rush offers a curated selection of services and products designed to simplify and enhance daily life. While specific offerings might evolve with market trends and customer feedback, a key component of our current business model focuses on providing premium grab-and-go food options. This includes freshly prepared meals, artisanal snacks, and locally sourced beverages, catering to the fast-paced lifestyles of professionals, students, and residents in the area. We are committed to using high-quality ingredients, prioritizing local suppliers whenever possible to support the regional economy and ensure freshness. </p> <br> <br>\n<p>Beyond food and beverage, The Rush features a carefully selected retail component offering items that complement our core offerings and reflect the lifestyle of our target demographic. This could include unique gifts, locally crafted goods, and essential everyday items, creating a convenient one-stop shop for busy individuals. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of speed, quality, and local relevance. We are not just another convenience store or café; we are a curated experience that caters to the specific needs and desires of the Guwahati community. By emphasizing local sourcing, sustainable practices, and a commitment to quality, we strive to build a brand that resonates with the values of our customers. We address the local market needs by providing convenient access to high-quality products and services that are tailored to the specific tastes and preferences of the Assamese community, offering alternatives to generic, mass-produced options.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>The customer experience is paramount at The Rush. We believe that every interaction is an opportunity to build lasting relationships and create brand loyalty. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service. We aim to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. We encourage feedback and actively seek ways to improve our offerings and enhance the overall experience. Beyond individual interactions, The Rush actively seeks to connect with the local community through various initiatives. This includes partnering with local artists and artisans to showcase their work, sponsoring local events, and supporting charitable causes that are important to the community. By actively engaging with the community, we aim to become an integral part of the fabric of Guwahati, fostering a sense of belonging and shared purpose.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, The Rush envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. Our long-term goals include establishing multiple locations throughout Guwahati and other key cities in Assam. We plan to continuously evolve our offerings to meet the changing needs of the market, exploring opportunities to introduce new products and services that align with our core values. We also aim to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as implementing online ordering systems, loyalty programs, and personalized recommendations. We see opportunities to develop a strong online presence, reaching a wider audience and building a stronger brand identity. Ultimately, our vision is to become a leading lifestyle brand in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, convenience, and community. We are confident that by staying true to our core values and continuously adapting to the needs of our customers, The Rush can achieve its ambitious goals and make a positive impact on the local community.</p>', 'RG Baruah Road, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:30:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
