(1829, 'Safarnama', 'Cafes', '', 'Safarnama, nestled within the vibrant Sikaria Compound on GS Rd, near Sohum Shoppe, is rapidly becoming a cornerstone of travel and exploration within the Assam landscape. More than just a travel agency, Safarnama aspires to be a curator of authentic experiences, connecting locals and tourists alike with the rich tapestry of culture, adventure, and natural beauty that Assam and the wider Northeast India region have to offer. We differentiate ourselves through a dedication to personalized service, a deep understanding of the local terrain and its nuances, and a commitment to sustainable and responsible tourism practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core business revolves around crafting unforgettable travel experiences. We offer a comprehensive suite of services, encompassing tour packages, customized itineraries, transportation arrangements, and accommodation bookings. Our tour packages are meticulously designed to cater to diverse interests, from wildlife enthusiasts eager to explore the Kaziranga National Park to spiritual seekers drawn to the ancient temples of Kamakhya and Hajo. For those seeking a more personalized adventure, our team of experienced travel consultants works closely with each client to create bespoke itineraries that align perfectly with their individual preferences, budget, and timeframe.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA key differentiator for Safarnama is our deep-rooted local knowledge. Unlike larger, national travel agencies, we possess an intimate understanding of Assam’s hidden gems, off-the-beaten-path destinations, and unique cultural traditions. We partner with local guides, homestays, and artisans to ensure that our clients experience the authentic heart of the region. This local expertise also allows us to navigate logistical challenges with ease, ensuring seamless and stress-free travel for our clients. This knowledge extends to responsible tourism, ensuring our tours benefit local communities while minimizing environmental impact. We actively promote eco-friendly practices and support local businesses, fostering a sustainable tourism ecosystem.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Safarnama, we believe that exceptional customer service is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive environment where clients feel valued and understood. From the initial inquiry to the final farewell, our team is dedicated to providing prompt, professional, and personalized assistance. We understand that travel planning can be daunting, and we are committed to guiding our clients through every step of the process, answering their questions, addressing their concerns, and ensuring that their travel experience exceeds their expectations. This commitment extends beyond the booking process; we maintain ongoing communication with our clients throughout their journey, providing support and assistance as needed.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur approach to connecting with the local community is multi-faceted. We actively participate in local events and festivals, showcasing the region\'s cultural heritage and promoting tourism. We also partner with local organizations to support community development initiatives. By fostering strong relationships with the local community, we aim to contribute to the region\'s economic growth and cultural preservation. Furthermore, we tailor some of our tours specifically for local residents looking to explore other parts of Assam and Northeast India, providing affordable and accessible travel options for those within the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Safarnama envisions becoming the leading travel agency in Northeast India, renowned for its commitment to personalized service, authentic experiences, and sustainable tourism practices. Our future plans include expanding our range of tour packages to cater to emerging travel trends, such as adventure tourism, wellness retreats, and culinary experiences. We also plan to invest in technology to enhance our online booking platform and streamline our operations, making it easier for clients to plan and book their travel experiences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are committed to building a team of highly skilled and passionate travel professionals who share our vision of providing exceptional customer service and promoting responsible tourism. We will continue to invest in training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of the travel industry. We also aim to forge strategic partnerships with airlines, hotels, and other travel providers to offer our clients the best possible value and selection. Ultimately, Safarnama’s long-term goal is to create a positive impact on the region by promoting sustainable tourism, supporting local communities, and preserving Assam\'s rich cultural heritage for generations to come.', 'Sikaria Compound, GS Rd, near Sohum Shoppe', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:30:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1830, 'The Kaffeine Klub', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The Kaffeine Klub, a vibrant and welcoming café nestled on Tripura Rd in the heart of Assam, is more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a community hub, a meeting place, and a purveyor of exceptional coffee experiences. Strategically located on Tripura Rd, The Kaffeine Klub aims to be a defining element in the local business environment of Assam, offering a unique blend of tradition and modernity that resonates with the region\'s diverse population.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Kaffeine Klub offers a curated menu built around specialty coffee, sourced from both local Assam plantations and internationally acclaimed farms. We understand the importance of supporting local producers, and our selection of Assam coffee beans showcases the rich, distinctive flavors of the region. Beyond coffee, our menu features a selection of handcrafted beverages including teas, refreshing iced drinks, and unique seasonal creations. To complement our drinks, we offer a delicious array of freshly baked pastries, light meals, and locally inspired snacks, using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Our unique selling point lies in the seamless fusion of quality ingredients, expert preparation, and a commitment to providing a comfortable and inviting atmosphere. By emphasizing locally sourced Assam coffee and regional delicacies, The Kaffeine Klub caters to the growing demand for authentic, high-quality food and beverage experiences within the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Kaffeine Klub, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where every guest feels valued. Our baristas are not only skilled coffee artisans but also friendly faces ready to engage with customers, offer recommendations, and create personalized experiences. We go beyond simply serving beverages; we aim to build relationships. Our commitment to excellent service extends to offering free Wi-Fi, comfortable seating arrangements suitable for both individual work and group gatherings, and a curated playlist of music that enhances the overall ambiance. The Kaffeine Klub actively connects with the local community by hosting events such as open mic nights featuring local musicians, art exhibitions showcasing regional artists, and collaborative workshops with local artisans. By fostering these connections, The Kaffeine Klub seeks to be an integral part of the local fabric, enriching the community and providing a space for creativity and collaboration.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Kaffeine Klub envisions itself as a thriving and expanding business within Assam and potentially beyond. Our future plans include developing a line of signature coffee blends and teas for retail sale, allowing customers to enjoy The Kaffeine Klub experience at home. We also plan to expand our food offerings to include more substantial meal options, catering to a wider range of dietary needs and preferences. Furthermore, we are exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other key areas within Assam, bringing our unique blend of quality coffee, exceptional service, and community engagement to a broader audience. Long-term, our goal is to establish The Kaffeine Klub as a recognizable and respected brand synonymous with quality, community, and a celebration of Assam\'s rich culinary heritage. We are committed to sustainable business practices and are actively seeking ways to reduce our environmental footprint and support local initiatives. The Kaffeine Klub\'s vision is to not just serve coffee but to serve the community and contribute to the economic and cultural growth of Assam.</p>', 'Tripura Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:35:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1831, 'CAFE AS-01', 'Cafes', '', '<p>CAFE AS-01: A Contemporary Coffee House Rooted in Assamese Hospitality</p>\n\n<p>Nestled at 254, Rajgarh Rd, CAFE AS-01 offers a refreshing oasis in the bustling heart of the city. More than just a coffee shop, CAFE AS-01 is a community hub, a place where the aroma of freshly brewed coffee blends seamlessly with the warmth of Assamese hospitality. We aim to provide a unique and memorable experience, catering to the diverse needs of students, professionals, and residents alike, offering a space for relaxation, productivity, and connection. CAFE AS-01 distinguishes itself from conventional cafes by integrating locally sourced ingredients and traditional Assamese flavors into its menu, creating a distinct culinary identity that celebrates the region\'s rich heritage. Our commitment extends beyond serving excellent coffee; we strive to cultivate a welcoming atmosphere and contribute positively to the local economy and cultural landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around high-quality specialty coffee, sourced from reputable growers and expertly prepared by skilled baristas. We offer a diverse range of coffee beverages, from classic espressos and lattes to innovative signature drinks that incorporate local spices and flavors. Beyond coffee, CAFE AS-01 boasts a curated menu of light meals and snacks, featuring both continental favorites and Assamese-inspired dishes. Think freshly baked pastries, flavorful sandwiches using locally baked bread, and traditional Assamese snacks like *pitha* with a modern twist. A selection of refreshing beverages, including locally sourced fruit juices and herbal teas, complements the food offerings. What truly sets us apart is our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We partner with local farmers and producers to ensure the freshness and quality of our ingredients, while simultaneously supporting the local economy. This commitment translates into a unique and authentic culinary experience that reflects the flavors of Assam. Furthermore, we offer free, reliable Wi-Fi and comfortable seating options, making CAFE AS-01 an ideal location for students to study, professionals to work remotely, or anyone seeking a peaceful retreat.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At CAFE AS-01, customer experience is paramount. We believe in providing personalized and attentive service that makes every customer feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and passionate about coffee, readily offering recommendations and answering questions. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and service. We aim to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and connected. We regularly host events, such as live music performances featuring local artists and coffee tasting workshops, to foster a sense of community and engagement. We also actively participate in local initiatives and support local charities, further demonstrating our commitment to giving back to the community. Furthermore, we prioritize cleanliness and hygiene, ensuring a safe and comfortable environment for our customers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, CAFE AS-01 envisions becoming a leading coffee house in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, community, and Assamese culture. Our future plans include expanding our menu to offer a wider range of Assamese dishes and snacks, further showcasing the region\'s culinary diversity. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and encourage repeat business. Exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and craftspeople to showcase their products in our cafe is also on the agenda. We believe this will further enhance the customer experience and support the local creative economy. Long-term, we aspire to open additional locations throughout the region, bringing the CAFE AS-01 experience to a wider audience. We remain committed to our core values of quality, community, and Assamese hospitality as we embark on this journey of growth. We strive to be more than just a coffee shop; we aim to be a vibrant and integral part of the Rajgarh Rd community and a destination that celebrates the best of Assam.</p>', '254, Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:35:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1832, 'La Monalisha Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>La Monalisha Cafe: A Culinary Oasis Opposite Rajiv Bhawan</p>\n\n<p>La Monalisha Cafe, strategically located at ABC, opposite Rajiv Bhawan, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a destination where the vibrant culture of Assam blends seamlessly with modern culinary trends. In a region known for its rich tea heritage and burgeoning cafe scene, La Monalisha distinguishes itself by offering a carefully curated menu, a welcoming ambiance, and a genuine commitment to providing a memorable experience for every guest. We strive to be a cornerstone of the local community, a place where individuals can connect, relax, and savor moments of respite amidst the bustling city life. Our commitment to quality ingredients and innovative flavors sets us apart, establishing La Monalisha as a significant and cherished presence in the Assam business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At La Monalisha Cafe, we pride ourselves on offering a diverse range of services and products designed to cater to the varied palates of our clientele. Our core offerings include a meticulously crafted coffee menu featuring locally sourced Assam tea and premium coffee beans, ensuring an authentic and flavorful experience. We also provide an array of freshly baked pastries, cakes, and desserts, prepared daily with the finest ingredients. Beyond beverages and baked goods, our menu extends to include light meals such as sandwiches, salads, and regional specialties, providing satisfying options for breakfast, lunch, and dinner. <br> <br> A unique selling point of La Monalisha Cafe is our focus on incorporating local Assamese flavors into our menu. We collaborate with local farmers and suppliers to source fresh, seasonal ingredients, ensuring that our dishes reflect the unique culinary heritage of the region. This commitment to local sourcing not only supports the local economy but also allows us to offer our customers a truly authentic taste of Assam. Moreover, we offer customized catering services for small gatherings and corporate events, bringing the La Monalisha experience to your doorstep. We understand the local market\'s need for quality dining options that are both accessible and representative of the region\'s culinary identity, and our services are designed to meet this demand effectively.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at La Monalisha Cafe. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with a warm and inviting atmosphere. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and appreciated. We believe in building genuine connections with our patrons, taking the time to understand their preferences and cater to their individual needs. This personalized approach fosters loyalty and encourages repeat business. <br> <br> What sets La Monalisha Cafe apart is our commitment to creating a sense of community. We regularly host events and workshops that celebrate local art, music, and culture, providing a platform for local talent and fostering a sense of belonging. We actively engage with the local community through social media and local partnerships, ensuring that we are not just a business but also a responsible and engaged member of the neighborhood. We strive to create a space where people can come together, share ideas, and celebrate the vibrant spirit of Assam. Our customer-centric approach and community engagement efforts are integral to our success and contribute to our standing as a beloved local establishment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>La Monalisha Cafe envisions a future of sustained growth and expanded community impact. Our long-term goals include establishing ourselves as a premier destination for both locals and tourists seeking an authentic and enriching culinary experience. We plan to expand our menu offerings to include more regional specialties and innovative fusion dishes, further showcasing the diverse flavors of Assam. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of the city and the surrounding region, making the La Monalisha experience more accessible to a wider audience. <br> <br> Furthermore, we are committed to enhancing our online presence and offering online ordering and delivery services to cater to the growing demand for convenient dining options. We plan to invest in staff training and development to ensure that our team remains at the forefront of culinary trends and customer service excellence. We also aim to strengthen our partnerships with local farmers and suppliers, further solidifying our commitment to sustainable sourcing and supporting the local economy. Our vision is to not only be a successful business but also a positive force for change in the community, promoting local culture, fostering economic growth, and providing a welcoming space for all.</p>', 'ABC, opposite Rajiv Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:35:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1833, 'BARISTA', 'Cafes', '', 'BARISTA, nestled conveniently on Zoo Rd, is more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a vibrant hub bringing a sophisticated café culture to the heart of Assam. Recognizing a gap in the local market for expertly crafted coffee and a welcoming, globally-inspired atmosphere, BARISTA has quickly established itself as a premier destination for residents and visitors alike seeking a refined yet comfortable experience. More than simply selling coffee, BARISTA aims to cultivate a community centered around quality, connection, and a shared appreciation for the perfect cup. The strategic location on Zoo Rd, a bustling thoroughfare, ensures high visibility and accessibility, making BARISTA a convenient stop for those starting their day, taking a break, or meeting with friends and colleagues. BARISTA reflects the burgeoning economic dynamism of Assam, catering to an increasingly discerning clientele that values both quality and atmosphere.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, BARISTA offers a comprehensive range of coffee beverages, expertly prepared by skilled baristas trained in the art of espresso making. From classic espressos, cappuccinos, and lattes to innovative signature blends featuring locally sourced ingredients where possible, the menu caters to a diverse palate. Beyond coffee, BARISTA boasts a curated selection of teas, refreshing iced beverages, and decadent hot chocolates. Food offerings complement the beverage menu, including freshly baked pastries, savory sandwiches, and light meals perfect for breakfast, lunch, or a quick snack. A key differentiator for BARISTA is its commitment to quality ingredients. Coffee beans are carefully selected, ensuring a rich and flavorful brew. Milk is sourced from local dairies prioritizing freshness and supporting local agriculture. This dedication to quality extends to all ingredients used in the food menu, ensuring a consistently delicious and satisfying experience. This commitment to quality and freshness, paired with a varied menu, sets BARISTA apart from generic coffee chains and caters specifically to the growing demand for premium café experiences in the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBARISTA prioritizes creating a welcoming and memorable customer experience. The café\'s design incorporates elements of modern aesthetics with comfortable seating arrangements, fostering an atmosphere conducive to both relaxation and productivity. Friendly and attentive baristas are trained not just to prepare exceptional coffee but also to engage with customers, offering personalized recommendations and building relationships. Wi-Fi connectivity is readily available, making BARISTA an ideal workspace for freelancers and students. Community engagement is also paramount. BARISTA actively participates in local events and partners with nearby businesses to foster a sense of belonging. Regular promotions and special offers are designed to reward loyal customers and attract new ones. Furthermore, BARISTA aims to become a community gathering spot, hosting events such as live music performances or art exhibitions, thus further integrating itself into the social fabric of Zoo Rd and the surrounding area. BARISTA strives to be more than just a transaction; it strives to be a part of the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, BARISTA envisions becoming the leading independent café chain in Assam. Future plans include expanding its menu offerings to incorporate more regional specialties and seasonal ingredients. Consideration is being given to introducing a loyalty program to further reward repeat customers. The potential for opening additional locations in other strategic areas within Assam is actively being explored, carefully selecting sites that align with the brand\'s ethos and target market. A strong emphasis will continue to be placed on staff training and development, ensuring that BARISTA maintains its high standards of quality and customer service as it grows. Furthermore, BARISTA is committed to sustainable practices, exploring opportunities to reduce its environmental footprint and support local communities through fair trade partnerships and responsible sourcing. Ultimately, BARISTA aims to create a lasting legacy, not only as a successful business but also as a positive force within the Assam business landscape, contributing to the region\'s vibrant culture and economic growth.', 'Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:35:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1834, 'Banksy Café', 'Cafes', '', 'Banksy Café: A Unique Culinary and Artistic Oasis on Hengrabari Road\n\nBanksy Café is more than just a place to grab a coffee; it\'s a vibrant hub designed to invigorate the senses and foster community engagement on Hengrabari Road, Guwahati. Nestled amidst the bustling activity of its location, the café distinguishes itself through a unique fusion of high-quality culinary offerings, a captivating artistic ambiance inspired by street art, and a commitment to providing exceptional customer experiences. In a city known for its rich culture and emerging café scene, Banksy Café aims to stand out by offering a distinctive and memorable destination that caters to both locals and visitors alike. It contributes to the growing Assam business landscape by providing a differentiated product, attracting a diverse customer base, and promoting local talent.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Banksy Café lies a curated menu of artisanal coffee, delectable pastries, and light meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The coffee program features carefully selected beans, expertly roasted to deliver rich, flavorful brews ranging from classic espresso-based drinks to innovative specialty creations. Patrons can indulge in a variety of sweet and savory treats, from freshly baked croissants and muffins to satisfying sandwiches and salads, perfect for a quick lunch or an afternoon snack. A key differentiator is the café\'s commitment to incorporating Assam\'s unique culinary heritage into its offerings. This could include using local teas, spices, or ingredients in signature dishes and beverages, providing a taste of the region\'s distinct flavors. Banksy Café also offers a selection of refreshing beverages, including freshly squeezed juices, smoothies, and handcrafted iced teas, providing options for all tastes and preferences. Beyond just offering food and drinks, Banksy Café aims to be a lifestyle destination, providing a meeting place, a workspace, or a place for quiet reflection.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Banksy Café. The staff is trained to provide warm, friendly, and efficient service, creating a welcoming atmosphere for all visitors. The café\'s design further enhances the customer experience. The interior décor is carefully curated to reflect the spirit of street art, featuring murals, graffiti-inspired artwork, and vibrant colors. This unique aesthetic provides a visually stimulating environment that encourages conversation and creativity. Banksy Café also understands the importance of connecting with the local community. The café regularly hosts events such as live music performances, art exhibitions featuring local artists, and workshops focused on coffee brewing, culinary arts, and creative expression. By actively engaging with the community, Banksy Café fosters a sense of belonging and becomes a valuable gathering place for residents and visitors alike. Wi-Fi is freely available, catering to professionals who need a space to work and students seeking a comfortable study environment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe vision for Banksy Café extends beyond its current location on Hengrabari Road. Future plans include expanding the menu to include more substantial meal options and evening offerings, such as wine and beer, creating a vibrant nightlife destination. There are also plans to partner with local farmers and suppliers to further enhance the café\'s commitment to sourcing sustainable and ethical ingredients. Another significant goal is to establish Banksy Café as a platform for emerging artists and entrepreneurs in Assam. This could involve providing opportunities for local artists to showcase their work, hosting workshops and seminars to empower aspiring business owners, and collaborating with local businesses to promote their products and services. The long-term goal is to establish Banksy Café as a recognizable and respected brand throughout Guwahati and beyond, known for its commitment to quality, creativity, and community engagement. The ambition is to make Banksy Café a symbol of innovation and cultural vibrancy within the local business landscape, attracting tourists and locals alike to a unique space. The potential for franchise opportunities in other cities throughout Assam is also being explored, allowing the Banksy Café concept to reach a wider audience while maintaining its core values.', 'Hengrabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:35:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1835, 'The Cloud 9 - Cafe & Lounge', 'Cafes', '', '<p><b>The Cloud 9 - Cafe & Lounge: A Haven of Refreshment and Relaxation in the Heart of Guwahati</b></p>\n<br> <br>\nThe Cloud 9 - Cafe & Lounge, strategically located on GS Road, near the popular Silkalay Store, is rapidly becoming a cornerstone of the Guwahati social scene. More than just a cafe, The Cloud 9 is designed as an urban oasis, offering a meticulously curated experience that blends the comfort of a familiar cafe with the sophistication of a modern lounge. In a city known for its vibrant culture and growing cosmopolitan atmosphere, The Cloud 9 stands out by providing a versatile space that caters to diverse needs, from casual coffee meetings to celebratory gatherings. We\'ve identified a growing demand in the Assam business landscape for spaces that offer a seamless transition between work and leisure, and The Cloud 9 is purpose-built to fill that void. Our ambition is to become synonymous with quality, comfort, and community in Guwahati, a place where memories are made and connections are fostered.\n<br> <br>\nOur core offerings are built around providing exceptional food and beverage options in a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. At the heart of our cafe experience is our expertly brewed coffee, sourced from select growers and prepared by skilled baristas dedicated to crafting the perfect cup. Our menu extends beyond coffee, featuring a diverse range of teas, refreshing beverages, and delectable pastries, sandwiches, and light meals. What truly distinguishes The Cloud 9 is our emphasis on using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. In the evenings, The Cloud 9 transforms into a lounge, offering a carefully curated selection of wines, beers, and cocktails. Our bartenders are adept at crafting both classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks, ensuring there\'s something to suit every palate. The ambiance is further enhanced by thoughtfully selected music and lighting, creating a sophisticated yet approachable atmosphere perfect for unwinding after a long day or socializing with friends and colleagues. We also offer complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, making it an ideal spot for remote work or informal meetings.\n<br> <br>\nAt The Cloud 9, exceptional customer service is paramount. Our team is carefully selected and trained to anticipate the needs of our guests, providing friendly, attentive, and personalized service that goes above and beyond expectations. We believe that genuine hospitality is the key to building lasting relationships with our customers. Beyond just serving food and drinks, we strive to create a welcoming environment where everyone feels valued and appreciated. We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artists and musicians, organizing themed events, and partnering with local businesses. This helps us foster a sense of community and establish The Cloud 9 as a hub for cultural exchange and social interaction. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to ensure we are continuously improving and adapting to their evolving needs. Our commitment to customer satisfaction is reflected in our high customer retention rate and positive word-of-mouth referrals. We want every guest who walks through our doors to leave with a positive experience and a desire to return.\n<br> <br>\nThe Cloud 9 - Cafe & Lounge envisions becoming a recognized and respected brand throughout Assam. Our future plans include expanding our menu to offer a wider range of culinary options, catering to diverse dietary preferences and incorporating seasonal ingredients. We are exploring opportunities to partner with local food artisans and craft breweries to further showcase the region\'s unique offerings. We also plan to introduce loyalty programs and special promotions to reward our regular customers and attract new ones. In the long term, we envision expanding our presence to other strategic locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam. We are committed to sustainable business practices, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the community. Our goal is to build a business that is not only profitable but also socially responsible and environmentally conscious. Ultimately, we aspire to create a lasting legacy, establishing The Cloud 9 as a place where people can come together to connect, relax, and create unforgettable memories. We believe that with our dedication to quality, customer service, and community engagement, The Cloud 9 is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and become a vital part of the Assam business landscape.\n<br> <br>\nWe are also constantly adapting to new technologies to provide a better customer experience. Online ordering, reservation systems and streamlined payment options are all tools we are either currently using or actively exploring for implementation. This ensures we\'re not only providing a great physical experience, but a convenient digital one as well.', 'GS Rd, near Silkalay Store', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:40:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1836, 'KC House', 'Cafes', '', '<p>KC House: A Cornerstone of Commerce Near Kar Bhawan</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled on the ground floor of Kay M Plaza, strategically located by the bustling Bus stop near Kar Bhawan, KC House is rapidly establishing itself as a vital commercial hub within the Assam business landscape. More than just a business establishment, KC House aims to be a dynamic platform that connects local talent, provides essential services, and contributes to the economic vitality of the area. Its prime location makes it easily accessible to a wide range of customers, from daily commuters to local residents and businesses, positioning it as a central point for commercial activity. The unique aspect of KC House lies in its dedication to providing a curated selection of services that cater specifically to the identified needs of the surrounding community, blending convenience with quality. This commitment sets KC House apart and makes it a significant contributor to the growth of local commerce in the vicinity of Kar Bhawan.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, KC House provides a suite of carefully selected services and products designed to address the immediate needs of the local market. One of its primary offerings is high-speed internet access and related digital services, catering to the growing demand for online connectivity among students, professionals, and businesses alike. This is particularly crucial given the increasing reliance on digital communication and online transactions in today\'s world. Furthermore, KC House provides essential printing and photocopying services, catering to the document needs of individuals, students, and local businesses who require quick and reliable access to these facilities. Another significant aspect of the business is its curated selection of stationery and office supplies, fulfilling the requirements of nearby offices, educational institutions, and individuals who need essential supplies for their daily activities. The unique selling point of KC House lies in its commitment to providing high-quality services at competitive prices, coupled with unparalleled customer service and a deep understanding of the local market needs. This combination of factors makes it a preferred destination for customers seeking reliable and convenient solutions to their everyday requirements.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at KC House. From the moment a customer enters the premises, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and eager to assist customers with their needs. KC House aims to create a lasting impression by going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. Beyond providing excellent services, KC House is dedicated to building strong connections with the local community. It actively participates in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and camaraderie. This commitment to community engagement extends to supporting local businesses and organizations, creating a network of mutual support and collaboration. By prioritizing customer service and actively engaging with the community, KC House differentiates itself from its competitors and establishes itself as a trusted and valued member of the local business ecosystem. The goal is not just to provide services, but to build lasting relationships with customers and contribute to the overall well-being of the community near Kar Bhawan.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, KC House envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading commercial hub in the area. The business plans to expand its service offerings based on customer feedback and market analysis, potentially including value-added services. Furthermore, KC House aims to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, exploring options such as online ordering and digital payment solutions. A key long-term goal is to establish strategic partnerships with other local businesses and organizations, creating a synergistic network that benefits the entire community. The business also aspires to create employment opportunities for local residents, further contributing to the economic growth of the area. With a strong foundation built on customer satisfaction, community engagement, and a commitment to excellence, KC House is well-positioned for continued success and future growth in the vibrant business landscape near Kar Bhawan. The vision is to not just be a business, but to be a catalyst for positive change and economic development in the local area, serving as a beacon of opportunity and prosperity for the community.</p>', 'Ground floor, Kay M Plaza, Bus stop, near Kar Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:40:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1837, 'IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE', 'Cafes', '', '<p>IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE: A Unique Fusion of Flavors Atop Pancham Tower</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Located on the 2nd floor of Pancham Tower, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE offers a distinctive dining experience that seamlessly blends the warmth of Irish hospitality with the vibrant culinary traditions of Assam. More than just a cafe, it\'s a destination designed to be a hub for conversation, community, and culinary exploration. Nestled amidst the bustling cityscape, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE provides a welcoming oasis, offering both familiar comforts and exciting new tastes. The cafe aims to contribute to the local business landscape by creating a space that fosters connections and celebrates the rich cultural tapestry of the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE are its core offerings: a carefully curated menu featuring both traditional Irish dishes and locally inspired Assamese specialties. The menu caters to a diverse palate, offering options for breakfast, lunch, and dinner, as well as a selection of snacks and beverages throughout the day. Signature dishes include hearty Irish stews, freshly baked scones, and a range of Assamese delicacies such as <i>khar</i>, <i>masor tenga</i>, and other regional favorites, prepared using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The cafe also boasts a selection of premium teas, including Assam\'s famed black tea, alongside expertly crafted coffee drinks and refreshing beverages. A unique selling point is the cafe’s commitment to using authentic recipes and traditional cooking methods, ensuring that each dish delivers an unparalleled taste experience. This blend of international and local flavors caters directly to the diverse demographic of Assam, offering something for everyone and addressing the growing demand for diverse and authentic culinary experiences. The cafe’s commitment to quality and freshness is paramount, setting it apart from more generic offerings in the area.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The cafe\'s ambiance is carefully designed to be both inviting and relaxing, with comfortable seating arrangements and a decor that reflects both Irish charm and Assamese artistry. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and passionate about providing personalized recommendations. Beyond simply serving food and drinks, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE aims to foster a sense of community. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, book readings, and themed culinary nights, are planned to engage with the local community and create a vibrant social atmosphere. The cafe actively seeks feedback from customers and uses it to continuously improve its offerings and service. Building strong relationships with local suppliers and producers is also a key element of the cafe\'s approach, ensuring that the business contributes to the local economy and supports sustainable practices. The focus is on building lasting relationships with customers, making them feel valued and connected to the IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE envisions becoming a landmark destination in the local culinary scene. Plans are underway to expand the menu with new and innovative dishes, further showcasing the best of both Irish and Assamese cuisine. The cafe also aims to develop a loyalty program to reward repeat customers and strengthen customer relationships. Potential expansion opportunities are being explored, with the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam. Furthermore, the cafe plans to invest in online ordering and delivery services to cater to a wider audience. A long-term goal is to establish IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement. The business also aims to play a more active role in promoting local culture and tourism, potentially partnering with local artisans and tourism organizations. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, IRISH REPUBLICA CAFE is poised for sustainable growth and a lasting impact on the Assam business landscape. The ultimate vision is to create a space that not only serves exceptional food and drinks but also contributes positively to the social and cultural fabric of the community.</p>', '2ND FLOOR, PANCHAM TOWER', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:40:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1838, 'Bark Bark Coffee - A Pet Friendly Dog Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Bark Bark Coffee: A Pet-Friendly Oasis on Rajgarh Road</p>\n\n<p>Nestled on the bustling Rajgarh Road, Bark Bark Coffee is more than just a café; it\'s a community hub where the love of coffee intertwines with the unwavering bond between humans and their canine companions. Serving as a unique haven in the Assam business landscape, we cater to a growing demographic of pet owners and coffee enthusiasts seeking a welcoming and inclusive space. Beyond providing a comfortable setting to enjoy expertly crafted beverages and delectable treats, Bark Bark Coffee fosters a sense of belonging for both people and their furry friends, addressing a significant demand for pet-friendly establishments within the region.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our core offering revolves around a dual-pronged approach: high-quality coffee and a safe, stimulating environment for dogs. We meticulously source our coffee beans from reputable suppliers, ensuring a rich and flavorful experience for our patrons. Our menu features a diverse range of coffee preparations, from classic espressos and lattes to regionally inspired concoctions that incorporate local ingredients. Complementing our coffee selection are a variety of pastries, sandwiches, and light meals prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. </p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What truly sets Bark Bark Coffee apart is our dedication to creating a pet-friendly atmosphere. We offer a designated dog-friendly zone, complete with comfortable seating, water bowls, and complimentary dog treats. Recognizing the importance of responsible pet ownership, we maintain strict hygiene standards and enforce guidelines to ensure the safety and well-being of all our patrons, both human and canine. Our space is thoughtfully designed to provide ample room for dogs to socialize and play, promoting a sense of community among pet owners. We also offer a curated selection of pet-related products, including durable toys, organic treats, and stylish accessories, catering to the needs of our four-legged customers. Furthermore, we host occasional dog-related events, such as adoption drives and training workshops, further solidifying our commitment to the local pet community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Bark Bark Coffee, customer experience is paramount. We believe in creating a warm and welcoming environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide friendly and efficient service, catering to the individual needs of each customer, whether they are seeking a quick caffeine fix or a leisurely afternoon with their furry friend. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. Beyond providing exceptional coffee and a pet-friendly space, we strive to build genuine connections with our community. We participate in local events, partner with animal shelters, and actively promote responsible pet ownership. By fostering a sense of community and contributing to the well-being of both humans and animals, we aim to be more than just a café; we aspire to be a positive force in the local Rajgarh Road area.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Bark Bark Coffee envisions becoming the leading pet-friendly destination in Assam. Our future plans include expanding our menu to offer a wider range of food and beverage options, including specialized items for dogs with dietary restrictions. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses to offer complementary services, such as grooming and dog walking. We aim to establish a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and foster a stronger sense of community. Furthermore, we are committed to promoting responsible pet ownership through educational initiatives and partnerships with local animal welfare organizations. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to replicate the Bark Bark Coffee model in other locations throughout Assam, creating a network of pet-friendly spaces that celebrate the unique bond between humans and their canine companions while contributing to the economic and social well-being of the local communities we serve.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We are confident that Bark Bark Coffee\'s unique concept, commitment to quality, and dedication to customer satisfaction will continue to resonate with the local community and establish us as a beloved and enduring presence on Rajgarh Road.</p>', 'Rajgarh Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:40:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
