(1839, '45 Minutes Cafe', 'Cafes', '', '45 Minutes Cafe: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nNestled on the ground floor of the iconic Punjab National Bank building, opposite All India Radio in Guwahati, 45 Minutes Cafe offers a refreshing culinary escape from the bustle of city life. More than just a cafe, it\'s a meeting place, a quiet corner for contemplation, and a vibrant hub where the local Assamese community and visitors alike can connect over exceptional food and beverages. In a city known for its rich tea culture and burgeoning food scene, 45 Minutes Cafe distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality ingredients, efficient service, and a thoughtfully curated menu that blends familiar favorites with innovative twists, establishing it as a significant and appreciated addition to Guwahati\'s business landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of 45 Minutes Cafe lies a dedication to providing a diverse range of high-quality food and beverage options, all served with speed and efficiency. The cafe\'s primary offering revolves around a thoughtfully designed menu featuring everything from freshly brewed coffees and expertly crafted teas to delectable pastries, sandwiches, and light meals. Recognizing the local palate, the menu incorporates Assamese flavors and ingredients where appropriate, offering dishes that resonate with the community while also appealing to international tastes. A key differentiator is the cafe\'s commitment to sourcing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and businesses while ensuring the highest quality for its customers. The “45 Minutes” promise reflects a commitment to serving customers quickly, making it an ideal spot for busy professionals, students, and anyone looking for a satisfying meal or beverage on a tight schedule. The cafe also boasts a range of grab-and-go options, catering to the fast-paced lifestyles of those working and commuting in the area. Further enhancing its appeal is the availability of free Wi-Fi, making it a convenient spot for remote work or casual browsing.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at 45 Minutes Cafe. The staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and efficient service, ensuring that every customer feels welcome and valued. The cafe\'s ambiance is carefully cultivated to create a relaxing and inviting atmosphere, blending modern design elements with comfortable seating arrangements. The open layout fosters a sense of community, while strategically placed quiet corners provide privacy for those seeking a more secluded experience. 45 Minutes Cafe actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artists and businesses, showcasing their work and products within the cafe space. Regular events, such as live music performances or art exhibitions, further enhance the cafe\'s role as a community gathering place. Feedback is actively sought from customers through various channels, including online surveys and in-person interactions, allowing the cafe to continuously improve its offerings and better meet the needs of its clientele. This dedication to customer satisfaction and community engagement fosters loyalty and reinforces 45 Minutes Cafe\'s position as a valued member of the Guwahati business ecosystem.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, 45 Minutes Cafe envisions significant growth potential. Plans are underway to expand the menu with new and exciting offerings, including seasonal specials that showcase the best of Assamese produce. Expansion within Guwahati is being considered, with potential locations identified in other high-traffic areas. Furthermore, the cafe is exploring opportunities to develop a strong online presence, including online ordering and delivery services, to cater to a wider audience. A longer-term goal is to establish 45 Minutes Cafe as a recognized brand, synonymous with quality, efficiency, and community engagement. This might involve franchising opportunities or expansion into other cities within the Northeast region. Sustainability is also a key focus, with plans to implement eco-friendly practices throughout the cafe\'s operations, including reducing waste, using sustainable packaging, and supporting local environmental initiatives. By remaining committed to its core values of quality, service, and community, 45 Minutes Cafe aims to become a leading cafe brand in the region, contributing to the growth and vibrancy of Guwahati\'s business and social landscape.', 'Ground Floor, Punjab national bank building, opp. All India radio', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:40:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1840, 'Garden Café', 'Cafes', '', 'Garden Café: A Tranquil Oasis in the Heart of Assam\n\nGarden Café, nestled at the coordinates 5Q4M+F92, represents more than just a place to eat; it\'s a community hub where the vibrant flavors of Assam blend harmoniously with a serene, garden-like atmosphere. In a region renowned for its rich tea culture and stunning landscapes, Garden Café offers a unique dining experience that caters to both locals and visitors seeking respite and refreshment. It aims to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, providing a relaxing ambiance and high-quality offerings that set it apart.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors and Relaxation\n\nAt its heart, Garden Café offers a carefully curated menu featuring both traditional Assamese cuisine and popular cafe staples. Think of fragrant, locally sourced ingredients transformed into dishes that are both familiar and exciting. The menu extends beyond just food, encompassing a wide selection of beverages. From expertly brewed Assam tea, sourced directly from nearby tea gardens, to artisanal coffees and refreshing fruit smoothies, there\'s something to satisfy every palate.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly distinguishes Garden Café is its commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers and producers but also ensures the highest quality and flavor in every dish. The café is also known for its unique offerings such as special tea blends inspired by the surrounding flora and handcrafted Assamese sweets rarely found elsewhere. We understand the local market\'s desire for authenticity and quality, and strive to deliver on both fronts. Garden Cafe also offers catering services for small events, bringing its unique flavors and ambiance to private gatherings. We can design menus to perfectly fit the needs and theme of any gathering.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience: Cultivating Connections and Creating Memories\n\nGarden Café is designed to be an inviting and welcoming space for all. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide exceptional customer service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and appreciated. More than just taking orders, the team is empowered to engage with customers, share insights about the menu, and create a personalized experience. The garden setting itself contributes significantly to the overall customer experience, offering a tranquil escape from the hustle and bustle of daily life. Customers can relax amidst lush greenery, enjoy the fresh air, and savor their meals in a peaceful environment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe café also actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. It regularly hosts events such as live music performances by local artists, workshops on Assamese cooking and tea blending, and art exhibitions showcasing the talents of local creatives. By fostering a sense of community and supporting local talent, Garden Café aims to become a vital part of the social fabric of the area. In addition, Garden Café emphasizes sustainable practices. This includes minimizing waste, using eco-friendly packaging, and sourcing ingredients from producers who share a commitment to environmental responsibility.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: Blooming into a Regional Destination\n\nGarden Café envisions a future where it becomes a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement in Assam. The long-term goal is to expand the business, potentially opening additional locations in other parts of the region, while maintaining the unique character and values that define the original café. This expansion will be carefully managed to ensure that the quality of the food, service, and ambiance remains consistently high.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture plans also include enhancing the menu with new and innovative dishes that showcase the diversity of Assamese cuisine. There are plans to incorporate more traditional recipes, explore fusion cuisine, and create seasonal menus that take advantage of the region\'s abundant produce. Additionally, Garden Café aims to further develop its online presence, offering online ordering, delivery services, and engaging content that promotes the café and its values. This will help to reach a wider audience and build brand awareness. We will develop a robust social media strategy, and email marketing program to engage current and potential clients with news, promotions, and events.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nUltimately, Garden Café aspires to be more than just a successful business; it aims to be a force for good in the local community. By supporting local farmers, promoting Assamese culture, and creating a welcoming space for all, Garden Café hopes to contribute to the economic and social well-being of the region. The vision is to bloom into a regional destination, drawing visitors from far and wide who seek an authentic and enriching experience in the heart of Assam.', '5Q4M+F92', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:45:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1841, 'D\'Kaffeto', 'Cafes', '', '<article>\n<h1>D\'Kaffeto: A Culinary Oasis on Tayabulla Road</h1>\n\n<p>D\'Kaffeto, nestled at 53, Tayabulla Rd, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a vibrant hub contributing to the evolving culinary scene of Assam. We offer a unique blend of traditional Assamese hospitality and modern culinary techniques, creating a welcoming space for locals and visitors alike. Positioned strategically on Tayabulla Road, D\'Kaffeto aims to be a preferred destination for those seeking a relaxing atmosphere, quality food, and exceptional coffee, all while embracing the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Our Core Offerings: A Symphony of Flavors</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of D\'Kaffeto lies a commitment to providing high-quality food and beverages that cater to diverse palates. Our menu features a curated selection of dishes, ranging from traditional Assamese delicacies prepared with locally sourced ingredients to popular continental favorites. We pride ourselves on using fresh, seasonal produce to ensure optimal flavor and nutritional value. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Coffee, naturally, is a cornerstone of our business. We serve expertly crafted coffee beverages using premium Arabica beans, sourced from reputable regional growers when available. From classic espressos and lattes to unique signature blends infused with local spices, our coffee menu is designed to tantalize the taste buds of even the most discerning coffee connoisseur. Beyond coffee, we offer a wide array of refreshing beverages including handcrafted teas, juices, and smoothies, perfect for the Assam climate. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our unique selling proposition stems from our dedication to creating an authentic and memorable dining experience. We strive to elevate the traditional cafe experience by combining exceptional food and drink with a warm and inviting ambiance. Further, whenever possible, we highlight the origin and stories behind our ingredients, connecting customers with the local farmers and producers who contribute to our culinary creations. This transparent approach builds trust and fosters a deeper appreciation for the food we serve. D\'Kaffeto addresses the growing demand for quality dining options within the local market, offering a sophisticated yet approachable alternative to conventional eateries.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Building Community, One Cup at a Time</h2>\n\n<p>At D\'Kaffeto, customer satisfaction is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our patrons by providing attentive and personalized service. Our staff is carefully trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and eager to assist customers with their selections. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where everyone feels comfortable and valued. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local artists and musicians, participating in community events, and supporting local charities. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, fostering a sense of mutual respect and collaboration. We are committed to incorporating feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and enhance the overall dining experience. Our focus extends beyond simply serving food; it is about cultivating a vibrant community space where people can connect, relax, and enjoy the best that Assam has to offer.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<h2>Looking Ahead: A Vision for Growth and Sustainability</h2>\n\n<p>D\'Kaffeto envisions a future where it remains a beloved landmark on Tayabulla Road and a significant contributor to the local economy. We plan to expand our menu, introducing new and innovative dishes that showcase the culinary diversity of Assam and beyond. We are exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and producers to further strengthen our commitment to sourcing sustainable and ethically produced ingredients.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our long-term goals include expanding our operations to other strategic locations within Assam, while maintaining the same high standards of quality and service that have become synonymous with the D\'Kaffeto brand. We are also exploring opportunities to develop a line of packaged food products featuring our signature recipes, allowing customers to enjoy the D\'Kaffeto experience in the comfort of their own homes. Ultimately, D\'Kaffeto aims to be more than just a cafe; it aspires to be a symbol of culinary excellence and community spirit, contributing to the vibrancy and prosperity of Assam for generations to come. We are dedicated to fostering a sustainable business model that benefits both our customers and the local community, ensuring a bright and delicious future for all.</p>\n</article>', '53, Tayabulla Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:45:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1842, 'Leaf & Bean', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Leaf & Bean, nestled in the heart of Assam at 4QRW+Q82, is more than just a purveyor of fine teas and coffees; it\'s an experience. We are dedicated to showcasing the rich agricultural heritage of the region, offering a curated selection of locally sourced Assam teas and freshly roasted coffees alongside complementary artisanal goods. In a market increasingly dominated by mass-produced beverages, Leaf & Bean stands out by prioritizing quality, authenticity, and a deep connection to the local community. Our commitment to sustainable practices and fair trade principles further distinguishes us, ensuring that every cup supports both the environment and the livelihoods of local farmers.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering centers around two pillars: premium Assam teas and freshly roasted specialty coffees. We source our tea leaves directly from select gardens known for their exceptional quality and adherence to traditional cultivation methods. This allows us to offer a diverse range of black, green, and white teas, each with its unique flavor profile reflecting the terroir of Assam. Our coffee beans, while sourced from various reputable origins to provide a breadth of flavor experiences, are roasted in-house using state-of-the-art equipment. This ensures optimal freshness and allows us to meticulously control the roasting process, maximizing the inherent characteristics of each bean. Beyond beverages, we also offer a selection of locally baked goods, artisanal honey, and handmade crafts that complement our drinks and provide a platform for other local artisans. Our unique selling point lies in our unwavering commitment to quality and traceability, allowing customers to understand the origins of their tea and coffee, and appreciate the artistry involved in their creation. This focus on local sourcing directly addresses the growing demand for authentic and sustainable products in the Assam market, supporting local economies and promoting regional specialties.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At Leaf & Bean, customer service is not merely a transaction; it\'s about building relationships and creating a welcoming atmosphere. Our team is trained to be knowledgeable about our products, offering personalized recommendations and sharing the stories behind each tea and coffee. We believe in creating a space where customers feel comfortable exploring new flavors and learning about the rich cultural heritage of Assam. Our cafe is designed to be a community hub, hosting regular events such as tea tasting workshops, coffee brewing demonstrations, and art exhibitions featuring local talent. We actively engage with the local community through partnerships with schools, charitable organizations, and farmers\' cooperatives. This commitment to social responsibility extends beyond our immediate community, as we actively promote sustainable farming practices and fair trade principles. By fostering a sense of belonging and promoting local culture, we aim to be more than just a cafe; we strive to be a positive force in the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Leaf & Bean envisions becoming a leading destination for premium Assam teas and specialty coffees in the region, recognized for our unwavering commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our online presence to reach a wider customer base, offering nationwide shipping and online tea and coffee subscriptions. We also plan to introduce a line of Leaf & Bean branded products, including tea infusers, coffee brewing equipment, and gift sets, further enhancing our brand recognition and expanding our revenue streams. A key element of our long-term vision is to establish direct trade relationships with more local tea gardens and coffee farmers, ensuring fair prices and promoting sustainable agricultural practices. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in strategic locations throughout Assam, bringing the Leaf & Bean experience to a broader audience. Ultimately, our goal is to showcase the unique flavors and cultural heritage of Assam to the world, while empowering local communities and promoting sustainable development. We see immense potential for growth in the Assam market, driven by increasing consumer awareness of quality and sustainability, and we are confident that Leaf & Bean is well-positioned to capitalize on these trends.</p>', '4QRW+Q82', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:45:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1843, 'Taobao', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Taobao, located on the 4th Floor of Aurus Mall, GS Rd, is rapidly establishing itself as a vibrant hub for curated lifestyle products, fashion, and unique artisanal goods, offering a compelling blend of traditional craftsmanship and contemporary design. More than just a retail space, Taobao strives to be a destination where local artistry is celebrated, and customers can discover distinctive pieces that reflect their individual style and support local enterprise. Its presence within the prominent Aurus Mall allows Taobao to access a broad customer base and contribute significantly to the evolving retail landscape of Assam. Taobao aims to provide a dynamic and inspiring shopping experience, differentiating itself from mainstream retailers through its dedication to quality, authenticity, and community engagement. </p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Taobao offers a diverse range of products designed to cater to the discerning tastes of the local market. The primary offerings include: a carefully curated selection of apparel from both established and emerging designers, showcasing contemporary trends alongside traditional Assamese textiles; a collection of handcrafted artisanal goods, encompassing ceramics, woodwork, and other unique home décor items; and a range of fashion accessories, from jewelry and bags to scarves and belts, sourced from local artisans and regional suppliers. The unique selling point lies in Taobao\'s commitment to sourcing high-quality, often locally-made, products that are not readily available elsewhere. This deliberate focus on supporting local artisans not only fosters regional economic growth but also provides customers with access to truly unique and authentic items. By understanding the local market\'s appreciation for craftsmanship and quality, Taobao successfully bridges the gap between traditional artistry and contemporary lifestyle needs. For example, handwoven Eri silk shawls, sourced directly from local weavers, are presented alongside modern, minimalist jewelry designs, appealing to a broad spectrum of customers with varying preferences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Taobao prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience, recognizing that building lasting relationships is crucial for long-term success. The store\'s ambiance is designed to be welcoming and inviting, with thoughtfully curated displays and attentive staff who are passionate about the products they sell. Customer service goes beyond simple transactions; the team at Taobao strives to provide personalized recommendations, style advice, and detailed information about the origin and craftsmanship of each item. This commitment to transparency and knowledge empowers customers to make informed purchasing decisions and fosters a deeper appreciation for the artistry behind the products. Regular workshops and events, showcasing local artisans and their crafts, further enhance the customer experience and strengthen Taobao\'s connection with the local community. These events provide opportunities for customers to meet the creators behind the products, learn about traditional techniques, and engage in hands-on activities, fostering a sense of community and shared appreciation for Assamese culture. Taobao actively seeks feedback from its customers, continuously refining its product offerings and services to better meet their needs and expectations. This customer-centric approach differentiates Taobao from larger retail chains and establishes it as a trusted destination for unique and high-quality products.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Taobao envisions significant growth potential and has ambitious plans for the future. The immediate focus is on expanding the product range to include additional categories, such as handcrafted furniture and sustainable home goods, while maintaining the commitment to quality and local sourcing. Exploring opportunities to partner with more artisans from across the Northeast region is also a key priority, further strengthening Taobao\'s position as a champion of regional craftsmanship. In the long term, Taobao aims to establish a stronger online presence, enabling it to reach a wider audience beyond the local area. This includes developing an e-commerce platform that showcases the diverse range of products and provides detailed information about the artisans and their stories. Furthermore, Taobao plans to explore opportunities to collaborate with other businesses and organizations to promote sustainable practices and support local economic development. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Taobao is poised to become a leading destination for curated lifestyle products and a significant contributor to the cultural and economic vibrancy of Assam. Ultimately, Taobao\'s long-term goal is to create a lasting legacy of supporting local artistry and providing customers with access to unique and high-quality products that reflect the rich heritage of the region.</p>', '4th Floor, Aurus Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:45:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1844, 'The Deck Cafe By Mayflower', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The Deck Cafe By Mayflower, strategically located on MLN Road, offers a refreshing oasis in the bustling heart of Assam. More than just a cafe, it\'s a carefully curated experience designed to blend the relaxed atmosphere of a deck with the rich culinary heritage of the region. We aim to be a vital hub for both the local community and visitors, offering a welcoming space for relaxation, connection, and the enjoyment of high-quality food and beverages. In a market increasingly seeking authentic and personalized experiences, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower distinguishes itself by providing a unique setting and a commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. We strive to contribute positively to the local business ecosystem by fostering relationships with local farmers and artisans, strengthening our community ties, and offering a distinctive alternative to standard cafe fare.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower offers a diverse menu of freshly prepared food and beverages. Our selection ranges from light bites and healthy salads to more substantial meals, catering to a variety of palates and dietary preferences. A key differentiator lies in our commitment to showcasing Assam\'s rich culinary traditions. We incorporate locally sourced tea, spices, and produce into our dishes, creating unique and flavorful options that reflect the region’s identity. Alongside classic cafe staples like expertly brewed coffee and refreshing iced beverages, we feature regional specialties and innovative fusion dishes that appeal to both adventurous foodies and those seeking familiar comforts. Our outdoor seating area, designed to resemble a relaxed deck, provides a unique and inviting ambiance that sets us apart from typical indoor cafes. This allows customers to enjoy the pleasant Assam weather while savoring their meals and drinks. By prioritizing quality ingredients, diverse menu options, and a unique atmosphere, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower effectively addresses the local market\'s demand for distinctive dining experiences and a comfortable social gathering place.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Deck Cafe By Mayflower. We strive to create a warm and welcoming environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each visit is memorable. We actively solicit customer feedback and use it to continually improve our offerings and service standards. Recognizing the importance of community engagement, we regularly host events such as live music performances featuring local artists, art exhibitions showcasing regional talent, and workshops related to food, culture, and sustainability. These events not only provide entertainment but also create opportunities for people to connect and build relationships within the community. We also actively participate in local initiatives and collaborate with other businesses to support community development. By fostering a strong sense of community and providing exceptional customer service, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower aims to be more than just a cafe; we aspire to be a beloved gathering place that contributes positively to the social fabric of MLN Road and beyond.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower envisions continued growth and expansion while maintaining its commitment to quality and community engagement. We plan to introduce new menu items and seasonal specials that further showcase the region\'s culinary diversity. We are exploring opportunities to expand our catering services to meet the growing demand for high-quality food at local events and gatherings. Another key focus is on enhancing our sustainability practices by reducing waste, sourcing more ingredients locally, and implementing eco-friendly operational procedures. We also aim to strengthen our online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms to reach a wider audience. Long-term, we aspire to establish The Deck Cafe By Mayflower as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, community, and the authentic flavors of Assam. This may involve opening additional locations or exploring franchising opportunities, always with the goal of maintaining our core values and providing exceptional experiences to our customers and contributing positively to the local economy. We believe that by staying true to our vision and continuously innovating, The Deck Cafe By Mayflower has the potential to become a thriving and enduring business that enriches the lives of the people we serve.</p>', 'MLN Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:45:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1845, 'Bagan : Patio Cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'Bagan : Patio Cafe is a distinctive culinary and social destination situated in the heart of Guwahati, Assam, specifically at The Greenwood, Bhabendra Nath Sakia Road, Beltola - Basistha Rd. More than just a cafe, Bagan offers a carefully curated experience blending the warmth of Assamese hospitality with the vibrant energy of a modern patio setting. It distinguishes itself in the local business landscape by providing a relaxed yet refined atmosphere, catering to diverse needs ranging from casual meetups to more formal gatherings. The strategic location provides convenient access for residents and visitors alike, establishing Bagan as a prominent landmark in the Beltola-Basistha area.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBagan : Patio Cafe’s core offerings revolve around providing a delectable array of food and beverage options within a welcoming ambiance. Our primary services encompass a wide-ranging menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and popular continental dishes, meticulously prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From flavorful Assamese thalis showcasing regional specialties to expertly brewed coffee and refreshing beverages, Bagan caters to a variety of palates. Beyond the food, Bagan offers a comfortable and aesthetically pleasing environment for customers to relax, socialize, or work remotely. The patio setting provides a unique open-air experience, setting it apart from typical enclosed cafes. A crucial selling point is the cafe\'s commitment to quality – not just in the ingredients and preparation of its menu items, but also in the overall ambiance and service. The offerings directly address the local market\'s need for a high-quality dining and social experience in a comfortable and accessible setting. We understand the community\'s desire for a space that reflects both tradition and modernity.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Bagan : Patio Cafe. The approach to service is centered on creating a welcoming and personalized environment for each guest. Staff are trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable about the menu, ensuring that every customer feels valued and well-cared for. Bagan strives to foster a sense of community by hosting occasional events, showcasing local artists, and partnering with nearby organizations. What truly makes Bagan stand out is its genuine connection with the local community. The cafe actively engages with local suppliers, supporting their businesses and incorporating their products into the menu. It serves as a gathering place for local residents, students, and professionals, creating a sense of belonging and fostering social interaction. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the offerings and overall experience. The goal is not just to provide food and beverages, but to create memorable moments and build lasting relationships with the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Bagan : Patio Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion while staying true to its core values of quality, community, and customer satisfaction. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more seasonal and regional specialties, enhancing the patio space with additional features and amenities, and exploring opportunities to collaborate with local artisans and businesses on a larger scale. The long-term goals involve establishing Bagan as a premier culinary and social destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional food, outstanding service, and strong community ties. The business recognizes the potential for scaling its operations, perhaps through opening additional locations or developing a catering service, while maintaining the same high standards of quality and customer focus that define the Bagan brand. By continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the local market, Bagan : Patio Cafe is poised to become an enduring success story in the Assamese business landscape.', 'The Greenwood, Bhabendra Nath Sakia Road, Beltola - Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:50:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1846, 'TeaKingdom', 'Cafes', '', '<article>\n<h1>TeaKingdom: A Taste of Assam\'s Finest</h1>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Assam at 5QCG+QVW, Uday Path, TeaKingdom isn\'t just a tea shop; it\'s an experience, a celebration of Assam\'s rich tea heritage, and a vibrant hub for the local community. More than just a beverage provider, TeaKingdom aims to be a cultural touchstone, offering both traditional and innovative tea experiences that cater to diverse palates while staying true to the essence of Assam\'s world-renowned tea. In a region steeped in tea culture, TeaKingdom distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, its innovative product offerings, and its deep connection to the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<section>\n<h2>Core Services and Products: Beyond the Cup</h2>\n\n<p>At its core, TeaKingdom offers a wide array of premium Assam teas, sourced directly from local gardens known for their commitment to sustainable practices and exceptional flavor profiles. From robust and malty CTC teas perfect for a morning boost to delicate and aromatic Orthodox teas ideal for afternoon relaxation, TeaKingdom caters to every tea lover\'s preference. We go beyond the traditional offerings with our signature blends, crafted in-house to capture the unique flavors of the region. These innovative blends often incorporate local spices, fruits, and herbs, creating a truly unique and memorable tea experience. <br> <br>Beyond the tea itself, TeaKingdom offers a curated selection of teaware, including traditional Assamese bamboo cups and modern ceramic designs. This allows customers to not only enjoy our teas but also elevate their tea-drinking ritual. To complement our tea offerings, we also provide a selection of locally sourced snacks and pastries, designed to perfectly pair with our various tea blends. Our focus on local sourcing ensures the freshness and quality of our products, while also supporting other businesses in the region. <br> <br>Our unique selling point lies in our ability to blend tradition with innovation. We honor the heritage of Assam tea while simultaneously introducing new and exciting flavors and experiences. This approach resonates with both locals and tourists alike, making TeaKingdom a destination for those seeking an authentic and memorable taste of Assam. We address the local market needs by providing a central location where people can purchase high-quality tea, learn about its production, and connect with other tea enthusiasts.</p>\n</section>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<section>\n<h2>Customer Experience: Building Community One Cup at a Time</h2>\n\n<p>At TeaKingdom, customer service isn\'t just a department; it\'s a philosophy. Every interaction is an opportunity to build relationships and create a welcoming and memorable experience. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our teas, offering personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. We encourage customers to sample different blends and learn about the origin and production of each tea. This educational approach fosters a deeper appreciation for Assam tea and empowers customers to make informed choices. <br> <br>What truly sets TeaKingdom apart is our commitment to connecting with the local community. We regularly host tea tasting events, workshops, and cultural performances that celebrate the traditions of Assam. These events provide a platform for local artisans and performers to showcase their talents, while also creating a sense of community among our customers. We also partner with local schools and organizations to promote tea education and awareness among younger generations. By actively engaging with the community, TeaKingdom has become more than just a business; it\'s a gathering place, a cultural center, and a source of local pride. We strive to create a warm, inviting atmosphere where everyone feels welcome, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p>\n</section>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<section>\n<h2>Future Vision: Cultivating Growth and Innovation</h2>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, TeaKingdom envisions expanding its reach while staying true to its core values. One key area of focus is expanding our online presence to cater to a wider audience, both domestically and internationally. This will involve developing a user-friendly e-commerce platform and implementing effective marketing strategies to reach new customers. We also plan to explore opportunities for franchising, allowing us to bring the TeaKingdom experience to other parts of Assam and beyond, while maintaining our commitment to quality and local sourcing. <br> <br>Innovation will continue to be a driving force behind our growth. We plan to invest in research and development to create new and exciting tea blends, utilizing local ingredients and exploring new brewing techniques. We also intend to expand our product line to include tea-infused food items and other tea-related products, further enhancing the TeaKingdom experience. <br> <br>Our long-term goal is to establish TeaKingdom as a leading brand in the Assam tea industry, recognized for its quality, innovation, and commitment to the local community. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously seeking new ways to enhance the customer experience, we can achieve sustainable growth and make a positive impact on the region\'s tea culture. We aim to not only sell tea but to also preserve and promote the rich heritage of Assam tea for generations to come, solidifying our position as a cultural ambassador of the region.</p>\n</section>\n</article>', '5QCG+QVW, Uday Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:50:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1847, 'MUNCH POINT CAFE', 'Cafes', '', 'MUNCH POINT CAFE: A Culinary Oasis in Lakhimi Nagar\n\nMUNCH POINT CAFE, situated at the convenient address of 10, Lakhimi Nagar Rd, stands as a vibrant and welcoming haven for food enthusiasts in the heart of Assam. More than just a café, MUNCH POINT aspires to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can gather, connect, and enjoy a delightful culinary experience. Recognizing the growing demand for high-quality, diverse food options within a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, MUNCH POINT CAFE fills a unique niche in the local business landscape by blending traditional Assam flavors with contemporary café fare. We strive to offer a refreshing alternative to the usual dining experiences, catering to a broad spectrum of tastes and preferences while embracing the rich culinary heritage of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of MUNCH POINT CAFE lies a commitment to providing exceptional food and beverage offerings. Our core menu revolves around a diverse selection of freshly prepared items, ranging from aromatic Assamese tea blends and robust coffee variations to delectable pastries, sandwiches, and light meals. We pride ourselves on sourcing locally grown ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness, supporting local farmers, and minimizing our environmental impact. This dedication to local sourcing not only enhances the flavor profiles of our dishes but also contributes to the sustainability of the regional economy.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA significant unique selling point of MUNCH POINT CAFE is our fusion menu, which artfully combines traditional Assamese cuisine with modern culinary techniques. Imagine savoring a subtly spiced \'Masor Tenga\' inspired sandwich or indulging in a \'Pitha\' inspired pastry, each bite offering a delightful exploration of flavors. This innovative approach caters to both those seeking familiar comforts and adventurous palates eager to experience new culinary horizons. Furthermore, we offer a rotating menu of seasonal specials, ensuring that there’s always something new and exciting to discover. This ensures that our offerings consistently meet the evolving taste preferences of the local market. Understanding the varied needs of our clientele, we also provide options for dietary restrictions, including vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free choices, making MUNCH POINT CAFE an inclusive and accessible destination for everyone.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at MUNCH POINT CAFE is paramount. We believe that creating a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere is just as important as serving delicious food. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and appreciated. From the moment you step through our doors, you\'ll be greeted with a warm smile and attentive service, making you feel right at home.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe strive to foster a strong connection with the local community by actively participating in local events and initiatives. We host regular live music performances featuring local artists, showcasing the region\'s vibrant cultural scene. Additionally, we collaborate with local artisans and craftspeople to feature their products within the café, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. By actively engaging with the community, MUNCH POINT CAFE aims to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a valued and integral part of the Lakhimi Nagar neighborhood. Moreover, we leverage customer feedback through surveys and direct interactions to continuously improve our offerings and services, demonstrating our commitment to exceeding customer expectations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, MUNCH POINT CAFE envisions expanding its presence within the local Assam business landscape. Our long-term goals include opening additional locations in neighboring towns and cities, bringing our unique blend of traditional and modern cuisine to a wider audience. We also plan to further develop our catering services, providing delicious and customized menus for local events and gatherings. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to partner with local educational institutions to offer internships and training programs, contributing to the development of the next generation of culinary professionals in Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAnother key aspect of our future vision is to strengthen our commitment to sustainability and ethical sourcing. We are actively researching ways to reduce our environmental footprint through initiatives such as composting food waste, using eco-friendly packaging, and partnering with suppliers who share our commitment to responsible practices. Ultimately, MUNCH POINT CAFE strives to be a beacon of culinary excellence, community engagement, and sustainable business practices in the heart of Assam. We believe that by providing exceptional food, creating a welcoming atmosphere, and actively supporting the local community, we can achieve our long-term goals and solidify our position as a leading café destination in the region.', '10, Lakhimi Nagar Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:50:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1848, 'The Caffeine Bar', 'Cafes', '', '<p>The Caffeine Bar, nestled on the 1st Floor of Harbala Market, is more than just a coffee shop; it\'s a vibrant hub designed to invigorate the local Assam community with exceptional coffee, delectable treats, and a welcoming atmosphere. Recognizing the growing demand for high-quality coffee experiences and a social gathering place, The Caffeine Bar aims to be a cornerstone of Harbala Market, offering a sophisticated yet accessible escape from the everyday. Our commitment to sourcing premium ingredients and providing personalized service sets us apart, making us a significant addition to the evolving culinary landscape of the region. We strive to create a space where customers can connect, relax, and fuel their day with the best that Assam has to offer, while also contributing to the economic vitality of Harbala Market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, The Caffeine Bar specializes in handcrafted coffee beverages, prepared with meticulously selected beans sourced from reputable regional suppliers and beyond. Our offerings range from classic espresso drinks like lattes and cappuccinos, crafted with precision and care, to unique signature blends inspired by local flavors and preferences. Beyond coffee, our menu boasts a tempting array of freshly baked pastries, light meals, and refreshing beverages, catering to a wide range of palates. Unique selling points include our commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers and producers. We also pride ourselves on our artisanal approach to coffee preparation, employing skilled baristas who are passionate about their craft and dedicated to providing consistently excellent beverages. Furthermore, The Caffeine Bar offers customizable options, allowing customers to tailor their drinks to their specific tastes and dietary needs. These services directly address the local market needs by providing a premium coffee experience that is both convenient and accessible within the bustling Harbala Market area, catering to students, professionals, and residents alike seeking a quality caffeine fix and a place to unwind.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The customer experience is paramount at The Caffeine Bar. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our baristas are trained not only to expertly prepare coffee but also to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and service standards. What truly sets The Caffeine Bar apart is our commitment to fostering a sense of community. We regularly host events such as open mic nights, coffee tasting sessions, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local talent and encouraging social interaction. We also actively participate in local initiatives, partnering with community organizations and supporting charitable causes. This approach allows us to connect with the local community on a deeper level, transforming The Caffeine Bar from just a coffee shop into a vital social hub that contributes to the well-being of Harbala Market and its residents.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for The Caffeine Bar is ambitious yet grounded in a deep understanding of the local market and its potential. We plan to expand our menu to include more locally inspired dishes and beverages, further showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam. We also envision establishing partnerships with other local businesses to create mutually beneficial collaborations. A key aspect of our growth strategy involves enhancing our online presence and offering online ordering and delivery services to cater to the evolving needs of our customers. Looking further ahead, we aspire to open additional locations within Assam, bringing the unique Caffeine Bar experience to a wider audience. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to become a leading coffee brand in the region, recognized not only for its exceptional coffee and food but also for its commitment to community engagement and sustainable business practices. We believe that by staying true to our values and continuously innovating, The Caffeine Bar has the potential to become a lasting and impactful presence in the Assam business landscape.</p>', '1st Floor, Harbala Market', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:50:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
