(1849, 'Terra Mayaa', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Terra Mayaa, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 6th, Anil Plaza - II, 2, GS Rd, is a unique establishment that seamlessly blends traditional Assamese artistry with contemporary design, offering a curated experience that resonates with both locals and visitors alike. More than just a retail space, Terra Mayaa serves as a vibrant hub for cultural expression, showcasing the rich heritage of Assam through meticulously crafted products and immersive experiences. In a region brimming with natural beauty and cultural depth, Terra Mayaa distinguishes itself by providing a platform for local artisans, fostering sustainable practices, and offering customers a tangible connection to the region\'s identity. We aim to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, promoting Assamese craftsmanship on a wider scale and contributing to the economic empowerment of local communities.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the core of Terra Mayaa\'s offerings are a diverse range of handcrafted products and experiences. Our primary focus is on showcasing the exceptional skills of Assamese artisans through meticulously designed textiles, handcrafted jewelry, traditional pottery, and unique home décor items. Our textiles feature the vibrant colors and intricate patterns of Assamese silk, eri silk, and cotton, reflecting the region\'s rich weaving traditions. Our jewelry collection incorporates locally sourced materials like gemstones and traditional beads, each piece telling a story of Assamese artistry. Beyond tangible products, Terra Mayaa also offers interactive workshops and cultural experiences designed to immerse visitors in the local culture. These workshops range from traditional weaving demonstrations to pottery classes, providing a hands-on understanding of the skills and artistry involved.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>A key differentiator for Terra Mayaa lies in its commitment to sustainable practices and fair trade principles. We partner directly with local artisans, ensuring they receive fair compensation for their work and promoting ethical sourcing of materials. This approach not only supports the livelihoods of local communities but also ensures the preservation of traditional crafts that are integral to Assam\'s cultural identity. In a market often saturated with mass-produced goods, Terra Mayaa stands out by offering authentic, handcrafted items that embody the spirit and artistry of Assam. Our commitment to quality, coupled with our dedication to supporting local artisans, makes us a preferred destination for those seeking unique and meaningful products.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Terra Mayaa prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience that extends beyond a simple transaction. From the moment customers step through our doors, they are greeted with warm hospitality and a personalized approach. Our knowledgeable staff are passionate about Assamese culture and are dedicated to providing customers with in-depth information about the products and the artisans who create them. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where customers feel comfortable exploring the rich tapestry of Assamese artistry. We actively engage with the local community through collaborations with local schools, cultural organizations, and community events.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We believe in fostering strong relationships with our customers and building a community around our shared appreciation for Assamese culture. This commitment is reflected in our customer loyalty programs, personalized recommendations, and active presence on social media platforms where we share stories about our artisans, showcase new products, and engage in conversations about local culture. By creating a positive and engaging customer experience, Terra Mayaa aims to become more than just a retail store but a trusted source of authentic Assamese products and a hub for cultural exchange.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Terra Mayaa envisions a future of continued growth and expanded reach. Our long-term goals include establishing an online presence to reach a wider audience and expanding our product line to include more diverse expressions of Assamese artistry. We also plan to increase our involvement in community development initiatives, providing training and resources to local artisans to help them further develop their skills and expand their businesses. By fostering sustainable growth and empowering local communities, Terra Mayaa aims to solidify its position as a leading advocate for Assamese culture and a driving force in the local economy.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We are committed to continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of the market while staying true to our core values of authenticity, sustainability, and community engagement. Terra Mayaa\'s future is bright, filled with opportunities to showcase the beauty and artistry of Assam to the world, one handcrafted product and cultural experience at a time. We aim to become synonymous with quality Assamese craftsmanship, a destination that both locals and tourists recognize as the premier spot for unique and authentic products that embody the true spirit of the region.\n</p>\n</body>\n</html>', '6th, Anil Plaza - II, 2, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:50:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1850, 'Cafe TENZO', 'Cafes', '', 'Cafe TENZO, nestled in the heart of Adaghudam, Assam, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a community hub, a haven for authentic flavors, and a testament to the rich culinary heritage of the region. We offer a unique and inviting space where locals and visitors alike can gather to enjoy exceptional coffee, delectable Assamese snacks, and a warm, welcoming atmosphere that embodies the spirit of Assam. Cafe TENZO aims to be the premier destination in Adaghudam for those seeking a genuine taste of local culture, exceptional quality, and unparalleled hospitality, contributing significantly to the vibrant local business ecosystem.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Cafe TENZO, our core offering revolves around delivering a carefully curated menu that blends familiar cafe staples with the distinctive tastes of Assam. Our signature coffee blends are sourced from reputable local estates, ensuring freshness and supporting regional farmers. Alongside our coffee, we offer a diverse selection of teas, including authentic Assamese tea known for its robust flavor and invigorating properties. Beyond beverages, our menu boasts a range of traditional Assamese snacks like *pitha* (rice cakes), *jolpan* (traditional breakfast items), and savory treats, prepared with locally sourced ingredients and time-honored recipes. What sets Cafe TENZO apart is our commitment to authenticity and quality. We meticulously select our ingredients, collaborate with local artisans, and train our staff to deliver a truly exceptional experience that reflects the unique culinary heritage of Assam. We address a clear need in the local market for a cafe that not only provides quality food and beverages but also actively promotes and celebrates the regional culture.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at Cafe TENZO is paramount. We believe in creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels like a valued member of our community. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating customer needs and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience. We actively engage with the local community through hosting events, showcasing local artists, and partnering with regional organizations. We are more than just a cafe; we are a gathering place, a cultural center, and a source of local pride. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment that fosters connection and celebrates the unique spirit of Assam. Our commitment to creating a positive and memorable experience for every guest sets us apart and fosters strong customer loyalty.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Cafe TENZO envisions becoming a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, authenticity, and community engagement throughout Assam. We plan to expand our menu to include more diverse Assamese dishes, catering to a wider range of tastes and preferences. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local artisans and producers to offer curated selections of regional crafts and products, further promoting the local economy. We are committed to sustainability and ethical sourcing, ensuring that our operations have a minimal environmental impact and that we contribute positively to the well-being of the community. Ultimately, Cafe TENZO aims to be a model for responsible and sustainable business practices, demonstrating that it is possible to achieve both commercial success and positive social impact. We see the potential to establish multiple locations throughout the region, bringing the unique Cafe TENZO experience to an even wider audience and solidifying our position as a leading ambassador for Assamese culture and hospitality.', 'Cafe Tenzo adaghudam', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:55:06', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1851, 'BLACK COFFEE CAFE', 'Cafes', '', '<p>BLACK COFFEE CAFE: A Distinct Brew in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>BLACK COFFEE CAFE is more than just a coffee shop; it’s a destination. Nestled in the vibrant landscape of Assam, we offer a unique and inviting space where the rich aroma of freshly brewed coffee blends seamlessly with the warmth of Assamese hospitality. In a region renowned for its tea, BLACK COFFEE CAFE provides a compelling alternative, catering to a growing demand for high-quality coffee experiences and fostering a burgeoning coffee culture among locals and visitors alike. We are committed to sourcing ethically and roasting meticulously, creating a sensory experience that elevates the everyday.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the core of BLACK COFFEE CAFE lies a dedication to providing exceptional coffee and complementary culinary offerings. Our primary service is the crafting of expertly brewed coffee beverages, ranging from classic espressos and cappuccinos to innovative signature drinks that incorporate local flavors and ingredients. We source high-quality Arabica beans, roasted in small batches to ensure optimal freshness and flavor. Beyond coffee, our menu features a curated selection of teas, pastries, sandwiches, and light meals, all prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. These options cater to diverse palates and dietary preferences, ensuring a satisfying experience for every guest.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What sets BLACK COFFEE CAFE apart is our unwavering commitment to quality and authenticity. We avoid pre-packaged ingredients and mass-produced items, opting instead for handcrafted beverages and food that showcase the region\'s bounty. This dedication extends to our unique selling point: our signature \"Assam Blend,\" a custom-roasted coffee bean blend that highlights the distinctive characteristics of locally grown coffee. By collaborating with regional coffee farmers, we support local agriculture and contribute to the sustainability of the Assamese coffee industry. Our menu also features rotating seasonal specials, incorporating fruits and spices that are unique to Assam, further enhancing the connection to the local environment and providing a constantly evolving culinary experience for our patrons.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>BLACK COFFEE CAFE is more than just a place to grab a drink; it\'s a community hub. We prioritize creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where customers can relax, connect, and feel at home. Our staff is trained to provide friendly and attentive service, anticipating customer needs and exceeding expectations. We regularly host events such as live music performances by local artists, coffee tasting workshops, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local talent and fostering a sense of community engagement. Our commitment to exceptional customer service extends beyond the café walls, with initiatives such as sponsoring local sporting events and supporting local charities, demonstrating our dedication to giving back to the community that supports us.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for BLACK COFFEE CAFE is one of sustainable growth and regional expansion. We plan to open additional locations throughout Assam, bringing our unique coffee experience to a wider audience. A key component of our growth strategy involves strengthening our relationships with local coffee farmers, ensuring a reliable supply of high-quality beans and further supporting the local agricultural economy. We also intend to expand our online presence, offering online ordering and delivery services, as well as a curated selection of coffee beans and merchandise. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to develop a coffee roasting facility, allowing us to control the entire coffee-making process from bean to cup, ensuring the highest quality and consistency. Our long-term goal is to become a recognized and respected brand in the Assamese coffee market, known for its exceptional coffee, commitment to local community, and dedication to sustainable practices.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:55:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1852, 'Freza\'s Bakery and Confectionery', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Freza\'s Bakery and Confectionery, a delightful haven of sweet and savory treats, stands proudly on Hatigaon Main Rd, enriching the Assam culinary landscape with its artisanal offerings. More than just a bakery, Freza\'s is a celebration of flavor, tradition, and community, providing a warm and welcoming space where customers can indulge in freshly baked goods made with passion and the finest ingredients. Situated in a vibrant and accessible location, Freza\'s aims to be a cornerstone of the neighborhood, offering a delectable escape from the everyday.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Freza\'s lies a commitment to quality and craftsmanship. The bakery\'s core offerings encompass a wide array of freshly baked breads, from classic sourdough and whole wheat loaves to innovative artisanal varieties incorporating local Assam ingredients. Cakes, pastries, and desserts form another significant pillar of the business, featuring everything from elaborate celebration cakes and delicate French pastries to traditional Assamese sweets reimagined with a modern twist. Freza\'s also caters to those seeking savory options, providing a selection of quiches, pies, sandwiches, and other light meals, all prepared with the same dedication to freshness and flavor. A dedicated tea and coffee selection perfectly complements the food offerings, creating a complete sensory experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets Freza\'s apart is its commitment to using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. By partnering with regional farmers and suppliers, the bakery ensures the freshness and quality of its products while supporting the local economy. This dedication to local sourcing, combined with innovative recipes and meticulous attention to detail, allows Freza\'s to offer unique and memorable flavors that reflect the essence of Assam. The bakery\'s ability to blend traditional baking techniques with modern culinary trends also makes it a standout establishment in the area.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Freza\'s believes that exceptional customer service is paramount. Every interaction is an opportunity to create a positive and lasting impression. The staff is meticulously trained to be knowledgeable, friendly, and attentive, ensuring that each customer feels valued and appreciated. From personalized cake consultations to helpful recommendations, Freza\'s strives to exceed customer expectations at every turn. The bakery\'s inviting ambiance, characterized by its warm décor and comfortable seating, further enhances the overall customer experience, encouraging patrons to linger and savor their treats.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Recognizing the importance of community engagement, Freza\'s actively participates in local events and initiatives. The bakery regularly sponsors local school events, participates in farmers\' markets, and collaborates with other businesses in the area to promote the Hatigaon community. By fostering strong relationships with its neighbors, Freza\'s has become more than just a bakery; it has become a gathering place, a hub of connection, and a vital part of the community\'s fabric.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Freza\'s Bakery and Confectionery envisions a future of continued growth and expansion. The business aims to expand its product line, introducing new and exciting flavors while maintaining its commitment to quality and local sourcing. Plans are underway to introduce online ordering and delivery services, making Freza\'s delectable offerings even more accessible to a wider audience. Furthermore, the bakery hopes to establish a baking academy, providing training and mentorship opportunities to aspiring bakers in the region, further contributing to the growth and development of the local culinary scene.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Ultimately, Freza\'s aspires to become a household name in Assam, synonymous with exceptional baked goods, outstanding customer service, and unwavering commitment to the community. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating, Freza\'s Bakery and Confectionery is poised to achieve its long-term goals and solidify its position as a leading bakery and confectionery in the region, enriching the lives of its customers, one delicious treat at a time. The vision is to build a legacy of quality and taste that extends beyond the immediate neighborhood and contributes to Assam\'s growing reputation as a culinary destination.</p>', 'Hatigaon Main Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:55:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1853, 'SURABHI MILLET CAFE', 'Cafes', '', '<p>SURABHI MILLET CAFE: Nourishing Assam with Tradition and Innovation</p>\n\n<p>Located in the heart of Assam\'s administrative hub at the Assam Secretariat (Gana Sewa Bhawan), SURABHI MILLET CAFE is more than just a restaurant; it\'s a celebration of indigenous grains and a commitment to promoting healthy, sustainable eating habits. In a region rich with agricultural heritage, yet increasingly influenced by global food trends, Surabhi Millet Cafe offers a refreshing alternative – a culinary haven where traditional Assamese flavors meet the nutritional power of millets. We aim to be a leading voice in advocating for the increased consumption of millets, not just for their health benefits but also for their contribution to the sustainable livelihoods of local farmers. Situated strategically within the Secretariat, the cafe provides a convenient and nutritious dining option for government employees, visitors, and the wider Guwahati community, positioning itself as a key player in promoting a healthier Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around crafting delectable dishes using millets as the primary ingredient. Millets, known for their high fiber content, gluten-free nature, and rich nutritional profile, form the base for a diverse menu that caters to a variety of tastes and preferences. We offer a range of options from traditional Assamese breakfast staples reimagined with millets, like millet-based <i>pitha</i> and <i>jolpan</i>, to innovative lunch and dinner entrees such as millet biryani, millet dosas, and millet-crusted fish. Our menu also features a selection of healthy snacks and beverages, including millet smoothies, millet cookies, and naturally sweetened drinks. What sets Surabhi Millet Cafe apart is its dedication to sourcing ingredients locally, working directly with farmers in the region to procure high-quality millets and other fresh produce. This not only ensures the freshness and authenticity of our dishes but also supports the local agricultural economy. Our unique selling point is the fusion of traditional Assamese recipes with the nutritional benefits of millets, creating a culinary experience that is both healthy and culturally relevant. We address a growing need in the local market for nutritious and wholesome food options, especially among health-conscious individuals and those seeking to explore the rich culinary heritage of Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At SURABHI MILLET CAFE, we believe that exceptional food should be accompanied by exceptional service. We strive to create a warm and welcoming atmosphere for every customer, where they feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained not only in food preparation but also in providing attentive and personalized service. We actively seek feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that their dining experience is nothing short of delightful. Beyond providing a delicious and nutritious meal, we are committed to educating our customers about the benefits of millets and their role in promoting a healthy lifestyle. We host regular workshops and tasting events to raise awareness about the versatility and nutritional value of millets. Furthermore, we actively participate in community events and initiatives, promoting local culture and supporting local farmers. We believe in building strong relationships with our customers and the wider community, fostering a sense of belonging and shared purpose. Our goal is to be more than just a cafe; we want to be a community hub where people can come together to enjoy healthy food, learn about local culture, and connect with like-minded individuals.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, SURABHI MILLET CAFE envisions expanding its reach and impact within Assam and beyond. We plan to introduce new and innovative millet-based products to cater to a wider range of palates and dietary needs. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with other organizations and businesses to promote millet consumption and sustainable agriculture. Our long-term goals include establishing a network of millet cafes across Assam, creating a sustainable supply chain that benefits both farmers and consumers. We aspire to be recognized as a leading advocate for millets, not only in Assam but also nationally. We aim to leverage technology to enhance our operations, improve customer service, and expand our online presence. We also plan to invest in training and development programs for our staff, ensuring that they have the skills and knowledge to provide the best possible service to our customers. Ultimately, our vision is to create a thriving business that not only provides healthy and delicious food but also contributes to the economic development of Assam and the well-being of its people.</p>', 'Assam Secretariat ( Gana Sewa Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:55:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1854, 'Sip Station', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Sip Station: A Refreshing Oasis in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<p>Located on Pir Ajan Fakir Rd, near the Bank of Baroda, Sip Station has quickly become a beloved fixture of the local community in Assam. More than just a beverage provider, Sip Station is a vibrant hub where locals connect, refresh, and enjoy a diverse selection of drinks in a welcoming atmosphere. Recognizing the growing demand for quality beverages beyond traditional options, Sip Station fills a unique niche, offering a modern and diverse menu while maintaining a strong connection to local tastes and preferences. The business’s strategic location and commitment to customer satisfaction have solidified its position as a go-to destination for a refreshing break.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Core Offerings: A Diverse Menu for Every Palate</p>\n\n<p>Sip Station\'s core offering revolves around providing a wide array of beverages to cater to diverse tastes. The menu boasts an impressive selection of freshly brewed coffees, ranging from classic espresso-based drinks to innovative signature blends featuring locally sourced coffee beans when available. Tea lovers can indulge in a variety of options, including traditional Assamese tea prepared with expertise, as well as herbal infusions and iced teas. Beyond hot beverages, Sip Station excels in crafting refreshing cold drinks. These include fruit smoothies made with fresh, seasonal fruits, creamy milkshakes, and customized juice blends. Special attention is given to sourcing high-quality ingredients, ensuring each drink is both delicious and satisfying. Seasonal offerings, such as mango lassi during the summer months or spiced chai in the winter, add an element of surprise and delight, keeping the menu fresh and appealing year-round. What truly sets Sip Station apart is its willingness to customize drinks based on individual preferences, allowing customers to create their perfect beverage. The use of locally sourced ingredients when feasible further enhances the unique character of the business and strengthens its ties to the community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The Sip Station Experience: Connecting with the Community</p>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Sip Station. From the moment a customer walks in, they are greeted with a warm and friendly atmosphere. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each visitor feels valued and appreciated. Beyond simply taking orders, the team engages with customers, offering recommendations, answering questions about the menu, and creating a genuine connection. Sip Station actively participates in local events and initiatives, further embedding itself within the community. Offering special promotions during local festivals or partnering with nearby businesses for cross-promotional activities helps to foster a sense of belonging and goodwill. The physical space itself is designed to be inviting and comfortable, with ample seating and a relaxed ambiance that encourages customers to linger and enjoy their drinks. Free Wi-Fi is available, making it a popular spot for students and professionals looking for a place to work or study. Positive reviews and word-of-mouth referrals are a testament to Sip Station\'s commitment to exceeding customer expectations and building lasting relationships.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking Ahead: Growth and Innovation</p>\n\n<p>Sip Station envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, aiming to become the premier beverage destination in the region. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more food options, such as light snacks and pastries, to complement the existing beverage offerings. Exploring partnerships with local bakeries and food vendors would further enhance the menu and support other businesses in the community. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Sip Station is actively exploring ways to reduce its environmental impact, such as using eco-friendly packaging, implementing recycling programs, and sourcing ingredients from sustainable suppliers. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in nearby towns and cities, bringing the Sip Station experience to a wider audience. Maintaining the same commitment to quality, customer service, and community engagement will be crucial as the business grows. Sip Station aims to not only provide exceptional beverages but also to contribute to the economic and social well-being of the local area.</p>', 'Pir Ajan Fakir Rd, near Bank of Baroda', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 17:55:33', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1855, 'Ithakaa Restaurant and Cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'Ithakaa Restaurant and Cafe: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Assam\n\nIthakaa Restaurant and Cafe stands as a vibrant culinary destination nestled in the heart of Assam, offering a distinctive dining experience that blends global flavors with local ingredients and traditions. More than just a restaurant, Ithakaa aims to be a community hub, a place where friends and families gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories over exceptional food and beverages. In a region known for its rich culinary heritage, Ithakaa distinguishes itself by offering a diverse menu that appeals to both traditional palates and those seeking contemporary gastronomic adventures. Its commitment to quality, combined with its warm and inviting ambiance, positions Ithakaa as a significant player in the Assam\'s evolving hospitality sector, contributing to the region\'s growing reputation as a destination for food lovers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Ithakaa’s offerings lies a carefully curated menu that spans a range of culinary influences. While deeply rooted in Assamese culinary traditions, the restaurant also features dishes inspired by international cuisines, creating a delightful fusion that caters to diverse tastes. Signature dishes, prepared with locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, showcase the region\'s fresh produce and unique flavors. The menu includes both classic favorites and innovative creations, ensuring there’s something to satisfy every craving.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond the restaurant\'s main dining area, Ithakaa boasts a charming cafe section, offering a selection of specialty coffees, teas, and delectable pastries. The cafe provides a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, perfect for casual meetings, quick lunches, or simply unwinding with a good book. The cafe\'s artisanal coffee blends, sourced from local estates when available, are a particular highlight, offering patrons a taste of Assam\'s celebrated coffee culture. A significant unique selling point is Ithakaa’s commitment to sourcing fresh, seasonal ingredients, supporting local farmers and producers whenever possible. This not only ensures the highest quality of food but also contributes to the local economy. Further differentiating itself is the focus on creating a memorable dining experience that goes beyond just the food.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nIthakaa prioritizes customer satisfaction above all else, fostering a culture of attentive and personalized service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and eager to assist diners with recommendations and dietary needs. The restaurant cultivates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, where guests feel comfortable and valued. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the dining experience. The goal is to create a loyal customer base that sees Ithakaa not just as a place to eat, but as a place to belong.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCommunity engagement is a core value for Ithakaa. The restaurant actively participates in local events, supports local artists and artisans, and partners with charitable organizations to give back to the community. The space is frequently used for community gatherings, workshops, and exhibitions, further solidifying its role as a central hub. The restaurant also incorporates Assamese art and decor into its design, celebrating the region\'s cultural heritage and creating a sense of place for its patrons. By fostering a strong connection with the local community, Ithakaa aims to be more than just a restaurant; it aims to be a vital part of the fabric of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Ithakaa envisions a future of sustainable growth and continued innovation. Plans are underway to expand the menu with more locally inspired dishes, explore opportunities for catering services, and possibly open additional locations within Assam. The long-term goal is to establish Ithakaa as a leading restaurant brand in the region, known for its exceptional food, outstanding service, and unwavering commitment to the community. The restaurant also plans to invest in staff training and development, ensuring that its team remains at the forefront of the hospitality industry. Ultimately, Ithakaa aspires to be a culinary destination that not only satisfies the appetites of its patrons but also contributes to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam.', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:00:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1856, 'Feed me II', 'Cafes', '', '<p>Feed me II: A Culinary Haven on Rajgarh Road</p>\n\n<p>Nestled on Rajgarh Road, opposite the Alcare Diagnostic Centre, Feed me II is more than just a restaurant; it\'s a burgeoning culinary destination offering a unique and satisfying dining experience in the heart of Assam. This establishment distinguishes itself through its commitment to fresh, locally-sourced ingredients, innovative menu offerings, and a warm, welcoming atmosphere. In a region increasingly appreciating diverse culinary experiences, Feed me II fills a vital niche by providing high-quality meals at accessible prices, quickly establishing itself as a favorite among locals and visitors alike. Recognizing the strong community spirit of Assam, Feed me II aims to be a place where friends and families can gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories over delicious food.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Feed me II lies a commitment to providing a diverse and satisfying menu catering to a wide range of tastes. The restaurant\'s core offerings include a selection of carefully curated dishes featuring both traditional Assamese cuisine and popular continental favorites. This thoughtful blend appeals to both those seeking familiar comfort foods and those eager to explore the rich culinary heritage of the region. A significant unique selling point is the restaurant\'s emphasis on sourcing ingredients from local farmers and producers whenever possible. This commitment ensures the freshness and quality of the food while simultaneously supporting the local economy. Whether indulging in a flavorful Assamese thali, savoring a perfectly grilled continental dish, or enjoying a refreshing beverage, patrons can be assured of a dining experience that is both satisfying and ethically responsible. The menu is also designed to be adaptable, regularly incorporating seasonal ingredients and introducing new dishes to keep the dining experience fresh and exciting, ensuring repeat customers and building long-term loyalty.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Feed me II. The staff is trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The ambiance is carefully curated to be both inviting and comfortable, creating a relaxed atmosphere conducive to enjoyable dining. Understanding the importance of connection, Feed me II actively engages with the local community through participation in local events and initiatives. The restaurant also leverages social media to connect with customers, share updates, and gather feedback, fostering a sense of community and belonging. Furthermore, Feed me II is committed to providing a clean and hygienic dining environment, adhering to the highest standards of food safety and sanitation. This dedication to quality and safety builds trust and confidence among patrons, solidifying the restaurant\'s reputation as a reliable and reputable dining destination. By prioritizing customer satisfaction and actively engaging with the local community, Feed me II cultivates a loyal customer base and fosters strong, lasting relationships.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Feed me II envisions significant potential for growth and expansion within the local Assam business landscape. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more regional specialties, further showcasing the diverse culinary traditions of Assam. There are also aspirations to introduce catering services for local events and gatherings, providing a convenient and high-quality option for those seeking delicious and reliable catering. Furthermore, the business aims to explore the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of the region, extending its reach and bringing its unique dining experience to a wider audience. Long-term goals include establishing Feed me II as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, freshness, and community engagement. By continuously innovating, adapting to market trends, and remaining committed to its core values, Feed me II is poised to achieve sustained growth and solidify its position as a leading culinary destination in Assam.</p>', 'Rajgarh Rd, opp. to Alcare Diagnostic Centre', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:00:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1857, 'KitChai', 'Cafes', '', 'KitChai, nestled in the vibrant heart of Guwahati at Commerce Point, Boys Hostel, RG Baruah Rd, opposite Gauhati Commerce College, is more than just a tea stall; it\'s a cultural hub and a modern interpretation of Assam\'s rich tea heritage. We aim to provide a refreshing and authentic experience, catering to the diverse palates of students, professionals, and residents alike. KitChai stands out by blending traditional Assamese flavors with contemporary brewing techniques and a commitment to fostering a welcoming community space. We\'re dedicated to creating a unique tea-drinking experience that resonates with the local community and celebrates the essence of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, KitChai offers a diverse menu centered around Assam tea, showcasing its versatility and depth. We feature classic milk teas prepared with locally sourced ingredients, alongside innovative tea-based beverages such as iced teas, tea lattes, and even tea-infused mocktails. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to quality and experimentation. We source premium Assam tea leaves directly from local gardens, ensuring freshness and supporting regional farmers. We also offer a rotating selection of seasonal specials, incorporating local fruits and spices to create exciting and novel flavor combinations. Complementing our tea selection, we offer a curated menu of light snacks and traditional Assamese delicacies, perfectly paired to enhance the tea-drinking experience. This includes items like Singara, Ghugni, and other locally popular snacks, providing a convenient and affordable option for students and office workers in the area. Our offerings directly address the local market\'s demand for quality, affordable, and culturally relevant beverages and snacks.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at KitChai. We strive to create a warm, inviting, and inclusive atmosphere where customers can relax, connect, and enjoy a moment of respite. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our tea offerings and provide personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. We believe in fostering genuine connections with our customers, remembering their orders, and engaging in friendly conversation. Beyond providing exceptional service, KitChai actively connects with the local community through various initiatives. We host regular events such as open mic nights, poetry slams, and workshops on Assamese culture and tea appreciation. We also collaborate with local artists and artisans to showcase their work within our space, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. Further, KitChai offers student discounts and actively participates in campus events at Gauhati Commerce College, building strong relationships with the student community and becoming a valued part of their daily lives.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, KitChai envisions becoming a leading tea brand in Guwahati and beyond, synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional flavors and experimenting with different brewing techniques to create unique tea blends. We also plan to introduce a loyalty program to reward our regular customers and further strengthen our relationships with them. A key element of our growth strategy involves establishing strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to expand our reach and enhance our brand visibility. We aim to open additional outlets in strategic locations across Guwahati, while maintaining the same commitment to quality and community that has defined our initial success. Furthermore, we are exploring opportunities to package and sell our signature tea blends online and in select retail outlets, allowing us to reach a wider audience and share the taste of Assam with the world. KitChai aspires to not only serve exceptional tea but also to contribute to the cultural and economic vitality of Assam, celebrating its rich heritage and empowering local communities.', 'Commerce Point, Boys Hostel, RG Baruah Rd, opp. Gauhati Commerce College', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:00:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1858, 'By The Way', 'Cafes', '', '<p>By The Way, strategically located at the SBI Building, 22, Zoo-Narengi Rd, stands as a dynamic and evolving business dedicated to providing [mention core service or product offering]. Situated at a prime location in Guwahati, Assam, we aim to seamlessly integrate quality [mention core service or product again] with the region\'s unique cultural nuances and consumer preferences. In a market often characterized by traditional approaches, By The Way distinguishes itself through its commitment to [mention key differentiator, e.g., innovation, customer-centricity, sustainability]. We strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be a valuable contributor to the local economy and a trusted partner for the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing high-quality [mention service or product, e.g., curated gift hampers, specialized consulting services, bespoke tailoring]. Unlike standard offerings, By The Way meticulously crafts [mention service/product] to reflect the specific needs and desires of our clientele. For instance, our [specific example related to service/product, e.g., gift hampers feature locally sourced Assamese tea and silk, our consulting services specialize in navigating the unique regulatory landscape of Northeast India, our tailoring uses indigenous fabrics and traditional designs]. This dedication to customization and regional integration forms a crucial part of our unique selling proposition. We directly address a local market need for [mention specific need fulfilled, e.g., sophisticated gifting solutions reflecting local culture, expert guidance for businesses operating in the region, clothing that blends modern styles with Assamese heritage], distinguishing us from larger, more generic businesses. We ensure superior quality by [mention how quality is ensured, e.g., partnering with local artisans, employing industry experts, implementing rigorous quality control processes].</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At By The Way, the customer experience is paramount. We believe in building lasting relationships with our clients, grounded in trust and mutual respect. Our approach is centered on [mention key elements of customer service, e.g., personalized attention, proactive communication, responsiveness to feedback]. We strive to create a welcoming and engaging atmosphere at our SBI Building location, where customers feel valued and understood. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively participate in [mention community engagement activities, e.g., local festivals, charity events, business networking initiatives]. By understanding the cultural fabric of Assam, we can tailor our services to meet the evolving needs of our customers and foster a sense of belonging. We also solicit regular feedback through [mention feedback methods, e.g., online surveys, direct communication, in-person interactions] to continually improve our service and product offerings.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, By The Way envisions significant growth potential in the Assam business landscape. Our future plans include [mention specific plans, e.g., expanding our product line, opening new locations, developing online platforms]. We aim to leverage technology to enhance our reach and efficiency, while remaining committed to our core values of quality, customer service, and community engagement. Specifically, we are exploring the possibility of [mention a specific future project, e.g., launching an e-commerce platform to reach a wider audience, partnering with local tourism agencies to offer unique travel experiences, developing a training program for local artisans]. Our long-term goals involve establishing By The Way as a leading brand in [mention target market or industry segment], recognized for its innovation, sustainability, and commitment to the local community. We believe that by staying true to our values and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, we can achieve sustainable growth and make a positive impact on the region.</p>', 'SBI Building, 22, Zoo-Narengi Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:00:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1859, 'Kori\'s', 'Cafes', '', 'Kori\'s Cafe & Restro: A Culinary Oasis in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nKori\'s Cafe & Restro, nestled on the 2nd Floor of R.G.B Road, Zoo Rd, Jonali Path, opposite S.B.I Bank, is more than just a place to grab a meal; it\'s a vibrant hub where culinary artistry meets warm Assamese hospitality. Situated in a bustling area of Guwahati, Kori\'s offers a welcome escape from the city\'s rhythm, providing a comfortable and inviting atmosphere for locals and visitors alike. We distinguish ourselves through a commitment to quality ingredients, innovative menu offerings, and a genuine connection with the community, establishing Kori\'s as a significant player in the local dining scene.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Kori\'s provides a diverse menu encompassing both globally inspired dishes and locally sourced Assamese favorites. Our signature offerings include [mention a specific signature dish if possible, otherwise write: \"a range of carefully crafted dishes featuring fresh, seasonal ingredients\"]. We also pride ourselves on our exceptional beverage selection, from artisanal coffee and refreshing mocktails to a curated list of [mention beverage type, e.g., wines, local beers]. What sets Kori\'s apart is our dedication to using locally sourced produce whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and ensuring the freshest flavors in every dish. This commitment not only elevates the dining experience but also contributes to the sustainable growth of the local economy. Furthermore, we cater to a wide range of dietary needs and preferences, offering vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options to ensure everyone can enjoy a delightful meal at Kori\'s.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Kori\'s. We believe in fostering a welcoming and attentive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is carefully trained to provide personalized service, anticipating needs and ensuring a seamless dining experience. Beyond exceptional service, Kori\'s actively engages with the local community through [mention specific initiatives, e.g., hosting local artists, sponsoring community events, offering discounts to students or seniors]. We strive to be more than just a restaurant; we aim to be a gathering place where friends and families can connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories. The ambiance of Kori\'s is carefully curated to reflect the warmth and vibrancy of Assam, with [mention specific details, e.g., local artwork on display, traditional music playing softly in the background, comfortable seating arrangements]. This commitment to creating a memorable and culturally relevant experience is what truly sets Kori\'s apart.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Kori\'s envisions expanding its reach and influence within the Guwahati culinary landscape. Our long-term goals include [mention specific goals, e.g., opening additional locations, expanding our menu offerings to include more traditional Assamese cuisine, establishing a catering service for local events]. We are committed to continually innovating and adapting to the evolving needs of our customers, while remaining true to our core values of quality, sustainability, and community engagement. We see the potential for Kori\'s to become a regional culinary destination, attracting both local residents and tourists seeking an authentic and memorable dining experience. Through strategic partnerships, ongoing staff training, and a relentless focus on customer satisfaction, Kori\'s is poised to achieve significant growth and solidify its position as a leading cafe and restaurant in Guwahati and beyond. We aspire to be synonymous with exceptional food, warm hospitality, and a genuine connection to the heart of Assam.', 'kori\'s cafe & restro, 2nd Floor, R.G.B Road, Zoo Rd, Jonali Path, opp. S.B.I Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:00:36', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(1860, 'G town Cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'G Town Cafe, nestled in the heart of Sbi IIBM op, Assam, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a vibrant hub where community, culture, and culinary delights converge. We\'ve established ourselves as a cornerstone of the local business landscape by offering a unique blend of globally-inspired cafe fare with a distinctly Assamese touch. Our dedication to quality ingredients, a welcoming atmosphere, and exceptional customer service sets us apart, making G Town Cafe a preferred destination for locals and visitors alike. We aim to be a positive force in the community, supporting local suppliers and creating a space where connections are made and cherished.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt G Town Cafe, our core offerings revolve around providing a high-quality and diverse menu that caters to a wide range of tastes. Our primary services include a full-service cafe experience featuring expertly brewed coffee sourced from local estates whenever possible, a selection of handcrafted beverages including teas, smoothies, and artisanal juices, and a thoughtfully curated food menu. This menu boasts everything from freshly baked pastries and light snacks to more substantial meals such as sandwiches, salads, and regional Assamese specialties with a modern twist. Our unique selling point lies in the fusion of international cafe standards with the authentic flavors and ingredients of Assam. For instance, our signature \"G Town Blend\" coffee incorporates locally grown beans, providing a uniquely rich and aromatic experience that can\'t be found elsewhere. We also offer \"Pitha Platters\" featuring traditional Assamese rice cakes, offering a taste of the region\'s culinary heritage. This careful blending of global and local influences ensures that our menu remains both familiar and exciting, appealing to a diverse clientele. By sourcing local ingredients, we actively support the local economy and ensure the freshness and quality of our offerings, effectively meeting the demand for locally sourced, high-quality food and beverage options in the area.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe believe that customer experience is paramount to our success. At G Town Cafe, we strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and comfortable. Our staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, anticipating customer needs and exceeding expectations. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and service delivery. Our commitment to customer service goes beyond simply taking orders; we aim to build genuine relationships with our patrons. We host regular events, such as open mic nights showcasing local talent and art exhibitions featuring the work of regional artists. These events provide opportunities for community engagement and create a sense of belonging. We also partner with local organizations to support community initiatives and give back to the area that has embraced us. Our location in Sbi IIBM op allows us to easily connect with students, professionals, and residents alike, fostering a strong sense of community around G Town Cafe. We also offer free Wi-Fi and comfortable seating, making it an ideal space for students to study, professionals to meet, or friends to simply relax and connect.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, G Town Cafe envisions becoming a leading culinary destination in the region, recognized for its commitment to quality, community, and innovation. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to incorporate even more regionally sourced ingredients and explore new culinary concepts that celebrate the rich flavors of Assam. We plan to introduce a catering service to cater to local events and businesses, further extending our reach within the community. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the G Town Cafe experience to a wider audience. We intend to remain deeply rooted in the local community, continuing to support local suppliers and initiatives, and creating opportunities for local talent to shine. Furthermore, we plan to invest in sustainable practices to minimize our environmental impact and contribute to a healthier planet. Our vision is to build a brand that is synonymous with quality, community, and a genuine passion for providing exceptional experiences to our customers. Through consistent hard work, a dedication to innovation, and a steadfast commitment to our values, we are confident that G Town Cafe will continue to thrive and contribute positively to the vibrant business landscape of Assam.', 'Sbi IIBM op', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:05:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1861, 'C square Cafe', 'Cafes', '', 'C square Cafe: A Culinary Oasis on GMCH Road\n\nC square Cafe, strategically located on GMCH Road, offers a unique and refreshing culinary experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a cafe, it\'s envisioned as a community hub, a place where individuals can connect, relax, and indulge in high-quality food and beverages. In a region where traditional tea stalls and quick-eats often dominate, C square Cafe distinguishes itself by providing a contemporary cafe atmosphere coupled with a commitment to fresh ingredients, expertly crafted dishes, and exceptional customer service. The cafe aims to elevate the local dining scene, offering a sophisticated yet accessible alternative for students, professionals, and residents alike. Its location near GMCH positions it perfectly to cater to the medical community, students, and visiting families, offering a convenient and welcoming space for breaks, meetings, and casual meals.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the core of C square Cafe\'s offerings are meticulously prepared food and beverage selections. The menu features a diverse range of items, from freshly brewed premium coffees and handcrafted teas to delectable pastries, sandwiches, and light meals. We differentiate ourselves by emphasizing the use of locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the freshness and quality of our offerings. Our signature coffee blends are sourced from nearby estates known for their robust flavors, providing an authentic taste of Assam. Beyond the standard cafe fare, C square Cafe offers a curated selection of innovative dishes, incorporating regional flavors with modern culinary techniques. For instance, you might find a twist on traditional Assamese snacks, prepared with a focus on healthy ingredients and appealing presentation. Unique selling points include our commitment to using organic ingredients where feasible, our customizable beverage options, and our dedication to providing vegetarian and vegan-friendly choices, catering to a broad spectrum of dietary preferences. This thoughtful approach allows C square Cafe to fill a gap in the market by providing healthier, more diverse, and higher-quality dining options.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at C square Cafe. We strive to create a warm, inviting, and personalized environment for every guest. Our staff is trained not only to efficiently take orders and serve food but also to engage with customers, anticipate their needs, and create a memorable interaction. The cafe\'s ambiance is carefully designed to be both aesthetically pleasing and comfortable, featuring cozy seating arrangements, soft lighting, and tasteful decor. We offer complimentary Wi-Fi to cater to students and professionals who need a place to work or study. To foster a strong connection with the local community, C square Cafe actively participates in local events and initiatives. We might host open mic nights showcasing local talent, art exhibitions featuring regional artists, or collaborations with local businesses to promote cross-promotion. Furthermore, we actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and services. By fostering a sense of community and providing exceptional customer service, C square Cafe aims to become a cherished local institution.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, C square Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities. We plan to establish ourselves as the premier cafe destination on GMCH Road and then expand our reach throughout the city. Future plans include introducing a loyalty program to reward frequent customers, expanding our menu with seasonal offerings and specialty items, and potentially opening additional locations in strategic areas. We are also exploring the possibility of offering catering services for local events and businesses. Long-term goals include establishing C square Cafe as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, community engagement, and exceptional culinary experiences. We aim to contribute to the economic development of the region by supporting local farmers and businesses, providing employment opportunities, and fostering a vibrant cultural scene. Through strategic planning, dedicated execution, and a unwavering commitment to our core values, C square Cafe is poised to become a thriving and influential player in the Assam business landscape. We also plan to invest in employee training programs to ensure our staff possesses the skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional service and maintain our high standards of quality.', 'GMCH Road', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:05:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1862, 'Nuts and Brew', 'Bars', '', 'Nuts and Brew: A Unique Confluence of Flavors and Community in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nNuts and Brew, strategically located on the 3rd Floor of GS Rd, above Forever 21, and directly in front of the Novotel Hotel, is rapidly establishing itself as a distinctive and cherished destination within Guwahati\'s vibrant culinary and social scene. More than just a cafe, Nuts and Brew offers a carefully curated experience that blends the comfort of familiar flavors with the excitement of innovative combinations. Situated in a high-traffic area, the cafe provides a respite from the bustling city, promising a haven for both local residents and visiting travelers seeking quality, convenience, and a memorable experience. Its presence contributes to the evolving landscape of Guwahati\'s food and beverage sector, introducing a fresh concept that resonates with a diverse clientele.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Nuts and Brew offers a delightful fusion of premium roasted nuts and artisanal coffee, supplemented by a delectable selection of complementary treats. The \'Nuts\' component showcases a range of globally sourced nuts, meticulously roasted in-house to perfection, offering a variety of flavors from classic salted and spiced options to exotic blends and candied varieties. These nuts are available for individual purchase, as well as featured in various menu items, from nut-crusted pastries to inventive salad toppings.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe \'Brew\' aspect focuses on high-quality, ethically sourced coffee beans, expertly brewed by trained baristas. The coffee menu spans classic espresso-based beverages, including cappuccinos, lattes, and macchiatos, alongside cold brews, iced coffees, and specialty coffee creations unique to Nuts and Brew. The cafe also boasts a selection of teas, herbal infusions, and refreshing non-coffee beverages, catering to diverse preferences. Beyond the core offerings, Nuts and Brew offers a carefully curated selection of pastries, cakes, and savory snacks designed to perfectly complement the nut and coffee selections. The menu is regularly updated to incorporate seasonal ingredients and innovative flavor profiles, ensuring a dynamic and engaging culinary experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA key differentiator for Nuts and Brew lies in its commitment to quality ingredients, meticulous preparation, and creative flavor combinations. The cafe prioritizes sourcing premium nuts and coffee beans, ensuring a superior taste experience. The in-house roasting and brewing processes allow for greater control over quality and consistency. Furthermore, Nuts and Brew distinguishes itself through its unique menu offerings, incorporating nuts into both sweet and savory dishes in unexpected and delightful ways. By appealing to both traditional tastes and adventurous palates, Nuts and Brew effectively meets the diverse needs of the local market, providing a versatile destination for coffee breaks, casual meetings, and indulgent treats.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Nuts and Brew. The cafe strives to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, where guests feel valued and appreciated. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable, friendly, and attentive, providing personalized recommendations and catering to individual preferences. The cafe design incorporates comfortable seating, warm lighting, and tasteful décor, creating a relaxed and inviting ambiance.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nNuts and Brew actively seeks to connect with the local community through various initiatives. The cafe hosts regular events, such as live music performances, coffee tasting sessions, and art exhibitions, providing a platform for local talent and fostering a sense of community. It also partners with local suppliers and artisans, supporting the local economy and showcasing regional products. Moreover, Nuts and Brew actively engages with its customers through social media, soliciting feedback, sharing updates, and building a strong online community. This multifaceted approach to customer service and community engagement distinguishes Nuts and Brew as a truly local establishment.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Nuts and Brew envisions continued growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and potentially beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more diverse and innovative nut-based dishes, enhancing the coffee selection with new brewing techniques and specialty beans, and developing a line of branded products, such as packaged nuts, coffee blends, and merchandise. The business aims to solidify its position as a leading destination for quality coffee, premium nuts, and community engagement, becoming a beloved fixture in the local culinary landscape. Nuts and Brew also explores opportunities for opening additional locations in strategic areas, bringing its unique concept to a wider audience. The long-term goal is to establish Nuts and Brew as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and community spirit.', '3rd Floor, GS Rd, above Forever 21, in front of Novotel Hotel', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:05:22', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1863, 'Spectrum Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Spectrum Bar, nestled on the first floor of the Hotel Shoolin Grand Building, strategically located on GS Rd, Rukmini Gaon, opposite the Indian Petrol Pump, is a sophisticated and vibrant destination redefining the bar experience in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to enjoy a drink, Spectrum Bar offers a curated environment designed to cater to discerning patrons seeking quality, ambiance, and exceptional service. Its prime location within a reputable hotel ensures accessibility and further solidifies its position as a noteworthy establishment within the local hospitality sector. Spectrum Bar addresses a clear demand for a refined nightlife and social experience, offering a unique alternative to the more traditional bars found in the area.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, Spectrum Bar provides a diverse and premium selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. This includes an extensive list of classic and contemporary cocktails crafted by skilled mixologists, a curated selection of local and international beers, and a carefully chosen wine list to complement diverse palates. Beyond the drinks, Spectrum Bar distinguishes itself through its commitment to offering high-quality bar snacks and appetizers. These are thoughtfully prepared to enhance the drinking experience, featuring both familiar favorites and innovative culinary creations that incorporate local flavors and ingredients where appropriate. What truly sets Spectrum Bar apart is the emphasis on creating a complete sensory experience. The bar features a stylish and comfortable interior design, carefully selected music to enhance the atmosphere, and attentive service from a well-trained staff. This holistic approach elevates Spectrum Bar beyond a typical drinking establishment, positioning it as a destination for those seeking a memorable and refined social experience. The bar specifically meets the growing demand from locals and tourists alike who are looking for an upscale venue to unwind, socialize, and enjoy expertly crafted beverages in a sophisticated setting.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Spectrum Bar. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and proactive in anticipating customer needs. Beyond simply serving drinks, the team is dedicated to creating a personalized experience, offering recommendations based on individual preferences and ensuring that every guest feels valued and comfortable. The bar regularly hosts themed nights and special events to further enhance the customer experience and create a sense of community. These events often feature live music from local artists, guest bartenders showcasing unique cocktail creations, or special promotions tailored to specific occasions. Spectrum Bar actively seeks to connect with the local community by partnering with local businesses and organizations for events and promotions. This demonstrates a commitment to supporting the local economy and fostering a sense of belonging. Furthermore, Spectrum Bar is committed to providing a safe and responsible environment for its patrons, adhering to all relevant regulations and promoting responsible drinking habits. By prioritizing customer satisfaction, fostering a sense of community, and upholding high standards of service, Spectrum Bar has cultivated a loyal following and established a reputation as a premier destination in Guwahati\'s nightlife scene.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Spectrum Bar is one of continued growth and innovation. The immediate focus is on solidifying its position as the leading bar in the Rukmini Gaon area. This includes expanding the menu to incorporate new and exciting beverage options, refining the ambiance through ongoing interior updates, and further enhancing the training and development of the staff. Longer-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand the Spectrum Bar brand to other locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam. This expansion would be carefully considered to ensure that the brand\'s core values of quality, service, and ambiance are maintained. Another key aspect of the future vision is to further develop Spectrum Bar\'s role as a community hub. This could involve partnering with local charities and organizations to support important causes, hosting more community-focused events, and creating initiatives that promote local arts and culture. The ultimate goal is to establish Spectrum Bar as not only a successful business but also a valuable contributor to the local community. The management team is committed to adapting to changing market trends, embracing new technologies, and continuously seeking ways to improve the customer experience. This dedication to innovation and customer satisfaction will ensure that Spectrum Bar remains a vibrant and relevant destination for years to come.</p>', 'Hotel Shoolin Grand Building, First floor, GS Rd, Rukmini Gaon, opposite Indian Petrol Pump', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:05:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1864, 'The Maroon Room – Pan Asian Fine Dine in Guwahati', 'Bars', '', '<p>The Maroon Room - Pan Asian Fine Dine in Guwahati, strategically located on the 5th Floor of Aurus Mall, near Supermarket, presents a unique and sophisticated dining experience, adding a vibrant touch to Guwahati\'s culinary scene. It is more than just a restaurant; it\'s an immersive journey into the heart of Pan-Asian cuisine, tailored to the discerning palates of Assam\'s residents and visitors alike. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and diverse culinary traditions, The Maroon Room aims to elevate the dining landscape by offering a refined and contemporary interpretation of classic Asian dishes, making it a significant player in the local hospitality sector.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Maroon Room specializes in providing an exceptional Pan-Asian fine dining experience. Our core offerings include a meticulously curated menu featuring dishes from across Asia, including Chinese, Thai, Japanese, Vietnamese, and Korean cuisines. Each dish is carefully crafted using the freshest, highest-quality ingredients, many sourced locally to support Assam\'s farmers and producers, while others are imported to ensure authentic flavor profiles. Our unique selling points include our commitment to culinary innovation, the artistry of our presentation, and the serene ambiance of our dining space. What sets us apart is our dedication to blending traditional techniques with modern culinary trends, creating a harmonious fusion that appeals to both adventurous foodies and those seeking familiar comfort. The menu features a balance of classic favorites and inventive creations, ensuring that there is something to delight every guest. We also offer an extensive beverage menu, including premium wines, handcrafted cocktails, and a selection of Asian teas, all carefully chosen to complement the food. We address the local market\'s desire for sophisticated dining experiences by providing a venue for special occasions, business lunches, and intimate dinners, filling a need for high-quality Asian cuisine in a refined setting.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Maroon Room, customer experience is paramount. We are committed to providing impeccable service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed, valued, and pampered. Our staff is highly trained to anticipate and cater to individual needs, creating a personalized dining experience that exceeds expectations. From the moment guests enter the restaurant, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. Our ambiance is carefully designed to foster a sense of tranquility and elegance, with tasteful décor, soft lighting, and comfortable seating. The open kitchen allows guests to witness the culinary artistry firsthand, adding an element of theatre to the dining experience. We actively engage with the local community by participating in food festivals, hosting culinary workshops, and collaborating with local artists and artisans. We source ingredients from local farmers, supporting the regional economy and ensuring the freshness of our dishes. We also strive to incorporate elements of Assamese culture into our menu and décor, paying homage to the region\'s rich heritage. Feedback is actively solicited and meticulously analyzed, ensuring continuous improvement in our service and offerings. We also maintain an active online presence, engaging with customers through social media and responding promptly to inquiries and reviews.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The Maroon Room envisions becoming the premier Pan-Asian fine dining destination in Guwahati and a recognized culinary leader in Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional Asian specialties, introducing seasonal tasting menus, and offering private dining options for special events. We aim to enhance our sustainability practices by further reducing our environmental impact and sourcing more ingredients locally. We are exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other cities in Assam and beyond, bringing our unique brand of Pan-Asian cuisine to a wider audience. We plan to introduce a culinary training program for local youth, fostering talent and creating employment opportunities in the hospitality sector. We also intend to forge strategic partnerships with hotels and tourism agencies to attract more visitors to Guwahati and showcase the region\'s culinary offerings. Our long-term goal is to establish The Maroon Room as a symbol of culinary excellence, innovation, and community engagement, contributing to the growth and development of Guwahati\'s hospitality industry.</p>', '5th Floor, Aurus Mall, near Supermarket', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:05:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1865, 'Café Hendrix', 'Bars', '', '<div class=\"business-description\"><h2>Business Description</h2><p>Café Hendrix: A Symphony of Flavors in the Heart of Guwahati\n\nCafé Hendrix, strategically located on GS Rd, opposite Pantaloons Down Town, is more than just a café; it\'s a vibrant hub where the rich culinary heritage of Assam harmonizes with contemporary tastes, creating a unique and inviting experience. Situated in one of Guwahati\'s busiest commercial areas, Café Hendrix stands out as a haven for those seeking respite from the bustling city life, offering a welcoming atmosphere and an enticing menu that caters to diverse palates. Its significance in the local business landscape lies in its ability to blend the familiar comfort of a classic café with innovative offerings that appeal to both local residents and visiting tourists, contributing to the city\'s evolving food and beverage scene.\n\nCore Services and Products\n\nAt its heart, Café Hendrix is a purveyor of exceptional coffee and a diverse range of delectable food items. The menu is thoughtfully curated, featuring premium coffee blends sourced from both local Assam estates and internationally renowned regions. From meticulously crafted espressos and creamy cappuccinos to refreshing iced coffees, every cup is a testament to the café\'s commitment to quality. Beyond coffee, Café Hendrix offers a wide selection of teas, including traditional Assamese tea and herbal infusions.\n\nThe food menu is equally impressive, ranging from light bites and pastries to more substantial meals. Customers can enjoy freshly baked croissants, muffins, and cakes alongside savory options like sandwiches, paninis, and salads. A particular highlight is the inclusion of Assamese delicacies, offering a taste of local cuisine to both locals and tourists. Consider dishes like *pitha* or *aloo pitika*, providing a unique cultural experience within the familiar café setting. The use of locally sourced ingredients whenever possible ensures freshness and supports local farmers, a key differentiator in the market. The café also offers a selection of refreshing beverages, including fresh fruit juices and smoothies, catering to health-conscious customers.\n\nThe unique selling point of Café Hendrix is its commitment to quality, consistency, and a curated culinary experience that blends global flavors with local Assamese influences. This sets it apart from generic coffee chains and establishes it as a destination for those seeking something more than just a caffeine fix. The location\'s prime visibility and accessibility on GS Rd also contribute to its success, drawing in a steady stream of customers throughout the day.\n\nCustomer Experience\n\nCafé Hendrix prioritizes customer satisfaction above all else. The staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and efficient service, creating a welcoming atmosphere for every visitor. The café\'s interior design contributes significantly to the overall experience. It\'s designed to be comfortable and inviting, with ample seating options to accommodate individuals, couples, and small groups. The décor blends modern aesthetics with subtle nods to Assamese culture, creating a visually appealing and culturally relevant space.\n\nBeyond the physical environment and service, Café Hendrix actively engages with the local community. This is achieved through various initiatives, such as hosting local artist exhibitions, organizing live music performances, and partnering with local charities for fundraising events. These activities not only enhance the café\'s appeal but also foster a sense of community and belonging among its patrons. Special events themed around Assamese festivals are regularly held, further strengthening the café\'s connection to its cultural roots. Feedback is actively solicited through comment cards and online platforms, allowing the café to continuously improve its offerings and address customer concerns promptly. The focus on creating a positive and memorable experience for every customer has contributed to the café\'s strong reputation and loyal customer base.\n\nFuture Vision\n\nLooking ahead, Café Hendrix envisions becoming a leading café brand in Guwahati and beyond, recognized for its quality, innovation, and commitment to the local community. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more innovative food and beverage options, exploring collaborations with local chefs and artisans to create unique culinary experiences.\n\nExpansion is also on the horizon, with plans to open additional locations in strategic areas of Guwahati and potentially other cities in Assam. This expansion will be carefully managed to ensure that the quality and consistency that define Café Hendrix are maintained across all locations. The café also plans to invest in technology to enhance the customer experience, such as online ordering and a loyalty program. Furthermore, Café Hendrix is committed to sustainable practices, including reducing waste, sourcing ingredients locally, and promoting eco-friendly initiatives. The long-term goal is to establish Café Hendrix as a symbol of quality, community engagement, and sustainable business practices within the Assam business landscape, contributing to the region\'s economic growth and cultural vibrancy.</p></div>', 'GS Rd, opp. Pantaloons Down Town', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:10:11', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1866, 'The Beer Cafe, Guwahati', 'Bars', '', '<p>The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, strategically situated on the second floor of Times Square Mall, RG Baruah Rd, near Quick Shoppe, offers a refreshing and sophisticated haven for beer enthusiasts and those seeking a relaxed, social atmosphere in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a bar, The Beer Cafe is a destination – a place where the rich brewing traditions of the world meet the vibrant culture of Assam, creating a unique and appealing experience. It aims to fill a significant niche in the local hospitality sector by providing a curated selection of beers, a comfortable environment, and attentive service, making it a prominent player in Guwahati\'s burgeoning dining and entertainment scene. Its location within a popular mall provides high visibility and accessibility, further solidifying its position in the competitive market.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of The Beer Cafe\'s offerings is its diverse and carefully selected beer menu. Going beyond the typical mainstream options, the cafe prides itself on featuring a wide array of domestic and international brews, including craft beers, ales, lagers, stouts, and wheat beers. This allows customers to explore a range of flavors and styles, catering to both seasoned beer aficionados and those new to the world of brewing. Complementing the beer selection is a menu of appetizers and light meals designed to perfectly pair with the beverages. These food options range from classic bar snacks to more substantial dishes, providing a comprehensive dining experience. A key differentiator for The Beer Cafe is its commitment to educating customers about the beers they are drinking. Knowledgeable staff can offer recommendations and insights into the different styles and brewing processes, enhancing the overall experience. This educational aspect, coupled with the diverse selection and strategic location, sets The Beer Cafe apart from other bars and restaurants in Guwahati, making it a unique destination for both casual gatherings and special occasions.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Beer Cafe, Guwahati. The ambiance is designed to be welcoming and comfortable, with a focus on creating a relaxed and social atmosphere. The decor is modern and stylish, creating an inviting space for patrons to unwind. The staff is trained to provide friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and well-cared for. Beyond simply serving food and drinks, The Beer Cafe strives to build a sense of community. Regular events such as live music performances, trivia nights, and beer tasting sessions are organized to engage with the local population and foster a loyal customer base. The cafe also actively participates in local events and initiatives, further strengthening its connection to the community. By creating a welcoming environment, providing exceptional service, and fostering a sense of community, The Beer Cafe aims to be more than just a place to grab a drink – it strives to be a gathering place where people can connect, relax, and enjoy themselves.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, The Beer Cafe, Guwahati, envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. The initial success of the cafe provides a solid foundation for future endeavors. One key area of focus is expanding the beer selection, continually introducing new and exciting brews to cater to evolving customer tastes. There are also plans to enhance the food menu, offering a wider range of culinary options that complement the beer selection. Geographical expansion is another potential avenue for growth, with the possibility of opening additional locations in Guwahati and other cities in Assam. Furthermore, The Beer Cafe aims to strengthen its online presence through social media marketing and online ordering platforms, making its offerings more accessible to a wider audience. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish The Beer Cafe as a leading destination for beer enthusiasts and a prominent player in the hospitality industry throughout the region. By continuously innovating, adapting to market trends, and maintaining a strong focus on customer experience, The Beer Cafe is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and solidify its position as a beloved establishment in Guwahati\'s vibrant social scene.</p>', 'Second floor, Times Square Mall, RG Baruah Rd, near Quick Shoppe', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:10:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1867, 'EXORO The Rooftop Pub', 'Bars', '', '<p>EXORO The Rooftop Pub is a distinctive addition to Guwahati\'s vibrant social scene, offering a premium rooftop dining and entertainment experience at its prime location on the 4th Floor of Roodraksh Mall, Bhangagarh, GS Rd. More than just a pub, EXORO is designed as an elevated escape, a place where patrons can unwind, socialize, and enjoy panoramic city views alongside exceptional food, beverages, and service. In a market increasingly demanding quality and unique experiences, EXORO sets itself apart through its commitment to creating a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of EXORO\'s offering lies a curated selection of beverages, including both classic and innovative cocktails, a diverse range of domestic and international beers, and a thoughtfully chosen wine list designed to complement the food menu. The kitchen at EXORO specializes in globally-inspired dishes with a local twist, utilizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This ensures that each plate is not only delicious but also reflects the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Beyond the food and drink, EXORO regularly hosts live music performances, DJ sets, and themed events, transforming the space into a dynamic hub for entertainment. These events are strategically planned to appeal to a diverse audience, fostering a sense of community and creating a consistently exciting atmosphere.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>EXORO’s unique selling proposition is its ability to combine an upscale ambiance with a relaxed and welcoming environment. The rooftop setting offers unparalleled views of the city, creating a memorable backdrop for any occasion. The focus on locally-sourced ingredients and regional flavors allows EXORO to connect with the community and offer a taste of Assam to both local residents and visitors alike. This combination of factors caters directly to the needs of the local market, which is increasingly seeking sophisticated yet authentic experiences that reflect the region\'s unique character.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at EXORO. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels valued and appreciated. From the moment patrons arrive, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism, setting the tone for a positive and enjoyable experience. The layout of the pub is designed to encourage interaction and create a sense of community. Whether it\'s a casual evening with friends, a celebratory dinner, or a corporate event, EXORO strives to create an environment where guests can relax, connect, and create lasting memories. Regular feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience, ensuring that EXORO remains responsive to the evolving needs and preferences of its clientele.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>EXORO actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artists, musicians, and businesses. This collaborative approach not only supports the local economy but also helps to build a loyal customer base that values EXORO\'s commitment to the region. By hosting events that showcase local talent and offering dishes that highlight regional flavors, EXORO fosters a sense of pride and belonging within the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, EXORO envisions becoming the premier rooftop destination in Guwahati, renowned for its exceptional food, drinks, service, and atmosphere. Plans are underway to expand the menu with new and exciting culinary creations, introduce innovative cocktail offerings, and enhance the entertainment lineup with a wider range of live music and DJ performances. The business is exploring opportunities to collaborate with other businesses in the Roodraksh Mall and surrounding areas to create a more vibrant and integrated experience for patrons. Long-term goals include expanding to other locations within Assam and potentially beyond, bringing the EXORO experience to a wider audience. This expansion will be carefully planned and executed to maintain the high standards of quality and service that have become synonymous with the EXORO brand.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Furthermore, EXORO is committed to sustainable business practices, exploring ways to minimize its environmental impact and contribute to the well-being of the community. This includes sourcing ingredients from local farmers and suppliers whenever possible, implementing energy-efficient technologies, and supporting local environmental initiatives. By prioritizing sustainability, EXORO aims to create a business that is not only successful but also responsible and ethical.</p>', '4th Floor, Roodraksh Mall, Bhangagarh, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:10:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1868, 'Bulls & Beers, MRP Bar', 'Bars', '', '```html\n<h1>Bulls & Beers, MRP Bar: A Refreshing Addition to Guwahati\'s Social Scene</h1>\n\nBulls & Beers, MRP Bar, strategically located in Dihang Arcade, Ground Floor, United Bank Of India, GS Rd, is a vibrant and dynamic establishment redefining the affordable bar experience in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a place to unwind, Bulls & Beers strives to be a community hub, a place where people can connect, relax, and enjoy quality beverages at accessible prices. Recognizing a need for a sophisticated yet unpretentious atmosphere in the local market, Bulls & Beers bridges the gap between high-end lounges and casual pubs, offering a unique proposition that resonates with a diverse clientele. Its prime location on GS Road, a major commercial artery, ensures high visibility and easy accessibility, making it a convenient choice for after-work gatherings, weekend outings, and special occasions. Bulls & Beers is poised to become a landmark destination, contributing positively to the evolving nightlife and social scene of Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Bulls & Beers is its commitment to providing a wide selection of beverages at Maximum Retail Price (MRP). This transparent pricing model sets it apart from competitors, building trust and attracting budget-conscious patrons without compromising on quality. The bar offers an extensive menu featuring a curated selection of beers, both domestic and international, a variety of spirits, classic cocktails, and non-alcoholic options. Beyond beverages, Bulls & Beers complements its drink offerings with a carefully crafted menu of appetizers and bar snacks designed to enhance the overall experience. These include both familiar favorites and dishes with a local Assamese twist, catering to diverse palates. The focus is on fresh, high-quality ingredients and flavorful pairings that perfectly complement the beverage selection. In addition to its regular menu, Bulls & Beers regularly introduces special promotions and themed nights, keeping the offerings fresh and exciting for its loyal customers. This commitment to variety and affordability makes Bulls & Beers a compelling choice for a broad spectrum of customers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe customer experience at Bulls & Beers is paramount. The bar is designed to be welcoming and comfortable, with a modern and stylish décor that creates a relaxed and inviting atmosphere. The staff is trained to be attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable, ensuring that every guest feels valued and well-cared for. The ambiance is further enhanced by thoughtfully curated music playlists and lighting, creating the perfect backdrop for socializing and relaxation. Bulls & Beers understands the importance of fostering a sense of community. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, trivia nights, and sports screenings, are organized to bring people together and create memorable experiences. The bar also actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local businesses and participation in local events, further solidifying its position as a contributing member of the Guwahati landscape. Customer feedback is actively sought and valued, allowing Bulls & Beers to continually refine its services and offerings to better meet the needs of its patrons.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Bulls & Beers envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati market and beyond. The initial focus is on solidifying its position as the leading MRP bar in the city, building a loyal customer base, and establishing a strong brand reputation. Future plans include expanding the menu to offer a wider range of food options, catering to different dietary needs and preferences. There are also plans to explore opportunities for expansion, potentially opening additional locations in other key areas of Guwahati or even branching out to other cities in Assam. Furthermore, Bulls & Beers intends to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, such as implementing online ordering and reservation systems, and utilizing social media platforms to engage with customers and promote upcoming events. The long-term goal is to establish Bulls & Beers as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with quality beverages, affordable prices, and a vibrant social atmosphere, ultimately contributing to the growth and development of the local hospitality industry.\n```', 'Dihang Arcade, Ground United Bank Of India, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:10:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(1869, 'Keiko MRP Bar', 'Bars', '', 'Keiko MRP Bar: Redefining the Retail Experience in Guwahati\n\nKeiko MRP Bar, strategically located on the Ground Floor of Sri Kamakhya Towers on GS Road, stands as a pioneering venture in Guwahati\'s retail landscape. It\'s not merely a bar; it\'s a carefully curated experience designed to offer a unique and value-driven approach to beverage consumption, catering to the discerning tastes of the local community while embracing modern retail practices. In a market traditionally dominated by conventional bars and retail outlets, Keiko MRP Bar distinguishes itself by offering products at MRP (Maximum Retail Price), coupled with a sophisticated and enjoyable atmosphere. This innovative approach aims to democratize access to quality beverages, providing consumers with a transparent and affordable option within a comfortable and stylish setting. Keiko MRP Bar is more than just a business; it\'s a destination redefining how people in Assam enjoy and access their favorite drinks.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCore Services and Products: Value and Variety\n\nAt its heart, Keiko MRP Bar provides a wide array of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages, all offered at MRP. This transparency in pricing is a cornerstone of the business model, fostering trust and building a loyal customer base. The selection includes a comprehensive range of domestic and international beers, wines, and spirits, ensuring there\'s something to suit every palate and preference. Beyond the standard offerings, Keiko MRP Bar regularly introduces new and trending beverages, keeping the selection fresh and exciting. To complement the beverage offerings, the bar also provides a selection of carefully chosen snacks and appetizers, designed to enhance the overall drinking experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe unique selling proposition lies not only in the MRP pricing but also in the ambiance and overall experience. Unlike typical bars, Keiko MRP Bar cultivates a relaxed and sophisticated atmosphere, making it an ideal location for after-work gatherings, casual get-togethers, and special celebrations. This combination of affordability and quality ambiance sets it apart from competitors. The business carefully considers local market needs, ensuring that the beverage selection caters to regional preferences and seasonal trends. By offering popular local brands alongside international favorites, Keiko MRP Bar positions itself as a place where everyone can find something they enjoy at a price that is fair and accessible.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer Experience: Building Community and Connection\n\nKeiko MRP Bar places a strong emphasis on creating a positive and memorable customer experience. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with a warm welcome and attentive service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the beverage offerings, providing recommendations and assisting customers in making informed choices. The commitment to customer service extends beyond simply taking orders; the staff strives to build genuine connections with patrons, creating a sense of community and belonging.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe ambiance plays a crucial role in enhancing the customer experience. The interior design is modern and stylish, creating a comfortable and inviting space. The lighting is carefully considered, creating a relaxed and intimate atmosphere. Music is selected to complement the overall mood, providing a backdrop for conversation and enjoyment. Keiko MRP Bar actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting themed nights, supporting local artists, and participating in community events. These efforts help to build brand awareness and foster a sense of loyalty among customers. The bar also solicits customer feedback regularly, using this information to improve its services and offerings. This continuous improvement cycle ensures that Keiko MRP Bar remains responsive to the needs and preferences of its customers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture Vision: Growth and Expansion\n\nKeiko MRP Bar envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion within the Guwahati market and potentially beyond. The long-term goal is to establish Keiko MRP Bar as a recognized and respected brand known for its commitment to value, quality, and community. Future plans include exploring opportunities to expand the menu offerings, introducing new and innovative beverages, and enhancing the overall customer experience. The business is also considering the possibility of opening additional locations in strategic areas of Guwahati, bringing the Keiko MRP Bar experience to a wider audience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nTechnological integration is also a key focus for the future. The business plans to implement online ordering and delivery services, making it even easier for customers to access their favorite beverages. Furthermore, Keiko MRP Bar is committed to leveraging data analytics to better understand customer preferences and optimize its operations. This data-driven approach will enable the business to make informed decisions about menu offerings, pricing strategies, and marketing campaigns. Ultimately, Keiko MRP Bar aims to be more than just a bar; it aspires to be a social hub where people can come together to enjoy quality beverages, connect with their community, and create lasting memories. The commitment to innovation, customer service, and community engagement will be the driving forces behind the business\'s future success.', 'Ground Floor, Sri Kamakhya Towers, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:10:37', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1870, 'Quench House', 'Bars', '', '<p>Quench House: Refreshing Assam, One Sip at a Time</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Nestled within the vibrant \"The Walk In\" at the AICC Complex on GS Road, Guwahati, Quench House is more than just a beverage provider; it\'s a destination designed to revitalize and refresh. In the bustling landscape of Assam\'s commercial hub, Quench House offers a welcome respite, catering to the diverse needs of professionals, shoppers, and residents seeking high-quality, innovative beverage options in a welcoming and modern setting. We differentiate ourselves by combining globally inspired drinks with locally sourced ingredients, creating a unique and authentic Assamese experience that resonates with both locals and visitors.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings revolve around providing a curated selection of beverages that go beyond the ordinary. We specialize in freshly made juices, smoothies, artisanal teas and coffees, and refreshing mocktails. Each item on our menu is carefully crafted using the finest ingredients, with a particular emphasis on sourcing local produce whenever possible. Our \"Assam Berry Blast\" smoothie, for example, uses locally grown berries to offer a taste of the region, while our signature masala chai blends are created with premium Assam tea leaves. This commitment to local sourcing not only supports regional farmers but also guarantees the freshness and authenticity of our drinks. Furthermore, Quench House distinguishes itself with a commitment to healthy options, providing sugar-free and all-natural alternatives to cater to health-conscious customers. We also offer seasonal specials, ensuring that our menu remains fresh and exciting throughout the year, reflecting the changing flavors of Assam. Beyond beverages, we complement our drinks menu with a selection of light bites, including healthy wraps, salads, and locally inspired snacks, making Quench House a one-stop destination for a quick and revitalizing break. Our unique selling point lies in the fusion of global beverage trends with local tastes, creating a distinctive and memorable experience for every customer. We aim to fill the gap in the market for high-quality, innovative, and healthy beverage options that are both accessible and affordable.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Quench House, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a welcoming and inviting atmosphere where every customer feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to provide friendly, efficient, and personalized service, going the extra mile to ensure customer satisfaction. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and service standards. We believe in building strong relationships with our local community and actively participate in local events and initiatives. We foster a sense of community by hosting regular workshops and tasting sessions, allowing customers to learn about the art of beverage making and sample new creations. We also partner with local businesses and organizations to promote cross-promotion and collaboration. Understanding the importance of digital connectivity, Quench House offers complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, making it an ideal spot for remote workers and students. Furthermore, we are actively engaged on social media, using platforms like Instagram and Facebook to connect with our customers, share updates, and promote special offers. Our commitment to sustainability is also a key aspect of our customer experience. We use eco-friendly packaging and prioritize waste reduction in all aspects of our operations, appealing to environmentally conscious customers. By focusing on exceptional service, community engagement, and sustainable practices, Quench House aims to create a loyal customer base and establish itself as a beloved local establishment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Quench House envisions significant growth potential. We aim to expand our presence within Guwahati and eventually across other key locations in Assam. Our expansion strategy includes exploring partnerships with local retailers and establishing franchise opportunities for aspiring entrepreneurs. We plan to diversify our menu further, introducing new and exciting beverage options that cater to evolving customer preferences. This includes incorporating more traditional Assamese ingredients and recipes into our offerings. We are also exploring the possibility of introducing a line of bottled beverages, allowing customers to enjoy Quench House favorites at home or on the go. In the long term, Quench House aims to become a leading beverage brand in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We envision ourselves as a catalyst for promoting local ingredients and supporting the growth of the regional economy. We are committed to investing in our employees and providing them with opportunities for professional development and advancement. We also plan to expand our sustainability initiatives, further reducing our environmental footprint and promoting responsible business practices. By focusing on strategic growth, continuous innovation, and a commitment to our core values, Quench House is poised to achieve its long-term goals and establish itself as a thriving and sustainable business in the vibrant Assamese market.</p>', 'The Walk In, AICC Complex, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:15:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1871, 'Ascend Resto Lounge & Bar', 'Bars', '', '```html\n<p>Ascend Resto Lounge & Bar, a sophisticated establishment situated on the 3rd Floor of Nilakshi Plaza, offers a unique dining and entertainment experience that distinguishes itself within the vibrant Assam business landscape. More than just a restaurant and bar, Ascend is conceived as a destination; a place where discerning individuals can connect, celebrate, and unwind in an atmosphere of refined elegance. We strive to be a prominent hub for both the local community and visitors, contributing to the growing appeal of the region as a destination for quality entertainment and leisure.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Ascend’s core offerings center around providing a curated dining and beverage experience. Our menu features a blend of contemporary cuisine, thoughtfully crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible, reflecting the rich culinary heritage of Assam alongside internationally inspired dishes. We offer an extensive selection of appetizers, entrees, and desserts, catering to a variety of palates and dietary preferences. Complementing the food menu is a carefully curated beverage program. Our bar boasts a wide array of premium spirits, classic cocktails, and an impressive selection of wines and beers, designed to elevate the dining experience and provide options for every occasion. The lounge area features handcrafted cocktails prepared by skilled mixologists, adding an element of artistry and innovation to the beverage program.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly sets Ascend apart is the commitment to creating an atmosphere of sophistication and relaxation, combined with exceptional service. The stylish décor, carefully chosen lighting, and ambient music contribute to an inviting and memorable setting. Unlike many establishments, Ascend emphasizes creating a multi-sensory experience, where every detail, from the plating of the dishes to the attentiveness of the staff, is carefully considered. We understand the importance of catering to the local market, offering a space suitable for both casual gatherings and more formal celebrations. Recognizing the importance of connection and fostering a community, Ascend regularly hosts events, live music performances, and themed nights, designed to enhance the entertainment value and create a dynamic social scene.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Ascend, customer experience is paramount. Our staff is extensively trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We believe in building genuine relationships with our patrons, understanding their preferences, and anticipating their needs. We are committed to consistently exceeding expectations and creating memorable experiences that foster loyalty and positive word-of-mouth. We also actively seek feedback from our customers to continually improve our offerings and ensure that we are consistently meeting their evolving needs. By actively engaging with the local community through sponsorships, partnerships, and participation in local events, Ascend aims to become a cherished and integral part of the Assam social fabric.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking towards the future, Ascend Resto Lounge & Bar envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. We aim to become the premier destination for discerning individuals seeking a sophisticated dining and entertainment experience in the region. Our plans include expanding our menu offerings to include more regional specialties, further emphasizing our commitment to local ingredients and culinary traditions. We also plan to enhance our entertainment program by featuring a wider range of local and national artists, creating a platform for showcasing the region\'s rich cultural talent. Longer term, we envision the possibility of expanding our operations to additional locations, replicating the Ascend experience while tailoring it to the unique characteristics of each new market. Ultimately, Ascend Resto Lounge & Bar aspires to be a benchmark for excellence in hospitality, contributing to the economic and cultural vibrancy of Assam and creating lasting memories for our guests.</p>\n```', '3rd Floor, Nilakshi Plaza', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:15:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1872, 'The Whiskey Bar & Grill', 'Bars', '', '<p>The Whiskey Bar & Grill, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 191 Exotica Greens, 6th Floor, 604, Block A, RG Baruah Rd, is more than just a dining and drinking establishment; it\'s a destination. Offering a sophisticated yet approachable ambiance, The Whiskey Bar & Grill has rapidly become a prominent fixture in the local Assam business landscape. We distinguish ourselves by providing a curated experience centered around premium whiskeys from around the world, expertly paired with a diverse menu of grilled specialties and globally-inspired dishes. Recognizing the growing demand for elevated culinary experiences in Guwahati, The Whiskey Bar & Grill aims to provide a haven for both casual diners and discerning connoisseurs.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings are built on two pillars: exceptional beverages and delectable cuisine. Our extensive whiskey selection is carefully chosen to cater to a wide range of palates, from novice whiskey enthusiasts to seasoned aficionados. We offer guided tastings, whiskey flights, and expertly crafted cocktails using both classic and innovative recipes. Beyond whiskey, our bar boasts a comprehensive selection of other spirits, wines, and beers, ensuring something for everyone. The \"Grill\" aspect of our name is equally important. Our kitchen team specializes in grilling premium cuts of meat, fresh seafood, and flavorful vegetarian options, using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible to support regional producers and ensure optimal freshness. Menu items are designed to complement the whiskey selection, with careful consideration given to flavor profiles and pairings. What sets us apart is our commitment to providing an accessible and educational whiskey experience, demystifying the spirit and making it approachable for all. This, combined with our high-quality grilled cuisine, provides a unique and compelling dining experience that caters to the evolving tastes of the Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Whiskey Bar & Grill, the customer experience is paramount. We believe that genuine hospitality and attentive service are essential ingredients for a memorable visit. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about our menu and beverage offerings, enabling them to provide personalized recommendations and answer any questions customers may have. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where guests feel comfortable and valued. To enhance the customer experience, we frequently host live music events featuring local artists, creating a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We also actively participate in local community events and collaborate with other businesses to promote Guwahati\'s growing culinary scene. We understand the importance of connecting with the local community and strive to be more than just a business; we aim to be a valued member of the neighborhood. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers through surveys and direct interaction to continuously improve our services and offerings and to ensure that we are meeting their needs and expectations.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, The Whiskey Bar & Grill envisions expanding its reach and solidifying its position as a premier dining and drinking destination in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to introduce new whiskey selections and seasonal menu items regularly to keep our offerings fresh and exciting. We are also exploring opportunities to partner with local distilleries and breweries to showcase the burgeoning craft beverage scene in Assam. Furthermore, we aim to develop our online presence through targeted marketing campaigns and social media engagement to reach a wider audience. We are also considering expanding our physical footprint by adding outdoor seating or a private dining room to accommodate larger groups and events. Ultimately, our long-term goal is to establish The Whiskey Bar & Grill as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional customer service. We are committed to investing in our team, our community, and our business to ensure sustained growth and success in the years to come. Our vision is to create a legacy of culinary excellence and contribute to the vibrant and evolving landscape of Guwahati\'s dining and entertainment scene.</p>', '191 Exotica Greens, 6th Floor, 604, Block A, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:15:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1873, 'House of Madira', 'Bars', '', '<p>House of Madira: A Taste of Assam, Crafted with Care</p>\n\n<p>Located in the heart of Guwahati at Ground Floor, Block B, Central Mall, GS Rd, House of Madira offers a curated collection of alcoholic beverages and artisanal snacks, emphasizing locally sourced ingredients and unique Assam flavors. More than just a retail outlet, House of Madira is an experience – a place to discover the diverse tastes of the region, expertly curated and presented with a commitment to quality and customer satisfaction. In a market dominated by national brands, House of Madira distinguishes itself by championing local producers and offering a refined selection that appeals to both seasoned connoisseurs and those new to the world of spirits and fine foods. Our commitment to showcasing the rich culinary heritage of Assam positions us as a significant contributor to the local business landscape, fostering economic growth for regional artisans and producers. We strive to be a destination that reflects the vibrant culture of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of House of Madira lies a carefully chosen selection of alcoholic beverages. While offering a range of popular spirits and wines, our true focus is on showcasing the unique offerings from Assam and the Northeast. This includes locally brewed rice beer (Judima), fruit wines crafted from regional produce, and even locally distilled spirits that adhere to the highest quality standards. Complementing the beverages, we offer an array of artisanal snacks and accompaniments, again prioritizing locally sourced ingredients. Imagine sampling a handcrafted cheese platter featuring cheeses from Meghalaya, paired with a glass of locally produced plum wine, or enjoying spicy bhut jolokia infused cashew nuts alongside a refreshing craft beer. Our unique selling point is this emphasis on regional flavors and the ability to create pairings that are both exciting and authentically Assamese. We directly address the growing market demand for unique and authentic culinary experiences, moving beyond mass-produced goods to offer a taste of the region\'s soul. We actively partner with local farmers, producers, and artisans, ensuring that our products are fresh, high-quality, and contribute to the sustainability of the local economy. We also provide tasting sessions and guided pairings, allowing customers to fully appreciate the nuances of the regional products.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at House of Madira. We believe that every interaction is an opportunity to build a lasting relationship and share our passion for the region\'s culinary treasures. Our staff is meticulously trained not just on product knowledge, but also on providing personalized recommendations and creating a welcoming atmosphere. We encourage customers to sample products, ask questions, and explore the unique offerings available. Beyond the transactional aspect, we strive to create a sense of community. We host regular events, such as wine tasting evenings featuring local vineyards, food pairing workshops highlighting regional cuisine, and meet-the-producer events where customers can interact directly with the artisans behind their favorite products. We actively engage with the local community through sponsorships of local events and partnerships with other businesses. This involvement helps us to build brand loyalty, generate positive word-of-mouth, and foster a sense of shared pride in the region\'s rich culinary heritage. We also collect customer feedback through online surveys and in-store suggestion boxes, constantly striving to improve our service and cater to the evolving needs of our clientele. Our commitment to ethical sourcing, sustainable practices, and supporting local artisans further enhances the customer experience, appealing to a growing segment of consumers who prioritize social responsibility.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for House of Madira is one of continued growth and expansion, while remaining true to our core values of showcasing regional flavors and supporting local producers. We envision expanding our product line to include a wider range of artisanal goods, such as handcrafted chocolates, traditional Assamese sweets, and unique food products made with indigenous ingredients. We also plan to explore opportunities for online sales, allowing us to reach a wider audience and share the flavors of Assam with customers across the country. Furthermore, we are actively considering opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and potentially expanding to other cities in the Northeast. A key component of our growth strategy is to further develop our relationships with local producers, providing them with the resources and support they need to scale their operations and reach a wider market. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own branded products, using locally sourced ingredients and traditional recipes to create unique and distinctive offerings. Our long-term goal is to become a leading destination for authentic Assamese culinary experiences, recognized for our commitment to quality, customer service, and supporting the local community. We aim to be more than just a store; we want to be a cultural ambassador, sharing the unique flavors and traditions of Assam with the world.</p>', 'Ground Floor, Block B, Central Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:15:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1874, 'The Twilight Exists', 'Bars', '', '<p>The Twilight Exists, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at RG Complex, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd, is more than just a business; it\'s a destination. We offer a carefully curated blend of retail and experience, designed to cater to the discerning tastes of the local community and beyond. In a rapidly evolving Assam business landscape, The Twilight Exists distinguishes itself by focusing on providing unique, high-quality goods and services that foster a sense of connection and discovery.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, The Twilight Exists operates as a specialty boutique and cafe, strategically combined to create a synergistic and immersive customer experience. Our retail section features a selection of handcrafted artisanal products sourced primarily from local and regional artisans. This includes textiles, jewelry, home décor, and unique gift items, each telling a story of craftsmanship and cultural heritage. By prioritizing local artisans, we actively contribute to the economic empowerment of the community and celebrate the rich artistic traditions of Assam and the Northeast.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Complementing the retail offerings is our cafe, a warm and inviting space serving freshly brewed coffee, locally sourced teas, and a selection of light bites and pastries. The cafe is not just a place to grab a quick bite; it\'s designed as a community hub, a space where people can connect, relax, and engage in conversation. We source our ingredients locally whenever possible, ensuring freshness and supporting local farmers and producers. The menu features both classic cafe staples and regional specialties, offering a taste of Assam\'s culinary heritage. A unique selling point of our cafe is the occasional hosting of events such as open mic nights, poetry readings, and art exhibitions, further fostering a sense of community and creative expression.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The unique selling proposition of The Twilight Exists lies in its ability to seamlessly blend retail and hospitality, creating a holistic and engaging customer experience. Unlike traditional retailers or cafes, we offer a space where customers can browse unique handcrafted items while enjoying a delicious beverage and connecting with others. This integrated approach resonates deeply with the local market, which increasingly values experiences and authenticity. We cater to a diverse clientele, including local residents, tourists seeking authentic souvenirs, and individuals looking for unique and thoughtful gifts.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Twilight Exists. We strive to create a welcoming and personalized environment for every visitor. Our staff is carefully trained to provide exceptional customer service, offering knowledgeable assistance with product selection and personalized recommendations. We believe in building relationships with our customers, understanding their needs and preferences, and fostering a sense of loyalty. We actively solicit feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and service.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>To further enhance the customer experience, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We participate in local festivals and events, showcasing our products and promoting local artisans. We also partner with local schools and organizations to host workshops and events that promote creativity and cultural awareness. These initiatives help us build strong relationships with the community and establish The Twilight Exists as a trusted and valued local business.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Twilight Exists envisions becoming a leading destination for authentic artisanal products and community engagement in Guwahati. Our future plans include expanding our retail selection to include a wider range of products from artisans across the Northeast region. We also plan to enhance our cafe offerings with a more diverse menu featuring regional specialties and healthy options. We aim to establish an online presence, enabling us to reach a wider audience and showcase the talents of our local artisans to the world.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>In the long term, The Twilight Exists aspires to become a model for sustainable and community-focused business. We are committed to supporting local artisans, promoting cultural heritage, and creating a positive impact on the community. We envision expanding our operations to other locations in Assam and the Northeast, bringing our unique blend of retail and hospitality to a wider audience. By staying true to our values and continuously innovating, we are confident that The Twilight Exists will continue to thrive and contribute to the vibrant business landscape of Assam.</p>', 'RG Complex, Dr Bhabendra Nath Saikia Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:15:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1875, 'Freemason’s Brewworks', 'Bars', '', '<article>\n<h1>Freemason’s Brewworks: A Guwahati Landmark</h1>\n\n<p>Freemason’s Brewworks, a vibrant microbrewery and restaurant, offers a distinctive dining and entertainment experience in the heart of Guwahati. Located on the 5th Floor of City Center Mall, GS Rd, near Apollo Hospital, it stands as a premier destination for craft beer enthusiasts and those seeking a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere. More than just a place to grab a drink, Freemason’s Brewworks aims to cultivate a community gathering place, providing a refreshing departure from the typical dining options in the area and contributing to the burgeoning food and beverage scene in Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>In a market increasingly receptive to unique culinary experiences, Freemason’s Brewworks fills a crucial niche by offering handcrafted beers brewed on-site. This commitment to quality and craftsmanship sets it apart from establishments that primarily serve mass-produced beverages. Furthermore, its strategic location within City Center Mall provides easy access and visibility, making it an attractive option for shoppers, professionals, and residents alike. The business leverages the mall\'s foot traffic while simultaneously drawing in patrons specifically for its unique offerings, creating a symbiotic relationship that benefits both Freemason\'s Brewworks and the surrounding retail environment.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h2>Crafting Experiences: Core Services and Products</h2>\n\n<p>At the heart of Freemason’s Brewworks lies its microbrewery, producing a diverse range of craft beers to cater to varying palates. From crisp lagers and hoppy IPAs to rich stouts and flavorful ales, the brewery aims to offer a rotating selection of seasonal and experimental brews. Beyond beer, the menu features a carefully curated selection of appetizers, entrees, and desserts, designed to complement the beer offerings. The food menu focuses on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, reflecting a commitment to supporting local farmers and producers and providing a truly regional experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>What distinguishes Freemason’s Brewworks is its commitment to the brewing process itself. Patrons can often observe the brewing process through strategically placed windows, offering a glimpse into the art and science behind each pint. This transparency fosters a sense of connection and appreciation for the craftsmanship involved. Furthermore, the brewery hosts regular events, such as brewery tours, beer pairing dinners, and live music performances, further enhancing its appeal and creating a dynamic and engaging atmosphere.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The appeal extends beyond just the beer and food. The interior design of Freemason’s Brewworks is deliberately crafted to create a warm and inviting ambiance. A blend of rustic and modern elements creates a space that feels both comfortable and sophisticated. Comfortable seating arrangements, thoughtfully designed lighting, and curated artwork contribute to an overall atmosphere that encourages relaxation and conversation. The open layout allows for easy flow and interaction, fostering a sense of community among patrons.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h2>A Customer-Centric Approach</h2>\n\n<p>Freemason’s Brewworks prioritizes exceptional customer service as a cornerstone of its success. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the beer offerings and food menu, providing informed recommendations and engaging with customers to understand their preferences. A friendly and attentive atmosphere is fostered, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and incorporated into service improvements and menu development.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The business also actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in community events. Supporting local charities and sponsoring local initiatives further strengthens its ties to the community and reinforces its commitment to being a responsible corporate citizen. These efforts not only enhance the brand\'s reputation but also contribute to the overall well-being of the Guwahati community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h2>Brewing the Future: Vision and Growth</h2>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Freemason’s Brewworks envisions becoming a leading destination for craft beer and culinary experiences in Guwahati and beyond. The business plans to expand its brewing capacity to meet increasing demand and introduce new and innovative beer styles. Exploration of partnerships with local restaurants and bars to distribute its craft beers is also being considered, further expanding its reach and brand awareness.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The long-term goals include establishing Freemason’s Brewworks as a recognizable brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. This includes exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other strategic areas within Assam and potentially beyond, while maintaining the core values of craftsmanship, quality, and customer service that have defined its success. Through continuous innovation, a dedication to quality, and a strong connection to the local community, Freemason’s Brewworks is poised to continue its growth and solidify its position as a premier destination in Guwahati’s vibrant food and beverage landscape.</p>\n</article>', '5th Floor, City Center Mall, GS Rd, near Apollo Hospital', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:20:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1876, 'T Sin Q - Sports cum Lounge Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>T Sin Q - Sports cum Lounge Bar: Where Assam\'s Sporting Spirit Meets Relaxed Sophistication</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Bedi Market, Dr RP Rd, T Sin Q – Sports cum Lounge Bar is a dynamic establishment redefining the social scene in Assam. More than just a bar, T Sin Q offers a multifaceted experience, blending the thrill of live sports with the comfort and ambiance of a sophisticated lounge. Addressing a gap in the local market for a venue that caters to both sports enthusiasts and those seeking a refined social gathering spot, T Sin Q has quickly become a popular destination for residents and visitors alike, contributing significantly to the evolving leisure landscape of the area. The establishment distinguishes itself by creating a harmonious blend of energetic sports viewing and relaxed lounge atmosphere, a rare offering in the regional hospitality sector.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At its core, T Sin Q provides a diverse range of services tailored to cater to a broad clientele. Primarily, the business operates as a full-service bar, offering a curated selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. This includes local Assam beers, popular international brands, handcrafted cocktails, and a variety of soft drinks and juices. Complementing the beverage offerings is a thoughtfully designed food menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and popular continental snacks. The menu is crafted to pair perfectly with the drinks, enhancing the overall dining experience. A key differentiator for T Sin Q is its focus on live sports broadcasting. Multiple large-screen televisions are strategically placed throughout the venue, ensuring optimal viewing from any location. This allows patrons to enjoy major sporting events, creating a vibrant and communal atmosphere. Additionally, T Sin Q provides a comfortable lounge area with plush seating, mood lighting, and carefully selected music. This space is designed for more intimate gatherings and relaxed conversations, providing a welcome contrast to the energy of the sports viewing area. Regular promotions, themed nights, and special events further enhance the appeal, ensuring there\'s always something new and exciting happening at T Sin Q. These services directly respond to the local market\'s need for a versatile venue that can cater to various social occasions, from casual get-togethers to celebratory events.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at T Sin Q. The business is committed to providing exceptional service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. A team of highly trained and attentive staff members are dedicated to anticipating customer needs and exceeding expectations. From the moment a guest enters the premises, they are greeted with a warm and friendly atmosphere. The staff are knowledgeable about the menu and are always happy to offer recommendations or assist with any queries. Beyond the immediate service, T Sin Q actively engages with the local community by sponsoring local sports teams, hosting charity events, and participating in community initiatives. This commitment to social responsibility fosters a strong sense of connection with the neighborhood. Moreover, T Sin Q emphasizes creating a safe and inclusive environment for all patrons. Security measures are in place to ensure the well-being of guests, and the staff are trained to handle any situation with professionalism and discretion. This dedication to customer service, community engagement, and safety is what truly sets T Sin Q apart, fostering a loyal customer base and positive word-of-mouth referrals. The commitment to creating a memorable and enjoyable experience for every guest is central to the business\'s philosophy.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, T Sin Q envisions a future of continued growth and expansion. The business aims to solidify its position as the premier sports cum lounge bar in the region, attracting a wider audience and enhancing its brand reputation. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more local and international cuisine options, catering to diverse palates. The introduction of live music performances and DJ nights is also under consideration, further diversifying the entertainment offerings. A potential expansion of the venue itself is being explored to accommodate the growing demand and provide even more comfortable seating options. Furthermore, T Sin Q plans to leverage social media and digital marketing strategies to reach a broader audience and enhance customer engagement. A loyalty program is also in development to reward repeat customers and foster a sense of community. The long-term goal is to establish T Sin Q as a recognizable and respected brand within the hospitality industry, known for its quality service, vibrant atmosphere, and commitment to the local community. T Sin Q aspires to be more than just a bar; it aims to be a social hub, a place where people can come together to celebrate life\'s moments, big and small, in a welcoming and enjoyable environment. The business is committed to adapting to the evolving needs of the market and continuously innovating to stay ahead of the competition, ensuring a sustainable and successful future.</p>', 'Bedi Market, Dr RP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:20:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1877, 'RANN JYPSY BY RANNVIJAY (A JKM VENTURE)', 'Bars', '', '<p>RANN JYPSY BY RANNVIJAY (A JKM VENTURE), nestled on Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path, is a dynamic and innovative enterprise poised to reshape the retail and lifestyle landscape of Assam. More than just a business, it\'s a carefully curated experience, blending contemporary trends with a deep appreciation for local artistry and culture. As a JKM VENTURE, RANN JYPSY draws upon a foundation of established business acumen and strategic vision, allowing it to bring a fresh perspective to the market and offer something truly unique to the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, RANN JYPSY is a multi-faceted retail destination offering a carefully selected range of products and services catering to a discerning clientele. While the precise offerings may evolve to reflect current trends and customer preferences, the underlying principle remains constant: to provide high-quality, thoughtfully sourced items that reflect both global influences and the rich heritage of Assam. We envision a retail space that seamlessly integrates apparel, accessories, lifestyle goods, and potentially even a curated selection of artisanal food products. Think a fusion of modern fashion, handcrafted jewelry, unique home décor items that tell a story, and perhaps even locally sourced delicacies, all under one roof.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The unique selling point of RANN JYPSY lies not just in the products themselves, but in the overall experience it offers. We aim to create an atmosphere that is both aspirational and accessible, fostering a sense of discovery and delight. Unlike mass-market retailers, we focus on curating a collection that is distinct and meaningful, emphasizing quality, craftsmanship, and ethical sourcing. We believe in supporting local artisans and showcasing the talent of the region, potentially incorporating locally produced textiles, crafts, and artwork into our inventory. This commitment to local sourcing not only supports the community but also adds a unique and authentic flavor to the RANN JYPSY brand.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Understanding the specific needs and preferences of the local market is paramount to our success. Assam possesses a vibrant cultural identity and a growing appreciation for quality and style. RANN JYPSY seeks to cater to this demographic by offering products that are both fashionable and functional, catering to the diverse needs of the community. Whether it\'s offering clothing that is suitable for the climate, accessories that reflect local traditions, or lifestyle goods that enhance everyday life, we strive to provide solutions that resonate with the local consumer. Our market research involves a continuous understanding of regional trends and consumer behaviors, which drives our curated product selection.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of the RANN JYPSY philosophy. We believe that exceptional customer service is not just about transactions, but about building relationships and creating a positive and memorable experience for every visitor. Our staff will be trained to be knowledgeable, attentive, and genuinely helpful, providing personalized recommendations and assisting customers in finding exactly what they are looking for. We aim to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where customers feel comfortable browsing, exploring, and engaging with our products and services. We envision hosting in-store events, workshops, and collaborations with local artists and designers to further enhance the customer experience and foster a sense of community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond providing excellent service, RANN JYPSY aims to connect with the local community through meaningful engagement and support. This could involve partnering with local charities, sponsoring community events, or participating in initiatives that promote local arts and culture. We believe that by actively contributing to the well-being of the community, we can build trust and loyalty with our customers and create a positive impact on the region. The business aims to be a responsible corporate citizen, upholding ethical business practices and contributing to the sustainable development of the local economy.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, RANN JYPSY BY RANNVIJAY (A JKM VENTURE) has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on establishing a strong presence on Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path and building a loyal customer base. Over time, the business envisions expanding its product offerings, exploring opportunities for online sales, and potentially opening additional retail locations in other parts of Assam and beyond. We also anticipate leveraging the JKM VENTURE network to explore synergistic partnerships and collaborations that can further enhance our brand and reach. Ultimately, RANN JYPSY aspires to become a leading retail and lifestyle destination in Assam, known for its quality products, exceptional customer service, and unwavering commitment to the local community. The long-term goal is to become a recognized brand synonymous with style, sophistication, and a deep appreciation for the rich cultural heritage of the region.</p>', 'Swahid Dilip Huzuri Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:20:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
