(1878, 'Lunar Restro Bar and Club', 'Bars', '', '<p>Lunar Restro Bar and Club: Elevating Guwahati\'s Nightlife Experience</p>\n\n<p>Lunar Restro Bar and Club, situated on the 5th Floor of Subham Square, opposite the Indira Gandhi Athletic Stadium in Guwahati, is a premier destination offering a sophisticated blend of dining, entertainment, and nightlife. More than just a venue, Lunar strives to be a vibrant hub where the local community can connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories. As a key player in Assam\'s growing hospitality sector, Lunar distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, innovation, and a deep understanding of local preferences.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Core Services and Products</strong></p>\n\n<p>At the heart of Lunar\'s offering is a carefully curated menu featuring a fusion of global cuisine and local Assamese flavors. The culinary team prides itself on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring both quality and support for local producers. Signature dishes are thoughtfully crafted to appeal to a diverse palate, from traditional favorites to contemporary culinary creations. Complementing the food menu is an extensive selection of beverages, including classic cocktails, premium spirits, a wide array of beers, and a thoughtfully chosen wine list. The bar staff are trained in mixology, ensuring each drink is expertly prepared and presented.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Beyond the culinary offerings, Lunar provides a dynamic entertainment experience. The venue features a state-of-the-art sound system, professional lighting, and a spacious dance floor, making it an ideal setting for live music performances, DJ sets, and themed parties. Lunar regularly hosts local bands and artists, providing a platform for showcasing Assam\'s rich musical talent. The ambiance is designed to be both sophisticated and inviting, creating an atmosphere where guests can relax, socialize, and enjoy the energy of the night. Unique selling points include its panoramic city views from the 5th-floor location, its commitment to providing a safe and secure environment, and its diverse range of entertainment options, catering to a wide demographic. These factors help Lunar meet the local market\'s demand for high-quality entertainment and dining experiences.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Customer Experience</strong></p>\n\n<p>Lunar Restro Bar and Club places a premium on providing exceptional customer service. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, beverages, and entertainment offerings, ensuring they can answer questions and provide recommendations. Lunar actively seeks feedback from customers to continuously improve its services and offerings. This dedication to customer satisfaction is reflected in the high levels of repeat business and positive reviews. Lunar also actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in community events. By sponsoring local initiatives and supporting charitable causes, Lunar demonstrates its commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the Assam business community.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Lunar distinguishes itself through its commitment to creating a memorable and enjoyable experience for every guest. This is achieved through a combination of high-quality food and beverages, a dynamic entertainment program, and exceptional customer service. The venue\'s design is carefully considered to create a sophisticated and inviting atmosphere, while the staff are dedicated to providing a warm and welcoming experience.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p><strong>Future Vision</strong></p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Lunar Restro Bar and Club envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam hospitality market. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more regional specialties, further enhancing the entertainment offerings with new and innovative programming, and potentially opening additional locations in other key cities throughout the region. The long-term goal is to establish Lunar as the leading restro bar and club in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. The business also seeks to develop sustainable practices to minimize its environmental footprint and contribute to a more responsible and eco-friendly operation. This includes exploring opportunities to reduce waste, conserve energy, and source sustainable products. By focusing on these key areas, Lunar aims to create a business that is not only successful but also contributes to the well-being of the local community and the environment.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Lunar aims to solidify its position as a premier entertainment and dining destination, continuing to innovate and adapt to the evolving needs and preferences of the local market. This commitment to excellence ensures that Lunar Restro Bar and Club will remain a vibrant and integral part of Guwahati\'s nightlife scene for years to come.</p>', '5th Floor, Subham Square, opposite Indira Gandhi Athletic Stadium', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:20:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1879, 'Gossip Sky Bar and Resto', 'Bars', '', '<p>Gossip Sky Bar and Resto: Elevated Dining and Entertainment in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<p>Gossip Sky Bar and Resto is a sophisticated dining and entertainment establishment located on the 1st Floor of the Bibekananda Complex, strategically positioned opposite Rajib Bhawan in a vibrant and accessible area of Assam. More than just a restaurant and bar, Gossip Sky Bar and Resto offers a unique, elevated experience, seamlessly blending exquisite culinary offerings with a stylish ambiance and breathtaking views of the surrounding cityscape. It aims to be a premier destination for both local residents and visitors seeking a memorable and refined experience, setting a new standard for dining and nightlife in the region. Its location provides easy access, making it a convenient spot for after-work gatherings, celebratory dinners, and casual meetups.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the core of Gossip Sky Bar and Resto\'s offerings are its diverse and meticulously crafted menus. The restaurant features a multi-cuisine approach, showcasing a curated selection of Indian, Continental, and Pan-Asian dishes prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This commitment to quality extends to the bar, which boasts an impressive array of expertly mixed cocktails, premium spirits, and a thoughtfully chosen wine list. The culinary team focuses on innovative flavor combinations and elegant presentation, ensuring that each dish is a feast for both the eyes and the palate. The signature cocktails are uniquely named and crafted, reflecting the local culture and adding a touch of whimsy to the drinking experience. A key differentiator is the rooftop setting, providing panoramic views that complement the dining experience, making it a highly desirable location for special occasions and romantic evenings. The provision of a comfortable and stylish indoor area also ensures year-round usability, irrespective of weather conditions. By catering to a wide range of tastes and preferences, Gossip Sky Bar and Resto aims to become a culinary landmark, consistently exceeding expectations and solidifying its position as a top-tier dining destination.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Gossip Sky Bar and Resto. The establishment strives to create a welcoming and attentive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. The service staff is meticulously trained to provide knowledgeable recommendations, anticipate needs, and deliver impeccable service with a genuine smile. From the moment a guest enters until their departure, the focus is on ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience. The ambiance is carefully curated with tasteful décor, comfortable seating, and mood-setting lighting, creating a relaxed yet sophisticated atmosphere. Regular live music performances and themed events add to the entertainment value, providing guests with a dynamic and engaging experience. Gossip Sky Bar and Resto actively engages with the local community by hosting special events, partnering with local artists and vendors, and supporting local initiatives. This commitment to community involvement helps to build strong relationships and foster a sense of belonging. By consistently exceeding expectations in both service and ambiance, Gossip Sky Bar and Resto aims to cultivate a loyal customer base and become an integral part of the local social scene.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Gossip Sky Bar and Resto is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and continuous improvement. The management team plans to expand its menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes that reflect evolving culinary trends and local preferences. Exploring opportunities for outdoor seating enhancements and potentially incorporating a dedicated private dining area are also under consideration. A significant focus will be placed on leveraging digital marketing channels to increase brand awareness and attract new customers, while also strengthening relationships with existing patrons through loyalty programs and personalized communication. Furthermore, the business aims to establish itself as a responsible corporate citizen by implementing sustainable practices and supporting local charities and community initiatives. Long-term goals include expanding the Gossip Sky Bar and Resto brand to other prime locations within Assam and potentially beyond, solidifying its position as a leading hospitality provider in the region. The commitment to exceptional quality, customer satisfaction, and community engagement will remain at the heart of the business\'s growth strategy, ensuring its continued success and positive impact on the local landscape.</p>', '1st Floor, Bibekananda complex, opposite Rajib Bhawan', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:20:39', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1880, 'The Root Barrel', 'Bars', '', '<p>The Root Barrel, strategically located on the 7th Floor of Exotica Greens, is a dynamic and innovative business redefining the Assam experience through a unique blend of traditional craftsmanship, modern design, and sustainable practices. More than just a commercial enterprise, The Root Barrel strives to be a vibrant hub where local artisans, businesses, and the community converge, fostering growth and showcasing the rich cultural heritage of the region. By bridging the gap between local artistry and global appeal, The Root Barrel positions itself as a significant player in the emerging Assam business landscape, contributing to economic diversification and promoting the region\'s distinctive identity on a broader stage. Our presence in Exotica Greens, a modern and accessible location, allows us to easily connect with a diverse clientele while simultaneously offering a sophisticated and professional environment for business interactions.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of The Root Barrel’s offerings lie two core pillars: curated artisan products and bespoke event experiences. Our product line showcases the exquisite skill and artistry of local Assam artisans, featuring handcrafted textiles, intricate woodwork, organic teas, and unique jewelry pieces. These items are meticulously selected for their quality, authenticity, and representation of Assam\'s cultural heritage. Beyond simply selling these products, we aim to tell the story behind each creation, connecting customers with the artisans and preserving traditional techniques. Our unique selling point is our commitment to ethical sourcing and fair trade practices, ensuring that the artisans receive equitable compensation for their work and are empowered to sustain their craft. This focus on ethical and sustainable production resonates strongly with the growing consumer demand for responsibly sourced goods. <br> <br>Complementing our product offerings is our bespoke event service, which provides tailored event planning and execution for both corporate and private clients. Drawing inspiration from Assam\'s vibrant culture and natural beauty, we create unforgettable experiences ranging from corporate retreats and product launches to weddings and cultural celebrations. Our events are infused with local flavor, incorporating regional cuisine, traditional music, and authentic decor. We leverage our network of local suppliers and artisans to ensure that each event is a unique and memorable reflection of Assam’s identity. These services directly address the local market\'s need for sophisticated and culturally relevant event solutions, filling a gap in the existing market.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Root Barrel. We cultivate a warm and welcoming atmosphere where every visitor feels valued and appreciated. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide exceptional service, offering personalized assistance and expert guidance to help customers discover the perfect product or create a memorable event. We prioritize building genuine relationships with our customers, understanding their needs and preferences to deliver solutions that exceed their expectations. We stand out by offering a truly immersive Assam experience, showcasing the region’s culture and traditions through our products, events, and interactions. <br> <br> Furthermore, The Root Barrel actively engages with the local community through partnerships with local artisans, community organizations, and educational institutions. We host workshops and cultural events to promote local artistry, educate the public about Assam\'s heritage, and foster a sense of community pride. We regularly participate in local festivals and events, showcasing our products and services and contributing to the vibrancy of the Assam community. This commitment to community engagement strengthens our brand reputation and fosters long-term customer loyalty.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Root Barrel envisions significant growth potential. Our long-term goals include expanding our product line to incorporate a wider range of Assam-made goods, developing an online platform to reach a global audience, and establishing strategic partnerships with businesses and organizations both within and outside of Assam. We aim to become the leading destination for authentic Assam products and experiences, recognized for our commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. <br> <br> We plan to explore opportunities to expand our event services to cater to a broader range of clients and event types, including offering destination wedding packages and corporate retreats in Assam. We also aim to develop a training program for local artisans, providing them with the skills and resources they need to grow their businesses and reach new markets. By investing in the development of local talent and promoting sustainable practices, The Root Barrel is committed to creating a positive impact on the Assam community and contributing to the region\'s economic prosperity. Our presence at Exotica Greens will remain a cornerstone as we build brand recognition and create a trusted space in the local market.</p>', '7th Floor, Exotica Greens', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:25:10', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1881, 'Cheers Cross Roads', 'Bars', '', '<p>Cheers Cross Roads stands as a vibrant hub of commerce and community, strategically positioned to serve the diverse needs of Assam. More than just a business, it represents a commitment to quality, local engagement, and sustainable growth within the region\'s evolving economic landscape. Cheers Cross Roads strives to be a cornerstone of the local economy, fostering connections and contributing to the prosperity of the surrounding area.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Cheers Cross Roads primarily offers a curated selection of locally sourced goods and artisanal products. Recognizing the rich tradition of craftsmanship in Assam, we feature handwoven textiles, organic teas, and unique handcrafted items. These products showcase the talent and heritage of local artisans, providing them with a platform to reach a wider audience. A key aspect of our service is fostering a direct link between consumers and producers, promoting fair trade practices and supporting the sustainability of local businesses. This connection underscores our commitment to showcasing the best of Assam to both residents and visitors alike. Additionally, Cheers Cross Roads provides a space for community events and workshops, further enhancing its role as a central gathering point. We also provide local produce which includes seasonal fruits and vegetables.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The unique selling point of Cheers Cross Roads lies in its dedication to authenticity and ethical sourcing. We meticulously vet our suppliers, ensuring that products meet rigorous standards of quality and sustainability. Furthermore, our commitment to fair pricing and transparent business practices distinguishes us from larger, impersonal retail chains. By prioritizing local partnerships, we create a mutually beneficial ecosystem that supports the growth of small businesses and preserves the unique cultural heritage of Assam. This not only resonates with consumers seeking authentic experiences but also reinforces our commitment to responsible business practices.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Cheers Cross Roads prioritizes creating an exceptional customer experience built on warmth, personalized service, and genuine connection. Our staff is deeply knowledgeable about the products we offer, providing insightful information and recommendations tailored to individual needs. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere where customers feel valued and appreciated. Beyond transactional interactions, Cheers Cross Roads actively engages with the local community through sponsorship of local events and participation in community initiatives. We aim to be more than just a business; we aim to be a trusted neighbor and a valuable contributor to the social fabric of Assam. Regularly hosting artist showcase also provides community engagement.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Cheers Cross Roads is ambitious, focused on sustainable growth and expanded community impact. We plan to broaden our product offerings while maintaining our commitment to local sourcing and ethical practices. This includes exploring partnerships with emerging artisans and expanding our reach through online platforms and strategic collaborations. We are also exploring opportunities to develop educational programs that promote sustainable business practices and empower local entrepreneurs. Ultimately, Cheers Cross Roads aspires to become a model for responsible business in Assam, demonstrating that economic success can be achieved while upholding social and environmental values.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Cheers Cross Roads envisions expanding its operations to include a small-scale processing unit for local agricultural products. This initiative would not only create additional employment opportunities but also add value to the region\'s agricultural output. This planned expansion aims to solidify Cheers Cross Roads\' position as a key driver of economic development and a champion of local producers.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:25:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1882, 'The Root Barrel', 'Bars', '', '<p>Nestled on the 7th Floor of Exotica Greens, The Root Barrel is rapidly establishing itself as a vibrant hub for Assam\'s burgeoning artisanal food and beverage scene. More than just a cafe or a restaurant, The Root Barrel is a curated experience, designed to showcase the rich agricultural heritage of the region and offer a unique, locally-sourced culinary journey to its patrons. In a market often dominated by national and international chains, The Root Barrel stands out by celebrating the distinct flavors and ingredients that define Assam, contributing to the local economy and fostering a deeper connection between consumers and producers. The business actively works to promote sustainable practices within its supply chain, focusing on ethical sourcing and supporting local farmers and artisans.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, The Root Barrel offers a range of carefully crafted services and products designed to appeal to a diverse clientele. The menu features dishes made with locally-sourced ingredients, including seasonal produce, traditional Assamese spices, and unique regional delicacies. From breakfast options showcasing indigenous grains to dinner plates featuring slow-cooked meats and vegetarian delicacies, the offerings are diverse and cater to a range of palates. A key differentiator is the focus on showcasing the unique tea varieties of Assam, with expert tea sommeliers guiding customers through tasting experiences and highlighting the subtle nuances of each blend. Beyond food and beverages, The Root Barrel also features a retail section where customers can purchase locally crafted goods, including handmade textiles, artisanal food products, and traditional Assamese crafts. These items serve as both souvenirs and tangible representations of the region\'s cultural richness. The cafe also offers catering services for events, providing customized menus that reflect the client\'s preferences and the seasonality of local ingredients.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The customer experience at The Root Barrel is paramount. Every aspect of the business, from the thoughtfully designed interior to the attentive service, is crafted to create a welcoming and memorable experience. Staff members are trained not only in providing efficient service but also in sharing information about the local ingredients and the stories behind the dishes. The Root Barrel actively engages with the local community through events such as cooking classes, tea tasting workshops, and collaborations with local artists and musicians. These initiatives not only attract new customers but also foster a sense of community and connection. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to improve the menu, services, and overall experience. The Root Barrel aims to cultivate a loyal customer base who appreciate the business\'s commitment to quality, sustainability, and community engagement. The establishment regularly partners with local NGOs to raise awareness and funds for various social causes, further solidifying its role as a responsible and contributing member of the community.\n</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, The Root Barrel envisions itself as a leading force in shaping Assam\'s culinary landscape. The business plans to expand its operations, potentially opening additional locations in other key cities within the region. It also aims to further develop its online presence, offering online ordering and delivery services, as well as expanding its reach to customers beyond the local area. A key focus for the future is strengthening its relationships with local farmers and artisans, ensuring a reliable supply of high-quality, locally-sourced ingredients. The business is also exploring the possibility of creating its own line of branded products, featuring unique Assamese ingredients and flavors. In the long term, The Root Barrel aspires to become a nationally recognized brand, synonymous with authentic Assamese cuisine and sustainable business practices. They plan to invest in employee training and development, ensuring that their staff members have the skills and knowledge necessary to deliver exceptional service and contribute to the business\'s continued success. The ultimate goal is to create a positive impact on the local economy, promote the region\'s cultural heritage, and provide a platform for local producers to thrive.\n</p>', '7th Floor, Exotica Greens', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:25:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1883, 'The View Restaurant and Lounge', 'Bars', '', 'The View Restaurant and Lounge, strategically situated on the 6th Floor, Block A, of the prestigious 191 Exotica Greens, RG Baruah Rd, is more than just a dining establishment; it’s an experience. As a sophisticated restaurant and lounge, The View offers a unique blend of exquisite culinary offerings, expertly crafted beverages, and a breathtaking panoramic vista of Guwahati, solidifying its position as a prominent and desirable destination within Assam’s burgeoning hospitality sector. The restaurant distinguishes itself by providing an elevated and refined ambiance, catering to discerning clientele seeking memorable dining and social experiences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe View’s significance lies not only in its prime location and stunning views, but also in its commitment to providing a sophisticated alternative to the existing dining landscape. By focusing on high-quality ingredients, impeccable service, and a thoughtfully curated atmosphere, The View aims to set a new standard for hospitality in the region, attracting both local residents and discerning travelers. The restaurant also contributes positively to the local economy by sourcing ingredients locally whenever possible and creating employment opportunities within the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, The View Restaurant and Lounge provides a multifaceted dining and entertainment experience. The restaurant offers a diverse menu featuring a blend of continental cuisine with subtle infusions of regional Assamese flavors. This culinary approach is designed to appeal to a broad palate while also celebrating the rich culinary heritage of the area. From meticulously prepared appetizers to elegantly plated main courses and decadent desserts, each dish is a testament to the culinary team\'s dedication to quality and innovation.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBeyond the restaurant offerings, The View Lounge boasts an extensive selection of premium spirits, handcrafted cocktails, and a carefully curated wine list. Expert mixologists craft signature cocktails that complement the stunning views and sophisticated atmosphere, creating a truly immersive experience. The lounge also offers a selection of light bites and sharing platters, perfect for enjoying with friends or colleagues.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nA significant unique selling point of The View is its unparalleled panoramic view of Guwahati. The floor-to-ceiling windows offer breathtaking vistas, transforming the dining experience into something truly special. This visual appeal is further enhanced by the elegant and contemporary interior design, creating a sophisticated and comfortable atmosphere.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe View addresses a clear market need for a high-end dining and social venue in Guwahati. While the city offers a variety of dining options, The View stands out by providing a complete experience that combines exceptional food and drinks, impeccable service, and an unforgettable ambiance. The restaurant also caters to the increasing demand for sophisticated nightlife options, providing a refined alternative to traditional bars and clubs.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at The View Restaurant and Lounge. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment a guest enters the premises until their departure, every detail is carefully considered to create a seamless and memorable experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe restaurant aims to create a welcoming and inclusive environment, fostering a sense of community among its patrons. This is achieved through regular events, promotions, and collaborations with local artists and organizations. The View also actively engages with the local community through social media, soliciting feedback and building relationships with its customers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFurthermore, The View understands the importance of adapting to the evolving needs of its customers. The restaurant continuously seeks feedback and monitors industry trends to ensure that its offerings remain relevant and appealing. This commitment to continuous improvement is essential for maintaining a competitive edge in the dynamic hospitality market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, The View Restaurant and Lounge envisions itself as a leading hospitality destination in Assam, renowned for its exceptional culinary offerings, impeccable service, and breathtaking views. The business anticipates continued growth by expanding its offerings and enhancing its customer experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nFuture plans include introducing seasonal menus that showcase the freshest local ingredients, further refining the cocktail program, and hosting a wider range of events and promotions. The business also plans to explore opportunities for expanding its brand presence, potentially through partnerships or additional locations. The ultimate goal is to establish The View as a symbol of sophisticated dining and social experiences in the region, contributing to the vibrancy and growth of Assam\'s business landscape. Long-term goals encompass establishing a strong reputation for culinary excellence and impeccable service, building a loyal customer base, and contributing positively to the local community.', '6th Floor, Block A, 191 Exotica Greens, RG Baruah Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:25:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1884, 'SHOTS - Cafe & Bar | Guwahati', 'Bars', '', '<p>SHOTS - Cafe & Bar | Guwahati, situated on the 2nd Floor of Nirvana Tower, RG Baruah Rd, opposite City Center Mall, offers a unique and vibrant social experience in the heart of Guwahati. More than just a cafe and bar, SHOTS strives to be a community hub, a place where locals and visitors alike can connect, unwind, and create lasting memories. Understanding the evolving social scene in Assam, SHOTS distinguishes itself by blending a relaxed daytime café atmosphere with an energetic and sophisticated nightlife destination.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>SHOTS provides a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to diverse preferences and occasions. During the day, it functions as a modern cafe, serving high-quality coffee sourced from local Assam estates, a selection of teas, freshly baked pastries, and a curated menu of light meals and snacks. The focus is on providing a comfortable and productive environment for individuals looking to work remotely, catch up with friends, or simply enjoy a peaceful moment. As evening approaches, SHOTS transforms into a lively bar, featuring an extensive selection of cocktails crafted by skilled bartenders, a wide range of domestic and international beers, and a premium spirits list. To complement the drinks menu, the bar offers a selection of appetizers and small plates, perfect for sharing and enhancing the social experience. The unique selling point of SHOTS lies in its versatility. It seamlessly transitions from a daytime cafe to a vibrant bar, catering to a broad spectrum of customer needs throughout the day and night. This adaptability addresses the growing demand in Guwahati for spaces that can accommodate different social activities and preferences, from casual daytime gatherings to energetic evening celebrations.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At SHOTS, customer experience is paramount. The establishment prioritizes attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu offerings, providing informed recommendations and addressing customer inquiries with professionalism and enthusiasm. Beyond exceptional service, SHOTS cultivates a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere. The interior design is contemporary and stylish, creating a comfortable and visually appealing space. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists, themed nights, and interactive workshops, are organized to foster a sense of community and engagement. Furthermore, SHOTS actively participates in local initiatives and collaborations, supporting local businesses and organizations to strengthen its connection with the surrounding community. By fostering a positive and engaging environment, SHOTS aims to create a loyal customer base and establish itself as a beloved destination in Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, SHOTS envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati hospitality sector. The long-term goals include expanding the menu offerings to incorporate more regional flavors and ingredients, further showcasing the culinary heritage of Assam. Plans are also underway to introduce loyalty programs and exclusive events to reward regular customers and foster brand loyalty. Furthermore, SHOTS is exploring opportunities to expand its presence to other strategic locations within Guwahati and potentially other cities in the Northeast region, bringing its unique cafe and bar concept to a wider audience. The business is committed to continuous improvement, constantly seeking feedback from customers and adapting its services to meet evolving needs and preferences. By maintaining a focus on quality, innovation, and community engagement, SHOTS aims to solidify its position as a leading cafe and bar in Guwahati and a significant contributor to the local business landscape.</p>', '2nd Floor, Nirvana Tower, RG Baruah Rd, opposite City Center Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:25:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1885, 'Roxy Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Roxy Bar, strategically located at Royal Centre, 603, Guwahati - Shillong Rd, GS Rd, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for discerning patrons seeking a sophisticated and vibrant nightlife experience in Guwahati, Assam. Situated on a major artery connecting Guwahati and Shillong, Roxy Bar benefits from high visibility and accessibility, making it a natural choice for after-work gatherings, celebratory occasions, and memorable evenings out. More than just a bar, Roxy Bar aims to contribute to the evolving social scene of Guwahati, offering a carefully curated environment that blends modern aesthetics with authentic Assamese hospitality.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Roxy Bar’s core offering revolves around providing a high-quality beverage selection coupled with a thoughtfully designed food menu. We specialize in expertly crafted cocktails, utilizing premium spirits and fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Our bartenders are trained to create both classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks that cater to diverse palates. Beyond cocktails, our bar boasts an extensive range of domestic and international beers, including craft selections, as well as a comprehensive wine list featuring reds, whites, and sparkling options. To complement the drinks, Roxy Bar offers a menu of appetizers and small plates designed for sharing and enjoyment. The menu includes both international favorites and dishes with subtle nods to Assamese flavors, providing a unique culinary experience. A key differentiator for Roxy Bar is its commitment to providing exceptional value. While maintaining a premium atmosphere and offering high-quality products, we strive to offer competitive pricing, making Roxy Bar accessible to a wider range of customers within the Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>At Roxy Bar, the customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm and attentive service designed to make them feel welcome and valued. Our staff is trained to anticipate customer needs and provide personalized recommendations, ensuring that each visit is tailored to individual preferences. The ambiance of Roxy Bar is carefully cultivated to create a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere. The interior design features comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and carefully selected lighting, creating an inviting space for both intimate conversations and lively gatherings. Music plays a crucial role in shaping the Roxy Bar experience. We feature a diverse playlist, carefully curated to create a vibrant and engaging atmosphere without being intrusive. Periodically, Roxy Bar hosts live music performances featuring local musicians, further enhancing the entertainment options and connecting with the local artistic community. Beyond the immediate customer experience, Roxy Bar actively seeks to connect with the broader Guwahati community. We participate in local events and support local initiatives, demonstrating our commitment to being a responsible and engaged member of the business landscape. We also leverage social media platforms to connect with customers, share updates, and promote special events, fostering a strong sense of community around the Roxy Bar brand.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, Roxy Bar envisions itself as a leading nightlife destination in Guwahati and beyond. We plan to continuously refine our offerings, introducing new cocktails, menu items, and entertainment options to keep the experience fresh and exciting for our customers. One potential avenue for growth is expanding our private event capabilities, offering customized packages for corporate gatherings, birthday celebrations, and other special occasions. We also plan to explore opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to create unique and mutually beneficial promotions. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they continue to deliver exceptional service. In the long term, Roxy Bar may explore the possibility of expanding to other locations within Assam or the Northeast region, replicating our successful model while adapting to the specific needs and preferences of each local market. Ultimately, our goal is to create a sustainable and thriving business that contributes to the cultural and economic vitality of Guwahati and the surrounding region.</p>', 'Royal Centre, 603, Guwahati - Shillong Rd, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:30:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1886, 'The Socialite', 'Bars', '', '<p><strong>The Socialite: Connecting Guwahati Through Curated Experiences</strong></p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 3rd, Tirupati Tower, Purvadoy, GS Rd, The Socialite is a dynamic event management and experiential marketing agency redefining social engagement within the Assam business landscape. More than just an event planner, The Socialite acts as a catalyst, forging meaningful connections between businesses, communities, and individuals through uniquely crafted experiences. We understand the nuances of the local culture and leverage that knowledge to create events that resonate deeply with the audience, fostering lasting impressions and driving tangible results. Our presence fills a crucial gap in the market, offering sophisticated and strategically aligned event solutions that elevate brands and enrich the social fabric of the region. We believe in the power of shared experiences to build relationships and drive business forward.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings are centered around delivering unforgettable event experiences, encompassing three key areas: corporate events, social gatherings, and experiential marketing campaigns. For corporate clients, we specialize in orchestrating seamless conferences, product launches, team-building activities, and gala dinners that reflect brand values and achieve specific business objectives. From securing prime venues and managing logistics to curating engaging content and coordinating speaker lineups, we handle every detail with meticulous precision. Our social event planning services cater to a wide range of occasions, including weddings, anniversaries, birthday celebrations, and themed parties, ensuring that each event is a reflection of the client\'s personality and vision. The Socialite doesn\'t just plan parties; we craft memories. Experiential marketing forms the third pillar of our services, where we design and execute immersive campaigns that captivate audiences and leave a lasting impact. This includes brand activations, pop-up events, and interactive installations designed to connect consumers with brands on a deeper, more emotional level. What sets The Socialite apart is our unwavering commitment to innovation, our deep understanding of the Assamese market, and our ability to tailor solutions to meet the unique needs of each client. We pride ourselves on sourcing local vendors and supporting local businesses, contributing to the economic growth of the region while delivering authentic and culturally relevant experiences. Our intimate knowledge of local preferences, coupled with our global perspective on event trends, allows us to deliver truly unique and effective solutions.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At The Socialite, exceptional customer service is paramount. We believe that building strong relationships with our clients is the key to success. From the initial consultation to the post-event follow-up, we are dedicated to providing a personalized and attentive service experience. Our team of experienced event professionals works closely with each client to understand their vision, budget, and objectives, ensuring that every detail is executed flawlessly. We proactively seek feedback and continuously strive to improve our services. What truly sets us apart is our deep connection to the local community. We actively participate in local events and initiatives, supporting charitable organizations and contributing to the cultural vibrancy of Guwahati. We believe in giving back to the community that has supported us, and we are committed to using our platform to make a positive impact. This commitment to community engagement not only strengthens our brand reputation but also fosters a sense of trust and loyalty among our clients and partners. We strive to build long-term relationships based on mutual respect and shared values, becoming an integral part of the social and business fabric of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Socialite envisions becoming the leading event management and experiential marketing agency in Northeast India. We plan to expand our service offerings to include destination event planning, catering to clients from across the region who wish to host events in Assam. We are also exploring opportunities to develop our own line of branded event products and merchandise, further enhancing the overall event experience. A key focus for the future is leveraging technology to enhance our services and streamline our operations. This includes implementing event management software, utilizing data analytics to track event performance, and incorporating virtual and augmented reality elements into our experiential marketing campaigns. We are committed to staying ahead of the curve and embracing new technologies that can enhance the value we provide to our clients. Furthermore, we aim to foster a culture of innovation and creativity within our team, encouraging continuous learning and development. We believe that our employees are our greatest asset, and we are committed to providing them with the training and resources they need to succeed. Our long-term goal is to establish The Socialite as a trusted and respected brand, synonymous with exceptional events, outstanding customer service, and a commitment to community engagement. We are confident that with our dedication, expertise, and passion for creating unforgettable experiences, we can achieve our vision and make a lasting impact on the social and business landscape of Assam.</p>', '3rd, Tirupati Tower, Purvadoy, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:30:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1887, 'Urban Mantra six mile', 'Bars', '', '<p>Urban Mantra Six Mile, nestled on Namghar Path, is a contemporary lifestyle boutique offering a curated selection of fashion, home décor, and artisanal crafts. More than just a retail space, Urban Mantra aims to be a haven for discerning customers seeking unique, high-quality products that reflect both modern sensibilities and Assam\'s rich cultural heritage. The boutique strives to bridge the gap between global trends and local artistry, making it a distinctive presence in Guwahati’s evolving retail landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Urban Mantra offers a diverse range of products and services designed to cater to a broad spectrum of tastes. The fashion section features apparel from emerging and established designers, focusing on comfortable yet stylish clothing made from natural fabrics like cotton, silk, and linen. The selection emphasizes contemporary silhouettes and timeless designs, appealing to individuals seeking sophisticated everyday wear and occasion-specific attire. Complementing the clothing line is a selection of handcrafted jewelry, bags, and accessories, sourced from local artisans and cooperatives, supporting indigenous craftsmanship and sustainable practices.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The home décor section showcases a carefully chosen collection of furniture, textiles, lighting, and decorative objects. These items are designed to add character and warmth to any living space, ranging from minimalist pieces with clean lines to more ornate designs inspired by traditional Assamese motifs. The store also features a selection of handcrafted pottery, paintings, and sculptures from local artists, promoting regional talent and providing customers with the opportunity to own unique pieces of art. A notable offering is its curated selection of Assamese tea, sourced directly from local tea gardens, providing an authentic taste of the region’s renowned beverage. These teas, along with locally produced honey and spices, are thoughtfully packaged and presented, making them ideal gifts or personal indulgences. The unique selling point lies in the fusion of contemporary design with traditional craftsmanship, creating a product offering that is both modern and deeply rooted in the local culture. This blend resonates with the growing demand for ethically sourced, handcrafted products that tell a story.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Urban Mantra Six Mile. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide personalized assistance and styling advice, ensuring that each customer feels valued and understood. The boutique fosters a warm and welcoming atmosphere, encouraging customers to browse at their leisure and discover new and exciting products. Regular events, such as designer meet-and-greets, art exhibitions, and tea tasting sessions, are organized to engage the local community and create a sense of belonging. These events provide a platform for local artists and artisans to showcase their work and connect with potential customers. The business actively participates in local festivals and community initiatives, strengthening its ties with the neighborhood and demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility. Customer feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the product offering and service quality. Building long-term relationships with customers is a key priority, fostering brand loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Urban Mantra Six Mile envisions expanding its product line to include a wider range of sustainable and ethically sourced goods. This includes exploring partnerships with more artisans and cooperatives from across Northeast India, showcasing the diverse talent and cultural heritage of the region. Plans are underway to develop an online platform to reach a wider audience and facilitate convenient online shopping. The business also aims to establish itself as a destination for cultural tourism, offering workshops and demonstrations that provide visitors with a deeper understanding of Assamese art, craft, and culture. Long-term goals include opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and beyond, extending the Urban Mantra brand to new markets. The ultimate vision is to become a leading lifestyle brand in Northeast India, recognized for its commitment to quality, craftsmanship, and community engagement, while remaining true to its roots on Namghar Path, Six Mile. The focus will always be on curating a collection that celebrates the best of both worlds: contemporary design and traditional Assamese artistry, enriching the lives of its customers and contributing to the vibrant cultural tapestry of the region.</p>', 'Namghar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:30:23', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(1888, 'Zen9 Café & Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Zen9 Café & Bar, situated on the 3rd Floor of the First Building within Central Mall on GS Road, offers a sophisticated yet relaxed dining and social experience, establishing itself as a unique destination within Guwahati\'s vibrant culinary scene. More than just a café or a bar, Zen9 seamlessly blends the ambiance of a contemporary restaurant with the conviviality of a stylish lounge, catering to a diverse clientele seeking quality food, refreshing beverages, and a comfortable atmosphere. Its location within Central Mall provides accessibility and visibility, making it a convenient and appealing choice for shoppers, professionals, and residents alike. The café’s commitment to providing a consistently high-quality experience differentiates it within the Assam business landscape, where the demand for refined dining and social venues is continuously growing.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Zen9 Café & Bar provides a comprehensive array of services designed to cater to various customer preferences and needs. At its core, the business offers a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese delicacies and globally inspired dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From delectable appetizers and hearty main courses to decadent desserts, the culinary offerings are crafted to tantalize the taste buds and provide a satisfying dining experience. The beverage menu is equally extensive, showcasing a wide selection of expertly crafted cocktails, premium spirits, fine wines, and a range of non-alcoholic options, including freshly brewed coffee, artisanal teas, and refreshing juices. A key differentiating factor is the café\'s ability to seamlessly transition from a daytime café environment to a vibrant bar setting in the evening. This versatility allows Zen9 to cater to different customer segments throughout the day, from those seeking a quiet lunch or afternoon coffee to those looking for a lively evening of drinks and socializing. Furthermore, Zen9 offers catering services for small events and gatherings, bringing its signature culinary expertise and impeccable service to private functions.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Zen9 Café & Bar, and every aspect of the business is designed to create a welcoming and memorable environment. The café prides itself on providing exceptional service delivered by a team of friendly, knowledgeable, and attentive staff members who are dedicated to exceeding customer expectations. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism, ensuring a positive and comfortable experience. The ambiance of Zen9 is carefully curated to create a relaxed and inviting atmosphere, featuring comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and soft, ambient lighting. This creates an environment conducive to both intimate conversations and larger social gatherings. Zen9 actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting live music performances featuring local artists, showcasing artwork from regional talent, and participating in community events. By supporting local talent and fostering a sense of community, Zen9 aims to become more than just a business; it strives to be a valued member of the Guwahati community, contributing to its cultural vibrancy and social fabric.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Zen9 Café & Bar envisions significant growth potential within the rapidly expanding Guwahati market. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more innovative and locally inspired dishes, further solidifying its position as a culinary destination. The business also aims to enhance its beverage offerings by introducing new and exciting cocktails, craft beers, and specialty wines, appealing to a broader range of tastes. Exploring opportunities to host themed events, such as wine tasting evenings, live music nights, and culinary workshops, is also on the horizon. These events will further enhance the café\'s appeal and attract new customers. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other strategic locations within Guwahati and beyond, replicating the successful Zen9 model while adapting to the unique characteristics of each new market. The focus will remain on providing exceptional customer service, creating a welcoming and vibrant atmosphere, and contributing to the growth and development of the local community. Zen9 Café & Bar is committed to establishing itself as a leading destination for quality food, refreshing beverages, and memorable experiences in Assam.</p>', '3rd Floor First Building, Central Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:30:29', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1889, 'The Alley Bar & Kitchen', 'Bars', '', '<p>The Alley Bar & Kitchen, nestled within the Hotel Agneedeep on By Lane Number 2 in Assam, offers a distinctive dining and social experience that bridges the gap between a sophisticated bar and a welcoming kitchen. More than just a place to grab a drink or a meal, The Alley is envisioned as a community hub, a place where locals and travelers alike can connect, unwind, and enjoy thoughtfully prepared food and beverages in a relaxed, yet stylish setting. Its location, slightly tucked away from the main thoroughfare, lends it an exclusive, intimate atmosphere, setting it apart from the more conventional establishments in the area.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, The Alley Bar & Kitchen offers a curated selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages, alongside a menu focused on fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. The bar program features classic cocktails prepared with precision, alongside signature creations that incorporate regional flavors and ingredients, celebrating the unique culinary landscape of Assam. Beyond the standard spirits, a focus is placed on craft beers, both domestic and international, providing options for the discerning beer enthusiast. The kitchen complements the bar with a menu designed for sharing and socializing. Appetizers are a particular strength, with options ranging from traditional Assamese snacks presented in a modern style to globally inspired small plates perfect for pairing with drinks. Larger plates are also available, showcasing seasonal produce and providing satisfying meal options. A key differentiator is the commitment to providing vegetarian and vegan options that are as thoughtfully crafted and flavorful as their meat-based counterparts, catering to a wider range of dietary preferences within the community. This focus on inclusivity and catering to diverse tastes is a core element of The Alley\'s business philosophy.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Alley Bar & Kitchen understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to success. Staff are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and beverage offerings, providing personalized recommendations and creating a welcoming atmosphere for every guest. The goal is to foster a sense of belonging, where patrons feel comfortable lingering and connecting with each other. The establishment emphasizes creating a memorable dining experience through attention to detail, from the quality of the ingredients to the ambiance of the space. Regular events, such as live music performances featuring local artists and themed cocktail nights, are organized to engage the community and provide unique entertainment options. The business actively participates in local initiatives and supports regional suppliers, demonstrating a commitment to the surrounding area and building strong relationships with neighboring businesses. Social media is utilized to connect with customers, promote events, and share stories about the restaurant\'s food, beverages, and staff, fostering a sense of transparency and authenticity.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Alley Bar & Kitchen envisions continued growth and expansion within the local market. Future plans include refining the menu based on customer feedback and seasonal availability, constantly striving to offer the most innovative and appealing dishes. Exploring opportunities to collaborate with local farmers and artisans will further strengthen the commitment to sourcing local ingredients and supporting the regional economy. The possibility of expanding the physical space to accommodate larger groups and events is also being considered. Furthermore, The Alley aims to establish itself as a leader in responsible bar and restaurant practices, focusing on sustainable sourcing, waste reduction, and ethical labor practices. The long-term goal is to build a sustainable and thriving business that contributes positively to the local community and provides a consistently exceptional experience for all who walk through its doors. By focusing on quality, innovation, and community engagement, The Alley Bar & Kitchen aims to solidify its position as a premier destination for dining and socializing in Assam.</p>', 'ABC, Hotel Agneedeep, By Lane Number 2', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:30:35', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1890, 'Beer Nation Cafe', 'Bars', '', '<p>Beer Nation Cafe, situated on the 1st Floor of the Silver Square Building, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for craft beer enthusiasts and those seeking a vibrant, community-focused social experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a cafe, Beer Nation Cafe aims to cultivate a culture of appreciation for diverse brewing styles, locally sourced ingredients, and engaging social interaction. We strive to be a cornerstone of the local business landscape, contributing to the growth and diversification of the regional hospitality sector by offering a unique and carefully curated experience unmatched in the area.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings revolve around an extensive and carefully selected menu of craft beers, both domestic and international. We prioritize partnerships with local breweries in Assam and the Northeast, showcasing their unique flavors and supporting the regional brewing industry. Beyond the familiar lagers and ales, customers can explore a rotating selection of stouts, IPAs, sours, and specialty brews, catering to a wide range of palates. We also offer insightful tasting notes and pairing suggestions to enhance the overall beer drinking experience. Complementing our beer selection is a thoughtfully designed food menu featuring globally-inspired dishes with a local twist. We emphasize fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, crafting dishes that perfectly complement the beer offerings and cater to diverse dietary preferences, including vegetarian and vegan options. In addition to food and beer, Beer Nation Cafe hosts regular events such as live music performances by local artists, trivia nights, and beer tasting workshops, fostering a lively and engaging atmosphere. Our unique selling point is the combination of a high-quality beer selection, locally-sourced ingredients, and community-focused events, creating a holistic experience that caters to the growing demand for sophisticated and engaging social venues in Assam.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Beer Nation Cafe, we are committed to providing exceptional customer service that fosters loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals. Our staff is highly trained not only in beer knowledge but also in providing attentive and personalized service. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and valued. We strive to anticipate customer needs, provide helpful recommendations, and address any concerns promptly and effectively. We are actively involved in the local community, supporting local charities and organizations through fundraising events and partnerships. We also prioritize building relationships with local businesses, sourcing ingredients locally and collaborating on promotional opportunities. Our connection to the local community is further strengthened through our active presence on social media platforms, where we share updates on new beer arrivals, upcoming events, and engage in meaningful conversations with our customers. We regularly solicit feedback from our customers through online surveys and in-person interactions to continuously improve our services and offerings, ensuring we are meeting and exceeding their expectations.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Beer Nation Cafe envisions significant growth and expansion opportunities within the Assam market and potentially beyond. Our long-term goals include establishing additional locations in key cities across the Northeast, further solidifying our position as a leading provider of craft beer and community-focused social experiences. We plan to expand our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes that showcase local ingredients and culinary traditions. We also aim to enhance our event programming, incorporating more diverse and engaging activities that cater to a broader range of interests. A key component of our future vision is a continued commitment to sustainability, implementing environmentally friendly practices throughout our operations. This includes reducing our carbon footprint, minimizing waste, and sourcing ingredients from sustainable and ethical sources. We also plan to invest in employee training and development, empowering our staff to provide exceptional service and contribute to the overall success of the business. By focusing on continuous improvement, community engagement, and sustainable practices, Beer Nation Cafe aims to not only grow as a business but also contribute positively to the social and economic development of the region.</p>', '1st Floor, Silver Square Building', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:35:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1891, 'Wine O’Clock Restro Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Wine O’Clock Restro Bar, strategically located on Beltola - Basistha Rd, near Basistha in Guwahati, Assam, offers a sophisticated yet relaxed dining and social experience. In a region where culinary experiences are deeply intertwined with social gatherings, Wine O’Clock distinguishes itself by providing a curated blend of global flavors, local tastes, and a comprehensive beverage selection, fostering a unique and appealing atmosphere for diverse patrons.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Wine O’Clock offers a multi-faceted dining and social experience centered around its restaurant and bar services. The restaurant features a diverse menu encompassing continental cuisine, authentic Assamese delicacies, and innovative fusion dishes, all prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The emphasis is on quality and culinary creativity, offering diners a range of choices from familiar favorites to exciting new flavors. Complementing the food menu is a comprehensive bar offering. This includes a thoughtfully curated wine list featuring both international and Indian selections, alongside a wide range of spirits, beers (domestic and imported), and expertly crafted cocktails. Wine O\'Clock stands out by providing an experience beyond simple food and drinks; it\'s about creating an atmosphere where patrons can enjoy convivial evenings, celebrate special occasions, or simply unwind after a long day. The restro bar also occasionally hosts themed nights featuring live music, DJ sets, and special food and drink promotions, further enhancing its appeal. These curated events are designed to cater to diverse tastes and provide unique entertainment options within the local community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience at Wine O’Clock is paramount. The establishment is committed to providing attentive and personalized service, ensuring every guest feels welcomed and valued. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and beverage options, offering informed recommendations and catering to individual preferences. The ambiance is carefully designed to be both inviting and sophisticated. A warm and contemporary décor, comfortable seating arrangements, and carefully chosen music all contribute to a relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere. Beyond excellent service and a pleasant ambiance, Wine O\'Clock aims to foster a sense of community. The location near Basistha allows it to cater to local residents and those visiting the area. The restro bar actively engages with the community through participation in local events and collaborations with local suppliers. This community-focused approach helps build strong relationships and reinforces Wine O\'Clock\'s position as a valued establishment within the Beltola-Basistha area.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Wine O’Clock Restro Bar envisions a future of continued growth and innovation. Plans include expanding the menu to further showcase regional Assamese cuisine and incorporating sustainable practices in sourcing and operations. There are also considerations to broaden the event calendar to include more diverse entertainment options, such as art exhibitions, culinary workshops, and collaborative events with local artisans. Wine O\'Clock aims to become a recognized culinary and social destination in Guwahati, known for its quality food and drinks, excellent service, and commitment to the local community. Long-term goals include establishing Wine O’Clock as a benchmark for restro-bar experiences in Assam and potentially expanding to other strategic locations within the region, always retaining the core values of quality, community engagement, and exceptional customer service that define the brand.</p>', 'Beltola - Basistha Rd, near Basistha', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:35:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1892, 'THE ECHO Pub & Grill', 'Bars', '', '```html\n<h1>THE ECHO Pub & Grill: A Vibrant Hub in Guwahati\'s Culinary Landscape</h1>\n\nTHE ECHO Pub & Grill, strategically located on the 1st & 2nd Floor of Dr. Bhabendra Nath Saikia Road, Basistha Rd, opposite Union Bank of India, is rapidly becoming a prominent fixture in Guwahati\'s thriving social and culinary scene. Beyond simply offering food and beverages, THE ECHO aims to create a welcoming and engaging environment where patrons can connect, relax, and enjoy a consistently high-quality experience. Situated in a key area with easy access and visibility, THE ECHO fills a need for a refined yet approachable pub and grill that caters to a diverse clientele seeking both familiar comforts and exciting new flavors. The business distinguishes itself through a commitment to exceptional service, a thoughtfully curated menu, and a vibrant ambiance that resonates with the spirit of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nTHE ECHO Pub & Grill\'s core offerings revolve around providing a comprehensive dining and social experience. At its heart is a meticulously crafted menu featuring a blend of classic pub fare and grilled specialties, infused with local Assamese influences wherever possible. Think perfectly grilled meats and seafood, alongside innovative appetizers and globally inspired dishes, all prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients. Vegetarian options are given equal consideration, ensuring that all dietary preferences are catered to. The bar boasts an extensive selection of beers, wines, and spirits, including locally brewed craft beers, alongside a creative cocktail menu designed to complement the food offerings. What truly sets THE ECHO apart is its commitment to providing consistently excellent food and drink in a comfortable and stylish setting. The two-story layout allows for varied experiences – the first floor offering a more casual pub atmosphere, while the second floor provides a slightly more refined dining setting, suitable for both intimate dinners and larger group gatherings. This flexibility allows THE ECHO to meet the diverse needs of the local market, from after-work drinks to weekend celebrations.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at THE ECHO Pub & Grill. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service. A warm and welcoming atmosphere is cultivated from the moment guests enter, ensuring that every visit is a memorable one. The emphasis is on building rapport with customers, understanding their preferences, and anticipating their needs. Beyond simply taking orders and serving food, the staff acts as ambassadors for the brand, engaging in genuine interactions and creating a sense of community. THE ECHO actively seeks feedback from its patrons, using both formal and informal channels to continuously improve its offerings and service standards. Furthermore, THE ECHO is committed to connecting with the local community through active participation in local events and partnerships with local suppliers whenever feasible. This dedication to supporting local businesses and engaging with the community reinforces THE ECHO\'s position as more than just a pub and grill; it\'s a valuable contributor to the social fabric of Guwahati. Special events, live music nights (featuring local artists), and themed promotions are regularly organized to create a vibrant and engaging atmosphere, fostering a sense of belonging and encouraging repeat visits.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, THE ECHO Pub & Grill envisions significant growth potential within the Guwahati market and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate even more innovative dishes and locally sourced ingredients, enhancing the beverage offerings with new and exciting cocktails and craft beers, and potentially opening additional locations in strategic areas of the city or other parts of Assam. The long-term goal is to establish THE ECHO as a leading hospitality brand recognized for its commitment to quality, service, and community engagement. Exploring opportunities for outdoor seating, offering online ordering and delivery services, and implementing loyalty programs are also under consideration to further enhance the customer experience and expand market reach. THE ECHO is committed to staying ahead of industry trends, continuously innovating, and adapting to meet the evolving needs of its customers, ensuring its continued success and solidifying its position as a cornerstone of Guwahati\'s social and culinary landscape.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nTHE ECHO aspires to be more than just a pub and grill; it strives to be a destination – a place where people come to celebrate, connect, and create lasting memories. By prioritizing quality, service, and community, THE ECHO is poised to become a beloved and enduring institution in Guwahati.\n```', '1st & 2nd Floor Dr. Bhabendra Nath Saikia Road, Basistha Rd, opposite Union Bank of India', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:35:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1893, 'FTV Lounge', 'Bars', '', '<p>FTV Lounge stands as a beacon of sophisticated entertainment and upscale hospitality within Guwahati’s vibrant social scene. Strategically located at ABC, 5th & 6th Floor, Lobby Level 2, Exotica Arcade, GS Rd, next to IDBI Bank, this premier establishment offers a distinctive experience, elevating the city’s nightlife and providing a sought-after venue for discerning clientele. Situated in a prime location on GS Road, the Lounge is easily accessible and benefits from high foot traffic, establishing itself as a prominent landmark within the Exotica Arcade. FTV Lounge aims to bring a cosmopolitan flair to Assam, offering a fusion of world-class ambiance with a genuine appreciation for local culture and preferences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core offering of FTV Lounge revolves around providing a multifaceted entertainment experience. This includes a meticulously curated selection of premium spirits, wines, and expertly crafted cocktails. A signature menu features a diverse range of culinary delights, from globally inspired appetizers and finger foods to more substantial dishes designed to complement the beverage offerings. The Lounge distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality and innovation. Live music performances featuring local and national artists, alongside sophisticated DJ sets, contribute to the electric atmosphere. Occasional themed nights, fashion events, and corporate gatherings are also hosted, further diversifying the Lounge\'s appeal and solidifying its position as a dynamic entertainment hub. FTV Lounge understands the specific needs of the local market by incorporating regional flavors and ingredients into its menu, supporting local artists through performance opportunities, and catering to a diverse demographic, ensuring that there is something for everyone to enjoy.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At FTV Lounge, the customer experience is paramount. A dedicated and highly trained staff ensures that every guest receives personalized attention and impeccable service. The ambiance is carefully designed to create an atmosphere of refined elegance, with stylish décor, comfortable seating arrangements, and state-of-the-art sound and lighting systems. The Lounge strives to foster a sense of community by hosting events that celebrate local culture and partnering with local businesses. Feedback is actively solicited and carefully considered, allowing FTV Lounge to continuously improve and tailor its offerings to meet the evolving needs of its clientele. Beyond providing a space for entertainment, FTV Lounge aims to be a place where people can connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories. The Lounge also maintains a strong presence on social media, engaging with its audience and promoting upcoming events, creating a virtual community around the brand.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, FTV Lounge envisions significant growth and expansion. Future plans include exploring opportunities to expand the menu with even more innovative culinary creations and introducing new entertainment concepts to keep the experience fresh and exciting. Collaborations with renowned mixologists and chefs are also being considered to further elevate the Lounge\'s offerings. The long-term goal is to establish FTV Lounge as the leading entertainment destination in Guwahati and a recognized brand across the Northeast region. This will involve strategic investments in marketing and branding, as well as a continuous focus on innovation and customer satisfaction. Potential expansion plans may also include opening new locations in other key cities in Assam and beyond, replicating the successful formula of FTV Lounge while adapting to the unique characteristics of each market. The Lounge is committed to remaining a vibrant and integral part of the local community, contributing to the economic growth and cultural richness of the region. Ultimately, FTV Lounge strives to be more than just a lounge; it aims to be a destination that embodies sophistication, entertainment, and a true appreciation for the spirit of Assam.</p>', 'ABC, 5th & 6th Floor, Lobby Level 2, Exotica Arcade, GS Rd, next to IDBI Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:35:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1894, 'Slice Of Lime Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', '', '<p>Slice Of Lime Bar & Restaurant, strategically located at 4RJ5+HC7, GS Rd in the heart of Assam, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier dining and social destination. Unlike conventional establishments, Slice Of Lime offers a carefully curated experience that blends contemporary culinary trends with the rich cultural tapestry of the region. It’s more than just a place to eat and drink; it\'s a venue designed to foster connections, celebrate local flavors, and provide a vibrant atmosphere for both residents and visitors. The restaurant aims to fill a specific niche by offering high-quality food and beverages in a sophisticated yet approachable setting, something that is noticeably lacking in the immediate vicinity. Slice Of Lime seeks to be a landmark, not just a place to eat, but a destination that enhances the local social scene and contributes positively to the surrounding business community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Slice Of Lime provides a comprehensive dining and bar experience. The restaurant\'s menu boasts a diverse selection of dishes, ranging from expertly prepared regional Assamese cuisine using locally sourced ingredients to international favorites, catering to a wide range of palates. The culinary team is dedicated to crafting flavorful and visually appealing dishes, emphasizing fresh, seasonal produce and authentic cooking techniques. Beyond the food, Slice Of Lime features a well-stocked bar offering a wide variety of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. This includes classic cocktails, craft beers (featuring local Assam breweries when available), and a carefully selected wine list designed to complement the menu. A key differentiator is the emphasis on creating unique and signature cocktails that reflect the restaurant\'s identity and offer a memorable drinking experience. The restaurant also offers private dining and catering services for special events and gatherings, extending its reach beyond the regular dining hours. Live music performances, themed nights, and special menu promotions are also regularly featured, making Slice Of Lime a dynamic and engaging venue.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Slice Of Lime. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The staff is meticulously trained to provide knowledgeable and personalized service, ensuring that every customer feels valued and comfortable. The ambiance is carefully designed to create a welcoming and enjoyable atmosphere. The interior décor blends modern aesthetics with subtle nods to Assamese culture, creating a space that is both stylish and inviting. Music is carefully selected to enhance the dining experience without being intrusive. Slice Of Lime understands the importance of building strong relationships with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events and supports local farmers and producers, reinforcing its commitment to sustainability and regional development. Furthermore, the restaurant actively seeks feedback from customers to continuously improve its offerings and adapt to changing preferences. Regular customer surveys, social media engagement, and direct communication with staff are all utilized to ensure that the restaurant remains responsive and attuned to the needs of the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Slice Of Lime envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. The long-term goal is to establish the restaurant as a leading dining and entertainment destination in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties and collaborating with local chefs and artisans to showcase the diverse culinary heritage of Assam. Exploring opportunities for franchising or opening additional locations in other parts of the state is also a consideration. Furthermore, Slice Of Lime is committed to leveraging technology to enhance the customer experience, exploring online ordering systems, loyalty programs, and other digital solutions to improve convenience and engagement. Sustainable practices will continue to be a priority, with ongoing efforts to minimize environmental impact and support local communities. The restaurant also intends to invest in ongoing training and development for its staff, ensuring that they remain equipped to provide exceptional service and contribute to the restaurant\'s continued success. Ultimately, Slice Of Lime aspires to become an iconic establishment that not only serves exceptional food and drinks but also plays a vital role in shaping the cultural landscape of Assam.</p>', '4RJ5+HC7, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:35:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1895, 'Playboy Beer Garden, Guwahati', 'Bars', '', '<p>Playboy Beer Garden, Guwahati, situated on the 6th Floor of Exotica Garden, GS Road, ABC, next to IDBI Bank, is a premium destination that elevates the city\'s social and entertainment landscape. More than just a bar, it\'s a carefully curated experience designed to offer patrons a sophisticated yet relaxed atmosphere, making it a significant player in Guwahati\'s burgeoning hospitality sector. Playboy Beer Garden is uniquely positioned to cater to the discerning tastes of Guwahati\'s residents and visitors, providing a high-quality offering distinct from the more traditional establishments in the area.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Playboy Beer Garden provides an extensive selection of premium beers, both domestic and international, carefully curated to cater to a wide range of palates. Complementing the impressive beer selection is a meticulously crafted menu featuring delectable food items ranging from innovative appetizers and bar snacks to substantial entrees designed to perfectly complement the beverage offerings. We also provide a range of spirits, wines, and non-alcoholic beverages. What truly distinguishes Playboy Beer Garden is its commitment to providing a holistic entertainment experience. This encompasses not only the quality of the drinks and food but also the ambiance, which features stylish décor, comfortable seating arrangements, and thoughtfully curated music playlists. Regular events, such as live music performances, themed nights, and special promotions, are organized to provide an engaging and dynamic experience for patrons. By blending premium beverages, high-quality food, and vibrant entertainment, Playboy Beer Garden meets the growing demand in Guwahati for sophisticated and contemporary social venues.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Playboy Beer Garden, and every detail is carefully considered to ensure guest satisfaction. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, knowledgeable, and courteous service, creating a welcoming and comfortable environment for every visitor. A proactive approach is taken to anticipate customer needs and exceed expectations, fostering loyalty and positive word-of-mouth referrals. Understanding the importance of community engagement, Playboy Beer Garden actively participates in local events and initiatives, building relationships with nearby businesses and residents. The business aims to become a recognizable and respected member of the Guwahati community by supporting local artists and showcasing regional talent, thereby fostering a sense of connection and shared identity with its patrons. Furthermore, Playboy Beer Garden actively solicits feedback from customers through various channels, enabling continuous improvement and ensuring that the business remains responsive to the evolving preferences of its clientele. This dedication to personalized service and community integration sets Playboy Beer Garden apart as a truly unique and customer-centric establishment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking toward the future, Playboy Beer Garden, Guwahati, envisions itself as the leading premium beer garden and entertainment destination in the region. Growth plans include expanding the menu to introduce new and exciting culinary offerings, enhancing the beverage selection with innovative craft beers and cocktails, and further refining the entertainment schedule to attract a wider audience. Exploring opportunities for strategic partnerships with local breweries and distilleries to feature regional products and support local businesses is also under consideration. The business is committed to investing in employee training and development to maintain the highest standards of service and professionalism. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within Assam, bringing the distinctive Playboy Beer Garden experience to a broader audience. By continuously innovating and adapting to the evolving market demands, Playboy Beer Garden is confident in its ability to achieve sustainable growth and solidify its position as a premier destination in Guwahati\'s vibrant social scene.</p>', '6th Floor, Exotica Garden GS Road, ABC, next to IDBI Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:40:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1896, 'Broncco', 'Bars', '', '<p>Broncco, located on the 2nd floor of Prithvi Centre on GS Road, is a dynamic business poised to make a significant impact on the Assam business landscape. More than just a service provider, Broncco aims to be a collaborative partner, understanding and addressing the nuanced needs of its clients within the unique context of the region\'s economic environment. We strive to foster sustainable growth for businesses and individuals alike, contributing to a vibrant and prosperous Assam. Our location in the heart of Guwahati\'s commercial hub allows us to be easily accessible and responsive to the evolving demands of the market. Broncco represents a commitment to innovation, quality, and ethical business practices, aiming to set a new standard for excellence in its chosen fields.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nBroncco\'s core offerings are centered around providing comprehensive business solutions tailored to the specific challenges and opportunities present in the local market. Currently, our primary services include digital marketing solutions, business consulting services, and specialized training programs. Our digital marketing offerings are designed to help businesses enhance their online presence, reach wider audiences, and drive measurable results. Unlike generic digital marketing agencies, we focus on understanding the cultural nuances and preferences of the Assamese consumer, ensuring campaigns resonate authentically and effectively. We leverage a range of strategies including SEO, social media marketing, content creation, and targeted advertising, all optimized for the local market.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur business consulting services offer strategic guidance to businesses seeking to improve operational efficiency, expand their market reach, or navigate complex regulatory environments. We understand the particular challenges faced by businesses operating in Assam, from logistical hurdles to access to capital. Our consultants bring a wealth of experience and local knowledge to provide practical, actionable solutions. We offer specialized training programs aimed at upskilling the local workforce and addressing specific skill gaps in the market. These programs cover a range of topics, from technical skills to leadership development, empowering individuals to enhance their career prospects and contribute to the growth of local businesses. These training programs, unique for their context-based learning, are designed to make employees ready for the current industry standards of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Broncco, we believe that exceptional customer experience is paramount to building lasting relationships and fostering loyalty. We are committed to providing personalized attention to each client, taking the time to understand their unique needs and challenges. Our approach is built on open communication, transparency, and a proactive problem-solving mindset. We go beyond simply delivering services; we strive to become trusted advisors and partners, working collaboratively with our clients to achieve their goals. We are active participants in the local community, supporting initiatives that promote economic development and social well-being. We believe in giving back to the community that supports us, and we are committed to building a strong and vibrant local economy. Broncco regularly conducts workshops and seminars free of charge for local businesses to support them in skill enhancement.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, Broncco envisions becoming a leading provider of innovative business solutions in Assam and beyond. We are committed to expanding our service offerings to meet the evolving needs of the market, exploring opportunities in areas such as technology integration, sustainable business practices, and export promotion. We plan to leverage technology to enhance our service delivery and improve the customer experience. This includes investing in data analytics, artificial intelligence, and automation to provide more personalized and efficient solutions. We are also committed to fostering a culture of innovation within our organization, encouraging our employees to develop new ideas and explore emerging trends. Broncco\'s long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainable economic development of Assam, empowering businesses and individuals to thrive in a dynamic and competitive global economy. By focusing on innovation, quality, and community engagement, Broncco is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and become a significant force in the region\'s business landscape. Broncco is aiming for significant growth and plans to become a nationally renowned company.</p>', '2nd floor, Prithvi Centre, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:40:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1897, 'Exotica Bar and Restro', 'Bars', '', 'Exotica Bar & Restro: A Culinary Oasis on Beltola-Basistha Road\n\nExotica Bar & Restro stands as a vibrant and welcoming establishment on Beltola-Basistha Road, directly opposite City Gas Service, offering a unique blend of delectable cuisine, refreshing beverages, and a relaxed atmosphere. More than just a dining destination, Exotica is designed to be a social hub, a place where friends and families can gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories. Its strategic location, combined with its commitment to quality and service, positions Exotica as a significant player in the growing Assam hospitality landscape, catering to both local residents and visitors alike. Exotica aims to be a contemporary and inviting place, providing a comfortable escape where customers can enjoy high-quality service, delicious food, and refreshing beverages in a stylish and welcoming setting.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Exotica Bar & Restro lies a carefully curated menu designed to tantalize the taste buds and cater to diverse palates. The restaurant boasts a wide array of culinary offerings, from authentic Assamese dishes showcasing the region\'s rich gastronomic heritage to popular Indian and Continental cuisines. The bar is equally well-stocked, offering a selection of premium spirits, wines, beers, and creative cocktails crafted by skilled mixologists. A particular focus is placed on sourcing fresh, locally-sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and ensuring the highest quality in every dish. What sets Exotica apart is its commitment to culinary innovation. The kitchen team constantly experiments with new flavors and techniques, introducing seasonal specials and menu updates that keep the dining experience fresh and exciting. This dedication to both tradition and innovation allows Exotica to appeal to a broad spectrum of customers, from those seeking a taste of home to those eager to explore new culinary horizons. The restaurant differentiates itself from its competitors through its attention to detail and its ability to consistently deliver high-quality food and service in a relaxed and inviting atmosphere.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Exotica Bar & Restro. From the moment guests step through the door, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The staff is meticulously trained to provide personalized recommendations, anticipate needs, and ensure a seamless and enjoyable dining experience. The ambiance is carefully crafted to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, with tasteful decor, comfortable seating, and thoughtfully chosen music. Exotica understands the importance of connecting with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events, sponsors community initiatives, and fosters relationships with neighboring businesses. Special promotions and themed nights are regularly organized to create a sense of excitement and engagement. Exotica Bar & Restro strives to be more than just a place to eat and drink; it aims to be a valuable member of the Beltola-Basistha Road community, a place where people feel welcome, connected, and valued. Regular feedback is actively sought from customers through surveys and social media engagement to continuously improve the customer experience and ensure that Exotica remains responsive to the evolving needs of the community.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Exotica Bar & Restro envisions a future of sustained growth and expansion. The business plans to solidify its position as a leading dining and entertainment destination on Beltola-Basistha Road, while also exploring opportunities to expand its reach to other locations within Guwahati and potentially beyond. This includes exploring strategic partnerships with local businesses and organizations to broaden its customer base and enhance its brand recognition. Plans are also in place to enhance the outdoor seating area, creating an even more inviting and comfortable space for guests to enjoy the pleasant Assam weather. Investment in employee training and development is a key priority, ensuring that the staff continues to provide the highest level of service and maintain Exotica\'s reputation for excellence. Furthermore, Exotica plans to leverage digital marketing strategies to enhance its online presence and reach a wider audience. This includes actively managing its social media channels, developing a user-friendly website with online ordering capabilities, and implementing targeted advertising campaigns. Ultimately, the long-term goal of Exotica Bar & Restro is to become a household name in Guwahati, synonymous with quality, service, and a memorable dining experience. By consistently delivering on its core values and adapting to the evolving needs of the market, Exotica is well-positioned to achieve its ambitious goals and contribute to the vibrant culinary scene of Assam.', 'Beltola - Basistha Rd, opposite City Gas Service', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 18:40:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
