(1917, 'The cocktails Bar & Grill', 'Bars', '', '```html\n<h1>The Cocktails Bar & Grill: A Vibrant Hub in Avtar Complex</h1>\n\nThe Cocktails Bar & Grill is a premium dining and entertainment establishment located in the heart of Avtar Complex, Avtar Complex Path. We are more than just a bar and grill; we are a destination, a place where the community gathers to celebrate life\'s moments, big and small. Our unique blend of handcrafted cocktails, delectable grilled cuisine, and a welcoming atmosphere sets us apart within the bustling Assam business landscape. We strive to provide an unparalleled experience, reflecting the rich cultural tapestry of the region while catering to a diverse clientele with sophisticated tastes.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nNestled strategically within Avtar Complex, we benefit from high foot traffic and excellent visibility, making us a readily accessible and recognizable establishment. We contribute to the local economy not only by providing employment opportunities but also by sourcing ingredients from regional suppliers whenever possible, fostering a collaborative environment with other local businesses. We believe in being a positive influence within the community, actively participating in local events and supporting charitable initiatives.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Core Services and Products: A Fusion of Flavors and Experiences</h2>\n\nAt The Cocktails Bar & Grill, our core offering revolves around providing a high-quality dining and entertainment experience. Our meticulously crafted cocktail menu features both classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks, each prepared with premium spirits, fresh ingredients, and a touch of artistry. Our skilled bartenders are passionate about their craft and are adept at creating personalized cocktails to suit individual preferences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nComplementing our cocktail program is a diverse and flavorful grill menu. We specialize in expertly grilled meats, seafood, and vegetarian options, prepared with locally inspired spices and seasonings. From succulent kebabs and perfectly seared steaks to flavorful vegetable skewers and fresh seafood platters, our menu caters to a wide range of palates and dietary preferences. We are committed to using fresh, high-quality ingredients, ensuring that every dish is a culinary delight.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWhat truly sets us apart is the seamless integration of our bar and grill offerings with a vibrant and engaging atmosphere. We regularly host live music performances featuring local artists, creating a lively and entertaining ambiance for our patrons. Our unique selling point lies in the combination of exceptional cocktails, delicious food, and captivating entertainment, all under one roof. This holistic approach allows us to meet the growing demand for premium dining and entertainment options within the local market, providing a much-needed space for socializing, relaxation, and celebration.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Customer Experience: Creating Lasting Memories</h2>\n\nCustomer satisfaction is at the heart of our business philosophy. We are dedicated to providing exceptional service that exceeds expectations and creates lasting memories. Our staff is meticulously trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. We actively solicit feedback from our customers and use it to continuously improve our offerings and service standards.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe believe in fostering a strong connection with the local community. We actively engage with our customers through social media, promoting local events and offering special promotions. We also host themed nights and special events that celebrate the culture and traditions of Assam, further strengthening our ties with the community. Our commitment to exceptional service and community engagement has helped us build a loyal customer base and establish a strong reputation as a premier dining and entertainment destination. We strive to create an environment where everyone feels comfortable, respected, and eager to return.\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<h2>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Elevating the Experience</h2>\n\nThe Cocktails Bar & Grill has ambitious plans for future growth and expansion. We envision becoming the premier destination for dining and entertainment in the greater Avtar Complex area and beyond. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties, introducing innovative cocktail concepts, and enhancing our entertainment offerings.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, potentially opening additional locations in strategically chosen areas. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure that they remain at the forefront of the hospitality industry. We aim to continue to leverage technology to enhance the customer experience, exploring options such as online ordering, mobile payments, and interactive menus. Our ultimate vision is to create a sustainable and thriving business that not only provides exceptional dining and entertainment but also contributes positively to the local community and economy. We believe that by staying true to our core values of quality, service, and community engagement, we can achieve our ambitious goals and solidify our position as a leading establishment in the Assam business landscape.\n```', 'Avtar Complex, Avtar Complex Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:00:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1918, 'Leaf Deck Café Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Leaf Deck Café Bar, situated in the vibrant heart of Assam, represents a refreshing addition to the local culinary and social scene. Strategically located above the well-known Kesaria Chaiwala and opposite All India Radio, it offers a convenient and accessible destination for both residents and visitors. More than just a café or a bar, Leaf Deck is envisioned as a community hub, a place where conversations flow as freely as the local tea, and where diverse palates find satisfaction in a carefully curated menu. In a region steeped in tradition yet embracing modernity, Leaf Deck aims to bridge the gap by offering a sophisticated, contemporary experience while retaining a strong connection to the local culture and spirit.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Leaf Deck Café Bar offers a dual experience: a daytime café transitioning into a vibrant bar in the evening. The café menu features a selection of freshly brewed coffees, including both international favorites and locally sourced Assam tea, prepared with precision and care. Complementing the beverages is a range of light bites, pastries, and more substantial meals crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. Sandwiches, salads, and other quick eats are designed to cater to the lunch crowd and those seeking a light afternoon snack. As the sun sets, Leaf Deck transforms into a bar offering a selection of beers, wines, and expertly crafted cocktails. The bar menu features appetizers and small plates that are perfect for sharing, encouraging socializing and interaction. A unique selling point of Leaf Deck is its commitment to incorporating local flavors and ingredients into its menu, creating dishes and drinks that are both familiar and innovative. For example, expect to find cocktails featuring local fruits or teas, and appetizers inspired by traditional Assamese cuisine with a modern twist. This approach not only provides a distinctive culinary experience but also supports local farmers and producers. Leaf Deck specifically addresses the local market\'s desire for a sophisticated yet approachable social space, filling a gap between traditional tea stalls and high-end restaurants.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Leaf Deck Café Bar. The staff is carefully selected and trained to provide friendly, attentive, and knowledgeable service. From offering recommendations on the menu to engaging in genuine conversation, they are committed to creating a welcoming atmosphere for every guest. The ambiance of Leaf Deck is carefully crafted to be both stylish and comfortable. The interior design blends modern aesthetics with elements of local Assamese culture, creating a space that is both visually appealing and culturally relevant. Comfortable seating, thoughtful lighting, and carefully curated music all contribute to a relaxed and inviting environment. Beyond providing exceptional service and ambiance, Leaf Deck actively seeks to connect with the local community. This is achieved through hosting events such as live music performances by local artists, art exhibitions showcasing local talent, and themed nights that celebrate Assamese culture and traditions. Leaf Deck aims to be more than just a business; it strives to be an integral part of the community, a place where people can come together to relax, socialize, and celebrate the rich culture of Assam.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Leaf Deck Café Bar envisions significant potential for growth and expansion. The immediate focus is on establishing a strong reputation within the local community and building a loyal customer base. This will be achieved through consistent quality of service, ongoing menu innovation, and active engagement with the community. Future plans include expanding the menu to offer a wider range of dishes and drinks, potentially including regional specialties and seasonal offerings. Another area of focus is on developing partnerships with local businesses and organizations to promote cross-promotion and collaboration. This could involve collaborating with local artists, musicians, and other creative professionals to host events and exhibitions at Leaf Deck. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Leaf Deck experience to a wider audience. The business also aims to explore opportunities to support local farmers and producers through sustainable sourcing practices and fair trade agreements. Ultimately, Leaf Deck Café Bar aims to be a leading example of a locally owned business that contributes to the economic and social well-being of the community, while providing a memorable and enjoyable experience for its customers.</p>', 'above Kesaria Chaiwala, opposite to All India Radio', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:00:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1919, 'Gam\'s Bar cum Restaurant', 'Bars', '', '<p>Gam\'s Bar cum Restaurant: A Culinary and Social Hub in Amritpur</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled in the heart of Ward No-43, Hazarika Complex, Amritpur Path, Gam\'s Bar cum Restaurant has quickly established itself as a premier destination for discerning locals and visitors alike. More than just a place to eat and drink, Gam\'s offers a unique blend of culinary experiences and a vibrant social atmosphere, setting it apart in the burgeoning Assam business landscape. Gam\'s is a testament to local entrepreneurship, providing a welcome space for community gatherings and a taste of both traditional and contemporary flavors.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, Gam\'s Bar cum Restaurant offers a diverse range of services catering to a variety of palates and preferences. The \"Restaurant\" aspect focuses on providing high-quality food, drawing inspiration from authentic Assamese cuisine while also incorporating popular Indian and Continental dishes. Fresh, locally sourced ingredients are prioritized to ensure both flavor and support for local farmers and producers. The menu is carefully curated to offer something for everyone, from hearty family meals to lighter snacks. This commitment to quality and variety distinguishes Gam\'s from more generic dining establishments in the area.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The \"Bar\" component complements the restaurant perfectly, offering a wide selection of beverages, including both local and international beers, spirits, and expertly crafted cocktails. The bar staff are trained to provide attentive and knowledgeable service, guiding patrons through the drink menu and creating a welcoming and convivial atmosphere. Special events and promotions, such as live music nights or themed cocktail evenings, are regularly organized to further enhance the social experience. This dual offering – quality food and a diverse drinks menu – positions Gam\'s as a one-stop destination for dining and entertainment.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What truly sets Gam\'s apart is its commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience. The staff are trained to be friendly, attentive, and responsive to the needs of each guest. A warm and inviting ambiance is cultivated through thoughtful décor, comfortable seating, and carefully curated background music. The goal is to create a space where patrons feel relaxed, valued, and eager to return. Gam\'s also actively engages with the local community, sponsoring local events, participating in community initiatives, and providing a platform for local artists and musicians. This dedication to community involvement fosters a strong sense of loyalty and connection, making Gam\'s more than just a business; it\'s a part of the local fabric.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, Gam\'s Bar cum Restaurant has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. One key objective is to further refine the menu, incorporating more seasonal and locally sourced ingredients to showcase the region\'s culinary heritage. Plans are also underway to expand the outdoor seating area, creating an even more inviting and comfortable space for patrons to enjoy the Assam weather. Furthermore, Gam\'s is exploring opportunities to partner with local businesses and organizations to offer unique experiences, such as cooking classes or wine tasting events. The long-term vision is to establish Gam\'s as a leading culinary and social destination in the region, known for its quality, innovation, and commitment to the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Gam\'s aims to become a recognizable brand synonymous with quality and genuine Assamese hospitality. This includes exploring options for catering services and expanding its presence through online ordering and delivery platforms, making its offerings more accessible to a wider audience. By continuously adapting to the evolving needs and preferences of its customers, and by remaining deeply rooted in the local community, Gam\'s Bar cum Restaurant is poised for continued success and growth in the years to come, becoming a cornerstone of the Amritpur social scene and a source of pride for the local community.</p>', 'Ward No-43, Hazarika Complex, Amritpur Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:00:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1920, 'Crystal Discotheque', 'Bars', '', '<p>Crystal Discotheque, located on the 1st floor of B Thakuria Plaza on Mother Teresa Road, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier nightlife destination in Assam. More than just a discotheque, Crystal Discotheque offers a sophisticated and immersive entertainment experience that caters to a discerning clientele seeking high-quality music, ambiance, and service. In a region where nightlife options are often limited, Crystal Discotheque fills a significant void by providing a contemporary and safe space for socializing and celebration, enriching the local entertainment scene and contributing to the burgeoning business landscape along Mother Teresa Road.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The core offering of Crystal Discotheque centers around providing an unparalleled nightlife experience. This includes a meticulously curated music program featuring both resident and guest DJs playing a diverse range of genres, from popular Bollywood hits and international chart-toppers to house and electronic music, ensuring a vibrant and engaging atmosphere for all patrons. The discotheque boasts a state-of-the-art sound system and dynamic lighting that creates an electrifying environment, further enhancing the sensory experience. Beyond music and ambiance, Crystal Discotheque offers a wide selection of premium beverages, including expertly crafted cocktails, imported spirits, and a curated wine list. A carefully designed menu of delectable appetizers and small plates complements the drinks, providing a complete and satisfying experience. A key differentiator is the emphasis on providing a safe and secure environment, with well-trained security personnel and adherence to all relevant regulations, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable night for every guest.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Crystal Discotheque is committed to delivering exceptional customer service, creating a welcoming and memorable experience for each visitor. The staff is trained to be attentive, courteous, and responsive to customer needs, ensuring a smooth and enjoyable evening. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with a warm and inviting atmosphere. The discotheque actively seeks feedback from patrons to continuously improve its services and offerings. Crystal Discotheque understands the importance of connecting with the local community and fosters relationships through special events and promotions that resonate with the cultural fabric of Assam. This includes hosting theme nights celebrating local festivals, collaborating with local artists and performers, and supporting charitable initiatives. By actively engaging with the community and prioritizing customer satisfaction, Crystal Discotheque aims to become a beloved and integral part of the local social scene.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Crystal Discotheque involves expanding its reach and solidifying its position as the leading discotheque in the region. This includes plans to host larger-scale events featuring renowned national and international DJs, further elevating the entertainment offerings. There are also plans to expand the menu to include more diverse culinary options, catering to a wider range of palates. Exploring opportunities for collaborations with local businesses and tourism agencies is also a priority, aiming to promote Crystal Discotheque as a key attraction for both local residents and visitors. Long-term goals include potentially expanding to other locations within Assam and the Northeast, bringing the Crystal Discotheque experience to a wider audience. The management is committed to investing in continuous improvements to the facility, technology, and staff training, ensuring that Crystal Discotheque remains at the forefront of the entertainment industry and continues to provide an exceptional experience for its valued customers, solidifying its status as a key contributor to the local economy and a vibrant part of the Assamese nightlife.</p>', '1st floor, B Thakuria Plaza, Mother Teresa Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:05:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1921, 'SISO Speakeasy', 'Bars', '', '```html\n<p>SISO Speakeasy, nestled within Anil Plaza - II, ABC, is redefining the social and culinary landscape of Assam. More than just an establishment, SISO Speakeasy is a vibrant hub that blends sophisticated ambiance with genuine local hospitality. It represents a new paradigm in Assam’s burgeoning hospitality sector, offering a curated experience that caters to discerning tastes while celebrating the region’s rich cultural tapestry. It\'s not simply a place to dine and unwind; it\'s a destination that fosters connection, conversation, and the creation of lasting memories. SISO Speakeasy fills a vital niche, offering an alternative to the standardized offerings prevalent in the area, providing a unique and memorable experience.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, SISO Speakeasy offers a carefully curated selection of expertly crafted cocktails, premium spirits, and a diverse menu of both local Assamese delicacies and globally inspired cuisine. The establishment prides itself on using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring both the quality and sustainability of its offerings. The cocktail program is designed to be innovative and engaging, featuring both classic concoctions and original creations that showcase the mixologists\' skill and creativity. Beyond beverages, the food menu offers something for every palate, from traditional Assamese dishes prepared with authentic recipes to contemporary interpretations of international favorites. What truly sets SISO Speakeasy apart is its commitment to providing an exceptional experience through meticulous attention to detail in every aspect, from the ambiance to the service to the quality of the offerings. This holistic approach ensures a truly unforgettable visit.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at SISO Speakeasy. Every guest is treated with genuine warmth and personalized attention, creating a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere. The staff is highly trained to anticipate needs and provide seamless service, ensuring that every visit is exceptional. The ambiance is carefully designed to create a sense of relaxed sophistication, with comfortable seating, atmospheric lighting, and curated music that enhances the overall experience. SISO Speakeasy actively connects with the local community by hosting events that showcase local artists, musicians, and culinary talent. This commitment to supporting local culture fosters a sense of community and belonging, making SISO Speakeasy more than just a business; it\'s a valuable part of the local fabric. Regular themed nights, live music performances, and collaborations with local artisans create a dynamic and engaging environment that appeals to a diverse clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for SISO Speakeasy is one of continued growth and innovation. Plans are underway to expand the menu with seasonal offerings that highlight the best of Assam\'s regional produce. The establishment also intends to further develop its cocktail program, introducing new and exciting creations that push the boundaries of mixology. Long-term goals include establishing SISO Speakeasy as a premier destination for both locals and tourists seeking an authentic and unforgettable Assamese experience. This includes exploring opportunities to partner with local tourism agencies and hotels to promote the establishment as a key attraction in the area. SISO Speakeasy is committed to upholding its reputation for excellence, continuously improving its offerings, and solidifying its position as a leader in Assam\'s hospitality industry. Ultimately, the goal is to create a legacy of exceptional experiences and lasting contributions to the local community.</p>\n```', 'Anil Plaza - II, ABC', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:05:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1922, 'Maikhana Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Maikhana Bar: A Fusion of Assam\'s Spirit and Modern Hospitality</p>\n\n<p>Nestled at 5QH2+MFG, GS Rd, Maikhana Bar offers a unique and contemporary interpretation of the traditional Assam experience. More than just a place to enjoy a drink, Maikhana aims to be a vibrant hub where locals and visitors alike can connect, unwind, and savor the rich flavors and cultural heritage of the region. In a market saturated with generic bars, Maikhana distinguishes itself by embracing local ingredients, promoting regional artisans, and cultivating an atmosphere that resonates with the authentic spirit of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Maikhana Bar provides a curated selection of beverages and culinary offerings that celebrate Assam\'s bounty. Our primary service is providing a relaxed and sophisticated environment to enjoy expertly crafted cocktails, premium spirits, and a thoughtfully chosen assortment of wines and beers. Beyond the standard bar offerings, Maikhana specializes in incorporating indigenous ingredients into our cocktails, such as locally sourced fruits, spices, and herbs. This commitment to local sourcing extends to our food menu, which features small plates and appetizers designed to complement our drink selection. We showcase regional delicacies with a modern twist, offering dishes that are both familiar and innovative. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to seamlessly blend the traditional and the contemporary, offering an authentic Assam experience in a stylish and comfortable setting. This approach caters directly to the growing demand for locally sourced and culturally relevant experiences within the Assam market, providing a welcome alternative to the generic offerings prevalent elsewhere.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Maikhana Bar. We strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our staff are trained to provide attentive and personalized service, offering recommendations and sharing stories about the ingredients and traditions behind our offerings. We believe in building genuine connections with our customers, fostering a sense of community and belonging. To further enhance the customer experience, Maikhana regularly hosts live music performances featuring local artists, creating a platform for showcasing Assam\'s vibrant cultural scene. We also partner with local artisans to display and sell their crafts within the bar, providing them with exposure and supporting the local economy. Maikhana actively engages with the community by participating in local events and initiatives, solidifying its role as a responsible and contributing member of the Assam business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Maikhana Bar envisions becoming a premier destination for experiencing the authentic flavors and culture of Assam. Our future plans include expanding our menu to incorporate more regional specialties and partnering with local farmers and producers to ensure a consistent supply of high-quality, locally sourced ingredients. We also aim to develop a signature line of Maikhana-branded products, such as bottled cocktails and artisanal snacks, that can be sold both in the bar and online. Furthermore, we plan to expand our footprint by opening additional locations in key cities throughout Assam, bringing the Maikhana experience to a wider audience. Our long-term goal is to establish Maikhana Bar as a recognized and respected brand that embodies the spirit of Assam and contributes to the region\'s economic and cultural growth. We are committed to continuously innovating and evolving, while remaining true to our core values of authenticity, quality, and community engagement.</p>', '5QH2+MFG, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:05:18', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1923, 'Mynah\'s : Bar & Bistro', 'Bars', '', '<p>Mynah\'s : Bar & Bistro, nestled within the serene ambiance of The Greenwood Resort in Assam, offers a sophisticated yet welcoming dining and social experience. More than just a place to eat and drink, Mynah\'s aspires to be a cornerstone of the resort\'s appeal and a notable destination for discerning locals and tourists alike, contributing positively to the growing hospitality sector in the region. The name itself, drawing inspiration from the Mynah bird, symbolizes the lively and communicative atmosphere we strive to cultivate, mirroring the bird\'s social nature and adaptable presence.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its heart, Mynah\'s operates on a dual concept: a vibrant bar and a refined bistro. The bar area boasts an extensive selection of beverages, ranging from classic cocktails and premium spirits to locally sourced beers and thoughtfully curated wines. Skilled mixologists craft innovative drinks, incorporating regional fruits and spices to offer a unique taste of Assam. The bistro complements the bar with a carefully designed menu featuring both international favorites and dishes that celebrate the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Fresh, locally sourced ingredients are prioritized, ensuring the highest quality and supporting regional farmers. Signature dishes showcase the distinctive flavors of Assam, providing guests with an authentic gastronomic journey. Furthermore, Mynah\'s offers a selection of delectable appetizers and sharing plates, perfect for enjoying with friends or colleagues.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Mynah\'s : Bar & Bistro differentiates itself through several key factors. Firstly, its location within The Greenwood Resort provides an unparalleled setting, offering guests stunning views and a tranquil escape. Secondly, the commitment to utilizing local produce and incorporating Assamese flavors into the menu sets it apart from typical hotel restaurants. The focus on expertly crafted cocktails and a well-curated wine list caters to a sophisticated clientele. Finally, the dual bar and bistro concept allows for a versatile experience, appealing to those seeking a casual drink, a formal dinner, or anything in between. This blend of ambiance, quality, and local flavor directly addresses the market need for a premium dining and social destination that reflects the unique character of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Mynah\'s. Every interaction is designed to be attentive, personalized, and memorable. Staff members are trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, beverages, and local area, enabling them to provide informed recommendations and cater to individual preferences. The ambiance is carefully curated to be both elegant and inviting, with comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and ambient lighting. Live music performances featuring local artists are occasionally hosted, adding to the vibrant atmosphere and supporting the regional arts scene. Mynah\'s actively engages with the local community through partnerships with regional producers and participation in local events. Special promotions and themed evenings are regularly organized to attract new customers and foster a sense of community among regulars. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Mynah\'s : Bar & Bistro envisions significant growth potential. The business plans to expand its menu offerings, incorporating more innovative dishes and seasonal specials that showcase the diverse flavors of Assam. The bar aims to further develop its cocktail program, introducing new and exciting creations that reflect the latest trends and utilize local ingredients. Strategic partnerships with local businesses and tour operators will be pursued to increase visibility and attract a wider audience. There are also plans to host regular events, such as wine tastings, cooking demonstrations, and themed parties, to enhance the customer experience and create a vibrant social hub. Long-term goals include establishing Mynah\'s as a leading dining and entertainment destination in the region, known for its exceptional food, drinks, service, and commitment to the local community. Ultimately, Mynah\'s aims to contribute to the growth and development of the tourism and hospitality sector in Assam, showcasing the region\'s unique charm and culinary heritage to the world.</p>', 'The Greenwood Resort', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:05:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1924, 'Kitchen Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', '', '<p>Kitchen Bar & Restaurant, situated on the 1st Floor of Amulya Complex on RG Baruah Rd, Zoo Rd, is a vibrant establishment redefining the dining and social scene in Guwahati. More than just a place to eat and drink, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant offers a holistic experience that blends delectable cuisine, crafted beverages, and a lively ambiance. Positioned strategically in a bustling commercial and residential area, it aims to become a preferred destination for both local residents and visitors seeking a memorable culinary adventure and a relaxing social atmosphere.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>In the burgeoning Assam business landscape, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant distinguishes itself by embracing a modern and innovative approach to the traditional restaurant and bar concept. It acknowledges the evolving tastes and preferences of the local populace, catering to a diverse clientele that appreciates quality food, expertly mixed drinks, and a sophisticated yet comfortable setting. Its significance lies in contributing to the growth of the local hospitality sector while simultaneously offering a unique and enjoyable experience not readily found elsewhere in the area. The restaurant contributes to the local economy by sourcing ingredients locally wherever possible, supporting regional suppliers and farmers, and providing employment opportunities for the community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Kitchen Bar & Restaurant offers a carefully curated menu featuring a diverse selection of cuisines, from regional Assamese specialties to popular continental dishes. This allows patrons to explore a range of flavors and culinary experiences within a single visit. The bar boasts an extensive beverage selection, including classic cocktails, innovative signature drinks, premium spirits, and a thoughtfully chosen wine list. This variety ensures that there is something to suit every taste and occasion. A unique selling point is the emphasis on fresh, high-quality ingredients, prepared with attention to detail and presented with flair. The chefs and bartenders are passionate about their craft, constantly experimenting with new flavors and techniques to create innovative and exciting offerings. The restaurant also accommodates dietary restrictions and preferences, offering vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>These services directly address the local market\'s need for diverse dining options that cater to a variety of tastes and preferences. The demand for quality entertainment and social venues is also met through the vibrant bar atmosphere, which provides a space for people to unwind, connect, and celebrate. By blending local flavors with international influences, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant aims to provide a culinary journey that appeals to both local residents and tourists seeking an authentic Assamese experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Kitchen Bar & Restaurant, customer experience is paramount. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and beverages, providing recommendations and answering questions with expertise and courtesy. The restaurant strives to create a welcoming and comfortable atmosphere, where patrons feel valued and appreciated. Special attention is paid to creating a memorable dining experience, with attention to detail in everything from table settings to music selection. What truly sets Kitchen Bar & Restaurant apart is its commitment to building relationships with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events and initiatives, sponsoring community programs and supporting local charities. It also hosts special events and promotions that cater to the interests of the local community, fostering a sense of belonging and creating a loyal customer base.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Furthermore, the restaurant uses social media platforms to actively engage with the community, share updates, promote events, and respond to customer feedback promptly. This open and transparent communication helps build trust and strengthens the restaurant\'s connection with its patrons.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>The future vision for Kitchen Bar & Restaurant is one of continued growth and expansion. The business aims to become a recognized and respected brand within the Guwahati hospitality sector, known for its quality, innovation, and community engagement. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional Assamese specialties, showcasing the rich culinary heritage of the area. There are also plans to introduce themed nights and events to further enhance the dining and entertainment experience. Longer-term goals involve potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Assam, bringing the unique Kitchen Bar & Restaurant experience to a wider audience. The business also intends to invest in staff training and development to ensure that its employees are equipped with the skills and knowledge to deliver exceptional service. By continuously innovating and adapting to the changing needs of the market, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant is poised for long-term success and sustainability.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ultimately, Kitchen Bar & Restaurant aspires to be more than just a restaurant and bar; it seeks to be a vital part of the local community, a place where people can come together to enjoy good food, good drinks, and good company. The goal is to create a lasting legacy of excellence and contribute to the growth and prosperity of the Assam business landscape.</p>', '1st Floor, Amulya Complex RG Baruah Rd, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:05:30', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1925, 'Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant', 'Bars', '', '<h1>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant: A Culinary Haven on GS Road</h1>\n\n<p>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant isn\'t just another dining establishment; it\'s a vibrant culinary landmark nestled on GS Road, conveniently located near HOTEL PRAGOTI MANOR. It represents a fusion of modern dining sensibilities with the warmth and hospitality deeply rooted in Assamese culture. Positioned in a bustling area, the restaurant provides a much-needed haven for families, professionals, and tourists alike, offering a diverse menu and a welcoming atmosphere that sets it apart in the local dining scene. Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant aims to be the preferred choice for those seeking quality food, refreshing drinks, and memorable moments shared with loved ones.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h2>A Diverse Culinary Experience</h2>\n\n<p>Our core offering revolves around providing a diverse and delectable menu that caters to a wide range of palates. The \"Kitchen\" aspect highlights our focus on freshly prepared dishes using locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring the highest quality and supporting local farmers. The \"Bar\" component features a curated selection of beverages, from classic cocktails and imported spirits to local beers and non-alcoholic options, designed to complement our food offerings perfectly. Finally, the \"Family Restaurant\" designation underscores our commitment to creating a welcoming and inclusive environment for families of all sizes. <br> <br> Our menu boasts a wide selection of dishes. Our Indian curries, cooked with traditional spices, are a huge favorite. Our sizzlers are always in high demand. We also offer Continental meals. The restaurant also has a dedicated pastry section with a pastry chef crafting exquisite pastries and cakes. <br> <br> What truly distinguishes Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant is our unwavering commitment to quality and innovation. We are constantly evolving our menu to incorporate seasonal ingredients and introduce exciting new dishes, all while maintaining the high standards that our patrons have come to expect. The dedication to crafting memorable dining experiences is what makes us stand out.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h2>Exceptional Customer Experience: More Than Just a Meal</h2>\n\n<p>At Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant, customer service isn\'t just a department; it\'s an ethos that permeates every aspect of our operation. We believe in creating a warm and inviting atmosphere where guests feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is carefully selected and trained to provide attentive, friendly, and efficient service, ensuring that every dining experience is a positive one. We strive to anticipate our customers\' needs and exceed their expectations, from offering personalized recommendations to accommodating special dietary requirements. <br> <br> Beyond the exceptional service, we actively engage with the local community through various initiatives. We regularly host events and promotions that celebrate local culture and traditions, further cementing our position as an integral part of the community fabric. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers and fostering a sense of belonging. This dedication to community engagement and exceptional customer service contributes significantly to our brand reputation and customer loyalty.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h2>Vision for the Future: Growing with Assam</h2>\n\n<p>Kitchen Bar & Family Restaurant envisions a future where it continues to be a leading dining destination in the region. Our long-term goals involve expanding our reach, both physically and digitally. We are exploring opportunities to open additional locations in strategic areas, bringing our unique dining experience to a wider audience. We are also investing in technology to enhance our online presence, streamline our operations, and improve the overall customer experience. This includes online ordering platforms, loyalty programs, and digital marketing initiatives. <br> <br> Furthermore, we are committed to continuous improvement and innovation. We will continue to refine our menu, explore new culinary trends, and invest in training and development for our staff. We aspire to be not only a successful business but also a responsible corporate citizen, contributing to the economic growth and social well-being of the local community. We aim to become a culinary destination that is not just visited, but remembered, and cherished for generations to come.</p>', 'GS Rd, near HOTEL PRAGOTI MANOR', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:10:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1926, 'Tulip Restaurant(Club DMD)', 'Bars', '', 'Tulip Restaurant (Club DMD) stands as a vibrant culinary destination in Guwahati, Assam, strategically located on GS Rd, opposite Bharti House, above the Bata Showroom. More than just a restaurant, Tulip represents a fusion of exquisite dining and engaging entertainment, catering to a diverse clientele seeking a memorable experience. Its prominent location ensures high visibility and accessibility, making it a landmark establishment within the bustling cityscape. Tulip distinguishes itself by offering a unique blend of restaurant ambiance coupled with the energy of a club atmosphere (Club DMD), catering to both daytime diners and evening revelers. The business significantly contributes to the local economy by providing employment opportunities and supporting local suppliers, enriching the Assam business landscape with its innovative approach.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nTulip Restaurant (Club DMD) offers a diverse array of culinary delights, focusing primarily on Indian and Continental cuisine, carefully curated to tantalize taste buds and cater to varying preferences. The menu boasts a selection of meticulously prepared dishes, using fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible to ensure quality and authenticity. From traditional Assamese delicacies to contemporary international favorites, the culinary offerings are designed to create a memorable dining experience. Beyond food, Tulip provides a wide selection of beverages, including mocktails, cocktails, and premium spirits. Club DMD, the entertainment aspect of Tulip, comes alive in the evenings with live music performances, DJ sets, and themed events, creating a vibrant and energetic atmosphere. This unique combination of fine dining and entertainment sets Tulip apart from other restaurants in Guwahati, providing a complete experience that caters to both the appetite and the desire for social interaction. This dual offering addresses a specific need in the local market for a venue that seamlessly transitions from a sophisticated dining experience to an exciting nightlife destination.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer service is at the heart of Tulip Restaurant (Club DMD)’s operations. The staff is trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. From the moment a customer walks in, they are greeted with warmth and hospitality, setting the tone for a positive and memorable experience. The restaurant prides itself on creating a comfortable and inviting ambiance, where guests can relax and enjoy their meals and entertainment. Regular feedback is actively sought from customers to continually improve the quality of service and offerings. Tulip actively engages with the local community through sponsorships of local events and partnerships with local organizations. Special promotions and events are frequently organized to celebrate local festivals and traditions, fostering a strong connection with the community. This commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement has earned Tulip a loyal following and a reputation as a premier dining and entertainment destination in Guwahati.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe future vision for Tulip Restaurant (Club DMD) is centered around continued growth and innovation. Plans are underway to expand the menu with new and exciting culinary creations, incorporating global trends while maintaining a focus on local flavors. Expansion of the physical space is also being considered to accommodate the growing demand and enhance the overall customer experience. Technology integration is a key focus, with plans to introduce online ordering, reservation systems, and loyalty programs to further enhance customer convenience. Furthermore, Tulip aims to solidify its position as a leader in the Guwahati entertainment scene by hosting a wider range of events and attracting renowned artists and performers. Long-term goals include establishing Tulip as a regional brand, with potential expansion to other cities in Assam and beyond, becoming synonymous with quality dining, engaging entertainment, and unwavering customer service. This ambitious vision is driven by a commitment to excellence and a deep understanding of the evolving needs and preferences of the local market.', 'GS Rd, opposite Bharti House, above Bata Showroom', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:10:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
