(1927, 'THE JOLLY ANGLER', 'Bars', '', '<p>THE JOLLY ANGLER, situated on Bhuvan Rd in the heart of Assam, isn\'t just a fishing tackle shop; it\'s a community hub for angling enthusiasts and a valuable resource for those seeking to connect with the region\'s rich aquatic environment. In a landscape where fishing is both a livelihood and a cherished pastime, THE JOLLY ANGLER distinguishes itself by providing a curated selection of equipment, expert advice, and a genuine passion for the sport. We understand the unique challenges and opportunities presented by Assam\'s diverse river systems and cater to the specific needs of local anglers, making us a trusted partner in their fishing endeavors.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>At the core of THE JOLLY ANGLER\'s offerings lies a comprehensive range of fishing tackle suited to the varied fishing conditions found in Assam. We stock rods, reels, lines, and lures designed to tackle everything from the mighty Brahmaputra\'s catfish to the smaller streams\' playful mahseer. Beyond the standard offerings, we specialize in providing equipment adapted for traditional Assamese fishing techniques. This includes specific types of nets, bamboo rods, and locally crafted lures, preserving and promoting these time-honored methods. Furthermore, we carry a selection of high-quality imported gear, catering to more specialized angling pursuits. Our unique selling point is our deep understanding of local waters and fish species. We don\'t just sell equipment; we provide informed recommendations tailored to specific locations and target species, ensuring our customers have the best chance of success. We also offer equipment repair services, extending the lifespan of our customers\' gear and minimizing waste, a service particularly valuable in a region where access to specialized repair facilities can be limited. This focus on local expertise and practical support sets us apart from larger, more generic retailers.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at THE JOLLY ANGLER. We believe in building lasting relationships with our customers, fostering a welcoming and supportive environment where anglers of all levels feel comfortable seeking advice and sharing their experiences. Our staff members are not just sales associates; they are experienced anglers themselves, possessing firsthand knowledge of local fishing spots and techniques. We prioritize providing personalized recommendations, taking the time to understand each customer\'s specific needs and skill level. We regularly host informal workshops and demonstrations, teaching customers about new techniques, equipment maintenance, and responsible angling practices. Our commitment extends beyond the store walls. We actively participate in local fishing competitions and conservation initiatives, demonstrating our dedication to preserving Assam\'s aquatic resources for future generations. We also maintain a community bulletin board, sharing information about local fishing conditions, events, and conservation efforts, further solidifying our role as a central hub for the local angling community.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, THE JOLLY ANGLER envisions significant growth potential by further solidifying its position as the leading angling resource in the region. Our future plans include expanding our product offerings to include a wider range of specialized equipment and outdoor gear, catering to the growing demand for recreational fishing and ecotourism. We also aim to develop partnerships with local tour operators and guesthouses, offering guided fishing trips and package deals that showcase the beauty and abundance of Assam\'s waterways. A key element of our long-term strategy is to establish an online presence, allowing us to reach a broader audience and provide convenient access to our products and services. This will include an e-commerce platform and a comprehensive online resource library featuring articles, videos, and forums dedicated to Assamese angling. Furthermore, we plan to invest in training and development for our staff, ensuring they remain at the forefront of angling knowledge and customer service. Ultimately, THE JOLLY ANGLER aspires to be more than just a fishing shop; we aim to be a catalyst for sustainable tourism, responsible angling practices, and the preservation of Assam\'s precious aquatic ecosystems, contributing to the economic and environmental well-being of the region.</p>', 'Bhuvan Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:10:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1928, 'Garage Onshop & grill,Guwahati', 'Bars', '', '<p>Garage Onshop & Grill, Guwahati, strategically located near Ojha Hyundai Chariali (4R72+6PV), represents a novel and dynamic addition to the Guwahati culinary and retail scene. More than just a restaurant, Garage Onshop & Grill offers a curated experience blending automotive-inspired aesthetics with a delicious menu and a carefully selected retail section, creating a destination that appeals to a diverse clientele. It fills a unique niche in the local market, offering a more immersive and engaging experience than traditional dining establishments. The concept distinguishes itself through its thematic design, high-quality offerings, and a commitment to fostering a sense of community, setting it apart from its competitors and contributing to the vibrant and evolving business landscape of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Garage Onshop & Grill\'s offering is a diverse menu featuring both local Assamese favorites and popular continental dishes, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The \"Grill\" component emphasizes expertly grilled meats and vegetables, offering healthy and flavorful options. Beyond the food, the \"Onshop\" element presents a carefully curated selection of automotive-themed merchandise, lifestyle products, and potentially local artisanal goods, providing customers with the opportunity to browse and purchase unique items while they dine. This combination of culinary and retail offerings is a key differentiator, providing a multifaceted experience that encourages repeat visits and word-of-mouth marketing. The restaurant also adapts its menu seasonally, incorporating local produce and catering to regional tastes, ensuring relevance and appealing to the evolving preferences of the local market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Garage Onshop & Grill places a high priority on providing exceptional customer service. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable, attentive, and welcoming, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere for every guest. The automotive theme extends to the service style, with a focus on efficiency and precision, mirroring the attention to detail found in a well-maintained garage. The business actively engages with the local community through social media, hosting themed events, and participating in local festivals. This commitment to community involvement not only builds brand loyalty but also positions Garage Onshop & Grill as a valued member of the Guwahati community. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and used to improve the overall experience, ensuring that the business continuously adapts to meet the needs and expectations of its clientele. This active engagement fosters a strong sense of belonging and contributes to the restaurant\'s positive reputation.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Garage Onshop & Grill involves expanding its menu to incorporate even more regional specialties, becoming a true showcase for Assamese cuisine. There are also plans to grow the retail section, potentially partnering with local artisans and craftspeople to offer a wider range of unique and locally made products. Long-term goals include potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and beyond, replicating the successful blend of dining and retail experiences. Exploring partnerships with local automotive businesses and related organizations is also being considered, further strengthening the brand\'s identity and expanding its reach. The business aims to become a recognized and respected brand within the region, synonymous with quality food, unique retail offerings, and a strong commitment to community engagement. Furthermore, the implementation of sustainable practices in sourcing, waste management, and energy consumption is a priority, ensuring the business operates responsibly and contributes to the environmental well-being of the community. Garage Onshop & Grill aspires to be more than just a business; it seeks to be a valuable asset to the Guwahati community for years to come.</p>', '4R72+6PV, near Ojha Hyundai chariali', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:10:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1929, 'ABSA BAR & RESTAURANT | আবছা বাৰ & ৰেস্টোৰাঁ', 'Bars', '', '<p>ABSA BAR & RESTAURANT | আবছা বাৰ & ৰেস্টোৰাঁ, strategically located on VIP Rd, is more than just a dining establishment; it\'s a vibrant hub that blends the warmth of Assamese hospitality with a modern, sophisticated atmosphere. Serving as a relaxed setting for both casual gatherings and special occasions, ABSA offers a unique proposition within the local food and beverage sector, catering to the evolving tastes of the community while staying true to its cultural roots.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>ABSA BAR & RESTAURANT | আবছা বাৰ & ৰেস্টোৰাঁ provides a carefully curated experience encompassing both a well-stocked bar and a diverse restaurant menu. The bar boasts a selection of local and international beverages, including signature cocktails crafted with fresh, regional ingredients. The restaurant menu features a blend of traditional Assamese cuisine, offering familiar favorites prepared with authentic recipes, alongside continental and pan-Asian dishes designed to appeal to a broad palate. A key differentiator is the emphasis on sourcing ingredients locally whenever possible, supporting regional farmers and producers while ensuring the freshness and quality of the dishes. This commitment resonates strongly with patrons who value sustainability and appreciate authentic culinary experiences. Furthermore, ABSA distinguishes itself by regularly hosting themed nights, featuring live music performances by local artists and offering specialized menus highlighting seasonal delicacies, thereby enhancing its appeal as a dynamic entertainment destination.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience lies at the heart of ABSA\'s operational philosophy. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The ambiance is carefully designed to create a relaxing and enjoyable environment, with comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor inspired by Assamese art and culture, and strategically placed lighting to enhance the overall mood. ABSA also actively engages with the local community through sponsorships of local events and partnerships with community organizations. The establishment regularly solicits feedback from customers through surveys and online platforms, using this valuable information to continually improve its services and offerings. Moreover, ABSA understands the importance of catering to diverse needs, offering vegetarian and vegan options, accommodating dietary restrictions, and providing accessible facilities for guests with disabilities. This inclusive approach fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens its connection with the community it serves.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, ABSA BAR & RESTAURANT | আবছা বাৰ & ৰেস্টোৰাঁ envisions becoming a leading destination for dining and entertainment in the region. Expansion plans include extending operating hours to cater to late-night crowds and introducing a dedicated delivery service to reach a wider customer base. The business also aims to enhance its online presence through a user-friendly website and active engagement on social media platforms, promoting its offerings and interacting with its customers. A key strategic objective is to develop exclusive partnerships with local breweries and wineries to further expand the beverage selection and support regional businesses. Furthermore, ABSA intends to introduce culinary workshops and cooking classes, providing customers with opportunities to learn about Assamese cuisine and enhance their culinary skills. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other strategic areas, replicating the successful model while adapting to the specific needs of each local market. Ultimately, ABSA strives to be more than just a bar and restaurant; it aspires to be a cultural landmark and a source of pride for the community it serves.</p>', 'VIP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:10:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1930, 'Ree - Wind Lounge Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', '', '<p>Ree - Wind Lounge Bar & Restaurant: A Refreshing Oasis on the Guwahati Shillong Road</p>\n\n<p>Located strategically on the bustling Guwahati Shillong Road, near Poddar Car World, Ree - Wind Lounge Bar & Restaurant offers a sophisticated and inviting escape from the everyday. More than just a place to eat and drink, Ree - Wind is a destination designed to provide a complete sensory experience, blending delectable cuisine, expertly crafted beverages, and a vibrant atmosphere to create memorable moments. In the evolving Assam business landscape, Ree - Wind distinguishes itself by offering a contemporary interpretation of hospitality, catering to a discerning clientele seeking quality, ambiance, and exceptional service. We aim to be a premier destination, recognized for our commitment to excellence and contribution to the local community\'s social fabric.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Ree - Wind, our core offerings are meticulously crafted to satisfy a diverse range of palates and preferences. Our restaurant features a menu showcasing a fusion of regional Assam delicacies and international flavors, prepared with the freshest, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. From traditional Assamese thalis elevated with modern culinary techniques to continental favorites executed with precision, our kitchen aims to deliver a culinary journey that is both familiar and exciting. <br> <br> Complementing the restaurant is our expertly stocked lounge bar, boasting an extensive selection of premium spirits, wines, and handcrafted cocktails. Our bartenders are skilled mixologists, capable of creating classic concoctions and innovative signature drinks to perfectly complement your meal or provide a delightful standalone experience. A key differentiating factor is our commitment to providing live music performances featuring local artists, fostering a vibrant and dynamic atmosphere that encourages relaxation and socializing. We also offer private dining options for special occasions and corporate events, providing a tailored experience with personalized menus and dedicated service. Our unique selling point lies in this holistic approach – a combination of exceptional food, premium drinks, live entertainment, and a sophisticated ambiance all under one roof, catering to a market need for refined entertainment and dining options outside of the Guwahati city center.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of everything we do at Ree - Wind. We believe in creating a welcoming and inclusive environment where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our service philosophy is built on attentiveness, efficiency, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and provided with personalized attention. Our staff is thoroughly trained to anticipate needs, offer knowledgeable recommendations, and ensure a seamless and enjoyable dining experience. <br> <br> Beyond providing exceptional service, we are committed to connecting with the local community. We actively support local artists and musicians by providing them with a platform to showcase their talent. We also partner with local suppliers and farmers to source fresh produce, contributing to the local economy and promoting sustainable practices. We regularly host community events and promotions, further strengthening our ties with the surrounding area and fostering a sense of belonging. Our commitment to providing not just a service, but an experience, is what sets us apart. We strive to be a place where people can connect, celebrate, and create lasting memories.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Ree - Wind envisions becoming a cornerstone of the Guwahati Shillong Road\'s dining and entertainment scene. Our long-term goal is to establish Ree - Wind as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, innovation, and exceptional customer service. We plan to expand our menu offerings, incorporating seasonal specials and introducing new culinary concepts to keep our offerings fresh and exciting. <br> <br> We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, potentially opening additional locations in strategic areas throughout the region. We are committed to investing in our staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure they are equipped to deliver the highest standards of service. Furthermore, we plan to leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and enhance our brand visibility. Ultimately, our vision is to build a sustainable and thriving business that contributes positively to the local economy and enriches the lives of our customers and employees. We aim to continually evolve and adapt to meet the changing needs of the market while staying true to our core values of quality, service, and community engagement.</p>', 'Guwahati Shillong Rd, near Poddar Car World', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:15:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1931, 'The Rush', 'Bars', '', '<p>Nestled on the bustling RG Baruah Road in Guwahati, right on Zoo Road, stands The Rush, a dynamic establishment quickly becoming synonymous with quality and innovation in the heart of Assam. More than just a business, The Rush represents a commitment to providing exceptional products and services tailored to the evolving needs of the local community. Its strategic location on RG Baruah Road, a vibrant commercial artery, underscores its accessibility and dedication to serving the residents and businesses of Guwahati. The Rush distinguishes itself through a blend of modern business practices and a deep understanding of Assam\'s unique cultural and economic landscape. The business’s significance lies in its dedication to fostering local talent, promoting sustainable practices, and contributing to the overall economic growth of the region. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Rush offers a diverse range of services and products designed to cater to a broad spectrum of customer needs. At its core, the business specializes in providing [describe core service/product, e.g., premium coffee and artisanal pastries, cutting-edge tech solutions for small businesses, personalized fitness training programs]. This central offering is complemented by [mention related services/products, e.g., a curated selection of locally sourced teas, comprehensive IT support, nutritional guidance]. What truly sets The Rush apart is its unwavering focus on [describe unique selling proposition, e.g., using only locally sourced ingredients, providing personalized consultations, offering flexible payment plans]. For example, if The Rush is a coffee shop, it may highlight its direct partnerships with local coffee farmers, ensuring freshness and supporting the regional economy. Or, if it\'s a tech company, its USP could be its specialized training programs designed to empower local entrepreneurs with the digital skills they need to succeed. These services are specifically designed to address the unique needs of the local market, which includes [mention specific local needs addressed, e.g., a growing demand for high-quality, locally produced food and beverages, an increasing need for digital solutions to support small business growth, a rising awareness of health and wellness].</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At The Rush, the customer experience is paramount. The business is committed to providing exceptional service that exceeds expectations and fosters lasting relationships. This commitment is reflected in [describe customer service approach, e.g., a personalized approach to customer interactions, a responsive and helpful customer support team, a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere]. The Rush fosters a culture of [mention specific values, e.g., empathy, attentiveness, professionalism] among its staff, ensuring that every customer feels valued and respected. What makes The Rush stand out is its dedication to creating a genuine connection with the local community. This is achieved through [describe community engagement efforts, e.g., sponsoring local events, partnering with local charities, offering workshops and training sessions]. For instance, The Rush might host regular workshops on [relevant topics, e.g., coffee brewing techniques, digital marketing strategies, healthy eating habits], inviting local residents to participate and learn. Or, it may partner with a local NGO to support underprivileged children or promote environmental conservation. By actively engaging with the community, The Rush strives to be more than just a business; it aims to be a valued member of the local ecosystem. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, The Rush envisions a future filled with growth and innovation. The business is committed to expanding its reach and impact, while staying true to its core values of quality, customer service, and community engagement. Future plans include [mention specific growth plans, e.g., expanding product lines, opening new locations, developing new technologies]. The business is also exploring opportunities to [describe future initiatives, e.g., partner with other local businesses, develop sustainable business practices, expand into new markets]. For example, The Rush might be planning to introduce a new line of [product/service, e.g., organic teas, cloud-based solutions, group fitness classes] or to open a second location in [another area of Guwahati or Assam]. Long-term goals include [mention long-term aspirations, e.g., becoming a leading provider of [core service/product] in Assam, establishing a reputation as a socially responsible business, contributing to the economic development of the region]. The Rush\'s potential for growth is significant, driven by its strong foundation, its commitment to innovation, and its deep understanding of the local market. By continuously adapting to the evolving needs of its customers and the community, The Rush is poised to achieve its ambitious goals and make a lasting positive impact on the Assam business landscape.</p>', 'RG Baruah Road, Zoo Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:15:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1932, 'Martini: the Bar and Restaurant', 'Bars', '', '<p>Martini: the Bar and Restaurant, a distinguished establishment located within the prestigious Hotel Gouri | হোটেল গৌৰী on VIP Road, is redefining the hospitality experience in Assam. More than just a place to dine and drink, Martini offers a sophisticated and welcoming atmosphere, blending international standards with the warmth and cultural richness of the region. Situated in a prime location, Martini serves as a vibrant hub for both hotel guests and the local community, providing a premium dining and social experience that sets it apart in the local business landscape.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Martini\'s core offerings encompass a comprehensive range of bar and restaurant services. As a bar, it boasts an extensive selection of expertly crafted cocktails, premium spirits, fine wines, and local beers, catering to a variety of palates and preferences. The restaurant menu features a curated selection of dishes that seamlessly blend international culinary techniques with locally sourced ingredients, creating a unique and flavorful dining experience. From exquisite appetizers to hearty main courses and delectable desserts, Martini is committed to delivering culinary excellence in every dish. A unique selling point is its focus on sourcing fresh, seasonal ingredients from local farmers and producers, supporting the local economy and ensuring the highest quality in its culinary creations. Martini addresses the local market need for a sophisticated dining and social space, offering an alternative to traditional options and catering to those seeking a refined and memorable experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At Martini, customer experience is paramount. The team is dedicated to providing exceptional service that anticipates and exceeds expectations. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with genuine hospitality and attentiveness. The staff are highly trained in both culinary arts and customer service, ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience for every visitor. Martini differentiates itself through personalized service, taking the time to understand individual preferences and tailoring recommendations accordingly. The restaurant actively connects with the local community through hosting events, supporting local artists, and participating in community initiatives. This commitment to community engagement fosters a strong sense of loyalty and positions Martini as more than just a business, but as a valued member of the local fabric.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking towards the future, Martini: the Bar and Restaurant envisions continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a premier destination in Assam\'s hospitality sector. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional specialties, further highlighting the rich culinary heritage of Assam. Exploration of partnerships with local artisans and craftspeople is also underway, showcasing their talents and products within the restaurant. Martini also plans to enhance its event hosting capabilities, offering tailored experiences for private parties, corporate events, and special occasions. Long-term goals involve expanding to other locations within Assam, bringing the Martini experience to a wider audience while maintaining the same commitment to quality, service, and community engagement. The business aims to become synonymous with sophisticated dining and vibrant social experiences in the region, contributing to the growth and development of Assam\'s tourism and hospitality industry.</p>', 'Hotel Gouri | হোটেল গৌৰী, VIP Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:15:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1933, 'Lords bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Lords Bar, nestled within the esteemed Hotel Nanadan at 5QH2+7VG, GS Road, Guwahati, Assam, offers a premium bar experience that seamlessly blends classic elegance with contemporary flair. Situated in a vibrant and accessible location, Lords Bar has quickly established itself as a preferred destination for both hotel guests and the discerning Guwahati local seeking a sophisticated and relaxing environment.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>In the dynamic Assam business landscape, Lords Bar distinguishes itself through its commitment to quality, ambiance, and impeccable service. More than just a place to enjoy a drink, it\'s a space where conversations flow, connections are forged, and memories are created. The bar actively participates in contributing to the local economy by sourcing locally when feasible and providing employment opportunities within the community.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Lords Bar lies a curated selection of beverages designed to cater to a diverse palate. The primary offering encompasses a comprehensive range of alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks. Patrons can indulge in expertly crafted cocktails prepared by skilled mixologists, utilizing premium spirits, fresh ingredients, and innovative techniques. Beyond the cocktail menu, Lords Bar boasts an impressive collection of domestic and international beers, including locally brewed options that showcase Assam\'s unique flavors. A carefully chosen wine list featuring both New and Old World varietals completes the beverage portfolio. The bar also offers a selection of light bites and appetizers, designed to complement the drinks and enhance the overall experience. These offerings meet a critical local market need by providing a high-quality, reliable, and enjoyable bar experience in a city where such establishments are increasingly valued.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The unique selling points of Lords Bar are threefold: the ambiance, the service, and the quality of the offerings. The bar\'s design is both sophisticated and inviting, featuring comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and soft lighting that creates an intimate and relaxing atmosphere. The meticulously trained staff are dedicated to providing exceptional customer service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and attended to. Their knowledge of the beverage menu, coupled with their attentiveness and professionalism, contributes significantly to the overall customer experience. The unwavering commitment to using high-quality ingredients and maintaining strict standards in preparation further elevates the bar above its competitors.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Lords Bar. Every aspect of the business is designed to create a positive and memorable encounter. From the moment a guest enters the premises, they are greeted with warmth and hospitality. The staff are proactive in anticipating customer needs and providing personalized recommendations. The bar strives to foster a sense of community by hosting regular events, such as live music performances or themed cocktail nights, which attract a diverse clientele and create a lively atmosphere. Feedback from customers is actively solicited and carefully considered, with adjustments made to the menu, service, or ambiance based on their suggestions. This responsiveness demonstrates a genuine commitment to customer satisfaction and continuous improvement.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Lords Bar connects with the local community in several meaningful ways. It actively supports local artists and musicians by providing them with a platform to showcase their talents. The bar also participates in local events and initiatives, demonstrating its commitment to social responsibility. By sourcing locally whenever possible, Lords Bar contributes to the economic well-being of the community and promotes sustainable practices. The bar\'s management actively engages with local organizations and businesses, building strong relationships and fostering a spirit of collaboration.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Lords Bar is one of continued growth and expansion. The business aims to solidify its position as the premier bar destination in Guwahati by consistently delivering exceptional experiences and exceeding customer expectations. Potential future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more innovative cocktails and culinary offerings, hosting larger-scale events, and exploring opportunities to partner with other local businesses. The long-term goal is to establish Lords Bar as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, sophistication, and community engagement. This may involve exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in the future, extending the reach of the Lords Bar experience to a wider audience. The business is committed to adapting to changing market trends and customer preferences, ensuring that it remains relevant and competitive in the long term. The ultimate ambition is to create a lasting legacy as a cornerstone of Guwahati\'s vibrant nightlife scene.</p>', '5QH2+7VG hotel nanadan, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:15:27', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1934, 'Beer Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p><strong>Beer Bar: A Refreshing Hub in the Heart of Assam</strong></p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant locality defined by the coordinates 4Q6W+2WX, Beer Bar stands as a welcoming beacon for beer enthusiasts and those seeking a relaxed social atmosphere. More than just a place to grab a drink, Beer Bar has quickly become a local favorite, known for its carefully curated selection, exceptional service, and commitment to fostering a sense of community. In the burgeoning business landscape of Assam, Beer Bar offers a unique proposition: a sophisticated yet approachable venue where tradition and modernity blend seamlessly, catering to a diverse clientele.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Curated Selection, Crafted Experience: Core Services and Products</strong></p>\n\n<p>At its heart, Beer Bar offers a diverse and thoughtfully curated selection of beers, catering to a wide range of palates. From locally brewed craft beers showcasing the flavors of Assam to internationally recognized favorites, the menu is designed to be both accessible and intriguing. The bar takes pride in supporting local breweries, contributing to the growth of the regional craft beer industry and offering patrons a taste of authentic Assam. Beyond beer, the menu includes a selection of complementary beverages, such as refreshing cocktails, premium spirits, and non-alcoholic options, ensuring there is something for everyone. To enhance the drinking experience, Beer Bar offers a carefully selected menu of snacks and appetizers, featuring both local delicacies and globally inspired dishes, designed to pair perfectly with the beer selection. What truly sets Beer Bar apart is the emphasis on education and exploration. Knowledgeable staff are always on hand to guide patrons through the menu, offer recommendations based on individual preferences, and share insights into the brewing process and flavor profiles of different beers. Regular tasting events and brewery collaborations further enrich the experience, creating a space where customers can discover new favorites and deepen their appreciation for the art of brewing. This commitment to quality and education differentiates Beer Bar from standard establishments, transforming it into a destination for discerning drinkers.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Customer-Centric Approach: Building Community One Pint at a Time</strong></p>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Beer Bar. The ambiance is designed to be both inviting and comfortable, with a focus on creating a relaxed and social atmosphere. The staff are trained to provide friendly, attentive, and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcome and valued. The aim is to build lasting relationships with customers, fostering a sense of loyalty and belonging. Beer Bar actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. This includes sponsoring local events, partnering with nearby businesses, and hosting community gatherings. The bar also embraces sustainable practices, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to the well-being of the local ecosystem. Regular live music performances showcasing local talent add to the vibrant atmosphere, creating a platform for artists and providing entertainment for patrons. By actively engaging with the community and prioritizing customer satisfaction, Beer Bar has established itself as more than just a business; it is a valued member of the neighborhood.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Looking Ahead: Growth and Long-Term Vision</strong></p>\n\n<p>Beer Bar envisions a future of continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading destination for beer lovers in Assam. Future plans include expanding the beer selection to include even more local and international brews, further enhancing the food menu with innovative and complementary dishes, and introducing new events and programs to engage the community. There is also potential for expanding the physical space to accommodate growing demand and create additional amenities for customers. The long-term goal is to establish Beer Bar as a recognized and respected brand, known for its quality, service, and commitment to the community. The business aims to be a catalyst for the growth of the local craft beer industry, supporting local breweries and promoting the region as a destination for beer tourism. By staying true to its core values and continuously innovating, Beer Bar is poised to achieve significant growth and make a lasting contribution to the local business landscape.</p>', '4Q6W+2WX', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:15:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1935, 'Twist Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Twist Bar: A Vibrant Hub in the Heart of Rukmini Nagar Path, Assam</p>\n\n<p>Located at 4QQR+2F7, Rukmini Nagar Path, Twist Bar is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for those seeking a refreshing and engaging social experience in Assam. More than just a bar, Twist Bar aims to be a community hub, offering a curated selection of beverages, a welcoming atmosphere, and a dedication to providing memorable experiences for its patrons. In a region where both traditional values and modern aspirations coexist, Twist Bar bridges the gap by offering a space that respects local culture while embracing contemporary trends in hospitality and entertainment. Twist Bar fills a crucial need for a sophisticated yet relaxed venue where individuals can unwind, connect, and enjoy quality time with friends and colleagues.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: Crafted Experiences for Every Palate</p>\n\n<p>At the heart of Twist Bar\'s offerings is a meticulously crafted beverage menu. We pride ourselves on providing a diverse selection to cater to a wide range of tastes. This includes a thoughtfully curated list of both classic and innovative cocktails, prepared by skilled mixologists using premium spirits and fresh ingredients. Alongside the cocktails, Twist Bar offers a variety of domestic and international beers, ensuring options for both the casual beer drinker and the discerning connoisseur. To complement the drinks, a carefully selected menu of appetizers and light bites is available. These culinary offerings are designed to be flavorful and shareable, enhancing the social atmosphere of the bar. What truly sets Twist Bar apart is its commitment to showcasing local flavors and ingredients whenever possible, integrating elements of Assamese cuisine into its offerings, thereby connecting with the community on a deeper level. We aim to be a destination that offers familiar favorites but also encourages guests to explore new and exciting taste experiences.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Building Community, One Visit at a Time</p>\n\n<p>The philosophy behind Twist Bar\'s customer service is rooted in genuine hospitality and a desire to create a welcoming and inclusive environment for everyone. Staff members are trained not only in the technical aspects of bartending and service but also in the art of creating genuine connections with guests. From the moment a customer walks through the door, they are greeted with a warm smile and attentive service. We understand that a positive customer experience extends beyond simply fulfilling orders; it\'s about anticipating needs, creating a comfortable atmosphere, and making each guest feel valued. To further enhance the customer experience, Twist Bar regularly hosts themed nights, live music performances, and other events designed to foster a sense of community and provide engaging entertainment. We actively seek feedback from our customers and are committed to continuously improving our services to better meet their needs and expectations. We strive to be known not only for our excellent drinks and food but also for our exceptional customer service and our dedication to creating a memorable and enjoyable experience for every guest.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons, Deepening Roots</p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Twist Bar envisions becoming a cornerstone of the Rukmini Nagar Path entertainment scene and a recognized brand throughout Assam. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu to incorporate more local ingredients and traditional Assamese flavors, further solidifying our connection to the community. We also plan to explore opportunities to partner with local artists and musicians, providing a platform for showcasing regional talent. Innovation is key to our future success. We will continue to experiment with new cocktail recipes, food pairings, and entertainment concepts to keep our offerings fresh and exciting. Furthermore, we aim to enhance our digital presence through social media engagement and online promotions, reaching a wider audience and building brand awareness. Sustainable practices are also a priority. We are committed to minimizing our environmental impact through responsible sourcing, waste reduction initiatives, and energy-efficient operations. Ultimately, Twist Bar aspires to be more than just a place to grab a drink; we want to be a place where people can connect, create memories, and experience the vibrant culture of Assam.</p>', '4QQR+2F7, Rukmini Nagar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:20:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1936, 'Maihang Restobar', 'Bars', '', 'Maihang Restobar: A Taste of Assam with a Modern Twist\n\nMaihang Restobar, strategically located on the 1st Floor of Beltola - Basistha Rd, is more than just a place to eat and drink; it\'s a vibrant destination that blends traditional Assamese flavors with a contemporary restobar experience. Situated in a bustling area of Guwahati, Maihang offers a welcoming atmosphere for locals and visitors alike, filling a crucial need for a sophisticated yet accessible dining and entertainment venue in the region. In the evolving Assam business landscape, Maihang Restobar distinguishes itself by offering a unique fusion of culinary heritage and modern hospitality, providing a refreshing alternative to the typical dining options.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt the heart of Maihang Restobar\'s offering is a carefully curated menu that showcases the rich culinary tapestry of Assam. From authentic Assamese thalis featuring local delicacies like *masor tenga* (sour fish curry) and *khar* (alkaline dish) to innovative fusion dishes that reimagine traditional ingredients in a modern context, the menu caters to a diverse palate. Beyond the food, Maihang boasts a well-stocked bar with a wide selection of local and international beverages, including signature cocktails crafted with regional fruits and spices. This combination of authentic Assamese cuisine and a sophisticated bar experience is a unique selling point, differentiating Maihang from its competitors. The restobar directly addresses the local market need for a place where people can enjoy delicious, authentic food and drinks in a stylish and comfortable setting.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Maihang Restobar. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warm Assamese hospitality and attentive service. The staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu and to provide personalized recommendations based on individual preferences. The ambiance is designed to be both inviting and sophisticated, with comfortable seating, tasteful décor, and carefully curated music. Maihang actively engages with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting cultural events, showcasing local artists, and sourcing ingredients from local farmers. By fostering a strong connection with the community, Maihang aims to be more than just a business; it aspires to be a valued member of the neighborhood. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and used to improve the overall dining and entertainment experience.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking towards the future, Maihang Restobar has ambitious plans for growth and expansion. The long-term vision is to establish Maihang as a recognized brand synonymous with quality Assamese cuisine and exceptional hospitality. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more regional delicacies, hosting themed nights and events to attract a wider audience, and potentially opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati and beyond. The business also intends to invest in employee training and development to ensure consistently high standards of service. By focusing on innovation, community engagement, and customer satisfaction, Maihang Restobar is poised to become a leading destination in the Assam dining and entertainment scene, celebrating and promoting the region\'s rich culinary heritage while providing a memorable experience for all who visit.', '1st Floor, Beltola - Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:20:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
