(1947, 'GUWAHATI BLUES [LOUNGE BAR]', 'Bars', '', '<p>GUWAHATI BLUES [LOUNGE BAR], nestled at 5Q5F+MRF, GS Rd, near Old Post Office, is a premier destination redefining the nightlife experience in Guwahati, Assam. More than just a lounge bar, it is a vibrant social hub that blends sophisticated ambiance with a distinctly local flavor. Offering a carefully curated selection of beverages, delectable cuisine, and live entertainment, GUWAHATI BLUES aims to be the preferred choice for residents and visitors seeking an unforgettable evening. In a region known for its rich cultural heritage and burgeoning urban scene, GUWAHATI BLUES stands out as a contemporary space where tradition meets modernity, fostering a sense of community and connection.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, GUWAHATI BLUES offers a comprehensive range of services designed to cater to diverse tastes and preferences. The bar boasts an extensive menu of premium spirits, classic cocktails, and locally inspired concoctions crafted by experienced mixologists. Complementing the beverage selection is a food menu featuring both international favorites and regional specialties, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. Live music performances are a regular feature, showcasing talented local artists across various genres, from soulful blues and jazz to contemporary pop and fusion. This dedication to providing high-quality entertainment elevates the lounge bar beyond a simple drinking establishment, transforming it into a dynamic performance venue. A key differentiator for GUWAHATI BLUES is its commitment to celebrating Assam\'s unique culinary and musical heritage, integrating local elements into its offerings to appeal to a discerning clientele seeking authentic experiences.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>GUWAHATI BLUES places a paramount emphasis on creating a memorable and enjoyable customer experience. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with a warm and inviting atmosphere, characterized by attentive service and personalized attention. The staff is trained to anticipate customer needs and provide recommendations based on individual preferences. The ambiance is carefully curated, blending comfortable seating arrangements, stylish décor, and subtle lighting to create a sophisticated yet relaxed environment. Regular customer feedback is actively solicited and incorporated into operational improvements, ensuring that GUWAHATI BLUES consistently meets and exceeds expectations. Beyond providing exceptional service, GUWAHATI BLUES actively engages with the local community through sponsorships, partnerships with local artists, and participation in community events. This commitment to social responsibility strengthens its connection with the surrounding area and reinforces its position as a valued member of the Guwahati business landscape.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for GUWAHATI BLUES is ambitious, focused on sustainable growth and continued innovation. Plans are underway to expand the menu offerings, incorporating more innovative culinary creations and catering to specific dietary needs and preferences. There is potential to host themed nights and special events that celebrate local culture and attract a wider audience. Exploring collaborations with other local businesses, such as breweries and distilleries, is also under consideration to further enhance the local flavor of the offerings. Long-term goals include establishing GUWAHATI BLUES as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, entertainment, and community engagement, potentially expanding to other locations within Assam and beyond. By remaining adaptable to evolving customer preferences and actively seeking opportunities for growth and improvement, GUWAHATI BLUES is poised to solidify its position as a leading entertainment destination in the region, contributing to the vibrancy and dynamism of Guwahati\'s nightlife scene.</p>', '5Q5F+MRF, GS Rd, near Old Post Office', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:30:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1948, 'DD bar and restaurant', 'Bars', '', 'DD Bar and Restaurant, strategically located at Ward No. 14, Sarma & Kalita Associate Building, Assam Trunk Rd, represents a modern and inviting establishment poised to become a cornerstone of the local culinary and social scene. We offer a blend of authentic regional flavors and contemporary dining experiences, designed to cater to a diverse clientele seeking quality, comfort, and a memorable outing. Positioned on a bustling thoroughfare, DD Bar and Restaurant aims to be more than just a place to eat and drink; it aspires to be a community hub, fostering connections and creating lasting memories. Our commitment to sourcing local ingredients, coupled with our attentive service and carefully curated ambiance, sets us apart within the competitive Assam hospitality sector.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nDD Bar and Restaurant’s core offerings encompass a full-service dining experience complemented by a well-stocked bar featuring both local and international beverages. Our menu is thoughtfully crafted to showcase the rich culinary heritage of Assam, incorporating traditional recipes and locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. Signature dishes include variations of *masor tenga*, and innovative takes on Assamese thalis, catering to both adventurous palates and those seeking familiar comfort food. Vegetarian options are prominently featured, acknowledging the diverse dietary preferences of the local population.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nThe bar offers a wide selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages, including locally brewed beers and spirits, as well as classic cocktails and international wines. We pride ourselves on using fresh ingredients and expert bartending techniques to deliver consistently high-quality drinks. Beyond the food and beverage offerings, DD Bar and Restaurant provides a unique selling point through its ambiance. The interior design blends modern aesthetics with traditional Assamese elements, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. Our spacious layout can accommodate both intimate gatherings and larger groups, making it an ideal venue for various occasions. Regular live music performances featuring local artists are planned to further enhance the customer experience and promote the region’s artistic talent.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt DD Bar and Restaurant, customer satisfaction is paramount. Our service philosophy centers on providing attentive, personalized, and friendly service to every guest. We actively solicit feedback to continuously improve our offerings and ensure we are meeting the evolving needs of our clientele. Staff training emphasizes not only product knowledge but also genuine hospitality and a commitment to exceeding expectations. Building strong relationships with the local community is a key priority. We participate in local events, sponsor community initiatives, and actively promote local producers and suppliers. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens our connection with the surrounding area. We aim to be more than just a business; we strive to be a valued member of the community, contributing to its vibrancy and economic well-being.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, DD Bar and Restaurant envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam hospitality market. Our long-term goals include establishing a reputation as a premier dining and entertainment destination, recognized for its quality, service, and community engagement. Future plans involve expanding the menu to incorporate seasonal specialties and introduce innovative culinary concepts. We are also exploring opportunities to offer catering services for local events and private functions.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe intend to leverage digital marketing strategies to reach a wider audience and enhance brand awareness. This includes developing a strong online presence through social media, online reviews, and targeted advertising campaigns. Furthermore, we are committed to investing in staff training and development to ensure our team remains at the forefront of industry best practices. Sustainability is also a key consideration in our future plans. We are exploring ways to reduce our environmental impact through responsible sourcing, waste reduction strategies, and energy-efficient practices.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nUltimately, DD Bar and Restaurant aims to become a sustainable and thriving business that contributes positively to the local economy and enhances the quality of life for the community we serve. We believe that our commitment to quality, service, community engagement, and innovation will position us for long-term success in the dynamic Assam hospitality landscape. We are confident that DD Bar and Restaurant will become a beloved gathering place for locals and visitors alike, offering a unique and memorable experience that reflects the rich culture and hospitality of Assam.', 'ward no .14, Sarma & Kalita associate building, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:30:25', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1949, 'Saki Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Saki Bar, situated at the convenient location of 5QJ2+65R on Assam Trunk Road, is a dynamic establishment dedicated to providing a premium beverage and social experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a bar, Saki Bar aims to be a vibrant hub, offering a curated selection of drinks and a welcoming atmosphere that reflects the spirit of the local community while introducing innovative concepts to the Assam nightlife scene.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Saki Bar stands out by blending traditional hospitality with modern trends. The bar caters to a diverse clientele, ranging from local residents seeking a familiar and friendly environment to travelers looking for an authentic Assam experience. Positioned on Assam Trunk Road, a major thoroughfare, Saki Bar benefits from high visibility and accessibility, making it a readily available choice for both planned evenings out and spontaneous gatherings. We believe that Saki Bar fills a niche in the local market by providing a sophisticated yet approachable venue, different from more traditional establishments, while still respecting and celebrating local culture. Its significance lies in offering a refined social space that elevates the overall experience for patrons.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Saki Bar’s offerings is a carefully selected range of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. The primary focus is on providing high-quality cocktails, crafted with fresh, locally sourced ingredients wherever possible. This commitment extends to offering a diverse selection of beers, including popular international brands and emerging craft beers from across India, alongside a carefully curated wine list catering to various tastes and preferences. Recognizing the increasing demand for sophisticated non-alcoholic options, Saki Bar boasts a menu of mocktails and artisanal soft drinks that are just as meticulously prepared as their alcoholic counterparts. A small selection of bar snacks and light meals is also available, designed to complement the drinks menu and provide satisfying culinary pairings.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What truly distinguishes Saki Bar is its commitment to quality and innovation. The cocktail menu features both classic recipes executed to perfection and original creations designed to showcase unique flavor combinations and the potential of local ingredients. We actively source spices, fruits, and other components from nearby farms and markets, supporting local producers and ensuring the freshness of our offerings. Furthermore, Saki Bar distinguishes itself with unique themed nights and events, ranging from live music performances showcasing local talent to special cocktail tasting sessions featuring guest bartenders. These events provide a dynamic and engaging experience that sets Saki Bar apart from its competitors.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Saki Bar. The staff is trained to provide attentive, friendly, and knowledgeable service, ensuring that every patron feels welcomed and valued. Bartenders are not only skilled mixologists but also engaging conversationalists, able to offer recommendations, share insights into the drink menu, and create a personalized experience for each guest. The ambiance of Saki Bar is carefully curated to be both stylish and inviting. The décor incorporates elements of modern design with subtle nods to Assamese culture, creating a space that is both sophisticated and comfortable. Lighting is carefully managed to create a relaxed and intimate atmosphere, while the music selection complements the overall mood.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Beyond providing exceptional service, Saki Bar actively strives to connect with the local community. We participate in local events and initiatives, partnering with community organizations to support causes that are important to the area. Saki Bar also aims to be a platform for local artists and musicians, providing them with a venue to showcase their talent and reach a wider audience. This commitment to community engagement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the connection between Saki Bar and the people it serves. We believe in creating a welcoming space where individuals can come together, celebrate life, and build lasting relationships.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking towards the future, Saki Bar envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam region. While maintaining its commitment to quality and community engagement, Saki Bar aims to introduce new services and offerings that cater to evolving consumer preferences. This may include expanding the food menu to offer more substantial meal options, developing a loyalty program to reward repeat customers, or exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other parts of Assam. A key focus for the future is on sustainable practices. Saki Bar is committed to minimizing its environmental impact by implementing measures such as reducing waste, conserving energy, and sourcing ingredients from sustainable suppliers. By embracing sustainability, Saki Bar aims to be a responsible and ethical business that contributes to the well-being of the community and the environment.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Ultimately, Saki Bar\'s long-term goal is to become a leading destination for socializing and entertainment in Assam, recognized for its commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We aspire to be more than just a bar; we strive to be a cherished part of the local community, a place where people can gather, celebrate, and create lasting memories. By staying true to its core values and continually adapting to meet the needs of its customers, Saki Bar is poised for continued success and a bright future in the Assam business landscape.</p>', '5QJ2+65R, Assam Trunk Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:30:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1950, 'Flames Lounge', 'Bars', '', '<p>Flames Lounge: A Premium Destination Above the Hustle of Guwahati</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Nestled on the 2nd Floor of J K Tower, above Axis Bank on Dr BK Kakati Rd, Flames Lounge offers a sophisticated and inviting escape from the vibrant energy of Guwahati. More than just a lounge, it’s a carefully curated experience designed to cater to discerning individuals seeking a relaxed yet refined atmosphere. Strategically located in a bustling commercial hub, Flames Lounge fills a vital niche by providing a premium destination for professionals, residents, and visitors alike to unwind, connect, and enjoy quality entertainment and hospitality.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Flames Lounge lies a commitment to providing exceptional service and high-quality offerings. The lounge\'s core services center around creating a memorable experience through a combination of expertly crafted beverages, delectable culinary creations, and a meticulously designed ambiance. Our extensive bar menu features classic cocktails, innovative mixes, and a curated selection of premium spirits, wines, and beers to satisfy every palate. Complementing the beverage selection is a thoughtfully designed food menu offering a range of appetizers, small plates, and main courses, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This dedication to quality distinguishes Flames Lounge within the local hospitality scene, offering a level of sophistication and refinement often sought but rarely consistently delivered.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>What truly sets Flames Lounge apart is its unwavering commitment to crafting a unique and unforgettable atmosphere. The interior design is both contemporary and comfortable, creating a welcoming space for socializing and relaxation. Carefully considered lighting, comfortable seating arrangements, and curated music playlists contribute to an ambiance that is both sophisticated and inviting. We understand the importance of creating a space that caters to various needs, whether it\'s a quiet corner for a business meeting, a comfortable lounge area for socializing with friends, or a vibrant space to enjoy live music or entertainment. To this end, Flames Lounge regularly hosts live music performances featuring local artists, themed nights, and special events designed to enhance the overall experience and foster a sense of community. These events cater to diverse tastes and preferences, ensuring there’s always something new and exciting happening at Flames Lounge.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Flames Lounge. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warm hospitality and attentive service. The staff is highly trained and dedicated to ensuring that every guest feels valued and taken care of. We believe in anticipating needs and exceeding expectations, paying close attention to detail to create a seamless and enjoyable experience. Feedback is actively encouraged and used to continually improve our offerings and service standards. Building strong relationships with our customers is a priority, and we strive to create a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels comfortable and respected. By focusing on personalized attention and genuine care, Flames Lounge has fostered a loyal customer base and a strong reputation within the local community.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Flames Lounge is deeply connected to the local community and actively participates in local initiatives whenever possible. We believe in supporting local businesses and talent, showcasing local artists and musicians, and sourcing ingredients from local suppliers. This commitment to community engagement not only strengthens our relationships with local stakeholders but also contributes to the overall vibrancy and prosperity of the Guwahati business landscape. We see ourselves as more than just a lounge; we are a part of the fabric of the community, committed to making a positive impact.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, Flames Lounge envisions continued growth and expansion within the Assam hospitality market. Our long-term goals include enhancing our service offerings, expanding our culinary and beverage menus, and introducing innovative entertainment concepts to further elevate the customer experience. We are constantly exploring new ways to cater to the evolving needs and preferences of our target audience, embracing innovation and creativity to stay ahead of the curve. We also plan to explore opportunities to expand our presence to other strategic locations within Assam, bringing the Flames Lounge experience to a wider audience. Our commitment to excellence, combined with a strong focus on customer satisfaction and community engagement, positions Flames Lounge for continued success and growth in the years to come.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>In conclusion, Flames Lounge is more than just a place to grab a drink; it’s a destination. It is a place where discerning individuals can come to relax, connect, and enjoy a premium hospitality experience. With its prime location, exceptional service, sophisticated ambiance, and commitment to community, Flames Lounge is poised to remain a prominent and valued fixture in the Guwahati business and social scene for many years to come.</p>', '2nd Floor, J K Tower, Dr BK Kakati Rd, above Axis Bank', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:35:08', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1951, 'Garage Cafe', 'Bars', '', 'Garage Cafe: Fueling Connections and Creativity in Guwahati\n\nGarage Cafe, nestled on the 3rd Floor of Central Mall on GS Road, is more than just a place to grab a coffee or a bite to eat; it\'s a vibrant hub designed to foster connections, creativity, and a sense of community within Guwahati\'s bustling landscape. Positioned strategically within a popular shopping destination, Garage Cafe offers a unique respite from the retail hustle, providing a welcoming atmosphere for shoppers, professionals, students, and anyone seeking a distinctive cafe experience. It stands out in the local Assam business landscape by blending a relaxed, industrial-chic aesthetic with a commitment to quality, local sourcing, and a dynamic event calendar.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nGarage Cafe’s core offering centers around a carefully curated menu of coffee, beverages, and food items, all designed to appeal to a diverse clientele. The coffee selection features both classic preparations and innovative specialty drinks, utilizing locally sourced coffee beans whenever possible to support Assam\'s rich coffee heritage and provide customers with an authentic taste of the region. Complementing the coffee is a range of teas, juices, and refreshing beverages catering to various preferences. The food menu balances familiar favorites with unique creations, from light snacks and sandwiches to more substantial meals, with vegetarian and vegan options readily available. A unique selling point is the cafe\'s commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients in many of its dishes, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring a high standard of quality and flavor. Furthermore, Garage Cafe distinguishes itself by regularly hosting themed events, workshops, and live music performances, transforming the cafe into a dynamic space for cultural exchange and artistic expression. These events, coupled with the comfortable and inviting atmosphere, address the local market\'s need for more than just a place to eat; they offer an experience, a connection, and a sense of belonging.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Garage Cafe. The staff is trained not only to provide efficient and friendly service but also to cultivate genuine connections with customers, remembering regulars\' orders and engaging in meaningful conversations. The cafe\'s design contributes significantly to the overall experience, featuring comfortable seating arrangements, ample natural light, and a carefully selected soundtrack that creates a relaxing and inspiring ambiance. Beyond the physical space, Garage Cafe leverages social media to engage with its community, sharing updates about menu items, upcoming events, and special promotions. The cafe also actively partners with local artists and artisans, showcasing their work on the cafe walls and offering a platform to promote their talent. These initiatives not only enhance the aesthetic appeal of the cafe but also demonstrate a commitment to supporting the local arts scene and fostering a sense of community pride. By prioritizing personal interactions, creating a welcoming environment, and actively engaging with the local community, Garage Cafe strives to be more than just a business; it aims to be a gathering place, a creative outlet, and a vital part of the Guwahati social fabric.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Garage Cafe envisions expanding its role as a leading community hub in Guwahati. Future plans include extending the menu to incorporate more regional Assamese cuisine, showcasing the diverse culinary heritage of the state. The cafe also plans to increase its collaborations with local businesses and organizations, hosting workshops, seminars, and networking events that cater to the needs of the local business community. Another key area of focus is sustainability. Garage Cafe aims to implement more eco-friendly practices, such as reducing waste, using biodegradable packaging, and sourcing ingredients from sustainable farms. Furthermore, there are plans to explore opening additional locations in other parts of Guwahati, bringing the unique Garage Cafe experience to a wider audience. The long-term goal is to establish Garage Cafe as a recognizable and respected brand, synonymous with quality, community, and a commitment to supporting the local economy and culture. Ultimately, Garage Cafe aspires to be a place where people can connect, create, and feel inspired, contributing to the vibrancy and dynamism of Guwahati\'s social and economic landscape.', '3rd Floor, Central Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:35:15', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1952, 'Dine Way Platz', 'Bars', '', '<p>Dine Way Platz, strategically located along the bustling Guwahati Shillong Rd, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier dining destination in the region. More than just a restaurant, Dine Way Platz represents a commitment to providing a multifaceted culinary experience that caters to the diverse tastes and preferences of the local community and travelers alike. Nestled amidst the vibrant energy of Assam, Dine Way Platz distinguishes itself through its dedication to quality ingredients, innovative menu options, and an unwavering focus on creating a welcoming and memorable atmosphere for every guest. We aim to be a landmark destination, synonymous with exceptional food and unparalleled service in the Guwahati area.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings revolve around delivering a superior dining experience centered on both traditional Assamese cuisine and popular continental favorites. We offer an extensive menu designed to tantalize taste buds, featuring locally sourced ingredients that capture the authentic flavors of the region. Signature dishes highlight the richness of Assamese culinary traditions, showcasing innovative preparations of local fish, meats, and vegetables. Furthermore, we understand the diverse palates of our clientele, which is why our menu also includes carefully curated continental options, ranging from classic pasta dishes to hearty grilled entrees. Beyond the main menu, Dine Way Platz features a vibrant café area, serving freshly brewed coffee, artisanal teas, and a selection of delectable pastries and desserts. Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to culinary creativity, blending traditional recipes with modern techniques to produce a truly exceptional dining experience. We strive to be more than just a place to eat; we aim to be a culinary ambassador, showcasing the best of Assam\'s food culture while also embracing international flavors. This approach effectively caters to the diverse market needs, satisfying both those seeking an authentic local experience and those craving familiar international dishes. Special dietary requirements are thoughtfully considered, with vegetarian, vegan, and gluten-free options available.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At Dine Way Platz, customer experience is paramount. We believe in creating an environment that fosters genuine connection and lasting memories. Our approach to customer service is built on the principles of attentiveness, efficiency, and personalized care. From the moment a guest walks through our doors, they are greeted with warmth and hospitality. Our staff is meticulously trained to provide exceptional service, anticipating customer needs and exceeding expectations. We actively solicit feedback through various channels, ensuring that we continuously improve and refine our services. What truly sets Dine Way Platz apart is our commitment to engaging with the local community. We regularly host events that celebrate Assamese culture, such as traditional music performances and art exhibitions. We also actively participate in local initiatives, supporting community organizations and partnering with local farmers and producers to source our ingredients. This dedication to community involvement fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens our ties with the people we serve. We strive to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a valued member of the Guwahati community, contributing to its vibrancy and prosperity.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Dine Way Platz is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and expansion. We envision becoming a recognized leader in the Assam hospitality sector, known for our commitment to culinary excellence, exceptional service, and community engagement. Our plans include expanding our menu offerings, introducing new and innovative dishes that showcase the region\'s culinary diversity. We are also exploring opportunities to expand our physical presence, potentially opening additional locations in key areas throughout Assam. We aim to implement sustainable practices throughout our operations, minimizing our environmental impact and contributing to a greener future. Furthermore, we plan to invest in employee training and development, empowering our team to provide the highest level of service and advance their careers within the company. Our long-term goals include establishing Dine Way Platz as a destination for culinary tourism, attracting visitors from across the globe who are eager to experience the authentic flavors of Assam. We believe that by staying true to our core values and continuously innovating, we can achieve our ambitious goals and solidify our position as a premier dining destination in the region. Ultimately, we aim to create a lasting legacy, one that celebrates the rich culinary heritage of Assam and contributes to the economic and social well-being of the local community.</p>', 'Guwahati Shillong Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:35:20', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1953, 'The Locals', 'Bars', '', '<p><b>The Locals: A Gateway to Authentic Assamese Experiences</b></p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the heart of the vibrant city, at Swagota Enivission, HDFC Home Loan building, next to Hotel Lily, The Locals stands as a beacon of authentic Assamese culture and craftsmanship. More than just a business, The Locals is a curated experience designed to connect visitors and residents alike with the rich heritage, unique artistry, and unparalleled hospitality of Assam. In a region known for its natural beauty and distinct cultural identity, The Locals provides a platform for local artisans, producers, and entrepreneurs to showcase their talents and products, contributing to the sustainable growth of the local economy and preserving the essence of Assamese tradition. We aim to bridge the gap between the exceptional skills within Assam and a wider audience, fostering appreciation and patronage of genuine local creations.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p><b>Core Services and Products: A Celebration of Assam</b></p>\n\n<p>The Locals offers a diverse array of services and products, all carefully selected to represent the best of Assam. Our core offerings include:</p>\n<br> <br>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Handloom and Handicrafts:</b> We feature an exquisite collection of handwoven textiles, including the famed Muga silk, Eri silk, and Pat silk, alongside traditional Assamese jewelry, bamboo crafts, and pottery. Each piece tells a story of generations of skilled artisans, using techniques passed down through families and reflecting the unique cultural identity of different tribes and communities. Unlike mass-produced alternatives, our handloom and handicraft products are characterized by their exceptional quality, intricate designs, and sustainable production practices.</li>\n<br> <br>\n<li><b>Local Food Products:</b> We curate a range of authentic Assamese food products, from traditional pickles and spices to locally grown teas and organic honey. These products offer a taste of Assam\'s culinary heritage, using locally sourced ingredients and traditional recipes. Our emphasis is on supporting local farmers and producers who prioritize sustainable agriculture and ethical practices. Patrons can be assured of freshness and authenticity, experiencing the true flavors of the region.</li>\n<br> <br>\n<li><b>Cultural Experiences:</b> Beyond products, The Locals offers curated cultural experiences, including traditional dance performances, cooking workshops, and guided tours of local villages and tea gardens. These experiences provide an immersive glimpse into the daily lives and cultural traditions of the Assamese people. Our aim is to promote cultural understanding and appreciation, while supporting local communities through responsible tourism.</li>\n<br> <br>\n<li><b>Custom Gift Curation:</b> We specialize in creating bespoke gift hampers and personalized products, tailored to individual preferences and occasions. This service is particularly popular for corporate gifting and special events, allowing customers to showcase the best of Assam to clients, employees, or guests.</li>\n</ul>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Our unique selling point lies in our commitment to authenticity, sustainability, and community empowerment. We prioritize sourcing directly from local artisans and producers, ensuring fair prices and supporting their livelihoods. Our products are not just commodities; they are cultural artifacts that embody the spirit and creativity of Assam. By choosing The Locals, customers are not just buying a product or service; they are investing in the preservation of a rich cultural heritage and the sustainable development of a vibrant local economy.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p><b>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Fostering Community</b></p>\n\n<p>At The Locals, we believe that customer service is about more than just transactions; it\'s about building relationships and fostering a sense of community. Our staff is knowledgeable about the products and services we offer, and passionate about sharing their knowledge with customers. We strive to create a welcoming and informative environment where customers can learn about Assamese culture, discover unique products, and connect with local artisans and producers. We provide personalized recommendations, tailored to individual needs and preferences, ensuring that every customer has a memorable and enriching experience. Regular workshops featuring local artisans performing and selling their craft fosters connection with the community. <br> <br>\nWe actively engage with the local community through partnerships with local organizations and participation in cultural events. We aim to be more than just a business; we aspire to be a cultural hub where people can come together to celebrate and appreciate the rich heritage of Assam. Our location, next to Hotel Lily and within the HDFC Home Loan building, provides easy access and visibility, making us a convenient destination for both tourists and residents. By fostering strong relationships with our customers and the local community, we aim to build a loyal customer base and establish The Locals as a trusted brand that represents the best of Assam.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p><b>Future Vision: Growing Sustainably and Preserving Heritage</b></p>\n\n<p>The Locals envisions becoming the leading platform for promoting Assamese culture and craftsmanship, both locally and globally. Our future plans include expanding our product range to include more diverse offerings from across Assam, such as traditional musical instruments, indigenous art forms, and local literature. We aim to establish an online presence to reach a wider audience and facilitate online sales, while continuing to prioritize ethical and sustainable practices. Exploring opportunities to partner with tourism agencies to showcase the cultural heritage of Assam will also be a focus.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>We are committed to fostering sustainable growth by supporting local artisans and producers, promoting fair trade practices, and investing in community development initiatives. Our long-term goal is to create a positive impact on the local economy and contribute to the preservation of Assamese culture for generations to come. By remaining true to our core values of authenticity, sustainability, and community empowerment, The Locals aspires to be a catalyst for positive change and a beacon of hope for the future of Assam.</p>', 'Swagota Enivission, HDFC Home Loan building, next to Hotel Lily', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:35:28', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1954, 'Midnight bar cum restaurant', 'Bars', '', '<p>Midnight Bar cum Restaurant: A Culinary and Entertainment Destination in Lalganesh</p>\n\n<p>Nestled in the vibrant locality of Lalganesh, Ganeshpally, along Lokhra Rd, Midnight Bar cum Restaurant is a sophisticated establishment redefining the local dining and entertainment experience. More than just a restaurant or a bar, Midnight offers a unique fusion of culinary artistry, expertly crafted cocktails, and a lively atmosphere, making it a premier destination for residents and visitors alike. Positioned strategically within a growing residential and commercial area, Midnight caters to a diverse clientele seeking a refined yet relaxed environment. It stands out within the Assam business landscape by providing a seamless transition from a fine dining experience to a vibrant nightlife venue, eliminating the need to choose between quality food and engaging entertainment. This hybrid model addresses the increasing demand for multifaceted venues that cater to diverse preferences under one roof.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Midnight Bar cum Restaurant provides a comprehensive range of services, centered around exceptional food, expertly prepared beverages, and a memorable ambience. At its core, the restaurant offers a diverse menu featuring both traditional Assamese cuisine and popular continental dishes. The culinary team focuses on utilizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring authentic flavors and supporting local farmers and producers. This commitment to local sourcing resonates with customers who value sustainability and regional specialties. Beyond the food, the bar boasts an extensive selection of premium spirits, wines, beers, and signature cocktails. The mixologists are trained to create both classic drinks and innovative concoctions, catering to a wide range of palates. Regular specials and themed nights keep the beverage offerings fresh and exciting. Unique selling points include live music performances by local artists, creating a dynamic and engaging atmosphere. Additionally, the restaurant offers private dining options for special occasions, catering to both small and large groups. These services directly meet the local market needs by providing a high-quality dining and entertainment option that\'s currently underserved in the Lalganesh area. The combination of excellent food, curated drinks, and live entertainment fills a niche, making Midnight a sought-after destination.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Midnight Bar cum Restaurant. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. From the moment a customer enters, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism. The team strives to anticipate needs and exceed expectations, creating a memorable and enjoyable dining experience. What sets Midnight apart is its commitment to creating a strong connection with the local community. The restaurant actively participates in local events and sponsors community initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and goodwill. Regular customer feedback is encouraged and used to continuously improve service and offerings. The management team understands the importance of building relationships with its patrons, turning first-time visitors into loyal regulars. By creating a welcoming and inclusive environment, Midnight has cultivated a strong sense of community, making it more than just a place to eat and drink; it\'s a gathering spot for friends and neighbors.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Midnight Bar cum Restaurant is ambitious and focused on sustainable growth and continued community engagement. Expansion plans include potentially adding outdoor seating to enhance the dining experience during favorable weather, capitalizing on the growing popularity of al fresco dining. There are also plans to diversify the menu, incorporating seasonal dishes and catering to specific dietary requirements, such as vegetarian and vegan options. Another key objective is to further develop the entertainment offerings, potentially introducing themed nights, DJ sets, and other live performances to attract a wider audience. Long-term goals include establishing Midnight as a recognized brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community spirit. The business aims to become a leading destination in the greater Guwahati area, known for its exceptional food, curated drinks, and vibrant atmosphere. Through continuous improvement, strategic partnerships, and a unwavering commitment to customer satisfaction, Midnight Bar cum Restaurant is poised to achieve significant growth and become an integral part of the local community for years to come.</p>', 'Lalganesh , Ganeshpally, Lokhra Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:35:34', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1955, 'Shanghai Salsa', 'Bars', '', '<p>Shanghai Salsa, nestled in the heart of Guwahati at 1st House, Leelamoni Medicos, 37, Ambikagiri Nagar Path, is a vibrant culinary venture bringing a unique fusion of Asian flavors to the Assam food scene. More than just a restaurant, Shanghai Salsa aims to be a cultural bridge, offering an accessible and exciting gastronomic experience that resonates with the local palate while introducing new and intriguing tastes.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>In a region known for its rich culinary heritage, Shanghai Salsa distinguishes itself by blending authentic Shanghai-style cooking techniques with the bold, spicy flavors characteristic of salsa and other Latin American cuisines. This unconventional yet surprisingly harmonious combination creates a dining experience that is both familiar and refreshingly novel. We source locally whenever possible, supporting Assam farmers and ensuring the freshest ingredients are used in our dishes. This commitment to local sourcing helps us connect with the community and offer meals made with regional pride.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Our core offerings revolve around a curated menu showcasing this fusion cuisine. Signature dishes include the \"Szechuan Salsa Chicken,\" a crispy fried chicken marinated in a traditional Szechuan peppercorn sauce and served with a tangy, homemade salsa; and \"Shanghai Noodles with Chipotle Shrimp,\" wok-fried noodles tossed with succulent shrimp and a smoky chipotle pepper sauce. Vegetarian options are also prominent, featuring dishes like \"Mapo Tofu Empanadas,\" a playful twist on the classic Mapo Tofu filling encased in a crispy empanada pastry and served with a side of cilantro-lime dipping sauce. In addition to the main courses, we offer a selection of innovative appetizers, desserts, and beverages, including Asian-inspired cocktails and traditional Assam tea, all designed to complement the bold flavors of our dishes.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The unique selling proposition of Shanghai Salsa lies in its ability to deliver a high-quality, flavorful experience that is both approachable and adventurous. We avoid relying on overly complicated or inaccessible ingredients, instead focusing on creating bold and satisfying dishes that appeal to a broad range of tastes. The combination of familiar Asian cooking styles with the zest of Latin American spices fills a noticeable gap in the local market, offering an alternative to the standard Indian, Chinese, and Continental fare typically found in Guwahati. By offering a unique menu, we cater to the adventurous eater and those looking for something new and flavorful.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Shanghai Salsa. From the moment guests enter our doors, they are greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. Our staff is trained to be knowledgeable about the menu, offering recommendations and answering questions with enthusiasm. We are committed to providing attentive and personalized service, ensuring that each guest feels valued and cared for. The restaurant\'s ambiance is designed to be both modern and inviting, creating a comfortable setting for diners to relax and enjoy their meals. Regular customer feedback is actively sought through comment cards and online surveys, allowing us to continuously improve our offerings and services.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Beyond providing excellent food and service, Shanghai Salsa actively engages with the local community. We participate in local events and festivals, showcasing our cuisine and supporting community initiatives. We have plans for cooking workshops that will be held to teach interested locals to create interesting fusion meals in their own kitchens. We also partner with local farmers and suppliers, contributing to the economic well-being of the region. By fostering strong relationships with our customers and the community, we aim to become an integral part of the Guwahati food scene, a place where people can come together to enjoy delicious food and celebrate the rich cultural diversity of Assam.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Shanghai Salsa envisions significant growth potential. Our long-term goals include expanding our menu, introducing new and exciting dishes that continue to push the boundaries of fusion cuisine. We are also exploring the possibility of opening additional locations in other parts of Assam and beyond, bringing our unique culinary experience to a wider audience. Furthermore, we plan to develop a catering service, providing our signature dishes for private events and corporate functions. Ultimately, Shanghai Salsa strives to be recognized as a leading culinary destination in the region, known for its innovative cuisine, exceptional service, and commitment to the community. We aspire to be more than just a restaurant, but a culinary and cultural landmark that enriches the lives of those we serve.</p>', '1st House, Leelamoni Medicos, 37, Ambikagiri Nagar Path', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:40:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
