(1966, 'Capital Liquor Restro Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Capital Liquor Restro Bar, strategically located on Maniram Dewan Rd, near Quick Wash Laundry, is rapidly becoming a cornerstone of Guwahati’s vibrant social scene. More than just a place to enjoy a drink, Capital Liquor Restro Bar offers a curated experience that blends the warmth of Assamese hospitality with a modern, sophisticated ambiance. In a market increasingly seeking both quality and connection, the establishment distinguishes itself by fostering a welcoming atmosphere where patrons can unwind, connect, and create memorable moments. Its significance lies in providing a premium yet accessible social hub, filling a niche for discerning individuals seeking a refined alternative to conventional bars and restaurants in the area.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>At the heart of Capital Liquor Restro Bar is a commitment to delivering an exceptional range of beverages and delectable food options. The bar boasts an extensive selection of premium spirits, carefully curated wines, and a diverse array of local and international beers, catering to a wide range of palates. Beyond the drinks, the restro bar\'s kitchen offers a tempting menu of appetizers, entrees, and desserts, each thoughtfully prepared using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. A signature offering is their innovative cocktail menu, blending classic concoctions with contemporary twists, reflecting both global trends and regional preferences. The unique selling point is the dedication to quality across all offerings, coupled with a focus on providing value for money. Capital Liquor Restro Bar addresses the local market\'s need for a sophisticated yet affordable dining and drinking experience, filling the gap between high-end luxury establishments and more basic local options.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at Capital Liquor Restro Bar. The team understands that a visit is not just about the food and drinks, but about the overall ambiance and interaction. The staff are trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, ensuring that every guest feels welcomed and valued. The bar\'s design incorporates comfortable seating, subtle lighting, and carefully selected music, creating a relaxed and inviting environment. What truly sets Capital Liquor Restro Bar apart is its connection with the local community. The establishment actively participates in local events and initiatives, fostering a sense of belonging and demonstrating a genuine commitment to the area. Regular themed nights, live music performances featuring local artists, and special promotions tailored to the needs and preferences of the surrounding community further strengthen this bond, transforming the bar into more than just a business, but a true community hub.</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Capital Liquor Restro Bar is one of continued growth and innovation. The business aims to expand its offerings while maintaining its commitment to quality and customer satisfaction. Future plans include introducing a wider selection of craft beers and locally sourced spirits, further developing the food menu to incorporate more regional delicacies, and expanding the entertainment offerings to include more live music and cultural events. The long-term goal is to establish Capital Liquor Restro Bar as a premier destination in Guwahati, recognized for its exceptional service, unique ambiance, and unwavering commitment to the local community. This includes exploring opportunities to expand to other strategic locations within the region, replicating the successful model while adapting to the unique characteristics of each new market. The business also intends to invest in employee training and development, ensuring that the team continues to provide the highest level of service and maintain the exceptional standards that have become synonymous with the Capital Liquor Restro Bar brand.</p>', 'Maniram Dewan Rd, near Quick Wash Laundry', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:50:12', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1967, 'Club Madiza', 'Bars', '', '<p>Club Madiza, strategically located on Dr BK Kakati Rd in the heart of [City Name, if known - otherwise omit], is more than just a business; it\'s a vibrant community hub offering a unique blend of services and experiences designed to cater to the diverse needs and evolving lifestyles of the Assam community.  We strive to be a place where people connect, create, and thrive, contributing positively to the local economy and cultural landscape. Our approach is rooted in understanding the distinct preferences of our local clientele, delivering tailored solutions that resonate with their aspirations and values. We are committed to building lasting relationships with our customers and stakeholders, establishing Club Madiza as a trusted and integral part of the neighborhood.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, Club Madiza offers a carefully curated selection of services and products designed to enrich the lives of our customers. Our offerings fall primarily into the categories of [Mention 2-3 main service/product categories, e.g.,  events & entertainment, lifestyle retail, or co-working space].  Our event and entertainment offerings focus on providing engaging and culturally relevant experiences, hosting live music performances featuring local artists, thematic workshops centered around Assamese traditions, and providing a stylish venue for private functions and celebrations. This focus sets us apart by fostering a sense of community and cultural pride.  For those seeking lifestyle retail options, we offer a selection of handcrafted goods, local artisanal products, and curated items that reflect the unique aesthetic and craftsmanship of the region. This provides a platform for local artisans and small businesses to showcase their talent and reach a wider audience. Furthermore, for professionals and entrepreneurs, we provide flexible co-working spaces, equipped with modern amenities and designed to foster collaboration and productivity. These spaces are designed to meet the needs of freelancers, startups, and remote workers seeking a supportive and stimulating work environment.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>What truly distinguishes Club Madiza is our unwavering commitment to providing an exceptional customer experience.  We understand that our success hinges on building strong relationships with our customers, and we achieve this through personalized service, attention to detail, and a genuine desire to exceed expectations. Our staff are not just employees; they are ambassadors of our brand, trained to anticipate customer needs and provide helpful and friendly assistance. We actively solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our offerings and ensure that we are meeting their evolving needs. We believe in fostering a welcoming and inclusive environment where everyone feels valued and respected. Our connection with the local community extends beyond our immediate customer base. We actively participate in local events, sponsor community initiatives, and partner with local organizations to support worthwhile causes. This community engagement reinforces our commitment to being a responsible and contributing member of the Assam business landscape.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking to the future, Club Madiza envisions a significant expansion of its reach and impact within the region. Our immediate plans involve [mention 1-2 specific, achievable near-term goals, e.g., expanding our online presence, introducing new service offerings, or hosting a major community event]. We are also exploring opportunities to forge strategic partnerships with other local businesses and organizations to create synergistic relationships that benefit the entire community. In the long term, we aim to become a leading destination for [reiterate the business\'s core focus and aspiration, e.g.,  cultural events, unique retail experiences, or innovative co-working solutions] in Assam, recognized for our commitment to quality, innovation, and community engagement. We are dedicated to remaining adaptive and responsive to the changing needs of our customers and the evolving dynamics of the market. By continuously innovating and refining our offerings, we are confident that Club Madiza will continue to thrive and make a positive contribution to the local economy and cultural landscape for years to come.</p>', 'Dr BK Kakati Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:50:17', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1968, 'Paplu Room', 'Bars', '', 'Paplu Room: A Hub of Innovation and Collaboration in Guwahati\n\nPaplu Room, located on the 2nd Floor of Uphar Market along the bustling Guwahati Shillong Road, is rapidly establishing itself as a dynamic hub for entrepreneurs, freelancers, and small businesses in Guwahati and the surrounding Assam region. More than just a co-working space, Paplu Room fosters a vibrant community where ideas are shared, collaborations are forged, and businesses thrive. We understand the unique challenges and opportunities presented by the local business environment, and our mission is to provide a supportive and stimulating ecosystem that empowers our members to reach their full potential. Paplu Room contributes to the growing entrepreneurial spirit of Assam by providing essential resources and cultivating a collaborative network. <br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Paplu Room offers flexible and affordable workspace solutions catering to a diverse range of needs. These include:\n\n*   **Dedicated Desks:** Providing a stable and personalized workspace for individuals seeking a consistent and productive environment. Each dedicated desk comes with ergonomic seating, ample power outlets, and secure storage options.\n\n*   **Hot Desks:** Ideal for freelancers, remote workers, and those who require a flexible workspace on an ad-hoc basis. Hot desks offer a cost-effective solution with access to all common amenities.\n\n*   **Private Offices:** Fully furnished and equipped private offices designed to accommodate small teams and startups. These offices offer privacy, security, and a professional environment for client meetings and focused work.\n\n*   **Meeting Rooms:** Well-equipped meeting rooms available for hourly or daily rentals, perfect for presentations, workshops, team meetings, and client consultations. These rooms are equipped with presentation technology, whiteboards, and comfortable seating.\n\nOur unique selling point lies in our commitment to fostering a strong sense of community. We regularly host networking events, workshops, and seminars featuring local experts and industry leaders. This provides our members with valuable opportunities to connect with potential collaborators, learn new skills, and gain insights into the local market. Unlike generic co-working spaces, Paplu Room actively curates its community to ensure a diverse mix of talents and perspectives, creating a truly enriching and collaborative environment. Our high-speed internet, printing and scanning facilities, and complimentary beverages further enhance the overall workspace experience. <br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at Paplu Room. We strive to create a welcoming and supportive atmosphere where every member feels valued and empowered. Our dedicated community managers are always on hand to assist with any needs, from technical support to networking introductions. We believe in building strong relationships with our members, understanding their individual goals, and providing tailored support to help them succeed. We actively solicit feedback from our members to continuously improve our services and ensure we are meeting their evolving needs. Our connection with the local community extends beyond our membership base. We partner with local businesses and organizations to host events that benefit the wider community, fostering a spirit of collaboration and mutual support. We believe in giving back to the community that has welcomed us and are committed to playing a positive role in its economic development. Our online presence is actively maintained to foster interaction and engagement within our community. <br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Paplu Room envisions becoming the leading hub for innovation and entrepreneurship in Guwahati and Northeast India. Our future plans include expanding our physical space to accommodate growing demand and introducing new services tailored to the specific needs of our members. We are exploring partnerships with venture capitalists and angel investors to provide our members with access to funding opportunities. We are also developing mentorship programs that connect experienced entrepreneurs with aspiring startups, providing valuable guidance and support. In the long term, we aspire to create a vibrant ecosystem that not only supports the growth of individual businesses but also contributes to the overall economic development of the region. This includes fostering innovation, attracting talent, and creating jobs. We aim to be a catalyst for positive change and contribute to a brighter future for Assam and Northeast India. By continuing to focus on community building, exceptional customer service, and innovative programming, Paplu Room is poised to make a significant and lasting impact on the local business landscape.', '2nd Floor, Uphar Market, Guwahati Shillong Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:50:24', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1969, 'Ivory Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Ivory Bar: A Refined Hospitality Experience in the Heart of Solapara, Assam</p>\n\n<p>Located on the 1st floor of Solapara Road, opposite Capital Travels, Ivory Bar offers a sophisticated and welcoming haven for those seeking a premium hospitality experience in Guwahati. More than just a bar, Ivory Bar is envisioned as a destination where impeccable service, a carefully curated ambiance, and a diverse selection of beverages and light fare converge to create memorable moments for locals and travelers alike. In a region increasingly appreciating refined leisure and social experiences, Ivory Bar aims to set a new standard for quality and personalized service within the Assam business landscape. Situated in a prominent location known for its accessibility and vibrant atmosphere, Ivory Bar contributes to the area\'s appeal as a hub for both business and leisure.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Core Services and Products: A Symphony of Flavors and Experiences</p>\n\n<p>At the heart of Ivory Bar\'s offerings is a meticulously crafted beverage menu, featuring an extensive selection of premium spirits, both domestic and international. From classic cocktails expertly prepared by skilled mixologists to a curated selection of fine wines and locally sourced craft beers, the bar caters to a diverse range of palates. In addition to its impressive drinks menu, Ivory Bar offers a thoughtfully designed selection of light fare and appetizers, complementing the beverages and providing a satisfying culinary experience. Dishes are prepared with fresh, high-quality ingredients, emphasizing regional flavors and international influences. The ambiance is carefully considered, with sophisticated lighting, comfortable seating arrangements, and curated music creating a relaxing and upscale setting. The unique selling point lies not only in the quality of the products but also in the overall experience, which is designed to be both refined and approachable. Understanding the needs of the local market, Ivory Bar aims to provide a space where individuals can unwind after a long day, celebrate special occasions, or simply enjoy the company of friends and colleagues in a stylish and comfortable environment. By offering a diverse range of experiences from lively evening gatherings to quieter, more intimate settings, Ivory Bar addresses the evolving preferences of the local community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer Experience: Personalized Service and Community Connection</p>\n\n<p>Ivory Bar prioritizes providing exceptional customer service that goes beyond simple transactions. The staff is extensively trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and proactive in anticipating customer needs. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with a warm welcome and a genuine desire to ensure their satisfaction. The focus is on building lasting relationships with customers, understanding their preferences, and creating a personalized experience that encourages repeat visits. Ivory Bar recognizes the importance of connecting with the local community. This is achieved through various initiatives, such as hosting themed nights featuring local artists and musicians, collaborating with local businesses for promotional events, and participating in community initiatives. By actively engaging with the local culture, Ivory Bar seeks to become more than just a business; it aims to be a valued member of the community. Feedback is actively sought and carefully considered, allowing the bar to continuously improve its services and tailor its offerings to meet the evolving needs of its clientele. This commitment to customer satisfaction and community engagement is what sets Ivory Bar apart and establishes its reputation as a premier hospitality destination in Solapara.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Future Vision: Growth, Innovation, and Continued Excellence</p>\n\n<p>The future vision for Ivory Bar is one of sustained growth, innovation, and continued excellence in the hospitality sector. The business aims to expand its offerings and services to cater to a wider range of customers while maintaining its commitment to quality and personalized service. Future plans may include introducing new menu items, expanding the selection of beverages, and hosting special events and promotions that appeal to diverse interests. Exploration of partnerships with other businesses in the region to create unique and collaborative experiences is also a key aspect of the long-term strategy. Technology will play an increasingly important role in enhancing the customer experience, with plans to implement online ordering systems, loyalty programs, and other digital solutions that streamline operations and improve customer engagement. Furthermore, Ivory Bar is committed to investing in its staff, providing ongoing training and development opportunities to ensure they remain at the forefront of the industry. By staying abreast of industry trends, embracing innovation, and remaining deeply connected to the local community, Ivory Bar aspires to become a leading hospitality destination in Guwahati and a symbol of quality and excellence in the region. The goal is to not only provide a memorable experience for every guest but also to contribute positively to the local economy and cultural landscape.</p>', '1st floor, Solapara Rd, opposite capital travels', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:50:31', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1970, 'Malt', 'Bars', '', '<p>Malt: Crafting Experiences in the Heart of Guwahati</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Located within the prestigious Novotel Guwahati GS Road, Downtown Dispur, Malt stands as a sophisticated destination redefining leisure and entertainment in Assam. More than just a venue, Malt is an experience meticulously crafted to cater to discerning palates and those seeking elevated moments. Situated strategically within a prominent hotel and business district, Malt brings a unique offering to the Guwahati social scene, providing a blend of premium beverages, delectable cuisine, and a vibrant atmosphere. It represents a significant addition to the local hospitality landscape, providing both hotel guests and the wider Guwahati community with a stylish and convenient space for relaxation, celebration, and networking. Malt distinguishes itself by prioritizing quality, ambience, and personalized service, contributing positively to the evolving entertainment culture of the region.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Malt\'s core offering revolves around a curated selection of premium beverages, featuring an extensive range of spirits, wines, and expertly crafted cocktails. The bar showcases both classic and contemporary mixes, prepared by skilled mixologists dedicated to delivering a perfect drink every time. Beyond the drinks, Malt boasts a thoughtfully designed menu of delectable food offerings. The culinary selections are carefully paired with the beverage program, providing a complete and harmonious gastronomic experience. The menu features a range of appetizers, small plates, and main courses designed to satisfy diverse tastes. Whether it’s enjoying a perfectly prepared cocktail after a long day of work, celebrating a special occasion with friends, or savoring a quiet moment alone, Malt offers a setting for every experience. What truly sets Malt apart is its commitment to providing a premium experience within a relaxed and inviting environment, filling a niche in the Guwahati market for a sophisticated yet unpretentious gathering place.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At Malt, customer experience is paramount. The emphasis is on creating a welcoming and personalized atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. The staff are trained to be knowledgeable, attentive, and proactive, ensuring seamless service and anticipating customer needs. From the moment guests arrive, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness, setting the tone for a memorable experience. The ambience, enhanced by carefully selected music and lighting, fosters a relaxed and sophisticated environment. Malt actively seeks to connect with the local community through curated events and promotions. These initiatives include themed nights, live music performances, and collaborations with local artists and businesses. By actively engaging with the community, Malt fosters a sense of belonging and becomes more than just a bar; it becomes a vibrant hub for social interaction and cultural exchange. Feedback is actively sought and valued, continuously refining services to meet and exceed customer expectations. Malt aims to build lasting relationships with its patrons, becoming a cherished destination in the heart of Guwahati.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for Malt is to solidify its position as the premier destination for sophisticated leisure and entertainment in Guwahati and beyond. Expansion opportunities within Assam and potentially other North Eastern states are being explored. Future plans include enhancing the menu with innovative culinary offerings, expanding the selection of premium beverages, and hosting larger-scale events and collaborations. There\'s a strong focus on developing the Malt brand into a recognizable symbol of quality, sophistication, and exceptional customer service. Digital marketing strategies will be further refined to reach a wider audience and enhance online engagement. Partnerships with local businesses and organizations will continue to be cultivated to strengthen community ties. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish Malt as a leading hospitality brand, synonymous with creating unforgettable experiences and contributing positively to the vibrant cultural landscape of the region.</p>', 'Novotel Guwahati GS Road, Downtown Dispur', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:55:07', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1971, 'D Father Lounge', 'Bars', '', '<p>D Father Lounge: A Refined Social Hub in the Heart of Assam</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>D Father Lounge is an emerging social and leisure destination, strategically located to serve the evolving tastes of Assam\'s discerning clientele. Positioned to be more than just a lounge, D Father Lounge aims to cultivate a sophisticated yet welcoming atmosphere where individuals can connect, unwind, and enjoy premium hospitality. Recognizing the growing demand for upscale entertainment options within the region, D Father Lounge strives to be a notable player in the local business landscape by offering a curated experience that blends modern luxury with Assamese warmth and tradition.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>At the heart of D Father Lounge\'s offerings lies a diverse selection of core services and products tailored to meet the needs of a broad demographic. The lounge provides a comprehensive beverage menu featuring both classic and innovative cocktails, a selection of premium spirits, and a curated wine list designed to complement the local palate. Accompanying the beverage offerings is a carefully crafted food menu emphasizing fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The cuisine focuses on fusion dishes incorporating regional Assamese flavors alongside popular international culinary styles. Beyond the food and beverage aspect, D Father Lounge also provides a curated entertainment program, featuring live music performances showcasing local artists, themed nights, and special events designed to enhance the overall social experience. The lounge also features comfortable seating arrangements, including private booths and communal areas, facilitating both intimate conversations and larger group gatherings. The unique selling proposition rests in the commitment to quality in every aspect, from the ingredients used to the service provided. This holistic approach ensures that D Father Lounge stands apart from competitors by providing an elevated experience that caters to the desire for refined entertainment within the local market.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at D Father Lounge, and the establishment is dedicated to creating a welcoming and memorable atmosphere for every guest. The staff is trained to provide attentive, personalized service, anticipating customer needs and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable visit. The lounge\'s design reflects a commitment to comfort and aesthetics, incorporating elements of modern design while retaining a distinct Assamese character. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and implemented to continually improve the services and offerings. To foster a deeper connection with the local community, D Father Lounge actively participates in local events and collaborates with regional businesses. This includes sponsoring local artists, supporting community initiatives, and partnering with nearby restaurants and hotels to create package deals. The aim is to become an integral part of the local social fabric, recognized not only as a premium leisure destination but also as a responsible and engaged member of the community.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p>The future vision for D Father Lounge involves strategic and sustainable growth within the Assam market and beyond. The initial focus is on solidifying its reputation as a premier entertainment destination within its current location. This will be achieved through continuous improvement in service quality, expansion of the menu offerings, and diversification of the entertainment program. Future plans include potentially expanding into other strategic locations within Assam, replicating the successful model while adapting to the specific characteristics of each new market. Additionally, D Father Lounge intends to explore opportunities to develop signature products and experiences, such as branded merchandise, special event packages, and culinary collaborations. The long-term goals encompass establishing D Father Lounge as a recognized and respected brand synonymous with quality, sophistication, and community engagement throughout the region. This vision is underpinned by a commitment to innovation, customer satisfaction, and responsible business practices.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:55:13', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1972, 'R.D. Bar & Restaurant', 'Bars', '', 'R.D. Bar & Restaurant stands as a prominent establishment in the heart of [Insert Specific Location in Assam], offering a unique blend of traditional Assamese flavors and modern culinary techniques. More than just a dining destination, R.D. Bar & Restaurant is a vibrant social hub, contributing significantly to the local business landscape by providing a welcoming space for residents and visitors alike to connect and enjoy authentic regional experiences. The restaurant distinguishes itself through its commitment to sourcing locally produced ingredients, supporting regional farmers and artisans while delivering unparalleled freshness and flavor to its patrons. It aspires to be synonymous with quality, community, and the rich culinary heritage of Assam.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, R.D. Bar & Restaurant offers a comprehensive dining experience. The restaurant features a diverse menu centered on Assamese cuisine, presenting both classic dishes prepared according to time-honored recipes and innovative creations that reimagine traditional flavors for the modern palate. Signature dishes might include [Specific Assamese dish example 1] and [Specific Assamese dish example 2], prepared with locally sourced [Specific locally sourced ingredient example] from nearby farms. Beyond the food, the bar service provides a selection of local and international beverages, including regionally brewed beers and curated cocktails that complement the menu. A key differentiator lies in the restaurant\'s dedication to showcasing the best of Assamese ingredients and culinary traditions, offering an authentic taste of the region that is difficult to find elsewhere. This focus on regional specialties caters directly to a growing demand from both locals and tourists for authentic and memorable experiences.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is paramount at R.D. Bar & Restaurant. The staff is trained to provide attentive and personalized service, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere for every guest. The restaurant\'s ambiance is carefully curated to reflect the local culture, with [Mention Specific Ambiance detail - e.g., traditional Assamese décor, live music featuring local artists, open-air seating area overlooking scenic views]. Community engagement is an integral part of R.D. Bar & Restaurant\'s identity. The restaurant actively participates in local events, supports local charities, and partners with regional businesses to promote Assam’s rich cultural heritage. Furthermore, it often hosts cultural events or special menus to celebrate regional festivals, strengthening its connection with the local community and creating a sense of belonging for its patrons. This commitment to community involvement not only enhances the customer experience but also solidifies R.D. Bar & Restaurant\'s position as a valued member of the local business ecosystem.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking to the future, R.D. Bar & Restaurant envisions itself as a leading culinary destination in Assam, known for its commitment to quality, community, and innovation. Growth plans include expanding its menu to incorporate more diverse regional cuisines and potentially opening additional locations within the state to cater to a broader audience. The restaurant is also exploring opportunities to develop a line of artisanal food products, showcasing the unique flavors of Assam to a wider market. Furthermore, R.D. Bar & Restaurant aims to strengthen its partnerships with local farmers and suppliers, promoting sustainable agricultural practices and supporting the local economy. Long-term goals include establishing a culinary training program to nurture local talent and contribute to the development of the region\'s hospitality industry. This multifaceted approach to growth will allow R.D. Bar & Restaurant to not only expand its business but also make a significant positive impact on the local community and economy.', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:55:19', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1973, 'Rm Bar and Restaurant', 'Bars', '', '<p><strong>Rm Bar and Restaurant: A Culinary and Social Hub in the Heart of Assam</strong></p>\n\n<p>Rm Bar and Restaurant stands as a vibrant and welcoming establishment, offering a unique blend of culinary delights and engaging social experiences. Nestled in the heart of Assam (address to be inserted), we have quickly become a favorite among locals and visitors alike, providing a memorable dining and entertainment destination. Our commitment to quality, combined with a distinctly Assamese touch, sets us apart in the local hospitality landscape. We strive to create an atmosphere where guests can relax, connect, and savor the best that Assam has to offer, both in terms of food and culture.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Diverse Offerings: From Traditional Flavors to Modern Mixology</strong></p>\n\n<p>At Rm Bar and Restaurant, we pride ourselves on our diverse menu that caters to a wide range of palates. Our culinary offerings are divided into distinct sections, each designed to provide a unique gastronomic journey:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Assamese Cuisine:</strong> We celebrate the rich culinary heritage of Assam with authentic dishes prepared using locally sourced ingredients. From the tangy *Masor Tenga* (sour fish curry) to the flavorful *Khar* (alkaline dish), and the comforting *Duck Curry*, our menu showcases the diversity of Assamese flavors. Our chefs meticulously prepare each dish, ensuring that the traditional recipes are honored while maintaining the highest standards of hygiene and presentation.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Indian Classics:</strong> Alongside our regional specialties, we also offer a selection of popular Indian dishes. This allows us to cater to a broader audience, providing familiar favorites alongside the more adventurous Assamese fare.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Continental Delights:</strong> For those seeking international flavors, our menu features a curated selection of Continental dishes. From pasta and pizzas to grilled meats and salads, we offer a variety of options to satisfy diverse tastes.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Bar:</strong> Our well-stocked bar boasts an impressive selection of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. Our skilled bartenders craft classic cocktails, innovative mixes, and refreshing mocktails. We also offer a wide range of spirits, beers, and wines, carefully selected to complement our food menu.</p>\n\n<p>What truly sets us apart is our commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. This not only supports local farmers and suppliers but also ensures that our dishes are bursting with authentic flavors. We also offer customizable menu options to cater to dietary restrictions and preferences, ensuring that every guest has a satisfying experience.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Customer Experience: Building Connections and Fostering Loyalty</strong></p>\n\n<p>At Rm Bar and Restaurant, we understand that a memorable dining experience extends beyond just the food and drinks. We are committed to providing exceptional customer service and creating a welcoming atmosphere that makes our guests feel valued and appreciated. Our staff is trained to be attentive, knowledgeable, and friendly, ensuring that every guest receives personalized attention.</p>\n\n<p>We actively engage with the local community through various initiatives, such as hosting local music performances, showcasing local artists, and participating in community events. We believe in supporting local talent and contributing to the vibrant cultural scene of Assam.</p>\n\n<p>We regularly solicit feedback from our customers to continuously improve our services and offerings. We use this feedback to refine our menu, enhance our ambiance, and optimize our customer service protocols. We also leverage social media to connect with our customers, share updates, and promote special events. We strive to create a community around Rm Bar and Restaurant, fostering a sense of belonging and loyalty among our patrons.</p>\n\n<br> <br>\n\n<p><strong>Future Vision: Expanding Horizons and Strengthening Roots</strong></p>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Rm Bar and Restaurant envisions continued growth and expansion, solidifying its position as a leading culinary and social destination in Assam. Our long-term goals include:</p>\n\n<p><strong>Expanding our Menu:</strong> We plan to introduce new and exciting dishes to our menu, further showcasing the diversity of Assamese cuisine and incorporating innovative culinary techniques.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Enhancing our Ambiance:</strong> We are committed to continuously improving our ambiance, creating a more comfortable and visually appealing space for our guests. This may involve renovations, upgrades to our décor, and the introduction of new entertainment options.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Strengthening Community Ties:</strong> We will continue to actively engage with the local community, supporting local businesses and participating in community events. We aim to become an integral part of the social fabric of Assam.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Exploring Expansion Opportunities:</strong> We are exploring opportunities to expand our operations to other locations in Assam and beyond, bringing the unique Rm Bar and Restaurant experience to a wider audience. This expansion will be carefully planned and executed, ensuring that we maintain the high standards of quality and customer service that have made us successful.</p>\n\n<p>Rm Bar and Restaurant is more than just a place to eat and drink; it\'s a place to connect, celebrate, and experience the best of Assam. We are committed to providing exceptional food, outstanding service, and a welcoming atmosphere for all our guests, and we look forward to continuing to serve the community for many years to come.</p>', '', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:55:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1974, 'Sura Vie', 'Bars', '', '<p>Sura Vie, located on the 4th floor of The Hub Mall, GS Rd, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination in Guwahati for those seeking a curated experience encompassing fine dining and sophisticated social interaction. More than just a restaurant or lounge, Sura Vie aims to be a vibrant hub where individuals can connect, celebrate, and savor exceptional culinary creations in a stylish and welcoming environment. Situated in a prime location within one of Guwahati\'s most popular malls, Sura Vie benefits from high visibility and easy accessibility, making it a convenient choice for both planned outings and spontaneous gatherings. Recognizing the burgeoning demand for high-quality entertainment and diverse dining options in Assam, Sura Vie is poised to become a cornerstone of the region\'s social scene, offering a unique blend of local warmth and international flair.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>At the heart of Sura Vie\'s offerings are its distinctive dining and lounge experiences. The establishment prides itself on its meticulously crafted menu, which features a diverse range of culinary delights. Patrons can expect to find a thoughtfully curated selection of dishes, blending regional Assam flavors with global culinary trends. This fusion approach not only caters to a wide range of palates but also showcases the region\'s rich culinary heritage. Complementing the food menu is an extensive beverage list featuring classic cocktails, innovative mixes, premium spirits, and a carefully selected wine list. Live music performances and themed events are frequently hosted, adding another layer of entertainment and creating a vibrant atmosphere. What sets Sura Vie apart is its commitment to using fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, supporting local farmers and producers while ensuring the highest quality in every dish. The focus is on delivering a holistic sensory experience, from the exquisite taste of the food to the captivating ambiance, making each visit a memorable occasion. The unique selling proposition lies in successfully combining fine dining, a sophisticated lounge atmosphere, and vibrant entertainment, fulfilling a previously unmet need in the Guwahati market.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Sura Vie understands that exceptional customer service is paramount to building a loyal clientele. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, anticipating the needs of each guest and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable experience. From the moment patrons enter Sura Vie, they are greeted with warmth and professionalism. The team strives to create a welcoming and inclusive atmosphere, where everyone feels comfortable and valued. Beyond simply providing excellent service, Sura Vie actively engages with the local community. Partnerships with local artists and musicians are fostered to showcase regional talent and contribute to the cultural vibrancy of Guwahati. Sura Vie also participates in local events and supports community initiatives, demonstrating a commitment to giving back and building strong relationships. This focus on community engagement extends to the menu, which often features dishes inspired by local recipes and traditions. Regular customer feedback is actively sought and incorporated into the business, ensuring that Sura Vie continues to evolve and meet the changing needs of its patrons. The aim is to cultivate a sense of belonging, where customers feel like valued members of the Sura Vie family.</p> <br> <br>\n<p>Looking ahead, Sura Vie envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam market and potentially beyond. The long-term goal is to establish Sura Vie as a recognized and respected brand, synonymous with quality, sophistication, and exceptional customer experience. Future plans include expanding the menu with innovative new dishes and beverage offerings, continuing to showcase local and regional culinary talent. The business also aims to further enhance its entertainment offerings, introducing new live music acts, themed events, and collaborations with local artists. Expansion to other strategic locations within Assam is under consideration, allowing Sura Vie to reach a wider audience. Furthermore, Sura Vie is committed to incorporating sustainable practices into its operations, minimizing its environmental impact and contributing to a more responsible business environment. By consistently delivering exceptional experiences, fostering strong community relationships, and embracing innovation, Sura Vie is poised to become a leading player in the region\'s hospitality industry, leaving a lasting positive impact on the local economy and cultural landscape.</p>', '4th floor, The Hub Mall, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 19:55:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1975, 'Mocha Cafe & Bar', 'Bars', '', 'Mocha Cafe & Bar, nestled at 2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd, is more than just a cafe; it\'s a vibrant hub where the rich tapestry of Assam\'s culture meets contemporary culinary experiences. Strategically located on the bustling GS Road, Mocha Cafe & Bar serves as a destination for locals and visitors seeking a relaxing and engaging atmosphere, exceptional coffee and beverages, and a menu that blends local flavors with global inspiration. We aim to be a cornerstone of the local community, fostering connections and providing a memorable experience with every visit.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur core offerings encompass a diverse range of services designed to cater to a broad spectrum of tastes. At the heart of our business is our carefully curated selection of specialty coffees, from classic espressos and cappuccinos crafted with locally sourced beans (where available), to innovative mocha blends that give our cafe its distinctive name. Complementing our coffee is an extensive beverage menu featuring handcrafted teas, refreshing smoothies, and a selection of mocktails perfect for unwinding after a long day. Beyond beverages, Mocha Cafe & Bar boasts a menu of delectable food items. This includes a variety of sandwiches, wraps, and light meals, as well as a selection of locally-inspired snacks and desserts that celebrate the region\'s culinary heritage. Our unique selling point lies in our ability to combine a sophisticated cafe experience with a comfortable and welcoming bar atmosphere, making us an ideal spot for morning coffee, lunch meetings, or evening gatherings. We adapt our menu seasonally, incorporating fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible, ensuring a dynamic and engaging culinary experience for our customers. Our offerings directly address the local market\'s desire for high-quality coffee, diverse food options, and a social space that promotes community interaction.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt Mocha Cafe & Bar, customer experience is paramount. We strive to create a warm and inviting atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Our team is dedicated to providing attentive and friendly service, going the extra mile to personalize each interaction. We train our staff to be knowledgeable about our menu and to offer recommendations based on individual preferences. Beyond exceptional service, we foster a strong connection with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting live music performances featuring local artists, organizing themed events that celebrate Assamese culture, and partnering with local businesses to promote their products and services. We actively solicit customer feedback and use it to continuously improve our offerings and enhance the overall experience. We also emphasize creating a visually appealing and comfortable environment, with thoughtful décor, comfortable seating, and ambient lighting designed to promote relaxation and conversation. Wi-Fi is freely available, making Mocha Cafe & Bar an ideal workspace for freelancers and remote workers.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Mocha Cafe & Bar envisions significant growth potential. We aim to expand our reach within the local market by exploring opportunities to open additional locations in strategic areas of Guwahati and beyond. We also plan to enhance our menu with new and innovative offerings, constantly adapting to evolving customer preferences. A key aspect of our future strategy involves strengthening our online presence through social media engagement, online ordering platforms, and targeted marketing campaigns. We also plan to explore partnerships with local delivery services to extend our reach and provide greater convenience to our customers. Long-term, our goal is to establish Mocha Cafe & Bar as a leading cafe and bar destination in Assam, recognized for its exceptional coffee, diverse menu, commitment to customer service, and strong community engagement. We envision becoming a recognizable brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and a true representation of the vibrant spirit of Assam. We believe in fostering a sustainable business model, focusing on responsible sourcing and minimizing our environmental impact. We are confident that by staying true to our core values and continually striving for excellence, Mocha Cafe & Bar will achieve its long-term goals and make a lasting contribution to the local business landscape.', '2 Shop, Ground Anil Plaza, 1, GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 20:00:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
INSERT INTO `directory` (`id`, `business_name`, `category`, `subcategory`, `description`, `address`, `district`, `city`, `contact_number`, `email`, `website`, `latitude`, `longitude`, `working_hours`, `image_urls`, `rating`, `reviews_count`, `updated_at`, `status`, `created_at`, `facebook_post_id`) VALUES
(1976, 'Club 9 Bar', 'Bars', '', '<p>Club 9 Bar, strategically situated on GS Road, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for discerning patrons seeking a sophisticated and vibrant nightlife experience in Assam. More than just a bar, Club 9 is a carefully curated social space designed to cater to the evolving tastes of the local community, offering a unique blend of premium beverages, delectable cuisine, and engaging entertainment. Its location on the bustling GS Road, a vital artery of commerce and social activity, ensures high visibility and accessibility, positioning Club 9 as a key player in the region’s leisure and hospitality sector.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Club 9 Bar\'s core offering revolves around providing an unparalleled beverage experience. The bar boasts an extensive selection of spirits, wines, and beers, sourced both locally and internationally, catering to a wide range of preferences. Skilled mixologists craft innovative cocktails using fresh, high-quality ingredients, ensuring each drink is a work of art. Complementing the beverage menu is a carefully crafted food menu featuring a selection of appetizers, small plates, and main courses designed to perfectly pair with the drinks. The focus is on providing high-quality ingredients, expertly prepared, with attention to local palates. One of Club 9’s unique selling points is its commitment to creating a dynamic and engaging atmosphere. This is achieved through regular live music performances featuring local bands and DJs, themed nights, and special events, ensuring there’s always something new and exciting on offer. This strategy directly addresses a need in the local market for more sophisticated and diverse entertainment options.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is at the heart of Club 9 Bar’s philosophy. The staff is meticulously trained to provide attentive, personalized service, ensuring every guest feels welcomed and valued. The ambiance is carefully cultivated to strike a balance between sophistication and approachability, creating a relaxed and comfortable environment where patrons can unwind and socialize. Beyond exceptional service and atmosphere, Club 9 actively engages with the local community through sponsorships of local events, partnerships with regional businesses, and charitable initiatives. This active participation fosters a sense of belonging and strengthens the bar’s connection to the community it serves. Feedback is actively solicited and implemented, demonstrating a commitment to continuous improvement and ensuring that the bar consistently meets the evolving needs and expectations of its clientele.</p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Looking ahead, Club 9 Bar envisions significant growth potential. Plans are underway to expand the menu to incorporate more regional culinary specialties, further catering to local tastes and promoting Assamese cuisine. Exploring opportunities for outdoor seating and expansion of the venue are also being considered to accommodate a growing customer base. Furthermore, Club 9 aims to establish itself as a leader in responsible alcohol service and promote a safe and enjoyable environment for all patrons. Long-term goals include establishing a reputation as a consistently high-quality establishment, becoming a recognizable brand within the Assam nightlife scene, and potentially expanding to other strategic locations within the region. The focus remains on providing a superior customer experience, fostering a strong connection with the local community, and continuously innovating to meet the evolving demands of the market.</p>', 'GS Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 20:00:14', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1977, 'The Krib, Bar and Eatery', 'Bars', '', '<p>The Krib, Bar and Eatery, nestled on the Ground Floor of Hotel Apollo Grand, GS Rd, near Central Mall, is more than just a dining establishment; it\'s a destination. It represents a modern, sophisticated approach to hospitality, seamlessly blending the ambiance of a high-end bar with the warmth and approachability of a neighborhood eatery. Situated in a prime location within Guwahati, a bustling hub in Assam, The Krib caters to a discerning clientele seeking quality food, expertly crafted beverages, and an inviting atmosphere. Its strategic positioning within a prominent hotel and proximity to a major shopping destination provides a significant advantage, attracting both hotel guests and local residents alike. The Krib distinguishes itself by offering a curated experience that elevates the standard for social gatherings and culinary exploration in the region. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>At its core, The Krib offers a comprehensive range of services designed to satisfy diverse palates and preferences. The establishment operates as a full-service bar, featuring an extensive selection of premium spirits, wines, and beers, including locally sourced craft brews when available. Bartenders are trained to create both classic cocktails and innovative concoctions, ensuring a drink menu that is both familiar and exciting. Complementing the bar is a robust eatery menu offering a diverse selection of appetizers, entrees, and desserts. The culinary offerings range from globally inspired dishes to regional specialties, prepared with fresh, locally sourced ingredients whenever possible. The unique selling point of The Krib lies in its commitment to providing a sophisticated yet relaxed environment where patrons can enjoy high-quality food and beverages without the pretension often associated with upscale establishments. This commitment addresses a growing need in the local market for venues that offer a refined experience that is also accessible and comfortable. The curated food and beverage options are designed to cater to both local tastes and international preferences, appealing to a broad demographic. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>Customer experience is paramount at The Krib. From the moment guests enter, they are greeted with warmth and attentiveness. The staff is meticulously trained to provide exceptional service, anticipating needs and ensuring a seamless and enjoyable visit. The ambiance is carefully crafted to create a welcoming and inclusive environment, with comfortable seating arrangements, tasteful décor, and carefully selected music that enhances the overall atmosphere without being intrusive. Recognizing the importance of community engagement, The Krib actively participates in local events and initiatives. Special promotions and themed nights are regularly organized to attract new customers and foster a sense of community among regulars. Feedback is actively solicited and used to continuously improve the customer experience, demonstrating a commitment to exceeding expectations. Furthermore, The Krib leverages social media and digital platforms to connect with the local community, showcasing its offerings, promoting events, and engaging in meaningful conversations with its patrons. The goal is to cultivate a loyal customer base by consistently delivering exceptional service and creating a welcoming space where people feel valued and appreciated. </p> <br> <br>\n\n<p>The Krib envisions becoming a leading destination for social gatherings and culinary experiences in Guwahati and beyond. Future plans include expanding the menu to incorporate more seasonal and locally sourced ingredients, further enhancing the culinary offerings. Exploring opportunities to partner with local producers and artisans to showcase regional products and support the local economy is also a key consideration. Expansion within Hotel Apollo Grand, perhaps adding a private dining area or outdoor seating, is being evaluated to accommodate growing demand. The long-term goal is to establish The Krib as a recognizable and respected brand synonymous with quality, innovation, and community engagement. This includes potentially exploring opportunities to open additional locations in other strategic areas within Assam and the Northeast region. Ultimately, The Krib aspires to be more than just a bar and eatery; it strives to be a vital part of the local community, contributing to the vibrant social and culinary landscape of Guwahati while providing exceptional experiences for all its patrons. Continuous innovation in menu offerings, ambiance, and customer service will remain central to achieving this vision. </p>', 'Ground Floor, Hotel Apollo Grand, GS Rd, near Central Mall', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 20:00:21', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1978, 'Tsangpo2.0', 'Bars', '', 'Tsangpo2.0: Bridging Tradition and Innovation in Assam\'s Business Hub\n\nNestled on the 7th floor of Hotel Brahmaputra Madhukalya, Sixmile, Panjabari Rd, Tsangpo2.0 represents a dynamic force in Assam\'s evolving business landscape. More than just a company, Tsangpo2.0 embodies the spirit of the Brahmaputra River – a constant flow of innovation, connectivity, and growth, deeply rooted in local values yet embracing global perspectives. We stand as a testament to Assam\'s potential, leveraging our strategic location and understanding of the local market to deliver unparalleled services and solutions. Tsangpo2.0 is committed to fostering sustainable growth and contributing to the economic prosperity of the region.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, Tsangpo2.0 is a multifaceted solutions provider, focusing on [Insert primary industry or sector here, e.g., \"digital marketing and business consultancy\"]. Our primary services encompass [List core services, e.g., \"comprehensive digital marketing strategies, including SEO, social media management, and content creation; business development consulting, offering market research, strategic planning, and process optimization; and training programs designed to upskill local talent\"]. We distinguish ourselves through a hyper-localized approach, understanding the nuances of the Assamese market better than our competitors. For example, our digital marketing strategies incorporate local languages and cultural references, ensuring maximum engagement with the target audience. Similarly, our business consultancy services are tailored to address the unique challenges and opportunities faced by businesses operating in Assam, factoring in factors such as infrastructure limitations and regional economic trends. Our training programs focus on providing practical skills that are immediately applicable in the local job market, contributing to a more skilled and competitive workforce.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nWe believe that exceptional customer service is paramount to success. At Tsangpo2.0, we strive to build lasting relationships with our clients, becoming trusted partners in their growth journey. Our customer service philosophy centers on responsiveness, transparency, and personalized attention. We understand that each client is unique, and we tailor our services to meet their specific needs and objectives. Our team is readily available to address any queries or concerns, providing prompt and efficient support. Furthermore, Tsangpo2.0 is deeply committed to connecting with the local community. We actively participate in local events, support local initiatives, and strive to create a positive impact on the community we serve. This connection is reflected in our recruitment practices, prioritizing local talent and providing opportunities for professional development within the region. We regularly collaborate with local businesses and organizations, fostering a spirit of collaboration and mutual growth.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking ahead, Tsangpo2.0 envisions becoming a leading force in [State desired future position in the market, e.g., \"Assam\'s digital transformation and business empowerment sector\"]. Our future plans include expanding our service offerings to encompass [List future plans, e.g., \"data analytics and business intelligence, providing clients with valuable insights to drive decision-making; expanding our training programs to include emerging technologies such as artificial intelligence and blockchain; and establishing a regional network of partners to extend our reach and impact\"]. We are also committed to investing in research and development to stay at the forefront of industry trends and deliver cutting-edge solutions to our clients. We aim to create a sustainable business model that not only generates profits but also contributes to the long-term economic and social well-being of Assam. This includes promoting ethical business practices, supporting environmental sustainability, and fostering a culture of innovation and inclusivity within our organization.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nOur location on the 7th floor of Hotel Brahmaputra Madhukalya provides us with a distinct advantage – a professional and accessible environment that is conducive to collaboration and growth. We believe that Tsangpo2.0 is ideally positioned to capitalize on the opportunities presented by Assam\'s growing economy and contribute to the region\'s continued success. With a strong foundation built on local values, innovative solutions, and a commitment to exceptional customer service, Tsangpo2.0 is poised to make a significant and lasting impact on Assam\'s business landscape. We invite businesses and individuals to partner with us on this journey of growth and innovation.', '7th floor, Hotel Brahmaputra Madhukalya, Sixmile, Panjabari Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 20:00:26', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1979, 'QUEEN BAR', 'Bars', '', 'QUEEN BAR, strategically located on GS Rd, near the Railway Station, is rapidly establishing itself as a premier destination for discerning patrons seeking a sophisticated and relaxing experience in the heart of Assam. More than just a bar, QUEEN BAR aims to be a central social hub, fostering a vibrant atmosphere where quality drinks, exceptional service, and community spirit converge. Recognizing a growing demand for upscale nightlife within the local business landscape, QUEEN BAR is designed to cater to both local residents and travelers seeking a premium and enjoyable experience. The bar is committed to elevating the standard of hospitality and entertainment in the area, becoming a landmark establishment known for its welcoming ambiance and commitment to excellence.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nAt its core, QUEEN BAR offers a diverse and carefully curated selection of beverages, designed to satisfy a wide range of preferences. The bar prides itself on serving high-quality spirits, both domestic and international, alongside a selection of expertly crafted cocktails. Experienced bartenders, skilled in the art of mixology, prepare classic drinks with precision and create innovative concoctions using fresh ingredients. Beyond alcoholic beverages, QUEEN BAR provides a range of non-alcoholic options, including mocktails, juices, and premium soft drinks, ensuring that all guests find something to enjoy. Complementing the drink menu, a carefully selected array of bar snacks and appetizers is available, featuring both local flavors and international favorites, designed to perfectly complement the beverages. The unique selling point lies in the commitment to quality and presentation, creating an experience that goes beyond simply enjoying a drink. QUEEN BAR seeks to fulfill the local market\'s need for a venue that offers a sophisticated alternative to typical bars, providing a relaxed yet refined atmosphere for socializing, networking, or simply unwinding after a long day.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nCustomer experience is at the forefront of QUEEN BAR’s operational philosophy. The establishment cultivates a welcoming and attentive atmosphere where every guest feels valued and appreciated. Staff members are meticulously trained to provide exceptional service, demonstrating genuine warmth, attentiveness, and a deep understanding of the menu. From the moment a guest enters, they are greeted with a smile and guided through the experience, ensuring that their needs are met promptly and efficiently. Beyond individual service, QUEEN BAR actively engages with the local community through various initiatives. This includes hosting themed nights that celebrate local culture and traditions, partnering with local businesses to promote cross-marketing opportunities, and supporting local events and charities. By actively participating in the community, QUEEN BAR aims to build strong relationships with its neighbors and establish itself as a trusted and respected member of the local business ecosystem. The bar\'s commitment to creating a positive and memorable experience extends beyond the confines of the establishment, solidifying its position as a valuable asset to the local area.\n\n<br> <br>\n\nLooking toward the future, QUEEN BAR envisions becoming the leading bar and social hub in the region, renowned for its exceptional quality, unmatched service, and commitment to the community. The business plans to expand its offerings to include live music performances, further enhancing the entertainment experience for its patrons. Expansion of the menu is also planned, introducing new and innovative cocktails and food pairings to keep the offerings fresh and exciting. Furthermore, QUEEN BAR intends to invest in staff training and development, ensuring that its team remains at the forefront of the hospitality industry, providing guests with the best possible service. Long-term goals include exploring opportunities to expand to other locations within Assam, replicating the success of the original establishment and extending its reach to a wider audience. By remaining adaptable to the evolving needs of the market and maintaining a steadfast commitment to quality and community engagement, QUEEN BAR is poised for continued growth and success, solidifying its position as a landmark destination for years to come. The strategic location on GS Rd, near the Railway Station, provides a strong foundation for attracting both local and transient customers, contributing significantly to the business\'s long-term viability and future prospects.', 'GS Rd, near Railway Station', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 20:00:32', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', ''),
(1980, 'B B WINESHOP', 'Bars', '', '<p>B B WINESHOP stands as a notable establishment within the burgeoning wine and spirits sector of Assam, strategically located at 4QMV+P29, Beltola - Basistha Rd. More than just a retailer, B B WINESHOP aims to be a curator and purveyor of fine beverages, offering a carefully selected range designed to cater to both seasoned connoisseurs and those new to the world of wine and spirits. The shop’s location makes it a convenient destination for residents and visitors alike, contributing to the evolving lifestyle landscape of the Beltola-Basistha area. With a dedication to quality, education, and community engagement, B B WINESHOP is committed to enriching the local cultural experience and fostering a deeper appreciation for the art of fine drinking.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>At its core, B B WINESHOP provides a diverse selection of wines, spirits, and related accessories. The wine selection spans a spectrum of varietals, regions, and price points, carefully chosen to represent both classic and emerging vineyards. From robust reds and crisp whites to sparkling wines and rosés, the shop endeavors to offer something for every palate and occasion. The spirits selection includes a range of whiskies, gins, vodkas, rums, and liqueurs, encompassing both well-known brands and artisanal, craft offerings. This carefully curated approach is a key differentiator, distinguishing B B WINESHOP from larger, more generic retail outlets. The focus is not simply on selling alcohol, but on providing a diverse and engaging selection that encourages exploration and discovery. Furthermore, the shop stocks essential accessories such as glassware, corkscrews, and decanters, providing a complete solution for the discerning beverage enthusiast. This commitment to providing a comprehensive experience, coupled with the selection of unique and hard-to-find items, meets the growing demand for quality and sophistication within the local market. The shop also caters to specific dietary needs, offering selections of organic and biodynamic wines.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>B B WINESHOP places paramount importance on creating a positive and memorable customer experience. The staff is trained not only to process transactions but also to offer knowledgeable advice and personalized recommendations. Whether a customer is seeking a specific wine pairing for a special meal or simply looking to explore new options, the team is equipped to guide them through the selection process. The shop environment is designed to be welcoming and inviting, creating a relaxed atmosphere where customers feel comfortable browsing and learning. Regular tasting events and educational workshops are planned to further engage the community and foster a deeper understanding of wine and spirits. Building relationships with local restaurants and caterers is also a priority, creating opportunities for collaborative promotions and partnerships. By focusing on personalized service, expert guidance, and community engagement, B B WINESHOP strives to cultivate a loyal customer base and become a valued resource for all beverage-related needs. Understanding the nuances of the local Assamese culture and incorporating elements that resonate with the community is also integral to the customer experience.</p>\n<br> <br>\n<p>Looking to the future, B B WINESHOP envisions significant growth and expansion within the Assam market. Future plans include expanding the product selection to include more locally sourced beverages, showcasing the unique flavors and traditions of the region. The potential for online sales and delivery is also being explored, allowing the shop to reach a wider audience and provide greater convenience to customers. Collaborations with local artisans and producers are being developed to create exclusive product offerings and further support the local economy. Ultimately, the long-term goal is to establish B B WINESHOP as a leading destination for wine and spirits in Assam, recognized for its quality selection, exceptional service, and commitment to community engagement. The business is also exploring opportunities to offer curated gift baskets and corporate gifting solutions, further diversifying its revenue streams and catering to a wider range of customer needs. Strategic partnerships with tourism operators are also being considered to promote B B WINESHOP as a destination for visitors seeking an authentic taste of Assam\'s beverage culture. This forward-thinking approach, combined with a dedication to core values, positions B B WINESHOP for continued success and enduring relevance in the years to come.</p>', '4QMV+P29, Beltola - Basistha Rd', 'Kamrup Metro', 'Guwahati', '', '', '', 0.00000000, 0.00000000, 'Closes at 10 PM', '', 0.00, 0, '2025-12-07 20:05:09', 'Active', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '');
